msgid "After meeting a refugee at Anchorpoint, I tracked down the whereabouts of a man named Caruso who had left his old outpost to die, only to discover he had joined a new outpost and became a valued member of their community. Before he confesses, he's asked me to help strengthen the outpost so that it may survive without him, starting with repairing a utility robot."
msgstr ""
"앵커포인트에서 한 난민을 만난 뒤, 옛날에 살던 전초기지를 배신하고 떠나 주민들을 죽게 만든 카루소라는 남자의 행방을 추적했다. 그리고 "
