#. SceneName = CREW_EliteCrew_Muria_TopLevels_Travel
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Friendly
#. SoundFileID = 00A4129A
#. ScriptNotes = Friendly
#. DialogueBefore = Muria: Yeah, but I hear black holes rip you apart before you ever "fall" in. And space is so sterile. I want to hear the trail of screams.
#. EDID: [01083B82]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0000F1"
msgid "Well, either way, if you ever find a bottomless pit in your travels, let me know. I've got a list."
msgstr "뭐, 어쨌든 여행 중에 바닥없는 구덩이를 발견하면 알려주세요. 할 일이 좀 있거든요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. SceneName = CREW_EliteCrew_Muria_TopLevels_Travel
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00716460
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: A black hole is technically a bottomless pit, in space.
#. EDID: [01083B98]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0000F2"
msgid "I don't know. Maybe a black hole. Not the kind in space, just a big bottomless pit. It'd be fun to throw people into it."
msgstr ""
"잘 모르겠네요. 블랙홀을 보고 싶은 걸지도요? 우주에 있는 그런 거 말고요. 그냥 바닥없는 큰 구덩이요. 사람을 밀어 넣으면 재밌을 것 "
"같네요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. SceneName = CREW_EliteCrew_Muria_TopLevels_Travel
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Question
#. SoundFileID = 00A97131
#. ScriptNotes = Question
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Is there anywhere you want to visit?
#. EDID: [01083B98]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0000F3"
msgid "You mean besides the cold, endless void?"
msgstr "차갑고 끝없는 공허 말고 다른 곳 말인가요?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. SceneName = CREW_EliteCrew_Muria_TopLevel_Jobs
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Friendly
#. SoundFileID = 009D37B5
#. ScriptNotes = Friendly / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Any good stories?
#. EDID: [01083BAD]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0000F5"
msgid "It was mostly the same story, except the Captain was a hermit crab and the whale was a beer can."
msgstr "이야기 흐름은 같았는데, 선장을 집게로, 고래를 맥주캔으로 바꿔 놨었죠."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. SceneName = CREW_EliteCrew_Muria_TopLevel_Jobs
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Amused
#. SoundFileID = 00A3814E
#. ScriptNotes = Amused / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Any good stories?
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Any good stories?
#. EDID: [01083BAD]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0000F6"
msgid "There was the time somebody brought in a slate to trade-in. It was Moby Dick, only he had re-recorded the narration and changed all the names."
msgstr ""
"한번은 어떤 사람이 중고품을 팔겠다고 오디오 슬레이트를 들고 왔거든요? 모비 딕이었는데, 지가 새로 해설을 녹음한답시고 이름들을 다 "
"바꿔놨더라고요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. SceneName = CREW_EliteCrew_Muria_TopLevels_Travel
