#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 002FC5E4
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Why not just shoot them?
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Why not just shoot them?
#. DialogueAfter = Muria: I feel like I shouldn't have to explain this to you of all people.
#. EDID: [01083BC1]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0000F7"
msgid "Because that's boring. Guns are noisy and lack drama."
msgstr "그건 재미없잖아요. 총은 시끄럽고 극적인 게 없어요."

