#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00A97BFF
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: What were some of your most popular potions? &&& Muria: Usually love and fortune. I pitched them to clients as investments, which means you have to pay more.|There wasn't any real science to it, I'd just grind up some goldenseal root, add a dash of cinnamon, and add almond milk for prosperity.|The problem is I'm single and poor, so it's pretty obvious the potions are a lie.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: There was the time somebody brought in a slate to trade-in. It was Moby Dick, only he had re-recorded the narration and changed all the names.
#. EDID: [01083C11]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0000F9"
msgid "Any good stories?"
msgstr "뭐 재미있는 일화 기억나는 거 없어?"

#. List: 2
