#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Muria
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00D380FC
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Did you ever ship to places outside Jemison? &&& Muria: That would mean using Star Parcel, but they have to grav jump everything, and that gets expensive. Too expensive unless you're shipping in bulk.|Of course I could solve that problem by never shipping the items. Maybe I'll put out some flyers whenever we're in Freestar space.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: That's because you can't die and you're jealous. It's a defense mechanism.
#. EDID: [01083B5B]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000116"
msgid "That doesn't sound neat to me."
msgstr "그런 일은 별로인 것 같은데."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. SceneName = CREW_EliteCrew_Muria_TopLevel_Finance
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 003679C6
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Did you ever have any actual interest in the finance sector? &&& Muria: Yeah. To me, stuff like magic, science, it's all semantics. Fire is fire, energy is energy.|It's the same vibe with banking and the dark arts. Necromancy, demon pacts, predatory loans -- it's all po-tay-to, po-tah-to.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Yeah, but where's the magic in that.
#. EDID: [01083B73]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
