#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Not all loans need to be predatory. They provide a way for regular folks to purchase homes and start business.
#. EDID: [01083B8A]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000118"
msgid "It's the same vibe with banking and the dark arts. Necromancy, demon pacts, predatory loans -- it's all po-tay-to, po-tah-to."
msgstr ""
"은행 업무나 흑마술이나 다 똑같은 부류에요. 강령술, 악마와의 계약, 약탈적인 대출... 토마토로 발음하든 토메이토로 발음하든 그게 그거 "
"아닌가요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. SceneName = CREW_EliteCrew_Muria_TopLevel_Finance
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Amused
