msgid "Did you ever have any actual interest in the finance sector?"
msgstr "진짜로 금융 쪽에 관심이 있었던 적이 있긴 해?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. SceneName = CREW_EliteCrew_Muria_TopLevel_Jobs
