#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I can relate. I die a little inside whenever we speak.
#. EDID: [01083B9F]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00011B"
msgid "You and me both."
msgstr "당신도요? 저도요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. SceneName = CREW_EliteCrew_Muria_TopLevel_Jobs
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 000BDFB7
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral / to Player Default
#. Prompt = What were some of your most popular potions?
#. DialogueAfter = Muria: You must've had a place with a lot of sunlight.
#. EDID: [01083BCF]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00011C"
msgid "The problem is I'm single and poor, so it's pretty obvious the potions are a lie."
msgstr "문제는 제가 독신이고 가난하는 거예요. 그 물약이 효과 없다는 게 너무 뻔히 보이죠."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. SceneName = CREW_EliteCrew_Muria_TopLevel_Jobs
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 0098A389
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = How did you get the job?
#. DialogueAfter = Muria: A morgue would be very on brand.
#. EDID: [01083B7E]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000124"
msgid "He thought it was a punishment. It was not."
msgstr "그 판사는 그게 벌주는 거라 생각했나 봐요. 전혀 아니었는데 말이죠."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. SceneName = CREW_EliteCrew_Muria_TopLevel_Jobs
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Thinking
#. SoundFileID = 0054A665
#. ScriptNotes = Thinking / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Did you ever ship to places outside Jemison?
#. DialogueAfter = Muria: You must've had a place with a lot of sunlight.
#. EDID: [01083B95]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000126"
msgid "Of course I could solve that problem by never shipping the items. Maybe I'll put out some flyers whenever we're in Freestar space."
msgstr "물론 물건을 안 보내면 해결되긴 하죠. 자유항성 공동체 영역에 있을 때마다 전단지라도 좀 돌려야겠네요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. SceneName = CREW_EliteCrew_Muria_TopLevel_Jobs
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 0083B6A9
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Did you ever ship to places outside Jemison?
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Did you ever ship to places outside Jemison?
#. EDID: [01083B95]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000127"
msgid "That would mean using Star Parcel, but they have to grav jump everything, and that gets expensive. Too expensive unless you're shipping in bulk."
msgstr ""
"그러려면 스타 파셀을 이용해야 하는데, 걔들은 모든 화물을 중력 도약으로 날려서 비용이 장난 아니게 들어요. 대량으로 보내는 게 아니라면 "
"너무 비싸서 엄두도 못 내죠."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
