#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0090ACF2
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Can you tell me about any past work experiences? &&& Muria: I used to sell potions and amulets online. Had a tiny little garden where I grew the ingredients.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: You'd think. But I'm allergic to daylight. I use artificial grow lights. It makes me feel like I'm sticking it to the sun.
#. EDID: [01083B71]
