#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Gross.
#. EDID: [01083B84]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00018A"
msgid "No cool robes. Just the clothes on your back."
msgstr "멋진 로브 같은 건 없어. 그냥 지금 입고 있는 옷 그대로 일하면 돼."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. SceneName = CREW_EliteCrew_Muria_TopLevel_Jobs
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00819F4E
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Can you tell me about any past work experiences?
#. DialogueAfter = Muria: A morgue would be very on brand.
#. EDID: [01083B9C]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00018B"
msgid "I did work in a morgue once. But I don't consider it a job so much as a lifelong passion."
msgstr "영안실에서 일한 적도 있어요. 일이라기보단 거의 인생의 낙에 가깝지만 말이죠."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. SceneName = CREW_EliteCrew_Muria_TopLevel_Jobs
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00008D3D
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Can you tell me about any past work experiences?
#. DialogueAfter = Muria: You must've had a place with a lot of sunlight.
#. EDID: [01083BAF]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00018C"
msgid "I used to sell potions and amulets online. Had a tiny little garden where I grew the ingredients."
msgstr "예전엔 온라인으로 물약이랑 부적을 팔았어요. 재료를 기르는 작은 정원도 있었고요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00296FF7
#. EDID: [01083D13]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00018D"
msgid "Sure. I assume it's in the contract."
msgstr "알겠어요. 고용 계약서에 적혀 있는 대로겠죠?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 001F73E4
#. EDID: [01083D09]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00018E"
msgid "Would if I could. Oh wait, I have to. Damn."
msgstr "할 수만 있다면 그러고 싶네요. 아, 잠깐만요, 무조건 해야 하나요. 젠장."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00E21D24
#. EDID: [01083CEE]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00018F"
msgid "I hope they spent their last days thinking of the long, healthy life they were going to lead."
msgstr "저 인간들이 무병장수의 꿈이나 꾸면서 마지막 나날을 보냈으면 좋겠네요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00CADC5C
#. EDID: [01083CED]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000190"
msgid "You did them a solid."
msgstr "저 사람들에게 호의를 베푸셨네요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 0018B045
#. EDID: [01083CEC]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000191"
msgid "What's a little crime between friends?"
msgstr "친구 사이인데 이 정도 범죄야 무슨 대수겠어요?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00945AAB
#. EDID: [01083CEB]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000192"
msgid "They deserved that."
msgstr "당해도 싸네요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00194C4D
#. EDID: [01083CEA]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000193"
msgid "You did them a favor. Trust me."
msgstr "당신은 저 사람들을 도와준 거예요. 절 믿으세요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00D9B3E0
#. EDID: [01083CE9]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000194"
msgid "Is it murder if life sucks?"
msgstr "사는 것도 시궁창인데 이걸 살인이라고 볼 수 있을까요?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00BF8198
#. EDID: [01083CE8]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000195"
msgid "Dead people don't know how lucky they are."
msgstr "죽은 사람들은 자기가 얼마나 운 좋은지도 모르죠."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 006E686E
#. EDID: [01083CE7]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000196"
msgid "They probably were miserable anyway."
msgstr "어차피 비참하게 살았을 거예요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 009D8755
#. EDID: [01083CE6]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000197"
msgid "If you do the killing, I get to keep the body."
msgstr "죽이는 건 당신이 하세요. 시체 챙기는 건 제가 할게요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00AD4A90
#. EDID: [01083CE5]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000198"
msgid "That escalated quickly."
msgstr "갑자기 급발진을 해버리셨네요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00A0AB38
#. EDID: [01083E4A]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000199"
msgid "I want to be the kind of necromancer that takes on new faces too."
msgstr "저도 얼굴을 바꿀 수 있는 강령술사 같은 게 되고 싶어요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 0014F075
#. EDID: [01083E49]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00019A"
msgid "You look great. Also, I think I deserve a raise."
msgstr "잘 어울리네요. 아울러, 저는 급여를 인상 받을 자격이 있다고 생각해요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 005C0C6B
#. EDID: [01083E48]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00019B"
msgid "I was getting sick of the old face anyway."
msgstr "어차피 예전 얼굴은 질리던 참이었어요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 007CBD6B
#. EDID: [01083E47]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00019C"
msgid "It's an improvement."
msgstr "더 나아졌네요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 0013D68F
#. EDID: [01083E46]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00019D"
msgid "Not bad. Could use some horns and vampire teeth though."
msgstr "나쁘지 않네요. 뿔이랑 흡혈귀 송곳니가 있었으면 더 좋았겠지만요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00F14D5D
#. EDID: [01083E45]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00019E"
msgid "Nice look. I approve."
msgstr "괜찮아 보이는데요. 마음에 들어요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00EABD5E
#. EDID: [01083E44]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00019F"
msgid "New face, new you."
msgstr "새로운 얼굴에, 새로운 당신이네요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00E695E8
#. EDID: [01083E43]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0001A0"
msgid "I like it."
msgstr "좋네요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00A1CDAA
#. EDID: [01083E42]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0001A1"
msgid "Cool new face."
msgstr "새 얼굴 멋지네요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00FA4388
#. EDID: [01083E41]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0001A2"
msgid "So you're some kind of changeling. Neat."
msgstr "당신은 일종의 체인질링 같은 존재였군요. 흥미롭네요."

