#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00BD3DFB
#. EDID: [010217DD]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0001DA"
msgid "*Sigh*"
msgstr "*한숨*"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_MiscDialogue
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMBernhardKleiber
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMBernhardKleiber
#. Face = Somber
#. SoundFileID = 00363092
#. ScriptNotes = Somber
#. EDID: [010217DC]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0001DB"
msgid "So many good people were lost."
msgstr "선량한 사람들이 너무 많이 죽었어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_MiscDialogue
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMBernhardKleiber
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMBernhardKleiber
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00DB09A2
#. EDID: [010217DB]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0001DC"
msgid "I grow weary of this galaxy."
msgstr "이 은하에 진절머리가 나."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_MiscDialogue
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMBernhardKleiber
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMBernhardKleiber
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00EB86A1
#. EDID: [010216B9]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0001DD"
msgid "I've done things I'm not proud of to survive."
msgstr "살아남기 위해 자랑스럽지 않은 짓거리를 일삼았지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_MiscDialogue
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMBernhardKleiber
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMBernhardKleiber
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0018D4FA
#. EDID: [010216B8]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0001DE"
msgid "Shinar was a quiet place. I miss it dearly."
msgstr "시날은 고요한 곳이었어. 몹시 그립군."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_MiscDialogue
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_HelpWanted_030_TopLevel02
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 006A7A7F
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I'm not familiar with the Tragedy of Shinar. &&& Bernhard: Shinar was a research outpost built out in the far reaches of space.|We were humble scientists, studying the land, and making discoveries.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: It would've continued to be thus, had we not invited a stranger into our home.
#. EDID: [0102169B]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0001DF"
msgid "Everything always seems fine at first."
msgstr "무슨 일이든 처음에는 괜찮아 보이는 법이죠."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_MiscDialogue
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_HelpWanted_030_TopLevel02
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Bernhard
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMBernhardKleiber
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00735CB7
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = I don't believe this sob story is even real.
#. DialogueAfter = Bernhard: I cannot speak to what you'll find there, but it may point you to what you seek.
#. EDID: [0102170B]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0001E0"
msgid "Here. The coordinates. There you will find the proof. "
msgstr "받아. 좌표다. 가면 증거를 찾을 수 있을 거야. "

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_MiscDialogue
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_HelpWanted_030_TopLevel02
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Bernhard
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMBernhardKleiber
#. Face = VeryAngry
#. SoundFileID = 007C815A
#. ScriptNotes = VeryAngry / to Player Default
#. Prompt = I don't believe this sob story is even real.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I don't believe this sob story is even real.
#. EDID: [0102170B]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0001E1"
msgid "If you doubt my words, traveler, then I suggest you visit the settlement in question."
msgstr "내 말이 의심스럽다면, 직접 정착지에 가서 확인해 봐."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_MiscDialogue
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_HelpWanted_000_StartScene01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = BarPatron
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFGenericFemale04
#. Face = Angry
#. SoundFileID = 00C4F91F
#. ScriptNotes = Angry / to Bernhard
#. DialogueBefore = BarPatron: Because it's the right thing to do. &&& Bernhard: Please. You know what your righteousness gets you? &&& Bernhard: A pointless death.
#. DialogueAfter = Bernhard: Yes, yes, be gone.
#. EDID: [0102154B]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0001E2"
msgid "I'm sorry you feel that way. But I'm going."
msgstr "그렇게 생각한다니 유감이네요. 하지만 전 할 거예요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_MiscDialogue
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_HelpWanted_030_TopLevel02
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Bernhard
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00B85DC7
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I'm not familiar with the Tragedy of Shinar. &&& Bernhard: Shinar was a research outpost built out in the far reaches of space.|We were humble scientists, studying the land, and making discoveries.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: It was. Which makes it all the more tragic it was taken from us.
#. EDID: [010217B2]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0001E3"
msgid "It sounds like a peaceful place."
msgstr "평화로운 곳이었나 보군."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_MiscDialogue
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_HelpWanted_030_TopLevel02
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Bernhard
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 002BB5EC
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: That doesn't mean you stop doing what's right. &&& Bernhard: On the contrary, to continue to do a foolish thing is the definition of insanity.|The pirate was the smart one, taking advantage of our foolishness.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Project Shinar's goal was to settle a Class B-H planet. Barely habitable.
#. EDID: [01021540]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0001E4"
msgid "Surely there was food and water on the planet?"
msgstr "그 행성에 식량이나 식수는 없었나?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_MiscDialogue
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_HelpWanted_040_TopLevel04
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Bernhard
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMBernhardKleiber
#. Face = Disgust
#. SoundFileID = 00A3637B
#. ScriptNotes = Disgust / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Are you against joining the Vanguard?
#. DialogueAfter = Bernhard: Once you open your eyes and see the world for what it really is, you will realize the truth.
#. EDID: [0102158E]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0001E7"
msgid "I am against volunteering for any fight I have no stake in, yes."
msgstr "나랑 상관없는 싸움을 위해 총대 멜 생각은 눈곱만큼도 없어. 맞아."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_MiscDialogue
