#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Very well.
#. EDID: [01021650]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0001E8"
msgid "Skip to the part with the tragedy, please."
msgstr "이제 그만 참극 부분으로 넘어가 주시지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_MiscDialogue
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_HelpWanted_030_TopLevel02
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMBernhardKleiber
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMBernhardKleiber
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 007F6A33
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Everything always seems fine at first.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Everything always seems fine at first.
#. DialogueAfter = Bernhard: There was a shipwreck with a lone survivor. We rescued him, brought him back, and treated his wounds.
#. EDID: [0102156A]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0001E9"
msgid "It would've continued to be thus, had we not invited a stranger into our home."
msgstr "낯선 사람을 우리 집안에 들이지만 않았어도, 예전처럼 계속 평화롭게 살 수 있었을 거야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_MiscDialogue
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_HelpWanted_000_StartScene01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Bernhard
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMBernhardKleiber
#. Face = Disgust
#. SoundFileID = 004278FC
#. ScriptNotes = Disgust / to BarPatron
#. DialogueBefore = Bernhard: A pointless death. &&& BarPatron: I'm sorry you feel that way. But I'm going.
#. EDID: [01021570]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0001EA"
msgid "Yes, yes, be gone."
msgstr "그래. 그래. 가라. 가."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_MiscDialogue
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_HelpWanted_030_TopLevel02
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Bernhard
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00D367A9
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: That doesn't sound like it was luck. &&& Bernhard: It was luck. I never said what kind. &&& Bernhard: Now I must live with my actions. All because we chose to help a stranger.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: If you doubt my words, traveler, then I suggest you visit the settlement in question.
#. EDID: [01021649]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0001EB"
msgid "I don't believe this sob story is even real."
msgstr "그 참극 이야기가 진짜인지 믿기 어렵군."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_MiscDialogue
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_HelpWanted_030_TopLevel02
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Bernhard
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00AAE448
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Everything always seems fine at first. &&& Bernhard: It would've continued to be thus, had we not invited a stranger into our home. &&& Bernhard: There was a shipwreck with a lone survivor. We rescued him, brought him back, and treated his wounds. &&& Bernhard: He repaid us by stealing our ship, wrecking our comms, and leaving us there to die.|All because we gave him shelter. Because we did the right thing.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: That's because it no longer exists. It has no more place on a map than the rocks and the trees.
#. EDID: [010215E2]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0001EC"
msgid "I've never heard of this settlement."
msgstr "그런 정착지가 있다는 걸 들어본 적이 없는데."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_MiscDialogue
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_HelpWanted_030_TopLevel02
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Bernhard
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00495C3A
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: That doesn't sound like it was luck. &&& Bernhard: It was luck. I never said what kind. &&& Bernhard: Now I must live with my actions. All because we chose to help a stranger.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: The lucky ones died that day. They are free from this farce.
#. EDID: [0102175A]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0001ED"
msgid "That's the way it goes. Be glad you survived."
msgstr "세상일이 다 그런 거야. 살아남은 걸 다행으로 여기라고."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_MiscDialogue
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_HelpWanted_030_TopLevel02
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Bernhard
