#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = It sounds like a peaceful place.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: It sounds like a peaceful place.
#. DialogueAfter = Bernhard: There was a shipwreck with a lone survivor. We rescued him, brought him back, and treated his wounds.
#. EDID: [010217B8]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0001EE"
msgid "It was. Which makes it all the more tragic it was taken from us."
msgstr "참 평화로웠지. 그래서 그 평화를 빼앗긴 게 더 참담하게 느껴지는 거야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_MiscDialogue
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_HelpWanted_030_TopLevel02
