#. EDID: [0102155F]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0001EF"
msgid "Very well."
msgstr "그러도록 하지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_MiscDialogue
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_HelpWanted_030_TopLevel02
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Bernhard
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMBernhardKleiber
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00A99C56
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Where do you think the pirate is now?
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Where do you think the pirate is now?
#. DialogueAfter = Bernhard: I can find him. I could go to Shinar and follow the trail.
#. EDID: [010216E0]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0001F0"
msgid "I want to say he's dead. But men like that are cockroaches. They have a bad habit of staying alive."
msgstr "진작에 뒈졌기를 바라지만, 그런 자식들은 아주 바퀴벌레가 따로 없어. 어떻게든 꾸역꾸역 살아남는 습성이 있지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_MiscDialogue
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_HelpWanted_030_TopLevel02
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Bernhard
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 003AB158
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: That doesn't sound like it was luck. &&& Bernhard: It was luck. I never said what kind. &&& Bernhard: Now I must live with my actions. All because we chose to help a stranger.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: I want to say he's dead. But men like that are cockroaches. They have a bad habit of staying alive.
#. EDID: [01021623]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0001F1"
msgid "Where do you think the pirate is now?"
msgstr "지금 그 해적이 어디에 있을 것 같아?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_MiscDialogue
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_HelpWanted_030_TopLevel02
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Bernhard
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMBernhardKleiber
#. Face = Disgust
#. SoundFileID = 0079C698
#. ScriptNotes = Disgust / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Bernhard: It would've continued to be thus, had we not invited a stranger into our home.
#. DialogueAfter = Bernhard: He repaid us by stealing our ship, wrecking our comms, and leaving us there to die.
#. EDID: [0102182A]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0001F4"
msgid "There was a shipwreck with a lone survivor. We rescued him, brought him back, and treated his wounds."
msgstr "우주선이 난파됐는데 생존자가 딱 한 명 있었어. 우리가 구조해서 전초기지로 데려온 다음, 다친 곳을 치료해 줬지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_MiscDialogue
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_HelpWanted_040_TopLevel05
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Bernhard
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMBernhardKleiber
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00142849
#. DialogueBefore = Bernhard: He was a real bear of a man. Soft spoken, but forceful. What few words he used, he didn't mince.
#. EDID: [01021604]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0001F5"
msgid "A man like that tends to get respect, but it's all a ruse. And he fooled us just long enough to give us the slip."
msgstr "원래 그런 인간들이 신뢰를 얻기 쉬운 법이지만, 결국 다 연기였던 거야. 우리를 속여서 감쪽같이 튀어 버렸으니까."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_MiscDialogue
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_HelpWanted_030_TopLevel02
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMBernhardKleiber
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMBernhardKleiber
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00F033AB
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = That doesn't sound like it was luck.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: That doesn't sound like it was luck.
#. DialogueAfter = Bernhard: Now I must live with my actions. All because we chose to help a stranger.
#. EDID: [01021593]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0001F6"
msgid "It was luck. I never said what kind."
msgstr "운이 좋았던 거 맞아. 행운인지 불운인지 말 안 했잖아."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_MiscDialogue
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_HelpWanted_040_TopLevel05
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00E52170
#. DialogueAfter = Bernhard: He was a real bear of a man. Soft spoken, but forceful. What few words he used, he didn't mince.
#. EDID: [010216C5]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0001F7"
msgid "What can you tell me about this pirate? Do you have a description?"
msgstr "그 해적에 대해 더 알려줄 건 없나? 어떻게 생겼지?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_MiscDialogue
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_HelpWanted_030_TopLevel02
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Bernhard
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMBernhardKleiber
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00B74E07
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = It's not wise to give a pirate shelter.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: It's not wise to give a pirate shelter.
#. DialogueAfter = Bernhard: I can find him. I could go to Shinar and follow the trail.
#. EDID: [010216E8]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0001F8"
msgid "Yes, but he lied to us -- told us he was a merchant, not a thief. And we paid the price for our naivety."
msgstr "맞아, 하지만 그 자식은 우리에게 거짓말을 했어. 도둑이 아니라 상인이라고 속였지. 결국 순진했던 우리는 그 대가를 치른 거지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_MiscDialogue
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_HelpWanted_040_TopLevel05
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Bernhard
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMBernhardKleiber
#. Face = Disgust
#. SoundFileID = 006A72C1
#. ScriptNotes = Disgust / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: What can you tell me about this pirate? Do you have a description?
#. DialogueAfter = Bernhard: A man like that tends to get respect, but it's all a ruse. And he fooled us just long enough to give us the slip.
#. EDID: [01021696]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0001F9"
msgid "He was a real bear of a man. Soft spoken, but forceful. What few words he used, he didn't mince."
msgstr "곰같이 덩치 큰 놈이었어. 조용히 말하지만 말에 묵직한 힘이 있었어. 말수는 적고, 빙빙 돌려 말하는 법이 없었지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_MiscDialogue
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_HelpWanted_040_TopLevel04
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00932C23
#. DialogueAfter = Bernhard: I am against volunteering for any fight I have no stake in, yes.
#. EDID: [01021823]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0001FA"
msgid "Are you against joining the Vanguard?"
msgstr "뱅가드에 입대하는 걸 싫어하나 보지?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_MiscDialogue
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_HelpWanted_030_TopLevel02
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0093FA20
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: That doesn't sound like it was luck. &&& Bernhard: It was luck. I never said what kind. &&& Bernhard: Now I must live with my actions. All because we chose to help a stranger.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: I've all but given up on finding him, but if you feel the need, here are the coordinates.
#. EDID: [01021715]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0001FB"
msgid "I can find him. I could go to Shinar and follow the trail."
msgstr "내가 찾아보겠어. 시날 전초기지로 가서 흔적을 쫓아 볼게."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_MiscDialogue
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_HelpWanted_030_TopLevel02
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Bernhard
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMBernhardKleiber
#. Face = Somber
#. SoundFileID = 00BB4F1D
#. ScriptNotes = Somber / to Player Default
#. Prompt = How did you survive?
#. DialogueAfter = Bernhard: Now I must live with my actions. All because we chose to help a stranger.
#. EDID: [01021762]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0001FC"
msgid "But some decided to take their own lives and die on their own terms."
msgstr "몇몇은 자신만의 방식대로 선택하겠다며 스스로 목숨을 끊는 쪽을 택했지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_MiscDialogue
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_HelpWanted_030_TopLevel02
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Bernhard
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMBernhardKleiber
#. Face = Disgust
#. SoundFileID = 00719B3C
#. ScriptNotes = Disgust / to Player Default
#. Prompt = How did you survive?
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: How did you survive?
#. EDID: [01021762]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0001FD"
msgid "Sheer luck. Without food, water... we only had days before dehydration set in."
msgstr "순전히 운이었지. 식량도 식수도 없었는데… 탈수가 오기까지 며칠밖에 남지 않았었어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_MiscDialogue
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_HelpWanted_030_TopLevel02
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Bernhard
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMBernhardKleiber
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00820440
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = So, you did the unthinkable.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: So, you did the unthinkable.
#. DialogueAfter = Bernhard: Now I must live with my actions. All because we chose to help a stranger.
#. EDID: [0102173C]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0001FE"
msgid "Yes. Grant me the courtesy of not spelling it out for you."
msgstr "그래. 굳이 내 입으로 일일이 설명하지 않게 해줬으면 좋겠군."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_MiscDialogue
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_HelpWanted_030_TopLevel02
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Bernhard
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMBernhardKleiber
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 005D4827
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = That's the way it goes. Be glad you survived.
#. DialogueAfter = Bernhard: I cannot speak to what you'll find there, but it may point you to what you seek.
#. EDID: [010217F8]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0001FF"
msgid "If you are curious, you will find them at these coordinates. "
msgstr "혹시 궁금하다면, 이 좌표로 가봐. 죽은 사람들을 찾을 수 있을 거야. "

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_MiscDialogue
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_HelpWanted_030_TopLevel02
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Bernhard
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMBernhardKleiber
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00EAAF4A
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
