#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: That's the way it goes. Be glad you survived.
#. EDID: [010217F8]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000200"
msgid "The lucky ones died that day. They are free from this farce."
msgstr "그날 죽은 사람들은 도리어 운이 좋았던 거야. 이 막장극에서 자유로워졌으니까."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_MiscDialogue
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_HelpWanted_030_TopLevel02
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00110B74
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: No good comes from helping strangers. &&& Bernhard: Yes. He doomed our entire settlement. But he lives, and we died.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: It was luck. I never said what kind.
#. EDID: [010215F9]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000201"
msgid "That doesn't sound like it was luck."
msgstr "운이 좋았던 것 같진 않은데."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_MiscDialogue
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_HelpWanted_050_TopLevel04
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 008F9447
#. DialogueAfter = Bernhard: Yes, leave.
#. EDID: [010215C0]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000202"
msgid "I'll leave you to it then."
msgstr "그럼 이만 가보겠습니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_MiscDialogue
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_HelpWanted_030_TopLevel02
