#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I can find him. I could go to Shinar and follow the trail.
#. DialogueAfter = Bernhard: I cannot speak to what you'll find there, but it may point you to what you seek.
#. EDID: [010215DE]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000203"
msgid "I've all but given up on finding him, but if you feel the need, here are the coordinates."
msgstr "그 자식 찾는 건 진작에 포기했어. 하지만 네가 정 가보겠다면 좌표를 알려줄게."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_MiscDialogue
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_HelpWanted_050_TopLevel04
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Bernhard
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMBernhardKleiber
#. Face = Disgust
#. SoundFileID = 005C3ABF
#. ScriptNotes = Disgust / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I'll leave you to it then.
#. EDID: [010215B5]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000204"
msgid "Yes, leave."
msgstr "그래, 가봐."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_MiscDialogue
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_HelpWanted_040_TopLevel03
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 007EAC6D
#. DialogueAfter = Bernhard: Of course, I thought about it. Every day for two years, until it consumed me.
#. EDID: [01021767]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000205"
msgid "Have you ever thought about getting revenge?"
msgstr "복수할까 생각해 본 적 있습니까?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_MiscDialogue
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_HelpWanted_030_TopLevel02
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Bernhard
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMBernhardKleiber
#. Face = Angry
#. SoundFileID = 00949260
#. ScriptNotes = Angry / to Player Default
#. Prompt = That doesn't mean you stop doing what's right.
#. DialogueAfter = Bernhard: I can find him. I could go to Shinar and follow the trail.
#. EDID: [010217E3]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000206"
msgid "The pirate was the smart one, taking advantage of our foolishness."
msgstr "그 해적 놈이 영리했던 거지. 어리석은 우리를 이용한 거니까."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_MiscDialogue
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_HelpWanted_030_TopLevel02
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Bernhard
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMBernhardKleiber
#. Face = Angry
#. SoundFileID = 00768B9D
#. ScriptNotes = Angry / to Player Default
#. Prompt = That doesn't mean you stop doing what's right.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: That doesn't mean you stop doing what's right.
#. EDID: [010217E3]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000207"
msgid "On the contrary, to continue to do a foolish thing is the definition of insanity."
msgstr "반대 아니냐. 어리석은 짓을 하는 걸 멈추지 않고 계속 하는 게 바로 미친 짓이야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_MiscDialogue
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_HelpWanted_030_TopLevel02
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Bernhard
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00A33A0E
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Everything always seems fine at first. &&& Bernhard: It would've continued to be thus, had we not invited a stranger into our home. &&& Bernhard: There was a shipwreck with a lone survivor. We rescued him, brought him back, and treated his wounds. &&& Bernhard: He repaid us by stealing our ship, wrecking our comms, and leaving us there to die.|All because we gave him shelter. Because we did the right thing.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: On the contrary, to continue to do a foolish thing is the definition of insanity.
#. EDID: [01021741]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00020B"
msgid "That doesn't mean you stop doing what's right."
msgstr "그렇다고 해서 옳은 일을 하는 걸 멈춰선 안 되죠."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_MiscDialogue
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_HelpWanted_030_TopLevel02
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Bernhard
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMBernhardKleiber
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 009430A0
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Surely there was food and water on the planet?
#. DialogueAfter = Bernhard: That doesn't sound like it was luck.
#. EDID: [010216A5]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00020C"
msgid "When he stole the ship, and our supplies, he sentenced us to death."
msgstr "그 자식이 우주선과 보급품을 훔쳐 달아난 건, 그냥 죽으라고 등 떠민 거나 다름없었어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_MiscDialogue
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_HelpWanted_030_TopLevel02
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Bernhard
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMBernhardKleiber
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 001ED205
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Surely there was food and water on the planet?
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Surely there was food and water on the planet?
#. EDID: [010216A5]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00020D"
msgid "Project Shinar's goal was to settle a Class B-H planet. Barely habitable."
msgstr "시날 프로젝트는 B-H급 행성에 정착하는 게 목표였어. B-H급은 간신히 거주 가능한 수준이지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_MiscDialogue
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_HelpWanted_030_TopLevel02
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Bernhard
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00B9492C
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: It's not wise to give a pirate shelter. &&& Bernhard: Yes, but he lied to us -- told us he was a merchant, not a thief. And we paid the price for our naivety.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Yes. Grant me the courtesy of not spelling it out for you.
#. EDID: [01021791]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00020E"
msgid "So, you did the unthinkable."
msgstr "그 말은, 해서는 안 될 짓을 할 수밖에 없었다는 거군."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_MiscDialogue
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_HelpWanted_030_TopLevel02
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Bernhard
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00E7569F
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Everything always seems fine at first. &&& Bernhard: It would've continued to be thus, had we not invited a stranger into our home. &&& Bernhard: There was a shipwreck with a lone survivor. We rescued him, brought him back, and treated his wounds. &&& Bernhard: He repaid us by stealing our ship, wrecking our comms, and leaving us there to die.|All because we gave him shelter. Because we did the right thing.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Sheer luck. Without food, water... we only had days before dehydration set in.
#. EDID: [010216A0]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00020F"
msgid "How did you survive?"
msgstr "어떻게 살아남은 거지?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_MiscDialogue
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_HelpWanted_040_TopLevel03
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Bernhard
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMBernhardKleiber
#. Face = Sad
#. SoundFileID = 009D2F97
#. ScriptNotes = Sad
#. DialogueBefore = Bernhard: Of course, I thought about it. Every day for two years, until it consumed me.|But then I realized there was no goddamn point. To any of it.
#. DialogueAfter = Bernhard: Wherever Caruso is, let God be his judge. And if there is no God, then we're all doomed anyway.
#. EDID: [01021736]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000210"
msgid "Even if I kill him, so what? My friends, my colleagues, are all dead."
msgstr "녀석을 죽인들 뭐가 달라지겠어? 친구도, 동료도 다 죽었는데."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_MiscDialogue
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_HelpWanted_040_TopLevel03
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Bernhard
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMBernhardKleiber
#. Face = Angry
#. SoundFileID = 00D20E10
#. ScriptNotes = Angry
#. DialogueBefore = Bernhard: Even if I kill him, so what? My friends, my colleagues, are all dead.
#. EDID: [0102165B]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000213"
msgid "Wherever Caruso is, let God be his judge. And if there is no God, then we're all doomed anyway."
msgstr "카루소가 어디에 있든, 신께서 녀석을 심판하시겠지. 만약 신이 없다면... 어차피 우리에겐 희망이 없는 거니까."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_MiscDialogue
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_HelpWanted_030_TopLevel02
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Bernhard
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 002CFC66
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Everything always seems fine at first. &&& Bernhard: It would've continued to be thus, had we not invited a stranger into our home. &&& Bernhard: There was a shipwreck with a lone survivor. We rescued him, brought him back, and treated his wounds. &&& Bernhard: He repaid us by stealing our ship, wrecking our comms, and leaving us there to die.|All because we gave him shelter. Because we did the right thing.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Yes, but he lied to us -- told us he was a merchant, not a thief. And we paid the price for our naivety.
#. EDID: [010215FE]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000214"
msgid "It's not wise to give a pirate shelter."
msgstr "해적에게 피신처를 마련해 주는 건 현명한 짓이 아니죠."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_MiscDialogue
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_HelpWanted_040_TopLevel03
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Bernhard
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMBernhardKleiber
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 006CB316
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueAfter = Bernhard: Even if I kill him, so what? My friends, my colleagues, are all dead.
#. EDID: [010216F3]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000215"
msgid "But then I realized there was no goddamn point. To any of it. "
msgstr "하지만 결국 아무런 의미도 없다는 걸 깨달았어. 모두 다 부질없다고. "

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_MiscDialogue
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_HelpWanted_040_TopLevel03
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Bernhard
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMBernhardKleiber
#. Face = Disgust
#. SoundFileID = 0018FABC
#. ScriptNotes = Disgust / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Have you ever thought about getting revenge?
#. EDID: [010216F3]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000216"
msgid "Of course, I thought about it. Every day for two years, until it consumed me."
msgstr "당연히 생각해 봤지. 2년 동안 매일, 그 생각에 완전히 사로잡혔었다고."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_MiscDialogue
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_HelpWanted_020_TopLevel01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Bernhard
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMBernhardKleiber
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 003BFAE3
#. DialogueBefore = Bernhard: Hear, hear! Bravery and stupidity are one and the same. I should know.
#. EDID: [010215BB]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000217"
msgid "I did not survive the Tragedy of Shinar just to forget its lessons."
msgstr "시날의 비극을 겪고도 아무런 교훈조차 얻지 못했다면, 난 살아남지 못했을 거야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_MiscDialogue
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_HelpWanted_020_TopLevel01
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Bernhard
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00129589
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Bernhard: Oh, these young fools, so certain of their morality. What do they know, eh?
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Yes, let us celebrate the young and the fearless, and build monuments to their heroism!
#. EDID: [01021732]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000218"
msgid "Foolish or not, their bravery should be commended."
msgstr "어리석든 아니든, 그 사람들의 용기는 칭찬받아 마땅합니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_MiscDialogue
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_HelpWanted_020_TopLevel01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Bernhard
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMBernhardKleiber
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 003118C1
#. ScriptNotes = Serious / to Player Default
#. Prompt = They know more than a coward like you.
#. DialogueAfter = Bernhard: I did not survive the Tragedy of Shinar just to forget its lessons.
#. EDID: [01021587]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000219"
msgid "You will find it harder when your mouth is full of dirt."
msgstr "입에 흙이 들어가면, 그런 모욕도 더는 못할 테니까."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_MiscDialogue
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_HelpWanted_020_TopLevel01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Bernhard
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMBernhardKleiber
#. Face = Angry
#. SoundFileID = 00D158AE
#. ScriptNotes = Angry / to Player Default
#. Prompt = They know more than a coward like you.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: They know more than a coward like you.
#. EDID: [01021587]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00021A"
msgid "Yes, hurl your insults while you still take breath!"
msgstr "그래, 아직 숨이 붙어 있을 때 마음껏 모욕해 보라고!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_MiscDialogue
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_HelpWanted_030_TopLevel02
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Bernhard
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMBernhardKleiber
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0099D2AB
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Everything always seems fine at first.
#. EDID: [010217AC]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00021B"
msgid "We were humble scientists, studying the land, and making discoveries."
msgstr "우리는 보잘것없는 과학자들이었어. 그저 그 땅을 연구하고 새로운 것을 발견하고 있었지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_MiscDialogue
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_HelpWanted_030_TopLevel02
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Bernhard
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMBernhardKleiber
#. Face = Disgust
#. SoundFileID = 00E8B78C
#. ScriptNotes = Disgust / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I'm not familiar with the Tragedy of Shinar.
#. EDID: [010217AC]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00021C"
msgid "Shinar was a research outpost built out in the far reaches of space."
msgstr "시날은 먼 우주에 세워진 전초기지었어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_MiscDialogue
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_HelpWanted_030_TopLevel02
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Bernhard
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMBernhardKleiber
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 007CE5C4
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = I've never heard of this settlement.
#. DialogueAfter = Bernhard: I can find him. I could go to Shinar and follow the trail.
#. EDID: [0102170F]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00021D"
msgid "All thanks to a lone pirate who tricked us all."
msgstr "모두를 속인 그 해적 놈 때문에 그런 꼴이 된 거지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_MiscDialogue
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_HelpWanted_030_TopLevel02
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Bernhard
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMBernhardKleiber
#. Face = Angry
#. SoundFileID = 00D4F6C2
#. ScriptNotes = Angry / to Player Default
#. Prompt = I've never heard of this settlement.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I've never heard of this settlement.
#. EDID: [0102170F]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00021E"
msgid "That's because it no longer exists. It has no more place on a map than the rocks and the trees."
msgstr "이젠 존재하지 않으니까. 지도에서 그곳은 그냥 돌맹이와 나무만 있는 곳과 다를 바 없게 됐거든."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_MiscDialogue
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_HelpWanted_030_TopLevel02
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMBernhardKleiber
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMBernhardKleiber
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00AFAD47
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = No good comes from helping strangers.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: No good comes from helping strangers.
#. DialogueAfter = Bernhard: I can find him. I could go to Shinar and follow the trail.
#. EDID: [01021830]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00021F"
msgid "Yes. He doomed our entire settlement. But he lives, and we died."
msgstr "맞아. 그 자식은 우리 정착지를 통째로 파멸로 몰고 갔지. 하지만 그 자식은 버젓이 살아남았고, 우리는 죽었지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_MiscDialogue
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_HelpWanted_020_TopLevel01
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Bernhard
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0099AD52
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Bernhard: Oh, these young fools, so certain of their morality. What do they know, eh?
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: And they learn nothing. I should know.
#. EDID: [010217E9]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000220"
msgid "They know nothing."
msgstr "그 사람들 정말 세상 물정을 하나도 모르는군."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_MiscDialogue
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_HelpWanted_030_TopLevel02
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00F31BE3
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Everything always seems fine at first. &&& Bernhard: It would've continued to be thus, had we not invited a stranger into our home. &&& Bernhard: There was a shipwreck with a lone survivor. We rescued him, brought him back, and treated his wounds. &&& Bernhard: He repaid us by stealing our ship, wrecking our comms, and leaving us there to die.|All because we gave him shelter. Because we did the right thing.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Yes. He doomed our entire settlement. But he lives, and we died.
#. EDID: [010215D8]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000221"
msgid "No good comes from helping strangers."
msgstr "모르는 사람을 도와줘 봤자 좋은 결과는 안 나오는 법이죠."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_MiscDialogue
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_HelpWanted_030_TopLevel02
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0029B64C
#. DialogueAfter = Bernhard: Shinar was a research outpost built out in the far reaches of space.
#. EDID: [01021564]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000222"
msgid "I'm not familiar with the Tragedy of Shinar."
msgstr "시날의 참극은 잘 모르겠는데."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_MiscDialogue
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_HelpWanted_020_TopLevel01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Bernhard
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMBernhardKleiber
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00BA6484
#. ScriptNotes = Serious / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Foolish or not, their bravery should be commended.
#. DialogueAfter = Bernhard: I did not survive the Tragedy of Shinar just to forget its lessons.
#. EDID: [01021786]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000223"
msgid "Let them watch us toast them, from the pits of their early graves!"
msgstr "우리가 건배하는 모습이나 지켜보라지! 개죽임당해 파묻힌 구덩이 속에서!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_MiscDialogue
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_HelpWanted_020_TopLevel01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Bernhard
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMBernhardKleiber
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00EA8FD9
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Foolish or not, their bravery should be commended.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Foolish or not, their bravery should be commended.
#. EDID: [01021786]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000224"
msgid "Yes, let us celebrate the young and the fearless, and build monuments to their heroism!"
msgstr "그래, 그 어리고 겁대가리 없는 녀석들을 찬양하자고! 녀석들의 영웅주의를 기리는 기념비도 아주 번듯하게 세워주고!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_MiscDialogue
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_HelpWanted_020_TopLevel01
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Bernhard
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
