#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Bernhard: Oh, these young fools, so certain of their morality. What do they know, eh?
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Yes, hurl your insults while you still take breath!
#. EDID: [01021673]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000225"
msgid "They know more than a coward like you."
msgstr "그 사람들이 당신 같은 겁쟁이보다는 세상 물정에 대해 더 잘 아는 거 같네."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_MiscDialogue
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_HelpWanted_020_TopLevel01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Bernhard
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMBernhardKleiber
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 007C80EC
#. ScriptNotes = Serious / to Player Default
#. Prompt = They're young. Let them be.
#. DialogueAfter = Bernhard: I did not survive the Tragedy of Shinar just to forget its lessons.
#. EDID: [01021546]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000226"
msgid "And I'll wait for the moment I can tell them \"I told you so.\""
msgstr "그러고는 녀석들 면전에 대고 \"내가 뭐랬냐\"라고 비웃어 줄 순간이 오길 기다릴 거야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_MiscDialogue
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_HelpWanted_020_TopLevel01
