#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000228"
msgid "They're young. Let them be."
msgstr "아직 다들 어리잖아. 그냥 내버려 둬."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_MiscDialogue
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_HelpWanted_020_TopLevel01
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00A7EFA7
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Bernhard: Oh, these young fools, so certain of their morality. What do they know, eh?
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Hear, hear! Bravery and stupidity are one and the same. I should know.
#. EDID: [010216C9]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000229"
msgid "No one who's seen war would want any part of it."
msgstr "전쟁을 겪어본 사람이라면 그 근처엔 얼씬거리고 싶지도 않을 겁니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_MiscDialogue
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_HelpWanted_000_StartScene01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Bernhard
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMBernhardKleiber
#. Face = Disgust
#. SoundFileID = 00CCF5C1
#. ScriptNotes = Disgust / to BarPatron
#. DialogueBefore = BarPatron: I'm going to enlist in the Vanguard.
#. DialogueAfter = BarPatron: Because it's the right thing to do.
#. EDID: [010216EE]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00022A"
msgid "Why? Why volunteer for such misery?"
msgstr "대체 왜? 왜 사서 고생을 하려는 거야?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_MiscDialogue
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_HelpWanted_020_TopLevel01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMBernhardKleiber
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMBernhardKleiber
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 003C2C0B
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = No one who's seen war would want any part of it.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: No one who's seen war would want any part of it.
#. DialogueAfter = Bernhard: I did not survive the Tragedy of Shinar just to forget its lessons.
#. EDID: [01021656]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00022B"
msgid "Hear, hear! Bravery and stupidity are one and the same. I should know."
msgstr "그럼! 그렇고 말고! 용맹함과 미련함은 결국 종이 한 장 차이지. 내가 직접 겪어봐서 잘 알지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_MiscDialogue
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_HelpWanted_020_TopLevel01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Bernhard
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMBernhardKleiber
#. Face = Disgust
#. SoundFileID = 00D30144
#. ScriptNotes = Disgust / to Player Default
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: No one who's seen war would want any part of it.
#. EDID: [0102167E]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00022C"
msgid "Oh, these young fools, so certain of their morality. What do they know, eh?"
msgstr "오, 이 어리고 어리석은 녀석들아. 그놈의 허황된 신념에 아주 단단히 빠졌구나. 세상 물정도 모르면서! 엉?"

#. List: 2
