msgctxt "00023C"
msgid "Mm-hm."
msgstr "음-흠."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMHalCaruso
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMHalCaruso
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00DA8418
#. EDID: [01021804]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00023D"
msgid "Don't worry about me being a flight risk. I won't fight what's already written."
msgstr "내가 도망칠까 걱정하지 마. 이미 쓰인 운명에 맞서진 않을 테니까."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMHalCaruso
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMHalCaruso
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00036902
#. EDID: [01021803]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00023E"
msgid "We'll talk more later."
msgstr "나중에 더 얘기하자."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMHalCaruso
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMHalCaruso
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00552A2E
#. EDID: [01021802]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00023F"
msgid "I'll be around if you have other questions."
msgstr "궁금한 게 더 있으면 난 근처에 있을게."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_b1000_IvicaGreet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Ivica
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMIvicaVukovic
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00B72741
#. Prompt = What favor did Caruso do for you?
#. DialogueBefore = Ivica: He donated supplies and his ship to this settlement.
#. DialogueAfter = Ivica: It's temporary. We just need the robot to help out for a time.
#. EDID: SFBGS00D_MS_HW_IvicaShared03
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000240"
msgid "There was always something fishy about that story. Now I know why."
msgstr "그 얘긴 늘 뭔가 수상했어. 이제야 이유를 알겠군."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_b1000_IvicaGreet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Ivica
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMIvicaVukovic
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00E9931C
#. Prompt = What favor did Caruso do for you?
#. DialogueBefore = Ivica: He donated supplies and his ship to this settlement.
#. DialogueAfter = Ivica: It's temporary. We just need the robot to help out for a time.
#. EDID: SFBGS00D_MS_HW_IvicaShared02
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000241"
msgid "Besides that? He got me slates of the last five Razer Derby championships. I'm still working through them, so no spoilers."
msgstr "그거 말고? 지난 다섯 번의 레이저 더비 챔피언십 슬레이트를 구해 줬어. 아직 보는 중이니까 스포일러는 하지 마."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2400_Caruso_TL09_Evidence
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMHalCaruso
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMHalCaruso
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00CCF9E9
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = I can hack into her computer, see if there isn't any evidence there.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I can hack into her computer, see if there isn't any evidence there.
#. DialogueAfter = Caruso: I think you'll just need to speak to her yourself.
#. EDID: SFBGS00D_MS_HW_QuestSharedInfo01
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000242"
msgid "If you can do it, it's worth the gamble."
msgstr "네가 할 수 있다면, 걸어볼 만한 도박이야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_150_Caruso_Greet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Caruso
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMHalCaruso
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00E41308
#. DialogueAfter = Caruso: It's better now, but there's still work to be done.
#. EDID: SFBGS00D_MS_HW_QuestSharedInfo02a
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000243"
msgid "When I arrived here, I found a place in dire straits. "
msgstr "내가 여기 도착했을 땐, 이곳은 정말 절박한 상황이었어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_150_Caruso_Greet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Caruso
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMHalCaruso
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00DD787E
#. DialogueBefore = Caruso: When I arrived here, I found a place in dire straits.
#. DialogueAfter = Caruso: Repairs are needed, physically and emotionally. I will need your help with both.
#. EDID: SFBGS00D_MS_HW_QuestSharedInfo02b
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000244"
msgid "It's better now, but there's still work to be done."
msgstr "지금은 나아졌지만, 아직 해야 할 일이 남아 있어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_b1000_IvicaGreet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Ivica
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMIvicaVukovic
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00D62382
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = I think I'll just find a cell to power the robot, thank you.
#. DialogueAfter = Ivica: One word: Magnets. The robot likes to go to the junkyard, and dig for spare parts.
#. EDID: SFBGS00D_MS_HW_QuestSharedInfo02
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000245"
msgid "Get out of here!"
msgstr "여기서 꺼져!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_b1000_IvicaGreet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Ivica
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMIvicaVukovic
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 009F0A38
#. ScriptNotes = Odjebi translates to fuck off / to Player Default
#. Prompt = I think I'll just find a cell to power the robot, thank you.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I think I'll just find a cell to power the robot, thank you.
#. EDID: SFBGS00D_MS_HW_QuestSharedInfo02
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000246"
msgid "Odjebi! And what am I supposed to do for work then?"
msgstr "꺼져(Odjebi)! 그럼 난 대체 무슨 일을 하라는 건데?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2600_GraceKim_TL10_Confront
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCFGraceKim
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFGraceKim
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 004B905B
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = [Grace's Computer] I'm just returning your belongings. I read your private logs. You're the supply thief.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: [Grace's Computer] I'm just returning your belongings. I read your private logs. You're the supply thief.
#. DialogueAfter = GraceKim: I was trying to get the blood sample for my research. When things got messy, I stole the Caelumite knowing it'd point to Yeats.
#. EDID: SFBGS00D_MS_HW_QuestSharedInfo04
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000247"
msgid "*Groan*. You know it's unethical to look through someone's personal logs, right?"
msgstr "*신음*. 남의 개인 기록을 뒤지는 건 비윤리적이라는 거 알지?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2600_GraceKim_TL10_Confront
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = GraceKim
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFGraceKim
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00C64C2F
#. DialogueBefore = GraceKim: Here's the Caelumite. That should be enough to clear Yeats.
#. EDID: SFBGS00D_MS_HW_QuestSharedInfo05
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000248"
msgid "I'll turn myself into the guard. We'll see how long that plays out once someone gets sick and needs my help."
msgstr "경비에게 자수하지. 누가 아파서 내 도움이 필요해지면 그게 얼마나 오래갈지 보자고."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2600_GraceKim_TL10_Confront
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCFGraceKim
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFGraceKim
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 004D42B8
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = So it IS Caspian's blood.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: So it IS Caspian's blood.
#. DialogueAfter = GraceKim: [Grace's Computer] You admitted to the theft on your computer. Time to fess up.
#. EDID: SFBGS00D_MS_HW_QuestSharedInfo03
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000249"
msgid "What? What are you implying?"
msgstr "뭐? 무슨 말을 하려는 거야?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2300_YeatsTL03_Enlightened
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Yeats
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMYeats
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00CD05CA
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: You're right. You should choose something else.
#. DialogueAfter = Yeats: You could preach for the House of the Enlightened.
#. EDID: SFBGS00D_MS_HW_QuestSharedInfo06
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00024A"
msgid "And what would you recommend?"
msgstr "그럼 당신은 뭘 추천하겠소?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2300_YeatsTL03_Enlightened
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Yeats
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00E8353B
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: You don't have to preach anything. Religion, atheism, or otherwise. &&& Yeats: And what authority do I have as a man who believes in nothing?
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: And what would you recommend?
#. EDID: SFBGS00D_MS_HW_QuestSharedInfo07
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00024B"
msgid "You're right. You should choose something else."
msgstr "네 말이 맞아. 다른 걸 선택하는 게 좋겠어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2300_YeatsTL03_Enlightened
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Yeats
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMYeats
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0032BB19
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Religion is a crutch. You need to stand up and face reality.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Religion is a crutch. You need to stand up and face reality.
#. DialogueAfter = Yeats: Hm. I will ruminate on this discussion. You have given me much to ponder.
#. EDID: SFBGS00D_MS_HW_QuestSharedInfo08
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00024C"
msgid "That feels even more hopeless, but a hard truth is still the truth. It must be stomached, even if the taste is sour."
msgstr "그건 더 절망적으로 들리지만, 쓰디쓴 진실도 진실이야. 맛이 시더라도 삼켜야 해."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2300_YeatsTL03_Enlightened
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Yeats
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMYeats
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0074B52A
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueAfter = Yeats: You could preach for the House of the Enlightened.
#. EDID: SFBGS00D_MS_HW_QuestSharedInfo09
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00024D"
msgid "I started to find company in drink and poetry, and became the lowly slug you see before you."
msgstr "나는 술과 시에서 벗을 찾기 시작했고, 결국 네 앞에 보이는 이 비천한 민달팽이가 됐지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2300_YeatsTL03_Enlightened
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Yeats
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMYeats
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00DF738C
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. EDID: SFBGS00D_MS_HW_QuestSharedInfo09
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00024F"
msgid "But shortly after I arrived here, there was a mass exodus. I lost the people's ear, and with it, my voice."
msgstr "하지만 내가 이곳에 도착하고 얼마 지나지 않아 사람들이 대거 떠났어. 사람들은 내 말을 듣지 않게 됐고, 그와 함께 내 목소리도 잃었지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2300_YeatsTL03_Enlightened
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Yeats
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMYeats
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0077B766
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: What did you preach before you lost your faith?
#. EDID: SFBGS00D_MS_HW_QuestSharedInfo09
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000250"
msgid "I was a preacher for the Sanctum Universum. A pretty good one, in fact. "
msgstr "나는 우주의 성소의 설교자였어. 사실 꽤 괜찮은 설교자였지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2300_YeatsTL03_Enlightened
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Yeats
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00C22CD3
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Let's talk about your faith. &&& Yeats: I have no faith. In anything. &&& Yeats: In other words, I am a free agent! Taking applications to serve as the mouth of God or Gods or No-God at all.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: I was a preacher for the Sanctum Universum. A pretty good one, in fact.
#. EDID: SFBGS00D_MS_HW_QuestSharedInfo10
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000251"
msgid "What did you preach before you lost your faith?"
msgstr "믿음을 잃기 전에는 무엇을 설교했나요?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_b1000_IvicaGreet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Ivica
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMIvicaVukovic
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00F7B4FC
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = What favor did Caruso do for you?
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: What favor did Caruso do for you?
#. DialogueAfter = Ivica: Besides that? He got me slates of the last five Razer Derby championships. I'm still working through them, so no spoilers.
#. EDID: SFBGS00D_MS_HW_IvicaShared01
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000252"
msgid "He donated supplies and his ship to this settlement."
msgstr "그는 이 정착지에 물자와 자기 우주선을 기부했어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCFGraceKim
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFGraceKim
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 007F37A1
#. EDID: SFFL_MS01_QuestSharedInfo09
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000253"
msgid "You made the wrong move. Somebody's gonna get hurt, or sick, and I won't be there to save them."
msgstr "넌 잘못된 선택을 했어. 누군가는 다치거나 병들 테고, 난 그들을 구해 주러 거기 없을 거야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCFSashaAtwell
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFSashaAtwell
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00779BBB
#. EDID: [01021855]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000255"
msgid "Sometimes I see the light on in Grace's tent all night. That woman could use a break"
msgstr "가끔 밤새도록 그레이스의 텐트에 불이 켜져 있는 게 보입니다. 좀 쉬면서 했으면 좋겠습니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCFSashaAtwell
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFSashaAtwell
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 004EA9D4
#. EDID: [01021854]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000256"
msgid "If you need medical attention, talk to Grace, she'll set you up."
msgstr "치료가 필요하면 그레이스한테 말해보십쇼. 잘 처치해 줄 겁니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCFSashaAtwell
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFSashaAtwell
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 005958B1
#. EDID: [01021853]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000257"
msgid "Ivica says Sunni is lazy, but I think it's an act. She does her job on her own time."
msgstr ""
"이비차는 써니가 땡땡이친다고 생각하지만, 그냥 그런 척하는 것뿐이라 생각합니다. 써니는 자기 속도에 맞춰서 일 처리를 다 해놓으니 "
"말입니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCFSashaAtwell
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFSashaAtwell
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00ABCB5E
#. EDID: [01021852]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000258"
msgid "Yeats is the town preacher and drunk. Right now he's doing both in jail."
msgstr "예이츠는 우리 마을의 목사 겸 술주정뱅이입니다. 지금 감옥에 갇혀서 설교랑 술주정을 동시에 하고 있죠."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCFSashaAtwell
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFSashaAtwell
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 001D8F1D
#. EDID: [01021851]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000259"
msgid "Big Hal's one of those guys who speaks from his chest. Sometimes it feels like he could knock you back with his breath."
msgstr "빅 할은 가슴으로 말하는 사나이죠. 가끔은 그 숨소리만으로도 뒤로 자빠질 것 같습니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCFZenaHield
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFZenaHield
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00935F94
#. EDID: [0102184F]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00025A"
msgid "I rely a lot on Dr. Kim to alleviate my aches and pains. She's a genius of a doctor."
msgstr "몸의 통증을 덜어내는 데 킴 의사에게 많이 의지하고 있어. 그녀는 천재적인 의사야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCFZenaHield
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFZenaHield
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00AE7420
#. EDID: [0102184E]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00025B"
msgid "I'm sorry, I've got too much to deal with right now. If you have business here, speak with Hal Caruso."
msgstr "미안하지만 지금은 처리할 일이 너무 많아. 여기 볼일이 있으면 할 카루소와 얘기해."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCFZenaHield
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFZenaHield
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 000C6EAF
#. EDID: [0102184D]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00025C"
msgid "This outpost is holding on by a thread. If it weren't for Hal..."
msgstr "이 전초기지는 간신히 버티고 있어. 할이 아니었다면..."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMIvicaVukovic
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMIvicaVukovic
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00A7D9EF
#. EDID: [0102184B]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00025D"
msgid "I've been listening to these relaxation tapes, but they aren't helping."
msgstr "이완 테이프를 듣고 있는데 전혀 도움이 안 돼."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMIvicaVukovic
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMIvicaVukovic
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00D92F8B
#. EDID: [0102184A]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00025E"
msgid "Grace and Sunni Kim couldn't be more different as siblings. You have to wonder if Sunni was adopted."
msgstr "그레이스와 써니 킴은 남매라고 보기 어려울 만큼 달라. 써니가 입양된 건 아닌지 궁금할 정도야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMIvicaVukovic
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMIvicaVukovic
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 003B4000
#. EDID: [01021849]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00025F"
msgid "I trained as a boxer when I was young. It taught me discipline. How to weather a punch in the gut. Life is full of such punches."
msgstr "어릴 때 복싱을 배웠어. 그게 내게 규율을 가르쳐 줬지. 배에 한 방 맞고도 버티는 법도. 인생은 그런 한 방으로 가득하니까."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMIvicaVukovic
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMIvicaVukovic
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 007080E3
#. EDID: [01021848]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000260"
msgid "Hal is Caspian's mentor. But someone needs to do the same for Sunni Kim. In my opinion, she's lazy."
msgstr "할은 캐스피언의 멘토야. 하지만 누군가는 써니 킴에게도 똑같이 해줘야 해. 내 생각엔 그 애는 게을러."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMIvicaVukovic
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMIvicaVukovic
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00BBFC12
#. EDID: [01021847]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000261"
msgid "There's a lot that needs doing here. But outside of Hal? No one wants to actually do the work."
msgstr "여긴 해야 할 일이 정말 많아. 그런데 할 말고는? 아무도 실제로 일하려 하지 않아."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMIvicaVukovic
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMIvicaVukovic
#. Face = Grateful
#. SoundFileID = 007DFAC7
#. ScriptNotes = Grateful
#. EDID: [01021845]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000262"
msgid "The ore from the mine will pay huge dividends. Starting with the generators."
msgstr "광산의 광석은 큰 이익을 가져올 거야. 발전기부터 시작해서 말이지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMIvicaVukovic
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMIvicaVukovic
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 006C9F16
#. EDID: [01021844]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000263"
msgid "Good work with the robot. Damn machines are no substitute for hard work."
msgstr "로봇 건은 잘했어. 빌어먹을 기계는 성실한 노동을 대신할 수 없지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMIvicaVukovic
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMIvicaVukovic
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 003F98A0
#. EDID: [01021843]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000264"
msgid "We had a deal, stranger. I suggest you honor it."
msgstr "거래하지 않았나. 외지인. 거래는 지키는 게 좋을 거야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMIvicaVukovic
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMIvicaVukovic
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00BC4A19
#. EDID: [01021842]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000265"
msgid "You said you were gonna scrap that robot. So why is it walking around like it owns the place?"
msgstr "그 로봇을 폐기하겠다고 했잖아. 그런데 왜 제 집인 양 돌아다니고 있는 거지?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCFSunniKim
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFSunniKim
#. Face = Tired
#. SoundFileID = 00C53666
#. ScriptNotes = Tired
#. EDID: [01021840]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000266"
msgid "*Yawn*"
msgstr "*하품*"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCFSunniKim
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFSunniKim
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0070EA0E
#. EDID: [0102183F]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000267"
msgid "Can't believe we got visitors coming to this dump."
msgstr "이런 쓰레기장에 방문객이 오다니 믿을 수가 없네."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCFSunniKim
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFSunniKim
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0072F1D4
#. EDID: [0102183E]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000268"
msgid "I got Big Hal to cover for like... three of shifts this week. Next week, I'm going for four."
msgstr "이번 주엔 빅 할한테 내 교대를... 세 번쯤 대신 서게 했어. 다음 주엔 네 번을 노릴 거야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCFSunniKim
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFSunniKim
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0081EBD7
#. EDID: [0102183D]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000269"
msgid "Yo."
msgstr "요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMHalCaruso
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMHalCaruso
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00AB563F
#. EDID: [0102183B]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00026A"
msgid "Once we finish the outpost's business, we can settle ours."
msgstr "전초기지 일을 끝내고 나면, 우리 일도 마무리할 수 있겠지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMHalCaruso
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMHalCaruso
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00C43694
#. EDID: [0102183A]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00026B"
msgid "You being here is kismet. The reaper coming to collect. I just thought I had more time."
msgstr "네가 여기 온 건 운명이야. 거두러 온 사신이지. 난 그저 시간이 좀 더 있을 줄 알았어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMHalCaruso
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMHalCaruso
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0055CABF
#. EDID: [01021839]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00026C"
msgid "I'll make my daily rounds. I trust you can keep our discussion private."
msgstr "난 일일 순찰을 돌겠네. 우리 대화는 비밀로 해줄 거라 믿어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2410_Sasha_Greet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Sasha
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFSashaAtwell
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00C076AD
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: I found the missing supplies.
#. EDID: [0102158B]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00026E"
msgid "All right, out with it. Hal says you got some new info that'll exonerate Yeats."
msgstr "좋습니다. 한번 말해 보시죠. 할의 말대로면 예이츠의 누명을 벗겨줄 새 정보가 있겠죠."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2600_GraceKim_TL10_Confront
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = GraceKim
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 003D1FB1
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: So what blood type is he? I'd like to know. &&& GraceKim: Just give me a moment to run the test. &&& GraceKim: Let me just mix it with the serum here and... there are no antigens? |Which means both Ivica AND Caspian are Rh-Null? That's impossible.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: What? What are you implying?
#. EDID: [010216E4]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00026F"
msgid "I'm sorry, but I lied to you. That blood isn't Ivica's. I just wanted to verify it's Caspian's."
msgstr "미안하지만, 너에게 거짓말했어. 그 피는 이비차의 것이 아니야. 캐스피언의 피인지 확인하고 싶었을 뿐이야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_d2750_YeatsCarusoSasha
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Caruso
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMHalCaruso
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00979D53
#. DialogueBefore = Sasha: All right Hal, I'm here. What's this big break in the case you pulled out the rabbit's hat?
#. DialogueAfter = Sasha: All right, out with it. Hal says you got some new info that'll exonerate Yeats.
#. EDID: [0102176B]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000270"
msgid "Not me. Talk to the newcomer. They've been investigating on my behalf."
msgstr "내가 찾은 게 아냐. 여기 신참 친구랑 얘기해 보라고. 나 대신 사건을 열심히 조사해 준 장본인이니까."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2500_GraceKim_TL00
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = GraceKim
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFGraceKim
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 007DC434
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: I'd like to ask you some questions.
#. EDID: [01021627]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000271"
msgid "I've been trying to convince him it's necessary and he just refuses to cooperate."
msgstr "필요한 일이라고 계속 설득해 봤지만, 그는 협조를 거부하고 있어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2500_GraceKim_TL00
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = GraceKim
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFGraceKim
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00932319
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Is there anything I can help you with?
#. EDID: [01021627]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000272"
msgid "Well, I seriously doubt he'll say yes, but if you can do me a favor, ask Ivica if he'll submit to a blood typing test."
msgstr "글쎄, 그가 승낙할 가능성은 정말 낮다고 보지만, 부탁 하나만 들어줄 수 있다면 이비차에게 혈액형 검사를 받아 줄 수 있는지 물어봐 줘."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2600_GraceKim_TL10_Confront
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = GraceKim
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFGraceKim
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 002815D2
#. DialogueBefore = GraceKim: Here's the Caelumite. That should be enough to clear Yeats.
#. EDID: [010217C6]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000273"
msgid "Just keep your end of the bargain."
msgstr "네가 맡은 몫만 지켜."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2600_GraceKim_TL10_Confront
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = GraceKim
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFGraceKim
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 005097DF
#. DialogueBefore = GraceKim: Just give me a moment to run the test.
#. EDID: [0102173F]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000274"
msgid "Let me just mix it with the serum here and... there are no antigens? "
msgstr "여기 혈청과 섞어 보면... 항원이 없다고?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2600_GraceKim_TL10_Confront
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = GraceKim
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0063A23F
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: So what blood type is he? I'd like to know. &&& GraceKim: Just give me a moment to run the test. &&& GraceKim: Let me just mix it with the serum here and... there are no antigens? |Which means both Ivica AND Caspian are Rh-Null? That's impossible.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: What? What are you implying?
#. EDID: [0102177A]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000275"
msgid "Because you got Caspian's blood on your gloves."
msgstr "네 장갑에 캐스피언의 피가 묻었으니까."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2600_GraceKim_TL10_Confront
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = GraceKim
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00475CFD
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: So it IS Caspian's blood. &&& GraceKim: What? What are you implying? &&& GraceKim: We can just mix it with a serum here to see if it produces antibodies. Hm... looks like a type AB positive.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: I don't remember, okay? And I don't keep everything on my computer. I have written documentation too.
#. EDID: [01021724]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000276"
msgid "What creature? Where's the lab data from that examination?"
msgstr "무슨 생물? 그 검사에 대한 실험실 데이터는 어디 있지?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2600_GraceKim_TL10_Confront
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = GraceKim
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 006C9DFE
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: [Evidence] I have something for you. &&& GraceKim: Oh, what do you have there? Surgical gloves and a used syringe?|Did you find these in the trash? I would advise you against handling such things.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: You must be joking. Those are my gloves and syringe, yes, but I was likely using them on a creature.
#. EDID: [0102168C]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000277"
msgid "They're your gloves and a tranquilizer from your lab. Which makes you a suspect in the supply theft."
msgstr "네 장갑과 네 연구실의 진정제야. 그러니 넌 물자 절도 사건의 용의자가 되는 거지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2600_GraceKim_TL10_Confront
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = GraceKim
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 005BCFDC
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: So it IS Caspian's blood. &&& GraceKim: What? What are you implying? &&& GraceKim: We can just mix it with a serum here to see if it produces antibodies. Hm... looks like a type AB positive.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: I can tell you right now who that is. It's Yeats.
#. EDID: [01021686]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000278"
msgid "So we just need to find someone with that blood type."
msgstr "그럼 그 혈액형을 가진 사람을 찾기만 하면 되겠군."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_d2750_YeatsCarusoSasha
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Sasha
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFSashaAtwell
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00A9492B
#. DialogueAfter = Caruso: Not me. Talk to the newcomer. They've been investigating on my behalf.
#. EDID: [01021647]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000279"
msgid "All right Hal, I'm here. What's this big break in the case you pulled out the rabbit's hat?"
msgstr "좋습니다. 할. 저 여기 있습니다. 마술사 모자에서 토끼라도 꺼내듯 찾아냈다는 그 결정적 단서가 대체 뭡니까?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2600_GraceKim_TL10_Confront
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = GraceKim
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFGraceKim
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 009BD632
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Where's the Caelumite now?
#. DialogueAfter = GraceKim: Don't try to pass the blame. You put an innocent man away.
#. EDID: [010217A0]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00027A"
msgid "But turns out I didn't need to go that far."
msgstr "그런데 알고 보니 그렇게까지 할 필요는 없었어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2600_GraceKim_TL10_Confront
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = GraceKim
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFGraceKim
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00A28769
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Where's the Caelumite now?
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Where's the Caelumite now?
#. EDID: [010217A0]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00027B"
msgid "I still have it. Well, most of it anyway. I synthesized some into chems, just in case I needed to ditch the evidence."
msgstr "아직 가지고 있어. 뭐, 대부분은 말이야. 증거를 없애야 할 경우를 대비해서 일부는 약물로 합성했어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2600_GraceKim_TL10_Evidence
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00C7373E
#. DialogueAfter = GraceKim: *Groan*. You know it's unethical to look through someone's personal logs, right?
#. EDID: [010215B2]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00027C"
msgid "[Evidence] You're the supply thief. I hacked into your computer and found a confession."
msgstr "[증거] 당신이 물자 도둑이야. 당신 컴퓨터를 해킹해서 자백을 찾았어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2600_GraceKim_TL10_Confront
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = GraceKim
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00E45A0A
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Don't try to pass the blame. You put an innocent man away. &&& GraceKim: Innocent? Let's not act like Yeats hasn't pissed us all off with his drinking. &&& GraceKim: Anyway, there, you have the truth. &&& GraceKim: So what now? Are you going to turn my sister in, or is there room to negotiate here?
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: You say I took the Caelumite for medicine but forgot to log the transfer. We blame the whole thing on negligence.
#. EDID: [01021723]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00027D"
msgid "What are you proposing?"
msgstr "무슨 제안을 하는 거지?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2600_GraceKim_TL10_Confront
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = GraceKim
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFGraceKim
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00F9D234
#. DialogueBefore = GraceKim: Innocent? Let's not act like Yeats hasn't pissed us all off with his drinking.
#. DialogueAfter = GraceKim: So what now? Are you going to turn my sister in, or is there room to negotiate here?
#. EDID: [010216D4]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00027E"
msgid "Anyway, there, you have the truth."
msgstr "어쨌든, 자, 이게 진실이야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_b1100_Ivica_TL05
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Ivica
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMIvicaVukovic
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0027870E
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Dr. Kim wants you to do a blood typing test?
#. EDID: [01021597]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00027F"
msgid "Absolutely not. If she wants my blood, she can come and take it herself."
msgstr "절대 안 돼. 내 피를 원한다면 직접 와서 가져가라고 해."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2600_GraceKim_TL10_Confront
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = GraceKim
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFGraceKim
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00B0E331
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = So we just need to find someone with that blood type.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: So we just need to find someone with that blood type.
#. DialogueAfter = GraceKim: What do you think? Did he do it?
#. EDID: [0102163E]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000280"
msgid "I can tell you right now who that is. It's Yeats."
msgstr "그게 누군지 지금 바로 말해줄 수 있어. 예이츠야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2600_GraceKim_TL10_Confront
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = GraceKim
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00A80799
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: [Grace's Computer] You admitted to the theft on your computer. Time to fess up. &&& ... &&& GraceKim: *Sigh* Fine, I admit it. I took the supplies. &&& GraceKim: I was trying to get the blood sample for my research. When things got messy, I stole the Caelumite knowing it'd point to Yeats. &&& GraceKim: I had hoped Sasha would let Yeats go with a slap on the wrist, but she turned it into this whole thing.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: A bloodhound is going to want meat. I just gave it to her.
#. EDID: [010215A3]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000281"
msgid "She just went where the evidence took her."
msgstr "그녀는 그저 증거가 이끄는 곳으로 갔을 뿐이야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_b1100_Ivica_TL05
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0065087B
#. DialogueAfter = Ivica: Absolutely not. If she wants my blood, she can come and take it herself.
#. EDID: [0102156E]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000282"
msgid "Dr. Kim wants you to do a blood typing test?"
msgstr "킴 의사가 당신에게 혈액형 검사를 하라고 해?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2600_GraceKim_TL10_Confront
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = GraceKim
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFGraceKim
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00747E96
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Keep your bribes. I'm letting her slide as a favor to you. But I want Yeats' name cleared.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Keep your bribes. I'm letting her slide as a favor to you. But I want Yeats' name cleared.
#. DialogueAfter = GraceKim: Here's the Caelumite. That should be enough to clear Yeats.
#. EDID: [0102159D]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000283"
msgid "I'd feel better if you took something, but fine. You're still in bed with me regardless."
msgstr "뭔가를 복용하면 더 안심이 되겠지만, 좋아. 어쨌든 넌 아직 내 병상에 있는 거니까."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2500_GraceKim_TL00
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 006ABFB5
#. DialogueAfter = GraceKim: Well, I seriously doubt he'll say yes, but if you can do me a favor, ask Ivica if he'll submit to a blood typing test.
#. EDID: [01021719]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000284"
msgid "Is there anything I can help you with?"
msgstr "내가 도울 일이 있나?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2600_GraceKim_TL10_Confront
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = GraceKim
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00904574
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Don't try to pass the blame. You put an innocent man away. &&& GraceKim: Innocent? Let's not act like Yeats hasn't pissed us all off with his drinking. &&& GraceKim: Anyway, there, you have the truth. &&& GraceKim: So what now? Are you going to turn my sister in, or is there room to negotiate here?
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: I'd feel better if you took something, but fine. You're still in bed with me regardless.
#. EDID: [0102180F]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000285"
msgid "Keep your bribes. I'm only letting you go because you provide a vital service. But I want Yeats' name cleared."
msgstr "뇌물은 됐어. 네가 꼭 필요한 서비스를 제공하니까 보내주는 것뿐이야. 하지만 예이츠의 누명은 벗겨져야 해."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2600_GraceKim_TL10_Confront
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = GraceKim
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 001D0F72
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Don't try to pass the blame. You put an innocent man away. &&& GraceKim: Innocent? Let's not act like Yeats hasn't pissed us all off with his drinking. &&& GraceKim: Anyway, there, you have the truth. &&& GraceKim: So what now? Are you going to turn my sister in, or is there room to negotiate here?
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: I'd feel better if you took something, but fine. You're still in bed with me regardless.
#. EDID: [0102180E]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000286"
msgid "Keep your bribes. I'm letting her slide as a favor to you. But I want Yeats' name cleared."
msgstr "뇌물은 됐어. 네 부탁이니까 그녀를 봐주는 거야. 하지만 예이츠의 누명은 벗겨져야 해."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2600_GraceKim_TL10_Confront
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = GraceKim
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFGraceKim
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00D3AEC9
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = What creature? Where's the lab data from that examination?
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: What creature? Where's the lab data from that examination?
#. DialogueAfter = GraceKim: [Grace's Computer] Cut the act. I read your logs. You stole the Caelumite after trying to obtain a blood sample.
#. EDID: [01021775]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000287"
msgid "I don't remember, okay? And I don't keep everything on my computer. I have written documentation too."
msgstr "기억 안 난다고, 알겠어? 그리고 난 모든 걸 컴퓨터에만 보관하지 않아. 서면 기록도 있어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2600_GraceKim_TL10_Confront
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = GraceKim
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFGraceKim
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00BCC380
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = You're covering for your sister, a chem addict. She stole the supplies.
#. DialogueAfter = GraceKim: Anyway, there, you have the truth.
#. EDID: [01021749]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000288"
msgid "When Yeats took the fall for that, I thought it'd be no big deal. But Sasha took it too far."
msgstr "그 일로 예이츠가 뒤집어썼을 때는 별일 아닐 줄 알았어. 그런데 사샤가 너무 멀리 갔지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2600_GraceKim_TL10_Confront
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = GraceKim
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFGraceKim
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00B001CE
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = You're covering for your sister, a chem addict. She stole the supplies.
#. EDID: [01021749]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000289"
msgid "She asked me to synthesize them into chems, but I refused. "
msgstr "그녀가 그걸 약물로 합성해 달라고 했지만, 난 거절했어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2600_GraceKim_TL10_Confront
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = GraceKim
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFGraceKim
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00A5C76F
#. ScriptNotes = Lying and throwing her sister under the bus. / to Player Default
#. Prompt = You're covering for your sister, a chem addict. She stole the supplies.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: You're covering for your sister, a chem addict. She stole the supplies.
#. EDID: [01021749]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00028A"
msgid "*Sigh* It's that obvious, huh. Yeah, Sunni's the one who stole the Caelumite."
msgstr "*한숨* 그렇게 티가 나나. 그래, 캘루마이트를 훔친 건 써니야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2600_GraceKim_TL10_Confront
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = GraceKim
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFGraceKim
#. Face = Defiant
#. SoundFileID = 00DA187D
#. ScriptNotes = Defiant / to Player Default
#. Prompt = They're your gloves and a tranquilizer from your lab. Which makes you a suspect in the supply theft.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: They're your gloves and a tranquilizer from your lab. Which makes you a suspect in the supply theft.
#. DialogueAfter = GraceKim: [Grace's Computer] Cut the act. I read your logs. You stole the Caelumite after trying to obtain a blood sample.
#. EDID: [010216D5]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00028B"
msgid "You must be joking. Those are my gloves and syringe, yes, but I was likely using them on a creature."
msgstr "농담하는 거겠지. 그게 내 장갑과 주사기인 건 맞아. 하지만 아마 생물에게 쓰고 있었을 거야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2600_GraceKim_TL10_Confront
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = GraceKim
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFGraceKim
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 005C01F5
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = [Extortion] That's of no use to me. I want credits instead.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: [Extortion] That's of no use to me. I want credits instead.
#. DialogueAfter = GraceKim: Here's the Caelumite. That should be enough to clear Yeats.
#. EDID: [01021663]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00028C"
msgid "*Sigh* Fine. I trust we have a deal then."
msgstr "*한숨* 좋아. 그럼 거래가 성립된 걸로 믿겠어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2600_GraceKim_TL10_Confront
