#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Don't try to pass the blame. You put an innocent man away. &&& GraceKim: Innocent? Let's not act like Yeats hasn't pissed us all off with his drinking. &&& GraceKim: Anyway, there, you have the truth. &&& GraceKim: So what now? Are you going to turn my sister in, or is there room to negotiate here?
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: *Sigh* Fine. I trust we have a deal then.
#. EDID: [01021612]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00028D"
msgid "[Extortion] That's of no use to me. I want credits instead."
msgstr "[협박] 그건 나한테 쓸모없어. 대신 크레딧을 원해."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2600_GraceKim_TL10_Confront
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = GraceKim
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFGraceKim
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00CFBF04
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = According to your records, that would make it Yeats' blood.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: According to your records, that would make it Yeats' blood.
#. DialogueAfter = GraceKim: What do you think? Did he do it?
#. EDID: [01021638]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00028E"
msgid "That's the most likely scenario. And it'd back up what everyone is saying about him."
msgstr "그게 가장 그럴듯한 상황이야. 그리고 모두가 그에 대해 하는 말도 뒷받침하겠지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2600_GraceKim_TL10_Confront
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = GraceKim
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0051D461
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Don't try to pass the blame. You put an innocent man away. &&& GraceKim: Innocent? Let's not act like Yeats hasn't pissed us all off with his drinking. &&& GraceKim: Anyway, there, you have the truth. &&& GraceKim: So what now? Are you going to turn my sister in, or is there room to negotiate here?
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: You're making a mistake. But fine, I can see I don't have a choice.
#. EDID: [01021579]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00028F"
msgid "Sorry. No deal."
msgstr "미안. 거래는 없어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2600_GraceKim_TL10_Confront
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = GraceKim
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00314606
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: So it IS Caspian's blood. &&& GraceKim: What? What are you implying? &&& GraceKim: We can just mix it with a serum here to see if it produces antibodies. Hm... looks like a type AB positive.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: That's the most likely scenario. And it'd back up what everyone is saying about him.
#. EDID: [010215EA]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000290"
msgid "According to your records, that would make it Yeats' blood."
msgstr "네 기록에 따르면, 그건 예이츠의 피라는 뜻이야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2600_GraceKim_TL10_Confront
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = GraceKim
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0076E8F4
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: [Grace's Computer] You admitted to the theft on your computer. Time to fess up. &&& ... &&& GraceKim: *Sigh* Fine, I admit it. I took the supplies. &&& GraceKim: I was trying to get the blood sample for my research. When things got messy, I stole the Caelumite knowing it'd point to Yeats. &&& GraceKim: I had hoped Sasha would let Yeats go with a slap on the wrist, but she turned it into this whole thing.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: I still have it. Well, most of it anyway. I synthesized some into chems, just in case I needed to ditch the evidence.
#. EDID: [0102174E]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000291"
msgid "Where's the Caelumite now?"
msgstr "캘루마이트는 지금 어디 있지?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2600_GraceKim_TL10_Confront
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 007826C1
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Don't try to pass the blame. You put an innocent man away. &&& GraceKim: Innocent? Let's not act like Yeats hasn't pissed us all off with his drinking. &&& GraceKim: Anyway, there, you have the truth. &&& GraceKim: So what now? Are you going to turn my sister in, or is there room to negotiate here?
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Good.
#. EDID: [010217C5]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000292"
msgid "You have a deal."
msgstr "거래하지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2600_GraceKim_TL10_Confront
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = GraceKim
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFGraceKim
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00FB7F04
#. DialogueBefore = GraceKim: Good.
#. DialogueAfter = GraceKim: Just keep your end of the bargain.
#. EDID: [0102179C]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000293"
msgid "Here's the Caelumite. That should be enough to clear Yeats."
msgstr "여기 캘루마이트야. 이 정도면 예이츠의 누명을 벗기기에 충분할 거야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2600_GraceKim_TL10_Confront
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = GraceKim
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00D13848
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: In my opinion, Yeats is the supply thief. &&& GraceKim: I'm afraid that's what the science says. I'm sorry. I know a lot of folks were hoping Yeats was innocent. &&& GraceKim: Now, if you'll excuse me, I have some samples to analyze.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: *Sigh* It's that obvious, huh. Yeah, Sunni's the one who stole the Caelumite.
#. EDID: [010216FD]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000294"
msgid "You're covering for someone."
msgstr "넌 누군가를 감싸고 있어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2600_GraceKim_TL10_Confront
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = GraceKim
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00FB8B60
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: In my opinion, Yeats is the supply thief. &&& GraceKim: I'm afraid that's what the science says. I'm sorry. I know a lot of folks were hoping Yeats was innocent. &&& GraceKim: Now, if you'll excuse me, I have some samples to analyze.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: *Sigh* It's that obvious, huh. Yeah, Sunni's the one who stole the Caelumite.
#. EDID: [010216FC]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000295"
msgid "You're covering for your sister, a chem addict. She stole the supplies."
msgstr "넌 약물 중독자인 네 여동생을 감싸고 있어. 그녀가 물자를 훔쳤지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2600_GraceKim_TL10_Confront
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCFGraceKim
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFGraceKim
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00A584F2
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Don't try to pass the blame. You put an innocent man away.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Don't try to pass the blame. You put an innocent man away.
#. DialogueAfter = GraceKim: Anyway, there, you have the truth.
#. EDID: [0102168B]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000296"
msgid "Innocent? Let's not act like Yeats hasn't pissed us all off with his drinking."
msgstr "무죄라고? 예이츠가 술 때문에 우리 모두를 짜증나게 한 적이 없는 척하지는 말자고."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2600_GraceKim_TL10_Confront
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = GraceKim
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFGraceKim
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0061AF97
#. DialogueBefore = GraceKim: *Groan*. You know it's unethical to look through someone's personal logs, right?
#. DialogueAfter = GraceKim: [Grace's Computer] You admitted to the theft on your computer. Time to fess up.
#. EDID: [01021619]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000297"
msgid "Look, I'm just going to be frank with you. Do you have any real proof? Because if not, then I suggest you leave."
msgstr "솔직히 말할게. 진짜 증거가 있나? 없다면 떠나는 게 좋겠어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2600_GraceKim_TL10_Confront
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = GraceKim
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFGraceKim
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 002B2266
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Sorry. No deal.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Sorry. No deal.
#. DialogueAfter = GraceKim: Here's the Caelumite. That should be enough to clear Yeats.
#. EDID: [010215C7]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000298"
msgid "You're making a mistake. But fine, I can see I don't have a choice."
msgstr "넌 실수하고 있어. 하지만 좋아, 내겐 선택의 여지가 없다는 건 알겠어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2600_GraceKim_zSC10
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = GraceKim
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFGraceKim
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00848E2A
#. EDID: [010217CD]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000299"
msgid "Yes, but I'm not a combat medic either."
msgstr "맞아. 하지만 나도 야전 의무병은 아니야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2600_GraceKim_zSC10
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = GraceKim
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFGraceKim
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00161C6D
#. EDID: [010217CC]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00029A"
msgid "You're right. I am the most qualified here. I can see where you're going with this."
msgstr "네 말이 맞아. 내가 여기서 가장 자격이 있지. 네가 무슨 말을 하려는지 알겠어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2600_GraceKim_TL10_Confront
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
