#. DialogueAfter = GraceKim: Here's the Caelumite. That should be enough to clear Yeats.
#. EDID: [01021531]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00029B"
msgid "Good. "
msgstr "좋아. "

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2600_GraceKim_TL10_Confront
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = GraceKim
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFGraceKim
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 006A689F
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = What are you proposing?
#. DialogueAfter = GraceKim: You have a deal.
#. EDID: [01021774]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00029C"
msgid "In exchange, I'll give you half price on medical treatment. And, I'll owe you a favor. "
msgstr "대신 의료 처치는 반값으로 해줄게. 그리고 네게 빚 하나 지지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2600_GraceKim_TL10_Confront
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = GraceKim
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFGraceKim
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 004F9B35
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = What are you proposing?
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: What are you proposing?
#. EDID: [01021774]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00029D"
msgid "You say I took the Caelumite for medicine but forgot to log the transfer. We blame the whole thing on negligence."
msgstr "내가 약을 만들려고 캘루마이트를 가져갔지만 이전 기록을 깜빡했다고 말해. 이 일은 전부 부주의 탓으로 돌리는 거야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2600_GraceKim_TL10_Confront
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = GraceKim
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFGraceKim
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00764E5F
#. DialogueBefore = GraceKim: *Sigh* Fine, I admit it. I took the supplies.
#. DialogueAfter = GraceKim: I had hoped Sasha would let Yeats go with a slap on the wrist, but she turned it into this whole thing.
#. EDID: [01021702]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00029E"
msgid "I was trying to get the blood sample for my research. When things got messy, I stole the Caelumite knowing it'd point to Yeats."
msgstr "연구를 위해 혈액 샘플을 얻으려 했어. 일이 꼬이자, 예이츠에게 의심이 가도록 캘루마이트를 훔쳤지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2600_GraceKim_zSC08
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = GraceKim
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFGraceKim
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0040A8E0
#. EDID: [01021644]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00029F"
msgid "There's no motive though. Why would I need to steal?"
msgstr "하지만 동기가 없잖아. 내가 왜 훔쳐야 하는데?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2600_GraceKim_zSC08
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = GraceKim
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFGraceKim
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0045CC3F
#. EDID: [01021643]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0002A0"
msgid "I know, it's hard to argue against that."
msgstr "알아, 그 말에 반박하긴 어렵지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2600_GraceKim_TL10_Confront
