#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 009463B8
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: [Grace's Computer] You admitted to the theft on your computer. Time to fess up. &&& ... &&& GraceKim: *Sigh* Fine, I admit it. I took the supplies. &&& GraceKim: I was trying to get the blood sample for my research. When things got messy, I stole the Caelumite knowing it'd point to Yeats. &&& GraceKim: I had hoped Sasha would let Yeats go with a slap on the wrist, but she turned it into this whole thing.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Innocent? Let's not act like Yeats hasn't pissed us all off with his drinking.
#. EDID: [0102163D]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0002A2"
msgid "Don't try to pass the blame. You put an innocent man away."
msgstr "책임을 떠넘기려 하지 마. 넌 무고한 사람을 감옥에 넣었어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2600_GraceKim_zSC11
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = GraceKim
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFGraceKim
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00A2595A
#. EDID: [010215CE]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0002A3"
msgid "Leave my sister out of this."
msgstr "내 여동생은 이 일에서 빼."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2600_GraceKim_zSC11
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = GraceKim
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFGraceKim
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 006DADE2
#. EDID: [010215CD]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0002A4"
msgid "No, I don't want to get Sunni in trouble."
msgstr "아니, 써니가 곤란해지는 건 싫어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2600_GraceKim_zSC11
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00700F7B
#. EDID: [01021536]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0002A5"
msgid "Your sister Sunni tried to cover up for you. Clearly she knows."
msgstr "네 여동생 써니가 널 감싸려 했어. 분명 알고 있는 거야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2600_GraceKim_TL10_Confront
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = GraceKim
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00DD5C17
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: [Grace's Computer] You admitted to the theft on your computer. Time to fess up. &&& ... &&& GraceKim: *Sigh* Fine, I admit it. I took the supplies. &&& GraceKim: I was trying to get the blood sample for my research. When things got messy, I stole the Caelumite knowing it'd point to Yeats. &&& GraceKim: I had hoped Sasha would let Yeats go with a slap on the wrist, but she turned it into this whole thing.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Very funny. But Sasha is pretty predictable, I won't lie.
#. EDID: [01021816]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0002A6"
msgid "Typical of a cop to mess up a standard house call and assault."
msgstr "경찰답네. 평범한 왕진과 폭행 사건 하나도 망쳐 놓다니."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2600_GraceKim_zSC10
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00447190
#. EDID: [01021729]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0002A7"
msgid "Administering the tranquilizer would've required medical training. That makes you a suspect."
msgstr "진정제를 투여하려면 의학 훈련이 필요했을 거야. 그러니 넌 용의자야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2600_GraceKim_zSC09
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = GraceKim
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFGraceKim
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0008CB8D
#. EDID: [010216DA]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0002A8"
msgid "I don't think anyone would've left him bleeding like that..."
msgstr "아무도 그를 그렇게 피 흘리게 내버려두진 않았을 것 같아..."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2600_GraceKim_zSC09
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00D2B9CA
#. EDID: [01021691]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0002A9"
msgid "The suspect bandaged Caspian up. Clearly you were qualified to."
msgstr "용의자는 캐스피언에게 붕대를 감아 줬어. 분명 당신은 그럴 자격이 있었지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2600_GraceKim_TL10_Confront
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = GraceKim
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFGraceKim
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 002A282D
#. DialogueBefore = GraceKim: I was trying to get the blood sample for my research. When things got messy, I stole the Caelumite knowing it'd point to Yeats.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Don't try to pass the blame. You put an innocent man away.
#. EDID: [010216B1]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0002AA"
msgid "I had hoped Sasha would let Yeats go with a slap on the wrist, but she turned it into this whole thing."
msgstr "사샤가 예이츠를 가벼운 경고로 풀어주길 바랐는데, 그녀가 이걸 이렇게 큰일로 만들어 버렸어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2600_GraceKim_zSC03
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = GraceKim
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFGraceKim
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00BCB87C
#. EDID: [010217AB]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0002AB"
msgid "You can't prove that. And like I said, there's likely contamination."
msgstr "그건 증명할 수 없어. 그리고 말했듯이 오염됐을 가능성이 있어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2600_GraceKim_zSC03
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = GraceKim
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFGraceKim
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00A5E05C
#. EDID: [010217AA]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0002AC"
msgid "I get your point. And I'm not saying the sample is foolproof either. Yeats might be innocent, like you say."
msgstr "무슨 말인지는 알겠어. 샘플이 완벽하다고 말하는 것도 아니야. 네 말처럼 예이츠가 무죄일 수도 있지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2600_GraceKim_zSC07
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = GraceKim
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFGraceKim
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00E46817
#. EDID: [0102181C]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0002AD"
msgid "Absolutely not. You can't coerce me into confessing."
msgstr "절대 안 돼. 날 강제로 자백하게 만들 순 없어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2600_GraceKim_zSC07
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = GraceKim
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFGraceKim
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 008EF23D
#. EDID: [0102181B]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0002AE"
msgid "You wouldn't..."
msgstr "설마 그러진 않겠지..."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2600_GraceKim_TL10_Confront
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = GraceKim
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFGraceKim
#. Face = Defiant
#. SoundFileID = 002ECBEB
#. ScriptNotes = Defiant
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: You have a deal.
#. EDID: [010216E7]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0002AF"
msgid "Keep in mind I am the only doctor in this outpost. "
msgstr "명심해, 이 전초기지의 의사는 나뿐이야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2600_GraceKim_TL10_Confront
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = GraceKim
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFGraceKim
#. Face = Angry
#. SoundFileID = 0012E763
#. ScriptNotes = Angry
#. DialogueBefore = GraceKim: Anyway, there, you have the truth.
#. EDID: [010216E7]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0002B0"
msgid "So what now? Are you going to turn me in, or is there room to negotiate here?"
msgstr "그래서 이제 어쩔 거야? 날 신고할 건가, 아니면 협상의 여지가 있나?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2600_GraceKim_TL10_Confront
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = GraceKim
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFGraceKim
#. Face = Defiant
#. SoundFileID = 000557A8
#. ScriptNotes = Defiant
#. DialogueBefore = GraceKim: Anyway, there, you have the truth.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: You have a deal.
#. EDID: [010216E6]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0002B1"
msgid "So what now? Are you going to turn my sister in, or is there room to negotiate here?"
msgstr "그래서 이제 어쩔 거야? 내 여동생을 신고할 건가, 아니면 협상의 여지가 있나?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2600_GraceKim_zSC06
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = GraceKim
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFGraceKim
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 007D055E
#. EDID: [01021755]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0002B2"
msgid "What? I'm not going to take the fall for him just so we can have a church."
msgstr "뭐? 예배당 하나 세우자고 내가 그 사람 대신 뒤집어쓸 생각은 없어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2600_GraceKim_zSC06
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = GraceKim
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFGraceKim
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00CCC368
#. EDID: [01021754]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0002B3"
msgid "I understand it's important, long term. I just..."
msgstr "장기적으로 중요하다는 건 이해해. 그냥..."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2600_GraceKim_zSC06
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00FE45EE
#. EDID: [010216B6]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0002B4"
msgid "You should just take the fall for this. We need Yeats to lead the House of Worship."
msgstr "넌 그냥 이걸 뒤집어써야 해. 예배당을 이끌려면 예이츠가 필요해."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2600_GraceKim_zSC05
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = GraceKim
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFGraceKim
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00D33CA2
#. EDID: [010217D9]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0002B5"
msgid "No. You haven't proven anything."
msgstr "아니. 넌 아무것도 증명하지 못했어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2600_GraceKim_zSC05
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = GraceKim
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFGraceKim
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 003BA2DE
#. EDID: [010217D8]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0002B6"
msgid "I'm not going to admit anything without evidence."
msgstr "증거 없이는 아무것도 인정하지 않을 거야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2600_GraceKim_zSC05
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = GraceKim
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFGraceKim
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00680361
#. EDID: [010217D7]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0002B7"
msgid "I'm sorry, but that's not evidence of anything."
msgstr "미안하지만, 그건 어떤 증거도 아니야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2600_GraceKim_zSC05
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = GraceKim
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFGraceKim
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00C6C67F
#. EDID: [010217D5]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0002B8"
msgid "I might be in trouble then, regardless of the facts."
msgstr "그럼 사실과 상관없이 곤란해질 수도 있겠군."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2600_GraceKim_zSC05
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = GraceKim
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFGraceKim
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00CC6445
#. EDID: [010217D4]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0002B9"
msgid "Is that how everyone else feels too? Damn."
msgstr "다른 사람들도 다 그렇게 느끼나? 젠장."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2600_GraceKim_TL10_Confront
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = GraceKim
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 008542E0
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: According to your records, that would make it Yeats' blood. &&& GraceKim: That's the most likely scenario. And it'd back up what everyone is saying about him.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: I agree. That kind of work is more common than you think, especially out here.
#. EDID: [01021761]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0002BA"
msgid "I think that's the most likely explanation."
msgstr "그게 가장 그럴듯한 설명이라고 생각해."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2600_GraceKim_zSC05
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00686D18
#. EDID: [01021731]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0002BB"
msgid "Stop wasting everyone's time. Confess already."
msgstr "다들 시간 낭비 그만하게 해. 당장 자백해."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2600_GraceKim_zSC05
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00210C72
#. EDID: [01021730]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0002BC"
msgid "Just admit you did it. Everyone thinks so."
msgstr "그냥 네가 했다고 인정해. 모두 그렇게 생각해."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2600_GraceKim_zSC05
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0025D845
#. EDID: [0102172F]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0002BD"
msgid "I have a feeling you're guilty. And I trust my gut."
msgstr "네가 유죄라는 느낌이 들어. 난 내 직감을 믿어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2540_GraceKim_TL04
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00B9CC24
#. DialogueAfter = GraceKim: Oh god no. I keep all chems, syringes, and equipment under lock and key.
#. EDID: [010215AD]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0002BE"
msgid "Are the medical supplies here free to use by anyone?"
msgstr "여기 의료 용품은 누구나 자유롭게 써도 되는 건가?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2600_GraceKim_zSC04
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = GraceKim
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFGraceKim
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00CE6ABD
#. EDID: [0102155E]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0002BF"
msgid "That's true. I... I don't have an answer for that."
msgstr "그건 사실이야. 난... 그에 대한 답이 없어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2600_GraceKim_zSC04
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00399A9A
#. EDID: [01021822]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0002C0"
msgid "You said yourself no one else had access to the gloves and the tranquilizer."
msgstr "장갑과 진정제에 접근할 수 있는 사람은 아무도 없다고 네가 직접 말했잖아."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2600_GraceKim_zSC08
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00E69321
#. EDID: [010215A8]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0002C1"
msgid "The gloves and tranquilizer alone implicate you."
msgstr "장갑과 진정제만으로도 네 혐의는 충분해."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2600_GraceKim_zSC07
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 002B8F31
#. EDID: [010217A5]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0002C2"
msgid "Look, I don't care what the evidence is. Either admit guilt or I will have to hurt the people you love."
msgstr "증거가 뭐든 상관없어. 죄를 인정해. 안 그러면 네가 사랑하는 사람들을 해칠 수밖에 없어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2600_GraceKim_zSC03
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00E9BE9C
#. EDID: [0102170A]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0002C3"
msgid "You're caught up in your own lies. I'd be willing to bet that blood doesn't actually match Yeats'."
msgstr "넌 네 거짓말에 스스로 발목이 잡혔어. 그 피가 실제로 예이츠의 피와 일치하지 않을 거라고 걸 수도 있어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2600_GraceKim_zSC02
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00FDCFBC
#. EDID: [01021672]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0002C4"
msgid "Clearly you're trying to get blood type data. No one else here has a need for it."
msgstr "분명 혈액형 데이터를 얻으려는 거야. 여기서 그게 필요한 사람은 너 말고 없어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2600_GraceKim_TL10_Confront
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = GraceKim
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFGraceKim
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00B603FE
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = We don't have a good suspect at this point.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: We don't have a good suspect at this point.
#. DialogueAfter = GraceKim: Now, if you'll excuse me, I have some samples to analyze.
#. EDID: [01021563]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0002C5"
msgid "Then we have to rely on Sasha's investigation. If she thinks Yeats did it, then he'll need to serve time for it."
msgstr "그럼 사샤의 수사에 의존해야 해. 그녀가 예이츠가 했다고 생각한다면, 그는 그 죄로 복역해야겠지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2600_GraceKim_zSC01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = GraceKim
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFGraceKim
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0047C546
#. EDID: [01021622]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0002C6"
msgid "I admit, I needed that information."
msgstr "인정할게, 그 정보가 필요했어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2600_GraceKim_TL10_Confront
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCFGraceKim
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFGraceKim
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00FF2960
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = In my opinion, Yeats is the supply thief.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: In my opinion, Yeats is the supply thief.
#. DialogueAfter = GraceKim: Now, if you'll excuse me, I have some samples to analyze.
#. EDID: [010216C4]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0002C7"
msgid "I'm afraid that's what the science says. I'm sorry. I know a lot of folks were hoping Yeats was innocent."
msgstr "유감이지만 과학은 그렇게 말해. 미안해. 예이츠가 무죄이길 바라는 사람들이 많았다는 건 알아."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2540_GraceKim_TL04
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = GraceKim
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFGraceKim
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00E536D5
#. EDID: [010215F8]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0002C8"
msgid "Medicine is a powerful tool, but one easily abused."
msgstr "의학은 강력한 도구지만, 쉽게 남용될 수 있어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2540_GraceKim_TL04
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = GraceKim
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFGraceKim
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00D688F7
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Are the medical supplies here free to use by anyone?
#. EDID: [010215F8]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0002C9"
msgid "Oh god no. I keep all chems, syringes, and equipment under lock and key."
msgstr "맙소사, 아니야. 약물, 주사기, 장비는 전부 자물쇠로 잠가 보관해."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2600_GraceKim_TL10_Confront
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = GraceKim
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFGraceKim
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 003D5652
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = I don't have anything concrete, no.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I don't have anything concrete, no.
#. DialogueAfter = GraceKim: Look, I'm just going to be frank with you. Do you have any real proof? Because if not, then I suggest you leave.
#. EDID: [010217E2]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0002CA"
msgid "*Scoffs* I'm sorry, but I don't have time to play these games. I've got work to do."
msgstr "*코웃음* 미안하지만, 이런 장난에 어울릴 시간 없어. 할 일이 있거든."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2600_GraceKim_TL10_Confront
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = GraceKim
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00979CC5
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: In my opinion, Yeats is the supply thief. &&& GraceKim: I'm afraid that's what the science says. I'm sorry. I know a lot of folks were hoping Yeats was innocent. &&& GraceKim: Now, if you'll excuse me, I have some samples to analyze.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: *Scoffs* I'm sorry, but I don't have time to play these games. I've got work to do.
#. EDID: [01021785]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0002CB"
msgid "I don't know, it's just a hunch."
msgstr "모르겠어, 그냥 직감이야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2600_GraceKim_TL10_Confront
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = GraceKim
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00600D88
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: In my opinion, Yeats is the supply thief. &&& GraceKim: I'm afraid that's what the science says. I'm sorry. I know a lot of folks were hoping Yeats was innocent. &&& GraceKim: Now, if you'll excuse me, I have some samples to analyze.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: *Scoffs* I'm sorry, but I don't have time to play these games. I've got work to do.
#. EDID: [01021784]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0002CC"
msgid "I don't have anything concrete, no."
msgstr "구체적인 건 없어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2600_GraceKim_TL10_Confront
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00024AFF
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: [Grace's Computer] I'm just returning your belongings. I read your private logs. You're the supply thief. &&& GraceKim: *Groan*. You know it's unethical to look through someone's personal logs, right?
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Just give me a moment to run the test.
#. EDID: [01021569]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0002CD"
msgid "So what blood type is he? I'd like to know."
msgstr "그래서 그 사람 혈액형이 뭐지? 알고 싶어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2600_GraceKim_zSC02
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = GraceKim
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFGraceKim
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00052780
#. EDID: [010216BE]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0002CE"
msgid "True, I can see why it'd look suspicious."
msgstr "맞아, 왜 수상해 보이는지는 알겠어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2600_GraceKim_TL10_Confront
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0092FFE9
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: In my opinion, Yeats is the supply thief. &&& GraceKim: I'm afraid that's what the science says. I'm sorry. I know a lot of folks were hoping Yeats was innocent. &&& GraceKim: Now, if you'll excuse me, I have some samples to analyze.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: *Groan*. You know it's unethical to look through someone's personal logs, right?
#. EDID: [010215B4]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0002CF"
msgid "[Grace's Computer] You admitted to the theft on your computer. Time to fess up."
msgstr "[그레이스의 컴퓨터] 당신 컴퓨터에서 절도를 인정했잖아. 이제 자백할 시간이야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2600_GraceKim_zSC01
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 003751D2
#. EDID: [010215D7]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0002D0"
msgid "You were after Caspian's blood."
msgstr "당신은 캐스피언의 피를 노리고 있었어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2600_GraceKim_TL10_Confront
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCFGraceKim
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFGraceKim
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00171445
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = So what blood type is he? I'd like to know.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: So what blood type is he? I'd like to know.
#. DialogueAfter = GraceKim: Let me just mix it with the serum here and... there are no antigens?
#. EDID: [010215BA]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0002D1"
msgid "Just give me a moment to run the test."
msgstr "검사할 시간을 조금만 줘."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2600_GraceKim_TL10_Confront
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = GraceKim
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFGraceKim
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00CEC6BD
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = I think that's the most likely explanation.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: I was hoping you might provide insight on where this blood and syringe came from.
#. EDID: [010217B1]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0002D2"
msgid "And I think I'd remember if I performed surgery on a person."
msgstr "그리고 내가 사람에게 수술을 했다면 기억했을 거야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2600_GraceKim_TL10_Confront
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = GraceKim
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFGraceKim
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0047D5DC
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = I think that's the most likely explanation.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I think that's the most likely explanation.
#. EDID: [010217B1]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0002D3"
msgid "I agree. That kind of work is more common than you think, especially out here. "
msgstr "동의해. 그런 일은 생각보다 흔해, 특히 이런 곳에서는."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2320_Caspian_Scene
