#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 000D8ED4
#. DialogueBefore = Caspian: So I tried to pick up the broken glass and put it in this box, and I cut my fingers. |Stupid, I know.
#. DialogueAfter = Caspian: And then out of nowhere, I feel this sharp, jabbing pain in my neck. I start to turn around, and then boom! I pass out.
#. EDID: [01021586]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0002D4"
msgid "So now there's blood and glass everywhere. So I turn to look for a broom."
msgstr "그래서 이제 피와 유리 조각이 사방에 있었어. 그래서 빗자루를 찾으러 돌아섰지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2600_GraceKim_TL10_Confront
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = GraceKim
