#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMCaspianRoberson
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00BA9C8B
#. DialogueBefore = Caspian: So the night it all went down, I was organizing the supplies over here, trying to get my system right.
#. DialogueAfter = Caspian: So I tried to pick up the broken glass and put it in this box, and I cut my fingers.
#. EDID: [0102153F]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0002D6"
msgid "That's when I dropped a box of mason jars."
msgstr "그때 내가 메이슨자 병 한 상자를 떨어뜨렸어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2600_GraceKim_TL10_Confront
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0046EDEC
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I'm not sure. I'm trying to figure out who stole them. &&& GraceKim: You shouldn't overthink it. Only one person had the motive. Sadly, that's Yeats. &&& GraceKim: What do you think? Did he do it?
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: I'm afraid that's what the science says. I'm sorry. I know a lot of folks were hoping Yeats was innocent.
#. EDID: [01021678]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0002D7"
msgid "In my opinion, Yeats is the supply thief."
msgstr "내 생각엔 예이츠가 물자 도둑이야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2600_GraceKim_TL10_Confront
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = GraceKim
