#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 009DC0B3
#. DialogueBefore = GraceKim: What? What are you implying?
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Is there anyone in the Outpost with that blood type? They might be a suspect.
#. EDID: [01021603]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0002D8"
msgid "We can just mix it with a serum here to see if it produces antibodies. Hm... looks like a type AB positive."
msgstr "여기 혈청과 섞어서 항체가 생기는지 보면 돼. 흠... AB형 Rh+인 것 같군."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2600_GraceKim_TL10_Confront
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = GraceKim
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFGraceKim
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0075AF6D
#. DialogueBefore = GraceKim: I'm afraid that's what the science says. I'm sorry. I know a lot of folks were hoping Yeats was innocent.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: [Grace's Computer] You admitted to the theft on your computer. Time to fess up.
#. EDID: [0102164F]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0002D9"
msgid "Now, if you'll excuse me, I have some samples to analyze."
msgstr "그럼 실례하지. 분석할 샘플이 좀 있어서."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2600_GraceKim_TL10_Confront
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = GraceKim
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0049B721
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: In my opinion, Yeats is the supply thief. &&& GraceKim: I'm afraid that's what the science says. I'm sorry. I know a lot of folks were hoping Yeats was innocent. &&& GraceKim: Now, if you'll excuse me, I have some samples to analyze.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: If you're going to make such a heavy accusation, I hope you can back it up.
#. EDID: [010216ED]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0002DA"
msgid "You're the supply thief."
msgstr "당신이 물자 도둑이야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2600_GraceKim_TL10_Confront
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = GraceKim
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFGraceKim
#. Face = Irritated
#. SoundFileID = 004F382B
#. ScriptNotes = Irritated / to Player Default
#. Prompt = I was hoping you might provide insight on where this blood and syringe came from.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I was hoping you might provide insight on where this blood and syringe came from.
#. DialogueAfter = GraceKim: What do you think? Did he do it?
#. EDID: [01021608]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0002DB"
msgid "Theft, most likely. Yeats may have stolen it from my lab to fulfill his chem habit."
msgstr "대부분은 절도겠지. 예이츠가 약물 습관을 채우려고 내 연구실에서 훔쳤을 수도 있어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2600_GraceKim_TL10_Confront
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = GraceKim
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 006BF8C2
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I'm not sure. I'm trying to figure out who stole them. &&& GraceKim: You shouldn't overthink it. Only one person had the motive. Sadly, that's Yeats. &&& GraceKim: What do you think? Did he do it?
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Then we have to rely on Sasha's investigation. If she thinks Yeats did it, then he'll need to serve time for it.
#. EDID: [01021829]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0002DC"
msgid "We don't have a good suspect at this point."
msgstr "현재로서는 마땅한 용의자가 없어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2600_GraceKim_TL10_Confront
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = GraceKim
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00A06796
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I'm not sure. I'm trying to figure out who stole them. &&& GraceKim: You shouldn't overthink it. Only one person had the motive. Sadly, that's Yeats. &&& GraceKim: What do you think? Did he do it?
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: What? Why would I do that?
#. EDID: [010215DD]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0002DD"
msgid "I don't think he did. I think you're hiding something."
msgstr "난 그가 했다고 생각하지 않아. 네가 뭔가 숨기고 있다고 생각해."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2600_GraceKim_TL10_Confront
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = GraceKim
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0026B9F8
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: [Lie] No, this is a sample of Ivica's blood. He's finally willing to donate to the cause. &&& GraceKim: *Exhales* Well it's about freaking time. |You don't know what a pain this has been, trying to get a simple blood sample from a very stubborn man.|And while the method of extraction looks a little sloppy, I'll take what I can get.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: You don't know the half of it. I've been arguing with this man for months. MONTHS.
#. EDID: [0102178B]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0002DE"
msgid "You sound relieved and overjoyed for a simple sample."
msgstr "단순한 샘플치고는 너무 안도하고 기뻐 보이는데."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2600_GraceKim_TL10_Confront
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = GraceKim
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFGraceKim
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00FA821F
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = You sound relieved and overjoyed for a simple sample.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: You sound relieved and overjoyed for a simple sample.
#. DialogueAfter = GraceKim: Let me just mix it with the serum here and... there are no antigens?
#. EDID: [010217E8]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0002DF"
msgid "You don't know the half of it. I've been arguing with this man for months. MONTHS."
msgstr "넌 절반도 몰라. 난 이 남자와 몇 달 동안 말다툼을 해 왔어. 몇 달 동안."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2600_GraceKim_TL10_Confront
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = GraceKim
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFGraceKim
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 002A2CDA
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = I don't think he did. I think you're hiding something.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I don't think he did. I think you're hiding something.
#. DialogueAfter = GraceKim: [Grace's Computer] You admitted to the theft on your computer. Time to fess up.
#. EDID: [01021629]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0002E0"
msgid "What? Why would I do that?"
msgstr "뭐? 내가 왜 그런 짓을 하지?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2600_GraceKim_TL10_Confront
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = GraceKim
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFGraceKim
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00E87067
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Do you want to know how I got it?
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Do you want to know how I got it?
#. DialogueAfter = GraceKim: So what blood type is he? I'd like to know.
#. EDID: [0102158D]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0002E1"
msgid "Absolutely. I'm guessing either you have a silver tongue, or you paid him in gold. Because I tried everything with that man."
msgstr "물론이지. 네가 말재주가 아주 좋거나, 아니면 황금이라도 쥐여줬나 보군. 난 그 남자에게 온갖 방법을 다 써 봤거든."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2600_GraceKim_TL10_Confront
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = GraceKim
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00747914
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: [Give Evidence] I need to know the blood type of the sample here, and what was in the syringe. &&& GraceKim: I can do this for you, with the caveat it's likely contaminated at this point. The result won't be conclusive proof of anything.|That being said, I'll still try to provide an answer for you. It'll only take a second to get a result.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Absolutely. I'm guessing either you have a silver tongue, or you paid him in gold. Because I tried everything with that man.
#. EDID: [01021545]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0002E2"
msgid "Do you want to know how I got it?"
msgstr "내가 그걸 어떻게 얻었는지 알고 싶어?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2600_GraceKim_TL10_Confront
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 002B0A54
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: So it IS Caspian's blood. &&& GraceKim: What? What are you implying? &&& GraceKim: We can just mix it with a serum here to see if it produces antibodies. Hm... looks like a type AB positive.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: As a matter of fact, that would be Yeats. And I believe he's already in custody.
#. EDID: [010217B7]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0002E3"
msgid "Is there anyone in the Outpost with that blood type? They might be a suspect."
msgstr "전초기지에 그 혈액형을 가진 사람이 있나? 용의자일지도 몰라."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2600_GraceKim_TL10_Confront
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = GraceKim
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFGraceKim
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0030BC6E
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = You're the supply thief.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: You're the supply thief.
#. DialogueAfter = GraceKim: Look, I'm just going to be frank with you. Do you have any real proof? Because if not, then I suggest you leave.
#. EDID: [0102173B]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0002E4"
msgid "If you're going to make such a heavy accusation, I hope you can back it up."
msgstr "그렇게 심각한 혐의를 제기하려면 뒷받침할 수 있었으면 좋겠어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2600_GraceKim_TL10_Confront
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 009A3F4A
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: So what blood type is he? I'd like to know. &&& GraceKim: Just give me a moment to run the test. &&& GraceKim: Let me just mix it with the serum here and... there are no antigens? |Which means both Ivica AND Caspian are Rh-Null? That's impossible.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: What? What are you implying?
#. EDID: [01021655]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0002E6"
msgid "So it IS Caspian's blood."
msgstr "그럼 정말 캐스피언의 피군."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2600_GraceKim_TL10_Confront
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = GraceKim
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFGraceKim
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 002E272A
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Might this blood belong to Yeats?
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Might this blood belong to Yeats?
#. DialogueAfter = GraceKim: I'm not sure. I'm trying to figure out who stole them.
#. EDID: [01021740]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0002E7"
msgid "I'd have to run an analysis, but I'd put money on it."
msgstr "분석을 해봐야겠지만, 내 돈을 걸 수 있을 정도야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2600_GraceKim_TL10_Confront
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = GraceKim
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00F892A3
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: So it IS Caspian's blood. &&& GraceKim: What? What are you implying? &&& GraceKim: We can just mix it with a serum here to see if it produces antibodies. Hm... looks like a type AB positive.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: I'd have to run a test but I haven't personally done any procedure like that. It's most likely from a dissection.
#. EDID: [010216C8]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0002E8"
msgid "Isn't there a chance this blood is human?"
msgstr "이 피가 인간의 것일 가능성은 없나?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2600_GraceKim_TL10_Confront
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = GraceKim
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFGraceKim
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00B1DFDF
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = I think Yeats stole your gloves and tranquilizer. I'm just trying to find proof.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I think Yeats stole your gloves and tranquilizer. I'm just trying to find proof.
#. DialogueAfter = GraceKim: What do you think? Did he do it?
#. EDID: [010216A4]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0002E9"
msgid "I don't really have proof to give you. But there's an overwhelming amount of circumstantial evidence pointing to him."
msgstr "네게 줄 만한 증거는 딱히 없어. 하지만 그를 가리키는 정황 증거가 압도적으로 많아."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2600_GraceKim_TL10_Confront
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCFGraceKim
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFGraceKim
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 005761C6
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Is there anyone in the Outpost with that blood type? They might be a suspect.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Is there anyone in the Outpost with that blood type? They might be a suspect.
#. DialogueAfter = GraceKim: What do you think? Did he do it?
#. EDID: [0102182F]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0002EA"
msgid "As a matter of fact, that would be Yeats. And I believe he's already in custody."
msgstr "사실대로 말하자면, 그건 예이츠야. 그리고 그는 이미 구금 중인 걸로 알아."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2600_GraceKim_TL10_Confront
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = GraceKim
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00607297
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I think that's the most likely explanation. &&& GraceKim: I agree. That kind of work is more common than you think, especially out here. |And I think I'd remember if I performed surgery on a person.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Theft, most likely. Yeats may have stolen it from my lab to fulfill his chem habit.
#. EDID: [010215BF]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0002EB"
msgid "I was hoping you might provide insight on where this blood and syringe came from."
msgstr "이 피와 주사기가 어디서 나온 건지 통찰을 줄 수 있을까 해서 왔어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2600_GraceKim_TL10_Confront
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = GraceKim
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00C20948
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: So we just need to find someone with that blood type. &&& GraceKim: I can tell you right now who that is. It's Yeats.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: I don't like where this questioning is going. What are you implying?
#. EDID: [01021592]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0002EC"
msgid "The blood doesn't appear to belong to any species native to this habitat."
msgstr "이 피는 이 거주지에 서식하는 어떤 토착종의 것도 아닌 것 같아."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2600_GraceKim_TL10_Confront
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00B78B77
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Is there anyone in the Outpost with that blood type? They might be a suspect. &&& GraceKim: As a matter of fact, that would be Yeats. And I believe he's already in custody.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: *Groan*. You know it's unethical to look through someone's personal logs, right?
#. EDID: [010217F7]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0002ED"
msgid "[Grace's Computer] Cut the act. I read your logs. You stole the Caelumite after trying to obtain a blood sample."
msgstr "[그레이스의 컴퓨터] 연기는 그만해. 네 기록을 읽었어. 넌 혈액 샘플을 얻으려 한 뒤 캘루마이트를 훔쳤지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2600_GraceKim_TL10_Confront
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = GraceKim
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFGraceKim
#. Face = Suspicious
#. SoundFileID = 005A8D4D
#. ScriptNotes = Suspicious / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Isn't there a chance this blood is human?
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Isn't there a chance this blood is human?
#. DialogueAfter = GraceKim: [Grace's Computer] Cut the act. I read your logs. You stole the Caelumite after trying to obtain a blood sample.
#. EDID: [01021714]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0002EE"
msgid "I'd have to run a test but I haven't personally done any procedure like that. It's most likely from a dissection."
msgstr "검사를 해봐야겠지만, 개인적으로 그런 시술을 한 적은 없어. 아마 해부에서 나온 것 같아."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2600_GraceKim_TL10_Confront
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = GraceKim
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00916E32
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Dissection? Really, doctor? I thought you'd come up with a more creative lie. &&& GraceKim: A lie? Are you accusing me of something?
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: I'd have to run an analysis, but I'd put money on it.
#. EDID: [010216F2]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0002EF"
msgid "Might this blood belong to Yeats?"
msgstr "이 피가 예이츠의 것일 수도 있을까?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2600_GraceKim_TL10_Confront
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = GraceKim
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFGraceKim
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00865E1C
