#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: You sound relieved and overjoyed for a simple sample.
#. EDID: [01021551]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00030C"
msgid "And while the method of extraction looks a little sloppy, I'll take what I can get."
msgstr "추출 방식이 좀 서툴러 보이긴 하지만, 이 정도라도 감지덕지야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2600_GraceKim_TL10_Confront
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = GraceKim
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFGraceKim
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00225490
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = [Lie] No, this is a sample of Ivica's blood. He's finally willing to donate to the cause.
#. EDID: [01021551]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00030D"
msgid "You don't know what a pain this has been, trying to get a simple blood sample from a very stubborn man."
msgstr "아주 고집 센 남자에게서 단순한 혈액 샘플 하나 얻으려고 얼마나 고생했는지 넌 모를 거야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2600_GraceKim_TL10_Confront
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = GraceKim
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFGraceKim
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00A66D49
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = [Lie] No, this is a sample of Ivica's blood. He's finally willing to donate to the cause.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: [Lie] No, this is a sample of Ivica's blood. He's finally willing to donate to the cause.
#. EDID: [01021551]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00030E"
msgid "*Exhales* Well it's about freaking time. "
msgstr "*숨 내뱉음* 이제야 됐네, 진짜."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2400_Caruso_TL09_Evidence
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Caruso
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMHalCaruso
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 000FB161
#. DialogueBefore = Caruso: I see. We may not have a choice. She's the only who can analyze the blood sample.
#. DialogueAfter = Caruso: In the meantime, I'll be here.
#. EDID: [010216D9]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00030F"
msgid "Very well. Deliver it to Dr. Kim. See if the blood matches Caspian's. If so, it validates his story."
msgstr "좋아. 킴 의사에게 가져가. 피가 캐스피언의 것과 일치하는지 봐. 맞다면 그의 이야기가 입증되는 거야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_b1200_Sunni_TL04COPY0000
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00CF76A5
#. DialogueAfter = SunniKim: Yeah, I saw that loser. He was bugging Caspian for something. Probably casing the joint.
#. EDID: [01021685]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000310"
msgid "I have questions on the stolen supplies. Sasha said you witnessed Yeats at the scene of the crime?"
msgstr "도난당한 물자에 대해 질문이 있어. 사샤 말로는 네가 범행 현장에서 예이츠를 봤다던데?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2320_Caspian_TL03
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 005CA39F
#. DialogueAfter = Caspian: I'm not assigned to anything yet, I fill in for the others when they need a break.
#. EDID: [010215EE]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000311"
msgid "What do you do around here?"
msgstr "여기서 무슨 일을 하죠?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2600_GraceKim_TL10_Confront
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 002A6237
#. DialogueAfter = GraceKim: Oh, what do you have there? Surgical gloves and a used syringe?
#. EDID: [0102160D]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000312"
msgid "[Evidence] I have something for you."
msgstr "[증거] 보여줄 게 있어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2400_Caruso_TL09_Evidence
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Caruso
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMHalCaruso
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00CAC75A
#. DialogueBefore = Caruso: Exactly. And the evidence we do have is flimsy.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: I can hack into her computer, see if there isn't any evidence there.
#. EDID: [010215C4]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000313"
msgid "If we could find out what her motive is, that and the gloves would be enough."
msgstr "그녀의 동기가 뭔지 알아낼 수 있다면, 그거와 장갑만으로 충분할 거야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_d3200_CarusoTL01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Caruso
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMHalCaruso
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0046CB32
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = I met a man named Bernhard Kleiber. Are you aware he survived?
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I met a man named Bernhard Kleiber. Are you aware he survived?
#. DialogueAfter = Caruso: You did what you had to.
#. EDID: [0102180D]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000314"
msgid "I was not. But he'll have his vengeance soon."
msgstr "난 아니었어. 하지만 그는 곧 복수를 하게 되겠지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2400_Caruso_TL09_Evidence
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Caruso
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMHalCaruso
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00E736F8
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Why Dr. Kim?
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Why Dr. Kim?
#. DialogueAfter = Caruso: That's what I would do.
#. EDID: [01021574]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000315"
msgid "She's the only one with the equipment and expertise to test the blood and find a match."
msgstr "그녀만이 피를 검사하고 일치하는 대상을 찾을 장비와 전문 지식을 갖추고 있어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_d3200_CarusoTL01
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Caruso
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 000D503F
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Before the vote, I want to talk about Shinar. &&& Caruso: I suspected you would. &&& Caruso: I didn't see what became of Shinar. But I can imagine. &&& Caruso: No ship, no comms. Dehydration sets in. Some choose death. Others are forced to make harder decisions.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: I was not. But he'll have his vengeance soon.
#. EDID: [0102179B]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000316"
msgid "I met a man named Bernhard Kleiber. Are you aware he survived?"
msgstr "버나드 클라이버라는 남자를 만났어. 그가 살아남았다는 걸 알고 있나?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_d3200_CarusoTL01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Caruso
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMHalCaruso
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0099B84D
#. DialogueBefore = Caruso: Nonetheless, I must face the consequences.
#. DialogueAfter = Caruso: This outpost has changed me. I see value in life. But that is not the same as being worthy of it.
#. EDID: [01021748]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000317"
msgid "Looking back, I never valued life. Not mine, not theirs."
msgstr "돌이켜보면, 난 삶을 소중히 여기지 않았어. 내 것도, 그들의 것도."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_b1000_IvicaGreet
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Ivica
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00E798FD
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Human labor is superior. If anything, the robot should be scrapped. &&& Ivica: Yes, yes... I am picking up what you are putting down. &&& Ivica: The robot is a useless heap of shit, but the parts are not. If, instead of repairing it, you were to break it...|I could use the spare parts to fix the mining machine.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: It's got a blown PCM. With a few tweaks, the parts from that Model A can fix it.
#. EDID: [01021618]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000318"
msgid "What's wrong with the mining machine?"
msgstr "채광 기계에 무슨 문제가 있죠?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2330_Caspian_Greeet
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Caspian
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00847C80
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Tell me what you know about the theft. &&& ... &&& Caspian: So I tried to pick up the broken glass and put it in this box, and I cut my fingers. |Stupid, I know. &&& Caspian: So now there's blood and glass everywhere. So I turn to look for a broom. &&& Caspian: And then out of nowhere, I feel this sharp, jabbing pain in my neck. I start to turn around, and then boom! I pass out.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: That was hours earlier. He was asking if we got a new supply of drinks, and I told him that wasn't on the docket until next month.
#. EDID: [0102171E]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000319"
msgid "Sunni Kim says he saw Yeats talking to you shortly before the theft? Is that not true?"
msgstr "써니 킴이 말하길, 절도 직전에 예이츠가 당신과 이야기하는 걸 봤다던데요? 사실이 아닌가요?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_d3200_CarusoTL01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Caruso
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMHalCaruso
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 001DC117
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = There were mass graves for those who took their own life.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: There were mass graves for those who took their own life.
#. DialogueAfter = Caruso: Looking back, I never valued life. Not mine, not theirs.
#. EDID: [01021662]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00031A"
msgid "Then they are braver souls than I."
msgstr "그렇다면 그들은 나보다 용감한 영혼들이군."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_b1200_Sunni_TL04COPY0000
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = SunniKim
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFSunniKim
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0043EF0F
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I have questions on the stolen supplies. Sasha said you witnessed Yeats at the scene of the crime?
#. EDID: [010216CF]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00031B"
msgid "Yeah, I saw that loser. He was bugging Caspian for something. Probably casing the joint."
msgstr "응, 그 패배자를 봤어. 캐스피언에게 뭔가 귀찮게 굴고 있었지. 아마 여기 사정을 살피던 거겠지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_d3200_CarusoTL01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Caruso
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMHalCaruso
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00ABBA3C
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = You left them all to die. You're a monster.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: You left them all to die. You're a monster.
#. DialogueAfter = Caruso: Looking back, I never valued life. Not mine, not theirs.
#. EDID: [010215C6]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00031C"
msgid "I did what I needed to, to survive. Or so I thought."
msgstr "살아남기 위해 해야 할 일을 했어. 아니, 그때는 그렇게 생각했지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2400_Caruso_TL09_Evidence
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Caruso
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00470FB7
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: She's a suspect. Anything she tells us would be unreliable. &&& Caruso: Exactly. And the evidence we do have is flimsy. &&& Caruso: If we could find out what her motive is, that and the gloves would be enough.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: No. Caelumite can be used for chems, which is why Yeats is a suspect.
#. EDID: [0102181A]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00031D"
msgid "Are the supplies that were stolen not a motive?"
msgstr "물자 자체를 훔치려던 게 동기일 가능성은 없나?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_d3200_CarusoTL01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMHalCaruso
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMHalCaruso
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00BD238C
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = You did what you had to.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: You did what you had to.
#. DialogueAfter = Caruso: Looking back, I never valued life. Not mine, not theirs.
#. EDID: [01021530]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00031E"
msgid "Nonetheless, I must face the consequences."
msgstr "그럼에도 나는 결과를 마주해야 해."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_200_CarusoTL10
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00CD6A66
#. DialogueAfter = Caruso: Not right now. Let's finish the work first.
#. EDID: [010215E9]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00031F"
msgid "Can we talk about what happened to Shinar?"
msgstr "시날에서 있었던 일에 대해 얘기해줄 수 있나?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_d3200_CarusoTL01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Caruso
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMHalCaruso
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 007D182B
#. DialogueBefore = Caruso: Looking back, I never valued life. Not mine, not theirs.
#. EDID: [01021773]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000320"
msgid "This outpost has changed me. I see value in life. But that is not the same as being worthy of it."
msgstr "이 전초기지가 나를 바꿨어. 나는 삶의 가치를 알게 됐어. 하지만 그것이 내가 그 삶을 누릴 자격이 있다는 뜻은 아니야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_d3200_CarusoTL01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Caruso
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMHalCaruso
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00CE9AC7
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Do you have any regrets for what you did?
#. EDID: [010216FB]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000321"
msgid "But then I came here. Befriended the people. And every situation became a mirror for what I'd done before."
msgstr "하지만 그 뒤 이곳에 왔어. 사람들과 친구가 됐지. 그리고 모든 상황이 내가 전에 저지른 일의 거울이 되었어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_d3200_CarusoTL01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Caruso
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMHalCaruso
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0036B054
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Do you have any regrets for what you did?
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Do you have any regrets for what you did?
#. EDID: [010216FB]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000322"
msgid "That is a complicated question. When I left Shinar, I was afraid of being discovered."
msgstr "그건 복잡한 질문이야. 시날을 떠났을 때, 난 발각될까 두려웠어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_d3200_CarusoTL01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Caruso
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMHalCaruso
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00E99910
#. ScriptNotes = Serious
#. DialogueBefore = Caruso: I didn't see what became of Shinar. But I can imagine.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: You did what you had to.
#. EDID: [01021722]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000323"
msgid "No ship, no comms. Dehydration sets in. Some choose death. Others are forced to make harder decisions."
msgstr "우주선도 없고, 통신도 없어. 탈수가 시작되지. 어떤 이들은 죽음을 택하고, 다른 이들은 더 힘든 결정을 강요받아."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_d3200_CarusoTL01
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Caruso
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00E9646E
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Before the vote, I want to talk about Shinar. &&& Caruso: I suspected you would. &&& Caruso: I didn't see what became of Shinar. But I can imagine. &&& Caruso: No ship, no comms. Dehydration sets in. Some choose death. Others are forced to make harder decisions.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: That is a complicated question. When I left Shinar, I was afraid of being discovered.
#. EDID: [010216AC]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000324"
msgid "Do you have any regrets for what you did?"
msgstr "과거에 벌인 짓에 대해 후회하나?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2320_Caspian_TL03
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Caspian
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMCaspianRoberson
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00680A1B
#. EDID: [0102163C]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000325"
msgid "He knows just about EVERYTHING, so I'm trying to soak up the knowledge like a sponge."
msgstr "그 사람은 정말 거의 모든 걸 알아. 그래서 스펀지처럼 지식을 빨아들이려고 하고 있어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2320_Caspian_TL03
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Caspian
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMCaspianRoberson
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00519F79
#. EDID: [0102163C]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000326"
msgid "These days I'm mostly just Hal's understudy."
msgstr "요즘은 대부분 할의 견습생 노릇을 하고 있어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2320_Caspian_TL03
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Caspian
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMCaspianRoberson
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 002B0388
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: What do you do around here?
#. EDID: [0102163C]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000327"
msgid "I'm not assigned to anything yet, I fill in for the others when they need a break."
msgstr "아직 맡은 일은 없고, 다른 사람들이 쉬어야 할 때 대신 들어가."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_d3200_CarusoTL01
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Caruso
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00F6C546
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Before the vote, I want to talk about Shinar. &&& Caruso: I suspected you would. &&& Caruso: I didn't see what became of Shinar. But I can imagine. &&& Caruso: No ship, no comms. Dehydration sets in. Some choose death. Others are forced to make harder decisions.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Then they are braver souls than I.
#. EDID: [01021611]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000328"
msgid "There were mass graves for those who took their own life."
msgstr "스스로 목숨을 끊은 사람들을 위한 집단 무덤이 있었어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_200_CarusoTL08
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Caruso
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMHalCaruso
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00499CDA
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Ivica and I decided to scrap the robot. He says he can fix the mining machine.
#. EDID: [010215A2]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00032A"
msgid "Good. I know Ivica thinks it'll replace him, but there's plenty of other work to be done for a man of his skillset."
msgstr "좋아. 이비차는 그게 자신을 대체할 거라고 생각하지만, 그의 능력이라면 할 일은 얼마든지 있어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_200_CarusoTL08
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Caruso
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMHalCaruso
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0088B455
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I got the robot working, but then it got damaged.
#. EDID: [01023C76]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00032B"
msgid "*Sigh* If it can't be repaired, see if Ivica can make use of the parts. Maybe some good will come out of this."
msgstr "*한숨* 수리할 수 없다면 이비차가 부품을 활용할 수 있는지 봐. 이 일에서라도 좋은 결과가 나오면 좋겠군."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_200_CarusoTL08
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Caruso
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMHalCaruso
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0059660E
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. EDID: [010215A1]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00032C"
msgid "But the ore will be of use. Mining it will be beneficial."
msgstr "하지만 광석은 쓸모가 있을 거야. 채굴하면 도움이 되겠지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_200_CarusoTL08
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Caruso
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMHalCaruso
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00B5E160
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Ivica and I decided to scrap the robot. He says he can fix the mining machine.
#. EDID: [010215A1]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00032D"
msgid "*Sigh* Ivica says a lot of things, not all of them true."
msgstr "*한숨* 이비차는 많은 말을 하지만, 전부 사실은 아니야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_d3200_CarusoTL01
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Caruso
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0025255C
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Before the vote, I want to talk about Shinar. &&& Caruso: I suspected you would. &&& Caruso: I didn't see what became of Shinar. But I can imagine. &&& Caruso: No ship, no comms. Dehydration sets in. Some choose death. Others are forced to make harder decisions.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: I did what I needed to, to survive. Or so I thought.
#. EDID: [01021578]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00032E"
msgid "You left them all to die. You're a monster."
msgstr "당신은 그들을 모두 죽게 내버려뒀어. 당신은 괴물이야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2400_Caruso_TL09_Evidence
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Caruso
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0092B086
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: She's a suspect. Anything she tells us would be unreliable. &&& Caruso: Exactly. And the evidence we do have is flimsy. &&& Caruso: If we could find out what her motive is, that and the gloves would be enough.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Unlikely, but true. It's possible. You'll have to establish motive to convince the guard.
#. EDID: [010216B5]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00032F"
msgid "Or she's innocent, and there's another explanation for the gloves."
msgstr "아니면 그녀는 무죄이고, 장갑에는 다른 설명이 있을 수도 있지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_d3200_CarusoTL01
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 009072AC
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Before the vote, I want to talk about Shinar. &&& Caruso: I suspected you would. &&& Caruso: I didn't see what became of Shinar. But I can imagine. &&& Caruso: No ship, no comms. Dehydration sets in. Some choose death. Others are forced to make harder decisions.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Nonetheless, I must face the consequences.
#. EDID: [010217C4]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000330"
msgid "You did what you had to."
msgstr "당신은 해야 할 일을 한 거야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_b1000_IvicaGreet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Ivica
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMIvicaVukovic
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0050E715
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = What's wrong with the mining machine?
#. EDID: [01021668]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000331"
msgid "We can use it to blast through the rock, and get the ore behind it."
msgstr "그걸로 암석을 뚫고, 그 뒤에 있는 광석을 얻을 수 있어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_b1000_IvicaGreet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Ivica
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMIvicaVukovic
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00F3BC10
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = What's wrong with the mining machine?
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: What's wrong with the mining machine?
#. EDID: [01021668]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000333"
msgid "It's got a blown PCM. With a few tweaks, the parts from that Model A can fix it."
msgstr "PCM이 나갔어. 약간 손보면 그 모델 A의 부품으로 고칠 수 있지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_d3200_CarusoTL01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Caruso
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMHalCaruso
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 009A0D82
#. DialogueBefore = Caruso: I suspected you would.
#. DialogueAfter = Caruso: No ship, no comms. Dehydration sets in. Some choose death. Others are forced to make harder decisions.
#. EDID: [010216D3]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000334"
msgid "I didn't see what became of Shinar. But I can imagine."
msgstr "시날이 어떻게 됐는지는 보지 못했어. 하지만 상상은 할 수 있지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_d3200_CarusoTL01
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00393988
#. DialogueAfter = Caruso: I suspected you would.
#. EDID: [0102168A]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000335"
msgid "Before the vote, I want to talk about Shinar."
msgstr "투표 전에 시날에 대해 이야기하고 싶어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_200_CarusoTL08
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 007E3D4F
#. DialogueAfter = Caruso: *Sigh* Ivica says a lot of things, not all of them true.
#. EDID: [01023CC2]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000336"
msgid "The robot's back up and running."
msgstr "로봇이 다시 작동하고 있어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_200_CarusoTL08
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0049D9CD
#. DialogueAfter = Caruso: *Sigh* Ivica says a lot of things, not all of them true.
#. EDID: [01021815]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000337"
msgid "I got the robot working, but then it got damaged."
msgstr "로봇을 작동시켰지만, 그 뒤 손상됐어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_200_CarusoTL08
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00CEAA0C
#. DialogueAfter = Caruso: *Sigh* Ivica says a lot of things, not all of them true.
#. EDID: [01021814]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000338"
msgid "Ivica and I decided to scrap the robot. He says he can fix the mining machine."
msgstr "이비차와 나는 로봇을 폐기하기로 했어. 그가 채광 기계를 고칠 수 있다고 해."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2400_Caruso_TL09_Evidence
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Caruso
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMHalCaruso
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00577B92
#. EDID: [01021779]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000339"
msgid "She might reveal something if you ask the right questions."
msgstr "알맞은 질문을 하면 그녀가 뭔가 드러낼지도 몰라."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2400_Caruso_TL09_Evidence
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Caruso
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMHalCaruso
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0048E22B
#. DialogueBefore = Caruso: If you can do it, it's worth the gamble.
#. EDID: [01021779]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00033A"
msgid "I think you'll just need to speak to her yourself."
msgstr "네가 직접 그녀와 이야기해 봐야 할 것 같아."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_b1000_IvicaGreet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Ivica
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMIvicaVukovic
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00B753E2
#. DialogueAfter = Ivica: I'll do it.
#. EDID: [0102174D]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00033B"
msgid "So, you've come back. Have you reconsidered my offer to scramble this robot's eggs?"
msgstr "그래, 돌아왔군. 이 로봇 머리를 휘저어 놓자는 내 제안을 다시 생각해 봤나?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_b1200_Sunni_TL01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCFSunniKim
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFSunniKim
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0074A127
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Already done. Hal Caruso asked me to get it working.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Already done. Hal Caruso asked me to get it working.
#. DialogueAfter = SunniKim: Anyway, looks like someone got Rusty up and running already, and I didn't even have to pay them. Sucker born every minute.
#. EDID: [01021701]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00033C"
msgid "Hell yeah. First I found some Chunks in my pocket, now this. This day just keeps getting better."
msgstr "좋았어. 먼저 주머니에서 청크를 좀 찾았고, 이제 이거라니. 오늘은 계속 좋아지기만 하네."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_b1200_Sunni_TL01
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00D561E6
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: What do you do out here? &&& SunniKim: I'm a "farmer", but technically my boy Rusty does all the work. &&& SunniKim: I'm a farmer, but I don't like it. It's boring and tedious.|And so I got to thinking, "This sucks. Why can't a robot do this shit?"
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Hell yeah. First I found some Chunks in my pocket, now this. This day just keeps getting better.
#. EDID: [010216B0]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00033D"
msgid "Already done. Hal Caruso asked me to get it working."
msgstr "이미 끝났어. 할 카루소가 내게 작동시켜 달라고 했어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2400_Caruso_TL09_Evidence
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Caruso
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0085A8CB
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: That's what I would do. &&& Caruso: I see. We may not have a choice. She's the only who can analyze the blood sample. &&& Caruso: Very well. Deliver it to Dr. Kim. See if the blood matches Caspian's. If so, it validates his story. &&& Caruso: In the meantime, I'll be here.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Fine. My mind is occupied at the moment, and I can't think straight.
#. EDID: [0102161D]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00033E"
msgid "On second thought, let's just bring it to Dr. Kim."
msgstr "다시 생각해 보니, 그냥 킴 의사에게 가져가자."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_b1200_Sunni_TL06
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = SunniKim
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFSunniKim
#. Face = Grateful
#. SoundFileID = 00AA0C00
#. ScriptNotes = Grateful
#. EDID: [01021562]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00033F"
msgid "But yeah, she's my sis. We look out for each other, because at the end of the day, if blood don't have your back, who does?"
msgstr "그래도 그 애는 내 여동생이야. 우린 서로 챙겨. 결국 피붙이가 네 편을 안 들어주면 누가 들어주겠어?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_b1200_Sunni_TL06
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = SunniKim
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFSunniKim
#. Face = Smug
#. SoundFileID = 0001D8C2
#. ScriptNotes = Smug
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: What can you tell me about Grace Kim?
#. EDID: [01021562]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000340"
msgid "Gracie? She got all the brains in the family. That's okay, I got this cool hat, so joke's on her."
msgstr "그레이시? 그 애는 우리 가족의 머리를 다 가져갔어. 괜찮아, 난 이 멋진 모자가 있으니까 결국 내가 이긴 거지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_d2750_YeatsCaruso
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Caruso
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMHalCaruso
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00735ABF
#. DialogueAfter = Yeats: You and your friend have cursed me.
#. EDID: [0102153A]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000341"
msgid "How are you holding up?"
msgstr "어떻게 버티고 있어?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2400_Caruso_TL09_Evidence
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Caruso
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMHalCaruso
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 006063D9
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Are the supplies that were stolen not a motive?
#. DialogueAfter = Caruso: I can hack into her computer, see if there isn't any evidence there.
#. EDID: [0102155A]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000342"
msgid "But Dr. Kim doesn't need to steal chems, she can request them."
msgstr "하지만 킴 의사는 약물을 훔칠 필요가 없어. 요청하면 되잖아."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2400_Caruso_TL09_Evidence
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Caruso
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMHalCaruso
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 008415D3
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Are the supplies that were stolen not a motive?
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Are the supplies that were stolen not a motive?
#. EDID: [0102155A]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000343"
msgid "No. Caelumite can be used for chems, which is why Yeats is a suspect."
msgstr "아니. 캘루마이트는 약물에 쓰일 수 있어. 그래서 예이츠가 용의자인 거야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2400_Caruso_TL09_Evidence
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Caruso
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMHalCaruso
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00BCBA69
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = I'm not sure that would be enough to free Yeats.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I'm not sure that would be enough to free Yeats.
#. DialogueAfter = Caruso: I think you'll just need to speak to her yourself.
#. EDID: [010217A4]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000344"
msgid "It might not, but maybe you can trap her in a lie."
msgstr "그렇지 않을 수도 있지만, 어쩌면 그녀를 거짓말에 걸려들게 할 수 있어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_d2750_YeatsCaruso
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Yeats
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMYeats
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 009F98CA
#. DialogueBefore = Caruso: How are you holding up?
#. DialogueAfter = Caruso: How so?
#. EDID: [010217CB]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000345"
msgid "You and your friend have cursed me."
msgstr "너와 네 친구가 나를 저주했어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_zScenes_SunniCaruso
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Caruso
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMHalCaruso
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00EDE7FE
#. DialogueBefore = Caruso: You shouldn't walk on the soil. It compacts the soil and decreases air spaces.
#. DialogueAfter = SunniKim: So what do you want me to do, fly? Get real.
#. EDID: [010216DF]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000346"
msgid "That cuts down on the oxygen your soil life has to make nutrients."
msgstr "그건 토양 생물이 영양분을 만들 산소를 줄여 버려."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2400_Caruso_TL09_Evidence
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Caruso
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMHalCaruso
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00170DAA
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Or she's innocent, and there's another explanation for the gloves.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Or she's innocent, and there's another explanation for the gloves.
#. DialogueAfter = Caruso: I think you'll just need to speak to her yourself.
#. EDID: [01021705]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000347"
msgid "Unlikely, but true. It's possible. You'll have to establish motive to convince the guard."
msgstr "가능성은 낮지만 사실이야. 가능해. 경비를 설득하려면 동기를 입증해야 할 거야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2400_Caruso_TL09_Evidence
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Caruso
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMHalCaruso
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00CD7452
#. DialogueBefore = Caruso: Very well. Deliver it to Dr. Kim. See if the blood matches Caspian's. If so, it validates his story.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: She's a suspect. Anything she tells us would be unreliable.
#. EDID: [01021728]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000348"
msgid "In the meantime, I'll be here."
msgstr "그동안 난 여기 있을게."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_zScenes_SunniCaruso
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = SunniKim
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFSunniKim
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00DC1EE5
#. DialogueBefore = Caruso: You shouldn't walk on the soil. It compacts the soil and decreases air spaces. &&& Caruso: That cuts down on the oxygen your soil life has to make nutrients.
#. DialogueAfter = Caruso: Just be mindful. Make dedicated pathways to avoid walking on your beds.
#. EDID: [010215F7]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000349"
msgid "So what do you want me to do, fly? Get real."
msgstr "그럼 내가 뭘 하길 바라는데, 날기라도 해? 현실적으로 생각해."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2400_Caruso_TL09_Evidence
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 004418D9
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: She's a suspect. Anything she tells us would be unreliable. &&& Caruso: Exactly. And the evidence we do have is flimsy. &&& Caruso: If we could find out what her motive is, that and the gloves would be enough.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: If you can do it, it's worth the gamble.
#. EDID: [01021642]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00034A"
msgid "I can hack into her computer, see if there isn't any evidence there."
msgstr "그녀의 컴퓨터를 해킹해서 증거가 있는지 볼 수 있어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_d2750_YeatsCaruso
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Caruso
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMHalCaruso
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 005D44F4
#. DialogueBefore = Caruso: How are you holding up? &&& Yeats: You and your friend have cursed me.
#. DialogueAfter = Yeats: Well, before I was sitting. Perfectly content. Now, I am waiting. And it's killing me.
#. EDID: [01021580]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00034B"
msgid "How so?"
msgstr "어떻게?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2400_Caruso_TL09_Evidence
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Caruso
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00B31A10
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: She's a suspect. Anything she tells us would be unreliable. &&& Caruso: Exactly. And the evidence we do have is flimsy. &&& Caruso: If we could find out what her motive is, that and the gloves would be enough.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: If you can do it, it's worth the gamble.
#. EDID: [010215A7]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00034C"
msgid "I'll just pick her pockets. She might have something incriminating on her."
msgstr "그냥 그녀의 주머니를 털어볼게. 그녀에게 불리한 뭔가를 갖고 있을지도 몰라."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_d2750_YeatsCaruso
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Yeats
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMYeats
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00428D5E
#. DialogueBefore = Yeats: You and your friend have cursed me. &&& Caruso: How so?
#. DialogueAfter = Caruso: Hopefully you won't have to wait much longer.
#. EDID: [010217D2]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00034D"
msgid "Well, before I was sitting. Perfectly content. Now, I am waiting. And it's killing me."
msgstr "글쎄, 전에는 앉아 있었지. 아주 만족스럽게. 지금은 기다리고 있어. 그게 날 미치게 해."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_zScenes_SunniCaruso
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = SunniKim
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFSunniKim
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00D9CFF2
#. DialogueBefore = SunniKim: So what do you want me to do, fly? Get real. &&& Caruso: Just be mindful. Make dedicated pathways to avoid walking on your beds.
#. EDID: [0102177D]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00034E"
msgid "Yeah, yeah."
msgstr "그래, 그래."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_zScenes_SunniCaruso
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Caruso
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMHalCaruso
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 002A609F
#. DialogueBefore = Caruso: That cuts down on the oxygen your soil life has to make nutrients. &&& SunniKim: So what do you want me to do, fly? Get real.
#. DialogueAfter = SunniKim: Yeah, yeah.
#. EDID: [0102172D]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00034F"
msgid "Just be mindful. Make dedicated pathways to avoid walking on your beds."
msgstr "명심해. 밭을 밟지 않도록 전용 통로를 만들어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2400_Caruso_TL09_Evidence
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Caruso
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0037FF0F
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: She's a suspect. Anything she tells us would be unreliable. &&& Caruso: Exactly. And the evidence we do have is flimsy. &&& Caruso: If we could find out what her motive is, that and the gloves would be enough.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: It might not, but maybe you can trap her in a lie.
#. EDID: [01021753]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000350"
msgid "I'm not sure that would be enough to free Yeats."
msgstr "그 정도로는 예이츠를 풀어주기에 충분하지 않을 것 같아."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_200_CarusoTL06
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Caruso
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMHalCaruso
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00367013
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: What will you be doing while I help the outpost?
#. DialogueAfter = Caruso: Recently I've been acting as the Outpost leader, with Zena retiring.
#. EDID: [01021695]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000351"
msgid "Making my rounds. There's much to do besides the tasks I gave you."
msgstr "순찰 중이야. 내가 맡긴 일 말고도 할 일이 많거든."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2400_Caruso_TL09_Evidence
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00F45C47
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: That's what I would do. &&& Caruso: I see. We may not have a choice. She's the only who can analyze the blood sample. &&& Caruso: Very well. Deliver it to Dr. Kim. See if the blood matches Caspian's. If so, it validates his story. &&& Caruso: In the meantime, I'll be here.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Exactly. And the evidence we do have is flimsy.
#. EDID: [010216BD]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000352"
msgid "She's a suspect. Anything she tells us would be unreliable."
msgstr "그녀는 용의자야. 그녀가 하는 말은 믿을 수 없어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2400_Caruso_TL09_Evidence
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Caruso
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMHalCaruso
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 007BB65B
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = On second thought, let's just bring it to Dr. Kim.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: On second thought, let's just bring it to Dr. Kim.
#. DialogueAfter = Caruso: In the meantime, I'll be here.
#. EDID: [0102166D]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000353"
msgid "Fine. My mind is occupied at the moment, and I can't think straight."
msgstr "좋아. 지금 머리가 복잡해서 제대로 생각이 안 나."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2400_Caruso_TL09_Evidence
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Caruso
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00BF55FD
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: [Syringe] I found this in the dumpster. It may have been used to sedate Caspian. &&& ... &&& Caruso: Surgical gloves... and there's blood on them. And a syringe. Possibly a tranquilizer. &&& Caruso: This seems to corroborate what Caspian told me, provided the blood is his. &&& Caruso: We could take the items to Dr. Kim to verify but...
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Agreed. I assume we're on the same page here.
#. EDID: [01021621]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000354"
msgid "I don't think that's wise."
msgstr "그건 현명하지 않은 것 같아."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2400_Sasha_TL04
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00133F6C
#. DialogueAfter = Sasha: I appreciate the effort, stranger, but that case has been solved. I'm just waiting on a confession.
#. EDID: [0102155D]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000355"
msgid "[Evidence] I found these in the dumpster. They may have been used to sedate Caspian."
msgstr "[증거] 쓰레기통에서 이것들을 찾았어. 캐스피언을 진정시키는 데 쓰였을지도 몰라."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_d2750_YeatsCaruso
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Caruso
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMHalCaruso
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0005D91D
#. DialogueBefore = Caruso: How so? &&& Yeats: Well, before I was sitting. Perfectly content. Now, I am waiting. And it's killing me.
#. EDID: [010215D2]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000356"
msgid "Hopefully you won't have to wait much longer."
msgstr "바라건대 그렇게 오래 기다리진 않아도 될 거야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2400_Caruso_TL09_Evidence
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Caruso
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMHalCaruso
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00954850
#. DialogueBefore = Caruso: This seems to corroborate what Caspian told me, provided the blood is his.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: That's what I would do.
#. EDID: [0102153E]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000357"
msgid "We could take the items to Dr. Kim to verify but..."
msgstr "그 물건들을 킴 의사에게 가져가 확인할 수도 있지만..."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2400_Caruso_TL09_Evidence
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Caruso
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMHalCaruso
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 006A385B
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: [Syringe] I found this in the dumpster. It may have been used to sedate Caspian.
#. DialogueAfter = Caruso: Surgical gloves... and there's blood on them. And a syringe. Possibly a tranquilizer.
#. EDID: [01021783]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000358"
msgid "Let's take a look."
msgstr "한번 보죠."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2400_Caruso_TL09_Evidence
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Caruso
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00FED1F6
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: That's what I would do. &&& Caruso: I see. We may not have a choice. She's the only who can analyze the blood sample. &&& Caruso: Very well. Deliver it to Dr. Kim. See if the blood matches Caspian's. If so, it validates his story. &&& Caruso: In the meantime, I'll be here.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Dr. Kim may not be completely forthcoming, if she's the one who stole the supplies.
#. EDID: [01021759]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000359"
msgid "Sure, but why don't you tell me first."
msgstr "물론이지, 하지만 먼저 네가 말해 보는 게 어때."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2400_Sasha_TL02
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Sasha
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFSashaAtwell
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 004B207E
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueAfter = Sasha: Big Hal is good people. He also knows a LOT about weapons.
#. EDID: [01021837]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00035A"
msgid "The first thing he did when he got here was fix up my weapon. Must've learned that with the Fleet."
msgstr "카루소는 여기 오자마자 제일 먼저 제 무기를 수리해 줬습니다. 크림슨 함대에 있을 때 배운 거겠죠."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2400_Sasha_TL02
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Sasha
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFSashaAtwell
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00EABCEB
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: What are your thoughts on Caruso?
#. EDID: [01021837]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00035B"
msgid "I always suspected something was off about Hal."
msgstr "할에게 뭔가 수상한 구석이 있다고 계속 의심했었습니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_zScenes_SunniCaruso
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Caruso
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMHalCaruso
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0027A833
#. DialogueAfter = Caruso: That cuts down on the oxygen your soil life has to make nutrients.
#. EDID: [01021648]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00035C"
msgid "You shouldn't walk on the soil. It compacts the soil and decreases air spaces."
msgstr "흙 위를 걸어서는 안 돼. 흙이 다져지고 공극이 줄어들거든."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2400_Sasha_TL04
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Sasha
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFSashaAtwell
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00C9B369
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. EDID: [010215AC]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00035D"
msgid "I don't know what you think you got there, but you're barking up the wrong tree."
msgstr "뭘 찾았다고 생각하는진 모르겠지만, 완전히 헛다리 짚고 계십니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2400_Sasha_TL04
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Sasha
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFSashaAtwell
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 005ACFD8
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: [Evidence] I found these in the dumpster. They may have been used to sedate Caspian.
#. EDID: [010215AC]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00035E"
msgid "I appreciate the effort, stranger, but that case has been solved. I'm just waiting on a confession."
msgstr "애써준 건 고맙습니다. 외지인 분. 하지만 그 사건은 해결됐습니다. 자백하기만 기다리고 있을 뿐입니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2400_Caruso_TL09_Evidence
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMHalCaruso
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMHalCaruso
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00323008
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = That's what I would do.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: That's what I would do.
#. DialogueAfter = Caruso: Very well. Deliver it to Dr. Kim. See if the blood matches Caspian's. If so, it validates his story.
#. EDID: [010215D6]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00035F"
msgid "I see. We may not have a choice. She's the only who can analyze the blood sample."
msgstr "그렇군. 선택의 여지가 없을지도 모르겠어. 혈액 샘플을 분석할 수 있는 사람은 그녀뿐이니까."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2300_Yeats_TL05
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Yeats
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMYeats
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0054D0EC
#. DialogueAfter = Yeats: If he is dead, then he knows what no living man is privy to.
#. EDID: [010216A8]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000360"
msgid "This shirt I'm wearing... it's his!"
msgstr "내가 입고 있는 이 셔츠... 그의 거야!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2300_Yeats_TL05
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Yeats
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMYeats
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 009DA33D
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: What are your thoughts on Caruso?
#. EDID: [010216A8]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000361"
msgid "He would give you the shirt off his back. Do you know how I know?"
msgstr "그는 자기 등에 걸친 셔츠까지 내어줄 사람이었어. 내가 어떻게 아는지 알아?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_200_CarusoTL06
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Caruso
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMHalCaruso
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 0071064D
#. ScriptNotes = Serious
#. DialogueBefore = Caruso: Making my rounds. There's much to do besides the tasks I gave you.
#. EDID: [01021821]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000363"
msgid "Recently I've been acting as the Outpost leader, with Zena retiring."
msgstr "최근에는 제가 전초기지 촌장 역할을 맡고 있습니다. 제나 씨가 은퇴해서요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2400_Caruso_TL09_Evidence
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Caruso
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMHalCaruso
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0089586C
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Sure, but why don't you tell me first.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Sure, but why don't you tell me first.
#. DialogueAfter = Caruso: If we could find out what her motive is, that and the gloves would be enough.
#. EDID: [010217A9]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000364"
msgid "Dr. Kim may not be completely forthcoming, if she's the one who stole the supplies."
msgstr "물자를 훔친 사람이 킴 의사라면, 그녀가 완전히 솔직하게 말하지 않을 수도 있어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2400_Sasha_TL01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCFSashaAtwell
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFSashaAtwell
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00773DE6
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = What supplies went missing? Maybe I can find them?
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: I've got questions about the stolen supplies.
#. EDID: [010215FC]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000365"
msgid "I'd talk to Caspian about it. He was the one working the tent when the supplies were stolen."
msgstr "그 일은 캐스피언에게 물어보겠습니다. 물자가 도난당했을 때 텐트에서 일하고 있었으니 말입니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2400_Sasha_TL01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCFSashaAtwell
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFSashaAtwell
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 009C67DD
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = What supplies went missing? Maybe I can find them?
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: What supplies went missing? Maybe I can find them?
#. EDID: [010215FC]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000366"
msgid "He stole Caelumite from the supply tent. It's a rare, unique material that can be used to craft stuff."
msgstr "보급 텐트에서 캘루마이트를 훔쳤습니다. 여러 물건 제작에 쓰이는 희귀하고 귀중한 재료입니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2400_Caruso_TL09_Evidence
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMHalCaruso
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMHalCaruso
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 008ABF58
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = She's a suspect. Anything she tells us would be unreliable.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: She's a suspect. Anything she tells us would be unreliable.
#. DialogueAfter = Caruso: If we could find out what her motive is, that and the gloves would be enough.
#. EDID: [01021709]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000367"
msgid "Exactly. And the evidence we do have is flimsy."
msgstr "정확해. 그리고 우리가 가진 증거는 허술해."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2400_Caruso_TL09_Evidence
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Caruso
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMHalCaruso
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 008AC2BA
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = I don't think that's wise.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I don't think that's wise.
#. DialogueAfter = Caruso: She's a suspect. Anything she tells us would be unreliable.
#. EDID: [01021671]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000368"
msgid "Agreed. I assume we're on the same page here. "
msgstr "동의해. 우리가 같은 생각이라고 봐도 되겠군."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2330_Caspian_Greeet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMCaspianRoberson
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMCaspianRoberson
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00707C7A
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = I've already combed through the dumpster and found some evidence.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I've already combed through the dumpster and found some evidence.
#. EDID: [01021713]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000369"
msgid "Cool, here's the key. If you find anything, I'd check back with Hal on what to do next."
msgstr "좋아, 여기 열쇠야. 뭔가 찾으면 다음에 뭘 할지 할에게 다시 확인해 봐."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2330_Caspian_Greeet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMCaspianRoberson
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMCaspianRoberson
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 009FFEE4
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = I've already combed through the dumpster and found some evidence.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I've already combed through the dumpster and found some evidence.
#. EDID: [01021712]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00036A"
msgid "Nuclear. Then I'd take it to the guard and confront the suspect."
msgstr "대형급이지. 그럼 그걸 경비에게 가져가서 용의자를 대면하게 해."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2330_Caspian_Greeet
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 005D9A56
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Tell me what you know about the theft. &&& ... &&& Caspian: So I tried to pick up the broken glass and put it in this box, and I cut my fingers. |Stupid, I know. &&& Caspian: So now there's blood and glass everywhere. So I turn to look for a broom. &&& Caspian: And then out of nowhere, I feel this sharp, jabbing pain in my neck. I start to turn around, and then boom! I pass out.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Oh yeah, like animal tranquilizer or something!
#. EDID: [010217FC]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00036B"
msgid "That may be a medical grade sedative, applied via a syringe."
msgstr "그건 주사기로 투여된 의료 등급 진정제일 수도 있어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2310_Caspian_TL01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Caspian
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMCaspianRoberson
#. Face = Defiant
#. SoundFileID = 001CF5D0
#. ScriptNotes = Defiant / to Player Default
#. Prompt = One man's endorsement means that much?
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: One man's endorsement means that much?
#. DialogueAfter = Caspian: Tell me what you know about the theft.
#. EDID: [010216C2]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00036C"
msgid "It's not just any man though, it's Hal. He's the glue that keeps this shit together."
msgstr "그냥 아무 남자가 아니야. 할이야. 이 난장판을 하나로 묶어 주는 접착제 같은 사람이라고."

