#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: I see. We may not have a choice. She's the only who can analyze the blood sample.
#. EDID: [01021585]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00036E"
msgid "That's what I would do."
msgstr "나라면 그렇게 하겠어."

