msgstr "이미 쓰레기통을 샅샅이 뒤져서 증거를 좀 찾았어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2400_Sasha_TL02
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Sasha
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFSashaAtwell
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00A44D6F
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. EDID: [010217EC]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000374"
msgid "My cop instincts tell me he used to be a military man or something. But he's a very private person."
msgstr "제 경찰 직감으로는 군인 출신이거나 그런 쪽 사람이었던 것 같습니다. 하지만 워낙 사생활을 드러내지 않아서 말이죠."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2400_Sasha_TL02
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Sasha
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFSashaAtwell
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 003A0A59
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. EDID: [010217EC]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000375"
msgid "First thing he did when he got here is fix the sights on my gun. "
msgstr "카루소는 여기 오자마자 제일 먼저 제 총의 조준기를 수리해 줬습니다. "

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2400_Sasha_TL02
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Sasha
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFSashaAtwell
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00EC2A54
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Sasha: I always suspected something was off about Hal.|The first thing he did when he got here was fix up my weapon. Must've learned that with the Fleet.
#. EDID: [010217EC]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000376"
msgid "Big Hal is good people. He also knows a LOT about weapons. "
msgstr "빅 할은 좋은 사람입니다. 거기에 무기에 대해서도 정말 많이 알고 있죠. "

