#. EDID: [010215E5]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000377"
msgid "What are your thoughts on Caruso?"
msgstr "카루소에 대해 어떻게 생각해?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2330_Caspian_Greeet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Caspian
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMCaspianRoberson
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00FBE94E
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = You said you cut yourself, is it possible your blood got on the assailant?
#. DialogueAfter = Caspian: That may be a medical grade sedative, applied via a syringe.
#. EDID: [01021573]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000378"
msgid "When I woke up? The broken glass and all the blood was cleaned up, and my hand was bandaged. "
msgstr "내가 깨어났을 때? 깨진 유리와 피는 전부 치워져 있었고, 내 손에는 붕대가 감겨 있었어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2330_Caspian_Greeet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Caspian
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMCaspianRoberson
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00AA7F39
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = You said you cut yourself, is it possible your blood got on the assailant?
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: You said you cut yourself, is it possible your blood got on the assailant?
#. EDID: [01021573]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000379"
msgid "One thousand percent. Because here's the kicker. "
msgstr "천 퍼센트 확실해. 결정적인 건 이거야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2300_Yeats_TL05
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Yeats
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMYeats
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00FDFB1D
#. EDID: [0102165E]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00037A"
msgid "Also, seeing as he loaned me this shirt, I think I will keep it."
msgstr "그리고 그가 이 셔츠를 빌려줬으니, 그냥 내가 갖기로 할 것 같아."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2300_Yeats_TL05
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Yeats
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMYeats
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00676992
#. DialogueBefore = Yeats: He would give you the shirt off his back. Do you know how I know?|This shirt I'm wearing... it's his!
#. EDID: [0102165E]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00037B"
msgid "If he is dead, then he knows what no living man is privy to."
msgstr "그가 죽었다면, 그는 살아 있는 어떤 인간도 알 수 없는 것을 알게 됐겠지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2330_Caspian_Greeet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMCaspianRoberson
