#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: That may be a medical grade sedative, applied via a syringe.
#. DialogueAfter = Caspian: Hal wanted to look in the dumpster bins for anything suspicious.
#. EDID: [01021795]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00037C"
msgid "Oh yeah, like animal tranquilizer or something!"
msgstr "아 맞아, 동물용 진정제 같은 거!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_200_CarusoTL07
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Caruso
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMHalCaruso
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0046E231
#. EDID: [010215C3]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00037D"
msgid "When you're done, find Caspian. He was there during the theft, and has information I'd like you to investigate."
msgstr "끝나면 캐스피언을 찾아. 그가 절도 당시 거기 있었고, 네가 조사해 봤으면 하는 정보를 가지고 있어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_200_CarusoTL07
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Caruso
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMHalCaruso
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 005C6C86
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Who should I talk to about helping Yeats?
#. EDID: [010215C3]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00037E"
msgid "I'd start with Yeats himself, and Sasha, his jailer."
msgstr "예이츠 본인과 그의 간수인 사샤부터 시작하겠어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2310_Caspian_TL01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Caspian
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMCaspianRoberson
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 009D5C80
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = You wouldn't say that if you knew what kind of man Hal really is.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: You wouldn't say that if you knew what kind of man Hal really is.
#. EDID: [01021718]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00037F"
msgid "Well, he's the only one who actually listened to my version of what happened."
msgstr "글쎄, 그는 실제로 내 이야기를 들어준 유일한 사람이었어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_140_Caruso_Greet
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Caruso
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00E986DD
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Go on then. Speak it. &&& Caruso: The truth is, I've been waiting for you. &&& Caruso: Yes, I am the one who left Shinar to die. My crimes are many, and without redemption. &&& Caruso: But I don't fear death, hunter. My blood is rancid, my bones rotten. |If you seek my life, then you'll be disappointed. There is no life left to take.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Regardless, I've accepted my fate. But it's not my fate I'm concerned about.
#. EDID: [01021745]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000380"
msgid "You must be tired of being hunted. I get it."
msgstr "사냥당하는 데 지쳤겠지. 이해해."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2330_Caspian_Greeet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Caspian
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMCaspianRoberson
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0035FC03
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: I've already combed through the dumpster and found some evidence.
#. EDID: [01021699]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000381"
msgid "But then the water pump broke and uh... yeah. That's when you showed up."
msgstr "그런데 그때 물 펌프가 고장 났고, 어... 그래. 그때 네가 나타났지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2330_Caspian_Greeet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Caspian
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMCaspianRoberson
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 002ECC5D
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Caspian: Oh yeah, like animal tranquilizer or something!
#. EDID: [01021699]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000382"
msgid "Hal wanted to look in the dumpster bins for anything suspicious."
msgstr "할은 수상한 것이 있는지 쓰레기통을 뒤져보길 원했어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2550_GraceKim_TL02
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = GraceKim
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFGraceKim
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00C43946
#. DialogueAfter = GraceKim: I'm still processing the shock, to be honest. I didn't know the man he was, only the one I knew.
#. EDID: [010216AF]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000383"
msgid "Hal has mentored Caspian and helped Zena with a lot of the leadership responsibilities."
msgstr "할은 캐스피언의 선생이 되어 주었고, 제나가 촌장으로서 책임을 많이 짊어질 수 있도록 도와주었습니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2550_GraceKim_TL02
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = GraceKim
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFGraceKim
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00D4DAF0
#. EDID: [010216AF]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000384"
msgid "He's a force multiplier for the group. Ivica works harder, but he keeps to himself."
msgstr "그는 이 집단의 전력 배가 장치야. 이비차가 더 열심히 일하지만, 그는 혼자 지내는 편이지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2550_GraceKim_TL02
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = GraceKim
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFGraceKim
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00D67796
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: What are your thoughts on Caruso?
#. EDID: [010216AF]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000385"
msgid "He's new, but he's earned his keep."
msgstr "새로 왔지만, 제 몫은 해냈어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2330_Caspian_Greeet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Caspian
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMCaspianRoberson
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00F2149E
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Caspian: So now there's blood and glass everywhere. So I turn to look for a broom.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: That may be a medical grade sedative, applied via a syringe.
#. EDID: [01021681]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000386"
msgid "And then out of nowhere, I feel this sharp, jabbing pain in my neck. I start to turn around, and then boom! I pass out."
msgstr "그런데 갑자기 목에 날카롭게 찌르는 통증이 느껴졌어. 돌아보려는 순간, 쾅! 그대로 기절했지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2330_Caspian_Greeet
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Caspian
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00C7A0D4
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Tell me what you know about the theft. &&& ... &&& Caspian: So I tried to pick up the broken glass and put it in this box, and I cut my fingers. |Stupid, I know. &&& Caspian: So now there's blood and glass everywhere. So I turn to look for a broom. &&& Caspian: And then out of nowhere, I feel this sharp, jabbing pain in my neck. I start to turn around, and then boom! I pass out.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: One thousand percent. Because here's the kicker.
#. EDID: [010217A8]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000387"
msgid "You said you cut yourself, is it possible your blood got on the assailant?"
msgstr "스스로 베였다고 했잖아. 네 피가 공격자에게 묻었을 가능성은 없을까?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_140_Caruso_Greet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMHalCaruso
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMHalCaruso
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0036DE65
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = There's always a sob story with you criminals. I'm not buying it.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: There's always a sob story with you criminals. I'm not buying it.
#. DialogueAfter = Caruso: The others in this outpost, they depend on me.
#. EDID: [0102160C]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000388"
msgid "No story. I am a killer, no doubt. But this isn't just about me."
msgstr "이야기랄 건 없어. 내가 살인자인 건 분명해. 하지만 이건 나 하나만의 문제가 아니야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2310_Caspian_TL01
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 007B7A0C
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I need to talk to you about the supply theft. &&& Caspian: Oh nice, are you gonna help us bust Yeats out? He totally didn't do it. Just ask Hal.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Yeah, I'll tell you what I told Sasha.
#. EDID: [010216A3]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000389"
msgid "Tell me what you know about the theft."
msgstr "절도에 대해 알고 있는 걸 말해줘."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_140_Caruso_Greet
