#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: No story. I am a killer, no doubt. But this isn't just about me.
#. EDID: [01021549]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00038A"
msgid "There's always a sob story with you criminals. I'm not buying it."
msgstr "너희 범죄자들은 늘 눈물겨운 사연이 있지. 난 안 믿어."

