#. Prompt = You must be tired of being hunted. I get it.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: You must be tired of being hunted. I get it.
#. DialogueAfter = Caruso: The others in this outpost, they depend on me.
#. EDID: [010216F7]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00038B"
msgid "Regardless, I've accepted my fate. But it's not my fate I'm concerned about."
msgstr "어쨌든 난 내 운명을 받아들였어. 하지만 내가 걱정하는 건 내 운명이 아니야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2330_Caspian_Greeet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Caspian
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMCaspianRoberson
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00449D98
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Seems like you were karate chopped.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Seems like you were karate chopped.
#. DialogueAfter = Caspian: Hal wanted to look in the dumpster bins for anything suspicious.
#. EDID: [01021633]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00038D"
msgid "Maybe, or some kind of neck pinch that targets pressure points. I've seen that shit in the movies!"
msgstr "어쩌면, 아니면 급소를 노리는 목 찌르기 같은 걸지도. 영화에서 그런 거 봤다고!"

