#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I need to talk to you about the supply theft. &&& Caspian: Oh nice, are you gonna help us bust Yeats out? He totally didn't do it. Just ask Hal.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Well, he's the only one who actually listened to my version of what happened.
#. EDID: [010217BB]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00038E"
msgid "You wouldn't say that if you knew what kind of man Hal really is."
msgstr "할이 실제로 어떤 사람인지 알았다면 그런 말은 못 했을 거야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
