#. DialogueAfter = Caspian: That's when I dropped a box of mason jars.
#. EDID: [01021670]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000392"
msgid "So the night it all went down, I was organizing the supplies over here, trying to get my system right."
msgstr "그래서 그날 밤 일이 터졌을 때, 나는 여기서 물자를 정리하고 있었어. 내 방식대로 체계를 잡으려고 말이야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2310_Caspian_TL01
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
