#. DialogueAfter = Caspian: Oh nice, are you gonna help us bust Yeats out? He totally didn't do it. Just ask Hal.
#. EDID: [010216F1]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000393"
msgid "I need to talk to you about the supply theft."
msgstr "물자 절도에 대해 이야기해야겠어."

