msgid "So I tried to pick up the broken glass and put it in this box, and I cut my fingers. "
msgstr "그래서 깨진 유리를 집어 이 상자에 넣으려다가 손가락을 베였어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2400_Sasha_TL01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Sasha
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFSashaAtwell
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 009110A8
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Were there any witnesses to the theft?
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Were there any witnesses to the theft?
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: I've got questions about the stolen supplies.
#. EDID: [010217B0]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000396"
msgid "Oh yeah. Sunni Kim says he saw Yeats creeping around the supply area on more than one occasion."
msgstr "예. 써니 킴 말로는, 예이츠가 보급 구역 주변을 한 번 이상 서성이는 걸 봤다고 했습니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2500_GraceKim_TL01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = GraceKim
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFGraceKim
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 009EBAF2
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: I'd like to ask you some questions.
#. EDID: [0102170D]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000397"
msgid "The street name for it is \"Giant Heart.\" The effects are typically increased energy and improved pain tolerance."
msgstr "시중 이름은 \"거성의 심장\"이야. 보통 에너지 증가와 통증 내성 향상 효과가 있어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2500_GraceKim_TL01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = GraceKim
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFGraceKim
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 009095FB
#. EDID: [0102170D]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000398"
msgid "It's a very useful material in crafting. But when with the right catalyst, it can also make a powerful chem."
msgstr "제작에 아주 유용한 재료야. 하지만 적절한 촉매와 함께라면 강력한 약물도 만들 수 있어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2500_GraceKim_TL01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = GraceKim
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFGraceKim
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0043409B
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: What can you tell me about the stolen supplies?
#. EDID: [0102170D]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000399"
msgid "We had a supply of Caelumite that Hal brought over from his old settlement."
msgstr "우리에겐 할이 예전 정착지에서 가져온 캘루마이트 보급분이 있었어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2310_Caspian_TL02
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 006330F2
#. DialogueAfter = Caspian: Because everyone here thinks I'm a screw up. And I get it. Sometimes I'll break stuff, lose things...
#. EDID: [01021833]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00039A"
msgid "You seem to trust Hal a lot. Why is that?"
msgstr "할을 많이 신뢰하는 것 같은데. 왜 그렇지?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2310_Caspian_TL02
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Caspian
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMCaspianRoberson
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0068FAD8
#. EDID: [0102156D]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00039B"
msgid "Hal's the only one who understood that."
msgstr "할만이 그걸 이해했어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2310_Caspian_TL02
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Caspian
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMCaspianRoberson
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00478560
#. EDID: [0102156D]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00039C"
msgid "But it just takes me a few tries to figure stuff out. Once I do, I'm solid."
msgstr "하지만 난 몇 번 시도하다 보면 결국 알아내. 일단 이해하면 제대로 해내고."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2310_Caspian_TL02
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Caspian
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMCaspianRoberson
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00EAC758
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: You seem to trust Hal a lot. Why is that?
#. EDID: [0102156D]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00039D"
msgid "Because everyone here thinks I'm a screw up. And I get it. Sometimes I'll break stuff, lose things... "
msgstr "여기 사람들은 다 내가 사고뭉치라고 생각하니까. 나도 이해해. 가끔 물건을 부수거나 잃어버리거든..."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2310_Caspian_TL01
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Caspian
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0085E9F9
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I need to talk to you about the supply theft. &&& Caspian: Oh nice, are you gonna help us bust Yeats out? He totally didn't do it. Just ask Hal.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: It's not just any man though, it's Hal. He's the glue that keeps this shit together.
#. EDID: [010215BE]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00039E"
msgid "One man's endorsement means that much?"
msgstr "한 사람의 보증이 그렇게 중요해?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2400_Sasha_TL01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Sasha
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFSashaAtwell
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00F8A226
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = What evidence do you have against him?
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: What evidence do you have against him?
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: I've got questions about the stolen supplies.
#. EDID: [010217B6]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00039F"
msgid "One, he's always high. Two, the thefts stopped as soon as I locked him up."
msgstr "첫째, 예이츠는 늘 취해 있습니다. 둘째, 제가 예이츠를 가두자마자 절도가 멈췄습니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2310_Caspian_TL01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMCaspianRoberson
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMCaspianRoberson
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00F7F51B
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Tell me what you know about the theft.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Tell me what you know about the theft.
#. DialogueAfter = Caspian: So the night it all went down, I was organizing the supplies over here, trying to get my system right.
#. EDID: [01021607]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0003A0"
msgid "Yeah, I'll tell you what I told Sasha."
msgstr "응, 사샤에게 했던 말을 그대로 해줄게."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2310_Caspian_TL01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Caspian
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMCaspianRoberson
#. Face = Grateful
#. SoundFileID = 00FF567A
#. ScriptNotes = Grateful
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I need to talk to you about the supply theft.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Tell me what you know about the theft.
#. EDID: [01021659]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0003A2"
msgid "Oh nice, are you gonna help us bust Yeats out? He totally didn't do it. Just ask Hal."
msgstr "오 좋다, 예이츠 탈옥시키는 거 도와주려는 거야? 그는 절대 안 했어. 할에게 물어봐."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2540_GraceKim_TL03
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = GraceKim
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFGraceKim
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00469B7D
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: I'd like to ask you some questions.
#. EDID: [0102158C]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0003A3"
msgid "But that's just who she is. I'm not going to ask her to change."
msgstr "하지만 그게 그 애야. 난 그 애에게 바뀌라고 요구하지 않을 거야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2540_GraceKim_TL03
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = GraceKim
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFGraceKim
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00CFE83A
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Can you tell me about your sister, Sunni?
#. EDID: [0102158C]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0003A4"
msgid "I know she gets a bad rap for not working as hard as the others, but I think it's her attitude more than her work ethic."
msgstr "그 애가 남들만큼 열심히 일하지 않는다고 평판이 나쁜 건 알아. 하지만 문제는 근면성보다 태도인 것 같아."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2550_GraceKim_TL02
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = GraceKim
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFGraceKim
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00536304
#. DialogueBefore = GraceKim: He's new, but he's earned his keep.|He's a force multiplier for the group. Ivica works harder, but he keeps to himself.|Hal has mentored Caspian and helped Zena with a lot of the leadership responsibilities.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: I'd like to ask you some questions.
#. EDID: [010215A0]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0003A5"
msgid "I'm still processing the shock, to be honest. I didn't know the man he was, only the one I knew."
msgstr "솔직히 말하면 아직 충격을 처리하는 중이야. 내가 아는 사람은 내가 알던 그 모습뿐이었지, 그가 어떤 사람이었는지는 몰랐어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2400_Sasha_TL01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Sasha
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFSashaAtwell
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00DB2103
#. ScriptNotes = Serious / to Player Default
#. Prompt = What happens if Yeats doesn't admit guilt?
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: What happens if Yeats doesn't admit guilt?
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: I've got questions about the stolen supplies.
#. EDID: [010217E7]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0003A6"
msgid "Then he's gonna have to make amends with whatever God he serves, and quick."
msgstr "그럼 예이츠는 자기가 섬기는 신과 얼른 화해해야겠죠."

