#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Oh yeah. Sunni Kim says he saw Yeats creeping around the supply area on more than one occasion.
#. EDID: [01021602]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0003AC"
msgid "Were there any witnesses to the theft?"
msgstr "절도 현장에 목격자가 있었나요?"

