#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 006E96F1
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = I make my own luck, priest.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I make my own luck, priest.
#. DialogueAfter = Yeats: I've no clue who you are or what brought this on, but as the Bard says, "Fortune brings in some boats that are not steered."
#. EDID: [010217B5]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0003C1"
msgid "Valiant. But if you are so confident, then by all means, talk to the guard, perform thy miracle!"
msgstr "용감하군. 하지만 그렇게 자신 있다면, 부디 경비와 이야기하고 그대의 기적을 행하게!"

