msgctxt "0003C4"
msgid "It's an open and shut case. Yeats is obviously the perp."
msgstr "뻔한 거 아닙니까. 예이츠가 범인인 게 분명합니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
