#. DialogueAfter = Sasha: It's an open and shut case. Yeats is obviously the perp.
#. EDID: [0102169F]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0003C5"
msgid "Hal put you up to this?"
msgstr "할이 이러라고 시켰습니까?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2300_YeatsTL03_Enlightened
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00FB4C49
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: God reveals himself to those who seek Him. If you keep the faith, you have nothing to fear. &&& Yeats: I know many multi-level marketing schemes that would say the same. But on the other hand, He did bring you to me. &&& Yeats: I find their ideology hopeless.|If man is without a soul, then he is but a rock, caught in time's endless river. |Day by day he's eroded by the stream, shrinking to a pebble, and ground to gravel and dust.|That is not something I want to preach. I want a world where we are more than dust.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: I see. Life without death will only increase the time we waste.
#. EDID: [010216BC]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0003C6"
msgid "Knowing dust is the end makes us value life. We take hold of it and live it without fear."
msgstr "끝이 먼지라는 걸 알기에 우리는 삶을 소중히 여기는 거야. 삶을 붙잡고 두려움 없이 사는 거지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2100_Yeats_Intro
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Yeats
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMYeats
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 005A91A4
#. ScriptNotes = If Caruso is dead, then this is the reply to all 3 of the previous questions.
#. DialogueBefore = Yeats: If that's your way of asking me to shut my bloody mouth, then well played. The floor is yours.
#. DialogueAfter = Yeats: What brings you, stranger, to this humble priest?
#. EDID: [01021591]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0003C7"
msgid "Indeed. Sasha tells me Hal Caruso is dead, by your hand. But I am not taking confessions."
msgstr "그렇군. 사샤가 말하길 할 카루소가 자네 손에 죽었다더군. 하지만 나는 고해를 듣는 중이 아니야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2300_YeatsTL04_WhyInPrison
