#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0003CB"
msgid "True enough! No man is swift enough to escape the devil's lasso. Not even Hal."
msgstr "맞는 말이야! 악마의 올가미에서 벗어날 만큼 빠른 사람은 없어. 할조차도."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2300_YeatsTL02_Prison
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
