#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMYeats
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 003BBBC9
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = One step at a time. Let's clear your name first.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: One step at a time. Let's clear your name first.
#. DialogueAfter = Yeats: I've no clue who you are or what brought this on, but as the Bard says, "Fortune brings in some boats that are not steered."
#. EDID: [010215B1]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0003CC"
msgid "If that is your wish, my dear Sisyphus, I will not stop you. Talk to the guard, and clear my name! Perform thy miracle!"
msgstr "그게 그대의 바람이라면, 사랑하는 시시포스여, 막지 않겠네. 경비와 이야기해 내 이름을 깨끗이 해주게! 그대의 기적을 행하게!"

