#. DialogueBefore = Yeats: If that is your wish, my dear Sisyphus, I will not stop you. Talk to the guard, and clear my name! Perform thy miracle!
#. EDID: [01021567]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0003D1"
msgid "I've no clue who you are or what brought this on, but as the Bard says, \"Fortune brings in some boats that are not steered.\""
msgstr "그대가 누구인지, 무엇이 이 일을 불러왔는지 나는 전혀 모르지만, 시인이 말했듯 \"운명은 조타수 없는 배도 데려온다네.\""

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2300_YeatsTL02_Prison
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Yeats
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMYeats
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 001DAF5A
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = He never made that clear to me.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: He never made that clear to me.
#. DialogueAfter = Yeats: Even if you were to find the supply thief and clear my name, I have lost it. My faith.
#. EDID: [01021765]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0003D2"
msgid "Strange. Hal is a man of few words, but the intent is always clear. Regardless..."
msgstr "이상하군. 할은 말수가 적은 사람이지만, 의도는 늘 분명했어. 어쨌든..."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2300_YeatsTL06
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Yeats
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMYeats
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 004B338C
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = If this is a place of worship, you need an actual doctrine to preach.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: If this is a place of worship, you need an actual doctrine to preach.
#. DialogueAfter = Yeats: You see, I was once a man of faith. Born into the Sanctum Universum.
#. EDID: [010216BB]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0003D3"
msgid "That is the heart of the issue at hand."
msgstr "그것이 지금 이 문제의 핵심이야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2300_YeatsTL06
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Yeats
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMYeats
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00203CAC
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Caruso has asked I help you get this place functioning.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: It's a shithole, and you're the chief defecator.
#. EDID: [01021544]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0003D4"
msgid "Is it not doing so now?"
msgstr "지금도 그러고 있지 않나?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2300_YeatsTL02_Prison
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Yeats
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0046DF97
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Caruso asked me to help you get out of jail. &&& Yeats: So Hal has not yet given up on me. A saint, that man. |I would say "angel," but I no longer believe in such things.|I take it he wants me to lead the House of Worship?
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: True enough! No man is swift enough to escape the devil's lasso. Not even Hal.
#. EDID: [01021789]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0003D5"
msgid "I wouldn't call him a saint."
msgstr "그를 성인이라고 부르진 않겠어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2300_YeatsTL03_Enlightened
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Yeats
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00954F07
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: God reveals himself to those who seek Him. If you keep the faith, you have nothing to fear. &&& Yeats: I know many multi-level marketing schemes that would say the same. But on the other hand, He did bring you to me. &&& Yeats: I find their ideology hopeless.|If man is without a soul, then he is but a rock, caught in time's endless river. |Day by day he's eroded by the stream, shrinking to a pebble, and ground to gravel and dust.|That is not something I want to preach. I want a world where we are more than dust.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: That feels even more hopeless, but a hard truth is still the truth. It must be stomached, even if the taste is sour.
#. EDID: [01021543]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0003D6"
msgid "Religion is a crutch. You need to stand up and face reality."
msgstr "종교는 목발이야. 스스로 일어서서 현실을 마주해야 해."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2300_YeatsTL03_Enlightened
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Yeats
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00423EA7
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: God reveals himself to those who seek Him. If you keep the faith, you have nothing to fear. &&& Yeats: I know many multi-level marketing schemes that would say the same. But on the other hand, He did bring you to me. &&& Yeats: I find their ideology hopeless.|If man is without a soul, then he is but a rock, caught in time's endless river. |Day by day he's eroded by the stream, shrinking to a pebble, and ground to gravel and dust.|That is not something I want to preach. I want a world where we are more than dust.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: True. There is a legacy beyond life that echoes across time.
#. EDID: [010215DB]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0003D7"
msgid "Words and deeds live on forever. Preach and you will be immortal."
msgstr "말과 행동은 영원히 남아. 설교하면 불멸이 될 거야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2300_YeatsTL03_Enlightened
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMYeats
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMYeats
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00838B44
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Knowing dust is the end makes us value life. We take hold of it and live it without fear.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Knowing dust is the end makes us value life. We take hold of it and live it without fear.
#. DialogueAfter = Yeats: Hm. I will ruminate on this discussion. You have given me much to ponder.
#. EDID: [010217AF]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0003D8"
msgid "I see. Life without death will only increase the time we waste."
msgstr "알겠네. 죽음 없는 삶은 우리가 낭비하는 시간을 늘릴 뿐이겠군."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2300_YeatsTL06
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00A6582B
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: We endure hardships as it is a test of our faith. &&& Yeats: A test? What are we, schoolchildren? The whole thing seems infantile, cast upon us by an insecure God. &&& Yeats: So next, I tried the House of Enlightened. But I found their philosophy lacking.|You can't really focus a religion on the absence of a creator.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Then why not call it what it is. A glorified chat server.
#. EDID: [010215ED]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0003D9"
msgid "It's about teaching self-reliance and fostering a community outside of belief in a creator."
msgstr "창조자에 대한 믿음 밖에서 자립을 가르치고 공동체를 키우는 것이지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2100_Yeats_Intro
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMYeats
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMYeats
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00FB7170
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Then we shouldn't waste any more time with idle chitchat.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Then we shouldn't waste any more time with idle chitchat.
#. DialogueAfter = Yeats: Indeed. Sasha tells me Hal Caruso is dead, by your hand. But I am not taking confessions.
#. EDID: [01021726]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0003DA"
msgid "If that's your way of asking me to shut my bloody mouth, then well played. The floor is yours."
msgstr "내 빌어먹을 입을 다물라는 식의 질문이라면, 잘했군. 무대는 그대의 것이야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2300_YeatsTL02_Prison
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0048D59F
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: He does. &&& Yeats: Then I must disappoint him. &&& Yeats: Even if you were to find the supply thief and clear my name, I have lost it. My faith.|So if Hal wishes me to preach, then as a wise man once said, "He's shit out of luck." As are you.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: If that is your wish, my dear Sisyphus, I will not stop you. Talk to the guard, and clear my name! Perform thy miracle!
#. EDID: [01021583]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0003DB"
msgid "One step at a time. Let's clear your name first."
msgstr "한 걸음씩 가자. 먼저 네 누명부터 벗기자고."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2300_YeatsTL06
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Yeats
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMYeats
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00A09692
#. DialogueAfter = Yeats: But in the end, I suppose it matters not. What I lack isn't a belief in God, it's a belief in humanity.
#. EDID: [010217CF]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0003DC"
msgid "I don't know much about its tenets, but I do know one thing. At least it's bold."
msgstr "그 교리는 잘 모르지만, 한 가지는 알아. 적어도 대담하긴 해."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2300_YeatsTL06
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Yeats
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMYeats
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00A19F33
#. DialogueBefore = Yeats: Then why not call it what it is. A glorified chat server.
#. EDID: [010217CF]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0003DD"
msgid "And then there is this third entry into the ring. Caruso's so-called \"Great Serpent.\""
msgstr "그리고 이 링에 세 번째로 들어온 것이 있지. 카루소가 말하는 이른바 \"위대한 뱀\" 말이야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2300_YeatsTL02_Prison
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMYeats
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMYeats
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0008CBC2
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = He does.
#. DialogueAfter = Yeats: Even if you were to find the supply thief and clear my name, I have lost it. My faith.
#. EDID: [01021827]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0003DE"
msgid "The larger issue is the voice I am tasked with preaching."
msgstr "더 큰 문제는 내가 설교해야 할 목소리야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2300_YeatsTL02_Prison
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMYeats
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMYeats
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0050AAA3
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = He does.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: He does.
#. EDID: [01021827]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0003DF"
msgid "Innocent, guilty, these are but temporary problems."
msgstr "무죄니 유죄니 하는 건 일시적인 문제일 뿐이야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2300_YeatsTL02_Prison
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMYeats
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMYeats
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00D8B0EF
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = He does.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: He does.
#. DialogueAfter = Yeats: Even if you were to find the supply thief and clear my name, I have lost it. My faith.
#. EDID: [01021826]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0003E0"
msgid "Then I must disappoint him."
msgstr "그렇다면 그를 실망시켜야겠군."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2300_YeatsTL06
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Yeats
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMYeats
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 008217D1
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: We endure hardships as it is a test of our faith.
#. EDID: [010215A6]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0003E1"
msgid "I even became a preacher of the doctrine. But where was God when I needed him most? That was the first of three lies."
msgstr "나는 그 교리의 설교자가 되기까지 했어. 하지만 내가 가장 필요로 했을 때 신은 어디에 있었나? 그것이 세 가지 거짓 중 첫째였지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2300_YeatsTL06
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Yeats
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMYeats
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 005D28A7
#. DialogueBefore = Yeats: You are tough but fair. I think I know where the problem lies.
#. EDID: [010215A6]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0003E2"
msgid "You see, I was once a man of faith. Born into the Sanctum Universum."
msgstr "알다시피, 나는 한때 믿음의 사람이었어. 우주의 성소에서 태어났지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2300_YeatsTL02_Prison
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Yeats
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMYeats
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00E536C7
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: One step at a time. Let's clear your name first.
#. EDID: [01021727]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0003E3"
msgid "So if Hal wishes me to preach, then as a wise man once said, \"He's shit out of luck.\" As are you."
msgstr "그러니 할이 내게 설교하길 바란다면, 어느 현자가 말했듯 \"그는 완전히 운이 없는 거야.\" 그대도 마찬가지고."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2300_YeatsTL02_Prison
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Yeats
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMYeats
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00667DCD
#. DialogueBefore = Yeats: Then I must disappoint him.
#. EDID: [01021727]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0003E4"
msgid "Even if you were to find the supply thief and clear my name, I have lost it. My faith."
msgstr "그대가 물자 도둑을 찾아 내 누명을 벗긴다 해도, 나는 그것을 잃었어. 나의 믿음을."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2300_YeatsTL02_Prison
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Yeats
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMYeats
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00EE9CEF
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: He does.
#. EDID: [01021667]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0003E5"
msgid "No, I suspect this is Saint Hal Caruso's doing. He always believed I was innocent."
msgstr "아니, 이건 성 할 카루소의 짓일 거라고 생각해. 그는 항상 내가 무죄라고 믿었지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2300_YeatsTL02_Prison
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Yeats
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMYeats
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0012F2A4
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Caruso asked me to help you get out of jail.
#. EDID: [01021667]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0003E6"
msgid "Zena never cared about what happened to me. "
msgstr "제나는 내게 무슨 일이 일어났는지 신경 쓴 적 없어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2300_YeatsTL02_Prison
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Yeats
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMYeats
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0077826A
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: He does.
#. EDID: [01021666]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0003E7"
msgid "I take it he wants me to lead the House of Worship?"
msgstr "그가 내가 예배당을 이끌기를 바라는 모양이군?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2300_YeatsTL02_Prison
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Yeats
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMYeats
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 001D32F5
#. EDID: [01021666]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0003E8"
msgid "I would say \"angel,\" but I no longer believe in such things."
msgstr "천사라고 말하고 싶지만, 이제 나는 그런 것을 믿지 않아."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2300_YeatsTL02_Prison
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Yeats
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMYeats
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00A263EE
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Caruso asked me to help you get out of jail.
#. EDID: [01021666]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0003E9"
msgid "So Hal has not yet given up on me. A saint, that man. "
msgstr "그러니 할은 아직 나를 포기하지 않았군. 성인 같은 사람이야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2300_YeatsTL06
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Yeats
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMYeats
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00BF8197
#. EDID: [0102163B]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0003EA"
msgid "The reality is, we are not worthy of whatever comes after."
msgstr "현실은, 우리는 그 뒤에 오는 무엇에도 합당하지 않다는 거야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2300_YeatsTL06
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Yeats
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMYeats
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 001375ED
#. DialogueBefore = Yeats: And then there is this third entry into the ring. Caruso's so-called "Great Serpent."|I don't know much about its tenets, but I do know one thing. At least it's bold.
#. EDID: [0102163B]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0003EB"
msgid "But in the end, I suppose it matters not. What I lack isn't a belief in God, it's a belief in humanity."
msgstr "하지만 결국 그건 중요하지 않은지도 모르겠어. 내게 부족한 건 신에 대한 믿음이 아니라, 인간성에 대한 믿음이니까."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2300_YeatsTL06
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Yeats
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMYeats
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00376DB6
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = If this is a place of worship, you need an actual doctrine to preach.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: If this is a place of worship, you need an actual doctrine to preach.
#. DialogueAfter = Yeats: So next, I tried the House of Enlightened. But I found their philosophy lacking.
#. EDID: [0102174C]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0003EC"
msgid "That is the heart of the issue at hand."
msgstr "그것이 지금 이 문제의 핵심이야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2300_YeatsTL03_Enlightened
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Yeats
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMYeats
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 004E3FB5
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Knowing dust is the end makes us value life. We take hold of it and live it without fear.
#. EDID: [0102182E]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0003ED"
msgid "That is not something I want to preach. I want a world where we are more than dust."
msgstr "그건 내가 설교하고 싶은 것이 아니야. 나는 우리가 먼지 이상의 존재인 세상을 원해."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2300_YeatsTL03_Enlightened
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Yeats
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMYeats
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00177E95
#. EDID: [0102182E]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0003EE"
msgid "Day by day he's eroded by the stream, shrinking to a pebble, and ground to gravel and dust."
msgstr "그는 날마다 물살에 깎여 자갈이 되고, 부서져 모래와 먼지가 되지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2300_YeatsTL03_Enlightened
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Yeats
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMYeats
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 006BB5CC
#. EDID: [0102182E]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0003EF"
msgid "If man is without a soul, then he is but a rock, caught in time's endless river. "
msgstr "인간에게 영혼이 없다면, 인간은 시간의 끝없는 강에 갇힌 바위일 뿐이야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2300_YeatsTL03_Enlightened
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Yeats
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMYeats
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0013DE1C
#. ScriptNotes = Player asked "Why not preach for the Enlightened?"
#. DialogueBefore = Yeats: I know many multi-level marketing schemes that would say the same. But on the other hand, He did bring you to me.
#. EDID: [0102182E]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0003F0"
msgid "I find their ideology hopeless."
msgstr "나는 그들의 이념이 절망적이라고 생각해."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2300_YeatsTL06
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Yeats
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0046EFC6
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: It's a shithole, and you're the chief defecator. &&& Yeats: You are tough but fair. I think I know where the problem lies. &&& Yeats: You see, I was once a man of faith. Born into the Sanctum Universum.|I even became a preacher of the doctrine. But where was God when I needed him most? That was the first of three lies.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: That is the heart of the issue at hand.
#. EDID: [010216D8]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0003F1"
msgid "If this is a place of worship, you need an actual doctrine to preach."
msgstr "이곳이 예배 장소라면, 설교할 실제 교리가 필요해."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2300_YeatsTL03_Enlightened
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0094A948
#. DialogueAfter = Yeats: I have no faith. In anything.
#. EDID: [01021658]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0003F2"
msgid "Let's talk about your faith."
msgstr "당신의 믿음에 대해 이야기하죠."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2300_YeatsTL06
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMYeats
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMYeats
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00251E5C
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = It's a shithole, and you're the chief defecator.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: It's a shithole, and you're the chief defecator.
#. DialogueAfter = Yeats: You see, I was once a man of faith. Born into the Sanctum Universum.
#. EDID: [01021721]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0003F3"
msgid "You are tough but fair. I think I know where the problem lies."
msgstr "넌 엄하지만 공정해. 어디에 문제가 있는지 알 것 같아."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2300_YeatsTL06
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Yeats
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMYeats
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00501E99
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = It's a mess, among other things.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: It's a mess, among other things.
#. DialogueAfter = Yeats: So next, I tried the House of Enlightened. But I found their philosophy lacking.
#. EDID: [0102164E]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0003F4"
msgid "It's not a mess, but a reflection. A mirror of my state of mind."
msgstr "엉망인 게 아니라 반영이야. 내 마음 상태를 비추는 거울이지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2300_YeatsTL06
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Yeats
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00DA89D9
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: We endure hardships as it is a test of our faith. &&& Yeats: A test? What are we, schoolchildren? The whole thing seems infantile, cast upon us by an insecure God. &&& Yeats: So next, I tried the House of Enlightened. But I found their philosophy lacking.|You can't really focus a religion on the absence of a creator.
#. EDID: [01021758]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0003F5"
msgid "Agreed. I never understood them myself."
msgstr "동의해. 나도 그들을 이해한 적은 없었어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2300_YeatsTL06
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0048D6CF
#. DialogueAfter = Yeats: Is it not doing so now?
#. EDID: [01021813]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0003F6"
msgid "Zena has asked I help you get this place functioning."
msgstr "제나가 이곳이 제대로 돌아가도록 당신을 도우라고 했어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2300_YeatsTL06
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 001870C8
#. DialogueAfter = Yeats: Is it not doing so now?
#. EDID: [01021812]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0003F7"
msgid "Caruso has asked I help you get this place functioning."
msgstr "카루소가 이곳이 제대로 돌아가도록 당신을 도우라고 했어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2300_YeatsTL06
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMYeats
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMYeats
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0012EB33
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = It's about teaching self-reliance and fostering a community outside of belief in a creator.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: It's about teaching self-reliance and fostering a community outside of belief in a creator.
#. DialogueAfter = Yeats: And then there is this third entry into the ring. Caruso's so-called "Great Serpent."
#. EDID: [010215DA]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0003F8"
msgid "Then why not call it what it is. A glorified chat server."
msgstr "그럼 있는 그대로 부르지 그래. 과장된 채팅 서버라고."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2300_YeatsTL06
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 008BE425
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Caruso has asked I help you get this place functioning. &&& Yeats: Is it not doing so now?
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: You are tough but fair. I think I know where the problem lies.
#. EDID: [01021820]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0003F9"
msgid "It's a shithole, and you're the chief defecator."
msgstr "여긴 똥통이고, 넌 그 똥통의 최고 배설자야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2300_YeatsTL06
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Yeats
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMYeats
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0005E7B4
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: It's about teaching self-reliance and fostering a community outside of belief in a creator.
#. EDID: [01021828]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0003FA"
msgid "You can't really focus a religion on the absence of a creator."
msgstr "창조자의 부재를 중심으로 종교를 세울 수는 없잖아."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2300_YeatsTL06
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Yeats
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMYeats
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 007DE4FB
#. DialogueBefore = Yeats: A test? What are we, schoolchildren? The whole thing seems infantile, cast upon us by an insecure God.
#. EDID: [01021828]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0003FB"
msgid "So next, I tried the House of Enlightened. But I found their philosophy lacking."
msgstr "그래서 다음으로 계몽회의 집을 시도했어. 하지만 그들의 철학도 부족하더군."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2100_Yeats_Intro
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Yeats
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00E5CBD4
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Many times he died, Many times rose again. &&& Yeats: A great man in his pride, Confronting murderous men. &&& Yeats: In fact, I find myself struggling to find value in anything written, or spoken. |Words are the cheapest currency, after all. And so easily counterfeited.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Said the liar to the fool. But I will happily play my part.
#. EDID: [010216EC]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0003FC"
msgid "Well, I'm not here to lie to you."
msgstr "글쎄, 난 너에게 거짓말하러 온 게 아니야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2300_YeatsTL06
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Yeats
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00B09D8C
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Caruso has asked I help you get this place functioning. &&& Yeats: Is it not doing so now?
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: It's not a mess, but a reflection. A mirror of my state of mind.
#. EDID: [01021778]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0003FD"
msgid "It's a mess, among other things."
msgstr "엉망이지. 그 밖에도 여러 가지로."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2300_YeatsTL06
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMYeats
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMYeats
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00CB33A0
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = We endure hardships as it is a test of our faith.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: We endure hardships as it is a test of our faith.
#. DialogueAfter = Yeats: So next, I tried the House of Enlightened. But I found their philosophy lacking.
#. EDID: [01021772]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0003FE"
msgid "A test? What are we, schoolchildren? The whole thing seems infantile, cast upon us by an insecure God."
msgstr "시험이라고? 우리가 학생인가? 모든 게 유치해 보여. 불안한 신이 우리에게 던져 놓은 것처럼."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2300_YeatsTL06
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00316399
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: It's a shithole, and you're the chief defecator. &&& Yeats: You are tough but fair. I think I know where the problem lies. &&& Yeats: You see, I was once a man of faith. Born into the Sanctum Universum.|I even became a preacher of the doctrine. But where was God when I needed him most? That was the first of three lies.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: A test? What are we, schoolchildren? The whole thing seems infantile, cast upon us by an insecure God.
#. EDID: [01021641]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0003FF"
msgid "We endure hardships as it is a test of our faith."
msgstr "우리는 고난을 견뎌. 그것이 우리 믿음의 시험이기 때문이야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2100_Yeats_Intro
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Yeats
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMYeats
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00241695
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Enough small talk. I didn't come here to debate with you.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Enough small talk. I didn't come here to debate with you.
#. DialogueAfter = Yeats: Indeed. Sasha tells me Hal Caruso is dead, by your hand. But I am not taking confessions.
#. EDID: [010215B9]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000400"
msgid "Indeed. Then I shall cease with the monologues and cede the podium to you."
msgstr "그렇군. 그렇다면 독백을 멈추고 연단을 그대에게 넘기겠네."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2100_Yeats_Intro
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Yeats
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMYeats
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00769830
#. DialogueBefore = Yeats: Indeed. Sasha tells me Hal Caruso is dead, by your hand. But I am not taking confessions.
#. EDID: [010215B7]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000401"
msgid "What brings you, stranger, to this humble priest?"
msgstr "무엇이 그대를 이 초라한 사제에게 데려왔나, 외지인이여?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2100_Yeats_Intro
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
