#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00FD7BD2
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Many times he died, Many times rose again. &&& Yeats: A great man in his pride, Confronting murderous men. &&& Yeats: In fact, I find myself struggling to find value in anything written, or spoken. |Words are the cheapest currency, after all. And so easily counterfeited.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: If that's your way of asking me to shut my bloody mouth, then well played. The floor is yours.
#. EDID: [01021617]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000406"
msgid "Then we shouldn't waste any more time with idle chitchat."
msgstr "그럼 쓸데없는 잡담으로 더 시간을 낭비하지 말아야겠군."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_120_Caruso_Greet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Caruso
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMHalCaruso
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 002A4638
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I was told you're the one who can help me with my extended warranty.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: You're a known criminal. I'm guessing there's probably a bounty on your head too.
#. EDID: [0102167B]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000407"
msgid "I think you have the wrong man. I'm just a farmer."
msgstr "사람 잘못 본 것 같아. 난 그저 농부야."

