#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00949B5C
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Yeats: &&& Yeats: Nor dread nor hope attend, A dying animal; A man awaits his end, Dreading and hoping all...
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: One hundred and fifty percent. Which isn't even possible, mathematically.
#. EDID: [01021559]
