#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Odjebi! And what am I supposed to do for work then?
#. EDID: [01021555]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000451"
msgid "Nah, I'll find another way to power the robot."
msgstr "아니, 로봇에 전원을 넣을 다른 방법을 찾을게."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
