#. DialogueAfter = Ivica: I'll do it.
#. EDID: [010215BC]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000452"
msgid "Caruso will be pissed, but he's all about making lemonade from lemons. Once he sees the power upgrade, he'll accept it. Begrudgingly."
msgstr "카루소는 화내겠지만, 그는 시련을 기회로 만드는 사람이잖아. 전력 업그레이드를 보면 받아들일 거야. 마지못해서라도."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_b1000_IvicaGreet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Ivica
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMIvicaVukovic
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00769B4D
