#. Prompt = Won't the other residents notice?
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Won't the other residents notice?
#. EDID: [010215BC]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000453"
msgid "Bah, machines around here are always breaking down. At worst, it'll look like a well-meaning accident."
msgstr "쳇, 여기 기계들은 늘 고장 나. 최악의 경우에도 선의의 사고처럼 보일 거야."

