#. EDID: [010216FA]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000458"
msgid "And so I got to thinking, \"This sucks. Why can't a robot do this shit?\""
msgstr "그래서 생각했지. \"이거 짜증 나네. 왜 로봇이 이 빌어먹을 일을 못 하지?\""

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_b1200_Sunni_TL01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = SunniKim
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFSunniKim
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00010205
#. DialogueBefore = SunniKim: I'm a "farmer", but technically my boy Rusty does all the work.
#. EDID: [010216FA]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000459"
msgid "I'm a farmer, but I don't like it. It's boring and tedious."
msgstr "난 농부지만 이 일이 싫어. 지루하고 따분해."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
