#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: No shit. That old dog Ivica finally did it.
#. EDID: [010215D5]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00045A"
msgid "Too late. The robot's malfunctioning."
msgstr "너무 늦었어. 로봇이 오작동 중이야."

#. List: 2
#. EDID: [01021800]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00045B"
msgid "What do you do out here?"
msgstr "여기서 무슨 일을 해?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
