#. DialogueAfter = Ivica: You'll need a power cell to turn it on. Here, this should do the trick.
#. EDID: [0102165D]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00045C"
msgid "Yes, so do I."
msgstr "응, 나도 그래."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_b1100_Ivica_TL01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Ivica
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMIvicaVukovic
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 0058EFA4
#. ScriptNotes = Emphasis on we / Confident
#. DialogueBefore = Ivica: Hvala puno. You've done this entire outpost a service. |No more lazy workers reliant on robots. And I can use the ore to improve things around here, starting with the generators.
#. EDID: [01021750]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00045E"
msgid "That should be enough to satisfy Caruso. And if it isn't? Screw it. We know better."
msgstr "그 정도면 카루소도 만족할 거야. 만족 못 한다면? 알 게 뭐야. 우리가 더 잘 아니까."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_b1100_Ivica_TL01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Ivica
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMIvicaVukovic
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00F9E6ED
#. DialogueAfter = Ivica: That should be enough to satisfy Caruso. And if it isn't? Screw it. We know better.
#. EDID: [01021605]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00045F"
msgid "No more lazy workers reliant on robots. And I can use the ore to improve things around here, starting with the generators."
msgstr "더는 로봇에 의존하는 게으른 일꾼은 없어. 그리고 광석을 이용해서 여기 상황을 개선할 수 있어. 발전기부터 시작해서."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_b1100_Ivica_TL01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Ivica
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMIvicaVukovic
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00EDCEC9
#. ScriptNotes = Hvala puno = Thank you very much.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: [Robot Parts] I've got the parts you requested.
#. EDID: [01021605]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000460"
msgid "Hvala puno. You've done this entire outpost a service. "
msgstr "정말 고마워(Hvala puno). 넌 이 전초기지 전체에 큰 도움을 줬어. "

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_b1100_Ivica_TL01
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
