#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00823169
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: [Lie] I can do that. Just tell me how. &&& Ivica: One word: Magnets. The robot likes to go to the junkyard, and dig for spare parts.|If you turn on the magnet while it's searching, it'll scramble its egg.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Bah, machines around here are always breaking down. At worst, it'll look like a well-meaning accident.
#. EDID: [0102176D]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000465"
msgid "Won't the other residents notice?"
msgstr "다른 주민들이 눈치채지 않을까?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_b1000_IvicaGreet
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Ivica
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00B0CF01
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Human labor is superior. If anything, the robot should be scrapped. &&& Ivica: Yes, yes... I am picking up what you are putting down. &&& Ivica: The robot is a useless heap of shit, but the parts are not. If, instead of repairing it, you were to break it...|I could use the spare parts to fix the mining machine.
#. DialogueAfter = Ivica: One word: Magnets. The robot likes to go to the junkyard, and dig for spare parts.
#. EDID: [01021698]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000466"
msgid "I'll be happy to scrap it for you."
msgstr "기꺼이 폐기해줄게."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_b1000_IvicaGreet
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
