#. ScriptNotes = Confident
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: [Lie] I can do that. Just tell me how.
#. EDID: [01021832]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000468"
msgid "I could use the spare parts to fix the mining machine."
msgstr "예비 부품으로 채광 기계를 고칠 수 있어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_b1000_IvicaGreet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Ivica
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMIvicaVukovic
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00565C08
#. DialogueBefore = Ivica: Yes, yes... I am picking up what you are putting down.
#. EDID: [01021832]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000469"
msgid "The robot is a useless heap of shit, but the parts are not. If, instead of repairing it, you were to break it..."
msgstr "로봇은 쓸모없는 고철덩이지만, 부품은 아니야. 그러니 수리하는 대신 망가뜨린다면..."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_b1000_IvicaGreet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Ivica
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMIvicaVukovic
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0066A6A9
#. DialogueBefore = Ivica: Sranje, temporary.
#. DialogueAfter = companion: It depends on how competent the hands are, robot or otherwise.
#. EDID: [01021675]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00046A"
msgid "Robots can't be trusted to do work that was meant to be done with human hands."
msgstr "로봇은 인간의 손으로 해야 할 일을 믿고 맡길 수 없어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_200_CarusoTL05
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Caruso
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMHalCaruso
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00B1E0AA
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Why do you care about the outpost's religion?
#. EDID: [0102177B]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00046B"
msgid "A strong moral center is the backbone of any settlement. Religious guidance provides it."
msgstr "굳건한 도덕적 중심은 모든 정착지의 중추야. 종교적 가르침이 그것을 제공하지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_b1000_IvicaGreet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Ivica
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMIvicaVukovic
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 000865B3
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: I'll do it.
#. EDID: [0102161B]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00046C"
msgid "If you turn on the magnet while it's searching, it'll scramble its egg. "
msgstr "탐색 중일 때 자석을 켜면, 그놈 머리를 휘저어 놓을 수 있어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_b1000_IvicaGreet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Ivica
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMIvicaVukovic
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00DF97A4
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: [Lie] I can do that. Just tell me how.
#. EDID: [0102161B]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00046D"
msgid "One word: Magnets. The robot likes to go to the junkyard, and dig for spare parts."
msgstr "한 단어로 말하자면, 자석. 로봇은 고철 처리장에 가서 예비 부품을 파내는 걸 좋아해."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_b1000_IvicaGreet
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Ivica
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00C6F55A
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: It's temporary. We just need the robot to help out for a time. &&& Ivica: Sranje, temporary. &&& Ivica: Robots can't be trusted to do work that was meant to be done with human hands. &&& companion: It depends on how competent the hands are, robot or otherwise.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Because robots need parts. Maintenance. Things we don't readily have.
#. EDID: [01021794]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00046E"
msgid "Why are humans more fit for the labor?"
msgstr "왜 인간이 노동에 더 적합하지?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_200_CarusoTL04
