#. Speaker = Caruso
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMHalCaruso
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00457EE9
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Why is Ivica against the robot?
#. EDID: [010216DB]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00046F"
msgid "He fears losing his job. But the robot is a tool. It's not meant to replace him."
msgstr "그는 자기 일자리를 잃을까 두려워해. 하지만 로봇은 도구야. 그를 대체하려는 게 아니야."

