#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I take it there are power cells somewhere we can use.
#. DialogueAfter = Caruso: You'll need to talk to Ivica, the supply coordinator.
#. EDID: [010215E8]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000493"
msgid "There are."
msgstr "있어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_b1000_IvicaGreet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Ivica
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMIvicaVukovic
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 009684E6
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = How does a robot do more harm than good?
#. DialogueAfter = Ivica: It's temporary. We just need the robot to help out for a time.
#. EDID: [010215CF]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000494"
msgid "Her entire generation is soft, and it's because of robots like Rusty."
msgstr "그 애 세대 전체가 나약해. 러스티 같은 로봇들 때문이지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_b1000_IvicaGreet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Ivica
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMIvicaVukovic
#. Face = Angry
#. SoundFileID = 008ACE21
#. ScriptNotes = Angry / to Player Default
#. Prompt = How does a robot do more harm than good?
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: How does a robot do more harm than good?
#. EDID: [010215CF]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000495"
msgid "Because it makes people lazy. Look at Sunni Kim. She can barely lift a finger to scratch her own ass."
msgstr "그건 사람을 게으르게 만들기 때문이야. 써니 킴을 봐. 자기 엉덩이 긁으려고 손가락 하나 드는 것도 겨우 하잖아."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_b1000_IvicaGreet
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Ivica
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0090D66C
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Ivica: So, you've come back. Have you reconsidered my offer to scramble this robot's eggs? &&& Ivica: I saw you talking to Caruso. &&& Ivica: I may owe him a favor, but we can't waste power cells on a pissbucket of bolts that does more harm than good.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Because it makes people lazy. Look at Sunni Kim. She can barely lift a finger to scratch her own ass.
#. EDID: [010216D0]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000496"
msgid "How does a robot do more harm than good?"
msgstr "로봇이 어떻게 득보다 해가 많다는 거죠?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
