#. DialogueAfter = Ivica: Robots can't be trusted to do work that was meant to be done with human hands.
#. EDID: [0102162C]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000497"
msgid "Sranje, temporary. "
msgstr "젠장(Sranje), 임시라니. "

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_200_CarusoTL01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Caruso
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMHalCaruso
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 001EC78A
#. DialogueBefore = Caruso: I had a similar thought. The junkyard might have the parts, but the magnet is hooked up to the same power source.
#. DialogueAfter = Caruso: I've been trying to convince him to shift around the outpost's power distribution, with little luck.
#. EDID: [01021651]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000498"
msgid "You'll need to talk to Ivica, the supply coordinator."
msgstr "보급 담당자인 이비차와 이야기해야 해."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_b1000_IvicaGreet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Ivica
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMIvicaVukovic
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00E48637
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Robots are fine as tools. They just shouldn't be a replacement for humans.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Robots are fine as tools. They just shouldn't be a replacement for humans.
#. DialogueAfter = Ivica: The robot is a useless heap of shit, but the parts are not. If, instead of repairing it, you were to break it...
#. EDID: [01021733]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000499"
msgid "Then perhaps we are in agreement."
msgstr "그렇다면 우리는 의견이 일치하는 모양이군."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_b1000_IvicaGreet
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Ivica
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00E9468B
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: It's temporary. We just need the robot to help out for a time. &&& Ivica: Sranje, temporary. &&& Ivica: Robots can't be trusted to do work that was meant to be done with human hands. &&& companion: It depends on how competent the hands are, robot or otherwise.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Then perhaps we are in agreement.
#. EDID: [01021680]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00049A"
msgid "Robots are fine as tools. They just shouldn't be a replacement for humans."
msgstr "로봇은 도구로서는 괜찮아. 다만 인간을 대체해서는 안 돼."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_b1000_IvicaGreet
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 009BA01F
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: It's temporary. We just need the robot to help out for a time. &&& Ivica: Sranje, temporary. &&& Ivica: Robots can't be trusted to do work that was meant to be done with human hands. &&& companion: It depends on how competent the hands are, robot or otherwise.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Yes, yes... I am picking up what you are putting down.
#. EDID: [010216F6]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00049B"
msgid "Human labor is superior. If anything, the robot should be scrapped."
msgstr "인간 노동이 더 우월해. 오히려 그 로봇은 폐기해야 해."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_b1000_IvicaGreet
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Ivica
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00F68F2A
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Ivica: So, you've come back. Have you reconsidered my offer to scramble this robot's eggs? &&& Ivica: I saw you talking to Caruso. &&& Ivica: I may owe him a favor, but we can't waste power cells on a pissbucket of bolts that does more harm than good.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: He donated supplies and his ship to this settlement.
#. EDID: [010217AE]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00049C"
msgid "What favor did Caruso do for you?"
msgstr "카루소가 당신에게 어떤 부탁을 해줬죠?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_200_CarusoTL02
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Caruso
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMHalCaruso
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 003B7978
#. ScriptNotes = yates rhymes with bates or hates
#. DialogueBefore = Caruso: The community center is a perfect place for sermons and prayer.
#. DialogueAfter = Caruso: We'll need to get him sober, and out of prison.
#. EDID: [01021697]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00049D"
msgid "The problem is the local pastor, Yeats, has been accused of theft. He says he's innocent. I believe him."
msgstr "문제는 지역 목사인 예이츠가 절도 혐의를 받고 있다는 거야. 그는 결백하다고 해. 난 그를 믿어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_200_CarusoTL04
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00EC9B5F
#. DialogueAfter = Caruso: He fears losing his job. But the robot is a tool. It's not meant to replace him.
#. EDID: [01021620]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00049E"
msgid "Why is Ivica against the robot?"
msgstr "왜 이비차는 로봇에 반대하죠?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_200_CarusoTL01
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0003A9E8
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Why the need for a robot? &&& Caruso: Human labor is costly. There are a number of processes we need to automate. &&& Caruso: There is a utility robot at the junkyard that could alleviate a lot of issues, but it's lacking a power cell.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: I had a similar thought. The junkyard might have the parts, but the magnet is hooked up to the same power source.
#. EDID: [01021645]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00049F"
msgid "If I had the materials I could craft one."
msgstr "재료가 있다면 하나 만들 수 있어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_200_CarusoTL01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Caruso
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMHalCaruso
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00D8DB53
#. DialogueBefore = Caruso: Human labor is costly. There are a number of processes we need to automate.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: If I had the materials I could craft one.
#. EDID: [01021565]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0004A0"
msgid "There is a utility robot at the junkyard that could alleviate a lot of issues, but it's lacking a power cell."
msgstr "고철 처리장에 많은 문제를 덜어줄 수 있는 다용도 로봇이 있지만, 파워 셀이 부족해."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_200_CarusoTL02
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Caruso
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMHalCaruso
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 009D438E
#. DialogueBefore = Caruso: I have a plan, but let's handle the matter of the robot first.
#. DialogueAfter = Caruso: The problem is the local pastor, Yeats, has been accused of theft. He says he's innocent. I believe him.
#. EDID: [010216CB]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0004A1"
msgid "The community center is a perfect place for sermons and prayer."
msgstr "주민 센터는 설교와 기도에 완벽한 장소야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
