#. DialogueAfter = Ivica: Robots can't be trusted to do work that was meant to be done with human hands.
#. EDID: [010216AA]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0004A2"
msgid "Oh, so you've bought into their propaganda too."
msgstr "아, 그러니까 너도 그들의 선전에 넘어간 거군."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_200_CarusoTL01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Caruso
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMHalCaruso
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 006B49F5
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Would any power cell work?
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Would any power cell work?
#. DialogueAfter = Caruso: If I had the materials I could craft one.
#. EDID: [0102163A]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0004A3"
msgid "No. The machines here are older models. The type of cell required is no longer in production."
msgstr "아니. 여기 기계들은 구형 모델이야. 필요한 셀 유형은 더 이상 생산되지 않아."

