#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00E0599C
#. DialogueAfter = Caruso: It's her time. She's older, and would like to return home.
#. EDID: [01021576]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0004A9"
msgid "Why is Zena retiring?"
msgstr "제나는 왜 은퇴하는 거죠?"

