#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 003C3642
#. DialogueBefore = Caruso: You'll need to talk to Ivica, the supply coordinator.
#. EDID: [010215DF]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0004AF"
msgid "I've been trying to convince him to shift around the outpost's power distribution, with little luck."
msgstr "전초기지의 전력 배분을 좀 조정하라고 설득해 왔지만, 별 성과가 없었어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_200_CarusoTL02
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00FFCA9F
#. DialogueAfter = Caruso: I have a plan, but let's handle the matter of the robot first.
#. EDID: [01021706]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0004B0"
msgid "How do I help with restoring the place of worship?"
msgstr "예배당 복구를 어떻게 도우면 되지?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_200_CarusoTL03
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Caruso
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMHalCaruso
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 002E3D03
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Why is Zena retiring?
#. EDID: [010216F0]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0004B1"
msgid "It's her time. She's older, and would like to return home."
msgstr "그녀의 때가 된 거야. 나이도 들었고, 고향으로 돌아가고 싶어 해."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_200_CarusoTL01
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Caruso
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0090CAFD
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Why the need for a robot? &&& Caruso: Human labor is costly. There are a number of processes we need to automate. &&& Caruso: There is a utility robot at the junkyard that could alleviate a lot of issues, but it's lacking a power cell.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: There are.
#. EDID: [01021692]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0004B2"
msgid "I take it there are power cells somewhere we can use."
msgstr "우리가 쓸 수 있는 파워 셀이 어딘가 있다는 말이군."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_150_Caruso_Greet
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 001F897A
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Caruso: When I arrived here, I found a place in dire straits. &&& Caruso: It's better now, but there's still work to be done. &&& Caruso: Repairs are needed, physically and emotionally. I will need your help with both.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Doesn't take much to look. People just prefer to talk.
#. EDID: [01021711]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0004B4"
msgid "You seem to be an astute observer to have noticed all this."
msgstr "이걸 다 알아차리다니, 꽤 예리한 관찰자인 것 같군."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_150_Caruso_Greet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Caruso
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMHalCaruso
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00DBDEA1
#. ScriptNotes = Serious
#. EDID: [0102162B]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0004B5"
msgid "Second, we need to restore this place of worship. We can solve a lot of social issues through sermon and prayer."
msgstr "둘째, 이 예배당을 복구해야 해. 설교와 기도로 많은 사회적 문제를 해결할 수 있어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_150_Caruso_Greet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Caruso
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMHalCaruso
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 0051C4A2
#. ScriptNotes = Serious
#. DialogueBefore = Caruso: And New Babylon is no exception.
#. EDID: [0102162B]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0004B6"
msgid "For one, I'd like to automate some of the work here. To do that, we need to fix the Model A unit by the junkyard."
msgstr "우선 이곳의 일부 작업을 자동화하고 싶어. 그러려면 고철 처리장 옆의 모델 A 유닛을 고쳐야 해."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_150_Caruso_Greet
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Caruso
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0099C5BF
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Caruso: When I arrived here, I found a place in dire straits. &&& Caruso: It's better now, but there's still work to be done. &&& Caruso: Repairs are needed, physically and emotionally. I will need your help with both.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Likewise. But some things are obvious to see, if not easy to correct.
#. EDID: [0102169D]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0004B7"
msgid "I can help with physical repairs, but people aren't my area of expertise."
msgstr "물리적인 수리는 도울 수 있지만, 사람 문제는 내 전문 분야가 아니야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_150_Caruso_Greet
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Caruso
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00CA49B1
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: You seem to be an astute observer to have noticed all this. &&& Caruso: Doesn't take much to look. People just prefer to talk. &&& Caruso: But to the matter at hand. As I mentioned, I have a list of things that I'd like to resolve.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: *Ahem* As I was saying...
#. EDID: [0102164B]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0004B8"
msgid "*Yawn* Yeah, yeah."
msgstr "*하품* 그래, 그래."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_150_Caruso_Greet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Caruso
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMHalCaruso
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00F31D46
#. DialogueBefore = Caruso: It's better now, but there's still work to be done.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: You seem to be an astute observer to have noticed all this.
#. EDID: [010217A2]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0004B9"
msgid "Repairs are needed, physically and emotionally. I will need your help with both."
msgstr "물리적으로도, 감정적으로도 수리가 필요해. 두 가지 모두 네 도움이 필요하다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_150_Caruso_Greet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Caruso
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMHalCaruso
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00567EDA
#. ScriptNotes = Serious
#. DialogueBefore = Caruso: Doesn't take much to look. People just prefer to talk.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Many outposts of this type have multiple maintenance issues.
#. EDID: [01021561]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0004BA"
msgid "But to the matter at hand. As I mentioned, I have a list of things that I'd like to resolve."
msgstr "하지만 본론으로 돌아가자. 말했듯이, 해결하고 싶은 일들의 목록이 있어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_150_Caruso_Greet
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Caruso
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 009B5E58
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: You seem to be an astute observer to have noticed all this. &&& Caruso: Doesn't take much to look. People just prefer to talk. &&& Caruso: But to the matter at hand. As I mentioned, I have a list of things that I'd like to resolve.
#. DialogueAfter = Caruso: For one, I'd like to automate some of the work here. To do that, we need to fix the Model A unit by the junkyard.
#. EDID: [0102182C]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0004BB"
msgid "Then state them before I get bored and blow your head off."
msgstr "그럼 내가 지루해서 네 머리를 날려 버리기 전에 말해."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_x1CarusoDiesArc_160_CarusoDead_Zena01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Zena
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFZenaHield
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00B31060
#. ScriptNotes = / to Caspian
#. DialogueBefore = Zena: Everyone... stand down. &&& Caspian: Wait, you're just gonna take this stranger's word for it? That slate could be forged!
#. DialogueAfter = Caspian: This isn't fair. You're just letting this stranger get away with murder.
#. EDID: [01021835]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0004BC"
msgid "It's no stranger's. It's Hal's own words. So I repeat. Stand down. NOW."
msgstr "낯선 자의 말이 아니야. 할 자신의 말이다. 그러니 다시 말하지. 물러서. 당장."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_150_Caruso_Greet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Caruso
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMHalCaruso
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 007BAF74
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Physically and emotionally?
#. DialogueAfter = Caruso: You seem to be an astute observer to have noticed all this.
#. EDID: [010216F9]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0004BD"
msgid "For the outpost to survive, it will need all its parts mended."
msgstr "전초기지가 살아남으려면 모든 부분을 고쳐야 해."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_150_Caruso_Greet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Caruso
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMHalCaruso
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0021E914
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Physically and emotionally?
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Physically and emotionally?
#. EDID: [010216F9]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0004BE"
msgid "Yes. People can be broken just as easily as any machine. "
msgstr "그래. 사람도 어떤 기계만큼이나 쉽게 망가질 수 있지. "

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_150_Caruso_Greet
