#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: You seem to be an astute observer to have noticed all this.
#. DialogueAfter = Caruso: But to the matter at hand. As I mentioned, I have a list of things that I'd like to resolve.
#. EDID: [010217EA]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0004C2"
msgid "Doesn't take much to look. People just prefer to talk."
msgstr "둘러보는 데는 큰 노력이 필요 없어. 사람들은 그냥 말하는 걸 더 좋아할 뿐이지."

#. List: 2
