#. DialogueAfter = Zena: Caspian, enough! Don't make this harder than it already is.
#. EDID: [0102171F]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0004C6"
msgid "This isn't fair. You're just letting this stranger get away with murder."
msgstr "이건 불공평해. 넌 이 낯선 자가 살인을 저지르고도 빠져나가게 놔두고 있잖아."

#. List: 2
