#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Of course. I have a list.
#. EDID: [01021717]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0004C7"
msgid "Just tell me where to start."
msgstr "어디서부터 시작하면 되는지만 말해."

