#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00495397
#. ScriptNotes = / to GraceKim, Sasha
#. DialogueBefore = Zena: Caspian, enough! Don't make this harder than it already is.
#. DialogueAfter = Zena: Look, I understand why you came here. But I do not approve how you went about doing it.
#. EDID: [010216A6]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0004CE"
msgid "Grace, Sasha. If you can see to the body..."
msgstr "그레이스, 사샤. 시신을 좀 맡아 줄 수 있겠나..."

