#. DialogueAfter = Caruso: When that work is done, I will turn myself in, or end my life. Whatever the people decide.
#. EDID: [01021824]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0004F3"
msgid "My terms are as follows. In exchange for my submission, I would like you to help me resolve some pressing issues here."
msgstr "내 조건은 이렇다. 내가 항복하는 대가로, 여기의 시급한 문제 몇 가지를 해결하는 걸 도와줬으면 해."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_140_Caruso_Greet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Caruso
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMHalCaruso
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00FCA24B
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = [Attack] Not good enough. You die here.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: [Attack] Not good enough. You die here.
#. DialogueAfter = Caruso: When I arrived here, I found a place in dire straits.
#. EDID: [0102161E]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0004F4"
msgid "Unfortunate. But I will not go quietly!"
msgstr "안타깝군. 하지만 순순히 가진 않겠다!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_140_Caruso_Greet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Caruso
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMHalCaruso
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00D7746A
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Regardless, the people of Shinar Outpost deserve justice.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Regardless, the people of Shinar Outpost deserve justice.
#. DialogueAfter = Caruso: The others in this outpost, they depend on me.
#. EDID: [010215F4]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0004F5"
msgid "They do. But it'll have to wait."
msgstr "그래. 하지만 그건 기다려야 해."

