#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Unfortunate. But I will not go quietly!
#. EDID: [01021537]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0004F7"
msgid "[Attack] Not good enough. You die here."
msgstr "[공격] 부족해. 넌 여기서 죽는다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
