#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Go on then. Speak it. &&& Caruso: The truth is, I've been waiting for you. &&& Caruso: Yes, I am the one who left Shinar to die. My crimes are many, and without redemption. &&& Caruso: But I don't fear death, hunter. My blood is rancid, my bones rotten. |If you seek my life, then you'll be disappointed. There is no life left to take.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Then we have a problem. My body is not free to take.
#. EDID: [010216E1]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0004F8"
msgid "If I can't take your life, then I'll take your empty husk."
msgstr "네 목숨을 가져갈 수 없다면, 빈 껍데기라도 가져가겠다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_140_Caruso_Greet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Caruso
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMHalCaruso
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00043E39
#. DialogueBefore = Caruso: My terms are as follows. In exchange for my submission, I would like you to help me resolve some pressing issues here.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: I've seen you die before. But things may change this time.
#. EDID: [01021595]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0004F9"
msgid "When that work is done, I will turn myself in, or end my life. Whatever the people decide."
msgstr "그 일이 끝나면 자수하거나 내 목숨을 끊겠다. 사람들이 무엇을 결정하든."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_140_Caruso_Greet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMHalCaruso
