#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Go on then. Speak it.
#. DialogueAfter = Caruso: Yes, I am the one who left Shinar to die. My crimes are many, and without redemption.
#. EDID: [010216FE]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0004FA"
msgid "The truth is, I've been waiting for you."
msgstr "사실, 난 널 기다리고 있었어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_140_Caruso_Greet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Caruso
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMHalCaruso
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0096BC42
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral / to Player Default
#. Prompt = What will happen to the outpost if you leave?
#. DialogueAfter = Caruso: I trust you have a proposition, then.
#. EDID: [01021660]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0004FB"
msgid "I had hoped to correct them, but your arrival has changed the timeline."
msgstr "그 문제들을 바로잡고 싶었지만, 네 도착으로 일정이 달라졌어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_140_Caruso_Greet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Caruso
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMHalCaruso
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 000FF8F8
#. ScriptNotes = Serious / to Player Default
#. Prompt = What will happen to the outpost if you leave?
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: What will happen to the outpost if you leave?
#. EDID: [01021660]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0004FC"
msgid "I can solve the short term problems. But there are long term issues at play."
msgstr "단기적인 문제는 해결할 수 있어. 하지만 장기적인 문제가 얽혀 있지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_140_Caruso_Greet
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Caruso
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 002E08A3
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: There's always a sob story with you criminals. I'm not buying it. &&& Caruso: No story. I am a killer, no doubt. But this isn't just about me. &&& Caruso: The others in this outpost, they depend on me.|For them, my absence will be an expensive purchase. And for their sake, I will not yield.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: I can solve the short term problems. But there are long term issues at play.
#. EDID: [01021683]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0004FD"
msgid "What will happen to the outpost if you leave?"
msgstr "네가 떠나면 전초기지는 어떻게 되지?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_140_Caruso_Greet
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Caruso
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0027277B
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Go on then. Speak it. &&& Caruso: The truth is, I've been waiting for you. &&& Caruso: Yes, I am the one who left Shinar to die. My crimes are many, and without redemption. &&& Caruso: But I don't fear death, hunter. My blood is rancid, my bones rotten. |If you seek my life, then you'll be disappointed. There is no life left to take.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: In due time. But not yet.
#. EDID: [0102153B]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0004FE"
msgid "If you wish to repent, you should turn yourself into the authorities."
msgstr "회개하고 싶다면 당국에 자수해야지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_140_Caruso_Greet
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Caruso
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0065E9CD
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: There's always a sob story with you criminals. I'm not buying it. &&& Caruso: No story. I am a killer, no doubt. But this isn't just about me. &&& Caruso: The others in this outpost, they depend on me.|For them, my absence will be an expensive purchase. And for their sake, I will not yield.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: That may be, but your coming means there will be others. So I wish to make a deal.
#. EDID: [01021547]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0004FF"
msgid "That's fine. I never intended to kill you."
msgstr "좋아. 애초에 널 죽일 생각은 없었어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_140_Caruso_Greet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Caruso
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMHalCaruso
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00D5015C
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = [Attack] I think they'll be just fine without you.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: [Attack] I think they'll be just fine without you.
#. DialogueAfter = Caruso: My terms are as follows. In exchange for my submission, I would like you to help me resolve some pressing issues here.
#. EDID: [01021554]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000500"
msgid "Then it's a fight. So be it!"
msgstr "그럼 싸움이다. 그렇게 하지!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_140_Caruso_Greet
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Caruso
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00B39A69
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Caruso: You mentioned Shinar. I regret what happened there. &&& ... &&& Caruso: Up ahead is the Community Center. We should have privacy there. &&& Caruso: Now, let's get one thing straight. I'm not here to fight you, hunter. &&& Caruso: But before you take me in, I just want to say my piece.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: You do that, and you'll have to answer to the whole outpost. Best to let me speak.
#. EDID: [01021631]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000501"
msgid "Or I can just kill you and be done with it. How's that sound?"
msgstr "아니면 그냥 널 죽이고 끝내도 되지. 그건 어때?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_140_Caruso_Greet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Caruso
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMHalCaruso
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00D77DA6
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = What crimes have you committed, exactly?
#. DialogueAfter = Caruso: I trust you have a proposition, then.
#. EDID: [01021590]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000502"
msgid "All of that's to say, my crimes are many. I don't ask for absolution. Only time."
msgstr "그러니까, 내 죄는 많다는 말이야. 사죄를 구하는 게 아니야. 시간만 바랄 뿐이지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_140_Caruso_Greet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Caruso
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMHalCaruso
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00AA6A3D
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = What crimes have you committed, exactly?
#. EDID: [01021590]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000503"
msgid "And before that, I was one of the Promised. A servant of House Va'ruun."
msgstr "그리고 그 전에는 약속받은 자 중 하나였어. 바룬 가문의 하인이었지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_140_Caruso_Greet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Caruso
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMHalCaruso
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00ACC4A4
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = What crimes have you committed, exactly?
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: What crimes have you committed, exactly?
#. EDID: [01021590]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000504"
msgid "You may know about Shinar. But before that, I spent time with the Crimson Fleet."
msgstr "시날에 대해서는 알고 있을지도 모르지. 하지만 그 전에는 크림슨 함대와 함께했어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_140_Caruso_Greet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Caruso
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMHalCaruso
#. Face = Defiant
#. SoundFileID = 00EB2641
#. ScriptNotes = Defiant
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: I trust you have a proposition, then.
#. EDID: [010217FF]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000505"
msgid "For them, my absence will be an expensive purchase. And for their sake, I will not yield."
msgstr "그들에게 내 부재는 큰 대가가 될 거야. 그리고 그들을 위해서라도 난 물러서지 않겠다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_140_Caruso_Greet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Caruso
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMHalCaruso
#. Face = Stern
#. SoundFileID = 00801505
#. ScriptNotes = Stern
#. DialogueBefore = Caruso: No story. I am a killer, no doubt. But this isn't just about me.
#. EDID: [010217FF]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000506"
msgid "The others in this outpost, they depend on me."
msgstr "이 전초기지의 다른 사람들은 나에게 의지하고 있어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_100_Scene01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Sasha
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFSashaAtwell
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00177DA2
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral
#. DialogueBefore = Sasha: Hm, maybe you two oughta clear this up in person.
#. EDID: [0102157A]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000507"
msgid "Head on through. He should be in the back. You can't miss him."
msgstr "안으로 들어가십쇼. 할은 뒤쪽에 있을 겁니다. 못 알아볼 수가 없을 겁니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_140_Caruso_Greet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Caruso
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMHalCaruso
#. Face = Defiant
#. SoundFileID = 00B20CD2
#. ScriptNotes = Defiant
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: There's always a sob story with you criminals. I'm not buying it.
#. EDID: [010216EA]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000508"
msgid "If you seek my life, then you'll be disappointed. There is no life left to take."
msgstr "내 목숨을 노리는 거라면 실망할 거야. 가져갈 목숨은 남아 있지 않아."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_140_Caruso_Greet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Caruso
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMHalCaruso
#. Face = Angry
#. SoundFileID = 00F4994D
#. ScriptNotes = Angry
#. DialogueBefore = Caruso: Yes, I am the one who left Shinar to die. My crimes are many, and without redemption.
#. EDID: [010216EA]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000509"
msgid "But I don't fear death, hunter. My blood is rancid, my bones rotten. "
msgstr "하지만 난 죽음을 두려워하지 않는다, 사냥꾼. 내 피는 썩었고, 뼈도 썩었어. "

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_140_Caruso_Greet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Caruso
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMHalCaruso
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 003E33F5
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = That's fine. I never intended to kill you.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: That's fine. I never intended to kill you.
#. DialogueAfter = Caruso: My terms are as follows. In exchange for my submission, I would like you to help me resolve some pressing issues here.
#. EDID: [0102163F]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00050A"
msgid "That may be, but your coming means there will be others. So I wish to make a deal."
msgstr "그럴지도 모르지. 하지만 네가 왔다는 건 다른 이들도 올 거란 뜻이야. 그래서 거래를 하고 싶어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_140_Caruso_Greet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Caruso
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMHalCaruso
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00EC4559
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Or I can just kill you and be done with it. How's that sound?
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Or I can just kill you and be done with it. How's that sound?
#. DialogueAfter = Caruso: Go on then. Speak it.
#. EDID: [0102176C]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00050B"
msgid "You do that, and you'll have to answer to the whole outpost. Best to let me speak."
msgstr "그렇게 하면 전초기지 전체에 대답해야 할 거야. 내 말을 듣는 게 좋다."

