#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Maybe. But the truth is, I've been waiting for you.
#. EDID: [010217B3]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00050E"
msgid "I think you misunderstand my intentions."
msgstr "내 의도를 오해한 것 같군."

