#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: You may know about Shinar. But before that, I spent time with the Crimson Fleet.
#. EDID: [01021743]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00050F"
msgid "What crimes have you committed, exactly?"
msgstr "정확히 어떤 죄를 저질렀지?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_140_Caruso_Greet
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0077C067
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Caruso: You mentioned Shinar. I regret what happened there. &&& ... &&& Caruso: Up ahead is the Community Center. We should have privacy there. &&& Caruso: Now, let's get one thing straight. I'm not here to fight you, hunter. &&& Caruso: But before you take me in, I just want to say my piece.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: The truth is, I've been waiting for you.
#. EDID: [010217C2]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000510"
msgid "Go on then. Speak it."
msgstr "그럼 계속해. 말해 봐."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_120_Caruso_Greet
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00151607
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I was told you're the one who can help me with my extended warranty. &&& Caruso: I think you have the wrong man. I'm just a farmer.
#. DialogueAfter = companion: And surely you know what comes next.
#. EDID: [01021810]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000511"
msgid "You're a known criminal. I'm guessing there's probably a bounty on your head too."
msgstr "너는 알려진 범죄자야. 네 목에 현상금도 걸려 있을 것 같은데."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_110_Scene02
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Caspian
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMCaspianRoberson
#. Face = Puzzled
#. SoundFileID = 00C73E7F
#. ScriptNotes = Puzzled
#. DialogueBefore = Caspian: The next step is we blow up this machine and strip it for parts! &&& Caruso: Or you can check the pressure valve.
#. DialogueAfter = Caspian: I... I think you're right. I didn't install it properly. That explains why the pump's malfunctioning.
#. EDID: [0102168D]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000512"
msgid "*Sigh*, or I can check the freaking valve."
msgstr "*한숨* 아니면 내가 그 빌어먹을 밸브를 확인하든가."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_120_Caruso_Greet
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Caruso
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00FC83AF
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I was told you're the one who can help me with my extended warranty. &&& Caruso: I think you have the wrong man. I'm just a farmer.
#. DialogueAfter = Caruso: Wait. Not here. Not in front of the boy.
#. EDID: [0102158F]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000513"
msgid "From one criminal to another, I just wanted to say I'm a huge fan of your work."
msgstr "범죄자끼리 하는 말인데, 네 일의 엄청난 팬이라고 말하고 싶었어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_140_Caruso_Greet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Caruso
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMHalCaruso
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00649679
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = I think you misunderstand my intentions.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I think you misunderstand my intentions.
#. DialogueAfter = Caruso: Yes, I am the one who left Shinar to die. My crimes are many, and without redemption.
#. EDID: [0102156B]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000514"
msgid "Maybe. But the truth is, I've been waiting for you."
msgstr "어쩌면. 하지만 사실은, 난 널 기다리고 있었어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_100_Scene01
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00DFCCA2
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: [Lie] I'm here to survey this land. &&& Sasha: We don't get too many survey teams out here. You'll probably want to talk to Hal, he does most of the scouting for us.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: That sounds like Big Hal. He's big boned, and a big softy.
#. EDID: [010216E9]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000515"
msgid "[Bernhard's Description] I was told he was a big bear of a man. Soft spoken, but didn't mince words."
msgstr ""
"[버나드가 해준 설명을 말한다] 덩치가 곰만한 남자가 있다고 들었습니다만. 말투는 부드럽지만, 할 말은 돌려 말하지 않는다던데요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_120_Caruso_Greet
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Caruso
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 000D0F06
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I was told you're the one who can help me with my extended warranty. &&& Caruso: I think you have the wrong man. I'm just a farmer.
#. DialogueAfter = companion: And surely you know what comes next.
#. EDID: [010216D6]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000516"
msgid "I was at the Outpost you left. Saw the mass graves."
msgstr "네가 떠난 그 전초기지에 갔었어. 집단 무덤을 봤지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_120_Caruso_Greet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Caruso
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMHalCaruso
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00FEDBF0
#. DialogueBefore = Caruso: Wait. Not here. Not in front of the boy.
#. EDID: [010215E7]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000517"
msgid "Follow me."
msgstr "따라와."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_140_Caruso_Greet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Caruso
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMHalCaruso
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00DB8F52
#. DialogueBefore = Caruso: The truth is, I've been waiting for you.
#. DialogueAfter = Caruso: But I don't fear death, hunter. My blood is rancid, my bones rotten.
#. EDID: [010215C8]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000518"
msgid "Yes, I am the one who left Shinar to die. My crimes are many, and without redemption."
msgstr "그래, 시날을 죽게 내버려 둔 사람이 바로 나다. 내 죄는 많고, 구원받을 수 없어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_140_Caruso_Greet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Caruso
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMHalCaruso
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 003391D1
#. ScriptNotes = Serious
#. DialogueBefore = Caruso: Now, let's get one thing straight. I'm not here to fight you, hunter.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Go on then. Speak it.
#. EDID: [01021552]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000519"
msgid "But before you take me in, I just want to say my piece."
msgstr "하지만 날 데려가기 전에, 내 할 말만은 하고 싶어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_130_Scene03
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Caruso
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMHalCaruso
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00DE2048
#. DialogueAfter = Caruso: But I'd rather not have this conversation in front of the others. Not yet.
#. EDID: [0102160F]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00051A"
msgid "If you're here for a confession, I won't deny what I've done."
msgstr "자백을 들으러 온 거라면, 내가 한 일을 부정하지 않겠다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_130_Scene03
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Caruso
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMHalCaruso
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0007FA0D
#. DialogueAfter = Caruso: But I'd rather not have this conversation in front of the others. Not yet.
#. EDID: [0102160E]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00051B"
msgid "You mentioned Shinar. I regret what happened there."
msgstr "시날을 언급했지. 그곳에서 일어난 일을 후회하고 있어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_120_Caruso_Greet
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Caruso
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00F0F135
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I was told you're the one who can help me with my extended warranty. &&& Caruso: I think you have the wrong man. I'm just a farmer.
#. DialogueAfter = companion: And surely you know what comes next.
#. EDID: [0102170C]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00051C"
msgid "The people of Shinar Outpost would say otherwise."
msgstr "시날 전초기지 사람들은 다르게 말할 거야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_120_Caruso_Greet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Caruso
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMHalCaruso
#. Face = Suspicious
#. SoundFileID = 003520FA
#. ScriptNotes = Suspicious / to Player Default
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: I was told you're the one who can help me with my extended warranty.
#. EDID: [010216C6]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00051D"
msgid "Do I know you, friend?"
msgstr "내가 자네를 아는가, 친구?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_100_Scene01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Sasha
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFSashaAtwell
#. Face = Puzzled
#. SoundFileID = 002F7107
#. ScriptNotes = Puzzled / to Player Default
#. Prompt = He's someone new to the settlement. Came in the past few years.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: He's someone new to the settlement. Came in the past few years.
#. DialogueAfter = Sasha: But he's no criminal. Not unless you count the dad joke he made about the picture in jail.
#. EDID: [0102182B]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00051E"
msgid "Well, the only newcomer I know of would be Big Hal. Our soon to be mayor-elect."
msgstr "글쎄, 제가 알기론 새로 온 주민은 빅 할 뿐입니다. 곧 선출될 시장님 말이죠."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_110_Scene02
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Caruso
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMHalCaruso
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 009329F5
#. DialogueBefore = Caruso: Easy. If the filters are fine, then what's the next step? &&& Caspian: The next step is we blow up this machine and strip it for parts!
#. DialogueAfter = Caspian: *Sigh*, or I can check the freaking valve.
#. EDID: [01021793]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00051F"
msgid "Or you can check the pressure valve."
msgstr "아니면 압력 밸브를 확인해도 되고."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_110_Scene02
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Caruso
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMHalCaruso
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00F8482B
#. DialogueBefore = Caruso: Check the intake filters. &&& Caspian: *Grumble*, they look fine. Ugh, this thing is so stupid!
#. DialogueAfter = Caspian: The next step is we blow up this machine and strip it for parts!
#. EDID: [01021770]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000520"
msgid "Easy. If the filters are fine, then what's the next step?"
msgstr "좋아. 필터가 멀쩡하다면 다음 단계는 뭐지?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_110_Scene02
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Caspian
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMCaspianRoberson
#. Face = Angry
#. SoundFileID = 00D3485F
#. ScriptNotes = Angry
#. DialogueBefore = Caruso: Check the intake filters.
#. DialogueAfter = Caruso: Easy. If the filters are fine, then what's the next step?
#. EDID: [01021635]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000521"
msgid "*Grumble*, they look fine. Ugh, this thing is so stupid!"
msgstr "*투덜* 멀쩡해 보이잖아. 으, 이거 진짜 멍청한 기계야!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_110_Scene02
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Caruso
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMHalCaruso
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00238C7E
#. DialogueAfter = Caspian: *Grumble*, they look fine. Ugh, this thing is so stupid!
#. EDID: [01021599]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000522"
msgid "Check the intake filters."
msgstr "흡입 필터를 확인해."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c3000_Yeats_Greet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Yeats
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMYeats
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0022D025
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Why are you asking me?
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Why are you asking me?
#. DialogueAfter = Yeats: Yes, I think that's what you should do.
#. EDID: [01023CAE]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000523"
msgid "You were the one who freed me, and restored my faith. Who better?"
msgstr "나를 풀어 주고 내 믿음을 되찾아 준 사람이 너였어. 너보다 나은 사람이 누가 있겠어?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_110_Scene02
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Caruso
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMHalCaruso
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00E8338D
#. DialogueBefore = Caruso: Or you can check the pressure valve. &&& Caspian: *Sigh*, or I can check the freaking valve. &&& Caspian: I... I think you're right. I didn't install it properly. That explains why the pump's malfunctioning.
#. EDID: [01021624]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000524"
msgid "Good. Take a break to cool off, and then get your tools."
msgstr "좋아. 잠깐 쉬면서 진정하고, 그다음 도구를 챙겨."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_110_Scene02
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Caspian
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMCaspianRoberson
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00F42EF7
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral
#. DialogueBefore = Caspian: *Sigh*, or I can check the freaking valve.
#. DialogueAfter = Caruso: Good. Take a break to cool off, and then get your tools.
#. EDID: [010216CD]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000525"
msgid "I... I think you're right. I didn't install it properly. That explains why the pump's malfunctioning."
msgstr "나... 네 말이 맞는 것 같아. 제대로 설치하지 않았어. 그래서 펌프가 오작동하는 거였구나."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_100_Scene01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Sasha
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFSashaAtwell
#. Face = Suspicious
#. SoundFileID = 00E03C32
#. ScriptNotes = Suspicious / to Player Default
#. Prompt = I'm sorry, I don't.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I'm sorry, I don't.
#. DialogueAfter = Sasha: [Bernhard's Description] I was told he was a big bear of a man. Soft spoken, but didn't mince words.
#. EDID: [010217A1]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000526"
msgid "Then maybe think a little harder, or turn around."
msgstr "그러면 조금 더 열심히 기억을 떠올려 보시거나, 돌아가십쇼."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_110_Scene02
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Caspian
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMCaspianRoberson
#. Face = Disgust
#. SoundFileID = 001A90C7
#. ScriptNotes = Disgust
#. DialogueBefore = Caspian: *Grumble*, they look fine. Ugh, this thing is so stupid! &&& Caruso: Easy. If the filters are fine, then what's the next step?
#. DialogueAfter = Caruso: Or you can check the pressure valve.
#. EDID: [01021571]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000527"
msgid "The next step is we blow up this machine and strip it for parts!"
msgstr "다음 단계는 이 기계를 폭파하고 부품을 뜯어내는 거야!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_100_Scene01
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Sasha
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00AA6EAA
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I'm looking for a dangerous criminal. &&& Sasha: Yeah? Got a description of the perp?
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Then maybe think a little harder, or turn around.
#. EDID: [0102166E]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000528"
msgid "I'm sorry, I don't."
msgstr "미안하지만, 기억이 안납니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2300_YeatsTL03_Enlightened
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Yeats
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00553A58
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: You're right. You should choose something else. &&& Yeats: And what would you recommend?
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: As someone who preached for the Sanctum, believe me, I know my hypocrisy is blatant. Perhaps I need to reconsider.
#. EDID: [01023C7C]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000529"
msgid "People believe in crazier things."
msgstr "사람들은 더 이상한 것도 믿어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_100_Scene01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCFSashaAtwell
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFSashaAtwell
#. Face = Smirk
#. SoundFileID = 00A1B799
#. ScriptNotes = Smirk / to Player Default
#. Prompt = [Bernhard's Description] I was told he was a big bear of a man. Soft spoken, but didn't mince words.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: [Bernhard's Description] I was told he was a big bear of a man. Soft spoken, but didn't mince words.
#. DialogueAfter = Sasha: But he's no criminal. Not unless you count the dad joke he made about the picture in jail.
#. EDID: [0102178D]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00052A"
msgid "That sounds like Big Hal. He's big boned, and a big softy."
msgstr "그거 빅 할 얘기 같습니다만. 덩치는 크지만, 마음은 부드러운 남자죠."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_100_Scene01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Sasha
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFSashaAtwell
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00ECCF90
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral
#. DialogueAfter = Sasha: Hm, maybe you two oughta clear this up in person.
#. EDID: [010215EB]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00052B"
msgid "Now that was a crime. \"It was framed.\" Ugh."
msgstr "그 개그야말로 범죄행위죠. \"프레임의 희생양이네.\" 막 이러고. 으."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_100_Scene01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Sasha
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFSashaAtwell
#. Face = Confused
#. SoundFileID = 00CB2ECC
#. ScriptNotes = Confused
#. DialogueBefore = Sasha: That sounds like Big Hal. He's big boned, and a big softy.
#. EDID: [010215EB]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00052C"
msgid "But he's no criminal. Not unless you count the dad joke he made about the picture in jail."
msgstr "근데 할은 범죄자가 아닙니다. 감옥에 있는 사진을 보고 아재 개그를 친 걸 죄라고 치지 않는 이상은 말입니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_100_Scene01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Sasha
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFSashaAtwell
#. Face = Surprised
#. SoundFileID = 00D704D0
#. ScriptNotes = Surprised / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Sorry, his name's Caruso.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Sorry, his name's Caruso.
#. DialogueAfter = Sasha: But he's no criminal. Not unless you count the dad joke he made about the picture in jail.
#. EDID: [0102167F]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00052D"
msgid "You mean Big Hal? "
msgstr "빅 할 말입니까? "

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_100_Scene01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Sasha
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFSashaAtwell
#. Face = Stern
#. SoundFileID = 0011AF90
#. ScriptNotes = Stern
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: [Lie] I'm here to survey this land.
#. EDID: [01021532]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00052E"
msgid "Hold up stranger. This outpost belongs to the citizens of New Babylon. State your business, or kindly leave."
msgstr "멈추시죠. 외지인 분. 이 전초기지는 뉴바빌론 주민들의 것입니다. 용건을 밝히거나, 정중히 떠나주십쇼."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_100_Scene01
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Sasha
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 009CE8B7
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: My business is none of yours, okay? &&& Sasha: That's all fine and dandy if you're a local. But anyone outside of this hundred meter zip code is trespassing.|Doubly so if I don't know your face.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: You mean Big Hal?
#. EDID: [010216BA]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00052F"
msgid "Sorry, his name's Caruso."
msgstr "미안합니다. 카루소란 사람을 찾고 있습니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_100_Scene01
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Sasha
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0071D0D5
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I'm looking for a man named Caruso. &&& Sasha: You mean Big Hal? Well, any friend of his is a friend of ours.|Head on through. You'll find him in the back, helping out with the water pump. Can't miss him. He's the one with the grimace.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Well, the only newcomer I know of would be Big Hal. Our soon to be mayor-elect.
#. EDID: [0102174A]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000530"
msgid "He's someone new to the settlement. Came in the past few years."
msgstr "정착지에 새로 온 사람입니다. 몇 년 전에 왔을 겁니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_100_Scene01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Sasha
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFSashaAtwell
#. Face = Thinking
#. SoundFileID = 000538A0
#. ScriptNotes = Thinking
#. DialogueBefore = Sasha: But he's no criminal. Not unless you count the dad joke he made about the picture in jail.|Now that was a crime. "It was framed." Ugh.
#. DialogueAfter = Sasha: Head on through. He should be in the back. You can't miss him.
#. EDID: [01021687]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000531"
msgid "Hm, maybe you two oughta clear this up in person."
msgstr "흠, 둘이 직접 만나서 문제를 정리하는 게 좋을 거 같습니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_100_Scene01
