#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Sasha: Hold up stranger. This outpost belongs to the citizens of New Babylon. State your business, or kindly leave.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: That's all fine and dandy if you're a local. But anyone outside of this hundred meter zip code is trespassing.
#. EDID: [01021575]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000532"
msgid "My business is none of yours, okay?"
msgstr "내가 뭘 하든 네가 뭔 상관이야? 신경 꺼, 알겠어?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_100_Scene01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
