#. Prompt = I'm looking for a dangerous criminal.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I'm looking for a dangerous criminal.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: I'm sorry, I don't.
#. EDID: [010216F5]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000533"
msgid "Yeah? Got a description of the perp?"
msgstr "예? 그 범인이 어떻게 생겼는지 말해주시겠습니까?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2300_YeatsTL03_Enlightened
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Yeats
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMYeats
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00483054
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = All things are possible with faith.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: All things are possible with faith.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Let's talk about your faith.
#. EDID: [01023C95]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000534"
msgid "A tenet I once preached, dutifully. But my time here has eroded my faith."
msgstr "한때 충실히 설교했던 교리야. 하지만 이곳에서 보낸 시간이 내 믿음을 갉아먹었어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c3000_Yeats_Greet
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 009986DD
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Grace was after a blood sample from Caspian. &&& ... &&& Yeats: It seems thy Act of God has been performed. I thank you, for having faith where I had none. &&& Yeats: In our past conversation, you recommended I look beyond religion and doctrine. I wonder if you still feel that way. &&& Yeats: Would you support preaching their scripture here?
#. DialogueAfter = Yeats: Very well. We will preach the scripture of the Great Serpent.
#. EDID: [01023C86]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000535"
msgid "Yes, I think that's what you should do."
msgstr "네, 그렇게 하시는 게 맞다고 봅니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_100_Scene01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Sasha
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFSashaAtwell
#. Face = Suspicious
#. SoundFileID = 007797FC
#. ScriptNotes = Suspicious / to Player Default
#. Prompt = My business is none of yours, okay?
#. DialogueAfter = Sasha: [Lie] I'm here to survey this land.
#. EDID: [0102161A]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000536"
msgid "Doubly so if I don't know your face."
msgstr "일면식도 없는 사람이라면 두말할 것도 없고 말입니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_100_Scene01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Sasha
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFSashaAtwell
#. Face = Neutral
