#. ScriptNotes = Neutral / to Player Default
#. Prompt = My business is none of yours, okay?
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: My business is none of yours, okay?
#. EDID: [0102161A]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000537"
msgid "That's all fine and dandy if you're a local. But anyone outside of this hundred meter zip code is trespassing."
msgstr "여기 주민이시라면 아무 문제 없겠죠. 하지만 이곳에서 반경 100미터 구역 외부에서 온 사람은 누구든 무단 침입자로 간주됩니다."

#. List: 2
