#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Yeah? Got a description of the perp?
#. EDID: [0102169C]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000538"
msgid "I'm looking for a dangerous criminal."
msgstr "위험한 범죄자를 찾고 있습니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2300_YeatsTL03_Enlightened
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Yeats
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMYeats
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00F41685
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = People believe in crazier things.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: People believe in crazier things.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Let's talk about your faith.
#. EDID: [01023C7D]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000539"
msgid "As someone who preached for the Sanctum, believe me, I know my hypocrisy is blatant. Perhaps I need to reconsider."
msgstr "우주의 성소에서 설교했던 사람으로서 말하는데, 내 위선이 노골적이라는 건 나도 알아. 다시 생각해 봐야 할지도 모르겠군."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_100_Scene01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Sasha
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFSashaAtwell
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 003C45B3
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral / to Player Default
#. Prompt = I'm looking for a man named Caruso.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: He's someone new to the settlement. Came in the past few years.
#. EDID: [01021776]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00053A"
msgid "Head on through. You'll find him in the back, helping out with the water pump. Can't miss him. He's the one with the grimace."
msgstr "안으로 들어가십쇼. 뒤쪽에서 물 펌프 일을 돕고 있을 겁니다. 못 알아볼 수가 없을 겁니다. 잔뜩 찡그리고 있을 테니 말입니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_100_Scene01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Sasha
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFSashaAtwell
#. Face = Confused
#. SoundFileID = 00B0D998
#. ScriptNotes = Confused / to Player Default
#. Prompt = I'm looking for a man named Caruso.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I'm looking for a man named Caruso.
#. EDID: [01021776]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00053B"
msgid "You mean Big Hal? Well, any friend of his is a friend of ours."
msgstr "빅 할 말입니까? 뭐, 할의 친구분이라면 우리 친구나 마찬가지죠."

