#. EDID: [0102179D]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00053C"
msgid "I'm looking for a man named Caruso."
msgstr "카루소라는 남자를 찾고 있습니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c3000_Yeats_Greet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Yeats
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMYeats
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00A5712A
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueAfter = Yeats: Would you support preaching their scripture here?
#. EDID: [01023C9F]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00053D"
msgid "And I'm leaning toward making this place a community center only, free from theocracy or doctrine."
msgstr "그리고 이곳을 신정이나 교리에서 벗어난 주민 센터로만 만드는 쪽으로 기울고 있어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c3000_Yeats_Greet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Yeats
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMYeats
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00D7DF1E
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Yeats: It seems thy Act of God has been performed. I thank you, for having faith where I had none.
#. EDID: [01023C9F]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00053E"
msgid "During my time here, I've thought a lot about what I want to preach. "
msgstr "여기 있는 동안 내가 무엇을 설교하고 싶은지 많이 생각해 봤어. "

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c3000_Yeats_Greet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Yeats
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMYeats
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00F6FD0A
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Yeats: It seems thy Act of God has been performed. I thank you, for having faith where I had none.
#. DialogueAfter = Yeats: Would you support preaching their scripture here?
#. EDID: [01023C9E]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00053F"
msgid "In our past conversation, you mentioned the House of Enlightened."
msgstr "지난 대화에서, 너는 계몽회의 집을 언급했지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c3000_Yeats_Greet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Yeats
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMYeats
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 006F24DC
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Yeats: It seems thy Act of God has been performed. I thank you, for having faith where I had none.
#. DialogueAfter = Yeats: Would you support preaching their scripture here?
#. EDID: [01023C9D]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000540"
msgid "In our past conversation, you recommended I revisit my faith in the Sanctum Universum."
msgstr "지난 대화에서, 너는 내가 우주의 성소 신앙을 다시 돌아보라고 권했지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c3000_Yeats_Greet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Yeats
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMYeats
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0036C3FE
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Yeats: It seems thy Act of God has been performed. I thank you, for having faith where I had none.
#. DialogueAfter = Yeats: Would you support preaching their scripture here?
#. EDID: [01023C9C]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000541"
msgid "In our past conversation, you spoke of the scripture of the Great Serpent."
msgstr "지난 대화에서, 너는 위대한 뱀의 경전을 이야기했지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c3000_Yeats_Greet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Yeats
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMYeats
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00849105
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Yeats: It seems thy Act of God has been performed. I thank you, for having faith where I had none.
#. DialogueAfter = Yeats: Would you support preaching their scripture here?
#. EDID: [01023C9B]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000542"
msgid "In our past conversation, you recommended I look beyond religion and doctrine. I wonder if you still feel that way."
msgstr "지난 대화에서 당신은 저에게 종교와 교리 그 너머를 보라고 권하셨지요. 지금도 여전히 그렇게 생각하시는지 궁금합니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c3000_Yeats_Greet
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Yeats
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00D32182
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Grace was after a blood sample from Caspian. &&& ... &&& Yeats: It seems thy Act of God has been performed. I thank you, for having faith where I had none. &&& Yeats: In our past conversation, you recommended I look beyond religion and doctrine. I wonder if you still feel that way. &&& Yeats: Would you support preaching their scripture here?
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: You were the one who freed me, and restored my faith. Who better?
#. EDID: [01023CA6]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000543"
msgid "Why are you asking me?"
msgstr "왜 나한테 묻는 거야?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2300_YeatsTL03_Enlightened
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Yeats
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMYeats
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0015D09D
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = He has been there the whole time, guiding me to you.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: He has been there the whole time, guiding me to you.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Let's talk about your faith.
#. EDID: [01023C8B]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000544"
msgid "Ah yes, you are the miracle worker, after all."
msgstr "아, 맞아. 너는 기적을 일으킨 사람이니까."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c3000_Yeats_Greet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Yeats
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMYeats
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 005DBB4C
#. DialogueBefore = Yeats: In our past conversation, you recommended I look beyond religion and doctrine. I wonder if you still feel that way.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Yes, I think that's what you should do.
#. EDID: [01023CAD]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000545"
msgid "What do you think? Shall we change the House of Worship to a Community Center?"
msgstr "어떻게 생각해? 예배당을 주민 센터로 바꿀까?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c3000_Yeats_Greet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Yeats
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMYeats
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00C16658
#. DialogueBefore = Yeats: In our past conversation, you recommended I look beyond religion and doctrine. I wonder if you still feel that way.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Yes, I think that's what you should do.
#. EDID: [01023CAC]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000546"
msgid "Would you support preaching their scripture here?"
msgstr "이곳에서 그 말씀을 전하는 것이 맞을까요?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2300_YeatsTL03_Enlightened
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Yeats
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 005303A3
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I would never joke about such things. &&& Yeats: Well, its worshipers certainly convey a seriousness, even if the premise is laughable. |Still, I shouldn't be quick to mock something the way others have mocked me.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Ah yes, you are the miracle worker, after all.
#. EDID: [01023C7B]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000547"
msgid "He has been there the whole time, guiding me to you."
msgstr "그분은 내내 거기에 계시며, 나를 너에게로 인도하셨어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c3000_Yeats_Greet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Yeats
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMYeats
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0094AB01
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Yeats: Sometimes miracles are just people doing their jobs. &&& Sasha: Yeah, yeah, yeah. Don't stomp the ice, Yeats. It's REAL thin.
#. DialogueAfter = Yeats: In our past conversation, you recommended I look beyond religion and doctrine. I wonder if you still feel that way.
#. EDID: [01023C74]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000548"
msgid "It seems thy Act of God has been performed. I thank you, for having faith where I had none."
msgstr "아무래도 그대가 말한 신의 섭리가 이루어진 듯하군요. 저조차 믿지 못했던 믿음을 가져주어 고맙습니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_200_CarusoTL10
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Caruso
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMHalCaruso
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00DA9B3D
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Can we talk about what happened to Shinar?
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Seems like you're avoiding the topic.
#. EDID: [01023CBC]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000549"
msgid "Not right now. Let's finish the work first."
msgstr "지금은 아니야. 먼저 일을 끝내자."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2300_YeatsTL03_Enlightened
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Yeats
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00970A07
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: People believe in crazier things. &&& Yeats: As someone who preached for the Sanctum, believe me, I know my hypocrisy is blatant. Perhaps I need to reconsider.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: A tenet I once preached, dutifully. But my time here has eroded my faith.
#. EDID: [01023C8A]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00054A"
msgid "All things are possible with faith."
msgstr "믿음이 있으면 모든 것이 가능하지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2300_YeatsTL03_Enlightened
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Yeats
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMYeats
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00327D26
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Put your trust in a divine creator and you will never be lost. Know that it is all part of his plan.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Put your trust in a divine creator and you will never be lost. Know that it is all part of his plan.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Let's talk about your faith.
#. EDID: [01023C7A]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00054B"
msgid "I once believed in the plan. I'm not sure I do anymore."
msgstr "한때는 그 계획을 믿었어. 지금도 그런지는 모르겠군."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2300_YeatsTL03_Enlightened
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Yeats
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0005F052
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Mark my words, you will not mock the Great Serpent when the Shrouding comes. &&& Yeats: So it's a "fire and brimstone" type god. Perhaps that's what I need to get my passion back for the craft.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: I once believed in the plan. I'm not sure I do anymore.
#. EDID: [01023C73]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00054C"
msgid "Put your trust in a divine creator and you will never be lost. Know that it is all part of his plan."
msgstr "신성한 창조주를 믿으면 결코 길을 잃지 않을 거야. 모든 것이 그분의 계획 일부임을 알아 둬."

