#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Caspian is clumsy. For all we know he fell and hit his head.
#. EDID: [01023CA9]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00056C"
msgid "You expect me to believe that, after what happened to Caspian? The man was drugged."
msgstr "저보고 그 말을 믿으란 겁니까? 캐스피언 꼴을 보고도 말이 된다고 생각하십니까? 몸에서 약물 성분이 나왔단 말입니다."

