#. Prompt = Just tell me where to start.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Just tell me where to start.
#. DialogueAfter = Caruso: For one, I'd like to automate some of the work here. To do that, we need to fix the Model A unit by the junkyard.
#. EDID: [0102164A]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0005A9"
msgid "Of course. I have a list."
msgstr "물론. 목록이 있어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c3000_Yeats_Greet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Yeats
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMYeats
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 005C6674
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = No, I think you should preach something else.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: No, I think you should preach something else.
#. DialogueAfter = Yeats: You could preach for the House of the Enlightened.
#. EDID: [01023C96]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0005AA"
msgid "And what would you recommend? I owe you my life, and my faith, so it's only right that you choose."
msgstr "그럼 너는 뭘 추천하겠어? 내 목숨과 믿음을 네게 빚졌으니, 네가 선택하는 게 맞겠지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c3000_Yeats_Greet
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Yeats
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 009C4941
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Grace was after a blood sample from Caspian. &&& ... &&& Yeats: It seems thy Act of God has been performed. I thank you, for having faith where I had none. &&& Yeats: In our past conversation, you recommended I look beyond religion and doctrine. I wonder if you still feel that way. &&& Yeats: Would you support preaching their scripture here?
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: And what would you recommend? I owe you my life, and my faith, so it's only right that you choose.
#. EDID: [01023CAA]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0005AB"
msgid "No, I think you should preach something else."
msgstr "아니, 다른 걸 설교해야 한다고 생각해."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2300_YeatsTL03_Enlightened
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Yeats
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMYeats
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0024F70A
#. DialogueBefore = Yeats: I see. Life without death will only increase the time we waste.
#. DialogueAfter = Yeats: It seems thy Act of God has been performed. I thank you, for having faith where I had none.
#. EDID: [01023CBA]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0005AC"
msgid "Hm. I will ruminate on this discussion. You have given me much to ponder."
msgstr "흠. 이 대화를 곱씹어 보겠어. 생각할 거리를 많이 주었군."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2410_Sasha_Greet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Sasha
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFSashaAtwell
#. Face = Disgust
#. SoundFileID = 00A12283
