#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Give me a second. I'll let you know when I'm done.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Caspian's testimony is unreliable. I questioned him and he didn't know up from down.
#. EDID: [01023C63]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0005AD"
msgid "I'm on the edge of my seat."
msgstr "결과가 어떨지 초조해서 못 참겠습니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2410_Sasha_Greet
