#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: I'm on the edge of my seat.
#. EDID: [01023CBD]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0005AE"
msgid "Give me a second. I'll let you know when I'm done."
msgstr "잠시 기다려 주시죠. 정리해서 알려드리겠습니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c3000_Yeats_Greet
