#. DialogueBefore = Yeats: Very well. We will preach the scripture of the Great Serpent.
#. EDID: [010258DF]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0005AF"
msgid "I suppose I should also thank Hal for his part in this. Not sure where he went off to though."
msgstr "할도 이번 일에 한몫을 해줬으니 고마워해야겠군요. 어디로 가버렸는지는 모르겠지만요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_130_Scene03
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Caruso
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMHalCaruso
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 000A537F
#. ScriptNotes = Serious
#. DialogueBefore = Caruso: Up ahead is the Community Center. We should have privacy there.
#. DialogueAfter = Caruso: But before you take me in, I just want to say my piece.
#. EDID: [010258E5]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0005B0"
msgid "Now, let's get one thing straight. I'm not here to fight you, hunter."
msgstr "자, 한 가지는 확실히 하자. 난 너와 싸우러 온 게 아니야, 사냥꾼."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_d3100_CarusoZena
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Zena
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFZenaHield
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0042C607
#. DialogueBefore = Zena: And what about the people here? Do we not get a say? &&& Caruso: That's why I suggested a vote.
#. EDID: [010258DA]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0005B1"
msgid "What you're asking for is a trial. But fine, if you want a damn jury, let it be us."
msgstr "네가 요구하는 건 재판이야. 하지만 좋아, 망할 배심원이 필요하다면 우리가 맡지."

