#. DialogueBefore = Zena: Then it's settled. We're putting it to a vote. &&& Caruso: As long as I am given the opportunity to confess. &&& Caruso: But in the interest of fairness, I don't know for certain what happened to Shinar after I left. |Perhaps the visitor would be better served to speak to that.
#. DialogueAfter = Zena: If you'd be willing to represent the people of Shinar, the trial will be fairer.
#. EDID: [010258CE]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0005B3"
msgid "I visited Shinar and witnessed the aftermath. I can speak to that."
msgstr "나는 시날을 방문했고 그 여파를 목격했어. 그에 대해 증언할 수 있어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
