#. EDID: [010258D0]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0005C6"
msgid "If such a person exists, then their testimony would be more than welcome."
msgstr "그런 사람이 있다면, 그 증언은 언제든 환영이야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_MiscDialogue
