msgid "All because we gave him shelter. Because we did the right thing."
msgstr "전부 녀석에게 피신처를 마련해 준 탓이야. 옳은 일을 한 탓이야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_MiscDialogue
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_HelpWanted_030_TopLevel02
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Bernhard
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMBernhardKleiber
#. Face = VeryAngry
#. SoundFileID = 00E4EC3D
#. ScriptNotes = VeryAngry / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Bernhard: There was a shipwreck with a lone survivor. We rescued him, brought him back, and treated his wounds.
#. EDID: [01026C0D]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000601"
msgid "He repaid us by stealing our ship, wrecking our comms, and leaving us there to die."
msgstr "그 대가로 녀석은 우리 우주선을 훔쳤고, 통신 장비를 부쉈고, 우리가 죽도록 내버려뒀어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
