#. Speaker = Zena
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFZenaHield
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00374B7E
#. Prompt = Permanent exile is my recommendation.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Permanent exile is my recommendation.
#. DialogueAfter = Zena: On that note, I'll ask one more time. Would anyone else like to speak?
#. EDID: SFBGS00D_MS_HW_QuestSharedInfo13
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000605"
msgid "Thank you for speaking. You haven't been here long, but I'm sure everyone here acknowledges the weight of your words."
msgstr "말해 줘서 고마워. 여기 온 지 오래되진 않았지만, 모두가 네 말의 무게를 인정할 거라고 확신해."

