#. ScriptNotes = In response to Alphonse saying Caruso should go free
#. Prompt = Caruso has atoned for his sins. He is contrite. I vote for leniency here.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Caruso has atoned for his sins. He is contrite. I vote for leniency here. &&& Caspian: Damn straight. Hal is one of us, and I say he's a free man. Any other vote is a betrayal.
#. DialogueAfter = Zena: Thank you both. I think we can all attest to Hal's contributions here. But that is not why we are having this vote.
#. EDID: SFBGS00D_MS_HW_QuestSharedInfo15
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000607"
msgid "*Scoffs*"
msgstr "*코웃음*"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2535_TalkToResidents_TL_Caspian
