msgid "No way."
msgstr "말도 안 돼."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_200_CarusoTL10
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Caruso
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMHalCaruso
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 007FCDCE
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Fair enough. But we have a deal.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Fair enough. But we have a deal.
#. DialogueAfter = Caruso: I don't blame you if you have doubts.
#. EDID: SFBGS00D_MS_HW_QuestSharedInfo17
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000609"
msgid "Understood."
msgstr "알겠어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c3100_Bernhard_Greet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMBernhardKleiber
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMBernhardKleiber
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 003E88B5
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = He's going to confess to his crimes. The people of New Babylon will decide his fate.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: He's going to confess to his crimes. The people of New Babylon will decide his fate.
#. DialogueAfter = Bernhard: But I suppose that is why you are here. You want me to bear witness.
#. EDID: SFBGS00D_MS_HW_QuestSharedInfo18
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00060A"
msgid "*Scoffs* Outsiders will not know the pain that man has caused. "
msgstr "*코웃음* 외지인들은 그 남자가 일으킨 고통을 모를 거야. "

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_d3500_OpeningStatement
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Zena
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFZenaHield
#. Face = Stern
#. SoundFileID = 00378C7D
#. ScriptNotes = Stern but keeping anger in check / Stern
#. Prompt = We should vote for Hal Caruso's execution.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: We should vote for Hal Caruso's execution. &&& Caspian: Oh come on, are we really going to let this outsider tell us how to vote?
#. DialogueAfter = Zena: On that note, I'll ask one more time. Would anyone else like to speak?
#. EDID: SFBGS00D_MS_HW_QuestSharedInfo19
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00060B"
msgid "Everyone, please calm down. You can speak your mind without trying to force people to vote your way. "
msgstr "여러분, 진정해 주세요. 사람들에게 특정 방향으로 투표하라고 강요하지 않고도 자기 생각을 말할 수 있습니다. "

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_d3500_OpeningStatement
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Zena
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFZenaHield
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 008C3CEF
#. Prompt = Caruso has atoned for his sins. He is contrite. I vote for leniency here.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Caruso has atoned for his sins. He is contrite. I vote for leniency here. &&& Caspian: Damn straight. Hal is one of us, and I say he's a free man. Any other vote is a betrayal. &&& Bernhard: *Scoffs*
#. DialogueAfter = Zena: On that note, I'll ask one more time. Would anyone else like to speak?
#. EDID: SFBGS00D_MS_HW_QuestSharedInfo20
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00060C"
msgid "Thank you both. I think we can all attest to Hal's contributions here. But that is not why we are having this vote."
msgstr "두 분 모두 고맙습니다. 할이 이곳에 기여한 바는 우리 모두 증언할 수 있다고 생각합니다. 하지만 그 때문에 이 투표를 하는 건 아닙니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMCaspianRoberson
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMCaspianRoberson
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0021D9FC
#. EDID: [01026C0C]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00060D"
msgid "There's no way I'm letting Hal go down for this."
msgstr "할이 이 일로 무너지게 놔둘 순 없어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMHalCaruso
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMHalCaruso
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00B10339
#. EDID: [01026C0B]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00060E"
msgid "I will turn myself into the guard, and await the outcome of the vote."
msgstr "나는 경비대에 자수하고 투표 결과를 기다리겠다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCFZenaHield
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFZenaHield
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00A973BD
#. EDID: [01026C0A]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00060F"
msgid "Here I thought I'd just ease into retirement..."
msgstr "난 그냥 은퇴 생활에 천천히 적응하면 될 줄 알았는데..."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCFZenaHield
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFZenaHield
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 008E0AD9
#. EDID: [01026C09]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000610"
msgid "It's always something."
msgstr "늘 뭔가가 생기는군."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMHalCaruso
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMHalCaruso
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 003D6CF4
#. EDID: [01026C27]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000611"
msgid "If the end is to come, let it come swiftly."
msgstr "끝이 온다면, 신속히 오게 하라."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMHalCaruso
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMHalCaruso
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00F92C11
#. EDID: [01026C26]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000612"
msgid "I've spent my time here making peace with the Great Serpent."
msgstr "나는 이곳에서 위대한 뱀과 화해하며 시간을 보냈어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMHalCaruso
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMHalCaruso
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 002EB7B2
#. EDID: [01026C25]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000613"
msgid "I will abide by whatever the people decide."
msgstr "사람들이 어떤 결정을 내리든 따르겠다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMCaspianRoberson
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMCaspianRoberson
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00B61FA0
#. EDID: [01026C23]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000614"
msgid "Yo, I heard Yeats was freed! Nice work!"
msgstr "요, 예이츠가 풀려났다고 들었어! 잘했어!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCFGraceKim
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFGraceKim
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0041FB7D
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral
#. EDID: SFFL_MS01_QuestSharedInfo07
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000615"
msgid "If you need patching up, I can help you."
msgstr "어디 다친 데 있으시면, 제가 치료해 드릴게요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCFGraceKim
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFGraceKim
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00A834A3
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral
#. EDID: [01026C20]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000616"
msgid "Always nice to get new visitors here."
msgstr "여기에 새 방문자가 오는 건 언제나 반갑지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCFGraceKim
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFGraceKim
#. Face = Nervous
#. SoundFileID = 00E0FD91
#. ScriptNotes = Nervous
#. EDID: SFFL_MS01_QuestSharedInfo08
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000617"
msgid "These late nights are doing me in."
msgstr "이놈의 야근 때문에 아주 죽을 맛이네요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCFGraceKim
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFGraceKim
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 008554E2
#. EDID: [01026C1E]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000618"
msgid "I'm trying to get blood samples from everyone in the settlement, but Ivica is being stubborn about it."
msgstr "정착지의 모두에게서 혈액 샘플을 받으려 하는데, 이비차가 고집을 부리고 있어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMCaspianRoberson
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMCaspianRoberson
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00FBD556
#. EDID: [01026C1C]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000619"
msgid "Ivica's good with a wrench, but boy does he like to complain."
msgstr "이비차는 렌치를 잘 다루지만, 정말 불평이 많아."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCFZenaHield
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFZenaHield
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00DB086C
#. EDID: [01026C1B]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00061A"
msgid "Sunni's quick as a wink. I just need to find the right place for her."
msgstr "써니는 눈 깜짝할 사이처럼 빨라. 그 아이에게 맞는 자리를 찾기만 하면 돼."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2600_GraceKim_TL10_Confront
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = GraceKim
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFGraceKim
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00B29ECE
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Typical of a cop to mess up a standard house call and assault.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Typical of a cop to mess up a standard house call and assault.
#. DialogueAfter = GraceKim: Anyway, there, you have the truth.
#. EDID: [01021556]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00061B"
msgid "Very funny. But Sasha is pretty predictable, I won't lie."
msgstr "재밌네. 하지만 사샤가 꽤 예측 가능하다는 건 인정할게."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2600_GraceKim_TL10_Confront
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = GraceKim
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFGraceKim
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00C5D740
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = She just went where the evidence took her.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: She just went where the evidence took her.
#. DialogueAfter = GraceKim: Anyway, there, you have the truth.
#. EDID: [010215EF]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00061C"
msgid "A bloodhound is going to want meat. I just gave it to her."
msgstr "블러드하운드는 고기를 원하겠지. 방금 그걸 줬어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_d3200_CarusoTL01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Caruso
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMHalCaruso
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 007CA325
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Do you have any regrets for what you did?
#. DialogueAfter = Caruso: You did what you had to.
#. EDID: [010216FB]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00061D"
msgid "I do not feel guilt for the dead. But I feel fear when I imagine the same fate happening here."
msgstr "죽은 이들에게 죄책감을 느끼지는 않아. 하지만 같은 운명이 이곳에 닥치는 걸 상상하면 두려워."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_d3200_CarusoTL01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Caruso
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMHalCaruso
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00E5E66C
#. EDID: [01021773]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00061E"
msgid "That, I leave for the people to judge."
msgstr "그건 사람들이 판단하게 두겠어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_200_CarusoTL03
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Caruso
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMHalCaruso
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 003DA4F8
#. EDID: [010216F0]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00061F"
msgid "The outpost has voted me as her successor. That will have to change."
msgstr "전초기지가 나를 그녀의 후임으로 뽑았어. 그건 바뀌어야 해."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2300_YeatsTL03_Enlightened
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Yeats
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMYeats
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00DB156A
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = You could preach for the Sanctum Universum.
#. DialogueAfter = Yeats: God reveals himself to those who seek Him. If you keep the faith, you have nothing to fear.
#. EDID: [01023CB7]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000620"
msgid "But where was \"He\" when I was made to suffer for a crime I didn't commit?"
msgstr "하지만 내가 저지르지도 않은 죄로 고통받아야 했을 때 \"그분\"은 어디 계셨지?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_d3100_CarusoZenaGreet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Zena
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFZenaHield
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 005B06D0
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Zena: If such a person exists, then their testimony would be more than welcome.
#. DialogueAfter = Zena: Oh, and one other thing. If the vote ends up a tie, I'd like you to break it.
#. EDID: [010258DD]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000621"
msgid "For my part, I'll try to get the word out about the trial and what it means for this Outpost, especially given recent events."
msgstr "내 쪽에서는 재판과 그 의미, 특히 최근 사건을 생각해 이 전초기지에 어떤 의미가 있는지 알리도록 해 볼게."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2535_TalkToResidents_TL_Ivica
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Ivica
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMIvicaVukovic
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0087FE1A
#. DialogueBefore = Ivica: So you think we should exonerate him? Well, you do have a point. No need to punish the folks here.
#. EDID: [01026C10]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000622"
msgid "I'll talk to the others and find out more. But I'm leaning toward following your lead."
msgstr "다른 사람들과 이야기해서 더 알아볼게. 하지만 네 의견을 따르는 쪽으로 마음이 기울고 있어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2535_TalkToResidents_TL_Ivica
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Ivica
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMIvicaVukovic
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00FD0C6B
#. DialogueBefore = Ivica: Oh? Doesn't surprise me.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Hal confessed to murder. There's going to be a vote on what to do with him.
#. EDID: [01026BBA]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000623"
msgid "What does that have to do with me?"
msgstr "그게 나와 무슨 상관이지?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2535_TalkToResidents_TL_Ivica
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Ivica
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMIvicaVukovic
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 002EB41D
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Exonerate him. He's atoned.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Exonerate him. He's atoned.
#. DialogueAfter = Ivica: I'll talk to the others and find out more. But I'm leaning toward following your lead.
#. EDID: [01026B61]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000624"
msgid "And that is what's best for the Outpost. Maybe you're right."
msgstr "그리고 그게 전초기지에 최선이지. 어쩌면 네 말이 맞을지도 몰라."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2535_TalkToResidents_TL_Ivica
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Ivica
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00500421
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Hal confessed to murder. There's going to be a vote on what to do with him. &&& Ivica: Well, if he's done something that serious, he should answer to the law. |Still, based on his work ethic, he's a changed man. Exile might be the best option. &&& Ivica: But I trust your opinion. What's your take on this?
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: And that is what's best for the Outpost. Maybe you're right.
#. EDID: [01026BCE]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000625"
msgid "Exonerate him. He's atoned."
msgstr "그를 사면해. 그는 죗값을 치렀어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2535_TalkToResidents_TL_Ivica
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Ivica
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMIvicaVukovic
#. Face = Defiant
#. SoundFileID = 00B285AD
#. ScriptNotes = Defiant / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Exile is the fairest option.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Exile is the fairest option.
#. DialogueAfter = Ivica: I'll talk to the others and find out more. But I'm leaning toward following your lead.
#. EDID: [01026BE2]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000626"
msgid "Then we are in agreement."
msgstr "그럼 우리는 의견이 같군."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2535_TalkToResidents_TL_Ivica
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Ivica
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00D5A054
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Hal confessed to murder. There's going to be a vote on what to do with him. &&& Ivica: Well, if he's done something that serious, he should answer to the law. |Still, based on his work ethic, he's a changed man. Exile might be the best option. &&& Ivica: But I trust your opinion. What's your take on this?
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Then we are in agreement.
#. EDID: [01026BC7]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000627"
msgid "Exile is the fairest option."
msgstr "추방이 가장 공정한 선택이야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2535_TalkToResidents_TL_Ivica
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Ivica
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMIvicaVukovic
#. Face = Defiant
#. SoundFileID = 00A0F23B
#. ScriptNotes = Defiant / to Player Default
#. Prompt = His crimes are extremely severe. I think you should vote for his execution.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: His crimes are extremely severe. I think you should vote for his execution.
#. DialogueAfter = Ivica: I'll talk to the others and find out more. But I'm leaning toward following your lead.
#. EDID: [01026BE6]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000628"
msgid "Harsh, but if what you say is true, it will be hard to argue against it."
msgstr "가혹하지만, 네 말이 사실이라면 반박하기 어려울 거야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2535_TalkToResidents_TL_Ivica
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Ivica
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 005703FE
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Hal confessed to murder. There's going to be a vote on what to do with him. &&& Ivica: Well, if he's done something that serious, he should answer to the law. |Still, based on his work ethic, he's a changed man. Exile might be the best option. &&& Ivica: But I trust your opinion. What's your take on this?
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Harsh, but if what you say is true, it will be hard to argue against it.
#. EDID: [01026BD2]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000629"
msgid "His crimes are extremely severe. I think you should vote for his execution."
msgstr "그의 죄는 극히 중대해. 그의 처형에 투표해야 한다고 생각해."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2535_TalkToResidents_TL_Ivica
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMIvicaVukovic
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMIvicaVukovic
#. Face = Defiant
#. SoundFileID = 00E79B92
#. ScriptNotes = Defiant / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Good workers are hard to find. Keep him around for that sake alone.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Good workers are hard to find. Keep him around for that sake alone.
#. DialogueAfter = Ivica: I'll talk to the others and find out more. But I'm leaning toward following your lead.
#. EDID: [01026B6C]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00062A"
msgid "So you think we should exonerate him? Well, you do have a point. No need to punish the folks here."
msgstr "그러니까 그를 사면해야 한다고 생각하는 거야? 뭐, 일리는 있네. 여기 사람들까지 벌줄 필요는 없지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2535_TalkToResidents_TL_Ivica
