#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Hal confessed to murder. There's going to be a vote on what to do with him. &&& Ivica: Well, if he's done something that serious, he should answer to the law. |Still, based on his work ethic, he's a changed man. Exile might be the best option. &&& Ivica: But I trust your opinion. What's your take on this?
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: So you think we should exonerate him? Well, you do have a point. No need to punish the folks here.
#. EDID: [01026B7F]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00062B"
msgid "Good workers are hard to find. Keep him around for that sake alone."
msgstr "좋은 일꾼은 찾기 어려워. 그것만으로도 곁에 둘 이유가 있어."

