#. Face = Angry
#. SoundFileID = 00167BC4
#. ScriptNotes = shy-nar / Angry
#. DialogueBefore = Caspian: This isn't right! You've got him locked up like some animal! &&& ... &&& Yeats: His deeds here should count for something. Are we not more than the sum of our mistakes? &&& SunniKim: Pretty big mistake though. How do we know he's not gonna do a sequel? &&& GraceKim: If my sister is being punished for something so minor, I expect much worse for Hal.
#. DialogueAfter = Ivica: This bickering is pointless. Let's just have the vote and be done with it.
#. EDID: [01026B9D]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00064A"
msgid "And how do we know Shinar wasn't dead in the water? You heard him, he wasn't even there when they died!"
msgstr "그리고 시날이 이미 끝장난 상태가 아니었다는 걸 우리가 어떻게 알아? 들었잖아, 그들이 죽었을 때 그는 거기 있지도 않았어!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c3100_Bernhard_Greet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Bernhard
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMBernhardKleiber
#. Face = Angry
#. SoundFileID = 00370E29
#. ScriptNotes = Angry / to Player Default
#. Prompt = You're right. It's not my place to tell you how to handle this.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: You're right. It's not my place to tell you how to handle this.
#. DialogueAfter = Bernhard: *Sigh*. You are not wrong.
#. EDID: [01026BEF]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00064B"
msgid "Oh, I know exactly how I will handle this. I have thought about this day for some time. I will see you there."
msgstr "아, 이 일을 어떻게 처리할지는 정확히 알고 있어. 이 날을 오래 생각해 왔거든. 거기서 보지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c3100_Bernhard_Greet
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Bernhard
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00597FB4
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I don't think you should attend. You seem a bit on edge. &&& Bernhard: Is this some kind of joke? How can I heal when my wounds are open?
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Oh, I know exactly how I will handle this. I have thought about this day for some time. I will see you there.
#. EDID: [01026BB1]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00064C"
msgid "You're right. It's not my place to tell you how to handle this."
msgstr "네 말이 맞아. 이 일을 어떻게 처리하라고 내가 말할 입장은 아니지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2300_YeatsTL03_Enlightened
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Yeats
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMYeats
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 000BAEED
#. DialogueBefore = Yeats: I have no faith. In anything.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: You could preach for the House of the Enlightened.
#. EDID: [01026B88]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00064D"
msgid "In other words, I am a free agent! Taking applications to serve as the mouth of God or Gods or No-God at all."
msgstr "다시 말해, 나는 자유 계약자다! 신이든 신들이든 무신이든, 그 입이 될 지원서를 받고 있지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c3100_Bernhard_Greet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Bernhard
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMBernhardKleiber
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00E85493
#. EDID: [01026C12]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00064E"
msgid "Fine. I will trust you to dole out his punishment. And truth is, I don't care to see that man's face ever again."
msgstr "좋아. 그의 처벌을 네게 맡기겠어. 사실, 난 그 남자의 얼굴을 다시는 보고 싶지 않아."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c3100_Bernhard_Greet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Bernhard
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMBernhardKleiber
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00E5F971
#. EDID: [01026C12]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00064F"
msgid "It's said that the past is a millstone. And turning it will only send us in circles."
msgstr "과거는 맷돌과 같다고들 하지. 그것을 돌려 봐야 우리를 제자리에서 맴돌게 할 뿐이야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c3100_Bernhard_Greet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Bernhard
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMBernhardKleiber
#. Face = Somber
#. SoundFileID = 0074E411
#. ScriptNotes = Somber
#. DialogueBefore = Bernhard: What? Are you saying Caruso will kill me?
#. EDID: [01026C12]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000650"
msgid "*Sigh*. You are not wrong."
msgstr "*한숨* 네 말이 틀리진 않아."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c3100_Bernhard_Greet
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Bernhard
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00C8ECB8
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I'm counting on you to help me sway the vote. &&& Bernhard: Well, you will get no sweeping rhetoric from me. Only the cold, hard truth. I hope that will be enough.
#. DialogueAfter = Bernhard: *Sigh*. You are not wrong.
#. EDID: [01026C29]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000651"
msgid "You have to forgive him. Not for him, but for yourself."
msgstr "그를 용서해야 해. 그를 위해서가 아니라, 너 자신을 위해서."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c3100_Bernhard_Greet
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Bernhard
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 001D4E68
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: He's reformed somewhat. That may not be how this goes down. &&& Bernhard: Reformed? A scorpion like Hal Caruso will never change his nature. But I will tell him in person, thanks to you.
#. DialogueAfter = Bernhard: *Sigh*. You are not wrong.
#. EDID: [01026B5B]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000652"
msgid "It's not worth it. It'll send you to a darker place."
msgstr "그럴 가치 없어. 너를 더 어두운 곳으로 몰아넣을 거야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c3100_Bernhard_Greet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Bernhard
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMBernhardKleiber
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0067A5A3
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = He's living quite comfortably. There really is no such thing as karma.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: He's living quite comfortably. There really is no such thing as karma.
#. DialogueAfter = Bernhard: But I suppose that is why you are here. You want me to bear witness.
#. EDID: [01026C00]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000653"
msgid "Then we should see fit to give him the karma he deserves."
msgstr "그럼 그에게 마땅한 업보를 안겨 줘야겠군."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c3100_Bernhard_Greet
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Bernhard
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 008D1ADA
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: You should know, I found Caruso. &&& Bernhard: What? You found him? And how is he? Dead? Tortured? No, neither are good enough for that man!
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Then we should see fit to give him the karma he deserves.
#. EDID: [01026BB7]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000654"
msgid "He's living quite comfortably. There really is no such thing as karma."
msgstr "그는 꽤 편하게 살고 있어. 인과응보라는 건 정말 없나 봐."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c3100_Bernhard_Greet
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Bernhard
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0024E349
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: You should know, I found Caruso. &&& Bernhard: What? You found him? And how is he? Dead? Tortured? No, neither are good enough for that man!
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: *Scoffs* Outsiders will not know the pain that man has caused.
#. EDID: [01026B75]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000655"
msgid "He's not in jail, if that's what you mean. But New Babylon is going to vote on his punishment."
msgstr "네가 그런 뜻으로 묻는 거라면, 그는 감옥에 있지 않아. 하지만 뉴바빌론이 그의 처벌을 투표로 정할 거야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c3100_Bernhard_Greet
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Bernhard
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00A507C1
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: You should know, I found Caruso. &&& Bernhard: What? You found him? And how is he? Dead? Tortured? No, neither are good enough for that man!
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: *Scoffs* Outsiders will not know the pain that man has caused.
#. EDID: [01026BE4]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000656"
msgid "He's tortured, but only by his past. He's confessed and awaits punishment at New Babylon."
msgstr "고통받고 있긴 해. 다만 과거 때문에. 그는 자백했고 뉴바빌론에서 처벌을 기다리고 있어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c3100_Bernhard_Greet
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 002128EB
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: You should know, I found Caruso. &&& Bernhard: What? You found him? And how is he? Dead? Tortured? No, neither are good enough for that man!
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: *Scoffs* Outsiders will not know the pain that man has caused.
#. EDID: [01026B62]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000657"
msgid "He's going to confess to his crimes. The people of New Babylon will decide his fate."
msgstr "그는 자신의 죄를 자백할 거야. 뉴바빌론 사람들이 그의 운명을 결정하겠지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2410_Sasha_Greet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Sasha
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFSashaAtwell
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0087538D
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Never mind.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Never mind.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Give me a second. I'll let you know when I'm done.
#. EDID: [01026B87]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000658"
msgid "*Sigh* Come back to me when you have something."
msgstr "*한숨* 뭔가 단서를 찾아내면 그때 다시 오십쇼."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2410_Sasha_Greet
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Sasha
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00583589
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Sasha: All right, out with it. Hal says you got some new info that'll exonerate Yeats.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: *Sigh* Come back to me when you have something.
#. EDID: [01026BC5]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000659"
msgid "Never mind."
msgstr "아직 없습니다. 신경 쓰지 마세요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c3100_Bernhard_Greet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Bernhard
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMBernhardKleiber
#. Face = Angry
#. SoundFileID = 004A07CC
#. ScriptNotes = Angry
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: You should know, I found Caruso.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: He's going to confess to his crimes. The people of New Babylon will decide his fate.
#. EDID: [01026BB8]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00065A"
msgid "What? You found him? And how is he? Dead? Tortured? No, neither are good enough for that man!"
msgstr "뭐? 그를 찾았다고? 그래서 그는 어때? 죽었어? 고문당했어? 아니, 둘 다 그 남자에겐 부족해!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2410_Sasha_Greet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCFSashaAtwell
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFSashaAtwell
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00D6F74E
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = I found the missing supplies.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I found the missing supplies.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: [Lie] Grace Kim has admitted to taking the supplies for medical use and forgot to log it. They were never stolen.
#. EDID: [01026BF5]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00065B"
msgid "Well I'll be damned. And where did you get this?"
msgstr "세상에. 어디서 찾았습니까?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2410_Sasha_Greet
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0095961B
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Sasha: All right, out with it. Hal says you got some new info that'll exonerate Yeats.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Well I'll be damned. And where did you get this?
#. EDID: [01026B76]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00065C"
msgid "I found the missing supplies."
msgstr "사라진 물자를 찾았습니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2600_GraceKim_TL10_Confront
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00191A63
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: [Evidence] I have something for you. &&& GraceKim: Oh, what do you have there? Surgical gloves and a used syringe?|Did you find these in the trash? I would advise you against handling such things.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: *Groan*. You know it's unethical to look through someone's personal logs, right?
#. EDID: [01026BAF]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00065D"
msgid "[Grace's Computer] I'm just returning your belongings. I read your private logs. You're the supply thief. "
msgstr "[그레이스의 컴퓨터] 네 물건을 돌려주러 왔을 뿐이야. 네 개인 로그를 읽었어. 네가 보급품 도둑이더군. "

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_200_CarusoTL10
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Caruso
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00C26B37
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Can we talk about what happened to Shinar? &&& Caruso: Not right now. Let's finish the work first.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Understood.
#. EDID: [01026BCD]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00065E"
msgid "That's all right. We can talk about it later."
msgstr "괜찮아. 나중에 얘기하자."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_200_CarusoTL10
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Caruso
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00E02EE4
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Can we talk about what happened to Shinar? &&& Caruso: Not right now. Let's finish the work first.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Understood.
#. EDID: [01026B59]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00065F"
msgid "Fair enough. But we have a deal."
msgstr "좋아. 하지만 우리는 거래했어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_200_CarusoTL10
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Caruso
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00BE7AEE
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Can we talk about what happened to Shinar? &&& Caruso: Not right now. Let's finish the work first.
#. DialogueAfter = Caruso: I don't blame you if you have doubts.
#. EDID: [01026B93]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000660"
msgid "Just don't get any cute ideas. If you run, I'll find you."
msgstr "허튼 생각 하지 마. 도망치면 내가 찾아낼 거야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_200_CarusoTL10
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Caruso
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMHalCaruso
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0082DEFD
#. EDID: [01026BCC]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000661"
msgid "When cornered, it is a man's natural inclination to run. But that will not serve the people here. "
msgstr "궁지에 몰리면 도망치려는 것이 인간의 자연스러운 성향이지. 하지만 그건 여기 사람들에게 도움이 되지 않아. "

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_200_CarusoTL10
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Caruso
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMHalCaruso
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00C8368C
#. DialogueBefore = Caruso: Delaying, yes. I am not in the mindset to revisit that time. Give me a moment to finish my business here.
#. EDID: [01026BCC]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000662"
msgid "I don't blame you if you have doubts. "
msgstr "의심이 든다 해도 탓하지 않아. "

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_200_CarusoTL10
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMHalCaruso
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMHalCaruso
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00D0E239
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Seems like you're avoiding the topic.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Seems like you're avoiding the topic.
#. DialogueAfter = Caruso: I don't blame you if you have doubts.
#. EDID: [01026BEB]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000663"
msgid "Delaying, yes. I am not in the mindset to revisit that time. Give me a moment to finish my business here."
msgstr "시간을 끌고 있는 건 맞아. 그 시절을 다시 떠올릴 마음가짐이 아니거든. 여기 일을 마칠 시간을 조금만 줘."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_d3500_OpeningStatement
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Ivica
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMIvicaVukovic
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0096CD41
#. ScriptNotes = / to Zena
#. DialogueBefore = Zena: If everyone is present, we can begin. &&& ... &&& Zena: And I know some of you think we're rushing into this, but for the sake of the Outpost, I'd like to resolve this now. &&& Zena: On your ballot are three choices. Execution, exile, or exoneration. &&& Zena: Now, if anyone wants to say a few words, the floor is yours.
#. DialogueAfter = Zena: Fair enough. Anyone else have anything to say?
#. EDID: [01026BDF]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000664"
msgid "The man's confessed. We all know how we're voting. I have work to do and this is keeping me from it."
msgstr "그 남자는 자백했어. 우리는 다 어떻게 투표할지 알고 있어. 난 할 일이 있고 이 일이 날 붙잡고 있다고."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2535_TalkToResidents_TL_Caspian
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Caspian
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMCaspianRoberson
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0095DBF4
#. DialogueBefore = Caspian: Even if what you're saying is true, he's changed! |Are we really gonna punish him for something that happened like a decade ago?|No, there's gotta be another way. I just have to figure out how the vote is gonna go down, and change it.
#. EDID: [01026BA5]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000665"
msgid "I'm gonna have to think on this. But there's gotta be a way!"
msgstr "이건 좀 생각해 봐야겠어. 하지만 방법이 분명 있을 거야!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_200_CarusoTL10
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00E4AE43
