#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Can we talk about what happened to Shinar? &&& Caruso: Not right now. Let's finish the work first.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Delaying, yes. I am not in the mindset to revisit that time. Give me a moment to finish my business here.
#. EDID: [01026B85]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000666"
msgid "Seems like you're avoiding the topic."
msgstr "그 얘기를 피하는 것 같네."

