#. DialogueBefore = Zena: If everyone is present, we can begin. &&& ... &&& Zena: Now, if anyone wants to say a few words, the floor is yours. &&& Ivica: The man's confessed. We all know how we're voting. I have work to do and this is keeping me from it. &&& Zena: Fair enough. Anyone else have anything to say?
