#. Prompt = I believe Bernhard Kleiber might have something to say.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I believe Bernhard Kleiber might have something to say.
#. DialogueAfter = Zena: All right. While I would've liked to hear your testimony, we will respect your wishes here.
#. EDID: [01026BB6]
