#. EDID: [01026B71]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000699"
msgid "Not sure why he trusts you more though. You just got here! "
msgstr "근데 왜 그가 널 더 믿는지는 모르겠어. 넌 방금 왔잖아! "

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2330_Caspian_Greeet
