#. Speaker = Caruso
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMHalCaruso
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00E102E7
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Save the speech for someone who cares.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Save the speech for someone who cares.
#. DialogueAfter = Caruso: The others in this outpost, they depend on me.
#. EDID: [01026BDE]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00069B"
msgid "Your feelings about me are not my concern."
msgstr "네가 나를 어떻게 느끼는지는 내 관심사가 아니야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_140_Caruso_Greet
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Caruso
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 002AA289
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Go on then. Speak it. &&& Caruso: The truth is, I've been waiting for you. &&& Caruso: Yes, I am the one who left Shinar to die. My crimes are many, and without redemption. &&& Caruso: But I don't fear death, hunter. My blood is rancid, my bones rotten. |If you seek my life, then you'll be disappointed. There is no life left to take.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Your feelings about me are not my concern.
#. EDID: [01026B5F]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00069C"
msgid "Save the speech for someone who cares."
msgstr "그 연설은 신경 쓰는 사람에게나 해."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2330_Caspian_Greeet
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Caspian
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 002A1D68
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: That may be a medical grade sedative, applied via a syringe. &&& Caspian: Oh yeah, like animal tranquilizer or something! &&& Caspian: Hal wanted to look in the dumpster bins for anything suspicious.|But then the water pump broke and uh... yeah. That's when you showed up.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: I totally would, but Hal said not to. I think he's worried I'd contaminate something.
#. EDID: [01026B58]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00069D"
msgid "I'm not fishing through trash. You do it."
msgstr "난 쓰레기 뒤질 생각 없어. 네가 해."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_d3300_SceneAll
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = GraceKim
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFGraceKim
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00BB53E2
#. DialogueBefore = Caspian: This isn't right! You've got him locked up like some animal! &&& Zena: Hal's confessed to some serious crimes. This isn't that simple. &&& Yeats: His deeds here should count for something. Are we not more than the sum of our mistakes? &&& SunniKim: Pretty big mistake though. How do we know he's not gonna do a sequel?
#. DialogueAfter = Caspian: And how do we know Shinar wasn't dead in the water? You heard him, he wasn't even there when they died!
#. EDID: [01026B6E]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00069E"
msgid "My sister's right. This isn't just any crime. He stole a ship and left an entire outpost to die. "
msgstr "내 여동생 말이 맞아. 이건 평범한 범죄가 아니야. 그는 배를 훔치고 전초기지 전체를 죽게 내버려 뒀어. "

