#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: I'd like to talk to him.
#. EDID: [01026B66]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0006B0"
msgid "Figured I'd give him a moment to settle his affairs with his maker before the vote."
msgstr "투표 전에 마지막으로 할이 창조주와 정리할 수 있게 시간을 좀 줬습니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_d3200_CarusoTL03
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Caruso
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMHalCaruso
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0078D4EE
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Yes. But I only have one vote. The others may feel differently.
#. EDID: [01026BB5]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0006B1"
msgid "I see. Then let the verdict be fair and just."
msgstr "알겠다. 그럼 판결이 공정하고 정의롭기를."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_d3200_CarusoTL03
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00198B19
#. DialogueAfter = Caruso: Indeed. When we first met, you said my life was forfeit. Do you still think so?
#. EDID: [01026B73]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0006B2"
msgid "We'll see how the vote goes down."
msgstr "투표가 어떻게 흘러갈지 보자고."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c3100_Bernhard_Greet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Bernhard
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMBernhardKleiber
#. Face = VeryAngry
#. SoundFileID = 00933FBC
#. ScriptNotes = VeryAngry / to Player Default
#. Prompt = I don't think you should attend. You seem a bit on edge.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I don't think you should attend. You seem a bit on edge.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: You're right. It's not my place to tell you how to handle this.
#. EDID: [01026B83]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0006B3"
msgid "Is this some kind of joke? How can I heal when my wounds are open?"
msgstr "이게 무슨 농담이야? 상처가 열린 채로 어떻게 치유하라는 거야?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c3100_Bernhard_Greet
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Bernhard
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 000E8C98
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: He's going to confess to his crimes. The people of New Babylon will decide his fate. &&& Bernhard: *Scoffs* Outsiders will not know the pain that man has caused. &&& Bernhard: But I suppose that is why you are here. You want me to bear witness. &&& Bernhard: Understood. Give me the coordinates, and I will put the nail in his oversized coffin.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Is this some kind of joke? How can I heal when my wounds are open?
#. EDID: [01026BC9]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0006B4"
msgid "I don't think you should attend. You seem a bit on edge."
msgstr "참석하지 않는 게 좋겠어. 좀 신경이 날카로워 보이네."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_d3200_CarusoTL02
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Caruso
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMHalCaruso
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00032FC2
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. EDID: [01026BF3]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0006B5"
msgid "But here, on the eve of death, prayer comes natural to me."
msgstr "하지만 여기, 죽음을 앞둔 전야에는 기도가 자연스럽게 나오네."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_d3200_CarusoTL02
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Caruso
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMHalCaruso
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00A78281
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Caruso: It is the word of Jinan and the will of the Serpent.
#. EDID: [01026BF3]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0006B6"
msgid "I am a deserter of House Va'ruun. As such, I have not followed the Serpent's Path for many years."
msgstr "나는 바룬 가문의 탈영자야. 그래서 오랫동안 뱀의 길을 따르지 않았지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_d3200_CarusoJail
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Caruso_Prayer
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMHalCaruso
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 001D0EF3
#. DialogueBefore = Caruso_Prayer: O Great Serpent, who brings the Shrouding, forgive this trespass.
#. DialogueAfter = Caruso: We meet again, Hunter. And it seems my time has come.
#. EDID: [01026BC8]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0006B7"
msgid "Guide me on this next journey, so that I may see the light, and become Promised once more."
msgstr "이 다음 여정에서 나를 인도하소서. 빛을 보고 다시 약속받은 자가 될 수 있도록."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_d3200_CarusoTL02
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Caruso
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMHalCaruso
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 009CD536
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Caruso: Very well.
#. DialogueAfter = Caruso: I am a deserter of House Va'ruun. As such, I have not followed the Serpent's Path for many years.
#. EDID: [01026B5E]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0006B8"
msgid "It is the word of Jinan and the will of the Serpent."
msgstr "그것은 지난의 말씀이자 뱀의 뜻이다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_d3200_CarusoJail
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Caruso_Prayer
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMHalCaruso
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00AC0E3D
#. ScriptNotes = Praying to a god
#. DialogueAfter = Caruso_Prayer: Guide me on this next journey, so that I may see the light, and become Promised once more.
#. EDID: [01026C28]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0006B9"
msgid "O Great Serpent, who brings the Shrouding, forgive this trespass."
msgstr "오, 장막의 날을 가져오는 위대한 뱀이시여, 이 침범을 용서하소서."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_d3200_CarusoTL02
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0004CE6D
#. DialogueAfter = Caruso: Perhaps your companion would prefer to elaborate.
#. EDID: [01026B67]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0006BA"
msgid "What's that prayer from?"
msgstr "그 기도는 어디서 온 거야?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_d3100_CarusoZenaGreet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Zena
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFZenaHield
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00101168
#. DialogueBefore = Zena: Thank you. Keep in mind, it's still a democratic process.
#. EDID: [01026B97]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0006BB"
msgid "*Sigh* Regardless, it looks we have a long day ahead of us. We best get to it."
msgstr "*한숨* 어쨌든, 우리 앞에 긴 하루가 놓인 것 같군. 시작하는 게 좋겠어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c3100_Bernhard_Greet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Bernhard
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMBernhardKleiber
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00011BD6
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = I'm counting on you to help me sway the vote.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I'm counting on you to help me sway the vote.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: You have to forgive him. Not for him, but for yourself.
#. EDID: [01026BAA]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0006BC"
msgid "Well, you will get no sweeping rhetoric from me. Only the cold, hard truth. I hope that will be enough."
msgstr "글쎄, 내게서 거창한 수사는 없을 거야. 차갑고 냉정한 진실뿐이지. 그걸로 충분했으면 좋겠어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c3100_Bernhard_Greet
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Bernhard
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0098715E
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: He's going to confess to his crimes. The people of New Babylon will decide his fate. &&& Bernhard: *Scoffs* Outsiders will not know the pain that man has caused. &&& Bernhard: But I suppose that is why you are here. You want me to bear witness. &&& Bernhard: Understood. Give me the coordinates, and I will put the nail in his oversized coffin.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Well, you will get no sweeping rhetoric from me. Only the cold, hard truth. I hope that will be enough.
#. EDID: [01026BDC]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0006BD"
msgid "I'm counting on you to help me sway the vote."
msgstr "투표를 움직이는 걸 네가 도와주리라 믿고 있어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c3100_Bernhard_Greet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Bernhard
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMBernhardKleiber
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 005DA3C2
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = He's reformed somewhat. That may not be how this goes down.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: He's reformed somewhat. That may not be how this goes down.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: It's not worth it. It'll send you to a darker place.
#. EDID: [01026B9B]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0006BE"
msgid "Reformed? A scorpion like Hal Caruso will never change his nature. But I will tell him in person, thanks to you."
msgstr "개심했다고? 할 카루소 같은 전갈은 절대 본성을 바꾸지 않아. 하지만 네 덕분에 직접 그에게 말할 수 있겠군."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c3100_Bernhard_Greet
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Bernhard
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 009D5DFB
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: He's going to confess to his crimes. The people of New Babylon will decide his fate. &&& Bernhard: *Scoffs* Outsiders will not know the pain that man has caused. &&& Bernhard: But I suppose that is why you are here. You want me to bear witness. &&& Bernhard: Understood. Give me the coordinates, and I will put the nail in his oversized coffin.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Reformed? A scorpion like Hal Caruso will never change his nature. But I will tell him in person, thanks to you.
#. EDID: [01026BD8]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0006BF"
msgid "He's reformed somewhat. That may not be how this goes down."
msgstr "그는 어느 정도 달라졌어. 일이 그렇게 흘러가지 않을 수도 있어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c3100_Bernhard_Greet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMBernhardKleiber
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMBernhardKleiber
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00D71B40
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Here they are. I'll meet you there.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Here they are. I'll meet you there.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: If you go there, there's a chance you will die. I've seen it.
#. EDID: [01026B7A]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0006C0"
msgid "Wonderful. Together we will write his obituary."
msgstr "훌륭하군. 함께 그의 부고를 쓰자고."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c3100_Bernhard_Greet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Bernhard
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMBernhardKleiber
#. Face = Defiant
#. SoundFileID = 00140B21
#. ScriptNotes = Defiant
#. DialogueBefore = Bernhard: But I suppose that is why you are here. You want me to bear witness.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Here they are. I'll meet you there.
#. EDID: [01026BEC]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0006C1"
msgid "Understood. Give me the coordinates, and I will put the nail in his oversized coffin."
msgstr "알겠다. 좌표를 줘. 그의 거대한 관에 마지막 못을 박아 주지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c3100_Bernhard_Greet
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
