#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Wonderful. Together we will write his obituary.
#. EDID: [01026BE5]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0006C2"
msgid "Here they are. I'll meet you there."
msgstr "여기 있어. 거기서 보자."

