#. DialogueAfter = Bernhard: What? You found him? And how is he? Dead? Tortured? No, neither are good enough for that man!
#. EDID: [01026B8F]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0006C8"
msgid "You should know, I found Caruso. "
msgstr "알아 둬야 해. 카루소를 찾았어. "

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c3100_Bernhard_Greet
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Bernhard
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
