#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: It's okay. It's going to take time to process. &&& Bernhard: You're right. I just thought I'd feel better. But it's more complicated than that. &&& Bernhard: *Sigh* Either way, thank you, stranger. While I don't know if closure will ever come, it's good to know others will not befall the same fate.
#. DialogueAfter = Bernhard: What? You found him? And how is he? Dead? Tortured? No, neither are good enough for that man!
#. EDID: [01026BF0]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0006C9"
msgid "You can still get your revenge though. I found Caruso. "
msgstr "그래도 복수는 할 수 있어. 카루소를 찾았거든. "

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c3100_Bernhard_Greet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Bernhard
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMBernhardKleiber
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00BE4D3C
#. DialogueBefore = Bernhard: Yes. The conditions were rough, but together we had tamed its hazards. It saddens me to think of all the knowledge we lost.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: You should know, I found and killed Caruso.
#. EDID: [01026B54]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0006CA"
msgid "And to think, the one responsible for their deaths is still roaming free."
msgstr "그들의 죽음에 책임 있는 자가 아직도 자유롭게 돌아다닌다니."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c3100_Bernhard_Greet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Bernhard
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMBernhardKleiber
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 005B40D7
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = I did, and I'm sorry.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I did, and I'm sorry.
#. DialogueAfter = Bernhard: And to think, the one responsible for their deaths is still roaming free.
#. EDID: [01026BB4]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0006CB"
msgid "Yes, a lot of very good people were lost. Brilliant minds."
msgstr "그래, 아주 훌륭한 사람들이 많이 사라졌어. 뛰어난 지성들이었지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
