#. DialogueBefore = Bernhard: You again? Did you ever find Shinar?
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Yes, the graves of brilliant scientists, laborers, parents and spouses.
#. EDID: [01026C2C]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0006CC"
msgid "I found a graveyard."
msgstr "묘지를 발견했어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c3100_Bernhard_Greet
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
