#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Based on what I saw, it would've been a fine outpost, had your luck been better.
#. EDID: [01026B70]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0006CE"
msgid "You again? Did you ever find Shinar?"
msgstr "또 너야? 시날은 찾았어?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_e2950_CarusoEnd_Greet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Caruso
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMHalCaruso
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00C5245D
#. ScriptNotes = Serious
#. DialogueAfter = Caruso: Regardless, I thank you for giving me the opportunity to atone. Be well.
#. EDID: [010275C0]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0006D0"
msgid "Perhaps by then, my body of work will be enough to balance them."
msgstr "아마 그때쯤이면 내가 이룬 일이 그 죄의 무게를 맞출 만큼 충분할지도 모르지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_e2950_CarusoEnd_Greet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Caruso
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMHalCaruso
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00149C5C
#. ScriptNotes = Serious
#. DialogueBefore = Caruso: Then lead the way.
#. EDID: [010275C0]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0006D1"
msgid "And when my time comes, I will kneel before the ghosts of Shinar, and put my soul on the scales."
msgstr "그리고 내 때가 오면, 시날의 유령들 앞에 무릎 꿇고 내 영혼을 저울 위에 올리겠다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_e2950_CarusoEnd_Greet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Caruso
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMHalCaruso
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 003ACD48
#. DialogueBefore = Caruso: Then I have but one request. I would like you to take me to Shinar.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: All right. I can take you to Shinar.
#. EDID: [010275B9]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0006D3"
msgid "I will live out my days there."
msgstr "그곳에서 여생을 보내겠다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_e2950_CarusoEnd_Greet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Caruso
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMHalCaruso
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00EB9EB7
#. DialogueBefore = Caruso: Then I have but one request. I would like you to take me to Shinar.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: All right. I can take you to Shinar.
#. EDID: [010275B8]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0006D4"
msgid "Bury me there, amongst the others."
msgstr "나를 다른 이들 사이, 그곳에 묻어 줘."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_e2950_CarusoEnd_Greet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Caruso
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMHalCaruso
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00674DE1
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Why Shinar?
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Why Shinar?
#. DialogueAfter = Caruso: All right. I can take you to Shinar.
#. EDID: [010275C7]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0006D5"
msgid "Yes. The people's mercy is not the same as their trust. I've broken it, by hiding my past."
msgstr "그래. 사람들의 자비가 그들의 신뢰와 같은 것은 아니야. 내 과거를 숨김으로써 그 신뢰를 깨뜨렸지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_e2950_CarusoEnd_Greet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Caruso
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMHalCaruso
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00B29222
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Why Shinar?
#. DialogueAfter = Caruso: All right. I can take you to Shinar.
#. EDID: [010275C6]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0006D6"
msgid "The ghosts of Shinar will not forgive what I have done. But they will witness my will to change."
msgstr "시날의 유령들은 내가 한 일을 용서하지 않을 거야. 하지만 내가 변하려는 의지는 보게 되겠지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_e2950_CarusoEnd_Greet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Caruso
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMHalCaruso
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 003E41F4
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Why Shinar?
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Why Shinar?
#. EDID: [010275C6]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0006D7"
msgid "I cannot turn back time. But I can try to rebuild what I destroyed."
msgstr "시간을 되돌릴 수는 없어. 하지만 내가 파괴한 것을 다시 세우려 노력할 수는 있어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_e2950_CarusoEnd_Greet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Caruso
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMHalCaruso
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00CBB49F
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Why Shinar?
#. DialogueAfter = Caruso: All right. I can take you to Shinar.
#. EDID: [010275C5]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0006D8"
msgid "And two, I would like to see it before I die. Stand face to face with the ghosts of Shinar, and deliver them their vengeance."
msgstr "그리고 둘째, 죽기 전에 그곳을 보고 싶어. 시날의 유령들과 마주 서서, 그들에게 복수를 전해 주고 싶다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_e2950_CarusoEnd_Greet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Caruso
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMHalCaruso
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00853006
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Why Shinar?
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Why Shinar?
#. EDID: [010275C5]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0006D9"
msgid "One, I don't want my execution or grave site to be a distraction to the people here."
msgstr "첫째, 내 처형이나 무덤이 여기 사람들에게 방해가 되지 않았으면 해."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_e2950_CarusoEnd_Greet
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Caruso
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 002BCA3C
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: It has. The vote says you're to die for your crimes. &&& Caruso: Then I have but one request. I would like you to take me to Shinar. &&& Caruso: Bury me there, amongst the others.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: One, I don't want my execution or grave site to be a distraction to the people here.
#. EDID: [010275E5]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0006DA"
msgid "Are you worried things might never go back to normal?"
msgstr "일이 다시는 정상으로 돌아가지 않을까 걱정돼?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_e2950_CarusoEnd_Greet
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Caruso
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0006DB5D
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: It has. The vote says you're to die for your crimes. &&& Caruso: Then I have but one request. I would like you to take me to Shinar. &&& Caruso: Bury me there, amongst the others.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: One, I don't want my execution or grave site to be a distraction to the people here.
#. EDID: [010275E4]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0006DB"
msgid "Why Shinar?"
msgstr "왜 시날이야?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_e2950_CarusoEnd_Greet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Caruso
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMHalCaruso
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 000B30AC
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = There are plenty of other places you can die.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: There are plenty of other places you can die.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: I can do that.
#. EDID: [010275FB]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0006DC"
msgid "The burden of my past will hang over me, yes. But that is no one's fault but my own."
msgstr "그래, 내 과거의 짐은 나를 짓누를 거야. 하지만 그건 누구의 잘못도 아닌 내 잘못이다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_e2950_CarusoEnd_Greet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Caruso
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMHalCaruso
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 000AD814
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = There are plenty of other places you can die.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: There are plenty of other places you can die.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: I can do that.
#. EDID: [010275FA]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0006DD"
msgid "But no other place I see as fitting. If you grant me passage, I will do my best not be a burden."
msgstr "하지만 다른 어느 곳도 그만큼 어울린다고 생각하지 않아. 통행을 허락해 준다면, 짐이 되지 않도록 최선을 다하겠다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_e2950_CarusoEnd_Greet
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Caruso
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00649C58
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: It has. The vote says you're to die for your crimes. &&& Caruso: Then I have but one request. I would like you to take me to Shinar. &&& Caruso: Bury me there, amongst the others.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: But no other place I see as fitting. If you grant me passage, I will do my best not be a burden.
#. EDID: [0102761C]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0006DE"
msgid "You're better off somewhere else, in my opinion."
msgstr "내 생각엔 다른 곳이 너한테 더 나아."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_e2950_CarusoEnd_Greet
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Caruso
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00374D2E
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: You're to be exiled. I'm taking you off-world. &&& Caruso: Then I have but one request. I would like you to take me to Shinar. &&& Caruso: I will live out my days there.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: But no other place I see as fitting. If you grant me passage, I will do my best not be a burden.
#. EDID: [0102761B]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0006DF"
msgid "There are better places to live."
msgstr "살기 더 좋은 곳들이 있어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_e2950_CarusoEnd_Greet
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Caruso
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00B91F34
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: It has. The vote says you're to die for your crimes. &&& Caruso: Then I have but one request. I would like you to take me to Shinar. &&& Caruso: Bury me there, amongst the others.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: But no other place I see as fitting. If you grant me passage, I will do my best not be a burden.
#. EDID: [0102761A]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0006E0"
msgid "There are plenty of other places you can die."
msgstr "죽을 곳은 얼마든지 있어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_e2950_CarusoEnd_Greet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMHalCaruso
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMHalCaruso
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00327785
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = All right. I can take you to Shinar.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: All right. I can take you to Shinar.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: I will be honored to.
#. EDID: [010275DD]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0006E1"
msgid "I will do my best."
msgstr "최선을 다하겠다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_e2950_CarusoEnd_Greet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMHalCaruso
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMHalCaruso
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00697DC1
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = All right. I can take you to Shinar.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: All right. I can take you to Shinar.
#. EDID: [010275DC]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0006E2"
msgid "Thank you. I have one more request. I would like you to execute me with this."
msgstr "고마워. 부탁이 하나 더 있어. 이것으로 나를 처형해 줬으면 해."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_e2950_CarusoEnd_Greet
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
