msgid "Then I have but one request. I would like you to take me to Shinar. "
msgstr "그렇다면 부탁은 하나뿐이야. 나를 시날로 데려가 줬으면 해. "

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_e2940_ZenaVoteTL02
