#. EDID: [01027615]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0006EE"
msgid "How do you think the outpost will handle the result?"
msgstr "전초기지가 그 결과를 어떻게 받아들일 것 같아?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_e2940_ZenaVoteTL02
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Zena
