#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0060E460
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: How do you think the outpost will handle the result?
#. DialogueAfter = Zena: At least with the Community Center up and running, there'll be a place to gather and talk about it.
#. EDID: [0102760E]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0006EF"
msgid "We'll do our best to move on. "
msgstr "우린 최선을 다해 앞으로 나아갈 거야. "

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_e2940_ZenaVoteTL03
