#. Prompt = There must be something I can do to help.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: There must be something I can do to help.
#. DialogueAfter = Zena: I'm sorry, but I need some time to process this, and the future of this outpost.
#. EDID: [010275F3]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0006F4"
msgid "I wish there was. But it may be we have to disband the place completely."
msgstr "그럴 수 있으면 좋겠어. 하지만 이곳을 완전히 해산해야 할지도 몰라."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_e2750_ZenaVoteGreet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Zena
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFZenaHield
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00534862
#. EDID: [0102761F]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0006F5"
msgid "You're welcome to handle any business you have here in the meantime. "
msgstr "그동안 여기서 처리할 일이 있으면 해도 좋아. "

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_e2750_ZenaVoteGreet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Zena
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFZenaHield
#. Face = Neutral
