#. DialogueBefore = Zena: I wish there was. But it may be we have to disband the place completely.
#. EDID: [0102761F]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0006F7"
msgid "I'm sorry, but I need some time to process this, and the future of this outpost."
msgstr "미안하지만, 이 일과 이 전초기지의 미래를 받아들이려면 시간이 좀 필요해."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_e2750_ZenaVoteGreet
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
