#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: I wish there was. But it may be we have to disband the place completely.
#. EDID: [010275BD]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0006F8"
msgid "There must be something I can do to help."
msgstr "내가 도울 수 있는 일이 분명 있을 거야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_e2750_ZenaVoteGreet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Zena
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFZenaHield
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0030C14C
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = With that attitude, this place is doomed.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: With that attitude, this place is doomed.
#. DialogueAfter = Zena: Settling out here, we've been through some hard times, but nothing like this.
#. EDID: [010275F1]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0006F9"
msgid "Not quite, but it doesn't look good."
msgstr "꼭 그렇진 않지만, 좋아 보이진 않아."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_e2750_ZenaVoteGreet
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Zena
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 003ADEDE
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: It's because you checked out and stopped paying attention to your people. &&& Zena: I've neglected some duties, but I never thought it'd end up like this. &&& Zena: Things were so promising here. I actually thought I could retire. |I even had a home picked out. Open kitchen, quartz counters, and a view of the ocean.|Now? I'll be living here until I die.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Not quite, but it doesn't look good.
#. EDID: [010275AB]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0006FA"
msgid "With that attitude, this place is doomed."
msgstr "그런 태도로는 이곳은 끝장이야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_e2750_ZenaVoteGreet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Zena
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFZenaHield
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0092EAE8
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: There must be something I can do to help.
#. EDID: [010275F4]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0006FB"
msgid "I just hope I have it in me to guide us out of this."
msgstr "이 상황에서 우리를 이끌 힘이 내 안에 있기를 바랄 뿐이야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_e2750_ZenaVoteGreet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Zena
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFZenaHield
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 008FF34F
#. DialogueBefore = Zena: I know.
#. EDID: [010275F4]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0006FC"
msgid "Settling out here, we've been through some hard times, but nothing like this."
msgstr "이곳에 정착한 뒤로 힘든 시기도 있었지만, 이런 일은 없었어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_e2750_ZenaVoteGreet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Zena
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFZenaHield
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 006BED4F
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Use the Community Center. Rely on prayer.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Use the Community Center. Rely on prayer.
#. DialogueAfter = Zena: Settling out here, we've been through some hard times, but nothing like this.
#. EDID: [0102761D]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0006FD"
msgid "You're right. I didn't realize it at the time, but this must be why Hal wanted Yeats to preach again."
msgstr "네 말이 맞아. 당시엔 몰랐지만, 할이 예이츠에게 다시 설교해 달라고 한 이유가 바로 이거였겠지."

