#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Zena
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 008C096F
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: It's because you checked out and stopped paying attention to your people. &&& Zena: I've neglected some duties, but I never thought it'd end up like this. &&& Zena: Things were so promising here. I actually thought I could retire. |I even had a home picked out. Open kitchen, quartz counters, and a view of the ocean.|Now? I'll be living here until I die.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: You're right. I didn't realize it at the time, but this must be why Hal wanted Yeats to preach again.
#. EDID: [010275C4]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0006FE"
msgid "Use the Community Center. Rely on prayer."
msgstr "주민 센터를 이용해. 기도에 의지하고."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_e2750_ZenaVoteGreet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Zena
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFZenaHield
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00B82B4B
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Lean on each other and you'll get through this.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Lean on each other and you'll get through this.
#. DialogueAfter = Zena: Settling out here, we've been through some hard times, but nothing like this.
#. EDID: [010275FC]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0006FF"
msgid "You're right. But it won't be easy."
msgstr "네 말이 맞아. 하지만 쉽지는 않을 거야."

