#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: You're right. But it won't be easy.
#. EDID: [010275BC]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000700"
msgid "Lean on each other and you'll get through this."
msgstr "서로 의지하면 이겨낼 수 있을 거야."

#. List: 2
