#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: As the leader, it's your responsibility.
#. EDID: [010275B4]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000702"
msgid "Now? I'll be living here until I die."
msgstr "이제? 죽을 때까지 여기서 살 거야."

