#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: It's because you checked out and stopped paying attention to your people. &&& Zena: I've neglected some duties, but I never thought it'd end up like this. &&& Zena: Things were so promising here. I actually thought I could retire. |I even had a home picked out. Open kitchen, quartz counters, and a view of the ocean.|Now? I'll be living here until I die.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: I know.
#. EDID: [010275F8]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000705"
msgid "As the leader, it's your responsibility."
msgstr "그건 촌장인 당신이 책임져야 할 일입니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
