#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Long, and hard.
#. EDID: [010275D5]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000706"
msgid "You have a long road ahead of you."
msgstr "네 앞에는 긴 길이 놓여 있어."

