#. DialogueBefore = Zena: I don't know what to say. How did this happen?
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: But why now? We were a peaceful outpost.
#. EDID: [010275D6]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000707"
msgid "The cycle of violence."
msgstr "폭력의 악순환."

