#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: I've neglected some duties, but I never thought it'd end up like this.
#. EDID: [010275B3]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00070A"
msgid "It's because you checked out and stopped paying attention to your people."
msgstr "네가 마음을 놓고 네 사람들에게 신경 쓰지 않았기 때문이야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_e2940_ZenaVoteTL01
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00111659
#. DialogueAfter = Zena: I was hoping to talk to you about that.
#. EDID: [01027607]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00070B"
msgid "I assume you have a plan to get things back to normal."
msgstr "상황을 정상으로 되돌릴 계획이 있겠지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_e2940_ZenaVoteTL01
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 001311B1
#. DialogueAfter = Zena: I was hoping to talk to you about that.
#. EDID: [01027606]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00070C"
msgid "You must have a plan to get Hal off-world."
msgstr "할을 외부 세계로 보낼 계획이 있겠지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_e2940_ZenaVoteTL01
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
