#. DialogueAfter = Zena: I was hoping to talk to you about that.
#. EDID: [01027605]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00070D"
msgid "You must have a plan to carry out the execution."
msgstr "처형을 집행할 계획이 있겠지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_e2750_ZenaVoteGreet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Zena
