#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: It's because you checked out and stopped paying attention to your people.
#. EDID: [010275F6]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00070E"
msgid "I don't know what to say. How did this happen?"
msgstr "무슨 말을 해야 할지 모르겠어. 어쩌다 이렇게 된 거지?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_e2940_ZenaVoteTL01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Zena
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFZenaHield
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 005A5B45
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: You must have a plan to carry out the execution.
#. DialogueAfter = Zena: Hal said if the vote shook out this way, he wanted you to be the one to do it.
#. EDID: [010275D1]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00070F"
msgid "I was hoping to talk to you about that."
msgstr "그 얘기를 하려고 했어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_e2940_ZenaVoteTL01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Zena
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFZenaHield
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 006F7A57
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral
#. EDID: [010275D9]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000710"
msgid "I'm sure this comes with some conflicting feelings for him, but we feel he's earned his freedom."
msgstr "그에게는 복잡한 감정이 따르겠지만, 우리는 그가 자유를 얻을 자격이 있다고 느껴."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_e2940_ZenaVoteTL01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Zena
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFZenaHield
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00A11DBE
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral
#. EDID: [010275D9]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000711"
msgid "On that note, if you don't mind, I'd like you to open his cell up. "
msgstr "그런 의미에서 괜찮다면, 그의 감방을 열어 줬으면 해. "

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_e2940_ZenaVoteTL01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Zena
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFZenaHield
#. Face = Relieved
#. SoundFileID = 00EA36BF
#. ScriptNotes = Relieved
#. DialogueBefore = Zena: I was hoping to talk to you about that.
#. EDID: [010275D9]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000712"
msgid "Yeah. Getting things back to normal will take some effort, but it's effort worth doing. Hal might disagree."
msgstr "그래. 정상으로 돌아가려면 노력이 좀 필요하겠지만, 할 가치가 있는 노력이야. 할은 동의하지 않을지도 모르지만."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_e2940_ZenaVoteTL01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Zena
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFZenaHield
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00C127EA
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral
#. DialogueBefore = Zena: I was hoping to talk to you about that.
#. EDID: [010275D8]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000713"
msgid "Hal said if the vote shook out this way, he wanted you to escort him out of here. "
msgstr "할은 투표가 이렇게 나오면 네가 자신을 여기서 호송해 주길 원한다고 했어. "

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_e2940_ZenaVoteTL01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Zena
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFZenaHield
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 000236A5
#. EDID: [010275D7]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000714"
msgid "And it makes sense. You're not from here. No one will resent you if you're the one who gives him peace."
msgstr "말이 되지. 넌 여기 사람이 아니니까. 네가 그에게 안식을 준다고 해서 아무도 널 원망하지 않을 거야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_e2940_ZenaVoteTL01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Zena
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFZenaHield
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00B67CF6
#. DialogueBefore = Zena: I was hoping to talk to you about that.
#. EDID: [010275D7]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000715"
msgid "Hal said if the vote shook out this way, he wanted you to be the one to do it. "
msgstr "할은 투표가 이렇게 나오면 네가 직접 해 주길 원한다고 했어. "

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_e2940_ZenaVoteGreet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Zena
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFZenaHield
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 002CBA36
#. EDID: [01027608]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000716"
msgid "Looks like I've got no choice but to see it through."
msgstr "끝까지 해내는 수밖에 없겠군."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_e2940_ZenaVoteGreet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Zena
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFZenaHield
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00D129C7
#. DialogueBefore = Zena: *Sigh* That was stressful.
#. EDID: [01027608]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000717"
msgid "There's going to be a lot of conversations in the coming days about how to repair things. "
msgstr "앞으로 며칠 동안 이 일을 어떻게 수습할지 많은 대화가 오갈 거야. "

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_e2920_ZenaVoteCarusoShot
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Sasha
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFSashaAtwell
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00284993
#. DialogueBefore = Sasha: What? Everyone stay here and watch the prisoner! I'm gonna check on Hal.
#. DialogueAfter = Caspian: He was my mentor. My friend! You don't deserve to live.
#. EDID: [01027611]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000718"
msgid "Shit. Caspian is right. Hal's dead."
msgstr "젠장. 캐스피언 말이 맞았습니다. 할이 죽었습니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_e2940_ZenaVoteGreet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Zena
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFZenaHield
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00DFE0E7
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueAfter = Zena: There's going to be a lot of conversations in the coming days about how to repair things.
#. EDID: [010275B7]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000719"
msgid "*Sigh* That was stressful."
msgstr "*한숨* 정말 스트레스였어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_e2910_ZenaVoteTally
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Zena
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFZenaHield
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 006EB9F8
#. ScriptNotes = Serious / to BallotBoxVotingMarkerThird
#. DialogueBefore = Zena: You can congratulate Hal or go back to your tents. But the decision is final.
#. EDID: [010275C1]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00071B"
msgid "I know this process hasn't been easy, but it's over now. "
msgstr "이 과정이 쉽지 않았다는 건 알지만, 이제 끝났어. "

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_e2920_ZenaVoteCarusoShot
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Sasha
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFSashaAtwell
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 008FA962
#. DialogueBefore = Sasha: Hands up asshole! You so much as move and I'm pulling the trigger! &&& ... &&& Caspian: No! You didn't! &&& Zena: Cass, get back here! &&& Caspian: He's dead. Hal's dead.
#. DialogueAfter = Zena: You better have a damn good explanation for why you shot this man.
#. EDID: [0102760A]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00071C"
msgid "What? Everyone stay here and watch the prisoner! I'm gonna check on Hal."
msgstr "네? 모두 여기 남아서 죄수를 지키십쇼! 전 할의 상태를 확인하러 가겠습니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_e2910_ZenaVoteTally
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Zena
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFZenaHield
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0088381F
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default, Caspian, Sasha, Ivica
#. DialogueBefore = Zena: The people of New Babylon have voted for execution. &&& Caspian: The hell we have!
#. DialogueAfter = Zena: You can congratulate Hal or go back to your tents. But the decision is final.
#. EDID: [010275CB]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00071D"
msgid "Hal Caruso's crimes will be forgiven, and he will be released from captivity."
msgstr "할 카루소의 죄는 용서되고, 그는 구금에서 풀려날 것입니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_e2910_ZenaVoteTally
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Zena
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFZenaHield
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00190D1C
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default, Caspian, Sasha, Ivica
#. DialogueBefore = Zena: The people of New Babylon have voted for exile. &&& Caspian: The hell we have!
#. DialogueAfter = Zena: You can congratulate Hal or go back to your tents. But the decision is final.
#. EDID: [010275CA]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00071E"
msgid "Hal Caruso will be given transport off-world. At which point he is permanently banished from this Outpost."
msgstr "할 카루소에게 외부 세계로 향하는 수송편이 제공될 것입니다. 그 시점부터 그는 이 전초기지에서 영구 추방됩니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_e2910_ZenaVoteTally
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Zena
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFZenaHield
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 009C3153
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default, Caspian, Sasha, Ivica
#. DialogueBefore = Zena: The people of New Babylon have voted for execution. &&& Caspian: The hell we have!
#. DialogueAfter = Zena: You can congratulate Hal or go back to your tents. But the decision is final.
#. EDID: [010275C9]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00071F"
msgid "Hal has asked to choose the manner of death. I will allow it."
msgstr "할은 죽음의 방식을 선택하게 해 달라고 요청했습니다. 허락하겠습니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_e2920_ZenaVoteCarusoShot
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Sasha
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFSashaAtwell
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0078DFDA
#. DialogueBefore = Sasha: Shit. Caspian is right. Hal's dead. &&& Caspian: He was my mentor. My friend! You don't deserve to live. &&& Zena: Cass, wait! &&& SunniKim: Holy shit.
#. DialogueAfter = Zena: Everyone, stand down! Sasha, escort Caspian to a holding cell, now!
#. EDID: [010275D4]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000720"
msgid "Goddamnit kid! What did you do?"
msgstr "빌어먹을! 야! 무슨 짓이야?"

