#. DialogueBefore = Zena: Citizens, if all the votes are in, I'll cast my vote and we'll begin the tally. &&& ... &&& Zena: It seems we have a tie. We've decided that in this event, the visitor, as a neutral party, will break the tie. &&& Sasha: Well, what's the verdict? &&& Zena: The people of New Babylon have voted for execution.
#. DialogueAfter = Zena: Hal has asked to choose the manner of death. I will allow it.
#. EDID: [01027620]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000721"
msgid "No shit..."
msgstr "말도 안 돼..."

