#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0068E8E7
#. ScriptNotes = / to BallotBoxVotingMarkerThird
#. DialogueBefore = Zena: It seems we have a tie. We've decided that in this event, the visitor, as a neutral party, will break the tie. &&& Sasha: Well, what's the verdict?
#. DialogueAfter = Sasha: *Gasps*
#. EDID: [01027614]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000726"
msgid "The people of New Babylon have voted to exonerate."
msgstr "뉴바빌론 사람들은 사면에 투표했습니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_e2910_ZenaVoteTally
