#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_e2910_ZenaVoteTally
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Zena
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFZenaHield
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00F19F4C
#. DialogueBefore = Zena: And for full transparency, I will be voting for an execution.
#. DialogueAfter = Zena: It seems we have a tie. We've decided that in this event, the visitor, as a neutral party, will break the tie.
#. EDID: [010275E6]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000755"
msgid "Now, to count the votes."
msgstr "이제 표를 세겠습니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_e2910_ZenaVoteTally
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Zena
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFZenaHield
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00F53B28
#. ScriptNotes = Serious / to BallotBoxVotingMarkerThird
#. DialogueBefore = Zena: Citizens, if all the votes are in, I'll cast my vote and we'll begin the tally.
#. DialogueAfter = Zena: What's wrong? Why are you interrupting me?
#. EDID: [010275AC]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000756"
msgid "Like all of you, I've given this a lot of thought, and done a lot of soul searching over this vote."
msgstr "여러분 모두와 마찬가지로, 저도 이 투표에 대해 깊이 생각했고 많은 자기 성찰을 했습니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_e2910_ZenaVoteTally
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Zena
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFZenaHield
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 003DF0B4
#. DialogueBefore = Zena: Like all of you, I've given this a lot of thought, and done a lot of soul searching over this vote.
#. DialogueAfter = Zena: What's wrong? Why are you interrupting me?
#. EDID: [010275D0]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000757"
msgid "And for full transparency, I will be voting for exile."
msgstr "그리고 완전한 투명성을 위해 말씀드리자면, 저는 추방에 투표하겠습니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_e2910_ZenaVoteTally
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Zena
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFZenaHield
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0074B9EF
#. DialogueBefore = Zena: Like all of you, I've given this a lot of thought, and done a lot of soul searching over this vote.
#. DialogueAfter = Zena: What's wrong? Why are you interrupting me?
#. EDID: [010275CF]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000758"
msgid "And for full transparency, I will be voting to exonerate."
msgstr "그리고 완전한 투명성을 위해 말씀드리자면, 저는 사면에 투표하겠습니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_e2910_ZenaVoteTally
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Zena
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFZenaHield
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00DC0728
#. DialogueBefore = Zena: Like all of you, I've given this a lot of thought, and done a lot of soul searching over this vote.
#. DialogueAfter = Zena: What's wrong? Why are you interrupting me?
#. EDID: [010275CE]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000759"
msgid "And for full transparency, I will be voting for an execution."
msgstr "그리고 완전한 투명성을 위해 말씀드리자면, 저는 처형에 투표하겠습니다."

#. List: 2
#. EDID: SFFL_MS01_SpeechChallenge_CaspianSharedInfo07
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00077E"
msgid "You have a point..."
msgstr "일리는 있어..."

#. List: 2
#. EDID: SFFL_MS01_SpeechChallenge_CaspianSharedInfo04
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00077F"
msgid "You're not wrong but..."
msgstr "네 말이 틀린 건 아니지만..."

#. List: 2
#. EDID: SFFL_MS01_SpeechChallenge_CaspianSharedInfo06
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000780"
msgid "I get it. But he killed him..."
msgstr "무슨 말인지는 알아. 하지만 그가 그를 죽였잖아..."

#. List: 2
#. EDID: SFFL_MS01_SpeechChallenge_CaspianSharedInfo05
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000781"
msgid "I know you're right but..."
msgstr "네 말이 맞다는 건 알지만..."

#. List: 2
#. EDID: SFFL_MS01_SpeechChallenge_CaspianSharedInfo02
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000782"
msgid "I hear what you're saying but..."
msgstr "네 말은 알겠지만..."

#. List: 2
#. EDID: SFFL_MS01_SpeechChallenge_CaspianSharedInfo03
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000783"
msgid "I don't know I... I can't think straight..."
msgstr "모르겠어, 나... 생각이 제대로 안 돼..."

#. List: 2
#. EDID: SFFL_MS01_SpeechChallenge_CaspianSharedInfo01
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000784"
msgid "I... I don't know..."
msgstr "나... 모르겠어..."

#. List: 2
#. EDID: [01027C75]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000785"
msgid "This isn't what Hal would want."
msgstr "이건 할이 원할 일이 아니야."

#. List: 2
#. EDID: [01027CE4]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000786"
msgid "Don't give me that shit. You didn't know him."
msgstr "그딴 소리 하지 마. 넌 그를 몰랐어."

#. List: 2
#. EDID: [01027CDA]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000787"
msgid "Seems like it'd solve a whole lot from where I'm standing!"
msgstr "내가 보기엔 많은 걸 해결할 것 같은데!"

#. List: 2
#. EDID: [01027C64]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000788"
msgid "Killing him won't solve anything."
msgstr "그를 죽여도 아무것도 해결되지 않아."

#. List: 2
#. EDID: [01027CE9]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000789"
msgid "Bernhard deserved a chance at revenge."
msgstr "버나드는 복수할 기회를 받을 자격이 있었어."

#. List: 2
#. EDID: [01027D10]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00078A"
msgid "Yeah? Well so do I."
msgstr "그래? 나도 마찬가지야."

#. List: 2
#. EDID: [01027CCD]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00078B"
msgid "Do this and you'll regret it for the rest of your life."
msgstr "이렇게 하면 평생 후회할 거야."

#. List: 2
#. EDID: [01027D09]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00078C"
msgid "I'm gonna regret letting him get away with murder if you don't stand aside."
msgstr "네가 비켜서지 않으면, 그가 살인을 저지르고도 빠져나가게 둔 걸 후회하게 될 거야."

#. List: 2
#. EDID: [01027CF5]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00078D"
msgid "Not before I kill him first."
msgstr "그 전에 내가 먼저 그를 죽일 거야."

#. List: 2
#. EDID: [01027CF0]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00078E"
msgid "If you don't put that gun away I'll be forced to stop you."
msgstr "그 총을 내려놓지 않으면 널 막을 수밖에 없어."

#. List: 2
#. EDID: [01027D58]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00078F"
msgid "Let him go to jail. Give him a trial. But you kill him, there's no going back."
msgstr "그를 감옥에 보내. 재판을 받게 해. 하지만 네가 그를 죽이면 되돌릴 수 없어."

#. List: 2
#. EDID: [01027D60]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000790"
msgid "So he can go free a week later? No, he dies now."
msgstr "그래서 일주일 뒤에 풀려나라고? 안 돼, 그는 지금 죽어야 해."

#. List: 2
#. EDID: [01027D77]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000791"
msgid "This isn't right."
msgstr "이건 옳지 않아."

#. List: 2
#. EDID: [01027D76]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000792"
msgid "You're a fool if you do this."
msgstr "이렇게 하면 넌 바보야."

#. List: 2
#. EDID: [01027D75]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000793"
msgid "You're making a big mistake."
msgstr "넌 큰 실수를 하고 있어."

#. List: 2
#. EDID: [01027D74]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000794"
msgid "This isn't who you are."
msgstr "이건 네 모습이 아니야."

#. List: 2
#. EDID: [01027D8B]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000795"
msgid "I don't care!"
msgstr "상관없어!"

#. List: 2
#. EDID: [01027D8A]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000796"
msgid "Just let me do this!"
msgstr "그냥 내가 하게 둬!"

#. List: 2
#. EDID: [01027D89]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000797"
msgid "No... you're wrong."
msgstr "아니... 넌 틀렸어."

#. List: 2
#. EDID: [01027D84]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000798"
msgid "Hal would've been executed anyway. This just sped up the process."
msgstr "할은 어차피 처형됐을 거야. 이건 과정을 앞당긴 것뿐이야."

#. List: 2
#. EDID: [01027D72]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000799"
msgid "You're wrong! There's no way the people here would've voted to kill him!"
msgstr "틀렸어! 여기 사람들이 그를 죽이라고 투표했을 리 없어!"

#. List: 2
#. EDID: [01027D7C]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00079A"
msgid "You have too many roots here. Don't spoil what this outpost has become."
msgstr "넌 여기에 너무 많은 뿌리를 내렸어. 이 전초기지가 이룬 걸 망치지 마."

#. List: 2
#. EDID: [01027D6D]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00079B"
msgid "I don't care anymore. No one here has ever given me respect, save Hal."
msgstr "이젠 상관없어. 여기서 나를 존중해 준 사람은 할 말고는 아무도 없었어."

#. List: 2
#. EDID: [01027D83]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00079C"
msgid "I'm not throwing MY life away. I'm taking his."
msgstr "내 삶을 버리는 게 아니야. 그의 목숨을 가져가는 거야."

#. List: 2
#. EDID: [01027D50]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00079D"
