msgid "Why did you come to this outpost?"
msgstr "이 전초기지에 온 이유가 뭔가요?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_AudioSlates
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_AudioSlates_Shinar03
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Non-Actor Track
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFSheilaCostas
#. Face = Stern
#. SoundFileID = 00F519DA
#. DialogueBefore = Non-Actor Track: I recognize that outside of a miracle, this is likely my last will and testament.
#. EDID: [01027DDC]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0007B3"
msgid "There is only one choice left. The others are already discussing how to do it."
msgstr "남은 선택은 단 하나뿐이다. 다른 사람들은 이미 어떻게 할지 논의하고 있다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_AudioSlates
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_AudioSlates_Shinar03
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Non-Actor Track
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFSheilaCostas
#. Face = Stern
#. SoundFileID = 00A5B3D4
#. DialogueBefore = Non-Actor Track: Dehydration symptoms have started to set in for all of us. Fatigue, dizziness...
#. DialogueAfter = Non-Actor Track: There is only one choice left. The others are already discussing how to do it.
#. EDID: [01027DCF]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0007B4"
msgid "I recognize that outside of a miracle, this is likely my last will and testament."
msgstr "기적이 일어나지 않는 한, 이게 내 마지막 유언장이 될 것 같다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_AudioSlates
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_AudioSlates_Shinar03
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Non-Actor Track
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFSheilaCostas
#. Face = Stern
#. SoundFileID = 0096FC78
#. DialogueBefore = Non-Actor Track: It's been three days since we were left for dead. A few went out in search of food and water, but haven't returned.
#. DialogueAfter = Non-Actor Track: I recognize that outside of a miracle, this is likely my last will and testament.
#. EDID: [01027DD9]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0007B5"
msgid "Dehydration symptoms have started to set in for all of us. Fatigue, dizziness..."
msgstr "모두에게 탈수 증상이 나타나기 시작했다. 피곤하고, 어지럽고..."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_AudioSlates
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_AudioSlates_Shinar03
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Non-Actor Track
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFSheilaCostas
#. Face = Stern
#. SoundFileID = 009C1F92
#. DialogueAfter = Non-Actor Track: Dehydration symptoms have started to set in for all of us. Fatigue, dizziness...
#. EDID: [01027DD6]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0007B6"
msgid "It's been three days since we were left for dead. A few went out in search of food and water, but haven't returned."
msgstr "사지로 내몰린 지 3일이 지났다. 몇 명이 식량과 물을 찾아 나섰지만, 돌아오지 못했다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_AudioSlates
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_AudioSlates_Shinar02
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Non-Actor Track
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMBernhardKleiber
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 009AA3F0
#. DialogueAfter = Non-Actor Track: It's Caruso. He's taken everything. The ship, our supplies...
#. EDID: [01027DDE]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0007B7"
msgid "What's happening? What's wrong?"
msgstr "무슨 일이야? 문제가 생겼어?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_AudioSlates
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_AudioSlates_Shinar02
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Non-Actor Track
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMBernhardKleiber
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00FB87B3
#. DialogueBefore = Non-Actor Track: Don't you see? There is no way out from this.
#. EDID: [01027DC8]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0007B8"
msgid "No. We will find a way to survive. Trust me. We will."
msgstr "아니야. 살아남을 방법을 찾을 수 있을 거야. 날 믿어. 우린 해낼 수 있어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_AudioSlates
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_AudioSlates_Shinar02
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Non-Actor Track
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFSheilaCostas
#. Face = Stern
#. SoundFileID = 00F00228
#. ScriptNotes = She's talking about taking their lives in a peaceful manner without dying from starvation/water deprivation
#. DialogueBefore = Non-Actor Track: We won't get a re-supply in time. He waited until we restocked before making his move.
#. DialogueAfter = Non-Actor Track: No. We will find a way to survive. Trust me. We will.
#. EDID: [01027DBF]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0007B9"
msgid "Don't you see? There is no way out from this."
msgstr "아직도 모르겠어? 해결할 수 있는 방법이 없다고."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_AudioSlates
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_AudioSlates_Shinar02
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Non-Actor Track
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFSheilaCostas
#. Face = Stern
#. SoundFileID = 002C00C8
#. DialogueBefore = Non-Actor Track: When is the next supply run? Home base will notice if we don't check in.
#. DialogueAfter = Non-Actor Track: Don't you see? There is no way out from this.
#. EDID: [01027DE5]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0007BA"
msgid "We won't get a re-supply in time. He waited until we restocked before making his move."
msgstr "제때 보급이 오지 못할 거야. 카루소는 우리가 보급품을 다시 채울 때까지 기다렸다가 훔쳐 간 거라고."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_AudioSlates
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_AudioSlates_Shinar02
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Non-Actor Track
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMBernhardKleiber
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00E7DE8E
#. DialogueBefore = Non-Actor Track: It's gone, Bernhard. All of it.
#. DialogueAfter = Non-Actor Track: We won't get a re-supply in time. He waited until we restocked before making his move.
#. EDID: [01027DE2]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0007BB"
msgid "When is the next supply run? Home base will notice if we don't check in."
msgstr "다음 보급선은 언제 오지? 우리가 연락하지 않으면 본진에서 알아챌 거야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_AudioSlates
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_AudioSlates_Shinar02
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Non-Actor Track
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFSheilaCostas
#. Face = Stern
#. SoundFileID = 0047BA61
#. DialogueBefore = Non-Actor Track: What about the food storage? The water?
#. DialogueAfter = Non-Actor Track: When is the next supply run? Home base will notice if we don't check in.
#. EDID: [01027DCD]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0007BC"
msgid "It's gone, Bernhard. All of it."
msgstr "사라졌어. 버나드. 전부 다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_AudioSlates
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_AudioSlates_Shinar02
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Non-Actor Track
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMBernhardKleiber
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 008D36B8
#. DialogueBefore = Non-Actor Track: It's Caruso. He's taken everything. The ship, our supplies...
#. DialogueAfter = Non-Actor Track: It's gone, Bernhard. All of it.
#. EDID: [01027DC6]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0007BD"
msgid "What about the food storage? The water?"
msgstr "식량 저장고는? 물은?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_AudioSlates
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_AudioSlates_Shinar02
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Non-Actor Track
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFSheilaCostas
#. Face = Stern
#. SoundFileID = 00F9096D
