#. DialogueAfter = Non-Actor Track: What about the food storage? The water?
#. EDID: [01027DCA]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0007BE"
msgid "It's Caruso. He's taken everything. The ship, our supplies..."
msgstr "카루소 짓이야. 그 새끼가 다 가져갔어. 우주선도, 우리 보급품도..."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_AudioSlates
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_AudioSlates_Shinar01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Non-Actor Track
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMBernhardKleiber
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0059CFD8
#. DialogueBefore = Non-Actor Track: At the very least, we should lock him up, treat him like a prisoner.
#. EDID: [01027DE1]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0007BF"
msgid "Well, you'll have to take it up with the group. But I think you're overreacting."
msgstr "글쎄, 그건 주민들과 상의해 봐야 할 거 같아. 근데 과민 반응하는 것 같은데."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_AudioSlates
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_AudioSlates_Shinar01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Non-Actor Track
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFSheilaCostas
#. Face = Stern
#. SoundFileID = 0016FF2F
#. DialogueBefore = Non-Actor Track: Relax. Even if you're right, the man can barely stand. He's no threat to the outpost.
#. DialogueAfter = Non-Actor Track: Well, you'll have to take it up with the group. But I think you're overreacting.
#. EDID: [01027DDF]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0007C0"
msgid "At the very least, we should lock him up, treat him like a prisoner."
msgstr "최소한 그 남자를 가둬두고 죄수처럼 감시해야 해."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_AudioSlates
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_AudioSlates_Shinar01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Non-Actor Track
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMBernhardKleiber
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00A38033
