#. DialogueAfter = Non-Actor Track: At the very least, we should lock him up, treat him like a prisoner.
#. EDID: [01027DC0]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0007C1"
msgid "Relax. Even if you're right, the man can barely stand. He's no threat to the outpost."
msgstr "진정해. 설령 당신 말이 맞더라도 그 남자는 지금 제대로 서 있지도 못해. 우리 전초기지에 위협이 될 인간은 아니라고."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_AudioSlates
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_AudioSlates_Shinar01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Non-Actor Track
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFSheilaCostas
#. Face = Stern
#. SoundFileID = 001193A8
#. DialogueBefore = Non-Actor Track: You think he's a smuggler?
#. DialogueAfter = Non-Actor Track: Relax. Even if you're right, the man can barely stand. He's no threat to the outpost.
#. EDID: [01027DD7]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0007C2"
msgid "I think he's worse. "
msgstr "그보다 더한 사람이라고 봐. "

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_AudioSlates
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_AudioSlates_Shinar01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Non-Actor Track
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFSheilaCostas
#. Face = Stern
#. SoundFileID = 0022E38F
#. DialogueBefore = Non-Actor Track: I mean, his ship didn't look like it was built for trade.
#. DialogueAfter = Non-Actor Track: You think he's a smuggler?
#. EDID: [01027DE0]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0007C3"
msgid "And some of the details of his story don't add up. "
msgstr "그리고 그 사람이 했던 말도 앞뒤가 안 맞는 부분이 있고. "

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_AudioSlates
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_AudioSlates_Shinar01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Non-Actor Track
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMBernhardKleiber
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00F756CD
#. DialogueBefore = Non-Actor Track: And some of the details of his story don't add up.
#. DialogueAfter = Non-Actor Track: I think he's worse.
#. EDID: [01027DCB]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0007C4"
msgid "You think he's a smuggler?"
msgstr "그 남자가 밀수꾼이라고 생각하는 거야?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_AudioSlates
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_AudioSlates_Shinar01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Non-Actor Track
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFSheilaCostas
#. Face = Stern
#. SoundFileID = 0056AE68
#. DialogueBefore = Non-Actor Track: Quiet man, hard worker. Keeps to himself mostly.
#. DialogueAfter = Non-Actor Track: And some of the details of his story don't add up.
#. EDID: [01027DD3]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0007C5"
msgid "I mean, his ship didn't look like it was built for trade."
msgstr "내 말은, 그 사람 우주선은 무역용으로 만들어진 것 같지 않았단 말이야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_AudioSlates
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_AudioSlates_Shinar01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Non-Actor Track
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMBernhardKleiber
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00F02BA0
#. DialogueBefore = Non-Actor Track: What do you think about this refugee, Caruso?
#. DialogueAfter = Non-Actor Track: I mean, his ship didn't look like it was built for trade.
#. EDID: [01027DD0]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0007C6"
msgid "Quiet man, hard worker. Keeps to himself mostly."
msgstr "과묵하고, 성실하던데. 주로 자기 일에만 집중하면서 있는 편이고."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_AudioSlates
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_AudioSlates_Shinar01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Non-Actor Track
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFSheilaCostas
#. Face = Stern
#. SoundFileID = 00FF1B36
#. DialogueAfter = Non-Actor Track: Quiet man, hard worker. Keeps to himself mostly.
#. EDID: [01027DC4]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0007C7"
msgid "What do you think about this refugee, Caruso?"
msgstr "그 피난민 있잖아. 카루소란 남자에 대해 어떻게 생각해?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_AudioSlates
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_AudioSlates_Chunks02
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = AUDIOONLY
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFAnnouncer
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00DACB8E
#. DialogueBefore = Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): For the Chunk is now part of you, and you are the Chunk.
#. EDID: [01027E1E]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0007C8"
msgid "Just as we are all made of stars, we are all made of Chunks."
msgstr "우리 모두가 별로 이루어졌듯, 우리 모두는 청크로 이루어져 있다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_AudioSlates
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_AudioSlates_Chunks02
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = AUDIOONLY
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFAnnouncer
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0022AF1A
#. DialogueBefore = Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): Really, it's your favorite food. It's comfort for your soul.
#. DialogueAfter = Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): For the Chunk is now part of you, and you are the Chunk.
#. EDID: [01027E18]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0007C9"
msgid "You lie down on the Chunk of not pork, and find yourself in perfect harmony with the universe. "
msgstr "너는 돼지고기가 아닌 청크 위에 눕고, 우주와 완벽한 조화를 이루는 자신을 발견한다. "

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_AudioSlates
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_AudioSlates_Chunks02
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = AUDIOONLY
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFAnnouncer
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 003ED4A8
#. DialogueBefore = Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): You lie down on the Chunk of not pork, and find yourself in perfect harmony with the universe.
#. DialogueAfter = Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): Just as we are all made of stars, we are all made of Chunks.
#. EDID: [01027E1B]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0007CA"
msgid "For the Chunk is now part of you, and you are the Chunk. "
msgstr "청크는 이제 너의 일부이고, 너는 청크이기 때문이다. "

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_AudioSlates
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_AudioSlates_Chunks02
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = AUDIOONLY
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFAnnouncer
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00B8B200
#. DialogueBefore = Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): You drop to your knees. You take a bite of the ground. It's familiar, and soothing. It's pork. But if you dislike pork, it's not that.
#. DialogueAfter = Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): You lie down on the Chunk of not pork, and find yourself in perfect harmony with the universe.
#. EDID: [01027E15]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0007CB"
msgid "Really, it's your favorite food. It's comfort for your soul. "
msgstr "사실, 그것은 네가 가장 좋아하는 음식이다. 영혼을 달래 주는 위안이지. "

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_AudioSlates
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_AudioSlates_Chunks02
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = AUDIOONLY
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFAnnouncer
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00F9EF08
#. DialogueBefore = Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): Here in this zero space, your mind is clear. You notice you are standing on something. A cube. No, not a cube, a Chunk.
#. DialogueAfter = Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): Really, it's your favorite food. It's comfort for your soul.
#. EDID: [01027E13]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0007CC"
msgid "You drop to your knees. You take a bite of the ground. It's familiar, and soothing. It's pork. But if you dislike pork, it's not that. "
msgstr "너는 무릎을 꿇는다. 땅을 한 입 베어 문다. 익숙하고, 편안하다. 돼지고기다. 하지만 돼지고기를 싫어한다면, 그건 아니다. "

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_AudioSlates
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_AudioSlates_Chunks02
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = AUDIOONLY
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFAnnouncer
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 006DE0A1
#. DialogueBefore = Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): In life, we find it hard to be present. But presently, you are here. Uncluttered. Unobstructed. Unbothered.
#. DialogueAfter = Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): You drop to your knees. You take a bite of the ground. It's familiar, and soothing. It's pork. But if you dislike pork, it's not that.
#. EDID: [01027E11]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0007CD"
msgid "Here in this zero space, your mind is clear. You notice you are standing on something. A cube. No, not a cube, a Chunk."
msgstr "이 무의 공간에서 네 정신은 맑다. 네가 무언가 위에 서 있음을 알아차린다. 정육면체. 아니, 정육면체가 아니라 청크다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_AudioSlates
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_AudioSlates_Chunks02
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = AUDIOONLY
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFAnnouncer
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00051CAE
#. DialogueBefore = Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): Welcome back.
#. DialogueAfter = Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): Here in this zero space, your mind is clear. You notice you are standing on something. A cube. No, not a cube, a Chunk.
#. EDID: [01027E0F]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0007CE"
msgid "In life, we find it hard to be present. But presently, you are here. Uncluttered. Unobstructed. Unbothered. "
msgstr "삶 속에서 우리는 현재에 머무르기 어려워한다. 하지만 지금, 너는 여기에 있다. 어수선함 없이. 가로막힘 없이. 흔들림 없이. "

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_AudioSlates
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_AudioSlates_Chunks02
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = AUDIOONLY
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFAnnouncer
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 000BC8E6
#. DialogueAfter = Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): In life, we find it hard to be present. But presently, you are here. Uncluttered. Unobstructed. Unbothered.
#. EDID: [01027E26]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0007CF"
msgid "Welcome back."
msgstr "돌아온 걸 환영해."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_MiscDialogue
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMYeats
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMYeats
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 009E565A
#. EDID: [01027D05]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0007D0"
msgid "Bertrand Russell had it right. There are two kinds of morality. The one we preach but seldom practice, and the one we practice but seldom preach."
msgstr "버트런드 러셀의 말이 맞았다. 도덕에는 두 종류가 있다. 우리가 설교하지만 좀처럼 실천하지 않는 도덕, 그리고 우리가 실천하지만 좀처럼 설교하지 않는 도덕."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_MiscDialogue
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMYeats
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMYeats
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0055CA6C
#. EDID: [01027D04]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0007D1"
msgid "The community center will be a place of communion and healing."
msgstr "주민 센터는 교류와 치유의 장소가 될 거야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_MiscDialogue
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMYeats
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMYeats
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 009432A3
#. EDID: [01027D03]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0007D2"
msgid "They say when life lacks meaning, you seek out its pleasures, however cheap."
msgstr "삶에 의미가 없으면, 사람은 아무리 값싼 것이라도 쾌락을 찾는다고들 하지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_MiscDialogue
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMBernhardKleiber
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMBernhardKleiber
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00E7134C
#. EDID: [01027DD8]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0007D3"
msgid "I try to keep myself hydrated. Even a dry mouth can trigger old memories."
msgstr "수분 보충에 신경 쓰고 있어. 입이 마르는 것만으로도 옛 기억이 떠오르거든."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_MiscDialogue
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCFGraceKim
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFGraceKim
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0059A3E6
#. EDID: [01027C5D]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0007D4"
msgid "Stay safe."
msgstr "조심히 지내."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_MiscDialogue
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCFGraceKim
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFGraceKim
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 009780E1
#. EDID: [01027C5C]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0007D5"
msgid "Goodbye."
msgstr "잘 가."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_MiscDialogue
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCFZenaHield
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFZenaHield
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00EDB567
#. EDID: [01027B76]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0007D6"
msgid "I hope you enjoy the rest of your time here."
msgstr "여기서 좋은 시간 보냈으면 좋겠군."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_MiscDialogue
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCFZenaHield
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFZenaHield
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00E18A5F
#. EDID: [01027B75]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0007D7"
msgid "Take care."
msgstr "몸조심해."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_MiscDialogue
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCFZenaHield
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFZenaHield
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 005C8124
#. EDID: [01027B74]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0007D8"
msgid "Goodbye."
msgstr "잘 가."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_MiscDialogue
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_HelpWanted_030_TopLevel02
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Bernhard
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMBernhardKleiber
#. Face = Depressed
#. SoundFileID = 008FD6CC
#. ScriptNotes = Depressed
#. DialogueBefore = Bernhard: It was luck. I never said what kind.
#. DialogueAfter = Bernhard: Shinar was a research outpost built out in the far reaches of space.
#. EDID: [01021679]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0007D9"
msgid "Now I must live with my actions. All because we chose to help a stranger."
msgstr "결국 내가 저지른 짓이니 내가 안고 살아야지. 다 낯선 놈 도와주려다가 이 지경이 된 거야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_MiscDialogue
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_HelpWanted_020_TopLevel01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Bernhard
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMBernhardKleiber
#. Face = Angry
#. SoundFileID = 0047C180
#. ScriptNotes = Angry / to Player Default
#. Prompt = They know nothing.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: They know nothing.
#. DialogueAfter = Bernhard: I did not survive the Tragedy of Shinar just to forget its lessons.
#. EDID: [01021609]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0007DA"
msgid "And they learn nothing. I should know."
msgstr "그리고 사람들은 거기서 깨닫는 것도 없어. 내가 직접 겪어봐서 잘 알지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_MiscDialogue
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_HelpWanted_050_SunniTL01
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00DB23FF
#. DialogueAfter = Sunni: Kicking and screaming basically.
#. EDID: [01027680]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0007DB"
msgid "How did you come to this outpost?"
msgstr "이 전초기지에는 어떻게 오게 되셨나요?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_MiscDialogue
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_HelpWanted_050_SunniTL01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Sunni
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFSunniKim
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00474BD2
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. EDID: [01027685]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0007DC"
msgid "Jokes on them, now I shovel shit for a living! Ha-ha-ha! Kill me."
msgstr "부모님 뜻대로 된 셈이죠. 지금은 먹고살려고 진짜 똥이나 푸고 있으니까요! 하하하! 진짜 죽고 싶네요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_MiscDialogue
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_HelpWanted_050_SunniTL01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Sunni
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFSunniKim
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0026A280
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. EDID: [01027685]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0007DD"
msgid "My parents forced me to come here and live with my sis after I got into some shit back in Neon."
msgstr "제가 네온에서 사고를 쳐서, 부모님이 언니랑 같이 여기에서 살라고 강제로 보내버렸거든요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_MiscDialogue
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_HelpWanted_050_SunniTL01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Sunni
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFSunniKim
#. Face = Disgust
#. SoundFileID = 00D996DF
#. ScriptNotes = Disgust / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: How did you come to this outpost?
#. EDID: [01027685]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0007DE"
msgid "Kicking and screaming basically."
msgstr "사실상 발버둥 치고 소리 지르면서 끌려왔죠."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_MiscDialogue
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_HelpWanted_050_ZenaTL02
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 006A35B8
#. DialogueAfter = Zena: It's human nature. People have been settling unknown lands since we were living in caves.
#. EDID: [0102767D]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0007DF"
msgid "Why settle all the way out here?"
msgstr "왜 하필 이렇게 먼 곳에 정착지를 만든 건가요?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_MiscDialogue
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_HelpWanted_050_ZenaTL02
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Zena
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFZenaHield
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00EC23AA
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. EDID: [01027687]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0007E0"
msgid "And just like the Earth, it will take centuries to uncover this land's secrets. "
msgstr "그리고 지구의 역사가 그랬던 것처럼, 이 땅의 비밀이 밝혀지려면 수 세기가 걸릴 거예요. "

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_MiscDialogue
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_HelpWanted_050_ZenaTL02
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Zena
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFZenaHield
#. Face = Disgust
#. SoundFileID = 00F8B622
#. ScriptNotes = Disgust / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Why settle all the way out here?
#. EDID: [01027687]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0007E1"
msgid "It's human nature. People have been settling unknown lands since we were living in caves."
msgstr "그게 인간의 본성이니까요. 인류는 동굴에 살던 시절부터 줄곧 미지의 땅을 개척했잖아요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_MiscDialogue
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_HelpWanted_050_ZenaTL01
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00F5E68A
#. DialogueAfter = Zena: I was part of the original group of settlers who came here decades ago.
#. EDID: [01027686]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0007E2"
msgid "How did you become leader of New Babylon?"
msgstr "어떻게 뉴바빌론의 촌장이 되신 건가요?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_MiscDialogue
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_HelpWanted_050_ZenaTL01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Zena
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFZenaHield
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00FD9566
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. EDID: [01027682]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0007E3"
msgid "These days, there's only a handful of us left, and we're just trying to get by."
msgstr "요즘은 주민도 몇 명 안 남아서, 그저 하루하루 어떻게든 버텨내려고 애쓰는 중이에요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_MiscDialogue
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_HelpWanted_050_ZenaTL01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Zena
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFZenaHield
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00C4DC6C
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. EDID: [01027682]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0007E4"
msgid "Those lofty goals died with the passing of our former leader, and the exodus that followed. "
msgstr "그 원대한 목표는 전임 촌장님이 돌아가시고, 그 뒤를 이어 주민들이 대거 이탈하면서 전부 수포로 돌아갔어요. "

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_MiscDialogue
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_HelpWanted_050_ZenaTL01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Zena
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFZenaHield
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00F6D2EB
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. EDID: [01027682]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0007E5"
msgid "We worked with L.I.S.T. to find a planet that we could transform into a thriving city."
msgstr "LIST와 함께 힘을 합쳐 번성하는 도시로 키울 수 있을 행성을 찾으려고 했죠."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_MiscDialogue
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_HelpWanted_050_ZenaTL01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Zena
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFZenaHield
#. Face = Disgust
#. SoundFileID = 00C43BF5
#. ScriptNotes = Disgust / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: How did you become leader of New Babylon?
#. EDID: [01027682]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0007E6"
msgid "I was part of the original group of settlers who came here decades ago."
msgstr "전 수십 년 전에 이곳으로 이주해 온 초기 정착민이에요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_MiscDialogue
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_HelpWanted_050_CaspianTL02
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Caspian
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMCaspianRoberson
#. Face = Angry
#. SoundFileID = 003956A4
#. ScriptNotes = Zay-na. / Angry / to Player Default
#. EDID: [010276C9]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0007E7"
msgid "Which is stupid. I've been here longer than anyone except Zena. They should show some respect."
msgstr "말도 안 되는 소리죠. 제나 씨를 빼면 제가 여기서 제일 오래 살았단 말이에요. 다들 저를 좀 존중해 줘야 해요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_MiscDialogue
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_HelpWanted_050_CaspianTL02
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Caspian
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMCaspianRoberson
#. Face = Disgust
#. SoundFileID = 00CD669D
#. ScriptNotes = Disgust / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Do people treat you differently because of being born here?
#. EDID: [010276C9]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0007E8"
msgid "What, like I'm a miracle baby? Nah, it's the opposite. Everyone here thinks I'm hopeless."
msgstr "왜요? 무슨 기적의 아이처럼 대하냐고요? 아뇨, 정반대예요. 여기 사람들은 다들 저보고 답이 없다고 생각하거든요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_MiscDialogue
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_HelpWanted_050_CaspianTL02
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00C1917D
#. DialogueAfter = Caspian: What, like I'm a miracle baby? Nah, it's the opposite. Everyone here thinks I'm hopeless.
#. EDID: [010276F2]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0007E9"
msgid "Do people treat you differently because of being born here?"
msgstr "주민들은 이곳에서 태어난 당신을 뭔가 다르게 대하나요?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_MiscDialogue
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_HelpWanted_050_CaspianTL01
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 008A10D0
#. DialogueAfter = Caspian: When I was born.
#. EDID: [010276E3]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0007EA"
msgid "When did you come to this outpost?"
msgstr "이 전초기지에 언제 오셨나요?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_MiscDialogue
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_HelpWanted_050_CaspianTL01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Caspian
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMCaspianRoberson
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 005B2443
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. EDID: [010276C4]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0007EB"
msgid "I know Grace is looking into some of the reasons why, but, so far no results."
msgstr "그레이스 씨가 왜 그런지 이유를 조사하는 걸로 아는데, 아직까지는 아무 결과도 안 나왔네요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_MiscDialogue
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_HelpWanted_050_CaspianTL01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Caspian
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMCaspianRoberson
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 001E53DD
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. EDID: [010276C4]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0007EC"
msgid "You're looking at the only naturally born citizen of New Babylon. Problem is, there hasn't been one since."
msgstr ""
"지금 보고 계신 제가 뉴바빌론에서 자연적으로 태어난 유일한 주민이에요. 문제는 그 이후로 새로 태어난 아이가 단 한 명도 없다는 거죠."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_MiscDialogue
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_HelpWanted_050_CaspianTL01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Caspian
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMCaspianRoberson
#. Face = Disgust
#. SoundFileID = 00081EDB
#. ScriptNotes = Disgust / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: When did you come to this outpost?
#. EDID: [010276C4]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0007ED"
msgid "When I was born."
msgstr "전 여기서 태어났어요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_MiscDialogue
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_HelpWanted_050_GraceTL01
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00CDB54A
#. DialogueAfter = Grace: I've come here on a research grant. Settlers living on the fringes provide a lot of interesting data.
#. EDID: [010276C6]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0007EE"
msgid "Why did you come to this outpost?"
msgstr "이 전초기지에 온 이유가 뭔가요?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_MiscDialogue
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_HelpWanted_050_GraceTL01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Grace
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFGraceKim
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0076C668
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. EDID: [010276C5]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0007EF"
msgid "In exchange, I provide medical services for the group."
msgstr "그 대가로, 저는 이 정착지 분들에게 의료 서비스를 제공해 드리고 있답니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_MiscDialogue
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_HelpWanted_050_GraceTL01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Grace
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFGraceKim
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 009B1F94
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. EDID: [010276C5]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0007F0"
msgid "How does the gravity, weather, and nutrients found in alien environments affect the human body over time?"
msgstr "외계 환경에서 발견되는 중력, 날씨, 영양소들이 시간이 흐름에 따라 인간의 신체에 어떤 영향을 미치는지 연구한다고 하면 될까요?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_MiscDialogue
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_HelpWanted_050_GraceTL01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Grace
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFGraceKim
#. Face = Disgust
#. SoundFileID = 00CC359C
#. ScriptNotes = Disgust / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Why did you come to this outpost?
#. EDID: [010276C5]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0007F1"
msgid "I've come here on a research grant. Settlers living on the fringes provide a lot of interesting data."
msgstr "연구 보조금을 받아서 오게 되었어요. 변방에 사는 정착민들은 흥미로운 데이터를 아주 많이 제공해 주거든요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_MiscDialogue
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_HelpWanted_050_ZenaGreet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Zena
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFZenaHield
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00BFAB5C
#. DialogueBefore = Zena: Well, if you ever consider staying long term, we can have that conversation in the near future.
#. EDID: [01027B6C]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0007F2"
msgid "Regardless, I hope you enjoy your stay, however long or short."
msgstr "어쨌든 잠시 계시든 오래 계시든, 머무시는 동안 즐거운 시간 보내셨으면 좋겠네요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_MiscDialogue
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_HelpWanted_050_ZenaGreet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Zena
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFZenaHield
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 007B2C04
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = How does one become a citizen?
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: How does one become a citizen?
#. DialogueAfter = Zena: I'm just passing through.
#. EDID: [01027B65]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0007F3"
msgid "There is a vetting process, and eventually a vote. But for now, feel free to walk around and get to know the people here."
msgstr "심사 과정도 거쳐야 하고, 최종적으로 주민 투표도 해야 돼요. 하지만 지금은 편하게 둘러보면서 여기 사람들과 인사나 나눠보세요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_MiscDialogue
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_HelpWanted_050_ZenaGreet
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Zena
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00AF4206
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Zena: It's always nice to have visitors to New Babylon. My name is Zena. I'm what amounts to a mayor around these parts.|Do you plan on staying long term? We're always looking for new citizens.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: There is a vetting process, and eventually a vote. But for now, feel free to walk around and get to know the people here.
#. EDID: [01027B77]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0007F4"
msgid "How does one become a citizen?"
msgstr "주민이 되려면 어떻게 해야 하나요?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_MiscDialogue
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_HelpWanted_050_ZenaGreet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Zena
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFZenaHield
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0041C074
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = I would love to be here long term.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I would love to be here long term.
#. DialogueAfter = Zena: Regardless, I hope you enjoy your stay, however long or short.
#. EDID: [01027B66]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0007F5"
msgid "Excellent. If it turns out that you're qualified, we could always use additional hands."
msgstr "아주 좋네요. 자격만 된다면, 저희야 언제든 새 일손을 환영하거든요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_MiscDialogue
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_HelpWanted_050_ZenaGreet
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Zena
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0050A52D
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Zena: It's always nice to have visitors to New Babylon. My name is Zena. I'm what amounts to a mayor around these parts.|Do you plan on staying long term? We're always looking for new citizens.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Excellent. If it turns out that you're qualified, we could always use additional hands.
#. EDID: [01027B68]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0007F6"
msgid "I would love to be here long term."
msgstr "이곳에 장기 체류하고 싶어요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_MiscDialogue
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_HelpWanted_050_ZenaGreet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Zena
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFZenaHield
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00E5C2E6
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = I'm here for Hal Caruso.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I'm here for Hal Caruso.
#. DialogueAfter = Zena: Regardless, I hope you enjoy your stay, however long or short.
#. EDID: [01027B6D]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0007F7"
msgid "Well, that bodes well. Hal's one of our newest and most productive citizens."
msgstr "음, 그거 잘 됐네요. 할은 주민들 중에서 들어온 지 얼마 안 된 신참이지만, 일 하나는 기가 막히게 잘하거든요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_MiscDialogue
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_HelpWanted_050_ZenaGreet
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Zena
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00869F94
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Zena: It's always nice to have visitors to New Babylon. My name is Zena. I'm what amounts to a mayor around these parts.|Do you plan on staying long term? We're always looking for new citizens.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Well, that bodes well. Hal's one of our newest and most productive citizens.
#. EDID: [01027B6E]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0007F8"
msgid "I'm here for Hal Caruso."
msgstr "할 카루소를 찾으러 왔습니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_MiscDialogue
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_HelpWanted_050_ZenaGreet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCFZenaHield
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFZenaHield
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00C358DF
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = I'm just passing through.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I'm just passing through.
#. DialogueAfter = Zena: Regardless, I hope you enjoy your stay, however long or short.
#. EDID: [01027B70]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0007F9"
msgid "Well, if you ever consider staying long term, we can have that conversation in the near future."
msgstr "뭐, 나중에라도 오래 머무실 생각이 드신다면, 그때 다시 제대로 얘기해 봐요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_MiscDialogue
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_HelpWanted_050_ZenaGreet
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00987C5D
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Zena: It's always nice to have visitors to New Babylon. My name is Zena. I'm what amounts to a mayor around these parts.|Do you plan on staying long term? We're always looking for new citizens.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Well, if you ever consider staying long term, we can have that conversation in the near future.
#. EDID: [01027B7F]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0007FA"
msgid "I'm just passing through."
msgstr "그냥 지나가던 길입니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_MiscDialogue
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_HelpWanted_050_ZenaGreet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Zena
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFZenaHield
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00CE7BF4
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral / to Player Default
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: I'm just passing through.
#. EDID: [01027B72]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0007FB"
msgid "Do you plan on staying long term? We're always looking for new citizens."
msgstr "오래 머무실 계획이신가요? 저희는 언제나 새로운 주민을 환영한답니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_MiscDialogue
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_HelpWanted_050_ZenaGreet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Zena
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFZenaHield
#. Face = Friendly
#. SoundFileID = 006202A4
#. ScriptNotes = Friendly / to Player Default
#. EDID: [01027B72]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0007FC"
msgid "It's always nice to have visitors to New Babylon. My name is Zena. I'm what amounts to a mayor around these parts."
msgstr "뉴바빌론에 오시는 손님은 언제나 환영합니다. 제 이름은 제나예요. 이래 봬도 이 동네에선 시장 노릇을 하고 있죠."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_MiscDialogue
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_HelpWanted_050_IvicaTL01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Ivica
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMIvicaVukovic
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 005C5673
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = You're better off not working for a company like that.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: You're better off not working for a company like that.
#. DialogueAfter = Ivica: But Zena, she's different. She says, "You need a job? Take your pick."
#. EDID: [01027C7A]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0007FD"
msgid "Company was fine. My boss was an ass."
msgstr "회사는 좋았어. 상사만 개자식이었지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_MiscDialogue
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_HelpWanted_050_IvicaTL01
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Ivica
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00B0FB33
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Why did you come to this outpost? &&& Ivica: I used to work for Star Parcel. Hauling packages, making deliveries.|One day I get a job to jump to some half-abandoned outpost. When I get there, I see the package is addressed to me.|I open it. There's a letter inside. It says, "Dear Ivica, you're fired!"
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Company was fine. My boss was an ass.
#. EDID: [01027C6E]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0007FE"
msgid "You're better off not working for a company like that."
msgstr "그런 회사라면 안 다니는 게 낫겠네요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_MiscDialogue
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_HelpWanted_050_IvicaTL01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Ivica
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMIvicaVukovic
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 000ACEC1
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = You should've seen that coming.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: You should've seen that coming.
#. DialogueAfter = Ivica: But Zena, she's different. She says, "You need a job? Take your pick."
#. EDID: [01027C67]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0007FF"
msgid "I was good at my job. My boss, he just didn't like me. In most places, that matters more."
msgstr "일은 잘했었다고. 상사가 날 싫어했던 것뿐이야. 어딜 가든 줄 잘 서는 게 중요하니까."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_MiscDialogue
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_HelpWanted_050_IvicaTL01
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Ivica
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 006C7E32
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Why did you come to this outpost? &&& Ivica: I used to work for Star Parcel. Hauling packages, making deliveries.|One day I get a job to jump to some half-abandoned outpost. When I get there, I see the package is addressed to me.|I open it. There's a letter inside. It says, "Dear Ivica, you're fired!"
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: I was good at my job. My boss, he just didn't like me. In most places, that matters more.
#. EDID: [01027C5A]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000800"
msgid "You should've seen that coming."
msgstr "진작에 눈치를 챘어야죠."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_MiscDialogue
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_HelpWanted_050_IvicaTL01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Ivica
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMIvicaVukovic
#. Face = Grateful
#. SoundFileID = 00349E2D
#. ScriptNotes = God closes one door, but opens a hundred. / Grateful / to Player Default
#. EDID: [01027C52]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000801"
msgid "So I did. As they used to say on the old world, \"Bog zatvori jedna vrata, a otvori stotinu.\""
msgstr ""
"그래서 골랐지. 옛 지구 속담 대로인가 봐. \"복 자트보리 예드나 브라타, 아 오트보리 스토티누. (하느님은 문 하나를 닫으시지만, 백 "
"개의 문을 여신다.)\""

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_MiscDialogue
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_HelpWanted_050_IvicaTL01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Ivica
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMIvicaVukovic
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00855657
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral / to Player Default
