msgctxt "000806"
msgid "I open it. There's a letter inside. It says, \"Dear Ivica, you're fired!\""
msgstr "열어보니까 편지가 있더라고. 이렇게 적혀 있었지. \"이비차에게. 넌 해고야!\""

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_MiscDialogue
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_HelpWanted_050_IvicaTL01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Ivica
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMIvicaVukovic
#. Face = Confused
#. SoundFileID = 005141AC
#. ScriptNotes = Confused / to Player Default
#. EDID: [01027C2E]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000807"
msgid "One day I get a job to jump to some half-abandoned outpost. When I get there, I see the package is addressed to me."
msgstr "어느 날 거의 버려진 전초기지로 가는 일을 맡았거든. 도착해 보니 내 앞으로 온 소포가 있더라고."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_MiscDialogue
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_HelpWanted_050_IvicaTL01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Ivica
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMIvicaVukovic
#. Face = Disgust
#. SoundFileID = 00A4CE2A
#. ScriptNotes = Disgust / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Why did you come to this outpost?
#. EDID: [01027C2E]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000808"
msgid "I used to work for Star Parcel. Hauling packages, making deliveries."
msgstr "예전에 스타 파셀에서 일했었어. 택배 운송하고, 배달하고 그랬지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_MiscDialogue
