#. DialogueAfter = Zena: Cass, listen to me. I've known you all my life. You're not a killer. Do what's right, and put the gun down.
#. EDID: [01027C6D]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000864"
msgid "He deserves a trial."
msgstr "그는 재판을 받을 자격이 있어."

