msgid "Hal's not who you think he is. He's a murderer."
msgstr "할은 네가 생각하는 그런 사람이 아니야. 살인자야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2535_TalkToResidents_TL_Grace
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = GraceKim
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 008944C2
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Just sick in the head. He's a murderer. &&& GraceKim: That's a heavy accusation, but I know better than to doubt you. I assume you have proof?
#. DialogueAfter = GraceKim: Interesting. Well, in that case, I just have one question.
#. EDID: [01027C3A]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00088D"
msgid "I was at Shinar, his old outpost. I saw the graves of the people he left die. We're to vote on his fate."
msgstr "나는 그의 옛 전초기지인 시나르에 있었어. 그가 죽게 내버려 둔 사람들의 무덤을 봤지. 우리는 그의 운명을 두고 투표해야 해."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2535_TalkToResidents_TL_Grace
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00FFB57B
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
