#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Really? I didn't expect that. Well, I guess I'll go have a chat with Zena, see which way the wind's blowing.
#. EDID: [01027C79]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00088E"
msgid "You can vote the way you like."
msgstr "원하는 대로 투표해도 돼."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2535_TalkToResidents_TL_Sasha
