#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0016E2FA
#. DialogueBefore = Zena: Well, now we have another mess on our hands. |I don't know who or what god we pissed off for this to happen. But I don't know how things got so grim.
#. DialogueAfter = Zena: On that note, I'll reiterate the outcome of the vote.
#. EDID: [01027D0C]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00089D"
msgid "I suppose he knew that we would never execute one of our own. "
msgstr "그는 우리가 우리 식구를 절대 처형하지 못할 거라는 걸 알았던 것 같아."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_e2920_BernhardKilledZenaGreet
