#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: He handled his business. I would've done the same.
#. EDID: [01027D00]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0008A0"
msgid "Well, now we have another mess on our hands. "
msgstr "이제 또 골칫거리가 생겼군."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_e2920_BernhardKilledZenaGreet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Caspian
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMCaspianRoberson
#. Face = Angry
#. SoundFileID = 008759A7
#. ScriptNotes = Angry
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Bernhard, the refugee from Shinar, tried to kill Caruso. I stopped him.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: He killed Caruso. This was retribution.
#. EDID: [01027D8C]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0008A1"
msgid "I knew it! I knew that guy was gonna try something!"
msgstr "그럴 줄 알았어! 그놈이 뭔가 저지를 줄 알았다고!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
