#. DialogueAfter = Zena: You better have a damn good explanation for why you shot this man.
#. EDID: [01027CEE]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0008A3"
msgid "Everyone, calm down! There's been enough blood shed already, let's not make it worse!"
msgstr "모두 진정해! 이미 피를 충분히 흘렸어. 더 악화시키지 마!"

#. List: 2
