#. DialogueAfter = Zena: Well, now we have another mess on our hands.
#. EDID: [01027D06]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0008AE"
msgid "He handled his business. I would've done the same."
msgstr "그는 자기 일을 처리한 거야. 나라도 똑같이 했을 거야."

