#. DialogueAfter = Zena: Well, now we have another mess on our hands.
#. EDID: [01027CDD]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0008B1"
msgid "He didn't think the outcome was right."
msgstr "그는 결과가 옳다고 생각하지 않았어."

