#. DialogueAfter = Zena: Sasha, escort the prisoner to his cell. Regardless of how the vote went down, he'll have to answer for Hal's death.
#. EDID: [01027CFC]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0008C2"
msgid "You're right Zena. I'm sorry."
msgstr "제나, 네 말이 맞아. 미안해."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_e2909_CaspianTalkHimDown
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Zena
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFZenaHield
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00A2382C
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: It's not. But neither is this.
#. DialogueAfter = Caspian: You're right Zena. I'm sorry.
#. EDID: [01027D0A]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0008C3"
msgid "Cass, listen to me. I've known you all my life. You're not a killer. Do what's right, and put the gun down."
msgstr "캐스, 내 말 들어. 난 평생 널 알아 왔어. 넌 살인자가 아니야. 옳은 일을 하고 총을 내려놔."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_e2909_CaspianTalkHimDown
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Caspian
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMCaspianRoberson
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 009D21DF
#. DialogueBefore = Caspian: And why not? This asshole killed Hal in cold blood.
#. DialogueAfter = Caspian: He killed Hal! You understand? He fucking killed him!
#. EDID: [01027CF1]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0008C4"
msgid "Nah, he killed Hal. He dies, right here."
msgstr "아니, 그놈이 할을 죽였어. 여기서 죽어야 해."

#. List: 2
#. EDID: [01027D64]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0008C5"
msgid "\"Who has not asked himself at some time or other: am I a monster or is this what it means to be a person?\""
msgstr "살면서 한 번쯤 스스로에게 묻지 않은 사람이 있을까요. 나는 괴물인가, 아니면 이것이 사람이 된다는 뜻인가?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2535_TalkToResidents_TL_Yeats
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Yeats
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMYeats
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00B6677A
#. DialogueBefore = Yeats: That is what Hal wants. But I teeter. I am far too acquainted with man's flaws to inflict such a punishment.
#. EDID: [01027D64]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0008C6"
msgid "But I digress. In closing I will leave you with the words of Clarice Lispector:"
msgstr "이야기가 샜군요. 마무리하며 클라리스 리스펙토르의 말을 남기겠습니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_e2950_CarusoEnd_Greet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Caruso
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMHalCaruso
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 007FA895
#. ScriptNotes = Serious
#. DialogueBefore = Caruso: And when my time comes, I will kneel before the ghosts of Shinar, and put my soul on the scales.|Perhaps by then, my body of work will be enough to balance them.
#. EDID: [01027D61]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0008C8"
msgid "Regardless, I thank you for giving me the opportunity to atone. Be well."
msgstr "어쨌든 속죄할 기회를 주셔서 감사합니다. 평안하시길."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_e2910_ZenaVoteTally
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Zena
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFZenaHield
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00C0077A
#. ScriptNotes = / to BallotBoxVotingMarkerThird
#. DialogueBefore = Zena: Hal has asked to choose the manner of death. I will allow it.
#. DialogueAfter = Zena: I know this process hasn't been easy, but it's over now.
#. EDID: [01027D5B]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0008C9"
msgid "You can say your goodbyes or go back to your tents. But the decision is final."
msgstr "작별 인사를 하거나 천막으로 돌아가도 됩니다. 하지만 결정은 최종입니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_e2910_ZenaVoteTally
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Zena
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFZenaHield
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 004672A0
