#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: I will be voting for his execution. I encourage you to do the same.
#. EDID: [01027D7E]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0008E4"
msgid "But now that Hal has come forward, the greater question of course, is what to do about it."
msgstr "하지만 이제 할이 앞으로 나섰으니, 물론 더 큰 문제는 이 일을 어떻게 할지입니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_d3200_CarusoTL01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Caruso
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMHalCaruso
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00B014D5
#. ScriptNotes = Serious / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Why take their supplies? Why not leave them with food and water?
#. DialogueAfter = Caruso: You did what you had to.
#. EDID: [01027DC2]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0008E7"
msgid "Make no mistake. I took their supplies, knowing they would die."
msgstr "분명히 해 두죠. 저는 그들이 죽을 것을 알면서도 물자를 가져갔습니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_d3200_CarusoTL01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Caruso
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMHalCaruso
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00FF616F
#. ScriptNotes = Serious / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Why take their supplies? Why not leave them with food and water?
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Why take their supplies? Why not leave them with food and water?
#. EDID: [01027DC2]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0008E8"
msgid "Because I didn't want to be followed. The body can only survive without water for three days."
msgstr "뒤쫓기고 싶지 않았기 때문입니다. 몸은 물 없이 3일밖에 버티지 못합니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_d3200_CarusoTL01
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Caruso
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0060F378
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Before the vote, I want to talk about Shinar. &&& Caruso: I suspected you would. &&& Caruso: I didn't see what became of Shinar. But I can imagine. &&& Caruso: No ship, no comms. Dehydration sets in. Some choose death. Others are forced to make harder decisions.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Because I didn't want to be followed. The body can only survive without water for three days.
#. EDID: [01027DDB]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0008E9"
msgid "Why take their supplies? Why not leave them with food and water?"
msgstr "왜 물자를 가져간 거? 왜 음식과 물을 남겨 두지 않았지?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2535_TalkToResidents_TL_Yeats
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Yeats
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 001B7812
