msgctxt "0008FB"
msgid "Exonerate him. He's paid his debt to society."
msgstr "무죄 방면하세요. 그는 사회에 진 빚을 갚았습니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2535_TalkToResidents_TL_Yeats
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Yeats
