#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 009665E6
#. EDID: [01027DE6]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0008FC"
msgid "But when the vote comes, we will have to decide for ourselves, what he deserves."
msgstr "하지만 투표가 시작되면, 그가 무엇을 받아 마땅한지는 우리 스스로 결정해야 합니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2535_TalkToResidents_TL_Yeats
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Yeats
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMYeats
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00549B92
#. DialogueBefore = Yeats: Not just her final book. A masterpiece.
#. EDID: [01027DE6]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0008FD"
msgid "Either way, I don't know if Hal Caruso is a \"good\" man. I don't know if the act of becoming good constitutes atonement."
msgstr "어쨌든 할 카루소가 \"선한\" 사람인지는 모르겠습니다. 선해지는 행위가 속죄가 되는지도 모르겠습니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_x1CarusoDiesArc_3010_ZenaGreet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Zena
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFZenaHield
#. Face = Defiant
#. SoundFileID = 0079155C
#. ScriptNotes = Defiant / to Player Default
#. Prompt = I got rid of a bad man who lied about his past. Why wouldn't you approve?
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I got rid of a bad man who lied about his past. Why wouldn't you approve?
#. DialogueAfter = Zena: I don't need your approval.
#. EDID: [01027E24]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0008FE"
msgid "And what if someone got caught in the crossfire? This could've been settled peacefully. What you did was reckless."
msgstr "누군가 교전에 휘말렸다면 어쩔 뻔했죠? 평화롭게 해결할 수도 있었습니다. 당신이 한 일은 무모했어요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_x1CarusoDiesArc_3010_ZenaGreet
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Zena
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00A97423
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: [Evidence] The proof is here. &&& ... &&& Zena: Caspian, enough! Don't make this harder than it already is. &&& Zena: Grace, Sasha. If you can see to the body... &&& Zena: Look, I understand why you came here. But I do not approve how you went about doing it.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: And what if someone got caught in the crossfire? This could've been settled peacefully. What you did was reckless.
#. EDID: [01027E22]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0008FF"
msgid "I got rid of a bad man who lied about his past. Why wouldn't you approve?"
msgstr "과거를 속인 나쁜 놈을 없앤 건데. 왜 찬성하지 않는 거지?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_x1CarusoDiesArc_3010_ZenaGreet
