#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Caruso attacked me. I had to defend myself.
#. DialogueAfter = Zena: I'd like you to leave, now. And don't come back.
#. EDID: [01027E1D]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000900"
msgid "Pirate or not, the Hal I knew was a measured man. You likely didn't give him a choice."
msgstr "해적이든 아니든, 내가 알던 할은 신중한 사람이었어. 네가 그에게 선택지를 주지 않았겠지."

