#. ScriptNotes = Angry / to Player Default
#. Prompt = I don't need your approval.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I don't need your approval.
#. DialogueAfter = Zena: I'd like you to leave, now. And don't come back.
#. EDID: [01027E17]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000902"
msgid "Fine. But we're the ones who have to deal with the fallout of your actions."
msgstr "좋아. 하지만 네 행동의 후폭풍은 우리가 감당해야 해."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
