#. EDID: [01027E2B]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000906"
msgid "Look, I understand why you came here. But I do not approve how you went about doing it."
msgstr "네가 왜 여기 왔는지는 이해해. 하지만 일을 처리한 방식은 인정할 수 없어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_x1CarusoDiesArc_160_CarusoDead_Zena01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Zena
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFZenaHield
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00DEC8B5
#. ScriptNotes = / to Caspian
#. DialogueBefore = Zena: It's no stranger's. It's Hal's own words. So I repeat. Stand down. NOW. &&& Caspian: This isn't fair. You're just letting this stranger get away with murder.
#. DialogueAfter = Zena: Grace, Sasha. If you can see to the body...
#. EDID: [01027E25]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000907"
msgid "Caspian, enough! Don't make this harder than it already is."
msgstr "캐스피언, 그만! 이미 힘든 일을 더 어렵게 만들지 마."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_130_Scene03
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Caruso
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMHalCaruso
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00CCF7AB
#. DialogueBefore = Caruso: This outpost has been through a lot, from even before I came here. But as you can see, it's starting to thrive.
#. DialogueAfter = Caruso: Now, let's get one thing straight. I'm not here to fight you, hunter.
#. EDID: [01027E23]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000908"
msgid "Up ahead is the Community Center. We should have privacy there."
msgstr "앞쪽에 주민 센터가 있어. 거기라면 사적인 얘기를 할 수 있을 거야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_MiscDialogue
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMCaspianRoberson
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMCaspianRoberson
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 001C5690
#. EDID: [01029893]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000953"
msgid "Thank god the vote went the way it did. I don't know what I'd do if Hal wasn't with us."
msgstr "투표 결과가 그렇게 나와서 정말 다행이야. 할이 우리 곁에 없었다면 내가 어떻게 됐을지 모르겠어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_MiscDialogue
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMCaspianRoberson
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMCaspianRoberson
#. Face = VeryAngry
#. SoundFileID = 00E868E2
#. ScriptNotes = VeryAngry
#. EDID: [01029892]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000954"
msgid "I don't care how long they lock me up. I don't regret shooting him. He got his revenge, I got mine."
msgstr "얼마나 오래 가둬 두든 상관없어. 그를 쏜 걸 후회하지 않아. 그는 복수했고, 나도 내 복수를 한 거야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_MiscDialogue
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMCaspianRoberson
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMCaspianRoberson
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0070F29C
#. EDID: [01029891]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000955"
msgid "I'll never forgive you for killing Hal."
msgstr "할을 죽인 너를 절대 용서하지 않을 거야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_MiscDialogue
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMCaspianRoberson
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMCaspianRoberson
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00C1CE24
#. EDID: [01029890]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000956"
msgid "I can't believe he's gone."
msgstr "그가 떠났다는 게 믿기지 않아."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_MiscDialogue
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMYeats
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMYeats
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 008BA0AB
#. EDID: [0102988E]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000957"
msgid "I don't know if letting Hal go was the right thing. So often, it's easy to do, but hard to know."
msgstr "할을 놓아주는 게 옳은 일이었는지 모르겠어. 흔히 행동은 쉽지만, 무엇이 옳은지 아는 건 어렵지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_MiscDialogue
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMYeats
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMYeats
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00B4F3AE
#. EDID: [0102988D]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000958"
msgid "Now I know why Hal wanted me back. He knew this day was coming."
msgstr "이제 할이 왜 나를 다시 불렀는지 알겠어. 그는 이 날이 올 걸 알고 있었던 거야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_100_Scene01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCFSashaAtwell
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFSashaAtwell
#. Face = Nervous
#. SoundFileID = 006E6865
#. ScriptNotes = Nervous / to Player Default
#. Prompt = [Lie] I'm here to survey this land.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: [Lie] I'm here to survey this land.
#. DialogueAfter = Sasha: Head on through. He should be in the back. You can't miss him.
#. EDID: [0102988C]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000959"
msgid "We don't get too many survey teams out here. You'll probably want to talk to Hal, he does most of the scouting for us."
msgstr "여기까지 오는 조사팀은 많지 않습니다만. 할과 얘기해 보시는 게 좋겠습니다. 정찰 일은 대부분을 할이 맡고 있으니 말입니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_100_Scene01
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00415419
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Sasha: Hold up stranger. This outpost belongs to the citizens of New Babylon. State your business, or kindly leave.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: We don't get too many survey teams out here. You'll probably want to talk to Hal, he does most of the scouting for us.
#. EDID: [0102988B]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00095A"
msgid "[Lie] I'm here to survey this land."
msgstr "[거짓말] 이 땅을 조사하러 왔습니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 009502C4
#. EDID: [01083DA1]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000A0E"
msgid "Yeah?"
msgstr "그래?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00623A22
#. EDID: [01083D96]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000A0F"
msgid "I want to sell a plushie, and then charge an arm and a leg for a thousand different accessories. I could really use the body parts."
msgstr "봉제 인형을 팔고, 거기에 엄청 비싼 액세서리 천 가지를 붙여 팔고 싶어. 그래서 신체 부위가 정말 필요해."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00080D1C
#. EDID: [01083D91]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000A10"
msgid "I bet I was an eldritch being in my past life."
msgstr "전생에는 분명 섬뜩한 고대 존재였을 거야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Question
#. SoundFileID = 00C63224
#. ScriptNotes = Question
#. EDID: [01083D8E]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000A11"
msgid "So are you like a captain-captain, or a pilot captain? Am I in the military now? Does that mean I get a pension?"
msgstr "너는 진짜 선장 같은 선장이야, 아니면 조종사 선장이야? 나 지금 군대에 들어온 거야? 그럼 연금도 받아?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00018C78
#. EDID: [01083D89]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000A12"
msgid "Ever think about how pointless life is? I do. Every day."
msgstr "삶이 얼마나 무의미한지 생각해 본 적 있어? 난 매일 해."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00AD7EC6
#. EDID: [01083D84]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000A13"
msgid "You ever want to join a cult? I mean, besides Constellation."
msgstr "사이비에 들어가 보고 싶었던 적 있어? 내 말은, 컨스텔레이션 말고."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 0058C2B3
#. EDID: [01083D7E]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000A14"
msgid "Find any cool mushrooms? Eat them."
msgstr "멋진 버섯 찾았어? 먹어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 004F49D3
#. EDID: [01083C22]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000A15"
msgid "Were we talking? I sure hope not."
msgstr "우리 얘기 중이었어? 아니었으면 좋겠는데."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 001A2CBE
#. EDID: [01083C5A]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000A16"
msgid "Got one."
msgstr "하나 잡았다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 005A7A42
#. EDID: [01083C57]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000A17"
msgid "Another one down."
msgstr "또 하나 쓰러졌다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Angry
#. SoundFileID = 0098E522
#. ScriptNotes = Angry
#. EDID: [01083CB3]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000A18"
msgid "Spill some blood for me!"
msgstr "날 위해 피를 좀 흘려!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
