#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. SceneName = CREW_EliteCrew_Muria_MasterTopLevel
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00E41A7B
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Do you mind if I ask you some personal questions?
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Earlier, you mentioned a ship full of dead cultists. What happened to them?
#. EDID: [01083C40]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000A1A"
msgid "Sure, I'm an open book. It's got spiders crawling all over it, but it's open."
msgstr "물론이지. 난 펼쳐진 책 같은 사람이야. 온통 거미가 기어 다니지만, 펼쳐져 있긴 해."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. SceneName = CREW_EliteCrew_Muria_TopLevel_FungiFacts
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 0098C2DD
#. DialogueAfter = Muria: Earlier, you mentioned a ship full of dead cultists. What happened to them?
#. EDID: [01083D57]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000A1B"
msgid "They use it in plastics, rubber, even toys. So fungi are also entertainment."
msgstr "플라스틱, 고무, 심지어 장난감에도 쓰여. 그러니까 균류는 오락이기도 한 거지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. SceneName = CREW_EliteCrew_Muria_TopLevel_FungiFacts
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00162D74
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Do you have any fun facts about fungi?
#. EDID: [01083D57]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000A1C"
msgid "So there's this thing called itaconic acid, which you can isolate from a fungus. "
msgstr "그러니까 이타콘산이라는 게 있는데, 균류에서 분리할 수 있어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. SceneName = CREW_EliteCrew_Muria_TopLevel_FungiFacts
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 006B34F2
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Do you have any fun facts about fungi?
#. DialogueAfter = Muria: Earlier, you mentioned a ship full of dead cultists. What happened to them?
#. EDID: [01083D54]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000A1D"
msgid "I've heard some xenofungi are known to break down concrete. It's my dream to lay siege to a castle with them."
msgstr "어떤 외계균류는 콘크리트를 분해한다고 들었어. 그걸로 성을 포위 공격하는 게 내 꿈이야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. SceneName = CREW_EliteCrew_Muria_TimeLocked
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00E73427
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = I would love to see a ship full of creepy cultists.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I would love to see a ship full of creepy cultists.
#. DialogueAfter = Muria: Although... I did leave an open pack of Chunks somewhere in the cockpit. Maybe it's sentient now.
#. EDID: [01083C0A]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000A1E"
msgid "It's not as cool as you think."
msgstr "생각하는 만큼 멋지진 않을걸요."

