#. Alias = Muria
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00A0137B
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Earlier, you mentioned a ship full of dead cultists. What happened to them? &&& Muria: They're still in orbit. Going in circles, just like their logic.|We can go visit them if you want. I have the coordinates, somewhere.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: What, you're afraid it's haunted or something?
#. EDID: [01083BDA]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000A1F"
msgid "No thanks. "
msgstr "사양할게. "

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. SceneName = CREW_EliteCrew_Muria_TimeLocked
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Muria
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00E9C914
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Earlier, you mentioned a ship full of dead cultists. What happened to them? &&& Muria: They're still in orbit. Going in circles, just like their logic.|We can go visit them if you want. I have the coordinates, somewhere.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: If it were, I wouldn't be standing here with you. I'd be communing with ghosts.
#. EDID: [01083B94]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000A20"
msgid "I don't know. Places like that are haunted."
msgstr "모르지. 그런 데서 유령이 나올 수도 있잖아."

