#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Usually love and fortune. I pitched them to clients as investments, which means you have to pay more.
#. EDID: [01083C24]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000A25"
msgid "What were some of your most popular potions?"
msgstr "가장 인기 있었던 물약은 뭐였어?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. SceneName = CREW_EliteCrew_Muria_TopLevel_Jobs
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Friendly
#. SoundFileID = 009CB210
#. ScriptNotes = Friendly / to Player Default
#. Prompt = What were some of your most popular potions?
#. EDID: [01083BCF]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000A26"
msgid "There wasn't any real science to it, I'd just grind up some goldenseal root, add a dash of cinnamon, and add almond milk for prosperity."
msgstr "과학적 근거 같은 건 없었어요. 그냥 금인초 뿌리를 갈아서, 계피 좀 넣고, 아몬드 우유를 부었을 뿐이에요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. SceneName = CREW_EliteCrew_Muria_TopLevel_Jobs
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00C3D406
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral / to Player Default
#. Prompt = What were some of your most popular potions?
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: What were some of your most popular potions?
#. EDID: [01083BCF]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000A27"
msgid "Usually love and fortune. I pitched them to clients as investments, which means you have to pay more."
msgstr "주로 연애운이나 재물운 관련 물약이요. 손님들에게는 이게 곧 투자라고 설득했어요. 그 말은 즉, 돈을 더 내야 한다는 뜻이죠."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. SceneName = CREW_EliteCrew_Muria_TopLevel_Jobs
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Muria
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0061DB48
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Did the potions actually work? &&& Muria: No. But I took the money anyway.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: I bet that's why you're so good at the combat stuff.
#. EDID: [01083C26]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000A28"
msgid "As someone who's worked retail, same."
msgstr "소매업 일을 해봐서 그런지, 공감가네."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. SceneName = CREW_EliteCrew_Muria_TopLevels_Travel
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Muria
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 007D3144
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Is there anywhere you want to visit? &&& Muria: You mean besides the cold, endless void?|I don't know. Maybe a black hole. Not the kind in space, just a big bottomless pit. It'd be fun to throw people into it.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: That'd be awesome, but those don't exist either. Believe me, I've done the research.
#. EDID: [01083BA1]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000A29"
msgid "As long as it's a sacrifice to some bottomless pit god."
msgstr "바닥없는 구덩이의 신에게 바치는 제물이라. 괜찮겠네."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. SceneName = CREW_EliteCrew_Muria_TopLevel_Jobs
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 006AEBE2
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Any good stories?
#. DialogueAfter = Muria: I can relate. I die a little inside whenever we speak.
#. EDID: [01083BAD]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000A2A"
msgid "He wanted two thousand credits for it. I offered him four. I got reprimanded for that. Jokes on them, I would've gone as high as six."
msgstr ""
"그 사람이 2천 크레딧을 요구했어요. 저는 4천을 제시했죠. 그 일로 사장님이 혼냈지만, 웃기잖아요. 마음 같아선 6천까지 쳐주고 "
"싶었는데."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. SceneName = CREW_EliteCrew_Muria_Recruit
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Muria
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00C05D3C
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: How did your interview with Galbank go? &&& Muria: Not great. They said I lacked "pep."|I looked up the word. It sounds like an illness. I pray it's fatal.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Then I need to talk to my lawyer and have them sue you for slander.
#. EDID: [01083BFF]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000A2B"
msgid "I think you have plenty of pep."
msgstr "패기는 충분해 보이는데."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. SceneName = CREW_EliteCrew_Muria_Recruit
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 009BCD5E
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral / to Player Default
#. Prompt = I think you have plenty of pep.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I think you have plenty of pep.
#. DialogueAfter = Muria: Well, now I need find work somewhere else. My landlord keeps asking for this thing called "rent."
#. EDID: [01083BD3]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000A2C"
msgid "Then I need to talk to my lawyer and have them sue you for slander."
msgstr "그렇다면 변호사한테 연락해서 당신을 명예훼손으로 고소해야겠네요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. SceneName = CREW_EliteCrew_Muria_Recruit
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00A65D0E
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Yeah, if only. &&& Muria: If only. &&& Muria: Well, now I need find work somewhere else. My landlord keeps asking for this thing called "rent."|I told him I could pay him with a potion that would turn him into a newt, but he refused.|Don't know why, seems like it'd be an improvement. But what do I know. Certainly not enough to be a banker.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Yeah? Is this one of those cults I hear so much about? I hope you at least got cool robes.
#. EDID: [01083B8E]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000A2D"
msgid "I've got a job on my crew if you want it."
msgstr "생각 있으면 내 우주선으로 와. 승무원 자린 만들어 둘 테니."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. SceneName = CREW_EliteCrew_Muria_TopLevel_Jobs
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00411031
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Did you ever try to raise any dead?
#. DialogueAfter = Muria: A morgue would be very on brand.
#. EDID: [01083C00]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000A2E"
msgid "I got really excited because his corpse started wailing, but it turns out it was just the gases being released. Shame."
msgstr "시체가 막 울부짖길래 진짜 신났었거든요. 근데 알고 보니까 그냥 가스 빠지는 소리더라고요. 아쉽게도요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. SceneName = CREW_EliteCrew_Muria_TopLevel_Jobs
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 00A19FB9
#. ScriptNotes = Confident / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Did you ever try to raise any dead?
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Did you ever try to raise any dead?
#. EDID: [01083C00]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000A2F"
msgid "I never really got enough time with the bodies. But I did sprinkle some ground wormwood and valerian root on this one guy."
msgstr "실제로 시체와 오래 있어보진 못했거든요. 근데 어떤 남자의 시체에 향쑥 가루랑 쥐오줌풀 뿌리를 좀 뿌려보긴 했어요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. SceneName = CREW_EliteCrew_Muria_Recruit
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Smirk
#. SoundFileID = 00B4DBB3
#. ScriptNotes = Smirk / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Before I bring you on, will you tell me more about your skills?
#. DialogueAfter = Muria: [Pay <Global=Crew_RecruitCost_TextReplacementValue> Credits] That won't be a problem.
#. EDID: [01083BA4]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000A30"
msgid "Pff, doctors, right? What do they know."
msgstr "풉, 의사 놈들이 다 그렇죠 뭐. 걔들이 뭘 알겠어요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. SceneName = CREW_EliteCrew_Muria_Recruit
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 001548F7
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Before I bring you on, will you tell me more about your skills?
#. EDID: [01083BA4]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000A31"
msgid "I also killed a man once by looking at him funny. Although the doctors claim it was a heart attack. "
msgstr "눈빛 하나로 사람을 보낸 적도 있죠. 의사들은 심장마비라고 결론 내렸지만요. "

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. SceneName = CREW_EliteCrew_Muria_Recruit
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0095678F
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Before I bring you on, will you tell me more about your skills?
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Before I bring you on, will you tell me more about your skills?
#. EDID: [01083BA4]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000A32"
msgid "Well, I'm pretty good with picking stuff up with my feet."
msgstr "음, 제가 발로 물건 줍는 건 기가 막히게 잘하거든요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. SceneName = CREW_EliteCrew_Muria_Recruit
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00D92FD6
#. DialogueBefore = Muria: All right. Guess I'll gather my potions and head to my post. You do have a post for me, right?
#. DialogueAfter = Muria: No place for me huh. Guess I'll go loiter around the bank some more.
#. EDID: [01083B5F]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000A33"
msgid "That sounds dismal. I'm on my way."
msgstr "그 소리를 들으니 참 우울해지네요. 저 이제 일하러 갈게요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. SceneName = CREW_EliteCrew_Muria_Recruit
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Muria
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00603FA1
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I'm an alien. Our cults do things differently where I'm from. &&& Muria: Rad. Not my vibe, though. &&& Muria: But yeah, I think I'm gonna need creds, up front. And a skull. Preferably with the brains still in it.|In exchange, I might show up to work two, maybe three times a week. Deal?
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Well, I'm pretty good with picking stuff up with my feet.
#. EDID: [01083BB9]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000A34"
msgid "Before I bring you on, will you tell me more about your skills? "
msgstr "채용하기 전에, 가진 기술에 대해 좀 더 알려 줄래? "

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. SceneName = CREW_EliteCrew_Muria_TopLevel_Cult
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00CED2FB
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: If they are believers, then they will find prosperity in the Shrouding as Promised. &&& Muria: Well, those sure are words. &&& Muria: But yeah, I didn't want to meet the Great Serpent, so I volunteered to pilot the ship.|And then it occurred to me -- if I was gonna be surrounded by a bunch of dead people, it'd be cool if I could raise them as my personal army.|I never made the grav jump. I still have the corpses.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: I'm not answering that question without a lawyer present.
#. EDID: [01083C1A]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000A35"
msgid "Are you saying you have ship full of corpses somewhere? That's... something."
msgstr "시체를 잔뜩 실은 우주선을 어디에 놔뒀다는 거야? 그건… 좀 그러네."

#. List: 2
#. EDID: [01083BF2]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000A36"
msgid "Join your crew? I usually travel alone, but the idea does appeal to me. I'd have more time to focus on my book if I were traveling with you."
msgstr ""
"승무원으로 합류하라고요? 보통 혼자 여행하지만, 그것도 마음에 드네요. 함께 여행한다면 제 책에 더 집중할 시간이 생길 거 같아요."

#. List: 2
#. EDID: [01083B9D]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000A37"
msgid "It seems like you are too. Maybe we should travel together. "
msgstr "그쪽도 그런 것 같네. 어쩌면 우리 함께 여행해야 할지도 모르겠어. "

#. List: 2
#. EDID: [01083C30]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000A38"
msgid "I understand. Thank you for indulging me. I hope the starfield treats you kindly."
msgstr "알겠습니다. 제 말상대가 되어 주셔서 감사해요. 별무리가 당신에게 다정하게 대해주기를 바랄게요."

#. List: 2
#. EDID: [01083C02]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000A39"
msgid "What type of book are you writing?"
msgstr "어떤 종류의 책을 쓰고 있지?"

