msgstr "갤뱅크 면접은 어떻게 됐어?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. SceneName = CREW_EliteCrew_Muria_TopLevels_Travel
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Question
#. SoundFileID = 0067289E
#. ScriptNotes = Question / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Why not just shoot them?
#. DialogueBefore = Muria: I feel like I shouldn't have to explain this to you of all people.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Is there anywhere you want to visit?
#. EDID: [01083C0D]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000A42"
msgid "Aren't you like a gangster or something?"
msgstr "당신은 무슨 폭력배나 그와 비슷한 부류 아니었나요?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. SceneName = CREW_EliteCrew_Muria_TopLevel_Past
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Muria
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 002EAB62
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: It was definitely more mundane than that. &&& Muria: You have your headcanon, I have mine.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Mmm... hard to say. They did introduce me to fantasy books and video slates. I think those became my parents after that.
#. EDID: [01083BD2]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000A43"
msgid "What about your parents? What were they like?"
msgstr "네 부모님은? 어떤 분들이었어?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. SceneName = CREW_EliteCrew_Muria_PersonalDetails
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Muria
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 008DA401
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I'd like to know more about your life before we met. &&& Muria:
#. DialogueAfter = Muria: Oh, the usual. Landscapes, mushrooms... the slow, inexorable march towards death. Stuff like that.
#. EDID: [01083B8B]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000A44"
msgid "You mentioned painting before. What sort of things do you like to paint?"
msgstr "전에 그림 그린다고 했잖아. 주로 어떤 걸 그리는데?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. SceneName = CREW_EliteCrew_Muria_TopLevel_Past
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 001C7D3B
#. ScriptNotes = Serious / to Player Default
#. Prompt = What about your parents? What were they like?
#. DialogueAfter = Muria: Let's go back to my other questions.
#. EDID: [01083BB7]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000A45"
msgid "It was a fairly transparent adoption process."
msgstr "꽤 투명한 입양 절차였어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. SceneName = CREW_EliteCrew_Muria_TopLevel_Past
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 003598D0
#. ScriptNotes = Serious / to Player Default
#. Prompt = What about your parents? What were they like?
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: What about your parents? What were they like?
#. EDID: [01083BB7]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000A46"
msgid "Mmm... hard to say. They did introduce me to fantasy books and video slates. I think those became my parents after that."
msgstr "음... 말하기 어렵네. 판타지 책이랑 비디오 슬레이트를 소개해 주긴 했어. 그 뒤로는 그것들이 내 부모가 된 것 같아."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. SceneName = CREW_EliteCrew_Muria_TopLevel_Past
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Muria
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0075FA35
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Just murder, or murdered and absorbed their souls? &&& Muria: I'd say murdered and turned their vengeful ghosts into my thralls.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: I had enough. Most of them were imaginary, or fungi.
#. EDID: [01083B8D]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000A47"
msgid "Did you have many friends as a child?"
msgstr "어릴 때 친구가 많았어?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. SceneName = CREW_EliteCrew_Muria_TopLevel_Paint
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Muria
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00C3B83C
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: You mentioned painting before. What sort of things do you like to paint? &&& Muria: Oh, the usual. Landscapes, mushrooms... the slow, inexorable march towards death. Stuff like that.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: It's a lot of things. Early Mondays. Gray hairs. The look on people's faces when they file their taxes.
#. EDID: [01083C4C]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000A48"
msgid "What does the \"slow, inexorable march toward death\" look like?"
msgstr "죽음을 향한 느리고 거스를 수 없는 행진은 어떤 모습이야?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueStarstations
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCFValeriaHahn
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFValeriaHahn
#. Face = Spaceship / Friendly
#. SoundFileID = 00337748
#. ScriptNotes = A pre-recorded cheerful greeting that plays when the player hails Anchorpoint from their ship while approaching.
#. EDID: [010781E8]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000A49"
msgid "Hey, you found us! Good job. Now dock that ship and come on in."
msgstr "어이, 우리를 찾았네! 잘했어. 이제 그 배를 도킹하고 들어와."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE02
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMGenericMale
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMGenericMale03
#. Face = Nervous
#. SoundFileID = 00CD43D0
#. ScriptNotes = Nervous
#. EDID: [0106C4FC]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000A4C"
msgid "They're staring at me, they're all staring at me..."
msgstr "그들이 나를 보고 있어. 모두 나를 보고 있어..."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE02
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMGenericMale
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMGenericMale03
#. Face = Nervous
#. SoundFileID = 00E61EAD
#. ScriptNotes = Nervous
#. EDID: [0106C4F4]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000A4D"
msgid "Say something!"
msgstr "뭐라도 말해!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE02
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE02_100b_HailingAnswered
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = HailingShip
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMGenericMale03
#. Face = Spaceship / Afraid
#. SoundFileID = 008FDC09
#. ScriptNotes = Afraid
#. Prompt = You need help. You're a danger to yourself and possibly others.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: You need help. You're a danger to yourself and possibly others.
#. DialogueAfter = HailingShip: *Sob* I can't take it! I just... god damn it, I can't take it anymore! I need to make them stop, but how? So many eyes... always watching.
#. EDID: [0106C4EF]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000A4E"
msgid "You think I'm crazy? Damn you, I'm not! I'm not! How can you not see them? The sea of endless eyes? You're drowning in them as we speak!"
msgstr "내가 미쳤다고 생각해? 젠장, 아니야! 아니라고! 어떻게 그들이 안 보여? 끝없는 눈의 바다 말이야. 너도 지금 그 속에 빠져 있잖아!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE02
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE02_100b_HailingAnswered
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = HailingShip
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMGenericMale03
#. Face = Spaceship / Afraid
#. SoundFileID = 00FAAE75
#. ScriptNotes = Afraid
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: You're talking about stars. They're harmless.
#. EDID: [0106C4E6]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000A4F"
msgid "What do they want from me? I can't eat, I can't sleep. And when I look in the mirror there are two eyes in my skull mocking me. Torturing me!"
msgstr "그들이 나한테 뭘 원하는 거지? 먹을 수도, 잘 수도 없어. 거울을 보면 내 두개골 안의 두 눈이 나를 비웃고 있어. 고문하고 있다고!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE02
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE02_100b_HailingAnswered
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = HailingShip
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMGenericMale03
#. Face = Spaceship / Nervous
#. SoundFileID = 004323EC
#. ScriptNotes = Nervous
#. DialogueBefore = HailingShip: The eyes, the eyes, what else would I be talking about? Do you not see them all around you? Are you lucky enough to be blind?
#. EDID: [0106C4E6]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000A50"
msgid "They're all around me, I can't escape them. The eyes are everywhere. I look outside my window and there's a sea of them. When I land and look up into the sky, I see them looking down on me."
msgstr "사방에 있어. 벗어날 수 없어. 눈들이 어디에나 있어. 창밖을 보면 그 바다가 보여. 착륙해서 하늘을 올려다보면, 그들이 나를 내려다보고 있어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE02
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE02_100b_HailingAnswered
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 004C01E1
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I don't know what you're talking about. &&& HailingShip: The eyes, the eyes, what else would I be talking about? Do you not see them all around you? Are you lucky enough to be blind? &&& HailingShip: They're all around me, I can't escape them. The eyes are everywhere. I look outside my window and there's a sea of them. When I land and look up into the sky, I see them looking down on me.|What do they want from me? I can't eat, I can't sleep. And when I look in the mirror there are two eyes in my skull mocking me. Torturing me!
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: No, you're blind. I envy you, but you're blind. Blind to the danger around you, around everyone.
#. EDID: [0106C4D1]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000A51"
msgid "You're talking about stars. They're harmless."
msgstr "별 얘기하는 거야. 해롭지 않아."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE02
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE02_100b_HailingAnswered
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 005A32C2
#. DialogueBefore = HailingShip: You aren't... one of them, are you? &&& HailingShip: &&& HailingShip: You... you... you aren't one of them, are you? One of the eyes...|Please god, please don't be one of them. Please...
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: The eyes, the eyes, what else would I be talking about? Do you not see them all around you? Are you lucky enough to be blind?
#. EDID: [0106C4D8]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000A52"
msgid "I don't know what you're talking about."
msgstr "무슨 말을 하는지 모르겠어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE02
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE02_100c_HailingRefused
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = HailingShip
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMGenericMale03
#. Face = Spaceship / Nervous
#. SoundFileID = 000D204B
#. ScriptNotes = Nervous
#. DialogueBefore = HailingShip:
#. EDID: [0106C4C5]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000A53"
msgid "I can't take this anymore... *sob* can't take this anymore..."
msgstr "더는 못 견디겠어... *흐느낌* 더는 못 견디겠어..."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_Anchorpoint_AudioSlateQuest
#. SceneName = SFFL_Anchorpoint_AudioSlateQuest_EvanGabriellaScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = AUDIOONLY
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFGabriellaLeBlanc
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00D4623C
#. DialogueAfter = Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): Thanks for your time.
#. EDID: [0106C444]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000A55"
msgid "My press agent can handle any further inquiries."
msgstr "추가 문의는 제 홍보 담당자가 처리할 겁니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_Anchorpoint_AudioSlateQuest
#. SceneName = SFFL_Anchorpoint_AudioSlateQuest_EvanGabriellaScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = AUDIOONLY
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFGabriellaLeBlanc
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0091FD48
#. DialogueBefore = Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): One more if I may...
#. EDID: [0106C444]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000A56"
msgid "I'm sorry, but I really don't have the time."
msgstr "죄송하지만 정말 시간이 없습니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02_AudioLogs
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_OpalAudioLog
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = OpalWoods
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCOpalWoods
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 006FD5C3
#. ScriptNotes = Venting, frustrated, and annoyed. Emphasis on 'everyone' in 'She makes everyone sad.'
#. DialogueBefore = Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): All she does is stand in a corner like some sad, lost child. It's so annoying. I liked her better when she was sick. At least then she wasn't taking up space.
#. DialogueAfter = Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): Okay. I better head back out. Not like I can stay in the cockpit the whole time. What a bitch...
#. EDID: [0106D252]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000A57"
msgid "Coop's nice 'cause, yeah, he's quiet, but he doesn't look sad or anything. Wren makes me sad. She makes everyone sad. I just don't get why she's always around."
msgstr "쿠프는 좋지. 조용하긴 해도 슬퍼 보이거나 그러진 않거든. 렌은 나를 슬프게 해. 모두를 슬프게 한다고. 왜 항상 주변에 있는지 모르겠어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02_AudioLogs
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_OpalAudioLog
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = OpalWoods
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCOpalWoods
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00DCB74E
#. ScriptNotes = Venting, frustrated, and annoyed. The last sentence she mumbles.
#. DialogueBefore = Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): Man, I had to step out for a minute. I swear, if I don't talk about this, or get this out, or something, I'm gonna explode. I cannot keep this in if I'm gonna be drinking.|I don't get why Sadie has to bring her sister to everything she's invited to. Sure, help her socialize more, but she doesn't do or say anything at these parties.
#. DialogueAfter = Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): Coop's nice 'cause, yeah, he's quiet, but he doesn't look sad or anything. Wren makes me sad. She makes everyone sad. I just don't get why she's always around.
#. EDID: [0106D251]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000A58"
msgid "All she does is stand in a corner like some sad, lost child. It's so annoying. I liked her better when she was sick. At least then she wasn't taking up space."
msgstr "하는 일이라곤 길 잃은 불쌍한 아이처럼 구석에 서 있는 것뿐이야. 정말 짜증 나. 아팠을 때가 더 좋았어. 그때는 적어도 자리만 차지하진 않았거든."

#. List: 2
