#. EDID: [0106C468]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000A5E"
msgid "Looks like I was right! Two pirate ships inbound!"
msgstr "내가 맞았잖아! 해적선 2척이 접근 중이야!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE04
