#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: VP of Acquisitions? Is that you?
#. DialogueAfter = GalBankShip: Hold on tight, I'm coming aboard.
#. EDID: [0106439B]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000AA3"
