#. Prompt = Is anyone on your ship hurt?
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Is anyone on your ship hurt?
#. DialogueAfter = GalBankShip: Hold on tight, I'm coming aboard.
#. EDID: [01064394]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000AA4"
msgid "Well, a few people, um...a few people are dead, but the VP of Acquisitions is unhurt. I'm okay too."
msgstr "음, 몇 사람이, 어... 몇 사람이 죽었지만, 인수 담당 부사장은 다치지 않았어요. 저도 괜찮고요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_EC07
