#. Face = Spaceship / Nervous
#. SoundFileID = 00C9621E
#. ScriptNotes = On the radio: reminding the player that they may face danger when they board the ship to rescue them. / Nervous
#. EDID: [010647FD]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000AA5"
msgid "Remember what I said about the pirates."
msgstr "해적들에 대해 제가 한 말 기억하세요."

#. List: 2
