#. DialogueBefore = GalBankShip: Mayday! Mayday! We are being attacked by pirates! They want to kidnap us!|What? Oh, right... They want to kidnap the VP of Acquisitions for GalBank. &&& PirateShip01: Stay out of this, Spacer! This does not concern you!
#. EDID: [0106C8D3]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000AA9"
msgid "Look at that ship flying straight through the mines. These idiots are going to kill themselves!"
msgstr "저 우주선이 지뢰 사이를 그대로 날아가고 있어. 저 멍청이들, 스스로 죽으려고 작정했군!"

