#. ScriptNotes = Amused
#. EDID: [01080458]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000AB5"
msgid "Starting to think you're getting a kick out of this... Am I wrong?"
msgstr "슬슬 이걸 즐기고 있는 것 같은데... 내가 틀렸어?"

