#. DialogueBefore = HailingShip: Hello? Can you hear me? This is Jara Kleel, pilot of the Sycorax.
#. DialogueAfter = HailingShip: I see, well... maybe someone else will come along that has half a heart. Sycorax out.
#. EDID: [0105456E]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000AC2"
msgid "I've taken damage from a pirate attack and lost power."
msgstr "해적 공격으로 피해를 입고 동력을 잃었습니다."

