#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0043E9DF
#. DialogueBefore = HailingShip: Hello? Can you hear me? This is Jara Kleel, pilot of the Sycorax. &&& HailingShip: &&& HailingShip: You're a life-saver! I was hauling a bounty to New Atlantis when a pack of pirates came out of nowhere. They must have been tracking me - guess they wanted their friend back.|I managed to fight them off, but they got a few good hits in and fried my power grid. I just need enough juice to jump to the nearest system for repairs. |What's left of their ship is drifting and ripe for the picking. If you get me a Power Cell, I'd be eternally grateful.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: You're a good egg. I appreciate it.
#. EDID: [01059ACB]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000AC3"
msgid "Ok. Let me see if I can find you what you need. "
msgstr "알겠습니다. 필요한 걸 찾아볼 수 있는지 보죠."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_RS01
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE_RS01_PowerCellDelivered
