#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00361B6D
#. DialogueBefore = HailingShip: You got it! You're a life-saver, truly.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Well... my mother used to say that you can always count on the kindness of strangers. I am eternally grateful. Thank you.
#. EDID: [0105F4B8]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
