#. ScriptNotes = Bobby patiently waiting for the player to buy something from his shop in a spaceship. / Serious / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Just looking around for now.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Just looking around for now.
#. EDID: [0106BE1E]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000AD9"
msgid "Sure, just let me know if you need any help."
msgstr "물론이죠. 도움이 필요하면 말씀만 하세요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC03
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC03_55_Bobby_Greeting
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Bobby
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC03_Bobby_Voice
#. Face = Confident
