#. ScriptNotes = Bobby patiently waiting for the player to buy something from his shop in a spaceship. / Confident / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Just looking around for now.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Just looking around for now.
#. EDID: [0106BE1D]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000ADA"
msgid "This is your shop, friend. Take all the time you need."
msgstr "여긴 당신 가게예요, 친구. 천천히 둘러보세요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC03
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC03_55_Bobby_Greeting
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Bobby
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC03_Bobby_Voice
#. Face = Sarcastic
#. SoundFileID = 0023755C
#. ScriptNotes = Bobby Kazan very happy to see his good friend (and invaluable customer) back into his shop. / Sarcastic / to Player Default
#. EDID: [0106BE2B]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000ADB"
msgid "Well, well, look at what the space cat brought in... How are you, my friend?"
msgstr "이런, 이런, 우주 고양이가 뭘 물어왔나 보군요... 잘 지내셨나요? 친구?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC03
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC03_55_Bobby_Greeting
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Bobby
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC03_Bobby_Voice
#. Face = Concentrating
#. SoundFileID = 00A3776C
#. ScriptNotes = Bobby Kazan welcoming the player as they return once more to the little shop in a spaceship he set up with his wife. More sincere this time. / Concentrating / to Player Default
#. EDID: [0106BE25]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000ADC"
msgid "Welcome back to our little shop in the stars."
msgstr "별들 사이의 작은 가게에 다시 오신 걸 환영합니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC03
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC03_55_Bobby_Greeting
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Bobby
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC03_Bobby_Voice
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 007B04CF
#. ScriptNotes = Bobby Kazan welcoming the player into the little shop in a spaceship he set up with his wife. Friendly but also out to make a buck. / Confident / to Player Default
#. EDID: [0106BE22]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000ADD"
msgid "Welcome to our shop. Let me know if you see anything you like."
msgstr "저희 가게에 오신 걸 환영합니다. 마음에 드는 게 있으면 말씀해 주세요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC03
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC03_55_Bobby_Greeting
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Bobby
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC03_Bobby_Voice
#. Face = Irritated
#. SoundFileID = 00FCDDBE
#. ScriptNotes = Bobby is ready to satisfy the player's shopping needs. / Irritated / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Bobby:
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: I'd like to see the specials, please.
#. EDID: [01053571]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000ADE"
msgid "What will it be today?"
msgstr "오늘은 무엇으로 할까요?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC03
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC03_55_Bobby_Greeting
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Bobby
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC03_Bobby_Voice
#. Face = Question
#. SoundFileID = 00A30408
#. ScriptNotes = Bobby is ready to satisfy the player's shopping needs. / Question / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Bobby:
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: I'd like to see the specials, please.
#. EDID: [01053570]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000ADF"
msgid "How can we help you?"
msgstr "무엇을 도와드릴까요?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC03
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC03_55_Bobby_Greeting
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Bobby
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0063E045
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Bobby: &&& Bobby:
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: That's our daughter's name. She would have turned nineteen a couple of weeks ago...
#. EDID: [0106BDF3]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000AE0"
msgid "Your ship's name, the \"Light of Anjali\". What does it mean?"
msgstr "당신 우주선 이름이 \"안잘리의 빛\"이던데요. 무슨 뜻인가요?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC03
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC03_55_Bobby_Greeting_Short
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Bobby
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC03_Bobby_Voice
#. Face = Irritated
#. SoundFileID = 00E47400
#. ScriptNotes = Bobby Kazan welcoming back the player - a returning customer - to his little shop in a spaceship. / Irritated / to Player Default
#. EDID: [010545E7]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000AE1"
msgid "Please, make yourself at home."
msgstr "부디 편히 계세요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC03
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC03_55_Bobby_Greeting_Short
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Bobby
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC03_Bobby_Voice
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 00DC13FC
#. ScriptNotes = Bobby Kazan welcoming back the player - a returning customer - to his little shop in a spaceship. / Confident / to Player Default
#. EDID: [010545E5]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000AE2"
msgid "Hello there!"
msgstr "안녕하세요!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC03
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC03_100_FanishaDialogue
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Fanisha
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC03_Fanisha_Voice
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00B1F38B
#. ScriptNotes = Reacts unemotionally to players saying they're not buying more stuff right now. / Neutral / to Player Default
#. Prompt = I'm fine for now.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I'm fine for now.
#. EDID: [010545DE]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000AE3"
msgid "Let me know if you change your mind."
msgstr "마음이 바뀌면 말씀해 주세요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC03
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC03_55_BobbyRumors
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Bobby
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC03_Bobby_Voice
#. Face = Disgust
#. SoundFileID = 00FD6C8B
#. ScriptNotes = Bobby Kazan, space trader, shares a bit of information/rumor/gossip he's heard with the player. / Disgust / to Player Default
#. EDID: [0106BE36]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000AE4"
msgid "The other day we had a VP for Galbank come aboard. Didn't even buy anything. What a cheapskate!"
msgstr "얼마 전 갤뱅크 부사장이 탑승했는데, 아무것도 안 샀어요. 정말 구두쇠라니까요!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC03
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC03_55_BobbyRumors
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Bobby
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC03_Bobby_Voice
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 00672704
#. ScriptNotes = Bobby Kazan, space trader, shares a bit of information/rumor/gossip he's heard with the player. / Confident / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Bobby: I heard a few things...
#. EDID: [0106BE36]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000AE5"
msgid "You meet some interesting people if you travel the Free Lanes long enough."
msgstr "자유 항로를 오래 여행하다 보면 흥미로운 사람들을 만나게 되죠."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC03
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC03_55_BobbyRumors
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Bobby
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC03_Bobby_Voice
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 009662D7
#. ScriptNotes = Bobby Kazan, space trader, shares a bit of information/rumor/gossip he's heard with the player, here about the bartender on Anchorpoint station. / Confident / to Player Default
#. EDID: [0106BE34]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000AE6"
msgid "She always has something interesting to say."
msgstr "항상 흥미로운 이야기를 해주거든요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC03
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC03_55_BobbyRumors
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Bobby
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC03_Bobby_Voice
#. Face = Thinking
#. SoundFileID = 00421C16
#. ScriptNotes = Bobby Kazan, space trader, shares a bit of information/rumor/gossip he's heard with the player. / Thinking / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Bobby: As usual, take what I say with a grain of salt.
#. EDID: [0106BE34]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000AE7"
msgid "If you ever get out to Anchorpoint, make sure you talk to the bartender."
msgstr "앵커포인트에 가게 되면 꼭 바텐더와 얘기해 보세요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC03
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC03_55_BobbyRumors
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Bobby
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC03_Bobby_Voice
#. Face = Disgust
#. SoundFileID = 00C39904
#. ScriptNotes = Bobby Kazan, space trader, shares a bit of information/rumor/gossip he's heard with the player. / Disgust / to Player Default
#. EDID: [0106BE32]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000AE8"
msgid "They say the guy who owns it won't spend a credit if he doesn't have to, and it shows."
msgstr "꼭 필요한 게 아니면 1크레딧도 안 쓴다고들 하는데, 딱 티가 나요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC03
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC03_55_BobbyRumors
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Bobby
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC03_Bobby_Voice
#. Face = Irritated
#. SoundFileID = 001489FC
#. ScriptNotes = Bobby Kazan, space trader, shares a bit of information/rumor/gossip he's heard with the player. / Irritated / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Bobby: I heard a few things...
#. EDID: [0106BE32]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000AE9"
msgid "Have you been to Anchorpoint yet? Kind of a dive, if you ask me."
msgstr "앵커포인트에 가 본 적 있어요? 제 생각엔 좀 허름한 곳 같아요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC03
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC03_55_BobbyRumors
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Bobby
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC03_Bobby_Voice
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00DE164F
#. ScriptNotes = Bobby putting a caveat on the info/rumor/gossip he just shared with the player. / Neutral / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Bobby:
#. DialogueAfter = Bobby: I'd like to see the specials, please.
#. EDID: [0106BE3E]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000AEA"
msgid "You didn't hear it from me. Anything else?"
msgstr "제게 들었다고 하진 마세요. 또 필요한 거 있나요?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC03
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC03_55_BobbyRumors
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Bobby
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC03_Bobby_Voice
#. Face = Question
#. SoundFileID = 0037D952
#. ScriptNotes = Bobby putting a caveat on the info/rumor/gossip he just shared with the player. / Question / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Bobby:
#. DialogueAfter = Bobby: I'd like to see the specials, please.
#. EDID: [0106BE3D]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000AEB"
msgid "Well, that's what they say. What else do you need today?"
msgstr "뭐, 사람들이 그렇게 말하더군요. 오늘은 또 무엇이 필요하신가요?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC03
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC03_55_BobbyRumors
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Bobby
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC03_Bobby_Voice
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00B4F8B0
#. ScriptNotes = Bobby putting a caveat on the info/rumor/gossip he just shared with the player. / Neutral / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Bobby:
#. DialogueAfter = Bobby: I'd like to see the specials, please.
#. EDID: [0106BE3A]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000AEC"
msgid "That's what I heard anyway. Anything else for you today?"
msgstr "어쨌든 그렇게 들었어요. 오늘 또 필요한 게 있나요?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC03
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC03_55_Bobby_Greeting
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Bobby
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC03_Bobby_Voice
#. Face = Irritated
#. SoundFileID = 00EA6EF9
#. ScriptNotes = Bobby is just about to share some information/rumor/gossip with the player. / Irritated / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Heard anything good recently?
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Heard anything good recently?
#. EDID: [0106BE13]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000AED"
msgid "Not a whole lot, but still..."
msgstr "아주 많지는 않지만, 그래도..."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_EC03
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Barrett
#. VoiceType = NPCMBarrett
#. Face = Spaceship / Question
#. SoundFileID = 0006CA1D
#. ScriptNotes = Companion commenting on Bobby and Fanisha's shop. which they have set up inside their spaceship. / Question
#. EDID: [0106C822]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000AEF"
msgid "Did you find anything you like?"
msgstr "마음에 드는 걸 찾으셨나요?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_EC03
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = SamCoe
#. VoiceType = NPCMSamCoe
#. Face = Spaceship / Smug
#. SoundFileID = 00F9947A
#. ScriptNotes = Companion commenting on Bobby and Fanisha's shop. which they have set up inside their spaceship. / Smug
#. EDID: [0106C81E]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000AF0"
msgid "What did I tell you, huh?"
msgstr "내가 뭐랬어, 응?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_EC03
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE_EC03_100b_HailingAnswered
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = MerchantShip
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00B7D83A
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = MerchantShip: Greetings traveler. This is your lucky day! &&& MerchantShip: &&& MerchantShip: Hello there! Are you ready to save big on everyday items?
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Such a shame, I'm sure you would have found what you needed.
#. EDID: [0104F90E]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000AF1"
msgid "Not right now, sorry."
msgstr "지금은 안 돼요, 죄송합니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_EC03
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE_EC03_100a_Hailing
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = MerchantShip
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC03_Bobby_Voice
#. Face = Spaceship / Confident
#. SoundFileID = 00ADB135
#. ScriptNotes = Over ship Radio: trader Bobby Kazan trying to entice the player to buy their wares. / Confident
#. DialogueBefore = MerchantShip: Greetings traveler. This is your lucky day!
#. DialogueAfter = MerchantShip: Well, maybe next time then.
#. EDID: [0104F91A]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000AF2"
msgid "We can deliver to your ship, or you can come aboard for special deals."
msgstr "당신 우주선으로 배달해 드릴 수도 있고, 특별 할인을 보러 직접 탑승하셔도 됩니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_EC03
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE_EC03_100b_HailingAnswered_1
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = MerchantShip
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC03_Bobby_Voice
#. Face = Spaceship / Friendly
#. SoundFileID = 0029EE89
#. ScriptNotes = Over ship Radio: trader Bobby Kazan hoping the player will purchase something from him next time they meet. / Friendly / to Player Default
#. Prompt = I'm all set, thanks.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I'm all set, thanks.
#. EDID: [01052EE1]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000AF3"
msgid "Very well then. Safe travels, valued customer!"
msgstr "그럼 알겠습니다. 안전하게 다니세요, 귀한 고객님!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_EC03
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE_EC03_100b_HailingAnswered_1
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = MerchantShip
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 008B3161
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = MerchantShip: Hello again, my friend! &&& MerchantShip: &&& MerchantShip: We're glad our paths crossed again, traveler. What do you need today?
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Very good, we're waiting for you.
#. EDID: [01052EE8]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000AF4"
msgid "I'm coming over to look at the specials."
msgstr "특별 상품을 보러 그쪽으로 가겠습니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_EC03
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE_EC03_95_ShotAtShip
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = MerchantShip
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC03_Bobby_Voice
#. Face = Spaceship / Angry
#. SoundFileID = 000CF665
#. ScriptNotes = On ship radio: Bobby reacts to the player shooting at his ship, trying to de-escalate as they fly away to safety. / Angry
#. DialogueAfter = ActiveCompanion: Why shoot at these people? They seem quite harmless...
#. EDID: [010545E3]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000AF5"
msgid "Hey, you break it, you buy it!"
msgstr "이봐요, 깨뜨리면 사야 해요!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_EC03
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE_EC03_100a_Hailing_1
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = MerchantShip
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC03_Bobby_Voice
#. Face = Spaceship / Happy
#. SoundFileID = 00DA6EF6
#. ScriptNotes = Over ship Radio: trader Bobby Kazan trying to entice the player to buy their wares. / Happy
#. DialogueBefore = MerchantShip: Hello again, my friend!
#. DialogueAfter = MerchantShip: Well, maybe next time then.
#. EDID: [01052EEC]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000AF6"
msgid "Happy to see you're still traveling the Free Lanes!"
msgstr "아직도 자유 항로를 여행 중이라니 반갑군요!"

#. List: 2
