#. Face = Disgust
#. SoundFileID = 00C3E250
#. ScriptNotes = Annoyed at the player. / Disgust / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Finally. Take me back to Anchorpoint.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Finally. Take me back to Anchorpoint.
#. EDID: [0104E23F]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000B33"
msgid "Just don't cause any trouble on the way there..."
msgstr "가는 길에 문제만 일으키지 마..."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0950_SAWYER_FG
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Sawyer
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 002A0E84
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Sawyer: What just happened...?
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: I guess I did in a way, but didn't think it was that bad. I thought she was playing around. Damn.
#. EDID: [0104E288]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000B34"
msgid "Didn't you know what Opal was doing to Wren?"
msgstr "오팔이 렌에게 무슨 짓을 하고 있었는지 몰랐어?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0950_SAWYER_FG
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Sawyer
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 009E8242
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: You were right. This was fun. &&& Sawyer: Man, did you do this? What the hell...? *Sigh* I never should have invited you. I'm ready to get you out of my hair, alright? Let's get you back.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: *Sigh* Look, the party's over now. I don't know what else you want to do. But be quick about it. I have to get Sadie and the other's home.
#. EDID: [0104E255]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000B35"
msgid "I've changed my mind. I don't want to leave yet."
msgstr "마음이 바뀌었어. 아직 떠나고 싶지 않아."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0950_SAWYER_FG
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Sawyer
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00F73D07
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Justice. &&& Sawyer: What...?|*Sigh* Never mind... Let me take you back to Anchorpoint. Looks like I got a mess to clean up afterwards.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Just don't cause any trouble on the way there...
#. EDID: [0104E22C]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000B36"
msgid "Finally. Take me back to Anchorpoint."
msgstr "드디어. 앵커포인트로 데려다줘."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0480_PARTY
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Opal
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCOpalWoods
#. Face = Sad
#. SoundFileID = 00969E52
#. ScriptNotes = Playing innocent. But failing to keep it up. Starting to feel sad, and maybe play a bit of the victim. / Sad / to Sadie
#. DialogueBefore = Opal: We've talked about this. I didn't do anything. Why would I be mean to Wren? &&& Sadie: You keep my sister's name out of your mouth! It doesn't matter who told me. You've been lying to me and been saying who knows what to Wren.
#. DialogueAfter = Sawyer: Woah, woah, what's going on here?
#. EDID: [0104E29E]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000B37"
msgid "Sadie... Listen..."
msgstr "세이디... 들어 봐..."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0480_PARTY
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Wren
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCWrenCarr
#. Face = Sad
#. SoundFileID = 00209900
#. ScriptNotes = Guilty. Thinking she caused this huge fight. / Sad / to Wren
#. DialogueBefore = Sadie: Cooper, you're done with that two-faced snake! &&& ... &&& Opal: Sadie... Listen... &&& Sawyer: Woah, woah, what's going on here? &&& Sadie: What's going on is my family and I are heading home. Go on, Sawyer, take us home in your new ride.
#. DialogueAfter = Cooper: You don't have to say anything.
#. EDID: [0104E22E]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000B38"
msgid "I'm sorry..."
msgstr "미안해..."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0480_PARTY
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Cooper
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCCooperCarr
#. Face = Shocked
#. SoundFileID = 00957102
#. ScriptNotes = Overhearing Sadie yelling at Opal and is shocked/angry. / Shocked / to Opal
#. DialogueBefore = Sadie: Cooper, you're done with that two-faced snake! &&& Sadie: I know you're the one that's been tormenting my sister! &&& Opal: We've talked about this. I didn't do anything. Why would I be mean to Wren? &&& Sadie: You keep my sister's name out of your mouth! It doesn't matter who told me. You've been lying to me and been saying who knows what to Wren.
#. DialogueAfter = Sawyer: Woah, woah, what's going on here?
#. EDID: [0104E2B1]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000B39"
msgid "Opal, what did Sadie just say?!"
msgstr "오팔, 방금 세이디가 뭐라고 한 거야?!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0480_PARTY
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Opal
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCOpalWoods
#. Face = Confused
#. SoundFileID = 001EC2B9
#. ScriptNotes = Confused. / Confused / to Sadie
#. DialogueBefore = Sadie: Cooper, you're done with that two-faced snake!
#. DialogueAfter = Opal: We've talked about this. I didn't do anything. Why would I be mean to Wren?
#. EDID: [0104E238]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000B3A"
msgid "Sadie?"
msgstr "세이디?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0480_PARTY
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Sadie
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCSadieCarr
#. Face = VeryAngry
#. SoundFileID = 00719F60
#. ScriptNotes = Angry. / VeryAngry / to Cooper
#. DialogueAfter = Opal: Sadie?
#. EDID: [0104E212]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000B3B"
msgid " Cooper, you're done with that two-faced snake!"
msgstr "쿠퍼, 저 두 얼굴의 독사 같은 여자와는 끝이야!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0475_PARTY
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Wren
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCWrenCarr
#. Face = Sad
#. SoundFileID = 0035BF8F
#. ScriptNotes = Shy and nervous. / Sad / to Wren
#. DialogueBefore = Wren: I know I told you before everything was fine. But to be honest, it's true that Opal has been bullying me. &&& Sadie: What? But you said-...|What all has she said? You should have told me sooner.
#. DialogueAfter = Sadie: I thought she was my friend.
#. EDID: [0104E26D]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000B3C"
msgid "I just know you two are friends, and I didn't want to mess that up."
msgstr "나는 그냥 너희 둘이 친구라는 걸 알고 있었고, 그걸 망치고 싶지 않았어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0475_PARTY
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Sadie
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCSadieCarr
#. Face = Suspicious
#. SoundFileID = 007B49FD
#. ScriptNotes = Casual and sweet to her younger sister. / Suspicious / to Wren
#. DialogueBefore = Wren: Sadie, can we talk? It's about Opal...
#. DialogueAfter = Wren: It's best she's not around.
#. EDID: [0106B85F]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000B3D"
msgid "Oh, Opal? You just missed her."
msgstr "아, 오팔? 방금 놓쳤어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0300Z_Wren_EMP
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Wren
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCWrenCarr
#. Face = Grateful
#. SoundFileID = 00C9A439
#. ScriptNotes = Grateful. / Grateful / to Player Default
#. Prompt = I learned to fight for myself.
#. EDID: [0104E22F]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000B3E"
msgid "Thank you for everything you said."
msgstr "네가 해 준 모든 말에 고마워."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0300Z_Wren_EMP
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Wren
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCWrenCarr
#. Face = Worried
#. SoundFileID = 001258BB
#. ScriptNotes = Nervous to tell Sadie, but sees she needs to now. / Worried / to Player Default
#. Prompt = I learned to fight for myself.
#. EDID: [0104E22F]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000B3F"
msgid "But perhaps I can at least stand up for myself? Sadie deserves to know anyway."
msgstr "하지만 적어도 나 자신을 위해 맞설 수는 있지 않을까? 어쨌든 세이디도 알아야 해."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0300Z_Wren_EMP
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Wren
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCWrenCarr
#. Face = Worried
#. SoundFileID = 00BD3F9B
#. ScriptNotes = Nervous to tell Sadie. / Worried / to Player Default
#. Prompt = I learned to fight for myself.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I learned to fight for myself.
#. EDID: [0104E22F]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000B40"
msgid "I don't know if I could do that."
msgstr "내가 그렇게 할 수 있을지 모르겠어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0300Z_Wren_EMP
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Wren
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00ED0938
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I've been in your position. Trust me, no one should ever go through what you're going through. &&& Wren: You have? I haven't talked to anyone about this. It's just scary...|How did you get through it?
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: I don't know if I could do that.
#. EDID: [0104E29D]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000B41"
msgid "I learned to fight for myself."
msgstr "나는 나 자신을 위해 싸우는 법을 배웠어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0300C_Wren_DIP
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Wren
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00A66C32
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Maybe. Unless Opal is jealous. You are Sadie's sister after all. &&& Wren: That's no reason to be jealous though. Opal and Sadie have been friends for years. Right?
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: You're right. It isn't.
#. EDID: [0104E2A7]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000B42"
msgid "Fine. Don't tell anyone. This was none of my business to begin with."
msgstr "좋아. 아무에게도 말하지 마. 애초에 내 일이 아니었어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0300C_Wren_DIP
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Wren
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCWrenCarr
#. Face = Concerned
#. SoundFileID = 006E28F3
#. ScriptNotes = Shy, but a hint of annoyance at the player pushing her to talk. / Concerned / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Fine. Don't tell anyone. This was none of my business to begin with.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Fine. Don't tell anyone. This was none of my business to begin with.
#. EDID: [0104E280]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000B43"
msgid "You're right. It isn't."
msgstr "네 말이 맞아. 아니지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0250_SawyerGossip
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00EB1CBB
#. DialogueAfter = Sawyer: Yeah, don't get Opal started on Wren. I swear she'll talk your ear off about the girl, and it's never anything good. But she just teases like that.
#. EDID: [0104E28B]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000B44"
msgid "Since I'm new here, is there anything I should know about anyone here?"
msgstr "내가 여기 새로 왔으니까, 여기 사람들에 대해 알아야 할 게 있을까?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0210C_SAW&OPAL
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Sawyer
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 001E22EF
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: If you two don't tell me where I am right now... &&& Sawyer: Hey, now! Calm down a moment. Relax. You're on my ship. Safe and sound. &&& Sawyer: And the party still isn't over. We invited more in on the fun. Go ahead, have a blast! Drink. Mingle! Who knows, by the time all this is over, you may meet your new best friend.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Woah, not yet. We're still having fun. Besides, do you want me to drive my ship during my own party?
#. EDID: [0104E24B]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000B45"
msgid "Wait. I didn't want to be here. Bring me back to Anchorpoint."
msgstr "잠깐. 난 여기 있고 싶지 않았어. 앵커포인트로 데려다줘."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0300B_Wren
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Wren
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCWrenCarr
#. Face = Stern
#. SoundFileID = 00444CCC
#. ScriptNotes = Shy and worried. / Stern / to Player Default
#. Prompt = It's alright. You can tell me.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: It's alright. You can tell me.
#. EDID: [0104E275]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000B46"
msgid "There's nothing to tell. Opal and I just aren't close is all. Now, will you drop it?"
msgstr "할 얘기 없어. 오팔과 나는 그냥 별로 친하지 않을 뿐이야. 이제 그만할래?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0215_SAWYER
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Sawyer
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCSawyerBrooks
#. Face = Smirk
#. SoundFileID = 00AED9CA
#. ScriptNotes = Friendly. / Smirk / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Okay. I should really get back to Anchorpoint.
#. EDID: [0104E265]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000B47"
msgid "Hey, now, we still have loads of fun to have and everyone is having a great time! I'll take you back once the party's over, yea?"
msgstr "야, 아직 재미있게 놀 게 잔뜩 남았고 모두 즐거운 시간을 보내고 있잖아! 파티가 끝나면 데려다줄게, 응?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0210C_SAW&OPAL
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Sawyer
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCSawyerBrooks
#. Face = Happy
#. SoundFileID = 006DCFE8
#. ScriptNotes = Friendly. / Happy / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Sawyer: Hey, now! Calm down a moment. Relax. You're on my ship. Safe and sound.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Right... I should get back to Anchorpoint.
#. EDID: [0104E25E]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000B48"
msgid "And the party still isn't over. We invited more in on the fun. Go ahead, have a blast! Drink. Mingle! Who knows, by the time all this is over, you may meet your new best friend."
msgstr "그리고 파티는 아직 끝나지 않았어. 재미를 더하려고 사람들을 더 초대했지. 마음껏 즐겨! 마시고, 어울려! 이 모든 게 끝날 때쯤엔 새 절친을 만날지도 모르잖아."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0210B_OPAL
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Opal
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCOpalWoods
#. Face = Happy
#. SoundFileID = 005C6895
#. ScriptNotes = Friendly. / Happy / to Player Default
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: If you two don't tell me where I am right now...
#. EDID: [0104E204]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000B49"
msgid "How was your nap? You feeling alright?"
msgstr "낮잠은 어땠어? 괜찮아?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0170_SAW&OPAL
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Sawyer
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCSawyerBrooks
#. Face = Happy
#. SoundFileID = 00EDDCDC
#. ScriptNotes = Excited to start drinking with the Player. / Happy / to Player Default
#. EDID: [0104E20C]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000B4A"
msgid "Don't worry. We order quality stuff. You ready? Go!"
msgstr "걱정 마. 우린 좋은 물건을 주문해. 준비됐어? 가!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0150C_SAW&OPAL
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Sawyer
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCSawyerBrooks
#. Face = Happy
#. SoundFileID = 00C93A47
#. ScriptNotes = Casual and Friendly. (Player response: Looks like you both are having a nice time.) / Happy / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Sawyer: Sorry. Can't help it. We're celebrating! Want to join? The more the merrier.
#. DialogueAfter = Opal: Really, Sawyer? Them?
#. EDID: [0104E28D]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000B4B"
msgid "Of course! This is a celebration! Come on, sit! Join us."
msgstr "물론이지! 축하 자리잖아! 이리 와, 앉아! 함께해."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0150C_SAW&OPAL
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00506DBE
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Opal: Hm, what? Here to buy a lady a drink? Too bad. I already got a boyfriend. &&& ... &&& Sawyer: Of course! This is a celebration! Come on, sit! Join us. &&& Opal: Really, Sawyer? Them? &&& Sawyer: Don't mind Opal. She has a hard time making new friends. |Who knows. We all may end up being peas in a pod!
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Take a seat.
#. EDID: [0104E251]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000B4C"
msgid "Sure. I would love to join you."
msgstr "그래. 너희와 함께하고 싶어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0300B_OPAL
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Opal
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCOpalWoods
#. Face = Angry
#. SoundFileID = 00EFAAEF
#. ScriptNotes = Angry. / Angry / to Player Default
#. Prompt = You don't deserve these friends. Soon enough they'll know what you're doing and leave you behind.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: You don't deserve these friends. Soon enough they'll know what you're doing and leave you behind.
#. EDID: [0106B284]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000B4D"
msgid "You know nothing about us. You're just some nosey weirdo me and Sawyer found at a bar."
msgstr "넌 우리에 대해 아무것도 몰라. 그냥 나랑 소이어가 술집에서 주워 온 참견쟁이 괴짜일 뿐이야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0300B_SADIE
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Sadie
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 004E7DF6
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: You should listen to this slate I found. &&& Sadie: A slate? Is this Opal's? Why do you have that? Let me see it.|What? I'm sorry. What is this? What- Why would she even say this?
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: I don't get it. Wren kept telling me nothing was happening. How long has this even been going on? Wren just got back from being sick. How could she-
#. EDID: [0106B2F6]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000B4E"
msgid "Opal has been bullying your sister."
msgstr "오팔이 네 여동생을 괴롭히고 있어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0300B_OPAL
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Opal
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0093BBF6
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: You sure had some colorful things to say in this slate of yours. &&& Opal: Where did you find that? That wasn't for you to listen to!
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Don't you dare show her that!
#. EDID: [0106B296]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000B4F"
msgid "I think Sadie would be interested in hearing it."
msgstr "세이디가 그 얘기를 듣고 싶어 할 것 같아."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0300B_OPAL
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCOpalWoods
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCOpalWoods
#. Face = Angry
#. SoundFileID = 0089B30A
#. ScriptNotes = Angry. / Angry / to Player Default
#. Prompt = I have your friends in the palm of my hands. I know exactly what to do with this slate.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I have your friends in the palm of my hands. I know exactly what to do with this slate.
#. EDID: [0106B2F7]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000B50"
msgid "You're going to do nothing."
msgstr "넌 아무것도 하지 않을 거야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0300A_OPAL_TL
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 002DB6FA
#. DialogueAfter = Opal: Where did you find that? That wasn't for you to listen to!
#. EDID: [0106B2C1]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000B51"
msgid "You sure had some colorful things to say in this slate of yours."
msgstr "네 슬레이트에 꽤 다채로운 말을 적어 놨더군."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0300D_Wren_SLATE
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Wren
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCWrenCarr
#. Face = Irritated
#. SoundFileID = 00B74445
#. ScriptNotes = Her shyness breaks off as Wren starts to go from upset to mad. / Irritated / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Wren: Where did you get this? I just-
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: And she won't stop unless you do something about it.
#. EDID: [0106B27E]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000B52"
msgid "I don't get it. Why does she do this? Sadie's her friend. She's dating my brother. Yet there is something wrong with me? What the hell?"
msgstr "이해가 안 돼. 왜 저러는 거야? 세이디는 자기 친구잖아. 내 오빠랑 사귀고 있고. 그런데 내가 문제라고? 대체 뭐야?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0300D_Wren_SLATE
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCWrenCarr
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCWrenCarr
#. Face = Irritated
#. SoundFileID = 00180357
#. ScriptNotes = Slightly more determined now. She's tired of the bullying. / Irritated / to Player Default
#. Prompt = And she won't stop unless you do something about it.
#. EDID: [0106B2BA]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000B53"
msgid "Excuse me. I need to go talk to my sister."
msgstr "실례할게. 내 여동생과 얘기하러 가야겠어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0300D_Wren_SLATE
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCWrenCarr
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCWrenCarr
#. Face = Somber
#. SoundFileID = 009FE5E2
#. ScriptNotes = Very upset and somber. / Somber / to Player Default
#. Prompt = And she won't stop unless you do something about it.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: And she won't stop unless you do something about it.
#. EDID: [0106B2BA]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000B54"
msgid "You're right... This isn't fair. Why do I have to be the one to speak up? "
msgstr "네 말이 맞아... 이건 불공평해. 왜 내가 나서서 말해야 하는 거지?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0300D_Wren_SLATE
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Wren
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCWrenCarr
#. Face = Suspicious
#. SoundFileID = 00ABD38E
#. ScriptNotes = Slightly more determined now. She's tired of the bullying. / Suspicious / to Player Default
#. Prompt = I think Sadie should have a listen to that slate.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I think Sadie should have a listen to that slate.
#. EDID: [0106B2E6]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000B55"
msgid "Yea... Yea, I think so too. Thank you."
msgstr "그래... 그래, 나도 그렇게 생각해. 고마워."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_TL_SAWYER_01
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00823293
#. DialogueAfter = Sawyer: My parents. We haven't seen eye to eye in a long time till recently. Guess they were happy to have their boy back and gave me a real nice allowance.
#. EDID: [0106B305]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000B56"
msgid "Where did you get the money for this nice ship?"
msgstr "이 멋진 우주선을 살 돈은 어디서 났어?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0250_WrenGossip
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Wren
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCWrenCarr
#. Face = Worried
#. SoundFileID = 001E8164
#. ScriptNotes = Impressed when talking about Sadie. But her tone becomes more shy and unsure when she brings up Sawyer. / Worried / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Would you know anything about this crowd?
#. EDID: [0106B2DF]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000B57"
msgid "I know my sister, Sadie, is the one who decorated and set up the ship's security. I only came today because I could tell she wanted me to see how everything turned out."
msgstr ""
"내 여동생 세이디가 우주선을 꾸미고 보안 장치를 설치했다는 건 알아. 오늘 온 것도, 세이디가 결과를 내가 봐 주길 바란다는 걸 알았기 "
"때문이야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0250_SadieGossip
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Sadie
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCSadieCarr
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0009FE94
#. ScriptNotes = Casual tone as she talks about her friends. / Neutral / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: What can you tell me about your friends?
#. EDID: [0106B2A8]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000B58"
msgid "Sawyer pays great now that he has Mommy and Daddy funding him. He asked me to set up his ship's security system and the amount he paid for it... damn. He might be on some kind of spending high now that he has the credits. "
msgstr ""
"소이어는 엄마 아빠가 돈을 대 주게 된 뒤로 보수가 정말 좋아졌어. 그가 내게 우주선 보안 시스템을 설치해 달라고 했는데, 그가 지불한 "
"금액이... 젠장. 크레딧이 생기더니 지금 돈 쓰는 재미에 빠진 것 같아."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0300B_Wren
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Wren
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCWrenCarr
#. Face = Worried
#. SoundFileID = 002099E2
#. ScriptNotes = Horrified that Opal is still saying terrible things about her. / Worried / to Player Default
#. Prompt = If she wasn't then she wouldn't have said what she said in this slate.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: If she wasn't then she wouldn't have said what she said in this slate.
#. DialogueAfter = Wren: Where did you get this? I just-
#. EDID: [0106B2BB]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000B59"
msgid "What? Let me see that."
msgstr "뭐? 그거 좀 보여줘."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0300_WREN_SC03
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00795914
#. EDID: [0106B28D]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000B5A"
msgid "If you don't tell me, then I'll go tell Sadie about it myself."
msgstr "네가 말하지 않으면, 내가 직접 세이디에게 말하러 갈 거야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0300B_Wren
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCWrenCarr
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCWrenCarr
#. Face = Worried
#. SoundFileID = 008A3C29
#. ScriptNotes = Frustrated and sad the Player is pushing her about the details with Opal. Just wants the Player to leave. / Worried / to Player Default
#. Prompt = If you don't stand up for yourself, it won't end.
#. DialogueBefore = Wren: But what am I meant to do? Opal and Sadie have been best friends for years. I can't destroy that.
#. EDID: [0106B2E9]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000B5B"
msgid "No. No, I'm done talking about this with you. Just leave me alone, okay?"
msgstr "아니. 아니, 이 얘기는 이제 너랑 그만할래. 그냥 날 내버려 둬, 알았지?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0300_WREN_SCRepeat
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Wren
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCWrenCarr
#. Face = Worried
#. SoundFileID = 0095A42C
#. ScriptNotes = Speech Challenge success. Worried and unsure. / Worried / to Player Default
#. EDID: [0106B2FD]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000B5C"
msgid "I guess that's true."
msgstr "그건 맞는 것 같아."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0300_WREN_SC05
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Wren
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCWrenCarr
#. Face = Somber
#. SoundFileID = 0030DAD3
#. ScriptNotes = Speech challenge success. Thinking aloud. / Somber / to Player Default
#. EDID: [0106B3BB]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000B5D"
msgid "I guess that could be true. I wouldn't want her to get away with harassing Cooper or Sadie if she is."
msgstr "그럴 수도 있겠네. 만약 그렇다면 오팔이 쿠퍼나 세이디를 괴롭히고도 그냥 넘어가게 두고 싶진 않아."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0195_SAW&OPAL
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Sawyer
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCSawyerBrooks
#. Face = Impressed
#. SoundFileID = 009AF786
#. ScriptNotes = Friendly. / Impressed / to Player Default
#. EDID: [0104E266]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000B5E"
msgid "Here. Let us help you. Once you get some rest, I'm sure you'll feel as good as new."
msgstr "자. 우리가 도와줄게. 좀 쉬고 나면 새 사람처럼 좋아질 거야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0195_SAW&OPAL
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Sawyer
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCSawyerBrooks
#. Face = Happy
#. SoundFileID = 00D42071
#. ScriptNotes = Surprised by Opal saying the time, but then wants to keep having fun with the Player. / Happy / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Sawyer: Opal, get a load of our new friend! &&& Opal: Wait. What time is it? Hey, Sawyer, we got to go meet up with Sadie and the others soon.
#. EDID: [0104E266]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000B5F"
msgid "Oh, right. Hey, friend, we- You good? Heh, maybe that was too many drinks?"
msgstr "아, 맞다. 이봐, 친구, 우리- 괜찮아? 하, 술을 너무 많이 마셨나?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0185_SAW&OPAL
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Sawyer
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCSawyerBrooks
#. Face = Happy
#. SoundFileID = 0050220E
#. ScriptNotes = (Player response: And another one.) Having fun drinking. / Happy / to Player Default
#. EDID: [0104E1F9]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000B60"
msgid "Ha! The others don't know what they're missing. Ready for the third drink?"
msgstr "하! 다른 사람들은 뭘 놓치는지 모른다니까. 세 번째 잔 준비됐어?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0252_COOPER_GREETING
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Cooper
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCCooperCarr
#. Face = Apologetic
#. SoundFileID = 00D073C1
#. ScriptNotes = Voice more gentle while talking about his sister. And not so rude to the Player. / Apologetic / to Player Default
#. Prompt = I think Wren mentioned you, so I wanted to say 'hi.'
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I think Wren mentioned you, so I wanted to say 'hi.'
#. DialogueAfter = Cooper: Right. Fine. I'm Cooper. I'm here because Opal and Sadie wanted me here. Not because Sawyer's get-togethers are my style. That's all.
#. EDID: [0106D679]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000B61"
msgid "Can't imagine you got much out of her. Don't take it personally. She's quiet like that."
msgstr "그녀에게서 별말 못 들었겠지. 개인적으로 받아들이진 마. 원래 그렇게 조용해."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0300D_SAWYER_FG
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Sawyer
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCSawyerBrooks
#. Face = Concerned
#. SoundFileID = 00127E46
#. ScriptNotes = Kind of annoyed at the Player, and worried for Opal. / Concerned / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Wait. I changed my mind. I don't want to leave yet.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Wait. I changed my mind. I don't want to leave yet.
#. EDID: [0106D695]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000B62"
msgid "Really? You've put Opal pretty on edge, okay? Whatever you want to do, just be quick about it."
msgstr "정말? 오팔을 꽤 불안하게 만들었어, 알겠지? 뭘 하려는 거든 빨리 해."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0195_SAW&OPAL
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Sawyer
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCSawyerBrooks
#. Face = Happy
#. SoundFileID = 0049F54B
#. ScriptNotes = Having a great time drinking with his new friend. / Happy
#. DialogueAfter = Opal: Wait. What time is it? Hey, Sawyer, we got to go meet up with Sadie and the others soon.
#. EDID: [0104E245]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000B63"
msgid "Opal, get a load of this guy!"
msgstr "오팔, 이 남자 좀 봐!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0195_SAW&OPAL
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Sawyer
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCSawyerBrooks
#. Face = Happy
#. SoundFileID = 007626BE
#. ScriptNotes = Having a great time drinking with his new friend. / Happy
#. DialogueAfter = Opal: Wait. What time is it? Hey, Sawyer, we got to go meet up with Sadie and the others soon.
#. EDID: [0104E246]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000B64"
msgid "Opal, get a load of this lady!"
msgstr "오팔, 이 여자 좀 봐!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0300D_SAWYER_FG
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Sawyer
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00626CE5
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Sawyer: What did you do?
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Yeah. Yeah. I can take you there.
#. EDID: [0106D67A]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000B65"
msgid "I'm with her. I just want to go back to Anchorpoint."
msgstr "나도 그녀와 같은 생각이야. 그냥 앵커포인트로 돌아가고 싶어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0300D_SAWYER_FG
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCSawyerBrooks
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCSawyerBrooks
#. Face = Confused
#. SoundFileID = 00936A26
#. ScriptNotes = Annoyed at the Player. / Confused / to Player Default
#. Prompt = I gave her what she deserved.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I gave her what she deserved.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: I'm ready. Take me back to Anchorpoint.
#. EDID: [0106D691]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000B66"
msgid "I invited you to have fun, not make Opal upset. Whatever. Let me just take you back."
msgstr "난 네가 재미있게 놀라고 초대한 거지, 오팔을 화나게 하라고 부른 게 아니야. 됐다. 그냥 데려다줄게."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0252_COOPER_GREETING
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Cooper
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCCooperCarr
#. Face = Amused
#. SoundFileID = 0075B772
#. ScriptNotes = Amused at the Player's answer and annoyed at Sawyer. / Amused / to Player Default
#. Prompt = He's a bit much for me.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: He's a bit much for me.
#. DialogueAfter = Cooper: Right. Fine. I'm Cooper. I'm here because Opal and Sadie wanted me here. Not because Sawyer's get-togethers are my style. That's all.
#. EDID: [0106D698]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000B67"
msgid "And you just met the guy. I've known him for years. Imagine how I feel."
msgstr "넌 그 남자를 방금 만났잖아. 난 몇 년째 알고 있어. 내 기분이 어떨지 상상해 봐."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0252_COOPER_GREETING
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCCooperCarr
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCCooperCarr
#. Face = Stern
#. SoundFileID = 009A7822
#. ScriptNotes = Slightly less rude. More indifferent, but mocking Sawyer. / Stern / to Player Default
#. Prompt = I wouldn't say I'm his friend. I hardly know the guy.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I wouldn't say I'm his friend. I hardly know the guy.
#. DialogueAfter = Cooper: Right. Fine. I'm Cooper. I'm here because Opal and Sadie wanted me here. Not because Sawyer's get-togethers are my style. That's all.
#. EDID: [0106D6A8]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000B68"
msgid "Right. I think Opal said you were new. Take it from me. Sawyer isn't all that."
msgstr "맞아. 오팔이 네가 새로 왔다고 했던 것 같아. 내 말 믿어. 소이어는 별거 아니야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0252_SADIE_GREETING
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Sadie
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCSadieCarr
#. Face = Friendly
#. SoundFileID = 003A103A
#. ScriptNotes = Casual, friendly, and chill. / Friendly / to Player Default
#. Prompt = We'll see how well I do after a couple of drinks.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: We'll see how well I do after a couple of drinks.
#. DialogueAfter = Sadie: Anyway, the name's Sadie. If you ever need a moment of peace, feel free to come and talk. I don't care to get too drunk at these things.
#. EDID: [0106D69B]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000B69"
msgid "Just don't get too wasted. Don't want to pass out all over again."
msgstr "너무 취하지만 마. 또다시 기절해서 널브러지는 건 싫잖아."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0252_WREN_GREETING
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Wren
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCWrenCarr
#. Face = Apologetic
#. SoundFileID = 00A3A3F7
#. ScriptNotes = Shy. / Apologetic / to Player Default
#. Prompt = I don't talk much either. Mostly I listen.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I don't talk much either. Mostly I listen.
#. DialogueAfter = Wren: Sorry. My name is Wren. Cooper and Sadie brought me along.
#. EDID: [0106D687]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000B6A"
msgid "That doesn't bode well for either of us then."
msgstr "그럼 우리 둘 다 전망이 안 좋네."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0252_WREN_GREETING
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00C4B0AB
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Wren: Hi there...|Sorry. I'm not too much of a talker, or that interesting. You'd be better off talking to my sister, Sadie.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: I heard Opal and Sawyer found you. So I doubt that.
#. EDID: [0106D689]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000B6B"
msgid "That's okay. I'm not that interesting either."
msgstr "괜찮아. 나도 그리 흥미로운 사람은 아니야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0252_WREN_GREETING
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Wren
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCWrenCarr
#. Face = Concerned
#. SoundFileID = 005E4C11
#. ScriptNotes = Shy. Puts herself down. She is clearly out of her element at the party. / Concerned / to Player Default
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: That's okay. I'm not that interesting either.
#. EDID: [0106D682]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000B6C"
msgid "Sorry. I'm not too much of a talker, or that interesting. You'd be better off talking to my sister, Sadie."
msgstr "미안. 난 말이 많지도 않고, 재미있는 사람도 아니야. 내 여동생 세이디와 얘기하는 게 나을 거야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0252_WREN_GREETING
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Wren
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCWrenCarr
#. Face = Concerned
#. SoundFileID = 00AC0089
#. ScriptNotes = Shy. Very nervous. She is clearly out of her element at the party. / Concerned / to Player Default
#. EDID: [0106D682]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000B6D"
msgid "Hi there..."
msgstr "안녕..."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0252_SADIE_GREETING
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Sadie
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCSadieCarr
#. Face = Happy
#. SoundFileID = 0019333A
#. ScriptNotes = chuckles at the start. Casual, friendly, and chill. / Happy / to Player Default
#. Prompt = I'm more worried about Opal and Sawyer behaving themselves.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I'm more worried about Opal and Sawyer behaving themselves.
#. DialogueAfter = Sadie: Anyway, the name's Sadie. If you ever need a moment of peace, feel free to come and talk. I don't care to get too drunk at these things.
#. EDID: [0106D67F]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000B6E"
msgid "Damn right. Those two do love to cause all sorts of trouble. I don't know how I put up with them."
msgstr "당연하지. 그 둘은 온갖 문제를 일으키는 걸 좋아하거든. 내가 어떻게 참고 사는지 모르겠어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0252_SADIE_GREETING
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Sadie
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0020E6F5
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Sadie: So you're the one Opal and Sawyer found? Hope you're planning on behaving yourself.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Just don't get too wasted. Don't want to pass out all over again.
#. EDID: [0106D694]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000B6F"
msgid "We'll see how well I do after a couple of drinks."
msgstr "몇 잔 마신 뒤에 얼마나 잘하는지 보자고."

