#. EDID: [0104D02C]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000B77"
msgid "We should go now."
msgstr "이제 가야 해."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC01
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC01_GloriaSwansen_SC_Easy02
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 002A4C1A
#. EDID: [01040739]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000B78"
msgid "You don't have to go into details. I just want to understand."
msgstr "자세히 말하지 않아도 돼. 그냥 이해하고 싶어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC01
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Dialogue_550_Guarded
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Voice
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Voice
#. Face = Defiant
#. SoundFileID = 00CF5DCA
#. ScriptNotes = She'd rather not tell the story of how she stole the spaceship from her abusive stepfather. / Defiant
#. Prompt = Tell me who you are and why you're on this ship.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Tell me who you are and why you're on this ship.
#. DialogueAfter = Gloria: Fine, I'll tell you! Maybe you'll leave me alone then...
#. EDID: [0104073A]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000B79"
msgid "Yeah? Or what?"
msgstr "그래? 아니면 뭐?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC01
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC01_GloriaSwansen_SC_Hard02
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Gloria
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Voice
#. Face = Nervous
#. SoundFileID = 0014734E
#. ScriptNotes = Sincerely starting to realize that being alone in space is dangerous, and that while the player may look scary they might not be a threat. / Nervous
#. EDID: [01040742]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000B7A"
msgid "You mean, there's worse than you out there?"
msgstr "그러니까, 너보다 더한 것들이 밖에 있다는 거야?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC01
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC01_GloriaSwansen_SC_Med02
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Gloria
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Voice
#. Face = Sad
#. SoundFileID = 008B336A
#. ScriptNotes = Sincerely realizing that she's put herself in danger, and that the player doesn't seem like a bad person. / Sad
#. EDID: [0104073F]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000B7B"
msgid "Yeah, I guess not."
msgstr "그래, 아닌 것 같네."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC01
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC01_GloriaSwansen_SC_Hard03
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Gloria
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Voice
#. Face = Somber
#. SoundFileID = 00CBCCFD
#. ScriptNotes = Daryl sarcastic about preferring to die in space rather than go back to live with her stepfather. / Somber
#. EDID: [0104075F]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000B7C"
msgid "Why not just throw me out of the airlock while you're at it..."
msgstr "이왕이면 그냥 날 에어락 밖으로 던져 버리지 그래..."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC01
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Dialogue_600_OpeningUp
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Gloria
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Voice
#. Face = Irritated
#. SoundFileID = 0075E287
#. ScriptNotes = Getting irritated that player doesn't want to hear her story. / Irritated
#. Prompt = Not right now.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Not right now.
#. DialogueAfter = Gloria: The truth is... this isn't my ship. It's my stepfather's.
#. EDID: [0104A1C9]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000B7D"
msgid "Really? Okay."
msgstr "정말? 알겠어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC01
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC01_GloriaSwansen_SC_Med03
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Gloria
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Voice
#. Face = Depressed
#. SoundFileID = 00F7DC0F
#. ScriptNotes = Gloria doesn't trust the authority figures in her life because she feels they've let her down. This is more sad than angry. / Depressed
#. EDID: [0104074B]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000B7E"
msgid "Why not? Everyone else has."
msgstr "왜 안 돼? 다른 사람들은 다 그랬는데."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC01
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Dialogue_550_Guarded
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Gloria
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Voice
#. Face = Angry
#. SoundFileID = 00E8AA29
#. ScriptNotes = Clamming up. She'd does not want to tell the story of how she stole the spaceship from her abusive stepfather. / Angry
#. DialogueBefore = Gloria: Yeah? Or what?
#. DialogueAfter = Gloria: The truth is... this isn't my ship. It's my stepfather's.
#. EDID: [0104075A]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000B7F"
msgid "I'm not saying another word. Put me in jail, leave me here, I don't care."
msgstr "한마디도 더 안 할 거야. 감옥에 넣든, 여기 두고 가든, 난 상관없어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC01
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC01_GloriaSwansen_SC_Hard01
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0071D4E9
#. EDID: [0104089B]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000B80"
msgid "Maybe I should just leave you to freeze to death."
msgstr "그냥 얼어 죽게 내버려 둘까."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC01
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Dialogue_570_Neutral
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Gloria
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0031EE6D
#. DialogueBefore = Gloria: What's up?
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Not my greatest idea, I know. I really thought I could handle it...
#. EDID: [01048C0A]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000B81"
msgid "You piloted this ship into deep space all by yourself?"
msgstr "이 우주선을 혼자서 심우주까지 조종해 온 거야?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC01
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Dialogue_550_Guarded
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Gloria
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 009004BD
#. DialogueBefore = Gloria: What do you want now?
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Oh you know, all kinds of stuff. Nothing out of the ordinary. Just regular cargo.
#. EDID: [01048C08]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000B82"
msgid "What kind of cargo are you transporting?"
msgstr "어떤 화물을 운송 중이지?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC01
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Dialogue_550_Guarded
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Gloria
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Voice
#. Face = Defiant
#. SoundFileID = 001D5AC8
#. ScriptNotes = Trying to lie herself out of this. She'd rather not tell the story of how she stole the spaceship from her abusive stepfather. / Defiant
#. Prompt = Where is the rest of the crew?
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Where is the rest of the crew?
#. DialogueAfter = Gloria: Tell me who you are and why you're on this ship.
#. EDID: [01048C06]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000B83"
msgid "It's just me. Yep. Just me and my cargo ship. I prefer it that way."
msgstr "나뿐이야. 그래. 나와 내 화물선뿐. 난 그게 좋아."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC01
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Dialogue_550_Guarded
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Gloria
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 009BDF90
#. DialogueBefore = Gloria: What do you want now?
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: It's just me. Yep. Just me and my cargo ship. I prefer it that way.
#. EDID: [01048C04]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000B84"
msgid "Where is the rest of the crew?"
msgstr "나머지 승무원은 어디 있지?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC01
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Dialogue_630_PlayerKnowsStory
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Gloria
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00C81354
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I do want to hear your story. &&& Gloria: Okay, well listen until the end then. &&& Gloria: The truth is... this isn't my ship. It's my stepfather's.|I had to get away, you know? As far away as I could... so I thought, why not take his ship, right?|But he set up an anti-theft system that totally bricked the ship. He's probably on his way here. &&& Gloria: So that's it. That's my story.|Kind of lame now that I said it out loud...
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Okay.
#. EDID: [0104A1C2]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000B85"
msgid "That's it for now."
msgstr "지금은 여기까지야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC01
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Dialogue_700_WaitingForStepfather
