#. Prompt = What do you plan on doing now?
#. DialogueAfter = Gloria: I can give you a lift if you want.
#. EDID: [0104A1C5]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000B8A"
msgid "I mean, unless I can find someone to take me to my cousin's in New Atlantis..."
msgstr "내 말은, 뉴아틀란티스에 있는 사촌 집까지 데려다줄 사람을 찾을 수 있다면 모를까..."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC01
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Dialogue_630_PlayerKnowsStory
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Gloria
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Voice
#. Face = Depressed
#. SoundFileID = 0033C0F3
#. ScriptNotes = Angry and depressed / Depressed / to Player Default
