#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: What do you plan on doing now?
#. EDID: [0104A1C5]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000B8B"
msgid "I don't have many options. My stepfather will be here any moment now..."
msgstr "선택지가 많지 않아. 의붓아버지가 곧 여기 올 거야..."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC01
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC01_GloriaSwansen_SC_Intimidation
