#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = SamCoe
#. VoiceType = NPCMSamCoe
#. Face = Thinking
#. SoundFileID = 00F9909C
#. ScriptNotes = Sam Coe commenting on the teenage runaway that has been rescued from a derelict ship she stole from her stepfather, and is now on player's ship. / Thinking
#. EDID: [0106C50C]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000B8E"
msgid "Let's just hope stepdaddy doesn't come after us..."
msgstr "의붓아빠가 우리를 쫓아오지 않기만 바라자..."

