#. Prompt = Do you need me to call someone for assistance with your ship?
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Do you need me to call someone for assistance with your ship?
#. DialogueAfter = cargoShip: Seems you're having problems. I can come aboard to help.
#. EDID: [010485F0]
