#. DialogueBefore = Gloria: Well, I guess this is it.|Thank you so much for helping me. I'll never forget it. &&& Gloria: Here, take this. For being such a nice person.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: I'm all set. I have enough credits to last me for a year. By that time I should have a job.
#. EDID: [0104DAC1]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000B96"
msgid "Do you need anything else?"
msgstr "또 필요한 게 있나?"

