#. DialogueAfter = Gloria: Here, take this. For being such a nice person.
#. EDID: [0104DABD]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000B98"
msgid "Thank you so much for helping me. I'll never forget it."
msgstr "도와줘서 정말 고마워. 절대 잊지 않을게."

