msgctxt "000B9D"
msgid "Everything okay there?"
msgstr "거기 괜찮아?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ03
#. SceneName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ03_MilesScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = MilesCutler
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMMilesCutler
#. Face = Nervous
#. SoundFileID = 0065C7EA
#. ScriptNotes = Nervous but relieved / Nervous / to Player Default
#. Prompt = It doesn't really matter. The point is, I'm here.
#. DialogueAfter = MilesCutler: I'm going to rest here a little bit, and then use their transmitter to call Lucia for a lift.
#. EDID: [01040494]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000B9E"
msgid "I don't know what these guys had planned for me, but I'm sure it wasn't pleasant."
msgstr "이 사람들이 나를 어떻게 하려 했는지는 모르겠지만, 분명 기분 좋은 일은 아니었을 거야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ03
#. SceneName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ03_MilesScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = MilesCutler
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMMilesCutler
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00E95477
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
