#. QuestName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ03
#. SceneName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ03_CuttuEndScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Cutty
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMCutty
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00131B2E
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Cutty: You did?|I'm sorry if that went badly. I was hoping to avoid dragging you into any family drama.|In any case, what matters is that Miles is out of danger.
#. EDID: [010435AE]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000BA4"
msgid "I said I'd get some credits together for you."
msgstr "당신에게 드릴 크레딧은 좀 모아 보겠다고 이미 말씀드렸을 텐데요."

#. List: 2
