#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0022CB98
#. ScriptNotes = / to MilesCutler
#. EDID: [0106BB96]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000BA9"
msgid "You have to take the first step. Nobody else can do it for you."
msgstr "첫걸음은 네가 내디뎌야 해. 다른 누구도 대신해 줄 수 없어."

