#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00E6F702
#. EDID: [01050244]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000BBC"
msgid "Let's get going."
msgstr "출발하죠."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. SceneName = SFFL_R03_175a_SpeakWithCaptain_Friendly_ShipDamaged
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Captain
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R03_NPCMCivilian01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 001E5B57
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: We won't have any problems if you don't make any problems.
#. EDID: SFFL_R03SharedInfo01_CaptainIntro01
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000BBD"
msgid "But, you know, I have to ask. Can we trust you? We aren't going to have any problems, are we?"
msgstr "그런데, 아시겠지만, 몇 가지 물어봐야겠어요. 당신을 믿어도 될까요? 문제를 일으키진 않겠죠?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. SceneName = SFFL_R03_175a_SpeakWithCaptain_Friendly_ShipDamaged
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Captain
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R03_NPCMCivilian01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 009B4A36
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. EDID: SFFL_R03SharedInfo01_CaptainIntro01
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000BBE"
msgid "Thanks for helping us out. We're all packed and ready to go. "
msgstr "도와줘서 고맙습니다. 짐은 다 챙겼고 떠날 준비도 끝났어요. "

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCFCivilian
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R03_NPCFCivilian01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0046A7D1
#. EDID: SFFL_R03SharedShipHello04
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000BBF"
msgid "See you on board."
msgstr "선상에서 봐."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. SceneName = SFFL_R03_100b_DefenderHailAccepted
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0077B72A
#. DialogueBefore = HailingShip: &&& HailingShip: &&& HailingShip:
#. EDID: [0103D1BC]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000BC0"
msgid "I'll give you a ride. "
msgstr "태워다 줄게."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. SceneName = SFFL_R03_100b_DefenderHailAccepted
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = HailingShip
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R03_NPCFCivilian01
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0040A01A
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I'll give you a ride.
#. EDID: [01052B70]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000BC1"
msgid "The captain will be waiting for you on board. "
msgstr "선장이 우주선에서 기다리고 있을 겁니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. SceneName = SFFL_R03_175a_SpeakWithCaptain_Betrayal_ShipDamaged01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Captain
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R03_NPCMCivilian01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00D430BC
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Let's get going.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Let's get going.
#. DialogueAfter = Captain: The thing is, we aren't who you think we are.
#. EDID: [01053D9B]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000BC2"
msgid "All business, huh? I get it."
msgstr "일 얘기만 하자? 흠? 알겠어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. SceneName = SFFL_R03_100a_DefenderHailStart
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = HailingShip
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R03_NPCFCivilian01
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00DC97BA
#. ScriptNotes = / to HailingShip
#. EDID: [0103D1BE]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000BC3"
msgid "Damn, that was a close one, but we aren't out of the woods yet. Our ship has taken heavy damage. Not sure if we'll be able to fly out of here."
msgstr ""
"젠장, 정말 아슬아슬했어. 하지만 아직 안심하긴 일러. 우리 우주선이 큰 피해를 입었거든. 여기서 날아 나갈 수 있을지 모르겠어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. SceneName = SFFL_R03_100b_DefenderHailAccepted
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = HailingShip
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R03_NPCFCivilian01
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00CD4E3C
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral
#. EDID: [01052EAC]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000BC4"
msgid "Our cockpit's been damaged and none of us are certified to fly. We're stranded. Could you fly us out of here?"
msgstr "조종실이 망가졌고, 우리 중엔 비행 자격이 있는 사람이 아무도 없어. 꼼짝없이 갇힌 셈이지. 우리를 여기서 태워 나가 줄 수 있겠나?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. SceneName = SFFL_R03_100b_DefenderHailAccepted
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = HailingShip
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R03_NPCFCivilian01
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00672FBE
#. ScriptNotes = distressed / Neutral
#. DialogueBefore = HailingShip:
#. EDID: [01052EAC]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000BC5"
msgid "Appreciate the assist but... damn. Can't believe I'm saying this, but our pilot was killed. "
msgstr "도와줘서 고맙긴 한데... 젠장. 이런 말을 하게 될 줄은 몰랐는데, 우리 조종사가 죽었어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. SceneName = SFFL_R03_100b_DefenderHailAccepted
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = HailingShip
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R03_NPCFCivilian01
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 002CE765
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral
#. EDID: [01052EAA]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000BC6"
msgid "We don't have a safe way to fly out of here. Would you be able to give us a ride? "
msgstr "여기서 안전하게 날아 나갈 방법이 없어. 혹시 우리를 태워 줄 수 있겠어?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. SceneName = SFFL_R03_100b_DefenderHailAccepted
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = HailingShip
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R03_NPCFCivilian01
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00B855C4
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral
#. DialogueBefore = HailingShip:
#. EDID: [01052EAA]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000BC7"
msgid "We appreciate your help, but our trouble isn't over yet. Our pilot was killed during the attack and the cockpit is heavily damaged. "
msgstr "도와줘서 고맙지만, 아직 문제가 끝난 게 아니야. 공격 중에 조종사가 죽었고 조종실도 크게 망가졌어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. SceneName = SFFL_R03_100b_DefenderHailAccepted
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = HailingShip
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R03_NPCFCivilian01
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00349C8D
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral
#. EDID: [01052EA6]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000BC8"
msgid "Our ship got torn up during that attack. Sorry to dump this on you, but could you fly us out of here?"
msgstr "그 공격 때문에 우리 우주선이 완전히 박살 났어. 이런 부탁까지 해서 미안한데, 우리를 여기서 태워 나가 줄 수 있겠어?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. SceneName = SFFL_R03_100b_DefenderHailAccepted
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = HailingShip
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R03_NPCFCivilian01
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00913DBE
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral
#. DialogueBefore = HailingShip:
#. EDID: [01052EA6]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000BC9"
msgid "Thanks for the help. Can't believe we made it. "
msgstr "도와줘서 고마워. 우리가 살아남았다니 믿기지가 않네."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. SceneName = SFFL_R03_175a_SpeakWithCaptain_Friendly_ShipDamaged
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Captain
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R03_NPCMCivilian01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0024FD54
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = You can trust me. Can I trust you?
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: You can trust me. Can I trust you?
#. DialogueAfter = Captain: We won't have any problems if you don't make any problems.
#. EDID: [0103EE05]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000BCA"
msgid "Yes, but I guess we'll just have to take each other at our words."
msgstr "그래요. 하지만 결국 서로의 말을 믿어야겠죠."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. SceneName = SFFL_R03_175a_SpeakWithCaptain_Friendly_ShipDamaged
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMCivilian
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R03_NPCMCivilian01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00C2B389
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = No offense taken. We should get going, now.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: No offense taken. We should get going, now.
#. EDID: [0103EDFC]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000BCB"
msgid "Sounds good, and thanks again."
msgstr "좋아요. 다시 한번 고맙습니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. SceneName = SFFL_R03_175a_SpeakWithCaptain_Friendly_ShipDamaged
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Captain
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 004F7797
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Captain: Thanks for helping us out. We're all packed and ready to go. |But, you know, I have to ask. Can we trust you? We aren't going to have any problems, are we?
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Yes, but I guess we'll just have to take each other at our words.
#. EDID: [0103EE02]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000BCC"
msgid "You can trust me. Can I trust you?"
msgstr "저는 믿어도 돼요. 저도 당신을 믿어도 될까요?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. SceneName = SFFL_R03_175a_SpeakWithCaptain_Friendly_ShipDamaged
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Captain
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00C09970
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: We won't have any problems if you don't make any problems. &&& Captain: *Sigh* Fair enough, I guess. &&& Captain: I'm not trying to start a fight here. I appreciate you helping us, but a bit of caution is reasonable after what just happened.|Sorry if I offended you.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Works for me.
#. EDID: [0103EE07]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000BCD"
msgid "Let's just get a move on. We're wasting time here."
msgstr "그냥 움직이죠. 여기서 시간 낭비하고 있을 순 없어요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. SceneName = SFFL_R03_175a_SpeakWithCaptain_Friendly_ShipDamaged01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMCivilian
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R03_NPCMCivilian01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00D47A23
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = I get it, but we should get going now.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I get it, but we should get going now.
#. EDID: [0104C420]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000BCE"
msgid "Okay, we're all packed up and ready to go."
msgstr "좋아요, 짐은 다 챙겼고 출발할 준비도 다 됐어요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. SceneName = SFFL_R03_175a_SpeakWithCaptain_Friendly_ShipDamaged01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Captain
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R03_NPCMCivilian01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 000C4437
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: I get it, but we should get going now.
#. EDID: [0104C410]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000BCF"
msgid "It's been a long and bad day."
msgstr "길고도 끔찍한 하루였네요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. SceneName = SFFL_R03_175a_SpeakWithCaptain_Friendly_ShipDamaged01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Captain
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R03_NPCMCivilian01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0070F2B2
#. DialogueBefore = Captain: It is what it is. I'm not looking for sympathy.
#. EDID: [0104C410]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000BD0"
msgid "*Sigh* Jesus, I need to get a grip. You're helping us out and here I am, complaining to you like an asshole. "
msgstr "*한숨* 세상에, 정신 좀 차려야겠네요. 우릴 이렇게 도와주고 계신데, 전 이렇게 못난 놈처럼 불평이나 늘어놓고 있잖아요. "

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. SceneName = SFFL_R03_175a_SpeakWithCaptain_Friendly_ShipDamaged01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Captain
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R03_NPCMCivilian01
#. Face = Irritated
#. SoundFileID = 00690586
#. ScriptNotes = Irritated / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Things could've been worse.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Things could've been worse.
#. DialogueAfter = Captain: *Sigh* Jesus, I need to get a grip. You're helping us out and here I am, complaining to you like an asshole.
#. EDID: [010530D7]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000BD1"
msgid "Spoken like someone who doesn't have to abandon their ship."
msgstr "자기 우주선을 버릴 필요 없는 사람다운 말이네요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. SceneName = SFFL_R03_175a_SpeakWithCaptain_Friendly_ShipDamaged01
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00725BD8
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Captain: Our savior, in the flesh.|Can't believe I have to resort to bumming rides from a stranger. *Sigh* And I just finished paying off this ship.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: It is what it is. I'm not looking for sympathy.
#. EDID: [0104C417]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000BD2"
msgid "Sorry about your ship. I wish I got here sooner."
msgstr "우주선 일은 유감입니다. 제가 더 일찍 왔으면 좋았을 텐데 아쉽군요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. SceneName = SFFL_R03_175a_SpeakWithCaptain_Betrayal_ShipDamaged
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Captain
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R03_NPCMCivilian01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0012D288
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral
#. DialogueBefore = Captain:
#. EDID: [01053DA9]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000BD3"
msgid "Look, if we got off on the wrong foot, I'm sorry."
msgstr "저기, 첫인상이 엉망이었다면 미안해."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. SceneName = SFFL_R03_175a_SpeakWithCaptain_Betrayal_ShipDamaged
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Captain
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R03_NPCMCivilian01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00B15D7B
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral
#. DialogueBefore = Captain:
#. EDID: [01053DA8]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000BD4"
msgid "I'm not an ungrateful person. I appreciate you doing this for us, a group of total strangers."
msgstr "난 배은망덕한 사람이 아니야. 생판 남인 우리를 위해 이렇게 해주다니 정말 고맙군."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. SceneName = SFFL_R03_175a_SpeakWithCaptain_Betrayal_ShipDamaged
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0007178B
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I'm just here to give you a ride. &&& Captain: &&& Captain: &&& Captain:
#. DialogueAfter = Captain: The thing is, we aren't who you think we are.
#. EDID: [0104C440]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000BD5"
msgid "I can fly my own ship."
msgstr "내 우주선은 내가 몰 수 있어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. SceneName = SFFL_R03_175a_SpeakWithCaptain_Betrayal_ShipDamaged
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Captain
