#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I'm just here to give you a ride. &&& Captain: &&& Captain: &&& Captain:
#. DialogueAfter = Captain: The thing is, we aren't who you think we are.
#. EDID: [0104C43A]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000BD6"
msgid "That doesn't seem like the best idea."
msgstr "그건 별로 좋은 생각 같지 않은데."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. SceneName = SFFL_R03_175a_SpeakWithCaptain_Betrayal_ShipDamaged
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Captain
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R03_NPCMCivilian01
#. Face = Irritated
#. SoundFileID = 00D74382
#. ScriptNotes = Irritated / to Player Default
#. Prompt = If you think I'm so suspicious, I'll leave.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: If you think I'm so suspicious, I'll leave.
#. EDID: [0104C441]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000BD7"
msgid "Come on, I had to ask."
msgstr "이봐, 물어볼 수는 있잖아."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. SceneName = SFFL_R03_175a_SpeakWithCaptain_Betrayal_ShipDamaged
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMCivilian
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R03_NPCMCivilian01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00EE6BD1
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral / to Player Default
#. Prompt = I'm just here to give you a ride.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I'm just here to give you a ride.
#. EDID: [01053DBB]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000BD8"
msgid "If you say so."
msgstr "그러시다면야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. SceneName = SFFL_R03_175a_SpeakWithCaptain_Friendly_PilotKilled01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Captain
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R03_NPCMCivilian01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0079DDD7
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral / to Player Default
#. Prompt = My condolences, but we should get moving before more Spacers show up.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: My condolences, but we should get moving before more Spacers show up.
#. EDID: [010530D9]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000BD9"
msgid "You can keep your condolences, I barely knew the guy."
msgstr "위로는 됐어요. 그 사람, 저도 잘 몰랐거든요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. SceneName = SFFL_R03_175a_SpeakWithCaptain_Friendly_PilotKilled01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Captain
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R03_NPCMCivilian01
#. Face = Irritated
#. SoundFileID = 009EC517
#. ScriptNotes = Irritated / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Why did those Spacers attack you?
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Why did those Spacers attack you?
#. DialogueAfter = Captain: Sorry about your pilot.
#. EDID: [010530BF]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000BDA"
msgid "How the hell should I know? "
msgstr "제가 그걸 어떻게 알아요? "

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. SceneName = SFFL_R03_175a_SpeakWithCaptain_Friendly_PilotKilled
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Captain
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R03_NPCMCivilian01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 009A93B9
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral / to Player Default
#. Prompt = My condolences, but we need to get moving. More spacers could jump in at any moment.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: My condolences, but we need to get moving. More spacers could jump in at any moment.
#. DialogueAfter = Captain: *Sigh* Anyway, thanks for giving us a ride out of here.
#. EDID: [010530EC]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000BDB"
msgid "Yeah, sorry. I need to snap out of it."
msgstr "예, 미안해요. 정신 차려야겠어요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. SceneName = SFFL_R03_175a_SpeakWithCaptain_Friendly_PilotKilled
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Captain
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R03_NPCMCivilian01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 004B6A84
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral / to Player Default
#. Prompt = My condolences, but we need to get moving. More spacers could jump in at any moment.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: My condolences, but we need to get moving. More spacers could jump in at any moment.
#. DialogueAfter = Captain: *Sigh* Anyway, thanks for giving us a ride out of here.
#. EDID: [010530EA]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000BDC"
msgid "You're right."
msgstr "맞아요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. SceneName = SFFL_R03_175a_SpeakWithCaptain_Friendly_PilotKilled
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Captain
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R03_NPCMCivilian01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 005ADD6E
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral
#. DialogueBefore = Captain: *Sigh* Anyway, thanks for giving us a ride out of here.
#. EDID: [010530E7]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000BDD"
msgid "No point moping around anymore, I guess. We'll see you aboard your ship."
msgstr "이제 더 우울해하고 있을 이유도 없겠죠. 당신 우주선에서 보죠."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. SceneName = SFFL_R03_175a_SpeakWithCaptain_Betrayal_PilotKilled
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Captain
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R03_NPCMCivilian01
#. Face = Angry
#. SoundFileID = 00763C14
#. ScriptNotes = Angry
#. DialogueBefore = Captain:
#. EDID: [01053DBD]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000BDE"
msgid "Put them down!"
msgstr "내려놔!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. SceneName = SFFL_R03_175a_SpeakWithCaptain_Betrayal_PilotKilled01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Captain
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R03_NPCMCivilian01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00397C38
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Why did those Spacers attack you?
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Why did those Spacers attack you?
#. DialogueAfter = Captain: Sorry about your pilot.
#. EDID: [01053DB2]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000BDF"
msgid "We must've looked like we were hauling some precious cargo, or something. I don't know."
msgstr "우리가 뭔가 귀한 화물이라도 싣고 있는 것처럼 보였나 봐. 나도 잘 모르겠네."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. SceneName = SFFL_R03_175a_SpeakWithCaptain_Betrayal_PilotKilled01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Captain
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R03_NPCMCivilian01
#. Face = Angry
#. SoundFileID = 002C9CBC
#. ScriptNotes = Angry
#. EDID: [01053DB6]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000BE0"
msgid "Fire!"
msgstr "쏴!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. SceneName = SFFL_R03_175a_SpeakWithCaptain_Betrayal_PilotKilled01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Captain
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R03_NPCMCivilian01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0026B76E
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral
#. DialogueBefore = Captain: The thing is, we aren't who you think we are.
#. EDID: [01053DB6]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000BE1"
msgid "What are the odds of us ever crossing paths? Well, you got unlucky today, friend. We're taking that ship of yours."
msgstr "우리가 마주칠 확률이 얼마나 됐겠어? 그런데 오늘 운이 나빴네. 친구. 네 우주선은 우리가 가져가겠다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. SceneName = SFFL_R03_175a_SpeakWithCaptain_Betrayal_PilotKilled01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Captain
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R03_NPCMCivilian01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0074BE78
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral / to Player Default
#. Prompt = My condolences, but we should get moving before more Spacers show up.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: My condolences, but we should get moving before more Spacers show up.
#. EDID: [01053D72]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000BE2"
msgid "I get it. We're in kind of a rush, too."
msgstr "알겠어. 우리도 좀 급한 상황이거든."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. SceneName = SFFL_R03_175a_SpeakWithCaptain_Betrayal_ShipDamaged
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Captain
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R03_NPCMCivilian01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 006562BB
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral
#. DialogueBefore = Captain:
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: I can fly my own ship.
#. EDID: [01053D84]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000BE3"
msgid "If you want, my crew and I can handle the flying. We know our way around ships, and we're fast learners. Hell, we just started flying this one a week ago."
msgstr ""
"원하면 내 선원들과 내가 조종을 맡을 수 있어. 우린 우주선을 다룰 줄 알고, 배우는 것도 빠르거든. 젠장, 이 우주선도 일주일 전에 "
"몰기 시작했다고."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. SceneName = SFFL_R03_175a_SpeakWithCaptain_Betrayal_ShipDamaged01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Captain
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R03_NPCMCivilian01
#. Face = Angry
#. SoundFileID = 00E6ADAE
#. ScriptNotes = Angry / to Player Default
#. EDID: [01053D77]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000BE4"
msgid "Get them!"
msgstr "잡아!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. SceneName = SFFL_R03_175a_SpeakWithCaptain_Betrayal_ShipDamaged01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Captain
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R03_NPCMCivilian01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0069B0E0
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral / to Player Default
#. EDID: [01053D77]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000BE5"
msgid "You seem like a nice person, but you're unlucky. We'll be taking that ship of yours."
msgstr "좋은 사람 같긴 한데, 운이 나빴군. 네 우주선은 우리가 가져가겠다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. SceneName = SFFL_R03_175a_SpeakWithCaptain_Betrayal_ShipDamaged01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Captain
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R03_NPCMCivilian01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00E8C92A
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Captain: The thing is, we aren't who you think we are.
#. EDID: [01053D77]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000BE6"
msgid "How do I put this..."
msgstr "이걸 어떻게 말해야 하나..."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. SceneName = SFFL_R03_175a_SpeakWithCaptain_Betrayal_ShipDamaged01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Captain
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R03_NPCMCivilian01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00127F93
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral
#. DialogueBefore = Captain:
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Thanks.
#. EDID: [01053D99]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000BE7"
msgid "Wow, that's a hell of a ship you have."
msgstr "와, 우주선이 정말 대단하네."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. SceneName = SFFL_R03_175a_SpeakWithCaptain_Betrayal_PilotKilled01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Captain
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R03_NPCMCivilian01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00F544E6
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral / to Player Default
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Sorry about your pilot.
#. EDID: [01053D69]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000BE8"
msgid "Gonna give us a ride? You're really saving our asses here. "
msgstr "우리 좀 태워 주겠어? 정말 생명의 은인으로 여길게. "

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. SceneName = SFFL_R03_175a_SpeakWithCaptain_Betrayal_PilotKilled
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Captain
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R03_NPCMCivilian01
#. Face = Irritated
#. SoundFileID = 000A0C0B
#. ScriptNotes = Irritated
#. EDID: [01053D93]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000BE9"
msgid "We don't need a ride. We'll just be taking your ship and leaving you dead with the pilot."
msgstr "태워줄 필요 없어. 그냥 네 우주선을 가져가고, 넌 그 조종사 옆에 죽은 채로 두고 갈 거니까."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ02A
#. SceneName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ02A_DeliveryScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = MaddieWing
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFMaddieWing
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00BE6F0C
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = MaddieWing: And here you go, payment as promised.
#. EDID: [01037163]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000BEA"
msgid "Check back with me sometime. I might have another target for you."
msgstr "나중에 다시 들러. 맡길 일이 또 있을지도 모르니까."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ02A
#. SceneName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ02A_DeliveryScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = MaddieWing
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFMaddieWing
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00D9D395
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = MaddieWing: Have you now?
#. DialogueAfter = MaddieWing: And in pristine condition, no less.
#. EDID: [0105D542]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000BEB"
msgid "Come to momma, you sweet little parts."
msgstr "엄마한테 오렴. 귀여운 부품들아."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ02A
#. SceneName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ02A_DeliveryScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = MaddieWing
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFMaddieWing
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00991239
#. ScriptNotes = Eager / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I've got your prototype robot parts.
#. DialogueAfter = MaddieWing: I'll just take those off your hands, thank you very much.
#. EDID: [01037173]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000BEC"
msgid "Have you now?"
msgstr "그래? 정말이야?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ02A
#. SceneName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ02A_DeliveryScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = MaddieWing
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFMaddieWing
#. Face = Concerned
#. SoundFileID = 00AC2193
#. ScriptNotes = Disappointed / Concerned / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = MaddieWing: I'll just take those off your hands, thank you very much.
#. DialogueAfter = MaddieWing: And here you go, payment as promised.
#. EDID: [0105D54A]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000BED"
msgid "They're kind of busted up. Too bad."
msgstr "좀 망가졌네. 아쉬워라."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ02A
#. SceneName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ02A_DeliveryScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = MaddieWing
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFMaddieWing
#. Face = Impressed
#. SoundFileID = 008DAF56
#. ScriptNotes = Impressed / Impressed / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = MaddieWing: I'll just take those off your hands, thank you very much.
#. DialogueAfter = MaddieWing: And here you go, payment as promised.
#. EDID: [0105D545]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000BEE"
msgid "They look brand new. Nice work."
msgstr "새것 같네. 잘했어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1200_Roman_MainRansomScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Roman
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRomanKreutz
#. Face = Nervous
#. SoundFileID = 00916586
#. ScriptNotes = Nervous / to Player Default
#. Prompt = I'll take out everyone here if you don't hand over Milli.
#. DialogueAfter = Roman: Here's the key to Milli's room.
#. EDID: SFFL_MS03_Roman_IntimidationResponse01
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000BEF"
msgid "Take the keys. We got her locked up over there."
msgstr "열쇠 받아. 저 방에 가둬 놨어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1200_Roman_MainRansomScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Roman
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRomanKreutz
#. Face = Nervous
#. SoundFileID = 0032ABAD
#. ScriptNotes = Nervous / to Player Default
#. Prompt = I'll take out everyone here if you don't hand over Milli.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I'll take out everyone here if you don't hand over Milli.
#. EDID: SFFL_MS03_Roman_IntimidationResponse01
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000BF0"
msgid "Whoa, hey, no one has to die here today, least not over some damn milliwhale."
msgstr "워, 멈춰. 오늘 여기서 누구 죽어나가는 꼴 보고 싶지 않다고. 저 빌어먹을 밀리고래 새끼 때문에 죽는 건 사양이야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1200_Roman_MainRansomScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Roman
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRomanKreutz
#. Face = Irritated
#. SoundFileID = 00AD9661
#. ScriptNotes = Irritated / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Nice doing business with you.
#. DialogueAfter = Roman: Yura didn't send me. She hired me to house sit for her sister.
#. EDID: SFFL_MS03_Roman_Yura01SceneReentry01
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000BF1"
msgid "Why would Yura send someone to pay a ransom that they don't have?"
msgstr "유라는 돈도 없을 텐데 왜 사람을 보냈을까?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1200_Roman_MainRansomScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Roman
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRomanKreutz
#. Face = Concerned
#. SoundFileID = 002C313F
#. ScriptNotes = Concerned / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Nice doing business with you.
#. DialogueAfter = Roman: I don't do favors for petnappers.
#. EDID: SFFL_MS03_Roman_Yura01SceneReentry03
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000BF2"
msgid "All right, plan B I guess. You want Milli? Do me a favor, and she's all yours."
msgstr "좋아, 그럼 플랜 B인가 보네. 밀리를 원해? 부탁 하나만 들어주면, 밀리를 줄게."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1200_Roman_MainBranchYura01Scene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Roman
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRomanKreutz
#. Face = Happy
#. SoundFileID = 00BED0C6
#. ScriptNotes = Happy / to Player Default
#. Prompt = What makes you think Yura's interested in you to begin with?
#. DialogueAfter = Roman: [Demand Credits: <Global=SFFL_MS03_PaymentCredits>] I don't do anything for free.
#. EDID: SFFL_MS03_Roman_YuraInterested01
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000BF3"
msgid "My friends tell me we both light up when we see each other. That's got to  mean something, right?"
msgstr "친구들이 그러는데, 우리가 만날 때마다 서로 엄청 환하게 웃는데. 이거 분명 무슨 의미가 있는 거겠지?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1200_Roman_MainBranchYura01Scene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Roman
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRomanKreutz
#. Face = Happy
#. SoundFileID = 00A7B346
#. ScriptNotes = Happy / to Player Default
#. Prompt = What makes you think Yura's interested in you to begin with?
#. EDID: SFFL_MS03_Roman_YuraInterested01
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000BF4"
msgid "We're always making excuses to hang out together, and we're always doing little things for each other..."
msgstr "늘 같이 있으려고 핑계를 만들고, 서로를 위해 자잘한 일들도 해주고..."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1200_Roman_MainBranchYura01Scene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Roman
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRomanKreutz
#. Face = Worried
#. SoundFileID = 001973D4
#. ScriptNotes = Worried / to Player Default
#. Prompt = What makes you think Yura's interested in you to begin with?
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: What makes you think Yura's interested in you to begin with?
#. EDID: SFFL_MS03_Roman_YuraInterested01
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000BF5"
msgid "I'm 99% sure she's interested. It's that 1% holding me back."
msgstr "분명 99% 유라도 관심이 있다니까. 문제는 날 망설이게 하는 그 1%야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMRomanKreutz
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRomanKreutz
#. Face = Concerned
#. SoundFileID = 006B365E
#. ScriptNotes = Concerned
#. EDID: [0105B445]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000BF6"
msgid "Don't let anything happen to Milli."
msgstr "밀리한테 아무 일도 없게 해."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMGenericMale / NPCFGenericFemale
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMGenericMale02 / SFFL_NPCMGenericMale01 / SFFL_NPCFGenericFemale01 / SFFL_NPCFGenericFemale02
#. Face = Depressed
#. SoundFileID = 00164D2A
#. ScriptNotes = Depressed
#. EDID: [0105B442]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000BF7"
msgid "I knew this wasn't going to go as planned."
msgstr "계획대로 안 될 거 같더라니."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMGenericMale / NPCFGenericFemale
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMGenericMale02 / SFFL_NPCMGenericMale01 / SFFL_NPCFGenericFemale01 / SFFL_NPCFGenericFemale02
#. Face = Depressed
#. SoundFileID = 004EA49E
#. ScriptNotes = Depressed
#. EDID: [0105B43F]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000BF8"
msgid "I knew those credits were a long shot."
msgstr "애초에 크레딧을 받을 수 있을 리가 없지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
