#. ScriptNotes = Depressed
#. EDID: [0105B43E]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000BF9"
msgid "I can't believe we didn't get those credits. "
msgstr "그 크레딧을 못 받았다니 믿기지가 않아. "

