#. ScriptNotes = Angry
#. EDID: [0105BFB5]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000BFE"
msgid "You gotta be kidding me!"
msgstr "장난하나!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMRomanKreutz
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRomanKreutz
#. Face = Angry
#. SoundFileID = 0073C041
#. ScriptNotes = Angry
#. EDID: [0105BFB2]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000BFF"
msgid "What the hell?"
msgstr "뭐야, 대체?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMGenericMale / NPCFGenericFemale
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMGenericMale02 / SFFL_NPCMGenericMale01 / SFFL_NPCFGenericFemale01 / SFFL_NPCFGenericFemale02
#. Face = Angry
#. SoundFileID = 00290CF8
#. ScriptNotes = Angry
#. EDID: [0105BFA4]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000C00"
msgid "We gotta save Milli!"
msgstr "밀리를 구해야 해!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMRomanKreutz
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRomanKreutz
#. Face = Angry
#. SoundFileID = 00BB218D
#. ScriptNotes = Angry
#. EDID: [0105BFA0]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000C01"
msgid "Some Ranger you are!"
msgstr "레인저라는 녀석이 꼴좋네!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1200_Roman_MainRansomScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Roman
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRomanKreutz
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 008154D6
#. ScriptNotes = Confident / to Player Default
#. Prompt = What kind of monster kidnaps someone's pet?
#. DialogueAfter = Roman: Give me Milli and I'll put in a good word for you with Yura.
#. EDID: [010358AA]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000C02"
msgid "That little runt's living better than me!"
msgstr "쬐끄만 녀석이 나보다 더 잘 살고 있잖아!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1200_Roman_MainRansomScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Roman
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRomanKreutz
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 00AB9B3E
#. ScriptNotes = Confident / to Player Default
#. Prompt = What kind of monster kidnaps someone's pet?
#. EDID: [010358AA]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000C03"
msgid "Did you see all the toys and pillows in there? "
msgstr "거기 장난감이랑 베개가 얼마나 많은지 봤어? "

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1200_Roman_MainRansomScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Roman
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRomanKreutz
#. Face = Concerned
#. SoundFileID = 007F6627
#. ScriptNotes = Offended. / Concerned / to Player Default
#. Prompt = What kind of monster kidnaps someone's pet?
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: What kind of monster kidnaps someone's pet?
#. EDID: [010358AA]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000C04"
msgid "Okay, that's a bit extreme. If I'm such a \"monster,\" why did I bother setting up Milli with such a plush room?"
msgstr "그렇게 나오시겠다? 말이 좀 심하네. 내가 그런 \"괴물\"이라면, 왜 밀리한테 저런 푹신한 방까지 마련해 줬겠어?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_3200_Yura_MainEndScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Atka
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFAtka
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00E49FC1
#. ScriptNotes = Serious / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Atka: Wow, I'll take your word for it then.|Yura actually outdid herself.
#. DialogueAfter = Yura: Oh not the plants again.
#. EDID: [0105A34F]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000C05"
msgid "Too bad I can't say the same for my plants."
msgstr "식물들도 상태가 좋았으면 좋았을 텐데."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_3200_Yura_MainEndScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Atka
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFAtka
#. Face = Amused
#. SoundFileID = 007ACBE9
#. ScriptNotes = Amused / to Player Default
#. DialogueAfter = Yura: Oh not the plants again.
#. EDID: [0105A34E]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000C06"
msgid "At least one survived, but she thrives on neglect."
msgstr "그래도 하나는 살아남았네. 방치해야 더 잘 자라는 녀석이긴 하지만."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_3200_Yura_MainEndScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Atka
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFAtka
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00FB6056
#. ScriptNotes = Serious / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Atka: Wow, I'll take your word for it then.|Yura actually outdid herself.
#. EDID: [0105A34E]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000C07"
msgid "Too bad I can't say the same for my plants."
msgstr "식물들도 상태가 좋았으면 좋았을 텐데."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_3200_Yura_MainEndScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Atka
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFAtka
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 00C9DEAA
#. ScriptNotes = Confident / to Player Default
#. Prompt = I wouldn't trust Yura to house sit for you anymore.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I wouldn't trust Yura to house sit for you anymore.
#. DialogueAfter = Atka: Here, it's what I intended to pay Yura, plus a little extra for the trouble and keeping the plant babies alive.
#. EDID: [010358BA]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000C08"
msgid "Don't worry, this is the last straw."
msgstr "걱정 마. 이제 안 맡길 거니까."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_3200_Yura_MainEndScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Yura
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFYura
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 007C6E45
#. ScriptNotes = Trying to get the player to support her so Atka will be satisfied. / Confident / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Yura: And see? Milli's fine!
#. DialogueAfter = companion: We guarded this creature with our very lives.
#. EDID: [010358B2]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000C09"
msgid "Right, \"pet sitters\"?"
msgstr "그렇지? '임시 집사님들'?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_3200_Yura_MainEndScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Atka
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFAtka
#. Face = Relieved
#. SoundFileID = 00B57E70
#. ScriptNotes = Relieved / to Milli
#. DialogueBefore = Atka: What do you mean "the pet sitter" has Milli? You were supposed to be taking care of her. &&& Yura: And I am! Hiring another pet sitter is taking care of her. &&& Yura: And look, just in time.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: [Lie] Just taking Milli for a walk.
#. EDID: [01035870]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000C0A"
msgid "Milli! Thank goodness you're okay."
msgstr "밀리! 무사해서 정말 다행이야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_3200_Yura_MainEndScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Yura
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFYura
#. Face = Defiant
#. SoundFileID = 0072A9A8
#. ScriptNotes = Defiant / to Atka
#. DialogueAfter = Atka: Yura... Never mind. We'll talk about this later.
#. EDID: [01035888]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000C0B"
msgid "I refuse to let you guilt me over something that you regrow all the time."
msgstr "어차피 다시 자라나는 걸 가지고 나한테 죄책감 주려고 하지 마."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_3200_Yura_MainEndScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Yura
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFYura
#. Face = Irritated
#. SoundFileID = 00EA867F
#. ScriptNotes = Irritated / to Atka
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: As a Freestar Ranger, I personally looked after Milli's safety. &&& Atka: Wow, I'll take your word for it then.|Yura actually outdid herself. &&& Atka: And, miraculously, all my plants are still alive.|You've proven yourself a far better house sitter than Yura ever was.
#. EDID: [01035888]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000C0C"
msgid "Oh not the plants again."
msgstr "아, 또 식물 얘기야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_3200_Yura_MainEndScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Atka
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFAtka
#. Face = Tired
#. SoundFileID = 0091325F
#. ScriptNotes = Tired / to Player Default
#. Prompt = I don't mind a little family drama.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I don't mind a little family drama.
#. DialogueAfter = Atka: Here, it's what I intended to pay Yura, plus a little extra for the trouble and keeping the plant babies alive.
#. EDID: [0103589B]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000C0D"
msgid "If only \"little\" was the word for it."
msgstr "사소하다는 말로 끝날 일이면 좋겠네."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_3200_Yura_MainEndScene
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Atka
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 006697B7
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: As a Freestar Ranger, I personally looked after Milli's safety. &&& ... &&& Yura: Oh not the plants again.|I refuse to let you guilt me over something that you regrow all the time. &&& Atka: Yura... Never mind. We'll talk about this later. &&& Atka: I'm sorry. No sense in you sticking around listening to this.|Let me pay you so you can get out of here.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: If only "little" was the word for it.
#. EDID: [01035878]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000C0E"
msgid "I don't mind a little family drama."
msgstr "상관없어. 사소한 집안 싸움 구경하는 것도 나쁘지 않으니까."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_3200_Yura_MainEndScene
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0053DB6C
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: [Lie] Just taking Milli for a walk. &&& Yura: Oh yeah? Well, great timing. |I got a message from Atka that she was returning early, so I got down here as soon as I could. &&& Atka: Excuse me. &&& Yura: Imagine my surprise when not only did she beat me back here, but Milli was nowhere to be found.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Well, you could've left a message or something... anything to explain why you weren't here.
#. EDID: [01035885]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000C0F"
msgid "I don't see how the timing is my fault."
msgstr "타이밍이 잘못된 게 왜 내 탓인지 잘 모르겠는데."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_3200_Yura_MainEndScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Yura
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFYura
#. Face = Irritated
#. SoundFileID = 00BB80D5
#. ScriptNotes = Emphasis on JUST. / Irritated / to Atka
#. DialogueBefore = Yura: Well, you could've left a message or something... anything to explain why you weren't here. &&& Atka: Excuse me, Yura. Are you going to tell me who these people are or what?
#. DialogueAfter = Yura: Atka, this is the pet sitter I told you about.
#. EDID: [01035872]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000C10"
msgid "I was just getting to that!"
msgstr "지금 말해주려고 했다고!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_3200_Yura_MainEndScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Yura
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFYura
#. Face = Friendly
#. SoundFileID = 0077FBD6
#. ScriptNotes = Scene re-entry. Telling the player they want to speak to her sister, not her. Player is looking to get paid. / Friendly / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Yura: And look, just in time.
#. DialogueAfter = Atka: I'm sorry. No sense in you sticking around listening to this.
#. EDID: [0106C858]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000C11"
msgid "Hey, don't look at me..."
msgstr "야, 나 보지 마..."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_3200_Yura_MainEndScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Yura
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFYura
#. Face = Concerned
#. SoundFileID = 00059F21
#. ScriptNotes = Scene re-entry. Trying to get the player to cooperate and back her up. / Concerned / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Yura: And look, just in time.
#. DialogueAfter = Atka: As a Freestar Ranger, I can guarantee she's fine.
#. EDID: [0106C853]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000C12"
msgid "Help me out here. Milli's fine, right?"
msgstr "나 좀 도와줘. 밀리는 괜찮은 거지?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1200_Roman_MainRansomScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Roman
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRomanKreutz
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 00B49A7A
#. ScriptNotes = Confident / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Roman: Whoa, what? Who are you? How would you even know anything about that?
#. EDID: [010358BE]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000C13"
msgid "Here's the key to Milli's room."
msgstr "여기 밀리 방 열쇠야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1100_Intercom_IntroScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Intercom
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMGenericMale01
#. Face = Thinking
#. SoundFileID = 009B767C
#. ScriptNotes = Confused because he was expecting Yura, but also considering the fact that the player claims to have the credits. / Thinking / to Player Default
#. Prompt = <Global=SFFL_MS03_RansomCredits> credits is my password.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: <Global=SFFL_MS03_RansomCredits> credits is my password.
#. DialogueAfter = Intercom: We've been waiting for you.
#. EDID: [010358C3]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000C14"
msgid "Hmm. Fair enough. "
msgstr "흠. 그거면 됐어. "

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1100_Intercom_IntroScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Intercom
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMGenericMale01
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 00C6AE05
#. ScriptNotes = Confident
#. DialogueBefore = Intercom: A wha--? Er, right away. Just give me a sec.
#. DialogueAfter = Intercom: Come on in.
#. EDID: [010358B9]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000C15"
msgid "We've been waiting for you."
msgstr "기다리고 있었어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1200_Roman_MainRansomScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Roman
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRomanKreutz
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 003A135B
#. ScriptNotes = Confident / to Player Default
#. Prompt = [Pay <Global=SFFL_MS03_RansomCredits>] Here's your credits.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: [Pay <Global=SFFL_MS03_RansomCredits>] Here's your credits.
#. DialogueAfter = Roman: Give me Milli and I'll put in a good word for you with Yura.
#. EDID: [01035A6D]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000C16"
msgid "Check your numbers, \"errand girl.\" You're short."
msgstr "숫자 다시 확인해. \"심부름꾼.\" 모자라잖아."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1200_Roman_MainRansomScene
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Roman
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0075AFE7
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Nice doing business with you. &&& Roman: Who are you?
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Nice doing business with you.
#. EDID: [01059D35]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000C17"
msgid "Fine, I'll be back with your credits."
msgstr "좋아, 크레딧을 가지고 돌아오겠어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1200_Roman_MainRansomScene
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
