#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Nice doing business with you.
#. EDID: [01035A70]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000C18"
msgid "[Pay <Global=SFFL_MS03_RansomCredits>] Here's your credits."
msgstr "[<Global=SFFL_MS03_RansomCredits> 크레딧 주기] 여기 크레딧이야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1200_Roman_MainRansomScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Roman
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRomanKreutz
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 00ED32C0
#. ScriptNotes = Confident / to Player Default
#. DialogueAfter = Roman: Yura didn't send me. She hired me to house sit for her sister.
#. EDID: [0103589A]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000C19"
msgid "I believe you have something for me."
msgstr "내게 바칠 게 있지 않냐."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1200_Roman_MainRansomScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Roman
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRomanKreutz
#. Face = Amused
#. SoundFileID = 00561126
#. ScriptNotes = Amused / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Nice doing business with you.
#. EDID: [0103589A]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000C1A"
msgid "So, I should've figured Yura would send a messenger. "
msgstr "아, 유라가 심부름꾼을 보낼 거란 걸 예상했어야 했는데. "

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1200_Roman_MainRansomScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Roman
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRomanKreutz
#. Face = Concerned
#. SoundFileID = 0037778D
#. ScriptNotes = Scene re-entry. Curious and concerned over how the player even got involved in this. / Concerned / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Nice doing business with you.
#. DialogueAfter = Roman: I'm the house sitter.
#. EDID: [0106C849]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000C1B"
msgid "Who even are you and what were you doing in Atka's house to begin with? "
msgstr "넌 대체 누구고, 처음부터 아트카의 집에서 뭘 하고 있었던 거야?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1200_Roman_MainRansomScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Roman
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRomanKreutz
#. Face = Concerned
#. SoundFileID = 00C1AB57
#. ScriptNotes = Scene reentry. Frustrated, disappointed. / Concerned / to Player Default
