#. DialogueAfter = companion: Such work is beneath us, but it does sound oddly satisfying.
#. EDID: [010358A8]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000C23"
msgid "It's basically house sitting for my sister. Just water a few plants, feed a little milliwhale until she gets home, and you're done! "
msgstr "그냥 우리 언니 집을 봐주면 돼. 식물 화분에 물 주고, 언니가 돌아올 때까지 자그마한 밀리고래한테 먹이만 주면 끝! "

#. List: 2
