msgid "Looking after plants and animals? No thanks. I need some level of excitement to keep me going."
msgstr "식물이랑 동물을 돌보라니? 싫어. 난 좀 자극적인 맛이 있어야 살맛이 나거든."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_0100_Yura_IntroMainScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Yura
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFYura
#. Face = Friendly
#. SoundFileID = 00C6CFC8
#. ScriptNotes = Friendly / to Player Default
