#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: That sounds too easy. What's the catch?
#. EDID: [0103588C]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000C27"
msgid "Seriously, no catch. House sitting just isn't for me, you know? "
msgstr "진짜로, 함정 같은 거 없다니까. 그냥 나랑 임시 집사 일은 좀 안 맞거든. 알겠지? "

