msgid "Count us in."
msgstr "우리가 할게."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1200_Roman_SC_Repeatable01Scene
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 006C3639
#. ScriptNotes = / to Roman
#. EDID: [01035A6F]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000C29"
msgid "There's no way I'm getting together that many credits."
msgstr "그 많은 크레딧을 마련할 방법이 없는데."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1200_Roman_MainBranchYura01Scene
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00CBBC95
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I'm here to negotiate. &&& Roman: Negotiate? Sorry, I'm an all or nothing kind of guy. &&& Roman: All right, enough of this bullshit. &&& Roman: Why would Yura send someone to pay a ransom that they don't have?
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: So you're the one that found the ransom note? Is Yura even there?
#. EDID: [01035A77]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000C2A"
msgid "Yura didn't send me. She hired me to house sit for her sister."
msgstr "유라가 날 보낸 게 아니야. 유라는 그냥 언니 집을 봐달라고 날 고용한 것뿐이야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1200_Roman_MainBranchYura01Scene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Roman
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRomanKreutz
#. Face = Concerned
#. SoundFileID = 0032C217
#. ScriptNotes = Concerned / to Player Default
#. Prompt = I'm under the impression Yura does what she wants.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I'm under the impression Yura does what she wants.
#. DialogueAfter = Roman: All right, plan B I guess. You want Milli? Do me a favor, and she's all yours.
#. EDID: [01035D53]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000C2B"
msgid "Heh, you got that right."
msgstr "하, 그 말이 맞아."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1200_Roman_MainBranchYura01Scene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Roman
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRomanKreutz
#. Face = Concerned
#. SoundFileID = 00EA9F3E
#. ScriptNotes = Frustrated. / Concerned / to Player Default
#. Prompt = She never mentioned any note.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: She never mentioned any note.
#. DialogueAfter = Roman: All right, plan B I guess. You want Milli? Do me a favor, and she's all yours.
#. EDID: [01035D5A]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000C2C"
msgid "No, son of a... So she has no idea about any of this?"
msgstr "아니, 이런 망할... 그럼 유라는 이번 일에 대해 아무것도 모르는 거야?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
