#. Alias = Roman
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 004BEB86
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Roman: Shouldn't you be off digging up some credits?
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Nope. Credits or nothing.
#. EDID: [01059CC6]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000C32"
msgid "We seriously can't work something out here?"
msgstr "정말 타협할 순 없을까?"

