#. DialogueBefore = Roman: Shouldn't you be off digging up some credits?
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Nice doing business with you.
#. EDID: [01059CF9]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000C34"
msgid "I'm still working on it."
msgstr "아직 처리 중이야."

