#. ScriptNotes = Speech challenge win: I'm willing to do this the hard way. / Nervous / to Player Default
#. EDID: [01059D40]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000C37"
msgid "I much prefer talking..."
msgstr "난 말로 하는 쪽이 훨씬 좋아..."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1200_Roman_SC_Repeatable02Scene
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00A30D43
#. ScriptNotes = / to Roman
#. EDID: [01059D7A]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000C38"
msgid "You realize I don't have to be nice about this."
msgstr "내가 좋게 봐줘야 할 이유는 없다는 거 알겠지?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1200_Roman_MainBranchYura01Scene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Roman
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRomanKreutz
#. Face = Tired
#. SoundFileID = 006E64BE
#. ScriptNotes = Tired / to Player Default
#. Prompt = What is going on here? You know Atka?
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: What is going on here? You know Atka?
#. DialogueAfter = Roman: She hates house sitting so we thought we'd shake things up a bit. Stage a little petnapping, maybe make a few credits on the side...
#. EDID: [01059CD6]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000C39"
msgid "I know them both, but this really isn't about Atka... It's about Yura."
msgstr "둘 다 알지만, 이건 사실 아트카 문제가 아니야... 유라 문제지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1200_Roman_FreestarScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Roman
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRomanKreutz
#. Face = Relieved
#. SoundFileID = 009ADDE4
#. ScriptNotes = Relieved / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Lucky for you, no one's pressing charges here.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Lucky for you, no one's pressing charges here.
#. DialogueAfter = Roman: Milli's all yours. Please, just take her, and this will never happen again.
#. EDID: [01059D02]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000C3A"
msgid "Really? Oh thank god. Even if they did, I'm sure Yura or Atka would've dropped them as soon as they knew it was us."
msgstr "정말? 아, 세상에 다행이다. 설령 신고했더라도, 우리라는 걸 알자마자 유라나 아트카가 바로 취소했을 거야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1200_Roman_FreestarScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Roman
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRomanKreutz
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 00876CF2
#. ScriptNotes = Confident / to Player Default
#. Prompt = And you really thought Yura would appreciate your prank?
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: And you really thought Yura would appreciate your prank?
#. DialogueAfter = Roman: Atka must've come home before Yura even saw the note. That's the only explanation.
#. EDID: [01059CCF]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000C3B"
msgid "I would've guaranteed it! I just never saw her reporting it to the Freestar Rangers. "
msgstr "분명 그랬을 거라고! 유라가 자유항성 레인저에게 신고할 줄은 몰랐어. "

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1200_Roman_FreestarScene
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Roman
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00522046
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Roman: I swear we were always going to return Milli safe and sound.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: I never thought Yura would take this seriously.
#. EDID: [01059CE8]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000C3C"
msgid "You never considered the consequences of your actions?"
msgstr "네 행동의 결과가 어떨지 생각해 본 적 없어?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1200_Roman_FreestarScene
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Roman
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00FD155C
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
