msgid "Good question! And lucky for me, we don't have to find out since you took the job."
msgstr "좋은 질문이야! 그리고 운 좋게도 네가 일을 맡았으니 우린 그걸 알아낼 필요가 없지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_0200_Yura_TL_AtkaScene
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Yura
