#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Well, yes and no. She sees this as a "fourth chance" to repair our relationship.
#. EDID: [01059CAF]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000C45"
msgid "Atka trusts you to watch her house?"
msgstr "아트카가 너한테 집을 맡길 만큼 믿어?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_3200_Yura_BranchEndRomanDeadScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Atka
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFAtka
#. Face = Nervous
