#. Prompt = I did what I had to do to bring Milli back safe.
#. EDID: [0105A33F]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000C46"
msgid "Please... just leave us."
msgstr "제발... 우릴 그냥 내버려 둬."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_3200_Yura_BranchEndRomanDeadScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Atka
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFAtka
#. Face = Nervous
#. SoundFileID = 00A27745
#. ScriptNotes = Nervous / to Player Default
#. Prompt = I did what I had to do to bring Milli back safe.
#. EDID: [0105A33F]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000C47"
msgid "What they did was wrong, but I can't say the punishment fit the crime."
msgstr "녀석들이 한 짓은 잘못됐지만, 지은 죄에 맞게 처벌을 받았다고 보긴 힘들 거 같아."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_3200_Yura_BranchEndRomanDeadScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Atka
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFAtka
#. Face = Nervous
#. SoundFileID = 00D7A996
#. ScriptNotes = Nervous / to Player Default
#. Prompt = I did what I had to do to bring Milli back safe.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I did what I had to do to bring Milli back safe.
#. EDID: [0105A33F]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000C48"
msgid "While I believe you, I can't imagine Roman or his friends ever hurting Milli intentionally."
msgstr "네 말을 믿을게. 하지만 로만이나 친구들이 일부러 밀리를 해치려 했다고? 상상이 안 가."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_0100_Yura_IntroMainScene
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Yura
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00747BF5
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Depends on what it is. &&& Yura: Oh you're gonna love it. Easiest credits you'll ever make!|All you have to do is water a few plants and feed a little milliwhale until my sister gets home. &&& companion: Such work is beneath us, but it does sound oddly satisfying.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: A milli-whale! It's like a big pillow on too many legs.
#. EDID: [01059CE1]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000C49"
msgid "A milli-what?"
msgstr "밀리 뭐라고?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_0100_Yura_IntroMainScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = companion
#. VoiceType = NPCFAndreja
#. Face = Thinking
#. SoundFileID = 00B7E7BD
#. ScriptNotes = Thinking / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Depends on what it is. &&& Yura: Oh you're gonna love it. Easiest credits you'll ever make!|All you have to do is water a few plants and feed a little milliwhale until my sister gets home.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Count us in.
#. EDID: [01059CD2]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000C4A"
msgid "Such work is beneath us, but it does sound oddly satisfying."
msgstr "우리가 하기엔 품격 떨어지는 일이지만, 묘하게 만족스러울 것 같긴 하네."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_3200_Yura_BranchEndRomanDeadScene
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Yura
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 006D6F5A
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Roman's not thinking anything anymore. &&& Yura: Hold up. What's that supposed to mean?
#. DialogueAfter = Yura: Oh my god... you killed him? All of them?
#. EDID: [0105A333]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000C4B"
msgid "Roman and his friends weren't exactly cooperative when I went to get Milli."
msgstr "밀리를 데리러 갔을 때 로만과 친구들이 협조해 주질 않았지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_3200_Yura_BranchEndRomanDeadScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Yura
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFYura
#. Face = Disbelief
#. SoundFileID = 0091B469
#. ScriptNotes = Disbelief / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Roman and his friends are dead.
#. DialogueAfter = Atka: Look... I... I think you should leave.
#. EDID: [0105A334]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000C4C"
msgid "Oh my god... you killed him? All of them?"
msgstr "세상에... 네가 로만을 죽였어? 전부 다?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_3200_Yura_BranchEndRomanScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Atka
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFAtka
#. Face = Grateful
#. SoundFileID = 00BD1831
#. ScriptNotes = Grateful / to Player Default
#. Prompt = I'm staying out of this.
#. DialogueAfter = Yura: Don't talk to me!
#. EDID: [0105A332]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000C4D"
msgid "Milli does seem fine, though, so I appreciate you stepping in."
msgstr "그래도 밀리는 괜찮아 보이니까, 도와줘서 고마워."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_3200_Yura_BranchEndRomanScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Atka
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFAtka
#. Face = Apologetic
#. SoundFileID = 0032DA7A
#. ScriptNotes = Apologetic / to Player Default
#. Prompt = I'm staying out of this.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I'm staying out of this.
#. EDID: [0105A332]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000C4E"
msgid "I'm really sorry you got sucked into all this."
msgstr "이 일에 휘말리게 돼서 정말 미안해."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_3200_Yura_BranchEndRomanScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Atka
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFAtka
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00644676
#. ScriptNotes = Serious / to Yura
#. DialogueBefore = Atka: Okay, great, so this was all some elaborate scheme for Roman to catch my sister's attention.
#. DialogueAfter = Yura: Oh come on, Milli is fine. Everything is fine!
#. EDID: [0105A350]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000C4F"
msgid "That still doesn't justify what you did, Yura. "
msgstr "그렇다고 해도 네가 한 행동이 정당화되지는 않아. 유라. "

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_3200_Yura_BranchEndRomanScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Yura
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFYura
#. Face = Irritated
#. SoundFileID = 00AD5728
#. ScriptNotes = Irritated / to Atka
#. DialogueBefore = Yura: I say if he did all this for me, that tells me plenty. &&& Atka: Okay, great, so this was all some elaborate scheme for Roman to catch my sister's attention. &&& Atka: That still doesn't justify what you did, Yura.
#. DialogueAfter = Yura: Help me out here.
#. EDID: [0105A362]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000C50"
msgid "Oh come on, Milli is fine. Everything is fine!"
msgstr "아, 왜 그래. 밀리는 괜찮잖아. 다 잘 된 거야!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_3200_Yura_BranchEndRomanScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Atka
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFAtka
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00A37A83
#. ScriptNotes = Serious / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Roman likes you, Yura. He's just not sure how to tell you. &&& Yura: I say if he did all this for me, that tells me plenty.
#. DialogueAfter = Atka: That still doesn't justify what you did, Yura.
#. EDID: [0105A352]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000C51"
msgid "Okay, great, so this was all some elaborate scheme for Roman to catch my sister's attention."
msgstr "좋아. 참 대단하네. 그럼 이 일은 모두 로만이 우리 동생 관심을 끌려고 꾸민 정교한 계획이었다는 거네."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_3200_Yura_BranchEndRomanScene
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Atka
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00723406
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Roman's not thinking anything anymore. &&& Yura: Hold up. What's that supposed to mean?
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Finally, someone who actually agrees with me.
#. EDID: [0105A345]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000C52"
msgid "I don't think Roman thinks much."
msgstr "로만은 깊게 생각하는 성격은 아닌 거 같던데."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_3200_Yura_BranchEndRomanScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Yura
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFYura
#. Face = Thinking
#. SoundFileID = 00D1D2AC
#. ScriptNotes = Thinking / to Player Default
#. Prompt = He was trying to earn a few credits.
#. DialogueAfter = Atka: I'm sorry. Who are you? And are you saying Roman stole Milli while I was gone?
#. EDID: [0105A354]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000C53"
msgid "Not like that's a bad idea..."
msgstr "나쁜 생각은 아닌 것 같은데..."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_3200_Yura_BranchEndRomanScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Yura
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFYura
#. Face = Confused
#. SoundFileID = 0009CE1B
#. ScriptNotes = ops as in "opportunities" / Confused / to Player Default
#. Prompt = He was trying to earn a few credits.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: He was trying to earn a few credits.
#. EDID: [0105A354]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000C54"
msgid "With Milli? What -- is he charging people for photo ops?"
msgstr "밀리로? 뭐, 사진 찍게 해주고 돈이라도 받으려고?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_3200_Yura_BranchEndRomanScene
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Atka
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00B873A6
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Roman and his friends didn't survive when I rescued Milli.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: You're not wrong...
#. EDID: [0105B432]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000C55"
msgid "Roman's just a common thief extorting people for credits."
msgstr "로만은 크레딧이나 뜯는 도둑일 뿐이야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_3200_Yura_MainEndScene
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Atka
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00122A90
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I don't see how the timing is my fault. &&& ... &&& Yura: And see? Milli's fine! &&& Yura: Right, "pet sitters"? &&& companion: We guarded this creature with our very lives.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Well, she seems fine. Milli does enjoy exploring, so a little adventure couldn't hurt.
#. EDID: [0106B1F1]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000C56"
msgid "We've had quite the adventure together."
msgstr "함께 참 다사다난한 모험을 겪었지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_3200_Yura_BranchEndRomanScene
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Yura
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00AF9E03
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Atka: What do you mean "the pet sitter" has Milli? You were supposed to be taking care of her. &&& Yura: And I am! Hiring another pet sitter is taking care of her. &&& Yura: And look, just in time. &&& Yura: How was Roman involved in all this stuff again?
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Sounds like Roman, but why?
#. EDID: [0105A342]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000C57"
msgid "Roman was just wasting my time."
msgstr "로만은 내 시간만 뺏은 셈이지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_3200_Yura_MainEndScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Atka
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFAtka
#. Face = Friendly
#. SoundFileID = 00FF17BC
#. ScriptNotes = Friendly / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Atka: Here, it's what I intended to pay Yura, plus a little extra for the trouble and keeping the plant babies alive.
#. DialogueAfter = Atka: If you ever want a little Milli of your own, that's my own personal recipe to give them all the nutrients they need.
#. EDID: [0105BFBA]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000C58"
msgid "Oh, and since you kept Milli safe, here's some milliwhale food."
msgstr "아, 그리고 밀리를 안전하게 지켜줬으니 밀리고래 먹이도 좀 줄게."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1300_Roman_TL_AtkaScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Roman
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRomanKreutz
#. Face = Nervous
#. SoundFileID = 00906C58
#. ScriptNotes = Nervous / to Player Default
#. Prompt = You think Atka will forgive you for this if she finds out?
#. DialogueAfter = Roman: If she's so nice, why use Atka and Milli to get Yura's attention?
#. EDID: [0105BF96]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000C59"
msgid "I think Atka knows I'd never let anything happen to Yura, and that's enough for her to accept me."
msgstr ""
"내가 유라에게 무슨 일이 생기도록 절대 내버려 두지 않을 거란 걸 아트카도 알고 있을 거야. 그거면 아트카가 나를 받아들이기에 충분하지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1300_Roman_TL_AtkaScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Roman
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRomanKreutz
#. Face = Nervous
#. SoundFileID = 007BE9D4
#. ScriptNotes = Nervous / to Player Default
#. Prompt = You think Atka will forgive you for this if she finds out?
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: You think Atka will forgive you for this if she finds out?
#. EDID: [0105BF96]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000C5A"
msgid "She might be a little mad at first, but I'm sure she'd come around. Especially since I did it all for Yura."
msgstr "처음엔 조금 화낼 수도 있지만, 결국 받아들일 거야. 특히 내가 전부 유라를 위해 한 거니까."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1300_Roman_TL_PetnappingScene
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 001E3CB1
#. ScriptNotes = / to Roman
#. DialogueAfter = Roman: Milli was the key. She's the only thing we could've taken that would've gotten Yura's attention in the first place.
#. EDID: [0105BF9A]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000C5B"
msgid "Of all things to impress someone, why involve Milli?"
msgstr "누군가에게 잘 보이려고 그런 거면, 왜 하필 밀리를 이용했어?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1200_Roman_FreestarScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Roman
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRomanKreutz
#. Face = Nervous
#. SoundFileID = 005301C3
#. ScriptNotes = Nervous / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Next time you'll face jail time.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Next time you'll face jail time.
#. DialogueAfter = Roman: Milli's all yours. Please, just take her, and this will never happen again.
#. EDID: [0105BF85]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000C5C"
msgid "Believe me when I say there will be no next time. "
msgstr "분명히 말하는데, 이번 같은 일은 두 번 다시 일어나지 않을 거야. "

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1200_Roman_StarbornScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Roman
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRomanKreutz
#. Face = Nervous
#. SoundFileID = 0027287A
#. ScriptNotes = Nervous / to Player Default
#. Prompt = If I told you, I'd have to kill you.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: If I told you, I'd have to kill you.
#. DialogueAfter = Roman: You've got yourself a deal. Here's the key to Milli's room.
#. EDID: [0105C9CC]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000C5D"
msgid "Okay, whoa, in that case, I don't have to know. "
msgstr "좋아, 워, 그런 거라면 난 몰라도 돼."

#. List: 2
