#. Speaker = companion
#. VoiceType = NPCFSarahMorgan
#. Face = Thinking
#. SoundFileID = 00C7AE75
#. ScriptNotes = Thinking / to Roman
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I don't do favors for petnappers. &&& Roman: Just hear me out. You got this petnapping thing all wrong.|You see, this is all a setup for Yura. &&& Roman: She hates house sitting. It's boring. So we thought why not liven things up?|We figured she'd get into it, maybe even get the credits from Atka...|And then when all went according to plan, I'd have the confidence to ask her out. |But now I've lost that chance. So, plan B. I give you Milli, you put in a good word for me with Yura.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: [Demand Credits: <Global=SFFL_MS03_PaymentCredits>] I don't do anything for free.
#. EDID: [0106B1F0]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000C5E"
msgid "All this for a date? I'm not sure whether to be impressed or mildly disturbed."
msgstr "고작 데이트 때문에 이런 거라고? 감탄해야 할지, 살짝 소름 돋아야 할지 모르겠네."

