msgid "Unless you hired me for my pilot skills, I'm pretty much bound to disappoint you."
msgstr "조종 실력 때문에 고용하는 게 아니라면, 아마 난 실망만 안겨줄 거야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03_Support
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_PostQuest_Yura_TL_Roman01Scene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Yura
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFYura
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 0079F43D
#. ScriptNotes = Confident / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Why don't you think you deserve him?
#. EDID: [0105BF95]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000C7E"
msgid "Sure I'm fun and always looking for the next thrill, but dating material? Me? I don't think so. "
msgstr "물론 난 재미있고 늘 자극을 찾아다니지만, 연애 상대로 삼기에는 어때? 날 좋아한다고? 아닌 것 같아. "

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03_Support
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_PostQuest_Yura_TL_Roman01Scene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Yura
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFYura
#. Face = Thinking
#. SoundFileID = 008D9AA2
#. ScriptNotes = Thinking / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Why don't you think you deserve him?
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Why don't you think you deserve him?
#. EDID: [0105BF95]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000C7F"
msgid "Roman deserves better. I mean, deep down, who am I? "
msgstr "로만은 더 나은 사람을 만날 자격이 있어. 내 말은, 깊이 따져 보자고. 내가 어떤 애인데? "

