#. ScriptNotes = Confident / to Player Default
#. EDID: [0105CED9]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000C84"
msgid "And he's the only person that's never trying to change me which goes a long way in my book."
msgstr "그리고 그는 날 바꾸려고 들지 않는 유일한 사람이야. 내 기준에선 그게 아주 큰 장점이지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03_Support
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_PostQuest_Yura_TL_Roman03Scene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Yura
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFYura
#. Face = Happy
#. SoundFileID = 00DB33F1
#. ScriptNotes = Happy / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: What can you tell me about Roman?
#. EDID: [0105CED9]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000C85"
msgid "Roman's the best. He always knows what to say to keep me sane."
msgstr "로만은 최고야. 내가 제정신을 붙잡게 해줄 말을 늘 알고 있거든."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03_Support
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_PostQuest_Yura_TL_AtkaScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Yura
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFYura
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 00023EAF
#. ScriptNotes = Confident / to Player Default
#. Prompt = The parents' view of success doesn't always match the child's.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: The parents' view of success doesn't always match the child's.
#. EDID: [0105CE90]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000C86"
msgid "Understatement of the year. I'm not exactly successful in my own eyes either, but at least it's the life I want to live."
msgstr "올해 최고의 절제된 표현이네. 나도 스스로 성공했다고 보진 않지만, 적어도 이건 내가 살고 싶은 삶이야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03_Support
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_PostQuest_Roman_YuraYesScene01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Roman
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRomanKreutz
#. Face = Grateful
#. SoundFileID = 00D36CE8
#. ScriptNotes = Grateful / to Player Default
#. EDID: [0106B1BE]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000C87"
msgid "But now? Best thing that could've happened."
msgstr "그런데 지금은? 이보다 더 좋을 순 없잖아."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03_Support
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_PostQuest_Roman_YuraYesScene01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Roman
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRomanKreutz
#. Face = Friendly
#. SoundFileID = 007F5283
#. ScriptNotes = Friendly / to Player Default
#. EDID: [0106B1BE]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000C88"
msgid "And hey, thanks for talking to Yura. I thought I was screwed when I heard your voice on that intercom."
msgstr "아, 그리고 유라와 얘기해줘서 고마워. 인터컴에서 네 목소리를 들었을 때 끝장난 줄 알았거든."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03_Support
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_PostQuest_Roman_YuraYesScene01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Roman
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRomanKreutz
#. Face = Concentrating
#. SoundFileID = 00191319
#. ScriptNotes = Getting a hold on himself. / Concentrating / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Roman: Be patient. I can do that.|I've been doing it for a while, so at least I got one base covered.
#. EDID: [0106B1BE]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000C89"
msgid "All right. I can do this. "
msgstr "좋아. 난 할 수 있어. "

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03_Support
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_PostQuest_Roman_YuraYesScene01
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Roman
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 002D81B3
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Roman: I feel like a nervous wreck. What do I say? I... I need advice. Anything!
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: No way. Oh no. That means I really get to go through with it now.
#. EDID: [0106B1BC]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000C8A"
msgid "I did my part. The rest is up to you."
msgstr "내 몫은 했어. 나머지는 네게 달렸어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03_Support
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_PostQuest_Roman_YuraYesScene01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Roman
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRomanKreutz
#. Face = Surprised
#. SoundFileID = 00BC52D2
#. ScriptNotes = Nervous excitement / Surprised / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Yura's going to think about it.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Yura's going to think about it.
#. DialogueAfter = Roman: I feel like a nervous wreck. What do I say? I... I need advice. Anything!
#. EDID: [0106B1B7]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000C8B"
msgid "Think about it? That's promising, right? Oh wow, she really might be ready to give me a shot. "
msgstr "생각해 보겠다고? 긍정적인 거 맞지? 와, 진짜 유라가 내게 기회를 줄 준비가 된 걸지도 몰라. "

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03_Support
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_PostQuest_Roman_YuraNoScene01
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Roman
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00B5841D
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Yura has some things she needs to work through. &&& Roman: *sigh* I know... I guess I was hoping we could work through those things together.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Hmm, maybe you're right. I never wanted to bring it up because every time Atka does, it's a fight.
#. EDID: [0106B1C3]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000C8C"
msgid "You should encourage her to get some help."
msgstr "유라에게 도움을 받으라고 말해봐."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03_Support
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_PostQuest_Roman_YuraNoScene01
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Roman
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 009F4C24
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Roman: I knew this wasn't gonna work out. Why do I even keep trying?
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: What? I'm the one that doesn't deserve her. How can she even think that?
#. EDID: [0106B1A5]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000C8D"
msgid "Yura doesn't think she deserves you."
msgstr "유라는 널 만날 자격이 없다고 생각하던데."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03_Support
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_PostQuest_Roman_YuraNoScene01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMRomanKreutz
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRomanKreutz
#. Face = Depressed
#. SoundFileID = 0040483A
#. ScriptNotes = Depressed / to Player Default
#. Prompt = I don't think she's ready, Roman.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I don't think she's ready, Roman.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: You need to move on.
#. EDID: [0106B1B9]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000C8E"
msgid "*sigh* I knew it. Every time I think she's letting me in, she pushes me away."
msgstr "*한숨* 그럴 줄 알았어. 유라가 나에게 마음을 열어줬구나 하는 생각이 들 때마다, 유라는 거리를 두잖아."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_Z01_AudioLogs
#. SceneName = SFFL_Z01_AudioLogs_DeathSlate_GABBY
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = AUDIOONLY
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCGabrielleBaker
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00F504CB
#. ScriptNotes = Exhausted and running out of oxygen. Tons of regret as she'll never see her wife again.
#. DialogueAfter = Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): I should have listened to her. Begged for me to get a job on land. Happy wife, happy life, right? But the pay - It's real helpful now.
#. EDID: [0106C730]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000C8F"
msgid "So, this is what it all led to, hm? I'll be out of air soon and I haven't seen anyone for the past... I don't know anymore."
msgstr "그러니까 결국 이렇게 되는 거군, 음? 곧 산소가 떨어질 거고, 지난... 이제 얼마나 됐는지도 모르겠지만 아무도 못 봤어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_Z01_AudioLogs
#. SceneName = SFFL_Z01_AudioLogs_LoveSlate_GABBY
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = AUDIOONLY
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCGabrielleBaker
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00C207D8
#. ScriptNotes = Sweet and Gentle. Also trying to be humorous.
#. DialogueBefore = Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): I want to thank you for being so patient with me.
#. DialogueAfter = Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): Speaking of this ship, she's a real piece of work. 'Best for the price,' my ass! I'm telling you that seller must have pulled a fast one on me.
#. EDID: [0106C72C]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000C90"
msgid "I promise, the second I step foot back home I'm taking you to the fanciest restaurant in town. I don't care how gross or dirty or whatever I'll be from a month in this hunk of metal. "
msgstr "약속할게. 집에 발을 들이는 순간, 마을에서 제일 근사한 식당으로 데려갈 거야. 이 고철덩이에서 한 달을 보내고 얼마나 지저분하고 끔찍해졌든 상관없어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_Z01_AudioLogs
#. SceneName = SFFL_Z01_AudioLogs_LoveSlate_GABBY
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = AUDIOONLY
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCGabrielleBaker
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 008A2F1A
#. ScriptNotes = Sweet and gentle.
#. DialogueAfter = Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): I want to thank you for being so patient with me.
#. EDID: [0106C728]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000C91"
msgid "I hope you're doing well, my Love. If all goes well I should be home soon. With a real nice pay day too."
msgstr "내 사랑, 잘 지내고 있었으면 좋겠어. 모든 일이 잘 풀리면 곧 집에 갈 수 있을 거야. 꽤 큰 보수도 챙겨서."

