#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I had to. You can't be trusted to vote correctly.
#. DialogueAfter = Yeats: For what it's worth, I will be voting in accordance with Hal's wishes. I disagree with the decision, but I will honor his choice.
#. EDID: [01034F7C]
