#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Maybe Spacers shouldn't be welcome here anymore.
#. EDID: [0103439E]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000C96"
msgid "If we closed our doors to the Spacers, they'd just kick them down, metaphorically speaking."
msgstr "스페이서들이 출입 못하게 막으면, 비유적으로 말해서 녀석들이 그냥 문을 박차고 들어올 거야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ01
