msgid "I wish I could spare someone to help you, but I just can't risk it."
msgstr "도울 사람을 붙여줄 수 있으면 좋겠지만, 지금은 위험을 감수할 수가 없어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ01
#. SceneName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ01_StartScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
