#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Spacers are pushovers. I've got this.
#. EDID: [010343BB]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000C9C"
msgid "Really?"
msgstr "정말인가?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ01
#. SceneName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ01_StartScene
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = ChanHuang
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00B34629
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: If that's true, maybe you should abandon the station. &&& ChanHuang: I don't disagree with you, but that's not my call.|Mister Saint owns this place, and we have a contract.|If he stays, we stay.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Once you've set out, I'll talk to Mister Saint.
#. EDID: [010343A7]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000C9D"
msgid "I'll solve your Spacer problem, but it'll cost you."
msgstr "스페이서 문제는 해결해 주겠지만, 대가는 받아야겠어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ01
#. SceneName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ01_StartScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = ChanHuang
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMChanHuang
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 00DE72EF
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Why? What happened?
#. DialogueAfter = ChanHuang: I'm not going anywhere.
#. EDID: [010343AA]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000C9E"
msgid "They said they were bringing everybody."
msgstr "녀석들은 갱단을 전부 데리고 오겠다고 했어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ01
#. SceneName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ01_StartScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = ChanHuang
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMChanHuang
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 00C79220
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Why? What happened?
#. EDID: [010343AA]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000C9F"
msgid "His friends stormed out, promising to come back for some retribution."
msgstr "녀석 친구들이 복수를 하러 돌아올 거라고 으름장을 놓으며 뛰쳐나갔지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ01
#. SceneName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ01_StartScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = ChanHuang
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMChanHuang
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 0035D061
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Why? What happened?
#. EDID: [010343AA]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000CA0"
msgid "One of them threatened to shoot a patron, so I locked him up."
msgstr "녀석들 중 한 녀석이 고객을 쏘겠다고 협박해서 가둬 놨어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ01
#. SceneName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ01_StartScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = ChanHuang
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMChanHuang
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 00E5BCC0
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Why? What happened?
#. EDID: [010343AA]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000CA1"
msgid "Ever since, they've been a lot worse."
msgstr "그 이후로, 녀석들 하는 짓거리가 훨씬 더 심해졌지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ01
#. SceneName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ01_StartScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = ChanHuang
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMChanHuang
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 005E38E1
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Why? What happened?
#. EDID: [010343AA]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000CA2"
msgid "Word is, they've got a new leader who's violent and bloodthirsty in the extreme."
msgstr "소문에 따르면, 새 두목이 권력을 잡았는데, 극도로 폭력적이고 피에 굶주린 놈이라더군."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ01
#. SceneName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ01_StartScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = ChanHuang
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMChanHuang
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 00BB4102
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Why? What happened?
#. EDID: [010343AA]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000CA3"
msgid "They've caused trouble before, but nothing too serious."
msgstr "전에도 문제를 일으킨 적은 있지만, 그렇게 심각하진 않았지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ01
