#. DialogueAfter = ChanHuang: Here. Compliments of Mister Saint.
#. EDID: [01059DC6]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000CA8"
msgid "As crazy as it sounds, I do see the logic in that."
msgstr "말도 안 되게 들리지만, 그 안에 논리가 있다는 건 알겠어."

