#. Prompt = You sound pretty desperate.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: You sound pretty desperate.
#. DialogueAfter = Sehoy: You seem like you're more versed in this whole flying thing than me.
#. EDID: [010325F8]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
