#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_Z01
#. SceneName = SFFL_Z01_200_SEHOY
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCSehoyBaker
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCSehoyBaker
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0051A513
#. ScriptNotes = Feels really broken and not tethered to reality. She feels like she's in so sort of lost, tiring limbo. Heartbroken. [Spaceship] / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Whatever credits you have left, keep them.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Whatever credits you have left, keep them.
#. DialogueAfter = companion: Perhaps Gabrielle can finally be at peace now. I just hope Sehoy can find it one day too.
#. EDID: [010352FE]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000CB6"
msgid "Oh, thank you... please, travel safe."
msgstr "아, 고마워요... 제발 안전하게 여행하세요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_Z01
#. SceneName = SFFL_Z01_200_SEHOY
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00D341E7
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I'm so sorry, Sehoy. &&& Sehoy: I guess I should just head back?|Thank you. I don't have much in the way of credits, but please, take these.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Oh, thank you... please, travel safe.
#. EDID: [010352FC]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000CB7"
msgid "Whatever credits you have left, keep them."
msgstr "남은 크레딧이 있다면 그냥 가지세요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_Z01
#. SceneName = SFFL_Z01_200_SEHOY
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Sehoy
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0058BF1B
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: She didn't say. I'm sorry. &&& Sehoy: I don't understand...|I'm sorry. This is all just- I don't mean to sound unappreciative. Thank you for finding her. |I don't have much in the way of credits, but here. Take them.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Yes. Here.
#. EDID: [010352F8]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000CB8"
msgid "Be safe out there."
msgstr "밖에서는 조심하세요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_Z01
#. SceneName = SFFL_Z01_200_SEHOY
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCSehoyBaker
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCSehoyBaker
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 005183CC
#. ScriptNotes = Feels as if time has stopped for her. Part of her though is holding back her tears. She tries to sound thankful, but is just lost. [Spaceship] / to Player Default
#. Prompt = I'm so sorry, Sehoy.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Whatever credits you have left, keep them.
#. EDID: [010352E3]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000CB9"
msgid "Thank you. I don't have much in the way of credits, but please, take these."
msgstr "감사합니다. 가진 크레딧이 많지는 않지만, 부디 이걸 받아주세요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_Z01
#. SceneName = SFFL_Z01_200_SEHOY
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCSehoyBaker
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCSehoyBaker
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 003A9153
#. ScriptNotes = Slow speaking. Feels as if time has stopped for her and she has no idea what to do. Part of her though is holding back her tears. [Spaceship] / to Player Default
#. Prompt = I'm so sorry, Sehoy.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I'm so sorry, Sehoy.
#. EDID: [010352E3]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000CBA"
msgid "I guess I should just head back?"
msgstr "그냥 돌아가면 되는 걸까요?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_Z01
#. SceneName = SFFL_Z01_200_SEHOY
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Sehoy
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00716D21
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Sehoy: You're back! Did you find Gabrielle? Please, tell me you've found her.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: What? May I see the slates?
#. EDID: [010352DC]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000CBB"
msgid "She was long gone by the time I found her. These slates were all I could find."
msgstr "내가 찾았을 땐 이미 오래전에 떠난 뒤였어. 찾을 수 있었던 건 이 슬레이트들뿐이었지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_Z01
#. SceneName = SFFL_Z01_200_SEHOY
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Sehoy
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00509F30
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Sehoy: You're back! Did you find Gabrielle? Please, tell me you've found her.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Why not? Did she say anything else? Why is she doing this...?
#. EDID: [0105660E]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000CBC"
msgid "[Lie] I did. But she didn't want to be found."
msgstr "[거짓말] 찾았어. 하지만 발견되고 싶어 하지 않았어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_Z01
#. SceneName = SFFL_Z01_200_SEHOY
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 005DC70E
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Sehoy: You're back! Did you find Gabrielle? Please, tell me you've found her.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: How did it- Let me see those.
#. EDID: [010352EA]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000CBD"
msgid "Her ship malfunctioned. I found these slates in the wreckage."
msgstr "그녀의 우주선이 고장 났어. 잔해에서 이 슬레이트들을 찾았지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_Z01
#. SceneName = SFFL_Z01_120_SEHOY
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Sehoy
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 007F1F17
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = HailingShip: In all honesty, I am. &&& Sehoy: You seem like you're more versed in this whole flying thing than me.|Please, have you seen a cargo ship out here? Piloted by a woman named Gabrielle Baker?|I'm her wife. She went on a job and it's been months...
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Dammit... I'm sorry. I just-
#. EDID: [010352E9]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000CBE"
msgid "I can't say I have."
msgstr "그렇다고는 못 하겠어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_Z01
#. SceneName = SFFL_Z01_120Starborn_SEHOY
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Sehoy
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00004B5B
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Yes. I found Gabrielle and her ship. &&& Sehoy: You did? Please tell me she's alright! Where is she?
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: What? But why? Where did you find her? I need to talk to her!
#. EDID: [010565F9]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000CBF"
msgid "[Lie] She didn't say much. I don't think she wanted to be found."
msgstr "[거짓말] 별말은 하지 않았어. 발견되고 싶어 하지 않았던 것 같아."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_Z01
#. SceneName = SFFL_Z01_120Starborn_SEHOY
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0074F084
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Yes. I found Gabrielle and her ship. &&& Sehoy: You did? Please tell me she's alright! Where is she?
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: What? No. Oh, no... Gabbie...
#. EDID: [01056628]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000CC0"
msgid "By the time I found her she was dead. Her ship was destroyed."
msgstr "내가 찾았을 때 그녀는 이미 죽어 있었어. 그녀의 우주선은 파괴됐고."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_Z01
#. SceneName = SFFL_Z01_300_COMPANION
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = companion
#. VoiceType = NPCMSamCoe
#. Face = Spaceship / Confident
#. SoundFileID = 00610F85
#. ScriptNotes = Player lied to Sehoy. Disappointed in the player for lying and prolonging the woman's heartbreak. Sad for Sehoy. [Spaceship]
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: It's just what she said. That's all I know. &&& Sehoy: That can't be right... I'm sorry. I have to find her.
#. EDID: [01056631]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000CC1"
msgid "Why'd you tell her that? She deserves to know the truth. Looks like there's no going back now."
msgstr "왜 그녀에게 그렇게 말했어? 그녀는 진실을 알 자격이 있어. 이제 되돌아갈 수 없겠네."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_Z01
#. SceneName = SFFL_Z01_300_COMPANION
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = companion
#. VoiceType = NPCMSamCoe
#. Face = Spaceship / Confident
#. SoundFileID = 00B916F6
#. ScriptNotes = Player told Sehoy Gabrielle is dead. Feels bad for Sehoy for having to go through such a heartbreaking and soul crushing thing. [Spaceship]
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: It's just what she said. That's all I know. &&& Sehoy: That can't be right... I'm sorry. I have to find her.
#. EDID: [01056630]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000CC2"
msgid "Poor thing. Shame she had to learn like this. But, in the end, guess it was better for her to know than never learn."
msgstr "가엾기도 하지. 이렇게 알게 되다니 안됐어. 그래도 결국엔 영영 모르는 것보단 아는 게 나았을 거야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_Z01
#. SceneName = SFFL_Z01_300_COMPANION
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = companion
#. VoiceType = NPCMBarrett
#. Face = Spaceship / Confident
#. SoundFileID = 00D8034E
#. ScriptNotes = Player lied to Sehoy. Disappointed in the player for lying and prolonging the woman's heartbreak. Sad for Sehoy. [Spaceship]
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: It's just what she said. That's all I know. &&& Sehoy: That can't be right... I'm sorry. I have to find her.
#. EDID: [0105662E]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000CC3"
msgid "Thought you'd spare her feelings or something? She's going to find out sooner or, well, later now, thanks to you. "
msgstr "그녀의 마음을 지켜주려 했던 거야? 그녀는 조만간 알게 됐을 거야. 아니, 네 덕분에 이제는 나중에 알게 되겠지만."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_Z01
#. SceneName = SFFL_Z01_300_COMPANION
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = companion
#. VoiceType = NPCMBarrett
#. Face = Spaceship / Confident
#. SoundFileID = 002AF6ED
#. ScriptNotes = Player told Sehoy Gabrielle is dead. Feels bad for Sehoy for having to go through such a heartbreaking and soul crushing thing. [Spaceship]
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: It's just what she said. That's all I know. &&& Sehoy: That can't be right... I'm sorry. I have to find her.
#. EDID: [0105662D]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000CC4"
msgid "Best for her to know than not at all. Hopefully she'll find peace one day."
msgstr "아예 모르는 것보다 아는 게 그녀에게는 나아. 언젠가 평화를 찾길 바라자."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_KT02_SailingHighSeas
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE_KT02_100b_HailingAnswered
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = HailingShip
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMGenericMale02
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00D524AD
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = [Lie] I did. Dibs on any Crimson Fleet.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: [Lie] I did. Dibs on any Crimson Fleet.
#. DialogueAfter = HailingShip: Don't worry darlin, I'm going to have a word with our lawyers.
#. EDID: [01031FB1]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000CC5"
msgid "Huh. This was supposed to be a private tour, but fine. I guess we'll just sit here and wait for the pirates to show up."
msgstr "허. 개인 투어가 될 예정이었는데, 좋아. 그럼 그냥 여기 앉아서 해적들이 나타나길 기다리면 되겠군."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_KT02_SailingHighSeas
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE_KT02_100b_HailingAnswered
