#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = HailingShip: All right you dastardly pirate scum, answer the hail! &&& HailingShip: &&& HailingShip: Thanks for answering, you filthy little pirate! &&& HailingShip: Any last words before we blow you to smithereens?
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Those are some fighting words for sure. Honey, power up the weapons!
#. EDID: [01031FAE]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000CC6"
msgid "My last words are \"Hot Dogs are a sandwich.\""
msgstr "내 유언은 \"핫도그는 샌드위치다.\"야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_KT02_SailingHighSeas
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE_KT02_100b_HailingAnswered
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = HailingShip
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMGenericMale02
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0065F255
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = [Lie] I'm not a pirate.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: [Lie] I'm not a pirate.
#. DialogueAfter = HailingShip: Wait darling, they might be with the tour.
#. EDID: [010388DD]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000CC7"
msgid "That's exactly what a pirate would say!"
msgstr "해적이라면 딱 그렇게 말하겠지!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_KT02_SailingHighSeas
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE_KT02_100b_HailingAnswered
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
