#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = HailingShip: All right you dastardly pirate scum, answer the hail! &&& HailingShip: &&& HailingShip: Thanks for answering, you filthy little pirate! &&& HailingShip: Any last words before we blow you to smithereens?
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: That's exactly what a pirate would say!
#. EDID: [010388D2]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000CC8"
msgid "[Lie] I'm not a pirate."
msgstr "[거짓말] 난 해적이 아니야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_KT02_SailingHighSeas
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE_KT02_100a_InitialScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = HailingShip
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFGenericFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00742933
#. ScriptNotes = Rich executive paying 100,000 credits to hunt pirates
#. DialogueBefore = HailingShip: Hey, where's he going!
#. EDID: [01031FB3]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000CC9"
msgid "Oh, we don't need him. Hail the pirate ship, darling! Use your \"executive\" voice!"
msgstr "아, 그 사람 없어도 돼요. 해적선에 교신을 보내요, 여보! 그 \"임원\" 목소리를 쓰세요!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_KT02_SailingHighSeas
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE_KT02_100a_HailingScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = HailingShip
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMGenericMale02
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00800B3D
#. EDID: [010388B9]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000CCA"
msgid "All right you dastardly pirate scum, answer the hail!"
msgstr "좋아, 이 비열한 해적 쓰레기들아, 교신에 응답해라!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_KT02_SailingHighSeas
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE_KT02_100a_InitialScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = HailingShip
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFGenericFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 005C06E1
#. ScriptNotes = Rich executive paying 100,000 credits to hunt pirates
#. DialogueBefore = HailingShip: Okay, I just need to figure out where the damn weapons system is.
#. DialogueAfter = HailingShip: Hey, where's he going!
#. EDID: [01031FAD]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000CCB"
msgid "Oh look darling, I think I see one! Over there! Mr. guide man, do you think we should hail them?"
msgstr "어머, 여보, 하나 보이는 것 같아요! 저기요! 안내원 양반, 교신을 보내야 할까요?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_KT02_SailingHighSeas
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE_KT02_100a_InitialScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = HailingShip
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFGenericFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00E320AC
#. ScriptNotes = Rich executive paying 100,000 credits to hunt pirates
#. DialogueBefore = HailingShip: Hell yeah! The chance to destroy a real pirate ship! This is worth every cred!
#. DialogueAfter = HailingShip: Okay, I just need to figure out where the damn weapons system is.
#. EDID: [010388D4]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000CCC"
msgid "I agree, darling. This was far better use of our funds than another luxury cruise."
msgstr "동의해요, 여보. 또 다른 호화 유람선보다 훨씬 나은 자금 사용이었어요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_KT02_SailingHighSeas
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE_KT02_100a_InitialScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = HailingShip
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMGenericMale02
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00D56BBC
#. ScriptNotes = Rich executive paying 100,000 credits to hunt pirates
#. DialogueBefore = TourEscort: This is a known pirate hunting ground. We suggest powering up your weapons, we could spot one at any moment.
#. DialogueAfter = HailingShip: I agree, darling. This was far better use of our funds than another luxury cruise.
#. EDID: [01031FB2]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000CCD"
msgid "Hell yeah! The chance to destroy a real pirate ship! This is worth every cred!"
msgstr "좋았어! 진짜 해적선을 파괴할 기회라니! 크레딧 한 푼도 아깝지 않아!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_KT02_SailingHighSeas
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE_KT02_100a_HailingScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = HailingShip
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMGenericMale02
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 009EC8EA
#. DialogueBefore = HailingShip: All right you dastardly pirate scum, answer the hail!
#. DialogueAfter = HailingShip: All right bub, you asked for it!
#. EDID: [010388CF]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000CCE"
msgid "Answer, or die!"
msgstr "응답해, 아니면 죽어!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_KT02_SailingHighSeas
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE_KT02_100b_HailingAnswered
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = HailingShip
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFGenericFemale01
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 003B0CB5
#. DialogueAfter = HailingShip: Damn straight. Well, thanks stranger. Appreciate you clearing things up.
#. EDID: [010388DE]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000CCF"
msgid "If these scammers think pirates are scary, they haven't met the team at Morgan, Locke, & Hartley."
msgstr "이 사기꾼들이 해적이 무섭다고 생각한다면, 아직 모건, 로크 & 하틀리의 팀을 못 만나본 거야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_KT02_SailingHighSeas
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE_KT02_100b_HailingAnswered
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = HailingShip
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFGenericFemale01
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00A16BEB
#. DialogueBefore = HailingShip: Scammed? Goddamnit! I knew it was too good to be true! I paid way more for the other hunts!
#. EDID: [010388DE]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000CD0"
msgid "Don't worry darlin, I'm going to have a word with our lawyers. "
msgstr "걱정 마세요, 여보. 우리 변호사들과 얘기해 볼게요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_Anchorpoint_RandConv03_RishiValeria
#. SceneName = SFFL_Anchorpoint_RandConv02_SceneCOPY0000
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Actor01
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFValeriaHahn
#. Face = Friendly
#. SoundFileID = 00E66401
#. ScriptNotes = / to Actor01
#. DialogueAfter = Actor02: That's unfortunate. Reliable traders are a rare commodity out here.
#. EDID: [01031720]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000CD1"
msgid "Might be time to find a new supplier, at least for the drinks."
msgstr "새 공급처를 찾아야 할 때가 온 것 같아. 적어도 술은 말이야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_Anchorpoint_RandConv03_RishiValeria
#. SceneName = SFFL_Anchorpoint_RandConv02_SceneCOPY0000
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Actor01
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFValeriaHahn
#. Face = Friendly
#. SoundFileID = 005C800D
#. ScriptNotes = / to Actor01
#. DialogueBefore = Actor02: You needed something?
#. EDID: [01031720]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000CD2"
msgid "We're running low again."
msgstr "또 재고가 부족해졌어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_Anchorpoint_RandConv03_RishiValeria
#. SceneName = SFFL_Anchorpoint_RandConv02_SceneCOPY0000
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Actor02
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRishiSaint
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 00A98DDD
#. ScriptNotes = / to Actor02
#. DialogueBefore = Actor02: You needed something? &&& Actor01: We're running low again.|Might be time to find a new supplier, at least for the drinks.
#. DialogueAfter = Actor01: I could always mix the drinks a little weaker.
#. EDID: [0103171E]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000CD3"
msgid "That's unfortunate. Reliable traders are a rare commodity out here."
msgstr "안타깝군요. 이곳에서 믿을 만한 상인은 귀하죠."

#. List: 2
#. EDID: [01031721]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000CD4"
msgid "We'd be lost without you, Maddie."
msgstr "매디가 없었으면 우린 곤란했을 거야."

#. List: 2
#. EDID: [0103171F]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000CD5"
msgid "I swear, if I had a credit for every time that thing broke down, I'd own my own space cantina."
msgstr "맹세하는데, 그 물건이 고장 날 때마다 크레딧을 하나씩 받았으면 내 우주 칸티나를 차렸을 거야."

#. List: 2
#. EDID: [0103171F]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000CD6"
msgid "Thanks, Maddie."
msgstr "고마워, 매디."

#. List: 2
#. EDID: [0103171D]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000CD7"
msgid "I know I'm talented, but duct tape and miracles only go so far."
msgstr "내가 재능 있는 건 알지만, 덕트 테이프와 기적에도 한계가 있어."

#. List: 2
#. EDID: [0103171D]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000CD8"
msgid "If you do, spend a little more money on the fixtures and appliances."
msgstr "그렇게 할 거면 설비랑 가전에는 돈을 좀 더 써."

#. List: 2
#. EDID: [01031727]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000CD9"
msgid "Hey Valeria. I got that cooler fixed for you. Again."
msgstr "안녕, 발레리아. 그 냉각기 고쳐놨어. 또."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_Anchorpoint_RandConv02_RishiKillian
#. SceneName = SFFL_Anchorpoint_RandConv02_Scene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Actor02
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRishiSaint
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 0019BBBD
#. ScriptNotes = / to Actor01
#. DialogueAfter = Actor01: I don't control how much our patrons choose to spend on my goods.
#. EDID: [01031700]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000CDA"
msgid "Profits are down, Killian. I need you to do better."
msgstr "수익이 줄고 있습니다. 킬리언. 더 분발해 주셔야겠어요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_Anchorpoint_RandConv01_ChanMaddie
#. SceneName = SFFL_Anchorpoint_RandConv01_Scene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Actor01
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFMaddieWing
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00238C94
#. ScriptNotes = / to Actor02
#. DialogueBefore = Actor01: And while I make your robot guards, who's going to keep this place running?|You got someone who can replace faulty breakers, refurbish the air scrubbers or weld hull plates?|And by the way, they have to do all that with spare parts and second-rate tools. &&& Actor02: Okay, I get it. Just keep it in mind in case you get some free time. That's all I ask.
#. EDID: [010316FA]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000CDB"
msgid "Sure, Chan."
msgstr "알았어. 챈."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_Anchorpoint_RandConv01_ChanMaddie
#. SceneName = SFFL_Anchorpoint_RandConv01_Scene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Actor02
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMChanHuang
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 00C41853
#. ScriptNotes = / to Actor01
#. DialogueBefore = Actor02: I didn't say an army.|You know there's only a handful of us keeping this place safe.|Just a few bots could still make a big difference. &&& Actor01: And while I make your robot guards, who's going to keep this place running?|You got someone who can replace faulty breakers, refurbish the air scrubbers or weld hull plates?|And by the way, they have to do all that with spare parts and second-rate tools.
#. DialogueAfter = Actor01: Sure, Chan.
#. EDID: [010316F8]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000CDC"
msgid "Okay, I get it. Just keep it in mind in case you get some free time. That's all I ask."
msgstr "좋아. 알겠어. 그냥 혹시라도 한가해지면 생각이나 한 번 해달라는 거야. 그 정도면 돼."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCFGrandma
#. VoiceType = SFFL_SE01_NPCFGrandma
#. Face = Nervous
#. SoundFileID = 0096EB5D
#. ScriptNotes = unnatural, robotic cadence / Nervous
#. EDID: [0104AE4A]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000CDD"
msgid "Leave! Leave now!"
msgstr "나가! 당장 나가!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCFGrandma
#. VoiceType = SFFL_SE01_NPCFGrandma
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00E04078
#. ScriptNotes = unnatural, almost robotic cadence / Neutral
#. EDID: [0104AE46]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000CDE"
msgid "Go on. Eat."
msgstr "자. 먹어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCFGrandma
#. VoiceType = SFFL_SE01_NPCFGrandma
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00B72CCE
#. ScriptNotes = unnatural, almost robotic cadence / Neutral
#. EDID: [0104AE43]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000CDF"
msgid "Please, come aboard."
msgstr "제발, 승선해."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCFGrandma
#. VoiceType = SFFL_SE01_NPCFGrandma
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00DE7870
#. ScriptNotes = robotic, unnatural / Neutral
#. EDID: [0104AF01]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000CE0"
msgid "Say something."
msgstr "뭐라도 말해 봐."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE01
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE01_250_GrandmaTalk
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Grandma
#. VoiceType = SFFL_SE01_NPCFGrandma
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0074DBB7
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral / to Player
#. DialogueAfter = Grandma: *Heavy breathing*
#. EDID: [0102FCBB]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000CE1"
msgid "So itchy... but your body seems like it would not be."
msgstr "너무 가려워... 하지만 네 몸은 그렇지 않을 것 같네."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE01
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE01_250_GrandmaTalk
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Grandma
#. VoiceType = SFFL_SE01_NPCFGrandma
#. Face = Spaceship / Irritated
#. SoundFileID = 00D093FB
#. ScriptNotes = deadpan / Irritated / to Player
#. DialogueBefore = Grandma: I am envious.
#. EDID: [0102FCBB]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000CE2"
msgid "I would like to inhabit a body like yours. My current body... I can feel it deteriorating. I feel my skin about to split, my teeth about to burst. I can feel itching behind my eyes. "
msgstr ""
"너 같은 몸에 들어가 살고 싶구나. 지금의 내 몸은... 망가져 가는 게 느껴져. 피부가 찢어질 것 같고, 이가 터질 것 같고, 눈 뒤가 "
"가려워. "

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE01
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE01_250_GrandmaTalkBranch
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Grandma
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00418546
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Grandma: *Heavy breathing*
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: You accused me of joking.
#. EDID: [0102FCC7]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000CE3"
msgid "Why are you just smiling at me?"
msgstr "왜 그냥 절 보며 웃고 있는 거죠?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE01
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE01_250_GrandmaTalk
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Grandma
#. VoiceType = SFFL_SE01_NPCFGrandma
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00238BE4
#. ScriptNotes = deadpan / Neutral / to Player Default
#. Prompt = I'm not answering that.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I'm not answering that.
#. DialogueAfter = Grandma: I would like to inhabit a body like yours. My current body... I can feel it deteriorating. I feel my skin about to split, my teeth about to burst. I can feel itching behind my eyes.
#. EDID: [0102FCBA]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000CE4"
msgid "Do not be so modest."
msgstr "그렇게 겸손 떨지 마."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE01
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE01_250_GrandmaTalk
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCFGrandma
#. VoiceType = SFFL_SE01_NPCFGrandma
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00273FD4
#. ScriptNotes = deadpan, ghostly. / Neutral / to Player Default
#. Prompt = My ship isn't much better.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: My ship isn't much better.
#. DialogueAfter = Grandma: How do you feel in your body? Do you feel alive?
#. EDID: [0102FCB6]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000CE5"
msgid "Interesting. Your body seems strong, full of vigor. You have no excuse to let your ship fall into such disrepair. "
msgstr "흥미롭네. 네 몸은 강하고 활력이 넘쳐 보여. 그런 몸을 가지고도 우주선을 이렇게 망가진 채 두다니 변명의 여지가 없구나. "

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE01
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE01_250_GrandmaTalk
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Grandma
#. VoiceType = SFFL_SE01_NPCFGrandma
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00F5224D
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral / to Player Default
#. Prompt = It's hard to pass up free food.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: It's hard to pass up free food.
#. DialogueAfter = Grandma: I can see your eyes wandering about my ship. I extend my apologies for the state of it.
#. EDID: [0102FCC4]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000CE6"
msgid "Yes, you may eat your fill in a moment. First, I would like to know you."
msgstr "그래, 곧 마음껏 먹어도 된다. 먼저 너에 대해 알고 싶구나."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE01
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE01_250_GrandmaTalk
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Grandma
#. VoiceType = SFFL_SE01_NPCFGrandma
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00972346
#. ScriptNotes = deadpan, almost ghostly / Neutral / to Player Default
#. Prompt = I'm not afraid of you. Are you afraid of me?
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I'm not afraid of you. Are you afraid of me?
#. DialogueAfter = Grandma: Nice to meet you.
#. EDID: [0102FCC2]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000CE7"
msgid "Afraid of your kind? Never."
msgstr "너 같은 부류를 두려워하느냐고? 전혀."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE01
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE01_250_GrandmaTalk
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Grandma
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00040E98
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Grandma: Hello.|I am glad you stopped by. I was beginning to think that you were... afraid.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Yes, you may eat your fill in a moment. First, I would like to know you.
#. EDID: [0102FCA3]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000CE8"
msgid "It's hard to pass up free food."
msgstr "공짜 음식은 거절하기 어렵죠."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE01
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE01_250_GrandmaTalk
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCFGrandma
#. VoiceType = SFFL_SE01_NPCFGrandma
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 006908DF
#. ScriptNotes = deadpan / Neutral / to Player Default
#. Prompt = I'm not sure I'm hungry anymore.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I'm not sure I'm hungry anymore.
#. DialogueAfter = Grandma: The food has been set out for you. Please, help yourself.
#. EDID: [010300CF]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000CE9"
msgid "Nonsense, nonsense."
msgstr "말도 안 돼, 말도 안 돼."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE01
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE01_255_DeclinedFood
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Grandma
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00901805
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I didn't inconvenience you. You're the one that invited me over. &&& Grandma: You are making us very angry!|We invited you to eat, and yet you spurn us. You may as well spit in our face!
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Eat! Eat! Eat!
