#. SoundFileID = 00733B31
#. DialogueBefore = HailingShip:
#. EDID: [01043FAA]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000D21"
msgid "I've got another job for you, if you're up for it. Same as last time, you just gotta get the contraband and give it to either me or the Trade Authority. "
msgstr "괜찮다면 맡길 일이 하나 더 있어. 지난번과 같아. 밀수품을 챙겨서 나나 무역 연맹에 넘기면 돼."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R01
#. SceneName = SFFL_R01_TL01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = HailingShip
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R01_Smuggler
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0057449A
#. EDID: [01043FA1]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000D22"
msgid "And you know what that means? Big money."
msgstr "그게 무슨 뜻인지 알아? 큰돈이지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R01
#. SceneName = SFFL_R01_TL01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = HailingShip
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R01_Smuggler
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0007FE01
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: What's so special about this contraband?
#. EDID: [01043FA1]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000D23"
msgid "Tell you the truth, I'm not sure. But, whatever it is, people are willing to kill for it, and possibly die for it. "
msgstr "솔직히 말하면 나도 잘 몰라. 하지만 그게 뭐든, 사람들은 그걸 위해 죽이려 들고, 어쩌면 죽으려 들기도 해."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R01
#. SceneName = SFFL_R01_HailAccepted
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00A3A5A3
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = HailingShip: You there. If your pockets are feeling light, I've got an opportunity for you. &&& HailingShip: Good, you picked up. I've got an opportunity for us to make some decent cash.|Thing is, I need someone that isn't afraid to... bend the law, so to speak. |How does that sound to you?
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Perfect.
#. EDID: [01043FB8]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000D24"
msgid "I bend the law all the time."
msgstr "난 법을 자주 어겨."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R01
#. SceneName = SFFL_R01_HailAccepted
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = HailingShip
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R01_Smuggler
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0096DA17
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = I'm gonna have to report this to the Freestar Rangers.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I'm gonna have to report this to the Freestar Rangers.
#. DialogueAfter = HailingShip: I'm marking the locations for you. Good luck.
#. EDID: [01043FA2]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000D25"
msgid "Ah, shit. That... that won't be necessary. I gotta go."
msgstr "아, 젠장. 그건... 그럴 필요는 없어. 난 가야겠어."

