#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I need some more information.
#. DialogueAfter = HailingShip: Trade Authority is paying a pretty penny to anyone who can get the contraband from some potentially dangerous areas.
#. EDID: [01043F9B]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000D26"
msgid "Okay, here's the thing..."
msgstr "좋아, 그러니까 사정은 이래..."

