#. DialogueAfter = HailingShip: I've got another job for you, if you're up for it. Same as last time, you just gotta get the contraband and give it to either me or the Trade Authority.
#. EDID: [01043FB4]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000D29"
msgid "Good to see you again."
msgstr "다시 보니 반갑군."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R01
#. SceneName = SFFL_R01_TL03
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = HailingShip
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00ED6183
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: You said you were injured on a job before? &&& HailingShip: Yeah. It's not really a good story.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: I... *sigh* All right. If you're gonna twist my arm so much.
#. EDID: [01051B9E]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000D2A"
msgid "I feel like this is a sensitive subject. It may be good for you to talk about it."
msgstr "이건 민감한 주제인 것 같아. 이야기해보는 게 너한테 좋을 수도 있어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R01
#. SceneName = SFFL_R01_TL03
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 005038C1
#. DialogueAfter = HailingShip: Yeah. It's not really a good story.
#. EDID: [01051BA1]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000D2B"
msgid "You said you were injured on a job before?"
msgstr "예전에 일하다 다쳤다고 했지?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R01
#. SceneName = SFFL_R01_TurnIn
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = HailingShip
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R01_Smuggler
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00F450CC
#. EDID: [010522E4]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000D2C"
msgid "Well, I can't pay you, obviously. Maybe next time our fortunes will change. "
msgstr "뭐, 당연히 보수는 줄 수 없어. 다음번엔 우리 운이 좀 달라질지도 모르지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R01
#. SceneName = SFFL_R01_TurnIn
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = HailingShip
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R01_Smuggler
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00E252C3
#. DialogueBefore = HailingShip: If I have more opportunities for you in the future, I'll find you.|Oh, before I forget. I have some intel pointing to some valuables in another location. I'll mark it on your map as a little bonus.|Good luck out there.
#. EDID: [010522E4]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000D2D"
msgid "*Sigh* We just lost out on some serious money. "
msgstr "*한숨* 큰돈을 벌 기회를 날려버렸어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMCutty
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMCutty
#. Face = Friendly
#. SoundFileID = 00900169
#. ScriptNotes = Grateful, warm / Friendly
#. EDID: [0106C84D]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000D39"
msgid "I can't tell you how much I appreciate what you did."
msgstr "당신이 해주신 일에 대해 얼마나 고맙게 생각하는지 말로 다 표현 못 하겠습니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMMilesCutler
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMMilesCutler
#. Face = Friendly
#. SoundFileID = 004A58BC
#. ScriptNotes = Warm, friendly / Friendly
#. EDID: [0106C452]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000D3A"
msgid "It's good to see you again."
msgstr "다시 만나서 반가워."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCFDanicaVolkov
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFDanicaVolkov
#. Face = Friendly
#. SoundFileID = 00FC3995
#. ScriptNotes = A friendly greeting.
#. EDID: [0104C3ED]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000D3B"
msgid "You been in a scrap? Need that ship patched up? Well I'm your gal."
msgstr "어디서 한판 붙고 오셨나? 우주선을 땜질해야 해? 그럼 내가 딱 적임자지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCFDanicaVolkov
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFDanicaVolkov
#. Face = Friendly
#. SoundFileID = 0067AD37
#. ScriptNotes = A friendly greeting.
#. EDID: [0104C3EB]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000D3C"
msgid "Need something for your ship? I can get you fixed up."
msgstr "우주선에 필요한 게 있어? 내가 손봐줄 수 있어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCFDanicaVolkov
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFDanicaVolkov
#. Face = Friendly
#. SoundFileID = 00035BAD
#. EDID: [0105F4D9]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000D3D"
msgid "Oh, hey! You talk to Maddie yet? She's looking for you."
msgstr "오, 어이! 매디랑 얘기해 봤어? 널 찾고 있던데."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCFValeriaHahn
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFValeriaHahn
#. Face = Friendly
#. SoundFileID = 00013D79
#. ScriptNotes = Friendly
#. EDID: [0103141D]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000D3E"
msgid "Welcome to our little corner of the starfield. Can I set you up with a drink?"
msgstr "이 별무리의 구석퉁이에 온 걸 환영해. 한잔 내줄까?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMRishiSaint
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRishiSaint
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 00B1BB8F
#. ScriptNotes = Polite but greedy
#. EDID: [0102672B]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000D3F"
msgid "People come to Anchorpoint for a quiet drink and some privacy."
msgstr "사람들은 조용히 한잔하고 사생활을 지키려고 앵커포인트에 옵니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMRishiSaint
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRishiSaint
#. Face = Impressed
#. SoundFileID = 00E12E8F
#. ScriptNotes = Impressed / Impressed
#. EDID: [01059E36]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000D40"
msgid "Quite a brave thing you did, taking on those Spacers."
msgstr "그 스페이서들을 상대하시다니 꽤 용감한 일을 하셨군요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCFMaddieWing
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFMaddieWing
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0052825D
#. ScriptNotes = Skeptical the player won't make a mess anyway
#. EDID: [01026728]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000D41"
msgid "You can use the workbenches, but don't make a mess."
msgstr "작업대는 써도 되지만, 어지럽히진 마."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCFMaddieWing
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFMaddieWing
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 005B6F51
#. ScriptNotes = Exasperated, shaking your head
#. EDID: [01026725]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000D42"
msgid "Surprised this place is still in one piece."
msgstr "이곳이 아직도 멀쩡하다니 놀랍네."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCFDarcyWeber
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFDarcyWeber
#. Face = Nervous
#. SoundFileID = 0022DC61
#. ScriptNotes = Haunted, nervous
#. EDID: [0102671C]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000D43"
msgid "It's out there, all around us... space... deadly space..."
msgstr "저 밖에 있어. 우리 주위에... 우주가... 치명적인 우주가..."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMCutty
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMCutty
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00108F34
#. ScriptNotes = Grumpy
#. EDID: [01026715]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000D44"
msgid "I can treat your injuries, but don't expect sympathy."
msgstr "부상은 치료해 줄 수 있지만, 동정이라도 해줄 거란 기대는 하지 마시길."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMCutty
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMCutty
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00FBA693
#. ScriptNotes = Grumpy
#. EDID: [01026714]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000D45"
msgid "You lost? Or just too drunk to realize this isn't the bar?"
msgstr "길 잃었어? 아니면 너무 취해서 여기가 바가 아니라는 것도 모르는 거야?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMCutty
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMCutty
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0033D267
#. ScriptNotes = Grumpy
#. EDID: [01026712]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000D46"
msgid "I hope you're not here to waste my time."
msgstr "내 시간을 낭비하러 온 게 아니었으면 좋겠어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMChanHuang
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMChanHuang
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 003F8FCD
#. ScriptNotes = Courteous but firm
#. EDID: [0102670F]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000D47"
msgid "Valeria can hook you up with a drink. Just don't overdo it."
msgstr "술 마시고 싶으면 발레리아에게 가 . 너무 많이 마시지만 마."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMGenericMale / NPCFGenericFemale
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMGenericMale02 / SFFL_NPCMGenericMale01 / SFFL_NPCFGenericFemale01 / SFFL_NPCFGenericFemale02
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00B90CCD
#. ScriptNotes = Dismissive
#. EDID: [0102670A]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000D48"
msgid "Whatever brought you here is none of my business."
msgstr "그쪽이 무슨 일로 여기 왔든 내 알 바 아니지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCFGenericFemale / NPCMGenericMale
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFGenericFemale03 / SFFL_NPCFGenericFemale04 / SFFL_NPCMGenericMale03
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0038BE46
#. ScriptNotes = Firm, a guard
#. EDID: [0104EDB0]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000D49"
msgid "I don't know if I trust Maddie's pet robot. It used to be a combat model."
msgstr "매디의 애완 로봇을 믿어도 되는지 모르겠습니다. 예전엔 전투 모델이었으니 말입니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMRishiSaint
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRishiSaint
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 0055DA8D
#. ScriptNotes = The player has suddenly stopped talking mid-conversation. Are they okay?
#. EDID: [0104EDD7]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000D4A"
msgid "Did I say something upsetting?"
msgstr "제가 기분 나쁜 말이라도 했습니까?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCFMaddieWing
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFMaddieWing
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00D89E50
#. ScriptNotes = Impatient, sassy. The player has suddenly stopped talking mid-conversation. Are they okay?
#. EDID: [0104EDD1]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000D4B"
msgid "Tick tock! Let's go!"
msgstr "똑딱똑딱! 어서 가자!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMKillianBrice
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMKillianBrice
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0026E5D7
#. ScriptNotes = The player has suddenly stopped talking mid-conversation. Are they okay?
#. EDID: [0104EDCE]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000D4C"
msgid "You have the look of someone deep in thought."
msgstr "깊은 생각에 잠긴 사람처럼 보이는군."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMChanHuang
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMChanHuang
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 0028FFB7
#. ScriptNotes = The player has suddenly stopped talking mid-conversation. Are they okay?
#. EDID: [0104EDBA]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000D4D"
msgid "Um..."
msgstr "음..."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMRishiSaint
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRishiSaint
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 00B167B5
#. ScriptNotes = Saying goodbye to the player, who has just departed mid-conversation.
#. EDID: [0104EDF9]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000D4E"
msgid "Good talk."
msgstr "이야기 나눠서 즐거웠습니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCFMaddieWing
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFMaddieWing
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00200080
#. ScriptNotes = A little sassy. Saying goodbye to the player, who has just departed mid-conversation.
#. EDID: [0104EDF7]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000D4F"
msgid "Go on then, get out of here. I've got work to do."
msgstr "그럼 가. 여기서 나가. 난 할 일이 있어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCFDanicaVolkov
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFDanicaVolkov
#. Face = Friendly
#. SoundFileID = 00C399A8
#. ScriptNotes = Friendly. Saying goodbye to the player, who has just departed mid-conversation.
#. EDID: [0104EDEA]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000D50"
msgid "Oh, we're done?"
msgstr "아, 할 얘기 끝나셨나?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMCutty
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMCutty
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0040C7B4
#. ScriptNotes = Grumpy. Saying goodbye to the player, who has just departed mid-conversation.
#. EDID: [0104EDE2]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000D51"
msgid "Goodbye."
msgstr "안녕히 가세요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMChanHuang
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMChanHuang
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 00704774
#. ScriptNotes = Saying goodbye to the player, who has just departed mid-conversation.
#. EDID: [0104EDDF]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000D52"
msgid "Back to work."
msgstr "다시 일해야지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_IntroScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = ChanHuang
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMChanHuang
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 00BD40C5
#. ScriptNotes = / to RishiSaint
#. DialogueBefore = ChanHuang: To attack a Spacer stronghold head-on?|No way in hell I'd give that order.|Our contract is security only. &&& RishiSaint: Maybe we offer the job to one of the patrons, then.|In the meantime, make sure your team is ready.|The Spacers will likely be coming in force.
#. DialogueAfter = RishiSaint: And give up Anchorpoint?
#. EDID: [010266FD]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000D53"
msgid "I still think we should consider evacuating."
msgstr "전 아직도 대피를 고려해야 한다고 생각합니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_IntroScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = ChanHuang
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMChanHuang
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 00F8FB99
#. ScriptNotes = Concerned, under threat / to RishiSaint
#. DialogueBefore = RishiSaint: Did the Spacers give any indication of when they plan to hit us?
#. DialogueAfter = RishiSaint: Damn. We can't risk sending any of your people while we're under imminent threat.
#. EDID: [010266F9]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000D54"
msgid "None. The warning was vague, probably to keep us off-balance and afraid."
msgstr "안 보입니다. 경고는 모호했습니다. 아마 우리를 불안하게 만들고 겁만 주려는 거였겠죠."

#. List: 2
#. EDID: [0102A519]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000D55"
msgid "How are you keeping solvent with such a remote location?"
msgstr "이렇게 외진 곳에서 어떻게 운영비를 충당하고 있죠?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_RishiTL04_Services
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00924CB8
#. ScriptNotes = / to RishiSaint
#. DialogueAfter = RishiSaint: Just the basics, really. We're a small operation.
#. EDID: [0102A532]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000D56"
msgid "What services are offered here?"
msgstr "여기서는 어떤 서비스를 제공하죠?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_RishiGreet
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = RishiSaint
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00DACA72
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I'm not exactly great with rules. &&& RishiSaint: There are only a few, I'm sure you'll manage.|But if you find you can't handle them, feel free to leave before things become... unpleasant.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: What kinds of dealings our patrons conduct here is not my business.
#. EDID: [0102A521]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000D57"
msgid "I know a smuggler's den when I see one, but don't worry, I won't blow your cover."
msgstr "밀수업자 소굴인지는 보면 압니다. 걱정 마세요. 정체를 폭로하진 않을게요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_RishiGreet
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 004B4FF9
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I won't cause any trouble. &&& RishiSaint: Excellent. I hope this will be the first of many visits.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: You're not the first person to make an incorrect assumption about this place.
#. EDID: [0102A539]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000D58"
msgid "Fair enough. Sorry to imply otherwise."
msgstr "좋습니다. 딴 뜻이 있었던 건 아니니 신경 쓰지 마세요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_RishiGreet
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = RishiSaint
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00A79C6C
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Don't you worry, I'll handle the Spacers. &&& RishiSaint: Really? |I believe in fair pay for a job well done.|Deal with these Spacers, and I'll provide the credits.|My head of security can point you in the right direction. &&& RishiSaint: A few words of advice.|We're happy to welcome all who pass through the airlock, but our hospitality has limits.|Acts of theft or violence will be met with a swift response.|We also value privacy and discretion here.|Our patrons expect to conduct whatever business they wish free from prying eyes and ears. &&& companion: Why do I find that vaguely suspicious?
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: I'm not sure what you're asking.
#. EDID: [0102A533]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000D59"
msgid "What exactly goes on here?"
msgstr "여기 대체 뭐 하는 곳이죠?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_RishiGreet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = RishiSaint
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRishiSaint
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 0012EB36
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = I'll solve your Spacer problem, for a price.
#. DialogueAfter = RishiSaint: This place is pretty remote.
#. EDID: [0102A51D]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000D5A"
msgid "My head of security can fill you in on the details."
msgstr "자세한 내용은 제 경비 책임자가 알려드릴 겁니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_RishiGreet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = RishiSaint
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRishiSaint
#. Face = Impressed
#. SoundFileID = 00B60B02
#. ScriptNotes = Impressed / to Player Default
#. Prompt = I'll solve your Spacer problem, for a price.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I'll solve your Spacer problem, for a price.
#. EDID: [0102A51D]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000D5B"
msgid "Oh? Consider your offer accepted."
msgstr "오? 그 제안은 받아들이도록 하죠."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_RishiGreet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = RishiSaint
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRishiSaint
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 009113F6
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = What kind of an establishment is this, exactly?
#. DialogueAfter = RishiSaint: This place is pretty remote.
#. EDID: [0102A52D]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000D5C"
msgid "Not everyone loves the bustle and noise of a large spaceport, after all."
msgstr "어쨌든 모두가 대형 우주항의 북적임과 소음을 좋아하는 건 아니니까요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_RishiGreet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = RishiSaint
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRishiSaint
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 00B8F3BC
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = What kind of an establishment is this, exactly?
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: What kind of an establishment is this, exactly?
#. EDID: [0102A52D]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000D5D"
msgid "A place to rest, refuel and stock up on supplies while enjoying a little privacy."
msgstr "조금의 사생활을 즐기며 쉬고, 연료를 보급하고, 물자를 채울 수 있는 곳이죠."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_RishiGreet
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = RishiSaint
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 001F1AC4
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = The station was built over eighty years ago by a wealthy industrialist named Gabriela LeBlanc..|She had hoped it would be a jumping-off point to remote systems not yet accessible by grav drive.|Unfortunately, the advances she expected in grav jump technology never materialized.|As a result, the station never realized its purpose and was eventually abandoned.|A few years ago, I purchased it and had it towed out of its decaying orbit around Algorab II. &&& RishiSaint: I make it a point to remember every face that boards this station.|Yours is a new one.|Welcome to Anchorpoint. I'm Rishi Saint, the owner of this establishment.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Commerce is my reason.
#. EDID: [0102A523]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000D5E"
msgid "A man who remembers faces must have a reason for doing so."
msgstr "남의 얼굴을 기억하는 건 그럴 이유가 있기 때문이겠죠."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_MaddieTL02_Background
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = MaddieWing
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFMaddieWing
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 002F99DD
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: You should feel guilty.
#. EDID: [0102C00C]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000D5F"
msgid "Still feel guilty about that part."
msgstr "아직도 그 일에 대해선 죄책감이 들어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_MaddieTL02_Background
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = MaddieWing
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFMaddieWing
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00EF7424
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. EDID: [0102C00C]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000D60"
msgid "I got caught and the local Ranger locked me up. My parents lost their jobs."
msgstr "계속하다 붙잡혔는데, 지역 담당 레인저가 날 가뒀어. 부모님은 직장을 잃으셨고."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_MaddieTL02_Background
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = MaddieWing
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFMaddieWing
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 009D463E
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. EDID: [0102C00C]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000D61"
msgid "Got to a point where I needed better parts, so I started stealing them from transport ships."
msgstr "그러다 더 좋은 부품이 필요하게 돼서, 운송선에서 부품을 훔치기 시작했어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_MaddieTL02_Background
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = MaddieWing
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFMaddieWing
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 001475CC
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. EDID: [0102C00C]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000D62"
msgid "As a kid, I was always tinkering. I started building robots out of dumpster parts."
msgstr "어릴 때부터 난 늘 뭔가를 만지작거렸어. 쓰레기통에 버려진 부품으로 로봇을 만들기 시작했지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_MaddieTL02_Background
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = MaddieWing
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFMaddieWing
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 000F9424
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: You said Rishi helped you out. What happened?
#. EDID: [0102C00C]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000D63"
msgid "I grew up in HopeTown. Parents were engineers. They worked for the company, like everyone else."
msgstr "난 호프타운에서 자랐어. 부모님은 엔지니어셨고. 다른 사람들처럼 회사에서 일하셨지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_MaddieTL02_Background
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00A13B2D
#. ScriptNotes = / to MaddieWing
#. DialogueAfter = MaddieWing: I grew up in HopeTown. Parents were engineers. They worked for the company, like everyone else.
#. EDID: [0102C02D]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000D64"
msgid "You said Rishi helped you out. What happened?"
msgstr "리시 씨가 널 도와줬다고 했었잖아? 무슨 일이 있었어?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_MaddieGreet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = MaddieWing
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFMaddieWing
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0073C646
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = If it's so dangerous, why do you stay?
#. DialogueAfter = MaddieWing: They're lucky to have you.
#. EDID: [0102C025]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000D65"
msgid "That, plus Rishi helped me out when I was in a bad spot, so I kind of owe him one."
msgstr "그것도 있고, 내가 힘들 때 리시 씨가 도와준 적이 있어서 좀 빚 같은 걸 졌거든."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_MaddieGreet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = MaddieWing
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFMaddieWing
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 005AD416
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = If it's so dangerous, why do you stay?
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: If it's so dangerous, why do you stay?
#. EDID: [0102C025]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000D66"
msgid "I like it here. Place keeps me busy."
msgstr "난 여기가 좋아. 할 일이 많아서 심심하진 않거든."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_MaddieGreet
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = MaddieWing
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00FD36E0
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I'll be careful. &&& MaddieWing: You better.|Got enough on my hands without having to clean up after fools who start poking and prodding things.|Had a trader in here last week who leaned on a pipe when the sealant was still drying.|Knocked the damn thing loose and sprayed hot water all over himself. &&& MaddieWing: Name's Maddie. I keep the place running.|Always had a knack for machines. Good thing, too.|If it wasn't for me, everyone would have been sucked out into space cause we lost a wall.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: And miss all the excitement?
#. EDID: [0102C011]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000D67"
msgid "Maybe I should go back to my ship, where it's safe."
msgstr "안전한 내 우주선으로 돌아가야 할지도 모르겠네."

#. List: 2
#. EDID: [0102C029]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000D68"
msgid "Maybe I should go back to my ship where it's safe."
msgstr "안전한 내 우주선으로 돌아가야 할지도 모르겠어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_MaddieGreet
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = MaddieWing
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00BBF489
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = MaddieWing: You new around here? Well don't break anything.|Place is barely holding together as it is.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: In case you ain't noticed, this place is old. Like, real old.
#. EDID: [0102C016]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000D69"
msgid "What do you mean by \"barely holding together?\""
msgstr "간신히 버티고 있다는 게 무슨 뜻이지?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_MaddieGreet
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0045D52F
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = MaddieWing: You new around here? Well don't break anything.|Place is barely holding together as it is.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: You better.
#. EDID: [0102C024]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000D6A"
msgid "I'll be careful."
msgstr "조심할게."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_ValeriaTL03_Background
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00920948
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: What brought you all the way out here? &&& ValeriaHahn: I have a son, Gabriel. He became very ill and I just couldn't afford the treatment.|I'd met Mister Saint while I was tending bar at the Astral Lounge.|He tried to hire me for this place, but I said no. It was just so remote.|When he learned about my son's illness, he said he'd pay the bills on the condition I work here.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: It might seem that way, but he's making a tidy profit.
#. EDID: [0103140B]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000D6B"
msgid "That's very generous."
msgstr "정말 후하군."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_ValeriaTL02_News
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = ValeriaHahn
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFValeriaHahn
#. Face = Friendly
#. SoundFileID = 00855B51
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. EDID: [01031424]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000D6C"
msgid "Glad we've got Chan and his guards around."
msgstr "챈과 그의 경비대원들이 있어서 다행이야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_ValeriaTL02_News
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = ValeriaHahn
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFValeriaHahn
#. Face = Friendly
#. SoundFileID = 00853E24
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. EDID: [01031424]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000D6D"
msgid "They said something about coming back real soon."
msgstr "곧 다시 오겠다는 식으로 말했어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_ValeriaTL02_News
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = ValeriaHahn
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFValeriaHahn
#. Face = Friendly
#. SoundFileID = 00A310EB
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. EDID: [01031424]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000D6E"
msgid "One ended up in the brig and the rest left in a huff."
msgstr "하나는 영창에 갔고 나머지는 씩씩거리며 떠났어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_ValeriaTL02_News
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = ValeriaHahn
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFValeriaHahn
#. Face = Friendly
#. SoundFileID = 006F3AFC
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Heard any interesting news lately?
#. EDID: [01031424]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000D6F"
msgid "We had a dust-up with some Spacers who got out of hand."
msgstr "통제 불능이 된 스페이서 몇 명과 한바탕 소동이 있었어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_ValeriaTL02_News
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = ValeriaHahn
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFValeriaHahn
#. Face = Friendly
#. SoundFileID = 004FAE61
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. EDID: [01031427]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000D70"
msgid "If you're looking to do some business, you should check with him."
msgstr "거래할 생각이라면 그에게 확인해 보는 게 좋아."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_ValeriaTL02_News
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = ValeriaHahn
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFValeriaHahn
#. Face = Friendly
#. SoundFileID = 00A0B20E
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. EDID: [01031427]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000D71"
msgid "My guess is those items aren't exactly legal, if you know what I mean."
msgstr "내 짐작엔 그 물건들이 딱히 합법적인 건 아닌 것 같아. 무슨 말인지 알지?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_ValeriaTL02_News
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = ValeriaHahn
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFValeriaHahn
#. Face = Friendly
#. SoundFileID = 0071752D
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. EDID: [01031427]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000D72"
msgid "Word is, Killian's looking to acquire some items of particular value."
msgstr "소문으로는 킬리언이 특별히 가치 있는 물건들을 구하려고 한대."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_ValeriaTL02_News
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = ValeriaHahn
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFValeriaHahn
#. Face = Friendly
#. SoundFileID = 00B944DB
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Heard any interesting news lately?
#. EDID: [01031427]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000D73"
msgid "I tend to keep my nose out of other peoples' business, but I did hear something."
msgstr "난 남의 일에는 참견하지 않는 편이지만, 들은 게 있긴 해."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_ValeriaTL02_News
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = ValeriaHahn
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFValeriaHahn
#. Face = Friendly
#. SoundFileID = 0092214D
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. EDID: [01031425]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000D74"
msgid "Give her some leeway, is all I'm saying. "
msgstr "그녀에게 조금 여유를 줘. 내 말은 그게 전부야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_ValeriaTL02_News
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = ValeriaHahn
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFValeriaHahn
#. Face = Friendly
#. SoundFileID = 00B502A9
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. EDID: [01031425]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000D75"
msgid "There was some chem use and it took a toll."
msgstr "약물 사용이 좀 있었고, 그게 대가를 치르게 했어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_ValeriaTL02_News
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = ValeriaHahn
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFValeriaHahn
#. Face = Friendly
#. SoundFileID = 0063A6D0
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. EDID: [01031425]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000D76"
msgid "Darcy's a good person, but she had a troubled youth. "
msgstr "다아시는 좋은 사람이지만, 젊을 때 힘든 시기를 보냈어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_ValeriaTL02_News
