#. ScriptNotes = / to ValeriaHahn
#. DialogueAfter = ValeriaHahn: Not exactly news, but I'll give you a heads-up anyway.
#. EDID: [01031411]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000D78"
msgid "Heard any interesting news lately?"
msgstr "최근에 흥미로운 소식 들은 거 있어?"

#. List: 2
