#. EDID: [0103142A]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000D7A"
msgid "Let's see what you've got."
msgstr "뭘 가지고 있는지 보자."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_DarcyGreet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = DarcyWeber
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFDarcyWeber
#. Face = Nervous
#. SoundFileID = 00E24084
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. EDID: [01031419]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000D7B"
msgid "So, how can I help you?"
msgstr "그래서, 내게 볼일이 있나?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_DarcyGreet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = DarcyWeber
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFDarcyWeber
#. Face = Nervous
#. SoundFileID = 008B219C
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = DarcyWeber: People do a lot of crazy things. That doesn't make them safe.|I should know, I grew up on Neon and fell in with a gang.|Safety was not foremost on anyone's mind.
#. EDID: [01031419]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000D7C"
msgid "In any case, you made the perilous journey to our little speck of light in the abyss. "
msgstr "어쨌든, 이 심연 같은 우주에서 고작 빛나는 점을 따라 용케 위험한 고비를 넘기면서 여기까지 왔네. "

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_DarcyGreet
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = DarcyWeber
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00FC3B5E
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = DarcyWeber: The ship that just docked, that was you, right?|You must be relieved to have made it here safe and sound.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Yeah, I get that a lot.
#. EDID: [0103140D]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000D7D"
msgid "You seem nervous. Is everything okay?"
msgstr "긴장한 것 같은데? 괜찮아?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_DarcyGreet
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = DarcyWeber
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00C58C72
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = DarcyWeber: The ship that just docked, that was you, right?|You must be relieved to have made it here safe and sound.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Well maybe you just haven't stopped to consider the hazards of space.
#. EDID: [01031431]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000D7E"
msgid "Space travel has risks, but it's nothing I can't handle."
msgstr "우주 여행에 위험이 따르긴 하지만, 감당 못 할 수준은 아니야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_DarcyTL03Leaving
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = DarcyWeber
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFDarcyWeber
#. Face = Nervous
#. SoundFileID = 007B7C29
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. EDID: [01031441]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000D7F"
msgid "That way, I'll never have to look up at the night sky and be reminded of the terrors of space."
msgstr "그러면 더 이상 밤하늘을 올려다볼 필요도, 우주의 그 끔찍한 공포를 다시 떠올릴 일도 없겠지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_DarcyTL03Leaving
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = DarcyWeber
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFDarcyWeber
#. Face = Nervous
#. SoundFileID = 006096CB
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. EDID: [01031441]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000D80"
msgid "Hopefully I can find a settlement on a planet where it's always day time."
msgstr "언제나 낮인 그런 행성의 정착지를 찾을 수 있다면 참 좋을 텐데."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_DarcyTL03Leaving
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = DarcyWeber
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFDarcyWeber
#. Face = Afraid
#. SoundFileID = 007E5875
#. ScriptNotes = Emphasis on NOT / Afraid / to Player Default
#. EDID: [01031441]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000D81"
msgid "I do not want to be conscious for any space travel, no way."
msgstr "우주 여행 중엔 깨어 있고 싶지 않아. 절대로."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_DarcyTL03Leaving
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = DarcyWeber
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFDarcyWeber
#. Face = Nervous
#. SoundFileID = 00BDC804
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. EDID: [01031441]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000D82"
msgid "Of course, I'll probably have to take something to knock myself out."
msgstr "물론 수면제라도 먹고 정신줄 놓은 채로 가야 하겠지만 말이야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_DarcyTL03Leaving
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = DarcyWeber
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFDarcyWeber
#. Face = Nervous
#. SoundFileID = 0085D1AC
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Do you ever think about leaving? Maybe starting over somewhere not in space?
#. EDID: [01031441]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000D83"
msgid "Oh, sure! Once I've saved up enough money, I'm going to book passage on a ship."
msgstr "아, 물론이지! 충분히 돈을 모으면 우주선 탑승권을 살 거야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_KillianTL01Vend
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = KillianBrice
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMKillianBrice
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00F32097
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I'd like to see your inventory.
#. EDID: [010316FD]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000D84"
msgid "Very well."
msgstr "좋아."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_CuttyTL01Vend
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Cutty
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMCutty
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00AF4EE7
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I'd like to see your selection of medical supplies.
#. EDID: SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_CuttySharedInfo02
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000D85"
msgid "Here. Make it quick."
msgstr "여기. 빨리 해."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_KillianTL02Job
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = KillianBrice
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMKillianBrice
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00AE3379
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = How much do you trust Saint?
#. DialogueAfter = KillianBrice: Good thing he was there for you.
#. EDID: [01031FD0]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000D86"
msgid "I trust that if I keep up my end of the bargain, he'll keep up his."
msgstr "내가 거래에서 맡은 대로 하면, 리시도 자기 맡은 대로 해줄 거라 믿어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_KillianTL02Job
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = KillianBrice
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMKillianBrice
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 005C3EAD
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = How much do you trust Saint?
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: How much do you trust Saint?
#. EDID: [01031FD0]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000D87"
msgid "Ours is a business relationship."
msgstr "사업 관계지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_KillianTL02Job
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMKillianBrice
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMKillianBrice
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 002D0D0D
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Good thing he was there for you.
#. DialogueAfter = companion: Wait a minute. Aren't you the guy behind that big Vanguard embezzling scandal?
#. EDID: [01031FD4]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000D88"
msgid "I was grateful for the extended hand of friendship."
msgstr "친절하게 도와줘서 고마웠지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_KillianTL02Job
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMKillianBrice
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMKillianBrice
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00B36235
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Good thing he was there for you.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Good thing he was there for you.
#. EDID: [01031FD4]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000D89"
msgid "Nobody else was. "
msgstr "그 때는 아무도 도와주지 않았거든. "

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_MaddieTL04_Quest
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = MaddieWing
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFMaddieWing
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00167740
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Sorry, but no. I'm not a pirate.
#. EDID: [0103716F]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000D8A"
msgid "If you change your mind, you know where I'll be."
msgstr "마음이 바뀌면, 날 찾으러 어디로 와야 하는지 알지?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_MaddieTL04_Quest
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = MaddieWing
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFMaddieWing
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00B5F5D2
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
