#. DialogueBefore = Cutty: I appreciate that.
#. EDID: [0106611B]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000DB5"
msgid "Now please hurry. My son's life is in your hands."
msgstr "이제 제발 서둘러 줘. 내 아들의 목숨이 네 손에 달렸어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_CuttyTL04Clean
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = CuttyClean
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMCutty
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0001F6D6
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = A shave and new clothes can't change who you really are.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: A shave and new clothes can't change who you really are.
#. DialogueAfter = CuttyClean: I don't know what the future holds. I can only take things one day at a time, and try to be a better man.
#. EDID: [0106BBAD]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000DB6"
msgid "You're right, of course, but maybe they can be the first small steps down a long road."
msgstr "물론 네 말이 맞아. 하지만 긴 여정의 첫 작은 발걸음이 될 수도 있겠지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_CuttyTL04Clean
