#. ScriptNotes = Halting, a little awkward / to CuttyClean
#. DialogueAfter = CuttyClean: Reasonably so, yes.
#. EDID: [0106BB91]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000DB8"
msgid "So, uh... how have you been otherwise? Does this place keep you busy?"
msgstr "그래, 어... 그 밖에는 어떻게 지냈어? 이곳 일이 널 바쁘게 해?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_IntroSceneAlternate
