#. DialogueAfter = ChanHuang: To attack a Spacer stronghold head-on? No way I'd give that order.
#. EDID: [0106C447]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000DB9"
msgid "Why not send one of your people?"
msgstr "왜 경비대원 중 한 명을 보내지 않는 건가요?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_IntroSceneAlternate
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
