#. DialogueBefore = ChanHuang: We should evacuate. The Spacers could already be on their way.
#. EDID: [0106C447]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000DBA"
msgid "And give up Anchorpoint? Hell no!"
msgstr "그리고 앵커포인트를 포기하라고요? 절대 안 됩니다!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMCutty
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMCutty
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00D67FAC
#. ScriptNotes = A doctor offering medical supplies to the player
#. EDID: [01053DE1]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000DBB"
msgid "Got a few things here."
msgstr "여기 몇 가지 있어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMCutty
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMCutty
#. Face = Irritated
#. SoundFileID = 00523807
#. ScriptNotes = Gruff / Irritated
#. EDID: [01053DE6]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000DBC"
msgid "That's all. Now get out of here."
msgstr "그게 다야. 이제 여기서 나가."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMCutty
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMCutty
#. Face = Irritated
#. SoundFileID = 0093760A
#. ScriptNotes = Gruff, a doctor telling a patient they don't have enough money. / Irritated
#. EDID: [01053DF6]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000DBD"
msgid "You haven't got the money. Stop wasting my time."
msgstr "돈이 없잖아. 내 시간 낭비하지 마."

#. List: 2
