#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00055C0A
#. EDID: [01031F0C]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000DBE"
msgid "Later."
msgstr "나중에."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_MiscDialogue
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMCaspianRoberson
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMCaspianRoberson
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0024A049
#. EDID: [01031ADD]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000DBF"
msgid "See ya."
msgstr "잘 가."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_MiscDialogue
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCFGenericFemale
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFGenericFemale04
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00811FD8
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral
#. EDID: [01052F7C]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000DC0"
msgid "I get that military service isn't for everybody. But it's right for me."
msgstr "군 복무가 모두에게 맞진 않는다는 건 알아요. 하지만 저한텐 맞아요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_MiscDialogue
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCFGenericFemale
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFGenericFemale04
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00A12337
#. ScriptNotes = Serious
#. EDID: [01052F7B]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000DC1"
msgid "I'm going to enlist in the Vanguard. I don't care what that old codger thinks, it's important."
msgstr "전 뱅가드에 입대할 거예요. 고집불통 영감이 뭐라고 생각하든 상관없어요. 이건 중요한 일이니까요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_MiscDialogue
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCFGraceKim
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFGraceKim
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00CDDDC6
#. EDID: [010647B5]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000DC2"
msgid "Well, the work goes on."
msgstr "뭐, 하던 일이나 계속해야죠."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_MiscDialogue
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCFGraceKim
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFGraceKim
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00753EF9
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral
#. EDID: SFFL_MS01_QuestSharedInfo05
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000DC3"
msgid "One less patient to worry about at least."
msgstr "최소한 신경 써야 할 환자가 한 명은 줄었네요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_MiscDialogue
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCFZenaHield
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFZenaHield
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00209590
#. ScriptNotes = Serious
#. EDID: [01030706]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000DC4"
msgid "There's a lot of work still to do, but I can't ignore the emotional toll this had on the group. People need a break."
msgstr "아직 해야 할 일이 많지만, 이 일이 사람들에게 준 감정적 부담을 무시할 수는 없어. 다들 휴식이 필요해."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_MiscDialogue
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCFSashaAtwell
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFSashaAtwell
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0026830A
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral
#. EDID: [01031697]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000DC5"
msgid "I guess it's business as usual then."
msgstr "결국 늘 하던 대로 흘러가죠."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_MiscDialogue
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMHalCaruso
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMHalCaruso
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00C5C66A
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral
#. EDID: [01043B16]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000DC6"
msgid "I will honor the choice of the group and do my best to keep this outpost alive."
msgstr "나는 이 집단의 선택을 존중하고, 이 전초기지를 살리기 위해 최선을 다하겠다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_MiscDialogue
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMHalCaruso
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMHalCaruso
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00650A67
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral
#. EDID: [01043B7C]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000DC7"
msgid "This may be poetic justice, to be left here with nothing, just as they were."
msgstr "이건 인과응보일지도 모르지. 그들이 그랬던 것처럼 아무것도 없이 이곳에 남겨지는 거니까."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_MiscDialogue
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCFZenaHield
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFZenaHield
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00AB9557
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral
#. EDID: [010316A3]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000DC8"
msgid "Losing Hal is a big loss. I'm not sure about our future here."
msgstr "할을 잃은 건 큰 손실이야. 이곳의 미래가 어떨지 모르겠어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_MiscDialogue
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMCaspianRoberson
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMCaspianRoberson
#. Face = Irritated
#. SoundFileID = 005FEA9B
#. ScriptNotes = Irritated
#. EDID: [010647BB]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000DC9"
msgid "If this outpost fails, we'll all know why."
msgstr "이 전초기지가 실패하면, 우린 모두 그 이유를 알게 되겠지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_MiscDialogue
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMBernhardKleiber
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMBernhardKleiber
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00195F7A
#. ScriptNotes = Player killed Caruso and told Bernhard, post-quest hello / Neutral
#. EDID: [01052E9C]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000DCA"
msgid "He's dead. Finally dead..."
msgstr "그가 죽었어. 드디어 죽었어..."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_MiscDialogue
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMBernhardKleiber
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMBernhardKleiber
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 005FBCC2
#. ScriptNotes = Serious
#. EDID: [010647B9]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000DCB"
msgid "It's been a while since I've worked at an outpost, but I feel confident I can be of use."
msgstr "전초기지에서 일한 지는 좀 됐지만, 도움이 될 자신은 있어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_MiscDialogue
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMCaspianRoberson
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMCaspianRoberson
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00F1AFD8
#. ScriptNotes = Serious
#. EDID: [010647B8]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000DCC"
msgid "The future of New Babylon is looking bright."
msgstr "뉴바빌론의 미래가 밝아 보이는군."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_MiscDialogue
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMBernhardKleiber
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMBernhardKleiber
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 002B978B
#. ScriptNotes = Serious
#. EDID: [0103CFC9]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000DCD"
msgid "The people here voted wisely. I hope the execution is long and painful."
msgstr "여기 사람들은 현명하게 투표했어. 처형이 길고 고통스럽길 바란다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMBernhardKleiber
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMBernhardKleiber
#. Face = VeryAngry
#. SoundFileID = 0098D86D
#. ScriptNotes = VeryAngry
#. EDID: [010313B5]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000DCE"
msgid "A vote, bah! Anything other than execution is a waste of time."
msgstr "투표라니, 흥! 처형이 아닌 건 전부 시간 낭비야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMCaspianRoberson
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMCaspianRoberson
#. Face = Angry
#. SoundFileID = 001FDB11
#. ScriptNotes = He plans on voting twice / Angry
#. EDID: [01043AFC]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000DCF"
msgid "This is stupid! Hal is innocent! And I'm gonna make sure he's free."
msgstr "이건 말도 안 돼! 할은 결백해! 그리고 내가 반드시 그를 풀려나게 할 거야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCFSunniKim
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFSunniKim
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0049214E
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral
#. EDID: [010313B1]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000DD0"
msgid "I'd love to see a hanging."
msgstr "교수형을 한번 보고 싶군."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCFGraceKim
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFGraceKim
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00384D3E
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral
#. EDID: [010313AF]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000DD1"
msgid "I did not have this on my bingo card, I'll tell you that much."
msgstr "이런 일이 생길 줄은 전혀 예상 못 했어. 그건 확실히 말할 수 있어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMHalCaruso
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMHalCaruso
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00AD7548
#. EDID: [01031116]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000DD2"
msgid "Lead the way. "
msgstr "앞장서."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_b1200_Sunni_TL03
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0042A803
#. DialogueAfter = SunniKim: Sit around and complain, dork.
#. EDID: [01030766]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000DD3"
msgid "What will you do if I don't fix the robot?"
msgstr "내가 로봇을 고치지 않으면 어떻게 할 거야?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_x1CarusoDiesArc_160_CarusoDead_Zena01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Zena
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFZenaHield
#. Face = Angry
#. SoundFileID = 0090637E
#. ScriptNotes = Player has decided to attack outpost. / Angry / to Player Default
#. Prompt = [Attack] I'm done talking. You're all dead.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: [Attack] I'm done talking. You're all dead.
#. DialogueAfter = Caspian: The hell it doesn't!
#. EDID: [010215E3]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000DD4"
msgid "No..."
msgstr "안 돼..."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2410_Sasha_Greet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Sasha
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFSashaAtwell
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 007F5DB5
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Sunni wants to get kicked out.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Sunni wants to get kicked out.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: She's trying to sell it on the black market.
#. EDID: [01023CBF]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000DD5"
msgid "Well, it's true she's a round peg trying to fit in a square hole. And by round, I mean a cactus."
msgstr "뭐, 써니는 네모난 구멍에 안 들어가는 둥근 말뚝 같은 애긴 하죠. 게다가 성격도 둥글기는커녕 가시 돋친 선인장 같습니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_200_CarusoTL02
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Caruso
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMHalCaruso
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00FC3AEE
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: How do I help with restoring the place of worship?
#. DialogueAfter = Caruso: The community center is a perfect place for sermons and prayer.
#. EDID: [0103071C]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000DD6"
msgid "I have a plan, but let's handle the matter of the robot first."
msgstr "계획은 있지만, 먼저 로봇 문제부터 처리하자."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_e2909_CaspianTalkHimDown
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Caspian
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMCaspianRoberson
#. Face = Sad
#. SoundFileID = 00D080C1
#. ScriptNotes = Successful speech challenge, Caspian will not kill Bernhard but is still emotional about it / Sad
#. DialogueBefore = Caspian: Nah, he killed Hal. He dies, right here.
#. DialogueAfter = Caspian: How is any of this okay?
#. EDID: [010316BD]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000DD7"
msgid "He killed Hal! You understand? He fucking killed him! "
msgstr "그가 할을 죽였어! 알아들어? 그 망할 놈이 할을 죽였다고!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_e2910_ZenaVoteTallyTIE
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Zena
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0093214E
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Zena: Citizens, if all the votes are in, I'll cast my vote and we'll begin the tally. &&& ... &&& Zena: Now, to count the votes. &&& Zena: It seems we have a tie. We've decided that in this event, the visitor, as a neutral party, will break the tie. &&& Zena: The floor is yours. What say you?
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Fine. If you won't break this impasse, I will.
#. EDID: [0103E32A]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000DD8"
msgid "I'm not comfortable making this decision. You make it."
msgstr "이 결정을 내리는 건 마음이 불편해. 네가 해."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_e2910_ZenaVoteTallyTIE
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Zena
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00A33460
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Zena: Citizens, if all the votes are in, I'll cast my vote and we'll begin the tally. &&& ... &&& Zena: Now, to count the votes. &&& Zena: It seems we have a tie. We've decided that in this event, the visitor, as a neutral party, will break the tie. &&& Zena: The floor is yours. What say you?
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Very well.
#. EDID: [0103E326]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000DD9"
msgid "Exonerate."
msgstr "무죄 방면."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_e2910_ZenaVoteTallyTIE
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Zena
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFZenaHield
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0084F228
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Zena: It seems we have a tie. We've decided that in this event, the visitor, as a neutral party, will break the tie.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Execution.
#. EDID: [0103E32D]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000DDA"
msgid "The floor is yours. What say you?"
msgstr "발언권은 네게 있어. 어떻게 생각하지?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c3100_Bernhard_Greet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMBernhardKleiber
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMBernhardKleiber
#. Face = Confused
#. SoundFileID = 00FCEEF1
#. ScriptNotes = Confused / to Player Default
#. Prompt = If you go there, there's a chance you will die. I've seen it.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: If you go there, there's a chance you will die. I've seen it.
#. DialogueAfter = Bernhard: *Sigh*. You are not wrong.
#. EDID: [0103F3BB]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000DDB"
msgid "What? Are you saying Caruso will kill me? "
msgstr "뭐? 카루소가 날 죽일 거라는 말이야?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c3100_Bernhard_Greet
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00A308CE
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Here they are. I'll meet you there. &&& Bernhard: Wonderful. Together we will write his obituary.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: What? Are you saying Caruso will kill me?
#. EDID: [0103F3BA]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000DDC"
msgid "If you go there, there's a chance you will die. I've seen it."
msgstr "거기로 가면 죽을 가능성이 있어. 내가 봤어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_d3200_CarusoTL03
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 009253DD
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: We'll see how the vote goes down. &&& Caruso: Indeed. When we first met, you said my life was forfeit. Do you still think so?
#. DialogueAfter = Caruso: I see. Then let the verdict be fair and just.
#. EDID: [0103FAF1]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000DDD"
msgid "Yes. But I only have one vote. The others may feel differently."
msgstr "그래. 하지만 내겐 표가 하나뿐이야. 다른 사람들은 다르게 생각할 수도 있어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_d3200_CarusoTL03
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Caruso
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00BD2B80
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: We'll see how the vote goes down. &&& Caruso: Indeed. When we first met, you said my life was forfeit. Do you still think so?
#. DialogueAfter = Caruso: I see. Then let the verdict be fair and just.
#. EDID: [0103FAF3]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000DDE"
msgid "I do, and I've done my best to sway the others to vote the same. "
msgstr "그래, 그리고 다른 사람들도 같은 쪽에 투표하도록 최선을 다해 설득했어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_d3200_CarusoTL03
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Caruso
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00EFFF35
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: We'll see how the vote goes down. &&& Caruso: Indeed. When we first met, you said my life was forfeit. Do you still think so?
#. DialogueAfter = Caruso: I see. Then let the verdict be fair and just.
#. EDID: [0103FAF2]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000DDF"
msgid "No, I've changed my mind."
msgstr "아니, 마음이 바뀌었어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_d3200_CarusoTL03
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Caruso
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMHalCaruso
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 007317CC
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: We'll see how the vote goes down.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Yes. But I only have one vote. The others may feel differently.
#. EDID: [0103FAEF]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000DE0"
msgid "Indeed. When we first met, you said imprisonment or exile should be my punishment. Do you still feel that way?"
msgstr "그렇군. 우리가 처음 만났을 때, 너는 감금이나 추방이 내 처벌이어야 한다고 했어. 아직도 그렇게 생각하나?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_e2920_ZenaVoteCarusoShot
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Caspian
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMCaspianRoberson
#. Face = Angry
#. SoundFileID = 0000054C
#. ScriptNotes = Bubbling, seething rage. I hate announcing it in dialogue but we need to give the player a cue to stop it from happening. / Angry / to Bernhard
#. DialogueBefore = Caspian: He's dead. Hal's dead. &&& Sasha: What? Everyone stay here and watch the prisoner! I'm gonna check on Hal. &&& Sasha: Shit. Caspian is right. Hal's dead.
#. DialogueAfter = Zena: You better have a damn good explanation for why you shot this man.
#. EDID: [01045E53]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000DE1"
msgid "He was my mentor. My friend! You don't deserve to live."
msgstr "그는 내 스승이었어. 내 친구였다고! 넌 살아 있을 자격이 없어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_d3200_CarusoTL02
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = companion
#. VoiceType = NPCFAndreja
#. Face = Angry
#. SoundFileID = 003B7969
#. ScriptNotes = Caruso has abandoned House Va'ruun so Andreja is not taking kindly to him / Angry
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: What's that prayer from? &&& Caruso: Perhaps your companion would prefer to elaborate.
#. DialogueAfter = Caruso: Very well.
#. EDID: [0105136F]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000DE2"
msgid "No, I would rather you speak His scripture, provided you still remember, \"Promised.\""
msgstr "아니, 네가 아직 기억한다면 그분의 경전을 말해줬으면 한다, \"약속받은 자\"여."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_d3200_CarusoTL02
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Caruso
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMHalCaruso
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00E458B9
#. ScriptNotes = If Andreja is with the Player and known to be with Va'ruun. / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: What's that prayer from?
#. DialogueAfter = companion: No, I would rather you speak His scripture, provided you still remember, "Promised."
#. EDID: [01051368]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000DE3"
msgid "Perhaps your companion would prefer to elaborate."
msgstr "어쩌면 네 동료가 더 자세히 설명하고 싶어 할지도 모르지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_120_Caruso_Greet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = companion
#. VoiceType = NPCMSamCoe
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 00F4B47C
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: You're a known criminal. I'm guessing there's probably a bounty on your head too.
#. DialogueAfter = Caruso: Wait. Not here. Not in front of the boy.
#. EDID: [0105136C]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000DE4"
msgid "And while we're not looking to start anything, we will if we have to."
msgstr "그리고 우린 문제를 일으키려는 건 아니지만, 필요하다면 그렇게 할 거야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_120_Caruso_Greet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = companion
#. VoiceType = NPCMBarrett
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00DE6CF0
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: You're a known criminal. I'm guessing there's probably a bounty on your head too.
#. DialogueAfter = Caruso: Wait. Not here. Not in front of the boy.
#. EDID: [0105136B]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000DE5"
msgid "And this is what we call the \"find out\" stage of things."
msgstr "그리고 이게 바로 소위 \"대가를 치르는\" 단계지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_b1000_IvicaGreet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = companion
#. VoiceType = NPCFSarahMorgan
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00BD8CC7
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: It's temporary. We just need the robot to help out for a time. &&& Ivica: Sranje, temporary. &&& Ivica: Robots can't be trusted to do work that was meant to be done with human hands.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Human labor is superior. If anything, the robot should be scrapped.
#. EDID: [01052C8E]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000DE6"
msgid "I think absolutes are dangerous in a galaxy full of nuance, but I see your point."
msgstr "난 절대적인 말은 미묘함으로 가득한 은하에서 위험하다고 생각하지만, 네 요점은 알겠어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_b1000_IvicaGreet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = companion
#. VoiceType = NPCMBarrett
#. Face = Irritated
#. SoundFileID = 0039AD68
#. ScriptNotes = Irritated
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: It's temporary. We just need the robot to help out for a time. &&& Ivica: Sranje, temporary. &&& Ivica: Robots can't be trusted to do work that was meant to be done with human hands.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Human labor is superior. If anything, the robot should be scrapped.
#. EDID: [01052C8C]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000DE7"
msgid "Well, I know one robot who would take umbrage with that philosophy."
msgstr "글쎄, 그 철학에 이의를 제기할 로봇 하나는 알고 있어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c3100_Bernhard_Greet
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00E3AD99
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: You should know, I found and killed Caruso. &&& Bernhard: What? Really? Then he's finally dead? I... I don't know what to say. &&& Bernhard: It's strange. I've been waiting for so long to hear those words and yet...|I don't know how to feel about it.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: You're right. I just thought I'd feel better. But it's more complicated than that.
#. EDID: [01052E95]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000DE8"
msgid "It's okay. It's going to take time to process."
msgstr "괜찮아. 받아들이는 데 시간이 걸릴 거야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c3100_Bernhard_Greet
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Bernhard
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 005A47B0
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Based on what I saw, it would've been a fine outpost, had your luck been better. &&& Bernhard: Yes. The conditions were rough, but together we had tamed its hazards. It saddens me to think of all the knowledge we lost. &&& Bernhard: And to think, the one responsible for their deaths is still roaming free.
#. DialogueAfter = Bernhard: What? Really? Then he's finally dead? I... I don't know what to say.
#. EDID: [01052E93]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "000DE9"
msgid "If by \"roaming free,\" you mean roaming the bowels of hell, then yes."
msgstr "자유롭게 돌아다닌다는 게 지옥 밑바닥을 돌아다닌다는 뜻이라면, 그래."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00F03E2D
#. EDID: [01083C20]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0010C3"
msgid "Your face is weird."
msgstr "네 얼굴 이상해."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00568A27
#. EDID: [01083C1F]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0010C4"
msgid "Did you die? That's cool."
msgstr "너 죽었어? 멋지네."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00D72153
#. EDID: [01083BEB]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0010C5"
msgid "Figures. I really need to install a toll booth in front of me. At least then you'd have to pay to bother me."
msgstr "그럴 줄 알았어. 내 앞에 통행료 징수소를 설치해야겠다니까. 그러면 적어도 날 귀찮게 하려면 돈을 내야 할 테니까."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00448E85
#. EDID: [01083DA0]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0010C6"
msgid "Mm-hm."
msgstr "음흠."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00939C51
#. EDID: [01083D99]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0010C7"
msgid "Look at you, saving the day, doing stuff. Hooray."
msgstr "봐라, 세상을 구하고 뭔가 하고 있네. 만세."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 0062E44A
#. EDID: [01083D97]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0010C8"
msgid "I feel like you want me to say something. Joke's on you."
msgstr "네가 내가 뭔가 말하길 바라는 것 같네. 유감이네."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 0046772E
#. EDID: [01083D87]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0010C9"
msgid "Do you have any pets? Fungi can be a pet."
msgstr "애완동물 있어? 균류도 애완동물이 될 수 있어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00FF3460
#. EDID: [01083D85]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0010CA"
msgid "The thought of happy people keeps me up at night."
msgstr "행복한 사람들을 생각하면 밤에 잠이 안 와."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 009F648B
#. EDID: [01083D83]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0010CB"
msgid "You know how people get butterflies in their stomach? I have spiders."
msgstr "사람들이 배 속에 나비가 날아다니는 느낌이라고 하잖아? 난 거미가 있어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00FB9C93
#. EDID: [01083D82]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0010CC"
msgid "Some words are just fun to say. Like macabre."
msgstr "어떤 단어들은 말하는 재미가 있어. 마카브르 같은 거."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 0088346A
#. EDID: [01083D80]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0010CD"
msgid "I need more gloom in my life."
msgstr "내 삶에는 우울함이 더 필요해."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 009A97F4
#. EDID: [01083D7F]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0010CE"
msgid "I want to explore planets with gigantic fungi. That is all."
msgstr "거대한 균류가 있는 행성을 탐험하고 싶어. 그게 다야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00E356C1
#. EDID: [01083D79]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0010CF"
msgid "So when do things get weird. "
msgstr "그래서 언제쯤 이상해지는 거야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 0067A28F
#. EDID: [01083D77]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0010D0"
msgid "Where to, Captain."
msgstr "어디로 갈까, 선장."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 001F0B77
#. EDID: [01083D72]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0010D1"
msgid "Huh. Didn't think you were still around."
msgstr "허. 아직도 곁에 있을 줄은 몰랐네."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 004B24C0
#. EDID: [01083DB6]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0010D2"
msgid "After you."
msgstr "먼저 가."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 0072D691
#. EDID: [01083DB0]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0010D3"
msgid "Well, see you around."
msgstr "그럼, 또 보자."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 001DA38B
#. EDID: [01083E55]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0010D4"
msgid "Look at all the dead things. Very macabre."
msgstr "죽은 것들이 잔뜩 있네. 아주 마카브르해."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 000150A0
#. EDID: [01083E54]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0010D5"
msgid "Death makes me happy."
msgstr "죽음은 날 행복하게 해."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00D4D4C1
#. EDID: [01083C58]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0010D6"
msgid "That's a hit."
msgstr "명중이야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 008261E2
#. EDID: [01083C55]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0010D7"
msgid "You're dead. Lucky you."
msgstr "너 죽었네. 운 좋다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. SceneName = CREW_EliteCrew_Muria_TopLevel_Cult
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Amused
#. SoundFileID = 005C1535
#. ScriptNotes = Amused / to Player Default
#. Prompt = If they are believers, then they will find prosperity in the Shrouding as Promised.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: If they are believers, then they will find prosperity in the Shrouding as Promised.
#. DialogueAfter = Muria: But yeah, I didn't want to meet the Great Serpent, so I volunteered to pilot the ship.
#. EDID: [01083BBA]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0010D8"
msgid "Well, those sure are words."
msgstr "뭐, 말은 그럴듯하네요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. SceneName = CREW_EliteCrew_Muria_Recruit
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Defiant
#. SoundFileID = 00FB4BFB
#. ScriptNotes = Defiant / to Player Default
#. Prompt = I might have some outfits I can trade you.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I might have some outfits I can trade you.
#. DialogueAfter = Muria: But yeah, I think I'm gonna need creds, up front. And a skull. Preferably with the brains still in it.
#. EDID: [01083BA5]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0010D9"
msgid "I'm not wearing your clothes. It's weird. And not the good kind."
msgstr "당신 옷은 안 입을 거예요. 이상해요. 안 좋은 쪽으로요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. SceneName = CREW_EliteCrew_Muria_Recruit
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Muria
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00C3FA6A
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Yeah, if only. &&& Muria: If only. &&& Muria: Well, now I need find work somewhere else. My landlord keeps asking for this thing called "rent."|I told him I could pay him with a potion that would turn him into a newt, but he refused.|Don't know why, seems like it'd be an improvement. But what do I know. Certainly not enough to be a banker.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Wow, you pay less than even GalBank. I'm impressed. But it's still not enough to sway me.
#. EDID: [01083B60]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0010DA"
msgid "You can keep whatever clothes you find while we're adventuring."
msgstr "모험 중에 주운 옷은 맘대로 입어도 돼."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. SceneName = CREW_EliteCrew_Muria_TopLevel_Past
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Muria
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 002EAB62
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: It was definitely more mundane than that. &&& Muria: You have your headcanon, I have mine.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Mmm... hard to say. They did introduce me to fantasy books and video slates. I think those became my parents after that.
#. EDID: [01083C03]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0010DB"
msgid "What about your parents? What were they like?"
msgstr "너희 부모님은 어떠셨는데? 어떤 분들이었어?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. SceneName = CREW_EliteCrew_Muria_MasterTopLevel
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00C61740
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Do you mind if I ask you some personal questions?
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Earlier, you mentioned a ship full of dead cultists. What happened to them?
#. EDID: [01083C3F]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0010DC"
msgid "Seems inappropriate, but okay."
msgstr "부적절해 보이지만, 뭐 좋아."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. SceneName = CREW_EliteCrew_Muria_TopLevel_Past
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00680C34
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Mind telling me more about your past?
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: That's a beautiful sentiment.
#. EDID: [01083B61]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0010DD"
msgid "I guess. I'm an only child. I like to think I was part of group, and I murdered all the other children in the womb."
msgstr "뭐. 전 외동이니까요. 그냥 원래는 형제가 여럿 있었지만, 엄마 뱃속에서 다른 애들을 다 없애 버렸다고 생각할래요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. SceneName = CREW_EliteCrew_Muria_MasterTopLevel
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Muria
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0066E597
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Do you mind if I ask you some personal questions? &&& Muria:
#. EDID: [01083B6F]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0010DE"
msgid "Can you tell me about your life before we met?"
msgstr "우리가 만나기 전 네 삶에 대해 말해 줄 수 있어?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. SceneName = CREW_EliteCrew_Muria_TopLevel_Past
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00D9AFCE
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Did you have many friends as a child?
#. DialogueAfter = Muria: Let's go back to my other questions.
#. EDID: [01083B92]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0010DF"
msgid "Not often I have human ones like you. Let's call it a trial phase though. I'm still sorting out the side effects."
msgstr "당신 같은 인간 친구는 별로 없었어요. 일단은 시험 기간이라고 해두죠. 저도 부작용을 확인해야 하니까요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. SceneName = CREW_EliteCrew_Muria_TimeLocked
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 0032943B
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: I would love to see a ship full of creepy cultists.
#. EDID: [01083B57]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0010E0"
msgid "We can go visit them if you want. I have the coordinates, somewhere."
msgstr "가보고 싶으면 안내해 줄게요. 어딘가에 좌표를 적어뒀을 거예요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. SceneName = CREW_EliteCrew_Muria_TimeLocked
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0018F690
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Earlier, you mentioned a ship full of dead cultists. What happened to them?
#. EDID: [01083B57]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0010E1"
msgid "They're still in orbit. Going in circles, just like their logic."
msgstr "아직 궤도 위에 있어요. 빙빙 돌고 있겠죠. 걔네 사고방식처럼요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. SceneName = CREW_EliteCrew_Muria_MasterTopLevel
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00964E28
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = I don't have any more questions right now.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I don't have any more questions right now.
#. EDID: [01083C09]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0010E2"
msgid "Nice. Now I can go back to whatever I was doing before you interrupted me."
msgstr "좋네. 이제 네가 방해하기 전에 내가 하던 무언가로 돌아갈 수 있겠어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. SceneName = CREW_EliteCrew_Muria_MasterTopLevel
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00FF7AE1
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = I don't have any more questions right now.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I don't have any more questions right now.
#. EDID: [01083C07]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0010E3"
msgid "Cool."
msgstr "좋아."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. SceneName = CREW_EliteCrew_Muria_MasterTopLevel
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00D748E4
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = I don't have any more questions right now.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I don't have any more questions right now.
#. EDID: [01083C06]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0010E4"
msgid "Thank god."
msgstr "다행이네."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. SceneName = CREW_EliteCrew_Muria_TopLevel_FungiFacts
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 001BA168
#. DialogueAfter = Muria: Earlier, you mentioned a ship full of dead cultists. What happened to them?
#. EDID: [01083D56]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0010E5"
msgid "I bet it smells awful too, but I have no idea. I've only seen pictures."
msgstr "냄새도 지독할 것 같은데, 난 전혀 몰라. 사진으로만 봤거든."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. SceneName = CREW_EliteCrew_Muria_TopLevel_FungiFacts
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00F6FD48
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Do you have any fun facts about fungi?
#. EDID: [01083D56]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0010E6"
msgid "My favorite fungus is this Old Earth mushroom called a Bleeding Tooth. It's gross and looks like gingivitis."
msgstr "내가 가장 좋아하는 균류는 옛 지구 버섯인 블리딩 투스야. 징그럽고 치은염처럼 생겼어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. SceneName = CREW_EliteCrew_Muria_PersonalDetails
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00203CB0
#. EDID: [01083C34]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0010E7"
msgid "I'd like to know more about your life before we met. "
msgstr "나와 만나기 전에 어떻게 살았는지 좀 더 얘기해 줘. "

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. SceneName = CREW_EliteCrew_Muria_TopLevel_Jobs
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00816E5F
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: You must've had a place with a lot of sunlight. &&& Muria: You'd think. But I'm allergic to daylight. I use artificial grow lights. It makes me feel like I'm sticking it to the sun.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: You and me both.
#. EDID: [01083BFB]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0010E8"
msgid "I can relate. I die a little inside whenever we speak."
msgstr "이해가 가. 너랑 대화할 때마다 마음이 조금씩 죽는 느낌이거든."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. SceneName = CREW_EliteCrew_Muria_TopLevel_Finance
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 0074AE2C
#. ScriptNotes = Confident / to Player Default
#. Prompt = How is banking similar to demonic pacts?
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: How is banking similar to demonic pacts?
#. DialogueAfter = Muria: Not all loans need to be predatory. They provide a way for regular folks to purchase homes and start business.
#. EDID: [01083B97]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0010E9"
msgid "When you take out a loan, it's a lot like making a contract with a demon. Only as a banker, your contract is backed by GalBank's institutional guarantee."
msgstr ""
"대출을 받는 건, 악마와 계약을 맺는 것과 아주 비슷하잖아요. 다만 은행원과 계약할 때는, 갤뱅크의 기관 보증이 뒷받침된다는 게 다를 "
"뿐이죠."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. SceneName = CREW_EliteCrew_Muria_TopLevel_Finance
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Muria
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00B0C064
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Did you ever have any actual interest in the finance sector? &&& Muria: Yeah. To me, stuff like magic, science, it's all semantics. Fire is fire, energy is energy.|It's the same vibe with banking and the dark arts. Necromancy, demon pacts, predatory loans -- it's all po-tay-to, po-tah-to.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Lots of ways. When I give someone a high interest loan, it's like casting a drain spell that slowly sucks the life force out of a person.
#. EDID: [01083B80]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0010EA"
msgid "How is banking similar to practicing necromancy?"
msgstr "은행 업무와 강령술이 뭐가 비슷하단 거야?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. SceneName = CREW_EliteCrew_Muria_TopLevels_Travel
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00AA01D1
#. DialogueAfter = Muria: You mean besides the cold, endless void?
#. EDID: [01083C49]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0010EB"
msgid "Is there anywhere you want to visit?"
msgstr "가보고 싶은 곳이 있어?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. SceneName = CREW_EliteCrew_Muria_TopLevels_Travel
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00558D00
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = As long as it's a sacrifice to some bottomless pit god.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: As long as it's a sacrifice to some bottomless pit god.
#. DialogueAfter = Muria: Earlier, you mentioned a ship full of dead cultists. What happened to them?
#. EDID: [01083B8C]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0010EC"
msgid "That'd be awesome, but those don't exist either. Believe me, I've done the research."
msgstr "그러면 정말 멋지겠지만, 그런 존재도 없어요. 맞다니까요. 이미 다 조사해 봤으니까요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. SceneName = CREW_EliteCrew_Muria_Recruit
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Puzzled
#. SoundFileID = 00472A5C
#. ScriptNotes = Puzzled / to Player Default
#. Prompt = I've got a job on my crew if you want it.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I've got a job on my crew if you want it.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: I'm an alien. Our cults do things differently where I'm from.
#. EDID: [01083B76]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0010ED"
msgid "Yeah? Is this one of those cults I hear so much about? I hope you at least got cool robes."
msgstr "어라? 이거 말로만 듣던 사이비 교단 같은 건가요? 멋지게 로브라도 차려입는 곳이면 좋겠는데요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. SceneName = CREW_EliteCrew_Muria_Recruit
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 001955B2
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral / to Player Default
#. Prompt = [Pay <Global=Crew_RecruitCost_TextReplacementValue> Credits] That won't be a problem.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: [<Global=Crew_RecruitCost_TextReplacementValue> Credits] I'm sorry, I can't afford that right now.
#. DialogueAfter = Muria: That sounds dismal. I'm on my way.
#. EDID: [01083B9B]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0010EE"
msgid "Figures. I really need to install a toll booth in front of me. At least then you'd have to pay to bother me."
msgstr "그럴 줄 알았어요. 제 앞에 요금소라도 하나 설치해야겠네요. 그래야 절 귀찮게 할 때 돈이라도 받을 수 있겠죠."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. SceneName = CREW_EliteCrew_Muria_Recruit
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00E1D150
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral / to Player Default
#. Prompt = [Pay <Global=Crew_RecruitCost_TextReplacementValue> Credits] That won't be a problem.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: [Pay <Global=Crew_RecruitCost_TextReplacementValue> Credits] That won't be a problem.
#. DialogueAfter = Muria: That sounds dismal. I'm on my way.
#. EDID: [01083B9A]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0010EF"
msgid "All right. Guess I'll gather my potions and head to my post. You do have a post for me, right?"
msgstr "알았어요. 물약이나 챙겨서 제 자리로 가야겠네요. 저한테 줄 자리가 있긴 한 거죠?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. SceneName = CREW_EliteCrew_Muria_TopLevel_Cult
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00636237
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Are you saying you have ship full of corpses somewhere? That's... something.
#. EDID: [01083B77]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0010F0"
msgid "I never made the grav jump. I still have the corpses."
msgstr "중력 도약은 안 했어요. 시체도 아직 있고요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. SceneName = CREW_EliteCrew_Muria_TopLevel_Cult
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Thinking
#. SoundFileID = 00335FFA
#. ScriptNotes = Thinking / to Player Default
#. EDID: [01083B77]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0010F1"
msgid "And then it occurred to me -- if I was gonna be surrounded by a bunch of dead people, it'd be cool if I could raise them as my personal army."
msgstr "그때 생각했죠. 죽은 사람들에 둘러싸일 거면, 되살려서 내 군대로 만들면 멋지겠다고요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. SceneName = CREW_EliteCrew_Muria_TopLevel_Cult
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 000C5A94
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Muria: Well, those sure are words.
#. EDID: [01083B77]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0010F2"
msgid "But yeah, I didn't want to meet the Great Serpent, so I volunteered to pilot the ship."
msgstr "근데... 예, 저는 위대한 뱀을 영접하러 가고 싶지 않아서, 우주선 조종사로 자원했어요."

#. List: 2
#. EDID: [01083C3C]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0010F3"
msgid "Would you be interested in traveling together? You sound like a perfect fit for my crew."
msgstr "함께 여행하지 않을래? 승무원이 되어주면 정말 완벽할 거 같은데."

#. List: 2
#. EDID: [01083BB0]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0010F4"
msgid "Would you? I've never worked on a crew before, but the idea does appeal to me. The older I get, the lonelier the void seems. "
msgstr "정말요? 승무원으로 일해본 적은 없지만, 끌리긴 하네요. 나이가 들수록 저 우주의 공허가 더 외롭게 느껴지네요. "

#. List: 2
#. EDID: [01083B6D]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0010F5"
msgid "I appreciate the sentiment. Consider my interest piqued. I'd be happy to join you. I have a feeling this will be a fruitful partnership. "
msgstr "그렇게 말해줘서 고마워요. 흥미가 좀 생기는군요. 기꺼이 동행할게요. 우리 꽤 괜찮은 파트너가 될 것 같은 예감이 드네요. "

