#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. SceneName = CREW_EliteCrew_Muria_TopLevel_Cult
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Muria
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0021019A
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: If they are believers, then they will find prosperity in the Shrouding as Promised. &&& Muria: Well, those sure are words. &&& Muria: But yeah, I didn't want to meet the Great Serpent, so I volunteered to pilot the ship.|And then it occurred to me -- if I was gonna be surrounded by a bunch of dead people, it'd be cool if I could raise them as my personal army.|I never made the grav jump. I still have the corpses.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Eh, it didn't seem like we'd have much in common. Would've been pretty awkward.
#. EDID: [01083C32]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0010F9"
msgid "Why didn't you want to meet the Great Serpent?"
msgstr "왜 위대한 뱀을 영접하고 싶지 않았어?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. SceneName = CREW_EliteCrew_Muria_TopLevel_Cult
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
