#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00A3DDE4
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Why didn't you want to meet the Great Serpent?
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Why didn't you want to meet the Great Serpent?
#. DialogueAfter = Muria: Are you saying you have ship full of corpses somewhere? That's... something.
#. EDID: [01083C04]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0010FA"
msgid "Eh, it didn't seem like we'd have much in common. Would've been pretty awkward."
msgstr "어, 공통점이 별로 없을 것 같았거든요. 영접하면 꽤 어색했을 거예요."

#. List: 2
