#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Except banking isn't nearly as cool.
#. EDID: [01083B5A]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0010FF"
msgid "Maybe not. But we all have to make compromises to get us through the work week."
msgstr "그럴지도 모르겠네요. 하지만 우리 모두 한 주 동안 일하는 걸 버티려면 어느 정도 타협은 해야 하는 법이니까요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. SceneName = CREW_EliteCrew_Muria_TopLevel_Paint
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 0062DC9B
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: You mentioned painting before. What sort of things do you like to paint?
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: As one does.
#. EDID: [01083B5D]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001100"
msgid "Oh, the usual. Landscapes, mushrooms... the slow, inexorable march towards death. Stuff like that."
msgstr "아, 늘 그렇지. 풍경, 버섯... 죽음을 향한 느리고 피할 수 없는 행진. 그런 것들."

