#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00A4BC59
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Seems like I don't have a choice. I'll play. &&& HailingShip: Fantastic. Amazing! Let the games begin! &&& HailingShip: A classic one to start with. Perhaps you know it? Let's hope you do...|What has an eye but cannot see?
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Not bad, but don't get cocky! We still have two more to go.
#. EDID: [0106C755]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001124"
msgid "A needle."
msgstr "바늘이야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE03
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE03_100b_HailingAnswered
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = HailingShip
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMGenericMale02
#. Face = Spaceship / Smug
#. SoundFileID = 0074CA0A
#. ScriptNotes = Smug / to Player Default
#. Prompt = A thought.
#. DialogueAfter = HailingShip: Time to say bye-bye to this one.
#. EDID: [0106C7FA]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001125"
msgid "Some thoughts are fleeting, sure. But some, some you hold on to forever."
msgstr "어떤 생각은 금방 사라지기도 해. 하지만 어떤 생각은 평생 붙잡고 살게 되지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE03
