#. DialogueAfter = HailingShip: Hmm, you're not doing so great, buddy. Two riddles down, and two people dead. Get your head in the game!
#. EDID: [0106D257]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001127"
msgid "Get over here! It's the end of the line!"
msgstr "이리 와! 여기서 끝이다!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_ActionFigures_SarahMorgan
#. SceneName = SFFL_ActionFigures_SarahMorganScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = SarahMorgan
#. VoiceType = NPCFSarahMorgan
#. Face = Disgust
#. SoundFileID = 00234452
#. ScriptNotes = Disgust / to Player Default
#. Prompt = No, it's clearly your evil twin.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: No, it's clearly your evil twin.
#. DialogueAfter = SarahMorgan: I don't like to talk about my past. But suffice to say, my history as a soldier was not without trauma.
#. EDID: [01065C2C]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001128"
msgid "The only evil one is the creator of this... thing."
msgstr "진짜 악한 건 이... 물건을 만든 창조자뿐이야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_ActionFigures_SarahMorgan
#. SceneName = SFFL_ActionFigures_SarahMorganScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = SarahMorgan
#. VoiceType = NPCFSarahMorgan
#. Face = Irritated
#. SoundFileID = 00A23141
#. ScriptNotes = Irritated / to Player Default
#. Prompt = You should feel proud.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: You should feel proud.
#. DialogueAfter = SarahMorgan: Either way, as collectibles go, it's definitely a conversation piece, so feel free to hold on to it.
#. EDID: [01065C30]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001129"
msgid "I don't know if proud is the word I'd use. \"Exploited\" seems like a better fit."
msgstr "자랑스럽다는 말이 맞는지는 모르겠어. \"착취당했다\"가 더 어울리겠지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_EC02
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = SamCoe
#. VoiceType = NPCMSamCoe
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 000E4AA4
#. ScriptNotes = Companion commenting about the presence of Dax Shepard, likely a criminal, aboard the player's ship. / Serious
#. EDID: [0106C818]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00112A"
msgid "I don't trust that guy one bit. He's a snake that'll turn on in the blink of an eye."
msgstr "저놈은 조금도 못 믿겠어. 눈 깜짝할 사이에 등을 돌릴 독사 같은 놈이야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_EC02
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE_EC02_50_CompanionComment
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = ActiveCompanion
#. VoiceType = NPCFAndreja
#. Face = Question
#. SoundFileID = 005B065C
#. ScriptNotes = Aboard player's ship, companion commenting on a seeming abandoned derelict ship floating in space in front of them. / Question
#. EDID: [0106C80D]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00112B"
msgid "Do you want to go have a look inside?"
msgstr "안에 들어가서 한번 볼래?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_EC02
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE_EC02_50_CompanionComment
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = ActiveCompanion
#. VoiceType = NPCFAndreja
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 002A3EBA
#. ScriptNotes = Aboard player's ship, companion commenting on a seeming abandoned derelict ship floating in space in front of them. / Serious
#. EDID: [0106C80D]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00112C"
msgid "I do not think there is anyone aboard that ship. Anyone alive, that is."
msgstr "저 우주선에 누가 타고 있을 것 같진 않아. 살아 있는 사람은 말이지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_EC02
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE_EC02_860_SecondWarning
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = DaxBurroughs
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC02_Dax_Voice
#. Face = Angry
#. SoundFileID = 00316C02
#. ScriptNotes = Warning player not to follow him as he walks off into Neon, his destination. / Angry / to Player Default
#. DialogueAfter = DaxBurroughs: Nice knowing you, pal.
#. EDID: [0106D4E5]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00112D"
msgid "Do you have a death wish, or something? Walk away. Now."
msgstr "죽고 싶기라도 한 거야? 그냥 가. 당장."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC02
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Voice
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC02_Dax_Voice
#. Face = Dying
#. SoundFileID = 00B0705E
#. ScriptNotes = Dying
#. EDID: [0106AD4A]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00112E"
msgid "I just need... to rest for a while."
msgstr "그냥 좀... 쉬어야겠어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC02
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC02_Dax_SC_Easy03
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = DaxBurroughs
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC02_Dax_Voice
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 00D23E58
#. ScriptNotes = Dax is starting to consider that maybe he can negotiate with the player instead of threatening them with his gun. / Confident / to Player Default
#. EDID: [0106AC45]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00112F"
msgid "I'm sure we could, as long as it's fair."
msgstr "공평하기만 하다면 가능하겠지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC02
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC02_Dax_SC_Hard02
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = DaxBurroughs
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC02_Dax_Voice
#. Face = Amused
#. SoundFileID = 00B0478D
#. ScriptNotes = Trying to lighten the mood after the player tells them to put their gun down. / Amused / to Player Default
#. EDID: [0106AC4F]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001130"
msgid "Are you always this cranky?"
msgstr "넌 항상 그렇게 까칠해?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC02
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC02_Dax_SC_Med03
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 008E3EB6
#. EDID: [0106AC51]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001131"
msgid "You know I can't just give up my ship, right?"
msgstr "내 우주선을 그냥 넘겨줄 수는 없다는 거 알지?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC02
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC02_Dax_SC_Med03
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = DaxBurroughs
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC02_Dax_Voice
#. Face = Sarcastic
#. SoundFileID = 00F6572E
#. ScriptNotes = Dax felt it was worth trying intimidating the player out of his ship, but admitting it didn't work while being a bit less threatening. / Sarcastic / to Player Default
#. EDID: [0106AC5E]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001132"
msgid "You'd be surprised how often that works."
msgstr "그게 의외로 자주 먹힌다니까."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC02
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC02_Dax_SC_Easy04
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0092982A
#. EDID: [0106AC6D]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001133"
msgid "Just tell me where you need to go, and I'll take you."
msgstr "어디로 가야 하는지만 말해. 데려다줄게."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC02
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC02_200_DaxIntro
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = DaxBurroughs
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC02_Dax_Voice
#. Face = Defiant
#. SoundFileID = 00B0429C
#. ScriptNotes = Dax isn't interested in telling the player why they want their ship or where they want to go with it. / Defiant / to Player Default
#. Prompt = I can give you a ride if you need one.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I can give you a ride if you need one.
#. DialogueAfter = DaxBurroughs: Let's talk this through.
#. EDID: [0106AC3C]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001134"
msgid "What I need is your ship. So give it to me."
msgstr "내게 필요한 건 네 우주선이야. 그러니 내놔."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC02
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC02_200_DaxIntro
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00DD2D3E
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = DaxBurroughs: Move a muscle and I'll shoot. &&& DaxBurroughs: No one needs to get hurt. I just need your ship.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Not sure what there is to talk about here.
#. EDID: [0106AC42]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001135"
msgid "Let's talk this through."
msgstr "말로 풀어보자."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC02
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC02_200_DaxIntro
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = DaxBurroughs
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00B140D8
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = DaxBurroughs: Move a muscle and I'll shoot. &&& DaxBurroughs: No one needs to get hurt. I just need your ship.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Sorry, wrong answer.
#. EDID: [0106AC53]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001136"
msgid "Not gonna happen."
msgstr "그럴 일은 없어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC02
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC02_200_DaxIntro
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = DaxBurroughs
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC02_Dax_Voice
#. Face = Defiant
#. SoundFileID = 0083827F
#. ScriptNotes = Threatening at gunpoint after catching the player in an ambush. / Defiant / to Player Default
#. DialogueAfter = DaxBurroughs: No one needs to get hurt. I just need your ship.
#. EDID: [0106AC47]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001137"
msgid "Move a muscle and I'll shoot."
msgstr "꼼짝만 해도 쏜다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_EC07_MiscDialogue
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Voice
#. VoiceType = SFFL_SE_EC07_Ruby_Voice
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 009A37F5
#. ScriptNotes = Ruby meeting the player in the street. Not very sincere. / Confident
#. EDID: [0106480C]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001138"
msgid "Why hello there. I'm sorry, I don't have time right now, but do keep in touch!"
msgstr "어머, 안녕하세요. 미안하지만 지금은 시간이 없어요. 그래도 꼭 연락해요!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_EC07_MiscDialogue
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Voice
#. VoiceType = SFFL_SE_EC07_Ruby_Voice
#. Face = Friendly
#. SoundFileID = 0047B162
#. ScriptNotes = Ruby meeting the player in the street. Not very sincere. / Friendly
#. EDID: [01064806]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001139"
msgid "Gotta run. Let's catch up sometime."
msgstr "가봐야 해. 다음에 얘기하자."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_EC07_MiscDialogue
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Voice
#. VoiceType = SFFL_SE_EC07_Ruby_Voice
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 005F4862
#. ScriptNotes = Ruby meeting the player in the street. / Confident
#. EDID: [01064806]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00113A"
msgid "Oh hi! Good to see you again."
msgstr "오, 안녕! 다시 보니 반갑네."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC07
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Voice
#. VoiceType = SFFL_SE_EC07_Ruby_Voice
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 008E4E6E
#. ScriptNotes = Ruby is not happy that Hannah accepted to be rescued by the player as well. / Serious
#. EDID: [0106A4E9]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00113B"
msgid "I'm very disappointed in Hannah."
msgstr "해나에게 정말 실망했어요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC07
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Voice
#. VoiceType = SFFL_SE_EC07_Hannah_Voice
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00653F80
#. ScriptNotes = Empathetic towards her boss and protective of her, even though her boss treats her like dirt. / Serious
#. EDID: [0106A4DF]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00113C"
msgid "This is not the first time Miss Krause has been targeted by pirates."
msgstr "크라우스 양이 해적들에게 표적이 된 건 이번이 처음이 아닙니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC07
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC07_210_RubyOnly
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = RubyKrause
#. VoiceType = SFFL_SE_EC07_Ruby_Voice
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 0063D18E
#. ScriptNotes = Explaining matter-of-factly that she plans on leaving Hannah behind in the minefield. / Serious / to Player Default
#. Prompt = So where should I take you two?
#. DialogueAfter = HannahFrye: Wait, what?
#. EDID: [01065F9D]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00113D"
msgid "Hannah will remain on the ship to make sure no one thinks it's abandoned."
msgstr "해나는 아무도 이 우주선이 버려졌다고 생각하지 않도록 우주선에 남을 겁니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC07
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC07_210_RubyOnly
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = RubyKrause
#. VoiceType = SFFL_SE_EC07_Ruby_Voice
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 00308E9D
#. ScriptNotes = Explaining matter-of-factly. / Confident / to Player Default
#. Prompt = So where should I take you two?
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: So where should I take you two?
#. EDID: [01065F9D]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00113E"
msgid "You'll be taking me to New Atlantis, so I can report this attack to headquarters in person."
msgstr "당신은 저를 뉴아틀란티스로 데려가서, 제가 본부에 직접 이 공격을 보고할 수 있게 해주셔야 합니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC07
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC07_120_HannahDialogue
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = HannahFrye
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 001D75AE
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = HannahFrye: &&& HannahFrye: Thank you so much for coming to our rescue! &&& HannahFrye: Can you find a way to open the door?
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Uh, let me ask Miss Krause.
#. EDID: [01065F9E]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00113F"
msgid "What do I get for helping you?"
msgstr "당신을 도우면 난 뭘 얻지?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC07
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC07_120_HannahDialogue
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = HannahFrye
#. VoiceType = SFFL_SE_EC07_Hannah_Voice
#. Face = Sad
#. SoundFileID = 003A2F93
#. ScriptNotes = Hannah sadly retelling how they were boarded by a first pirate ship they encountered. / Sad / to Player Default
#. Prompt = What happened here?
#. DialogueAfter = HannahFrye: Don't worry, this shouldn't take long.
#. EDID: [01065FAA]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001140"
msgid "Crew members fought them off, but they were all killed."
msgstr "승무원들이 그들을 물리쳤지만, 모두 목숨을 잃었습니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC07
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC07_120_HannahDialogue
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = HannahFrye
