#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: What can I do for you?
#. EDID: [01064395]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00115A"
msgid "If you could take the VP of Acquisitions to a safe location that would be great!"
msgstr "인수 담당 부사장님을 안전한 장소로 데려가 주시면 정말 좋겠습니다!"

