msgid "That's a GalBank ship those pirates are after. If they make it through the mines, that is."
msgstr "해적들이 노리는 건 갤뱅크 우주선이야. 지뢰밭을 통과한다면 말이지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_EC07
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE_EC07_660_Ruby
