#. Face = Worried
#. SoundFileID = 00DE691C
#. ScriptNotes = Companion reactive after the ship hit a few space mines. / Worried
#. EDID: [0105C390]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001165"
msgid "I do not think I am ready to meet my maker yet. We should turn around."
msgstr "아직 창조주를 만날 준비는 안 된 것 같아. 돌아가자."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_EC08
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE_EC08_150_BoardingCompanionInterjection
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = ActiveCompanion
#. VoiceType = NPCFAndreja
#. Face = Somber
#. SoundFileID = 00FF0267
#. ScriptNotes = Somber / to BoardableDerelict_CockpitDoor
#. EDID: [01080470]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001166"
msgid "I hope this is worth the risk. All it takes is one stray mine..."
msgstr "이 위험을 감수할 만한 가치가 있으면 좋겠군. 빗나간 지뢰 하나면..."

#. List: 2
#. EDID: [01054A53]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001167"
msgid " The bulkhead behind me is going to blow, I just know it."
msgstr "내 뒤쪽 격벽이 곧 터질 거야. 분명해."

#. List: 2
#. EDID: [01054A53]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001168"
msgid "It's that creaking noise again."
msgstr "또 그 삐걱거리는 소리야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_Anchorpoint_RandConv05_MaddieRishi
#. SceneName = SFFL_Anchorpoint_RandConv05_MaddieRishiScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
