#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0025D5B6
#. ScriptNotes = / to Actor01
#. EDID: [01054A60]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001169"
msgid "Unless you want Valeria serving frozen drinks to a bunch of human popsicles, you're going to have to pony up."
msgstr "발레리아가 인간 아이스바들한테 냉동 음료를 대접하게 만들고 싶지 않으면, 돈을 좀 내셔야 할걸요."

