#. SoundFileID = 005F50D1
#. ScriptNotes = Still in shock, but quick to trust her sister. Remorseful that she didn't help Wren sooner. / Worried / to Wren
#. DialogueAfter = Wren: I just know you two are friends, and I didn't want to mess that up.
#. EDID: [0104E259]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0011B3"
msgid "What all has she said? You should have told me sooner."
msgstr "걔가 다 뭐라고 했는데? 더 일찍 말했어야지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0475_PARTY
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Sadie
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCSadieCarr
#. Face = Shocked
#. SoundFileID = 00F12A2C
#. ScriptNotes = Surprised about the truth. / Shocked / to Wren
#. DialogueBefore = Sadie: What do you mean? &&& Wren: I know I told you before everything was fine. But to be honest, it's true that Opal has been bullying me.
#. EDID: [0104E259]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0011B4"
msgid "What? But you said-..."
msgstr "뭐? 하지만 네가 말했잖-..."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0480_PARTY
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Opal
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCOpalWoods
#. Face = Worried
#. SoundFileID = 00FD75EB
#. ScriptNotes = Trying to act innocent and confused. / Worried / to Sadie
#. DialogueBefore = Sadie: Cooper, you're done with that two-faced snake! &&& Sadie: I know you're the one that's been tormenting my sister!
#. DialogueAfter = Sadie: You keep my sister's name out of your mouth! It doesn't matter who told me. You've been lying to me and been saying who knows what to Wren.
#. EDID: [0104E262]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0011B5"
msgid "We've talked about this. I didn't do anything. Why would I be mean to Wren?"
msgstr "이 얘긴 했잖아. 난 아무 짓도 안 했어. 내가 왜 렌에게 못되게 굴겠어?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0475_PARTY
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Sadie
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCSadieCarr
#. Face = Confused
#. SoundFileID = 008B901E
#. ScriptNotes = Confused. / Confused / to Wren
#. DialogueBefore = Sadie: Oh, Opal? You just missed her. &&& Wren: It's best she's not around.
#. DialogueAfter = Wren: I know I told you before everything was fine. But to be honest, it's true that Opal has been bullying me.
#. EDID: [0104E230]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0011B6"
msgid "What do you mean?"
msgstr "무슨 뜻이야?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0215_SAWYER
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00E41CB7
#. DialogueAfter = Sawyer: Hey, now, we still have loads of fun to have and everyone is having a great time! I'll take you back once the party's over, yea?
#. EDID: [0104E1FC]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0011B7"
msgid "Okay. I should really get back to Anchorpoint. "
msgstr "알았어. 난 정말 앵커포인트로 돌아가야겠어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0300B_Wren
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCWrenCarr
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCWrenCarr
#. Face = Depressed
#. SoundFileID = 0023104D
#. ScriptNotes = Shy and worried. / Depressed / to Player Default
#. Prompt = If you don't stand up for yourself, it won't end.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: If you don't stand up for yourself, it won't end.
#. DialogueAfter = Wren: You're right... I hate that you're right.
#. EDID: [0104E2A5]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0011B8"
msgid "But what am I meant to do? Opal and Sadie have been best friends for years. I can't destroy that."
msgstr "하지만 내가 뭘 해야 하는데? 오팔과 세이디는 몇 년째 절친이야. 내가 그걸 망칠 순 없어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0250_OpalGossip
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Opal
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCOpalWoods
#. Face = Angry
#. SoundFileID = 0093806C
#. ScriptNotes = Acting indifferent, but a hint of disdain in her tone. / Angry / to Player Default
#. EDID: [0104E21A]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0011B9"
msgid "She never talks to anyone and doesn't even do anything. I don't understand why she bothered coming today."
msgstr "걔는 아무한테도 말을 안 하고, 아무것도 하지도 않아. 오늘 왜 굳이 왔는지 모르겠어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0250_OpalGossip
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Opal
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCOpalWoods
#. Face = Irritated
#. SoundFileID = 00F268E2
#. ScriptNotes = Acting indifferent, but a hint of disdain in her tone. / Irritated / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: You wouldn't happen to know any juicy gossip, would you?
#. EDID: [0104E21A]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0011BA"
msgid "Gossip, huh? Well, don't tell Sadie or Cooper, but you're better off if you avoid Wren. She's that sad-looking girl in the corner. "
msgstr "소문이라고? 그래, 세이디나 쿠퍼에게는 말하지 마. 하지만 렌은 피하는 게 나을 거야. 구석에 있는 슬퍼 보이는 여자애야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0210C_SAW&OPAL
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Sawyer
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCSawyerBrooks
#. Face = Happy
#. SoundFileID = 006CA00A
#. ScriptNotes = (Player response: Sounds fun. I'm going to go enjoy myself.) Friendly. / Happy / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Sounds great. I'm going to go enjoy myself.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Sounds great. I'm going to go enjoy myself.
#. EDID: [0104E227]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0011BB"
msgid "Have fun."
msgstr "재밌게 놀아."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0210C_SAW&OPAL
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Sawyer
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00AD8C2C
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: If you two don't tell me where I am right now... &&& Sawyer: Hey, now! Calm down a moment. Relax. You're on my ship. Safe and sound. &&& Sawyer: And the party still isn't over. We invited more in on the fun. Go ahead, have a blast! Drink. Mingle! Who knows, by the time all this is over, you may meet your new best friend.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Have fun.
#. EDID: [0104E29B]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0011BC"
msgid "Sounds great. I'm going to go enjoy myself."
msgstr "좋네. 난 가서 즐길게."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0210B_OPAL
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Opal
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCOpalWoods
#. Face = Smug
#. SoundFileID = 000300D6
#. ScriptNotes = (Player Response: I feel great. Thanks for not leaving me passed out in a hallway.) Friendly. / Smug / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I feel great. Thanks for not leaving me passed out in a hallway.
#. DialogueAfter = Sawyer: And the party still isn't over. We invited more in on the fun. Go ahead, have a blast! Drink. Mingle! Who knows, by the time all this is over, you may meet your new best friend.
#. EDID: [0104E205]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0011BD"
msgid "Don't thank me. Sawyer was the one with the idea to bring you here. You're on his ship."
msgstr "나한테 고마워하지 마. 널 여기 데려오자고 한 건 소여였어. 여긴 걔 우주선이야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0150C_SAW&OPAL
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Opal
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCOpalWoods
#. Face = Smug
#. SoundFileID = 00270089
#. ScriptNotes = Casual and smug. / Smug / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Sure. I would love to join you. &&& Sawyer: Take a seat. &&& Sawyer: I finally got my new ship paid off. Even sounds wild to say.
#. DialogueAfter = Sawyer: Don't tell them, but I managed to get more money from them than was needed. Got the ship decked out too now!
#. EDID: [0104E270]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0011BE"
msgid "AKA, he got back into his parents' good graces and they paid it off for him."
msgstr "다시 말해, 부모님 눈에 다시 들었고 부모님이 그걸 대신 갚아준 거지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0150C_SAW&OPAL
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Sawyer
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCSawyerBrooks
#. Face = Friendly
#. SoundFileID = 00C37E7F
#. ScriptNotes = Casual and Friendly. (Player response: Sounds like you guys are missing a few. ) / Friendly / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Opal: Hm, what? Here to buy a lady a drink? Too bad. I already got a boyfriend. &&& Opal: Sounds like you're waiting on some friends.
#. DialogueAfter = Opal: Really, Sawyer? Them?
#. EDID: [0104E26F]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0011BF"
msgid "Ah, they'll be around later. But for now, we could always use another? It's no fun to celebrate if you can't bring others into it."
msgstr "아, 그들은 나중에 올 거야. 하지만 지금은 한 명 더 있어도 좋지 않겠어? 다른 사람들을 끌어들이지 못하면 축하하는 재미가 없잖아."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0975_COMPANION
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = companion
#. VoiceType = NPCMBarrett
#. Face = Smug
#. SoundFileID = 00465631
#. ScriptNotes = Happy to see the player back. / Smug
#. EDID: [0106B2B7]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0011C0"
msgid "Dusty, you're back! I thought you got swallowed by a quasar the way you blipped out with those partiers. You must've had a wild time. You can tell me all about it later."
msgstr ""
"두더지! 돌아왔구나! 그 파티꾼들과 갑자기 사라지는 걸 보고 퀘이사에 삼켜진 줄 알았어. 엄청난 시간을 보냈겠네. 나중에 전부 들려줘."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0975_COMPANION
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = companion
#. VoiceType = NPCFAndreja
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00528E87
#. ScriptNotes = Relieved to see the Player again after they disappeared to go to a party. / Neutral
#. EDID: [0106B2B6]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0011C1"
msgid "There you are. Last I saw you, you left with Sawyer and his friends. I wasn't sure when you'd return, but it's a relief that you're back now."
msgstr "거기 있었군요. 마지막으로 봤을 때 당신은 소여와 그 친구들과 함께 떠났어요. 언제 돌아올지 몰랐는데, 이제 돌아와서 안심이에요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0101_SAW&OPAL
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Opal
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCOpalWoods
#. Face = Friendly
#. SoundFileID = 00C331EF
#. ScriptNotes = Casual and friendly. / Friendly / to Sawyer
#. DialogueBefore = Sawyer: So, when do you think the others will get here?
#. DialogueAfter = Sawyer: Hear, hear!
#. EDID: [0104E200]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0011C2"
msgid "Should be any moment. But their loss. We get to start the party early."
msgstr "이제 곧 올 거야. 하지만 그쪽 손해지. 우린 파티를 일찍 시작하면 돼."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0300A_SADIE_TL
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 001FC49B
#. DialogueAfter = Sadie: A slate? Is this Opal's? Why do you have that? Let me see it.
#. EDID: [0106B2D5]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0011C3"
msgid "You should listen to this slate I found."
msgstr "내가 찾은 이 슬레이트를 들어봐야 해."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_TL_COOPER_03
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Cooper
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCCooperCarr
#. Face = Irritated
#. SoundFileID = 00B0D43E
#. ScriptNotes = Annoyed. / Irritated / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Do you know about Opal bullying your sister?
#. EDID: [0106B2C5]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0011C4"
msgid "You heard that rumor too? Trust me. I've talked with Wren and Opal, and neither say anything is going on. So, don't spread that around."
msgstr "너도 그 소문 들었어? 날 믿어. 렌과 오팔 둘 다하고 얘기해봤는데, 둘 다 아무 일도 없다고 했어. 그러니 그 얘기 퍼뜨리지 마."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_TL_Sadie_03
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Sadie
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCSadieCarr
#. Face = Irritated
#. SoundFileID = 0021A2F7
#. ScriptNotes = Annoyed. Not so much at the player, but more so about the rumor. / Irritated / to Player Default
#. EDID: [0106B2BC]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0011C5"
msgid "Wren and Opal have both told me nothing like that is going on. So, you can put that idea to rest."
msgstr "렌과 오팔 둘 다 내게 그런 일은 전혀 없다고 말했어. 그러니 그 생각은 접어도 돼."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_TL_Sadie_03
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Sadie
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCSadieCarr
#. Face = Irritated
#. SoundFileID = 009C49BB
#. ScriptNotes = Annoyed. Not so much at the player, but more so the rumor. / Irritated / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Do you know about Opal bullying your sister?
#. EDID: [0106B2BC]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0011C6"
msgid "Who told you that? I've been hearing it around, but trust me, none of it is true."
msgstr "누가 그런 말을 했어? 나도 여기저기서 듣긴 했지만, 믿어. 전부 사실이 아니야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_TL_SADIE_01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Sadie
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCSadieCarr
#. Face = Smirk
#. SoundFileID = 00501EA4
#. ScriptNotes = Casual. / Smirk / to Player Default
#. EDID: [0106B29E]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0011C7"
msgid "I just set up the security system. See the turrets around the ship? That's them. It was nothing special, but Sawyer did pay well."
msgstr "난 보안 시스템만 설치했어. 우주선 주변 포탑들 보이지? 그게 그거야. 별일은 아니었지만, 소여가 돈은 잘 줬지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_TL_SADIE_01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Sadie
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCSadieCarr
#. Face = Smirk
#. SoundFileID = 009D4FD0
#. ScriptNotes = Casual. A bit humored that there are rumors claiming she did more than what she really did. / Smirk / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: You set up Sawyer's ship?
#. EDID: [0106B29E]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0011C8"
msgid "Is that what you heard? It's not like I built this ship from the ground up, or decorated the place. All this is a bit too rich for me."
msgstr "그렇게 들었어? 내가 이 우주선을 처음부터 만든 것도 아니고, 꾸민 것도 아니야. 이 모든 건 나한텐 좀 과해."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_TL_SAWYER_02
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Sawyer
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCSawyerBrooks
#. Face = Friendly
#. SoundFileID = 00D40D28
#. ScriptNotes = Casual and friendly. / Friendly / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Are all your parties like this?
#. EDID: [0106B2D8]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0011C9"
msgid "In terms of fun? Yes. In terms of style? When I could afford it. But now, with my parent's credits flowing into my pockets, I plan to make every party better than the last."
msgstr "재미 면에서는? 맞아. 스타일 면에서는? 감당할 수 있을 때만. 하지만 이제 부모님 크레딧이 내 주머니로 흘러들어오니, 파티마다 전보다 더 멋지게 만들 생각이야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0300D_Wren_SLATE
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Wren
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCWrenCarr
#. Face = Concentrating
#. SoundFileID = 00744267
#. ScriptNotes = Slightly more determined now. She's tired of the bullying. / Concentrating / to Player Default
#. Prompt = You're not the problem. She is.
#. EDID: [0106B2C3]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0011CA"
msgid "Sadie needs to know the truth."
msgstr "세이디는 진실을 알아야 해."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0300D_Wren_SLATE
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Wren
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCWrenCarr
#. Face = Sad
#. SoundFileID = 005AC12B
#. ScriptNotes = Very upset and somber. / Sad / to Player Default
#. Prompt = You're not the problem. She is.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: You're not the problem. She is.
#. EDID: [0106B2C3]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0011CB"
msgid "I'm tired of acting like it's me. I've done nothing to her."
msgstr "내가 그런 것처럼 행동하는 것도 지쳤어. 난 걔한테 아무 짓도 안 했어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_TL_COOPER_02
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Cooper
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCCooperCarr
#. Face = Irritated
#. SoundFileID = 00E3A26A
#. ScriptNotes = Annoyed and distant. He rather not be talking. / Irritated / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: How are you liking the party?
#. EDID: [0106B291]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0011CC"
msgid "Not very much. I only came because of Sadie, Opal, and Wren. I can't stand Sawyer or his get-togethers all that much. They're too loud and obnoxious."
msgstr "별로 없어. 난 세이디, 오팔, 렌 때문에 왔을 뿐이야. 소여나 그 모임들은 별로 못 참겠어. 너무 시끄럽고 불쾌해."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0300_WREN_SC01
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00C12D2B
#. EDID: [0106B2C0]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0011CD"
msgid "The longer you keep quiet about this, the hard it will be talk about it in the future."
msgstr "이 일을 오래 숨길수록 나중에 말하기가 더 힘들어질 거야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0300_WREN_SC01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Wren
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCWrenCarr
#. Face = Irritated
#. SoundFileID = 005C7FDF
#. ScriptNotes = Speech Challenge failed. Wren is a little annoyed at the player for pushing. / Irritated / to Player Default
#. EDID: [0106B2F4]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0011CE"
msgid "Even if that's true, I don't know you. Why would I discuss this with you?"
msgstr "그게 사실이라 해도, 난 널 몰라. 왜 이 일을 너와 얘기해야 하지?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0300_WREN_SC01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Wren
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCWrenCarr
#. Face = Worried
#. SoundFileID = 00894FC1
#. ScriptNotes = Speech challenge success. Wren is nervous to talk about the bullying. / Worried / to Player Default
#. EDID: [0106B2F3]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0011CF"
msgid "I know that but... It's not something I can just talk about."
msgstr "그건 알지만... 그냥 말할 수 있는 일이 아니야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0300B_Wren
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Wren
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00EBDA14
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I've heard Opal has been causing you issues, is that true? &&& Wren: What? Why would you even ask that? Opal and Sadie are best friends. I'm Sadie's sister, why would Opal do anything to me?
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: What? Let me see that.
#. EDID: [0106B29D]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0011D0"
msgid "If she wasn't then she wouldn't have said what she said in this slate."
msgstr "그렇지 않았다면 이 슬레이트에서 그런 말을 하지 않았겠지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0300B_Wren
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Wren
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCWrenCarr
#. Face = Sad
#. SoundFileID = 008813D7
#. ScriptNotes = Really getting upset, and a little scared, that the Player won't leave her alone. / Sad / to Player Default
#. Prompt = I can't believe you're just going to let Opal get away with everything she's done to you.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I can't believe you're just going to let Opal get away with everything she's done to you.
#. EDID: [0106B287]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0011D1"
msgid "I thought I told you to leave me alone. Just go."
msgstr "나한테서 떨어지라고 했잖아. 그냥 가."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_TL_COOPER_01
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0068F20C
#. DialogueAfter = Cooper: Long. I'd say about three years and eight months? Yea. That sounds about right. Can't say I regret a day of it.
#. EDID: [0106B306]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0011D2"
msgid "How long have you and Opal been dating?"
msgstr "너와 오팔은 사귄 지 얼마나 됐어?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0300_WREN_SC05
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Wren
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCWrenCarr
#. Face = Irritated
#. SoundFileID = 00BF822C
#. ScriptNotes = Speech challenge failed. Annoyed, but turns sad at the end 'Everyone except me.' / Irritated / to Player Default
#. EDID: [0106B3BC]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0011D3"
msgid "No. She would never do that. Opal's been friends with everyone for years. Everyone except me."
msgstr "아니. 걔가 그럴 리 없어. 오팔은 몇 년째 모두와 친구였어. 나만 빼고."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0300_WREN_SC06
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Wren
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCWrenCarr
#. Face = Irritated
#. SoundFileID = 001C2056
#. ScriptNotes = Speech challenge success. Annoyed. / Irritated / to Player Default
#. EDID: [0106B2AF]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0011D4"
msgid "I'm not saying it's fine. It's just- You wouldn't get it."
msgstr "괜찮다는 말은 아니야. 그냥- 넌 이해 못 해."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0300_WREN_SCRepeat
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Wren
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCWrenCarr
#. Face = Irritated
#. SoundFileID = 00B1F4AF
#. ScriptNotes = Speech Challenge failed. Annoyed. / Irritated / to Player Default
#. EDID: [0106B302]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0011D5"
msgid "Stop talking like you know what's going on. You don't."
msgstr "뭘 아는 것처럼 말하지 마. 넌 몰라."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0300_WREN_SCRepeat
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Wren
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCWrenCarr
#. Face = Irritated
#. SoundFileID = 00A93A86
#. ScriptNotes = Speech Challenge failed. Annoyed. / Irritated / to Player Default
#. EDID: [0106B304]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0011D6"
msgid "You don't understand any of this."
msgstr "넌 이 일 아무것도 이해 못 해."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0300_WREN_SCRepeat
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Wren
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCWrenCarr
#. Face = Irritated
#. SoundFileID = 00AA9E57
#. ScriptNotes = Speech Challenge failed. Annoyed. / Irritated / to Player Default
#. EDID: [0106B303]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0011D7"
msgid "It's not that simple..."
msgstr "그렇게 간단하지 않아..."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0300_WREN_SCRepeat
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 005A3BF9
#. EDID: [0106B2D3]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0011D8"
msgid "If you don't tell anyone, Opal won't leave you alone."
msgstr "아무한테도 말하지 않으면 오팔은 널 가만두지 않을 거야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0195_SAW&OPAL
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Opal
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCOpalWoods
#. Face = Happy
#. SoundFileID = 00145592
#. ScriptNotes = Having fun, but then realizes the time. / Happy
#. DialogueBefore = Sawyer: Opal, get a load of our new friend!
#. DialogueAfter = Sawyer: Oh, right. Hey, friend, we- You good? Heh, maybe that was too many drinks?
#. EDID: [0104E23D]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0011D9"
msgid "Wait. What time is it? Hey, Sawyer, we got to go meet up with Sadie and the others soon. "
msgstr "잠깐. 지금 몇 시야? 이봐, 소여, 우리 곧 세이디랑 다른 애들을 만나러 가야 해."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0195_SAW&OPAL
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Sawyer
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCSawyerBrooks
#. Face = Happy
#. SoundFileID = 00129BBF
#. ScriptNotes = Having a great time drinking with his new friend. / Happy
#. DialogueAfter = Opal: Wait. What time is it? Hey, Sawyer, we got to go meet up with Sadie and the others soon.
#. EDID: [0104E247]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0011DA"
msgid "Opal, get a load of our new friend!"
msgstr "오팔, 우리 새 친구 좀 봐!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0252_SADIE_GREETING
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Sadie
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCSadieCarr
#. Face = Friendly
#. SoundFileID = 007443CC
#. ScriptNotes = Casual and a little friendly, but mostly chill. / Friendly / to Player Default
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Trust me, I don't even want to be here.
#. EDID: [0106D60D]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0011DB"
msgid "So you're the one Opal and Sawyer found? Hope you're planning on behaving yourself."
msgstr "네가 오팔과 소여가 찾았다는 사람이군? 얌전히 굴 생각이면 좋겠네."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0300D_SAWYER_FG
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Sawyer
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00DD5B98
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Take this slate. It will fill you in on everything. &&& Sawyer: A slate? You caused all this over a slate? Whatever. I'll take a listen later. For now, let's get you back to Anchorpoint.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Really? You've put Opal pretty on edge, okay? Whatever you want to do, just be quick about it.
#. EDID: [0106D68F]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0011DC"
msgid "Wait. I changed my mind. I don't want to leave yet."
msgstr "잠깐. 마음이 바뀌었어. 아직 떠나고 싶지 않아."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0300D_SAWYER_FG
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCSawyerBrooks
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCSawyerBrooks
#. Face = Concentrating
#. SoundFileID = 00548CB4
#. ScriptNotes = Determined to get the Player back. / Concentrating / to Player Default
#. Prompt = I'm ready. Take me back to Anchorpoint.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I'm ready. Take me back to Anchorpoint.
#. EDID: [0106D68A]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0011DD"
msgid "I'll start a course."
msgstr "항로를 잡을게."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0252_WREN_GREETING
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Wren
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00D538AD
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Wren: Hi there...|Sorry. I'm not too much of a talker, or that interesting. You'd be better off talking to my sister, Sadie.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: That doesn't bode well for either of us then.
#. EDID: [0106D680]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0011DE"
msgid "I don't talk much either. Mostly I listen."
msgstr "나도 말이 많진 않아. 대부분은 듣는 쪽이야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0252_SADIE_GREETING
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Sadie
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCSadieCarr
#. Face = Friendly
#. SoundFileID = 009EE28A
#. ScriptNotes = Casual and friendly. / Friendly / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Sadie: Sounds like the alcohol brought you then. Opal told me she met you at a bar.
#. EDID: [0106D690]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0011DF"
msgid "Anyway, the name's Sadie. If you ever need a moment of peace, feel free to come and talk. I don't care to get too drunk at these things."
msgstr "아무튼, 내 이름은 세이디야. 잠깐 조용히 쉬고 싶으면 언제든 와서 얘기해. 난 이런 자리에서 너무 취하는 건 별로라서."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0252_COOPER_GREETING
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00F6955A
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Cooper: You're Sawyer's new friend, right? Surprised you're not partying it up with him.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Right. I think Opal said you were new. Take it from me. Sawyer isn't all that.
#. EDID: [0106D6A0]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0011E0"
msgid "I wouldn't say I'm his friend. I hardly know the guy."
msgstr "그 사람 친구라고 하긴 어렵지. 거의 모르는 사람이야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0252_SADIE_GREETING
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Sadie
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0044B430
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Sadie: So you're the one Opal and Sawyer found? Hope you're planning on behaving yourself.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Damn right. Those two do love to cause all sorts of trouble. I don't know how I put up with them.
#. EDID: [0106D67C]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0011E1"
msgid "I'm more worried about Opal and Sawyer behaving themselves."
msgstr "난 오팔과 소여가 얌전히 굴지가 더 걱정이야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0252_WREN_GREETING
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCWrenCarr
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCWrenCarr
#. Face = Concerned
#. SoundFileID = 00567E3F
#. ScriptNotes = Still shy and nervous. But trying her best to make conversation. / Concerned / to Player Default
#. Prompt = That's okay. I'm not that interesting either.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: That's okay. I'm not that interesting either.
#. DialogueAfter = Wren: Sorry. My name is Wren. Cooper and Sadie brought me along.
#. EDID: [0106D68E]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0011E2"
msgid "I heard Opal and Sawyer found you. So I doubt that."
msgstr "오팔과 소여가 널 찾았다고 들었어. 그러니 그건 아닐 것 같은데."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0252_SADIE_GREETING
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Sadie
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0003B10E
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Sadie: So you're the one Opal and Sawyer found? Hope you're planning on behaving yourself.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Be careful, alright? Don't want to ruin the fun.
#. EDID: [0106D6A4]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0011E3"
msgid "I'm at a party. We'll see."
msgstr "난 파티에 왔어. 두고 보자고."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Voice
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Voice
#. Face = Angry
#. SoundFileID = 0072340D
#. ScriptNotes = Gloria being a depressed teen trying to cope with the bad situation she's in. / Angry
#. EDID: [010485FC]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0011ED"
msgid "Life sucks."
msgstr "사는 게 엿 같아."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC01
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_MiscWarning
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Speaker03
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Voice
#. Face = Spaceship / Nervous
#. SoundFileID = 00DA9374
#. ScriptNotes = Gloria talking to player over PA system, trying to get them to turn around and leave her ship. / Nervous
#. DialogueAfter = Speaker01: Turn around and go back to your ship.
#. EDID: SFFL_BE_EC01SharedInfo07
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0011EE"
msgid "Turn around and go back to your ship."
msgstr "돌아서 네 우주선으로 돌아가."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC01
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_MiscWarning
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Speaker03
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Voice
#. Face = Spaceship / Afraid
#. SoundFileID = 00716048
#. ScriptNotes = Gloria talking to player over PA system, trying to get them to turn around and leave her ship. / Afraid
#. DialogueAfter = Speaker01: Turn around and go back to your ship.
#. EDID: SFFL_BE_EC01SharedInfo11
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0011EF"
msgid "Whatever you do, do not come up to the bridge!"
msgstr "무슨 일이 있어도 함교에는 오지 마!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Voice
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Voice
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 00C47401
#. ScriptNotes = Eager to get on the player's ship and leave for New Atlantis, hopefully before her stepfather arrives. / Confident
#. EDID: [0104D02B]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0011F0"
msgid "I'm ready when you are."
msgstr "네가 준비되면 나도 준비됐어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC01
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Dialogue_570_Neutral
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Gloria
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Voice
#. Face = Worried
#. SoundFileID = 00125C21
#. ScriptNotes = She'd rather the player just leave her alone, doesn't want to tell the story of how she stole the spaceship from her abusive stepfather. / Worried
#. Prompt = I have a feeling you'd rather I not call the authorities. Am I right?
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I have a feeling you'd rather I not call the authorities. Am I right?
#. DialogueAfter = Gloria: Tell me how a teenager ended up alone on this ship.
#. EDID: [0104077A]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0011F1"
msgid "I'd rather not, if that's possible."
msgstr "가능하다면 그러고 싶지 않아."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC01
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC01_GloriaSwansen_SC_Hard04
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Gloria
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Voice
#. Face = Defiant
#. SoundFileID = 0093B507
#. ScriptNotes = She might dye her hair black and start wearing emo make up and clothes soon. She doesn't really mean it. / Defiant
#. EDID: [01040750]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0011F2"
msgid "I don't care what happens to me or to anyone else."
msgstr "나한테 무슨 일이 생기든, 다른 사람에게 무슨 일이 생기든 상관없어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC01
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Dialogue_600_OpeningUp
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Gloria
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00C6DFAA
#. DialogueBefore = Gloria: Do you want to hear my story or not?
#. EDID: [0104076B]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0011F3"
msgid "Not right now."
msgstr "지금은 안 돼."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC01
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Dialogue_570_Neutral
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Gloria
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Voice
#. Face = Depressed
#. SoundFileID = 005BDF70
#. ScriptNotes = After persuasion attempt by player, Gloria relents and accepts to tell the story of how she stole this ship from her abusive stepfather. / Depressed
#. DialogueBefore = Gloria: And why should I trust you?
#. DialogueAfter = Gloria: The truth is... this isn't my ship. It's my stepfather's.
#. EDID: [01040771]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0011F4"
msgid "I guess I might as well tell you."
msgstr "말해도 되겠지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC01
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC01_GloriaSwansen_SC_Hard04
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00CC1E38
#. EDID: [01040752]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0011F5"
msgid "I can't let you put yourself and others in danger, you understand?"
msgstr "네가 너 자신과 다른 사람들을 위험에 빠뜨리게 둘 순 없어. 알겠어?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC01
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Dialogue_570_Neutral
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 007007C0
#. DialogueBefore = Gloria: What's up?
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: And why should I trust you?
#. EDID: [0104074E]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0011F6"
msgid "Tell me how a teenager ended up alone on this ship."
msgstr "십 대가 어떻게 이 우주선에 혼자 있게 됐는지 말해봐."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC01
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC01_GloriaSwansen_SC_Easy01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Gloria
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Voice
#. Face = Confused
#. SoundFileID = 00E370D4
#. ScriptNotes = Sincere, but not knowing where to start her story, as the her difficult family situation has been going on for a while. / Confused
#. EDID: [0104089C]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0011F7"
msgid "I appreciate it, I just... It's complicated."
msgstr "고마워. 그냥... 복잡해."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC01
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Dialogue_570_Neutral
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Voice
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Voice
#. Face = Suspicious
#. SoundFileID = 008D3557
#. ScriptNotes = Not as guarded as before, trying to act unemotional to not arise suspicions that she stole the ship. / Suspicious
#. Prompt = Tell me how a teenager ended up alone on this ship.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Tell me how a teenager ended up alone on this ship.
#. DialogueAfter = Gloria: I guess I might as well tell you.
#. EDID: [01040779]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0011F8"
msgid "And why should I trust you?"
msgstr "그런데 왜 내가 당신을 믿어야 해?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC01
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Dialogue_600_OpeningUp
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Gloria
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Voice
#. Face = Irritated
#. SoundFileID = 003E2D11
#. ScriptNotes = A bit miffed that the player told her to hold off on telling her story for a moment, after they tried to get her to speak. / Irritated / to Player Default
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: I do want to hear your story.
#. EDID: [01040776]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0011F9"
msgid "Do you want to hear my story or not?"
msgstr "내 얘기를 듣고 싶은 거야, 아닌 거야?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC01
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC01_GloriaSwansen_SC_Gangster
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Gloria
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Voice
#. Face = Depressed
#. SoundFileID = 00BD34D5
#. ScriptNotes = Gloria sense that the player comes from a tough upbringing, and it's making her realize the risks she's taking running away from home. / Depressed
#. EDID: [01040765]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0011FA"
msgid "Yeah, I guess you would know..."
msgstr "그래, 넌 알겠지..."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC01
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Dialogue_550_Guarded
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Gloria
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00600C9C
#. DialogueBefore = Gloria: What do you want now?
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: I'm fine. Plenty of supplies on the ship. But thanks.
#. EDID: [0104075C]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0011FB"
msgid "I can spare food or water if needed."
msgstr "필요하면 음식이나 물은 나눠줄 수 있어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC01
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC01_GloriaSwansen_SC_Med05
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Gloria
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Voice
#. Face = Smug
#. SoundFileID = 00464B6E
#. ScriptNotes = Gloria mocking the player and being dismissive as she is with the authority figures in her life. / Smug
#. EDID: [01040763]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0011FC"
msgid "Now you sound just like my school counselor. No thanks."
msgstr "이제 우리 학교 상담 선생님처럼 말하네. 사양할게."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC01
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC01_GloriaSwansen_SC_Easy01
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 000A995D
#. EDID: [0104089E]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0011FD"
msgid "Look, I don't care that much either way. I just want to help."
msgstr "봐, 어느 쪽이든 난 그다지 상관없어. 그냥 돕고 싶을 뿐이야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC01
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Dialogue_700_WaitingForStepfather
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Gloria
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Voice
#. Face = Sarcastic
#. SoundFileID = 00B5C4F5
#. ScriptNotes = Gloria sarcastic as she believes the player will leave her stranded in space (variant where Gloria has told her story to the player). / Sarcastic / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Are you going to be okay?
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Are you going to be okay?
#. DialogueAfter = Gloria: I could take you to a spaceport if you want.
#. EDID: [0104D028]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0011FE"
msgid "Oh yeah. I'm sure my stepfather won't be angry with me for stealing his prized ship."
msgstr "아, 그렇지. 내가 새아버지의 소중한 우주선을 훔쳤는데 분명 화내지 않으시겠지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC01
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Dialogue_630_PlayerKnowsStory
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Gloria
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00B5FDFB
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I do want to hear your story. &&& Gloria: Okay, well listen until the end then. &&& Gloria: The truth is... this isn't my ship. It's my stepfather's.|I had to get away, you know? As far away as I could... so I thought, why not take his ship, right?|But he set up an anti-theft system that totally bricked the ship. He's probably on his way here. &&& Gloria: So that's it. That's my story.|Kind of lame now that I said it out loud...
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Stepfather, not father. And no, it's not for the best. I'll just run away again.
#. EDID: [0104A1BF]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0011FF"
msgid "Space is dangerous, maybe it's best to go back to your father?"
msgstr "우주는 위험해. 아버지에게 돌아가는 게 낫지 않을까?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC01
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Dialogue_700_WaitingForStepfather
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Gloria
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 001535A1
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Gloria:
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Nope. I'm fine. Goodbye, now.
#. EDID: [0104D01A]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001200"
msgid "Do you need anything else before I go?"
msgstr "내가 가기 전에 더 필요한 거 있니?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC01
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Dialogue_700_WaitingForStepfather
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Gloria
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Voice
#. Face = Somber
#. SoundFileID = 00B79204
#. ScriptNotes = Gloria feels caught in her situation, and would rather the player just leave her alone to worry about her stepfather coming to get his ship back. / Somber / to Player Default
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: I could take you to a spaceport if you want.
#. EDID: [0104D025]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001201"
msgid "You should leave before my stepfather arrives. He's not a nice man."
msgstr "내 새아버지가 도착하기 전에 떠나는 게 좋아. 좋은 사람이 아니거든."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC01
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Dialogue_700_WaitingForStepfather
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Voice
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Voice
#. Face = Pleading
#. SoundFileID = 00874C3D
#. ScriptNotes = Gloria suddenly lights up as a new opportunity for a new, brighter future with her cousin in New Atlantis presents itself. / Pleading / to Player Default
#. Prompt = I could take you to a spaceport if you want.
#. DialogueAfter = Gloria: I'll just...come back for the ship later.
#. EDID: [0104D01E]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001202"
msgid "In fact, if you could take me to New Atlantis that'd be awesome."
msgstr "사실, 뉴아틀란티스까지 데려다줄 수 있으면 정말 좋겠어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC01
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Dialogue_700_WaitingForStepfather
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Voice
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Voice
#. Face = Surprised
#. SoundFileID = 00B8979B
#. ScriptNotes = Gloria suddenly lights up as a new opportunity for a new, brighter future with her cousin in New Atlantis presents itself. / Surprised / to Player Default
#. Prompt = I could take you to a spaceport if you want.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I could take you to a spaceport if you want.
#. EDID: [0104D01E]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001203"
msgid "Uh...yeah, I do want that."
msgstr "어... 응, 그러고 싶어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_EC01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Voice
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Voice
#. Face = Grateful
#. SoundFileID = 00457264
#. ScriptNotes = Sincerely grateful to player for rescuing her from deep space and a potentially angry stepfather. / Grateful
#. EDID: [0104DEAA]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001204"
msgid "Thank you again for helping me."
msgstr "도와줘서 다시 한번 고마워."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_EC01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Voice
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Voice
#. Face = Nervous
#. SoundFileID = 00C591DC
#. ScriptNotes = Showing some enthusiastic impatience as she contemplates a new life in New Atlantis.
#. EDID: [0104DAC8]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001205"
msgid "I can't wait to get some new clothes. This spacesuit stinks!"
msgstr "새 옷을 빨리 입고 싶어. 이 우주복 냄새나!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_EC01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Voice
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Voice
#. Face = Grateful
#. SoundFileID = 004DDA12
#. ScriptNotes = Grateful
#. EDID: [0104DAC6]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001206"
msgid "Thank you for doing this."
msgstr "이렇게 해줘서 고마워."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_EC01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Andreja
#. VoiceType = NPCFAndreja
#. Face = Disgust
#. SoundFileID = 007FB936
#. ScriptNotes = Disgust
#. EDID: [0106C505]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001207"
msgid "On Va'ruun'kai this would never have been tolerated."
msgstr "바룬카이였다면 이런 일은 절대 용납되지 않았을 거야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_EC01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
