msgstr "당신 아버지는 죄책감 때문에 연락하지 못할 겁니다. 이제 당신에게 달렸어요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ03
#. SceneName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ03_SC05Hard
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = MilesCutler
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMMilesCutler
#. Face = Irritated
#. SoundFileID = 00E946B6
#. ScriptNotes = Irritated / Irritated / to Player Default
#. EDID: [0106BC01]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001223"
msgid "I'm the victim here. I'm the one who's owed an apology."
msgstr "피해자는 나야. 사과를 받아야 하는 쪽도 나라고."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ03
#. SceneName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ03_SC01Easy
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = MilesCutler
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMMilesCutler
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00DB35BB
#. ScriptNotes = Skeptical / to Player Default
#. EDID: [0106BBF0]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001224"
msgid "That goes both ways."
msgstr "그건 서로 마찬가지야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ03
#. SceneName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ03_SC03Medium
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = MilesCutler
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMMilesCutler
#. Face = Sad
#. SoundFileID = 00FB14CF
#. ScriptNotes = A rebuke, sad, regrets / Sad / to Player Default
#. EDID: [0106BBCB]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001225"
msgid "The fact we're family just makes everything harder."
msgstr "우리가 가족이라는 사실이 모든 걸 더 어렵게 만들 뿐이야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ03
#. SceneName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ03_SC03Medium
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = MilesCutler
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMMilesCutler
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 007C4F19
#. ScriptNotes = Thinking about things, coming around to the player's persuasive argument. / to Player Default
#. EDID: [0106BBC8]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001226"
msgid "Believe it or not, I do have some good family memories. They just got buried."
msgstr "믿기 어렵겠지만, 나도 가족과의 좋은 추억이 있어. 그냥 묻혀버렸을 뿐이지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ03
#. SceneName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ03_SC04Medium
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00ACEFFF
#. ScriptNotes = / to MilesCutler
#. EDID: [0106BBB0]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001227"
msgid "Do it for yourself. To prove that you can."
msgstr "네 자신을 위해 해. 네가 할 수 있다는 걸 증명하려고."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ03
#. SceneName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ03_MilesScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMMilesCutler
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMMilesCutler
#. Face = Sad
#. SoundFileID = 000DA672
#. ScriptNotes = Resigned / Sad / to Player Default
#. Prompt = He's at Anchorpoint. You should reach out, try to heal the rift.
#. DialogueAfter = MilesCutler: I'm going to rest here a little bit, and then use their transmitter to call Lucia for a lift.
#. EDID: [0106BBA9]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001228"
msgid "We both made our choices and now we have to live with them."
msgstr "우린 둘 다 선택을 했고, 이제 그 선택을 안고 살아야 해."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ03
#. SceneName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ03_MilesScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMMilesCutler
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMMilesCutler
#. Face = Sad
#. SoundFileID = 007DF1DE
#. ScriptNotes = Resigned, sad / Sad / to Player Default
#. Prompt = He's at Anchorpoint. You should reach out, try to heal the rift.
#. DialogueBefore = MilesCutler: I don't know. It's been a real long time. I'm not even sure how much he cares anymore.
#. EDID: [0106BBA9]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001229"
msgid "I know what you're trying to say, but it doesn't change anything."
msgstr "네가 무슨 말을 하려는지는 알아. 하지만 그게 아무것도 바꾸진 않아."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ03
#. SceneName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ03_MilesScene
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = MilesCutler
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0000C840
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: [Lie] That's right. She's the one who hired me. &&& MilesCutler: Best damn co-pilot a guy could ask for.|I'm going to owe her a top-notch dinner at Dawn's Roost in New Atlantis.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: You're right. Just know that it's not a happy tale.
#. EDID: [0106BBAC]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00122A"
msgid "What happened? I'm involved now, so I have a right to know."
msgstr "무슨 일이 있었죠? 이제 저도 관련됐으니 알 권리가 있습니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ03
#. SceneName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ03_MilesScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = MilesCutler
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMMilesCutler
#. Face = Depressed
#. SoundFileID = 00FAE347
#. ScriptNotes = Deep sadness / Depressed / to Player Default
#. DialogueAfter = companion: It's not hard to understand how such a tragedy could tear a family apart.
#. EDID: [01040496]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00122B"
msgid "He left the very next day, and cut off all contact. "
msgstr "아버지는 바로 다음 날 떠났고, 모든 연락을 끊었어. "

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ03
#. SceneName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ03_MilesScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = MilesCutler
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMMilesCutler
#. Face = Sad
#. SoundFileID = 00092B6E
#. ScriptNotes = Sadness, a painful memory / Sad / to Player Default
#. EDID: [01040496]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00122C"
msgid "His hubris cost both of their lives."
msgstr "아버지의 오만 때문에 두 사람이 목숨을 잃었지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ03
#. SceneName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ03_MilesScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = MilesCutler
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMMilesCutler
#. Face = Somber
#. SoundFileID = 00D27C95
#. ScriptNotes = Somber, a painful memory / Somber / to Player Default
#. EDID: [01040496]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00122D"
msgid "He demanded to do the surgery, but it wasn't his area of expertise."
msgstr "아버지는 자기가 수술하겠다고 고집했지만, 산부인과는 아버지의 전문 분야가 아니었어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ03
#. SceneName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ03_MilesScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = MilesCutler
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMMilesCutler
#. Face = Somber
#. SoundFileID = 00184628
#. ScriptNotes = Somber, a painful memory / Somber / to Player Default
#. EDID: [01040496]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00122E"
msgid "My wife was about to give birth and there were complications. The life-threatening kind."
msgstr "아내가 출산을 앞두고 있었을 때, 합병증이 생겼어. 생명이 위험했지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ03
#. SceneName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ03_MilesScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = MilesCutler
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMMilesCutler
#. Face = Somber
#. SoundFileID = 00C5B096
#. ScriptNotes = Somber, a painful memory / Somber / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = MilesCutler: Yeah. You risked a lot coming out here, so it's the least I can do.
#. EDID: [01040496]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00122F"
msgid "He was a doctor, well-respected but arrogant."
msgstr "아버지는 의사였어. 존경받았지만, 오만했지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ03
#. SceneName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ03_MilesScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = companion
#. VoiceType = NPCMSamCoe
#. Face = Sad
#. SoundFileID = 000B044F
#. ScriptNotes = Sad, at a loss for words. / Sad / to MilesCutler
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: He's at Anchorpoint. You should reach out, try to heal the rift.
#. EDID: [0106BBC3]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001230"
msgid "I understand not getting along with your old man, but that's... yeah."
msgstr "아버지와 사이가 좋지 않은 건 이해하지만, 그건... 그래."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ03
#. SceneName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ03_MilesScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = companion
#. VoiceType = NPCMSamCoe
#. Face = Sad
#. SoundFileID = 00770B51
#. ScriptNotes = Almost a whisper as you process the tragic story. / Sad / to MilesCutler
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: If you want to talk about it, I'm listening. &&& MilesCutler: Yeah. You risked a lot coming out here, so it's the least I can do. &&& MilesCutler: He was a doctor, well-respected but arrogant.|My wife was about to give birth and there were complications. The life-threatening kind.|He demanded to do the surgery, but it wasn't his area of expertise.|His hubris cost both of their lives.|He left the very next day, and cut off all contact.
#. EDID: [0106BBC3]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001231"
msgid "Damn. Can't imagine how hard that must have been."
msgstr "젠장. 얼마나 힘들었을지 상상도 안 돼."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMCivilian
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R03_NPCMCivilian01
#. Face = Confused
#. SoundFileID = 00A0594B
#. ScriptNotes = Confused
#. EDID: [0104C419]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001232"
msgid "What's going on?"
msgstr "무슨 일이죠?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMCivilian / NPCFCivilian
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R03_NPCMCivilian01 / SFFL_R03_NPCFCivilian01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0042E327
#. EDID: [0104C428]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001233"
msgid "We won't be any trouble."
msgstr "폐 끼치지 않을게요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCFCivilian
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R03_NPCFCivilian01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00DCAB32
#. EDID: SFFL_R03SharedShipHello02
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001234"
msgid "We'll see you on board, then."
msgstr "그럼 우주선에서 뵙겠습니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. SceneName = SFFL_R03_100b_DefenderHailAccepted
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = HailingShip
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R03_NPCFCivilian01
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0060101F
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I'll give you a ride.
#. EDID: [01052B6F]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001235"
msgid "I'll let the captain know you're coming aboard."
msgstr "선장에게 당신이 승선한다고 알려두겠습니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. SceneName = SFFL_R03_100b_DefenderHailAccepted
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = HailingShip
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R03_NPCFCivilian01
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 000FB1CF
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: I'll give you a ride.
#. EDID: [01052EAB]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001236"
msgid "Do you think you could at least fly us out of here? Our cockpit is damaged and, well, we're all shaken up."
msgstr "적어도 저희를 여기서 벗어나게 날려주실 수 있을까요? 조종실이 손상됐고, 음, 모두 충격을 받은 상태라서요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. SceneName = SFFL_R03_100b_DefenderHailAccepted
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = HailingShip
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R03_NPCFCivilian01
#. Face = Spaceship / Irritated
#. SoundFileID = 00698D6E
#. ScriptNotes = Irritated
#. DialogueBefore = HailingShip:
#. EDID: [01052EAB]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001237"
msgid "It would've been nice to have some help back there. Now our... *sigh* Our pilot has been killed.  "
msgstr "아까 도움을 받을 수 있었으면 좋았을 텐데요. 이제 우리... *한숨* 우리 조종사가 죽었습니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. SceneName = SFFL_R03_100b_DefenderHailAccepted
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = HailingShip
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R03_NPCFCivilian01
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00B3B5B4
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: I'll give you a ride.
#. EDID: [0103D1C4]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001238"
msgid "Could you fly us home? "
msgstr "저희를 집까지 데려다주실 수 있을까요?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. SceneName = SFFL_R03_100b_DefenderHailAccepted
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = HailingShip
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R03_NPCFCivilian01
#. Face = Spaceship / Irritated
#. SoundFileID = 00E29D82
#. ScriptNotes = Irritated
#. DialogueBefore = HailingShip:
#. EDID: [0103D1C4]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001239"
msgid "We would've appreciated your help back there. Now our ship is torn to bits. I'm not sure if we'll be able to fly out of here."
msgstr "아까 도와주셨다면 고마웠을 겁니다. 이제 우리 우주선은 산산조각이 났어요. 여기서 날아나갈 수 있을지 모르겠습니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. SceneName = SFFL_R03_175a_SpeakWithCaptain_Friendly_ShipDamaged01
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Captain
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 008AEAF5
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Captain: Our savior, in the flesh.|Can't believe I have to resort to bumming rides from a stranger. *Sigh* And I just finished paying off this ship.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: How the hell would I know? Spacers will be Spacers. They see a ship and they want to blow it up.
#. EDID: [0104C40F]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00123A"
msgid "Any idea why those Spacers targeted you?"
msgstr "저 스페이서들이 왜 당신들을 노렸는지 짐작 가는 게 있나요?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. SceneName = SFFL_R03_175a_SpeakWithCaptain_Betrayal_ShipDamaged01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMCivilian
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R03_NPCMCivilian01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00065F8D
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Thanks.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Thanks.
#. DialogueAfter = Captain: The thing is, we aren't who you think we are.
#. EDID: [0103E24B]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00123B"
msgid "Of course. You know, I always wanted a ship like that. This one was fine, sure, but yours just has that... I don't know. Something special.  Something that makes you wanna fly it. "
msgstr ""
"물론이지. 알다시피, 난 늘 그런 우주선을 갖고 싶었어. 이 우주선도 괜찮긴 했지만, 네 우주선에는 그... 뭐랄까. 특별한 뭔가가 "
"있어. 몰아보고 싶어지게 만드는 뭔가가. "

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. SceneName = SFFL_R03_175a_SpeakWithCaptain_Betrayal_ShipDamaged01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Captain
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R03_NPCMCivilian01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00F61DB3
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral / to Player Default
#. EDID: [0103E246]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00123C"
msgid "So you're the captain, huh? Ready to give us a ride?"
msgstr "그래서 네가 선장이야? 우리를 태워줄 준비 됐어?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. SceneName = SFFL_R03_175a_SpeakWithCaptain_Friendly_ShipDamaged
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Captain
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R03_NPCMCivilian01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00F375B2
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Did I do anything to make you nervous?
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Did I do anything to make you nervous?
#. DialogueAfter = Captain: We won't have any problems if you don't make any problems.
#. EDID: [0103EDFB]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00123D"
msgid "No, but you'll forgive me if I'm shaken up after almost getting blasted apart by spacers. "
msgstr "아뇨, 하지만 스페이서들에게 거의 산산조각 날 뻔한 뒤라 제가 좀 혼란스러워 해도 이해해 주세요. "

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. SceneName = SFFL_R03_175a_SpeakWithCaptain_Friendly_ShipDamaged01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Captain
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R03_NPCMCivilian01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00B32AC5
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: I get it, but we should get going now.
#. EDID: [010530C7]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00123E"
msgid "Sorry, it's just been a bad day."
msgstr "미안해요. 그냥 오늘 일진이 안 좋았네요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. SceneName = SFFL_R03_175a_SpeakWithCaptain_Friendly_ShipDamaged01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Captain
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R03_NPCMCivilian01
#. Face = Apologetic
#. SoundFileID = 00B59DE6
#. ScriptNotes = apologetic / Apologetic
#. DialogueBefore = Captain: It is what it is. I'm not looking for sympathy.
#. EDID: [010530C7]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00123F"
msgid "*Sigh* Hold on. That was uncalled for. I'm being a jerk."
msgstr "*한숨* 잠깐만요. 방금은 괜한 소리 해봤어요. 제가 못나게 굴고 있었네요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. SceneName = SFFL_R03_175a_SpeakWithCaptain_Friendly_ShipDamaged01
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Captain
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00AC4958
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Sorry about your ship. I wish I got here sooner. &&& Captain: It is what it is. I'm not looking for sympathy. &&& Captain: *Sigh* Jesus, I need to get a grip. You're helping us out and here I am, complaining to you like an asshole. |It's been a long and bad day.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: All right, I hear you. Let's get moving.
#. EDID: [0104C416]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001240"
msgid "Let's just get a move on. We're wasting time here."
msgstr "그냥 움직이죠. 여기서 시간 낭비하고 있을 순 없어요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. SceneName = SFFL_R03_175a_SpeakWithCaptain_Friendly_ShipDamaged01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Captain
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R03_NPCMCivilian01
#. Face = Irritated
#. SoundFileID = 00355593
#. ScriptNotes = Irritated / to Player Default
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Sorry about your ship. I wish I got here sooner.
#. EDID: [0104C415]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001241"
msgid "Can't believe it. I put my heart and soul into this ship, and all of my hard work - poof."
msgstr "믿을 수가 없네요. 이 우주선에 내 마음과 영혼을 쏟아부었는데, 그 모든 노력이 펑 사라졌어요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. SceneName = SFFL_R03_175a_SpeakWithCaptain_Friendly_ShipDamaged01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Captain
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R03_NPCMCivilian01
#. Face = Irritated
#. SoundFileID = 007A7CDC
#. ScriptNotes = Irritated / to Player Default
#. EDID: [0104C415]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001242"
msgid "Well, welcome aboard, I guess. Feels weird saying that, seeing as how it's little more than scrap, now."
msgstr "뭐, 승선을 환영한다고 해야 할까요. 이제 고철이나 다름없으니 그렇게 말하는 것도 이상하네요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. SceneName = SFFL_R03_175a_SpeakWithCaptain_Friendly_PilotKilled01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Captain
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R03_NPCMCivilian01
#. Face = Irritated
#. SoundFileID = 005A515D
#. ScriptNotes = Irritated / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Why did those Spacers attack you?
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Why did those Spacers attack you?
#. DialogueAfter = Captain: Sorry about your pilot.
#. EDID: [010539DB]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001243"
msgid "No idea. How am I supposed to know what a Spacer is thinking? They're maniacs."
msgstr "전혀 몰라요. 스페이서가 무슨 생각을 하는지 제가 어떻게 알겠어요? 녀석들은 미치광이들이에요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. SceneName = SFFL_R03_175a_SpeakWithCaptain_Betrayal_ShipDamaged
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00F21C84
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Captain:
#. EDID: [0104C438]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001244"
msgid "I'm just here to give you a ride."
msgstr "난 그냥 태워주러 온 거야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. SceneName = SFFL_R03_175a_SpeakWithCaptain_Friendly_PilotKilled01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Captain
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R03_NPCMCivilian01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00587839
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral
#. DialogueBefore = Captain:
#. DialogueAfter = Captain: Anyway, we're ready to leave whenever you are.
#. EDID: [010530C3]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001245"
msgid "*Sigh* I'm really not looking forward to all the paperwork after all of this."
msgstr "*한숨* 이 일이 다 끝난 뒤 처리해야 할 서류 생각만 해도 정말 싫네요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. SceneName = SFFL_R03_175a_SpeakWithCaptain_Friendly_PilotKilled
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Captain
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R03_NPCMCivilian01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00268024
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral / to Player Default
#. Prompt = My condolences, but we need to get moving. More spacers could jump in at any moment.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: My condolences, but we need to get moving. More spacers could jump in at any moment.
#. DialogueAfter = Captain: *Sigh* Anyway, thanks for giving us a ride out of here.
#. EDID: [010530EB]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001246"
msgid "I know. *Sigh* Can't wait for this all to be over."
msgstr "알아요. *한숨* 이 모든 게 빨리 끝났으면 좋겠어요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. SceneName = SFFL_R03_175a_SpeakWithCaptain_Friendly_PilotKilled01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Captain
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R03_NPCMCivilian01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00CDF29D
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral
#. DialogueBefore = Captain:
#. EDID: [010539D0]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001247"
msgid "Well, let's get a move on, I guess."
msgstr "그럼 움직여야겠군요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. SceneName = SFFL_R03_175a_SpeakWithCaptain_Friendly_PilotKilled01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Captain
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R03_NPCMCivilian01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00643FC8
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral
#. DialogueBefore = Captain:
#. EDID: [010539CF]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001248"
msgid "Anyway, we're ready to leave whenever you are."
msgstr "어쨌든, 우리야 언제든 떠날 준비가 되어 있어요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. SceneName = SFFL_R03_175a_SpeakWithCaptain_Betrayal_PilotKilled
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Captain
