#. Face = Angry
#. SoundFileID = 0071BA33
#. ScriptNotes = Angry
#. DialogueBefore = Captain:
#. EDID: [01053DA3]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001249"
msgid "Kill them!"
msgstr "죽여!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. SceneName = SFFL_R03_175a_SpeakWithCaptain_Betrayal_PilotKilled01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Captain
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R03_NPCMCivilian01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 006F19DF
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Why did those Spacers attack you?
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Why did those Spacers attack you?
#. DialogueAfter = Captain: Sorry about your pilot.
#. EDID: [01053DB3]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00124A"
msgid "Probably just had itchy trigger fingers and wanted to kill something. I can relate to that."
msgstr "아마 손가락이 근질거려서 뭐라도 죽이고 싶었던 거겠지. 그 마음은 이해돼."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. SceneName = SFFL_R03_175a_SpeakWithCaptain_Betrayal_PilotKilled01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Captain
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R03_NPCMCivilian01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0028F09F
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Why did those Spacers attack you?
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Why did those Spacers attack you?
#. DialogueAfter = Captain: Sorry about your pilot.
#. EDID: [01053DB1]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00124B"
msgid "Just trying to make a living the only way they know how."
msgstr "지들이 아는 유일한 방식대로 먹고살려는 거겠지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. SceneName = SFFL_R03_175a_SpeakWithCaptain_Betrayal_PilotKilled01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Captain
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R03_NPCMCivilian01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00BE592D
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral
#. DialogueBefore = Captain:
#. DialogueAfter = Captain: The thing is, we aren't who you think we are.
#. EDID: [01053D8E]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00124C"
msgid "You know, when we took over this ship I really thought we were home free. Karma, I guess. Damn Spacers."
msgstr "있잖아. 우리가 이 우주선을 장악했을 때는 이제 정말 안전하다고 생각했어. 업보인가 봐. 망할 스페이서들."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. SceneName = SFFL_R03_175a_SpeakWithCaptain_Betrayal_PilotKilled01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMCivilian
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R03_NPCMCivilian01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00233357
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Sorry about your pilot.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Sorry about your pilot.
#. EDID: [01053D9F]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00124D"
msgid "To tell you the truth, we aren't really wasting any tears over him. "
msgstr "사실대로 말하면, 조종사 때문에 딱히 눈물나진 않아. "

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. SceneName = SFFL_R03_175a_SpeakWithCaptain_Betrayal_ShipDamaged
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Captain
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R03_NPCMCivilian01
#. Face = Irritated
#. SoundFileID = 0019F106
#. ScriptNotes = Irritated / to Player Default
#. Prompt = We won't have any problems if you don't make any.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: We won't have any problems if you don't make any.
#. EDID: [01053DBF]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00124E"
msgid "Right back at you."
msgstr "너도 마찬가지야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. SceneName = SFFL_R03_175a_SpeakWithCaptain_Betrayal_ShipDamaged01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Captain
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R03_NPCMCivilian01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0024C03D
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral
#. DialogueBefore = Captain:
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Thanks.
#. EDID: [01053D98]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00124F"
msgid "You have a hell of a ship. Gotta say, I'm jealous, what with my ship being in the state it's in."
msgstr "우주선 진짜 대단하네. 솔직히 질투나. 내 우주선이 저런 상태라서 더 그런가."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. SceneName = SFFL_R03_175a_SpeakWithCaptain_Betrayal_ShipDamaged
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Captain
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R03_NPCMCivilian01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 003D11A0
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral
#. DialogueBefore = Captain:
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: I can fly my own ship.
#. EDID: [01053D85]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001250"
msgid "Oh, my crew and I will handle the flying. Least we can do."
msgstr "아, 조종은 나와 내 선원들이 맡을게. 그 정도는 해야지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. SceneName = SFFL_R03_175a_SpeakWithCaptain_Betrayal_PilotKilled
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Captain
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R03_NPCMCivilian01
#. Face = Irritated
#. SoundFileID = 00F33FA3
#. ScriptNotes = Irritated
#. EDID: [01053D94]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001251"
msgid "Heh, we appreciate all your help. There's just one thing left that we need from you. Your ship."
msgstr "헤, 도와줘서 고마워. 이제 필요한 게 딱 하나 남았네. 네 우주선."

