msgid "I thought we had a deal!"
msgstr "거래를 지킬 줄 알았는데!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMGenericMale / NPCFGenericFemale
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMGenericMale02 / SFFL_NPCMGenericMale01 / SFFL_NPCFGenericFemale01 / SFFL_NPCFGenericFemale02
#. Face = Angry
#. SoundFileID = 00E377F8
#. ScriptNotes = Angry
#. EDID: [0105BFAD]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001276"
msgid "Can this day get any worse?"
msgstr "오늘 운수가 이보다 더 나빠질 수 있을까?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_3200_Yura_MainEndScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Yura
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFYura
#. Face = Irritated
#. SoundFileID = 00A8AE69
#. ScriptNotes = Irritated / to Atka
#. DialogueAfter = Atka: Yura... Never mind. We'll talk about this later.
#. EDID: [01035889]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001277"
msgid "Just toss a bunch of leaves in water and make more. Isn't that what you do?"
msgstr "그냥 잎사귀를 물에 잔뜩 던져 넣고 더 만들면 되잖아. 너희가 하는 일이 그거 아니야?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_3200_Yura_MainEndScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Yura
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFYura
#. Face = Irritated
#. SoundFileID = 001CFA94
#. ScriptNotes = Irritated / to Atka
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: As a Freestar Ranger, I personally looked after Milli's safety. &&& Atka: Wow, I'll take your word for it then.|Yura actually outdid herself. &&& Atka: And, miraculously, all my plants are still alive.|You've proven yourself a far better house sitter than Yura ever was.
#. EDID: [01035889]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001278"
msgid "Oh not the plants again."
msgstr "아, 또 식물 얘기야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_3200_Yura_MainEndScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Yura
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFYura
#. Face = Confused
#. SoundFileID = 00E2EFEB
#. ScriptNotes = Confused / to Player Default
#. Prompt = You can blame your friend Roman for us not being here.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: You can blame your friend Roman for us not being here.
#. DialogueAfter = Yura: Roman took Milli and was holding her for ransom.
#. EDID: [0103589E]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001279"
msgid "Oh god, do I even want to know? How is he involved in this?"
msgstr "맙소사, 내가 굳이 내막까지 알아야 할까? 도대체 로만은 어쩌다 이 일에 엮인 건데?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_3200_Yura_MainEndScene
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Atka
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00ABF7C0
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: As a Freestar Ranger, I personally looked after Milli's safety. &&& ... &&& Yura: Oh not the plants again.|I refuse to let you guilt me over something that you regrow all the time. &&& Atka: Yura... Never mind. We'll talk about this later. &&& Atka: I'm sorry. No sense in you sticking around listening to this.|Let me pay you so you can get out of here.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Don't worry, this is the last straw.
#. EDID: [010358AC]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00127A"
msgid "I wouldn't trust Yura to house sit for you anymore."
msgstr "이제 유라에게 임시 집사 일을 맡기지 않는 게 좋겠는데."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_3200_Yura_MainEndScene
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Yura
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00E1675D
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: [Lie] Just taking Milli for a walk. &&& Yura: Oh yeah? Well, great timing. |I got a message from Atka that she was returning early, so I got down here as soon as I could. &&& Atka: Excuse me. &&& Yura: Imagine my surprise when not only did she beat me back here, but Milli was nowhere to be found.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Oh god, do I even want to know? How is he involved in this?
#. EDID: [01035863]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00127B"
msgid "You can blame your friend Roman for us not being here. "
msgstr "여기 없었던 건 내 탓이 아니라 네 친구 로만 탓이라고. "

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_3100_Yura_AtkaScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Yura
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFYura
#. Face = Relieved
#. SoundFileID = 003EA279
#. ScriptNotes = Reassuring. Player showed up just in time to bail her out of a situation. / Relieved / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Yura: And I am! Hiring another pet sitter is taking care of her.
#. DialogueAfter = Yura: Don't talk to me!
#. EDID: [0103588D]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00127C"
msgid "And look, just in time. "
msgstr "봐. 딱 맞춰 왔잖아. "

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_3200_Yura_MainEndScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Yura
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFYura
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 0078E2BF
#. ScriptNotes = Confident / to Atka
#. DialogueBefore = Yura: I was just getting to that!
#. DialogueAfter = Yura: And, I assume, a very trusted friend...
#. EDID: [010358AE]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00127D"
msgid "Atka, this is the pet sitter I told you about."
msgstr "아트카, 이쪽이 내가 말한 임시 집사야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1200_Roman_MainRansomScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Roman
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRomanKreutz
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 0073318B
#. ScriptNotes = Confident / to Player Default
#. Prompt = [Pay <Global=SFFL_MS03_RansomCredits>] Here's your credits.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: [Pay <Global=SFFL_MS03_RansomCredits>] Here's your credits.
#. DialogueAfter = Roman: Give me Milli and I'll put in a good word for you with Yura.
#. EDID: [01035A6E]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00127E"
msgid "Check your numbers, \"errand runner.\" You're short."
msgstr "숫자 다시 확인해. \"심부름꾼.\" 모자라잖아."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_3200_Yura_MainEndScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Yura
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFYura
#. Face = Irritated
#. SoundFileID = 003391BC
#. ScriptNotes = Irritated / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Yura: Oh yeah? Well, great timing. |I got a message from Atka that she was returning early, so I got down here as soon as I could. &&& Atka: Excuse me.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: I don't see how the timing is my fault.
#. EDID: [01035873]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00127F"
msgid "Imagine my surprise when not only did she beat me back here, but Milli was nowhere to be found."
msgstr "내가 얼마나 놀랐겠어? 언니가 나보다 먼저 집에 와 있는 데다, 밀리까지 사라졌으니."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_3200_Yura_MainEndScene
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Yura
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0086A540
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: [Lie] Just taking Milli for a walk. &&& Yura: Oh yeah? Well, great timing. |I got a message from Atka that she was returning early, so I got down here as soon as I could. &&& Atka: Excuse me. &&& Yura: Imagine my surprise when not only did she beat me back here, but Milli was nowhere to be found.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Oh, so this is my fault? There's no "take Milli for a walk" listed on those care instructions.
#. EDID: [010358C4]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001280"
msgid "If you would've stayed here, you wouldn't have this problem."
msgstr "네가 여기 남아 있었다면 이런 문제는 없었을 거야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_3200_Yura_MainEndScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Atka
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFAtka
#. Face = Irritated
#. SoundFileID = 00E839A6
#. ScriptNotes = Trying to get her sister's attention. / Irritated / to Yura
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: [Lie] Just taking Milli for a walk. &&& Yura: Oh yeah? Well, great timing. |I got a message from Atka that she was returning early, so I got down here as soon as I could.
#. DialogueAfter = Yura: Imagine my surprise when not only did she beat me back here, but Milli was nowhere to be found.
#. EDID: [010358A1]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001281"
msgid "Excuse me."
msgstr "유라. 잠깐만."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_0140_Yura_IntroPostRejectionScene
