#. DialogueAfter = Yura: Here's the key to Atka's house.
#. EDID: [01035898]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001282"
msgid "A few more credits never hurt anyone, right?"
msgstr "크레딧이 조금 더 있다고 나쁠 건 없잖아?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_3200_Yura_MainEndScene
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00C3A619
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Atka: What do you mean "the pet sitter" has Milli? You were supposed to be taking care of her. &&& Yura: And I am! Hiring another pet sitter is taking care of her. &&& Yura: And look, just in time. &&& Yura: Don't talk to me!
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Oh yeah? Well, great timing.
#. EDID: [01035892]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001283"
msgid "[Lie] Just taking Milli for a walk."
msgstr "[거짓말] 밀리를 산책시키고 왔어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_3200_Yura_MainEndScene
