#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Milli was petnapped. I had to get her back.
#. EDID: [01035874]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001286"
msgid "Petnapped? Are you kidding me? Who would even want that little bottom feeder? "
msgstr "애완동물 납치? 장난해? 누가 그 쪼그맣고 바닥에 놓인 먹이나 먹는 녀석을 원하겠어? "

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_0140_Yura_IntroPostRejectionScene
