#. Prompt = Pomegranate.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Pomegranate.
#. DialogueAfter = Intercom: We've been waiting for you.
#. EDID: [01059CDF]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00128E"
msgid "Who--? Hmm... Come on in."
msgstr "누구...? 흠... 들어와."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_0100_Yura_IntroMainScene
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Yura
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 003F2C92
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Depends on what it is. &&& Yura: Oh you're gonna love it. Easiest credits you'll ever make!|All you have to do is water a few plants and feed a little milliwhale until my sister gets home. &&& companion: Such work is beneath us, but it does sound oddly satisfying.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Wow, really? You'd let a poor, innocent creature die?
#. EDID: [0103586F]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00128F"
msgid "I don't house sit. Find someone else."
msgstr "내가 무슨 집사인 줄 아나. 다른 사람 찾아."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_0100_Yura_IntroMainScene
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Yura
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 003635EB
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Depends on what it is. &&& Yura: Oh you're gonna love it. Easiest credits you'll ever make!|All you have to do is water a few plants and feed a little milliwhale until my sister gets home. &&& companion: Such work is beneath us, but it does sound oddly satisfying.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Seriously, no catch. House sitting just isn't for me, you know?
#. EDID: [0103587F]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001290"
msgid "That sounds too easy. What's the catch?"
msgstr "너무 쉬워 보이는데. 함정이라도 있나?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1200_Roman_SC_Generic04Scene
