#. ScriptNotes = Speech challenge win: You're not going to consider lowering the price? / Thinking / to Player Default
#. EDID: [01059D71]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001293"
msgid "Hmm, I don't know... "
msgstr "흠, 모르겠는데..."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_0100_Yura_IntroMainScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Yura
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFYura
#. Face = Friendly
#. SoundFileID = 0093A405
#. ScriptNotes = Friendly / to Player Default
#. DialogueAfter = Yura: Count us in.
#. EDID: [01059CDD]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001294"
msgid "I was hoping you could do me a wee teeny tiny favor."
msgstr "아주 사소한 부탁 하나만 들어 줄 수 있을까 해서."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_0100_Yura_IntroMainScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Yura
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFYura
#. Face = Friendly
#. SoundFileID = 006AEC9C
#. ScriptNotes = Friendly / to Player Default
#. EDID: [01059CDD]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001295"
msgid "So, I heard what you did for the station, taking out those Spacers, and since you look like you're on your way out..."
msgstr "저기, 우주정거장에서 얘기를 들었어. 네가 스페이서들을 처리했다면서? 마침 나가려는 것 같아서..."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
