#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I'm the last person you'll see if you don't hand over Milli right now. &&& Roman: Okay, whoa. Let's talk about this.|How about plan B? No more credits, just a simple favor, and Milli is all yours.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: No, son of a... So she has no idea about any of this?
#. EDID: [01035D58]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001296"
msgid "She never mentioned any note."
msgstr "유리는 쪽지 얘기 같은 건 안 했어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1200_Roman_MainBranchYura01Scene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
