#. ScriptNotes = Confident / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Tell me the favor first.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Tell me the favor first.
#. EDID: [01035D87]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001299"
msgid "I give you Milli... and you put in a good word for me with Yura. "
msgstr "내가 밀리를 넘기면... 넌 유라에게 내 얘기를 좋게 해주는 거야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1200_Roman_MainBranchYura01Scene
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Roman
