#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00BA79E5
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Not that I know of. &&& Roman: Great. Great! Well, this sure went south quick. &&& Roman: All right, plan B I guess. You want Milli? Do me a favor, and she's all yours.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: That's not gonna happen.
#. EDID: [01035D8A]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00129A"
msgid "[Attack] Plan C. I'm taking Milli."
msgstr "[공격] 플랜 C. 밀리는 내가 데려간다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1200_Roman_SC_Generic03Scene
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00C7043A
#. ScriptNotes = / to Roman
#. EDID: [01035D60]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00129B"
msgid "I'm sure you don't really want to do this."
msgstr "사실 이러고 싶지 않잖아."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1200_Roman_MainBranchYura02Scene
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Roman
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00E1CFEA
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Nice sob story, but I'm just here for Milli. &&& Roman: Oh yeah, well if I recall, you don't have the credits. |The way I see it, you've got two choices: pay up or get the hell out of here.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Go ahead and try.
#. EDID: [01035D8B]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00129C"
msgid "[Attack] I like the option where I take what I want."
msgstr "[공격] 난 원하는 걸 가져가는 선택지가 마음에 드는데."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1200_Roman_MainBranchYura02Scene
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Roman
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00B7ED6F
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Shows how much you know about Yura. &&& Roman: Damn, maybe you're right.|Here I am trying to impress her to ask her out, and I don't even know her well enough to realize how stupid it all is.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: You'd do that after all this?
#. EDID: [01035D90]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00129D"
msgid "If you give me Milli, I'll put in a good word for you."
msgstr "밀리를 넘기면, 유라에게 네 얘기를 좋게 해줄게."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1200_Roman_MainBranchYura02Scene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Roman
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRomanKreutz
#. Face = Happy
#. SoundFileID = 00D068A2
#. ScriptNotes = Happy / to Player Default
#. Prompt = If you give me Milli, I'll put in a good word for you.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Fine. I'll be back with your credits.
#. EDID: [01035D94]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00129E"
msgid "Here's the key to the room. That little bottom feeder's all yours."
msgstr "방 열쇠야. 저 쪼그맣고 바닥에 놓인 먹이나 먹는 녀석을 데려가."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1200_Roman_MainBranchYura02Scene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Roman
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRomanKreutz
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 00F58233
#. ScriptNotes = Confident / to Player Default
#. Prompt = If you give me Milli, I'll put in a good word for you.
#. EDID: [01035D94]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00129F"
msgid "Hell yeah, you don't know what this means to me."
msgstr "좋았어, 이게 나한테 어떤 의미인지 넌 모를 거야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1200_Roman_MainBranchYura02Scene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Roman
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRomanKreutz
#. Face = Concerned
#. SoundFileID = 00A9FF9F
#. ScriptNotes = Concerned / to Player Default
#. Prompt = If you give me Milli, I'll put in a good word for you.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: If you give me Milli, I'll put in a good word for you.
#. EDID: [01035D94]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0012A0"
msgid "You'd do that after all this? "
msgstr "이런 일이 있었는데도 그렇게 해준다고? "

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1200_Roman_MainBranchYura02Scene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMRomanKreutz
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRomanKreutz
#. Face = Concerned
#. SoundFileID = 001B9795
#. ScriptNotes = Concerned / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Sorry to have ruined your plans.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: You should tell her how you feel. She'd appreciate that even more.
#. EDID: [01035D86]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0012A1"
msgid "All these years of trying to build up the courage to ask her out, and I'm still screwing it up."
msgstr "수년 동안 걔에게 데이트 신청할 용기를 내려고 애썼는데, 아직도 망치고 있어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1200_Roman_MainBranchYura02Scene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMRomanKreutz
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRomanKreutz
#. Face = Irritated
#. SoundFileID = 007577E5
#. ScriptNotes = Irritated / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Sorry to have ruined your plans.
#. EDID: [01035D86]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0012A2"
msgid "I should've known she'd do something like this. "
msgstr "걔가 이런 식으로 나올 줄 알았어야 했는데."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1200_Roman_MainBranchYura02Scene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMRomanKreutz
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRomanKreutz
#. Face = Concerned
#. SoundFileID = 0035ADED
#. ScriptNotes = Concerned / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Sorry to have ruined your plans.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Sorry to have ruined your plans.
#. EDID: [01035D86]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0012A3"
msgid "This isn't your fault. It's mine."
msgstr "이건 네 잘못이 아니야. 내 잘못이지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1200_Roman_MainBranchYura01Scene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Roman
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRomanKreutz
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 00007187
#. ScriptNotes = Confident / to Player Default
#. DialogueAfter = companion: All this setup when you should be confessing to her directly.
#. EDID: [01035D91]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0012A4"
msgid "But now I've lost that chance. So, plan B. I give you Milli, you put in a good word for me with Yura."
msgstr "하지만 이제 그 기회를 놓쳤어. 그래서 플랜 B로 갈 거야. 내가 밀리를 주면, 넌 유라에게 좋게 내 얘기를 해줘."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1200_Roman_MainBranchYura01Scene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Roman
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRomanKreutz
#. Face = Concerned
#. SoundFileID = 00007805
#. ScriptNotes = Concerned / to Player Default
#. EDID: [01035D91]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0012A5"
msgid "And then when all went according to plan, I'd have the confidence to ask her out. "
msgstr "그리고 모든 게 계획대로 됐으면, 난 자신감을 얻어서 걔에게 데이트 신청을 했을 거야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1200_Roman_MainBranchYura01Scene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Roman
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRomanKreutz
#. Face = Concerned
#. SoundFileID = 00056DC2
#. ScriptNotes = Concerned / to Player Default
#. EDID: [01035D91]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0012A6"
msgid "We figured she'd get into it, maybe even get the credits from Atka..."
msgstr "우린 걔가 이 일에 빠져들 거라고 생각했어. 어쩌면 아트카에게서 크레딧까지 받아낼 수도 있고..."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1200_Roman_MainBranchYura01Scene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Roman
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRomanKreutz
#. Face = Concerned
#. SoundFileID = 00E9BD3A
#. ScriptNotes = Concerned / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Roman: Just hear me out. You got this petnapping thing all wrong.|You see, this is all a setup for Yura.
#. EDID: [01035D91]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0012A7"
msgid "She hates house sitting. It's boring. So we thought why not liven things up?"
msgstr "걔는 임시 집사 일을 싫어해. 지루하니까. 그래서 좀 활기를 넣어보면 어떨까 한 거야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_3200_Yura_MainEndScene
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Yura
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 006BC764
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Atka: What do you mean "the pet sitter" has Milli? You were supposed to be taking care of her. &&& Yura: And I am! Hiring another pet sitter is taking care of her. &&& Yura: And look, just in time. &&& Yura: Don't talk to me!
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Yeah, you and me both, but apparently Atka decided to come home earlier than expected.
#. EDID: [01059CED]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0012A8"
msgid "I figured you'd still be at Anchorpoint."
msgstr "그쪽은 아직 앵커포인트에 있을 줄 알았는데."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1200_Roman_SC_Generic01Scene
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00E03507
#. ScriptNotes = / to Roman
#. EDID: [01059CA8]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0012A9"
msgid "We're talking about a milliwhale here, right?"
msgstr "지금 밀리고래 얘기하는 거 맞지?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1200_Roman_MainBranchYura01Scene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMRomanKreutz
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRomanKreutz
#. Face = Concerned
#. SoundFileID = 007918DC
#. ScriptNotes = Concerned / to Player Default
#. Prompt = [Demand Credits: <Global=SFFL_MS03_PaymentCredits>] Don't make me repeat myself.
#. DialogueAfter = Roman: Here's the key to Milli's room. Little critter's all yours.
#. EDID: [01059CF5]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0012AA"
msgid "Here's the key to Milli's room. Just don't forget our deal."
msgstr "밀리 방 열쇠 여기 있어. 거래한 거 지켜."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1200_Roman_MainBranchYura01Scene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMRomanKreutz
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRomanKreutz
#. Face = Nervous
#. SoundFileID = 00D21053
#. ScriptNotes = Nervous / to Player Default
#. Prompt = [Demand Credits: <Global=SFFL_MS03_PaymentCredits>] Don't make me repeat myself.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: [Demand Credits: <Global=SFFL_MS03_PaymentCredits>] Don't make me repeat myself.
#. EDID: [01059CF5]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0012AB"
msgid "All right, all right, I'll pay you. "
msgstr "알았어, 알았어. 돈 줄게. "

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1200_Roman_MainBranchYura02Scene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Roman
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRomanKreutz
#. Face = Depressed
#. SoundFileID = 008FA323
#. ScriptNotes = Depressed / to Player Default
#. Prompt = So this is all some plan to entertain Yura?
#. DialogueAfter = Roman: Sorry to have ruined your plans.
#. EDID: [01059CB5]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0012AC"
msgid "I.. I thought it would show how much I care about her, but obviously, I've failed miserably."
msgstr "나.. 난 그 애를 얼마나 아끼는지 보여줄 수 있을 거라고 생각했는데, 보시다시피 처참하게 실패했어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1200_Roman_MainBranchYura02Scene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Roman
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRomanKreutz
#. Face = Depressed
#. SoundFileID = 00CB1D93
#. ScriptNotes = Depressed / to Player Default
#. Prompt = So this is all some plan to entertain Yura?
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: So this is all some plan to entertain Yura?
#. EDID: [01059CB5]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0012AD"
msgid "No, it's more than that. I wanted to put this all together to impress her."
msgstr "아니, 그 이상이야. 걔에게 좋은 인상을 주려고 이 모든 걸 준비하고 싶었어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1200_Roman_TruthScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Roman
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRomanKreutz
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 00C4E10A
#. ScriptNotes = Confident / to Player Default
#. EDID: [01059CEC]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0012AE"
msgid "Here's the key to Milli's room. Consider it an even trade."
msgstr "밀리 방 열쇠야. 공평한 교환이라고 생각해."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1200_Roman_TruthScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Roman
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRomanKreutz
#. Face = Amused
#. SoundFileID = 00E6267C
#. ScriptNotes = Emphasis on "you" / Amused / to Player Default
#. EDID: [01059CEC]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0012AF"
msgid "Heh, I guess I owe you now."
msgstr "헤, 이제 내가 빚진 것 같네."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1200_Roman_TruthScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Roman
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRomanKreutz
#. Face = Relieved
#. SoundFileID = 00925265
#. ScriptNotes = Relieved / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Roman: Damn, I never thought about it way... |And it would just be my luck that I'd send someone out there to speak for me and they'd screw it up.
#. EDID: [01059CEC]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0012B0"
msgid "I hate to say it, but you're right. I need to do this myself."
msgstr "인정하긴 싫지만, 네 말이 맞아. 이건 내가 직접 해야 해."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1200_Roman_TruthScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Roman
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRomanKreutz
#. Face = Amused
#. SoundFileID = 00E38EE6
#. ScriptNotes = Amused / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Your friends are right for once.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Your friends are right for once.
#. DialogueAfter = Roman: I hate to say it, but you're right. I need to do this myself.
#. EDID: [01059CC5]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0012B1"
msgid "Don't tell them that. I'll never live it down."
msgstr "그 애들에게 그 말은 하지 마. 평생 놀림감이 될 거야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1200_Roman_FreestarScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMRomanKreutz
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRomanKreutz
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 0098AA37
#. ScriptNotes = Confident / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Just make sure you stick to legal activities next time.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Just make sure you stick to legal activities next time.
#. DialogueAfter = Roman: Milli's all yours. Please, just take her, and this will never happen again.
#. EDID: [01059CCC]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0012B2"
msgid "You bet we will. Lesson learned."
msgstr "물론 그러지. 교훈을 얻었어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1200_Roman_FreestarBranchYuraScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Roman
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRomanKreutz
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00009D91
#. ScriptNotes = Frustrated. / Serious / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Yura hired me to house sit. She doesn't know about all this.
#. DialogueAfter = Roman: I swear we were always going to return Milli safe and sound.
#. EDID: [01059D36]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0012B3"
msgid "Of course she would've pawned this job off on someone else. I should've thought of that!"
msgstr "당연히 걔가 이 일을 다른 사람에게 떠넘겼겠지. 그걸 생각했어야 했는데!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1200_Roman_FreestarBranchYuraScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Roman
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRomanKreutz
#. Face = Surprised
#. SoundFileID = 00F6F04B
#. ScriptNotes = Surprised / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Yura hired me to house sit. She doesn't know about all this.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Yura hired me to house sit. She doesn't know about all this.
#. EDID: [01059D36]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0012B4"
msgid "You're kidding me. So Yura hasn't even seen the note?"
msgstr "농담이지. 그럼 유라는 쪽지를 보지도 못했다는 거야?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1200_Roman_FreestarScene
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Roman
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00FD9EA5
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Roman: I swear we were always going to return Milli safe and sound.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: I know, I know, but it wasn't really petnapping, it was really more petborrowing.
#. EDID: [01059CC7]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0012B5"
msgid "Stealing someone's pet is a serious crime."
msgstr "남의 애완동물을 훔치는 건 중범죄야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1200_Roman_FreestarScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Roman
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRomanKreutz
#. Face = Nervous
#. SoundFileID = 0049B96F
#. ScriptNotes = Nervous / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Just hand over the milliwhale.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Just hand over the milliwhale.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: And you really thought Yura would appreciate your prank?
#. EDID: [01059D1C]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0012B6"
msgid "You got it. She's in the next room. Here's the key."
msgstr "알았어. 다음 방에 있어. 열쇠야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1200_Roman_FreestarBranchYuraScene
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00F55D5B
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: And you really thought Yura would appreciate your prank? &&& Roman: I would've guaranteed it! I just never saw her reporting it to the Freestar Rangers. &&& Roman: Atka must've come home before Yura even saw the note. That's the only explanation.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: You found the note? So Yura doesn't know about this at all?
#. EDID: [01059CC8]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0012B7"
msgid "Atka didn't report this. I found your ransom note."
msgstr "아트카가 신고한 게 아니야. 네가 쓴 몸값 요구서를 찾았어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1200_Roman_MainBranchYura01Scene
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00E299D2
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: [Demand Credits: <Global=SFFL_MS03_PaymentCredits>] I don't do anything for free. &&& Roman: But you aren't doing it for free, you're getting Milli, right?
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: All right, all right, I'll pay you.
#. EDID: [01059D06]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0012B8"
msgid "[Demand Credits: <Global=SFFL_MS03_PaymentCredits>] Don't make me repeat myself."
msgstr "[<Global=SFFL_MS03_PaymentCredits> 크레딧 요구] 같은 말 반복하게 하지 마."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1200_Roman_FreestarScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMRomanKreutz
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRomanKreutz
#. Face = Nervous
#. SoundFileID = 001001FA
#. ScriptNotes = Nervous / to Player Default
#. Prompt = I'm listening.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Petnapping for fun is still petnapping.
#. EDID: [01059CAD]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0012B9"
msgid "Yura gets bored out of her mind house sitting, so we were going to stage a petnapping, you know, for fun."
msgstr "유라는 임시 집사 일을 하면 지루해 하니까, 우리가 애완동물 납치를 연출하려고 했어. 그냥 재미로 말이야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1200_Roman_FreestarScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMRomanKreutz
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRomanKreutz
#. Face = Nervous
#. SoundFileID = 00AEAEFC
#. ScriptNotes = Nervous / to Player Default
#. Prompt = I'm listening.
#. EDID: [01059CAD]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0012BA"
msgid "I knew Atka was going to be out of town and her sister Yura was going to get stuck watching Milli..."
msgstr "아트카가 집을 비울 거고, 그 여동생 유라가 밀리를 돌보게 될 거라는 걸 알고 있었어..."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1200_Roman_FreestarScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMRomanKreutz
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRomanKreutz
#. Face = Nervous
#. SoundFileID = 007A905A
#. ScriptNotes = Nervous / to Player Default
#. Prompt = I'm listening.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I'm listening.
#. EDID: [01059CAD]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0012BB"
msgid "We didn't really petnap Milli, we just sort of borrowed her... for a prank."
msgstr "우리가 정말 밀리를 납치한 건 아니야. 그냥 좀 빌린 거지... 장난으로."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1200_Roman_MainBranchYura01Scene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Roman
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRomanKreutz
#. Face = Disbelief
#. SoundFileID = 00E2D8BF
#. ScriptNotes = Disbelief / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Yura didn't send me. I found your ransom note.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Yura didn't send me. I found your ransom note.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: I'm the last person you'll see if you don't hand over Milli right now.
#. EDID: [01059D4D]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0012BC"
msgid "What? Who even are you and what were you doing in Atka's house to begin with? "
msgstr "뭐? 넌 대체 누구고, 애초에 아트카 집에서 뭘 하고 있었던 거야? "

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1100_Intercom_ReturnScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Intercom
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMGenericMale01
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 00A697A2
#. ScriptNotes = Confident
#. DialogueBefore = Intercom: Now was that so hard?
#. EDID: [01059CAC]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0012BD"
msgid "Get in here and let's get this over with."
msgstr "들어와. 마무리를 짓자고."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1100_Intercom_IntroScene
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Intercom
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 009D3221
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Intercom: Password.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: No way. Pass. Word.
#. EDID: [01059D19]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0012BE"
msgid "I'm here for Milli. Let me in."
msgstr "밀리 때문에 왔다. 문 열어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_0100_Yura_IntroMainScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = companion
#. VoiceType = NPCMSamCoe
#. Face = Happy
#. SoundFileID = 005ABE98
#. ScriptNotes = Happy / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Depends on what it is. &&& Yura: Oh you're gonna love it. Easiest credits you'll ever make!|All you have to do is water a few plants and feed a little milliwhale until my sister gets home.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Count us in.
#. EDID: [01059CD4]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0012BF"
msgid "Oh Cora would love this. Plants, pets, and a good book? She'd be all in."
msgstr "아, 코라가 정말 좋아하겠네. 식물, 애완동물, 좋은 책이라니? 완전히 빠질 거야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_0200_Yura_TL_AtkaScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Yura
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFYura
#. Face = Smug
#. SoundFileID = 002DC37C
#. ScriptNotes = Smug / to Player Default
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: I have some other questions.
#. EDID: [01059CE9]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0012C0"
msgid "Obviously the favorite when it came to mom and dad. "
msgstr "엄마 아빠에게는 당연히 제일 사랑받는 쪽이었지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_0200_Yura_TL_AtkaScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Yura
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFYura
#. Face = Thinking
#. SoundFileID = 006D7284
#. ScriptNotes = Thinking / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Can you tell me more about your sister?
#. EDID: [01059CE9]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0012C1"
msgid "Atka? I like to think of her as the anti-me: responsible, keeps to herself, excelling at everything she does..."
msgstr "아트카? 나는 걔를 나와 정반대라고 생각해. 책임감 있고, 혼자 지내고, 하는 일마다 뛰어나고..."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_0140_Yura_IntroPostRejectionScene
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Yura
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00C80C02
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Yura: Oh hey, finally interested in that house sitting gig? It's not too late you know.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: It's so simple. It's literally just watering some plants and feeding a milliwhale... every day until my sister gets back.
#. EDID: [01059CFD]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0012C2"
msgid "What does this involve again?"
msgstr "내가 정확히 뭘 해야 한다고?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1100_Intercom_IntroScene
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00876576
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Intercom: Password.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: A wha--? Er, right away. Just give me a sec.
#. EDID: [01059CAA]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0012C3"
msgid "I'm a Freestar Ranger, here about a stolen pet, so open up."
msgstr "나는 자유항성 레인저다. 가축 절도 건으로 왔으니 문 열어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_0200_Yura_TL_HouseSittingScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Yura
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFYura
#. Face = Friendly
#. SoundFileID = 00C63326
#. ScriptNotes = Friendly / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: If this job is so easy, why can't you do it?
#. EDID: [01059CF4]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0012C4"
msgid "House sitting? Really? There's a difference between easy and boring and I don't do boring."
msgstr "임시 집사? 진짜? 쉬운 것과 지루한 건 다르고, 난 지루한 건 안 해."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_0200_Yura_TL_YuraScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Yura
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFYura
#. Face = Friendly
#. SoundFileID = 00D9680E
#. ScriptNotes = Friendly / to Player Default
#. EDID: [01059D30]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0012C5"
msgid "I'm a pilot at heart so anything that involves running in the Free Lanes is the job for me, as long as the price is right."
msgstr "난 타고난 조종사라서 자유 항로에서 달리는 일이면 뭐든 내 일이지. 보수만 맞으면."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_0200_Yura_TL_YuraScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Yura
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFYura
#. Face = Friendly
#. SoundFileID = 00446B82
#. ScriptNotes = Friendly / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: What are you going to do while I'm watching the house?
#. EDID: [01059D30]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0012C6"
msgid "Live my life for one. "
msgstr "우선 내 인생을 사는 거."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_0100_Yura_IntroMainScene
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Yura
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 008B62B8
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Depends on what it is. &&& Yura: Oh you're gonna love it. Easiest credits you'll ever make!|All you have to do is water a few plants and feed a little milliwhale until my sister gets home. &&& companion: Such work is beneath us, but it does sound oddly satisfying.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: No more than a few days, I promise!
#. EDID: [01059D4E]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0012C7"
msgid "How long do I have to do this for?"
msgstr "얼마나 오래 걸리는 일인데?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_0115_Yura_IgnoredScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Yura
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFYura
#. Face = Irritated
#. SoundFileID = 00BB79FA
#. ScriptNotes = Grumbling to herself as player ignores her initial call out, but has some level of understanding. / Irritated / to Player Default
#. EDID: [01059CF3]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0012C8"
msgid "Or just ignore me. That's fine. I'd have better things to do, too."
msgstr "아니면 그냥 날 무시하든가. 괜찮아. 나라도 더 할 일이 많겠지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_3200_Yura_BranchEndRomanDeadScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Atka
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFAtka
#. Face = Nervous
#. SoundFileID = 0034DEAF
#. ScriptNotes = Nervous / to Player Default
#. Prompt = The Settled Systems is safer with them gone.
#. EDID: [0105A330]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0012C9"
msgid "Please, just leave us. I think we need some space."
msgstr "부탁이니까 이제 그만 나가줘. 우리끼리 조용히 얘기 좀 해야겠어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_3200_Yura_BranchEndRomanDeadScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Atka
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFAtka
#. Face = Nervous
#. SoundFileID = 005A50E3
#. ScriptNotes = Nervous / to Player Default
#. Prompt = The Settled Systems is safer with them gone.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: The Settled Systems is safer with them gone.
#. EDID: [0105A330]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0012CA"
msgid "Roman and his friends were... misguided individuals, but I can't say they deserved this."
msgstr "로만과 그 친구들은... 잘못된 길로 빠져들긴 했지만, 이런 일을 당해도 쌀만큼 나쁜 놈들은 아니었어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_3200_Yura_BranchEndRomanScene
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0070C159
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Roman was trying to impress Yura with a staged petnapping. &&& Yura: Wait what? He did this for me? That's crazy.|I have been complaining to him about it for some time... I just never thought he'd do something like this, at least not for me.|Oh my god, so he was expecting me to show up to get Milli all this time. No wonder I couldn't find him.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: I say if he did all this for me, that tells me plenty.
#. EDID: [0105A359]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0012CB"
msgid "Roman likes you, Yura. He's just not sure how to tell you."
msgstr "로만은 널 좋아해, 유라. 어떻게 말해야 할지 모를 뿐이야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_3200_Yura_BranchEndRomanScene
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Atka
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0058AF68
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Roman took Milli and was holding her for ransom. &&& ... &&& Atka: I'm sorry. Who are you? And are you saying Roman stole Milli while I was gone? &&& Yura: Atka, this is the pet sitter I was telling you about.|And as you can see, Milli is fine! &&& Atka: Fine? She was stolen right out of our home! She could be traumatized. |What was Roman even thinking?
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Roman and his friends are dead.
#. EDID: [0105B42F]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0012CC"
msgid "Roman and his friends didn't survive when I rescued Milli."
msgstr "밀리를 구했을 때, 로만과 친구들은 살아있지 않았어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_3200_Yura_BranchEndRomanScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Atka
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFAtka
#. Face = Relieved
#. SoundFileID = 00FB9F49
#. ScriptNotes = Relieved / to Player Default
#. Prompt = I don't think Roman thinks much.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I don't think Roman thinks much.
#. DialogueAfter = Yura: Hey, Roman just thinks outside the box.
#. EDID: [0105A347]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0012CD"
msgid "Finally, someone who actually agrees with me."
msgstr "드디어 내 말에 동의해주는 사람이 나타났네."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_3200_Yura_BranchEndRomanScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCFYura
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFYura
#. Face = Confused
#. SoundFileID = 003286A1
#. ScriptNotes = Confused / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Roman took Milli and was holding her for ransom.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Roman took Milli and was holding her for ransom.
#. DialogueAfter = Atka: I'm sorry. Who are you? And are you saying Roman stole Milli while I was gone?
#. EDID: [0105A340]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0012CE"
msgid "Ransom? Why would he even do that?"
msgstr "몸값? 로만이 대체 왜 그런 짓을 했는데?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_3200_Yura_BranchEndRomanScene
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Yura
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00D6F7F7
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Atka: What do you mean "the pet sitter" has Milli? You were supposed to be taking care of her. &&& Yura: And I am! Hiring another pet sitter is taking care of her. &&& Yura: And look, just in time. &&& Yura: How was Roman involved in all this stuff again?
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: With Milli? What -- is he charging people for photo ops?
#. EDID: [0105A34D]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0012CF"
msgid "He was trying to earn a few credits."
msgstr "로만이 크레딧 푼돈을 벌려고 했어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_3200_Yura_BranchEndRomanScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Atka
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFAtka
#. Face = Concerned
#. SoundFileID = 00999927
#. ScriptNotes = Concerned / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Roman's just a common thief extorting people for credits.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Roman's just a common thief extorting people for credits.
#. DialogueAfter = Yura: Well, you're not right either! You make it sound like he's just some loser criminal who's out to get people, but he's not.
#. EDID: [0105B433]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0012D0"
msgid "You're not wrong..."
msgstr "틀린 말은 아니야..."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_3200_Yura_BranchEndRomanScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Yura
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFYura
#. Face = Confused
#. SoundFileID = 00318F19
#. ScriptNotes = Confused / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Roman was just wasting my time.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Roman was just wasting my time.
#. DialogueAfter = Atka: I'm sorry. Who are you? And are you saying Roman stole Milli while I was gone?
#. EDID: [0105A346]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0012D1"
msgid "Sounds like Roman, but why? "
msgstr "로만 답긴 한데, 왜 그런 거야? "

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1300_Roman_TL_YuraScene
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 003DC918
#. ScriptNotes = / to Roman
#. DialogueAfter = Roman: Yura's great. She's like that person that makes you feel better just knowing they're around.
#. EDID: [0105BFAE]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0012D2"
msgid "Can you tell me more about Yura?"
msgstr "유라에 대해 더 말해줄 수 있어?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1300_Roman_TL_AtkaScene
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Roman
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0097D631
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: What do you know about Atka? &&& Roman: Yura's sister? She's pretty nice, but she doesn't exactly approve of our lifestyle, if you know what I mean.|She thinks anyone who operates mostly in the Free Lanes is up to no good. |She's not wrong, but at least she's always been nice to me, and pretty forgiving of Yura.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Oh god, where do I begin? Yura's probably one of the least responsible people I've ever known.
#. EDID: [0105BF7D]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0012D3"
msgid "What is Atka forgiving Yura for?"
msgstr "아트카는 유라를 뭘 용서하는 거야?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1300_Roman_TL_AtkaScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Roman
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRomanKreutz
#. Face = Nervous
#. SoundFileID = 0027FCC0
#. ScriptNotes = Nervous / to Player Default
#. Prompt = What is Atka forgiving Yura for?
#. DialogueAfter = Roman: If she's so nice, why use Atka and Milli to get Yura's attention?
#. EDID: [0105BF78]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0012D4"
msgid "House sitting, obviously, dinner dates, jobs, you know... Atka's always trying to help her out, but she just doesn't get that Yura's not interested."
msgstr ""
"당연히, 임시 집사 일, 저녁 약속, 일자리, 그런 것들 말이야... 아트카는 늘 유라를 도우려 하지만, 유라가 관심 없다는 걸 이해하지 "
"못해."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1300_Roman_TL_AtkaScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Roman
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRomanKreutz
#. Face = Nervous
#. SoundFileID = 001A12C9
#. ScriptNotes = Nervous / to Player Default
#. Prompt = What is Atka forgiving Yura for?
#. EDID: [0105BF78]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0012D5"
msgid "I feel like it's part of her charm, but yeah, she's always letting Atka down."
msgstr "그게 유라의 매력 중 하나 같기도 하지만, 뭐, 아트카는 그것 때문에 항상 유라에게 실망하지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1300_Roman_TL_AtkaScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Roman
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRomanKreutz
#. Face = Nervous
#. SoundFileID = 00284ECF
#. ScriptNotes = Nervous / to Player Default
#. Prompt = What is Atka forgiving Yura for?
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: What is Atka forgiving Yura for?
#. EDID: [0105BF78]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0012D6"
msgid "Oh god, where do I begin? Yura's probably one of the least responsible people I've ever known."
msgstr "세상에, 어디서부터 말해야 하지? 유라는 내가 아는 사람 중 가장 책임감 없는 축에 들어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1200_Roman_StarbornScene
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Roman
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 004C531A
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Give me Milli and I'll put in a good word for you with Yura. &&& Roman: Whoa, what? Who are you? How would you even know anything about that?
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: You're kidding? Of course she would...
#. EDID: [0105C9CF]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0012D7"
msgid "Yura hired me to house sit, but it's obvious what's going on."
msgstr "유라가 나를 임시 집사로 고용했지만, 무슨 일인지 뻔해."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_3200_Yura_BranchEndRomanScene
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00D064AA
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Roman likes you, Yura. He's just not sure how to tell you. &&& ... &&& Atka: That still doesn't justify what you did, Yura. &&& Yura: Oh come on, Milli is fine. Everything is fine! &&& Yura: Help me out here.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Wow, I'll take your word for it then.
#. EDID: [0105C9C8]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0012D8"
msgid "As a Freestar Ranger, I can guarantee she's fine."
msgstr "자유항성 레인저로서, 밀리는 괜찮다고 보장할게."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_3200_Yura_MainEndScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = companion
#. VoiceType = NPCMBarrett
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 00A6D9C3
#. ScriptNotes = Milli is a rare albino milliwhale. / Confident / to Atka
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I don't see how the timing is my fault. &&& ... &&& Yura: You'll be happy to know, they were just taking Milli for a walk. &&& Yura: And see? Milli's fine! &&& Yura: Right, "pet sitters"?
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: As a Freestar Ranger, I personally looked after Milli's safety.
#. EDID: [0106B1F3]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0012D9"
msgid "Only the best care for the rarest of milliwhales."
msgstr "가장 희귀한 밀리고래인데 최고로 보살펴 줘야지."

#. List: 2
