#. ScriptNotes = Player told Roman that Yura said no. / Concerned
#. EDID: [0106B1DD]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0012DA"
msgid "That sucks for Roman. It's gonna take a while for him to get over it."
msgstr "로만한테는 안됐네. 그걸 극복하려면 시간이 좀 걸릴 거야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03_Support
