#. EDID: [0106B1D1]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0012DB"
msgid "I've only got a million different things going through my head now."
msgstr "지금 머릿속에 온갖 생각이 백만 가지는 지나가고 있어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03_Support
