#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 009DADE8
#. ScriptNotes = / to Atka
#. DialogueAfter = Atka: Milliwhale care is easy. All you really need to do is feed them.
#. EDID: [0105CEC7]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0012E7"
msgid "How do you take care of a milliwhale?"
msgstr "밀리고래는 어떻게 돌봐?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03_Support
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_PostQuest_Yura_TL_Roman01Scene
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Yura
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00E42278
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Why don't you think you deserve him? &&& Yura: Roman deserves better. I mean, deep down, who am I? |Sure I'm fun and always looking for the next thrill, but dating material? Me? I don't think so. |Unless you hired me for my pilot skills, I'm pretty much bound to disappoint you.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Well sure, not right now. But give it time.
#. EDID: [0105BF9F]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0012E8"
msgid "I have a feeling you wouldn't disappoint Roman. "
msgstr "너라면 로만을 실망시키지 않을 것 같은데. "

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03_Support
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_PostQuest_Yura_TL_Roman01Scene
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00ECD82A
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: He really likes you, Yura. Give him a chance. &&& Yura: Give him a chance so I can screw it all up? |Roman's great, really, but the moment you start dating someone, that means you start letting them in and I really suck at that.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: You know... you're right. Roman's seen me at my worst and still hasn't given up on me.
#. EDID: [0105BF93]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0012E9"
msgid "That's just fear talking. If you like Roman, don't let fear keep you apart."
msgstr "그냥 두려워서 그렇게 말하는 거잖아. 로만을 좋아한다면, 두렵다고 거리를 두려 하지 마."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03_Support
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_PostQuest_Yura_TL_Roman01Scene
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Yura
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 008DFC32
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Roman wanted me to put in a good word for him with you. &&& Yura: Roman's the best. &&& Yura: I can't believe he did all this for me. &&& Yura: I really wish I deserved someone like him, but I'm just not relationship material. Not right now.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: I only hope Roman understands. I keep saying I'm going to get it together, but who knows when that'll be.
#. EDID: [0105BF9B]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0012EA"
msgid "I get that. Relationships aren't for everyone."
msgstr "이해해. 모두가 관계 맺는 걸 좋아하는 건 아니니까."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03_Support
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_PostQuest_Atka_TL_YuraScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCFAtka
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFAtka
#. Face = Concerned
#. SoundFileID = 001EEA64
#. ScriptNotes = Concerned / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Why do you worry about Yura?
#. DialogueAfter = Atka: Why do you worry about Yura?
#. EDID: [0105CE88]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0012EB"
msgid "And with Yura spending all her time working in the Free Lanes... who knows what could happen to her."
msgstr "그리고 유라는 시간 대부분을 자유 항로에서 일하는 데 보내는데... 무슨 일이 생길지 누가 알겠어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03_Support
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_PostQuest_Atka_TL_YuraScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCFAtka
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFAtka
#. Face = Somber
#. SoundFileID = 0091B645
#. ScriptNotes = Somber / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Why do you worry about Yura?
#. EDID: [0105CE88]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0012EC"
msgid "Our parents died a few years ago in some freak accident traveling to Paradiso."
msgstr "우리 부모님은 몇 년 전 파라디소로 가던 중 이상한 사고로 돌아가셨어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03_Support
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_PostQuest_Atka_TL_YuraScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCFAtka
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFAtka
#. Face = Concerned
#. SoundFileID = 00AE35D0
#. ScriptNotes = Concerned / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Why do you worry about Yura?
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Why do you worry about Yura?
#. EDID: [0105CE88]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0012ED"
msgid "Because she's my sister, and she's all I have."
msgstr "걔는 내 여동생이고, 내게 남은 전부니까."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03_Support
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_PostQuest_Atka_TL_AtkaScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Atka
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFAtka
#. Face = Friendly
#. SoundFileID = 00DD2F52
#. ScriptNotes = Friendly / to Player Default
#. EDID: [0105CE96]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0012EE"
msgid "I really only leave for the conferences. I'm a biologist, so I do all my work out here remotely."
msgstr "난 회의가 있을 때만 떠나. 생물학자라서 일은 전부 여기서 원격으로 해."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03_Support
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_PostQuest_Atka_TL_AtkaScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Atka
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFAtka
#. Face = Friendly
#. SoundFileID = 00031E77
#. ScriptNotes = Friendly / to Player Default
#. EDID: [0105CE96]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0012EF"
msgid "I basically keep to myself. People aren't really my thing, so I like it out here. Just me, Milli, and the plants."
msgstr "난 기본적으로 혼자 지내. 사교 활동은 별로 내 취향이 아니라서, 여기 있는 게 좋아. 나, 밀리, 그리고 식물들뿐이니까."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03_Support
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_PostQuest_Atka_TL_AtkaScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Atka
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFAtka
#. Face = Irritated
#. SoundFileID = 00F28376
#. ScriptNotes = Irritated / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Can you tell me a little bit about yourself?
#. EDID: [0105CE96]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0012F0"
msgid "Oh not much to tell really. "
msgstr "사실 별로 말할 건 없어. "

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03_Support
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_PostQuest_Atka_TL_AtkaScene
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 003A88B8
#. ScriptNotes = / to Atka
#. DialogueAfter = Atka: Oh not much to tell really.
#. EDID: [0105CEA2]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0012F1"
msgid "Can you tell me a little bit about yourself?"
msgstr "당신에 대해 조금 말해줄 수 있어?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03_Support
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_PostQuest_Atka_TL_MilliScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Atka
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFAtka
#. Face = Friendly
#. SoundFileID = 002183AC
#. ScriptNotes = Friendly / to Player Default
#. EDID: [0105CEB9]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0012F2"
msgid "They're so docile and calm. I'm not sure anything bothers Milli at all."
msgstr "정말 온순하고 차분해. 밀리는 뭐든 전혀 신경 쓰지 않는 것 같아."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03_Support
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_PostQuest_Atka_TL_MilliScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Atka
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFAtka
#. Face = Friendly
#. SoundFileID = 002B6FBE
#. ScriptNotes = Friendly / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: How do you take care of a milliwhale?
#. EDID: [0105CEB9]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0012F3"
msgid "Milliwhale care is easy. All you really need to do is feed them."
msgstr "밀리고래 돌보기는 쉬워. 사실 먹이만 주면 돼."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03_Support
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_PostQuest_Yura_TL_Roman01Scene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Yura
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFYura
#. Face = Grateful
#. SoundFileID = 00D82E79
#. ScriptNotes = Grateful / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Yura: You know... you're right. Roman's seen me at my worst and still hasn't given up on me. |And I do trust him. I really do owe it to both of us to stop shutting him out.
#. EDID: [0106B1C1]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0012F4"
msgid "I guess I have a lot to think about thanks to you."
msgstr "덕분에 생각할 게 많아진 것 같아."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03_Support
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_PostQuest_Roman_YuraYesScene01
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Roman
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 003ABEA0
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I think I was rather convincing. &&& Roman: What? You're not joking? Oh god, so I really get to go through with it now. &&& Roman: I feel like a nervous wreck. What do I say? I... I need advice. Anything!
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: I know her, of course. it's not like we've never spoken before.
#. EDID: [0106B1B0]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0012F5"
msgid "You know Yura. You'll know what to do when the time comes."
msgstr "유라를 알잖아. 때가 되면 어떻게 해야 할지 너도 알게 될 거야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03_Support
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_PostQuest_Roman_YuraYesScene01
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Roman
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00E8436D
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I think I was rather convincing. &&& Roman: What? You're not joking? Oh god, so I really get to go through with it now. &&& Roman: I feel like a nervous wreck. What do I say? I... I need advice. Anything!
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: You could've fooled me, but you did get me this far.
#. EDID: [0106B1A7]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0012F6"
msgid "You're on your own. I don't do relationship advice."
msgstr "네가 알아서 해. 난 연애 상담 안 해."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03_Support
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_PostQuest_Roman_YuraNoScene01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Roman
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRomanKreutz
#. Face = Depressed
#. SoundFileID = 0091CF2D
#. ScriptNotes = Depressed / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Yura has some things she needs to work through.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Yura has some things she needs to work through.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: You should encourage her to get some help.
#. EDID: [0106B1B2]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0012F7"
msgid "*sigh* I know... I guess I was hoping we could work through those things together. "
msgstr "*한숨* 알아... 그냥 우리가 그런 문제들을 함께 풀어갈 수 있길 바랐던 것 같아."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03_Support
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_PostQuest_Roman_YuraNoScene01
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Roman
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 009C0D68
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Yura doesn't think she deserves you. &&& Roman: What? I'm the one that doesn't deserve her. How can she even think that?|*sigh* That's classic Yura, though. Never thinks she's good enough for anything.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Yeah, at least I know that much. And don't worry, I'd never bail on a friend in need, especially Yura.
#. EDID: [0106B1BD]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0012F8"
msgid "Just be there for her. You mean a lot to her."
msgstr "그 애 곁에 있어줘. 넌 그 애에게 큰 의미가 있어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_Z01_AudioLogs
#. SceneName = SFFL_Z01_AudioLogs_DeathSlate_GABBY
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = AUDIOONLY
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCGabrielleBaker
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0027C8B2
#. ScriptNotes = Exhausted and running out of oxygen. Tons of regret as she'll never see her wife again.
#. DialogueBefore = Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): I should have listened to her. Begged for me to get a job on land. Happy wife, happy life, right? But the pay - It's real helpful now.
#. DialogueAfter = Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): But now... I just want to be in it a bit longer...
#. EDID: [0106C729]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0012FA"
msgid "I guess I hoped if we had enough we could have grown gray in peace. Perfect life and all that."
msgstr "충분히 있었다면 평화롭게 늙어갈 수 있길 바랐던 것 같아. 완벽한 삶 같은 거 말이야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_CrimeDialogue
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_CrimeDialogue_Vote
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 006D1D7B
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Guard: What do you think you're doing?
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: It better not.
#. EDID: [01034F7B]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0012FB"
msgid "I'm sorry, it was an accident. Won't happen again."
msgstr "미안해, 사고였어. 다시는 안 그럴게."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMChanHuang
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMChanHuang
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 000BAE70
#. EDID: [010343B3]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0012FC"
msgid "You should get somewhere safe."
msgstr "어디든 안전한 곳으로 떠나는 게 좋을 거 같은데."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ01
#. SceneName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ01_StartScene
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = ChanHuang
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00BD4CF4
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Why? What happened? &&& ChanHuang: There's a Spacer gang that makes regular stops here.|They've caused trouble before, but nothing too serious.|Word is, they've got a new leader who's violent and bloodthirsty in the extreme.|Ever since, they've been a lot worse.|One of them threatened to shoot a patron, so I locked him up.|His friends stormed out, promising to come back for some retribution.|They said they were bringing everybody.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Really?
#. EDID: [010343B0]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0012FD"
msgid "Spacers are pushovers. I've got this."
msgstr "스페이서야 만만하지. 내가 처리할게."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ01
#. SceneName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ01_StartScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = ChanHuang
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMChanHuang
#. Face = Somber
#. SoundFileID = 005306D7
#. ScriptNotes = Resigned to your fate / Somber / to Player Default
#. Prompt = If that's true, maybe you should abandon the station.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: I'll solve your Spacer problem, but it'll cost you.
#. EDID: [010343A2]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0012FE"
msgid "If he stays, we stay."
msgstr "세인트 씨가 남는다면, 우리도 남을 거야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ01
#. SceneName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ01_StartScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = ChanHuang
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMChanHuang
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 00976929
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = If that's true, maybe you should abandon the station.
#. EDID: [010343A2]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0012FF"
msgid "Mister Saint owns this place, and we have a contract."
msgstr "이곳의 주인은 세인트 씨고, 우리는 세인트 씨와 맺은 계약이 있어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ01
#. SceneName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ01_StartScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = ChanHuang
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMChanHuang
#. Face = Somber
#. SoundFileID = 00F0260C
#. ScriptNotes = Conflicted / Somber / to Player Default
#. Prompt = If that's true, maybe you should abandon the station.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: If that's true, maybe you should abandon the station.
#. EDID: [010343A2]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001300"
msgid "I don't disagree with you, but that's not my call."
msgstr "그 말에 반대하는 건 아니지만, 그건 내가 결정할 문제가 아니야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_Z01_SE1
#. SceneName = SFFL_Z01_100b_HailingAnswered_SEHOY
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = HailingShip
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCSehoyBaker
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00DD693C
#. ScriptNotes = Sad and regretful. [Spaceship] / to Player Default
#. Prompt = If you're looking for help, look elsewhere.
#. DialogueAfter = HailingShip: No, wait! Dammit!
#. EDID: [010325F6]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001301"
msgid "Oh, Gabrielle, what am I going to do...?"
msgstr "아, 가브리엘, 난 어떡해야 하지...?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_Z01_SE1
#. SceneName = SFFL_Z01_100b_HailingAnswered_SEHOY
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = HailingShip
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCSehoyBaker
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00A10C9A
#. ScriptNotes = Scared and desperate. [Spaceship] / to Player Default
#. Prompt = If you're looking for help, look elsewhere.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: If you're looking for help, look elsewhere.
#. EDID: [010325F6]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001302"
msgid "No, no, please! Come back!"
msgstr "안 돼, 안 돼, 제발! 돌아와!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_Z01_SE1
#. SceneName = SFFL_Z01_100b_HailingAnswered_SEHOY
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0010A304
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = HailingShip: Hello? Is someone there? Please, tell me if you can hear me. This is Sehoy Baker. &&& HailingShip: &&& HailingShip: H-Hello? Thank goodness! You don't know how good it is to hear another voice.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: In all honesty, I am.
#. EDID: [010325F7]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001303"
msgid "You sound pretty desperate."
msgstr "꽤 절박해 보이네."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_Z01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCSehoyBaker
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCSehoyBaker
#. Face = Spaceship / Angry
#. SoundFileID = 005339D4
#. ScriptNotes = Scared [Spaceship] / Angry
#. EDID: [01056625]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001304"
msgid "Stop! I'm not here to fight!"
msgstr "멈춰! 싸우러 온 게 아니야!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_Z01
#. SceneName = SFFL_Z01_200_SEHOY
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Sehoy
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCSehoyBaker
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 007BF4BC
#. ScriptNotes = Confused and heartbroken. [Spaceship] / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Go home.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Go home.
#. DialogueAfter = companion: Perhaps Gabrielle can finally be at peace now. I just hope Sehoy can find it one day too.
#. EDID: [01035304]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001305"
msgid "R-Right. I... I will. If you come across her again, please, tell her I'm waiting."
msgstr "그-그렇군요. 저... 그렇게 할게요. 다시 그녀를 만나면, 제발 제가 기다리고 있다고 전해주세요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_Z01
#. SceneName = SFFL_Z01_200_SEHOY
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Sehoy
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCSehoyBaker
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00B7B319
#. ScriptNotes = Shocked and confused as to why her wife wouldn't want to be found. [Spaceship] / to Player Default
#. Prompt = [Lie] I found her, but she said she can't go home yet.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: [Lie] I did. But she didn't want to be found.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: She didn't say. I'm sorry.
#. EDID: [010352F9]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001306"
msgid "What? Why wouldn't she want to be found? No. That doesn't make sense."
msgstr "뭐라고요? 왜 발견되길 원하지 않겠어요? 아니요. 말이 안 돼요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_Z01
#. SceneName = SFFL_Z01_120_SEHOY
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Sehoy
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCSehoyBaker
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0056CCB6
#. ScriptNotes = Trying to calm herself to plead to the Player to help her. [Spaceship] / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Space travel can take quite a while. I'm sure she's fine.
#. EDID: [010352FB]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001307"
msgid "Just, if you do find her out there, let her know Sehoy is looking for her. Tell my love to come home."
msgstr "그냥, 혹시 밖에서 그녀를 찾게 되면 세호이가 그녀를 찾고 있다고 알려주세요. 내 사랑에게 집으로 돌아오라고 전해주세요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_Z01
#. SceneName = SFFL_Z01_120_SEHOY
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Sehoy
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCSehoyBaker
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00F5BCB2
#. ScriptNotes = Worried and nervous. [Spaceship] / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Space travel can take quite a while. I'm sure she's fine.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Space travel can take quite a while. I'm sure she's fine.
#. EDID: [010352FB]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001308"
msgid "But what if she isn't? She should have been home long ago. I can't keep waiting on what if's."
msgstr "하지만 아니면요? 벌써 오래전에 집에 왔어야 해요. 만약이라는 말만 믿고 계속 기다릴 수는 없어요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_Z01
#. SceneName = SFFL_Z01_300_COMPANION
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = companion
#. VoiceType = NPCFSarahMorgan
#. Face = Spaceship / Confident
#. SoundFileID = 0070A7EF
#. ScriptNotes = Player lied to Sehoy, but she didn't believe the Player. Disappointed in the player for lying and prolonging the woman's heartbreak. [Spaceship]
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: It's just what she said. That's all I know. &&& Sehoy: That can't be right... I'm sorry. I have to find her.
#. EDID: [01056633]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001309"
msgid "You weren't much help there, were you? Why did you try to lie? You should have just told her the truth."
msgstr "별 도움이 안 됐네, 그렇지? 왜 거짓말하려고 했어? 그냥 진실을 말했어야지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_Z01
#. SceneName = SFFL_Z01_300_COMPANION
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = companion
#. VoiceType = NPCMSamCoe
#. Face = Spaceship / Confident
#. SoundFileID = 00AC7F9F
#. ScriptNotes = Player lied to Sehoy, but she didn't believe the Player. Disappointed in the player for lying and prolonging the woman's heartbreak. [Spaceship]
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: It's just what she said. That's all I know. &&& Sehoy: That can't be right... I'm sorry. I have to find her.
#. EDID: [01056632]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00130A"
msgid "Looks like she's smarter than you gave her credit for. Shame she still doesn't know the truth."
msgstr "네가 생각한 것보다 똑똑한 모양이군. 아직도 진실을 모른다는 게 안타깝지만."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_Z01
#. SceneName = SFFL_Z01_300_COMPANION
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = companion
#. VoiceType = NPCMBarrett
#. Face = Spaceship / Confident
#. SoundFileID = 00135FEC
#. ScriptNotes = Player lied to Sehoy, but she didn't believe the Player. Disappointed in the player for lying and prolonging the woman's heartbreak. [Spaceship]
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: It's just what she said. That's all I know. &&& Sehoy: That can't be right... I'm sorry. I have to find her.
#. EDID: [0105662F]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00130B"
msgid "What did you hope to accomplish by telling her that? Poor woman is going to be searching until she finds Gabrielle herself now."
msgstr "그런 말을 해서 뭘 이루고 싶었던 거야? 불쌍한 여자는 이제 가브리엘을 직접 찾을 때까지 계속 찾아다니겠지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_Z01
#. SceneName = SFFL_Z01_300_COMPANION
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = companion
#. VoiceType = NPCFAndreja
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00E2AB1A
#. ScriptNotes = Player lied to Sehoy, but she didn't believe the Player. Disappointed in the player for lying and prolonging the woman's heartbreak. [Spaceship]
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: It's just what she said. That's all I know. &&& Sehoy: That can't be right... I'm sorry. I have to find her.
#. EDID: [0105662B]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00130C"
msgid "What was the point in telling her that? Now she'll never end her search."
msgstr "그런 말을 해서 무슨 의미가 있었어? 이제 그 여자는 절대 수색을 끝내지 않을 거야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_Z01
#. SceneName = SFFL_Z01_200_SEHOY
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Sehoy
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 002F5ACE
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Sehoy: You're back! Did you find Gabrielle? Please, tell me you've found her.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: That can't be right... I'm sorry. I have to find her.
#. EDID: [010565F7]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00130D"
msgid "It's just what she said. That's all I know."
msgstr "그냥 그 사람이 말한 그대로야. 내가 아는 건 그게 전부야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_Z01
#. SceneName = SFFL_Z01_200_SEHOY
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Sehoy
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00DE09CE
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Sehoy: You're back! Did you find Gabrielle? Please, tell me you've found her.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: No... No. I can't. I have to find her. I have to.
#. EDID: [010565F5]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00130E"
msgid "I think you should just go home."
msgstr "그냥 집에 가는 게 좋겠어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_Z01
#. SceneName = SFFL_Z01_125_SEHOY
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Sehoy
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0009BB05
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Sehoy: You again? Please tell me you've seen Gabrielle.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Wait! Please! Dammit...
#. EDID: [01056606]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00130F"
msgid "No. And I don't have time to look."
msgstr "아니. 그리고 찾을 시간도 없어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_Z01
#. SceneName = SFFL_Z01_125_SEHOY
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Sehoy
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCSehoyBaker
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00C143D8
#. ScriptNotes = Thankful that the Player has had a change of heart to help her. / to Player Default
#. Prompt = I haven't. But I will keep an eye out.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I haven't. But I will keep an eye out.
#. EDID: [010565F2]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001310"
msgid "Thank you... Please. If you see her, tell her Sehoy is looking for her."
msgstr "고마워요... 제발. 그녀를 보면 세호이가 찾고 있다고 전해주세요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_Z01
#. SceneName = SFFL_Z01_125_SEHOY
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Sehoy
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCSehoyBaker
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00FCBF82
#. ScriptNotes = Surprised the Player has returned to her. But still pleads if they have seen Gabrielle. [Spaceship] / to Player Default
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: If you haven't found her yet, then I guess I can help.
#. EDID: [0105660C]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001311"
msgid "You again? Please tell me you've seen Gabrielle."
msgstr "또 당신인가요? 제발 가브리엘을 봤다고 말해주세요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_Z01
#. SceneName = SFFL_Z01_125_SEHOY
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Sehoy
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00CF7F1F
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Sehoy: You again? Please tell me you've seen Gabrielle.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Thank you... Please. If you see her, tell her Sehoy is looking for her.
#. EDID: [010565FC]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001312"
msgid "I haven't. But I will keep an eye out."
msgstr "아직 못 봤어요. 하지만 계속 찾아볼게요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_KT02_SailingHighSeas
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE_KT02_100b_HailingAnswered
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = HailingShip
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMGenericMale02
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 003B934F
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Yeah, what's a smithereen?
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Yeah, what's a smithereen?
#. DialogueAfter = HailingShip: My last words are "Hot Dogs are a sandwich."
#. EDID: [010388BE]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001313"
msgid "That's what you're gonna be, you bald-faced brigand!"
msgstr "그 꼴이 네가 될 거다, 뻔뻔한 도적놈아!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_KT02_SailingHighSeas
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE_KT02_100b_HailingAnswered
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = HailingShip
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMGenericMale02
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0053380B
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = HailingShip: Don't worry darlin, I'm going to have a word with our lawyers. |If these scammers think pirates are scary, they haven't met the team at Morgan, Locke, & Hartley.
#. EDID: [010388BF]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001314"
msgid "Damn straight. Well, thanks stranger. Appreciate you clearing things up."
msgstr "그야 당연하지. 아무튼 고맙네, 낯선 이. 오해를 풀어줘서 고마워."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_KT02_SailingHighSeas
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE_KT02_100b_HailingAnswered
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = HailingShip
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 008E5598
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = HailingShip: All right you dastardly pirate scum, answer the hail! &&& HailingShip: &&& HailingShip: Thanks for answering, you filthy little pirate! &&& HailingShip: Any last words before we blow you to smithereens?
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: That's what you're gonna be, you bald-faced brigand!
#. EDID: [010388B6]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001315"
msgid "Yeah, what's a smithereen?"
msgstr "그래, 산산조각이 뭔데?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_KT02_SailingHighSeas
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE_KT02_100b_HailingAnswered
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = AudioOnly
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMGenericMale02
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00C6A2D6
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = I didn't. You clearly got scammed.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I didn't. You clearly got scammed.
#. DialogueAfter = HailingShip: Don't worry darlin, I'm going to have a word with our lawyers.
#. EDID: [010388D6]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001316"
msgid "Scammed? Goddamnit! I knew it was too good to be true! I paid way more for the other hunts!"
msgstr "사기였다고? 젠장! 너무 좋다 싶더라니! 다른 사냥들에는 훨씬 더 많이 냈는데!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_KT02_SailingHighSeas
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE_KT02_100a_InitialScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = HailingShip
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMGenericMale02
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 001754BF
#. ScriptNotes = Rich executive paying 100,000 credits to hunt pirates
#. DialogueBefore = HailingShip: I agree, darling. This was far better use of our funds than another luxury cruise.
#. DialogueAfter = HailingShip: Oh look darling, I think I see one! Over there! Mr. guide man, do you think we should hail them?
#. EDID: [01031FAF]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001317"
msgid "Okay, I just need to figure out where the damn weapons system is."
