#. DialogueBefore = Actor01: I could always mix the drinks a little weaker.|Of course, the patrons don't like that overly much.|Maybe we should charge less for the drinks, at least until the quality improves. &&& Actor02: No, we should not.|Beverage sales are a staple of this operation. A pillar.|Dilute the drinks if you need to, but we won't be diluting our profits.
