msgid "And by the way, they have to do all that with spare parts and second-rate tools."
msgstr "게다가 대체 근무자가 예비 부품과 싸구려 공구만 가지고 그런 일들을 전부 해낼 수 있어야 한다고."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_Anchorpoint_RandConv01_ChanMaddie
#. SceneName = SFFL_Anchorpoint_RandConv01_Scene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Actor01
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFMaddieWing
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00A7C3CE
#. ScriptNotes = / to Actor02
#. EDID: [010316F6]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00131F"
msgid "You got someone who can replace faulty breakers, refurbish the air scrubbers or weld hull plates?"
msgstr "고장 난 차단기를 교체하고, 공기 정화기를 수리하고, 선체 판을 용접할 수 있는 사람이 또 있어?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_Anchorpoint_RandConv01_ChanMaddie
#. SceneName = SFFL_Anchorpoint_RandConv01_Scene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Actor01
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFMaddieWing
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00D5449C
#. ScriptNotes = / to Actor02
#. DialogueBefore = Actor01: About building you an army of robots?|Look, nobody would enjoy that more than me, but you know I ain't got time. &&& Actor02: I didn't say an army.|You know there's only a handful of us keeping this place safe.|Just a few bots could still make a big difference.
#. EDID: [010316F6]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001320"
msgid "And while I make your robot guards, who's going to keep this place running?"
msgstr "근데 당신네 로봇 경비대원을 내가 만드는 동안, 누가 여길 계속 굴러가게 관리하는데?"

