#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Give me something that I can say is proof that I killed you, then you need to get out of here and disappear. &&& CaptiveNPC: &&& CaptiveNPC: Wait, no! Don't do this! &&& CaptiveNPC: Please, just take my money. Those idiots took most of it, but I'll give you whatever I have left.
#. EDID: [01045E8F]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001340"
msgid "[Attack] Not interested. "
msgstr "[공격] 관심 없어. "

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R02
#. SceneName = SFFL_R02_TurnIn_ArbitratorMad
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = TheArbitrator
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R02_NPCMTheArbitrator
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 0011A2D4
#. ScriptNotes = A slight mocking undertone - any attempt at mercy the player tried will be undermined by you. You hold the power / Serious / to Player Default
#. EDID: [01044802]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001341"
msgid "You won't be receiving payment this time. Now get out of here."
msgstr "이번에는 보수를 받지 못할 거다. 이제 그만 가봐."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R02
#. SceneName = SFFL_R02_TurnIn_ArbitratorMad
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = TheArbitrator
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R02_NPCMTheArbitrator
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00687424
#. ScriptNotes = A slight mocking undertone - any attempt at mercy the player tried will be undermined by you. You hold the power / Serious / to Player Default
#. EDID: [01044802]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001342"
msgid "And about the target you let go, I'll see to it that they're killed."
msgstr "그리고 네가 놓아준 목표물은, 내가 반드시 죽일 거다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R02
#. SceneName = SFFL_R02_TurnIn_ArbitratorMad
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = TheArbitrator
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R02_NPCMTheArbitrator
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00E114B2
#. ScriptNotes = Serious / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = TheArbitrator: Not this time.
#. EDID: [01044802]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001343"
msgid "If this happens again and I find out, that will be the end of our dealings together. "
msgstr "또 이런 짓을 벌이면, 거래는 끝이다. "

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R02
#. SceneName = SFFL_R02_TL01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = TheArbitrator
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R02_NPCMTheArbitrator
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 0006D017
#. ScriptNotes = Serious
#. EDID: [01044801]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001344"
msgid "I'm paying you to kill people that I want dead. Whether or not they have a bounty on their head isn't my concern. "
msgstr "내가 죽이고 싶은 사람들을 죽이라고 너에게 돈을 주는 거다. 녀석들 머리에 현상금이 걸렸는지 아닌지는 관심 없다. "

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R02
#. SceneName = SFFL_R02_TL01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = TheArbitrator
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R02_NPCMTheArbitrator
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00966A8C
#. ScriptNotes = Serious
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: How is this any different than what the Trackers Alliance does?
#. EDID: [01044801]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001345"
msgid "I have nothing to do with the Trackers Alliance. This is a contract between you and me."
msgstr "나는 추적자 동맹과 아무 관련이 없다. 이 일은 너와 나 사이의 계약일 뿐이다."

