#. DialogueAfter = CaptiveNPC: Wait, no! Don't do this!
#. EDID: [010590EF]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001346"
msgid "Once I figure out how to get out of here, you'll never see me again. "
msgstr "여기서 빠져나갈 방법만 찾으면 돼. 그러면 내 얼굴 볼 일 없을 거야. "

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R02
#. SceneName = SFFL_R02_GeneralCaptiveNPC_Scene
