#. Prompt = No need to explain yourself. We've been through this before, you and I.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: No need to explain yourself. We've been through this before, you and I.
#. DialogueAfter = TheArbitrator: My intel shows the target is at this location. Take them out and bring me proof of the kill.
#. EDID: [01059AB9]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00134D"
msgid "If that's the case, I guess I'll skip the preamble. "
msgstr "그렇다면, 서론은 생략해야겠군."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R02
#. SceneName = SFFL_R02_GeneralNPC_Scene
