msgctxt "001360"
msgid "See Valeria for a drink. The prices are fair."
msgstr "발레리아를 찾아가서 한잔 즐겨 보시죠. 가격도 저렴합니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMRishiSaint
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRishiSaint
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 00493A44
#. ScriptNotes = Firm
#. EDID: [0102672D]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001361"
msgid "Keep to yourself and don't ask too many questions."
msgstr "당신 용무만 보시고, 질문은 너무 많이 하지 마시길 바랍니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMRishiSaint
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRishiSaint
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 00B98DC4
#. EDID: [01065749]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001362"
msgid "Welcome back. Maddie was hoping to talk to you. "
msgstr "돌아오셨군요. 매디가 당신과 얘기하고 싶어 했습니다. "

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCFMaddieWing
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFMaddieWing
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 000FEC98
#. ScriptNotes = A finger in the player's chest, back off. Firm but not angry.
#. EDID: [01026727]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001363"
msgid "Hey, you want to hang back a little? I don't like people invading my space."
msgstr "저기, 조금만 뒤로 물러서 줄래? 남이 내 영역 침범하는 거 싫거든."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMKillianBrice
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMKillianBrice
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 007DC9F6
#. ScriptNotes = Amused
#. EDID: [01026722]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001364"
msgid "It's said that a bargain is only fair when both sides are equally unhappy with it. I've always found that amusing."
msgstr "거래는 양쪽이 똑같이 불만족스러울 때만 공정하다고들 하지. 난 그 말이 늘 재미있더라."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMKillianBrice
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMKillianBrice
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00128413
#. ScriptNotes = Cool, measured
#. EDID: [01026721]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001365"
msgid "I'll consider any deal, but I make no promises about which ones I'll accept."
msgstr "어떤 거래든 검토는 하겠지만, 거래를 받아들일 거라 장담할 순 없다 이말이야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMCutty
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMCutty
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00026D82
#. ScriptNotes = Weary
#. EDID: [01026716]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001366"
msgid "*Sigh* Another day."
msgstr "*한숨* 또 하루가 시작됐군."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMChanHuang
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMChanHuang
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 00971063
#. ScriptNotes = Firm authority
#. EDID: [0102670E]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001367"
msgid "If you're looking to do some business, talk to Killian or Darcy."
msgstr "거래를 하고 싶으면 킬리언이나 다르시와 말해봐."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMChanHuang
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMChanHuang
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 00595571
#. ScriptNotes = Firm authority
#. EDID: [0102670C]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001368"
msgid "Firm, but fair. That's how we run this place."
msgstr "엄격하지만 공정하게. 우리가 이곳을 운영하는 방식이지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMGenericMale / NPCFGenericFemale
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMGenericMale02 / SFFL_NPCMGenericMale01 / SFFL_NPCFGenericFemale01 / SFFL_NPCFGenericFemale02
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 006602CE
#. ScriptNotes = Casual conversation
#. EDID: [01026706]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001369"
msgid "Sure, this place ain't fancy, but if you need to lay low, you can do a lot worse."
msgstr "그래, 이곳은 화려하진 않지만, 이 정도면 숨어 지내기엔 괜찮지. 이보다 훨씬 나쁜 곳도 많으니까."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCFGenericFemale / NPCMGenericMale
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFGenericFemale03 / SFFL_NPCFGenericFemale04 / SFFL_NPCMGenericMale03
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00873E84
#. ScriptNotes = Firm, a guard
#. EDID: [0104EDAE]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00136A"
msgid "If you're looking for supplies, talk to Killian and Darcy."
msgstr "보급품을 찾고 있다면 킬리언이나 다르시와 말하십쇼."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCFGenericFemale / NPCMGenericMale
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFGenericFemale03 / SFFL_NPCFGenericFemale04 / SFFL_NPCMGenericMale03
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0009D9CD
#. ScriptNotes = Firm, a guard
#. EDID: [0104EDAD]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00136B"
msgid "Mister Saint calls the shots, so stay on his good side."
msgstr "세인트 씨가 결정권자시니, 그분 눈 밖에 나지 마십쇼."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCFGenericFemale / NPCMGenericMale
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFGenericFemale03 / SFFL_NPCFGenericFemale04 / SFFL_NPCMGenericMale03
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 006C8292
#. ScriptNotes = Stern authority.
#. EDID: [01026701]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00136C"
msgid "Around here, we appreciate discretion."
msgstr "이 주변에서는 신중함을 높이 삽니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCFGenericFemale / NPCMGenericMale
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFGenericFemale03 / SFFL_NPCFGenericFemale04 / SFFL_NPCMGenericMale03
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00BF3762
#. EDID: [01065748]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00136D"
msgid "Oh, you're back. Killian wanted to see you."
msgstr "오, 돌아왔군. 킬리언이 널 보고 싶어 했어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMRishiSaint
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRishiSaint
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 003BAF82
#. ScriptNotes = The player has suddenly stopped talking mid-conversation. Are they okay?
#. EDID: [0104EDD5]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00136E"
msgid "Not to be impolite, but I'm a busy man."
msgstr "무례하게 굴려는 건 아니지만, 저는 바쁜 사람입니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCFMaddieWing
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFMaddieWing
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0047E28C
#. ScriptNotes = Impatient, sassy. The player has suddenly stopped talking mid-conversation. Are they okay?
#. EDID: [0104EDD3]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00136F"
msgid "Hey, I've got an idea. How about you get on with it?"
msgstr "어이, 좋은 생각이 있어. 이제 본론으로 들어가는 건 어때?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMKillianBrice
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMKillianBrice
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 004E6552
#. ScriptNotes = The player has suddenly stopped talking mid-conversation. Are they okay?
#. EDID: [0104EDCD]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001370"
msgid "Mulling over your options, I trust?"
msgstr "선택지를 곰곰이 따져보고 있는 거겠지?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCFDarcyWeber
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFDarcyWeber
#. Face = Nervous
#. SoundFileID = 009294FC
#. ScriptNotes = Amused. The player has suddenly stopped talking mid-conversation. Are they okay? Play for a laugh, Be dramatic.
#. EDID: [0104EDCB]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001371"
msgid "And just like that, with no warning, the customer entered a trance."
msgstr "갑자기, 예고도 없이, 눈앞의 손님이 그만 정신을 잃고 말았습니다. 그런 상황인 건가?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCFDarcyWeber
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFDarcyWeber
#. Face = Nervous
#. SoundFileID = 00F9A1CA
#. ScriptNotes = Nervous. The player has suddenly stopped talking mid-conversation. Are they okay?
#. EDID: [0104EDCA]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001372"
msgid "I get lost in my thoughts, too. A lot."
msgstr "나도 생각에 빠지곤 해. 자주."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMCutty
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMCutty
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 000C1C5C
#. ScriptNotes = Grumpy, impatient. The player has suddenly stopped talking mid-conversation. Are they okay?
#. EDID: [0104EDBF]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001373"
msgid "How many drinks have you had, exactly?"
msgstr "정확히 술을 몇 잔이나 마신 겁니까?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMCutty
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMCutty
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 003812DF
#. ScriptNotes = Grumpy, impatient. The player has suddenly stopped talking mid-conversation. Are they okay?
#. EDID: [0104EDBD]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001374"
msgid "Well?"
msgstr "그래서요?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMChanHuang
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMChanHuang
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 00E7A998
#. ScriptNotes = The player has suddenly stopped talking mid-conversation. Are they okay?
#. EDID: [0104EDB9]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001375"
msgid "Is something wrong?"
msgstr "무슨 문제라도 있나?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCFValeriaHahn
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFValeriaHahn
#. Face = Friendly
#. SoundFileID = 00ED7171
#. ScriptNotes = Friendly. Saying goodbye to the player, who has just departed mid- conversation. Light chuckle at the end.
#. EDID: [0104EDFD]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001376"
msgid "What is it Rishi likes to say? \"Good talk.\""
msgstr "리시는 뭐라고 하더라? \"좋은 대화였어.\""

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMRishiSaint
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRishiSaint
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 00E0E44C
#. ScriptNotes = Saying goodbye to the player, who has just departed mid-conversation.
#. EDID: [0104EDFB]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001377"
msgid "Rather abrupt, but all right."
msgstr "꽤 갑작스럽지만, 알겠습니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMKillianBrice
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMKillianBrice
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00E343C7
#. ScriptNotes = Saying goodbye to the player, who has just departed mid-conversation.
#. EDID: [0104EDF2]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001378"
msgid "Will that be all?"
msgstr "그게 전부인가?"

#. List: 2
#. EDID: [0102A537]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001379"
msgid "If you need medical attention, you can see Cutty, our resident physician."
msgstr "의료 처치가 필요하면, 이곳 상주 의사인 커티를 찾아가시면 됩니다."

#. List: 2
#. EDID: [0102A537]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00137A"
msgid "We have two vendors, Killian and Darcy, who offer a range of useful goods."
msgstr "저희에게는 유용한 물품을 다양하게 제공하는 상인 두 명, 킬리언과 다르시가 있습니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_RishiTL04_Services
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = RishiSaint
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRishiSaint
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 00C48BE5
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. EDID: [0102A537]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00137B"
msgid "Valeria runs the bar, which has a modest selection."
msgstr "발레리아가 술집을 운영합니다. 파는 술은 몇 종류 안 되지만요."

#. List: 2
#. EDID: [0102A537]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00137C"
msgid "Just the basic necessities, really. We're a small operation."
msgstr "정말 기본적인 필수품뿐입니다. 우리는 작은 조직이라서요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_RishiGreet
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = RishiSaint
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 004150B2
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I guess that's reasonable. &&& RishiSaint: I'm hardly asking for much. Just civil behavior.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Good. I suggest you make a habit of not prying.
#. EDID: [0102A517]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00137D"
msgid "I suspect there's more to it, but I won't pry."
msgstr "그 이상의 사정이 있는 것 같지만, 캐묻지는 않도록 하겠습니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_RishiGreet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMRishiSaint
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRishiSaint
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 004989DF
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Fair enough. Sorry to imply otherwise.
#. DialogueAfter = RishiSaint: I won't cause any trouble.
#. EDID: [0102A53E]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00137E"
msgid "Now, back to the matter at hand. I trust you understand the rules?"
msgstr "이제 본론으로 돌아가죠. 규칙은 이해하셨으리라 믿어도 되겠습니까?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_RishiGreet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMRishiSaint
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRishiSaint
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 00DC1F7E
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Fair enough. Sorry to imply otherwise.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Fair enough. Sorry to imply otherwise.
#. EDID: [0102A53E]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00137F"
msgid "You're not the first person to make an incorrect assumption about this place."
msgstr "이곳에 대해 잘못된 추측을 한 건 당신 뿐만이 아닙니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_RishiGreet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = RishiSaint
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRishiSaint
#. Face = Stern
#. SoundFileID = 00BDCA59
#. ScriptNotes = Stern / to Player Default
#. Prompt = I'm not exactly great with rules.
#. DialogueAfter = RishiSaint: Unless you have any questions, I'll leave you to it.
#. EDID: [0102A530]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001380"
msgid "But if you find you can't handle them, feel free to leave before things become... unpleasant."
msgstr "하지만 감당할 수 없겠다 싶으시면... 불쾌한 일이 벌어지기 전에 떠나셔도 좋습니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_RishiGreet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = RishiSaint
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRishiSaint
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 00A3C0EF
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = I'm not exactly great with rules.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I'm not exactly great with rules.
#. EDID: [0102A530]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001381"
msgid "There are only a few, I'm sure you'll manage."
msgstr "규칙이래봤자 몇 개뿐이니, 잘 해내실 거라 믿습니다."

#. List: 2
#. EDID: [0102A51B]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001382"
msgid "Thanks. I'll have a look around."
msgstr "고마워요. 한번 둘러볼게요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_RishiGreet
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = RishiSaint
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00F66F5F
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I heard you talking. Got some kind of trouble with Spacers? &&& RishiSaint: One of the guests, a Spacer, was causing trouble. We locked him up so he could sleep off his drink.|His friends didn't take kindly to it, and stormed out.|Now it seems they're coming back to teach us a lesson.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Bold words.
#. EDID: [0102A52B]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001383"
msgid "I wouldn't worry, Spacers aren't that much of a threat."
msgstr "걱정하지 않아도 됩니다. 스페이서들은 그렇게 크게 위협적이진 않습니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_RishiGreet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = RishiSaint
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRishiSaint
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 00B58C87
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = A man who remembers faces must have a reason for doing so.
#. DialogueAfter = RishiSaint: A few words of advice.
#. EDID: [0102A51F]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001384"
msgid "If it also encourages them to spend a few more credits, all the better."
msgstr "고객들을 환영해서 크레딧을 조금 더 쓰도록 부추길 수 있다면 더 좋고요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_RishiGreet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = RishiSaint
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRishiSaint
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 000180E7
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = A man who remembers faces must have a reason for doing so.
#. EDID: [0102A51F]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001385"
msgid "Making people feel welcome is the best way to get them to come back."
msgstr "사람들이 환영받는다고 느끼게 만드는 게 고객들이 다시 오게 만드는 가장 좋은 방법입니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_RishiGreet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = RishiSaint
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRishiSaint
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 000C4D68
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = A man who remembers faces must have a reason for doing so.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: A man who remembers faces must have a reason for doing so.
#. EDID: [0102A51F]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001386"
msgid "Commerce is my reason. "
msgstr "상업 활동을 위해서지요. "

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_RishiGreet
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = RishiSaint
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0012ED03
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = The station was built over eighty years ago by a wealthy industrialist named Gabriela LeBlanc..|She had hoped it would be a jumping-off point to remote systems not yet accessible by grav drive.|Unfortunately, the advances she expected in grav jump technology never materialized.|As a result, the station never realized its purpose and was eventually abandoned.|A few years ago, I purchased it and had it towed out of its decaying orbit around Algorab II. &&& RishiSaint: I make it a point to remember every face that boards this station.|Yours is a new one.|Welcome to Anchorpoint. I'm Rishi Saint, the owner of this establishment.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: A place to rest, refuel and stock up on supplies while enjoying a little privacy.
#. EDID: [0102A531]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001387"
msgid "What kind of an establishment is this, exactly?"
msgstr "여긴 정확히 어떤 시설이죠?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_RishiGreet
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0087A552
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = The station was built over eighty years ago by a wealthy industrialist named Gabriela LeBlanc..|She had hoped it would be a jumping-off point to remote systems not yet accessible by grav drive.|Unfortunately, the advances she expected in grav jump technology never materialized.|As a result, the station never realized its purpose and was eventually abandoned.|A few years ago, I purchased it and had it towed out of its decaying orbit around Algorab II. &&& RishiSaint: I make it a point to remember every face that boards this station.|Yours is a new one.|Welcome to Anchorpoint. I'm Rishi Saint, the owner of this establishment.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: That's not by accident.
#. EDID: [0102A51A]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001388"
msgid "This place is pretty remote."
msgstr "여긴 꽤 외진 곳에 있네요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_MaddieGreet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = MaddieWing
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFMaddieWing
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00CA7CCE
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = That doesn't sound very safe.
#. DialogueAfter = MaddieWing: Name's Maddie. I keep the place running.
#. EDID: [0102C012]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001389"
msgid "Course you'll have to live under the boot. Ain't a trade I'd make, but that's me."
msgstr "물론 억압당하며 살아야겠지만. 나라면 절대 그렇게는 안 살아. 물론 내 경우는 그렇다는 거야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_MaddieGreet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = MaddieWing
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFMaddieWing
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00D1400E
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = That doesn't sound very safe.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: That doesn't sound very safe.
#. EDID: [0102C012]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00138A"
msgid "You want safe, get a place in New Atlantis."
msgstr "안전한 걸 원한다면 뉴아틀란티스에나 가셔."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_MaddieGreet
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = MaddieWing
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00F6BBB9
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I'll be careful. &&& MaddieWing: You better.|Got enough on my hands without having to clean up after fools who start poking and prodding things.|Had a trader in here last week who leaned on a pipe when the sealant was still drying.|Knocked the damn thing loose and sprayed hot water all over himself. &&& MaddieWing: Name's Maddie. I keep the place running.|Always had a knack for machines. Good thing, too.|If it wasn't for me, everyone would have been sucked out into space cause we lost a wall.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Some ignorant dusty got careless while he was docking.
#. EDID: [0102C02A]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00138B"
msgid "You almost lost an entire wall?"
msgstr "벽 한쪽이 통째로 날아갈 뻔했다고?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_RishiTL04_Services
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00924CB8
#. ScriptNotes = / to RishiSaint
#. DialogueAfter = RishiSaint: Just the basics, really. We're a small operation.
#. EDID: [0102C018]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00138C"
msgid "What services are offered here?"
msgstr "여기서는 어떤 서비스를 제공하죠?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_MaddieGreet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = MaddieWing
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFMaddieWing
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00D22627
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = What do you mean by "barely holding together?"
#. DialogueAfter = MaddieWing: I'll be careful.
#. EDID: [0102C01B]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00138D"
msgid "That full-time job belongs to me."
msgstr "내가 유지보수 일에 매달리고 있단 뜻이지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_MaddieGreet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = MaddieWing
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFMaddieWing
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00882209
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = What do you mean by "barely holding together?"
#. EDID: [0102C01B]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00138E"
msgid "It's a full-time job making sure everything works around here. "
msgstr "내가 유지보수 일에 매달리고 있어서 이 주변의 모든 게 제대로 돌아가는 거야. "

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_MaddieGreet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = MaddieWing
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFMaddieWing
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00B6E19E
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = What do you mean by "barely holding together?"
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: What do you mean by "barely holding together?"
#. EDID: [0102C01B]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00138F"
msgid "In case you ain't noticed, this place is old. Like, real old."
msgstr "눈치 못 챘다면 말해두겠는데, 이곳은 낡았어. 아주 많이 낡았지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_MaddieGreet
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = MaddieWing
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0064B9DF
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = MaddieWing: You new around here? Well don't break anything.|Place is barely holding together as it is.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: You want safe, get a place in New Atlantis.
#. EDID: [0102C02C]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001390"
msgid "That doesn't sound very safe."
msgstr "여기 안전해 보이질 않는데."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_RishiTL02_History
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = RishiSaint
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRishiSaint
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 00DFB3AC
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: You had it towed? That couldn't have been cheap.
#. EDID: [0102C017]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001391"
msgid "I found it in a decaying orbit around Algorab II and had it towed here, into the Free Lanes."
msgstr "알고라브 II 주변의 추락 궤도에서 발견해서 이곳 자유 항로로 견인해 왔습니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_RishiTL02_History
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = RishiSaint
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRishiSaint
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 008417A5
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. EDID: [0102C017]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001392"
msgid "I stumbled across a reference in some old business records and came for a look."
msgstr "오래된 사업 기록에서 언급된 걸 우연히 발견하고 찾기 시작했죠."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_RishiTL02_History
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = RishiSaint
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRishiSaint
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 0092FFCC
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. EDID: [0102C017]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001393"
msgid "When the expected advances in Grav Drive technology didn't happen, the station was abandoned and forgotten."
msgstr "중력 구동기 기술이 기대했던 만큼 발전되지 않자, 이 우주정거장은 버려져 잊히고 말았습니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_RishiTL02_History
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = RishiSaint
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRishiSaint
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 005465FB
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. EDID: [0102C017]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001394"
msgid "The intent was to create a jumping-off point to star systems not yet accessible by grav jump."
msgstr "중력 도약으로 아직 접근할 수 없는 항성계로 가는 출발점을 만들려는 의도로 세워졌죠."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_RishiTL02_History
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = RishiSaint
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRishiSaint
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 0068E028
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: What's the history of this place?
#. EDID: [0102C017]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001395"
msgid "The station was built over eighty years ago as part of a failed business venture."
msgstr "이 정거장은 80여 년 전, 실패로 끝난 어떤 사업 계획의 일환으로 건설되었습니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_ValeriaTL03_Background
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = ValeriaHahn
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFValeriaHahn
#. Face = Friendly
#. SoundFileID = 00EF13BD
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = What kind of illness does Gabriel suffer from?
#. DialogueAfter = ValeriaHahn: That's very generous.
#. EDID: [01031423]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001396"
msgid "Apparently he was the only one who caught it. Rotten luck, I guess."
msgstr "겉보기엔 그 사람만 걸린 모양이야. 운이 지독히 나빴던 거겠지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_ValeriaTL03_Background
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = ValeriaHahn
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFValeriaHahn
#. Face = Friendly
#. SoundFileID = 00167F83
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = What kind of illness does Gabriel suffer from?
#. EDID: [01031423]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001397"
msgid "Mister Saint explained it, but I don't have any background in medicine so most of it went over my head."
msgstr "세인트 씨가 설명해주긴 했지만, 의학 지식이 없어서 대부분 이해하지 못했어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_ValeriaTL03_Background
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = ValeriaHahn
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFValeriaHahn
#. Face = Friendly
#. SoundFileID = 00858577
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = What kind of illness does Gabriel suffer from?
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: What kind of illness does Gabriel suffer from?
#. EDID: [01031423]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001398"
msgid "It's some kind of alien pathogen. It was attacking his nervous system."
msgstr "외계 병원체에 감염됐어. 가브리엘의 신경계를 공격했지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_ValeriaTL03_Background
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = ValeriaHahn
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 006DB42B
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: What brought you all the way out here? &&& ValeriaHahn: I have a son, Gabriel. He became very ill and I just couldn't afford the treatment.|I'd met Mister Saint while I was tending bar at the Astral Lounge.|He tried to hire me for this place, but I said no. It was just so remote.|When he learned about my son's illness, he said he'd pay the bills on the condition I work here.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: It's kind of the way Neon works. Everything comes at a cost.
#. EDID: [01031410]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001399"
msgid "Sounds to me like Rishi took advantage of you."
msgstr "내가 보기엔 리시가 당신 처지를 이용한 것 같은데."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_ValeriaTL01_Vend
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = ValeriaHahn
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFValeriaHahn
#. Face = Friendly
#. SoundFileID = 003AA85A
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Let's see what you've got.
#. EDID: [01031436]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00139A"
msgid "Here you go."
msgstr "자, 여기."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_ValeriaTL03_Background
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 003E48B9
#. ScriptNotes = / to ValeriaHahn
#. DialogueAfter = ValeriaHahn: I have a son, Gabriel. He became very ill and I just couldn't afford the treatment.
#. EDID: [0103142E]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00139B"
msgid "What brought you all the way out here?"
msgstr "이 먼 곳까지는 무슨 일로 오셨죠?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_DarcyGreet
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = DarcyWeber
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 007C6308
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = DarcyWeber: The ship that just docked, that was you, right?|You must be relieved to have made it here safe and sound.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: This area? Well, if you mean the Algorab system then maybe.
#. EDID: [01031415]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00139C"
msgid "Why are you surprised I'm safe? Is this area dangerous?"
msgstr "내가 무사한 게 왜 놀라운데? 이 구역이 그렇게 위험해?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_DarcyTL01Vend
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = DarcyWeber
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFDarcyWeber
#. Face = Nervous
#. SoundFileID = 000EDF74
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I'd like to see what you have in stock.
#. EDID: [01031706]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00139D"
msgid "Okay."
msgstr "알겠어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_KillianTL02Job
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = KillianBrice
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMKillianBrice
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00CFA55D
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = What did you do to land in jail?
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: What did you do to land in jail?
#. DialogueAfter = KillianBrice: Good thing he was there for you.
#. EDID: [01031FCE]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00139E"
msgid "That's a personal matter, and I'm not inclined to discuss it with you."
msgstr "개인적인 문제라, 그쪽과 얘기하고 싶지 않군."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_KillianTL02Job
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 003C8D44
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: How did you get this job? &&& KillianBrice: I previously worked with the station's owner, Rishi Saint.|There was some unfortunate business involving my accounting duties with the Vanguard, and I served some time.|When I got out, Rishi approached me with a job opportunity.|It was the best of a very limited set of options.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Nobody else was.
#. EDID: [01031FD3]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00139F"
msgid "Good thing he was there for you."
msgstr "리시 씨가 있어서 다행이었네."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_KillianTL02Job
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = KillianBrice
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00CECFA6
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: How did you get this job? &&& KillianBrice: I previously worked with the station's owner, Rishi Saint.|There was some unfortunate business involving my accounting duties with the Vanguard, and I served some time.|When I got out, Rishi approached me with a job opportunity.|It was the best of a very limited set of options.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: I wasn't in a position to negotiate, but I wouldn't say I was treated unfairly.
#. EDID: [01031FC7]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0013A0"
msgid "I'm guessing he got you cheap, given your circumstances."
msgstr "그쪽 처지를 보고선 싸게 부려먹으려 했나 보네."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_KillianTL02Job
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = KillianBrice
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMKillianBrice
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00889E11
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Good thing he was there for you.
#. EDID: [01031FC8]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0013A1"
msgid "It was the best of a very limited set of options."
msgstr "선택지가 없던 상황이라, 그때는 이게 최선이었어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_KillianTL02Job
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = KillianBrice
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMKillianBrice
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00A81FEF
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. EDID: [01031FC8]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0013A2"
msgid "When I got out, Rishi approached me with a job opportunity."
msgstr "출소했을 때, 리시가 일자리를 제안했지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_KillianTL02Job
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = KillianBrice
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMKillianBrice
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00C4A6E8
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. EDID: [01031FC8]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0013A3"
msgid "There was some unfortunate business involving my accounting duties with the Vanguard, and I served some time."
msgstr "뱅가드에서 회계 업무를 맡다가 불미스러운 일이 좀 있었고, 징역을 살았지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_KillianTL02Job
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = KillianBrice
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMKillianBrice
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00D60626
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: How did you get this job?
#. EDID: [01031FC8]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0013A4"
msgid "I previously worked with the station's owner, Rishi Saint."
msgstr "전에 이 우주정거장 주인인 리시 세인트와 같이 일했어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_MaddieTL04_Quest
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = MaddieWing
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFMaddieWing
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00D6D306
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Tough break for you, then.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Tough break for you, then.
#. DialogueAfter = MaddieWing: How about I quit wasting both of our time, and just level with you?
#. EDID: [0103716E]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0013A5"
msgid "What you call a tough break, I call an opportunity. Your opportunity."
msgstr "네 눈엔 이게 불운으로 보이나 본데, 내 눈엔 기회로 보여. 너에겐 기회잖아."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_MaddieTL04_Quest
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00EB9316
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: A job? I'm listening. &&& MaddieWing: That's right.|Tiger here's in need of some upgrades.|Thing is, I don't have the parts.|Now, the parts I'm talking about ain't your standard items. |I want the cutting edge stuff. Prototypes. Parts that ain't even on the market yet.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Well ain't you smart?
#. EDID: [01037166]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0013A6"
msgid "And you need me to acquire some of these prototype robot parts."
msgstr "그리고 그 로봇 부품 시제품을 내가 구해 와야 한다는 거군."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_CuttyTL03Quest
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Cutty
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMCutty
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00CAFDFF
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = I'm available for hire, if you can put up the credits.
#. DialogueAfter = Cutty: There's one more thing.
#. EDID: [010404A5]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0013A7"
msgid "By the time you get back, I'll have your money."
msgstr "당신이 돌아올 때쯤엔 돈을 마련해 두죠."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_CuttyTL03Quest
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Cutty
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMCutty
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00F50BCE
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = I'm available for hire, if you can put up the credits.
#. EDID: [010404A5]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0013A8"
msgid "But I give you my word I'll pay you fairly."
msgstr "하지만 공정하게 보수는 지급하겠다고 약속하죠."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_CuttyTL03Quest
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Cutty
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMCutty
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00138050
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = I'm available for hire, if you can put up the credits.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I'm available for hire, if you can put up the credits.
#. EDID: [010404A5]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0013A9"
msgid "Look, I'm not exactly swimming in credits here."
msgstr "봐요, 여기 크레딧이 넘쳐나는 상황은 아니거든요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_CuttyTL03Quest
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Cutty
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMCutty
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 008CAB93
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = There's no need to be defensive.
#. DialogueAfter = Cutty: It's my son Miles. He's a cargo pilot. Makes some dangerous runs.
#. EDID: [010404A8]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0013AA"
msgid "I shouldn't be taking it out on you."
msgstr "당신한테 화풀이하려던 건 아니었어요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_CuttyTL03Quest
