#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: There's no need to be defensive.
#. EDID: [010404A8]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0013AB"
msgid "*Sigh* Yeah, I guess you're right."
msgstr "*한숨* 예, 당신 말이 맞는 것 같습니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_CuttyTL03Quest
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
