#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: *Sigh* No, don't be. It's not you.
#. EDID: [010404A3]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0013AC"
msgid "Sorry, no offense intended."
msgstr "미안해요. 기분 나쁘게 하려던 건 아니었어요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_CuttyTL03Quest
