#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Are you okay? You seem to be in a bad mood.
#. EDID: [01040487]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0013AF"
msgid "Yeah? Well I just got some bad news."
msgstr "그래요? 예... 방금 안 좋은 소식을 들었거든요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_KillianGreet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = KillianBrice
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMKillianBrice
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 002696F4
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = I'll think about it.
#. EDID: [01047150]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0013B0"
msgid "Retrieve the cargo, and your credits will be right here waiting for you."
msgstr "화물을 회수해 와. 크레딧은 여기서 줄게."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_KillianGreet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = KillianBrice
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMKillianBrice
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00DA0386
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = I'll think about it.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I'll think about it.
#. EDID: [01047150]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0013B1"
msgid "I'll give you the coordinates, and you can do whatever you like with them."
msgstr "좌표는 넘겨줄 테니, 마음대로 해."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_KillianGreet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = KillianBrice
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMKillianBrice
#. Face = Friendly
#. SoundFileID = 00415BE8
#. ScriptNotes = Sly smile, setting up to ask for something / Friendly / to Player Default
#. Prompt = I'm not really looking to buy anything right now.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I'm not really looking to buy anything right now.
#. DialogueAfter = KillianBrice: I have a network of buyers interested in obtaining rare and dangerous chemical compounds.
#. EDID: [01045E60]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0013B2"
msgid "Then perhaps I can interest you in a unique opportunity."
msgstr "그렇다면 아주 솔깃해할 만한 특별한 기회를 하나 제안해 볼까 하는데."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_KillianGreet
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = KillianBrice
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00CA19C8
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I'm <Alias=Player>. Good to meet you. &&& KillianBrice: Likewise. And may I say, your timing is fortunate. &&& KillianBrice: I have a network of buyers interested in obtaining rare and dangerous chemical compounds.|Being controlled substances, a permit is required to transport the compounds.|Of course, for the resourceful ship's captain, there are always other options. &&& companion: By which he no doubt means a ship's captain willing to risk breaking the law.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: It's bad for business to ask such questions, but it's not hard to guess.
#. EDID: [01047147]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0013B3"
msgid "What exactly are your buyers planning to do with these chemicals?"
msgstr "구매자들은 이 화학물질로 대체 뭘 하는 거지?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_KillianGreet
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0069F376
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I'm <Alias=Player>. Good to meet you. &&& KillianBrice: Likewise. And may I say, your timing is fortunate. &&& KillianBrice: I have a network of buyers interested in obtaining rare and dangerous chemical compounds.|Being controlled substances, a permit is required to transport the compounds.|Of course, for the resourceful ship's captain, there are always other options. &&& companion: By which he no doubt means a ship's captain willing to risk breaking the law.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Not quite. There's a little more to it.
#. EDID: [0104714A]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0013B4"
msgid "So you need a smuggler."
msgstr "그러니까 밀수업자가 필요하다 이거군."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_KillianGreet
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = KillianBrice
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00EEFEFD
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I'm <Alias=Player>. Good to meet you. &&& KillianBrice: Likewise. And may I say, your timing is fortunate. &&& KillianBrice: I have a network of buyers interested in obtaining rare and dangerous chemical compounds.|Being controlled substances, a permit is required to transport the compounds.|Of course, for the resourceful ship's captain, there are always other options. &&& companion: By which he no doubt means a ship's captain willing to risk breaking the law.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: I assure you, the reward is more than equal to the risk.
#. EDID: [01047143]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0013B5"
msgid "For work like that, the credits better be great."
msgstr "그런 일이라면 크레딧을 아주 두둑이 쳐줘야겠는데."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_RishiTL02_History
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = RishiSaint
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00C7633D
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: What's the history of this place? &&& RishiSaint: The station was built over eighty years ago as part of a failed business venture.|The intent was to create a jumping-off point to star systems not yet accessible by grav jump.|When the expected advances in Grav Drive technology didn't happen, the station was abandoned and forgotten.|I stumbled across a reference in some old business records and came for a look.|I found it in a decaying orbit around Algorab II and had it towed here, into the Free Lanes.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: A wealthy industrialist named Gabriella LeBlanc.
#. EDID: [010516D0]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0013B6"
msgid "Who was it that built Anchorpoint originally?"
msgstr "처음에 앵커포인트를 지은 사람이 누구였죠?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_KillianGreet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = KillianBrice
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMKillianBrice
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00CE1E74
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player
#. DialogueAfter = companion: By which he no doubt means a ship's captain willing to risk breaking the law.
#. EDID: [0104713F]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0013B7"
msgid "Of course, for the resourceful ship's captain, there are always other options."
msgstr "물론, 수완 좋은 선장이라면, 언제나 또 다른 대안을 마련하지만."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_KillianGreet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = KillianBrice
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMKillianBrice
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00293F5E
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player
#. EDID: [0104713F]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0013B8"
msgid "Being controlled substances, a permit is required to transport the compounds."
msgstr "규제 물질이라서, 그 화합물들을 운송하려면 허가증이 필요하지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_KillianGreet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = KillianBrice
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMKillianBrice
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00AA0712
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player
#. DialogueBefore = KillianBrice: Likewise. And may I say, your timing is fortunate.
#. EDID: [0104713F]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0013B9"
msgid "I have a network of buyers interested in obtaining rare and dangerous chemical compounds."
msgstr "희귀하고 위험한 화합물을 구하려는 구매자들의 거래망이 있어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_ValeriaTL03_Background
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = companion
#. VoiceType = NPCFSarahMorgan
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 00C5FCF3
#. ScriptNotes = / to ValeriaHahn
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: That's very generous. &&& ValeriaHahn: It might seem that way, but he's making a tidy profit.|I had to agree to pay ten percent extra as interest.|What choice did I have?
#. DialogueAfter = ValeriaHahn: Now that I've told you my life's story, how about a drink?
#. EDID: [01052F34]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0013BA"
msgid "It seems Mister Saint is quite the opportunist."
msgstr "세인트 씨는 꽤 기회주의자인 것 같군요."

#. List: 2
#. EDID: [01052F2F]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0013BB"
msgid "*Chuckle* Touché."
msgstr "*킥킥 웃음* 한 방 먹었군요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_RishiTL02_History
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = RishiSaint
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRishiSaint
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 002D8D94
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Who was it that built Anchorpoint originally?
#. DialogueAfter = RishiSaint: You had it towed? That couldn't have been cheap.
#. EDID: [010516D1]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0013BC"
msgid "I wish she were here to see that I'm trying to salvage something of that dream."
msgstr "르블랑이 여기 있어서 제가 그 꿈의 일부라도 건져 보려 하는 모습을 봤으면 좋겠습니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_RishiTL02_History
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = RishiSaint
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRishiSaint
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 009E3FF0
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Who was it that built Anchorpoint originally?
#. EDID: [010516D1]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0013BD"
msgid "Alas, despite its impressive capabilities, even Grav Drive has its limits."
msgstr "아쉽게도, 중력 구동기가 아무리 뛰어나도 한계가 있습니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_RishiTL02_History
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = RishiSaint
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRishiSaint
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 00ACFE07
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Who was it that built Anchorpoint originally?
#. EDID: [010516D1]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0013BE"
msgid "She was a true visionary. Her dream was to usher in the next great chapter of interstellar exploration."
msgstr "르블랑은 진정한 선지자였지요. 르블랑의 꿈은 성간 탐사의 다음 위대한 장을 여는 것이었죠."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_RishiTL02_History
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = RishiSaint
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRishiSaint
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 00064445
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Who was it that built Anchorpoint originally?
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Who was it that built Anchorpoint originally?
#. EDID: [010516D1]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0013BF"
msgid "A wealthy industrialist named Gabriella LeBlanc."
msgstr "가브리엘라 르블랑이라는 부유한 기업가였죠."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_MaddieTL02_Background
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = MaddieWing
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFMaddieWing
#. Face = Sarcastic
#. SoundFileID = 00D51E65
#. ScriptNotes = Mix of sarcasm and regret. Kind of mocking yourself. / Sarcastic / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Stealing from cargo ships? You must have been pretty resourceful to pull that off.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Stealing from cargo ships? You must have been pretty resourceful to pull that off.
#. DialogueAfter = MaddieWing: Anyway, I busted myself out, stowed away aboard a courier ship and spent a few years on the lam.
#. EDID: [01052F2B]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0013C0"
msgid "Oh sure, I was real resourceful, until the day I wasn't resourceful enough."
msgstr "아, 물론이지. 정말 재주가 좋았어. 재주가 부족했던 그날 전까진."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_RishiGreet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = companion
#. VoiceType = NPCFSarahMorgan
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 00AA5760
#. ScriptNotes = Skeptical / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Don't you worry, I'll handle the Spacers. &&& RishiSaint: Really? |I believe in fair pay for a job well done.|Deal with these Spacers, and I'll provide the credits.|My head of security can point you in the right direction. &&& RishiSaint: A few words of advice.|We're happy to welcome all who pass through the airlock, but our hospitality has limits.|Acts of theft or violence will be met with a swift response.|We also value privacy and discretion here.|Our patrons expect to conduct whatever business they wish free from prying eyes and ears.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: I won't cause any trouble.
#. EDID: [010516D7]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0013C1"
msgid "It's not hard to imagine the kinds of transactions that must take place here."
msgstr "여기서 어떤 거래들이 오갔을지 상상하기 어렵지 않네."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_RishiGreet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = companion
#. VoiceType = NPCFAndreja
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00644DF4
#. ScriptNotes = Suspicious / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Don't you worry, I'll handle the Spacers. &&& RishiSaint: Really? |I believe in fair pay for a job well done.|Deal with these Spacers, and I'll provide the credits.|My head of security can point you in the right direction. &&& RishiSaint: A few words of advice.|We're happy to welcome all who pass through the airlock, but our hospitality has limits.|Acts of theft or violence will be met with a swift response.|We also value privacy and discretion here.|Our patrons expect to conduct whatever business they wish free from prying eyes and ears.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: I won't cause any trouble.
#. EDID: [010516D4]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0013C2"
msgid "Why do I find that vaguely suspicious?"
msgstr "왜 어딘가 수상하게 느껴질까?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_ChanTL01
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00FA1F68
#. ScriptNotes = / to ChanHuang
#. DialogueAfter = ChanHuang: Challenges? You're asking me about challenges?
#. EDID: [01054A56]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0013C3"
msgid "What kinds of challenges do you face out here?"
msgstr "이런 외진 곳에서는 주로 뭐가 어려운 편이야?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_ChanTL02
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00C3D40D
#. ScriptNotes = / to ChanHuang
#. DialogueAfter = ChanHuang: I used to be Freestar Security. Got wounded in the line of duty.
#. EDID: [01054A62]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0013C4"
msgid "What made you want to work in such a remote place?"
msgstr "어쩌다 이런 외진 곳에서 일할 생각을 하게 된 거지?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_DanicaTL02
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = DanicaVolkov
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFDanicaVolkov
#. Face = Friendly
#. SoundFileID = 0078CBE0
#. ScriptNotes = Enthusiastic / Friendly / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I'd like to view and modify my ships.
#. EDID: [01054A71]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0013C5"
msgid "I've got you covered."
msgstr "내가 해줄게."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_MaddieReofferZ02
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = MaddieWing
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFMaddieWing
#. Face = SinisterSmile
#. SoundFileID = 0048C32E
#. ScriptNotes = Devious / SinisterSmile / to Player Default
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: I'll get those parts for you.
#. EDID: [0105F4D4]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0013C6"
msgid "How about it? Want to go get me some more of those tasty little prototype parts? "
msgstr "어때? 그 맛있는 로봇 부품 시제품 좀 더 구해다 줄래? "

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_MaddieReofferZ02
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = MaddieWing
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFMaddieWing
#. Face = Friendly
#. SoundFileID = 003CA2EB
#. ScriptNotes = Excited, eager / Friendly / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Got any leads on more of those prototype robot parts?
#. EDID: [0105F4D4]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0013C7"
msgid "Well I'm glad you asked, because I do indeed."
msgstr "물어봐 줘서 기쁘네. 사실 있거든."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_DanicaTL03
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = DanicaVolkov
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFDanicaVolkov
#. Face = Friendly
#. SoundFileID = 00E5775D
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. EDID: [01058D76]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0013C8"
msgid "Mister Saint's the one in charge. I'm sure he can tell you the whole history of the place."
msgstr "세인트 씨가 이곳 책임자야. 여기 역사에 대해 전부 말해 줄 거야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_DanicaTL03
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = DanicaVolkov
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFDanicaVolkov
#. Face = Friendly
#. SoundFileID = 00EB059D
#. ScriptNotes = Put "interesting" in italics a bit, hinting at criminals and scoundrels / to Player Default
#. EDID: [01058D76]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0013C9"
msgid "That, and we get all kinds of interesting folks through here, if you catch my drift."
msgstr "그리고, 여기엔 온갖 흥미로운 사람들이 오가지. 무슨 말인지 알겠지?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_DanicaTL03
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = DanicaVolkov
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFDanicaVolkov
#. Face = Friendly
#. SoundFileID = 0016ABA1
#. ScriptNotes = Amused, maybe a chuckle / to Player Default
#. EDID: [01058D76]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0013CA"
msgid "I can tell you it's a near miracle the place is still in one piece."
msgstr "이곳이 아직 멀쩡히 남아 있는 건 거의 기적이라고 할 수 있지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_DanicaTL03
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = DanicaVolkov
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFDanicaVolkov
#. Face = Friendly
#. SoundFileID = 00C66505
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: What can you tell me about Anchorpoint?
#. EDID: [01058D76]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0013CB"
msgid "Haven't been here real long, so not much."
msgstr "여기 온 지 오래되지 않아서 잘 몰라."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_MaddieReofferZ02
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = MaddieWing
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0003ABCD
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Got any leads on more of those prototype robot parts? &&& MaddieWing:
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: You do that. I ain't going anywhere.
#. EDID: [0105F4CC]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0013CC"
msgid "Not right now, but I'll keep it in mind."
msgstr "지금은 아니지만, 기억해 둘게."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_Killian_ReofferZ04
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = KillianBrice
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00A8FE1D
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Do you have any more leads on lost shipments? &&& KillianBrice: Nothing yet, but it's only a matter of time.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: I understand. Perhaps another time.
#. EDID: [01065740]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0013CD"
msgid "I'll have to pass this time."
msgstr "이번엔 사양할게."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_CuttyTL04Clean
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = CuttyClean
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMCutty
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00A8FC6C
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. EDID: [0106BB97]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0013CE"
msgid "Now, was there something else you needed?"
msgstr "그럼, 더 필요한 게 있었나요?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_CuttyTL04Clean
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = CuttyClean
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMCutty
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 000FB13A
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = CuttyClean: Thank you. Hopefully I can develop a little faith in myself, as well.
#. EDID: [0106BB97]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0013CF"
msgid "I don't know what the future holds. I can only take things one day at a time, and try to be a better man."
msgstr "미래가 어떻게 될지는 모르겠습니다. 하루하루 살아가면서 더 나은 사람이 되려고 할 뿐이죠."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_CuttyTL03Quest
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Cutty
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMCutty
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00D2E611
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = What happened between you and your son?
#. DialogueAfter = Cutty: I understand.
#. EDID: [0106611A]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0013D0"
msgid "Especially if it involved the greatest regret of your life."
msgstr "특히 그게 인생 최대의 후회와 관련된 일이라면요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_CuttyTL03Quest
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Cutty
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMCutty
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00418FBC
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = What happened between you and your son?
#. EDID: [0106611A]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0013D1"
msgid "I'm sure you'd want your privacy respected if our roles were reversed."
msgstr "입장이 바뀌었다면 당신도 사생활을 존중받고 싶을 거라고 생각합니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_CuttyTL03Quest
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Cutty
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMCutty
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 007E9815
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = What happened between you and your son?
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: What happened between you and your son?
#. EDID: [0106611A]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0013D2"
msgid "Look, I don't know you, and that's a sensitive subject."
msgstr "봐요, 난 당신을 모르고, 그건 민감한 주제예요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_IntroSceneAlternate
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = RishiSaint
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRishiSaint
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 0074F2DE
#. ScriptNotes = / to ChanHuang
#. EDID: [0106C44E]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0013D3"
msgid "Just do it fast."
msgstr "처리만 빨리 해주세요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_IntroSceneAlternate
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = RishiSaint
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRishiSaint
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 00640E2A
#. ScriptNotes = / to ChanHuang
#. DialogueBefore = RishiSaint: And give up Anchorpoint? Hell no!|Why not send one of your people? &&& ChanHuang: To attack a Spacer stronghold head-on? No way I'd give that order.
#. EDID: [0106C44E]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0013D4"
msgid "Then hire someone. One of the patrons maybe. I'll pay the cost."
msgstr "그럼 누군가를 고용하세요. 고객분들 중 한 명에게 일을 맡겨 보시죠. 비용은 제가 내겠습니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMCutty
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMCutty
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00EE56A9
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral tone. A doctor who feels like the patient is wasting their time.
#. EDID: [01053DF2]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0013D5"
msgid "Sure. What else do you need?"
msgstr "물론이죠. 또 뭐가 필요하신가요?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMCutty
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMCutty
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 001C17AA
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral tone. A doctor who feels like the patient is wasting their time.
#. EDID: [01053DF1]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0013D6"
msgid "I suppose we're done, then."
msgstr "그럼 이걸로 끝인 것 같군요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMCutty
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMCutty
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00B3DA6A
#. ScriptNotes = Grumpy. A doctor who feels like the patient is wasting their time.
#. EDID: [01053DEC]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0013D7"
msgid "Fine."
msgstr "좋아요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMCutty
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMCutty
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 006DC7E9
#. ScriptNotes = A doctor examining a patient
#. EDID: [01053DDD]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0013D8"
msgid "What have we got here..."
msgstr "어디 보자..."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMCutty
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMCutty
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 005FD6C1
#. ScriptNotes = A doctor offering medical supplies to the player
#. EDID: [01053DE2]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0013D9"
msgid "Yeah, all right."
msgstr "응, 알았어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMCutty
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMCutty
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 008EA056
#. ScriptNotes = A doctor examining a patient who has no injuries
#. EDID: [01053DFE]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0013DA"
msgid "You're in good shape as far as I can see."
msgstr "제가 보기엔 상태가 괜찮습니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_MiscDialogue
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCFSunniKim
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFSunniKim
#. Face = Impressed
#. SoundFileID = 00AFCD23
#. ScriptNotes = Impressed
#. EDID: [010647D6]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0013DB"
msgid "I think next time we should have a trial by combat."
msgstr "다음번엔 결투 재판으로 해야겠어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_MiscDialogue
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCFSashaAtwell
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFSashaAtwell
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00161F68
#. ScriptNotes = Serious
#. EDID: [010647C8]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0013DC"
msgid "Hal really had us all fooled. I'm going to be extra vigilant now. Everyone's a suspect."
msgstr "할이 완전히 우리 모두를 속였습니다. 이제 더 경계해야겠습니다. 모두가 용의자니 말입니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_MiscDialogue
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_HelpWanted_030_TopLevel02
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Bernhard
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMBernhardKleiber
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 007166D9
#. ScriptNotes = Serious
#. DialogueBefore = Bernhard: I've all but given up on finding him, but if you feel the need, here are the coordinates.
#. EDID: [0102F6E6]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0013DD"
msgid "I cannot speak to what you'll find there, but it may point you to what you seek."
msgstr "거기서 뭘 찾을지는 모르지만, 녀석을 찾는데 단서가 될지도 모르겠군."

#. List: 2
#. EDID: SFFL_MS01_QuestSharedInfo06
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0013DE"
msgid "Very well."
msgstr "좋습니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMIvicaVukovic
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMIvicaVukovic
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00EB1DC5
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral
#. EDID: [010313B0]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0013DF"
msgid "This is tiresome. Let's just be done with it."
msgstr "지긋지긋하군요. 그냥 끝내죠."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMHalCaruso
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMHalCaruso
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 000EB48C
#. EDID: [0106ABDA]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0013E0"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2600_GraceKim_zSC02
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = GraceKim
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFGraceKim
#. Face = Defiant
#. SoundFileID = 005C4F50
#. ScriptNotes = Defiant
#. EDID: [01043AFD]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0013E1"
msgid "Of course, I'm a doctor. It doesn't mean I'm the thief."
msgstr "물론 전 의사입니다. 그렇다고 제가 도둑이라는 뜻은 아니죠."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2410_Sasha_Greet
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Sasha
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 004E941A
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Money. It's always money. &&& Sasha: Yeah, criminals are all the same. They never want to do the work. They rather just steal.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Damn, I never pegged her for that. But if there's a motive AND evidence clearing this drunk, I guess he can go.
#. EDID: [01023C79]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0013E2"
msgid "It doesn't matter. It doesn't justify what she did."
msgstr "범죄자인지는 상관없잖아요. 그렇다고 저지른 짓이 정당화되진 않으니까요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2410_Sasha_Greet
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Sasha
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00D7B7F7
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Caspian was taking recreational chems. &&& Sasha: Ah, that makes sense. The kid's of that age.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Yeah, criminals are all the same. They never want to do the work. They rather just steal.
#. EDID: [01023C8D]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0013E3"
msgid "Money. It's always money."
msgstr "돈. 언제나 돈이 문제죠."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2410_Sasha_Greet
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Sasha
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00B0B592
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Caspian's testimony is unreliable. I questioned him and he didn't know up from down. &&& Sasha: True, and if the doc vouches for your story, then I'll take it as gospel.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Well, it's true she's a round peg trying to fit in a square hole. And by round, I mean a cactus.
#. EDID: [01023CB4]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0013E4"
msgid "Sunni wants to get kicked out."
msgstr "써니 씨는 일부러 쫓겨나려고 그랬던 겁니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_e2950_CarusoEnd_Greet
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 007DE6D5
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Caruso: I'm sorry Bernhard had to die. I take it the others voted to exonerate.
#. DialogueAfter = Caruso: Then I have but one request. I would like you to take me to Shinar.
#. EDID: [0103CFC4]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0013E5"
msgid "You're to be set free. Your life is yours to do what you wish."
msgstr "넌 풀려날 거야. 이제 당신 마음대로 살라고."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_e2940_ZenaVoteTL01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Zena
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFZenaHield
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00437D3F
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral
#. EDID: [010275D8]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0013E6"
msgid "For what it's worth, I agree. You've got a ship, and we can pay you the fare."
msgstr "도움이 될진 모르겠지만, 저도 동의해요. 당신에게는 우주선이 있고, 우리는 운임을 낼 수 있어요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_b1200_Sunni_TL03
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = SunniKim
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFSunniKim
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 008FE092
#. ScriptNotes = Confident
#. DialogueBefore = SunniKim: Sit around and complain, dork.
#. EDID: [01030764]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0013E7"
msgid "Pretty foolproof plan if you ask me."
msgstr "제가 보기엔 꽤 빈틈없는 계획이네요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_130_Scene03
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Caruso
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMHalCaruso
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00E2157E
#. DialogueBefore = Caruso: You mentioned Shinar. I regret what happened there.
#. DialogueAfter = Caruso: This outpost has been through a lot, from even before I came here. But as you can see, it's starting to thrive.
#. EDID: [01031114]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0013E8"
msgid "But I'd rather not have this conversation in front of the others. Not yet."
msgstr "하지만 이 얘기는 다른 사람들 앞에서는 하고 싶지 않아요. 아직은요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_b1000_IvicaGreet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Ivica
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMIvicaVukovic
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00D25EB4
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = If the magnet damages the parts, how are they still of use?
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: If the magnet damages the parts, how are they still of use?
#. DialogueAfter = Ivica: I'll do it.
#. EDID: [01031366]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0013E9"
msgid "The magnet will destroy the hard drive. But I only need the components. It'll be fine."
msgstr "자석이 하드 드라이브를 망가뜨릴 거예요. 하지만 필요한 건 부품뿐이니 괜찮을 겁니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_e2920_BernhardKilledZenaGreet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCFZenaHield
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFZenaHield
#. Face = Angry
#. SoundFileID = 00017ACD
#. ScriptNotes = Angry / to Player Default
#. Prompt = He killed Caruso. This was retribution.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: He killed Caruso. This was retribution.
#. DialogueAfter = Zena: But fine. He admitted to killing Hal, and the vote would've only went one way.
#. EDID: [010388F6]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0013EA"
msgid "And who's going to get revenge for him? "
msgstr "그럼 그 사람 복수는 누가 해 주죠?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_d3100_CarusoZenaGreet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Zena
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFZenaHield
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00D229F7
#. ScriptNotes = Serious / to Player Default
#. Prompt = And if I don't? You can't force me to decide.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: And if I don't? You can't force me to decide.
#. DialogueAfter = Zena: *Sigh* Regardless, it looks we have a long day ahead of us. We best get to it.
#. EDID: [0103CFB8]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0013EB"
msgid "That's disappointing, but if you choose to abstain, I'll break the tie."
msgstr "실망스럽지만, 기권하겠다면 제가 동률을 깨겠습니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_d3100_CarusoZenaGreet
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Zena
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00C536B5
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: There is someone else who would be better than me. A survivor of the Shinar Outpost. &&& Zena: If such a person exists, then their testimony would be more than welcome. &&& Zena: For my part, I'll try to get the word out about the trial and what it means for this Outpost, especially given recent events. &&& Zena: Oh, and one other thing. If the vote ends up a tie, I'd like you to break it.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: That's disappointing, but if you choose to abstain, I'll break the tie.
#. EDID: [0103CFB6]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0013EC"
msgid "And if I don't? You can't force me to decide."
msgstr "제가 결정 안 하겠다면요? 저한테 결정을 강요하시면 안 되죠."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_140_Caruso_Greet
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0016242E
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I trust you have a proposition, then. &&& Caruso: I do. &&& Caruso: My terms are as follows. In exchange for my submission, I would like you to help me resolve some pressing issues here. &&& Caruso: When that work is done, I will turn myself in, or end my life. Whatever the people decide.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Then the future is not written.
#. EDID: [0103F3BD]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0013ED"
msgid "I've seen you die before. But things may change this time."
msgstr "네가 죽는 걸 전에 본 적이 있어. 하지만 이번엔 달라질 수도 있겠지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_e2910_ZenaVoteTallyTIE
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0028717C
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Zena: Citizens, if all the votes are in, I'll cast my vote and we'll begin the tally. &&& ... &&& Zena: Now, to count the votes. &&& Zena: It seems we have a tie. We've decided that in this event, the visitor, as a neutral party, will break the tie. &&& Zena: The floor is yours. What say you?
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Very well.
#. EDID: [0103E32E]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0013EE"
msgid "Execution."
msgstr "처형."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_b1200_Sunni_Greet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCFSunniKim
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFSunniKim
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00119180
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral / to Player Default
#. Prompt = I'm sure it's how you cope.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I'm sure it's how you cope.
#. EDID: [010483F4]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0013EF"
msgid "Nah, I think I just like being one. Cool thought though."
msgstr "아니, 그냥 내가 그런 존재인 게 좋은 것 같아. 멋진 생각이긴 하네."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_d3200_CarusoTL03
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Caruso
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMHalCaruso
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00306FF4
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: We'll see how the vote goes down.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Yes. But I only have one vote. The others may feel differently.
#. EDID: [0103FAF0]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0013F0"
msgid "Indeed. When we first met, you seemed prepared to leave my fate to the others. Do you know how you will vote?"
msgstr "그렇습니다. 처음 만났을 때 당신은 제 운명을 다른 사람들에게 맡길 준비가 된 듯 보였죠. 어떻게 투표할지 알고 있습니까?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_200_CarusoTL01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Caruso
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMHalCaruso
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00CB98AD
#. ScriptNotes = / to companion
#. DialogueBefore = Caruso: I've been trying to convince him to shift around the outpost's power distribution, with little luck.|Maybe you'll be able to sway him. &&& companion: Then perhaps you aren't being forceful enough.
#. EDID: [01051376]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0013F1"
msgid "At this point, that's all I can ask for."
msgstr "지금으로선 그 정도만 바랄 수 있죠."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_120_Caruso_Greet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = companion
#. VoiceType = NPCFAndreja
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00EAA66A
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: You're a known criminal. I'm guessing there's probably a bounty on your head too.
#. DialogueAfter = Caruso: Wait. Not here. Not in front of the boy.
#. EDID: [0105136A]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0013F2"
msgid "And surely you know what comes next."
msgstr "그리고 다음에 무슨 일이 오는지는 당연히 알고 있겠죠."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_e2900_Vote_Yeats
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Yeats
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMYeats
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 002F7F33
#. ScriptNotes = / to BallotBox
#. EDID: [01052CBC]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0013F3"
msgid "For what it's worth, I will be voting in accordance with Hal's wishes. I disagree with the decision, but I will honor his choice."
msgstr "도움이 될지는 모르겠지만, 저는 할의 뜻에 따라 투표할 겁니다. 그 결정에는 동의하지 않지만, 그의 선택은 존중하겠습니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_d3200_CarusoTL02
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = companion
#. VoiceType = NPCMBarrett
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 009B6CC1
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: What's that prayer from? &&& Caruso: Perhaps your companion would prefer to elaborate.
#. DialogueAfter = Caruso: Very well.
#. EDID: [01051371]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0013F4"
msgid "Yes, it seems very familiar, theologically speaking."
msgstr "네, 신학적으로 보면 아주 익숙한 것 같군요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_200_CarusoTL01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = companion
#. VoiceType = NPCMBarrett
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00E9E19E
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: If I had the materials I could craft one. &&& Caruso: I had a similar thought. The junkyard might have the parts, but the magnet is hooked up to the same power source. &&& Caruso: You'll need to talk to Ivica, the supply coordinator. &&& Caruso: I've been trying to convince him to shift around the outpost's power distribution, with little luck.|Maybe you'll be able to sway him.
#. DialogueAfter = Caruso: Ivica's a stubborn man. I'm not sure force is the right tactic. But I'll leave it to your judgment.
#. EDID: [01051378]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0013F5"
msgid "Well I have been known to persuade a person or two with my otherworldly charm. It's one of my many super powers."
msgstr "뭐, 저의 초월적인 매력으로 한두 사람쯤 설득한 적은 있죠. 제 수많은 초능력 중 하나예요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c3100_Bernhard_Greet
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Bernhard
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0087F79F
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: You should know, I found and killed Caruso. &&& Bernhard: What? Really? Then he's finally dead? I... I don't know what to say. &&& Bernhard: It's strange. I've been waiting for so long to hear those words and yet...|I don't know how to feel about it.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Yes, and I am grateful. I just thought I would feel differently about this news.
#. EDID: [01052E94]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0013F6"
msgid "Gratitude is what I expect. Hunting him down wasn't easy."
msgstr "감사를 기대하죠. 그를 추적하는 건 쉽지 않았습니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c3100_Bernhard_Greet
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00F700F1
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Based on what I saw, it would've been a fine outpost, had your luck been better. &&& Bernhard: Yes. The conditions were rough, but together we had tamed its hazards. It saddens me to think of all the knowledge we lost. &&& Bernhard: And to think, the one responsible for their deaths is still roaming free.
#. DialogueAfter = Bernhard: What? Really? Then he's finally dead? I... I don't know what to say.
#. EDID: [01052EA0]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0013F7"
msgid "You should know, I found and killed Caruso. "
msgstr "알아 두세요, 제가 카루소를 찾아 죽였습니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_e2920_BernhardKilled
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Caruso
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMHalCaruso
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 007649CC
#. ScriptNotes = Serious
#. DialogueBefore = Caspian: No! You didn't! &&& ... &&& Zena: Everyone, stand down! Sasha, escort Caspian to a holding cell, now! &&& Sasha: Yes ma'am! &&& Zena: Listen up everyone! As of this moment, I am instituting a curfew! |You're to return to your quarters until I give the go ahead to leave!
#. DialogueAfter = Zena: You better have a damn good explanation for why you shot this man.
#. EDID: [0105594A]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0013F8"
msgid "*Exhales* You did what you had to. But this is not how I wanted things to end."
msgstr "*Exhales* 해야 할 일을 한 거예요. 하지만 일이 이렇게 끝나길 바라진 않았어요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_130_Scene03
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Caruso
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMHalCaruso
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 003289D2
#. DialogueBefore = Caruso: But I'd rather not have this conversation in front of the others. Not yet.
#. DialogueAfter = Caruso: Up ahead is the Community Center. We should have privacy there.
#. EDID: [0106ABDF]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0013F9"
msgid "This outpost has been through a lot, from even before I came here. But as you can see, it's starting to thrive."
msgstr "이 전초기지는 제가 오기 전부터 많은 일을 겪었습니다. 하지만 보시다시피 이제 번창하기 시작했죠."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00A5291D
#. EDID: [01083DB5]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0014B2"
msgid "All right."
msgstr "알겠어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00C54D3C
#. EDID: [01083DB4]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0014B3"
msgid "Mm-hm."
msgstr "음-흠."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 0068E8BD
#. EDID: [01083DB3]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0014B4"
msgid "Good talk."
msgstr "좋은 대화였어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 0026846F
#. EDID: [01083DB2]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0014B5"
msgid "Back to it then."
msgstr "그럼 다시 하던 일로."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 001C766C
#. EDID: [01083DA2]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0014B6"
msgid "What?"
msgstr "뭐?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 002C6960
#. EDID: [01083D9F]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0014B7"
msgid "Hey."
msgstr "이봐."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 0070495D
#. EDID: [01083D9B]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0014B8"
msgid "I tried playing chess once. But I don't understand why there's knights and bishops but no torturers."
msgstr "체스를 한 번 해 봤어. 그런데 왜 나이트랑 비숍은 있는데 고문 담당자는 없는지 모르겠더라."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 006B451F
#. EDID: [01083D93]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0014B9"
msgid "People say my outlook is too grim. Those people are dead now."
msgstr "사람들은 내 시각이 너무 암울하다고 해. 그런 사람들은 이제 죽었어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00BDEA9E
#. EDID: [01083D8F]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0014BA"
msgid "I've been part of your crew for a good minute. I wonder when bonuses pay out."
msgstr "네 승무원으로 지낸 지도 꽤 됐어. 상여금은 언제 나오는지 궁금하네."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00BE38E4
#. EDID: [01083D8A]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0014BB"
msgid "If I die, I want to be taxidermied. "
msgstr "내가 죽으면 박제해 줬으면 해."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00231D0A
#. EDID: [01083D88]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0014BC"
msgid "I'm not like other companions. I'm not gonna comment on whatever pointless thing you're doing at the moment. I just don't care."
msgstr "난 다른 동료들과 달라. 네가 지금 하는 쓸데없는 일에 일일이 논평하지 않을 거야. 관심 없거든."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00C9781B
#. EDID: [01083D86]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0014BD"
msgid "Life is terrible. It's that realization that keeps me going."
msgstr "인생은 끔찍해. 그 깨달음이 날 계속 살아가게 해."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 0029E37F
#. EDID: [01083E52]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0014BE"
msgid "I hope these things come back to haunt us."
msgstr "이 일들이 나중에 우리를 괴롭히러 돌아왔으면 좋겠어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. SceneName = CREW_EliteCrew_Muria_MasterTopLevel
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00EE9612
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Do you mind if I ask you some personal questions?
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Earlier, you mentioned a ship full of dead cultists. What happened to them?
#. EDID: [01083C41]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0014BF"
msgid "Fine. Do your worst."
msgstr "좋아. 최악으로 해 봐."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. SceneName = CREW_EliteCrew_Muria_MasterTopLevel
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Muria
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 003C4517
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Do you mind if I ask you some personal questions? &&& Muria:
#. DialogueAfter = Muria: Around the time I joined that cult I told you about.
#. EDID: [01083B56]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0014C0"
msgid "When did you start taking an interest in necromancy?"
msgstr "언제부터 강령술에 관심을 갖기 시작한 거야?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. SceneName = CREW_EliteCrew_Muria_MasterTopLevel
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Muria
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0080BDEF
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Do you mind if I ask you some personal questions? &&& Muria:
#. EDID: [01083C84]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0014C1"
msgid "Do you have any fun facts about fungi?"
msgstr "균류에 관한 재미있는 사실 좀 있어?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. SceneName = CREW_EliteCrew_Muria_TopLevel_Jobs
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00465746
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I can relate. I die a little inside whenever we speak. &&& Muria: You and me both.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Maybe. But I like to think I'm more than a witch's face.
#. EDID: [01083BA9]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0014C2"
msgid "A morgue would be very on brand."
msgstr "'영안실' 상표 같은 게 있으면 딱 어울리겠다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. SceneName = CREW_EliteCrew_Muria_TopLevel_FungiFacts
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00E0A4E6
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral
#. DialogueAfter = Muria: Earlier, you mentioned a ship full of dead cultists. What happened to them?
#. EDID: [01083D59]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0014C3"
msgid "I don't know, I think it's kind of cool that trees pay for stuff."
msgstr "몰라, 나무가 뭔가 대가를 치른다는 게 좀 멋진 것 같아."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. SceneName = CREW_EliteCrew_Muria_TopLevel_FungiFacts
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00E7CD17
#. EDID: [01083D59]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0014C4"
msgid "The trees use the network to exchange nutrients, and they pay the fungi in sugar. "
msgstr "나무들은 그 네트워크로 영양분을 교환하고, 균류에게 설탕으로 대가를 지불해."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. SceneName = CREW_EliteCrew_Muria_TopLevel_FungiFacts
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00CBF79E
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Do you have any fun facts about fungi?
#. EDID: [01083D59]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0014C5"
msgid "You ever heard of a mycorrhizal network? They're basically a postal service for trees, linked up by mycelium."
msgstr "균근 네트워크 들어 본 적 있어? 균사체로 연결된 나무들의 우편 서비스 같은 거야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. SceneName = CREW_EliteCrew_Muria_TopLevel_FungiFacts
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00AEA0CA
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Do you have any fun facts about fungi?
#. DialogueAfter = Muria: Earlier, you mentioned a ship full of dead cultists. What happened to them?
#. EDID: [01083D58]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0014C6"
msgid "Did you know there are fungi you can only detect through DNA sequencing? They're called dark taxa. I just call them cool."
msgstr "DNA 염기서열 분석으로만 발견할 수 있는 균류가 있다는 거 알아? 암흑 분류군이라고 해. 난 그냥 멋지다고 부르지만."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. SceneName = CREW_EliteCrew_Muria_TimeLocked
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00DE3C4C
#. DialogueAfter = Muria: They're still in orbit. Going in circles, just like their logic.
#. EDID: [01083B70]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0014C7"
msgid "Earlier, you mentioned a ship full of dead cultists. What happened to them?"
msgstr "전에 광신도 시체로 가득 찬 우주선 얘기를 했었잖아. 그 사람들한테 무슨 일이 있었던 거야?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. SceneName = CREW_EliteCrew_Muria_TimeLocked
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 0020A0D4
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = No thanks.
#. DialogueAfter = Muria: Although... I did leave an open pack of Chunks somewhere in the cockpit. Maybe it's sentient now.
#. EDID: [01083BBE]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0014C8"
msgid "Sadly, it's not. Not a whispering wall or pale lady to speak of."
msgstr "안타깝게도 안 나오거든요. 속삭이는 벽도, 창백한 여인도 없어요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. SceneName = CREW_EliteCrew_Muria_TimeLocked
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 002168DC
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral / to Player Default
#. Prompt = No thanks.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: No thanks.
#. EDID: [01083BBE]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0014C9"
msgid "What, you're afraid it's haunted or something?"
msgstr "왜요? 유령이라도 나올까 봐 무서워요?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. SceneName = CREW_EliteCrew_Muria_TopLevel_Jobs
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0000397A
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral
#. DialogueAfter = Muria: I can relate. I die a little inside whenever we speak.
#. EDID: [01083BB3]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0014CA"
msgid "That was fun. I think I died a little inside every time I went in, which was neat."
msgstr "재밌었어요. 출근할 때마다 마음이 조금씩 죽는 느낌이었는데, 그게 좋더라고요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. SceneName = CREW_EliteCrew_Muria_TopLevel_Jobs
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Thinking
#. SoundFileID = 00587235
#. ScriptNotes = Thinking
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Can you tell me about any past work experiences?
#. EDID: [01083BB3]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0014CB"
msgid "Let's see. There was the time I worked cashier at an audio slate store. "
msgstr "떠올려 볼게요. 오디오 슬레이트 가게에서 계산대를 맡은 적이 있어요. "

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. SceneName = CREW_EliteCrew_Muria_TopLevel_Jobs
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Irritated
#. SoundFileID = 004951DB
#. ScriptNotes = Irritated / to Player Default
#. Prompt = What were your responsibilities?
#. DialogueAfter = Muria: A morgue would be very on brand.
#. EDID: [01083BDF]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0014CC"
msgid "I asked several times if I could take a body home. It didn't even have to be one of the preserved ones. They still said no."
msgstr ""
"시체를 집에 가져가도 되냐고 몇 번 물어봤거든요. 보존 처리가 잘 안된 것도 상관없다고 했는데, 끝까지 안 된다더라고 하더라고요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. SceneName = CREW_EliteCrew_Muria_TopLevel_Jobs
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00206BF4
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = What were your responsibilities?
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: What were your responsibilities?
#. EDID: [01083BDF]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0014CD"
msgid "They had me doing laundry and cleaning up blood and other viscera. They gave us a machine to suck up blobs of fat."
msgstr "빨래하고, 피나 내장 같은 것도 닦고 그랬죠. 지방 덩어리를 빨아들이는 기계도 쓰라고 주더라고요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. SceneName = CREW_EliteCrew_Muria_TopLevel_Jobs
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Muria
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00F31E43
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: As someone who's worked retail, same. &&& Muria: I bet that's why you're so good at the combat stuff.|I know when I need to fight, I just picture some raging customer asking to speak to the manager.|There should be manager brand bullets you could keep in the register. |And yes, I believe all cashiers should have the legal right to shoot customers.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Community service. A judge had charged me with two hundred hours for shoplifting.
#. EDID: [01083BBF]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0014CE"
msgid "How did you get the job?"
msgstr "어떻게 그 일을 하게 됐어?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. SceneName = CREW_EliteCrew_Muria_TopLevel_Finance
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00AC127D
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = How is banking similar to practicing necromancy?
#. DialogueAfter = Muria: Not all loans need to be predatory. They provide a way for regular folks to purchase homes and start business.
#. EDID: [01083DD3]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0014CF"
msgid "It's kind of like having my own personal corpse."
msgstr "꼭 저만의 개인 시체를 갖고 있는 것 같은 기분이지요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. SceneName = CREW_EliteCrew_Muria_TopLevel_Finance
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00DDB4C8
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral / to Player Default
#. Prompt = How is banking similar to practicing necromancy?
#. EDID: [01083DD3]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0014D0"
msgid "Eventually they get so strapped with debt they become a lifeless husk working three jobs to fund my lavish lifestyle. "
msgstr ""
"결국 대출자들은 빚에 너무 쪼들린 나머지 영혼 없는 껍데기가 되어, 저의 호화로운 생활비를 충당해 주기 위해 하루에 쓰리잡을 뛰는 신세가 "
"되는 거죠. "

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. SceneName = CREW_EliteCrew_Muria_TopLevel_Finance
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Friendly
#. SoundFileID = 005589DF
#. ScriptNotes = Friendly / to Player Default
#. Prompt = How is banking similar to practicing necromancy?
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: How is banking similar to practicing necromancy?
#. EDID: [01083DD3]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0014D1"
msgid "Lots of ways. When I give someone a high interest loan, it's like casting a drain spell that slowly sucks the life force out of a person."
msgstr ""
"여러가지가 비슷하죠. 누군가에게 고금리 대출을 해주는 것은, 그 사람의 생명력을 서서히 흡수하는 저주 주문을 거는 것과 아주 비슷하니까요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. SceneName = CREW_EliteCrew_Muria_TopLevel_Jobs
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 0090EA3F
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = I like working retail personally.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I like working retail personally.
#. EDID: [01083B66]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0014D2"
msgid "Yeah? Can't relate."
msgstr "? 전 전혀 안 그런데요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. SceneName = CREW_EliteCrew_Muria_TopLevel_Jobs
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00795F1D
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral / to Player Default
#. Prompt = As someone who's worked retail, same.
#. DialogueAfter = Muria: I can relate. I die a little inside whenever we speak.
#. EDID: [01083BB6]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0014D3"
msgid "And yes, I believe all cashiers should have the legal right to shoot customers."
msgstr "예, 맞아요. 모든 계산원에게는 법적으로 손님을 쏠 수 있는 권리가 있어야 한다고 생각해요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. SceneName = CREW_EliteCrew_Muria_TopLevel_Jobs
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00E9ADD2
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral / to Player Default
#. Prompt = As someone who's worked retail, same.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: As someone who's worked retail, same.
#. EDID: [01083BB6]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0014D4"
msgid "I bet that's why you're so good at the combat stuff."
msgstr "그래서 그렇게 전투를 잘하는 거군요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. SceneName = CREW_EliteCrew_Muria_TopLevels_Travel
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Muria
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0028C409
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Is there anywhere you want to visit? &&& Muria: You mean besides the cold, endless void?|I don't know. Maybe a black hole. Not the kind in space, just a big bottomless pit. It'd be fun to throw people into it.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Sure is.
#. EDID: [01083BFD]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0014D5"
msgid "That's murder."
msgstr "그건 살인이야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. SceneName = CREW_EliteCrew_Muria_TopLevels_Travel
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 002F91B4
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = A black hole is technically a bottomless pit, in space.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: A black hole is technically a bottomless pit, in space.
#. DialogueAfter = Muria: Earlier, you mentioned a ship full of dead cultists. What happened to them?
#. EDID: [01083B5C]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0014D6"
msgid "Yeah, but I hear black holes rip you apart before you ever \"fall\" in. And space is so sterile. I want to hear the trail of screams."
msgstr ""
"예, 근데 블랙홀은 구덩이에 채 '떨어지기도' 전에 몸이 갈기갈기 찢긴다던데요. 게다가 우주는 너무 적막해요. 사람들이 떨어지면서 길게 "
"내지르는 비명 소리를 듣고 싶다고요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. SceneName = CREW_EliteCrew_Muria_Recruit
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 004FF74C
#. ScriptNotes = Serious / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Yeah, if only.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Yeah, if only.
#. DialogueAfter = Muria: Well, now I need find work somewhere else. My landlord keeps asking for this thing called "rent."
#. EDID: [01083C2E]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0014D7"
msgid "If only."
msgstr "그러면 좋겠네요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. SceneName = CREW_EliteCrew_Muria_TopLevel_Jobs
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Suspicious
#. SoundFileID = 0028955B
#. ScriptNotes = Suspicious / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Is that where you learned necromancy isn't real?
#. DialogueAfter = Muria: A morgue would be very on brand.
#. EDID: [01083C3B]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0014D8"
msgid "So when they said I couldn't make a blood pact with an eldritch horror to raise an army of darkness, well, that could've been a lie too."
msgstr ""
"그러니까 부모님이 어둠의 군대를 만들기 위해 엘드리치 호러랑 피의 계약을 맺는 일도 불가능하다고 한 말도 순 거짓말일지도 모르죠."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. SceneName = CREW_EliteCrew_Muria_TopLevel_Jobs
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Suspicious
#. SoundFileID = 00AE344C
#. ScriptNotes = Suspicious / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Is that where you learned necromancy isn't real?
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Is that where you learned necromancy isn't real?
#. EDID: [01083C3B]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0014D9"
msgid "Pretty much. My parents had told me it wasn't, but keep in mind, these are the same people who lied about the tooth collector, and the reverse burglar in the red suit."
msgstr ""
"대충 그렇죠. 우리 부모님도 강령술 같은 건 없다고 말씀하시긴 했거든요. 근데요. 부모님들은 '요정인 척하는 이빨 수집'이랑 '빨간 옷 "
"입고 굴뚝으로 들어오는 늙은 소매넣기범'에 대해서도 거짓말을 했다고요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. SceneName = CREW_EliteCrew_Muria_Recruit
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Muria
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00806938
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Yeah, if only. &&& Muria: If only. &&& Muria: Well, now I need find work somewhere else. My landlord keeps asking for this thing called "rent."|I told him I could pay him with a potion that would turn him into a newt, but he refused.|Don't know why, seems like it'd be an improvement. But what do I know. Certainly not enough to be a banker.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: I have. But nothing sticks out.
#. EDID: [01083C13]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0014DA"
msgid "Have you been looking for other jobs?"
msgstr "다른 일자리 알아보고는 있어?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. SceneName = CREW_EliteCrew_Muria_TopLevel_Jobs
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Muria
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0011994B
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Can you tell me about any past work experiences? &&& Muria: I used to sell potions and amulets online. Had a tiny little garden where I grew the ingredients.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: I never really got enough time with the bodies. But I did sprinkle some ground wormwood and valerian root on this one guy.
#. EDID: [01083B52]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0014DB"
msgid "Did you ever try to raise any dead?"
msgstr "그래서 진짜로 시체를 되살리려고 시도해 본 적 있어?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. SceneName = CREW_EliteCrew_Muria_Recruit
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00AD675D
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Will you work for any less than that?
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Will you work for any less than that?
#. DialogueAfter = Muria: [Pay <Global=Crew_RecruitCost_TextReplacementValue> Credits] That won't be a problem.
#. EDID: [01083C62]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0014DC"
msgid "Ha, good one. You're funny."
msgstr "하하, 말은 잘해요. 참 웃기시네요."

#. List: 2
#. EDID: [01083B54]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0014DD"
msgid "I have to be going."
msgstr "이제 가봐야겠어."

#. List: 2
#. EDID: [01083BCB]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0014DE"
msgid "If you're looking for company, I'd be happy to bring you along with me. "
msgstr "동행을 원한다면 기꺼이 같이 다녀주지. "

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. SceneName = CREW_EliteCrew_Muria_TopLevel_Cult
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Suspicious
#. SoundFileID = 00BE4AB4
#. ScriptNotes = Suspicious / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Are you saying you have ship full of corpses somewhere? That's... something.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Are you saying you have ship full of corpses somewhere? That's... something.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Do you mind if I ask you some personal questions?
#. EDID: [01083B85]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0014DF"
msgid "I'm not answering that question without a lawyer present."
msgstr "변호사 없이는 대답 안 할 거예요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. SceneName = CREW_EliteCrew_Muria_TopLevel_Cult
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Muria
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 005C6811
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: If they are believers, then they will find prosperity in the Shrouding as Promised. &&& Muria: Well, those sure are words. &&& Muria: But yeah, I didn't want to meet the Great Serpent, so I volunteered to pilot the ship.|And then it occurred to me -- if I was gonna be surrounded by a bunch of dead people, it'd be cool if I could raise them as my personal army.|I never made the grav jump. I still have the corpses.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: They're just orbiting around a planet, or moon, I forget. I have it written down somewhere.
#. EDID: [01083B91]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0014E0"
msgid "Where are the corpses?"
msgstr "시체들은 어디 있어?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. SceneName = CREW_EliteCrew_Muria_Recruit
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 004B382B
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral / to Player Default
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: [Pay <Global=Crew_RecruitCost_TextReplacementValue> Credits] That won't be a problem.
#. EDID: [01083BA6]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0014E1"
msgid "In exchange, I might show up to work two, maybe three times a week. Deal?"
msgstr "그 대가로 일주일에 두세 번쯤은 일하러 나와 줄게요. 거래 성립인가요?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. SceneName = CREW_EliteCrew_Muria_Recruit
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 004D7E79
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Muria: Rad. Not my vibe, though.
#. EDID: [01083BA6]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0014E2"
msgid "But yeah, I think I'm gonna need creds, up front. And a skull. Preferably with the brains still in it."
msgstr "근데 말이죠. 크레딧은 선불로 받아야겠어요. 그리고 두개골도 하나 줘요. 뇌수가 그대로 담겨 있는 걸로요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. SceneName = CREW_EliteCrew_Muria_Wait
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00537603
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Wait here a moment.
#. EDID: [01083D3A]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0014E3"
msgid "Why, are you gonna go out for cigarettes?"
msgstr "왜, 담배 사러 나가게?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. SceneName = CREW_EliteCrew_Muria_TimeLocked
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 002C94DD
#. DialogueBefore = Muria: It's not as cool as you think.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: You did that on purpose I assume.
#. EDID: [01083C44]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0014E4"
msgid "Although... I did leave an open pack of Chunks somewhere in the cockpit. Maybe it's sentient now."
msgstr "근데... 조종실 어딘가에 뜯어놓은 청크 팩을 두고 오긴 했네요. 어쩌면 지금쯤 자의식이 생겼을지도 몰라요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. SceneName = CREW_EliteCrew_Muria_Pickup
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00937C65
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I'd like you to follow me for a while.
#. EDID: [01083C94]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0014E5"
msgid "Fine, I got nothing better to do."
msgstr "좋아요, 딱히 할 일도 없으니까요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. SceneName = CREW_EliteCrew_Muria_Pickup
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 006A976C
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I'd like you to follow me for a while.
#. EDID: [01083C92]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0014E6"
msgid "I better get overtime pay for this."
msgstr "초과 근무 수당을 받아야겠는데요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. SceneName = CREW_EliteCrew_Muria_Pickup
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00CBD58F
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I'd like you to follow me for a while.
#. EDID: [01083C91]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0014E7"
msgid "I'll go get my potions."
msgstr "물약 좀 챙겨올게요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. SceneName = CREW_EliteCrew_Muria_Follow
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 003DDCF2
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Let's get moving.
#. EDID: [01083DA7]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0014E8"
msgid "I'll go get my potions."
msgstr "물약 좀 챙겨올게요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. SceneName = CREW_EliteCrew_Muria_MasterTopLevel
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Muria
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00C75384
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Do you mind if I ask you some personal questions? &&& Muria:
#. DialogueAfter = Muria: You mean besides the cold, endless void?
#. EDID: [01083C37]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0014E9"
msgid "Is there anywhere you want to visit?"
msgstr "가 보고 싶은 곳 있어?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. SceneName = CREW_EliteCrew_Muria_TopLevels_Travel
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Question
#. SoundFileID = 001E59D1
#. ScriptNotes = Question / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Why not just shoot them?
#. DialogueBefore = Muria: I feel like I shouldn't have to explain this to you of all people.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Is there anywhere you want to visit?
#. EDID: [01083C0E]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0014EA"
msgid "Aren't you like a pirate or something?"
msgstr "당신은 무슨 해적이나 그와 비슷한 부류 아니었나요?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. SceneName = CREW_EliteCrew_Muria_TopLevel_Finance
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Muria
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 003D9097
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Did you ever have any actual interest in the finance sector? &&& Muria: Yeah. To me, stuff like magic, science, it's all semantics. Fire is fire, energy is energy.|It's the same vibe with banking and the dark arts. Necromancy, demon pacts, predatory loans -- it's all po-tay-to, po-tah-to.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Maybe not. But we all have to make compromises to get us through the work week.
#. EDID: [01083B89]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0014EB"
msgid "Except banking isn't nearly as cool."
msgstr "은행 업무가 흑마술처럼 멋있진 않다는 거 빼곤 다 맞네."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. SceneName = SFBGS00M_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria_RecruitOptional
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 009753D2
#. DialogueAfter = Muria: Hm. Tempting. But I want to work for an evil greater than myself.
#. EDID: [01083BA0]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0014EC"
msgid "Forget GalBank. What if you came to work for me instead?"
msgstr "갤뱅크는 잊어. 대신 나한테 와서 일하는 건 어때?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. SceneName = CREW_EliteCrew_Muria_TopLevel_Paint
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 004C0B36
#. DialogueAfter = Muria: Oh, the usual. Landscapes, mushrooms... the slow, inexorable march towards death. Stuff like that.
#. EDID: [01083B67]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0014ED"
msgid "You mentioned painting before. What sort of things do you like to paint?"
msgstr "전에 그림 얘기를 했었죠. 어떤 걸 그리는 걸 좋아하나요?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. SceneName = CREW_EliteCrew_Muria_TopLevel_Past
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 009A42F1
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: That's a beautiful sentiment. &&& Muria: I know. It brings a tear to my eye just thinking about it.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Okay.
#. EDID: [01083DD4]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0014EE"
msgid "Let's go back to my other questions."
msgstr "아까 질문으로 돌아가자."

#. List: 2
#. EDID: [01083C4A]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0014EF"
msgid "Okay."
msgstr "알겠어요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. SceneName = CREW_EliteCrew_Muria_TopLevel_Past
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Muria
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 002220BD
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Fair. &&& Muria: More than fair. Facts.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Yeah. I'd be a murderer.
#. EDID: [01083C27]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0014F0"
msgid "Would you be different if you had siblings?"
msgstr "형제자매가 있었다면 달라졌을까?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. SceneName = CREW_EliteCrew_Muria_TopLevel_Past
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
