#. Prompt = Would you be different if you had siblings?
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Would you be different if you had siblings?
#. DialogueAfter = Muria: Let's go back to my other questions.
#. EDID: [01083BFE]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0014F1"
msgid "Yeah. I'd be a murderer."
msgstr "그래. 살인자가 됐겠지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. SceneName = CREW_EliteCrew_Muria_TopLevel_Past
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00D9AFCE
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Did you have many friends as a child?
#. DialogueAfter = Muria: Let's go back to my other questions.
#. EDID: [01083B75]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0014F2"
msgid "Not often I have human ones like you. Let's call it a trial phase though. I'm still sorting out the side effects."
msgstr "너 같은 인간 친구는 흔치 않아. 일단 시험 단계라고 하자. 아직 부작용을 정리하는 중이거든."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. SceneName = CREW_EliteCrew_Muria_TopLevel_Past
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Thinking
#. SoundFileID = 00FECB66
#. ScriptNotes = Thinking / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Did you have many friends as a child?
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Did you have many friends as a child?
#. EDID: [01083B75]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0014F3"
msgid "I had enough. Most of them were imaginary, or fungi."
msgstr "충분히 있었어. 대부분 상상이었거나, 균류였지만."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
