#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: You mentioned painting before. What sort of things do you like to paint? &&& Muria: Oh, the usual. Landscapes, mushrooms... the slow, inexorable march towards death. Stuff like that.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Very.
#. EDID: [01083CC6]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0014F4"
msgid "Neat."
msgstr "멋지네."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. SceneName = CREW_EliteCrew_Muria_TopLevel_Paint
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Muria
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
