#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: You mentioned painting before. What sort of things do you like to paint? &&& Muria: Oh, the usual. Landscapes, mushrooms... the slow, inexorable march towards death. Stuff like that.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: I usually burn them when I'm finished. If they're not too terrible I'll take a picture before I do it though.
#. EDID: [01083B99]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0014F5"
msgid "Where do you keep your paintings?"
msgstr "네 그림들은 어디에 보관해?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE02
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE02_100b_HailingAnswered
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = HailingShip
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMGenericMale03
#. Face = Spaceship / Nervous
#. SoundFileID = 0010878D
#. ScriptNotes = Nervous
#. Prompt = Are you okay?
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Are you okay?
#. DialogueAfter = HailingShip: I don't know what you're talking about.
#. EDID: [0106C4D5]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0014F8"
msgid "Why... why are you asking? I'm not answering that. I... and I asked you a question first. You need to answer me now!"
msgstr "왜... 왜 묻는 거야? 대답 안 해. 난... 그리고 내가 먼저 질문했잖아. 이제 네가 대답해야 해!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE02
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE02_100b_HailingAnswered
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMGenericMale
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMGenericMale03
#. Face = Spaceship / Nervous
#. SoundFileID = 00D43D23
#. ScriptNotes = Nervous
#. Prompt = I don't know what you're talking about.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I don't know what you're talking about.
#. DialogueAfter = HailingShip: They're all around me, I can't escape them. The eyes are everywhere. I look outside my window and there's a sea of them. When I land and look up into the sky, I see them looking down on me.
#. EDID: [0106C4B9]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0014F9"
msgid "The eyes, the eyes, what else would I be talking about? Do you not see them all around you? Are you lucky enough to be blind?"
msgstr "눈, 눈 말이야. 내가 또 뭘 말하겠어? 주변에 온통 보이지 않아? 눈이 안 보일 만큼 운이 좋은 거야?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE02
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE02_100a_Hailing
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = HailingShip
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMGenericMale03
#. Face = Spaceship / Nervous
#. SoundFileID = 002CE209
#. ScriptNotes = Nervous
#. EDID: [0106C4E3]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0014FA"
msgid "You aren't... one of them, are you?"
msgstr "당신은... 그들 중 하나가 아니죠?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_Anchorpoint_AudioSlateQuest
#. SceneName = SFFL_Anchorpoint_AudioSlateQuest_EvanGabriellaScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = AUDIOONLY
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMEvanAlonso
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00C5D72B
#. DialogueAfter = Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): *Chuckle* I hardly think that's necessary.
#. EDID: [0106C44D]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0014FB"
msgid "If it doesn't, is there a fallback plan? Some other way to use the station that's profitable?"
msgstr "그게 안 되면 대비책은 있습니까? 기지를 수익성 있게 활용할 다른 방법이라든가요?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_Anchorpoint_AudioSlateQuest
#. SceneName = SFFL_Anchorpoint_AudioSlateQuest_EvanGabriellaScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = AUDIOONLY
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMEvanAlonso
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 006A3CAC
#. DialogueBefore = Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): Very well, but make it quick.
#. EDID: [0106C44D]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0014FC"
msgid "Anchorpoint was built on the premise that Grav Drive technology will advance beyond its current limits."
msgstr "앵커포인트는 중력 구동기 기술이 현재 한계를 넘어 발전할 거라는 전제 위에 지어졌습니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_EC06
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE_EC06_50_Hailing
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Satellite
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFGenericFemale01
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00796D28
#. ScriptNotes = A recorded distress call coming from a satellite, used by pirates to lure unsuspecting ships. Slightly unemotional. / Neutral
#. EDID: [0106AD5A]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0014FD"
msgid "Please respond and provide assistance. We're in danger."
msgstr "응답 바랍니다. 지원을 제공해 주세요. 저희는 위험에 처해 있습니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_EC06
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE_EC06_250_CompanionInterjection
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = ActiveCompanion
#. VoiceType = NPCMSamCoe
#. Face = Somber
#. SoundFileID = 00B5972D
#. ScriptNotes = Companion reacting to a third pirate ship joining the space battle against the player's ship. / Somber
#. DialogueBefore = PirateShip03:
#. EDID: [0106C46E]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0014FE"
msgid "Don't panic, but it looks like we've got one more pirate to deal with."
msgstr "당황하지 마세요. 처리해야 할 해적이 하나 더 있는 것 같습니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_EC06
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE_EC06_Pirate01_Scene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = PirateShip01
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMGenericMale03
#. Face = Spaceship / Angry
#. SoundFileID = 00BCF3BE
#. ScriptNotes = Aggressive pirates grav jumping into the area to attach the player's ship in an ambush. / Angry
#. EDID: [0106B172]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0014FF"
msgid "This one's mine! I saw it first!"
msgstr "이건 내 거야! 내가 먼저 봤어!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_EC06
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE_EC06_120_HailRefused
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Satellite
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFGenericFemale01
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00BDDD98
#. ScriptNotes = A recorded distress call coming from a satellite, used by pirates to lure unsuspecting ships. Slightly unemotional. / Neutral
#. DialogueBefore = Satellite:
#. EDID: [0106B17B]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001500"
msgid "Mayday! Mayday!"
msgstr "메이데이! 메이데이!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_EC06
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE_EC06_150_CompanionInterjection
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = ActiveCompanion
#. VoiceType = NPCFSarahMorgan
#. Face = Worried
#. SoundFileID = 00BABB3D
#. ScriptNotes = Companion reacting to the sudden arrival of two pirate ships as the player's ship is ambushed. / Worried
#. EDID: [0106C46B]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001501"
msgid "I knew it! We walked right into a spacer ambush!"
msgstr "그럴 줄 알았어! 우린 스페이서 매복에 제대로 걸어든 거야!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE04
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCFGenericFemale
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFGenericFemale04
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00235B58
#. EDID: [0106B96F]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001502"
msgid "Hello?"
msgstr "여보세요?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE03
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE03_100a_Hailing
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = HailingShip
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMGenericMale02
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00400151
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral
#. EDID: [0106A308]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001503"
msgid "Well hey there stranger. I've got something for you that'll blow your mind. Trust me, you're never gonna forget this."
msgstr "오, 안녕 낯선 분. 네 정신을 날려 버릴 물건이 있어. 믿어, 절대 잊지 못할 거야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE03
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE03_100b_HailingAnswered
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = HailingShip
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMGenericMale02
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00BDBEF1
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral / to Player Default
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Well, before I agree to anything, I need more info.
#. EDID: [0106A314]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001504"
msgid "You see, I want to play a game with you. A bit of a twisted one, but that's what makes it so fun. The stakes are high!"
msgstr "그러니까, 너랑 게임을 하고 싶어. 좀 뒤틀린 게임이지만 그게 재미있는 거지. 판돈은 커!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE03
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE03_100b_HailingAnswered
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = HailingShip
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMGenericMale02
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00C44331
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = HailingShip:
#. EDID: [0106A314]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001505"
msgid "Ah, good, you picked up. I've been flying all over, looking for someone, anyone, to play with. "
msgstr "아, 좋아, 받았군. 같이 놀 사람, 아무나 찾아다니느라 여기저기 날아다녔어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE03
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE03_100b_HailingAnswered
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = HailingShip
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMGenericMale02
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0040DDF0
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Seems like I don't have a choice. I'll play.
#. EDID: [0106C4C8]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001506"
msgid "It's very simple, really. Three lives for three riddles. If you refuse to answer, or if you get a riddle wrong, I kill one of my little friends on board."
msgstr "정말 간단해. 목숨 셋에 수수께끼 셋. 대답을 거부하거나 틀리면, 내 우주선에 있는 작은 친구들 중 하나를 죽일 거야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE03
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE03_100b_HailingAnswered
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = HailingShip
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMGenericMale02
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00954532
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral
#. EDID: [0106C4C8]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001507"
msgid "*Ahem* 'Scuse me. Do I have your attention now? Then allow me to explain the rules of my little game."
msgstr "*Ahem* 실례. 이제 주목해 주시겠어요? 그럼 제 작은 게임의 규칙을 설명하지요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE03
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE03_100b_HailingAnswered
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = HailingShip
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMGenericMale02
#. Face = Spaceship / Irritated
#. SoundFileID = 00544485
#. ScriptNotes = shouting at his hostage / Irritated
#. DialogueBefore = HailingShip: He's insane, help us! He killed the pilot, he-
#. EDID: [0106C4C8]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001508"
msgid "All right, shut up, that's enough. Get on back with the rest of them. Move!"
msgstr "좋아, 닥쳐, 그만하면 됐어. 나머지한테 돌아가. 움직여!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE03
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE03_100b_HailingAnswered
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = HailingShip
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00E27254
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Seems like I don't have a choice. I'll play. &&& HailingShip: Fantastic. Amazing! Let the games begin! &&& HailingShip: A classic one to start with. Perhaps you know it? Let's hope you do...|What has an eye but cannot see?
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Congrats, you just doomed someone out of an utter lack of initiative. Would it have killed you to take a guess?
#. EDID: [0106C758]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001509"
msgid "I don't know."
msgstr "모르겠어요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE03
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE03_100b_HailingAnswered
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMGenericMale
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMGenericMale02
#. Face = Spaceship / Smug
#. SoundFileID = 0026FFA0
#. ScriptNotes = Smug / to Player Default
#. Prompt = A potato.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: A potato.
#. DialogueAfter = HailingShip: Time's up for this one.
#. EDID: [0106C754]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00150A"
msgid "A valiant effort, but wrong. A potato has many eyes."
msgstr "용감한 시도였지만 틀렸어. 감자에는 눈이 많지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE03
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE03_100b_HailingAnswered
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = HailingShip
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0072A294
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: A school bus. &&& ... &&& HailingShip: Help me! Help me, please! He's gonna kill us- &&& HailingShip: All right, all right, enough! |Do you hear that? Do you hear how scared they are? How exciting is that?|All right, one more to go. The grand finale! You ready? &&& HailingShip: What's light as a feather, but even the strongest person can't hold it for long?
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Hey, good job. That's the right answer, I knew you had it in ya.
#. EDID: [0106C7F2]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00150B"
msgid "Breath."
msgstr "숨결."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE03
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE03_100b_HailingAnswered
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = HailingShip
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0003563D
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: A school bus. &&& ... &&& HailingShip: Help me! Help me, please! He's gonna kill us- &&& HailingShip: All right, all right, enough! |Do you hear that? Do you hear how scared they are? How exciting is that?|All right, one more to go. The grand finale! You ready? &&& HailingShip: What's light as a feather, but even the strongest person can't hold it for long?
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Wrong. Wrong, wrong, wrong. That's too bad.
#. EDID: [0106C7F9]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00150C"
msgid "A thought."
msgstr "생각."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE03
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE03_100c_GameRefused
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = HailingShip
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMGenericMale02
#. Face = Spaceship / Angry
#. SoundFileID = 00D104A4
#. ScriptNotes = Angry
#. EDID: [0106D1B1]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00150D"
msgid "Hope you enjoy the fireworks."
msgstr "불꽃놀이를 즐겼으면 좋겠어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE03
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE03_100c_GameRefused
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = HailingShip
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMGenericMale02
#. Face = Spaceship / Angry
#. SoundFileID = 009FBF4C
#. ScriptNotes = Angry
#. DialogueBefore = HailingShip: I swear to whatever god you worship, if you end this hail I will blow up this ship. Everyone - EVERYONE - on board will die!|You will not deny me this game!
#. EDID: [0106D1B1]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00150E"
msgid "You thought I was bluffing? I do not bluff."
msgstr "내가 허세 부린 줄 알았어? 난 허세 안 부려."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE03
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE03_100c_GameRefused
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = HailingShip
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMGenericMale02
#. Face = Spaceship / Angry
#. SoundFileID = 00FFA437
#. ScriptNotes = Angry
#. DialogueAfter = HailingShip: Seems like I don't have a choice. I'll play.
#. EDID: [0106D1B3]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00150F"
msgid "You will not deny me this game!"
msgstr "넌 내게서 이 게임을 빼앗지 못해!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE03
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE03_100c_GameRefused
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = HailingShip
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMGenericMale02
#. Face = Spaceship / Angry
#. SoundFileID = 0009658E
#. ScriptNotes = Angry
#. DialogueBefore = HailingShip: Do. Not. End. This. Hail!
#. EDID: [0106D1B3]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001510"
msgid "I swear to whatever god you worship, if you end this hail I will blow up this ship. Everyone - EVERYONE - on board will die!"
msgstr ""
"네가 믿는 신이 누구든 그 신을 걸고 맹세하지, 이 통신을 끊으면 이 우주선을 날려 버리겠다. 탑승자 모두 - 모두가 - 죽을 거야!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE03
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE03_100b_HailingAnswered
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = HailingShip
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMGenericMale02
#. Face = Spaceship / Smug
#. SoundFileID = 004B062B
#. ScriptNotes = about to shoot a hostage / Smug
#. DialogueBefore = HailingShip: A valiant effort, but wrong. A potato has many eyes.
#. DialogueAfter = HailingShip: All right. On to the next riddle!
#. EDID: [0106D258]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001511"
msgid "Time's up for this one."
msgstr "이번 건 시간 끝이야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_ActionFigures_SarahMorgan
#. SceneName = SFFL_ActionFigures_SarahMorganScene
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = SarahMorgan
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00571546
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: It is. It's from a set of Colony War Heroes. &&& SarahMorgan: Hero? Is that what they're calling me? I find that term almost offensive. &&& SarahMorgan: I don't like to talk about my past. But suffice to say, my history as a soldier was not without trauma. &&& SarahMorgan: To see me in that uniform, memorialized in this way... I don't know how to feel.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: You took the words right out of my mouth.
#. EDID: [01065C27]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001512"
msgid "It's insulting."
msgstr "모욕적이군요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_ActionFigures_SarahMorgan
#. SceneName = SFFL_ActionFigures_SarahMorganScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = SarahMorgan
#. VoiceType = NPCFSarahMorgan
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00BE3F4C
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral / to Player Default
#. Prompt = I thought it was amusing.
#. DialogueAfter = SarahMorgan: Either way, as collectibles go, it's definitely a conversation piece, so feel free to hold on to it.
#. EDID: [01065C25]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001513"
msgid "But to see my service commercialized this way... well, it's certainly a choice."
msgstr "하지만 제 복무가 이런 식으로 상업화된 걸 보니... 뭐, 확실히 특이한 선택이군요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_ActionFigures_SarahMorgan
#. SceneName = SFFL_ActionFigures_SarahMorganScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = SarahMorgan
#. VoiceType = NPCFSarahMorgan
#. Face = Concerned
#. SoundFileID = 00AAA719
#. ScriptNotes = Concerned / to Player Default
#. Prompt = I thought it was amusing.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I thought it was amusing.
#. EDID: [01065C25]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001514"
msgid "Maybe under different circumstances, I might've appreciated it. "
msgstr "다른 상황이었다면 고맙게 여겼을지도 모르죠."

#. List: 2
