#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: It is. It's from a set of Colony War Heroes. &&& SarahMorgan: Hero? Is that what they're calling me? I find that term almost offensive. &&& SarahMorgan: I don't like to talk about my past. But suffice to say, my history as a soldier was not without trauma. &&& SarahMorgan: To see me in that uniform, memorialized in this way... I don't know how to feel.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Maybe under different circumstances, I might've appreciated it.
#. EDID: [01065C21]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001515"
msgid "I thought it was amusing."
msgstr "재미있다고 생각했어요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_ActionFigures_SarahMorgan
#. SceneName = SFFL_ActionFigures_SarahMorganScene
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0066D9C4
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: It is. It's from a set of Colony War Heroes. &&& SarahMorgan: Hero? Is that what they're calling me? I find that term almost offensive. &&& SarahMorgan: I don't like to talk about my past. But suffice to say, my history as a soldier was not without trauma. &&& SarahMorgan: To see me in that uniform, memorialized in this way... I don't know how to feel.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: I don't know if proud is the word I'd use. "Exploited" seems like a better fit.
#. EDID: [01065C2E]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001516"
msgid "You should feel proud."
msgstr "자랑스러워해도 됩니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_ActionFigures_SarahMorgan
#. SceneName = SFFL_ActionFigures_SarahMorganScene
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0031BA52
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Have you seen this action figure? &&& SarahMorgan: Oh my god. Is that supposed to be me?
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Hero? Is that what they're calling me? I find that term almost offensive.
#. EDID: [01065C24]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001517"
msgid "It is. It's from a set of Colony War Heroes."
msgstr "맞습니다. 식민지 전쟁 영웅 세트 중 하나예요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_ActionFigures_SarahMorgan
#. SceneName = SFFL_ActionFigures_SarahMorganScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = SarahMorgan
#. VoiceType = NPCFSarahMorgan
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 001403F4
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Lighten up, they did their best.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Lighten up, they did their best.
#. DialogueAfter = SarahMorgan: I don't like to talk about my past. But suffice to say, my history as a soldier was not without trauma.
#. EDID: [01065C2F]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001518"
msgid "And without my permission."
msgstr "그리고 제 허락도 없이요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_EC02
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Voice
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC02_Dax_Voice
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 007BA693
#. ScriptNotes = Dax rudely complaining while aboard the player's ship as they travel to Neon. / Serious
#. EDID: [0106ACA4]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001519"
msgid "Are we there yet?"
msgstr "아직 멀었어요?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_EC02
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Voice
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC02_Dax_Voice
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00E8D1FB
#. ScriptNotes = Dax acting tough while aboard the player's ship as they travel to Neon. / Serious
#. EDID: [0106ACA3]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00151A"
msgid "I'll keep my weapon close until we're at our destination, if you don't mind."
msgstr "목적지에 도착할 때까지 무기는 가까이 두겠습니다. 괜찮으시다면요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_EC02
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Barrett
#. VoiceType = NPCMBarrett
#. Face = Suspicious
#. SoundFileID = 00FC275A
#. ScriptNotes = Companion commenting about the presence of Dax Shepard, likely a criminal, aboard the player's ship. / Suspicious
#. EDID: [0106C815]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00151B"
msgid "Watch out for that guy. He could still want to take over the ship."
msgstr "저 사람 조심해. 아직도 우주선을 장악하려 할지 몰라."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_EC02
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Andreja
#. VoiceType = NPCFAndreja
#. Face = Somber
#. SoundFileID = 00EEC5CE
#. ScriptNotes = Andrja commenting about the presence of Dax Shepard on board the player's ship, ready to take matter into her own hands if necessary. / Somber
#. EDID: [0106C813]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00151C"
msgid "If he steps out of line, I will kill him."
msgstr "선을 넘으면 내가 죽이겠어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_EC02
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE_EC02_50_CompanionComment
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = ActiveCompanion
#. VoiceType = NPCFSarahMorgan
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00177A0E
#. ScriptNotes = Aboard player's ship, companion commenting on a seeming abandoned derelict ship floating in space in front of them. / Serious
#. EDID: [0106C810]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00151D"
msgid "We should go check in case someone needs help."
msgstr "누가 도움이 필요한지 확인하러 가 봐야 해요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_EC02
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE_EC02_50_CompanionComment
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = ActiveCompanion
#. VoiceType = NPCFSarahMorgan
#. Face = Question
#. SoundFileID = 000E7CDE
#. ScriptNotes = Aboard player's ship, companion commenting on a seeming abandoned derelict ship floating in space in front of them. / Question
#. EDID: [0106C810]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00151E"
msgid "Do you think there's anyone inside that ship?"
msgstr "저 우주선 안에 누가 있을까요?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_EC02
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE_EC02_50_CompanionComment
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = ActiveCompanion
#. VoiceType = NPCMSamCoe
#. Face = Thinking
#. SoundFileID = 007C54CE
#. ScriptNotes = Aboard player's ship, companion commenting on a seeming abandoned derelict ship floating in space in front of them. / Thinking
#. EDID: [0106C80F]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00151F"
msgid "Another day, another space derelict. Do you think it's worth checking out?"
msgstr "또 하루, 또 버려진 우주선이군. 확인해 볼 가치가 있을까?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_EC02
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE_EC02_860_SecondWarning
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = DaxBurroughs
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC02_Dax_Voice
#. Face = Stern
#. SoundFileID = 0057F1B9
#. ScriptNotes = Dax didn't want to do this, but the player leaves them no choice, so he attacks them. / Stern / to Player Default
#. DialogueAfter = DaxBurroughs: Nice knowing you, pal.
#. EDID: [0106D4E7]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001520"
msgid "All right, that does it!"
msgstr "좋아, 이걸로 끝이야!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_EC02
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE_EC02_870_DaxAttacks
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = DaxBurroughs
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC02_Dax_Voice
#. Face = Somber
#. SoundFileID = 00C4138B
#. ScriptNotes = Dax didn't want to do this, but the player leaves them no choice, so he attacks them. / Somber
#. EDID: [0106D4F0]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001521"
msgid "Nice knowing you, pal."
msgstr "알아서 반가웠어, 친구."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_EC02
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE_EC02_850_FirstWarning
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = DaxBurroughs
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC02_Dax_Voice
#. Face = Somber
#. SoundFileID = 001DF9A1
#. ScriptNotes = Dax didn't want to do this, but the player leaves them no choice, so he attacks them. / Somber / to Player Default
#. DialogueAfter = DaxBurroughs: Do you have a death wish, or something? Walk away. Now.
#. EDID: [0106D4EF]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001522"
msgid "You asked for it, buddy."
msgstr "네가 자초한 거야, 친구."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC02
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Voice
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC02_Dax_Voice
#. Face = SinisterSmile
#. SoundFileID = 00DAE495
#. ScriptNotes = The character means they are going to enjoy killing the player. / SinisterSmile
#. EDID: [0106AD44]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001523"
msgid "I'm going to enjoy this."
msgstr "즐겁겠군."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC02
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Voice
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC02_Dax_Voice
#. Face = Angry
#. SoundFileID = 0099A913
#. ScriptNotes = Angry
#. EDID: [0106AD43]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001524"
msgid "Die, you rat!"
msgstr "죽어, 쥐새끼야!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC02
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Voice
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC02_Dax_Voice
#. Face = Angry
#. SoundFileID = 001A2BD4
#. ScriptNotes = Angry
#. EDID: [0106AD42]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001525"
msgid "I knew I couldn't trust you!"
msgstr "널 믿으면 안 된다는 걸 알았어!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC02
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC02_Dax_SC_Gangster
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = DaxBurroughs
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC02_Dax_Voice
#. Face = Thinking
#. SoundFileID = 0021DBBA
#. ScriptNotes = Dax is starting to consider that maybe he can negotiate with the player - perhaps a fellow criminal - instead of threatening them with his gun. / Thinking / to Player Default
#. EDID: [0106AC49]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001526"
msgid "Huh. Is that so?"
msgstr "허. 그래?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC02
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC02_Dax_SC_Hard02
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = DaxBurroughs
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC02_Dax_Voice
#. Face = Defiant
#. SoundFileID = 00B6178F
#. ScriptNotes = Calmly but sternly refusing to put down their weapon, currently pointed at the player. / Defiant / to Player Default
#. EDID: [0106AC50]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001527"
msgid "I don't think I will put it down, no."
msgstr "아니, 내려놓을 생각 없어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC02
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC02_Dax_SC_Med03
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = DaxBurroughs
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC02_Dax_Voice
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00D4D96A
#. ScriptNotes = Acting tough, trying to intimidate the player into giving him their ship. / Serious / to Player Default
#. EDID: [0106AC5F]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001528"
msgid "Sure you can. And you will."
msgstr "당연히 할 수 있지. 그리고 하게 될 거야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC02
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC02_Dax_SC_Easy04
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = DaxBurroughs
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC02_Dax_Voice
#. Face = Irritated
#. SoundFileID = 00F345A5
#. ScriptNotes = Dax shutting off any attempt by the player at finding out more about who they are and what they do. / Irritated / to Player Default
#. EDID: [0106AC40]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001529"
msgid "Where I need to go is not your concern."
msgstr "내가 어디로 가야 하는지는 네가 알 바 아니야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC02
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC02_Dax_SC_Intimidate
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = DaxBurroughs
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC02_Dax_Voice
#. Face = Defiant
#. SoundFileID = 00A2A70F
#. ScriptNotes = Dax is not impressed by the player's threats as he's pointing his gun at them. / Defiant / to Player Default
#. EDID: [0106AC6C]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00152A"
msgid "That's pretty big talk for someone at the end of my gun."
msgstr "내 총구 끝에 선 사람치고는 말이 꽤 크네."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC02
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC02_Dax_SC_Easy03
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = DaxBurroughs
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC02_Dax_Voice
#. Face = Defiant
#. SoundFileID = 00D2893C
#. ScriptNotes = Defiant / to Player Default
#. EDID: [0106AC46]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00152B"
msgid "I'm not quite as confident as you are."
msgstr "난 너만큼 자신 있진 않아."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC02
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC02_Dax_SC_Easy01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = DaxBurroughs
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC02_Dax_Voice
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 003BE3C2
#. ScriptNotes = Still threatening the player, Dax is nevertheless comforted a bit by realizing they both speak the same language. / Confident / to Player Default
#. EDID: [0106AC63]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00152C"
msgid "Good, we have an understanding."
msgstr "좋아, 서로 알아들었군."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC02
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC02_Dax_SC_Easy03
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 003AB49C
#. EDID: [0106AC3D]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00152D"
msgid "I'm sure we can come to an agreement."
msgstr "우린 분명 합의할 수 있을 겁니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC02
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC02_200_DaxIntro
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = DaxBurroughs
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC02_Dax_Voice
#. Face = Suspicious
#. SoundFileID = 0019196C
#. ScriptNotes = Dax isn't interested in telling the player why they want their ship or where they want to go with it. / Suspicious / to Player Default
#. Prompt = What do you need my ship for?
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: What do you need my ship for?
#. DialogueAfter = DaxBurroughs: Let's talk this through.
#. EDID: [0106AC68]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00152E"
msgid "Pretty sure that's none of your business."
msgstr "그건 네가 알 바 아닌 것 같은데."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC02
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC02_200_DaxIntro
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = DaxBurroughs
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC02_Dax_Voice
#. Face = Angry
#. SoundFileID = 00DFE8C5
#. ScriptNotes = Amping up the pressure, gun pointed at the player, after the latter gave him attitude. / Angry / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Not gonna happen.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Not gonna happen.
#. DialogueAfter = DaxBurroughs: Let's talk this through.
#. EDID: [0106AC59]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00152F"
msgid "Sorry, wrong answer."
msgstr "미안, 오답이야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC02
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC02_300_DaxLowersWeapon
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = DaxBurroughs
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC02_Dax_Voice
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 006EFF2A
#. ScriptNotes = Impressed by the player's audacity, Dax promises the player they'll get compensated for taking him to Neon. / Confident / to Player Default
#. Prompt = I can't do discreet for free.
#. DialogueAfter = DaxBurroughs: Sure. I'll just say you're my brother-in-law.
#. EDID: [0106AC91]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001530"
msgid "Once I'm back I'm sure my boss will want to reward you in some way. He's like that."
msgstr "내가 돌아가면 우리 보스가 어떤 식으로든 보상하고 싶어 할 거야. 그런 사람이거든."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC02
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC02_300_DaxLowersWeapon
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = DaxBurroughs
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC02_Dax_Voice
#. Face = Amused
#. SoundFileID = 000FA719
#. ScriptNotes = Dax reacts to the player asking for money to take him to Neon, impressed by their audacity. / Amused / to Player Default
#. Prompt = I can't do discreet for free.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I can't do discreet for free.
#. EDID: [0106AC91]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001531"
msgid "Hah! You're pushing your luck, pal!"
msgstr "하! 운을 너무 시험하는군, 친구!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC02
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC02_300_DaxLowersWeapon
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = DaxBurroughs
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC02_Dax_Voice
#. Face = Suspicious
#. SoundFileID = 0056A185
#. ScriptNotes = Dax has accepted to talk to the player instead of shooting them, and tells them they need a lift to Neon. / Suspicious / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = DaxBurroughs: All right, we'll do it your way then.
#. DialogueAfter = DaxBurroughs: Sure. I'll just say you're my brother-in-law.
#. EDID: [0106AC9D]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001532"
msgid "Is there a problem?"
msgstr "문제라도 있습니까?"

