#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00793F2D
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Let's talk this through. &&& ... &&& DaxBurroughs: All right, we'll do it your way then. &&& DaxBurroughs: I need to get to Neon as fast as possible without being seen. Think you can handle that? &&& DaxBurroughs: I took the fall for someone else after a bank robbery went wrong. I ended up inside for a while.|One day there was an opportunity to get out, and I took it. Then I took this piece of crap ship.|Then I had a grav jump failure, ended up with just enough power for life support, then you showed up.|Is that enough for you? Can we go now?
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Hah! You're pushing your luck, pal!
#. EDID: [0106AC94]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001533"
msgid "I can't do discreet for free."
msgstr "공짜로 조용히 처리할 순 없어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC02
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC02_300_DaxLowersWeapon
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = DaxBurroughs
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC02_Dax_Voice
#. Face = Irritated
#. SoundFileID = 00BDA091
#. ScriptNotes = Dax finds that the player asks too many question about his past, but accepts to answer just so that the player will stop. / Irritated / to Player Default
#. Prompt = What else can you tell me before I take you aboard?
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: What else can you tell me before I take you aboard?
#. DialogueAfter = DaxBurroughs: I took the fall for someone else after a bank robbery went wrong. I ended up inside for a while.
#. EDID: [0106AD3E]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001534"
msgid "You're starting to get on my nerves, you know that? All right, where to start..."
msgstr "너 슬슬 내 신경을 건드리는 거 알아? 좋아, 어디서부터 시작할까..."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_EC07_MiscDialogue
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Voice
#. VoiceType = SFFL_SE_EC07_Hannah_Voice
#. Face = Apologetic
#. SoundFileID = 00E044DA
#. ScriptNotes = Sincerely grateful to the player for rescuing her, but still trying to excuse her boss. / Apologetic
#. EDID: [01064815]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001535"
msgid "Don't worry about Miss Krause, she's a bit standoffish but I know she's grateful as well."
msgstr "크라우스 양은 걱정하지 마세요. 좀 붙임성이 없지만 그녀도 고마워하는 건 알고 있어요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC07
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC07_210_RubyOnly
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = RubyKrause
#. VoiceType = SFFL_SE_EC07_Ruby_Voice
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00AFAFD3
#. ScriptNotes = A bit incredulous that the player would put the life of her assistant above GalBank's valuable property. / Serious / to Player Default
#. Prompt = I'm not leaving her behind, it's too risky.
#. DialogueAfter = HannahFrye: Wait, what?
#. EDID: SFFL_BE_EC07SharedInfo01
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001536"
msgid "It's your call...but I can't guarantee she'll still have a job when we get to New Atlantis."
msgstr "당신 판단에 맡기죠... 하지만 뉴아틀란티스에 도착했을 때 그녀에게 아직 일자리가 있을지는 장담 못 합니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC07
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC07_210_RubyOnly
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = RubyKrause
#. VoiceType = SFFL_SE_EC07_Ruby_Voice
#. Face = Irritated
#. SoundFileID = 0007452B
#. ScriptNotes = A bit incredulous that the player would put the life of her assistant above GalBank's valuable property. / Irritated / to Player Default
#. Prompt = I'm not leaving her behind, it's too risky.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I'm not leaving her behind, it's too risky.
#. EDID: SFFL_BE_EC07SharedInfo01
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001537"
msgid "So you'd have me risk losing this fine ship instead? I don't think the board would approve."
msgstr "그럼 이 훌륭한 우주선을 잃을 위험을 감수하라는 겁니까? 이사회가 승인할 것 같지는 않군요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC07
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC07_210_RubyOnly
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = RubyKrause
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0008C624
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = HannahFrye: &&& ... &&& RubyKrause: Thank you, Hannah, I'll handle it from here. &&& RubyKrause: On behalf of the GalBank consortium, thank you for coming to our assistance.|We are in need of a temporary transportation service, as it were. &&& RubyKrause: Are you done thinking now?
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: So you'd have me risk losing this fine ship instead? I don't think the board would approve.
#. EDID: [0106802D]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001538"
msgid "I'm not leaving her behind, it's too risky."
msgstr "그녀를 두고 가진 않을 겁니다. 너무 위험해요."

#. List: 2
