#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: I'm not leaving you behind.
#. EDID: [0106803C]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00153A"
msgid "Do you need anything?"
msgstr "필요한 게 있습니까?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC07
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC07_215_HannahReacts
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = RubyKrause
#. VoiceType = SFFL_SE_EC07_Ruby_Voice
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 00585370
#. ScriptNotes = Trying to sound reassuring, but isn't very convincing. / Confident / to HannahFrye
#. DialogueAfter = HannahFrye: We're in the middle of a minefield!
#. EDID: [01068023]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00153B"
msgid "You'll be fine. I'll send for you as soon as I get back."
msgstr "괜찮을 겁니다. 돌아오자마자 사람을 보내겠습니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC07
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC07_215_HannahReacts
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = RubyKrause
#. VoiceType = SFFL_SE_EC07_Ruby_Voice
#. Face = Irritated
#. SoundFileID = 00103011
#. ScriptNotes = Ruby explaining to Hannah she's worth less than the ship, as if she was talking to a pouty teen. / Irritated / to HannahFrye
#. DialogueBefore = RubyKrause: I'm right behind you. &&& HannahFrye: Wait, what?|I really have to stay behind? What if the pirates come back?
#. EDID: [01068023]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00153C"
msgid "This is a very expensive ship, we can't just abandon it."
msgstr "이건 아주 비싼 우주선입니다. 그냥 버릴 수는 없어요."

#. List: 2
