#. DialogueBefore = Roman:
#. EDID: [0105CEBD]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00153F"
msgid "I'm good hanging out here with you."
msgstr "난 여기서 너랑 지내는 게 좋아."

#. List: 2
