#. DialogueAfter = Atka: I could but you're literally right here, doing nothing.
#. EDID: [0105CEBE]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001541"
msgid "Clean? Can't you pay someone to do that?"
msgstr "청소? 그런 건 누구 돈 주고 시키면 안 돼?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03_RC_AtkaYura04
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_RC_AtkaYura04Scene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Atka
