#. ScriptNotes = Amused / to Yura
#. DialogueBefore = Atka: &&& Yura:
#. EDID: [0105CEF2]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001542"
msgid "Sounds like fun. Just don't overdo it. I don't want any late-night calls about bailing you out."
msgstr "재밌겠네. 그냥 너무 무리하진 마. 한밤중에 보석금 내 달라는 전화는 받고 싶진 않거든."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03_RC_AtkaYura04
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_RC_AtkaYura04Scene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Yura
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFYura
#. Face = Amused
#. SoundFileID = 00A66815
#. ScriptNotes = Amused / to Atka
#. DialogueBefore = Yura: &&& Atka:
#. EDID: [0105CECC]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001543"
msgid "Don't worry, we'll do something completely different but equally annoying, just to keep you guessing."
msgstr "걱정 마. 널 계속 긴장하게 하려고 완전히 다르지만 똑같이 짜증나는 일을 할게."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03_RC_AtkaYura04
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_RC_AtkaYura04Scene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Yura
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFYura
#. Face = Amused
#. SoundFileID = 00AC5A34
#. ScriptNotes = Amused / to Atka
#. DialogueBefore = Yura: &&& Atka:
#. EDID: [0105CECB]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001544"
msgid "Wow, I'm really never going to hear the end of that one."
msgstr "와, 이 얘기는 정말 끝없이 듣게 되겠네."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03_RC_AtkaYura04
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_RC_AtkaYura04Scene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Yura
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFYura
#. Face = Amused
#. SoundFileID = 0057E8D0
#. ScriptNotes = Amused / to Atka
#. DialogueBefore = Yura: &&& Atka:
#. EDID: [0105CECA]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001545"
msgid "Hey, then it's not a real vacation, is it?"
msgstr "이봐, 그러면 진짜 휴가가 아니잖아?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03_RC_AtkaYura04
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_RC_AtkaYura04Scene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Atka
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFAtka
#. Face = Question
#. SoundFileID = 00631A9E
#. ScriptNotes = Question / to Yura
#. EDID: [0105CF27]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001546"
msgid "What are you and Roman up to?"
msgstr "너랑 로만 둘이 뭘 꾸미고 있어?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_EC07
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Voice
#. VoiceType = SFFL_SE_EC07_Ruby_Voice
#. Face = Concerned
#. SoundFileID = 0088FBB4
#. ScriptNotes = Subtly questioning the player's competence as a pilot as the player's ship is attacked by pirates. / Concerned
#. EDID: [0106A4FE]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001547"
msgid "Are you sure you know what you're doing?"
msgstr "정말 네가 뭘 하는지 알고 있는 거야?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_EC07
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Voice
#. VoiceType = SFFL_SE_EC07_Hannah_Voice
#. Face = Worried
#. SoundFileID = 005DF8EF
#. ScriptNotes = Hannah expresses nervousness after she has boarded the player's ship. / Worried
#. EDID: [0106A4EF]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001548"
msgid "I hope Miss Krause won't be too angry with me."
msgstr "크라우스 양이 나한테 너무 화내지 않았으면 좋겠어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_EC07
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Andreja
#. VoiceType = NPCFAndreja
#. Face = Disbelief
#. SoundFileID = 00B58241
#. ScriptNotes = Andreja comments on all the dead bodies inside the GalBank ship, as pirate tried to kidnap the VP of GalBank. / Disbelief
#. EDID: [0106C8D6]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001549"
msgid "All those people dead, just to get one person. Such a waste."
msgstr "그 많은 사람이 죽었는데, 고작 한 사람을 잡으려고. 너무 헛된 일이야."

