msgid "Thank you for responding! We really need your help!"
msgstr "응답해 주셔서 감사합니다! 정말 도움이 필요합니다!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_EC07
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE_EC07_60_PirateReactsToMines
