#. DialogueAfter = GalBankShip: Thank you for responding! We really need your help!
#. EDID: [0105F655]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00154E"
msgid "Please provide immediate assistance if you can!"
msgstr "가능하다면 즉시 지원해 주세요!"

