#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Well, a few people, um...a few people are dead, but the VP of Acquisitions is unhurt. I'm okay too.
#. EDID: [0106439C]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00154F"
msgid "Is anyone on your ship hurt?"
msgstr "당신 우주선에 다친 사람은 없나요?"

