#. DialogueAfter = Actor02: That could take weeks, and I know you've got plenty in stock right now.
#. EDID: [01054A4A]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001564"
msgid "Talk to Mister Saint. If he provides the funds, I'll arrange a purchase."
msgstr "세인트 씨와 얘기해 봐. 자금을 마련해주면 내가 구매를 주선하도록 하지."

#. List: 2
