#. DialogueAfter = HailingShip: I see, well... maybe someone else will come along that has half a heart. Sycorax out.
#. EDID: [01054570]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001566"
msgid "C'mon... I'm dead in the void here."
msgstr "이봐... 여기 우주 한복판에서 꼼짝 못 하겠다고."

#. List: 2
