msgctxt "00157B"
msgid "There are rumors of pirates using fake distress calls to lure in unsuspecting victims."
msgstr "해적들이 가짜 조난 신호로 방심한 희생자를 유인한다는 소문이 있어요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC03
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC03_55_BobbyRumors
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Bobby
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC03_Bobby_Voice
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 0091B09B
#. ScriptNotes = Bobby Kazan, space trader, shares a bit of information/rumor/gossip he's heard with the player. / Serious / to Player Default
#. EDID: [0106BE37]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00157C"
msgid "We're usually pretty open about things, but I didn't get a good feeling from them."
msgstr "평소에는 사람들을 잘 받아주는 편이지만, 그놈들한테선 영 불길한 예감이 들더라고요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC03
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC03_55_BobbyRumors
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Bobby
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC03_Bobby_Voice
#. Face = Thinking
#. SoundFileID = 000B507E
#. ScriptNotes = Bobby Kazan, space trader, shares a bit of information/rumor/gossip he's heard with the player. / Thinking / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Bobby: I heard a few things...
#. EDID: [0106BE37]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00157D"
msgid "The other day we came across a ship that was clearly stolen. Wanted to come aboard. I said no."
msgstr "며칠 전에 도난당한 게 분명한 우주선을 만났어요. 승선하고 싶다고 하더군요. 거절했죠."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC03
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC03_55_BobbyRumors
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Bobby
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC03_Bobby_Voice
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00BE9D03
#. ScriptNotes = Bobby Kazan, space trader, shares a bit of information/rumor/gossip he's heard with the player. / Neutral / to Player Default
#. EDID: [0106BE33]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00157E"
msgid "I guess the place is kind of a haven for smugglers. Not that I would know."
msgstr "이곳은 밀수업자들의 안식처 같은 곳인가 봐요. 제가 아는 건 아니지만요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC03
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC03_55_BobbyRumors
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Bobby
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC03_Bobby_Voice
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 002564B2
#. ScriptNotes = Bobby Kazan, space trader, shares a bit of information/rumor/gossip he's heard with the player. / Confident / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Bobby: Come close my friend, I'll share what I know.
#. EDID: [0106BE33]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00157F"
msgid "I know a guy who *only* runs contraband for a living. Does a lot of his meet-ups at Anchorpoint."
msgstr "밀수품 운반만으로 먹고사는 사람을 알아요. 앵커포인트에서 만남을 많이 갖죠."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC03
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC03_55_BobbyRumors
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Bobby
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC03_Bobby_Voice
#. Face = Sarcastic
#. SoundFileID = 0018ED5A
#. ScriptNotes = Bobby Kazan, space trader, shares a bit of information/rumor/gossip he's heard with the player. / Sarcastic / to Player Default
#. EDID: [0106BE31]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001580"
msgid "Probably drifted off due to gravity interactions and so on. Good places to find loot, if you dare!"
msgstr "아마 중력 상호작용 같은 것 때문에 떠밀려 갔겠지. 용기가 있다면 전리품 찾기 좋은 곳이야!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC03
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC03_55_BobbyRumors
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Bobby
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC03_Bobby_Voice
