#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Thank you. I'm ready to return to Anchorpoint.
#. EDID: [0104E219]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0015CD"
msgid "Yeah. Yeah."
msgstr "그래. 그래."

#. List: 2
