#. SoundFileID = 0009F12E
#. ScriptNotes = Much more angry. / Angry / to Opal
#. DialogueBefore = Sadie: I thought she was my friend.
#. DialogueAfter = Sadie: Wait here.
#. EDID: [0104E2A8]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0015D3"
msgid "That lying..."
msgstr "그 거짓말쟁이..."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0475_PARTY
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Sadie
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCSadieCarr
#. Face = Thinking
#. SoundFileID = 0012FEF9
#. ScriptNotes = Mumbling to herself. Feel betrayed. / Thinking / to Sadie
#. DialogueBefore = Sadie: What? But you said-...|What all has she said? You should have told me sooner. &&& Wren: I just know you two are friends, and I didn't want to mess that up.
#. DialogueAfter = Sadie: That lying...
#. EDID: [0104E295]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0015D4"
msgid "I thought she was my friend."
msgstr "그녀가 내 친구라고 생각했어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0475_PARTY
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Wren
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCWrenCarr
#. Face = Worried
#. SoundFileID = 008CFFF6
#. ScriptNotes = Nervous to tell Sadie. / Worried / to Sadie
#. DialogueAfter = Sadie: Oh, Opal? You just missed her.
#. EDID: [0104E2B2]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0015D5"
msgid "Sadie, can we talk? It's about Opal..."
msgstr "세이디, 얘기 좀 할 수 있어? 오팔에 관한 일이야..."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0475_PARTY
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Wren
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCWrenCarr
#. Face = Worried
#. SoundFileID = 008DD8BD
#. ScriptNotes = Shy and nervous. / Worried / to Wren
#. DialogueBefore = Wren: It's best she's not around. &&& Sadie: What do you mean?
#. DialogueAfter = Sadie: What? But you said-...
#. EDID: [0104E243]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0015D6"
msgid "I know I told you before everything was fine. But to be honest, it's true that Opal has been bullying me."
msgstr "전에 다 괜찮다고 말했지만, 솔직히 오팔이 날 괴롭힌 건 사실이야."

#. List: 2
