#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00F02A93
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I've been in your position. Trust me, no one should ever go through what you're going through. &&& Wren: You have? I haven't talked to anyone about this. It's just scary...|How did you get through it?
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: My sister always invites me to these. I don't want to disappoint her and tell her 'No.'
#. EDID: [0104E21C]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0015D7"
msgid "I distanced myself from the problem."
msgstr "그 문제에서 거리를 뒀어요."

#. List: 2
