#. Prompt = I don't think I ever did...
#. EDID: [0104E242]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0015DA"
msgid "I guess then, it will only work out if I tell Sadie. I need to tell her."
msgstr "그럼 세이디에게 말해야만 일이 풀리겠네요. 말해야겠어요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
