#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Like I should with Sadie. You're right. I'll go tell her.
#. EDID: [0104E261]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0015DC"
msgid "I talked with those I knew who loved me."
msgstr "나를 사랑해 주는 사람들과 이야기를 나눴어요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0340_TL_WREN
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00EF9359
#. DialogueAfter = Wren: You're still thinking of that? Just let it go.
#. EDID: [0104E286]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0015DD"
msgid "Are you really okay with Opal harassing you?"
msgstr "오팔이 널 괴롭히는 걸 정말 괜찮다고 생각해?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0340_TL_WREN
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Wren
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCWrenCarr
#. Face = Sad
#. SoundFileID = 00F227E6
#. ScriptNotes = Shy, but also annoyed at the player for bringing up the bullying again. / Sad / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Are you really okay with Opal harassing you?
#. DialogueAfter = Wren: If you don't stand up for yourself, it won't end.
#. EDID: [0104E267]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0015DE"
msgid "You're still thinking of that? Just let it go."
msgstr "아직도 그 생각을 하고 있어? 그냥 잊어버려."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0300C_Wren_DIP
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Wren
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 000491FE
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Maybe. Unless Opal is jealous. You are Sadie's sister after all. &&& Wren: That's no reason to be jealous though. Opal and Sadie have been friends for years. Right?
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: If I tell Sadie, maybe she can talk to Opal and clear all that up?
#. EDID: [0104E294]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0015DF"
msgid "Sure. But maybe Opal feels like she has to share Sadie with you."
msgstr "그럴 수도 있지. 하지만 오팔은 세이디를 너와 나눠야 한다고 느낄지도 몰라."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0300B_Wren
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Wren
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCWrenCarr
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0031C8E6
#. ScriptNotes = Shy and worried. / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Maybe. Unless Opal is jealous. You are Sadie's sister after all.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Maybe. Unless Opal is jealous. You are Sadie's sister after all.
#. DialogueAfter = Wren: I've been in your position. Trust me, no one should ever go through what you're going through.
#. EDID: [0104E237]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0015E0"
msgid "That's no reason to be jealous though. Opal and Sadie have been friends for years. Right?"
msgstr "그렇다고 질투할 이유는 아니잖아. 오팔과 세이디는 몇 년째 친구였지? 맞지?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0250_SawyerGossip
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Sawyer
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCSawyerBrooks
#. Face = Friendly
#. SoundFileID = 004DC606
#. ScriptNotes = Casual. A bit grossed out thinking about Wren being sick. / Friendly / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Since I'm new here, is there anything I should know about anyone here?
#. EDID: [0106B2DD]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0015E1"
msgid "Be careful around Wren. Sadie told me she's been at Reliant Medical lately, and she didn't even tell me why. Whatever it was, she better not be contagious. I heard some diseases can linger on a person."
msgstr "렌 주변에서는 조심해. 세이디가 요즘 릴라이언트 메디컬에 다닌다고 했는데, 이유도 안 알려줬대. 뭐였든 전염성은 없었으면 좋겠네. 어떤 병은 사람 몸에 오래 남는다고 들었거든."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0250_SawyerGossip
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Sawyer
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCSawyerBrooks
#. Face = Friendly
#. SoundFileID = 00EC3345
#. ScriptNotes = Casual and friendly while he gossips. / Friendly / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Since I'm new here, is there anything I should know about anyone here?
#. EDID: [0106B2DB]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0015E2"
msgid "If you end up with any questions about the ship, go ask Sadie. She's the one who set up a good part of this place. She made this ship look like paradise, and set up a wicked security system."
msgstr ""
"우주선에 대해 궁금한 게 있으면 세이디에게 물어봐. 이곳의 상당 부분을 꾸민 사람이 그녀야. 이 우주선을 낙원처럼 만들고, 끝내주는 보안 "
"시스템도 설치했지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0250_SawyerGossip
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Sawyer
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCSawyerBrooks
#. Face = Friendly
#. SoundFileID = 006CDFE9
#. ScriptNotes = Casual and friendly while he gossips. Slight whisper like he doesn't want anyone to over hear this. / Friendly / to Player Default
#. EDID: [0106B2DA]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0015E3"
msgid "Between you and me, I hope she's finally deciding to break things off with him."
msgstr "우리끼리 말인데, 그녀가 드디어 그와 헤어지기로 마음먹은 거였으면 좋겠어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0250_SawyerGossip
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Sawyer
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCSawyerBrooks
#. Face = Friendly
#. SoundFileID = 007BF107
#. ScriptNotes = Casual and friendly while he gossips. / Friendly / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Since I'm new here, is there anything I should know about anyone here?
#. EDID: [0106B2DA]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0015E4"
msgid "Don't try flirting with Opal, alright? Cooper and her are dating. And trust me, you don't want to pick a fight with him. Though, from what I've seen, Opal has been a bit distant from him as of late."
msgstr "오팔한테 추파 던질 생각은 하지 마, 알겠어? 쿠퍼랑 사귀고 있거든. 그리고 믿어, 그와 싸움을 걸고 싶진 않을 거야. 다만 내가 보기엔 요즘 오팔이 그에게서 좀 멀어진 것 같아."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0250_SawyerGossip
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Sawyer
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCSawyerBrooks
#. Face = Smirk
#. SoundFileID = 00D87A91
#. ScriptNotes = Casual and friendly. / Smirk / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Since I'm new here, is there anything I should know about anyone here?
#. EDID: [0104E240]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0015E5"
msgid "Yeah, don't get Opal started on Wren. I swear she'll talk your ear off about the girl, and it's never anything good. But she just teases like that."
msgstr "그래, 렌 얘기로 오팔을 시작하게 하지 마. 맹세하는데 그 여자 얘기로 귀에 못이 박히게 할 거야. 좋은 말은 하나도 없고. 그래도 그냥 그렇게 놀리는 거야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0300B_Wren
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Wren
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 000BDC30
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I've heard Opal has been causing you issues, is that true? &&& Wren: What? Why would you even ask that? Opal and Sadie are best friends. I'm Sadie's sister, why would Opal do anything to me?
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: There's nothing to tell. Opal and I just aren't close is all. Now, will you drop it?
#. EDID: [0104E289]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0015E6"
msgid "It's alright. You can tell me. "
msgstr "괜찮아. 말해도 돼."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0300A_Wren
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 001CE5A9
#. DialogueAfter = Wren: What? Why would you even ask that? Opal and Sadie are best friends. I'm Sadie's sister, why would Opal do anything to me?
#. EDID: [0104E2B0]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0015E7"
msgid "I've heard Opal has been causing you issues, is that true?"
msgstr "오팔이 너를 힘들게 한다고 들었어. 사실이야?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0210C_SAW&OPAL
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Sawyer
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCSawyerBrooks
#. Face = Smug
#. SoundFileID = 00712B4C
#. ScriptNotes = Friendly. Making a joke at the last part. Ironic since that is how the Player leaves the party. / Smug / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Wait. I didn't want to be here. Bring me back to Anchorpoint.
#. EDID: [0104E222]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0015E8"
msgid "Go on. Have fun. We'll take you back when we're all done partying! That or if something worse happened, ha!"
msgstr "가 봐. 재미있게 놀아. 파티가 다 끝나면 다시 데려다줄게! 아니면 더 나쁜 일이 생기면, 하!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0210C_SAW&OPAL
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Sawyer
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCSawyerBrooks
#. Face = Smirk
#. SoundFileID = 00F99472
#. ScriptNotes = (Player response: Wait. I didn't want to be here. Bring me back to Anchorpoint.) Friendly. / Smirk / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Wait. I didn't want to be here. Bring me back to Anchorpoint.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Wait. I didn't want to be here. Bring me back to Anchorpoint.
#. EDID: [0104E222]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0015E9"
msgid "Woah, not yet. We're still having fun. Besides, do you want me to drive my ship during my own party?"
msgstr "워, 아직 안 돼. 아직 재미있게 놀고 있잖아. 게다가 내 파티 도중에 내가 내 우주선을 몰길 바라?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0210C_SAW&OPAL
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCSawyerBrooks
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCSawyerBrooks
#. Face = Smug
#. SoundFileID = 00708934
#. ScriptNotes = Friendly. / Smug / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Right... I should get back to Anchorpoint.
#. EDID: [0104E235]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0015EA"
msgid "We'll return to Anchorpoint once the party's over."
msgstr "파티가 끝나면 앵커포인트로 돌아갈 거야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0210C_SAW&OPAL
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCSawyerBrooks
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCSawyerBrooks
#. Face = Happy
#. SoundFileID = 0082944A
#. ScriptNotes = (Player response: Right... I should get back to Anchorpoint.) Friendly. Makes a joke at the last sentence. Meant to be ironic. / Happy / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Right... I should get back to Anchorpoint.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Right... I should get back to Anchorpoint.
#. EDID: [0104E235]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0015EB"
msgid "Don't mean you have to. Come on. We're celebrating 'til we're sick of each other or dead! "
msgstr "그럴 필요는 없다는 뜻이야. 어서. 서로 질리거나 죽을 때까지 축하하는 거야!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0160B_SAWYER
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Sawyer
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCSawyerBrooks
#. Face = Friendly
#. SoundFileID = 00418DC1
#. ScriptNotes = Casual and friendly. / Friendly / to Player Default
#. DialogueAfter = Sawyer: Sure. I would love to join you.
#. EDID: [0104E21F]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0015EC"
msgid "You're back! Still want to join us?"
msgstr "돌아왔네! 아직도 우리랑 함께하고 싶어?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0150C_SAW&OPAL
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Sawyer
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCSawyerBrooks
#. Face = Smug
#. SoundFileID = 001700C5
#. ScriptNotes = Casual and Friendly. / Smug / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Sawyer: I finally got my new ship paid off. Even sounds wild to say. &&& Opal: AKA, he got back into his parents' good graces and they paid it off for him.
#. DialogueAfter = Sawyer: Sure. I would love to join you.
#. EDID: [0104E248]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0015ED"
msgid "Don't tell them, but I managed to get more money from them than was needed. Got the ship decked out too now!"
msgstr "그들에게는 말하지 마. 필요한 것보다 돈을 더 받아냈거든. 이제 우주선도 제대로 꾸며 놨어!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0150C_SAW&OPAL
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Sawyer
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00894A57
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Opal: Hm, what? Here to buy a lady a drink? Too bad. I already got a boyfriend. &&& ... &&& Sawyer: Of course! This is a celebration! Come on, sit! Join us. &&& Opal: Really, Sawyer? Them? &&& Sawyer: Don't mind Opal. She has a hard time making new friends. |Who knows. We all may end up being peas in a pod!
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: That's a shame. Well, if you ever want to have a few free drinks, you know where to find us.
#. EDID: [0104E228]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0015EE"
msgid "I don't drink."
msgstr "난 술 안 마셔."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0150C_SAW&OPAL
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Sawyer
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 007D24EF
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Opal: Hm, what? Here to buy a lady a drink? Too bad. I already got a boyfriend. &&& ... &&& Sawyer: Of course! This is a celebration! Come on, sit! Join us. &&& Opal: Really, Sawyer? Them? &&& Sawyer: Don't mind Opal. She has a hard time making new friends. |Who knows. We all may end up being peas in a pod!
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Of course! We'll be here!
#. EDID: [0104E23B]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0015EF"
msgid "Not now. Maybe later if you both are still here."
msgstr "지금은 아니야. 너희 둘 다 아직 여기 있으면 나중에 어쩌면."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0150C_SAW&OPAL
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Sawyer
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCSawyerBrooks
#. Face = Happy
#. SoundFileID = 00794346
#. ScriptNotes = Casual and Friendly. (Player response: You two are being noisy.) / Happy / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Sawyer: Ah, they'll be around later. But for now, we could always use another? It's no fun to celebrate if you can't bring others into it.
#. DialogueAfter = Opal: Really, Sawyer? Them?
#. EDID: [0104E25B]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0015F0"
msgid "Sorry. Can't help it. We're celebrating! Want to join? The more the merrier."
msgstr "미안. 어쩔 수 없어. 축하하는 중이거든! 같이 할래? 많을수록 즐겁잖아."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0150A_OPAL
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Opal
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCOpalWoods
#. Face = Smug
#. SoundFileID = 008CF8D4
#. ScriptNotes = Casual and Smug. / Smug / to Player Default
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Sounds like you're waiting on some friends.
#. EDID: [0104E25A]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0015F1"
msgid "Hm, what? Here to buy a lady a drink? Too bad. I already got a boyfriend."
msgstr "흠, 뭐야? 숙녀에게 술 한잔 사 주러 왔어? 아쉽네. 난 이미 남자친구가 있어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0101_SAW&OPAL
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Sawyer
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCSawyerBrooks
#. Face = Smug
#. SoundFileID = 00DB409A
#. ScriptNotes = Casual and having fun. / Smug / to Sawyer
#. DialogueBefore = Sawyer: Hear, hear! &&& Opal: This will be one hell of a celebration, won't it, Sawyer?
#. EDID: [0104E26E]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0015F2"
msgid "Heh! Let's get another round of drinks!"
msgstr "헤! 술 한 잔 더 하자!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0101_SAW&OPAL
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Opal
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCOpalWoods
#. Face = Friendly
#. SoundFileID = 005CEFCB
#. ScriptNotes = Casual and friendly. / Friendly / to Opal
#. DialogueBefore = Opal: Should be any moment. But their loss. We get to start the party early. &&& Sawyer: Hear, hear!
#. DialogueAfter = Sawyer: Heh! Let's get another round of drinks!
#. EDID: [0104E282]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0015F3"
msgid "This will be one hell of a celebration, won't it, Sawyer?"
msgstr "끝내주는 축하 파티가 되겠지, 그렇지, 소이어?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0975_COMPANION
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = companion
#. VoiceType = NPCFSarahMorgan
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00315080
#. ScriptNotes = A bit upset at the player's carelessness of getting drunk, but then sighs and is just happy they are okay. / Serious
#. EDID: [0106B2B9]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0015F4"
msgid "It's good to see you again. I didn't know when you would return after running off with those two. *Sigh* Well, I hope you had a fun time."
msgstr "다시 보니 좋네요. 그 둘과 떠난 뒤 언제 돌아올지 몰랐어요. *한숨* 뭐, 즐거운 시간 보냈길 바랍니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0300B_OPAL
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00980089
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: You sure had some colorful things to say in this slate of yours. &&& Opal: Where did you find that? That wasn't for you to listen to!
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: You're going to do nothing.
#. EDID: [0106B275]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0015F5"
msgid "I have your friends in the palm of my hands. I know exactly what to do with this slate."
msgstr "네 친구들은 내 손아귀에 있어. 이 슬레이트로 뭘 해야 할지 정확히 알아."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0300B_SADIE
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Sadie
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCSadieCarr
#. Face = VeryAngry
#. SoundFileID = 00F94CEB
#. ScriptNotes = Angry. / VeryAngry / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Opal needs to pay.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Opal needs to pay.
#. EDID: [0106B2AD]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0015F6"
msgid "Trust me. She's going to."
msgstr "믿어. 그녀는 그렇게 할 거야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0300B_SADIE
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Sadie
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCSadieCarr
#. Face = Angry
#. SoundFileID = 009A21F4
#. ScriptNotes = Angry. / Angry / to Player Default
#. Prompt = You should talk with Opal.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: You should talk with Opal.
#. EDID: [0106B2CC]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0015F7"
msgid "We're going to talk, alright."
msgstr "우린 얘기할 거야, 알겠지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0300B_SADIE
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Sadie
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCSadieCarr
#. Face = Angry
#. SoundFileID = 009C6FA4
#. ScriptNotes = Realizes what happened and now angry at Opal. / Angry / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Opal has been bullying your sister.
#. EDID: [0106B2BE]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0015F8"
msgid "You wait right here. Opal and I are going to have a few words."
msgstr "넌 여기서 기다려. 오팔과 내가 몇 마디 나눌 거야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0300B_SADIE
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Sadie
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCSadieCarr
#. Face = Confused
#. SoundFileID = 00CAC992
#. ScriptNotes = More confusion, but pieces together at the end Wren was sick because of Opal. / Confused / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Opal has been bullying your sister.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Opal has been bullying your sister.
#. EDID: [0106B2BE]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0015F9"
msgid "I don't get it. Wren kept telling me nothing was happening. How long has this even been going on? Wren just got back from being sick. How could she- "
msgstr "이해가 안 돼. 렌은 계속 아무 일도 없다고 했어. 대체 언제부터 이랬던 거야? 렌은 아파 있다가 막 돌아왔는데. 어떻게 그녀가-"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0300B_SADIE
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00B1EF90
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: You should listen to this slate I found. &&& Sadie: A slate? Is this Opal's? Why do you have that? Let me see it.|What? I'm sorry. What is this? What- Why would she even say this?
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: And she's not going to like me either. Wait here.
#. EDID: [0106B28E]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0015FA"
msgid "Sounds like Opal doesn't like your sister very much."
msgstr "오팔이 네 여동생을 별로 좋아하지 않는 것 같네요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0300D_Wren_SLATE
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Wren
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCWrenCarr
#. Face = Defiant
#. SoundFileID = 00EB9229
#. ScriptNotes = Determined now. She's tired of the bullying. / Defiant / to Player Default
#. Prompt = I hope you know what to do with that slate.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I hope you know what to do with that slate.
#. EDID: [0106B277]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0015FB"
msgid "I do. Excuse me."
msgstr "그래요. 실례할게요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0300D_Wren_SLATE
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Wren
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0019635B
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: If she wasn't then she wouldn't have said what she said in this slate. &&& Wren: What? Let me see that. &&& Wren: Where did you get this? I just- &&& Wren: I don't get it. Why does she do this? Sadie's her friend. She's dating my brother. Yet there is something wrong with me? What the hell?
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: I do. Excuse me.
#. EDID: [0106B2FC]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0015FC"
msgid "I hope you know what to do with that slate."
msgstr "그 슬레이트로 뭘 해야 할지 알고 있었으면 좋겠어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_TL_OPAL_01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Opal
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCOpalWoods
#. Face = Smug
#. SoundFileID = 0030C0EA
#. ScriptNotes = Casual and rather indifferent, like talking about Cooper isn't a big deal. / Smug / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: How long have you and Cooper been dating?
#. EDID: [0106B281]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0015FD"
msgid "I don't know. You lose track after a while. Maybe that's a good thing, right? He's sweet though, even if he seems otherwise."
msgstr "모르겠어. 시간이 지나면 헷갈리게 돼. 어쩌면 그게 좋은 걸지도, 그렇지? 겉보기와 달리 그는 다정하긴 해."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0250_WrenGossip
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00F51194
#. DialogueAfter = Wren: Yeah. Just, be careful about Opal. She gets mad easily and I think she holds a grudge too.
#. EDID: [0106B2D9]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0015FE"
msgid "Would you know anything about this crowd?"
msgstr "이 사람들에 대해 아는 게 있나요?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_TL_COOPER_02
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00BD62DB
#. DialogueAfter = Cooper: Not very much. I only came because of Sadie, Opal, and Wren. I can't stand Sawyer or his get-togethers all that much. They're too loud and obnoxious.
#. EDID: [0106B295]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0015FF"
msgid "How are you liking the party?"
msgstr "파티는 마음에 드나요?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0250_SadieGossip
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Sadie
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCSadieCarr
#. Face = Suspicious
#. SoundFileID = 00CA860D
#. ScriptNotes = Casual but a bit worried and annoyed in her tone. / Suspicious / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: What can you tell me about your friends?
#. EDID: [0106B2A9]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001600"
msgid "Right, since you're new you wouldn't know about Opal and Cooper. They've been dating for a while now. Though, I'm a little nervous. Seems like Opal is spending less and less time with him. She better not break his heart."
msgstr "맞아, 넌 새로 왔으니까 오팔과 쿠퍼에 대해 모르겠지. 둘은 꽤 오래 사귀었어. 그래도 난 좀 불안해. 오팔이 그와 보내는 시간이 점점 줄어드는 것 같거든. 그의 마음을 아프게 하진 않았으면 좋겠어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0300_WREN_SC02
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Wren
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCWrenCarr
#. Face = Irritated
#. SoundFileID = 003E2C8E
#. ScriptNotes = Speech Challenge failed. Wren is angry at what the Player said. / Irritated / to Player Default
#. EDID: [0106B286]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001601"
msgid "You know nothing about me. You just got here, and this is so much more complicated than you think."
msgstr "넌 나에 대해 아무것도 몰라. 방금 왔잖아. 이건 네 생각보다 훨씬 복잡해."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0300_WREN_SC02
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Wren
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCWrenCarr
#. Face = Somber
#. SoundFileID = 00E2D143
#. ScriptNotes = Speech Challenge Success. Wren feel sad and scared. / Somber / to Player Default
#. EDID: [0106B285]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001602"
msgid "You don't know Opal like I do. I wish I could tell Sadie, but I don't want to upset her."
msgstr "넌 나만큼 오팔을 몰라. 세이디에게 말하고 싶지만, 그녀를 속상하게 하고 싶지 않아."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0250_CooperGossip
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Cooper
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCCooperCarr
#. Face = Worried
#. SoundFileID = 0061333C
#. ScriptNotes = Soft and kinder tone while talking about his sister. Hint of worry as he's worried about his sister. / Worried / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Can you tell me anything about anyone here?
#. EDID: [0106B2CA]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001603"
msgid "My little sister, Wren, is here. To be honest, I'm a bit shocked she even came. She wasn't feeling too well for a while. This party is her first time being out in months."
msgstr "내 여동생 렌이 여기 있어. 솔직히, 그녀가 온 것만으로도 좀 놀랐어. 한동안 몸이 별로 안 좋았거든. 이번 파티가 몇 달 만에 처음 외출한 거야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0300B_Wren
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Wren
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00D284EF
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I've heard Opal has been causing you issues, is that true? &&& Wren: What? Why would you even ask that? Opal and Sadie are best friends. I'm Sadie's sister, why would Opal do anything to me?
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: I thought I told you to leave me alone. Just go.
#. EDID: [0106B293]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001604"
msgid "I can't believe you're just going to let Opal get away with everything she's done to you."
msgstr "오팔이 너한테 한 모든 일을 그냥 넘어가게 둔다니 믿을 수가 없어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0300_WREN_SCRepeat
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Wren
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCWrenCarr
#. Face = Worried
#. SoundFileID = 00013577
#. ScriptNotes = Speech Challenge success. Worried and unsure. / Worried / to Player Default
#. EDID: [0106B2FF]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001605"
msgid "Okay. I can understand that."
msgstr "알겠어. 이해할 수 있어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0300_WREN_SCRepeat
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Wren
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCWrenCarr
#. Face = Worried
#. SoundFileID = 00FD7DA2
#. ScriptNotes = Speech Challenge success. Worried and unsure. / Worried / to Player Default
#. EDID: [0106B300]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001606"
msgid "You may be right."
msgstr "네 말이 맞을지도 몰라."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0300_WREN_SCRepeat
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00ACE0C4
#. EDID: [0106B2D4]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001607"
msgid "You never know when Opal may go farther than just harassment. You'll be safer if you tell someone."
msgstr "오팔이 괴롭힘에서 더 나아가지 않으리란 보장은 없어. 누군가에게 말하면 더 안전할 거야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0175_SAW&OPAL
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Opal
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCOpalWoods
#. Face = Friendly
#. SoundFileID = 00A33231
#. ScriptNotes = (Player response: Whatever you say.) Having fun drinking. / Friendly / to Player Default
#. EDID: [0104E203]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001608"
msgid "Ready for the second?"
msgstr "두 번째 준비됐어?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0300_WREN_SC04
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00D65EC4
#. EDID: [0106B2E7]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001609"
msgid "Opal is nothing but a punk. The others need to know what she's like."
msgstr "오팔은 그냥 양아치야. 다른 사람들도 그녀가 어떤 사람인지 알아야 해."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0252_COOPER_GREETING
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Cooper
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCCooperCarr
#. Face = Stern
#. SoundFileID = 00CEF871
#. ScriptNotes = More indifferent than rude. Kind of just wants to be done with the conversation. / Stern / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Cooper: Right. I think Opal said you were new. Take it from me. Sawyer isn't all that.
#. EDID: [0106D683]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00160A"
msgid "Right. Fine. I'm Cooper. I'm here because Opal and Sadie wanted me here. Not because Sawyer's get-togethers are my style. That's all."
msgstr "그래. 좋아. 난 쿠퍼야. 오팔과 세이디가 오라고 해서 왔어. 소이어의 모임이 내 취향이라서가 아니야. 그게 전부야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0252_COOPER_GREETING
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Cooper
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0045E296
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Cooper: You're Sawyer's new friend, right? Surprised you're not partying it up with him.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: So you're the overly friendly type? Great.
#. EDID: [0106D69D]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00160B"
msgid "I wanted to meet everyone else here."
msgstr "여기 있는 다른 사람들을 만나고 싶었어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0252_WREN_GREETING
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Wren
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 008BF8C7
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Wren: Hi there...|Sorry. I'm not too much of a talker, or that interesting. You'd be better off talking to my sister, Sadie.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: I just think you'll have a better time doing it elsewhere.
#. EDID: [0106D677]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00160C"
msgid "I was just told to mingle. I don't think it mattered with who."
msgstr "그냥 어울리라는 말만 들었어. 누구와인지는 상관없었던 것 같아."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0252_SADIE_GREETING
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Sadie
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCSadieCarr
#. Face = Friendly
#. SoundFileID = 00BD0853
#. ScriptNotes = Small chuckle. Casual, friendly, and chill. / Friendly / to Player Default
#. Prompt = I'm at a party. We'll see.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I'm at a party. We'll see.
#. DialogueAfter = Sadie: Anyway, the name's Sadie. If you ever need a moment of peace, feel free to come and talk. I don't care to get too drunk at these things.
#. EDID: [0106D676]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00160D"
msgid "Be careful, alright? Don't want to ruin the fun."
msgstr "조심해, 알겠지? 분위기 망치고 싶지 않잖아."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0252_SADIE_GREETING
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 009FB365
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Sadie: So you're the one Opal and Sawyer found? Hope you're planning on behaving yourself.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Sounds like the alcohol brought you then. Opal told me she met you at a bar.
#. EDID: [0106D6A7]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00160E"
msgid "Trust me, I don't even want to be here."
msgstr "믿어, 나도 여기 있고 싶지도 않아."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0252_WREN_GREETING
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Wren
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0091E0D9
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Wren: Hi there...|Sorry. I'm not too much of a talker, or that interesting. You'd be better off talking to my sister, Sadie.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Maybe...
#. EDID: [0106DC22]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00160F"
msgid "I'm sure you're more interesting than you think."
msgstr "넌 네 생각보다 더 흥미로운 사람일 거야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0480_PARTY
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Wren
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCWrenCarr
#. Face = Sad
#. SoundFileID = 00D23F2D
#. ScriptNotes = Guilty. Thinking she caused this huge fight. / Sad / to Wren
#. DialogueBefore = Wren: I'm sorry... &&& Cooper: You don't have to say anything. &&& Cooper: We're going home. &&& Opal: Sadie! Cooper! Wait! We can talk about this!
#. EDID: [01078788]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001610"
msgid "I'm sorry..."
msgstr "미안해..."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ04
#. SceneName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ04_KillianTL_TurnIn
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = KillianBrice
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMKillianBrice
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 004208C2
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = KillianBrice:
#. EDID: [01065745]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001612"
msgid "I'll let you know if I hear of any other lost shipments."
msgstr "다른 내던져진 선적물 소식을 들으면 알려주지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ04
#. SceneName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ04_KillianTL_TurnIn
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = KillianBrice
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMKillianBrice
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0037EA17
#. ScriptNotes = Pleased / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = KillianBrice: Excellent.
#. EDID: [0106574E]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001613"
msgid "Here is your payment."
msgstr "여기 보수다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Voice
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Voice
#. Face = Worried
#. SoundFileID = 0035AF9C
#. ScriptNotes = Talking to herself, worried about the predicament she finds herself in. / Worried
#. EDID: [010485FD]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001614"
msgid "What's going to happen to me?"
msgstr "나는 어떻게 되는 거야?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Voice
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Voice
#. Face = Defiant
#. SoundFileID = 00359BC0
#. ScriptNotes = Gloria doesn't want to talk to the player anymore after putting an end to the player's questioning. / Defiant
#. EDID: [0104BFFB]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001615"
msgid "I'm not saying another word."
msgstr "더는 한마디도 안 할 거야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Voice
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Voice
#. Face = Depressed
#. SoundFileID = 00D4FE2D
#. ScriptNotes = Gloria being a depressed teen trying to cope with the bad situation she's in. / Depressed
#. EDID: [010485EC]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001616"
msgid "This is not what I wanted."
msgstr "이건 내가 원한 게 아니야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC01
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Warning_3
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Speaker03
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Voice
#. Face = Spaceship / Pleading
#. SoundFileID = 0088A335
#. ScriptNotes = Gloria talking to player over PA system, trying to get them to turn around and leave her ship. / Pleading
#. EDID: SFFL_BE_EC01SharedInfo03
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001617"
msgid "Just...go away, okay? Please?"
msgstr "그냥... 가 줘, 알겠어? 제발?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC01
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Warning_3
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Speaker03
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Voice
#. Face = Spaceship / InPain
#. SoundFileID = 001784B0
#. ScriptNotes = Talking over PA: reacting after some object fell on her head after she reactivated ship gravity. / InPain
#. DialogueBefore = Speaker03: Okay, you asked for it. Defense systems activated! &&& Speaker04: No wait, that's not it. Let me try again.
#. EDID: SFFL_BE_EC01SharedInfo03
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001618"
msgid "Ow! That really hurt!"
msgstr "아야! 정말 아팠어!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC01
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Warning_Door
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Speaker06
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Voice
#. Face = Spaceship / Defiant
#. SoundFileID = 009A65B7
#. ScriptNotes = Gloria talking to player over PA system, trying to get them to turn around and leave her ship (mocking player they're trying to unlock a door). / Defiant
#. DialogueAfter = Speaker01: Turn around and go back to your ship.
#. EDID: SFFL_BE_EC01SharedInfo04
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001619"
msgid "Not even an expert could do it."
msgstr "전문가라도 못 했을 거야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC01
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Warning_Door
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Speaker06
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Voice
#. Face = Spaceship / Defiant
#. SoundFileID = 00A92B06
#. ScriptNotes = Gloria talking to player over PA system, trying to get them to turn around and leave her ship. / Defiant
#. EDID: SFFL_BE_EC01SharedInfo04
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00161A"
msgid "Ha! Good luck unlocking that door."
msgstr "하! 그 문을 열 수 있으면 열어 봐."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC01
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_MiscWarning
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Speaker03
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Voice
#. Face = Spaceship / Nervous
#. SoundFileID = 00564B73
#. ScriptNotes = Gloria talking to player over PA system, trying to get them to turn around and leave her ship. / Nervous
#. DialogueAfter = Speaker01: Turn around and go back to your ship.
#. EDID: SFFL_BE_EC01SharedInfo06
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00161B"
msgid "You're making a big mistake!"
msgstr "큰 실수를 하고 있어!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC01
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_MiscWarning
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Speaker03
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Voice
#. Face = Spaceship / Angry
#. SoundFileID = 000766A5
#. ScriptNotes = Gloria talking to player over PA system, trying to get them to turn around and leave her ship. / Angry
#. DialogueAfter = Speaker01: Turn around and go back to your ship.
#. EDID: SFFL_BE_EC01SharedInfo08
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00161C"
msgid "I don't need your help, so just go."
msgstr "네 도움 필요 없으니까 그냥 가."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Voice
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Voice
#. Face = Smirk
#. SoundFileID = 0098B708
#. ScriptNotes = Gloria doesn't care if the player takes stuff from the cargo ship, because it's her abusive stepfather's stuff. / Smirk
#. EDID: [0104D02F]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00161D"
msgid "If you want to grab some cargo on your way out, go crazy. My stepfather's got insurance."
msgstr "나가는 길에 화물 좀 가져가고 싶으면 마음대로 해. 새아버지가 보험 들어놨으니까."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Voice
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Voice
#. Face = Grateful
#. SoundFileID = 00B3C543
#. ScriptNotes = Gloria doesn't care if the player takes stuff from the cargo ship, because it's her abusive stepfather's stuff (though the player doesn't know that). / Grateful
#. EDID: [0104D02E]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00161E"
msgid "If you want to grab some cargo for your trouble, that's fine. We'll call it even."
msgstr "고생한 대가로 화물을 좀 가져가고 싶다면 괜찮아. 그걸로 퉁치자."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Voice
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Voice
#. Face = Nervous
#. SoundFileID = 002D1A8F
#. ScriptNotes = She's really afraid of her stepfather coming back to get his stolen ship,and wants to get on the player's ship ASAP. / Nervous
#. EDID: [0104D02D]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00161F"
msgid "We should hurry. My stepfather won't be alone."
msgstr "서둘러야 해. 새아버지가 혼자 오진 않을 거야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC01
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC01_GloriaSwansen_SC_Hard02
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Gloria
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Voice
#. Face = Smug
#. SoundFileID = 00A49305
#. ScriptNotes = While this line has the same text as the previous one, this time it is said in a sarcastic, mocking tone, meant to insult the player. / Smug
#. EDID: [01040743]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001620"
msgid "You mean, there's worse than you out there?"
msgstr "그 말은, 바깥에는 너보다 더한 게 있다는 거야?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC01
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC01_GloriaSwansen_SC_Easy03
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00579BEC
#. EDID: [01040755]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001621"
msgid "Why don't you just start from the beginning?"
msgstr "처음부터 말해 보지 그래?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC01
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Dialogue_600_OpeningUp
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Voice
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Voice
#. Face = Tired
#. SoundFileID = 0054B593
#. ScriptNotes = A bit miffed that the player told her to hold off on telling her story for a moment, after they tried to get her to speak. / Tired
#. Prompt = I do want to hear your story.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I do want to hear your story.
#. DialogueAfter = Gloria: The truth is... this isn't my ship. It's my stepfather's.
#. EDID: [01040770]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001622"
msgid "Okay, well listen until the end then."
msgstr "좋아, 그럼 끝까지 들어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC01
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC01_GloriaSwansen_SC_Med01
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00A37673
#. EDID: [01040778]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001623"
msgid "There must be people out there worried sick about you."
msgstr "네가 걱정돼서 미칠 것 같은 사람들도 있을 텐데."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC01
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC01_GloriaSwansen_SC_Hard02
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 007B5F0B
#. EDID: [01040758]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001624"
msgid "The next person to find you might not be as understanding as I am."
msgstr "다음에 널 발견하는 사람은 나만큼 이해심이 없을지도 몰라."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC01
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC01_GloriaSwansen_SC_Med02
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00744D2C
#. EDID: [01040744]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001625"
msgid "It's not safe for you to travel out here alone."
msgstr "여기서 혼자 여행하는 건 안전하지 않아."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC01
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC01_GloriaSwansen_SC_Easy05
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0082070D
#. EDID: [01040769]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001626"
msgid "I'm not your enemy, you know? Just a concerned stranger."
msgstr "난 네 적이 아니야, 알지? 그냥 걱정하는 낯선 사람일 뿐이야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC01
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC01_GloriaSwansen_SC_Easy02
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Gloria
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Voice
#. Face = Somber
#. SoundFileID = 0000ACDD
#. ScriptNotes = Gloria doesn't trust authority figures, and is clamming up. / Somber
#. EDID: [01040761]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001627"
msgid "Stop pretending you care. No one does."
msgstr "걱정하는 척 그만해. 아무도 신경 안 써."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC01
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC01_GloriaSwansen_SC_Med03
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0095BBDA
#. EDID: [01040751]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001628"
msgid "I don't care what you've done, I can't abandon you like that."
msgstr "네가 뭘 했든 상관없어. 널 그렇게 버려둘 순 없어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC01
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Dialogue_570_Neutral
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Gloria
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00BAED57
#. DialogueBefore = Gloria: What's up?
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: I'd rather not, if that's possible.
#. EDID: [0104073C]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001629"
msgid "I have a feeling you'd rather I not call the authorities. Am I right?"
msgstr "내가 당국에 신고하지 않았으면 하는 것 같은데. 맞지?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC01
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Dialogue_550_Guarded
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Gloria
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Voice
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 00F0B384
#. ScriptNotes = Trying to be dismissive, but at the same time appreciating the kind gesture from the player. Starting to feel less threatened a bit. / Confident
#. Prompt = I can spare food or water if needed.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I can spare food or water if needed.
#. DialogueAfter = Gloria: Tell me how a teenager ended up alone on this ship.
#. EDID: [01040741]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00162A"
msgid "I'm fine. Plenty of supplies on the ship. But thanks."
msgstr "난 괜찮아. 우주선에 보급품이 많거든. 그래도 고마워."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC01
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Dialogue_500_Initial_Encounter
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Gloria
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Voice
#. Face = Afraid
#. SoundFileID = 00749292
#. ScriptNotes = Afraid of the player who has just found her hiding in the cockpit of the stolen spaceship. / Afraid / to Player Default
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: I'm not going to hurt you, I just want to talk.
#. EDID: [0104073B]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00162B"
msgid "I don't want any trouble. Please don't hurt me."
msgstr "문제 일으키고 싶지 않아. 제발 해치지 말아줘."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC01
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC01_GloriaSwansen_SC_Easy03
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Gloria
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Voice
#. Face = Confused
#. SoundFileID = 00A9B24F
#. ScriptNotes = Gloria is not used to adults taking the time to hear her story, and it's catching her off-guard. / Confused
#. EDID: [0104074C]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00162C"
msgid "I don't know...I'm so confused right now."
msgstr "모르겠어... 지금 너무 혼란스러워."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC01
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Dialogue_500_Initial_Encounter
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Voice
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Voice
#. Face = Nervous
#. SoundFileID = 00C8B2E4
#. ScriptNotes = She'd rather not tell the story of how she stole the spaceship from her abusive stepfather. / Nervous
#. Prompt = I'm not going to hurt you, I just want to talk.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I'm not going to hurt you, I just want to talk.
#. DialogueAfter = Gloria: Tell me who you are and why you're on this ship.
#. EDID: [0104075D]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00162D"
msgid "I don't have anything to talk about."
msgstr "할 얘기 없어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC01
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Dialogue_600_OpeningUp
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00D49369
#. DialogueBefore = Gloria: Do you want to hear my story or not?
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Okay, well listen until the end then.
#. EDID: [0104077B]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00162E"
msgid "I do want to hear your story."
msgstr "네 이야기를 듣고 싶어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC01
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Dialogue_600_OpeningUp
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Gloria
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Voice
#. Face = Sad
#. SoundFileID = 00406916
#. ScriptNotes = Gloria opening up and telling the story of how she ran away from home after stealing her abusive stepfather's prized cargo ship. / Sad
#. DialogueAfter = Gloria: So that's it. That's my story.
#. EDID: [01040777]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00162F"
msgid "But he set up an anti-theft system that totally bricked the ship. He's probably on his way here."
msgstr "하지만 새아버지가 도난 방지 시스템을 설치해 둬서 우주선이 완전히 먹통이 됐어. 아마 여기로 오고 있을 거야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC01
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Dialogue_600_OpeningUp
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Gloria
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Voice
#. Face = Irritated
#. SoundFileID = 006A7053
#. ScriptNotes = Gloria opening up and telling the story of how she ran away from home after stealing her abusive stepfather's prized cargo ship. / Irritated
#. EDID: [01040777]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001630"
msgid "I had to get away, you know? As far away as I could... so I thought, why not take his ship, right?"
msgstr "도망쳐야 했어. 무슨 말인지 알지? 최대한 멀리... 그래서 생각했지. 새아버지의 우주선을 가져가면 어떨까 하고."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC01
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Dialogue_600_OpeningUp
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Gloria
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Voice
#. Face = Depressed
#. SoundFileID = 001369D2
#. ScriptNotes = Gloria opening up and telling the story of how she ran away from home after stealing her abusive stepfather's prized cargo ship. / Depressed
#. DialogueBefore = Gloria: Okay, well listen until the end then.
#. EDID: [01040777]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001631"
msgid "The truth is... this isn't my ship. It's my stepfather's."
msgstr "사실은... 이건 내 우주선이 아니야. 새아버지 거야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC01
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Dialogue_500_Initial_Encounter
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Gloria
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0024855A
#. DialogueBefore = Gloria: I don't want any trouble. Please don't hurt me.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Kinda? I don't know.
#. EDID: [01040756]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001632"
msgid "Do I look like I want to hurt you?"
msgstr "내가 널 해치고 싶어 하는 것처럼 보여?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC01
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC01_GloriaSwansen_SC_Gangster
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Gloria
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Voice
#. Face = Defiant
#. SoundFileID = 000B10A6
#. ScriptNotes = Trying to act tough in front of the tough player with a shady past. / Defiant
#. EDID: [01040766]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001633"
msgid "Don't worry, I won't take candy from strangers."
msgstr "걱정 마, 낯선 사람한테 사탕 받진 않을게."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC01
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC01_GloriaSwansen_SC_Easy04
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Gloria
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Voice
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 00ABDFF2
#. ScriptNotes = Gloria tells the player she can be as obstinate as they are as they try to question her. / Confident
#. EDID: [01040747]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001634"
msgid "Oh yeah? Wanna bet?"
msgstr "아 그래? 내기할래?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC01
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC01_GloriaSwansen_SC_Easy04
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Gloria
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Voice
#. Face = Depressed
#. SoundFileID = 00E8854D
#. ScriptNotes = She's starting to think that she might as well do as the player says as it's easier than always being defiant. / Depressed
#. EDID: [01040746]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001635"
msgid "*sigh* I'm already getting tired."
msgstr "*한숨* 벌써 지치기 시작하네."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC01
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Dialogue_570_Neutral
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Gloria
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Voice
#. Face = Stern
#. SoundFileID = 00305B28
#. ScriptNotes = She'd rather the player just leave her alone, doesn't want to tell the story of how she stole the spaceship from her abusive stepfather. / Stern
#. Prompt = What's your destination?
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: What's your destination?
#. DialogueAfter = Gloria: Tell me how a teenager ended up alone on this ship.
#. EDID: [01048C0E]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001636"
msgid "I'm afraid I can't tell you that."
msgstr "그건 말할 수 없어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC01
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Warning_1
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Speaker02
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Voice
#. Face = Spaceship / Irritated
#. SoundFileID = 009E093D
#. ScriptNotes = Gloria talking to player over PA system, trying to convince them to turn around and leave her ship. / Irritated
#. DialogueAfter = Speaker01: Turn around and go back to your ship.
#. EDID: SFFL_BE_EC01SharedInfo12
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001637"
msgid "You're trespassing right now. Go back to your ship."
msgstr "지금 무단 침입 중인 거 알아? 네 우주선으로 돌아가."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC01
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Warning_1
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Speaker02
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Voice
#. Face = Spaceship / Irritated
#. SoundFileID = 00F7956D
#. ScriptNotes = Gloria talking to player over PA system, trying to convince them to turn around and leave her ship. / Irritated
#. EDID: SFFL_BE_EC01SharedInfo12
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001638"
msgid "What are you doing? I told you we didn't need anything!"
msgstr "뭐 하는 거야? 아무것도 필요 없다고 했잖아!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC01
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Dialogue_550_Guarded
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Gloria
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Voice
#. Face = Worried
#. SoundFileID = 0021D3EC
#. ScriptNotes = Trying to lie herself out of this. She'd rather not tell the story of how she stole the spaceship from her abusive stepfather. / Worried
#. Prompt = What kind of cargo are you transporting?
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: What kind of cargo are you transporting?
#. DialogueAfter = Gloria: Tell me who you are and why you're on this ship.
#. EDID: [01048C09]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001639"
msgid "Oh you know, all kinds of stuff. Nothing out of the ordinary. Just regular cargo."
msgstr "알잖아. 이것저것 있어. 평범한 것들이야. 그냥 일반 화물이라고."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC01
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Dialogue_630_PlayerKnowsStory
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Gloria
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Voice
#. Face = Somber
#. SoundFileID = 00D6C958
#. ScriptNotes = Player ended the conversation, and it's fine with her as she can go back to brooding. / Somber / to Player Default
#. Prompt = That's it for now.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: That's it for now.
#. DialogueAfter = Gloria: Here, take this. I don't need it anymore.
#. EDID: [0104A1C7]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00163A"
msgid "Okay."
msgstr "알겠어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC01
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Dialogue_630_PlayerKnowsStory
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Gloria
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Voice
#. Face = Grateful
#. SoundFileID = 00E30200
#. ScriptNotes = Gloria grateful that the player has accepted to take her to her cousin's in New Atlantis. / Grateful / to Player Default
#. Prompt = I guess I could take you to New Atlantis.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I guess I could take you to New Atlantis.
#. DialogueAfter = Gloria: Here, take this. I don't need it anymore.
#. EDID: [0104A1C0]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00163B"
msgid "You would do that for me? Really? Thank you!"
msgstr "날 위해 그렇게 해준다고? 정말? 고마워!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC01
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Dialogue_630_PlayerKnowsStory
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Gloria
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 005CF5E0
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I do want to hear your story. &&& Gloria: Okay, well listen until the end then. &&& Gloria: The truth is... this isn't my ship. It's my stepfather's.|I had to get away, you know? As far away as I could... so I thought, why not take his ship, right?|But he set up an anti-theft system that totally bricked the ship. He's probably on his way here. &&& Gloria: So that's it. That's my story.|Kind of lame now that I said it out loud...
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: You would do that for me? Really? Thank you!
#. EDID: [0104A1BE]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00163C"
msgid "I guess I could take you to New Atlantis."
msgstr "뉴아틀란티스까지 데려다줄 수는 있을 것 같아."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC01
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Dialogue_630_PlayerKnowsStory
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Gloria
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Voice
#. Face = Defiant
#. SoundFileID = 00A1546A
#. ScriptNotes = She really does not want to go back to an abusive familial situation. / Defiant / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Space is dangerous, maybe it's best to go back to your father?
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Space is dangerous, maybe it's best to go back to your father?
#. DialogueAfter = Gloria: I can give you a lift if you want.
#. EDID: [0104A1CB]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00163D"
msgid "Stepfather, not father. And no, it's not for the best. I'll just run away again."
msgstr "아버지가 아니라 새아버지야. 그리고 전혀 안 좋아. 돌아가 봤자 난 그냥 또 도망칠 거니까."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC01
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Dialogue_630_PlayerKnowsStory
