#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Sure, I can do that.
#. EDID: [0104A1C6]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00163E"
msgid "Can you tell me your story again?"
msgstr "네 이야기를 다시 들려줄 수 있겠니?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC01
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Dialogue_630_PlayerKnowsStory
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Gloria
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Voice
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00346D5D
#. ScriptNotes = More comfortable around the player now that she's told the story of how she stole her stepfather's ship. / Neutral / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Gloria: The truth is... this isn't my ship. It's my stepfather's.|I had to get away, you know? As far away as I could... so I thought, why not take his ship, right?|But he set up an anti-theft system that totally bricked the ship. He's probably on his way here.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: I can give you a lift if you want.
#. EDID: [01040775]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00163F"
msgid "Did you want to ask me something?"
msgstr "뭐 물어보고 싶은 거 있어?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC01
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Dialogue_700_WaitingForStepfather
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Gloria
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0056422F
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Gloria:
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Me? Oh, I'll be fine. I enjoy being stranded in outer space.
#. EDID: [0104D01B]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001640"
msgid "Are you going to be okay?"
msgstr "괜찮겠어?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC01
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Dialogue_700_WaitingForStepfather
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Gloria
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Voice
#. Face = Defiant
#. SoundFileID = 003D438C
#. ScriptNotes = Gloria clamming up. She'd rather deal with her problems than talk about them with an adult. / Defiant / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Do you need anything else before I go?
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Do you need anything else before I go?
#. DialogueAfter = Gloria: I'll just...come back for the ship later.
#. EDID: [0104D01C]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001641"
msgid "Nope. I'm fine. Goodbye, now."
msgstr "아니. 괜찮아. 그럼 잘 가."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC01
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Dialogue_700_WaitingForStepfather
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Gloria
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Voice
#. Face = Tired
#. SoundFileID = 002D45ED
#. ScriptNotes = Gloria stole the ship from her abusive stepfather, and so doesn't care if the player steals stuff. / Tired / to Player Default
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: I could take you to a spaceport if you want.
#. EDID: [0104D026]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001642"
msgid "Help yourself to whatever cargo you want before leaving. I don't care."
msgstr "떠나기 전에 원하는 화물은 뭐든 가져가. 난 상관없어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC01
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Dialogue_630_PlayerKnowsStory
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Voice
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Voice
#. Face = Pleading
#. SoundFileID = 002E7E5C
#. ScriptNotes = Gloria lights up as a new opportunity for a new, brighter future with her cousin in New Atlantis presents itself. / Pleading / to Player Default
#. Prompt = I can give you a lift if you want.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I can give you a lift if you want.
#. DialogueAfter = Gloria: Here, take this. I don't need it anymore.
#. EDID: [0106B985]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001643"
msgid "I didn't want to ask... but it'd be awesome if you could take me to my cousin's in New Atlantis."
msgstr "이런 부탁하고 싶진 않았는데... 뉴아틀란티스에 있는 사촌 집까지 데려다주면 좋겠어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC01
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Dialogue_630_PlayerKnowsStory
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
