#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: I didn't want to ask... but it'd be awesome if you could take me to my cousin's in New Atlantis.
#. EDID: [0106B987]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001644"
msgid "I can give you a lift if you want."
msgstr "원하면 태워다줄 수 있어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_EC01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Voice
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Voice
#. Face = Irritated
#. SoundFileID = 0075F648
#. ScriptNotes = Enthusiastically impatient. / Irritated
#. EDID: [0104DACD]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001645"
msgid "Can we go out now? I want to breathe some fresh air."
msgstr "이제 나가도 돼? 신선한 공기를 좀 마시고 싶어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_EC01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = SarahMorgan
#. VoiceType = NPCFSarahMorgan
#. Face = Sad
#. SoundFileID = 00E562BD
#. ScriptNotes = Sarah commenting on the runaway teen now aboard the ship, reminiscing about her own youth. / Sad
#. EDID: [0106C50E]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001646"
msgid "She was the lead singer in my band. We knew she had it rough at home. One day she was just... gone."
msgstr "그녀는 우리 밴드의 리드 보컬이었어요. 집안 사정이 힘들다는 건 알고 있었죠. 어느 날 그냥... 사라졌어요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_EC01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = SarahMorgan
#. VoiceType = NPCFSarahMorgan
#. Face = Thinking
#. SoundFileID = 00103AA7
#. ScriptNotes = Sarah commenting on the runaway teen now aboard the ship, reminiscing about her own youth. / Thinking
#. EDID: [0106C50E]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001647"
msgid "Poor girl. She reminds me of a friend I had, back when I was her age."
msgstr "불쌍한 아이예요. 제가 그 나이였을 때 알던 친구가 떠오르네요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_EC01
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE_EC01_80_AcceptHailScene
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = cargoShip
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00D49646
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = cargoShip: Hey there, if you can hear me...we're fine! We don't need anything! &&& cargoShip: ...wait, is it this button? Or that one? &&& cargoShip: &&& cargoShip: Really, there's no need to respond.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: No, don't do that! Uh...we'll fix the ship ourselves. But thanks!
#. EDID: [010485EA]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001648"
msgid "Do you need me to call someone for assistance with your ship?"
msgstr "우주선 문제를 도와줄 사람을 부를까요?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_EC01
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE_EC01_80_AcceptHailScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = cargoShip
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Voice
#. Face = Spaceship / Nervous
#. SoundFileID = 004DE191
#. ScriptNotes = Trying to get the player's ship to just continue on their way, and not stop to help (as she's in a stolen ship and would get caught). / Nervous / to Player Default
#. Prompt = What's your situation? Are you in danger?
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: What's your situation? Are you in danger?
#. DialogueAfter = cargoShip: Seems you're having problems. I can come aboard to help.
#. EDID: [010485FF]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001649"
msgid "Huh...just a temporary hiccup. We're working on it. Just keep going. Bye!"
msgstr "허... 그냥 일시적인 문제야. 알아서 처리 중이야. 계속 가. 안녕!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_EC01
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE_EC01_550_GloriaGoodbye
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Gloria
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0079607D
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Gloria: Well, I guess this is it.|Thank you so much for helping me. I'll never forget it. &&& Gloria: Here, take this. For being such a nice person.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: I don't know yet... Where my feet will take me, I guess. It's like an adventure!
#. EDID: [0104DACE]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00164A"
msgid "Where do you go from here?"
msgstr "이제 어디로 갈 거니?"

