#. SoundFileID = 003E25AA
#. ScriptNotes = The player has stopped talking mid-conversation and there's a long, awkward pause. / Question
#. EDID: [0106BB86]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00164E"
msgid "Still with me?"
msgstr "아직 곁에 있지?"

