#. ScriptNotes = Relief / Relieved / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Just here to do a job.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Just here to do a job.
#. DialogueAfter = MilesCutler: If you're here, that must mean Lucia made it out. Thank goodness.
#. EDID: [010404A9]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00164F"
msgid "If that job is rescuing me, I'm not going to complain."
msgstr "날 구하려고 그러는 거라면, 불평 안 할게."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ03
#. SceneName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ03_MilesScene
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 001BDF4F
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: If you want to talk about it, I'm listening. &&& MilesCutler: Yeah. You risked a lot coming out here, so it's the least I can do. &&& MilesCutler: He was a doctor, well-respected but arrogant.|My wife was about to give birth and there were complications. The life-threatening kind.|He demanded to do the surgery, but it wasn't his area of expertise.|His hubris cost both of their lives.|He left the very next day, and cut off all contact. &&& companion: It's not hard to understand how such a tragedy could tear a family apart.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: I don't know. It's been a real long time. I'm not even sure how much he cares anymore.
#. EDID: [01040492]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001650"
msgid "He's at Anchorpoint. You should reach out, try to heal the rift."
msgstr "그는 앵커포인트에 있어요. 연락해 보세요. 관계를 회복해 보세요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ03
#. SceneName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ03_MilesScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = MilesCutler
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMMilesCutler
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00D7596E
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = You have every right to want him out of your life.
#. DialogueAfter = MilesCutler: I'm going to rest here a little bit, and then use their transmitter to call Lucia for a lift.
#. EDID: [01040493]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001651"
msgid "But there's a difference between wanting me to be alive and wanting me in his life."
msgstr "하지만 내가 살아 있길 바라는 것과, 아버지의 인생에 내가 있길 바라는 건 다르지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ03
#. SceneName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ03_MilesScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = MilesCutler
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMMilesCutler
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0028C463
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = You have every right to want him out of your life.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: You have every right to want him out of your life.
#. EDID: [01040493]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001652"
msgid "I guess so."
msgstr "그런 것 같아."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ03
#. SceneName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ03_MilesScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = MilesCutler
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMMilesCutler
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 005FF04B
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Relationships between fathers and sons can be complicated.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Relationships between fathers and sons can be complicated.
#. DialogueAfter = MilesCutler: I'm going to rest here a little bit, and then use their transmitter to call Lucia for a lift.
#. EDID: [0104049C]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001653"
msgid "Believe me, I know that better than anyone."
msgstr "믿어줘. 그건 내가 누구보다 잘 알아."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ03
#. SceneName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ03_MilesScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = MilesCutler
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMMilesCutler
#. Face = Impressed
#. SoundFileID = 00348DA7
#. ScriptNotes = Impressed, delighted. Saved by Superman! / Impressed / to Player Default
#. Prompt = I'm the famed galactic superhero called... The Mantis!
#. DialogueAfter = MilesCutler: If you're here, that must mean Lucia made it out. Thank goodness.
#. EDID: [01040497]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001654"
msgid "Wow, I don't know what to say. Thank you, Mantis!"
msgstr "와, 뭐라고 해야 할지 모르겠어. 고마워! 맨티스!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ03
#. SceneName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ03_MilesScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = MilesCutler
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMMilesCutler
#. Face = Surprised
#. SoundFileID = 00083B85
#. ScriptNotes = Surprised and also impressed / Surprised / to Player Default
#. Prompt = I'm the famed galactic superhero called... The Mantis!
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I'm the famed galactic superhero called... The Mantis!
#. EDID: [01040497]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001655"
msgid "Wait, seriously? Those stories are true?"
msgstr "잠깐, 진짜야? 그 이야기들이 사실이었다고요?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ03
#. SceneName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ03_MilesScene
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = MilesCutler
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00526A9C
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = MilesCutler: Who are you? You're not one of them.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: If that job is rescuing me, I'm not going to complain.
#. EDID: [01040485]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001656"
msgid "Just here to do a job."
msgstr "그냥 일하러 온 겁니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ03
#. SceneName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ03_MilesScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMMilesCutler
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMMilesCutler
#. Face = Relieved
#. SoundFileID = 00785B2C
#. ScriptNotes = Huge relief / Relieved / to Player Default
#. Prompt = I'm here to rescue you.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I'm here to rescue you.
#. DialogueAfter = MilesCutler: If you're here, that must mean Lucia made it out. Thank goodness.
#. EDID: [01040489]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001657"
msgid "You have no idea how happy I am to hear those words."
msgstr "그 말을 듣게 되어 얼마나 기쁜지 넌 짐작도 못할 거야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ03
#. SceneName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ03_MilesScene
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0080F0D1
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = MilesCutler: Who are you? You're not one of them.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: You have no idea how happy I am to hear those words.
#. EDID: [01040498]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001658"
msgid "I'm here to rescue you."
msgstr "당신을 구하러 왔습니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ03
#. SceneName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ03_SC06Hard
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = MilesCutler
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMMilesCutler
#. Face = Sad
#. SoundFileID = 00E3D57C
#. ScriptNotes = Conflicted / Sad / to Player Default
#. EDID: [0106BBE1]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001659"
msgid "It's one thing to feel sorry for yourself, but to abandon your family? I don't know if I can forgive that."
msgstr "자기연민에 빠지는 건 그렇다 쳐도, 가족을 버렸잖아? 그걸 용서할 수 있을지 모르겠어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ03
#. SceneName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ03_SC06Hard
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = MilesCutler
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMMilesCutler
#. Face = Stern
#. SoundFileID = 00B729F1
#. ScriptNotes = Stern / Stern / to Player Default
#. EDID: [0106BBE0]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00165A"
msgid "If he wants to wallow in pity, I'm not going to stop him."
msgstr "아버지가 자기연민에 빠져 허우적대고 싶다면, 말리진 않을 거야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ03
#. SceneName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ03_SC06Hard
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = MilesCutler
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMMilesCutler
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00FFE207
#. ScriptNotes = Thinking about things, coming around to the player's persuasive argument. / to Player Default
#. EDID: [0106BBDC]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00165B"
msgid "I never wanted any of this, but if I can make things right, then maybe I should."
msgstr "이렇게 되길 원한 적은 없지만, 바로잡을 수 있다면 그래야 할지도 모르지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ03
#. SceneName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ03_SC02Easy
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = MilesCutler
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMMilesCutler
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00DA4A18
#. ScriptNotes = Skeptical, irritated / to Player Default
#. EDID: [0106BBBE]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00165C"
msgid "After a while, you learn to live with the pain."
msgstr "시간이 지나면 그 고통과 함께 사는 법을 배우게 돼."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ03
#. SceneName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ03_SC02Easy
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = MilesCutler
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMMilesCutler
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00F69C8B
#. ScriptNotes = Skeptical, irritated / to Player Default
#. EDID: [0106BBBD]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00165D"
msgid "What do you know about it, anyway? It's between me and him."
msgstr "네가 대체 뭘 안다고? 이건 나와 그 인간 사이의 일이야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ03
#. SceneName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ03_SC01Easy
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = MilesCutler
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMMilesCutler
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0064E75A
#. ScriptNotes = Thinking about things, coming around to the player's persuasive argument. / to Player Default
#. EDID: [0106BBEB]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00165E"
msgid "After what just happened to me, I'm inclined to agree."
msgstr "방금 내게 일어난 일을 생각하면, 동의하는 쪽으로 기울게 되네."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ03
#. SceneName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ03_SC05Hard
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = MilesCutler
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMMilesCutler
#. Face = Irritated
#. SoundFileID = 004F7CBF
#. ScriptNotes = Irritated / Irritated / to Player Default
#. EDID: [0106BC00]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00165F"
msgid "If he really wanted to talk, he's always known how to reach me."
msgstr "정말 이야기하고 싶었다면, 아버지는 언제든 나에게 연락할 수 있었어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ03
#. SceneName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ03_SC04Medium
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = MilesCutler
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMMilesCutler
#. Face = Sad
#. SoundFileID = 002C9943
#. ScriptNotes = Sad, halting / Sad / to Player Default
#. EDID: [0106BBF7]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001660"
msgid "I want to be strong, but the grief is unbearable some days."
msgstr "강해지고 싶지만, 어떤 날은 슬픔을 감당할 수가 없어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ03
#. SceneName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ03_SC04Medium
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = MilesCutler
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMMilesCutler
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00087242
#. ScriptNotes = Thinking about things, coming around to the player's persuasive argument. / to Player Default
#. EDID: [0106BBF3]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001661"
msgid "It'll be difficult, I know, but maybe you're right."
msgstr "어렵겠지만, 네 말이 맞을지도 몰라."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ03
#. SceneName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ03_MilesScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = companion
#. VoiceType = NPCFSarahMorgan
#. Face = Sad
#. SoundFileID = 00DDFECB
#. ScriptNotes = Sincere sympathy / Sad / to MilesCutler
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: If you want to talk about it, I'm listening. &&& MilesCutler: Yeah. You risked a lot coming out here, so it's the least I can do. &&& MilesCutler: He was a doctor, well-respected but arrogant.|My wife was about to give birth and there were complications. The life-threatening kind.|He demanded to do the surgery, but it wasn't his area of expertise.|His hubris cost both of their lives.|He left the very next day, and cut off all contact.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: He's at Anchorpoint. You should reach out, try to heal the rift.
#. EDID: [0106BBC4]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001662"
msgid "That's truly awful. I'm so sorry."
msgstr "정말 끔찍하네요. 유감입니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ03
#. SceneName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ03_MilesScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = companion
#. VoiceType = NPCMBarrett
#. Face = Sad
#. SoundFileID = 00E142D5
#. ScriptNotes = Sad / Sad / to MilesCutler
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: If you want to talk about it, I'm listening. &&& MilesCutler: Yeah. You risked a lot coming out here, so it's the least I can do. &&& MilesCutler: He was a doctor, well-respected but arrogant.|My wife was about to give birth and there were complications. The life-threatening kind.|He demanded to do the surgery, but it wasn't his area of expertise.|His hubris cost both of their lives.|He left the very next day, and cut off all contact.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: He's at Anchorpoint. You should reach out, try to heal the rift.
#. EDID: [0106BBC2]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001663"
msgid "That is truly heartbreaking. "
msgstr "정말 가슴 아픈 일이네요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ03
#. SceneName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ03_SC04Medium
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00953060
#. ScriptNotes = / to MilesCutler
#. EDID: [0106BBB2]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001664"
msgid "You need to find it within yourself to rise above the pain and do what's right."
msgstr "당신 안에서 고통을 딛고 옳은 일을 할 힘을 찾아야 합니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ03
#. SceneName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ03_SC04Medium
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00188221
#. ScriptNotes = / to MilesCutler
#. EDID: [0106BBB1]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001665"
msgid "Sometimes, it takes a lot of strength to forgive someone. Be strong."
msgstr "때로는 누군가를 용서하는 데 큰 힘이 필요합니다. 강해지세요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ03
#. SceneName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ03_SC02Easy
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0008A3EF
#. ScriptNotes = / to MilesCutler
#. EDID: [0106BB90]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001666"
msgid "You can't ignore this pain forever. It's time to start healing."
msgstr "이 고통을 영원히 외면할 수는 없어요. 이제 치유를 시작할 때입니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ03
#. SceneName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ03_SC02Easy
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00EA661A
#. ScriptNotes = / to MilesCutler
#. EDID: [0106BB8E]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001667"
msgid "You know what they say about open wounds. They tend to fester."
msgstr "벌어진 상처가 어떻게 되는지 알잖아요. 곪기 마련이죠."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ03
#. SceneName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ03_SC03Medium
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = MilesCutler
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMMilesCutler
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 001DCACA
#. ScriptNotes = Thinking about things, coming around to the player's persuasive argument. / to Player Default
#. EDID: [0106BBC7]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001668"
msgid "I used to be so proud of my father. I miss feeling that way."
msgstr "예전엔 아버지가 정말 자랑스러웠어. 그렇게 느끼던 시절이 그리워."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ03
#. SceneName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ03_SC03Medium
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = MilesCutler
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMMilesCutler
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00D89AAB
#. ScriptNotes = Thinking about things, coming around to the player's persuasive argument. Emphasize "has". / to Player Default
#. EDID: [0106BBC6]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001669"
msgid "Family has always been important to me."
msgstr "나에게 가족은 언제나 중요했어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ03
#. SceneName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ03_MilesScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMMilesCutler
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMMilesCutler
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0038ED28
#. ScriptNotes = Acceptance, a touch a hope / to Player Default
#. Prompt = He's at Anchorpoint. You should reach out, try to heal the rift.
#. DialogueBefore = MilesCutler: I don't know. It's been a real long time. I'm not even sure how much he cares anymore.
#. DialogueAfter = MilesCutler: I'm going to rest here a little bit, and then use their transmitter to call Lucia for a lift.
#. EDID: [0106BBA8]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00166A"
msgid "You're right. I think it's time to mend some old wounds."
msgstr "네 말이 맞아. 오래된 상처를 치유할 때인 것 같아."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ03
#. SceneName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ03_MilesScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = MilesCutler
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMMilesCutler
#. Face = Suspicious
#. SoundFileID = 0016A25D
#. ScriptNotes = Stretch out that "riiight..." it's dripping with skepticism. You really doubt this statement. / Suspicious / to Player Default
#. Prompt = [Lie] I'm the famed galactic superhero called... The Mantis!
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: [Lie] I'm the famed galactic superhero called... The Mantis!
#. DialogueAfter = MilesCutler: If you're here, that must mean Lucia made it out. Thank goodness.
#. EDID: [0106BB80]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00166B"
msgid "Right. Well, um, Mantis, thanks for coming to my rescue."
msgstr "그래. 어, 맨티스, 구하러 와 줘서 고마워."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ03
#. SceneName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ03_MilesScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMMilesCutler
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMMilesCutler
#. Face = Somber
#. SoundFileID = 0067D878
#. ScriptNotes = Somber, bracing to talk about painful things. / Somber / to Player Default
#. Prompt = If you want to talk about it, I'm listening.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: If you want to talk about it, I'm listening.
#. DialogueAfter = MilesCutler: He was a doctor, well-respected but arrogant.
#. EDID: [0106BBAE]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00166C"
msgid "Yeah. You risked a lot coming out here, so it's the least I can do."
msgstr "그래. 여기까지 오는 데 큰 위험을 감수했으니, 이 정도는 해야지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ03
#. SceneName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ03_MilesScene
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = MilesCutler
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00B1269D
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = MilesCutler: Who are you? You're not one of them.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Right. Well, um, Mantis, thanks for coming to my rescue.
#. EDID: [0106BBA5]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00166D"
msgid "[Lie] I'm the famed galactic superhero called... The Mantis!"
msgstr "[거짓말] 나는... 맨티스라고 불리는 유명한 은하계 슈퍼히어로다!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMCivilian / NPCFCivilian
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R03_NPCMCivilian01 / SFFL_R03_NPCFCivilian01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 004583F5
#. EDID: [0104C427]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00166E"
msgid "We'd be stranded if not for you."
msgstr "당신이 아니었다면 우린 조난당했을 거예요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCFCivilian
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R03_NPCFCivilian01
#. Face = Confused
#. SoundFileID = 00010EDB
#. ScriptNotes = Confused
#. EDID: [0104C41E]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00166F"
msgid "Waiting for your response. "
msgstr "응답을 기다리고 있습니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMCivilian
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R03_NPCMCivilian01
#. Face = Confused
#. SoundFileID = 000F0DEA
#. ScriptNotes = Confused
#. EDID: [0104C41A]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001670"
msgid "Uh..."
msgstr "어..."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMCivilian
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R03_NPCMCivilian01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00B8FF26
#. EDID: [01050248]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001671"
msgid "Thanks. For everything."
msgstr "고마워요. 전부 다요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMCivilian
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R03_NPCMCivilian01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00B90733
#. EDID: [01050247]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001672"
msgid "We'll try not to get in your way."
msgstr "방해되지 않도록 할게요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. SceneName = SFFL_R03_175a_SpeakWithCaptain_Friendly_ShipDamaged
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMCivilian
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R03_NPCMCivilian01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 001137B5
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = We won't have any problems if you don't make any problems.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: We won't have any problems if you don't make any problems.
#. DialogueAfter = Captain: I'm not trying to start a fight here. I appreciate you helping us, but a bit of caution is reasonable after what just happened.
#. EDID: SFFL_R03SharedInfo01_CaptainInfo01
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001673"
msgid "*Sigh* Fair enough, I guess. "
msgstr "*한숨* 그 정도면 공평하겠네요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCFCivilian
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R03_NPCFCivilian01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0031490D
#. EDID: SFFL_R03SharedShipHello05
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001674"
msgid "The captain is waiting for you. You'll speak with them on board."
msgstr "선장이 당신을 기다리고 있습니다. 승선해서 선장과 대화하세요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCFCivilian
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R03_NPCFCivilian01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 004A91D3
#. EDID: SFFL_R03SharedShipHello01
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001675"
msgid "The captain is waiting for you on board."
msgstr "선장이 우주선 안에서 당신을 기다리고 있습니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCFCivilian
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R03_NPCFCivilian01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 008F2AA7
#. EDID: SFFL_R03SharedShipHello03
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001676"
msgid "The captain will speak with you on board."
msgstr "선장이 우주선 안에서 당신과 이야기할 겁니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. SceneName = SFFL_R03_100a_DefenderHailStart
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = HailingShip
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R03_NPCFCivilian01
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0033E39E
#. ScriptNotes = not said desperately, just asking them to respond to your hail / to HailingShip
#. EDID: [0103D1C1]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001677"
msgid "Requesting response. This is urgent. "
msgstr "응답 요청. 긴급 상황입니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. SceneName = SFFL_R03_100b_DefenderHailAccepted
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = HailingShip
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R03_NPCFCivilian01
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00E4CDBE
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I'll give you a ride.
#. EDID: [01052EA2]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001678"
msgid "Copy that. We'll see you aboard. The captain will be waiting for you."
msgstr "알겠습니다. 우주선에서 뵙죠. 선장이 당신을 기다리고 있을 겁니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. SceneName = SFFL_R03_100b_DefenderHailAccepted
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = HailingShip
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R03_NPCFCivilian01
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0040E7BE
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I'll give you a ride.
#. EDID: [0103D1BA]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001679"
msgid "We'll see you on board. You can speak with our captain then."
msgstr "우주선에서 뵙죠. 그때 저희 선장과 이야기하실 수 있습니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. SceneName = SFFL_R03_100b_DefenderHailAccepted
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = HailingShip
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0024F909
#. DialogueBefore = HailingShip: &&& HailingShip: &&& HailingShip:
#. EDID: [0103D1BB]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00167A"
msgid "I can't give you a ride. "
msgstr "태워 드릴 수는 없습니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. SceneName = SFFL_R03_100b_DefenderHailAccepted
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = HailingShip
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R03_NPCFCivilian01
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00C13137
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: I'll give you a ride.
#. EDID: [01052EA5]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00167B"
msgid "*Sigh* Look, we're as good as stranded now. Do you think you could at least fly us out of here?"
msgstr "*한숨* 봐요, 우린 이제 사실상 조난당한 거나 마찬가지예요. 적어도 우리를 여기서 데리고 나가 줄 수는 없나요?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. SceneName = SFFL_R03_100b_DefenderHailAccepted
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = HailingShip
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R03_NPCFCivilian01
#. Face = Spaceship / Irritated
#. SoundFileID = 0081DA63
#. ScriptNotes = Irritated
#. DialogueBefore = HailingShip:
#. EDID: [01052EA5]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00167C"
msgid "You never thought to give us a hand back there? While you were twiddling your thumbs, our pilot was killed. "
msgstr "거기서 우리를 도와줄 생각은 전혀 안 했나요? 당신이 손 놓고 있는 사이에 우리 조종사가 죽었어요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. SceneName = SFFL_R03_100b_DefenderHailAccepted
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = HailingShip
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R03_NPCFCivilian01
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00E156D3
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral
#. EDID: [01052EA7]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00167D"
msgid "It looks like our engines and Grav Drive were heavily damaged during the attack. I hate to ask, but could you fly us out of here?"
msgstr "공격 중에 엔진과 중력 구동기가 심하게 손상된 것 같습니다. 이런 부탁 드리기 싫지만, 우리를 여기서 데려가 주실 수 있나요?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. SceneName = SFFL_R03_100b_DefenderHailAccepted
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = HailingShip
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R03_NPCFCivilian01
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00D91374
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral
#. DialogueBefore = HailingShip:
#. EDID: [01052EA7]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00167E"
msgid "Damn, things were getting dicey there for a minute. Not sure we would've survived if you hadn't shown up."
msgstr "젠장, 잠깐 정말 위험했어. 당신이 나타나지 않았다면 우리가 살아남았을지 모르겠군."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. SceneName = SFFL_R03_175a_SpeakWithCaptain_Betrayal_ShipDamaged01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Captain
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R03_NPCMCivilian01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 009A45F9
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Let's get going.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Let's get going.
#. DialogueAfter = Captain: The thing is, we aren't who you think we are.
#. EDID: [0103E241]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00167F"
msgid "Yeah, guess we should get going before any more Spacers show up."
msgstr "그래, 스페이서가 더 나타나기 전에 출발해야겠어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. SceneName = SFFL_R03_175a_SpeakWithCaptain_Betrayal_ShipDamaged01
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Captain
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0078C949
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Captain: &&& Captain:
#. EDID: [0103E23F]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001680"
msgid "Let's get going."
msgstr "출발하지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. SceneName = SFFL_R03_175a_SpeakWithCaptain_Betrayal_ShipDamaged01
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0019C8EE
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Captain: &&& Captain:
#. EDID: [0103E249]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001681"
msgid "Thanks."
msgstr "고마워."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. SceneName = SFFL_R03_175a_SpeakWithCaptain_Betrayal_ShipDamaged01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Captain
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R03_NPCMCivilian01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00E4FE9C
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral / to Player Default
#. EDID: [01053D6F]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001682"
msgid "Thanks for helping us out. I know it's a burden."
msgstr "도와줘서 고맙군. 정말 부담되는 일이었을 텐데."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. SceneName = SFFL_R03_175a_SpeakWithCaptain_Betrayal_ShipDamaged01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Captain
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R03_NPCMCivilian01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 007D255C
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral / to Player Default
#. EDID: [01053D6E]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001683"
msgid "Ah, good, you're here. We're ready to leave when you are."
msgstr "아, 좋아, 오셨군. 우리도 떠날 준비가 됐어. 그쪽도 준비는 됐겠지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. SceneName = SFFL_R03_175a_SpeakWithCaptain_Friendly_ShipDamaged
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Captain
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R03_NPCMCivilian01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00955FC3
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Let's just get a move on. We're wasting time here.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Let's just get a move on. We're wasting time here.
#. EDID: [0103EDF8]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001684"
msgid "Works for me."
msgstr "전 괜찮습니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. SceneName = SFFL_R03_175a_SpeakWithCaptain_Friendly_ShipDamaged
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00876700
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Captain: Thanks for helping us out. We're all packed and ready to go. |But, you know, I have to ask. Can we trust you? We aren't going to have any problems, are we?
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: *Sigh* Fair enough, I guess.
#. EDID: [0103EDFD]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001685"
msgid "We won't have any problems if you don't make any problems."
msgstr "문제 만들지만 않으면 우리도 문제 없을 겁니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. SceneName = SFFL_R03_175a_SpeakWithCaptain_Friendly_ShipDamaged
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMCivilian
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R03_NPCMCivilian01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00F8A70E
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = We won't have any problems if you don't make any problems.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: We won't have any problems if you don't make any problems.
#. DialogueAfter = Captain: I'm not trying to start a fight here. I appreciate you helping us, but a bit of caution is reasonable after what just happened.
#. EDID: [010530D3]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001686"
msgid "I don't mean to come across as ungrateful. "
msgstr "감사할 줄 모르는 것처럼 보이고 싶지는 않습니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. SceneName = SFFL_R03_175a_SpeakWithCaptain_Friendly_ShipDamaged
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Captain
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00876989
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Captain: Thanks for helping us out. We're all packed and ready to go. |But, you know, I have to ask. Can we trust you? We aren't going to have any problems, are we?
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: No, but you'll forgive me if I'm shaken up after almost getting blasted apart by spacers.
#. EDID: [0103EDF9]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001687"
msgid "Did I do anything to make you nervous?"
msgstr "제가 뭐 긴장하게 만들만한 짓을 했나요?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. SceneName = SFFL_R03_175a_SpeakWithCaptain_Friendly_ShipDamaged01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Captain
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R03_NPCMCivilian01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00007160
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Let's just get a move on. We're wasting time here.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Let's just get a move on. We're wasting time here.
#. EDID: [010530C6]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001688"
msgid "Got it, let's go."
msgstr "알았어요. 갑시다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. SceneName = SFFL_R03_175a_SpeakWithCaptain_Friendly_ShipDamaged01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Captain
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R03_NPCMCivilian01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00362266
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Let's just get a move on. We're wasting time here.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Let's just get a move on. We're wasting time here.
#. EDID: [0104C413]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001689"
msgid "All right, I hear you. Let's get moving."
msgstr "알겠습니다. 무슨 말인지 알겠어요. 움직이죠."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. SceneName = SFFL_R03_175a_SpeakWithCaptain_Friendly_ShipDamaged01
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Captain
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00AF9290
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Captain: Our savior, in the flesh.|Can't believe I have to resort to bumming rides from a stranger. *Sigh* And I just finished paying off this ship.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Yeah, well, that's easy for you to say. You still have your ship.
#. EDID: [0104C412]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00168A"
msgid "Things could've been worse."
msgstr "더 나쁠 수도 있었어요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. SceneName = SFFL_R03_175a_SpeakWithCaptain_Betrayal_ShipDamaged
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Captain
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00206F62
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Captain:
#. EDID: [0104C437]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00168B"
msgid "If you think I'm so suspicious, I'll leave."
msgstr "내가 그렇게 수상하다 싶으면 떠나주겠어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. SceneName = SFFL_R03_175a_SpeakWithCaptain_Betrayal_ShipDamaged
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMCivilian
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R03_NPCMCivilian01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 002C58DA
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral / to Player Default
#. Prompt = I'm just here to give you a ride.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I'm just here to give you a ride.
#. EDID: [0104C439]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00168C"
msgid "I hope it's not too much trouble."
msgstr "너무 폐가 되지 않았으면 좋겠군."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. SceneName = SFFL_R03_175a_SpeakWithCaptain_Friendly_PilotKilled01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Captain
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R03_NPCMCivilian01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00238512
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral
#. DialogueBefore = Captain:
#. DialogueAfter = Captain: Anyway, we're ready to leave whenever you are.
#. EDID: [010539D8]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00168D"
msgid "Man, I really hope none of this comes out of my paycheck. Everything just went south so quickly."
msgstr "아, 제발 이번 일로 제 월급이 깎이는 일만은 없었으면 좋겠네요. 모든 상황이 순식간에 최악으로 치닫고 말았어요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. SceneName = SFFL_R03_175a_SpeakWithCaptain_Friendly_PilotKilled01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Captain
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R03_NPCMCivilian01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00BFDD3A
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral / to Player Default
#. Prompt = My condolences, but we should get moving before more Spacers show up.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: My condolences, but we should get moving before more Spacers show up.
#. EDID: [010539D4]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00168E"
msgid "I hear that."
msgstr "그 말이 맞아요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. SceneName = SFFL_R03_175a_SpeakWithCaptain_Friendly_PilotKilled01
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Captain
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00B7144E
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Captain:
#. EDID: [010530D0]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00168F"
msgid "My condolences, but we should get moving before more Spacers show up."
msgstr "애도드립니다만, 스페이서가 더 나타나기 전에 움직여야 합니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. SceneName = SFFL_R03_175a_SpeakWithCaptain_Friendly_PilotKilled01
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00D7927B
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Captain:
#. EDID: [010530C8]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001690"
msgid "Sorry about your pilot."
msgstr "조종사 일은 유감입니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. SceneName = SFFL_R03_175a_SpeakWithCaptain_Friendly_PilotKilled01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Captain
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R03_NPCMCivilian01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 008F933C
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral / to Player Default
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Sorry about your pilot.
#. EDID: [010539CE]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001691"
msgid "So, you're giving us a ride? Good. Can't leave here fast enough. It's creepy... just having the pilot's body lying there."
msgstr ""
"그러니까, 우리를 태워 준다는 거죠? 좋아요. 여기서 빨리 떠나고 싶어요. 소름 끼쳐요... 조종사 시신이 저기 그대로 누워 있으니."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. SceneName = SFFL_R03_175a_SpeakWithCaptain_Friendly_PilotKilled
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Captain
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R03_NPCMCivilian01
#. Face = Depressed
#. SoundFileID = 00608BC5
#. ScriptNotes = Depressed
#. DialogueBefore = Captain: It's okay. Well, it's not but... damn, I just don't know what to say right now.
#. DialogueAfter = Captain: We're ready to leave whenever you are. Thanks for this.
#. EDID: [010530F6]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001692"
msgid "Enough of that, though. We need to get moving."
msgstr "그 얘기는 그만하죠. 이동해야 합니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. SceneName = SFFL_R03_175a_SpeakWithCaptain_Friendly_PilotKilled
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Captain
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R03_NPCMCivilian01
#. Face = Depressed
#. SoundFileID = 0036389E
#. ScriptNotes = Depressed
#. DialogueBefore = Captain: It's okay. Well, it's not but... damn, I just don't know what to say right now.
#. DialogueAfter = Captain: We're ready to leave whenever you are. Thanks for this.
#. EDID: [010530F4]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001693"
msgid "*Sigh* Anyway, thanks for giving us a ride out of here."
msgstr "*한숨* 어쨌든, 여기서 나갈 수 있게 태워 주셔서 감사합니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. SceneName = SFFL_R03_175a_SpeakWithCaptain_Friendly_PilotKilled
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Captain
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R03_NPCMCivilian01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00C9791F
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Do you have any idea why the Spacers attacked you?
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Do you have any idea why the Spacers attacked you?
#. DialogueAfter = Captain: I'm sorry about your pilot.
#. EDID: [010530F3]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001694"
msgid "They're Spacers, they don't need a reason to attack you. They'll kill you because they're bored. Hell, maybe that was the reason."
msgstr ""
"스페이서들이잖아요. 공격하는 데 이유 따윈 필요 없는 녀석들이에요. 지루하다는 이유로도 남을 죽일 놈들이에요. 젠장, 어쩌면 그게 "
"이유였을지도요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. SceneName = SFFL_R03_175a_SpeakWithCaptain_Friendly_PilotKilled
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMCivilian
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R03_NPCMCivilian01
#. Face = Depressed
#. SoundFileID = 00F056FE
#. ScriptNotes = Depressed / to Player Default
#. Prompt = I'm sorry about your pilot.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I'm sorry about your pilot.
#. DialogueAfter = Captain: *Sigh* Anyway, thanks for giving us a ride out of here.
#. EDID: [010530F9]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001695"
msgid "He flew like hell today. Rest of us would probably be dead if not for him."
msgstr "오늘 조종사는 정말 미친 듯이 날았어요. 조종사가 아니었으면 나머지 우리는 아마 죽었을 겁니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. SceneName = SFFL_R03_175a_SpeakWithCaptain_Friendly_PilotKilled
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMCivilian
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R03_NPCMCivilian01
#. Face = Depressed
#. SoundFileID = 0081E2FF
#. ScriptNotes = Depressed / to Player Default
#. Prompt = I'm sorry about your pilot.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I'm sorry about your pilot.
#. DialogueAfter = Captain: *Sigh* Anyway, thanks for giving us a ride out of here.
#. EDID: [010530F8]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001696"
msgid "It's okay. Well, it's not but... damn, I just don't know what to say right now."
msgstr "괜찮아요. 아니, 괜찮진 않지만... 젠장, 지금은 뭐라고 해야 할지 모르겠어요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. SceneName = SFFL_R03_175a_SpeakWithCaptain_Friendly_PilotKilled
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00535797
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Captain: Good to see you. We need all the help we can get, now.|Can't believe it. We were so close to getting out of that attack in one piece. Then they scored a direct hit on the cockpit, and...
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: It's okay. Well, it's not but... damn, I just don't know what to say right now.
#. EDID: [010530EE]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001697"
msgid "I'm sorry about your pilot."
msgstr "조종사 일은 유감입니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. SceneName = SFFL_R03_175a_SpeakWithCaptain_Friendly_PilotKilled
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Captain
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R03_NPCMCivilian01
#. Face = Depressed
#. SoundFileID = 0086C6D2
#. ScriptNotes = Depressed / to Player Default
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: I'm sorry about your pilot.
#. EDID: [010530FC]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001698"
msgid "Can't believe it. We were so close to getting out of that attack in one piece. Then they scored a direct hit on the cockpit, and..."
msgstr "믿을 수가 없네요. 공격에서 멀쩡히 빠져나오기 직전이었는데. 녀석들이 조종실에 직격탄을 날렸고, 그리고..."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. SceneName = SFFL_R03_175a_SpeakWithCaptain_Friendly_PilotKilled
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Captain
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R03_NPCMCivilian01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00959054
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. EDID: [010530FC]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001699"
msgid "Good to see you. We need all the help we can get, now."
msgstr "만나서 반가워요. 지금은 도움이란 도움은 다 필요하겠네요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. SceneName = SFFL_R03_175a_SpeakWithCaptain_Betrayal_PilotKilled01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Captain
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R03_NPCMCivilian01
#. Face = Angry
#. SoundFileID = 00369A53
#. ScriptNotes = Angry
#. EDID: [01053DB7]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00169A"
msgid "Kill them!"
msgstr "죽여!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. SceneName = SFFL_R03_175a_SpeakWithCaptain_Betrayal_PilotKilled01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Captain
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R03_NPCMCivilian01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00579CAD
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral
#. DialogueBefore = Captain: The thing is, we aren't who you think we are.
#. EDID: [01053DB7]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00169B"
msgid "Your ship is ours, now."
msgstr "이제 네 우주선은 우리 거야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. SceneName = SFFL_R03_175a_SpeakWithCaptain_Betrayal_PilotKilled01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMCivilian
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R03_NPCMCivilian01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00185604
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Sorry about your pilot.
#. EDID: [01053DA0]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00169C"
msgid "Not everyone is meant to live a long life."
msgstr "모두가 오래 살 운명은 아니지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. SceneName = SFFL_R03_175a_SpeakWithCaptain_Betrayal_PilotKilled01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMCivilian
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R03_NPCMCivilian01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00F6FD68
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Sorry about your pilot.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Sorry about your pilot.
#. EDID: [01053DA0]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00169D"
msgid "Yeah, it's unfortunate, but it was his time to die I guess."
msgstr "그래, 안타깝지만 조종사는 죽을 때가 됐던 것 같아."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. SceneName = SFFL_R03_175a_SpeakWithCaptain_Betrayal_ShipDamaged
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Captain
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R03_NPCMCivilian01
#. Face = Irritated
#. SoundFileID = 00BD44AD
#. ScriptNotes = Irritated / to Player Default
#. Prompt = We won't have any problems if you don't make any.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: We won't have any problems if you don't make any.
#. EDID: [01053DBE]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00169E"
msgid "Guess I should've kept my mouth shut."
msgstr "입 다물고 있었어야 했나 보군."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. SceneName = SFFL_R03_175a_SpeakWithCaptain_Betrayal_ShipDamaged
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
