#. ScriptNotes = Warning friends not to hurt the milliwhale. / Angry
#. EDID: [0105BFA3]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0016B1"
msgid "Just watch out for Milli!"
msgstr "밀리 조심해!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMGenericMale / NPCFGenericFemale
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMGenericMale02 / SFFL_NPCMGenericMale01 / SFFL_NPCFGenericFemale01 / SFFL_NPCFGenericFemale02
#. Face = Angry
#. SoundFileID = 00D80836
#. ScriptNotes = Angry
#. EDID: [0105BFA1]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0016B2"
msgid "This is the last time I trust the Freestar Rangers!"
msgstr "이번만 자유항성 레인저를 믿을 거야!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1200_Roman_MainRansomScene
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Roman
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0069ED8F
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Nice doing business with you. &&& Roman: Who are you?
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Okay, that's a bit extreme. If I'm such a "monster," why did I bother setting up Milli with such a plush room?
#. EDID: [01035896]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0016B3"
msgid "What kind of monster kidnaps someone's pet?"
msgstr "대체 어떤 괴물 새끼시길래 남의 애완동물을 납치하셨나?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1200_Roman_MainRansomScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Roman
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRomanKreutz
#. Face = Concerned
#. SoundFileID = 00CC1353
#. ScriptNotes = Concerned / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Yura is in on this?
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Yura is in on this?
#. DialogueAfter = Roman: Give me Milli and I'll put in a good word for you with Yura.
#. EDID: [0103585E]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0016B4"
msgid "In on this? No no, this is... this is my plan. I just figured Yura would be the one to show up at our door."
msgstr "한패냐고? 아니, 아냐, 이건... 이건 내가 계획한 거야. 그냥 유라가 이 집 문 앞에 나타날 줄 알았다고."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_3200_Yura_MainEndScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCFAtka
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFAtka
#. Face = Smirk
#. SoundFileID = 009ABCCF
#. ScriptNotes = Smirk / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Getting paid is what I'm here for.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Getting paid is what I'm here for.
#. DialogueAfter = Atka: Here, it's what I intended to pay Yura, plus a little extra for the trouble and keeping the plant babies alive.
#. EDID: [010358A0]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0016B5"
msgid "If Yura hired you, I'm not surprised."
msgstr "유라가 왜 너한테 맡겼는지 알겠네."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_3200_Yura_MainEndScene
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00A7F3E8
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: As a Freestar Ranger, I personally looked after Milli's safety. &&& ... &&& Yura: Oh not the plants again.|I refuse to let you guilt me over something that you regrow all the time. &&& Atka: Yura... Never mind. We'll talk about this later. &&& Atka: I'm sorry. No sense in you sticking around listening to this.|Let me pay you so you can get out of here.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: If Yura hired you, I'm not surprised.
#. EDID: [01035871]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0016B6"
msgid "Getting paid is what I'm here for."
msgstr "난 일당을 받으러 온 건데."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_3200_Yura_MainEndScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Atka
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFAtka
#. Face = Apologetic
#. SoundFileID = 0030EDF4
#. ScriptNotes = Apologetic / to Player Default
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Getting paid is what I'm here for.
#. EDID: [01035868]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0016B7"
msgid "Let me pay you so you can get out of here."
msgstr "여기 일당이니까 받고 이제 그만 가봐."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_3200_Yura_MainEndScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Atka
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFAtka
#. Face = Apologetic
#. SoundFileID = 00AFC5A4
#. ScriptNotes = Apologetic / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Atka: Yura... Never mind. We'll talk about this later.
#. EDID: [01035868]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0016B8"
msgid "I'm sorry. No sense in you sticking around listening to this."
msgstr "미안해. 여기 남아서 계속 얘기를 듣고 있을 필요는 없어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_3200_Yura_MainEndScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Atka
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFAtka
#. Face = Concerned
#. SoundFileID = 00B4C0E9
#. ScriptNotes = Concerned / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Atka: Wow, I'll take your word for it then.|Yura actually outdid herself.
#. DialogueAfter = Atka: Getting paid is what I'm here for.
#. EDID: [01035DAA]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0016B9"
msgid "Let me pay you since I'm sure you don't want to stick around and hear us argue any longer."
msgstr "일당을 줄게. 우리 말다툼을 더 오래 듣고 싶진 않을 테니까."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_3200_Yura_MainEndScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Yura
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFYura
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 001FA50F
#. ScriptNotes = Reassuring. / Confident / to Atka
#. DialogueBefore = Yura: You'll be happy to know, they were just taking Milli for a walk.
#. DialogueAfter = Yura: Right, "pet sitters"?
#. EDID: [0103586B]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0016BA"
msgid "And see? Milli's fine!"
msgstr "보이지? 밀리는 멀쩡해!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_3200_Yura_MainEndScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Yura
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFYura
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 00123C1E
#. ScriptNotes = Trying to get the player to support her so Atka will be satisfied. / Confident / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Yura: And see? Milli's fine!
#. DialogueAfter = companion: We guarded this creature with our very lives.
#. EDID: [0106B1EB]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0016BB"
msgid "Right, \"pet sitter\"?"
msgstr "그렇지? '임시 집사님'?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_3200_Yura_MainEndScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Atka
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFAtka
#. Face = Irritated
#. SoundFileID = 00C4F52B
#. ScriptNotes = Player has a companion with them. / Irritated / to Yura
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I don't see how the timing is my fault. &&& Yura: Well, you could've left a message or something... anything to explain why you weren't here.
#. DialogueAfter = Yura: I was just getting to that!
#. EDID: [0106B1EC]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0016BC"
msgid "Excuse me, Yura. Are you going to tell me who these people are or what?"
msgstr "잠깐만. 유라. 이 사람이 누군지 말해 줄 거야? 말 거야?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_3200_Yura_MainEndScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCFYura
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFYura
#. Face = Concerned
#. SoundFileID = 00FF9767
#. ScriptNotes = Concerned / to Player Default
#. Prompt = [Lie] Just taking Milli for a walk.
#. DialogueAfter = Atka: Excuse me.
#. EDID: [010358B1]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0016BD"
msgid "I got a message from Atka that she was returning early, so I got down here as soon as I could. "
msgstr "아트카가 일찍 돌아온다는 메시지를 받아서, 최대한 빨리 여기 내려왔지. "

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_3200_Yura_MainEndScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCFYura
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFYura
#. Face = Sarcastic
#. SoundFileID = 0040D4BE
#. ScriptNotes = Sarcastic / to Player Default
#. Prompt = [Lie] Just taking Milli for a walk.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: [Lie] Just taking Milli for a walk.
#. EDID: [010358B1]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0016BE"
msgid "Oh yeah? Well, great timing. "
msgstr "아 그래? 타이밍이 좋았네. "

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_0140_Yura_IntroPostRejectionScene
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Yura
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00291E21
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Yura: Oh hey, finally interested in that house sitting gig? It's not too late you know.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: You got it.
#. EDID: [010358C0]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0016BF"
msgid "Just give me the details and let's get this over with."
msgstr "세부 사항만 말해 줘. 빨리 끝내자고."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1200_Roman_MainRansomScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Roman
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRomanKreutz
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 00DABCC1
#. ScriptNotes = Confident / to Player Default
#. Prompt = [Pay <Global=SFFL_MS03_RansomCredits>] Here's your credits.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: [Pay <Global=SFFL_MS03_RansomCredits>] Here's your credits.
#. DialogueAfter = Roman: Give me Milli and I'll put in a good word for you with Yura.
#. EDID: [01035A6C]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0016C0"
msgid "Check your numbers, \"errand boy.\" You're short."
msgstr "숫자 다시 확인해. \"심부름꾼.\" 모자라잖아."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1100_Intercom_IntroScene
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Intercom
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00F7EDE0
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Intercom: Password.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Hmm. Fair enough.
#. EDID: [0103586C]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0016C1"
msgid "<Global=SFFL_MS03_RansomCredits> credits is my password."
msgstr "암호는 <Global=SFFL_MS03_RansomCredits> 크레딧이다 ."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_3200_Yura_MainEndScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Yura
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFYura
#. Face = Confused
#. SoundFileID = 0081BA12
#. ScriptNotes = Scene re-entry. / Confused / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Yura: And look, just in time.
#. DialogueAfter = Yura: Roman took Milli and was holding her for ransom.
#. EDID: [0106C857]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0016C2"
msgid "How was Roman involved in all this stuff again?"
msgstr "로만은 이 일에 어떻게 얽혀 있던 거지?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_3200_Yura_MainEndScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Yura
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFYura
#. Face = Happy
#. SoundFileID = 00B9624C
#. ScriptNotes = Scene re-entry. Happy surprise. / Happy / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Yura: And look, just in time.
#. DialogueAfter = Yura: Roman likes you, Yura. He's just not sure how to tell you.
#. EDID: [0106C854]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0016C3"
msgid "I can't believe Roman did all this for me."
msgstr "로만이 나를 위해 이 모든 걸 했다니 믿을 수가 없어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1200_Roman_MainRansomScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Roman
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRomanKreutz
#. Face = Question
#. SoundFileID = 008627A7
#. ScriptNotes = Question / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Nice doing business with you.
#. DialogueAfter = Roman: [Demand Credits: <Global=SFFL_MS03_PaymentCredits>] I don't do anything for free.
#. EDID: [0106C846]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0016C4"
msgid "So, how about it? I give you Milli and you put in a good word for me with Yura?"
msgstr "그래서, 어때? 내가 밀리를 넘기면, 유라한테 나에 대해 좋게 말해 줄래?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1200_Roman_MainRansomScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Roman
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRomanKreutz
#. Face = Concerned
#. SoundFileID = 003828A5
#. ScriptNotes = Scene reentry. Frustrated, disappointed. / Concerned / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Nice doing business with you.
#. DialogueAfter = Roman: You should tell her how you feel. She'd appreciate that even more.
#. EDID: [0106C844]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0016C5"
msgid "I can't believe I did all this for Yura and still screwed it up."
msgstr "유라를 위해 이 모든 걸 했는데도 망쳐 버렸다니 믿을 수가 없어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1200_Roman_MainRansomScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Roman
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRomanKreutz
#. Face = Worried
#. SoundFileID = 00973003
#. ScriptNotes = Scene reentry. Worried. / Worried / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Nice doing business with you.
#. DialogueAfter = Roman: Be honest, and don't trust someone else to tell her how you feel.
#. EDID: [0106C842]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0016C6"
msgid "I know I need to tell Yura how I feel. I just don't want to ruin everything if I make the wrong call."
msgstr "유라에게 내 감정을 말해야 한다는 건 알아. 그냥 잘못된 결정을 해서 모든 걸 망치고 싶지 않을 뿐이야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1100_Intercom_IntroScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Intercom
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMGenericMale01
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 00622964
#. ScriptNotes = Demanding. / Confident
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: I'm a Freestar Ranger, here about a stolen pet, so open up.
#. EDID: [01035880]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0016C7"
msgid "Password."
msgstr "암호."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_0100_Yura_IntroBranchNoScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Yura
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFYura
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 00B3399D
#. ScriptNotes = Confident / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Now it's definitely a "no."
#. DialogueAfter = Yura: So, here's the key to my sister Atka's house. She lives on Muphrid IV, outside of the Freestar Collective.
#. EDID: [010358AD]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0016C8"
msgid "But, if you change your mind, come find me. The sooner I can ditch this job, the better."
msgstr "하지만 마음이 바뀌면 날 찾아와. 이 일을 빨리 털어낼수록 좋으니까."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_0100_Yura_IntroBranchNoScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Yura
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFYura
#. Face = Suspicious
#. SoundFileID = 007B79C6
#. ScriptNotes = Suspicious / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Now it's definitely a "no."
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Now it's definitely a "no."
#. EDID: [010358AD]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0016C9"
msgid "Hard stance! Okay, I mean, I get it. I obviously don't want to do this either."
msgstr "강경하네! 좋아, 그러니까, 이해해. 나도 당연히 이 일을 하고 싶진 않아."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_0100_Yura_IntroBranchNoScene
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Yura
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00AF4C37
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Yura: So, how about that house sitting job? You in?
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: You know, we are polar opposites, but that's why you're perfect for this!
#. EDID: [0103589D]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0016CA"
msgid "Pets I have time for. People not so much."
msgstr "애완동물에게 쓸 시간은 있어. 사람은 별로."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_0100_Yura_IntroMainScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCFYura
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFYura
#. Face = Happy
#. SoundFileID = 00B558E9
#. ScriptNotes = Happy / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Count us in.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Count us in.
#. DialogueAfter = Yura: It's a small house on Muphrid IV and the milliwhale's name is Milli. Original, I know, but that's my sister for you.
#. EDID: [010358B7]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0016CB"
msgid "You're the best. Here's the key to Atka's house."
msgstr "최고다. 여기 아트카 언니 집 열쇠야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1200_Roman_MainBranchYura01Scene
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Roman
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 007AFC1F
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I'm here to negotiate. &&& Roman: Negotiate? Sorry, I'm an all or nothing kind of guy. &&& Roman: All right, enough of this bullshit. &&& Roman: Why would Yura send someone to pay a ransom that they don't have?
#. DialogueAfter = Roman: Yura has everything to do with this, it's all for her.
#. EDID: [01035A68]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0016CC"
msgid "The question is, what does Yura have to do with any of this?"
msgstr "문제는 유라가 이 일과 무슨 상관이 있느냐는 거잖아?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1200_Roman_SC_Repeatable01Scene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Roman
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRomanKreutz
#. Face = SinisterSmile
#. SoundFileID = 00ECA225
#. ScriptNotes = Speech challenge lose: You're not going to consider lowering the price? / SinisterSmile / to Player Default
#. EDID: [01059D75]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0016CD"
msgid "You look more than capable of scraping a few credits together."
msgstr "크레딧 몇 푼쯤은 충분히 긁어모을 수 있어 보이는데."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1200_Roman_SC_Repeatable01Scene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Roman
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRomanKreutz
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 00A9FA1C
#. ScriptNotes = Speech challenge lose: You're not going to consider lowering the price? / Confident / to Player Default
#. EDID: [01035A74]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0016CE"
msgid "Aaand... not my problem."
msgstr "그리이이고... 내 문제 아니야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1200_Roman_SC_Repeatable01Scene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Roman
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRomanKreutz
#. Face = Thinking
#. SoundFileID = 001EF239
#. ScriptNotes = Speech challenge win: You're not going to consider lowering the price? / Thinking / to Player Default
#. EDID: [01035A73]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0016CF"
msgid "It's steep, I'll give you that."
msgstr "비싸긴 해, 그건 인정할게."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1200_Roman_MainRansomScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Roman
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRomanKreutz
#. Face = Irritated
#. SoundFileID = 008A5DD9
#. ScriptNotes = Irritated / to Player Default
#. Prompt = I'm here to negotiate.
#. DialogueBefore = Roman: Negotiate? Sorry, I'm an all or nothing kind of guy.
#. DialogueAfter = Roman: Why would Yura send someone to pay a ransom that they don't have?
#. EDID: [01035A6B]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0016D0"
msgid "All right, enough of this bullshit."
msgstr "좋아, 헛소리는 이쯤 하자."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1200_Roman_MainBranchYura01Scene
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Roman
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 001403F9
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: What is going on here? You know Atka? &&& Roman: I know them both, but this really isn't about Atka... It's about Yura.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: You've got to be kidding me.
#. EDID: [01035D5C]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0016D1"
msgid "Yes, no, and no."
msgstr "맞고, 아니고, 아니야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1200_Roman_SC_Generic04Scene
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00A247A4
#. ScriptNotes = / to Roman
#. EDID: [01035D55]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0016D2"
msgid "I'm sure we can come to a new agreement."
msgstr "새로운 합의에 이를 수 있을 거야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1200_Roman_MainBranchYura02Scene
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Roman
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00FEE507
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: If you give me Milli, I'll put in a good word for you. &&& Roman: You'd do that after all this? |Hell yeah, you don't know what this means to me.|Here's the key to the room. That little bottom feeder's all yours.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Looking forward to it.
#. EDID: [01035DA1]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0016D3"
msgid "Fine. I'll be back with your credits."
msgstr "좋아. 크레딧을 가지고 돌아올게."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1200_Roman_MainBranchYura01Scene
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 000274E0
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I'm the house sitter. &&& Roman: The house sitter? Dammit, I should've seen this coming.|Ah, think, Roman, think...
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Great. Great! Well, this sure went south quick.
#. EDID: [01035D5B]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0016D4"
msgid "Not that I know of."
msgstr "내가 알기로는 아니야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1200_Roman_SC_Generic03Scene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Roman
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRomanKreutz
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 0006FB13
#. ScriptNotes = Speech challenge lose: I'm sure you don't really want to do this. / Confident / to Player Default
#. EDID: [01035D52]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0016D5"
msgid "Well, it's done."
msgstr "뭐, 끝내야겠네."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1200_Roman_MainBranchYura02Scene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMRomanKreutz
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRomanKreutz
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 002C3185
#. ScriptNotes = Confident / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Pay <Global=SFFL_MS03_RansomCredits>: Here's your credits.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Pay <Global=SFFL_MS03_RansomCredits>: Here's your credits.
#. DialogueAfter = Roman: Here's the key to Milli's room.
#. EDID: [01035D88]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0016D6"
msgid "And here I was thinking you were broke."
msgstr "난 네가 빈털터리인 줄 알았는데 말이야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1200_Roman_MainBranchYura02Scene
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Roman
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 009E4D91
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: So this is all some plan to entertain Yura? &&& Roman: No, it's more than that. I wanted to put this all together to impress her.|I.. I thought it would show how much I care about her, but obviously, I've failed miserably.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Oh yeah, well if I recall, you don't have the credits.
#. EDID: [01035D99]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0016D7"
msgid "Nice sob story, but I'm just here for Milli."
msgstr "사연 참 딱하네. 하지만 난 밀리 때문에 온 거야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1200_Roman_MainBranchYura01Scene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Roman
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRomanKreutz
#. Face = Friendly
#. SoundFileID = 005DE67C
#. ScriptNotes = Friendly / to Player Default
#. Prompt = All right. I'll do it.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: All right. I'll do it.
#. DialogueAfter = Roman: Here's the key to Milli's room. Little critter's all yours.
#. EDID: [01035D9E]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0016D8"
msgid "Now we're talking! You don't know what this means to me."
msgstr "이제 말이 통하네! 이게 나한테 어떤 의미인지 넌 모를 거야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1200_Roman_MainBranchYura01Scene
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Roman
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00DAD382
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I don't do favors for petnappers. &&& Roman: Just hear me out. You got this petnapping thing all wrong.|You see, this is all a setup for Yura. &&& Roman: She hates house sitting. It's boring. So we thought why not liven things up?|We figured she'd get into it, maybe even get the credits from Atka...|And then when all went according to plan, I'd have the confidence to ask her out. |But now I've lost that chance. So, plan B. I give you Milli, you put in a good word for me with Yura. &&& companion: All this setup when you should be confessing to her directly.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Hey, this has been years in the making.
#. EDID: [01035D93]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0016D9"
msgid "This is all about getting a date?"
msgstr "이게 전부 데이트 한번 하려고 벌인 일이야?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1200_Roman_MainBranchYura01Scene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Roman
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRomanKreutz
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 00B88600
#. ScriptNotes = Confident / to Player Default
#. Prompt = This is all about getting a date?
#. DialogueAfter = Roman: [Demand Credits: <Global=SFFL_MS03_PaymentCredits>] I don't do anything for free.
#. EDID: [01035D96]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0016DA"
msgid "This is the perfect chance."
msgstr "이건 완벽한 기회야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1200_Roman_MainBranchYura01Scene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Roman
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRomanKreutz
#. Face = Concerned
#. SoundFileID = 00200DC9
#. ScriptNotes = Concerned / to Player Default
#. Prompt = This is all about getting a date?
#. EDID: [01035D96]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0016DB"
msgid "I've been waiting for my chance to break through that friend barrier, but it's hard. It's risky, you know?"
msgstr "그 친구라는 벽을 넘어설 기회를 기다려 왔는데, 쉽지 않더라고. 위험 부담도 있잖아?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1200_Roman_MainBranchYura01Scene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Roman
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRomanKreutz
#. Face = Defiant
#. SoundFileID = 00609F36
#. ScriptNotes = Defiant / to Player Default
#. Prompt = This is all about getting a date?
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: This is all about getting a date?
#. EDID: [01035D96]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0016DC"
msgid "Hey, this has been years in the making. "
msgstr "야, 이건 몇 년을 준비해 온 일이야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1200_Roman_MainBranchYura01Scene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMRomanKreutz
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRomanKreutz
#. Face = Concerned
#. SoundFileID = 00105FDC
#. ScriptNotes = Concerned / to Player Default
#. Prompt = I don't do favors for petnappers.
#. DialogueAfter = Roman: She hates house sitting. It's boring. So we thought why not liven things up?
#. EDID: [01035DA3]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0016DD"
msgid "You see, this is all a setup for Yura."
msgstr "봐, 이건 전부 유라를 위한 판이야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1200_Roman_MainBranchYura01Scene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMRomanKreutz
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRomanKreutz
#. Face = Concerned
#. SoundFileID = 005D1474
#. ScriptNotes = Concerned / to Player Default
#. Prompt = I don't do favors for petnappers.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I don't do favors for petnappers.
#. EDID: [01035DA3]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0016DE"
msgid "Just hear me out. You got this petnapping thing all wrong."
msgstr "일단 내 말 좀 들어 봐. 이 애완동물 납치 건은 완전히 오해야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1200_Roman_MainBranchYura01Scene
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Roman
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00DA267C
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Not that I know of. &&& Roman: Great. Great! Well, this sure went south quick. &&& Roman: All right, plan B I guess. You want Milli? Do me a favor, and she's all yours.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: I give you Milli... and you put in a good word for me with Yura.
#. EDID: [01035DA6]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0016DF"
msgid "Tell me the favor first."
msgstr "부탁이 뭔지 먼저 말해."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1200_Roman_MainBranchYura02Scene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Roman
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRomanKreutz
#. Face = Concerned
#. SoundFileID = 00CA993D
#. ScriptNotes = Concerned / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Roman: The question is, what does Yura have to do with any of this?
#. DialogueAfter = Roman: She hates house sitting so we thought we'd shake things up a bit. Stage a little petnapping, maybe make a few credits on the side...
#. EDID: [01035DA2]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0016E0"
msgid "Yura has everything to do with this, it's all for her. "
msgstr "유라가 왜 상관없어. 전부 유라를 위한 거라고."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_3200_Yura_MainEndScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Yura
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFYura
#. Face = Irritated
#. SoundFileID = 001BF42C
#. ScriptNotes = Irritated / to Player Default
#. Prompt = I figured you'd still be at Anchorpoint.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I figured you'd still be at Anchorpoint.
#. DialogueAfter = Atka: Excuse me.
#. EDID: [01059CFF]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0016E1"
msgid "Yeah, you and me both, but apparently Atka decided to come home earlier than expected."
msgstr "그래, 나도 그럴 거라 생각했지. 그런데 아트카가 예상보다 일찍 집에 돌아오기로 했거든."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1200_Roman_SC_Generic05Scene
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0056C218
#. ScriptNotes = / to Roman
#. EDID: [01059CE4]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0016E2"
msgid "This is someone's pet. You should just hand her over."
msgstr "누군가의 애완동물이잖아. 그냥 넘겨줘."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1200_Roman_MainBranchYura02Scene
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Roman
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 006C3CF9
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I'm here to negotiate. &&& ... &&& Roman: The question is, what does Yura have to do with any of this? &&& Roman: Yura has everything to do with this, it's all for her. &&& Roman: She hates house sitting so we thought we'd shake things up a bit. Stage a little petnapping, maybe make a few credits on the side...|Never crossed my mind she'd bail on her sister and get someone else to take her place.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: I'm 99% sure she's interested. It's that 1% holding me back.
#. EDID: [01059CF6]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0016E3"
msgid "What makes you think Yura's interested to begin with?"
msgstr "애초에 유라가 관심 있다고 생각하는 근거가 뭐야?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1200_Roman_SC_Repeatable02Scene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Roman
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRomanKreutz
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 0002D89E
#. ScriptNotes = Speech challenge lose: I'm willing to do this the hard way. / Confident / to Player Default
#. EDID: [01059D46]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0016E4"
msgid "You're outnumbered, so I don't care."
msgstr "너희 수가 더 많든 말든 상관없어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1200_Roman_SC_Repeatable02Scene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Roman
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRomanKreutz
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 00C737B0
#. ScriptNotes = Scoffing, player wearing the alien costume. Speech challenge lose: I'm willing to do this the hard way. / Confident / to Player Default
#. EDID: [01059D43]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0016E5"
msgid "You really want to know, dressed like that?"
msgstr "그 차림으로 정말 알고 싶은 거야?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1200_Roman_SC_Repeatable02Scene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Roman
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRomanKreutz
#. Face = Nervous
#. SoundFileID = 00CEBECC
#. ScriptNotes = Speech challenge win: I'm willing to do this the hard way. / Nervous / to Player Default
#. EDID: [01059D41]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0016E6"
msgid "When you put it that way..."
msgstr "그렇게 말하니까..."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1200_Roman_MainBranchYura02Scene
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Roman
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00B33457
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I'm here to negotiate. &&& ... &&& Roman: The question is, what does Yura have to do with any of this? &&& Roman: Yura has everything to do with this, it's all for her. &&& Roman: She hates house sitting so we thought we'd shake things up a bit. Stage a little petnapping, maybe make a few credits on the side...|Never crossed my mind she'd bail on her sister and get someone else to take her place.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: No, it's more than that. I wanted to put this all together to impress her.
#. EDID: [01059CD7]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0016E7"
msgid "So this is all some plan to entertain Yura?"
msgstr "그러니까 이게 전부 유라를 즐겁게 해 주려고 계획한 거라고?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1200_Roman_ReturnScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Roman
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRomanKreutz
#. Face = Smirk
#. SoundFileID = 00124FBB
#. ScriptNotes = Smirk / to Player Default
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Pay <Global=SFFL_MS03_RansomCredits>: Here's your credits.
#. EDID: [01059CCD]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0016E8"
msgid "Shouldn't you be off digging up some credits?"
msgstr "가서 크레딧이나 모아야 하지 않을까?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1200_Roman_TruthScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Roman
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRomanKreutz
#. Face = Worried
#. SoundFileID = 00EA1161
#. ScriptNotes = Worried / to Player Default
#. Prompt = If she says no, at least you told her how you felt.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: If she says no, at least you told her how you felt.
#. DialogueAfter = Roman: I hate to say it, but you're right. I need to do this myself.
#. EDID: [01059D25]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0016E9"
msgid "Yeah, yeah, because if I never say anything, I'll regret it. "
msgstr "그래, 그래. 아무 말도 안 하면 평생 후회할 테니까."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1200_Roman_TruthScene
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 009FCE66
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: You should tell her how you feel yourself. It will mean more coming from you. &&& Roman: That's what everyone keeps telling me... I just don't want to ruin everything if I make the wrong call.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Damn, I never thought about it way...
#. EDID: [01059CE3]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0016EA"
msgid "Be honest, and don't trust someone else to tell her how you feel."
msgstr "솔직하게 말해. 네 마음을 남이 대신 전해 주길 기대하지 말고."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1200_Roman_MainBranchYura01Scene
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Roman
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00F22CC6
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: You should tell her how you feel yourself. It will mean more coming from you. &&& Roman: That's what everyone keeps telling me... I just don't want to ruin everything if I make the wrong call.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Fine, fine, I get it. I guess it is a bit much to dump on a complete stranger.
#. EDID: [01059CD9]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0016EB"
msgid "[Demand Credits: <Global=SFFL_MS03_PaymentCredits>] I think I'm owed a bit more after all this."
msgstr "[<Global=SFFL_MS03_PaymentCredits> 크레딧 요구] 이 정도 했으면 조금 더 받아야겠는데."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1200_Roman_MainBranchYura01Scene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMRomanKreutz
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRomanKreutz
#. Face = Thinking
#. SoundFileID = 001DEB5F
#. ScriptNotes = Thinking / to Player Default
#. Prompt = I'm the house sitter.
#. DialogueAfter = Roman: All right, plan B I guess. You want Milli? Do me a favor, and she's all yours.
#. EDID: [01059D2C]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0016EC"
msgid "Ah, think, Roman, think..."
msgstr "아, 생각해, 로만, 생각하라고..."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1200_Roman_MainBranchYura01Scene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMRomanKreutz
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRomanKreutz
#. Face = Irritated
#. SoundFileID = 00B09B79
#. ScriptNotes = Frustrated. / Irritated / to Player Default
#. Prompt = I'm the house sitter.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I'm the house sitter.
#. EDID: [01059D2C]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0016ED"
msgid "The house sitter? Dammit, I should've seen this coming."
msgstr "임시 집사? 젠장, 이럴 줄 알았어야 했는데."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1200_Roman_MainBranchYura01Scene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Roman
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRomanKreutz
#. Face = Apologetic
#. SoundFileID = 00ED11F0
#. ScriptNotes = Apologetic / to Player Default
#. Prompt = [Demand Credits: <Global=SFFL_MS03_PaymentCredits>] I think I'm owed a bit more after all this.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: [Demand Credits: <Global=SFFL_MS03_PaymentCredits>] I think I'm owed a bit more after all this.
#. DialogueAfter = Roman: Here's the key to Milli's room. Little critter's all yours.
#. EDID: [01059CB0]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0016EE"
msgid "Fine, fine, I get it. I guess it is a bit much to dump on a complete stranger."
msgstr "알았어, 알았어. 생판 모르는 사람한테 이런 걸 떠넘기는 건 좀 과하긴 하지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1200_Roman_MainBranchYura01Scene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Roman
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRomanKreutz
#. Face = Nervous
#. SoundFileID = 00459DCF
#. ScriptNotes = Nervous / to Player Default
#. Prompt = I'm the last person you'll see if you don't hand over Milli right now.
#. DialogueAfter = Roman: I don't do favors for petnappers.
#. EDID: [01059D04]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0016EF"
msgid "How about plan B? No more credits, just a simple favor, and Milli is all yours."
msgstr "플랜 B는 어때? 크레딧은 더 없고, 간단한 부탁 하나만 들어주면 밀리는 네가 데려가도 돼."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1200_Roman_MainBranchYura01Scene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Roman
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRomanKreutz
#. Face = Concerned
#. SoundFileID = 00B8818A
#. ScriptNotes = Concerned / to Player Default
#. Prompt = I'm the last person you'll see if you don't hand over Milli right now.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I'm the last person you'll see if you don't hand over Milli right now.
#. EDID: [01059D04]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0016F0"
msgid "Okay, whoa. Let's talk about this."
msgstr "알았어, 잠깐. 얘기해 보자."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1200_Roman_MainBranchYura02Scene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Roman
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRomanKreutz
#. Face = Concerned
#. SoundFileID = 00D36BCA
#. ScriptNotes = Concerned / to Player Default
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Sorry to have ruined your plans.
#. EDID: [01059D4F]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0016F1"
msgid "Never crossed my mind she'd bail on her sister and get someone else to take her place."
msgstr "자기 여동생을 버리고 다른 사람한테 대신 맡길 줄은 꿈에도 몰랐어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1200_Roman_MainBranchYura02Scene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Roman
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRomanKreutz
#. Face = Concerned
#. SoundFileID = 008DB157
#. ScriptNotes = Concerned / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Roman: Yura has everything to do with this, it's all for her.
#. EDID: [01059D4F]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0016F2"
msgid "She hates house sitting so we thought we'd shake things up a bit. Stage a little petnapping, maybe make a few credits on the side..."
msgstr "유라가 임시 집사 일을 싫어해서 우리가 분위기를 좀 바꿔 보자고 했어. 애완동물 납치극을 꾸미고, 덤으로 크레딧도 좀 벌고..."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1200_Roman_TruthScene
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Roman
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00AB7D3D
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: You should tell her how you feel yourself. It will mean more coming from you. &&& Roman: That's what everyone keeps telling me... I just don't want to ruin everything if I make the wrong call.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Don't tell them that. I'll never live it down.
#. EDID: [01059CC3]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0016F3"
msgid "Your friends are right for once."
msgstr "이번만큼은 네 친구들이 맞네."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1200_Roman_MainBranchYura01Scene
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Roman
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0054C62D
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: All right. I'll do it. &&& Roman: Now we're talking! You don't know what this means to me.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Good because you were about to wipe me out.
#. EDID: [01059CC2]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0016F4"
msgid "I suppose you're right."
msgstr "네 말이 맞는 것 같아."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1200_Roman_MainBranchYura01Scene
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Roman
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00C78AFF
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Yura didn't send me. I found your ransom note. &&& Roman: What? Who even are you and what were you doing in Atka's house to begin with?
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Okay, whoa. Let's talk about this.
#. EDID: [01059D14]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0016F5"
msgid "I'm the last person you'll see if you don't hand over Milli right now."
msgstr "지금 당장 밀리를 넘기지 않으면 네가 마지막으로 보는 사람은 내가 될 거야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1200_Roman_FreestarScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Roman
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRomanKreutz
#. Face = Relieved
#. SoundFileID = 00FCB8EE
#. ScriptNotes = Relieved / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Don't worry about it. No harm, no foul.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Don't worry about it. No harm, no foul.
#. DialogueAfter = Roman: Milli's all yours. Please, just take her, and this will never happen again.
#. EDID: [01059D48]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0016F6"
msgid "Oh god, thank you. You have no idea how freaked out I was. "
msgstr "세상에, 고마워. 내가 얼마나 겁먹었는지 넌 모를 거야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1200_Roman_FreestarBranchYuraScene
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Roman
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00E93E03
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: And you really thought Yura would appreciate your prank? &&& Roman: I would've guaranteed it! I just never saw her reporting it to the Freestar Rangers. &&& Roman: Atka must've come home before Yura even saw the note. That's the only explanation.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: You don't think I know that now?
#. EDID: [01059D0F]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0016F7"
msgid "The only explanation is that you're an idiot."
msgstr "설명할 길은 하나뿐이네. 네가 얼간이라는 거."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1200_Roman_FreestarScene
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0025FEC0
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Petnapping for fun is still petnapping. &&& Roman: I think we all realize that now, but I swear it was completely innocent.|We didn't mean anything by it. We were always going to return Milli safe and sound.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: You bet we will. Lesson learned.
#. EDID: [01059D7B]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0016F8"
msgid "Just make sure you stick to legal activities next time."
msgstr "다음번엔 합법적인 일만 하도록 해."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1200_Roman_MainBranchYura01Scene
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Roman
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00C08356
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I'm here to negotiate. &&& Roman: Negotiate? Sorry, I'm an all or nothing kind of guy. &&& Roman: All right, enough of this bullshit. &&& Roman: Why would Yura send someone to pay a ransom that they don't have?
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: What? Who even are you and what were you doing in Atka's house to begin with?
#. EDID: [01059D76]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0016F9"
msgid "Yura didn't send me. I found your ransom note."
msgstr "유라가 보낸 게 아니야. 네가 쓴 몸값 요구서를 찾았어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1200_Roman_FreestarScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Roman
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRomanKreutz
#. Face = Nervous
#. SoundFileID = 0020D611
#. ScriptNotes = Nervous / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Stealing someone's pet is a serious crime.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Petnapping is a pretty elaborate distraction.
#. EDID: [01059D1E]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0016FA"
msgid "And if she knew I was the one that took Milli, I swear we wouldn't be standing here now."
msgstr "그리고 밀리를 데려간 게 나라는 걸 유라가 알았다면, 맹세코 우린 지금 여기 서 있지도 못했을 거야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1200_Roman_FreestarScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Roman
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRomanKreutz
#. Face = Nervous
#. SoundFileID = 004500E0
#. ScriptNotes = Nervous / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Stealing someone's pet is a serious crime.
#. EDID: [01059D1E]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0016FB"
msgid "We only did all this to distract Yura... for fun!"
msgstr "우린 그냥 유라를 딴 데 정신 팔리게 하려고 한 거야... 재미로!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1200_Roman_FreestarScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Roman
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRomanKreutz
#. Face = Nervous
#. SoundFileID = 0056DEEA
#. ScriptNotes = Nervous / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Stealing someone's pet is a serious crime.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Stealing someone's pet is a serious crime.
#. EDID: [01059D1E]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0016FC"
msgid "I know, I know, but it wasn't really petnapping, it was really more petborrowing."
msgstr "알아, 알아. 하지만 진짜 애완동물 납치가 아니라 애완동물 빌리기에 가까웠다고."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1200_Roman_MainBranchYura01Scene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMRomanKreutz
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRomanKreutz
#. Face = Concerned
#. SoundFileID = 00531960
#. ScriptNotes = Concerned / to Player Default
#. Prompt = [Demand Credits: <Global=SFFL_MS03_PaymentCredits>] I don't do anything for free.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: [Demand Credits: <Global=SFFL_MS03_PaymentCredits>] I don't do anything for free.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: [Demand Credits: <Global=SFFL_MS03_PaymentCredits>] Don't make me repeat myself.
#. EDID: [01059CB3]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0016FD"
msgid "But you aren't doing it for free, you're getting Milli, right?"
msgstr "그래도 공짜로 하는 건 아니잖아. 밀리를 받는 거 맞지?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1100_Intercom_IntroScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Intercom
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMGenericMale01
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00F5197E
#. ScriptNotes = Serious / to Player Default
#. Prompt = I'm here for Milli. Let me in.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I'm here for Milli. Let me in.
#. DialogueAfter = Intercom: I'm a Freestar Ranger, here about a stolen pet, so open up.
#. EDID: [01059D07]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0016FE"
msgid "No way. Pass. Word."
msgstr "안. 돼. 암. 호."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1200_Roman_FreestarScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Roman
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRomanKreutz
#. Face = Pleading
#. SoundFileID = 00C694EB
#. ScriptNotes = Pleading / to Player Default
#. DialogueAfter = Roman: Petnapping for fun is still petnapping.
#. EDID: [0106C83E]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0016FF"
msgid "Please, just let me explain."
msgstr "제발, 설명 좀 하게 해 줘."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1200_Roman_FreestarScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Roman
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRomanKreutz
#. Face = Pleading
#. SoundFileID = 00CBB882
#. ScriptNotes = Pleading / to Player Default
#. EDID: [0106C83E]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001700"
msgid "Look, this is all a big misunderstanding."
msgstr "있잖아, 이건 다 큰 오해야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1200_Roman_FreestarScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Roman
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRomanKreutz
#. Face = Pleading
#. SoundFileID = 006CA5AA
#. ScriptNotes = Pleading / to Player Default
#. DialogueAfter = Roman: Petnapping for fun is still petnapping.
#. EDID: [0106C83D]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001701"
msgid "See? This was just one big misunderstanding. It was just for fun."
msgstr "봤지? 그냥 커다란 오해였어. 재미로 한 것뿐이라고."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1200_Roman_MainBranchYura01Scene
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0073E809
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I don't do favors for petnappers. &&& Roman: Just hear me out. You got this petnapping thing all wrong.|You see, this is all a setup for Yura. &&& Roman: She hates house sitting. It's boring. So we thought why not liven things up?|We figured she'd get into it, maybe even get the credits from Atka...|And then when all went according to plan, I'd have the confidence to ask her out. |But now I've lost that chance. So, plan B. I give you Milli, you put in a good word for me with Yura. &&& companion: All this setup when you should be confessing to her directly.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: But you aren't doing it for free, you're getting Milli, right?
#. EDID: [01059CEA]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001702"
msgid "[Demand Credits: <Global=SFFL_MS03_PaymentCredits>] I don't do anything for free."
msgstr "[<Global=SFFL_MS03_PaymentCredits> 크레딧 요구] 난 공짜로는 아무것도 안 해."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1200_Roman_FreestarScene
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Roman
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 007D7077
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Roman: I swear we were always going to return Milli safe and sound.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Just talk to Yura. Tell her I took Milli and she'll know it wasn't serious. She'll back me up.
#. EDID: [01059D7F]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001703"
msgid "And what if I don't buy this story?"
msgstr "내가 이 얘기를 못 믿겠다면?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1100_Intercom_ReturnScene
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Intercom
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 007DFBD4
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Intercom: I thought I told you to get lost.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Good enough.
#. EDID: [01059D28]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001704"
msgid "<Global=SFFL_MS03_RansomCredits> credits is my password."
msgstr "암호는 <Global=SFFL_MS03_RansomCredits> 크레딧이다 ."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1100_Intercom_IntroScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMGenericMale
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMGenericMale01
#. Face = Worried
#. SoundFileID = 00FD9E72
#. ScriptNotes = Stammering at the beginning, completely unprepared for the Freestar Rangers to get involved in a such a tiny scheme. / Worried / to Player Default
#. Prompt = I'm a Freestar Ranger, here about a stolen pet, so open up.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I'm a Freestar Ranger, here about a stolen pet, so open up.
#. DialogueAfter = Intercom: We've been waiting for you.
#. EDID: [01059CA4]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001705"
msgid "A wha--? Er, right away. Just give me a sec."
msgstr "뭐라...? 어, 바로 열게. 잠깐만."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_0200_Yura_TL_AtkaScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCFYura
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFYura
#. Face = Friendly
#. SoundFileID = 00515B6F
#. ScriptNotes = Friendly / to Player Default
#. Prompt = I have some other questions.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I have some other questions.
#. EDID: [01059D2D]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001706"
msgid "Sure thing. Ask away."
msgstr "물론이지. 뭐든 물어봐."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_0200_Yura_TL_AtkaScene
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Yura
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00698D0E
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Can you tell me more about your sister? &&& Yura: Atka? I like to think of her as the anti-me: responsible, keeps to herself, excelling at everything she does...|Obviously the favorite when it came to mom and dad.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Good question! And lucky for me, we don't have to find out since you took the job.
#. EDID: [01059D3B]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001707"
msgid "What if you couldn't find anyone to house sit Atka's place?"
msgstr "아트카네 집을 봐줄 사람을 아무도 못 찾으면 어쩌려고 했어?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_0200_Yura_TL_AtkaScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Yura
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFYura
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 00C5EEB1
#. ScriptNotes = Confident / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Atka trusts you to watch her house?
#. DialogueAfter = Yura: I have some other questions.
#. EDID: [01059CA2]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001708"
msgid "It's just that house sitting is not for me, and at least this time I'm trying to get someone to take my place."
msgstr "난 그냥 임시 집사 일이 안 맞아. 그래도 이번엔 최소한 날 대신할 사람을 구하려고는 했다고."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_0200_Yura_TL_AtkaScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Yura
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFYura
#. Face = Concerned
#. SoundFileID = 00A73ABE
#. ScriptNotes = Concerned / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Atka trusts you to watch her house?
#. EDID: [01059CA2]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001709"
msgid "I haven't exactly been reliable in the past, but I swore to her that I've changed... and I have!"
msgstr "예전에는 내가 그리 믿음직하지 못했던 건 맞지만, 그녀한테 변했다고 맹세했어... 그리고 진짜 변했어!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_0200_Yura_TL_AtkaScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Yura
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFYura
#. Face = Concerned
#. SoundFileID = 0073A4B5
#. ScriptNotes = Concerned / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Atka trusts you to watch her house?
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Atka trusts you to watch her house?
#. EDID: [01059CA2]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00170A"
msgid "Well, yes and no. She sees this as a \"fourth chance\" to repair our relationship."
msgstr "글쎄, 맞기도 하고 아니기도 해. 그녀는 이걸 우리 관계를 고칠 \"네 번째 기회\"로 보고 있어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_0140_Yura_IntroPostRejectionScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Yura
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFYura
#. Face = Friendly
#. SoundFileID = 00875BF7
#. ScriptNotes = Friendly / to Player Default
#. Prompt = What does this involve again?
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: What does this involve again?
#. DialogueAfter = Yura: Looks like I could use those credits after all.
#. EDID: [01059CEB]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00170B"
msgid "It's so simple. It's literally just watering some plants and feeding a milliwhale... every day until my sister gets back."
msgstr "정말 간단해. 말 그대로 식물에 물 주고 밀리고래한테 먹이 주기만 하면 돼... 우리 언니가 돌아올 때까지 매일."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_0100_Yura_IntroMainScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = companion
#. VoiceType = NPCFSarahMorgan
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 00E39925
#. ScriptNotes = Confident / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Depends on what it is. &&& Yura: Oh you're gonna love it. Easiest credits you'll ever make!|All you have to do is water a few plants and feed a little milliwhale until my sister gets home.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Count us in.
#. EDID: [01059CD5]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00170C"
msgid "House sitting? Sounds like a lovely break to me."
msgstr "임시 집사 일? 멋진 휴가를 보내는 것처럼 들리는데."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_3200_Yura_BranchEndRomanDeadScene
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Yura
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 006A5DFE
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Roman's not thinking anything anymore. &&& Yura: Hold up. What's that supposed to mean?
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: God, don't scare me like that.
#. EDID: [0105A33C]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00170D"
msgid "Nothing. Never mind."
msgstr "아무것도 아니야. 신경 쓰지 마."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_3200_Yura_BranchEndRomanDeadScene
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 006D2DB1
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Roman's not thinking anything anymore. &&& Yura: Hold up. What's that supposed to mean?
#. DialogueAfter = Yura: Oh my god... you killed him? All of them?
#. EDID: [0105A356]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00170E"
msgid "Roman and his friends are dead."
msgstr "로만과 친구들은 죽었어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_3200_Yura_BranchEndRomanScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCFYura
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFYura
#. Face = Happy
#. SoundFileID = 003FA3F3
#. ScriptNotes = Happy / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Roman likes you, Yura. He's just not sure how to tell you.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Roman likes you, Yura. He's just not sure how to tell you.
#. DialogueAfter = Atka: Okay, great, so this was all some elaborate scheme for Roman to catch my sister's attention.
#. EDID: [0105A363]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00170F"
msgid "I say if he did all this for me, that tells me plenty."
msgstr "그가 이 모든 걸 날 위해 했다면, 그걸로 충분히 알 수 있어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_3200_Yura_BranchEndRomanScene
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Yura
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 000879D2
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I don't think Roman thinks much. &&& Atka: Finally, someone who actually agrees with me. &&& Yura: Hey, Roman just thinks outside the box.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: I wish I could've seen the look on his face. He hates it when plans go bad.
#. EDID: [0105A33E]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001710"
msgid "He was pretty disappointed to see me."
msgstr "날 보고 꽤 실망하던데."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_3200_Yura_BranchEndRomanScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Yura
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFYura
#. Face = Defiant
#. SoundFileID = 00652BB4
#. ScriptNotes = Defiant / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Maybe Roman's just trying to get ahead in this world.
#. DialogueAfter = Atka: Okay, great, so this was all some elaborate scheme for Roman to catch my sister's attention.
#. EDID: [0105A35E]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001711"
msgid "Besides, it's not like he was out murdering people."
msgstr "게다가 사람들을 죽이고 다닌 것도 아니잖아."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_3200_Yura_BranchEndRomanScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Yura
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFYura
#. Face = Defiant
#. SoundFileID = 00B21D76
#. ScriptNotes = Defiant / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Maybe Roman's just trying to get ahead in this world.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Maybe Roman's just trying to get ahead in this world. &&& Atka: Just like Roman to take the easy way, too.
#. EDID: [0105A35E]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001712"
msgid "Hey, why work your ass off when there's easier ways to make credits? "
msgstr "야, 더 쉬운 크레딧 벌이 방법이 있는데 왜 죽어라 일해?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_3200_Yura_BranchEndRomanScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCFYura
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFYura
#. Face = Surprised
#. SoundFileID = 00430933
#. ScriptNotes = Surprised / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Roman was trying to impress Yura with a staged petnapping.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Roman likes you, Yura. He's just not sure how to tell you.
#. EDID: [0105A358]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001713"
msgid "Oh my god, so he was expecting me to show up to get Milli all this time. No wonder I couldn't find him."
msgstr "세상에, 그럼 로만은 내내 내가 밀리를 데리러 오길 기다렸던 거네. 내가 못 찾은 것도 당연하지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_3200_Yura_BranchEndRomanScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCFYura
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFYura
#. Face = Thinking
#. SoundFileID = 00EB628E
#. ScriptNotes = Thinking / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Roman was trying to impress Yura with a staged petnapping.
#. EDID: [0105A358]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001714"
msgid "I have been complaining to him about it for some time... I just never thought he'd do something like this, at least not for me."
msgstr "내가 한동안 그에게 그 일로 불평하긴 했어... 그래도 그런 짓까지 할 줄은 몰랐어. 적어도 날 위해서는."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_3200_Yura_BranchEndRomanScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCFYura
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFYura
#. Face = Surprised
#. SoundFileID = 0093E70A
#. ScriptNotes = Surprised / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Roman was trying to impress Yura with a staged petnapping.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Roman was trying to impress Yura with a staged petnapping.
#. EDID: [0105A358]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001715"
msgid "Wait what? He did this for me? That's crazy."
msgstr "잠깐, 뭐? 이걸 날 위해 했다고? 미쳤네."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_3200_Yura_BranchEndRomanScene
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Atka
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00AE09F4
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Roman took Milli and was holding her for ransom. &&& ... &&& Atka: I'm sorry. Who are you? And are you saying Roman stole Milli while I was gone? &&& Yura: Atka, this is the pet sitter I was telling you about.|And as you can see, Milli is fine! &&& Atka: Fine? She was stolen right out of our home! She could be traumatized. |What was Roman even thinking?
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Just like Roman to take the easy way, too.
#. EDID: [0105A35F]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001716"
msgid "Maybe Roman's just trying to get ahead in this world."
msgstr "어쩌면 로만은 그저 이 세상에서 성공하려고 발버둥 치는 것뿐일지도 몰라."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_3200_Yura_BranchEndRomanScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Atka
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFAtka
#. Face = Amused
#. SoundFileID = 00D51E36
#. ScriptNotes = Amused / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Maybe Roman's just trying to get ahead in this world.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Maybe Roman's just trying to get ahead in this world.
#. DialogueAfter = Yura: Hey, why work your ass off when there's easier ways to make credits?
#. EDID: [0105B44C]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001717"
msgid "Just like Roman to take the easy way, too. "
msgstr "쉬운 길을 택하는 것도 딱 로만답네."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_3200_Yura_BranchEndRomanScene
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00B1D5ED
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Roman is dead.
#. DialogueAfter = Yura: Wait what? He did this for me? That's crazy.
#. EDID: [0105A33B]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001718"
msgid "Roman was trying to impress Yura with a staged petnapping."
msgstr "로만은 짜고 친 애완동물 납치극으로 유라에게 잘 보이려 했어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_3200_Yura_BranchEndRomanScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Yura
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFYura
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 00F6946A
#. ScriptNotes = Confident / to Atka
#. DialogueAfter = Atka: Fine? She was stolen right out of our home! She could be traumatized.
#. EDID: [0105A32E]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001719"
msgid "And as you can see, Milli is fine!"
msgstr "보다시피 밀리는 멀쩡해!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_3200_Yura_BranchEndRomanScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Yura
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFYura
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 00680864
#. ScriptNotes = Confident / to Atka
#. DialogueBefore = Yura: Ransom? Why would he even do that? &&& Atka: I'm sorry. Who are you? And are you saying Roman stole Milli while I was gone?
#. EDID: [0105A32E]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00171A"
msgid "Atka, this is the pet sitter I was telling you about."
msgstr "아트카, 이쪽이 내가 말했던 임시 집사야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_3200_Yura_BranchEndRomanScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Atka
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFAtka
#. Face = Concerned
#. SoundFileID = 0043039A
#. ScriptNotes = Concerned / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Roman took Milli and was holding her for ransom. &&& Yura: Ransom? Why would he even do that?
#. DialogueAfter = Yura: Atka, this is the pet sitter I was telling you about.
#. EDID: [0105A348]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00171B"
msgid "I'm sorry. Who are you? And are you saying Roman stole Milli while I was gone?"
msgstr "말하는 도중에 미안한데, 넌 누구야? 내가 없는 동안 로만이 밀리를 훔쳤다고?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_3200_Yura_MainEndScene
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0050690C
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I don't see how the timing is my fault. &&& ... &&& Yura: And see? Milli's fine! &&& Yura: Right, "pet sitters"? &&& companion: We guarded this creature with our very lives.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Wow, I'll take your word for it then.
#. EDID: [0105A32D]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00171C"
msgid "As a Freestar Ranger, I personally looked after Milli's safety."
msgstr "자유항성 레인저로서, 직접 밀리를 안전하게 돌봤지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_3200_Yura_MainEndScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Atka
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFAtka
#. Face = Impressed
#. SoundFileID = 00AC31A1
#. ScriptNotes = Impressed / to Player Default
#. Prompt = We've had quite the adventure together.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: We've had quite the adventure together.
#. DialogueAfter = Atka: And, miraculously, all my plants are still alive.
#. EDID: [0105A33A]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00171D"
msgid "Well, she seems fine. Milli does enjoy exploring, so a little adventure couldn't hurt."
msgstr "음, 멀쩡해 보이네. 밀리는 탐험을 좋아하니까, 작은 모험 정도는 해도 나쁘지 않지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_3200_Yura_MainEndScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Yura
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFYura
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 00342BE0
#. ScriptNotes = Confident / to Atka
#. DialogueBefore = Yura: And, I assume, a very trusted friend...
#. DialogueAfter = Yura: And see? Milli's fine!
#. EDID: [0105A34C]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00171E"
msgid "You'll be happy to know, he was just taking Milli for a walk."
msgstr "거봐, 별일 아니랬지? 그냥 밀리 산책시키던 중이었다고."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_3200_Yura_MainEndScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Yura
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFYura
#. Face = Confident
