#. DialogueAfter = Yura: And see? Milli's fine!
#. EDID: [0105A34B]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00171F"
msgid "You'll be happy to know, she was just taking Milli for a walk."
msgstr "거봐, 별일 아니랬지? 그냥 밀리 산책시키던 중이었다고."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_3200_Yura_BranchEndRomanScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Yura
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFYura
#. Face = Defiant
#. SoundFileID = 00289711
#. ScriptNotes = Defiant / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Roman's just a common thief extorting people for credits.
#. DialogueAfter = Atka: Okay, great, so this was all some elaborate scheme for Roman to catch my sister's attention.
#. EDID: [0105B434]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001720"
msgid "Roman cares about people. In fact, if he stole Milli it was probably to get my attention in the first place."
msgstr "로만은 사람을 아끼는 애야. 사실 그가 밀리를 훔쳤다면 애초에 내 관심을 끌려고 그랬을 가능성이 커."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_3200_Yura_BranchEndRomanScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Yura
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFYura
#. Face = Defiant
#. SoundFileID = 00D2ACA5
#. ScriptNotes = Defiant / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Roman's just a common thief extorting people for credits.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Roman's just a common thief extorting people for credits. &&& Atka: You're not wrong...
#. EDID: [0105B434]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001721"
msgid "Well, you're not right either! You make it sound like he's just some loser criminal who's out to get people, but he's not."
msgstr "글쎄, 너도 맞는 건 아니야! 네 말은 그가 사람들을 해치려는 한심한 범죄자 같잖아. 하지만 아니야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1300_Roman_TL_YuraScene
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Roman
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 002926F5
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Can you tell me more about Yura? &&& Roman: Yura's great. She's like that person that makes you feel better just knowing they're around.|She always knows what to say, too. I just wish she knew how cool she really is.|I tell her all the time, but when it comes to taking compliments, she hates it.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Sure.
#. EDID: [0105BF8A]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001722"
msgid "Let me ask you about something else."
msgstr "다른 것도 좀 물어볼게."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1300_Roman_TL_YuraScene
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Roman
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00BE702A
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Can you tell me more about Yura? &&& Roman: Yura's great. She's like that person that makes you feel better just knowing they're around.|She always knows what to say, too. I just wish she knew how cool she really is.|I tell her all the time, but when it comes to taking compliments, she hates it.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Well, rejection for one. I don't want to ruin the friendship we already have.
#. EDID: [0105BF98]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001723"
msgid "Why are you so afraid to tell her how you feel?"
msgstr "왜 유라에게 마음을 밝히는 걸 그렇게 두려워해?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1300_Roman_TL_AtkaScene
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Roman
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 004CBA9B
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: What do you know about Atka? &&& Roman: Yura's sister? She's pretty nice, but she doesn't exactly approve of our lifestyle, if you know what I mean.|She thinks anyone who operates mostly in the Free Lanes is up to no good. |She's not wrong, but at least she's always been nice to me, and pretty forgiving of Yura.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: I guess so.
#. EDID: [0105BF75]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001724"
msgid "Can I ask you something else?"
msgstr "다른 것도 물어봐도 돼?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1300_Roman_TL_AtkaScene
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Roman
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00262BB2
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: What do you know about Atka? &&& Roman: Yura's sister? She's pretty nice, but she doesn't exactly approve of our lifestyle, if you know what I mean.|She thinks anyone who operates mostly in the Free Lanes is up to no good. |She's not wrong, but at least she's always been nice to me, and pretty forgiving of Yura.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: She might be a little mad at first, but I'm sure she'd come around. Especially since I did it all for Yura.
#. EDID: [0105BF73]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001725"
msgid "You think Atka will forgive you for this if she finds out?"
msgstr "아트카가 알게 되면 이 일을 용서해 줄 것 같아?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1300_Roman_TL_AtkaScene
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 003FEB3E
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: What do you know about Atka? &&& Roman: Yura's sister? She's pretty nice, but she doesn't exactly approve of our lifestyle, if you know what I mean.|She thinks anyone who operates mostly in the Free Lanes is up to no good. |She's not wrong, but at least she's always been nice to me, and pretty forgiving of Yura.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: We just never thought Atka'd find out. Honest.
#. EDID: [0105BF83]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001726"
msgid "If she's so nice, why use Atka and Milli to get Yura's attention?"
msgstr "그렇게 좋은 녀석이면서 왜 아트카와 밀리를 이용해서 유라의 관심을 끌려고 해?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1300_Roman_TL_AtkaScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMRomanKreutz
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRomanKreutz
#. Face = Nervous
#. SoundFileID = 00EDE267
#. ScriptNotes = Nervous / to Player Default
#. Prompt = If she's so nice, why use Atka and Milli to get Yura's attention?
#. DialogueAfter = Roman: If she's so nice, why use Atka and Milli to get Yura's attention?
#. EDID: [0105BF7A]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001727"
msgid "Even if Atka did find out, I'd like to think she'd know Milli was safe with us."
msgstr "아트카가 알게 되더라도, 적어도 밀리가 우리와 함께 안전했다는 건 알아줄 거라고 생각하고 싶어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1300_Roman_TL_AtkaScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMRomanKreutz
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRomanKreutz
#. Face = Nervous
#. SoundFileID = 00C761A9
#. ScriptNotes = Nervous / to Player Default
#. Prompt = If she's so nice, why use Atka and Milli to get Yura's attention?
#. EDID: [0105BF7A]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001728"
msgid "Milli knows us, so she came willingly, and just look at the setup we had for her. She just made herself at home."
msgstr "밀리는 우리를 아니까 순순히 따라온 거야. 우리가 마련해 둔 환경을 봐. 완전히 자기 집처럼 지냈다고."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1300_Roman_TL_AtkaScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMRomanKreutz
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRomanKreutz
#. Face = Nervous
#. SoundFileID = 006E2495
#. ScriptNotes = Nervous / to Player Default
#. Prompt = If she's so nice, why use Atka and Milli to get Yura's attention?
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: If she's so nice, why use Atka and Milli to get Yura's attention?
#. EDID: [0105BF7A]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001729"
msgid "We just never thought Atka'd find out. Honest. "
msgstr "우린 아트카가 알게 될 거라고는 전혀 생각 못 했어. 진짜야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1300_Roman_TL_AtkaScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Roman
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRomanKreutz
#. Face = Nervous
#. SoundFileID = 00C768D5
#. ScriptNotes = Nervous / to Player Default
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: If she's so nice, why use Atka and Milli to get Yura's attention?
#. EDID: [0105BF87]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00172A"
msgid "She's not wrong, but at least she's always been nice to me, and pretty forgiving of Yura."
msgstr "틀린 말은 아니지만, 그래도 적어도 나한테는 늘 친절했고 유라한테도 꽤 너그러웠어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1300_Roman_TL_AtkaScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Roman
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRomanKreutz
#. Face = Nervous
#. SoundFileID = 00C46F5F
#. ScriptNotes = Nervous / to Player Default
#. EDID: [0105BF87]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00172B"
msgid "She thinks anyone who operates mostly in the Free Lanes is up to no good. "
msgstr "아트카는 자유 항로에서 일하는 사람은 다 수상하다고 생각해. "

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1300_Roman_TL_AtkaScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Roman
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRomanKreutz
#. Face = Nervous
#. SoundFileID = 00DD160C
#. ScriptNotes = Nervous / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: What do you know about Atka?
#. EDID: [0105BF87]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00172C"
msgid "Yura's sister? She's pretty nice, but she doesn't exactly approve of our lifestyle, if you know what I mean."
msgstr "유라의 언니? 꽤 좋은 사람이야. 하지만 우리가 사는 방식을 딱히 좋게 보진 않아. 무슨 말인지 알지?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1200_Roman_StarbornScene
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Roman
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 004DEAC3
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Give me Milli and I'll put in a good word for you with Yura. &&& Roman: Whoa, what? Who are you? How would you even know anything about that?
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Obviously, it's beyond my... whatever.
#. EDID: [0105C9D0]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00172D"
msgid "It's beyond your comprehension. Just take the deal."
msgstr "네 이해 범위를 넘어서는 일이야. 그냥 거래나 받아들여."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1200_Roman_MainRansomScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMRomanKreutz
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRomanKreutz
#. Face = Concerned
#. SoundFileID = 005AC976
#. ScriptNotes = Concerned / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Give me Milli and I'll put in a good word for you with Yura.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Give me Milli and I'll put in a good word for you with Yura.
#. DialogueAfter = Roman: Doesn't matter. I know you like her. I'll put in a good word.
#. EDID: [0105C9D2]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00172E"
msgid "Whoa, what? Who are you? How would you even know anything about that?"
msgstr "잠깐, 뭐? 넌 뭐야? 내 속마음을 어떻게 알아챈 거야?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_3200_Yura_MainEndScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = companion
#. VoiceType = NPCMSamCoe
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 00663795
#. ScriptNotes = Confident / to Atka
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I don't see how the timing is my fault. &&& ... &&& Yura: You'll be happy to know, they were just taking Milli for a walk. &&& Yura: And see? Milli's fine! &&& Yura: Right, "pet sitters"?
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: As a Freestar Ranger, I personally looked after Milli's safety.
#. EDID: [0106B1F4]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00172F"
msgid "We took great care of your little Milli, ma'am, and it was our pleasure."
msgstr "부인, 저희가 부인의 자그마한 밀리를 아주 잘 돌봤습니다. 참으로 즐거웠습니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_3200_Yura_MainEndScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Yura
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFYura
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 00EEDEB9
#. ScriptNotes = Referring to the player's companion. / Confident / to Atka
#. DialogueBefore = Yura: Atka, this is the pet sitter I told you about.
#. DialogueAfter = Yura: You'll be happy to know, they were just taking Milli for a walk.
#. EDID: [0106B1EA]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001730"
msgid "And, I assume, a very trusted friend..."
msgstr "그리고, 아주 믿을 만한 친구야..."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1200_Roman_MainBranchYura01Scene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = companion
#. VoiceType = NPCFAndreja
#. Face = Concerned
#. SoundFileID = 0044A0DE
#. ScriptNotes = Concerned / to Roman
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I don't do favors for petnappers. &&& Roman: Just hear me out. You got this petnapping thing all wrong.|You see, this is all a setup for Yura. &&& Roman: She hates house sitting. It's boring. So we thought why not liven things up?|We figured she'd get into it, maybe even get the credits from Atka...|And then when all went according to plan, I'd have the confidence to ask her out. |But now I've lost that chance. So, plan B. I give you Milli, you put in a good word for me with Yura.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: [Demand Credits: <Global=SFFL_MS03_PaymentCredits>] I don't do anything for free.
#. EDID: [0106B1ED]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001731"
msgid "All this setup when you should be confessing to her directly."
msgstr "직접 고백해야 할 때인데 이렇게 판이나 짜고 있다니."

