msgstr "네가 떠난 뒤로 로만이 꽤 초조해했어. 좋은 소식이 있으면 좋겠네."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03_Support
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMGenericMale / NPCFGenericFemale / NPCMRomanKreutz
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMGenericMale02 / SFFL_NPCMGenericMale01 / SFFL_NPCFGenericFemale01 / SFFL_NPCFGenericFemale02 / SFFL_NPCMRomanKreutz
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 00DEC646
#. ScriptNotes = Player has returned to talk to Roman about Yura. / Confident
#. EDID: [0106B1DA]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001735"
msgid "Hope you were able to help out Roman."
msgstr "로만을 도울 수 있었으면 좋겠네."

