#. ScriptNotes = Player has returned to talk to Roman about Yura. / Impressed
#. EDID: [0106B1D7]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001736"
msgid "Didn't expect to see you back here."
msgstr "여기 다시 올 줄은 몰랐는데."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03_Support
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMRomanKreutz
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRomanKreutz
#. Face = Grateful
#. SoundFileID = 00FD677B
#. ScriptNotes = Roman knows Yura might give him a chance. / Grateful
#. EDID: [0106B1D0]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001737"
msgid "I sure owe you."
msgstr "내가 정말 신세 졌어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03_Support
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMRomanKreutz
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRomanKreutz
#. Face = Depressed
#. SoundFileID = 000A6803
#. ScriptNotes = Player unable to convince Yura to give Roman a chance. / Depressed
#. EDID: [0106B1CD]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001738"
msgid "I just gotta find something to take my mind off of this."
msgstr "이 일에서 신경을 돌릴 뭔가를 찾아야겠어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03_Support
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMRomanKreutz
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRomanKreutz
#. Face = Question
#. SoundFileID = 00E211A0
#. ScriptNotes = Player has returned after putting in a good word for him with Yura. / Question
#. EDID: [0106B1CA]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001739"
msgid "Did you talk to Yura yet?"
msgstr "유라하고는 얘기해 봤어?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03_Support
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCFYura
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFYura
#. Face = Disgust
#. SoundFileID = 002EE3C6
#. ScriptNotes = Knows the player killed Roman. More disgusted/rude than sad. / Disgust
#. EDID: [0105CF02]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00173A"
msgid "You again."
msgstr "또 너야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03_Support
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCFYura
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFYura
#. Face = Grateful
#. SoundFileID = 0096370D
#. ScriptNotes = Grateful
#. EDID: [0105CF00]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00173B"
msgid "Roman's the best. I can't imagine life without him now."
msgstr "로만은 최고야. 이제 로만 없는 삶은 상상도 못 하겠어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03_Support
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCFYura
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFYura
#. Face = Angry
#. SoundFileID = 0029BF6F
#. ScriptNotes = Just learned the player killed her best friend. Sad, upset, angry. / Angry
#. EDID: [0105BFD4]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00173C"
msgid "I have nothing to say to you."
msgstr "너한테 할 말 없어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03_Support
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCFYura
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFYura
#. Face = Irritated
#. SoundFileID = 00AEBB1B
#. ScriptNotes = Irritated
#. EDID: [0105BFCB]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00173D"
msgid "I can't believe Atka came home early. I swear it was just to catch me slacking off."
msgstr "아트카가 일찍 돌아왔다니 믿기지가 않아. 내가 게으름 피우는 걸 잡으려고 그런 게 분명해."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03_Support
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCFYura
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFYura
#. Face = Friendly
#. SoundFileID = 00B224D1
#. ScriptNotes = Friendly
#. EDID: [0105BFC9]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00173E"
msgid "I don't get plants. I have a hard enough time taking care of myself."
msgstr "난 식물을 모르겠어. 내 몸 하나 챙기기도 벅차다고."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03_Support
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCFAtka
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFAtka
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 009AA8ED
#. ScriptNotes = Serious
#. EDID: [0105BFC2]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00173F"
msgid "Please, I really think you should leave."
msgstr "제발, 정말로 나가 줬으면 좋겠어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03_Support
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCFAtka
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFAtka
#. Face = Friendly
#. SoundFileID = 00426635
#. ScriptNotes = Friendly
#. EDID: [0105BFBE]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001740"
msgid "Milli seems to really like you."
msgstr "밀리가 너를 정말 좋아하는 것 같아."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03_Support
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCFAtka
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFAtka
#. Face = Grateful
#. SoundFileID = 00FF5B59
#. ScriptNotes = Grateful
#. EDID: [0105BFBD]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001741"
msgid "I appreciate you dealing with all this."
msgstr "일을 처리해 줘서 고마워."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03_Support
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMRomanKreutz
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRomanKreutz
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00630D7B
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral
#. EDID: [0106B1D4]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001742"
msgid "See you around."
msgstr "또 보자."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03_Support
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMRomanKreutz
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRomanKreutz
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0017D976
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral
#. EDID: [0106B1D3]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001743"
msgid "Later."
msgstr "나중에 봐."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03_Support
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMRomanKreutz
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRomanKreutz
#. Face = Nervous
#. SoundFileID = 00B774D2
#. ScriptNotes = Nervous
#. EDID: [0105CEE7]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001744"
msgid "Don't forget about Yura."
msgstr "유라 잊지 마."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03_Support
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCFYura
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFYura
#. Face = Friendly
#. SoundFileID = 0014252D
#. ScriptNotes = Friendly
#. EDID: [0105CEDD]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001745"
msgid "See you around."
msgstr "또 보자."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03_Support
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMRomanKreutz
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRomanKreutz
#. Face = Nervous
#. SoundFileID = 00DE4504
#. ScriptNotes = Player hasn't spoken for a while. He knows the player is a Freestar Ranger. / Nervous
#. EDID: [0105CF19]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001746"
msgid "This silence can't be good..."
msgstr "이 침묵, 좋은 징조는 아닌데..."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03_Support
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMRomanKreutz
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRomanKreutz
#. Face = Angry
#. SoundFileID = 0074336F
#. ScriptNotes = Going into combat. / Angry
#. EDID: [0106D5B4]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001747"
msgid "You're dead!"
msgstr "죽어라!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03_Support
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCFAtka
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFAtka
#. Face = Angry
#. SoundFileID = 000671E2
#. ScriptNotes = Going into combat. / Angry
#. EDID: [0106D5B3]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001748"
msgid "Damn it!"
msgstr "젠장!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03_Support
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCFYura
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFYura
#. Face = Angry
#. SoundFileID = 008B0137
#. ScriptNotes = Taunt. / Angry
#. EDID: [0106D5B5]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001749"
msgid "Worst house sitter ever!"
msgstr "최악의 임시 집사네!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03_Support
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCFAtka
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFAtka
#. Face = Angry
#. SoundFileID = 003743CF
#. ScriptNotes = Player killed Yura. / Angry
#. EDID: [0106D5AF]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00174A"
msgid "Yura, no!"
msgstr "유라, 안 돼!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03_Support
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCFAtka
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFAtka
#. Face = Angry
#. SoundFileID = 00E93AC8
#. ScriptNotes = Player killed Milli. / Angry
#. EDID: [0106D5AE]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00174B"
msgid "Milli!"
msgstr "밀리!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03_Support
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_PostQuest_Yura_TL_Roman01Scene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Yura
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFYura
#. Face = Thinking
#. SoundFileID = 001DC8B0
#. ScriptNotes = Thinking / to Player Default
#. Prompt = But if you never try, you could lose him, and the regret would be worse.
#. DialogueAfter = Yura: I guess I have a lot to think about thanks to you.
#. EDID: [0105BF7C]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00174C"
msgid "*sigh* But you're right. Just the possibility of losing him kills me, so maybe it is a chance worth taking."
msgstr "*한숨* 네 말이 맞아. 로만을 잃는다는 생각만으로도 죽을 것 같으니, 이번엔 과감히 용기를 내볼게."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03_Support
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_PostQuest_Yura_TL_Roman01Scene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Yura
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFYura
#. Face = Concerned
#. SoundFileID = 00E78116
#. ScriptNotes = Concerned / to Player Default
#. Prompt = But if you never try, you could lose him, and the regret would be worse.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: But if you never try, you could lose him, and the regret would be worse.
#. EDID: [0105BF7C]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00174D"
msgid "Don't you think I've thought of that? "
msgstr "내가 그것도 생각 안 해봤을 것 같아? "

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03_Support
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_PostQuest_Yura_TL_Roman01Scene
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 009CB788
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: He really likes you, Yura. Give him a chance. &&& Yura: Give him a chance so I can screw it all up? |Roman's great, really, but the moment you start dating someone, that means you start letting them in and I really suck at that.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: You know... you're right. Roman's seen me at my worst and still hasn't given up on me.
#. EDID: [0105BF92]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00174E"
msgid "But you're perfect together. Trust Roman. You'll be fine."
msgstr "하지만 둘이 정말 잘 어울려. 로만을 믿어. 괜찮을 거야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03_Support
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_PostQuest_Yura_TL_Roman01Scene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCFYura
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFYura
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 00F8B5DE
#. ScriptNotes = Confident / to Player Default
#. Prompt = That's just fear talking. If you like Roman, don't let fear keep you apart.
#. DialogueAfter = Yura: I guess I have a lot to think about thanks to you.
#. EDID: [0105BF81]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00174F"
msgid "And I do trust him. I really do owe it to both of us to stop shutting him out."
msgstr "난 로만을 믿어. 우리 둘 모두를 위해서라도 더는 거리를 두면 안 돼."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03_Support
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_PostQuest_Yura_TL_Roman01Scene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCFYura
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFYura
#. Face = Thinking
#. SoundFileID = 00D232B3
#. ScriptNotes = Thinking / to Player Default
#. Prompt = That's just fear talking. If you like Roman, don't let fear keep you apart.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: That's just fear talking. If you like Roman, don't let fear keep you apart.
#. EDID: [0105BF81]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001750"
msgid "You know... you're right. Roman's seen me at my worst and still hasn't given up on me. "
msgstr "그러고 보면… 정말 네 말이 맞는 것 같아. 로만은 한심한 내 모습까지 봤는데도, 한 번도 날 버린 적이 없었어. "

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03_Support
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_PostQuest_Yura_TL_Roman01Scene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Yura
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFYura
#. Face = Concerned
#. SoundFileID = 001FEC6F
#. ScriptNotes = Emphasis on "know". Intentionally repeating "lose him." / Concerned / to Player Default
#. Prompt = How do you feel about him?
#. DialogueAfter = Yura: He really likes you, Yura. Give him a chance.
#. EDID: [0105BF84]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001751"
msgid "That's why I can't lose him. And if we dated, I know I'd lose him."
msgstr "그러니까 더더욱 로만을 잃고 싶지 않은 거야. 괜히 사귀었다가 헤어지기라도 하면, 그땐 진짜 걔를 영영 못 보게 될 테니까."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03_Support
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_PostQuest_Yura_TL_Roman01Scene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Yura
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFYura
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 0061D5A2
#. ScriptNotes = Confident / to Player Default
#. Prompt = How do you feel about him?
#. EDID: [0105BF84]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001752"
msgid "In fact, it's hard not to care about the guy, especially when you get him to open up."
msgstr "사실 그 애한테 정을 안 주기가 힘들 거야. 특히 속마음을 털어놓을 때는 더 그렇겠지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03_Support
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_PostQuest_Yura_TL_Roman01Scene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Yura
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFYura
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 003DC3C3
#. ScriptNotes = Confident / to Player Default
#. Prompt = How do you feel about him?
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: How do you feel about him?
#. EDID: [0105BF84]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001753"
msgid "Roman? He's the best friend anyone can ask for. Reliable, good listener, totally gets me."
msgstr "로만 말이야? 걔만큼 좋은 친구가 또 어디 있겠어. 든든하고, 내 고민도 다 들어주고, 세상에서 날 제일 잘 아는 애야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03_Support
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_PostQuest_Yura_TL_Roman01Scene
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Yura
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 001EE973
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Roman wanted me to put in a good word for him with you. &&& Yura: Roman's the best. &&& Yura: I can't believe he did all this for me. &&& Yura: I really wish I deserved someone like him, but I'm just not relationship material. Not right now.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Roman deserves better. I mean, deep down, who am I?
#. EDID: [0105BF89]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001754"
msgid "Why don't you think you deserve him? "
msgstr "왜 로만 곁에 있을 자격이 없다고 생각해? "

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03_Support
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_PostQuest_Yura_TL_Roman01Scene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Yura
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFYura
#. Face = Amused
#. SoundFileID = 002B72D9
#. ScriptNotes = Amused / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Roman wanted me to put in a good word for him with you.
#. DialogueAfter = Yura: I can't believe he did all this for me.
#. EDID: [0105BF70]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001755"
msgid "Roman's the best. "
msgstr "로만은 최고야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03_Support
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_PostQuest_Yura_MS03DoneRomanDeadScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Yura
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFYura
#. Face = Sad
#. SoundFileID = 00F80DC4
#. ScriptNotes = Sad / to Atka
#. DialogueBefore = Atka: Yura, I'm so sorry. I know how close you were.
#. DialogueAfter = Atka: I'm sure deep down he knew. He had to.
#. EDID: [0105BF97]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001756"
msgid "I... I loved him, Atka... and I never got to tell him."
msgstr "나... 난 로만을 사랑했어. 아트카... 그런데 말하지 못했어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03_Support
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_PostQuest_Atka_TL_YuraScene
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Atka
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00B74883
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Can you tell me more about Yura? &&& Atka: You pretty much experienced my sister in a nutshell.|She's the queen of work avoidance. I think she'd rather die than hold down a real job.|I just want some stability in her life, so I don't have to worry about her all the time.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: I'm tired all the time. I'm just not ready to give up on her yet.
#. EDID: [0105CEB0]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001757"
msgid "Aren't you tired of Yura disappointing you?"
msgstr "유라가 널 실망시키는 거 지겹지 않아?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03_Support
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_PostQuest_Atka_TL_YuraScene
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Atka
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00256954
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Can you tell me more about Yura? &&& Atka: You pretty much experienced my sister in a nutshell.|She's the queen of work avoidance. I think she'd rather die than hold down a real job.|I just want some stability in her life, so I don't have to worry about her all the time.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: It's not like I haven't tried. It's just that I'm always her fallback plan.
#. EDID: [0105CED7]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001758"
msgid "Why not let Yura live her own life?"
msgstr "유라가 자립하게 놔두는 게 어때?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03_Support
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_PostQuest_Atka_TL_RomanScene
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 009D9C2C
#. ScriptNotes = / to Atka
#. DialogueAfter = Atka: Out of all Yura's friends, Roman's probably the best.
#. EDID: [0105CEAE]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001759"
msgid "What kind of guy is Roman?"
msgstr "로만은 어떤 사람이야?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03_Support
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_PostQuest_Atka_TL_YuraScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Atka
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFAtka
#. Face = Concerned
#. SoundFileID = 00BEDB40
#. ScriptNotes = Concerned / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Why not let Yura live her own life?
#. DialogueAfter = Atka: Why do you worry about Yura?
#. EDID: [0105CEC3]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00175A"
msgid "But what if something happens and I can't be that person anymore? Yura's friends are great, but they're just as unreliable as she is."
msgstr ""
"그런데 무슨 일이 생겨서 내가 더는 유라를 돌봐줄 수 없으면 어떡해? 유라의 친구들은 좋은 애들이지만, 유라만큼이나 믿음직하지 못해."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03_Support
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_PostQuest_Atka_TL_YuraScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Atka
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFAtka
#. Face = Concerned
#. SoundFileID = 007DE690
#. ScriptNotes = Concerned / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Why not let Yura live her own life?
#. EDID: [0105CEC3]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00175B"
msgid "Credits, a place to stay, bailing her out of a bad situation or jail itself."
msgstr "크레딧 주기, 지낼 곳 마련하기, 나쁜 상황이나 감옥에서 구해주기."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03_Support
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_PostQuest_Atka_TL_YuraScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Atka
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFAtka
#. Face = Concerned
#. SoundFileID = 00CCD394
#. ScriptNotes = Concerned / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Why not let Yura live her own life?
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Why not let Yura live her own life?
#. EDID: [0105CEC3]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00175C"
msgid "It's not like I haven't tried. It's just that I'm always her fallback plan. "
msgstr "이미 해 봤어. 그냥 내가 항상 유라의 대비책이라 문제인 거지. "

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03_Support
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_PostQuest_Roman_YuraYesScene01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMRomanKreutz
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRomanKreutz
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 0008D110
#. ScriptNotes = Confident / to Player Default
#. Prompt = If things work out, just be patient.
#. DialogueAfter = Roman: All right. I can do this.
#. EDID: [0106B1A2]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00175D"
msgid "I've been doing it for a while, so at least I got one base covered."
msgstr "한동안 해 온 일이라, 적어도 한쪽 기반은 다져 놨어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03_Support
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_PostQuest_Roman_YuraYesScene01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMRomanKreutz
