#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 00DD2C53
#. ScriptNotes = Confident / to Player Default
#. Prompt = If things work out, just be patient.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: If things work out, just be patient.
#. EDID: [0106B1A2]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00175E"
msgid "Be patient. I can do that."
msgstr "인내심을 가져라. 그건 할 수 있어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03_Support
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_PostQuest_Atka_TL_RomanScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Atka
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFAtka
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 00504DFA
#. ScriptNotes = Confident / to Player Default
#. EDID: [0105CED6]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00175F"
msgid "I think he genuinely cares about her, and he's the only one I trust to look out for her."
msgstr "로만은 진심으로 유라를 아껴준다고 생각해. 유라를 돌봐 줄 사람으로 믿을만한 건 로만뿐이야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03_Support
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_PostQuest_Atka_TL_RomanScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Atka
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFAtka
#. Face = Friendly
#. SoundFileID = 001FB4A5
#. ScriptNotes = Friendly / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: What kind of guy is Roman?
#. EDID: [0105CED6]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001760"
msgid "Out of all Yura's friends, Roman's probably the best. "
msgstr "유라의 친구들 중에서는, 로만이 아마 제일 나을 거야. "

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03_Support
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_PostQuest_Yura_TL_AtkaScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Yura
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFYura
#. Face = Thinking
#. SoundFileID = 002DF904
#. ScriptNotes = Thinking / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Atka just wants to make sure you're taken care of.
#. EDID: [0105CEA4]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001761"
msgid "But, unlike our parents, she never gave up on me, and she's always there when things really fall apart."
msgstr "하지만 우리 부모님과는 달리, 그녀는 날 포기한 적이 없고 진짜로 일이 무너질 때마다 항상 곁에 있어 줘."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03_Support
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_PostQuest_Yura_TL_AtkaScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Yura
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFYura
#. Face = Disgust
#. SoundFileID = 001DB1B0
#. ScriptNotes = Disgust / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Atka just wants to make sure you're taken care of.
#. EDID: [0105CEA4]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001762"
msgid "I wanted to hate her as a kid, she was always so perfect. Still is, of course."
msgstr "어릴 땐 그녀를 미워하고 싶었어. 늘 너무 완벽했거든. 물론 지금도 그렇고."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03_Support
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_PostQuest_Yura_TL_AtkaScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Yura
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFYura
#. Face = Concerned
#. SoundFileID = 0093D374
#. ScriptNotes = Concerned / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Atka just wants to make sure you're taken care of.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Atka just wants to make sure you're taken care of.
#. EDID: [0105CEA4]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001763"
msgid "I know, which is probably why I let her talk me into these stupid situations to begin with. "
msgstr "알아. 그래서 애초에 그녀가 날 이런 바보 같은 상황에 끌어들이게 두는 거겠지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03_Support
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_PostQuest_Yura_TL_AtkaScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Yura
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFYura
#. Face = Amused
#. SoundFileID = 00D692FF
#. ScriptNotes = Amused / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Have you told Atka you're not interested in that kind of life?
#. DialogueAfter = Yura: Steady jobs suck. Freelance all the way.
#. EDID: [0105CED5]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001764"
msgid "You'd think she likes being disappointed by now. "
msgstr "이쯤 되면 실망하는 걸 좋아한다고 생각할 수도 있겠네."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03_Support
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_PostQuest_Yura_TL_AtkaScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Yura
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFYura
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 0030FFD8
#. ScriptNotes = Confident / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Have you told Atka you're not interested in that kind of life?
#. EDID: [0105CED5]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001765"
msgid "She makes me do something, I somehow fail to do it, we fight over it, she forgives me, rinse and repeat."
msgstr "그녀가 나한테 뭘 시키고, 난 어떻게든 실패하고, 우린 그걸로 싸우고, 그녀는 날 용서하고, 그걸 반복해."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03_Support
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_PostQuest_Yura_TL_AtkaScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Yura
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFYura
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 00C84E9D
#. ScriptNotes = Confident / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Have you told Atka you're not interested in that kind of life?
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Have you told Atka you're not interested in that kind of life?
#. EDID: [0105CED5]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001766"
msgid "Only every time she tries to get me to do something, and the cycle is always the same."
msgstr "그녀가 나한테 뭘 시킬 때마다 그래. 그 순환은 늘 똑같아."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03_Support
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_PostQuest_Roman_YuraYesScene01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Roman
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRomanKreutz
#. Face = Nervous
#. SoundFileID = 001FB7A5
#. ScriptNotes = Nervous / to Player Default
#. Prompt = You know Yura. You'll know what to do when the time comes.
#. DialogueAfter = Roman: All right. I can do this.
#. EDID: [0106B1B3]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001767"
msgid "Whether or not I'll know what to do next time I see her is a completely different story."
msgstr "다음에 유라를 봤을 때 내가 뭘 해야 할지 알지는 완전히 별개의 얘기지만."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03_Support
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_PostQuest_Roman_YuraYesScene01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Roman
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRomanKreutz
#. Face = Nervous
#. SoundFileID = 0030F67A
#. ScriptNotes = Nervous / to Player Default
#. Prompt = You know Yura. You'll know what to do when the time comes.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: You know Yura. You'll know what to do when the time comes.
#. EDID: [0106B1B3]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001768"
msgid "I know her, of course. it's not like we've never spoken before. "
msgstr "물론 유라를 알지. 한 번도 말해 본 적 없는 사이도 아니니까. "

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03_Support
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_PostQuest_Roman_YuraYesScene01
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00CBD7E7
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Roman: I feel like a nervous wreck. What do I say? I... I need advice. Anything!
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: What? You're not joking? Oh god, so I really get to go through with it now.
#. EDID: [0106B1AE]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001769"
msgid "I think I was rather convincing."
msgstr "난 꽤 설득력 있었다고 생각해."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03_Support
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_PostQuest_Roman_YuraNoScene01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Roman
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRomanKreutz
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 00009396
#. ScriptNotes = Confident / to Player Default
#. Prompt = You should encourage her to get some help.
#. EDID: [0106B1A3]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00176A"
msgid "I'll do it. What's the worst that could happen at this point?"
msgstr "할게. 이 지경에서 최악이래 봐야 뭐가 더 있겠어?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03_Support
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_PostQuest_Roman_YuraNoScene01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Roman
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRomanKreutz
#. Face = Thinking
#. SoundFileID = 000B306C
#. ScriptNotes = Thinking / to Player Default
#. Prompt = You should encourage her to get some help.
#. EDID: [0106B1A3]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00176B"
msgid "But I guess if she heard it from me, too, maybe she'd consider it for once."
msgstr "하지만 내 입으로 직접 유라에게 얘길 한다면, 한 번쯤은 진지하게 생각해 줄지도 몰라."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03_Support
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_PostQuest_Roman_YuraNoScene01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Roman
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRomanKreutz
#. Face = Thinking
#. SoundFileID = 000CC798
#. ScriptNotes = Thinking / to Player Default
#. Prompt = You should encourage her to get some help.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: You should encourage her to get some help.
#. EDID: [0106B1A3]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00176C"
msgid "Hmm, maybe you're right. I never wanted to bring it up because every time Atka does, it's a fight."
msgstr "흠, 네 말이 맞을지도 몰라. 아트카가 그 얘기를 꺼낼 때마다 싸움이 일어나서 말을 꺼내고 싶지 않았거든."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03_Support
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_PostQuest_Roman_YuraNoScene01
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00736D04
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Roman: I knew this wasn't gonna work out. Why do I even keep trying?
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: *sigh* I knew it. Every time I think she's letting me in, she pushes me away.
#. EDID: [0106B1AB]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00176D"
msgid "I don't think she's ready, Roman."
msgstr "유라는 아직 준비가 안 된 것 같아. 로만."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03_Support
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_PostQuest_Roman_YuraNoScene01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Roman
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRomanKreutz
#. Face = Worried
#. SoundFileID = 0009A93A
#. ScriptNotes = Worried / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Yura doesn't think she deserves you.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Just be there for her. You mean a lot to her.
#. EDID: [0106B1AA]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00176E"
msgid "*sigh* That's classic Yura, though. Never thinks she's good enough for anything."
msgstr "*한숨* 그래도 그게 전형적인 유라지. 자기가 뭐든 누릴 자격이 없다고 생각하잖아."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03_Support
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_PostQuest_Roman_YuraNoScene01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Roman
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRomanKreutz
#. Face = Puzzled
#. SoundFileID = 004990BE
#. ScriptNotes = Puzzled / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Yura doesn't think she deserves you.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Yura doesn't think she deserves you.
#. EDID: [0106B1AA]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00176F"
msgid "What? I'm the one that doesn't deserve her. How can she even think that?"
msgstr "뭐? 자격이 없는 건 나야. 유라가 왜 그렇게 생각한 거지?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_Z01_AudioLogs
#. SceneName = SFFL_Z01_AudioLogs_DeathSlate_GABBY
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = AUDIOONLY
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCGabrielleBaker
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 002FD364
#. ScriptNotes = Exhausted and running out of oxygen. One final sigh. She'll fall asleep soon after. This is the end for her.
#. EDID: [0106C72A]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001770"
msgid "I'm so tired."
msgstr "너무 지쳤어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_Z01_AudioLogs
#. SceneName = SFFL_Z01_AudioLogs_DeathSlate_GABBY
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = AUDIOONLY
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCGabrielleBaker
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00E19924
#. ScriptNotes = Exhausted and running out of oxygen. Tons of regret as she'll never see her wife again. Tearing up.
#. DialogueBefore = Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): I guess I hoped if we had enough we could have grown gray in peace. Perfect life and all that.
#. EDID: [0106C72A]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001771"
msgid "But now... I just want to be in it a bit longer..."
msgstr "그런데 이제는... 조금만 더 그 안에 있고 싶어..."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_CrimeDialogue
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_CrimeDialogueScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Guard
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFSashaAtwell
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 009EE6BA
#. ScriptNotes = Serious / to Player Default
#. DialogueAfter = Guard: I'm sorry, it was an accident. Won't happen again.
#. EDID: [01034E63]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001772"
msgid "Hold up! You've got a bounty that'll need to be paid off if you want to keep that head on your shoulders."
msgstr "멈춰! 머리가 몸통에 그대로 붙어있고 싶으면 당장 현상금부터 내시지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_CrimeDialogue
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_CrimeDialogue_Vote
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Guard
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00E5AE85
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Guard: What do you think you're doing?
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Yeah? Well, take it up with founding fathers. We're putting those votes back and that's that.
#. EDID: [01034F7F]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001773"
msgid "I had to. You can't be trusted to vote correctly."
msgstr "그럴 수밖에 없었어. 넌 제대로 투표할 만큼 믿을 수가 없거든."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMChanHuang
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMChanHuang
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 00EF1514
#. EDID: [010343B8]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001774"
msgid "Glad you found your way here."
msgstr "길 안 잃어버리고 잘 찾아왔네."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMChanHuang
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMChanHuang
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 00B94F7D
#. EDID: [010343B6]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001775"
msgid "Your help's appreciated."
msgstr "도와줘서 고맙네."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ01
#. SceneName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ01_StartScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = ChanHuang
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMChanHuang
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 0007A2FB
#. ScriptNotes = Growing hope / to Player Default
#. Prompt = I'll solve your Spacer problem, but it'll cost you.
#. DialogueAfter = ChanHuang: Now listen, there's no need for excessive bloodshed here.
#. EDID: [010343AB]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001776"
msgid "I'm sure he'll be willing to provide some credits for your trouble."
msgstr "세인트 씨가 수고비로 크레딧을 좀 얹어줄 거야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ01
#. SceneName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ01_StartScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = ChanHuang
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMChanHuang
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 002747B9
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = I'll solve your Spacer problem, but it'll cost you.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I'll solve your Spacer problem, but it'll cost you.
#. EDID: [010343AB]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001777"
msgid "Once you've set out, I'll talk to Mister Saint."
msgstr "처리하러 출발하면, 세인트 씨에게 얘기해 두도록 하지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ01
#. SceneName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ01_Conclusion
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = ChanHuang
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMChanHuang
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 002A50E6
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Words of gratitude are fine, but credits are better.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Words of gratitude are fine, but credits are better.
#. DialogueAfter = ChanHuang: Here. Compliments of Mister Saint.
#. EDID: [010343BC]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001778"
msgid "Of course, just as we agreed."
msgstr "물론 줘야지. 합의한 대로."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ01
#. SceneName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ01_Conclusion
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = ChanHuang
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 002B93A3
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I took care of your Spacer problem. &&& ChanHuang: Really? You hardly look any the worse for wear.|We're in your debt, friend. Thank you.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: If we closed our doors to the Spacers, they'd just kick them down, metaphorically speaking.
#. EDID: [010343BD]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001779"
msgid "Maybe Spacers shouldn't be welcome here anymore."
msgstr "스페이서는 여기 들이지 않는 게 좋을지도 모르겠네."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ01
#. SceneName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ01_StartScene
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = ChanHuang
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00186F2D
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = ChanHuang: You might want to get out of here while you still can.|Spacers are planning a raid on this place, and it could happen soon.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: There's a Spacer gang that makes regular stops here.
#. EDID: [010343A6]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00177A"
msgid "Why? What happened?"
msgstr "왜? 무슨 일이 있었는데?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ01
#. SceneName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ01_Conclusion
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0036771A
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I took care of your Spacer problem. &&& ChanHuang: Really? You hardly look any the worse for wear.|We're in your debt, friend. Thank you.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: We don't hear those words very often in Anchorpoint.
#. EDID: [010343A8]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00177B"
msgid "Happy to help."
msgstr "도움이 됐다니 기쁘네."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ01
#. SceneName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ01_Conclusion
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = companion
#. VoiceType = NPCMBarrett
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 001F329A
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Maybe Spacers shouldn't be welcome here anymore.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Maybe Spacers shouldn't be welcome here anymore. &&& ChanHuang: If we closed our doors to the Spacers, they'd just kick them down, metaphorically speaking.|Easier to just let them in and try to contain the mess.
#. DialogueAfter = ChanHuang: Here. Compliments of Mister Saint.
#. EDID: [01059DC4]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00177C"
msgid "It makes a strange kind of sense."
msgstr "묘하게 앞뒤가 맞네요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_Z01_SE1
#. SceneName = SFFL_Z01_100a_Hailing_SEHOY
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = HailingShip
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCSehoyBaker
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 003DF2D1
#. ScriptNotes = Nervous and desperate. Unsure is she is even controlling the ship's hailing system correctly. [Spaceship]
#. DialogueBefore = HailingShip: Hello? Is someone there? Please, tell me if you can hear me. This is Sehoy Baker.
#. DialogueAfter = HailingShip: No, wait! Dammit!
#. EDID: [010325FC]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00177D"
msgid "Yes, yes, I see you. Hello?"
msgstr "그래, 그래, 보인다. 여보세요?"

