#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = HailingShip: Hello? Is someone there? Please, tell me if you can hear me. This is Sehoy Baker. &&& HailingShip: &&& HailingShip: H-Hello? Thank goodness! You don't know how good it is to hear another voice.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: No, no, please! Come back!
#. EDID: [010325F4]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00177E"
msgid "If you're looking for help, look elsewhere."
msgstr "도움을 찾는 거라면 다른 데 알아봐."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_Z01_SE1
#. SceneName = SFFL_Z01_100b_HailingAnswered_SEHOY
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = HailingShip
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCSehoyBaker
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0047E79E
#. ScriptNotes = Thankful that someone has answered her call for help. [Spaceship] / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = HailingShip:
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: You sound pretty desperate.
#. EDID: [010325F3]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00177F"
msgid "H-Hello? Thank goodness! You don't know how good it is to hear another voice."
msgstr "여-여보세요? 다행이다! 다른 목소리를 듣는 게 이렇게 반가울 줄은 모를 거예요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_Z01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCSehoyBaker
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCSehoyBaker
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00F2C7BE
#. ScriptNotes = Worried. [Spaceship]
#. EDID: [01056637]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001780"
msgid "Please be safe out there."
msgstr "밖에서는 조심하세요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_Z01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCSehoyBaker
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCSehoyBaker
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00ADE5A1
#. ScriptNotes = Worried. [Spaceship]
#. EDID: [01056611]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001781"
msgid "Please, tell me you've found something..."
msgstr "제발, 뭔가 찾았다고 말해 주세요..."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_Z01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCSehoyBaker
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCSehoyBaker
#. Face = Spaceship / Angry
#. SoundFileID = 00B049E2
#. ScriptNotes = Scared [Spaceship] / Angry
#. EDID: [01056627]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001782"
msgid "That's enough! Stop!"
msgstr "그만해! 멈춰!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_Z01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCSehoyBaker
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCSehoyBaker
#. Face = Spaceship / InPain
#. SoundFileID = 002D5C1F
#. ScriptNotes = Grunt from spaceship getting hit [Spaceship] / InPain
#. EDID: [01056617]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001783"
msgid "Ggh!"
msgstr "으윽!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_Z01
#. SceneName = SFFL_Z01_200_SEHOY
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Sehoy
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCSehoyBaker
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 005B1242
#. ScriptNotes = Though she is trying to gather herself, she is just in between trying to hold back tears and be somewhat thankful. [Spaceship] / to Player Default
#. Prompt = She didn't say. I'm sorry.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Be safe out there.
#. EDID: [010352DF]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001784"
msgid "I don't have much in the way of credits, but here. Take them."
msgstr "크레딧은 얼마 없지만, 여기요. 가져가세요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_Z01
#. SceneName = SFFL_Z01_200_SEHOY
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Sehoy
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCSehoyBaker
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 007C1FBE
#. ScriptNotes = Though she is trying to gather herself, she is just in between trying to hold back tears and be somewhat thankful. [Spaceship] / to Player Default
#. Prompt = She didn't say. I'm sorry.
#. EDID: [010352DF]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001785"
msgid "I'm sorry. This is all just- I don't mean to sound unappreciative. Thank you for finding her. "
msgstr "죄송해요. 이게 다 그냥- 감사하지 않다는 뜻은 아니에요. 그녀를 찾아 주셔서 고마워요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_Z01
#. SceneName = SFFL_Z01_200_SEHOY
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Sehoy
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCSehoyBaker
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 006F9610
#. ScriptNotes = Soft crying and confused. [Spaceship] / to Player Default
#. Prompt = She didn't say. I'm sorry.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: She didn't say. I'm sorry.
#. EDID: [010352DF]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001786"
msgid "I don't understand..."
msgstr "이해가 안 돼요..."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_Z01
#. SceneName = SFFL_Z01_200_SEHOY
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Sehoy
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCSehoyBaker
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00EDF34A
#. ScriptNotes = Feels really broken and not tethered to reality. She feels like she's in so sort of lost, tiring limbo. Tears starting to come in. [Spaceship] / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Be safe out there.
#. DialogueAfter = companion: Perhaps Gabrielle can finally be at peace now. I just hope Sehoy can find it one day too.
#. EDID: [010352ED]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001787"
msgid "Um, goodbye."
msgstr "음, 안녕히 가세요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_Z01
#. SceneName = SFFL_Z01_200_SEHOY
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Sehoy
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCSehoyBaker
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00560B65
#. ScriptNotes = Feels really broken and not tethered to reality. She feels like she's in so sort of lost, tiring limbo. [Spaceship] / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Be safe out there.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Be safe out there.
#. EDID: [010352ED]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001788"
msgid "Yes. Here."
msgstr "네. 여기요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_Z01
#. SceneName = SFFL_Z01_200_SEHOY
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Sehoy
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCSehoyBaker
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0058574A
#. ScriptNotes = Confused and lost. Perhaps a bit sad angry that her wife is pushing her away like this. [Spaceship] / to Player Default
#. Prompt = All she said was that she wanted you to go back home.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Go home.
#. EDID: [01035301]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001789"
msgid "I don't know why she's doing this, but here. I wish I had more credits to give you. I'm sorry. Hopefully this will work."
msgstr "왜 그녀가 이러는지는 모르겠지만, 여기요. 더 많은 크레딧을 드릴 수 있으면 좋겠는데. 죄송해요. 이걸로 됐으면 좋겠어요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_Z01
#. SceneName = SFFL_Z01_200_SEHOY
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Sehoy
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCSehoyBaker
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00B66B42
#. ScriptNotes = Confused and lost at what to say. Perhaps a bit sad angry that her wife is pushing her away like this. [Spaceship] / to Player Default
#. Prompt = All she said was that she wanted you to go back home.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: All she said was that she wanted you to go back home.
#. EDID: [01035301]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00178A"
msgid "I see... Thank you for telling me."
msgstr "그렇군요... 알려 줘서 고마워요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_Z01
#. SceneName = SFFL_Z01_200_SEHOY
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Sehoy
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0023450B
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Sehoy: You're back! Did you find Gabrielle? Please, tell me you've found her.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: I see... Thank you for telling me.
#. EDID: [010352DA]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00178B"
msgid "All she said was that she wanted you to go back home."
msgstr "그녀가 한 말은 당신이 집으로 돌아갔으면 한다는 것뿐이었어요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_Z01
#. SceneName = SFFL_Z01_200_SEHOY
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 001D4367
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Her ship malfunctioned. I found these slates in the wreckage. &&& Sehoy: How did it- Let me see those.|I-I can't believe this, my star, she's-
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: I guess I should just head back?
#. EDID: [010352F0]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00178C"
msgid "I'm so sorry, Sehoy."
msgstr "정말 미안해요, 세호이."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_Z01
#. SceneName = SFFL_Z01_200_SEHOY
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Sehoy
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00DAFF4F
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: She was long gone by the time I found her. These slates were all I could find. &&& Sehoy: What? May I see the slates?|No... No, Gabbie...
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: There really isn't, is there...?
#. EDID: [010352FD]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00178D"
msgid "You should go home. There's nothing left for you out here."
msgstr "집으로 돌아가세요. 여기엔 당신을 위한 게 아무것도 남아 있지 않아요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_Z01
#. SceneName = SFFL_Z01_200_SEHOY
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Sehoy
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCSehoyBaker
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00F8E5D2
#. ScriptNotes = Shocked and confused as to why her wife is doing all this. Wondering why Gabrielle is pushing her away like this. [Spaceship] / to Player Default
#. Prompt = [Lie] I found her, but she said she can't go home yet.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: [Lie] I found her, but she said she can't go home yet.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: She didn't say. I'm sorry.
#. EDID: [0105661A]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00178E"
msgid "Why not? Did she say anything else? Why is she doing this...?"
msgstr "왜요? 다른 말은 없었어요? 왜 그러는 거죠...?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_Z01
#. SceneName = SFFL_Z01_200_SEHOY
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Sehoy
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCSehoyBaker
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 004188B2
#. ScriptNotes = Horrified and heartbroken. Tearing up. [Spaceship] / to Player Default
#. Prompt = She was long gone by the time I found her. These slates were all I could find.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: You should go home. There's nothing left for you out here.
#. EDID: [010352EC]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00178F"
msgid "No... No, Gabbie..."
msgstr "안 돼... 안 돼, 개비..."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_Z01
#. SceneName = SFFL_Z01_200_SEHOY
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Sehoy
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCSehoyBaker
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00860648
#. ScriptNotes = Shocked and horrified. Pleads for the slates to find out what happened to her love. [Spaceship] / to Player Default
#. Prompt = She was long gone by the time I found her. These slates were all I could find.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: She was long gone by the time I found her. These slates were all I could find.
#. EDID: [010352EC]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001790"
msgid "What? May I see the slates?"
msgstr "뭐라고요? 슬레이트를 볼 수 있을까요?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_Z01
#. SceneName = SFFL_Z01_120_SEHOY
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Sehoy
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 009F7B86
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = HailingShip: In all honesty, I am. &&& Sehoy: You seem like you're more versed in this whole flying thing than me.|Please, have you seen a cargo ship out here? Piloted by a woman named Gabrielle Baker?|I'm her wife. She went on a job and it's been months...
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: But what if she isn't? She should have been home long ago. I can't keep waiting on what if's.
#. EDID: [01035303]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001791"
msgid "Space travel can take quite a while. I'm sure she's fine."
msgstr "우주 여행은 시간이 꽤 걸릴 수 있어요. 분명 괜찮을 거예요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_Z01
#. SceneName = SFFL_Z01_120_SEHOY
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Sehoy
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00B4C488
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = HailingShip: In all honesty, I am. &&& Sehoy: You seem like you're more versed in this whole flying thing than me.|Please, have you seen a cargo ship out here? Piloted by a woman named Gabrielle Baker?|I'm her wife. She went on a job and it's been months...
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: I did. I took our savings and bought a ship to find her.
#. EDID: [010352F7]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001792"
msgid "Wait, did you come all the way out here to find her?"
msgstr "잠깐, 아내를 찾으려고 여기까지 온 건가요?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_Z01
#. SceneName = SFFL_Z01_120Starborn_SEHOY
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Sehoy
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCSehoyBaker
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 008ED9BB
#. ScriptNotes = Shocked and confused as to why her wife wouldn't want to be found. [Spaceship] / to Player Default
#. Prompt = [Lie] She didn't want you to know where she was. She said she still has a lot of work she needs to do.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: [Lie] She didn't say much. I don't think she wanted to be found.
#. DialogueAfter = Sehoy: I'm so sorry, Sehoy.
#. EDID: [01056605]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001793"
msgid "That doesn't make any sense. Why would she say that? Please, tell me where you found her."
msgstr "말이 안 돼요. 왜 그런 말을 하죠? 제발, 어디서 그녀를 찾았는지 말해 주세요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_Z01
#. SceneName = SFFL_Z01_120Starborn_SEHOY
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Sehoy
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 005416BC
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Yes. I found Gabrielle and her ship. &&& Sehoy: You did? Please tell me she's alright! Where is she?
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: What? But why? Where did you find her? I need to talk to her!
#. EDID: [010565F8]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001794"
msgid "[Lie] She didn't want you to know where she was. She said she still has a lot of work she needs to do."
msgstr "[거짓말] 그녀는 자신이 어디 있는지 당신이 알길 원하지 않았어요. 아직 해야 할 일이 많다고 했어요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_Z01
#. SceneName = SFFL_Z01_300_COMPANION
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = companion
#. VoiceType = NPCFAndreja
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 009B1824
#. ScriptNotes = Player told Sehoy Gabrielle is dead. Feels bad for Sehoy for having to go through such a heartbreaking and soul crushing thing. [Spaceship]
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: It's just what she said. That's all I know. &&& Sehoy: That can't be right... I'm sorry. I have to find her.
#. EDID: [0105662A]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001795"
msgid "Perhaps Gabrielle can finally be at peace now. I just hope Sehoy can find it one day too."
msgstr "어쩌면 가브리엘도 이제 마침내 평화를 찾을 수 있겠죠. 세호이도 언젠가는 그럴 수 있길 바랄 뿐이에요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_Z01
#. SceneName = SFFL_Z01_200_SEHOY
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Sehoy
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCSehoyBaker
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00F317A3
#. ScriptNotes = Confused and scared. Knows the Player is hiding something and this frightens her. She is now in a bigger rush to find Gabrielle. [Spaceship] / to Player Default
#. Prompt = It's just what she said. That's all I know.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: It's just what she said. That's all I know.
#. DialogueAfter = companion: Perhaps Gabrielle can finally be at peace now. I just hope Sehoy can find it one day too.
#. EDID: [0105660D]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001796"
msgid "That can't be right... I'm sorry. I have to find her."
msgstr "그럴 리가 없어요... 죄송해요. 그녀를 찾아야겠어요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_Z01
#. SceneName = SFFL_Z01_125_SEHOY
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Sehoy
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCSehoyBaker
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00DDA2E2
#. ScriptNotes = Frustrated the Player has left once again. [Spaceship] / to Player Default
#. Prompt = No. And I don't have time to look.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: No. And I don't have time to look.
#. EDID: [010565FB]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001797"
msgid "Wait! Please! Dammit..."
msgstr "잠깐! 제발! 젠장..."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_Z01
#. SceneName = SFFL_Z01_120_SEHOY
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Sehoy
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCSehoyBaker
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00E29F05
#. ScriptNotes = Shocked by the refusal, and horrified. She finally got a hold of someone, but now is back where she started with having no help. [Spaceship] / to Player Default
#. Prompt = That sounds like a you problem. Not mine. Good luck.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: That sounds like a you problem. Not mine. Good luck.
#. EDID: [01056607]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001798"
msgid "No! Wait, please!"
msgstr "안 돼! 잠깐만요, 제발!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_Z01
#. SceneName = SFFL_Z01_120_SEHOY
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Sehoy
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 009D5C8D
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = HailingShip: In all honesty, I am. &&& Sehoy: You seem like you're more versed in this whole flying thing than me.|Please, have you seen a cargo ship out here? Piloted by a woman named Gabrielle Baker?|I'm her wife. She went on a job and it's been months...
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: You can? Thank you. Thank you so much!
#. EDID: [0105660A]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001799"
msgid "I haven't seen her. But I can help you find her."
msgstr "그녀를 본 적은 없어요. 하지만 찾는 건 도와드릴 수 있어요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_KT02_SailingHighSeas
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE_KT02_100b_HailingAnswered
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = HailingShip
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00C60FBA
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = HailingShip: All right you dastardly pirate scum, answer the hail! &&& HailingShip: &&& HailingShip: Thanks for answering, you filthy little pirate! &&& HailingShip: Any last words before we blow you to smithereens?
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Well, if you aren't gonna say anything, I guess we'll let our guns do the talking!
#. EDID: [010388C4]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0017A2"
msgid "[Remain silent]"
msgstr "[침묵]"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_KT02_SailingHighSeas
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE_KT02_100b_HailingAnswered
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = HailingShip
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 007644B0
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: My last words are "Hot Dogs are a sandwich." &&& HailingShip: Those are some fighting words for sure. Honey, power up the weapons! &&& HailingShip: Is that right? Did you pay the 50k to hunt pirates?
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Goddamnit! Honey, power up those weapons!
#. EDID: [010388B3]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0017A3"
msgid "[Attack] No, I'm with a different tour guide. We hunt rich executives like you."
msgstr "[공격] 아니, 난 다른 관광 안내원과 함께 있어. 우리 일은 너 같은 부유한 임원들을 사냥하는 거야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_KT02_SailingHighSeas
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE_KT02_100b_HailingAnswered
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = HailingShip
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMGenericMale02
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 006CD93D
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = HailingShip: Those are some fighting words for sure. Honey, power up the weapons!
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: I didn't. You clearly got scammed.
#. EDID: [010388CB]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0017A4"
msgid "Is that right? Did you pay the 50k to hunt pirates?"
msgstr "그래요? 해적을 사냥하려고 5만을 낸 건가요?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_KT02_SailingHighSeas
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE_KT02_100a_InitialScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = TourEscort
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMGenericMale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0057FA0F
#. DialogueAfter = HailingShip: Hell yeah! The chance to destroy a real pirate ship! This is worth every cred!
#. EDID: [010388BA]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0017A5"
msgid "This is a known pirate hunting ground. We suggest powering up your weapons, we could spot one at any moment."
msgstr "이곳은 알려진 해적 사냥터입니다. 언제든 해적을 발견할 수 있으니 무기 전원을 올려 두시길 권합니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_Anchorpoint_RandConv03_RishiValeria
#. SceneName = SFFL_Anchorpoint_RandConv02_SceneCOPY0000
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Actor02
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRishiSaint
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 0013E7F8
#. ScriptNotes = / to Actor01
#. DialogueAfter = Actor01: And when someone draws a gun on me over it?
#. EDID: [01031724]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0017A7"
msgid "Dilute the drinks if you need to, but we won't be diluting our profits."
msgstr "필요하면 술은 묽게 타도 되지만, 우리 수익까지 묽게 만들 순 없습니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_Anchorpoint_RandConv03_RishiValeria
#. SceneName = SFFL_Anchorpoint_RandConv02_SceneCOPY0000
