#. ScriptNotes = / to Actor02
#. EDID: [01031722]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0017AB"
msgid "Of course, the patrons don't like that overly much."
msgstr "물론 고객들이 그걸 그리 좋아하진 않지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_Anchorpoint_RandConv03_RishiValeria
#. SceneName = SFFL_Anchorpoint_RandConv02_SceneCOPY0000
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Actor01
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFValeriaHahn
#. Face = Friendly
#. SoundFileID = 009D7BAB
#. ScriptNotes = / to Actor02
#. DialogueBefore = Actor01: We're running low again.|Might be time to find a new supplier, at least for the drinks. &&& Actor02: That's unfortunate. Reliable traders are a rare commodity out here.
#. EDID: [01031722]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0017AC"
msgid "I could always mix the drinks a little weaker."
msgstr "술을 조금 약하게 탈 수도 있지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_Anchorpoint_RandConv02_RishiKillian
#. SceneName = SFFL_Anchorpoint_RandConv02_Scene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Actor01
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMKillianBrice
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 000887C7
#. ScriptNotes = / to Actor01
#. DialogueAfter = Actor02: As I've said before, I will never consider advertising to the public.
#. EDID: [01031707]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0017AD"
msgid "If you listened to my suggestions, we could do better."
msgstr "내 제안대로만 했으면, 결과가 더 좋게 나왔을 텐데."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_Anchorpoint_RandConv02_RishiKillian
#. SceneName = SFFL_Anchorpoint_RandConv02_Scene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Actor01
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMKillianBrice
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0098E47E
#. ScriptNotes = / to Actor01
#. DialogueBefore = Actor02: Profits are down, Killian. I need you to do better.
#. EDID: [01031707]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0017AE"
msgid "I don't control how much our patrons choose to spend on my goods."
msgstr "고객들이 내 물건에 돈을 얼마나 쓸지까지 내가 마음대로 할 수는 없잖아."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_Anchorpoint_RandConv02_RishiKillian
#. SceneName = SFFL_Anchorpoint_RandConv02_Scene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Actor01
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMKillianBrice
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00D324E2
#. ScriptNotes = / to Actor02
#. DialogueAfter = Actor02: Just do your job.
#. EDID: [010316F5]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0017AF"
msgid "Either we take steps to bolster profits or accept that they'll be less than they could."
msgstr "수익을 끌어올릴 수단을 마련하든가, 아니면 벌 수 있는 것보다 적은 수익을 받아들이든가 해야지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_Anchorpoint_RandConv02_RishiKillian
#. SceneName = SFFL_Anchorpoint_RandConv02_Scene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Actor01
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMKillianBrice
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00BA0B0D
#. ScriptNotes = / to Actor02
#. DialogueBefore = Actor01: I don't control how much our patrons choose to spend on my goods.|If you listened to my suggestions, we could do better. &&& Actor02: As I've said before, I will never consider advertising to the public.|Above all, our customers value the privacy of this station.|The last thing we need is to attract unwanted attention.
#. EDID: [010316F5]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0017B0"
msgid "You can't have it both ways."
msgstr "둘 다 가질 수는 없어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_Anchorpoint_RandConv01_ChanMaddie
#. SceneName = SFFL_Anchorpoint_RandConv01_Scene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Actor02
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMChanHuang
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 007C8078
#. ScriptNotes = / to Actor01
#. DialogueAfter = Actor01: And while I make your robot guards, who's going to keep this place running?
#. EDID: [010316F4]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0017B1"
msgid "Just a few bots could still make a big difference."
msgstr "로봇 몇 대만 더 있어도 격차를 크게 벌릴 수 있어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_Anchorpoint_RandConv01_ChanMaddie
#. SceneName = SFFL_Anchorpoint_RandConv01_Scene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Actor02
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMChanHuang
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 0051FDD8
#. ScriptNotes = / to Actor01
#. EDID: [010316F4]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0017B2"
msgid "You know there's only a handful of us keeping this place safe."
msgstr "여길 지키는 인원이 우리 몇 명뿐이라는 거 알잖아."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_Anchorpoint_RandConv01_ChanMaddie
#. SceneName = SFFL_Anchorpoint_RandConv01_Scene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Actor02
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMChanHuang
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 0021D283
#. ScriptNotes = / to Actor01
#. DialogueBefore = Actor02: Have you thought any more about my idea? &&& Actor01: About building you an army of robots?|Look, nobody would enjoy that more than me, but you know I ain't got time.
#. EDID: [010316F4]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0017B3"
msgid "I didn't say an army."
msgstr "무슨 군대를 만들라는 게 아냐."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_Anchorpoint_RandConv01_ChanMaddie
#. SceneName = SFFL_Anchorpoint_RandConv01_Scene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Actor01
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFMaddieWing
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00E39BF7
#. ScriptNotes = / to Actor02
#. DialogueAfter = Actor02: I didn't say an army.
#. EDID: [01031703]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0017B4"
msgid "Look, nobody would enjoy that more than me, but you know I ain't got time."
msgstr "저기, 나보다 더 즐겁게 로봇을 만들 사람은 없겠지만, 나한테 시간 없는 거 알잖아."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_Anchorpoint_RandConv01_ChanMaddie
#. SceneName = SFFL_Anchorpoint_RandConv01_Scene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Actor01
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFMaddieWing
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00A5436C
#. ScriptNotes = / to Actor02
#. DialogueBefore = Actor02: Have you thought any more about my idea?
#. EDID: [01031703]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0017B5"
msgid "About building you an army of robots?"
msgstr "로봇 군대를 만들어 주는 거?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_Anchorpoint_RandConv01_ChanMaddie
#. SceneName = SFFL_Anchorpoint_RandConv01_Scene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Actor02
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMChanHuang
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 007F9E51
#. ScriptNotes = / to Actor01
#. DialogueAfter = Actor01: About building you an army of robots?
#. EDID: [01031701]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0017B6"
msgid "Have you thought any more about my idea?"
msgstr "내 아이디어에 대해 더 생각해 봤어?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCFGrandma
#. VoiceType = SFFL_SE01_NPCFGrandma
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00752EE3
#. ScriptNotes = unnatural, almost robotic cadence / Neutral
#. EDID: [0104AE44]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0017B7"
msgid "Join me on my ship."
msgstr "내 우주선에 타거라."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE01
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE01_250_GrandmaTalk
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Grandma
#. VoiceType = SFFL_SE01_NPCFGrandma
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00062CE2
#. ScriptNotes = deadpan, almost ghostly / Neutral / to Player Default
#. Prompt = I've felt better, honestly.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I've felt better, honestly.
#. DialogueAfter = Grandma: I would like to inhabit a body like yours. My current body... I can feel it deteriorating. I feel my skin about to split, my teeth about to burst. I can feel itching behind my eyes.
#. EDID: [0102FCB7]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0017B8"
msgid "Interesting. You look alive to me."
msgstr "흥미롭구나. 내가 보기엔 살아 있는 것처럼 보이는데."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE01
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE01_250_GrandmaTalk
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0099C25E
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: My ship isn't much better. &&& Grandma: Interesting. Your body seems strong, full of vigor. You have no excuse to let your ship fall into such disrepair. &&& Grandma: How do you feel in your body? Do you feel alive?
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: I am envious.
#. EDID: [0102FCAB]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0017B9"
msgid "I feel good."
msgstr "몸 상태는 좋아요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE01
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE01_250_GrandmaTalkBranch
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
