#. ScriptNotes = deadpan, almost ghostly. / Neutral
#. DialogueBefore = Grandma: Interesting. Your body seems strong, full of vigor. You have no excuse to let your ship fall into such disrepair.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: I feel good.
#. EDID: [0102FCBD]
