#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Grandma
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00F6CAC5
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Nice to meet you. &&& Grandma: Likewise. It feels good to have you here. &&& Grandma: I can see your eyes wandering about my ship. I extend my apologies for the state of it.|I regret that it has fallen into disrepair as of late. It has been... years since I have landed anywhere. Years and years.
#. DialogueAfter = Grandma: How do you feel in your body? Do you feel alive?
#. EDID: [0102FCAF]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0017BD"
msgid "You're joking. That can't be true."
msgstr "농담이겠죠. 그게 가능할 리 없잖아요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE01
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE01_250_GrandmaTalk
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
