#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Nice to meet you.
#. DialogueAfter = Grandma: I can see your eyes wandering about my ship. I extend my apologies for the state of it.
#. EDID: [0102FCB1]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0017C0"
msgid "Likewise. It feels good to have you here."
msgstr "나도 반갑구나. 네가 여기 있어서 좋구나."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE01
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE01_250_GrandmaTalk
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Grandma
#. VoiceType = SFFL_SE01_NPCFGrandma
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00D48831
#. ScriptNotes = deadpan / Neutral / to Player Default
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Nice to meet you.
#. EDID: [0102FCB3]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0017C1"
msgid "I am glad you stopped by. I was beginning to think that you were... afraid."
msgstr "들러 줘서 기쁘단다. 하도 안 오길래 혹시... 무서워서 도망친 건가 싶었지 뭐니."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE01
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE01_250_GrandmaTalk
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Grandma
#. VoiceType = SFFL_SE01_NPCFGrandma
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0084369A
#. ScriptNotes = deadpan / Neutral / to Player Default
#. EDID: [0102FCB3]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0017C2"
msgid "Hello."
msgstr "안녕."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE01
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE01_250_GrandmaTalk
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00D32928
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I feel good. &&& Grandma: I am envious. &&& Grandma: I would like to inhabit a body like yours. My current body... I can feel it deteriorating. I feel my skin about to split, my teeth about to burst. I can feel itching behind my eyes. |So itchy... but your body seems like it would not be. &&& Grandma: Now that I have gotten to know you better, I think it is time to eat.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Nonsense, nonsense.
#. EDID: [010300CC]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0017C3"
msgid "I'm not sure I'm hungry anymore."
msgstr "이제 별로 배가 고프지 않은 것 같아요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE01
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE01_255_DeclinedFood
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Grandma
#. VoiceType = SFFL_SE01_NPCFGrandma
#. Face = Irritated
#. SoundFileID = 001C738B
#. ScriptNotes = Irritated / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Fine, if it means that much to you. Just calm down.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Fine, if it means that much to you. Just calm down.
#. EDID: [0103073B]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0017C4"
msgid "Good. And you will eat every last bit, or you will make us angry again."
msgstr "좋구나. 마지막 한 조각까지 다 먹으렴. 안 그러면 우리를 다시 화나게 만들게 될 거야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE01
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE01_255_DeclinedFood
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Grandma
#. VoiceType = SFFL_SE01_NPCFGrandma
#. Face = Irritated
#. SoundFileID = 00A862DD
