#. DialogueBefore = Grandma: What is the meaning of this?
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: I didn't inconvenience you. You're the one that invited me over.
#. EDID: [0103073A]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0017C5"
msgid "You inconvenience me by coming on my ship, and yet you decline my hospitality. "
msgstr "내 우주선에 올라와 나를 불편하게 해 놓고도, 내 호의는 거절하는구나. "

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE01
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE01_260_AteFood
