msgid "Hmmph. I was trying to help you out. "
msgstr "흠. 도와주려고 했는데."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R01
#. SceneName = SFFL_R01_HailAccepted
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = HailingShip
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R01_Smuggler
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 001577A7
#. DialogueBefore = HailingShip: Trade Authority is paying a pretty penny to anyone who can get the contraband from some potentially dangerous areas. |Thing is, I know my limits. I'm a smuggler, not a fighter. I don't like to get my hands dirty like that. So, here's the deal - I'll pay you to get the contraband and bring it back to me.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: I'm not afraid of doing some smuggling. I'm in.
#. EDID: [01029886]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0017F2"
msgid "If you're set up for it, and wanna go the extra mile, you can deliver the goods to the Trade Authority yourself. Hell, makes my job a whole lot easier, and you'll get more credits for the trouble."
msgstr "준비가 되어 있고 한 발 더 나아가고 싶다면, 물건을 직접 무역 연맹에 전달해도 돼. 솔직히 내 일이 훨씬 쉬워지고, 수고한 만큼 더 많은 크레딧도 받을 거야."

#. List: 2
