#. DialogueAfter = HailingShip: If I have more opportunities for you in the future, I'll find you.
#. EDID: [01043FAD]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0017F5"
msgid "Always a pleasure working with you."
msgstr "함께 일하는 건 언제나 즐겁습니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R01
#. SceneName = SFFL_R01_HailAccepted
