#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I'm going to have to report this to the Vanguard.
#. EDID: [01043FAF]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0017F7"
msgid "Uh, that won't be necessary. I never said anything. "
msgstr "어, 그럴 필요는 없어. 난 아무 말도 안 했어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R01
