#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 007A48CC
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I bend the law all the time. &&& HailingShip: Perfect. &&& HailingShip: Trade Authority is paying a pretty penny to anyone who can get the contraband from some potentially dangerous areas. |Thing is, I know my limits. I'm a smuggler, not a fighter. I don't like to get my hands dirty like that. So, here's the deal - I'll pay you to get the contraband and bring it back to me. &&& HailingShip: If you're set up for it, and wanna go the extra mile, you can deliver the goods to the Trade Authority yourself. Hell, makes my job a whole lot easier, and you'll get more credits for the trouble.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Ah, shit. That... that won't be necessary. I gotta go.
#. EDID: [01043F9E]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0017F8"
msgid "I'm gonna have to report this to the Freestar Rangers."
msgstr "이 일은 자유항성 레인저에게 보고해야겠어."

#. List: 2
