#. SoundFileID = 00E007F9
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. EDID: [01043F96]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0017FB"
msgid "Thing is, I need someone that isn't afraid to... bend the law, so to speak. "
msgstr "문제는, 말하자면... 법을 좀 굽히는 걸 두려워하지 않는 사람이 필요하다는 거야."

