#. Speaker = HailingShip
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R01_Smuggler
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00BD621C
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueAfter = HailingShip: I've got another job for you, if you're up for it. Same as last time, you just gotta get the contraband and give it to either me or the Trade Authority.
#. EDID: [01043FB3]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001802"
msgid "Hey, remember me?"
msgstr "이봐, 나 기억해?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R01
#. SceneName = SFFL_R01_HailAccepted
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Smuggler
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R01_Smuggler
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 005C00BA
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral / to Player Default
#. Prompt = I'm not afraid of doing some smuggling. I'm in.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I'm not afraid of doing some smuggling. I'm in.
#. DialogueAfter = HailingShip: I'm marking the locations for you. Good luck.
#. EDID: [01051BA9]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001803"
msgid "Fantastic, this should be easy money then."
msgstr "훌륭해. 그럼 쉬운 돈벌이가 되겠군."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R01
#. SceneName = SFFL_R01_TL03
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = HailingShip
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R01_Smuggler
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00F65A42
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral
#. EDID: [01051B9C]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001804"
msgid "*Sigh* That's it, all right? Let's stop talking about this."
msgstr "*한숨* 좋아, 그게 다야. 이제 이 얘기는 그만하자."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R01
#. SceneName = SFFL_R01_TL03
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = HailingShip
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R01_Smuggler
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 000302F3
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral
#. EDID: [01051B9C]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001805"
msgid "The bullets started flying, I got hit in the leg and arm, my neck was grazed. I got lucky though. I managed to hit him square in the head, and that was that."
msgstr "총알이 날아다니기 시작했고, 난 다리와 팔에 맞고 목도 스쳤어. 그래도 운이 좋았지. 놈의 머리를 정통으로 맞혔고, 그걸로 끝이었어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R01
#. SceneName = SFFL_R01_TL03
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = HailingShip
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R01_Smuggler
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 008C1E73
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral
#. EDID: [01051B9C]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001806"
msgid "I came back with the contraband and he was waiting on the ship with a gun in his hand. Told me to hand the stuff over and that he was gonna leave me stranded."
msgstr "밀수품을 가지고 돌아왔더니 그가 총을 들고 우주선에서 기다리고 있었어. 물건을 넘기라고, 날 버리고 떠나겠다고 하더군."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R01
#. SceneName = SFFL_R01_TL03
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = HailingShip
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R01_Smuggler
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00115384
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral
#. EDID: [01051B9C]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001807"
msgid "Well, someone or something got into his head and convinced him to double-cross me. "
msgstr "글쎄, 누군가나 무언가가 그의 머릿속에 들어가 날 배신하라고 설득한 거야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R01
#. SceneName = SFFL_R01_TL03
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = HailingShip
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R01_Smuggler
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00341CE6
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral
#. DialogueBefore = HailingShip: Wow, you really know how to guilt trip someone. Fine, if it means so much to you.
#. EDID: [01051B9C]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001808"
msgid "I was on a typical job with my pilot at the time. We worked together for, maybe, fifteen years or so? I trusted this guy with my life."
msgstr "그때 난 조종사와 평범한 일을 하고 있었어. 우리는 아마 15년쯤 함께 일했나? 내 목숨을 맡길 만큼 그를 믿었지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R01
#. SceneName = SFFL_R01_TL03
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 005C8B97
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: You said you were injured on a job before? &&& HailingShip: Yeah. It's not really a good story.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Wow, you really know how to guilt trip someone. Fine, if it means so much to you.
#. EDID: [01051B9D]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001809"
msgid "I could be killed getting this contraband for you. Just answer my questions."
msgstr "당신을 위해 이 밀수품을 구하다가 죽을 수도 있어. 질문에 답해 줘."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R01
#. SceneName = SFFL_R01_TL03
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = HailingShip
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R01_Smuggler
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 009DB81F
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral / to Player Default
#. Prompt = We don't have to talk about it.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: We don't have to talk about it.
#. DialogueAfter = HailingShip: I was on a typical job with my pilot at the time. We worked together for, maybe, fifteen years or so? I trusted this guy with my life.
#. EDID: [01051BA6]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00180A"
msgid "Works for me."
msgstr "난 좋아."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R01
#. SceneName = SFFL_R01_TL03
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = HailingShip
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00316F19
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: You said you were injured on a job before? &&& HailingShip: Yeah. It's not really a good story.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Works for me.
#. EDID: [01051BA5]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00180B"
msgid "We don't have to talk about it."
msgstr "그 얘기는 안 해도 돼."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R01
#. SceneName = SFFL_R01_TL03
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = HailingShip
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 009140EE
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: You said you were injured on a job before? &&& HailingShip: Yeah. It's not really a good story.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: No. Let's just drop it.
#. EDID: [01051B9F]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00180C"
msgid "I'd still like to hear it."
msgstr "그래도 듣고 싶어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R01
#. SceneName = SFFL_R01_TL02
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 003B5A44
#. DialogueAfter = HailingShip: I said it before, I'm a smuggler, not a fighter. If what the Trade Authority says is true, this contraband is in some pretty hostile locations.
#. EDID: [01051BA4]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00180D"
msgid "Why can't you get this contraband yourself?"
msgstr "왜 이 밀수품을 직접 구하지 못하는 거야?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R01
#. SceneName = SFFL_R01_TurnIn
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = HailingShip
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R01_Smuggler
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00DBD20F
#. EDID: [010522E3]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00180E"
msgid "I'll see you around. Maybe we'll have better luck next time."
msgstr "또 보자. 다음번엔 운이 더 좋을지도 모르지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R01
#. SceneName = SFFL_R01_TurnIn
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = HailingShip
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R01_Smuggler
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00EAFBF7
#. EDID: [010522E3]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00180F"
msgid "*Sigh* It's not like I would've fared any better. I appreciate you trying, at least, but I obviously can't give you any money."
msgstr "*한숨* 내가 했어도 딱히 더 낫진 않았을 거야. 그래도 시도해 준 건 고맙지만, 돈은 줄 수 없겠네."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R01
#. SceneName = SFFL_R01_TurnIn
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = HailingShip
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R01_Smuggler
#. Face = Spaceship / Irritated
#. SoundFileID = 0086DE8A
#. ScriptNotes = Irritated
#. DialogueBefore = HailingShip: If I have more opportunities for you in the future, I'll find you.|Oh, before I forget. I have some intel pointing to some valuables in another location. I'll mark it on your map as a little bonus.|Good luck out there.
#. EDID: [010522E3]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001810"
msgid "Damn it, really? What happened? "
msgstr "젠장, 정말이야? 무슨 일이 있었어?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMCutty
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMCutty
#. Face = Friendly
#. SoundFileID = 00991867
#. ScriptNotes = Grateful, warm / Friendly
#. EDID: [0106C84F]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001811"
msgid "For the first time in a long while, I feel hope for better days."
msgstr "오랜만에 처음으로 더 나은 날에 대한 희망이 느껴집니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMCutty
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMCutty
#. Face = Friendly
#. SoundFileID = 003A376A
#. ScriptNotes = Grateful, warm / Friendly
#. EDID: [0106C84E]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001812"
msgid "Thanks to you, my son and I are talking again."
msgstr "당신 덕분에 아들과 다시 대화하게 됐어요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMMilesCutler
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMMilesCutler
#. Face = Friendly
#. SoundFileID = 0085121E
#. ScriptNotes = Warm, friendly / Friendly
#. EDID: [0106C454]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001813"
msgid "Talking to my father again after so long has been a little awkward, but we'll figure it out."
msgstr "오랜만에 아버지와 다시 이야기하는 게 조금 어색하긴 하지만, 어떻게든 해낼 거야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCFValeriaHahn
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFValeriaHahn
#. Face = Friendly
#. SoundFileID = 009789EC
#. EDID: [01059E37]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001814"
msgid "If I never see another Spacer in here again, that'll be just fine with me."
msgstr "여기서 다시는 스페이서를 보지 않았으면 좋겠어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCFValeriaHahn
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFValeriaHahn
#. Face = Friendly
#. SoundFileID = 00934575
#. EDID: [0106574A]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001815"
msgid "Oh good, you're here. Maddie asked me to send you her way. "
msgstr "아, 잘 왔네. 매디가 당신을 자기한테 보내 달라고 했어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMRishiSaint
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRishiSaint
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 00C11494
#. ScriptNotes = Polite but greedy
#. EDID: [0102672A]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001816"
msgid "Your credits are more than welcome here."
msgstr "당신 크레딧은 언제든 환영입니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCFMaddieWing
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFMaddieWing
#. Face = SinisterSmile
#. SoundFileID = 00FC7529
#. ScriptNotes = Impressed, and a little bloodthirsty at the end / SinisterSmile
#. EDID: [01059E35]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001817"
msgid "Heard you gave those Spacers some hell. I bet that was fun."
msgstr "스페이서들에게 한바탕 본때를 보여 줬다며? 꽤 재미있었겠네."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCFMaddieWing
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFMaddieWing
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00063D2C
#. ScriptNotes = Exasperated, shaking your head
#. EDID: [01026726]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001818"
msgid "I sure ain't bored. Got no time to be."
msgstr "난 전혀 지루하지 않아. 그럴 시간이 없거든."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMCutty
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMCutty
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 007C6B5C
#. ScriptNotes = Grumpy
#. EDID: [01026713]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001819"
msgid "The reek of this place permeates everything."
msgstr "이곳의 악취는 모든 것에 배어 있어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMChanHuang
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMChanHuang
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 00566AA3
#. ScriptNotes = Firm
#. EDID: [01026710]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00181A"
msgid "Don't get nosy about the patrons. We don't like that around here."
msgstr "고객들 일에 간섭하지 마. 우리는 그런 거 싫어해."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMChanHuang
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMChanHuang
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 0026407A
#. ScriptNotes = Firm authority
#. EDID: [0102670D]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00181B"
msgid "Unless you want to spend the night in a cell, I suggest you play by the rules."
msgstr "감옥에서 밤을 보내고 싶지 않으면 규칙대로 행동하는 게 좋을 거야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMChanHuang
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMChanHuang
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 00910AA4
#. EDID: [0105F4D6]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00181C"
msgid "You should check in with Maddie. She wants to talk to you."
msgstr "매디에게 들러 봐. 당신과 얘기하고 싶어 하더군."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMGenericMale / NPCFGenericFemale
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMGenericMale02 / SFFL_NPCMGenericMale01 / SFFL_NPCFGenericFemale01 / SFFL_NPCFGenericFemale02
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00B0AA9B
#. ScriptNotes = Dismissive
#. EDID: [0104EDB4]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00181D"
msgid "Sorry, got a lot on my mind right now."
msgstr "미안, 지금 고민거리가 많아서 얘기 못해."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMGenericMale / NPCFGenericFemale
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMGenericMale02 / SFFL_NPCMGenericMale01 / SFFL_NPCFGenericFemale01 / SFFL_NPCFGenericFemale02
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00FB427F
#. EDID: [01059E34]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00181E"
msgid "From what I hear, those Spacers got what was coming to them."
msgstr "듣자 하니 그 스페이서들이 당할 일을 당했다더군."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMGenericMale / NPCFGenericFemale
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMGenericMale02 / SFFL_NPCMGenericMale01 / SFFL_NPCFGenericFemale01 / SFFL_NPCFGenericFemale02
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 009BC73C
#. ScriptNotes = Dismissive
#. EDID: [01026709]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00181F"
msgid "Keep walking."
msgstr "계속 걸어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCFGenericFemale / NPCMGenericMale
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFGenericFemale03 / SFFL_NPCFGenericFemale04 / SFFL_NPCMGenericMale03
#. Face = Impressed
#. SoundFileID = 00CF266D
#. ScriptNotes = Admiration / Impressed
#. EDID: [01059E33]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001820"
msgid "You the one who took on the Spacers? Nice job."
msgstr "네가 스페이서들과 맞붙은 사람이야? 잘했어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCFGenericFemale / NPCMGenericMale
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFGenericFemale03 / SFFL_NPCFGenericFemale04 / SFFL_NPCMGenericMale03
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00B59BF0
#. ScriptNotes = Firm, a guard
#. EDID: [0104EDB1]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001821"
msgid "Might want to keep your distance. Some of us have itchy trigger fingers. "
msgstr "좀 떨어지시는 게 좋을 겁니다. 여기 경비대원 중엔 총질에 환장한 녀석들도 있지 말입니다. "

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCFGenericFemale / NPCMGenericMale
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFGenericFemale03 / SFFL_NPCFGenericFemale04 / SFFL_NPCMGenericMale03
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00DDB81F
#. ScriptNotes = Firm, a guard
#. EDID: [01026704]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001822"
msgid "If there's trouble, let us handle it."
msgstr "문제가 생기면 우리한테 맡기십쇼."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCFGenericFemale / NPCMGenericMale
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFGenericFemale03 / SFFL_NPCFGenericFemale04 / SFFL_NPCMGenericMale03
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 004C1181
#. ScriptNotes = Firm, a guard
#. EDID: [01026703]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001823"
msgid "Can't chat right now. I'm on duty."
msgstr "지금은 잡담하면 안 됩니다. 근무 중입니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCFGenericFemale / NPCMGenericMale
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFGenericFemale03 / SFFL_NPCFGenericFemale04 / SFFL_NPCMGenericMale03
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00CC7007
#. ScriptNotes = Stern authority.
#. EDID: [01026700]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001824"
msgid "Behave yourself and we won't have a problem."
msgstr "얌전히 굴면 문제없을 거야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCFValeriaHahn
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFValeriaHahn
#. Face = Friendly
#. SoundFileID = 0010ED70
#. ScriptNotes = Friendly. The player has suddenly stopped talking mid-conversation. Are they okay?
#. EDID: [0104EDDA]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001825"
msgid "Doing okay?"
msgstr "괜찮아?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCFValeriaHahn
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFValeriaHahn
#. Face = Friendly
#. SoundFileID = 00D87678
#. ScriptNotes = Friendly. The player has suddenly stopped talking mid-conversation. Are they okay?
#. EDID: [0104EDD9]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001826"
msgid "You seem a little distracted there."
msgstr "좀 딴생각하는 것 같은데."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMKillianBrice
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMKillianBrice
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0078C4D4
#. ScriptNotes = The player has suddenly stopped talking mid-conversation. Are they okay?
#. EDID: [0104EDCF]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001827"
msgid "I'm in no hurry."
msgstr "난 서두를 거 없어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCFDarcyWeber
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFDarcyWeber
#. Face = Nervous
#. SoundFileID = 00607854
#. ScriptNotes = The player has suddenly stopped talking mid-conversation. Are they okay?
#. EDID: [0104EDC9]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001828"
msgid "Need a little quiet time?"
msgstr "조용히 있고 싶어?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCFDanicaVolkov
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFDanicaVolkov
#. Face = Friendly
#. SoundFileID = 00E2239E
#. ScriptNotes = The player has suddenly stopped talking mid-conversation. Are they okay?
#. EDID: [0104EDC6]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001829"
msgid "Is it just me, or did a whole lot of awkward silence just come walking down the hall?"
msgstr "나만 느꼈나? 방금 복도에서 엄청나게 어색한 침묵이 걸어 들어온 것 같은데?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMCutty
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMCutty
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0075E0B7
#. ScriptNotes = The player has suddenly stopped talking mid-conversation. Are they okay?
#. EDID: [0104EDC3]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00182A"
msgid "I'll wait."
msgstr "기다릴게."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMCutty
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMCutty
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00D8BC24
#. ScriptNotes = Grumpy, impatient. The player has suddenly stopped talking mid-conversation. Are they okay?
#. EDID: [0104EDBE]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00182B"
msgid "Stop wasting my time and get on with it."
msgstr "내 시간 그만 낭비하고 본론으로 들어가."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCFValeriaHahn
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFValeriaHahn
#. Face = Friendly
#. SoundFileID = 00B21684
#. ScriptNotes = Friendly. Saying goodbye to the player, who has just departed mid- conversation.
#. EDID: [0104EDFE]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00182C"
msgid "Until next time!"
msgstr "다음에 봐!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMRishiSaint
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRishiSaint
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 00959085
#. ScriptNotes = Saying goodbye to the player, who has just departed mid-conversation.
#. EDID: [0104EDFA]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00182D"
msgid "Somewhere else you need to be?"
msgstr "어디 가실 곳이 있습니까?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCFMaddieWing
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFMaddieWing
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 000FC95B
#. ScriptNotes = A little sassy. Saying goodbye to the player, who has just departed mid-conversation.
#. EDID: [0104EDF5]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00182E"
msgid "Yeah, I was done talking to you anyway."
msgstr "그래, 어차피 나도 너랑 할 얘기 더 없어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCFDarcyWeber
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFDarcyWeber
#. Face = Nervous
#. SoundFileID = 00070421
#. ScriptNotes = Saying goodbye to the player, who has just departed mid-conversation.
#. EDID: [0104EDEF]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00182F"
msgid "All done? Well, you know where I'll be."
msgstr "다 끝났어? 뭐, 다음에 어떻게 찾아와야 하는지는 알지?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCFDanicaVolkov
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFDanicaVolkov
#. Face = Friendly
#. SoundFileID = 00A499A7
#. ScriptNotes = Friendly. Saying goodbye to the player, who has just departed mid-conversation.
#. EDID: [0104EDE9]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001830"
msgid "See you!"
msgstr "또 봐!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMCutty
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMCutty
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00159C73
#. ScriptNotes = Friendly. Saying goodbye to the player, who has just departed mid-conversation.
#. EDID: [0104EDE5]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001831"
msgid "Take care."
msgstr "몸조심해."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMCutty
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMCutty
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00895738
#. ScriptNotes = Grumpy. Saying goodbye to the player, who has just departed mid-conversation.
#. EDID: [0104EDE3]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001832"
msgid "Whatever. Just go."
msgstr "됐어. 그냥 가."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_IntroScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = RishiSaint
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRishiSaint
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 0075F2DF
#. ScriptNotes = Firm / to ChanHuang
#. EDID: [010266FE]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001833"
msgid "No, we stand our ground."
msgstr "아니요, 우린 물러서지 않습니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_IntroScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = RishiSaint
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRishiSaint
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 0043459B
#. ScriptNotes = Defiant, stubborn / to ChanHuang
#. EDID: [010266FE]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001834"
msgid "Hell no! I've worked too hard to make this place what it is."
msgstr "절대 안 됩니다! 이곳을 지금처럼 만들려고 얼마나 애썼는 줄 아십니까."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_IntroScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = RishiSaint
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRishiSaint
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 00654AF1
#. ScriptNotes = Defiant, stubborn / to ChanHuang
#. DialogueBefore = RishiSaint: Maybe we offer the job to one of the patrons, then.|In the meantime, make sure your team is ready.|The Spacers will likely be coming in force. &&& ChanHuang: I still think we should consider evacuating.
#. EDID: [010266FE]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001835"
msgid "And give up Anchorpoint?"
msgstr "앵커포인트를 포기하란 말입니까?"

#. List: 2
#. EDID: [0102A51E]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001836"
msgid "That, plus a high degree of discipline when it comes to expenses, keeps us afloat."
msgstr "그 점에 더해 지출을 철저히 관리하는 덕분에 우리가 버티는 겁니다."

#. List: 2
#. EDID: [0102A51E]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001837"
msgid "For many, being off the beaten path is a large part of appeal."
msgstr "많은 사람들에게는 외진 곳에 있다는 점이 매력의 큰 부분입니다."

#. List: 2
#. EDID: [0102A51E]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001838"
msgid "Instead, we rely on word-of-mouth from a loyal base of frequent patrons."
msgstr "대신 단골 고객층의 입소문에 의존합니다."

#. List: 2
#. EDID: [0102A51E]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001839"
msgid "I prefer not to advertise, due both to the cost and the unwanted attention it would risk."
msgstr "광고는 하지 않는 편입니다. 비용도 비용이지만, 원치 않는 관심을 끌 위험도 있으니까요."

#. List: 2
#. EDID: [0102A51E]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00183A"
msgid "I won't deny that it's been a challenge."
msgstr "어려운 도전 과제였다는 건 부인하지 않겠습니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_RishiTL03_Background
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 004B72F9
#. ScriptNotes = / to RishiSaint
#. DialogueAfter = RishiSaint: There's not really much to tell.
#. EDID: [0102A53C]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00183B"
msgid "What's your background?"
msgstr "당신 배경은 어떻게 되죠?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_RishiGreet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = RishiSaint
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRishiSaint
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 00C4A682
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = I know a smuggler's den when I see one, but don't worry, I won't blow your cover.
#. DialogueAfter = RishiSaint: I won't cause any trouble.
#. EDID: [0102A525]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00183C"
msgid "I suggest you avoid making assumptions and simply stick to the rules."
msgstr "섣불리 추측하지 마시고 그냥 규칙을 지키시길 권하겠습니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_RishiGreet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = RishiSaint
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRishiSaint
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 00C4C753
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = I know a smuggler's den when I see one, but don't worry, I won't blow your cover.
#. EDID: [0102A525]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00183D"
msgid "But a smuggler's den? No, not at all. "
msgstr "그런데 밀수업자의 소굴이라니요? 아니요, 전혀 아닙니다. "

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_RishiGreet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = RishiSaint
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRishiSaint
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 00DD55EE
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = I know a smuggler's den when I see one, but don't worry, I won't blow your cover.
#. EDID: [0102A525]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00183E"
msgid "Is it possible that some of it would not be considered entirely legal? Perhaps"
msgstr "거래 중 일부가 완전히 합법적이라고 여겨지지 않을 가능성도 있지 않냐고요? 아마도요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_RishiGreet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = RishiSaint
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRishiSaint
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 00645023
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = I know a smuggler's den when I see one, but don't worry, I won't blow your cover.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I know a smuggler's den when I see one, but don't worry, I won't blow your cover.
#. EDID: [0102A525]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00183F"
msgid "What kinds of dealings our patrons conduct here is not my business."
msgstr "우리 고객들이 여기서 어떤 거래를 하든 그건 제 알 바 아닙니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_RishiGreet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = RishiSaint
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRishiSaint
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 004F7DEB
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = I guess that's reasonable.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I guess that's reasonable.
#. DialogueAfter = RishiSaint: Unless you have any questions, I'll leave you to it.
#. EDID: [0102A528]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001840"
msgid "I'm hardly asking for much. Just civil behavior."
msgstr "저는 많은 걸 요구하려는 게 아닙니다. 그저 예의있게 행동하시면 됩니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_RishiGreet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = RishiSaint
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRishiSaint
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 001F19B4
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueAfter = companion: Why do I find that vaguely suspicious?
#. EDID: [0102A534]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001841"
msgid "Our patrons expect to conduct whatever business they wish free from prying eyes and ears."
msgstr "우리 고객들은 엿보는 눈과 엿듣는 귀에서 벗어나 원하는 업무를 처리하시길 원하시죠."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_RishiGreet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = RishiSaint
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRishiSaint
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 003B7872
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. EDID: [0102A534]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001842"
msgid "We also value privacy and discretion here."
msgstr "또한 이곳에서는 사생활과 재량권을 중시합니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_RishiGreet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = RishiSaint
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRishiSaint
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 00D4F984
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. EDID: [0102A534]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001843"
msgid "Acts of theft or violence will be met with a swift response."
msgstr "절도나 폭력 행위에는 신속히 대응할 겁니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_RishiGreet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = RishiSaint
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRishiSaint
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 002A9511
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. EDID: [0102A534]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001844"
msgid "We're happy to welcome all who pass through the airlock, but our hospitality has limits."
msgstr "에어락을 지나 들어오는 모든 분들을 진심으로 환영하지만, 저희의 환대에도 한계가 있습니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_RishiGreet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = RishiSaint
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRishiSaint
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 00297D11
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = RishiSaint: Really? |I believe in fair pay for a job well done.|Deal with these Spacers, and I'll provide the credits.|My head of security can point you in the right direction.
#. EDID: [0102A534]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001845"
msgid "A few words of advice."
msgstr "조언 몇 마디 드리죠."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_RishiGreet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = RishiSaint
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRishiSaint
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 0048660F
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = I heard you talking. Got some kind of trouble with Spacers?
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: I wouldn't worry, Spacers aren't that much of a threat.
#. EDID: [0102A53B]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001846"
msgid "Now it seems they're coming back to teach us a lesson."
msgstr "이제 스페이서들이 우리에게 교훈을 주겠다며 쳐들어 오려는 모양입니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_RishiGreet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = RishiSaint
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRishiSaint
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 002E5C56
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = I heard you talking. Got some kind of trouble with Spacers?
#. EDID: [0102A53B]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001847"
msgid "His friends didn't take kindly to it, and stormed out."
msgstr "그 스페이서의 친구들은 그 일을 좋게 받아들이지 않았고, 화를 내면서 나가 버렸습니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_RishiGreet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = RishiSaint
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRishiSaint
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 0038B3EB
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = I heard you talking. Got some kind of trouble with Spacers?
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I heard you talking. Got some kind of trouble with Spacers?
#. EDID: [0102A53B]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001848"
msgid "One of the guests, a Spacer, was causing trouble. We locked him up so he could sleep off his drink."
msgstr "손님이었던 스페이서 한 녀석이 소란을 피웠습니다. 술이 깰 때까지 그 스페이서를 가둬 뒀었죠."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_MaddieTL01_Tiger
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = MaddieWing
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFMaddieWing
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00FF9FE6
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. EDID: [0102C010]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001849"
msgid "Yeah, he's a work in progress. Probably always will be, but ain't we all?"
msgstr "뭐, 타이거는 아직 손볼 데가 많아. 아마 계속 그럴 거야. 하지만 우리도 다 그렇잖아?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_MaddieTL01_Tiger
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = MaddieWing
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFMaddieWing
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00870964
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. EDID: [0102C010]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00184A"
msgid "I'm working on rigging up a harness so he can carry tools and such. Be my little helper."
msgstr "타이거가 도구 같은 걸 나를 수 있게 하네스를 달아 주려고 작업 중이야. 귀여운 조수로 삼을 거야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_MaddieTL01_Tiger
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = MaddieWing
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFMaddieWing
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0046D56E
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. EDID: [0102C010]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00184B"
msgid "He keeps me company. And he keeps the unwanted attention away, if you catch my drift."
msgstr "타이거 덕분에 적적하진 않거든. 그리고 쓸데없이 접근하는 놈들도 쫓아내 줘. 무슨 말인지 알지?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_MaddieTL01_Tiger
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = MaddieWing
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFMaddieWing
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00B61FC4
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. EDID: [0102C010]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00184C"
msgid "*Laugh* Okay, okay, bad joke."
msgstr "*웃음* 알았어, 알았어. 농담이 별로였네."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_MaddieTL01_Tiger
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = MaddieWing
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFMaddieWing
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00D23D09
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: This robot is yours?
#. EDID: [0102C010]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00184D"
msgid "Yep, my creation. My pet project, you could say."
msgstr "그래, 내 창조물이야. 말하자면 내 애완 로봇 프로젝트지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_MaddieTL03_Parts
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00AE3AC0
#. ScriptNotes = / to MaddieWing
#. DialogueAfter = MaddieWing: It ain't like I've got a steady stream of top-quality parts coming in.
#. EDID: [0102C014]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00184E"
msgid "How do you keep stocked up on parts and supplies out here?"
msgstr "이런 곳에서 부품과 보급품은 어떻게 계속 확보하는 거야?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_MaddieGreet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = MaddieWing
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFMaddieWing
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00E1371C
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Maybe I should go back to my ship, where it's safe.
#. DialogueAfter = MaddieWing: Anyway, the workshop's my quarters, but you can use the equipment if you want.
#. EDID: [0102C015]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00184F"
msgid "Some of us just ain't the \"settle down in peace and quiet\" type."
msgstr "우리 중엔 그냥 \"평화롭게 조용히 정착하는\" 타입이 아닌 사람도 있거든."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_MaddieGreet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = MaddieWing
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFMaddieWing
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00425B1D
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Maybe I should go back to my ship, where it's safe.
#. EDID: [0102C015]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001850"
msgid "I get it. Life out on the edge ain't for everyone."
msgstr "이해해. 변방의 삶이 모두에게 맞는 건 아니지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_MaddieGreet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = MaddieWing
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFMaddieWing
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00263205
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Maybe I should go back to my ship, where it's safe.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Maybe I should go back to my ship, where it's safe.
#. EDID: [0102C015]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001851"
msgid "And miss all the excitement?"
msgstr "재미있는 걸 그냥 넘기고 가려고?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_MaddieGreet
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00E32AB9
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I'll be careful. &&& MaddieWing: You better.|Got enough on my hands without having to clean up after fools who start poking and prodding things.|Had a trader in here last week who leaned on a pipe when the sealant was still drying.|Knocked the damn thing loose and sprayed hot water all over himself. &&& MaddieWing: Name's Maddie. I keep the place running.|Always had a knack for machines. Good thing, too.|If it wasn't for me, everyone would have been sucked out into space cause we lost a wall.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Hell yeah they are.
#. EDID: [0102C028]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001852"
msgid "They're lucky to have you."
msgstr "여기 사람들한텐 당신이 있는 게 운이 좋은 거네."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_MaddieGreet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = MaddieWing
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFMaddieWing
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00D4222B
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: They're lucky to have you.
#. EDID: [0102C01F]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001853"
msgid "If it wasn't for me, everyone would have been sucked out into space cause we lost a wall."
msgstr "내가 아니었으면 벽 한쪽이 날아가서 모두 우주 밖으로 빨려 나갔을 거야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_MaddieGreet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = MaddieWing
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFMaddieWing
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0080562D
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. EDID: [0102C01F]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001854"
msgid "Always had a knack for machines. Good thing, too."
msgstr "기계를 다루는 데 소질이 있거든. 불행 중 다행이지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_MaddieGreet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = MaddieWing
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFMaddieWing
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00E6BCFC
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = MaddieWing: You better.|Got enough on my hands without having to clean up after fools who start poking and prodding things.|Had a trader in here last week who leaned on a pipe when the sealant was still drying.|Knocked the damn thing loose and sprayed hot water all over himself.
#. EDID: [0102C01F]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001855"
msgid "Name's Maddie. I keep the place running."
msgstr "내 이름은 매디야. 내가 이곳을 굴러가게 만들지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_MaddieGreet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCFMaddieWing
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFMaddieWing
#. Face = Irritated
#. SoundFileID = 009D22A2
#. ScriptNotes = Irritated / to Player Default
#. Prompt = I'll be careful.
#. DialogueAfter = MaddieWing: Name's Maddie. I keep the place running.
#. EDID: [0102C026]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001856"
msgid "Knocked the damn thing loose and sprayed hot water all over himself."
msgstr "빌어먹을 게 툭 떨어져 나가더니 그 상인 온몸에 뜨거운 물이 튀었어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_MaddieGreet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCFMaddieWing
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFMaddieWing
#. Face = Irritated
#. SoundFileID = 005D8B9C
#. ScriptNotes = Irritated / to Player Default
#. Prompt = I'll be careful.
#. EDID: [0102C026]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001857"
msgid "Had a trader in here last week who leaned on a pipe when the sealant was still drying."
msgstr "지난주에 여기 왔던 상인은 아직 밀봉제가 마르는 중인 배관에 기댔었지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_MaddieGreet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCFMaddieWing
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFMaddieWing
#. Face = Irritated
#. SoundFileID = 009F4821
#. ScriptNotes = Irritated / to Player Default
#. Prompt = I'll be careful.
#. EDID: [0102C026]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001858"
msgid "Got enough on my hands without having to clean up after fools who start poking and prodding things."
msgstr "쓸데없이 이것저것 찔러대는 멍청이들 뒤치다꺼리까지 하기엔 이미 충분히 할 일이 많아."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_MaddieGreet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCFMaddieWing
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFMaddieWing
#. Face = Irritated
#. SoundFileID = 0053E2B7
#. ScriptNotes = Irritated / to Player Default
#. Prompt = I'll be careful.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I'll be careful.
#. EDID: [0102C026]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001859"
msgid "You better."
msgstr "그러는 게 좋을 거야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_MaddieGreet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = MaddieWing
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFMaddieWing
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00F637C4
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: I'll be careful.
#. EDID: [0102C021]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00185A"
msgid "Place is barely holding together as it is."
msgstr "이곳은 지금도 간신히 버티고 있거든."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_MaddieGreet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = MaddieWing
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFMaddieWing
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00752CF8
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. EDID: [0102C021]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00185B"
msgid "You new around here? Well don't break anything."
msgstr "여긴 처음 왔어? 그럼 아무것도 망가뜨리지 마."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_RishiTL04_Services
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = RishiSaint
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRishiSaint
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 00611025
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. EDID: [0102C022]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00185C"
msgid "If you need medical attention, Cutty is our resident physician."
msgstr "의료 처치가 필요하시면 커티가 이곳 상주 의사이니 찾아가시면 됩니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_RishiTL04_Services
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = RishiSaint
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRishiSaint
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 0041ED6D
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. EDID: [0102C022]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00185D"
msgid "We have two vendors, Killian and Darcy, who stock some useful items."
msgstr "여기에 상인은 킬리언과 다시가 있는데, 둘 다 쓸 만한 물건을 마련해 두고 있습니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_RishiTL04_Services
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = RishiSaint
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRishiSaint
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 00C48BE5
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. EDID: [0102C022]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00185E"
msgid "Valeria runs the bar, which has a modest selection."
msgstr "발레리아가 술집을 운영합니다. 파는 술은 몇 종류 안 되지만요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_RishiTL04_Services
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = RishiSaint
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRishiSaint
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 0072C5A6
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: What services are offered here?
#. EDID: [0102C022]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00185F"
msgid "Just the basics, really. We're a small operation."
msgstr "정말 기본적인 것만 제공하고 있습니다. 저희는 소규모로 운영하니까요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_ValeriaTL03_Background
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = ValeriaHahn
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 004F0E99
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: What brought you all the way out here? &&& ValeriaHahn: I have a son, Gabriel. He became very ill and I just couldn't afford the treatment.|I'd met Mister Saint while I was tending bar at the Astral Lounge.|He tried to hire me for this place, but I said no. It was just so remote.|When he learned about my son's illness, he said he'd pay the bills on the condition I work here.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: It's some kind of alien pathogen. It was attacking his nervous system.
#. EDID: [01031421]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001860"
msgid "What kind of illness does Gabriel suffer from?"
msgstr "가브리엘은 어떤 병을 앓고 있지?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_ValeriaTL03_Background
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = ValeriaHahn
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFValeriaHahn
#. Face = Friendly
#. SoundFileID = 00BAE763
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = How long will you have to work here to pay off the debt?
#. DialogueAfter = ValeriaHahn: That's very generous.
#. EDID: [01031432]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001861"
msgid "*Sigh* I don't love missing a huge chunk of my son's childhood, but at least he'll have one."
msgstr ""
"*한숨* 아이가 자라는 소중한 순간들을 곁에서 보지 못하는 건 정말 싫지만, 적어도 여기서 버틴 덕분에, 아이가 안전하게 살아갈 미래가 "
"생긴 거니까."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_ValeriaTL03_Background
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = ValeriaHahn
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFValeriaHahn
#. Face = Friendly
#. SoundFileID = 00EF3C35
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = How long will you have to work here to pay off the debt?
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: How long will you have to work here to pay off the debt?
#. EDID: [01031432]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001862"
msgid "A couple of years still."
msgstr "아직 몇 년은 남았어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_ValeriaTL01_Vend
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = ValeriaHahn
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFValeriaHahn
#. Face = Friendly
#. SoundFileID = 0074D412
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Let's see what you've got.
#. EDID: [01031435]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001863"
msgid "Sure thing."
msgstr "물론이지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_DarcyGreet
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = DarcyWeber
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0058360F
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Yep, happy to have made it here safely. &&& DarcyWeber: You should be! Every time you press that launch button it's a roll of the dice. &&& DarcyWeber: Think about it. There's pirates and Spacers out there who'd love nothing more than to blast you into atoms.|Not to mention micrometeorite storms, cosmic rays, and the icy vacuum of space itself.|You think your ship will protect you, but one loose bolt in your hull, one faulty circuit in life support...|That's all it takes.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: When you do a dangerous thing over and over and keep getting away with it, you get complacent.
#. EDID: [0103142F]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001864"
msgid "You are vastly overstating the dangers. "
msgstr "지나치게 위험을 부풀린 거 같은데. "

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_DarcyGreet
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00584AE4
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Yep, happy to have made it here safely. &&& DarcyWeber: You should be! Every time you press that launch button it's a roll of the dice. &&& DarcyWeber: Think about it. There's pirates and Spacers out there who'd love nothing more than to blast you into atoms.|Not to mention micrometeorite storms, cosmic rays, and the icy vacuum of space itself.|You think your ship will protect you, but one loose bolt in your hull, one faulty circuit in life support...|That's all it takes.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: People do a lot of crazy things. That doesn't make them safe.
#. EDID: [01031422]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001865"
msgid "Space travel is very safe. People do it all the time."
msgstr "우주 여행은 매우 안전해. 다른 사람들도 계속 여행 다니잖아."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_DarcyGreet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCFDarcyWeber
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFDarcyWeber
#. Face = Nervous
#. SoundFileID = 006A804B
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Space travel is very safe. People do it all the time.
#. DialogueAfter = DarcyWeber: In any case, you made the perilous journey to our little speck of light in the abyss.
#. EDID: [01031429]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001866"
msgid "Safety was not foremost on anyone's mind."
msgstr "그 누구도 안전을 최우선으로 생각하지 않더라."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_DarcyGreet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCFDarcyWeber
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFDarcyWeber
#. Face = Nervous
#. SoundFileID = 00BE2A08
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Space travel is very safe. People do it all the time.
#. EDID: [01031429]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001867"
msgid "I should know, I grew up on Neon and fell in with a gang."
msgstr "미친 짓은 내가 또 잘 알지. 네온에서 자랐고 갱단과 어울리기도 했으니까."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_DarcyGreet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCFDarcyWeber
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFDarcyWeber
#. Face = Nervous
#. SoundFileID = 0083CDF5
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Space travel is very safe. People do it all the time.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Space travel is very safe. People do it all the time.
#. EDID: [01031429]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001868"
msgid "People do a lot of crazy things. That doesn't make them safe."
msgstr "인간들이야 별의별 미친 짓을 다 저지르잖아. 그런 짓을 저지른다고 안전해지는 것도 아니고."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_DarcyGreet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = DarcyWeber
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFDarcyWeber
#. Face = Nervous
#. SoundFileID = 00685F2B
#. ScriptNotes = Nervous / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Why are you surprised I'm safe? Is this area dangerous?
#. DialogueAfter = DarcyWeber: Yep, happy to have made it here safely.
#. EDID: [01031418]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001869"
msgid "Space travel is incredibly dangerous. Anyone who arrives safely is lucky."
msgstr "우주 여행은 대단히 위험해. 무사히 도착한 사람은 그냥 운이 좋은 거야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_DarcyGreet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = DarcyWeber
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFDarcyWeber
#. Face = Nervous
#. SoundFileID = 00C1CB7C
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Why are you surprised I'm safe? Is this area dangerous?
#. EDID: [01031418]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00186A"
msgid "But that's not what I mean."
msgstr "근데 내가 말하는 위험은 그런 게 아니야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_DarcyGreet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = DarcyWeber
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFDarcyWeber
#. Face = Nervous
#. SoundFileID = 007F7AAB
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Why are you surprised I'm safe? Is this area dangerous?
#. EDID: [01031418]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00186B"
msgid "It's pretty remote out here. There's no United Colonies or Freestar Collective patrol ships."
msgstr "이곳은 꽤 외진 곳이야. 식민지 연합이나 자유항성 공동체 순찰선도 없긴 해."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_DarcyGreet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = DarcyWeber
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFDarcyWeber
#. Face = Nervous
#. SoundFileID = 000892D1
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Why are you surprised I'm safe? Is this area dangerous?
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Why are you surprised I'm safe? Is this area dangerous?
#. EDID: [01031418]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00186C"
msgid "This area? Well, if you mean the Algorab system then maybe. "
msgstr "이 구역? 알고라브 항성계를 말하는 거라면, 글쎄. "

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_DarcyGreet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = DarcyWeber
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFDarcyWeber
#. Face = Nervous
#. SoundFileID = 00A2A653
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Space travel has risks, but it's nothing I can't handle.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Space travel has risks, but it's nothing I can't handle.
#. DialogueAfter = DarcyWeber: Think about it. There's pirates and Spacers out there who'd love nothing more than to blast you into atoms.
#. EDID: [01031438]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00186D"
msgid "Well maybe you just haven't stopped to consider the hazards of space."
msgstr "글쎄, 그냥 위험한 우주 환경에 대해 생각해 본 적도 없는 거 아닌가."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_DarcyGreet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = DarcyWeber
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFDarcyWeber
#. Face = Nervous
#. SoundFileID = 00910651
#. ScriptNotes = Nervous / Nervous / to Player Default
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Yep, happy to have made it here safely.
#. EDID: [01031430]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00186E"
msgid "You must be relieved to have made it here safe and sound."
msgstr "여기까지 용케 살아서 도착했네. 한시름 놓았겠네."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_DarcyGreet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = DarcyWeber
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFDarcyWeber
#. Face = Nervous
#. SoundFileID = 0018B82F
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. EDID: [01031430]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00186F"
msgid "The ship that just docked, that was you, right?"
msgstr "방금 도킹한 우주선, 당신이 몰고 온 거지?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_DarcyTL02Fear
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0072AABF
#. ScriptNotes = / to DarcyWeber
#. DialogueAfter = DarcyWeber: Do you ever lay on your back and look up at the stars? I used to do that to test myself.
#. EDID: [01031442]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001870"
msgid "How do you cope with a constant fear of space while living on a star station?"
msgstr "계속 우주 공포증에 시달리는 주제에, 도대체 우주정거장 생활은 어떻게 견디는 거지?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_KillianTL01Vend
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = KillianBrice
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMKillianBrice
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00093C2E
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I'd like to see your inventory.
#. EDID: [010316FE]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001871"
msgid "I'm sure you'll find something useful."
msgstr "분명 쓸 만한 걸 찾을 수 있을 거야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_DarcyTL01Vend
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
