msgid "It's all right. "
msgstr "꽤 괜찮죠. "

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. SceneName = CREW_EliteCrew_Muria_TimeLocked
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00449481
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = I don't know. Places like that are haunted.
#. DialogueAfter = Muria: Although... I did leave an open pack of Chunks somewhere in the cockpit. Maybe it's sentient now.
#. EDID: [01083B7C]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001A20"
msgid "There's not really a reason to go back."
msgstr "돌아가 봤자 별거 없어요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. SceneName = CREW_EliteCrew_Muria_TimeLocked
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 008D1DFA
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral / to Player Default
#. Prompt = I don't know. Places like that are haunted.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I don't know. Places like that are haunted.
#. EDID: [01083B7C]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001A21"
msgid "If it were, I wouldn't be standing here with you. I'd be communing with ghosts."
msgstr "진짜 그랬다면, 당신 앞에 서있을 수도 없었을걸요. 유령들이랑 대화나 나누고 있었겠죠."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. SceneName = CREW_EliteCrew_Muria_TopLevel_Jobs
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Muria
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00DD3090
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Can you tell me about any past work experiences? &&& Muria: I used to sell potions and amulets online. Had a tiny little garden where I grew the ingredients.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: That would mean using Star Parcel, but they have to grav jump everything, and that gets expensive. Too expensive unless you're shipping in bulk.
#. EDID: [01083BAA]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001A22"
msgid "Did you ever ship to places outside Jemison?"
msgstr "제미슨 밖으로도 물건을 배송해 본 적 있어?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. SceneName = CREW_EliteCrew_Muria_TopLevel_Jobs
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Muria
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0054B6E8
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Can you tell me about any past work experiences? &&& Muria: I used to sell potions and amulets online. Had a tiny little garden where I grew the ingredients.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: It's all right.
#. EDID: [01083C36]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001A23"
msgid "That sounds like a relaxing hobby."
msgstr "거 참 마음 편해지는 취미네."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. SceneName = CREW_EliteCrew_Muria_TopLevel_Jobs
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Muria
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 009B7B8F
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Any good stories? &&& Muria: There was the time somebody brought in a slate to trade-in. It was Moby Dick, only he had re-recorded the narration and changed all the names.|It was mostly the same story, except the Captain was a hermit crab and the whale was a beer can.|He wanted two thousand credits for it. I offered him four. I got reprimanded for that. Jokes on them, I would've gone as high as six.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Pretty much. My parents had told me it wasn't, but keep in mind, these are the same people who lied about the tooth collector, and the reverse burglar in the red suit.
#. EDID: [01083C47]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001A24"
msgid "Is that where you learned necromancy isn't real?"
msgstr "거기서 강령술이 실제로는 없다는 걸 알게 된 거야?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. SceneName = CREW_EliteCrew_Muria_Recruit
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Impressed
#. SoundFileID = 004984C1
#. ScriptNotes = Impressed / to Player Default
#. DialogueAfter = Muria: I've got a job on my crew if you want it.
#. EDID: [01083E3F]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001A25"
msgid "If so, good job. I could learn a thing or two from you."
msgstr "그게 목적이었다면, 잘하셨네요. 한 수 배워야겠는데요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. SceneName = CREW_EliteCrew_Muria_Recruit
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Muria
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00E10583
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Yeah, if only. &&& Muria: If only. &&& Muria: Well, now I need find work somewhere else. My landlord keeps asking for this thing called "rent."|I told him I could pay him with a potion that would turn him into a newt, but he refused.|Don't know why, seems like it'd be an improvement. But what do I know. Certainly not enough to be a banker.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Same.
#. EDID: [01083B5E]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001A26"
msgid "Sorry to hear you're unemployed."
msgstr "구직에 실패했다니 안타깝네."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. SceneName = CREW_EliteCrew_Muria_Recruit
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Muria
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00330C0E
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: How did your interview with Galbank go? &&& Muria: Not great. They said I lacked "pep."|I looked up the word. It sounds like an illness. I pray it's fatal.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Not if you're boring. Or a robot. Same thing, I guess.
#. EDID: [01083BB8]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001A27"
msgid "Sorry to hear that. It's hard to find work in this economy."
msgstr "안됐네. 요즘 불경기라 일자리 구하기가 쉽지 않지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. SceneName = CREW_EliteCrew_Muria_Recruit
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00D2EF5B
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Sorry to hear you're unemployed.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Sorry to hear you're unemployed.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: No cool robes. Just the clothes on your back.
#. EDID: [01083CE3]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001A28"
msgid "Same."
msgstr "그러게요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. SceneName = CREW_EliteCrew_Muria_Recruit
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 007FF23D
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I'm an alien. Our cults do things differently where I'm from. &&& Muria: Rad. Not my vibe, though. &&& Muria: But yeah, I think I'm gonna need creds, up front. And a skull. Preferably with the brains still in it.|In exchange, I might show up to work two, maybe three times a week. Deal?
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: All right. Guess I'll gather my potions and head to my post. You do have a post for me, right?
#. EDID: [01083BCA]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001A29"
msgid "[<Global=Crew_RecruitCost_TextReplacementValue> Credits] I'm sorry, I can't afford that right now."
msgstr ""
"[<Global=Crew_RecruitCost_TextReplacementValue> 크레딧] 미안하지만 지금 그 만큼은 감당할 수 없어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. SceneName = CREW_EliteCrew_Muria_Recruit
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 008CF6D4
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I'm an alien. Our cults do things differently where I'm from. &&& Muria: Rad. Not my vibe, though. &&& Muria: But yeah, I think I'm gonna need creds, up front. And a skull. Preferably with the brains still in it.|In exchange, I might show up to work two, maybe three times a week. Deal?
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: All right. Guess I'll gather my potions and head to my post. You do have a post for me, right?
#. EDID: [01083BC9]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001A2A"
msgid "[Pay <Global=Crew_RecruitCost_TextReplacementValue> Credits] That won't be a problem. "
msgstr "[<Global=Crew_RecruitCost_TextReplacementValue> 크레딧 주기] 그 정도라면 문제없지. "

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. SceneName = CREW_EliteCrew_Muria_Recruit
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Muria
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00023694
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I'm an alien. Our cults do things differently where I'm from. &&& Muria: Rad. Not my vibe, though. &&& Muria: But yeah, I think I'm gonna need creds, up front. And a skull. Preferably with the brains still in it.|In exchange, I might show up to work two, maybe three times a week. Deal?
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Don't have the creds, huh. It happens.
#. EDID: [01083C2F]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001A2B"
msgid "You know, I think I'd rather keep traveling on my own. "
msgstr "눈치챘겠지만, 난 혼자 여행하는 게 더 좋아. "

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. SceneName = CREW_EliteCrew_Muria_Recruit
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00490B65
#. ScriptNotes = Happy the player left mid-conversation.
#. DialogueBefore = Muria: No place for me huh. Guess I'll go loiter around the bank some more.
#. EDID: [01083D17]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001A2C"
msgid "Oh cool, you're leaving."
msgstr "오, 잘 됐네요. 드디어 가시는 건가요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. SceneName = CREW_EliteCrew_Muria_TopLevel_Cult
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Muria
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 007D3F18
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: If they are believers, then they will find prosperity in the Shrouding as Promised. &&& Muria: Well, those sure are words. &&& Muria: But yeah, I didn't want to meet the Great Serpent, so I volunteered to pilot the ship.|And then it occurred to me -- if I was gonna be surrounded by a bunch of dead people, it'd be cool if I could raise them as my personal army.|I never made the grav jump. I still have the corpses.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Well, you can't. I was a naive little goth with dreams of terrorizing the galaxy.
#. EDID: [01083C65]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001A2D"
msgid "Assuming you could actually raise them."
msgstr "정말로 소생시킬 수 있으려나."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. SceneName = CREW_EliteCrew_Muria_TopLevel_Cult
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 002C8766
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Assuming you could actually raise them.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Do you mind if I ask you some personal questions?
#. EDID: [01083BD6]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001A2E"
msgid "Now I'll just have to make people miserable the old fashioned way, by mocking them. "
msgstr "이제는 그냥 고전적인 방식으로 사람들을 비참하게 만들어야겠죠. 조롱하는 방식으로 말이죠. "

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. SceneName = CREW_EliteCrew_Muria_TopLevel_Cult
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 003825EB
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Assuming you could actually raise them.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Assuming you could actually raise them.
#. EDID: [01083BD6]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001A2F"
msgid "Well, you can't. I was a naive little goth with dreams of terrorizing the galaxy."
msgstr "뭐, 당신이라면 무리겠죠. 저야 그때는 세상 물정 모르고 은하를 공포에 빠뜨리겠다는 꿈에 빠져 있었던 고스족 소녀였고요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. SceneName = CREW_EliteCrew_Muria_Wait
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 005CA699
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Wait here a moment.
#. EDID: [01083D3C]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001A30"
msgid "Guess I'll just read a book."
msgstr "그냥 책이나 읽어야겠다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. SceneName = CREW_EliteCrew_Muria_Wait
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00EADCBE
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Wait here a moment.
#. EDID: [01083D3B]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001A31"
msgid "Sure. I'll wait."
msgstr "물론. 기다릴게."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. SceneName = CREW_EliteCrew_Muria_Wait
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00046609
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Wait here a moment.
#. EDID: [01083D39]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001A32"
msgid "I'll try not to get bored."
msgstr "지루해지지 않게 노력해 볼게."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. SceneName = CREW_EliteCrew_Muria_TopLevel_Cult
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 0077D6BA
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Where are the corpses?
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Where are the corpses?
#. DialogueAfter = Muria: Are you saying you have ship full of corpses somewhere? That's... something.
#. EDID: [01083C83]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001A33"
msgid "They're just orbiting around a planet, or moon, I forget. I have it written down somewhere."
msgstr "어떤 행성 궤도 위에 있어요. 아, 위성이었나? 어딘가에 적어뒀을 거예요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. SceneName = CREW_EliteCrew_Muria_TimeLocked
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Muria
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 005B7660
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I would love to see a ship full of creepy cultists. &&& Muria: It's not as cool as you think. &&& Muria: Although... I did leave an open pack of Chunks somewhere in the cockpit. Maybe it's sentient now.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Trick question. Chunks don't have flavor. But I digress.
#. EDID: [01083BD9]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001A34"
msgid "What flavor Chunks? Asking the important questions here."
msgstr "무슨 맛 청크야? 그거 중대 사항이라고."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. SceneName = CREW_EliteCrew_Muria_TimeLocked
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00F76D3B
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = What flavor Chunks? Asking the important questions here.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: What flavor Chunks? Asking the important questions here.
#. DialogueAfter = Muria: Fungus in space can survive extreme conditions. There's stories of blobs of mold on the Mir Space Station that could swallow a human head.
#. EDID: [01083BBD]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001A35"
msgid "Trick question. Chunks don't have flavor. But I digress."
msgstr "묘한 질문이네요. 청크에 맛 같은 게 있을 리가 없잖아요. 뭐, 헛소리는 여기까지 하죠."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. SceneName = CREW_EliteCrew_Muria_TimeLocked
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Muria
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0047C1E6
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I would love to see a ship full of creepy cultists. &&& Muria: It's not as cool as you think. &&& Muria: Although... I did leave an open pack of Chunks somewhere in the cockpit. Maybe it's sentient now.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Well, in this case, a documentary.
#. EDID: [01083BA8]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001A36"
msgid "You joke, but that's how horror movies start."
msgstr "농담하는 거야? 근데 공포 영화가 원래 딱 그렇게 시작하긴 해."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. SceneName = CREW_EliteCrew_Muria_Follow
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00B7A18B
#. EDID: [01083B93]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001A37"
msgid "Let's get moving."
msgstr "이제 가자."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. SceneName = CREW_EliteCrew_Muria_TopLevel_Finance
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 003C356A
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral / to Player Default
#. Prompt = I see what you mean.
#. EDID: [01083BE0]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001A38"
msgid "The only real difference is that witches get burned at the stake, whereas bankers get golden parachutes."
msgstr "유일한 차이점이라면, 마녀들은 말뚝에 묶여 화형을 당하지만, 은행원들은 거액의 퇴직금을 받고 탈출한다는 것 정도겠네요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. SceneName = CREW_EliteCrew_Muria_TopLevel_Finance
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 002A1833
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral / to Player Default
#. Prompt = I see what you mean.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I see what you mean.
#. EDID: [01083BE0]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001A39"
msgid "Yeah. It's not exactly apples to apples, but it does come from the same tree."
msgstr "예. 완전히 똑같은 사과라고 볼 수는 없어도, 결국 같은 나무에서 자란 사과 같은 거죠."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. SceneName = CREW_EliteCrew_Muria_Recruit
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00304A54
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: I've got a job on my crew if you want it.
#. EDID: [01083CA7]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001A3A"
msgid "Don't know why, seems like it'd be an improvement. But what do I know. Certainly not enough to be a banker."
msgstr "왜 싫다는지 모르겠어요. 양서류가 되면 더 나아 보일 텐데. 진짜 모르겠어요. 그래서 은행원이 되지 못했나 봐요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. SceneName = CREW_EliteCrew_Muria_Recruit
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00D5F2BD
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral
#. EDID: [01083CA7]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001A3B"
msgid "I told him I could pay him with a potion that would turn him into a newt, but he refused."
msgstr "집주인한테 대신 양서류 영원으로 변하는 물약을 드리겠다고 했는데, 싫다고 하더라고요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. SceneName = CREW_EliteCrew_Muria_Recruit
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Defiant
#. SoundFileID = 007BF373
#. ScriptNotes = Defiant
#. DialogueBefore = Muria: If only.
#. EDID: [01083CA7]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001A3C"
msgid "Well, now I need find work somewhere else. My landlord keeps asking for this thing called \"rent.\""
msgstr "흠, 다른 일자리를 찾아야겠네요. 집주인이 '월세'라는 걸 자꾸 내라고 하거든요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. SceneName = CREW_EliteCrew_Muria_TopLevels_Travel
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00907D9E
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Why not just shoot them?
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Is there anywhere you want to visit?
#. EDID: [01083C0F]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001A3D"
msgid "It's just instead of a club, it's like, the universe."
msgstr "무대가 클럽 대신에 우주 같은 걸로 바뀌었을 뿐이잖아요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. SceneName = CREW_EliteCrew_Muria_TopLevels_Travel
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Question
#. SoundFileID = 003D8ED5
#. ScriptNotes = Question / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Why not just shoot them?
#. DialogueBefore = Muria: I feel like I shouldn't have to explain this to you of all people.
#. EDID: [01083C0F]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001A3E"
msgid "Aren't you like a bouncer or something? Throwing people out is kind of your thing. "
msgstr "당신은 무슨 경비원이나 그와 비슷한 부류 아니었나요? 사람들을 밖으로 던져버리는 거라면 잘 하잖아요. "

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. SceneName = SFBGS00M_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria_RecruitOptional
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00097B32
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral
#. EDID: [01083BA2]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001A3F"
msgid "But tell you what, come back in a few hours. If I don't get the job, I might reconsider."
msgstr "그래도 이렇게 하자. 몇 시간 뒤에 다시 와. 내가 그 일을 못 구하면 다시 생각해 볼지도 몰라."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. SceneName = SFBGS00M_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria_RecruitOptional
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 0082E8C1
#. EDID: [01083BA2]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001A40"
msgid "And no one person can be as evil as a bank."
msgstr "은행만큼 사악해질 수 있는 사람은 아무도 없으니까."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. SceneName = SFBGS00M_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria_RecruitOptional
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Thinking
#. SoundFileID = 00EE85B6
#. ScriptNotes = Thinking
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Forget GalBank. What if you came to work for me instead?
#. EDID: [01083BA2]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001A41"
msgid "Hm. Tempting. But I want to work for an evil greater than myself. "
msgstr "흠. 솔깃하네. 하지만 난 나보다 더 큰 악을 위해 일하고 싶어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. SceneName = CREW_EliteCrew_Muria_TopLevel_Paint
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Friendly
#. SoundFileID = 00295540
#. ScriptNotes = Friendly / to Player Default
#. Prompt = As one does.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: As one does.
#. EDID: [01083B51]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001A42"
msgid "As one does."
msgstr "다들 그러듯이."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. SceneName = CREW_EliteCrew_Muria_TopLevel_Paint
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 0039D1FC
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = What does the "slow, inexorable march toward death" look like?
#. DialogueAfter = Muria: As one does.
#. EDID: [01083CA6]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001A43"
msgid "Those feelings are what I like to paint."
msgstr "내가 그리고 싶은 건 그런 감정들이야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. SceneName = CREW_EliteCrew_Muria_TopLevel_Paint
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00D6F441
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = What does the "slow, inexorable march toward death" look like?
#. EDID: [01083CA6]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001A44"
msgid "Or the moment you realize your youth is gone, and your best years are behind you, but you still have to live, because you're too scared to die."
msgstr "아니면 젊음이 사라졌고 최고의 시절도 지나갔지만, 죽는 게 너무 무서워서 계속 살아야 한다는 걸 깨닫는 순간."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. SceneName = CREW_EliteCrew_Muria_TopLevel_Paint
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 009ABF5F
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral / to Player Default
#. Prompt = What does the "slow, inexorable march toward death" look like?
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: What does the "slow, inexorable march toward death" look like?
#. EDID: [01083CA6]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001A45"
msgid "It's a lot of things. Early Mondays. Gray hairs. The look on people's faces when they file their taxes."
msgstr "여러 가지야. 월요일 아침. 흰머리. 세금 신고할 때 사람들의 얼굴에 떠오르는 표정."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueStarstations
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCFValeriaHahn
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFValeriaHahn
#. Face = Spaceship / Friendly
#. SoundFileID = 0034B73E
#. ScriptNotes = A pre-recorded cheerful greeting that plays when the player hails Anchorpoint from their ship while approaching.
#. EDID: [010781EB]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001A48"
msgid "Welcome to Anchorpoint -- the perfect place to relax and resupply."
msgstr "앵커포인트에 온 걸 환영해. 휴식하고 재보급을 하기에 완벽한 곳이지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueStarstations
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCFValeriaHahn
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFValeriaHahn
#. Face = Spaceship / Friendly
#. SoundFileID = 0095280A
#. ScriptNotes = A pre-recorded cheerful greeting that plays when the player hails Anchorpoint from their ship while approaching.
#. EDID: [010781EA]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001A49"
msgid "Here at Anchorpoint, we offer cold drinks, supplies of all kinds and a comfortable place to relax."
msgstr "이곳 앵커포인트에서는 차가운 음료, 각종 보급품, 편히 쉴 수 있는 공간을 제공해."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueStarstations
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCFValeriaHahn
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFValeriaHahn
#. Face = Spaceship / Friendly
#. SoundFileID = 0066FFDD
#. ScriptNotes = A pre-recorded cheerful greeting that plays when the player hails Anchorpoint from their ship while approaching.
#. EDID: [010781E9]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001A4A"
msgid "Need a break from traveling the Free Lanes? We're here to serve you!"
msgstr "자유 항로 여행에 지쳤어? 우리가 정성껏 모셔드리지!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueStarstations
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCFValeriaHahn
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFValeriaHahn
#. Face = Spaceship / Friendly
#. SoundFileID = 00BC8C64
#. ScriptNotes = A pre-recorded cheerful greeting that plays when the player hails Anchorpoint from their ship while approaching.
#. EDID: [010781E7]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001A4B"
msgid "You've arrived at Anchorpoint, where everyone is welcome."
msgstr "앵커포인트에 드디어 도착했구나. 여긴 누구나 환영받는 곳이지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE02
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMGenericMale
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMGenericMale03
#. Face = Nervous
#. SoundFileID = 0020E315
#. ScriptNotes = Nervous
#. EDID: [0106C4FB]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001A4F"
msgid "Make it stop, please make it stop."
msgstr "멈춰 줘, 제발 멈춰 줘."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE02
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMGenericMale
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMGenericMale03
#. Face = Nervous
#. SoundFileID = 00FF6BF6
#. ScriptNotes = Nervous
#. EDID: [0106C4F3]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001A50"
msgid "What's going on?"
msgstr "무슨 일이야?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE02
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE02_100b_HailingAnswered
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = HailingShip
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMGenericMale03
#. Face = Spaceship / Afraid
#. SoundFileID = 007C5E3D
#. ScriptNotes = fully succumbing to madness / Afraid
#. EDID: [0106C4E5]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001A51"
msgid "What if I'm wrong? Oh god, what if I'm wrong? *Sob* The eyes... the eyes! The eyes!"
msgstr "내가 틀렸으면 어떡하지? 세상에, 내가 틀렸으면 어떡해? *흐느낌* 눈들이... 눈들이! 눈들이!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE02
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE02_100b_HailingAnswered
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = HailingShip
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMGenericMale03
#. Face = Spaceship / Afraid
#. SoundFileID = 00160295
#. ScriptNotes = Afraid
#. EDID: [0106C4E5]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001A52"
msgid "Right? I won't be able to see the eyes anymore, right? They won't be able to torture me... but what if I'm wrong? Oh god... oh god... what if I'm wrong..."
msgstr "그렇지? 더는 눈들을 볼 수 없게 되겠지, 맞지? 그들이 날 고문할 수 없을 거야... 하지만 내가 틀렸으면 어떡해? 세상에... 세상에... 내가 틀렸으면 어떡하지..."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE02
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE02_100b_HailingAnswered
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = HailingShip
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMGenericMale03
#. Face = Spaceship / Afraid
#. SoundFileID = 00EB74C9
#. ScriptNotes = Afraid
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Don't do that. That's not going to fix anything!
#. EDID: [0106C4E5]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001A53"
msgid "God damn it, why me? Why not torture someone else? I've had enough! Once I rip out my eyes, they can't torture me anymore! "
msgstr "젠장, 왜 나야? 왜 다른 사람을 고문하지 않는 거야? 난 이제 충분해! 내 눈을 뽑아 버리면, 그들은 더는 날 고문하지 못해!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE02
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE02_100b_HailingAnswered
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = HailingShip
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00D13623
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: You're talking about stars. They're harmless. &&& HailingShip: No, you're blind. I envy you, but you're blind. Blind to the danger around you, around everyone. &&& HailingShip: *Sob* I can't take it! I just... god damn it, I can't take it anymore! I need to make them stop, but how? So many eyes... always watching.|My eyes... they're, they're evil like the rest of them. They're keeping tabs on me, telling the others where I am... that has to be it. That has to be it, right?|*Sob* I have to rip them right out of my skull. Kill them before they kill me. And I won't let them kill me! I won't! I won't!
#. DialogueAfter = HailingShip: God damn it, why me? Why not torture someone else? I've had enough! Once I rip out my eyes, they can't torture me anymore!
#. EDID: [0106C4CC]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001A54"
msgid "Don't be so stupid. Snap out of it."
msgstr "멍청하게 굴지 마. 정신 차려."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE02
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE02_100b_HailingAnswered
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00CFF0DC
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: You're talking about stars. They're harmless. &&& HailingShip: No, you're blind. I envy you, but you're blind. Blind to the danger around you, around everyone. &&& HailingShip: *Sob* I can't take it! I just... god damn it, I can't take it anymore! I need to make them stop, but how? So many eyes... always watching.|My eyes... they're, they're evil like the rest of them. They're keeping tabs on me, telling the others where I am... that has to be it. That has to be it, right?|*Sob* I have to rip them right out of my skull. Kill them before they kill me. And I won't let them kill me! I won't! I won't!
#. DialogueAfter = HailingShip: God damn it, why me? Why not torture someone else? I've had enough! Once I rip out my eyes, they can't torture me anymore!
#. EDID: [0106C4B4]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001A55"
msgid "Don't do that. That's not going to fix anything!"
msgstr "그러지 마. 그걸로는 아무것도 해결되지 않아!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE02
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE02_100b_HailingAnswered
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = HailingShip
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMGenericMale03
#. Face = Spaceship / Afraid
#. SoundFileID = 00AD1590
#. ScriptNotes = Afraid
#. Prompt = Maybe you're right. You are being watched.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Maybe you're right. You are being watched.
#. DialogueAfter = HailingShip: *Sob* I can't take it! I just... god damn it, I can't take it anymore! I need to make them stop, but how? So many eyes... always watching.
#. EDID: [0106C4B5]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001A56"
msgid "Of course I am, and so are you. We're all being watched. The eyes are watching us right now."
msgstr "물론 나도 그렇고, 너도 그래. 우린 모두 감시당하고 있어. 눈들이 바로 지금 우리를 보고 있어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE02
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE02_100b_HailingAnswered
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = HailingShip
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00A5FC51
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: You're talking about stars. They're harmless. &&& HailingShip: No, you're blind. I envy you, but you're blind. Blind to the danger around you, around everyone. &&& HailingShip: *Sob* I can't take it! I just... god damn it, I can't take it anymore! I need to make them stop, but how? So many eyes... always watching.|My eyes... they're, they're evil like the rest of them. They're keeping tabs on me, telling the others where I am... that has to be it. That has to be it, right?|*Sob* I have to rip them right out of my skull. Kill them before they kill me. And I won't let them kill me! I won't! I won't!
#. DialogueAfter = HailingShip: God damn it, why me? Why not torture someone else? I've had enough! Once I rip out my eyes, they can't torture me anymore!
#. EDID: [0106C4BC]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001A57"
msgid "You're having a crisis. Let me board so I can help you."
msgstr "당신은 위기 상황이에요. 도와줄 수 있게 승선하게 해 주세요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE02
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE02_100b_HailingAnswered
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = HailingShip
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00936D56
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I don't know what you're talking about. &&& HailingShip: The eyes, the eyes, what else would I be talking about? Do you not see them all around you? Are you lucky enough to be blind? &&& HailingShip: They're all around me, I can't escape them. The eyes are everywhere. I look outside my window and there's a sea of them. When I land and look up into the sky, I see them looking down on me.|What do they want from me? I can't eat, I can't sleep. And when I look in the mirror there are two eyes in my skull mocking me. Torturing me!
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: You think I'm crazy? Damn you, I'm not! I'm not! How can you not see them? The sea of endless eyes? You're drowning in them as we speak!
#. EDID: [0106C4E1]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001A58"
msgid "You need help. You're a danger to yourself and possibly others."
msgstr "당신에겐 도움이 필요해요. 당신은 자기 자신에게, 어쩌면 다른 사람들에게도 위험합니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE02
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE02_100b_HailingAnswered
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = HailingShip
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMGenericMale03
#. Face = Spaceship / Nervous
#. SoundFileID = 0016E4D4
#. ScriptNotes = Nervous
#. Prompt = I'm not one of them. At least, I don't think I am.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I'm not one of them. At least, I don't think I am.
#. DialogueAfter = HailingShip: They're all around me, I can't escape them. The eyes are everywhere. I look outside my window and there's a sea of them. When I land and look up into the sky, I see them looking down on me.
#. EDID: [0106C4C7]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001A59"
msgid "I'm supposed to believe you?"
msgstr "내가 널 믿어야 해?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE02
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE02_100b_HailingAnswered
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = HailingShip
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 007AD72A
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I don't know what you're talking about. &&& HailingShip: The eyes, the eyes, what else would I be talking about? Do you not see them all around you? Are you lucky enough to be blind? &&& HailingShip: They're all around me, I can't escape them. The eyes are everywhere. I look outside my window and there's a sea of them. When I land and look up into the sky, I see them looking down on me.|What do they want from me? I can't eat, I can't sleep. And when I look in the mirror there are two eyes in my skull mocking me. Torturing me!
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Of course I am, and so are you. We're all being watched. The eyes are watching us right now.
#. EDID: [0106C4B1]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001A5A"
msgid "Maybe you're right. You are being watched."
msgstr "어쩌면 네 말이 맞아. 넌 감시당하고 있어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE02
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE02_100b_HailingAnswered
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = HailingShip
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 000DE373
#. DialogueBefore = HailingShip: You aren't... one of them, are you? &&& HailingShip: &&& HailingShip: You... you... you aren't one of them, are you? One of the eyes...|Please god, please don't be one of them. Please...
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Why... why are you asking? I'm not answering that. I... and I asked you a question first. You need to answer me now!
#. EDID: [0106C4CD]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001A5B"
msgid "Are you okay?"
msgstr "괜찮아?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE02
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE02_100b_HailingAnswered
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMGenericMale
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMGenericMale03
#. Face = Spaceship / Afraid
#. SoundFileID = 0026DD89
#. ScriptNotes = Afraid
#. Prompt = You're talking about stars. They're harmless.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: You're talking about stars. They're harmless.
#. DialogueAfter = HailingShip: *Sob* I can't take it! I just... god damn it, I can't take it anymore! I need to make them stop, but how? So many eyes... always watching.
#. EDID: [0106C4DA]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001A5C"
msgid "No, you're blind. I envy you, but you're blind. Blind to the danger around you, around everyone."
msgstr "아니, 넌 눈이 멀었어. 부럽지만, 넌 눈이 멀었어. 네 주변의 위험, 모두의 주변에 있는 위험을 보지 못해."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE02
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE02_100b_HailingAnswered
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = HailingShip
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMGenericMale03
#. Face = Spaceship / Nervous
#. SoundFileID = 00842DC1
#. ScriptNotes = Nervous
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: I don't know what you're talking about.
#. EDID: [0106C4CA]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001A5D"
msgid "Please god, please don't be one of them. Please..."
msgstr "제발 신이시여, 제발 그들 중 하나가 아니게 해 주세요. 제발..."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE02
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE02_100b_HailingAnswered
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = HailingShip
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMGenericMale03
#. Face = Spaceship / Nervous
#. SoundFileID = 0051F766
#. ScriptNotes = Nervous
#. DialogueBefore = HailingShip:
#. EDID: [0106C4CA]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001A5E"
msgid "You... you... you aren't one of them, are you? One of the eyes..."
msgstr "너... 너... 너는 그들 중 하나가 아니지? 눈들 중 하나..."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE02
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE02_100a_Hailing
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = HailingShip
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMGenericMale03
#. Face = Spaceship / Nervous
#. SoundFileID = 00174094
#. ScriptNotes = Nervous
#. DialogueBefore = HailingShip: You aren't... one of them, are you?
#. DialogueAfter = HailingShip: I can't take this anymore... *sob* can't take this anymore...
#. EDID: [0106C4DF]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001A5F"
msgid "I can't take it anymore..."
msgstr "더는 못 견디겠어..."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE02
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE02_100a_Hailing
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = HailingShip
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMGenericMale03
#. Face = Spaceship / Nervous
#. SoundFileID = 00B97175
#. ScriptNotes = Nervous
#. DialogueBefore = HailingShip: You aren't... one of them, are you?
#. DialogueAfter = HailingShip: I can't take this anymore... *sob* can't take this anymore...
#. EDID: [0106C4DE]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001A60"
msgid "They're everywhere..."
msgstr "어디에나 있어..."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_Anchorpoint_AudioSlateQuest
#. SceneName = SFFL_Anchorpoint_AudioSlateQuest_EvanGabriellaScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = AUDIOONLY
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMEvanAlonso
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0044199F
#. DialogueBefore = Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): I'm sorry, but I really don't have the time.|My press agent can handle any further inquiries.
#. EDID: [0106C448]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001A61"
msgid "Thanks for your time."
msgstr "시간 내 주셔서 감사합니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_Anchorpoint_AudioSlateQuest
#. SceneName = SFFL_Anchorpoint_AudioSlateQuest_EvanGabriellaScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = AUDIOONLY
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMEvanAlonso
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00F4BB35
#. DialogueAfter = Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): I welcome it. Throughout our history, every visionary has had skeptics.
#. EDID: [0106C441]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001A62"
msgid "Do you feel like that's an unfair characterization? Any words for the skeptics?"
msgstr "그런 평가가 부당하다고 느끼십니까? 회의론자들에게 한 말씀 하시겠습니까?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_Anchorpoint_AudioSlateQuest
#. SceneName = SFFL_Anchorpoint_AudioSlateQuest_EvanGabriellaScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = AUDIOONLY
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMEvanAlonso
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 008E5C2C
#. EDID: [0106C441]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001A63"
msgid "They point to the personal wealth you've sunk into it, and the speculative nature of the venture."
msgstr "그들은 당신이 쏟아부은 개인 재산과 이 사업의 투기적 성격을 지적합니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_Anchorpoint_AudioSlateQuest
#. SceneName = SFFL_Anchorpoint_AudioSlateQuest_EvanGabriellaScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = AUDIOONLY
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMEvanAlonso
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00DF3CBB
#. DialogueBefore = Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): *Chuckle* I hardly think that's necessary.|As someone who's spent her entire professional life in the world of commerce, I can promise you one thing.|Progress is inevitable, especially if there's a profit to be made.
#. EDID: [0106C441]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001A64"
msgid "Some have characterized Anchorpoint as a vanity project."
msgstr "일부에서는 앵커포인트를 허영심에서 나온 프로젝트라고 평가했습니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_Anchorpoint_AudioSlateQuest
#. SceneName = SFFL_Anchorpoint_AudioSlateQuest_EvanGabriellaScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = AUDIOONLY
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFGabriellaLeBlanc
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00512F27
#. DialogueAfter = Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): One more if I may...
#. EDID: [0106C442]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001A65"
msgid "I assure you, we're going into this with clear eyes and a great plan."
msgstr "분명히 말씀드리지만, 우리는 명확한 시야와 훌륭한 계획을 가지고 이 일에 임하고 있습니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_Anchorpoint_AudioSlateQuest
#. SceneName = SFFL_Anchorpoint_AudioSlateQuest_EvanGabriellaScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = AUDIOONLY
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFGabriellaLeBlanc
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 009BF5BB
#. EDID: [0106C442]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001A66"
msgid "It's a simple truth that bold ideas elicit strong reactions."
msgstr "대담한 아이디어가 강한 반응을 불러일으킨다는 건 단순한 진실입니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_Anchorpoint_AudioSlateQuest
#. SceneName = SFFL_Anchorpoint_AudioSlateQuest_EvanGabriellaScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = AUDIOONLY
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFGabriellaLeBlanc
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00E458EB
#. DialogueBefore = Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): Some have characterized Anchorpoint as a vanity project.|They point to the personal wealth you've sunk into it, and the speculative nature of the venture.|Do you feel like that's an unfair characterization? Any words for the skeptics?
#. EDID: [0106C442]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001A67"
msgid "I welcome it. Throughout our history, every visionary has had skeptics."
msgstr "저는 환영합니다. 역사 내내 모든 선구자에게는 회의론자들이 있었습니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_Anchorpoint_AudioSlateQuest
#. SceneName = SFFL_Anchorpoint_AudioSlateQuest_EvanGabriellaScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = AUDIOONLY
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFGabriellaLeBlanc
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 003D1502
#. DialogueAfter = Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): Some have characterized Anchorpoint as a vanity project.
#. EDID: [0106C44F]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001A68"
msgid "Progress is inevitable, especially if there's a profit to be made."
msgstr "진보는 필연적입니다. 특히 이익을 낼 수 있다면요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_Anchorpoint_AudioSlateQuest
#. SceneName = SFFL_Anchorpoint_AudioSlateQuest_EvanGabriellaScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = AUDIOONLY
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFGabriellaLeBlanc
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 004B4602
#. EDID: [0106C44F]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001A69"
msgid "As someone who's spent her entire professional life in the world of commerce, I can promise you one thing."
msgstr "평생을 상업의 세계에서 보낸 사람으로서, 한 가지는 약속드릴 수 있습니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_Anchorpoint_AudioSlateQuest
#. SceneName = SFFL_Anchorpoint_AudioSlateQuest_EvanGabriellaScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = AUDIOONLY
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFGabriellaLeBlanc
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 005B2103
#. DialogueBefore = Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): Anchorpoint was built on the premise that Grav Drive technology will advance beyond its current limits.|If it doesn't, is there a fallback plan? Some other way to use the station that's profitable?
#. EDID: [0106C44F]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001A6A"
msgid "*Chuckle* I hardly think that's necessary."
msgstr "*킥킥 웃음* 그럴 필요는 거의 없다고 생각합니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_Anchorpoint_AudioSlateQuest
#. SceneName = SFFL_Anchorpoint_AudioSlateQuest_EvanGabriellaScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = AUDIOONLY
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFGabriellaLeBlanc
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00026C65
#. DialogueBefore = Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): Excuse me, Ms. LeBlanc? Just a few quick questions for SSNN, if you could.
#. DialogueAfter = Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): Anchorpoint was built on the premise that Grav Drive technology will advance beyond its current limits.
#. EDID: [0106C44B]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001A6B"
msgid "Very well, but make it quick."
msgstr "좋습니다. 하지만 빨리 하세요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_Anchorpoint_AudioSlateQuest
#. SceneName = SFFL_Anchorpoint_AudioSlateQuest_EvanGabriellaScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = AUDIOONLY
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFGabriellaLeBlanc
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00026C65
#. DialogueBefore = Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): Excuse me, Ms. LeBlanc? Just a few quick questions for SSNN, if you could.
#. DialogueAfter = Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): Anchorpoint was built on the premise that Grav Drive technology will advance beyond its current limits.
#. EDID: [0106C44A]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001A6C"
msgid "Very well, but make it quick."
msgstr "좋습니다. 하지만 빨리 하세요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_Anchorpoint_AudioSlateQuest
#. SceneName = SFFL_Anchorpoint_AudioSlateQuest_GusGentryScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = AUDIOONLY
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMGusGentry
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00406C76
#. EDID: [0106C446]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001A6D"
msgid "This is Chief Engineer Gus Gentry of Anchorpoint Station, signing off for the last time."
msgstr "앵커포인트 우주정거장의 수석 엔지니어 거스 젠트리입니다. 마지막으로 송신을 종료합니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_Anchorpoint_AudioSlateQuest
#. SceneName = SFFL_Anchorpoint_AudioSlateQuest_GusGentryScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = AUDIOONLY
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMGusGentry
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00AE949E
#. EDID: [0106C446]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001A6E"
msgid "Damn... wish I could be there to see it."
msgstr "젠장... 그걸 직접 볼 수 있으면 좋을 텐데."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_Anchorpoint_AudioSlateQuest
#. SceneName = SFFL_Anchorpoint_AudioSlateQuest_GusGentryScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = AUDIOONLY
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMGusGentry
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00CD0BCA
#. ScriptNotes = The planet is pronounced "AL-guh-rab Two"
#. EDID: [0106C446]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001A6F"
msgid "Until one day, she'll light up the sky over Algorab II in a last, glorious fireball."
msgstr "언젠가 그녀는 알고라브 II의 하늘을 마지막 찬란한 불덩이로 밝히겠지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_Anchorpoint_AudioSlateQuest
#. SceneName = SFFL_Anchorpoint_AudioSlateQuest_GusGentryScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = AUDIOONLY
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMGusGentry
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00F8066A
#. EDID: [0106C446]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001A70"
msgid "Without the occasional correction from the orbital thrusters, she'll start to drop."
msgstr "궤도 추력기로 가끔 보정해 주지 않으면, 이 기지는 추락하기 시작할 거야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_Anchorpoint_AudioSlateQuest
#. SceneName = SFFL_Anchorpoint_AudioSlateQuest_GusGentryScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = AUDIOONLY
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMGusGentry
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 002A471F
#. EDID: [0106C446]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001A71"
msgid "And now, it's time to say goodbye."
msgstr "그리고 이제 작별을 고할 시간이야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_Anchorpoint_AudioSlateQuest
#. SceneName = SFFL_Anchorpoint_AudioSlateQuest_GusGentryScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = AUDIOONLY
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMGusGentry
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 007D5E0E
#. EDID: [0106C446]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001A72"
msgid "A whole lot of folks put a whole lot of passion into the job. We built her right, and built her to last."
msgstr "정말 많은 사람들이 이 일에 엄청난 열정을 쏟았어. 우린 이 기지를 제대로, 오래 버티도록 지었지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_Anchorpoint_AudioSlateQuest
#. SceneName = SFFL_Anchorpoint_AudioSlateQuest_GusGentryScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = AUDIOONLY
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMGusGentry
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00B7773A
#. EDID: [0106C446]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001A73"
msgid "I remember the day we started construction on this station. There was so much enthusiasm, so much pride."
msgstr "이 우주정거장 건설을 시작하던 날이 기억나. 열정도, 자부심도 넘쳐났지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_Anchorpoint_AudioSlateQuest
#. SceneName = SFFL_Anchorpoint_AudioSlateQuest_GusGentryScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = AUDIOONLY
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMGusGentry
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00CFA65E
#. EDID: [0106C446]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001A74"
msgid "You live in a place long enough, it starts to feel like a kind of home, I suppose."
msgstr "한곳에서 오래 살다 보면, 그곳이 일종의 집처럼 느껴지기 시작하는 것 같아."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_Anchorpoint_AudioSlateQuest
#. SceneName = SFFL_Anchorpoint_AudioSlateQuest_GusGentryScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = AUDIOONLY
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMGusGentry
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00873764
#. ScriptNotes = Somber, reminiscing
#. EDID: [0106C446]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001A75"
msgid "Don't know why I'm recording this. Just seems like somebody should say something."
msgstr "왜 이걸 녹음하는지 모르겠어. 그냥 누군가는 무슨 말이라도 해야 할 것 같아서."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02_AudioLogs
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_OpalAudioLog
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = OpalWoods
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCOpalWoods
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00AA3983
#. ScriptNotes = Venting, frustrated, and annoyed. Sighs out the last part.
#. DialogueBefore = Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): Coop's nice 'cause, yeah, he's quiet, but he doesn't look sad or anything. Wren makes me sad. She makes everyone sad. I just don't get why she's always around.
#. EDID: [0106D253]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001A76"
msgid "Okay. I better head back out. Not like I can stay in the cockpit the whole time. What a bitch..."
msgstr "좋아. 다시 밖으로 나가야겠어. 계속 조종실에만 있을 수는 없으니까. 진짜 엿 같네..."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_RS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE_RS01_Barrow_Jackson_Hail
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0067E8E1
#. EDID: [0106D25C]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001A78"
msgid "Hello? Can you hear me? This is Jara Kleel, pilot of the Sycorax."
msgstr "여보세요? 들리나요? 저는 시코락스의 조종사 자라 클릴입니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_RS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE_RS01_Barrow_Jackson_Hail
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00019F67
#. DialogueBefore = Player: Hello? Can you hear me? This is Jara Kleel, pilot of the Sycorax.
#. DialogueAfter = HailingShip: I see, well... maybe someone else will come along that has half a heart. Sycorax out.
#. EDID: [0106D260]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001A79"
msgid "C'mon... I'm dead in the void here."
msgstr "제발... 나 여기 공허 속에서 꼼짝 못 하고 있어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_RS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE_RS01_Barrow_Jackson_Hail
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00B10CC9
#. DialogueBefore = Player: Hello? Can you hear me? This is Jara Kleel, pilot of the Sycorax.
#. DialogueAfter = HailingShip: I see, well... maybe someone else will come along that has half a heart. Sycorax out.
#. EDID: [0106D25F]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001A7A"
msgid "Please, if you're reading me... I need your help."
msgstr "제발, 수신 중이라면... 도움이 필요합니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_RS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE_RS01_Barrow_Jackson_Hail
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00DF76A1
#. DialogueBefore = Player: Hello? Can you hear me? This is Jara Kleel, pilot of the Sycorax.
#. DialogueAfter = HailingShip: I see, well... maybe someone else will come along that has half a heart. Sycorax out.
#. EDID: [0106D25E]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001A7B"
msgid "I've taken damage from a pirate attack and lost power."
msgstr "해적 공격으로 피해를 입고 동력을 잃었습니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_EC06
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE_EC06_Pirate03_Scene
