#. DialogueAfter = ActiveCompanion: A third ship has joined the fight. Watch out!
#. EDID: [0106B165]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001A81"
msgid "I had friends on that ship, you monster!"
msgstr "그 우주선에 내 친구들이 있었어, 이 괴물아!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_EC06
