#. DialogueBefore = PirateShip03:
#. EDID: [0106C46F]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001A84"
msgid "Another pirate ship? I told you this was a bad idea!"
msgstr "또 해적선이야? 이거 나쁜 생각이라고 했잖아!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_EC06
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE_EC06_10_CompanionInterjection
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = ActiveCompanion
#. VoiceType = NPCFSarahMorgan
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00133832
#. ScriptNotes = As they are approaching a radio signal calling for help in the middle of deep space. / Serious
#. EDID: [0106C473]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001A85"
msgid "Let's find the source of the signal and then get the hell out of here."
msgstr "신호의 근원을 찾은 다음 여기서 당장 빠져나가자."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_EC06
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE_EC06_10_CompanionInterjection
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = ActiveCompanion
#. VoiceType = NPCFSarahMorgan
#. Face = Concerned
#. SoundFileID = 00239817
#. ScriptNotes = As they are approaching a radio signal calling for help in the middle of deep space. / Concerned
#. EDID: [0106C473]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001A86"
msgid "I don't know about you, but I don't have a good feeling about this place."
msgstr "너는 어떨지 모르겠지만, 난 이곳 느낌이 좋지 않아."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_EC06
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE_EC06_10_CompanionInterjection
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = ActiveCompanion
#. VoiceType = NPCFAndreja
#. Face = Concerned
#. SoundFileID = 0049A03A
#. ScriptNotes = As they are approaching a radio signal calling for help in the middle of deep space. / Concerned
#. EDID: [0106C470]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001A87"
msgid "Maybe we should just continue on our way..."
msgstr "그냥 가던 길을 계속 가는 게 좋을지도..."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_EC06
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE_EC06_10_CompanionInterjection
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = ActiveCompanion
#. VoiceType = NPCFAndreja
#. Face = Worried
#. SoundFileID = 0022E7F3
#. ScriptNotes = As they are approaching a radio signal calling for help in the middle of deep space. / Worried
#. EDID: [0106C470]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001A88"
msgid "I do not like this...it feels like an ambush."
msgstr "마음에 안 들어... 매복 같은 느낌이야."

