#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00908653
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: A potato. &&& HailingShip: A valiant effort, but wrong. A potato has many eyes. &&& HailingShip: Time's up for this one. &&& HailingShip: All right. On to the next riddle! |What goes to school but does not go to class?
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Well, then, I guess someone is dying.
#. EDID: [0106C747]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001A9C"
msgid "I don't know."
msgstr "모르겠어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE03
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE03_100a_Hailing
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = HailingShip
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMGenericMale02
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00B916CF
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral
#. DialogueBefore = HailingShip: Well hey there stranger. I've got something for you that'll blow your mind. Trust me, you're never gonna forget this.
#. DialogueAfter = HailingShip: You've gotta be kidding me. No one wants to play? Really?
#. EDID: [0106A311]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001A9D"
msgid "I'm telling you, you don't wanna miss this."
msgstr "장담하는데, 이건 놓치면 후회할 거야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE03
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE03_100c_HailingRefused
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = HailingShip
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMGenericMale02
#. Face = Spaceship / Irritated
#. SoundFileID = 002655C7
#. ScriptNotes = Irritated
#. DialogueBefore = HailingShip:
#. EDID: [0106A306]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001A9E"
msgid "You've gotta be kidding me. No one wants to play? Really?"
msgstr "장난해? 아무도 안 하겠다고? 진짜로?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE03
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE03_100b_HailingAnswered
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = HailingShip
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMGenericMale02
#. Face = Spaceship / Smug
#. SoundFileID = 004C5021
#. ScriptNotes = Smug
#. DialogueBefore = HailingShip: Get over here! It's the end of the line!
#. DialogueAfter = HailingShip: Before we enter our grand finale, let me just remind you what you're playing for.
#. EDID: [0106C74E]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001A9F"
msgid "So that's one wrong so far. One dead body. Don't let it get to your head. "
msgstr "그럼 지금까지 하나 틀렸네. 시체 하나. 너무 신경 쓰진 마."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE03
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE03_100b_HailingAnswered
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 005247F4
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Well, before I agree to anything, I need more info. &&& ... &&& HailingShip: Come here, honey, say hi to our contestant! Get over here! &&& HailingShip: He's insane, help us! He killed the pilot, he- &&& HailingShip: All right, shut up, that's enough. Get on back with the rest of them. Move!|*Ahem* 'Scuse me. Do I have your attention now? Then allow me to explain the rules of my little game.|It's very simple, really. Three lives for three riddles. If you refuse to answer, or if you get a riddle wrong, I kill one of my little friends on board.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Fantastic. Amazing! Let the games begin!
#. EDID: [0106C4E0]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001AA0"
msgid "Seems like I don't have a choice. I'll play."
msgstr "선택의 여지가 없는 것 같군. 하겠어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE03
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE03_100b_HailingAnswered
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMGenericMale
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMGenericMale02
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00B275B3
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Seems like I don't have a choice. I'll play.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Seems like I don't have a choice. I'll play.
#. DialogueAfter = HailingShip: A classic one to start with. Perhaps you know it? Let's hope you do...
#. EDID: [0106C4D7]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001AA1"
msgid "Fantastic. Amazing! Let the games begin!"
msgstr "훌륭해. 아주 좋아! 게임을 시작하지!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE03
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE03_100b_HailingAnswered
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = HailingShip
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFGenericFemale01
#. Face = Spaceship / Afraid
#. SoundFileID = 0039A658
#. ScriptNotes = Afraid
#. DialogueBefore = HailingShip: Come here, honey, say hi to our contestant! Get over here!
#. DialogueAfter = HailingShip: All right, shut up, that's enough. Get on back with the rest of them. Move!
#. EDID: [0106C4BF]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001AA2"
msgid "He's insane, help us! He killed the pilot, he-"
msgstr "저놈 미쳤어요, 도와주세요! 조종사를 죽였어요, 저-"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE03
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE03_100b_HailingAnswered
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = HailingShip
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMGenericMale02
#. Face = Spaceship / Irritated
#. SoundFileID = 00B7296D
#. ScriptNotes = speaking to his hostage. Wants his hostage to speak to the player to convince them to play his game / Irritated
#. DialogueBefore = HailingShip: More info? Yeah, I've got your info.
#. DialogueAfter = HailingShip: He's insane, help us! He killed the pilot, he-
#. EDID: [0106C4BA]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001AA3"
msgid "Come here, honey, say hi to our contestant! Get over here!"
msgstr "이리 와, 자기야. 참가자한테 인사해야지! 어서 와!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE03
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE03_100b_HailingAnswered
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = HailingShip
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMGenericMale02
#. Face = Spaceship / Irritated
#. SoundFileID = 000D8376
