#. Prompt = I don't know.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I don't know.
#. DialogueAfter = HailingShip: Get over here! It's the end of the line!
#. EDID: [0106C749]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001AA4"
msgid "Well, then, I guess someone is dying."
msgstr "그럼 누군가는 죽겠네."

