#. DialogueBefore = HailingShip: Well hey there stranger. I've got something for you that'll blow your mind. Trust me, you're never gonna forget this. &&& HailingShip: &&& HailingShip: Ah, good, you picked up. I've been flying all over, looking for someone, anyone, to play with. |You see, I want to play a game with you. A bit of a twisted one, but that's what makes it so fun. The stakes are high!
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: I'll get to that in due time. I'd hate to spoil anything just yet.
#. EDID: [0106C4B2]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001AA5"
msgid "What are you talking about?"
msgstr "무슨 소리야?"

