#. Face = Spaceship / Irritated
#. SoundFileID = 00DB30A0
#. ScriptNotes = Irritated / to Player Default
#. Prompt = I'm not doing anything with you.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I'm not doing anything with you.
#. DialogueAfter = HailingShip: Come here, honey, say hi to our contestant! Get over here!
#. EDID: [0106C4DB]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001AA7"
msgid "Oh? Maybe this will convince you."
msgstr "오? 이러면 설득이 되려나."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE03
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE03_100b_HailingAnswered
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = HailingShip
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 000BBD97
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = HailingShip: Well hey there stranger. I've got something for you that'll blow your mind. Trust me, you're never gonna forget this. &&& HailingShip: &&& HailingShip: Ah, good, you picked up. I've been flying all over, looking for someone, anyone, to play with. |You see, I want to play a game with you. A bit of a twisted one, but that's what makes it so fun. The stakes are high!
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Oh? Maybe this will convince you.
#. EDID: [0106C4D9]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001AA8"
msgid "I'm not doing anything with you."
msgstr "너랑은 아무것도 안 해."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE03
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE03_100b_HailingAnswered
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = HailingShip
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00364C26
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: A potato. &&& HailingShip: A valiant effort, but wrong. A potato has many eyes. &&& HailingShip: Time's up for this one. &&& HailingShip: All right. On to the next riddle! |What goes to school but does not go to class?
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Not bad, but wrong. A principal sometimes enters the classrooms, after all.
#. EDID: [0106C74C]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001AA9"
msgid "The principal. "
msgstr "교장."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE03
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE03_100b_HailingAnswered
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = HailingShip
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMGenericMale02
#. Face = Spaceship / Smug
#. SoundFileID = 0062C773
#. ScriptNotes = Smug / to Player Default
#. Prompt = The principal.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: The principal.
#. DialogueAfter = HailingShip: Get over here! It's the end of the line!
#. EDID: [0106C750]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001AAA"
msgid "Not bad, but wrong. A principal sometimes enters the classrooms, after all."
msgstr "나쁘진 않은데, 틀렸어. 교장은 가끔 교실에 들어가기도 하잖아."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE03
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE03_100b_HailingAnswered
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0020C246
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Seems like I don't have a choice. I'll play. &&& HailingShip: Fantastic. Amazing! Let the games begin! &&& HailingShip: A classic one to start with. Perhaps you know it? Let's hope you do...|What has an eye but cannot see?
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: A valiant effort, but wrong. A potato has many eyes.
#. EDID: [0106C746]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001AAB"
msgid "A potato."
msgstr "감자."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE03
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE03_100b_HailingAnswered
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = HailingShip
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMGenericMale02
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00F8866F
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral / to Player Default
#. Prompt = A needle.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: A needle.
#. DialogueAfter = HailingShip: All right. On to the next riddle!
#. EDID: [0106C756]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001AAC"
msgid "Not bad, but don't get cocky! We still have two more to go."
msgstr "나쁘진 않지만 우쭐대지 마! 아직 두 개나 남았으니까."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE03
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE03_100b_HailingAnswered
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = HailingShip
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMGenericMale01
#. Face = Spaceship / Afraid
#. SoundFileID = 003556C9
#. ScriptNotes = Afraid
#. DialogueBefore = HailingShip: Before we enter our grand finale, let me just remind you what you're playing for.|You, get over here! Now!
#. DialogueAfter = HailingShip: All right, all right, enough!
#. EDID: [0106C7F5]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001AAD"
msgid "Help me! Help me, please! He's gonna kill us-"
msgstr "도와줘요! 제발 도와주세요! 저놈이 우릴 죽일 거예-"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE03
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE03_100b_HailingAnswered
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = HailingShip
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00068910
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Seems like I don't have a choice. I'll play. &&& HailingShip: Fantastic. Amazing! Let the games begin! &&& HailingShip: A classic one to start with. Perhaps you know it? Let's hope you do...|What has an eye but cannot see?
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Oh, that's funny, but I don't think the hostage that I'm about to kill will be laughing.
#. EDID: [0106C753]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001AAE"
msgid "Your dead body after I kill you."
msgstr "내가 널 죽인 뒤에 남을 네 시체."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE03
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE03_100b_HailingAnswered
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = HailingShip
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00DE9119
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: A school bus. &&& ... &&& HailingShip: Help me! Help me, please! He's gonna kill us- &&& HailingShip: All right, all right, enough! |Do you hear that? Do you hear how scared they are? How exciting is that?|All right, one more to go. The grand finale! You ready? &&& HailingShip: What's light as a feather, but even the strongest person can't hold it for long?
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Are you serious? You want these people to die, don't you?
#. EDID: [0106C7FB]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001AAF"
msgid "I don't know."
msgstr "모르겠어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE03
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE03_100b_HailingAnswered
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = HailingShip
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMGenericMale02
#. Face = Spaceship / Irritated
#. SoundFileID = 00D454F3
#. ScriptNotes = Irritated / to Player Default
#. Prompt = I don't know.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I don't know.
#. DialogueAfter = HailingShip: Time's up for this one.
#. EDID: [0106C744]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001AB0"
msgid "Congrats, you just doomed someone out of an utter lack of initiative. Would it have killed you to take a guess?"
msgstr "축하해, 넌 완전히 소극적으로 굴어서 누군가를 죽게 만들었어. 찍어 보기라도 하면 죽기라도 했나?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE03
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE03_100b_HailingAnswered
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = HailingShip
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMGenericMale02
#. Face = Spaceship / Smug
#. SoundFileID = 0027CA03
#. ScriptNotes = Smug
#. EDID: [0106C7FF]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001AB1"
msgid "Well, it's been fun, but I'd better get going. I have some business to attend to. Thanks for playing! Hahaha!"
msgstr "뭐, 재미있었지만 난 이만 가야겠어. 처리할 일이 있어서. 게임에 참여해 줘서 고마워! 하하하!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE03
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE03_100b_HailingAnswered
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = HailingShip
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMGenericMale02
#. Face = Spaceship / Smug
#. SoundFileID = 003BF44B
#. ScriptNotes = Smug
#. DialogueBefore = HailingShip: Time to say bye-bye to this one.
#. EDID: [0106C7FF]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001AB2"
msgid "Well, you tried your best, but I guess nobody's perfect. Looks like my friends here didn't get out of this unscathed."
msgstr "뭐, 최선을 다하긴 했지만 완벽한 사람은 없는 법이지. 여기 내 친구들은 무사히 빠져나가진 못한 것 같네."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE03
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE03_100b_HailingAnswered
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = HailingShip
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMGenericMale02
#. Face = Spaceship / Smug
#. SoundFileID = 00A1C910
#. ScriptNotes = Smug
#. EDID: [0106C7FE]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001AB3"
msgid "Guess I'll just have to find another contestant for my little game. I better get going then, it's been fun! Hahaha!"
msgstr "내 작은 게임에 참가할 다른 사람을 찾아야겠군. 그럼 이만 가야겠다. 재미있었어! 하하하!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE03
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE03_100b_HailingAnswered
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = HailingShip
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMGenericMale02
#. Face = Spaceship / Smug
#. SoundFileID = 0045EEC7
#. ScriptNotes = Smug
#. DialogueBefore = HailingShip: Time to say bye-bye to this one.
#. EDID: [0106C7FE]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001AB4"
msgid "Wow, three for three. Good job. But now I have my own riddle to solve: what the hell am I supposed to do with these hostages now? I can't let 'em go to waste!"
msgstr "와, 세 문제를 전부 맞혔네. 잘했어. 하지만 이제 나도 풀어야 할 수수께끼가 생겼군. 이 인질들을 대체 어떻게 해야 하지? 그냥 낭비할 순 없잖아!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE03
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE03_100b_HailingAnswered
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = HailingShip
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMGenericMale02
#. Face = Spaceship / Angry
#. SoundFileID = 009FF5DD
#. ScriptNotes = yelling at one of his hostages / Angry
#. DialogueAfter = HailingShip: Help me! Help me, please! He's gonna kill us-
#. EDID: [0106C7F6]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001AB5"
msgid "You, get over here! Now!"
msgstr "너, 이리 와! 당장!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE03
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE03_100b_HailingAnswered
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = HailingShip
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMGenericMale02
#. Face = Spaceship / Smug
#. SoundFileID = 004D7E9E
#. ScriptNotes = Smug
#. DialogueBefore = HailingShip: Hmm, you're not doing so great, buddy. Two riddles down, and two people dead. Get your head in the game!
#. EDID: [0106C7F6]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001AB6"
msgid "Before we enter our grand finale, let me just remind you what you're playing for."
msgstr "성대한 피날레로 들어가기 전에, 네가 뭘 걸고 플레이하는지 다시 알려 주지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE03
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE03_100b_HailingAnswered
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = HailingShip
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMGenericMale02
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00174AF2
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral
#. DialogueBefore = HailingShip: All right, all right, enough! |Do you hear that? Do you hear how scared they are? How exciting is that?|All right, one more to go. The grand finale! You ready?
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: A grenade.
#. EDID: [0106C7FD]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001AB7"
msgid "What's light as a feather, but even the strongest person can't hold it for long?"
msgstr "깃털처럼 가볍지만, 아무리 강한 사람도 오래 붙잡을 수 없는 것은?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE03
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE03_100b_HailingAnswered
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = HailingShip
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMGenericMale02
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0033AA82
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral
#. DialogueAfter = HailingShip: What's light as a feather, but even the strongest person can't hold it for long?
#. EDID: [0106C7F8]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001AB8"
msgid "All right, one more to go. The grand finale! You ready?"
msgstr "좋아, 하나만 더. 성대한 피날레다! 준비됐어?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE03
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE03_100b_HailingAnswered
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = HailingShip
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMGenericMale02
#. Face = Spaceship / Smug
#. SoundFileID = 003F61B9
#. ScriptNotes = Smug
#. EDID: [0106C7F8]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001AB9"
msgid "Do you hear that? Do you hear how scared they are? How exciting is that?"
msgstr "들려? 저 사람들이 얼마나 겁먹었는지 들려? 얼마나 짜릿해?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE03
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE03_100b_HailingAnswered
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = HailingShip
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMGenericMale02
#. Face = Spaceship / Irritated
#. SoundFileID = 00FB3241
#. ScriptNotes = Irritated
#. DialogueBefore = HailingShip: Help me! Help me, please! He's gonna kill us-
#. EDID: [0106C7F8]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001ABA"
msgid "All right, all right, enough! "
msgstr "알았어, 알았어, 그만!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE03
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE03_100b_HailingAnswered
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = HailingShip
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMGenericMale02
#. Face = Spaceship / Smug
#. SoundFileID = 003CB363
#. ScriptNotes = Smug / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Why are you doing this?
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Why are you doing this?
#. DialogueAfter = HailingShip: Seems like I don't have a choice. I'll play.
#. EDID: [0106D1AF]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001ABB"
msgid "I was bored. "
msgstr "심심했거든."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE03
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE03_100b_HailingAnswered
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = HailingShip
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 003C06AD
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Well, before I agree to anything, I need more info. &&& ... &&& HailingShip: Come here, honey, say hi to our contestant! Get over here! &&& HailingShip: He's insane, help us! He killed the pilot, he- &&& HailingShip: All right, shut up, that's enough. Get on back with the rest of them. Move!|*Ahem* 'Scuse me. Do I have your attention now? Then allow me to explain the rules of my little game.|It's very simple, really. Three lives for three riddles. If you refuse to answer, or if you get a riddle wrong, I kill one of my little friends on board.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: I was bored.
#. EDID: [0106D1AE]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001ABC"
msgid "Why are you doing this?"
msgstr "왜 이러는 거야?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE03
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE03_100b_HailingAnswered
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = HailingShip
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMGenericMale02
#. Face = Spaceship / Angry
#. SoundFileID = 00312CA2
#. ScriptNotes = Angry / to Player Default
#. Prompt = I'm not getting involved in this. I'm leaving.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I'm not getting involved in this. I'm leaving.
#. DialogueAfter = HailingShip: I swear to whatever god you worship, if you end this hail I will blow up this ship. Everyone - EVERYONE - on board will die!
#. EDID: [0106D1B0]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001ABD"
msgid "Do. Not. End. This. Hail!"
msgstr "이. 교신을. 끊지. 마!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_ActionFigures_SarahMorgan
#. SceneName = SFFL_ActionFigures_SarahMorganScene
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = SarahMorgan
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0063587F
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Have you seen this action figure? &&& SarahMorgan: Oh my god. Is that supposed to be me?
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: And without my permission.
#. EDID: [01065C2D]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001ABE"
msgid "Lighten up, they did their best."
msgstr "진정해, 저 사람들도 최선을 다했잖아."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_ActionFigures_SarahMorgan
#. SceneName = SFFL_ActionFigures_SarahMorganScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = SarahMorgan
#. VoiceType = NPCFSarahMorgan
#. Face = Friendly
#. SoundFileID = 004EC430
#. ScriptNotes = Friendly
#. DialogueBefore = SarahMorgan: Either way, as collectibles go, it's definitely a conversation piece, so feel free to hold on to it.
#. EDID: [01065C2B]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001ABF"
msgid "But I also wouldn't be opposed to you tossing it into the nearest incinerator."
msgstr "그래도 그걸 가장 가까운 소각로에 던져 버리는 것도 반대하진 않을 거야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_ActionFigures_SarahMorgan
#. SceneName = SFFL_ActionFigures_SarahMorganScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = SarahMorgan
#. VoiceType = NPCFSarahMorgan
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 00B7E1C3
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = It's insulting.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: It's insulting.
#. DialogueAfter = SarahMorgan: Either way, as collectibles go, it's definitely a conversation piece, so feel free to hold on to it.
#. EDID: [01065C29]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001AC0"
msgid "You took the words right out of my mouth."
msgstr "내가 하려던 말을 그대로 했네."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_ActionFigures_SarahMorgan
#. SceneName = SFFL_ActionFigures_SarahMorganScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = SarahMorgan
#. VoiceType = NPCFSarahMorgan
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 00A5584A
#. DialogueBefore = SarahMorgan: I don't like to talk about my past. But suffice to say, my history as a soldier was not without trauma.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: You should feel proud.
#. EDID: [01065C26]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001AC1"
msgid "To see me in that uniform, memorialized in this way... I don't know how to feel."
msgstr "내가 그 제복을 입은 모습이 이런 식으로 기념되다니... 기분을 어떻게 받아들여야 할지 모르겠어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_ActionFigures_SarahMorgan
#. SceneName = SFFL_ActionFigures_SarahMorganScene
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = SarahMorgan
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0008F8F2
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Have you seen this action figure? &&& SarahMorgan: Oh my god. Is that supposed to be me?
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: The only evil one is the creator of this... thing.
#. EDID: [01065C2A]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001AC2"
msgid "No, it's clearly your evil twin."
msgstr "아니, 딱 봐도 네 사악한 쌍둥이잖아."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_ActionFigures_SarahMorgan
#. SceneName = SFFL_ActionFigures_SarahMorganScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = SarahMorgan
#. VoiceType = NPCFSarahMorgan
#. Face = Irritated
#. SoundFileID = 0088B17C
#. ScriptNotes = Irritated / to Player Default
#. Prompt = It is. It's from a set of Colony War Heroes.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: It is. It's from a set of Colony War Heroes.
#. DialogueAfter = SarahMorgan: I don't like to talk about my past. But suffice to say, my history as a soldier was not without trauma.
#. EDID: [01065C23]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001AC3"
msgid "Hero? Is that what they're calling me? I find that term almost offensive."
msgstr "영웅? 사람들이 날 그렇게 부른다고? 그 표현은 거의 모욕처럼 느껴지는데."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_ActionFigures_SarahMorgan
#. SceneName = SFFL_ActionFigures_SarahMorganScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = SarahMorgan
#. VoiceType = NPCFSarahMorgan
#. Face = Shocked
#. SoundFileID = 00BE9A21
#. ScriptNotes = Shocked
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Have you seen this action figure?
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: It is. It's from a set of Colony War Heroes.
#. EDID: [01065C22]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001AC4"
msgid "Oh my god. Is that supposed to be me?"
msgstr "맙소사. 이게 나라고 만든 거야?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_ActionFigures_SarahMorgan
#. SceneName = SFFL_ActionFigures_SarahMorganScene
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 007273A2
#. DialogueAfter = SarahMorgan: Oh my god. Is that supposed to be me?
#. EDID: [01065C34]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001AC5"
msgid "Have you seen this action figure?"
msgstr "이 액션 피규어 본 적 있어?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_EC02
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = SarahMorgan
#. VoiceType = NPCFSarahMorgan
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00D99F49
#. ScriptNotes = Companion commenting about the presence of Dax Shepard, likely a criminal, aboard the player's ship. / Serious
#. EDID: [0106C81C]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001AC6"
msgid "I trust you know what you're doing."
msgstr "네가 뭘 하는지 알고 있다고 믿을게."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_EC02
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Barrett
#. VoiceType = NPCMBarrett
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00A44443
#. ScriptNotes = Companion commenting about the presence of Dax Shepard, likely a criminal, aboard the player's ship. / Serious
#. EDID: [0106C816]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001AC7"
msgid "I'll keep an eye on him."
msgstr "내가 그를 지켜볼게."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_EC02
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE_EC02_850_FirstWarning
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = DaxBurroughs
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC02_Dax_Voice
#. Face = Angry
#. SoundFileID = 00DB24FD
#. ScriptNotes = Warning player not to follow him as he walks off into Neon, his destination. / Angry / to Player Default
#. DialogueAfter = DaxBurroughs: Do you have a death wish, or something? Walk away. Now.
#. EDID: [0106D4EE]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001AC8"
msgid "Final warning. Back off, now!"
msgstr "마지막 경고다. 당장 물러서!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_EC02
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE_EC02_850_FirstWarning
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = DaxBurroughs
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC02_Dax_Voice
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00BDB173
#. ScriptNotes = Warning player not to follow him as he walks off into Neon, his destination. / Serious / to Player Default
#. DialogueAfter = DaxBurroughs: Do you have a death wish, or something? Walk away. Now.
#. EDID: [0106D4ED]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001AC9"
msgid "You better back off right now. I'm not joking."
msgstr "당장 물러서는 게 좋을 거야. 농담 아니야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_EC02
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE_EC02_800_WalkingAway
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = DaxBurroughs
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC02_Dax_Voice
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 004E5ACE
#. ScriptNotes = Dax waving away any questions or protests the player may have about getting paid while walking away from the ship and into Neon. / Confident / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = DaxBurroughs: Looks like I made the right choice trusting you after all.|Still, don't follow me or I'll shoot you right down.
#. DialogueAfter = DaxBurroughs: It's been fun.
#. EDID: [0106D4EB]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001ACA"
msgid "Don't worry about your money, you'll get it as soon as I talk to my boss."
msgstr "네 돈은 걱정하지 마. 보스랑 얘기하는 대로 받을 수 있을 테니까."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_EC02
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE_EC02_650_Goodbye
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = DaxBurroughs
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC02_Dax_Voice
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00B7D8D1
#. ScriptNotes = Dax has arrived at destination and is saying goodbye to the player coming to meet them on the tarmac. Coldly threatening. / Serious / to Player Default
#. DialogueAfter = DaxBurroughs: Don't worry about your money, you'll get it as soon as I talk to my boss.
#. EDID: [0106D4F1]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001ACB"
msgid "Still, don't follow me or I'll shoot you right down."
msgstr "그래도 날 따라오면 바로 쏴 버릴 거야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_EC02
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE_EC02_650_Goodbye
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = DaxBurroughs
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC02_Dax_Voice
#. Face = Smug
#. SoundFileID = 00B50F0A
#. ScriptNotes = Dax has arrived at destination and is saying goodbye to the player coming to meet them on the tarmac. A hint of friendliness. / Smug / to Player Default
#. EDID: [0106D4F1]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001ACC"
msgid "Looks like I made the right choice trusting you after all."
msgstr "결국 널 믿은 게 옳은 선택이었던 것 같군."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC02
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Voice
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC02_Dax_Voice
#. Face = Defiant
#. SoundFileID = 001B1C73
#. ScriptNotes = Defiant
#. EDID: [0106AD45]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001ACD"
msgid "Tell me, is your ship worth more than you life?"
msgstr "말해 봐, 네 우주선이 네 목숨보다 더 값어치가 있나?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC02
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Voice
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC02_Dax_Voice
#. Face = Dying
#. SoundFileID = 006AFFB4
#. ScriptNotes = Dying
#. EDID: [0106AD4C]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001ACE"
msgid "This... wasn't supposed to happen."
msgstr "이건... 이렇게 될 일이 아니었는데."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC02
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Voice
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC02_Dax_Voice
#. Face = Dying
#. SoundFileID = 004D9A86
#. ScriptNotes = Dying
#. EDID: [0106AD4D]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001ACF"
msgid "I think you've made your point..."
msgstr "네 뜻은 충분히 전한 것 같군..."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC02
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Voice
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC02_Dax_Voice
#. Face = Dying
#. SoundFileID = 00A1170E
#. ScriptNotes = Dying
#. EDID: [0106AD4B]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001AD0"
msgid "I'll... take your offer now."
msgstr "이제... 네 제안을 받아들이겠어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC02
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC02_Dax_SC_Gangster
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 007E8818
#. EDID: [0106AC3E]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001AD1"
msgid "Drop the act. I'll take you to Neon, no questions asked."
msgstr "연기는 그만해. 아무것도 묻지 않고 네온까지 데려다주지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC02
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC02_Dax_SC_Med01
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00C1B235
#. EDID: [0106AC4B]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001AD2"
msgid "You don't know what you're getting into."
msgstr "네가 무슨 일에 끼어드는지 모르는군."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC02
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC02_Dax_SC_Starborn
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = DaxBurroughs
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC02_Dax_Voice
#. Face = Angry
#. SoundFileID = 008CB242
#. ScriptNotes = Dax derides the Starborn Player's prophetic-sounding words. / Angry / to Player Default
#. EDID: [0106AC5D]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001AD3"
msgid "What the hell are you talking about, fool?"
msgstr "대체 무슨 헛소리를 하는 거야, 멍청아?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC02
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC02_Dax_SC_Med02
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = DaxBurroughs
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC02_Dax_Voice
#. Face = Thinking
#. SoundFileID = 009970F3
#. ScriptNotes = Dax seriously considering taking a different approach than the violent one here - but he's not quite there yet. / Thinking / to Player Default
#. EDID: [0106AC69]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001AD4"
msgid "You mean one where we don't shoot each other to bits? Anything's possible, I guess."
msgstr "서로 산산조각 날 때까지 쏘지 않는 쪽 말이야? 뭐든 가능하긴 하겠지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC02
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC02_Dax_SC_Hard03
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00C4918A
#. EDID: [0106AC44]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001AD5"
msgid "Am I supposed to be impressed?"
msgstr "내가 감탄이라도 해야 하나?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC02
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC02_Dax_SC_Gangster
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = DaxBurroughs
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC02_Dax_Voice
#. Face = Defiant
#. SoundFileID = 00A2768F
#. ScriptNotes = Dax doesn't believe player's offer to take them to Neon (especially since he never told them that's where he needs to go - the player guessed). / Defiant / to Player Default
#. EDID: [0106AC4A]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001AD6"
msgid "I'm sure you'd like me to believe that."
msgstr "내가 그렇게 믿어 주길 바라는 거겠지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC02
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC02_Dax_SC_Hard02
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00FBD13D
#. EDID: [0106AC67]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001AD7"
msgid "Put your gun down now, then we'll talk."
msgstr "지금 총 내려놔. 그럼 얘기하지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC02
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC02_Dax_SC_Starborn
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00033C3B
#. EDID: [0106AC4E]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001AD8"
msgid "I know how this ends for you. It's not too late."
msgstr "네 끝이 어떻게 될지 알아. 아직 늦지 않았어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC02
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC02_Dax_SC_Med01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = DaxBurroughs
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC02_Dax_Voice
#. Face = Defiant
#. SoundFileID = 00CFA071
#. ScriptNotes = Dax is not impressed by the player, and tells them they don't know what they're getting into either. / Defiant / to Player Default
#. EDID: [0106AC55]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001AD9"
msgid "Neither do you."
msgstr "너도 마찬가지야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC02
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC02_Dax_SC_Easy02
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 004E01DB
#. EDID: [0106AC56]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001ADA"
msgid "You really don't need to point that thing at me."
msgstr "그걸 굳이 나한테 겨눌 필요는 없어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC02
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC02_200_DaxIntro
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = DaxBurroughs
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC02_Dax_Voice
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00942867
#. ScriptNotes = The player has convinced Dax to lower their weapon and talk things over instead of shooting each other. / Serious / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = DaxBurroughs: Not sure what there is to talk about here.
#. DialogueAfter = DaxBurroughs: I need to get to Neon as fast as possible without being seen. Think you can handle that?
#. EDID: [0106AC57]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001ADB"
msgid "All right, we'll do it your way then."
msgstr "좋아, 그럼 네 방식대로 하지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC02
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC02_Dax_SC_Easy01
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0078AB28
#. EDID: [0106AC41]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001ADC"
msgid "You're right, no one needs to get hurt."
msgstr "네 말이 맞아. 아무도 다칠 필요 없어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC02
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC02_200_DaxIntro
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = DaxBurroughs
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 009EC4B2
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = DaxBurroughs: Move a muscle and I'll shoot. &&& DaxBurroughs: No one needs to get hurt. I just need your ship.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: So did I.
#. EDID: [0106AC48]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001ADD"
msgid "[Attack] Oh well, I gave you a chance."
msgstr "[공격] 뭐, 기회는 줬어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC02
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC02_300_DaxLowersWeapon
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = DaxBurroughs
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00F06739
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Let's talk this through. &&& ... &&& DaxBurroughs: All right, we'll do it your way then. &&& DaxBurroughs: Is there a problem? &&& DaxBurroughs: I took the fall for someone else after a bank robbery went wrong. I ended up inside for a while.|One day there was an opportunity to get out, and I took it. Then I took this piece of crap ship.|Then I had a grav jump failure, ended up with just enough power for life support, then you showed up.|Is that enough for you? Can we go now?
#. EDID: [0106AC9A]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001ADE"
msgid "Okay, let's go."
msgstr "좋아, 가자."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC02
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC02_Dax_SC_Easy04
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = DaxBurroughs
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC02_Dax_Voice
#. Face = Suspicious
#. SoundFileID = 001969AD
#. ScriptNotes = Dax is starting to consider that maybe he can negotiate with the player instead of threatening them with his gun. / Suspicious / to Player Default
#. EDID: [0106AC3F]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001ADF"
msgid "As simple as that, huh?"
msgstr "그렇게 간단하다고?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC02
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC02_200_DaxIntro
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = DaxBurroughs
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC02_Dax_Voice
#. Face = Stern
#. SoundFileID = 005288A5
#. ScriptNotes = Telling the player they gave them a chance to avoid combat as well, before starting combat. / Stern / to Player Default
#. Prompt = [Attack] Oh well, I gave you a chance.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: [Attack] Oh well, I gave you a chance.
#. DialogueAfter = DaxBurroughs: All right, we'll do it your way then.
#. EDID: [0106AC4D]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001AE0"
msgid "So did I."
msgstr "나도 그랬어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC02
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC02_Dax_SC_Easy02
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = DaxBurroughs
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC02_Dax_Voice
#. Face = Defiant
#. SoundFileID = 001B4934
#. ScriptNotes = Dax is a violent man. Here he's hinting that he could take the non-violent approach towards the player, but prefers not to. / Defiant / to Player Default
#. EDID: [0106AC66]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001AE1"
msgid "I don't need to, I *want* to."
msgstr "그럴 필요는 없지. 내가 그러고 싶은 거야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC02
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC02_Dax_SC_Easy01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = DaxBurroughs
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC02_Dax_Voice
#. Face = Defiant
#. SoundFileID = 008A82C2
#. ScriptNotes = It's just as simple as that: you don't want trouble, then just give me your ship. / Defiant / to Player Default
#. EDID: [0106AC64]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001AE2"
msgid "Then give me your ship."
msgstr "그럼 네 우주선을 넘겨."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC02
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC02_300_DaxLowersWeapon
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = DaxBurroughs
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC02_Dax_Voice
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 001CC8C8
#. ScriptNotes = Dax shutting down player's empathetic question about people who might be coming to Dax's rescue. / Serious / to Player Default
#. Prompt = No one's even trying to rescue you?
#. DialogueAfter = DaxBurroughs: Sure. I'll just say you're my brother-in-law.
#. EDID: [0106ACA5]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001AE3"
msgid "Every person for themselves, am I right?"
msgstr "각자도생이지, 안 그래?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC02
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC02_300_DaxLowersWeapon
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = DaxBurroughs
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC02_Dax_Voice
#. Face = Sarcastic
#. SoundFileID = 00BBD432
#. ScriptNotes = Dax shutting down player's empathetic question about people who might be coming to Dax's rescue. / Sarcastic / to Player Default
#. Prompt = No one's even trying to rescue you?
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: No one's even trying to rescue you?
#. EDID: [0106ACA5]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001AE4"
msgid "Aw, stop, you're going to make me cry."
msgstr "아, 그만해. 눈물 날 것 같잖아."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC02
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC02_300_DaxLowersWeapon
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = DaxBurroughs
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00456A4B
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Let's talk this through. &&& ... &&& DaxBurroughs: All right, we'll do it your way then. &&& DaxBurroughs: I need to get to Neon as fast as possible without being seen. Think you can handle that? &&& DaxBurroughs: I took the fall for someone else after a bank robbery went wrong. I ended up inside for a while.|One day there was an opportunity to get out, and I took it. Then I took this piece of crap ship.|Then I had a grav jump failure, ended up with just enough power for life support, then you showed up.|Is that enough for you? Can we go now?
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Not in this area, as far as I know. I got pretty far before the thing died on me.
#. EDID: [0106AC90]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001AE5"
msgid "Anyone looking for you we should worry about?"
msgstr "널 찾는 사람이 있다면 우리가 걱정해야 할까?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC02
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC02_300_DaxLowersWeapon
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = DaxBurroughs
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC02_Dax_Voice
#. Face = Smug
#. SoundFileID = 007ACF83
#. ScriptNotes = Smug / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Anyone looking for you we should worry about?
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Anyone looking for you we should worry about?
#. DialogueAfter = DaxBurroughs: Sure. I'll just say you're my brother-in-law.
#. EDID: [0106ACA6]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001AE6"
msgid "Not in this area, as far as I know. I got pretty far before the thing died on me."
msgstr "내가 아는 한 이 근처엔 없어. 그게 고장 나기 전에 꽤 멀리 왔거든."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC02
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC02_300_DaxLowersWeapon
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = DaxBurroughs
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC02_Dax_Voice
#. Face = Rage
#. SoundFileID = 00471BC2
#. ScriptNotes = Angry Dax reacting to the player attacking him after telling him they wanted to negotiate. / Rage / to Player Default
#. Prompt = [Attack] Yeah, you know what? I lied.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: [Attack] Yeah, you know what? I lied.
#. EDID: [0106AC97]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001AE7"
msgid "I damn well knew it!"
msgstr "역시 그럴 줄 알았어!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC02
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC02_300_DaxLowersWeapon
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = DaxBurroughs
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00482107
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Let's talk this through. &&& ... &&& DaxBurroughs: All right, we'll do it your way then. &&& DaxBurroughs: I need to get to Neon as fast as possible without being seen. Think you can handle that? &&& DaxBurroughs: I took the fall for someone else after a bank robbery went wrong. I ended up inside for a while.|One day there was an opportunity to get out, and I took it. Then I took this piece of crap ship.|Then I had a grav jump failure, ended up with just enough power for life support, then you showed up.|Is that enough for you? Can we go now?
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: I damn well knew it!
#. EDID: [0106AC98]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001AE8"
msgid "[Attack] Yeah, you know what? I lied."
msgstr "[공격] 그래, 있잖아? 거짓말했어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC02
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC02_300_DaxLowersWeapon
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = DaxBurroughs
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC02_Dax_Voice
#. Face = Somber
#. SoundFileID = 00D35138
#. ScriptNotes = Dax mulling whether to accept the player's threatening demand for money, or instead to just shoot them on the spot. / Somber / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Pay me now or die here. It's your choice.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Pay me now or die here. It's your choice.
#. EDID: [0106AC93]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001AE9"
msgid "So that's how it's going to be, huh? All right, I get it."
msgstr "그래, 그렇게 나오겠다 이거지? 좋아, 알겠어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC02
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC02_300_DaxLowersWeapon
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Voice
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC02_Dax_Voice
#. Face = Smirk
#. SoundFileID = 007D6BEC
#. ScriptNotes = Dax is genuinely amused by the player's suggestion that he pose as their brother-in-law. / Smirk / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Sure. I'll just say you're my brother-in-law.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Sure. I'll just say you're my brother-in-law.
#. EDID: [0106AC95]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001AEA"
msgid "Heh, why not. Let's go then."
msgstr "헤, 왜 안 되겠어. 그럼 가자."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC02
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC02_300_DaxLowersWeapon
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = DaxBurroughs
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC02_Dax_Voice
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 00F656B7
#. ScriptNotes = Dax has accepted to talk to the player instead of shooting them, and tells them what they need. / Confident / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = DaxBurroughs: All right, we'll do it your way then.
#. DialogueAfter = DaxBurroughs: Sure. I'll just say you're my brother-in-law.
#. EDID: [0106AC9C]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001AEB"
msgid "I need to get to Neon as fast as possible without being seen. Think you can handle that?"
msgstr "남들 눈에 띄지 않고 최대한 빨리 네온까지 가야 해. 해낼 수 있겠어?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC02
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC02_300_DaxLowersWeapon
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = DaxBurroughs
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC02_Dax_Voice
#. Face = Irritated
#. SoundFileID = 00733363
#. ScriptNotes = Dax recounts the series of events that led him there in a hurried, slightly exasperated way. / Irritated / to Player Default
#. DialogueAfter = DaxBurroughs: Sure. I'll just say you're my brother-in-law.
#. EDID: [0106AD3F]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001AEC"
msgid "Is that enough for you? Can we go now?"
msgstr "이제 충분해? 이제 가도 돼?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC02
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC02_300_DaxLowersWeapon
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = DaxBurroughs
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC02_Dax_Voice
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00569271
#. ScriptNotes = Dax recounts the series of events that led him there in a hurried, slightly exasperated way. / Neutral / to Player Default
#. EDID: [0106AD3F]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001AED"
msgid "Then I had a grav jump failure, ended up with just enough power for life support, then you showed up."
msgstr "그다음 중력 도약 고장이 나서 생명 유지 장치에 쓸 전력만 겨우 남았고, 그러다 네가 나타난 거야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC02
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC02_300_DaxLowersWeapon
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = DaxBurroughs
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC02_Dax_Voice
#. Face = Sarcastic
#. SoundFileID = 00515465
#. ScriptNotes = Dax recounts the series of events that led him there in a hurried, slightly exasperated way. / Sarcastic / to Player Default
#. EDID: [0106AD3F]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001AEE"
msgid "One day there was an opportunity to get out, and I took it. Then I took this piece of crap ship."
msgstr "어느 날 빠져나갈 기회가 생겼고, 난 그걸 잡았어. 그리고 이 고물 우주선을 가져왔지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC02
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC02_300_DaxLowersWeapon
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = DaxBurroughs
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC02_Dax_Voice
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 00FEE950
#. ScriptNotes = Dax recounts the series of events that led him there in a hurried, slightly exasperated way. / Confident / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = DaxBurroughs: I need to get to Neon as fast as possible without being seen. Think you can handle that?
#. EDID: [0106AD3F]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001AEF"
msgid "I took the fall for someone else after a bank robbery went wrong. I ended up inside for a while."
msgstr "은행 강도 사건이 잘못된 뒤에 남 대신 죄를 뒤집어썼어. 그래서 한동안 안에 있었지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC02
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC02_300_DaxLowersWeapon
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = DaxBurroughs
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00A44015
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Let's talk this through. &&& ... &&& DaxBurroughs: All right, we'll do it your way then. &&& DaxBurroughs: I need to get to Neon as fast as possible without being seen. Think you can handle that? &&& DaxBurroughs: I took the fall for someone else after a bank robbery went wrong. I ended up inside for a while.|One day there was an opportunity to get out, and I took it. Then I took this piece of crap ship.|Then I had a grav jump failure, ended up with just enough power for life support, then you showed up.|Is that enough for you? Can we go now?
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: You're starting to get on my nerves, you know that? All right, where to start...
#. EDID: [0106AD3D]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001AF0"
msgid "What else can you tell me before I take you aboard?"
msgstr "널 태우기 전에 더 해 줄 말이 있나?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_EC07_MiscDialogue
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Voice
#. VoiceType = SFFL_SE_EC07_Hannah_Voice
#. Face = Apologetic
#. SoundFileID = 000B765E
#. ScriptNotes = Sincerely grateful to the player for rescuing her, if in a hurry. / Apologetic
#. EDID: [0106481B]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001AF2"
msgid "Miss Krause is waiting for me, but maybe we can catch up later? Bye!"
msgstr "크라우스 씨가 날 기다리고 있지만, 나중에 또 얘기할 수 있겠죠? 안녕!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_EC07_MiscDialogue
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Voice
#. VoiceType = SFFL_SE_EC07_Hannah_Voice
#. Face = Happy
#. SoundFileID = 00241491
#. ScriptNotes = Sincerely grateful to the player for rescuing her, if in a hurry. / Happy
#. EDID: [0106481B]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001AF3"
msgid "Oh, hello! Always great to see you!"
msgstr "아, 안녕하세요! 언제 봐도 정말 반가워요!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_EC07_MiscDialogue
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Voice
#. VoiceType = SFFL_SE_EC07_Hannah_Voice
#. Face = Apologetic
#. SoundFileID = 007CE70B
#. ScriptNotes = Sincerely grateful to the player for rescuing her, if in a hurry. / Apologetic
#. EDID: [01064819]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001AF4"
msgid "I have to run now, but thanks again for everything!"
msgstr "이제 가 봐야 하지만, 다시 한번 정말 고마워요!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_EC07_MiscDialogue
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Voice
#. VoiceType = SFFL_SE_EC07_Hannah_Voice
#. Face = Amused
#. SoundFileID = 000DC2A9
#. ScriptNotes = Sincerely grateful to the player for rescuing her, if in a hurry. / Amused
#. EDID: [01064819]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001AF5"
msgid "Hello! Fancy meeting you here."
msgstr "안녕하세요! 여기서 만나다니 반갑네요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_EC07_MiscDialogue
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Voice
#. VoiceType = SFFL_SE_EC07_Hannah_Voice
#. Face = Grateful
#. SoundFileID = 0045958C
#. ScriptNotes = Sincerely grateful to the player for rescuing her. / Grateful
#. EDID: [01064813]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001AF6"
msgid "I'll never forget what you did for me."
msgstr "당신이 제게 해 준 일은 절대 잊지 않을게요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_EC07_MiscDialogue
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Voice
#. VoiceType = SFFL_SE_EC07_Ruby_Voice
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 0033C134
#. ScriptNotes = Ruby meeting the player in the street. / Confident
#. EDID: [0106480E]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001AF7"
msgid "So nice to see you again."
msgstr "다시 만나서 정말 반가워요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_EC07_MiscDialogue
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Voice
#. VoiceType = SFFL_SE_EC07_Ruby_Voice
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 008F1DF2
#. ScriptNotes = Ruby meeting the player in the street. A bit dismissive. / Confident
#. EDID: [0106480B]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001AF8"
msgid "I have to run, but let's have lunch one day."
msgstr "가 봐야 하지만, 언젠가 같이 점심 먹어요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_EC07_MiscDialogue
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Voice
#. VoiceType = SFFL_SE_EC07_Ruby_Voice
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 007F2779
#. ScriptNotes = Ruby meeting the player in the street. / Confident
#. EDID: [0106480B]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001AF9"
msgid "Oh, hello! I hope everything is good with you."
msgstr "아, 안녕하세요! 모든 일이 잘 풀리고 있길 바라요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_EC07_MiscDialogue
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Voice
#. VoiceType = SFFL_SE_EC07_Ruby_Voice
#. Face = Friendly
#. SoundFileID = 004A1B64
#. ScriptNotes = Ruby meeting the player in the street. / Friendly
#. EDID: [01064809]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001AFA"
msgid "Until next time, then."
msgstr "그럼 다음에 또 봐요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_EC07_MiscDialogue
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Voice
#. VoiceType = SFFL_SE_EC07_Ruby_Voice
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 00ECCEBD
#. ScriptNotes = Ruby meeting the player in the street. / Confident
#. EDID: [01064809]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001AFB"
msgid "That was quite the adventure we had in that minefield, wasn't it?"
msgstr "그 기뢰밭에서 겪은 일은 꽤 대단한 모험이었죠?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC07
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Voice
#. VoiceType = SFFL_SE_EC07_Ruby_Voice
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 0067FB91
#. ScriptNotes = Sounding eager to get to the player's ship.
#. EDID: [0106A4E8]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001AFC"
msgid "We're right behind you."
msgstr "바로 뒤따라가겠습니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_EC07
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Voice
#. VoiceType = SFFL_SE_EC07_Ruby_Voice
#. Face = Somber
#. SoundFileID = 0008806F
#. ScriptNotes = Ruby is not happy that they are taking her assistant Hannah back with them to the player's ship, instead of leaving her behind. / Somber
#. EDID: [0106A4E7]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001AFD"
msgid "That ship better not get stolen while we're gone."
msgstr "우리가 없는 동안 그 우주선이 도난당하지 않으면 좋겠군."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC07
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Voice
#. VoiceType = SFFL_SE_EC07_Ruby_Voice
#. Face = Defiant
#. SoundFileID = 00D31C4E
#. ScriptNotes = Ruby is not happy that they are taking her assistant Hannah back with them to the player's ship, instead of leaving her behind. / Defiant
#. EDID: [0106A4E6]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001AFE"
msgid "Let the record show that I don't approve of this."
msgstr "기록으로 남겨 두자면, 난 이 일에 찬성하지 않아."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC07
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Voice
#. VoiceType = SFFL_SE_EC07_Ruby_Voice
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 008A467F
#. ScriptNotes = Almost sounding impatient, but polite.
#. EDID: [0106A4E4]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001AFF"
msgid "Lead the way, I'm right behind you."
msgstr "앞장서, 바로 뒤따라갈게."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC07
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Voice
#. VoiceType = SFFL_SE_EC07_Ruby_Voice
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 00C946B2
#. ScriptNotes = Trying to reassure the player after they left her assistant alone on the derelict ship inside a minefield.
#. EDID: [0106A4E2]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001B00"
msgid "Don't worry about Hannah, she can take care of herself."
msgstr "한나는 걱정하지 마. 자기 몸은 알아서 지킬 수 있어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC07
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Voice
#. VoiceType = SFFL_SE_EC07_Hannah_Voice
#. Face = Relieved
#. SoundFileID = 004C058A
#. ScriptNotes = Trying to keep her composure inside a damaged spaceship in a minefield. / Relieved
#. EDID: [0106A4E0]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001B01"
msgid "I can't wait to get out of here!"
msgstr "여기서 나가고 싶어서 못 참겠어!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC07
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC07_215_HannahReacts
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = HannahFrye
#. VoiceType = SFFL_SE_EC07_Hannah_Voice
#. Face = Pleading
#. SoundFileID = 00F292AA
#. ScriptNotes = Hannah's voice is cracking as she's on the verge of losing it, but can't do that in front of her boss. / Pleading / to RubyKrause
#. DialogueBefore = HannahFrye: Wait, what?|I really have to stay behind? What if the pirates come back? &&& RubyKrause: This is a very expensive ship, we can't just abandon it.|You'll be fine. I'll send for you as soon as I get back.
#. DialogueAfter = RubyKrause: She'll be fine. She's a real trooper.
#. EDID: [01068028]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001B02"
msgid "We're in the middle of a minefield!"
msgstr "우린 지금 기뢰밭 한가운데 있어!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC07
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC07_120_HannahDialogue
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Voice
#. VoiceType = SFFL_SE_EC07_Hannah_Voice
#. Face = Relieved
#. SoundFileID = 001FB7F6
#. ScriptNotes = Talking to the player from behind a large ship door that's been locked. Hopeful that the player will find a way to get them out. / Relieved / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Don't worry, this shouldn't take long.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Don't worry, this shouldn't take long.
#. DialogueAfter = HannahFrye: Miss Krause promises that GalBank will reward you adequately for your time.
#. EDID: [010655D4]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001B03"
msgid "That's great! Thank you so much!"
msgstr "정말 잘됐어요! 정말 고마워요!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC07
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC07_120_HannahDialogue
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = HannahFrye
#. VoiceType = SFFL_SE_EC07_Hannah_Voice
#. Face = Worried
#. SoundFileID = 000533A7
#. ScriptNotes = Talking to the player from behind a large ship door that's been locked. Hopeful that the player will find a way to get them out. / Worried / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = HannahFrye: Thank you so much for coming to our rescue!
#. DialogueAfter = HannahFrye: Don't worry, this shouldn't take long.
#. EDID: [010655D5]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001B04"
msgid "Can you find a way to open the door?"
msgstr "문을 열 방법을 찾아줄 수 있나요?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC07
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC07_120_HannahDialogue
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = HannahFrye
#. VoiceType = SFFL_SE_EC07_Hannah_Voice
#. Face = Grateful
#. SoundFileID = 00581050
#. ScriptNotes = Talking to the player from behind a large ship door that's been locked. / Grateful / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = HannahFrye:
#. DialogueAfter = HannahFrye: Can you find a way to open the door?
#. EDID: [010655D3]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001B05"
msgid "Thank you so much for coming to our rescue!"
msgstr "우릴 구하러 와 주셔서 정말 감사합니다!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC07
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC07_120_HannahDialogue
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = HannahFrye
#. VoiceType = SFFL_SE_EC07_Hannah_Voice
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 003850D0
#. ScriptNotes = Trying to sound as professional as possible while talking through a locked ship door. / Confident
#. DialogueBefore = HannahFrye: That's great! Thank you so much!
#. DialogueAfter = HannahFrye: Don't worry, this shouldn't take long.
#. EDID: [01065FA0]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001B06"
msgid "Miss Krause promises that GalBank will reward you adequately for your time."
msgstr "크라우스 씨는 갤뱅크가 당신의 수고에 충분한 보상을 할 거라고 약속했습니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC07
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC07_120_HannahDialogue
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = HannahFrye
#. VoiceType = SFFL_SE_EC07_Hannah_Voice
#. Face = Confused
#. SoundFileID = 00E01549
#. ScriptNotes = A bit taken aback by the player's request to know what they'll get for helping them out. / Confused / to Player Default
#. Prompt = What do I get for helping you?
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: What do I get for helping you?
#. DialogueAfter = HannahFrye: Miss Krause promises that GalBank will reward you adequately for your time.
#. EDID: [01065F9F]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001B07"
msgid "Uh, let me ask Miss Krause."
msgstr "어, 크라우스 씨께 물어볼게요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC07
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC07_210_RubyOnly
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = RubyKrause
#. VoiceType = SFFL_SE_EC07_Ruby_Voice
#. Face = Question
#. SoundFileID = 000C6545
#. ScriptNotes = Ruby is quite ready to go to the player's ship, but still keeps it cool. / Question / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = RubyKrause: On behalf of the GalBank consortium, thank you for coming to our assistance.|We are in need of a temporary transportation service, as it were.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: All right, let's go.
#. EDID: [01068033]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001B08"
msgid "Shall we go then?"
msgstr "그럼 갈까요?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC07
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC07_100_HannahDialogue
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = HannahFrye
#. VoiceType = SFFL_SE_EC07_Hannah_Voice
#. Face = Nervous
#. SoundFileID = 001B8434
#. ScriptNotes = Calling out to the player from behind a large ship door that's been locked. / Nervous / to Player Default
#. DialogueAfter = HannahFrye: Thank you so much for coming to our rescue!
#. EDID: [010655DB]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001B09"
msgid "The door won't open from the inside."
msgstr "문은 안쪽에서 열리지 않아요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC07
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC07_100_HannahDialogue
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = HannahFrye
#. VoiceType = SFFL_SE_EC07_Hannah_Voice
#. Face = Pleading
#. SoundFileID = 00D80258
#. ScriptNotes = Calling out to the player from behind a large ship door that's been locked. / Pleading / to Player Default
#. DialogueAfter = HannahFrye: Thank you so much for coming to our rescue!
#. EDID: [010655DA]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001B0A"
msgid "Come closer!"
msgstr "가까이 와요!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC07
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC07_100_HannahDialogue
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = HannahFrye
#. VoiceType = SFFL_SE_EC07_Hannah_Voice
#. Face = Worried
#. SoundFileID = 001A74EA
#. ScriptNotes = Calling out to the player from behind a large ship door that's been locked. / Worried / to Player Default
#. DialogueAfter = HannahFrye: Thank you so much for coming to our rescue!
#. EDID: [010655D9]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001B0B"
msgid "We're both in here!"
msgstr "우리 둘 다 여기 있어요!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC07
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC07_210_RubyOnly
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = RubyKrause
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00CB1963
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = HannahFrye: &&& ... &&& RubyKrause: Thank you, Hannah, I'll handle it from here. &&& RubyKrause: On behalf of the GalBank consortium, thank you for coming to our assistance.|We are in need of a temporary transportation service, as it were. &&& RubyKrause: Are you done thinking now?
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: You'll be taking me to New Atlantis, so I can report this attack to headquarters in person.
#. EDID: [01065FA6]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001B0C"
msgid "So where should I take you two?"
msgstr "그럼 두 분을 어디로 모셔다드리면 될까요?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC07
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC07_120_HannahDialogue
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = HannahFrye
#. VoiceType = SFFL_SE_EC07_Hannah_Voice
#. Face = Nervous
#. SoundFileID = 0072CC45
#. ScriptNotes = Talking to the player from behind a large ship door that's been locked. Trying to be delicate when talking about her dead colleagues inside the ship. / Nervous / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Can't you open the door from the inside?
#. DialogueAfter = HannahFrye: Don't worry, this shouldn't take long.
#. EDID: [01065FA4]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001B0D"
msgid "But perhaps you can find the key on one of the people who are, um, no longer alive?"
msgstr "하지만, 음, 이제 살아 있지 않은 사람들 중 하나한테서 열쇠를 찾을 수 있을지도 모르죠."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC07
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC07_120_HannahDialogue
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = HannahFrye
#. VoiceType = SFFL_SE_EC07_Hannah_Voice
#. Face = Sad
#. SoundFileID = 00BE3F6F
#. ScriptNotes = Talking to the player from behind a large ship door that's been locked. Hopeful that the player will find a way to get them out. / Sad / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Can't you open the door from the inside?
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Can't you open the door from the inside?
#. EDID: [01065FA4]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001B0E"
msgid "No, we don't have the key and the manual override is damaged."
msgstr "아니요, 열쇠는 없고 수동 재정의 장치도 손상됐어요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC07
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Voice
#. VoiceType = SFFL_SE_EC07_Ruby_Voice
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00D008BF
#. ScriptNotes = Letting her own concern briefly shine through. / Serious
#. EDID: SFFL_BE_EC07SharedInfo02
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001B0F"
msgid "We should probably go before any more pirates arrive."
msgstr "해적이 더 오기 전에 가는 게 좋겠어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC07
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC07_210_RubyOnly
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = RubyKrause
#. VoiceType = SFFL_SE_EC07_Ruby_Voice
#. Face = Sarcastic
#. SoundFileID = 00275765
#. ScriptNotes = Sounding a bit less formal. / Sarcastic / to Player Default
#. DialogueAfter = RubyKrause: All right, let's go.
#. EDID: [01065FA9]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001B10"
msgid "We are in need of a temporary transportation service, as it were."
msgstr "그러니까, 일시적인 운송 서비스가 필요한 상황입니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC07
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC07_210_RubyOnly
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = RubyKrause
#. VoiceType = SFFL_SE_EC07_Ruby_Voice
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 00CAC485
#. ScriptNotes = Sounding very official. / Confident / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = RubyKrause: Thank you, Hannah, I'll handle it from here.
#. EDID: [01065FA9]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001B11"
msgid "On behalf of the GalBank consortium, thank you for coming to our assistance."
msgstr "갤뱅크 차관단을 대표해, 저희를 도와주러 와 주셔서 감사합니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC07
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC07_200_HannahRubyDialogue
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = HannahFrye
#. VoiceType = SFFL_SE_EC07_Hannah_Voice
#. Face = Happy
#. SoundFileID = 0099E286
#. ScriptNotes = Almost laughing with relief. / Happy / to Player Default
#. DialogueAfter = RubyKrause: Thank you, Hannah, I'll handle it from here.
#. EDID: [01065FA8]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001B12"
msgid "I have to say, I was starting to worry we'd never get out of this ship!"
msgstr "솔직히 말해서, 우리가 이 우주선에서 영영 못 나가는 건 아닌지 걱정되기 시작했어요!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC07
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC07_200_HannahRubyDialogue
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = HannahFrye
#. VoiceType = SFFL_SE_EC07_Hannah_Voice
#. Face = Relieved
#. SoundFileID = 007D3F26
#. ScriptNotes = Relieved and excited that the player was able to unlock the cockpit door, freeing them. / Relieved / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = HannahFrye:
#. EDID: [01065FA8]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001B13"
msgid "Great, you found a way to open that door!"
msgstr "좋아요, 그 문을 열 방법을 찾았군요!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC07
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC07_120_HannahDialogue
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = HannahFrye
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00F0E1E6
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = HannahFrye: &&& HannahFrye: Thank you so much for coming to our rescue! &&& HannahFrye: Can you find a way to open the door?
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: No, we don't have the key and the manual override is damaged.
#. EDID: [01065FA1]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001B14"
msgid "Can't you open the door from the inside?"
msgstr "안쪽에서 문을 열 수는 없나요?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC07
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC07_220_Hannah
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = HannahFrye
#. VoiceType = SFFL_SE_EC07_Hannah_Voice
#. Face = Apologetic
#. SoundFileID = 009D56D2
#. ScriptNotes = Trying to keep a brave face, but scared to be left alone in the minefield. / Apologetic / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Does she always treat you like this?
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Does she always treat you like this?
#. DialogueAfter = HannahFrye: I'm not leaving you behind.
#. EDID: [01068022]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001B15"
msgid "What? Oh no, that's fine, don't worry about it. She'll send for me. I'll be fine."
msgstr "뭐라고요? 아뇨, 괜찮아요. 걱정하지 마세요. 그분이 절 부를 거예요. 전 괜찮을 겁니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC07
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC07_220_Hannah
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = HannahFrye
#. VoiceType = SFFL_SE_EC07_Hannah_Voice
#. Face = Sad
#. SoundFileID = 00172E1E
#. ScriptNotes = Trying to remain strong and positive even though she's scared. / Sad / to Player Default
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: I'm not leaving you behind.
#. EDID: [0106803E]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001B16"
msgid "Did you want to ask me something?"
msgstr "제게 묻고 싶은 게 있었나요?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC07
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC07_215_HannahReacts
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = HannahFrye
#. VoiceType = SFFL_SE_EC07_Hannah_Voice
#. Face = Afraid
#. SoundFileID = 0052D830
#. ScriptNotes = Still hoping that Miss Krause will reconsider leaving her behind. / Afraid / to RubyKrause
#. DialogueAfter = RubyKrause: This is a very expensive ship, we can't just abandon it.
#. EDID: [01068039]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001B17"
msgid "I really have to stay behind? What if the pirates come back?"
msgstr "제가 정말 뒤에 남아야 하나요? 해적들이 돌아오면 어떡해요?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC07
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC07_215_HannahReacts
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = HannahFrye
#. VoiceType = SFFL_SE_EC07_Hannah_Voice
#. Face = Worried
#. SoundFileID = 0027665D
#. ScriptNotes = Hannah reacts with barely-contained surprise at the news that they will leave her behind in the minefield. / Worried / to RubyKrause
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: All right, let's go. &&& RubyKrause: I'm right behind you.
#. EDID: [01068039]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001B18"
msgid "Wait, what?"
msgstr "잠깐, 뭐라고요?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC07
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC07_210_RubyOnly
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = RubyKrause
#. VoiceType = SFFL_SE_EC07_Ruby_Voice
#. Face = Irritated
#. SoundFileID = 00F6C740
#. ScriptNotes = Ruby leaving the fate of Hannah in the player's hands. / Irritated / to Player Default
#. Prompt = I'm not leaving her behind, it's too risky.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I'm not leaving her behind, it's too risky.
#. DialogueAfter = HannahFrye: Wait, what?
#. EDID: [01068025]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001B19"
msgid "As I said before, it's your call."
msgstr "아까 말했듯이, 당신이 결정할 일이에요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC07
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC07_220_Hannah
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = HannahFrye
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 000E02B5
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = HannahFrye: I'm sorry, I'm not normally this emotional, um...It's been a rough day.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Thanks, I appreciate it.
#. EDID: [01068034]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001B1A"
msgid "I'll make sure there are no pirates around before leaving."
msgstr "떠나기 전에 주변에 해적이 없는지 확인하겠습니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC07
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC07_220_Hannah
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = HannahFrye
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0088F4E7
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = HannahFrye: I'm sorry, I'm not normally this emotional, um...It's been a rough day.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Uh, yeah...I'll be all right. As long as I don't drift into the mines, I guess.
#. EDID: [0106802E]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001B1B"
msgid "Are you sure you're okay staying here?"
msgstr "여기 남아 있어도 정말 괜찮겠어요?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC07
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC07_210_RubyOnly
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = RubyKrause
#. VoiceType = SFFL_SE_EC07_Ruby_Voice
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 0075108F
#. ScriptNotes = A bit irritated that the player didn't jump right away at the chance of rescuing them. / Serious / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Let me think about it.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Let me think about it.
#. DialogueAfter = HannahFrye: Wait, what?
#. EDID: [01068029]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001B1C"
msgid "Sure, take your time."
msgstr "물론이죠, 천천히 하세요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC07
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC07_230_HannahDialogue
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = HannahFrye
#. VoiceType = SFFL_SE_EC07_Hannah_Voice
#. Face = Amused
#. SoundFileID = 0035812D
#. ScriptNotes = Hannah tells the player not to worry after he stood up for her to her boss. / Amused / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = HannahFrye: Thanks again for taking me with you.
#. EDID: [01069D96]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001B1D"
msgid "Don't worry about me, Ruby - I mean, Miss Krause needs me too much to fire me."
msgstr "전 걱정하지 마세요, 루비. 아니, 크라우스 씨는 제가 너무 필요해서 절 해고 못 해요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC07
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC07_210_RubyOnly
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = RubyKrause
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 007D80B8
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = HannahFrye: &&& ... &&& RubyKrause: Thank you, Hannah, I'll handle it from here. &&& RubyKrause: On behalf of the GalBank consortium, thank you for coming to our assistance.|We are in need of a temporary transportation service, as it were. &&& RubyKrause: Are you done thinking now?
#. EDID: [0106D505]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001B1E"
msgid "Just tell me where I need to take you two."
msgstr "두 분을 어디로 데려가야 하는지만 말해 주세요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_KT01_MoldBlobs
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE_KT01_MoldBlobsScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = XMarker
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMGenericMale04
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00721FAD
#. DialogueBefore = XMarker: Warning. Hazardous microorganisms detected. Critical systems damaged.
#. EDID: [010649A7]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001B1F"
msgid "All personnel, please evacuate the ship immediately."
msgstr "전 직원은 즉시 우주선에서 대피하십시오."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_KT01_MoldBlobs
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE_KT01_MoldBlobsScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = XMarker
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMGenericMale04
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00D2475E
#. DialogueAfter = XMarker: All personnel, please evacuate the ship immediately.
#. EDID: [010649A6]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001B20"
msgid "Warning. Hazardous microorganisms detected. Critical systems damaged."
msgstr "경고. 유해 미생물 감지. 주요 시스템 손상."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_KT01_MoldBlobs
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE_KT01_MoldBlobsSceneEnd
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = XMarker
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMGenericMale04
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00A3FDF7
#. DialogueAfter = XMarker: Critical systems unresponsive. All personnel, please evacuate the ship at your earliest convenience.
#. EDID: [0106B98F]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001B21"
msgid "Hazardous organisms removed."
msgstr "유해 생명체 제거 완료."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03_RC_RomanYuraFriends01
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_RC_RomanYuraFriends01Scene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Yura
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFYura
#. Face = Amused
#. SoundFileID = 000193F4
#. ScriptNotes = Playful tone. / Amused / to Roman
#. DialogueBefore = Yura: &&& Roman:
#. EDID: [0105CEF7]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001B23"
msgid "I'll still never forget that last job, and the scars sure won't let us forget either."
msgstr "난 아직도 그 마지막 일을 잊지 못해. 흉터도 우리가 잊지 못하게 해 주고 있고."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03_RC_RomanYuraFriends01
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_RC_RomanYuraFriends01Scene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Yura
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFYura
#. Face = Amused
#. SoundFileID = 00D533B2
#. ScriptNotes = Playful tone. / Amused / to Roman
#. DialogueBefore = Yura: &&& Roman:
#. EDID: [0105CEF5]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001B24"
msgid "That was still a good time, though. Even if half of it was in that backstreet ER."
msgstr "그래도 즐거웠지. 절반은 뒷골목 응급실에서 보냈지만."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03_RC_RomanYuraFriends01
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_RC_RomanYuraFriends01Scene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Roman
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRomanKreutz
#. Face = Apologetic
#. SoundFileID = 00225DA9
#. ScriptNotes = Apologetic / to Yura
#. DialogueBefore = Roman: &&& Yura:
#. EDID: [0105CE9E]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001B25"
msgid "I think we both know the less I have to say the better."
msgstr "말을 적게 할수록 좋다는 건 우리 둘 다 알잖아."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03_RC_RomanYuraFriends01
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_RC_RomanYuraFriends01Scene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Yura
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFYura
#. Face = Amused
#. SoundFileID = 0040A66D
#. ScriptNotes = Playful tone. / Amused / to Roman
#. DialogueBefore = Yura: &&& Roman:
#. EDID: [0105CEC2]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001B26"
msgid "Just don't embarrass me like that last time. "
msgstr "지난번처럼 날 창피하게 만들지만 마."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03_RC_RomanYuraFriends01
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_RC_RomanYuraFriends01Scene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Roman
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRomanKreutz
#. Face = Friendly
#. SoundFileID = 008C63F1
#. ScriptNotes = Friendly / to Yura
#. EDID: [0105CEA9]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001B27"
msgid "Anything going on later?"
msgstr "나중에 뭐 있어?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03_RC_RomanYuraFriends01
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_RC_RomanYuraFriends01Scene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Yura
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFYura
#. Face = Friendly
#. SoundFileID = 006794B5
#. ScriptNotes = Friendly / to Roman
#. DialogueBefore = Roman:
#. EDID: [0105CF21]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001B28"
msgid "Only a package pickup. I could use some backup if you're interested."
msgstr "소포 하나 찾으러 가는 것뿐이야. 관심 있으면 지원이 좀 필요할 수도 있어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03_RC_RomanYuraTogether01
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_RC_RomanYuraTogether01Scene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Roman
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRomanKreutz
#. Face = Amused
#. SoundFileID = 00DB4A8E
#. ScriptNotes = Amused / to Yura
#. DialogueBefore = Roman: &&& Yura:
#. EDID: [0105CEEE]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001B29"
msgid "I like how our biggest challenge is figuring out what to do."
msgstr "뭘 할지 정하는 게 제일 큰 고민거리라니. 좋네."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03_RC_RomanYuraTogether01
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_RC_RomanYuraTogether01Scene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Roman
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRomanKreutz
#. Face = Question
#. SoundFileID = 003FDCB2
#. ScriptNotes = Question / to Yura
#. EDID: [0105CED0]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001B2A"
msgid "Got any plans for later?"
msgstr "나중에 계획 있어?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03_RC_RomanYuraTogether01
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_RC_RomanYuraTogether01Scene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Yura
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFYura
#. Face = Happy
#. SoundFileID = 0043207D
#. ScriptNotes = Happy / to Roman
#. DialogueBefore = Roman:
#. EDID: [0105CEBB]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001B2B"
msgid "I don't know. Something with you?"
msgstr "모르겠어. 너랑 뭔가?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03_RC_AtkaYura03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_RC_AtkaYura03Scene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Atka
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFAtka
#. Face = Tired
#. SoundFileID = 009CC5B8
#. ScriptNotes = Tired / to Yura
#. DialogueBefore = Atka: Are you kidding me right now? &&& Yura: Hey, I love Milli like she was my own. The plants are a different story.
#. EDID: [0105CE8C]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001B2C"
msgid "*sigh*"
msgstr "*한숨*"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03_RC_AtkaYura03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_RC_AtkaYura03Scene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Yura
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFYura
#. Face = Amused
#. SoundFileID = 00507AF0
#. ScriptNotes = Amused / to Atka
#. DialogueBefore = Yura: So how long until the next big science conference? &&& Atka: Hopefully not too soon. I hate leaving Milli alone.
#. DialogueAfter = Atka: Are you kidding me right now?
#. EDID: [0105CEAA]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001B2D"
msgid "But she's never really alone. You know I'll watch her."
msgstr "하지만 그녀는 정말로 혼자인 적이 없어. 내가 지켜볼 거란 거 알잖아."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03_RC_AtkaYura03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_RC_AtkaYura03Scene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Atka
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFAtka
#. Face = Amused
#. SoundFileID = 0062A9E5
#. ScriptNotes = Amused / to Yura
#. DialogueBefore = Atka: Hopefully not too soon. I hate leaving Milli alone. &&& Yura: But she's never really alone. You know I'll watch her.
#. DialogueAfter = Yura: Hey, I love Milli like she was my own. The plants are a different story.
#. EDID: [0105CEC4]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001B2E"
msgid "Are you kidding me right now? "
msgstr "지금 장난해? "

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03_RC_AtkaYura03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_RC_AtkaYura03Scene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Yura
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFYura
#. Face = Question
#. SoundFileID = 00BE4ED3
#. ScriptNotes = Question / to Atka
#. DialogueAfter = Atka: Hopefully not too soon. I hate leaving Milli alone.
#. EDID: [0105CE9B]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001B2F"
msgid "So how long until the next big science conference?"
msgstr "그래서 다음 대형 과학 컨퍼런스까지 얼마나 남았어?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03_RC_AtkaYura02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_RC_AtkaYura02Scene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Atka
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFAtka
#. Face = Concerned
#. SoundFileID = 001D21FA
#. ScriptNotes = Concerned / to Yura
#. DialogueBefore = Atka: Maybe if you don't have any money, you shouldn't have so many expenses. &&& Yura: Is that like a yes? Because I couldn't tell.
#. EDID: [0105CE8E]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001B30"
msgid "No, that was me trying to make a point which failed miserably."
msgstr "아니, 내가 요점을 전하려다가 처참하게 실패했나 보네."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03_RC_AtkaYura02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_RC_AtkaYura02Scene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Yura
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFYura
#. Face = Amused
#. SoundFileID = 001A141F
#. ScriptNotes = Amused / to Atka
#. DialogueBefore = Yura: It's not like I don't have my own expenses. &&& Atka: Maybe if you don't have any money, you shouldn't have so many expenses.
#. DialogueAfter = Atka: No, that was me trying to make a point which failed miserably.
#. EDID: [0105CE95]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001B31"
msgid "Is that like a yes? Because I couldn't tell."
msgstr "그거 인정해주는 거야? 잘 구분이 안 되네."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03_RC_AtkaYura01
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_RC_AtkaYura01Scene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Yura
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFYura
#. Face = Amused
#. SoundFileID = 00E8B378
#. ScriptNotes = Amused / to Atka
#. DialogueBefore = Yura: Clean? Can't you pay someone to do that? &&& Atka: I could but you're literally right here, doing nothing.|Not to mention this mess is mostly yours.
#. DialogueAfter = Atka: For cleaning up your mess? I don't think so.
#. EDID: [0105CEAF]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001B32"
msgid "Fine, fine... But you owe me."
msgstr "알겠어, 알겠다고... 하지만 나한테 빚진 건 알아둬."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03_RC_AtkaYura01
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_RC_AtkaYura01Scene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Atka
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFAtka
#. Face = Amused
#. SoundFileID = 00927977
#. ScriptNotes = Amused / to Yura
#. DialogueBefore = Atka: I could but you're literally right here, doing nothing.|Not to mention this mess is mostly yours. &&& Yura: Fine, fine... But you owe me.
#. EDID: [0105CE97]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001B33"
msgid "For cleaning up your mess? I don't think so."
msgstr "난장판은 네가 벌였는데 빛은 내가 졌다고? 그건 아닌 것 같은데."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03_RC_AtkaYura01
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_RC_AtkaYura01Scene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Atka
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFAtka
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 00C30BD2
#. ScriptNotes = Confident / to Yura
#. DialogueAfter = Yura: Clean? Can't you pay someone to do that?
#. EDID: [0105CEA3]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001B34"
msgid "Hey, Yura, do you mind helping me clean up later? "
msgstr "야, 유라, 나중에 청소하는 것 좀 도와줄래? "

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03_RC_AtkaYura04
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_RC_AtkaYura04Scene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Atka
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFAtka
#. Face = Amused
#. SoundFileID = 006BD96E
#. ScriptNotes = Amused / to Yura
#. EDID: [0105CEF3]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001B35"
msgid "Just keep it together. I'd rather hear about your vacation from you, not from SSNN."
msgstr "정신 잘 차려. 네 휴가 얘기는 SSNN에서가 아니라 네 입으로 듣고 싶으니까."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03_RC_AtkaYura04
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_RC_AtkaYura04Scene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Atka
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFAtka
#. Face = Amused
#. SoundFileID = 007D603A
#. ScriptNotes = Amused / to Yura
#. DialogueBefore = Atka: &&& Yura:
#. EDID: [0105CEF3]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001B36"
msgid "A real vacation will be nice for you two. "
msgstr "너희 둘이 진짜 휴가를 갔으면 좋겠네. "

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03_RC_AtkaYura04
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_RC_AtkaYura04Scene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Atka
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFAtka
#. Face = Amused
#. SoundFileID = 000258FC
#. ScriptNotes = Amused / to Yura
#. DialogueBefore = Atka: &&& Yura:
#. EDID: [0105CEF1]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001B37"
msgid "Just don't get kicked out again. Or if you do, don't show up here in the middle of the night."
msgstr "다시 쫓겨나지만 마. 혹시 쫓겨나더라도 한밤중에 여기 나타나진 말고."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03_RC_AtkaYura04
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_RC_AtkaYura04Scene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Yura
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFYura
#. Face = Happy
#. SoundFileID = 0030BF7B
#. ScriptNotes = Happy / to Atka
#. DialogueBefore = Atka:
#. EDID: [0105CEB5]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001B38"
msgid "We're thinking about checking out Trident. Seeing if we can do a cute little vacation. He's so romantic."
msgstr "트라이던트 우주선을 한번 알아볼까 생각 중이야. 귀엽고 조촐한 휴가로 갈 수 있을지 보려고. 로만은 정말 로맨틱해."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03_RC_AtkaYura04
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_RC_AtkaYura04Scene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Yura
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFYura
#. Face = Happy
#. SoundFileID = 002157C3
#. ScriptNotes = Happy / to Atka
#. DialogueBefore = Atka:
#. EDID: [0105CEB4]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001B39"
msgid "Can you believe he actually mentioned going to Paradiso? Can you imagine me on a beach?"
msgstr "로만이 진짜로 파라디소에 가자는 말을 꺼냈다니까? 믿겨져? 내가 해변에 있는 모습이 상상이 돼?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03_RC_AtkaYura04
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_RC_AtkaYura04Scene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Atka
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFAtka
#. Face = Question
#. SoundFileID = 004EC45A
#. ScriptNotes = Question / to Yura
#. EDID: [0105CF26]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001B3A"
msgid "You and Roman have any plans?"
msgstr "너랑 로만은 휴가 계획 있어?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03_RC_AtkaYura04
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_RC_AtkaYura04Scene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Atka
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFAtka
#. Face = Question
#. SoundFileID = 00AB26C0
#. ScriptNotes = Question / to Yura
#. EDID: [0105CF25]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001B3B"
msgid "How are things with Roman?"
msgstr "로만이랑은 어때?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_EC07
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Barrett
#. VoiceType = NPCMBarrett
#. Face = Sad
#. SoundFileID = 0071DB0C
#. ScriptNotes = Barrett comments on all the dead bodies inside the GalBank ship, as pirate tried to kidnap the VP of GalBank. / Sad
#. EDID: [0106C8D7]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001B3C"
msgid "If only we had gotten here sooner, we could have saved all these people..."
msgstr "우리가 조금만 더 빨리 왔더라면 이 사람들을 모두 구할 수 있었을 텐데..."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_EC07
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = SamCoe
#. VoiceType = NPCMSamCoe
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00A6DA40
#. ScriptNotes = Sam is reacting to Ruby Krause - VP of GalBank - as she treats her personal assistant Hannah poorly. / Serious
#. EDID: [0106C8D5]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001B3D"
msgid "You couldn't pay me enough to do that young woman's job."
msgstr "돈을 아무리 줘도 저 젊은 여자의 일은 못 하겠어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_EC07
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Voice
#. VoiceType = SFFL_SE_EC07_Ruby_Voice
#. Face = Irritated
#. SoundFileID = 005D289A
#. ScriptNotes = Not showing regret at leaving Hannah behind in the minefield, but rather at not asking her work stuff before. / Irritated
#. EDID: [0106A504]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001B3E"
msgid "I should have asked Hannah for tomorrow's agenda before leaving her."
msgstr "한나를 두고 오기 전에 내일 일정을 물어봤어야 했는데."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_EC07
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Voice
#. VoiceType = SFFL_SE_EC07_Ruby_Voice
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00A5279C
#. ScriptNotes = Wondering if she'll fire Hannah for her accepting to be rescued by the player. / Serious
#. EDID: [0106A503]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001B3F"
msgid "Now I just need to decide what to do with Hannah."
msgstr "이제 한나를 어떻게 할지만 결정하면 되겠군."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_EC07
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Voice
#. VoiceType = SFFL_SE_EC07_Ruby_Voice
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 0038A8C1
#. ScriptNotes = Feeling more relaxed after the ship left the minefield. / Confident
#. EDID: [0106A502]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001B40"
msgid "That's enough excitement for today, don't you agree?"
msgstr "오늘은 이 정도 소동이면 충분하지 않겠어?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_EC07
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Voice
#. VoiceType = SFFL_SE_EC07_Ruby_Voice
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 000318B4
#. ScriptNotes = Feeling more relaxed after the ship left the minefield. / Confident
#. EDID: [0106A500]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001B41"
msgid "Well that was quite the adventure."
msgstr "음, 꽤 대단한 모험이었네."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_EC07
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Voice
#. VoiceType = SFFL_SE_EC07_Ruby_Voice
#. Face = Concerned
#. SoundFileID = 00F78C34
#. ScriptNotes = Trying to make the player feel bad for not letting Hannah in the minefield. / Concerned
#. EDID: [0106A4FD]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001B42"
msgid "I just hope you did the right thing taking Hannah along with us."
msgstr "한나를 우리와 함께 데려간 게 옳은 일이었기를 바랄 뿐이야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_EC07
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Voice
#. VoiceType = SFFL_SE_EC07_Ruby_Voice
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00F6EC67
#. ScriptNotes = Expressing slightly impatience more than fear at another pirate attack. Ruby has places to be. / Serious
#. EDID: [0106A4FB]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001B43"
msgid "We should leave. Now."
msgstr "우린 떠나야 해. 당장."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_EC07
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Voice
#. VoiceType = SFFL_SE_EC07_Ruby_Voice
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 001E4C78
#. ScriptNotes = Ruby's first comment upon entering the player's ship. Unintentionally insulting. / Neutral
#. EDID: [0106A4FA]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001B44"
msgid "You ship is smaller than I imagined."
msgstr "네 우주선은 생각보다 작네."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_EC07
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Voice
#. VoiceType = SFFL_SE_EC07_Hannah_Voice
#. Face = Nervous
#. SoundFileID = 0080C1C9
#. ScriptNotes = Hannah is calming down as they leave the minefield behind. / Nervous
#. EDID: [0106A4F7]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001B45"
msgid "I can't wait to be back on solid ground."
msgstr "빨리 단단한 땅을 다시 밟고 싶어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_EC07
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Voice
#. VoiceType = SFFL_SE_EC07_Hannah_Voice
#. Face = Nervous
#. SoundFileID = 00D21121
#. ScriptNotes = Hannah is calming down as they leave the minefield behind. / Nervous
#. EDID: [0106A4F5]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001B46"
msgid "I feel better now."
msgstr "이제 좀 괜찮아졌어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_EC07
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Voice
#. VoiceType = SFFL_SE_EC07_Hannah_Voice
#. Face = Angry
#. SoundFileID = 004BC6C1
#. ScriptNotes = Inside the player's ship, Hannah reacts in fear as pirate ships attack them. / Angry
#. EDID: [0106A4F1]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001B47"
msgid "I hate pirates!"
msgstr "해적은 정말 싫어!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_EC07
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Voice
#. VoiceType = SFFL_SE_EC07_Hannah_Voice
#. Face = Nervous
#. SoundFileID = 007C1CB2
#. ScriptNotes = Hannah expresses nervousness about more pirates after she has boarded the player's ship. / Nervous
#. EDID: [0106A4ED]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001B48"
msgid "Let's hope we can get away before more pirates show up."
msgstr "해적들이 더 나타나기 전에 빠져나갈 수 있길 바라자."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_EC07
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE_EC07_100_HailAccepted
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Voice
#. VoiceType = SFFL_SE_EC07_Hannah_Voice
#. Face = Spaceship / Nervous
#. SoundFileID = 00000BAB
#. ScriptNotes = ...Hannah (still on the radio) warns the player about a threat on their ship, and sounds a little apologetic about it. / Nervous / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Hold on tight, I'm coming aboard.
#. DialogueAfter = GalBankShip: The VP of Acquisitions, Miss Krause, pledges to give you a generous reward if you help her.
#. EDID: [0105F64F]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001B49"
msgid "Also, um, a pirate or two *may* have already boarded our ship, so... be careful."
msgstr "그리고, 음, 해적 한둘이 *이미* 우리 우주선에 올라탔을지도 몰라요. 그러니... 조심하세요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_EC07
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE_EC07_100_HailAccepted
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Voice
#. VoiceType = SFFL_SE_EC07_Hannah_Voice
#. Face = Spaceship / Grateful
#. SoundFileID = 00FF3AA5
#. ScriptNotes = Hannah is very grateful that the player will come aboard their ship to help them, but... / Grateful / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Hold on tight, I'm coming aboard.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Hold on tight, I'm coming aboard.
#. EDID: [0105F64F]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001B4A"
msgid "Thank you so much!"
msgstr "정말 감사합니다!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_EC07
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE_EC07_50_InitialContact
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = GalBankShip
#. VoiceType = SFFL_SE_EC07_Hannah_Voice
#. Face = Spaceship / Tired
#. SoundFileID = 00028435
#. ScriptNotes = Radio: Hannah is interrupted off-mic by Ruby Krause, who wants her to correct what she just said. Hannah sounds both tired and annoyed. / Tired
#. DialogueAfter = PirateShip01: Stay out of this, Spacer! This does not concern you!
#. EDID: [0105F650]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001B4B"
msgid "What? Oh, right... They want to kidnap the VP of Acquisitions for GalBank."
msgstr "뭐라고요? 아, 맞다... 그들은 갤뱅크 인수 담당 부사장을 납치하려고 해요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_EC07
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE_EC07_50_InitialContact
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = GalBankShip
#. VoiceType = SFFL_SE_EC07_Hannah_Voice
#. Face = Spaceship / Pleading
#. SoundFileID = 0054AB7A
#. ScriptNotes = Radio, not a pilot nor a comms specialist, but an administrative assistant stuck on a derelict ship with her boss, attacked by pirates. / Pleading
#. EDID: [0105F650]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001B4C"
msgid "Mayday! Mayday! We are being attacked by pirates! They want to kidnap us!"
msgstr "메이데이! 메이데이! 해적들에게 공격받고 있습니다! 저들이 우릴 납치하려고 해요!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_EC07
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE_EC07_80_Hailing
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = GalBankShip
#. VoiceType = SFFL_SE_EC07_Hannah_Voice
#. Face = Spaceship / Nervous
#. SoundFileID = 00F1CEDD
#. ScriptNotes = Hannah is sending out a radio distress call, hoping that someone will come to their help. / Nervous
#. DialogueBefore = GalBankShip: Whoa! Did you see that? The pirate ship blew up on a space mine!|Uh... Mayday! Mayday!
#. DialogueAfter = GalBankShip: Thank you for responding! We really need your help!
#. EDID: [0105F656]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001B4D"
msgid "Mayday! Mayday! We have been attacked by pirates and have lost our engines."
msgstr "메이데이! 메이데이! 해적들에게 공격받았고 엔진을 잃었습니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_EC07
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE_EC07_80_Hailing
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = GalBankShip
#. VoiceType = SFFL_SE_EC07_Hannah_Voice
#. Face = Spaceship / Afraid
#. SoundFileID = 009659A3
#. ScriptNotes = Hannah is sending out a radio distress call, hoping that someone will come to their help. / Afraid
#. DialogueBefore = GalBankShip: Whoa! Did you see that? The pirate ship blew up on a space mine!|Uh... Mayday! Mayday!
#. DialogueAfter = GalBankShip: Thank you for responding! We really need your help!
#. EDID: [0105F654]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001B4E"
msgid "We have lost our shields, engine power, and grav jump capabilities."
msgstr "보호막, 엔진 출력, 중력 도약 기능을 잃었습니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_EC07
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE_EC07_100_HailAccepted
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = GalBankShip
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 001E5F7F
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = GalBankShip: Whoa! Did you see that? The pirate ship blew up on a space mine!|Uh... Mayday! Mayday! &&& GalBankShip: &&& GalBankShip: Thank you for responding! We really need your help!|I mean...the VP of Acquisitions for the GalBank consortium needs your help.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Uh, let me ask.
#. EDID: [0106439D]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001B4F"
msgid "What's in it for me?"
msgstr "나한테 떨어지는 건 뭐지?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_EC07
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE_EC07_100_HailAccepted
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = GalBankShip
#. VoiceType = SFFL_SE_EC07_Hannah_Voice
#. Face = Spaceship / Confused
#. SoundFileID = 00C5DC6B
#. ScriptNotes = On the radio: Hannah is a bit surprised that the player says they'll think about rescuing them or not, but is trying to keep a positive attitude. / Confused / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Let me think about it.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Let me think about it.
#. DialogueAfter = GalBankShip: The VP of Acquisitions, Miss Krause, pledges to give you a generous reward if you help her.
#. EDID: [0106439F]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001B50"
msgid "Uh, okay, we'll be right here!"
msgstr "어, 알겠어요. 여기 있을게요!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_EC07
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE_EC07_100_HailAccepted
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = GalBankShip
#. VoiceType = SFFL_SE_EC07_Hannah_Voice
#. Face = Spaceship / Puzzled
#. SoundFileID = 0065F76F
#. ScriptNotes = On the radio: a bit taken aback at the player asking what's in it for them if they help. / Puzzled / to Player Default
#. Prompt = What's in it for me?
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: What's in it for me?
#. DialogueAfter = GalBankShip: The VP of Acquisitions, Miss Krause, pledges to give you a generous reward if you help her.
#. EDID: [01064399]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001B51"
msgid "Uh, let me ask."
msgstr "어, 물어볼게요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_EC07
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE_EC07_80_Hailing
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = GalBankShip
#. VoiceType = SFFL_SE_EC07_Hannah_Voice
#. Face = Spaceship / Confused
#. SoundFileID = 00F120D9
#. ScriptNotes = Hannah has reacted to pirate ship exploding but realizes that she's still supposed to send a distress call. / Confused
#. EDID: [0106439E]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001B52"
msgid "Uh... Mayday! Mayday!"
msgstr "어... 메이데이! 메이데이!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_EC07
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE_EC07_80_Hailing
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = GalBankShip
#. VoiceType = SFFL_SE_EC07_Hannah_Voice
#. Face = Spaceship / Surprised
#. SoundFileID = 00BE9787
#. ScriptNotes = Here Hannah is talking to Ruby Krause, standing next to her in their ship's cockpit, as she reacts to the pirate ship blowing up on a spacemine. / Surprised
#. EDID: [0106439E]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001B53"
msgid "Whoa! Did you see that? The pirate ship blew up on a space mine!"
msgstr "우와! 봤어요? 해적선이 우주 기뢰에 맞아 폭발했어요!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_EC07
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE_EC07_660_Ruby
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = RubyKrause
#. VoiceType = SFFL_SE_EC07_Ruby_Voice
#. Face = Amused
#. SoundFileID = 00C1971B
#. ScriptNotes = Ruby is thanking the player, and for the first time seems actually grateful. Almost flirty. / Amused / to Player Default
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: You never know.
#. EDID: [0106A4DA]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001B54"
msgid "Who knows, maybe we'll meet again some day. Though preferably not in a minefield."
msgstr "누가 알겠어요. 언젠가 다시 만날지도 모르죠. 가능하면 기뢰밭이 아닌 곳에서요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_EC07
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE_EC07_660_Ruby
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = RubyKrause
#. VoiceType = SFFL_SE_EC07_Ruby_Voice
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 00DD48DA
#. ScriptNotes = Ruby is thanking the player after he took them back to New Atlantis. / Confident / to Player Default
#. EDID: [0106A4DA]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001B55"
msgid "Thank you for taking us to safety. I'll be wiring your reward shortly."
msgstr "우리를 안전한 곳까지 데려다줘서 감사합니다. 보상은 곧 송금하겠습니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_EC07
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE_EC07_700_RubyAndHannah
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = RubyKrause
#. VoiceType = SFFL_SE_EC07_Ruby_Voice
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00D48D3F
#. ScriptNotes = Sounds almost cold. Ruby is back to treating her assistant like dirt, but just a bit. / Neutral
#. DialogueAfter = HannahFrye: Right behind you, Miss Krause.
#. EDID: [0106A4DB]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001B56"
msgid "Come on Hannah, let's go."
msgstr "가자, 한나."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_EC07
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE_EC07_660_Ruby
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 007FA896
