#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: All right, safe travels to you.
#. EDID: [0106A4DC]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001B57"
msgid "You never know."
msgstr "모르는 일이죠."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_EC07
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE_EC07_55_CompanionComment
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = ActiveCompanion
#. VoiceType = NPCMBarrett
#. Face = Concerned
#. SoundFileID = 00A9900F
#. ScriptNotes = Barrett is reacting to seeing a pirate ship attack a corporate ship inside a debris-filled spacemine field. / Concerned
#. DialogueBefore = GalBankShip: Mayday! Mayday! We are being attacked by pirates! They want to kidnap us!|What? Oh, right... They want to kidnap the VP of Acquisitions for GalBank. &&& PirateShip01: Stay out of this, Spacer! This does not concern you!
#. EDID: [0106C8D1]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001B58"
msgid "We have to help that GalBank ship. Just steer clear of those mines."
msgstr "저 갤뱅크 우주선을 도와야 해. 저 기뢰들만 잘 피해서 가."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_EC07
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE_EC07_660_Ruby
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Voice
#. VoiceType = SFFL_SE_EC07_Ruby_Voice
#. Face = Friendly
#. SoundFileID = 00FE2C8E
#. ScriptNotes = Again, Ruby sounds genuinely friendly, which is unusual. / Friendly / to Player Default
#. Prompt = You never know.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: You never know.
#. DialogueAfter = RubyKrause: Come on Hannah, let's go.
#. EDID: [0106A4D9]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001B59"
msgid "All right, safe travels to you."
msgstr "좋아, 안전하게 여행해."

#. List: 2
