#. DialogueAfter = Actor01: Good luck.
#. EDID: [01059DBD]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001B71"
msgid " I'll talk to Rishi again, but I expect the answer will be the same as last time."
msgstr " 리시 씨와 다시 얘기해 보겠지만, 대답은 지난번과 같을 거라고 봐."

#. List: 2
