#. ScriptNotes = Exasperated / Depressed / to Actor01
#. DialogueBefore = Actor02: One of the patrons stepped up.|Probably saved us all. &&& Actor01: Really?|That was brave. But if you ask me, we got off lucky.|There's going to be trouble again someday. There always is.|We can't expect our customers to handle it every time.|We need more security.
#. EDID: [01059DBD]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001B72"
msgid "Believe me, I know."
msgstr "믿어 줘, 나도 알아."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_Anchorpoint_RandConv10_ChanValeria_Z01
#. SceneName = SFFL_Anchorpint_RandConv10_ChanValeria_Z01_Scene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
