#. ScriptNotes = / to Actor01
#. DialogueBefore = Actor02: Everyone behaving themselves? &&& Actor01: Yep! Smooth sailing here, now that those Spacers are gone.|I heard they're no longer a problem.|What happened? Did you send one of your people?
#. EDID: [01059DC1]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001B74"
msgid "One of the patrons stepped up."
msgstr "고객 중 한 명이 나섰어."

#. List: 2
