#. ScriptNotes = / to Actor01
#. EDID: SFFL_AnchorpointSharedInfoQuest_MaddeB2
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001B77"
msgid "Okay, okay, you get to stay a tiger."
msgstr "알았어, 알았어. 넌 타이거로 남아도 돼."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_Anchorpoint_RandConv12_MaddieTiger03
