#. ScriptNotes = Talking to a pet / to Actor01
#. EDID: [01058E1B]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001B79"
msgid "I should make you a new toy. Maybe something you can chase around. What do you think, Tiger?"
msgstr "새 장난감을 만들어 줘야겠어. 네가 쫓아다닐 수 있는 걸로. 어떻게 생각해? 타이거?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_EC08
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE_EC08_10_CompanionInterjection
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = ActiveCompanion
#. VoiceType = NPCFSarahMorgan
#. Face = Thinking
#. SoundFileID = 00CDE36D
#. ScriptNotes = Companion reacting to the player's ship entering a debris field littered with space mines. / Thinking
#. EDID: SFFL_SE_EC08SharedInfo04
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001B7A"
msgid "Not sure who set this up in the middle of nowhere, but it appears a few ships got caught in it."
msgstr "누가 이런 외딴곳 한가운데에 설치했는지는 몰라도, 우주선 몇 척이 걸린 것 같아."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_EC08
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE_EC08_10_CompanionInterjection
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = ActiveCompanion
#. VoiceType = NPCFSarahMorgan
#. Face = Worried
#. SoundFileID = 007B29F7
#. ScriptNotes = Companion reacting to the player's ship entering a debris field littered with space mines. / Worried
#. EDID: SFFL_SE_EC08SharedInfo04
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001B7B"
msgid "Ugh, space mines. Better stay away from this area, if you want my advice."
msgstr "으, 우주 기뢰라니. 내 조언을 듣겠다면 이 구역엔 가까이 가지 않는 게 좋겠어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_EC08
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE_EC08_100_CompanionInterjection_Hit
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = ActiveCompanion
#. VoiceType = NPCFSarahMorgan
#. Face = Concerned
#. SoundFileID = 00D65950
#. ScriptNotes = Companion reactive after the ship hit a few space mines. / Concerned
#. EDID: [0105C393]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001B7C"
msgid "Perhaps we should just leave this area altogether, don't you think?"
msgstr "그냥 이 지역을 완전히 떠나는 게 좋지 않을까요?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_EC08
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE_EC08_200_SelfDestructCompanion
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = ActiveCompanion
#. VoiceType = NPCMSamCoe
#. Face = Smirk
#. SoundFileID = 0078604D
#. ScriptNotes = Smirk
#. DialogueBefore = ActiveCompanion:
#. EDID: [01080463]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001B7D"
msgid "It does make for some nice fireworks."
msgstr "그래도 꽤 멋진 불꽃놀이는 되네."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_EC08
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE_EC08_200_SelfDestructCompanion
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = ActiveCompanion
#. VoiceType = NPCMBarrett
#. Face = Somber
#. SoundFileID = 00598F39
#. ScriptNotes = Somber
#. DialogueBefore = ActiveCompanion:
#. EDID: [01080460]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001B7E"
msgid "I doubt that was five hundred meters away... We're lucky it didn't go off sooner."
msgstr "저게 500미터나 떨어져 있었을 것 같진 않은데... 더 일찍 터지지 않은 게 다행이야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_EC08
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE_EC08_200_SelfDestructCompanion
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = ActiveCompanion
#. VoiceType = NPCFAndreja
#. Face = Thinking
#. SoundFileID = 009547F5
#. ScriptNotes = Thinking
#. DialogueBefore = ActiveCompanion:
#. EDID: [0108045E]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001B7F"
msgid "I do not believe I will be getting used to this any time soon."
msgstr "이건 당분간 익숙해질 것 같지 않군."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_EC08
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE_EC08_150_BoardingCompanionInterjection
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = ActiveCompanion
#. VoiceType = NPCFSarahMorgan
#. Face = Sarcastic
#. SoundFileID = 00DC38DF
#. ScriptNotes = Sarcastic / to BoardableDerelict_CockpitDoor
#. EDID: [01080477]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001B80"
msgid "So what are we looking for here, in addition to the inebriating thrill of discovery?"
msgstr "그럼 발견의 취할 듯한 짜릿함 말고, 여기서 뭘 찾는 거지?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_EC08
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE_EC08_150_BoardingCompanionInterjection
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = ActiveCompanion
#. VoiceType = NPCFSarahMorgan
#. Face = Concerned
#. SoundFileID = 00EB632B
#. ScriptNotes = Concerned / to BoardableDerelict_CockpitDoor
#. EDID: [01080475]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001B81"
msgid "Let's take a quick tour then get out before this wreck comes in contact with one of those mines."
msgstr "간단히 둘러보고, 이 잔해가 저 기뢰들 중 하나와 닿기 전에 나가자."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_EC08
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE_EC08_150_BoardingCompanionInterjection
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = ActiveCompanion
#. VoiceType = NPCFAndreja
#. Face = Concerned
#. SoundFileID = 00E2CC04
#. ScriptNotes = Concerned / to BoardableDerelict_CockpitDoor
#. EDID: [0108046F]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001B82"
msgid "I find your fascination for derelict ships... intriguing."
msgstr "네가 버려진 우주선에 매혹되는 점은... 흥미롭군."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_EC08
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE_EC08_150_BoardingCompanionInterjection
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = ActiveCompanion
#. VoiceType = NPCFAndreja
#. Face = Nervous
#. SoundFileID = 00F6EC17
#. ScriptNotes = Nervous / to BoardableDerelict_CockpitDoor
#. EDID: [0108046E]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001B83"
msgid "We shouldn't be in here. This is a place of pain and sorrow."
msgstr "우린 여기 있으면 안 돼. 이곳은 고통과 슬픔의 장소야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_EC08
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE_EC08_150_BoardingCompanionInterjection
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = ActiveCompanion
#. VoiceType = NPCMBarrett
#. Face = Nervous
#. SoundFileID = 00EB47A0
#. ScriptNotes = Nervous / to BoardableDerelict_CockpitDoor
#. EDID: [0108046C]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001B84"
msgid "Let's be quick. Mines usually won't be triggered by derelict ships, but this one still has power."
msgstr "빨리 끝내자. 기뢰는 보통 버려진 우주선에 반응하지 않지만, 이건 아직 전력이 남아 있어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_EC08
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE_EC08_150_BoardingCompanionInterjection
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = ActiveCompanion
#. VoiceType = NPCMBarrett
#. Face = Nervous
#. SoundFileID = 0088D6B9
#. ScriptNotes = Nervous / to BoardableDerelict_CockpitDoor
#. EDID: [0108046B]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001B85"
msgid "Places like these give me the creeps, to be perfectly honest."
msgstr "솔직히 말해서 이런 곳은 소름 끼쳐."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_EC08
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE_EC08_150_BoardingCompanionInterjection
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = ActiveCompanion
#. VoiceType = NPCMSamCoe
#. Face = Amused
#. SoundFileID = 001225BE
#. ScriptNotes = Amused / to BoardableDerelict_CockpitDoor
#. EDID: [0108046A]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001B86"
msgid "Exploring derelict ships in a minefield... You've got a sense of adventure, I'll give you that!"
msgstr "기뢰밭에서 버려진 우주선을 탐험하다니... 모험심 하나는 인정할게!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_EC08
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE_EC08_150_BoardingCompanionInterjection
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = ActiveCompanion
#. VoiceType = NPCMSamCoe
#. Face = Concerned
#. SoundFileID = 00220631
#. ScriptNotes = Concerned / to BoardableDerelict_CockpitDoor
#. EDID: [01080468]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001B87"
msgid "For the record, I'm not entirely comfortable with this. It almost feels like grave robbing."
msgstr "분명히 말해 두지만, 난 이게 썩 편하진 않아. 거의 무덤 도굴처럼 느껴지거든."

#. List: 2
#. EDID: [01054A4D]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001B88"
msgid "Fine."
msgstr "좋아."

#. List: 2
#. EDID: [01054A6C]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001B89"
msgid "Why not take a look? You know what they say, better safe than sorry! "
msgstr "한번 살펴보는 게 어때? 안전이 제일이라는 말도 있잖아!"

#. List: 2
#. EDID: [01054A65]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001B8A"
msgid "Yeah, I hear that every day. It's normal. Just loose stuff in the ducts blowing around."
msgstr "그래, 그 소리는 매일 들어. 정상적인 거야. 덕트 안에서 헐거운 물건들이 날아다니는 것뿐이야."

#. List: 2
#. EDID: [01054A64]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001B8B"
msgid "It's an old station. There's all kinds of sounds. It ain't anything to worry about."
msgstr "오래된 우주정거장이야. 별별 소리가 다 나. 걱정할 일은 아니야."

#. List: 2
#. EDID: [01054A54]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001B8C"
msgid "Whatever it is, I doubt it has good intentions."
msgstr "그게 뭐든 좋은 의도를 가졌을 것 같진 않아."

#. List: 2
#. EDID: [01054A54]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001B8D"
msgid "There's something in the air ducts. I can hear it skittering around."
msgstr "공기 덕트 안에 뭔가 있어. 안에서 바스락거리며 돌아다니는 소리가 들려."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_Anchorpoint_RandConv05_MaddieRishi
#. SceneName = SFFL_Anchorpoint_RandConv05_MaddieRishiScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Actor01
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRishiSaint
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 0081E0BB
#. ScriptNotes = Irritated, you don't like to spend money / to Actor02
#. DialogueBefore = Actor01: *Sigh* What is it this time? &&& Actor02: You already know, cause I told you yesterday.|And before you ask me again, no, I can't just patch it up.|I can't make the parts appear out of thin air and we ain't got anything I can replace them with.
#. DialogueAfter = Actor02: Ain't much to consider.
#. EDID: [01054A58]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001B8E"
msgid "I'll consider it."
msgstr "고려해 보겠습니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_Anchorpoint_RandConv05_MaddieRishi
#. SceneName = SFFL_Anchorpoint_RandConv05_MaddieRishiScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Actor02
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFMaddieWing
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00878A62
#. ScriptNotes = / to Actor01
#. DialogueAfter = Actor01: I'll consider it.
#. EDID: [01054A52]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001B8F"
msgid "I can't make the parts appear out of thin air and we ain't got anything I can replace them with."
msgstr "부품을 허공에서 만들어낼 수도 없고, 대체할 만한 것도 없어요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_Anchorpoint_RandConv05_MaddieRishi
#. SceneName = SFFL_Anchorpoint_RandConv05_MaddieRishiScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Actor02
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFMaddieWing
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 006F5B76
#. ScriptNotes = / to Actor01
#. EDID: [01054A52]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001B90"
msgid "And before you ask me again, no, I can't just patch it up."
msgstr "또 질문하기 전에 대답해 두겠는데, 안돼요. 그냥 땜질해선 못 고쳐요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_Anchorpoint_RandConv05_MaddieRishi
#. SceneName = SFFL_Anchorpoint_RandConv05_MaddieRishiScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Actor02
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFMaddieWing
#. Face = Irritated
#. SoundFileID = 00B92293
#. ScriptNotes = Irritated / Irritated / to Actor01
#. DialogueBefore = Actor02: Hey Rishi. Give me some money. &&& Actor01: *Sigh* What is it this time?
#. EDID: [01054A52]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001B91"
msgid "You already know, cause I told you yesterday."
msgstr "이미 알잖아요. 어제 말해 줬잖아요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_Anchorpoint_RandConv05_MaddieRishi
#. SceneName = SFFL_Anchorpoint_RandConv05_MaddieRishiScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Actor01
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRishiSaint
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 00EC7AE7
#. ScriptNotes = Anticipating bad news / to Actor02
#. DialogueBefore = Actor02: Hey Rishi. Give me some money.
#. DialogueAfter = Actor02: You already know, cause I told you yesterday.
#. EDID: [01054A4B]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001B92"
msgid "*Sigh* What is it this time?"
msgstr "*한숨* 이번엔 또 뭡니까?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_Anchorpoint_RandConv06_ChanKillian
#. SceneName = SFFL_Anchorpoint_RandConv06_ChanKillianScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Actor01
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMKillianBrice
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00EEF72F
#. ScriptNotes = Icy / to Actor02
#. DialogueBefore = Actor01: He might, but I prefer certainty over possibility.|Credits first. No discussion. &&& Actor02: Fine, but you should consider your priorities.|Should there be an incident, we might not be able to protect everyone. |I might be forced to make a difficult choice.
#. EDID: [01054A63]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001B93"
msgid "You do your job as you see fit, and I'll do mine."
msgstr "넌 네가 맡은 일을 해. 난 내가 맡은 일을 할게."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_Anchorpoint_RandConv06_ChanKillian
#. SceneName = SFFL_Anchorpoint_RandConv06_ChanKillianScene
