#. EDID: [01058D77]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001B9C"
msgid "I could reach out to a few past acquaintances. I'm sure we could find..."
msgstr "예전 지인 몇 명에게 연락해 볼 수 있을 겁니다. 분명 지원자를 찾을 수..."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_Anchorpoint_RandConv08_ChanRishi
#. SceneName = SFFL_Anchorpoint_RandConv06_ChanKillianSceneCOPY0000COPY0000
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Actor02
