msgid "The recent incident with that Spacer gang concerns me."
msgstr "최근 그 스페이서 갱단과 있었던 사건이 걱정됩니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_RS01
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE_RS01_HailRefused
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = HailingShip
#. VoiceType = SFFL_SE_RS01_NPCFJara_Kleel
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 008D88F5
#. DialogueBefore = HailingShip:
#. EDID: [01054571]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001BA5"
msgid "I see, well... maybe someone else will come along that has half a heart. Sycorax out. "
msgstr "알겠습니다, 뭐... 반쪽짜리 양심이라도 가진 다른 누군가가 나타나겠죠. 시코락스 통신 종료."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_RS01
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE_RS01_HailAccept
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = HailingShip
#. VoiceType = SFFL_SE_RS01_NPCFJara_Kleel
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00EA5E93
#. Prompt = Who's this bounty you're hauling?
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Who's this bounty you're hauling?
#. DialogueAfter = HailingShip: Ok. Let me see if I can find you what you need.
#. EDID: [0105456B]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001BA6"
msgid "Krell Vonn. He's wanted in three systems for raiding civilian convoys. "
msgstr "크렐 본. 민간 수송대를 습격한 혐의로 세 성계에서 수배 중입니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_RS01
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE_RS01_HailAccept
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = HailingShip
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00D2924C
#. DialogueBefore = HailingShip: Hello? Can you hear me? This is Jara Kleel, pilot of the Sycorax. &&& HailingShip: &&& HailingShip: You're a life-saver! I was hauling a bounty to New Atlantis when a pack of pirates came out of nowhere. They must have been tracking me - guess they wanted their friend back.|I managed to fight them off, but they got a few good hits in and fried my power grid. I just need enough juice to jump to the nearest system for repairs. |What's left of their ship is drifting and ripe for the picking. If you get me a Power Cell, I'd be eternally grateful.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Krell Vonn. He's wanted in three systems for raiding civilian convoys.
#. EDID: [01054569]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001BA7"
msgid "Who's this bounty you're hauling?"
msgstr "당신이 운송 중인 현상수배범은 누구죠?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_RS01
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE_RS01_HailAccept
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = HailingShip
#. VoiceType = SFFL_SE_RS01_NPCFJara_Kleel
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00BCF9B3
#. Prompt = Sorry, but I've got my own issues to deal with.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Sorry, but I've got my own issues to deal with.
#. EDID: [01054567]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001BA8"
msgid "Oh. Uh... well if you change your mind, you know where I'll be. "
msgstr "아. 어... 마음이 바뀌면 제가 어디 있는지 아시죠."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_RS01
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE_RS01_HailAccept
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = HailingShip
#. VoiceType = SFFL_SE_RS01_NPCFJara_Kleel
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00ACCCED
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Ok. Let me see if I can find you what you need.
#. EDID: [01054572]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001BA9"
msgid "What's left of their ship is drifting and ripe for the picking. If you get me a Power Cell, I'd be eternally grateful."
msgstr "그들 우주선의 잔해가 표류 중이라 챙길 게 많을 겁니다. 파워 셀 하나만 구해 주시면 영원히 감사하겠습니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_RS01
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE_RS01_HailAccept
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = HailingShip
#. VoiceType = SFFL_SE_RS01_NPCFJara_Kleel
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 000A0D0F
#. EDID: [01054572]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001BAA"
msgid "I managed to fight them off, but they got a few good hits in and fried my power grid. I just need enough juice to jump to the nearest system for repairs. "
msgstr "겨우 격퇴하긴 했지만 몇 방 제대로 맞아서 전력망이 타 버렸습니다. 수리하러 가장 가까운 성계로 점프할 만큼의 전력만 있으면 됩니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_RS01
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE_RS01_HailAccept
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = HailingShip
#. VoiceType = SFFL_SE_RS01_NPCFJara_Kleel
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0049F9DA
#. DialogueBefore = HailingShip:
#. EDID: [01054572]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001BAB"
msgid "You're a life-saver! I was hauling a bounty to New Atlantis when a pack of pirates came out of nowhere. They must have been tracking me - guess they wanted their friend back."
msgstr "당신은 생명의 은인입니다! 현상수배범을 뉴아틀란티스로 운송하던 중 해적 무리가 난데없이 나타났어요. 절 추적하고 있었던 게 분명합니다. 친구를 되찾고 싶었나 보죠."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_RS01
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE_RS01_PowerCellDelivered
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Kleel
#. VoiceType = SFFL_SE_RS01_NPCFJara_Kleel
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 002D6417
#. Prompt = I know what it's like to hope for a hand up when all you can do is grasp at the air.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I know what it's like to hope for a hand up when all you can do is grasp at the air.
#. EDID: [0105F4B9]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001BAC"
msgid "Well... my mother used to say that you can always count on the kindness of strangers. I am eternally grateful. Thank you."
msgstr "음... 어머니께서 낯선 이의 친절에 기대도 되는 때가 있다고 하셨죠. 영원히 감사하겠습니다. 감사합니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_RS01
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE_RS01_PowerCellDelivered
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = HailingShip
#. VoiceType = SFFL_SE_RS01_NPCFJara_Kleel
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0084731B
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: I know what it's like to hope for a hand up when all you can do is grasp at the air.
#. EDID: [0105F4BC]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001BAD"
msgid "I knew you wouldn't leave me stranded out here."
msgstr "당신이 절 여기 표류한 채 두고 가지 않을 줄 알았습니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_RS01
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE_RS01_PowerCellDelivered
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = HailingShip
#. VoiceType = SFFL_SE_RS01_NPCFJara_Kleel
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0075B3F7
#. Prompt = Just get the hell out of here before someone less generous realizes you're an easy target.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Just get the hell out of here before someone less generous realizes you're an easy target.
#. EDID: [0106D1BF]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001BAE"
msgid "Aye-aye, captain. Consider me dust. "
msgstr "예, 예, 선장님. 먼지처럼 조용히 따라갈게요. "

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_RS01
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE_RS01_PowerCellDelivered
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = HailingShip
#. VoiceType = SFFL_SE_RS01_NPCFJara_Kleel
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0050B95A
#. Prompt = I know. I'm a regular big damn hero. But keep it to yourself, yeah? I've got a reputation to maintain.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I know. I'm a regular big damn hero. But keep it to yourself, yeah? I've got a reputation to maintain.
#. EDID: [0106D1C1]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001BAF"
msgid "*laughs* Don't worry, 'hero'... your secret's safe with me. Thanks again."
msgstr "*웃음* 걱정 마, '영웅'... 네 비밀은 지켜 줄게. 다시 한번 고마워."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_RS01
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE_RS01_PowerCellDelivered
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = HailingShip
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00191837
#. DialogueBefore = HailingShip: You got it! You're a life-saver, truly.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: *laughs* Don't worry, 'hero'... your secret's safe with me. Thanks again.
#. EDID: [0106D1C0]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001BB0"
msgid "I know. I'm a regular big damn hero. But keep it to yourself, yeah? I've got a reputation to maintain."
msgstr "알아. 난 흔히 말하는 대단한 영웅이지. 하지만 너만 알고 있어, 알았지? 지켜야 할 평판이 있거든."

