#. EDID: [0106BE27]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001BBD"
msgid "Well, if it isn't my good friend. Come in!"
msgstr "아니, 이게 누구세요. 반가운 손님이시군요. 들어오세요!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC03
