#. DialogueAfter = Bobby: I'd like to see the specials, please.
#. EDID: [0106BDFB]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001BC3"
msgid "Will that be it for today?"
msgstr "오늘은 그걸로 끝인가요?"

#. List: 2
