msgid "Welcome back, my friend!"
msgstr "다시 오셨군요. 손님!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC03
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC03_55_Bobby_Greeting
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Bobby
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC03_Bobby_Voice
#. Face = Sarcastic
#. SoundFileID = 00801DDF
#. ScriptNotes = Bobby briefly opens up to the player, who has become a friend by now. However, he quickly changes the subject, which is still too painful. / Sarcastic / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Your ship's name, the "Light of Anjali". What does it mean?
#. DialogueAfter = Bobby: I'd like to see the specials, please.
#. EDID: [0106BDF7]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001BCF"
msgid "Anyway, that's our second ship by that name. The first one was so small, you wouldn't believe!"
msgstr "어쨌든 그 이름을 붙인 두 번째 우주선이에요. 첫 번째는 믿기 힘들 만큼 작았죠!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC03
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC03_55_Bobby_Greeting
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Bobby
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC03_Bobby_Voice
#. Face = Confused
#. SoundFileID = 009D7B33
#. ScriptNotes = Bobby briefly opens up to the player, who has become a friend by now. However, he quickly changes the subject, which is still too painful. / Confused / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Your ship's name, the "Light of Anjali". What does it mean?
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Your ship's name, the "Light of Anjali". What does it mean?
#. EDID: [0106BDF7]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001BD0"
msgid "That's our daughter's name. She would have turned nineteen a couple of weeks ago..."
msgstr "우리 딸의 이름이에요. 몇 주 전이면 열아홉 살이 되었을 텐데..."

#. List: 2
