#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Heard anything good recently?
#. EDID: [0106BE10]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001BD3"
msgid "I heard a few things..."
msgstr "몇 가지 들은 게 있긴 합니다..."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC03
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC03_55_Bobby_Greeting
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Bobby
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC03_Bobby_Voice
#. Face = Question
#. SoundFileID = 00533672
#. ScriptNotes = Bobby understands that the player isn't just out to buy goods, but also seeks information, and promises to have some the next time they meet. / Question / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Heard anything good recently?
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Heard anything good recently?
#. EDID: [0106BE0E]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001BD4"
msgid "You mean, like rumors and gossip? Nothing comes to mind, but I'll keep an ear out for you."
msgstr "소문이나 뒷이야기 같은 걸 말하시는 건가요? 딱히 떠오르는 건 없지만 귀 기울여 보겠습니다."

