#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001BDC"
msgid "Your loss, traveler. Maybe next time."
msgstr "손해 보시는 겁니다, 여행자님. 다음 기회에요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_EC03
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE_EC03_100a_Hailing_1
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = MerchantShip
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC03_Bobby_Voice
#. Face = Spaceship / Confident
#. SoundFileID = 00ABC76A
#. ScriptNotes = Over ship Radio: trader Bobby Kazan trying to entice the player to buy their wares. / Confident
#. DialogueBefore = MerchantShip: Hello again, my friend!
#. DialogueAfter = MerchantShip: Well, maybe next time then.
#. EDID: [01052EEE]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001BDD"
msgid "As always, we can deliver normal supplies to your ship."
msgstr "언제나처럼 일반 보급품은 우주선으로 배송해 드릴 수 있습니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_EC03
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE_EC03_800_Goodbye
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = MerchantShip
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC03_Bobby_Voice
#. Face = Spaceship / Friendly
#. SoundFileID = 003D9E4D
#. ScriptNotes = Friendly
#. EDID: [0105356B]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001BDE"
msgid "Until next time..."
msgstr "그럼 다음에 또..."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_EC03
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE_EC03_800_Goodbye
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = MerchantShip
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC03_Bobby_Voice
#. Face = Spaceship / Confident
#. SoundFileID = 00881238
#. ScriptNotes = Confident
#. EDID: [0105356B]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001BDF"
msgid "Pleasure doing business with you, traveler."
msgstr "거래해서 즐거웠습니다. 여행자님."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_EC03
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE_EC03_150_CompanionComment
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = ActiveCompanion
#. VoiceType = NPCFSarahMorgan
#. Face = Spaceship / Friendly
#. SoundFileID = 00A7BC8B
#. ScriptNotes = Companion commenting on meeting the space traders once again. / Friendly
#. DialogueBefore = ActiveCompanion: How intriguing. What do you suppose those "specials" are?|I better go with you, you know, in case I see something I like.
#. EDID: [0106C808]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001BE0"
msgid "Oh it's that little space shop I like! Let's pay them a visit."
msgstr "아, 내가 좋아하는 그 작은 우주 상점이네! 한번 들러 보자."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_EC03
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE_EC03_150_CompanionComment
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = ActiveCompanion
#. VoiceType = NPCFAndreja
#. Face = Spaceship / Thinking
#. SoundFileID = 00EFB6B8
#. ScriptNotes = Companion commenting on the friendly radio exchange they just had with Bobby Kazan, space trader. / Thinking
#. DialogueAfter = ActiveCompanion: Oh look, it is those space traders. Do you want to go see what they have?
#. EDID: [0106C809]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001BE1"
msgid "I am kind of curious to see what they have on board now."
msgstr "지금은 선내에 뭐가 있는지 좀 궁금하군."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_EC03
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE_EC03_150_CompanionComment
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = ActiveCompanion
#. VoiceType = NPCFAndreja
#. Face = Spaceship / Surprised
#. SoundFileID = 0015E933
#. ScriptNotes = Companion commenting on the friendly radio exchange they just had with Bobby Kazan, space trader. / Surprised
#. EDID: [0106C809]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001BE2"
msgid "Well that was odd... I did not expect traders so far off in interplanetary space."
msgstr "음, 이상하군... 행성계 간 우주에서 이렇게 멀리 떨어진 상인들은 예상 못 했어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCCooperCarr
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCCooperCarr
#. Face = Irritated
#. SoundFileID = 00671821
#. ScriptNotes = Distant and a little annoyed. / Irritated
#. EDID: [0106B395]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001BE3"
msgid "I'm done talking anyway's."
msgstr "어차피 난 말 다 했어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCSawyerBrooks
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCSawyerBrooks
#. Face = Friendly
#. SoundFileID = 00881252
#. ScriptNotes = Casual and friendly. / Friendly
#. EDID: [0106B38C]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001BE4"
msgid "If you need anything, just let me know."
msgstr "필요한 게 있으면 말만 해."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCOpalWoods
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCOpalWoods
#. Face = Friendly
#. SoundFileID = 00259B05
#. ScriptNotes = Casual and friendly. / Friendly
#. EDID: [0106B387]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001BE5"
msgid "We can talk later."
msgstr "나중에 얘기하자."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = MS02GenericPartyGuest04VT
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS02GenericPartyGuest04VT
#. Face = Worried
#. SoundFileID = 00B2DB11
#. ScriptNotes = Concerned. / Worried
#. EDID: [0106B3B0]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001BE6"
msgid "Hey, if you need to sit down, then go sit down."
msgstr "야, 앉아야겠으면 가서 앉아."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = MS02GenericPartyGuest02VT
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS02GenericPartyGuest02VT
#. Face = Irritated
#. SoundFileID = 006B01DA
#. ScriptNotes = Annoyed. / Irritated
#. EDID: [0106B3AE]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001BE7"
msgid "Watch where you're going."
msgstr "앞 좀 보고 다녀."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCCooperCarr
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCCooperCarr
#. Face = Irritated
#. SoundFileID = 002C29EF
#. ScriptNotes = Annoyed. / Irritated
#. EDID: [0106B3A4]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001BE8"
msgid "You're going to trip on someone."
msgstr "그러다 누구한테 걸려 넘어진다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0300B_Wren
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCWrenCarr
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCWrenCarr
#. Face = Worried
#. SoundFileID = 00591C8F
#. ScriptNotes = Scared to tell Sadie about Opal, but knows she must. / Worried / to Player Default
#. Prompt = If you don't stand up for yourself, it won't end.
#. EDID: SFFL_MS02_YoureRightIHateThatYoureRight
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001BE9"
msgid "Alright. Guess I'm doing this."
msgstr "알았어. 내가 하게 되겠네."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0300B_Wren
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCWrenCarr
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCWrenCarr
#. Face = Sad
#. SoundFileID = 0048A986
#. ScriptNotes = Scared to tell Sadie about Opal, but knows she must. / Sad / to Player Default
#. Prompt = If you don't stand up for yourself, it won't end.
#. DialogueBefore = Wren: But what am I meant to do? Opal and Sadie have been best friends for years. I can't destroy that.
#. EDID: SFFL_MS02_YoureRightIHateThatYoureRight
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001BEA"
msgid "You're right... I hate that you're right."
msgstr "네 말이 맞아... 네 말이 맞다는 게 짜증 나."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = MS02GenericPartyGuest04VT
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS02GenericPartyGuest04VT
#. Face = Concentrating
#. SoundFileID = 00BF1F7E
#. ScriptNotes = After fight. Annoyed the party is over, but thinking aloud to save the night for herself. / Concentrating
#. EDID: [0106B43F]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001BEB"
msgid "I wonder if I can snatch a few drinks before I leave."
msgstr "떠나기 전에 술 몇 잔 낚아챌 수 있을까."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = MS02GenericPartyGuest03VT
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS02GenericPartyGuest03VT
#. Face = Happy
#. SoundFileID = 00FA7BDC
#. ScriptNotes = After fight. Trying to bring the mood back up. / Happy
#. EDID: [0106B429]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001BEC"
msgid "Come on! The party only ends if we let it. Woo!"
msgstr "가자! 우리가 끝내지 않는 한 파티는 안 끝나. 우!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = MS02GenericPartyGuest03VT
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS02GenericPartyGuest03VT
#. Face = Amused
#. SoundFileID = 00535EEE
#. ScriptNotes = During the fight. And living for the drama! / Amused
#. EDID: [0106B427]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001BED"
msgid "I do love some entertainment."
msgstr "난 여흥이 정말 좋아."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = MS02GenericPartyGuest01VT
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS02GenericPartyGuest01VT
#. Face = Friendly
#. SoundFileID = 003A85A7
#. ScriptNotes = Casual and Friendly. During party. / Friendly
#. EDID: [0106B419]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001BEE"
msgid "Sawyer and Opal said they found a new face. Welcome aboard."
msgstr "소여랑 오팔이 새로운 얼굴을 찾았다고 하더군. 승선을 환영해."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCCooperCarr
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCCooperCarr
#. Face = Angry
#. SoundFileID = 00B56A1A
#. ScriptNotes = During fight. Angry at what's going on. / Angry
#. EDID: [0106B413]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001BEF"
msgid "I'm busy."
msgstr "바빠."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCSadieCarr
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCSadieCarr
#. Face = Irritated
#. SoundFileID = 00C3CC27
#. ScriptNotes = After Fight. Mad at what Opal did. / Irritated
#. EDID: [0106B40B]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001BF0"
msgid "And to think, Opal was my friend."
msgstr "오팔이 내 친구였다는 걸 생각하면 참."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCSawyerBrooks
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCSawyerBrooks
#. Face = Friendly
#. SoundFileID = 00391F4C
#. ScriptNotes = Casual and friendly. Player hasn't joined Sawyer and Opal for drinks yet. / Friendly
#. EDID: [0106B3EC]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001BF1"
msgid "We'll all have a good time, trust me. Let's have some drinks."
msgstr "우린 다 즐거운 시간을 보낼 거야, 날 믿어. 술이나 마시자."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCOpalWoods
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCOpalWoods
#. Face = Somber
#. SoundFileID = 008FCFDD
#. ScriptNotes = Upset, but more so sad upset than mad upset. Fight ended and so did Opal's friendship with Sadie. / Somber
#. EDID: [0106B3E1]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001BF2"
msgid "I don't think you're welcome here anymore."
msgstr "넌 이제 여기서 환영받지 못하는 것 같아."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCOpalWoods
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCOpalWoods
#. Face = Smug
#. SoundFileID = 002919BB
#. ScriptNotes = Casual and friendly. Player hasn't joined Sawyer and Opal for drinks yet. / Smug
#. EDID: [0106B3D7]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001BF3"
msgid "Come on. We don't bite."
msgstr "어서 와. 우린 물지 않아."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = MS02GenericPartyGuest02VT / MS02GenericPartyGuest01VT / MS02GenericPartyGuest03VT / MS02GenericPartyGuest04VT
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS02GenericPartyGuest02VT / SFFL_MS02GenericPartyGuest01VT / SFFL_MS02GenericPartyGuest03VT / SFFL_MS02GenericPartyGuest04VT
#. Face = Angry
#. SoundFileID = 00917052
#. ScriptNotes = Starting Combat. Angry. / Angry
#. EDID: [0106B3D2]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001BF4"
msgid "You won't get away with that!"
msgstr "그냥 넘어갈 수 있을 줄 알아!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCWrenCarr
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCWrenCarr
#. Face = Angry
#. SoundFileID = 005A1973
#. ScriptNotes = Starting combat. Scared. / Angry
#. EDID: [0106B3C3]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001BF5"
msgid "Leave us alone!"
msgstr "우릴 내버려 둬!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCWrenCarr
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCWrenCarr
#. Face = Angry
#. SoundFileID = 0033B06B
#. ScriptNotes = Starting combat. Scared. / Angry
#. EDID: [0106B3C2]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001BF6"
msgid "What's going on?"
msgstr "무슨 일이야?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCOpalWoods
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCOpalWoods
#. Face = Angry
#. SoundFileID = 00BED0CE
#. ScriptNotes = Starting combat. Angry. / Angry
#. EDID: [0106B3BE]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001BF7"
msgid "How stupid are you?"
msgstr "넌 대체 얼마나 멍청한 거야?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = MS02GenericPartyGuest04VT
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS02GenericPartyGuest04VT
#. Face = Angry
#. SoundFileID = 0047EF6F
#. ScriptNotes = Angry. In combat. / Angry
#. EDID: [0106B377]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001BF8"
msgid "I just wanted to have a fun time, but no. You had to ruin that."
msgstr "난 그냥 즐겁게 놀고 싶었는데, 아니지. 네가 그걸 망쳐야 했지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = MS02GenericPartyGuest02VT
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS02GenericPartyGuest02VT
#. Face = Angry
#. SoundFileID = 003B7B80
#. ScriptNotes = Angry. In combat. / Angry
#. EDID: [0106B376]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001BF9"
msgid "I'm getting real tired of you."
msgstr "네가 정말 지겨워지고 있어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = MS02GenericPartyGuest02VT
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS02GenericPartyGuest02VT
#. Face = Angry
#. SoundFileID = 009F47AB
#. ScriptNotes = Angry. In combat. / Angry
#. EDID: [0106B375]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001BFA"
msgid "I can't wait to put you down."
msgstr "널 쓰러뜨리고 싶어서 못 참겠어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCSawyerBrooks
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCSawyerBrooks
#. Face = Angry
#. SoundFileID = 00AF6876
#. ScriptNotes = In combat. Angry. Trying to fight off Sawyer's turret system on the ship that suddenly turned on and attacked guests. / Angry
#. EDID: [0106B366]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001BFB"
msgid "Someone must have set them off."
msgstr "누군가가 그걸 작동시킨 게 분명해."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCSawyerBrooks
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCSawyerBrooks
#. Face = Angry
#. SoundFileID = 00B11567
#. ScriptNotes = In combat. Angry. Trying to fight off Sawyer's turret system on the ship that suddenly turned on and attacked guests. / Angry
#. EDID: SFFL_MS02_SAWYER_EveryoneTakeCover
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001BFC"
msgid "Everyone, take cover!"
msgstr "모두, 엄폐해!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCSawyerBrooks
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCSawyerBrooks
#. Face = Angry
#. SoundFileID = 00187B37
#. ScriptNotes = In combat. Angry. / Angry
#. EDID: [0106B35D]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001BFD"
msgid "Way to ruin the party!"
msgstr "파티를 망치는 데는 선수네!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCCooperCarr
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCCooperCarr
#. Face = Angry
#. SoundFileID = 0084EE3E
#. ScriptNotes = In combat. Angry. / Angry
#. EDID: [0106B355]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001BFE"
msgid "You're only making me madder."
msgstr "넌 날 더 화나게 만들 뿐이야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCWrenCarr
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCWrenCarr
#. Face = Angry
#. SoundFileID = 000794E6
#. ScriptNotes = In combat. Scared. / Angry
#. EDID: [0106B34B]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001BFF"
msgid "I don't want to hurt you. We can stop this."
msgstr "널 해치고 싶지 않아. 이걸 멈출 수 있어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCSadieCarr
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCSadieCarr
#. Face = Angry
#. SoundFileID = 00F22543
#. ScriptNotes = In combat. Angry. Trying to fight off Sawyer's turret system on the ship that suddenly turned on and attacked guests. / Angry
#. EDID: [0106B343]
