#. Speaker = Sawyer
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCSawyerBrooks
#. Face = Shocked
#. SoundFileID = 00C31A54
#. ScriptNotes = Shocked at what just happened. Not understanding fully what happened and how. / Shocked / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Sawyer: Woah, woah, what's going on here? &&& ... &&& Wren: I'm sorry... &&& Cooper: You don't have to say anything. &&& Cooper: We're going home.
#. DialogueAfter = Wren: I'm sorry...
#. EDID: [0104E26B]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001C0D"
msgid "I..."
msgstr "난..."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0950_SAWYER_FG
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Sawyer
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCSawyerBrooks
#. Face = Concerned
#. SoundFileID = 00AC7B67
#. ScriptNotes = Trying to figure out what the next plan of action it. A little frustrated. / Concerned / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Sadie learned the truth of Opal's abuse towards Wren.
#. EDID: [0104E274]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001C0E"
msgid "Dammit. I better talk to Opal after all this. Here, let's get you back to Anchorpoint."
msgstr "젠장. 이 일이 끝나면 결국 오팔과 얘기해야겠어. 자, 앵커포인트로 데려다줄게."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0950_SAWYER_FG
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Sawyer
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCSawyerBrooks
#. Face = Concerned
#. SoundFileID = 003EF43C
#. ScriptNotes = Surprised Opal would do such a thing, but trying to be understanding. / Concerned / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Sadie learned the truth of Opal's abuse towards Wren.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Sadie learned the truth of Opal's abuse towards Wren.
#. EDID: [0104E274]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001C0F"
msgid "I don't blame her reaction then. I'd be pissed off too."
msgstr "그렇다면 그녀가 그런 반응을 보인 것도 탓하진 않아. 나라도 화났을 거야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0950_SAWYER_FG
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Sawyer
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00B3D0D6
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Sawyer: What just happened...?
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: What...?
#. EDID: [0104E210]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001C10"
msgid "Justice."
msgstr "정의."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0480_PARTY
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Opal
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCOpalWoods
#. Face = Pleading
#. SoundFileID = 00B470D2
#. ScriptNotes = Sad that she was caught and trying to save her friendships. / Pleading
#. DialogueBefore = Opal: Sadie... Listen... &&& ... &&& Wren: I'm sorry... &&& Cooper: You don't have to say anything. &&& Cooper: We're going home.
#. DialogueAfter = Wren: I'm sorry...
#. EDID: [0104E27F]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001C11"
msgid "Sadie! Cooper! Wait! We can talk about this!"
msgstr "새이디! 쿠퍼! 기다려! 우리 얘기할 수 있어!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0480_PARTY
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Sadie
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCSadieCarr
#. Face = Angry
#. SoundFileID = 00853A4A
#. ScriptNotes = Angry. / Angry / to Sawyer
#. DialogueBefore = Sadie: You keep my sister's name out of your mouth! It doesn't matter who told me. You've been lying to me and been saying who knows what to Wren. &&& Opal: Sadie... Listen... &&& Sawyer: Woah, woah, what's going on here?
#. DialogueAfter = Wren: I'm sorry...
#. EDID: [0104E21B]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001C12"
msgid "What's going on is my family and I are heading home. Go on, Sawyer, take us home in your new ride."
msgstr "무슨 일이냐면, 우리 가족과 난 집으로 돌아간다는 거야. 가자, 소여. 네 새 탈것으로 우릴 집에 데려다줘."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0300Z_Wren_EMP
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Wren
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCWrenCarr
#. Face = Grateful
#. SoundFileID = 007D9521
#. ScriptNotes = Grateful. / Grateful / to Player Default
#. Prompt = I talked with those I knew who loved me.
#. EDID: [0104E1FE]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001C13"
msgid "Thank you for the advice."
msgstr "조언 고마워요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0300Z_Wren_EMP
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Wren
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCWrenCarr
#. Face = Worried
#. SoundFileID = 007DFB7D
#. ScriptNotes = Nervous to tell Sadie, but sees she needs to now. / Worried / to Player Default
#. Prompt = I talked with those I knew who loved me.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I talked with those I knew who loved me.
#. EDID: [0104E1FE]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001C14"
msgid "Like I should with Sadie. You're right. I'll go tell her."
msgstr "새이디에게 그래야 하는 것처럼요. 당신 말이 맞아요. 가서 말할게요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0300Z_Wren_EMP
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Wren
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCWrenCarr
#. Face = Grateful
#. SoundFileID = 005E2F31
#. ScriptNotes = Grateful. / Grateful / to Player Default
#. Prompt = I distanced myself from the problem.
#. EDID: [0104E209]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001C15"
msgid "Um, thank you."
msgstr "음, 고마워요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0300Z_Wren_EMP
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Wren
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCWrenCarr
#. Face = Worried
#. SoundFileID = 001FE744
#. ScriptNotes = Nervous to tell Sadie, but sees she needs to now. / Worried / to Player Default
#. Prompt = I distanced myself from the problem.
#. EDID: [0104E209]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001C16"
msgid "But she needs to know about this, doesn't she? Right... She does."
msgstr "하지만 그녀도 이 일을 알아야 하잖아요, 그렇죠? 맞아... 알아야 해요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0300Z_Wren_EMP
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Wren
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCWrenCarr
#. Face = Worried
#. SoundFileID = 00D1ED82
#. ScriptNotes = Nervous. / Worried / to Player Default
#. Prompt = I distanced myself from the problem.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I distanced myself from the problem.
#. EDID: [0104E209]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001C17"
msgid "My sister always invites me to these. I don't want to disappoint her and tell her 'No.'"
msgstr "언니는 항상 날 이런 데 초대해요. 실망시키면서 '싫어'라고 말하고 싶지 않아요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0300C_Wren_DIP
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0070F556
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Maybe. Unless Opal is jealous. You are Sadie's sister after all. &&& Wren: That's no reason to be jealous though. Opal and Sadie have been friends for years. Right?
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: You have? I haven't talked to anyone about this. It's just scary...
#. EDID: [0104E202]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001C18"
msgid "I've been in your position. Trust me, no one should ever go through what you're going through."
msgstr "나도 네 입장에 있어 봤어. 날 믿어. 누구도 네가 겪고 있는 일을 겪어선 안 돼."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0300B_Wren
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 007A14AC
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I've heard Opal has been causing you issues, is that true? &&& Wren: What? Why would you even ask that? Opal and Sadie are best friends. I'm Sadie's sister, why would Opal do anything to me?
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: But what am I meant to do? Opal and Sadie have been best friends for years. I can't destroy that.
#. EDID: [0104E27E]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001C19"
msgid "If you don't stand up for yourself, it won't end."
msgstr "네가 맞서지 않으면, 끝나지 않을 거야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0300C_Wren_DIP
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Wren
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 003A6E61
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Maybe. Unless Opal is jealous. You are Sadie's sister after all. &&& Wren: That's no reason to be jealous though. Opal and Sadie have been friends for years. Right?
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: I know she would, but-
#. EDID: [0104E258]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001C1A"
msgid "But you can't let Opal get away with harassing you. Sadie is your sister. She would want you safe above all."
msgstr "하지만 오팔이 널 괴롭히고도 그냥 넘어가게 둘 순 없어. 새이디는 네 언니잖아. 그녀라면 무엇보다 네 안전을 바랄 거야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0300B_Wren
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Wren
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0035F841
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I've heard Opal has been causing you issues, is that true? &&& Wren: What? Why would you even ask that? Opal and Sadie are best friends. I'm Sadie's sister, why would Opal do anything to me?
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: That's no reason to be jealous though. Opal and Sadie have been friends for years. Right?
#. EDID: [0104E24D]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001C1B"
msgid "Maybe. Unless Opal is jealous. You are Sadie's sister after all."
msgstr "그럴지도. 오팔이 질투하는 게 아니라면 말이야. 넌 결국 새이디의 여동생이니까."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0210B_OPAL
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCOpalWoods
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCOpalWoods
#. Face = Happy
#. SoundFileID = 00B678BB
#. ScriptNotes = (Player response: If you two don't tell me where I am right now...) Friendly. / Happy / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: If you two don't tell me where I am right now...
#. DialogueAfter = Sawyer: And the party still isn't over. We invited more in on the fun. Go ahead, have a blast! Drink. Mingle! Who knows, by the time all this is over, you may meet your new best friend.
#. EDID: [0104E22B]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001C1C"
msgid "Calm down. You're on Sawyer's ship. You're safe."
msgstr "진정해. 넌 소여의 우주선에 있어. 안전해."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0210A_SAWYER
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Sawyer
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCSawyerBrooks
#. Face = Happy
#. SoundFileID = 00E59F8D
#. ScriptNotes = Partly chuckling the 'oh' at the start. Somewhat making fun of the Player and how drunk they got. / Happy / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: My head is pounding.
#. DialogueAfter = Sawyer: And the party still isn't over. We invited more in on the fun. Go ahead, have a blast! Drink. Mingle! Who knows, by the time all this is over, you may meet your new best friend.
#. EDID: [0106D5D4]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001C1D"
msgid "Oh, yea, buddy. You drank so much! I thought you were gonna puke your guts up back at Anchorpoint. But hey, look at you now. Up and at 'em! "
msgstr "오, 그래, 친구. 너 엄청 마셨더라! 앵커포인트에서 속을 다 게워 낼 줄 알았어. 그런데 봐, 지금은 멀쩡히 일어났잖아! 힘내!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0150B_SAWYER
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Sawyer
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCSawyerBrooks
#. Face = Friendly
#. SoundFileID = 00F3F55C
#. ScriptNotes = Casual and friendly. / Friendly / to Player Default
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Sounds like you're waiting on some friends.
#. EDID: [0104E283]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001C1E"
msgid "Hey, sorry! We're not being too loud, are we? "
msgstr "아, 죄송해요! 저희가 너무 시끄럽진 않죠?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0150C_SAW&OPAL
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Sawyer
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00BB88C9
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Opal: Hm, what? Here to buy a lady a drink? Too bad. I already got a boyfriend. &&& ... &&& Sawyer: Of course! This is a celebration! Come on, sit! Join us. &&& Opal: Really, Sawyer? Them? &&& Sawyer: Don't mind Opal. She has a hard time making new friends. |Who knows. We all may end up being peas in a pod!
#. DialogueAfter = Sawyer: I finally got my new ship paid off. Even sounds wild to say.
#. EDID: [0104E214]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001C1F"
msgid "What are you celebrating?"
msgstr "뭘 축하하는 거지?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0150C_SAW&OPAL
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCSawyerBrooks
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCSawyerBrooks
#. Face = Happy
#. SoundFileID = 00EEC7B8
#. ScriptNotes = Casual and Friendly. (Player response: Sure. I would love to join you two.) / Happy / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Sure. I would love to join you.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Sure. I would love to join you.
#. DialogueAfter = Sawyer: I finally got my new ship paid off. Even sounds wild to say.
#. EDID: [0104E232]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001C20"
msgid "Take a seat."
msgstr "앉아."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0300C_OPAL&SAWYER
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Opal
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCOpalWoods
#. Face = Angry
#. SoundFileID = 00418031
#. ScriptNotes = Angry at the Player. / Angry / to Player
#. DialogueBefore = Opal: I'll explain later. For now, take this asshole back to the dump where we found him.
#. EDID: [0106B28A]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001C21"
msgid "Hope you drink, and choke on your own vomit. "
msgstr "마시다가 네 토사물에 목 막혀 죽으면 좋겠어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0300B_OPAL
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Opal
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCOpalWoods
#. Face = Disbelief
#. SoundFileID = 00DC3993
#. ScriptNotes = Shocked the Player found the slate she vented into. Angry at them. / Disbelief / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: You sure had some colorful things to say in this slate of yours.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: I have your friends in the palm of my hands. I know exactly what to do with this slate.
#. EDID: [0106B2B4]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001C22"
msgid "Where did you find that? That wasn't for you to listen to!"
msgstr "그걸 어디서 찾았어? 그건 네가 들으라고 둔 게 아니야!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0101_SAW&OPAL
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Sawyer
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCSawyerBrooks
#. Face = Amused
#. SoundFileID = 0023A4E6
#. ScriptNotes = Casual and having fun. / Amused / to Sawyer
#. DialogueBefore = Sawyer: So, when do you think the others will get here? &&& Opal: Should be any moment. But their loss. We get to start the party early.
#. DialogueAfter = Opal: This will be one hell of a celebration, won't it, Sawyer?
#. EDID: [0104E296]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001C23"
msgid "Hear, hear!"
msgstr "옳소!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0300C_OPAL&SAWYER
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Opal
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCOpalWoods
#. Face = Angry
#. SoundFileID = 001B97A8
#. ScriptNotes = Angry. / Angry / to Sawyer
#. DialogueBefore = Sawyer: Opal, what's going on?
#. DialogueAfter = Opal: Hope you drink, and choke on your own vomit.
#. EDID: [0106B2E3]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001C24"
msgid "I'll explain later. For now, take this asshole back to the dump where we found her."
msgstr "나중에 설명할게. 지금은 이 개자식을 우리가 발견한 쓰레기장으로 다시 데려가."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0300C_OPAL&SAWYER
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Opal
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCOpalWoods
#. Face = Angry
#. SoundFileID = 00916E7F
#. ScriptNotes = Angry. / Angry / to Sawyer
#. DialogueBefore = Sawyer: Opal, what's going on?
#. DialogueAfter = Opal: Hope you drink, and choke on your own vomit.
#. EDID: [0106B2E2]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001C25"
msgid "I'll explain later. For now, take this asshole back to the dump where we found him."
msgstr "나중에 설명할게. 지금은 이 개자식을 우리가 발견한 쓰레기장으로 다시 데려가."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0300B_SADIE
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Sadie
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0033C973
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: You should listen to this slate I found. &&& Sadie: A slate? Is this Opal's? Why do you have that? Let me see it.|What? I'm sorry. What is this? What- Why would she even say this?
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Trust me. She's going to.
#. EDID: [0106B273]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001C26"
msgid "Opal needs to pay."
msgstr "오팔은 대가를 치러야 해."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0300B_SADIE
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Sadie
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00AA7390
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: You should listen to this slate I found. &&& Sadie: A slate? Is this Opal's? Why do you have that? Let me see it.|What? I'm sorry. What is this? What- Why would she even say this?
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: We're going to talk, alright.
#. EDID: [0106B440]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001C27"
msgid "You should talk with Opal."
msgstr "오팔과 얘기해 봐야 해."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0300D_Wren_SLATE
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0066360C
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: If she wasn't then she wouldn't have said what she said in this slate. &&& Wren: What? Let me see that. &&& Wren: Where did you get this? I just- &&& Wren: I don't get it. Why does she do this? Sadie's her friend. She's dating my brother. Yet there is something wrong with me? What the hell?
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: You're right... This isn't fair. Why do I have to be the one to speak up?
#. EDID: [0106B298]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001C28"
msgid "And she won't stop unless you do something about it."
msgstr "네가 어떻게 하지 않는 한 그녀는 멈추지 않을 거야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_TL_WREN_02
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Wren
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCWrenCarr
#. Face = Somber
#. SoundFileID = 001C788F
#. ScriptNotes = Shy and self conscious of how she looks at the party. / Somber / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Is this your first party?
#. EDID: [0106B396]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001C29"
msgid "No. Do I look that much out of place? Sawyer's parties just never were my thing. I feel like a fish out of water."
msgstr "아니. 내가 그렇게 안 어울려 보여? 소여의 파티는 원래 내 취향이 아니었어. 물 밖에 나온 물고기 같은 기분이야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0300D_Wren_SLATE
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Wren
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 008C14F4
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: If she wasn't then she wouldn't have said what she said in this slate. &&& Wren: What? Let me see that. &&& Wren: Where did you get this? I just- &&& Wren: I don't get it. Why does she do this? Sadie's her friend. She's dating my brother. Yet there is something wrong with me? What the hell?
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: I'm tired of acting like it's me. I've done nothing to her.
#. EDID: [0106B2A4]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001C2A"
msgid "You're not the problem. She is."
msgstr "문제는 네가 아니야. 그녀지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_TL_SAWYER_01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Sawyer
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCSawyerBrooks
#. Face = Amused
#. SoundFileID = 00E2111E
#. ScriptNotes = Casual, friendly, and really excited to talk about his ship. / Amused / to Player Default
#. EDID: [0106B2C8]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001C2B"
msgid "I had this ship before then, but hey, with all the new credits I thought 'why not make this place even better?' I think it turned out amazing!"
msgstr ""
"그전부터 이 우주선은 갖고 있었지만, 새 크레딧이 잔뜩 생겼으니 '이곳을 더 좋게 만들어 보지 뭐' 싶었지. 정말 멋지게 나온 것 같아!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_TL_SAWYER_01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Sawyer
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCSawyerBrooks
#. Face = Happy
#. SoundFileID = 00234C9B
#. ScriptNotes = Casual and friendly. / Happy / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Where did you get the money for this nice ship?
#. EDID: [0106B2C8]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001C2C"
msgid "My parents. We haven't seen eye to eye in a long time till recently. Guess they were happy to have their boy back and gave me a real nice allowance. "
msgstr "부모님이야. 최근까지 오랫동안 사이가 좋지 않았거든. 아들이 돌아와서 기뻤는지 꽤 넉넉한 용돈을 주셨어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_TL_SADIE_02
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Sadie
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCSadieCarr
#. Face = Friendly
#. SoundFileID = 00FE9F82
#. ScriptNotes = Chuckle at start. Casual, friendly, and chill. / Friendly / to Player Default
#. EDID: [0106B2BF]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001C2D"
msgid "I kid. All three of us have known each other since we were little. Been best of friends ever since."
msgstr "농담이야. 우리 셋은 어릴 때부터 알고 지냈어. 그때부터 쭉 가장 친한 친구였지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_TL_SADIE_02
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Sadie
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCSadieCarr
#. Face = Friendly
#. SoundFileID = 0066824E
#. ScriptNotes = Casual and friendly. Making a joke. / Friendly / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Do you know Opal or Sawyer very well?
#. EDID: [0106B2BF]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001C2E"
msgid "Enough to be invited."
msgstr "초대받을 만큼은 되지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_TL_OPAL_02
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Opal
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCOpalWoods
#. Face = Smug
#. SoundFileID = 00395B40
#. ScriptNotes = Casual and a little smug. / Smug
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: How are you liking the party so far?
#. EDID: [0106B27F]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001C2F"
msgid "It beats staying at home doing nothing. And there's booze. Not much else for me to say."
msgstr "집에 앉아서 아무것도 안 하는 것보단 나아. 술도 있고. 더 할 말은 별로 없어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0250_CooperGossip
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00BDA90D
#. DialogueAfter = Cooper: There's my sister, Sadie. She's a wizard at tech and decor. See how nice this ship looks? Yeah, she did that. Sawyer paid her a pretty credit for it all too.
#. EDID: [0106B278]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001C30"
msgid "Can you tell me anything about anyone here?"
msgstr "여기 있는 사람들에 대해 아는 거 좀 말해 줄 수 있어?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_TL_COOPER_01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Cooper
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCCooperCarr
#. Face = Thinking
#. SoundFileID = 007C128C
#. ScriptNotes = Casual. At the time frame he starts thinking aloud a bit like doing math in his head. At the end his voice is soft and sweet. / Thinking / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: How long have you and Opal been dating?
#. EDID: [0106B2F5]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001C31"
msgid "Long. I'd say about three years and eight months? Yea. That sounds about right. Can't say I regret a day of it."
msgstr "오래됐지. 한 3년 8개월 정도? 그래. 그 정도가 맞는 것 같아. 하루도 후회한다고는 못 하겠어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0250_CooperGossip
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Cooper
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCCooperCarr
#. Face = Irritated
#. SoundFileID = 00903C8A
#. ScriptNotes = Not really in the mood to talk, but will brag about his sister if given the chance. / Irritated / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Can you tell me anything about anyone here?
#. EDID: [0106B2C9]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001C32"
msgid "There's my sister, Sadie. She's a wizard at tech and decor. See how nice this ship looks? Yeah, she did that. Sawyer paid her a pretty credit for it all too."
msgstr ""
"저쪽은 내 여동생 새이디야. 기술이랑 장식 쪽에선 마법사나 다름없지. 이 우주선이 얼마나 멋진지 보여? 그래, 그녀가 한 거야. 소여도 "
"꽤 두둑한 크레딧을 지불했고."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0300_WREN_SC02
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00DC76B6
#. EDID: [0106B2CB]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001C33"
msgid "If you let Opal of all people bully you, then you must be spineless."
msgstr "다른 사람도 아니고 오팔한테 괴롭힘당한다면, 넌 줏대가 없는 거야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_TL_OPAL_01
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00C91BB0
#. DialogueAfter = Opal: I don't know. You lose track after a while. Maybe that's a good thing, right? He's sweet though, even if he seems otherwise.
#. EDID: [0106B2F2]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001C34"
msgid "How long have you and Cooper been dating?"
msgstr "너와 쿠퍼는 얼마나 오래 사귀었어?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0300_WREN_SCRepeat
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Wren
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCWrenCarr
#. Face = Worried
#. SoundFileID = 002DE8BF
#. ScriptNotes = Speech Challenge success. Worried and unsure. / Worried / to Player Default
#. EDID: [0106B2FE]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001C35"
msgid "You have a point."
msgstr "일리가 있네."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0300_WREN_SC04
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Wren
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCWrenCarr
#. Face = Worried
#. SoundFileID = 00D4656D
#. ScriptNotes = Speech Challenge success. Worried about telling the others about Opal. / Worried / to Player Default
#. EDID: [0106B2A5]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001C36"
msgid "If I could tell the others I would. But is it really that simple?"
msgstr "다른 사람들에게 말할 수 있으면 말했겠지. 하지만 정말 그렇게 간단한 일일까?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0300_WREN_SCRepeat
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00AD9405
#. EDID: [0106B2D2]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001C37"
msgid "If you don't feel comfortable telling Sadie, you can always tell Cooper."
msgstr "새이디에게 말하는 게 불편하면, 언제든 쿠퍼에게 말해도 돼."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0252_WREN_GREETING
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Wren
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCWrenCarr
#. Face = Concerned
#. SoundFileID = 0071FBD0
#. ScriptNotes = Putting herself down again. / Concerned / to Player Default
#. EDID: [0106D684]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001C38"
msgid "I'm sure you'd have a better time with them instead. Or heck, even Opal and Sawyer would be better company than me right now."
msgstr "그 사람들과 함께라면 분명 더 즐거울 거야. 아니, 지금은 오팔이나 소여도 나보다는 나은 상대겠지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0252_WREN_GREETING
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Wren
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCWrenCarr
#. Face = Concerned
#. SoundFileID = 00084E3B
#. ScriptNotes = Trying to make conversation, but very nervous. / Concerned / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Wren: I heard Opal and Sawyer found you. So I doubt that.
#. EDID: [0106D684]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001C39"
msgid "Sorry. My name is Wren. Cooper and Sadie brought me along."
msgstr "미안. 내 이름은 렌이야. 쿠퍼와 새이디가 데려왔어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0300D_SAWYER_FG
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Sawyer
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCSawyerBrooks
#. Face = Confused
#. SoundFileID = 00287C0E
#. ScriptNotes = Confused on what happened. Slightly annoyed. / Confused / to Player Default
#. Prompt = I'm with her. I just want to go back to Anchorpoint.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I'm with her. I just want to go back to Anchorpoint.
#. EDID: [0106D67E]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001C3A"
msgid "Yeah. Yeah. I can take you there."
msgstr "그래. 그래. 거기로 데려다줄 수 있어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0300D_SAWYER_FG
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Sawyer
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCSawyerBrooks
#. Face = Confused
#. SoundFileID = 0064A664
#. ScriptNotes = Confused about the slate, but just wants to get the Player back to Anchorpoint. / Confused / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Barely anything. Here. Make sure Sadie or Cooper gets this slate.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Barely anything. Here. Make sure Sadie or Cooper gets this slate.
#. EDID: [0106D674]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001C3B"
msgid "Why would they want this slate? I guess it can wait. Let me take you back to Anchorpoint."
msgstr "그들이 왜 이 슬레이트를 원하지? 뭐, 그건 나중에 생각해도 되겠지. 앵커포인트로 데려다줄게."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0300D_SAWYER_FG
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Sawyer
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00290A03
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Sawyer: What did you do?
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: A slate? You caused all this over a slate? Whatever. I'll take a listen later. For now, let's get you back to Anchorpoint.
#. EDID: [0106D699]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001C3C"
msgid "Take this slate. It will fill you in on everything."
msgstr "이 슬레이트를 가져가. 모든 내용을 알 수 있을 거야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0300D_SAWYER_FG
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Sawyer
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00E382DA
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Sawyer: What did you do?
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Why would they want this slate? I guess it can wait. Let me take you back to Anchorpoint.
#. EDID: [0106D6A2]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001C3D"
msgid "Barely anything. Here. Make sure Sadie or Cooper gets this slate."
msgstr "거의 아무것도 몰라. 여기. 새이디나 쿠퍼가 이 슬레이트를 받게 해 줘."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0252_COOPER_GREETING
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Cooper
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCCooperCarr
#. Face = Irritated
#. SoundFileID = 0038AD59
#. ScriptNotes = Annoyed. Sarcastic at the end. / Irritated / to Player Default
#. Prompt = I wanted to meet everyone else here.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I wanted to meet everyone else here.
#. DialogueAfter = Cooper: Right. Fine. I'm Cooper. I'm here because Opal and Sadie wanted me here. Not because Sawyer's get-togethers are my style. That's all.
#. EDID: [0106D6A1]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001C3E"
msgid "So you're the overly friendly type? Great."
msgstr "그러니까 넌 지나치게 친절한 타입이구나? 훌륭하네."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0252_WREN_GREETING
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Wren
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCWrenCarr
#. Face = Concerned
#. SoundFileID = 000BAF72
#. ScriptNotes = Shy, and putting herself down again. / Concerned / to Player Default
#. Prompt = I was just told to mingle. I don't think it mattered with who.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I was just told to mingle. I don't think it mattered with who.
#. DialogueAfter = Wren: Sorry. My name is Wren. Cooper and Sadie brought me along.
#. EDID: [0106D67D]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001C3F"
msgid "I just think you'll have a better time doing it elsewhere."
msgstr "그냥 다른 곳에서 하는 게 더 즐거울 거라고 생각해."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ04
#. SceneName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ04_KillianTL_TurnIn
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = KillianBrice
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMKillianBrice
#. Face = Friendly
#. SoundFileID = 002C6AB5
#. ScriptNotes = Very pleased / Friendly / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I've recovered the lost shipment.
#. EDID: [0106573D]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001C40"
msgid "That's good news."
msgstr "좋은 소식이군."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ04
#. SceneName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ04_KillianTL_TurnIn
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = KillianBrice
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMKillianBrice
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 006201F1
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = KillianBrice:
#. EDID: [01065746]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001C41"
msgid "Perhaps another such opportunity will present itself soon."
msgstr "곧 또 다른 기회가 찾아올지도 모르겠네."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Voice
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Voice
#. Face = Depressed
#. SoundFileID = 00FCC49D
#. ScriptNotes = Gloria doesn't want to talk to the player anymore. / Depressed
#. EDID: [0104BFFA]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001C42"
msgid "Just... go away. Please."
msgstr "그냥... 가 줘. 제발."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Voice
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Voice
#. Face = Sad
#. SoundFileID = 00FBF3DF
#. ScriptNotes = Gloria being a depressed teen trying to cope with the bad situation she's in, and feeling like she has to apologize for it as well. / Sad
#. EDID: [010485EE]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001C43"
msgid "I'm so sorry..."
msgstr "정말 미안해..."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Voice
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Voice
#. Face = Sad
#. SoundFileID = 005FD6E2
#. ScriptNotes = Gloria being a depressed teen trying to cope with the bad situation she's in. / Sad
#. EDID: [010485FB]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001C44"
msgid "This is not what I wanted."
msgstr "이건 내가 원한 게 아니야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC01
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Warning_3
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Speaker06
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Voice
#. Face = Spaceship / Confused
#. SoundFileID = 00A8AB45
#. ScriptNotes = Talking over PA system, a bit embarrassed after trying to activate countermeasures but reactivating ship gravity instead. / Confused
#. DialogueBefore = Speaker03: Okay, you asked for it. Defense systems activated!
#. DialogueAfter = Speaker03: Ow! That really hurt!
#. EDID: SFFL_BE_EC01SharedInfo02
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001C45"
msgid "No wait, that's not it. Let me try again."
msgstr "아니, 잠깐. 그게 아니야. 다시 해 볼게."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC01
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Warning_2
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Speaker01
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Voice
#. Face = Spaceship / Nervous
#. SoundFileID = 0049FE41
#. ScriptNotes = Gloria talking to player over PA system, trying to get them to turn around and leave her ship (she's serious about "activating countermeasures"). / Nervous
#. DialogueAfter = Speaker01: Turn around and go back to your ship.
#. EDID: SFFL_BE_EC01SharedInfo05
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001C46"
msgid "I'm serious! I'll do it!"
msgstr "진심이야! 정말 할 거야!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC01
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Warning_2
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Speaker01
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Voice
#. Face = Spaceship / Nervous
#. SoundFileID = 00FAE524
#. ScriptNotes = Gloria talking to player over PA system, trying to get them to turn around and leave her ship. / Nervous
#. EDID: SFFL_BE_EC01SharedInfo05
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001C47"
msgid "This is your last warning. Go back or...uh...I'll activate countermeasures."
msgstr "마지막 경고야. 돌아가, 아니면... 어... 대응 조치를 작동시킬 거야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Voice
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Voice
#. Face = Nervous
#. SoundFileID = 00783B4E
#. ScriptNotes = Eager to get on the player's ship and leave for New Atlantis, hopefully before her stepfather arrives. / Nervous
#. EDID: [0104D02A]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001C48"
msgid "I'm right behind you."
msgstr "바로 뒤따라갈게."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC01
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC01_GloriaSwansen_SC_Hard04
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Gloria
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Voice
#. Face = Sad
#. SoundFileID = 006674B8
#. ScriptNotes = Gloria realizing that her actions could have an impact on other people's lives, and she doesn't see herself as a selfish person. / Sad
#. EDID: [0104074F]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001C49"
msgid "Well I sure don't want to hurt anyone..."
msgstr "글쎄, 난 정말 아무도 다치게 하고 싶지 않아..."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC01
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC01_GloriaSwansen_SC_StarbornPerk
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Gloria
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Voice
#. Face = Afraid
#. SoundFileID = 008B08F7
#. ScriptNotes = Gloria reacts negatively at the Starborn player's words which suggests they know her future. / Afraid
#. EDID: [01040749]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001C4A"
msgid "Why are you saying that? Did someone send you after me? Are you *stalking* me?"
msgstr "왜 그런 말을 하는 거야? 누가 널 보내서 날 쫓게 했어? 너 나를 *스토킹*하는 거야?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC01
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC01_GloriaSwansen_SC_StarbornPerk
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Gloria
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Voice
#. Face = Surprised
#. SoundFileID = 003911F4
#. ScriptNotes = Gloria is confused and tries to deny, but she can't hide the fact that she's troubled by the player's words. / Surprised
#. EDID: [01040748]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001C4B"
msgid "I um, I didn't actually... How did you know? Is it that obvious?"
msgstr "나, 음, 사실은 안... 어떻게 알았어? 그렇게 티 나?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC01
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Dialogue_600_OpeningUp
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Gloria
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Voice
#. Face = Angry
#. SoundFileID = 0005CD12
#. ScriptNotes = Frustrated that player won't listen to her, clams up. / Angry
#. Prompt = Not right now.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Not right now.
#. DialogueAfter = Gloria: The truth is... this isn't my ship. It's my stepfather's.
#. EDID: [0104A1CA]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001C4C"
msgid "You know what? Never mind. I'm not saying anything else."
msgstr "됐어. 아무것도 아니야. 더는 말 안 할래."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC01
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC01_GloriaSwansen_SC_Hard03
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Gloria
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Voice
#. Face = Pleading
#. SoundFileID = 00505953
#. ScriptNotes = Her stepfather isn't a good parent, nor a good person. Probably abusive, though to what extent we won't know. She'll run away again. / Pleading
#. EDID: [0104075E]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001C4D"
msgid "No please, I can't go back there!"
msgstr "안 돼, 제발. 거기로 돌아갈 순 없어!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC01
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC01_GloriaSwansen_SC_Med01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Gloria
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Voice
#. Face = Somber
#. SoundFileID = 0067E6F6
#. ScriptNotes = Not being mopey or whining. She really does feel alone in the world, and it's starting to harden her heart. / Somber
#. EDID: [0104076D]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001C4E"
msgid "Nope. Nobody cares if I live or die."
msgstr "아니. 내가 살든 죽든 아무도 신경 안 써."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC01
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC01_GloriaSwansen_SC_Med01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Gloria
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Voice
#. Face = Sad
#. SoundFileID = 00901EF2
#. ScriptNotes = Gloria is thinking of her cousin in New Atlantis, the only member of her family she is close to. / Sad
#. EDID: [0104076C]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001C4F"
msgid "Only one, really...and I was planning on telling them I was okay."
msgstr "딱 한 명은 있어... 그리고 그 사람한테 내가 괜찮다고 말할 생각이었어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC01
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC01_GloriaSwansen_SC_Hard03
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 008E1985
#. EDID: [01040757]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001C50"
msgid "I'll call SysDef, they should be able to get you back to your family."
msgstr "성계 방위군에 연락할게. 그들이 네 가족에게 돌려보내 줄 수 있을 거야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC01
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC01_GloriaSwansen_SC_Med05
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 002F5169
#. EDID: [01040774]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001C51"
msgid "It doesn't have to be like this. Help me help you."
msgstr "꼭 이렇게 될 필요는 없어. 내가 널 도울 수 있게 해 줘."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC01
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Dialogue_500_Initial_Encounter
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Gloria
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Voice
#. Face = Suspicious
#. SoundFileID = 001A93E9
#. ScriptNotes = Not sure if she should trust the player or not. / Suspicious
#. Prompt = Do I look like I want to hurt you?
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Do I look like I want to hurt you?
#. DialogueAfter = Gloria: I'm not going to hurt you, I just want to talk.
#. EDID: [01040768]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001C52"
msgid "Kinda? I don't know."
msgstr "어느 정도는? 모르겠어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC01
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC01_GloriaSwansen_SC_Easy05
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Gloria
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Voice
#. Face = Defiant
#. SoundFileID = 00964FC1
#. ScriptNotes = She is starting to clam up, her usual reaction when being questioned. / Defiant
#. EDID: [01040754]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001C53"
msgid "Sorry, but I don't trust you. Or anyone."
msgstr "미안하지만, 난 널 믿지 않아. 누구도 믿지 않아."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC01
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC01_GloriaSwansen_SC_Med03
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Gloria
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Voice
#. Face = Confused
#. SoundFileID = 009C8F04
#. ScriptNotes = Gloria is caught between her wanting to get out of her predicament by trusting the player and the risk she's taking by doing so. / Confused
#. EDID: [0104074A]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001C54"
msgid "I really want to trust you..."
msgstr "정말 널 믿고 싶어..."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC01
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC01_GloriaSwansen_SC_Easy02
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Gloria
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Voice
#. Face = Depressed
#. SoundFileID = 002D7303
#. ScriptNotes = The player's kindness and patience in trying to understand how she ended up here is starting to work, and Gloria is opening up just a bit. / Depressed
#. EDID: [01040760]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001C55"
msgid "I wouldn't even know where to start..."
msgstr "어디서부터 시작해야 할지도 모르겠어..."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC01
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC01_GloriaSwansen_SC_Easy04
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 001C625C
#. EDID: [0104076A]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001C56"
msgid "I can do this all day. You'll tire before I do."
msgstr "난 하루 종일도 할 수 있어. 네가 나보다 먼저 지칠 거야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC01
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC01_GloriaSwansen_SC_Easy01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Gloria
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Voice
#. Face = Stern
#. SoundFileID = 00699928
#. ScriptNotes = Gloria doesn't trust the player, and is determine to find her way alone (even if she's afraid of what will happen out there). / Stern
#. EDID: [0104089D]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001C57"
msgid "I don't need your help. Just go."
msgstr "네 도움은 필요 없어. 그냥 가."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC01
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC01_GloriaSwansen_SC_Hard01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Gloria
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Voice
#. Face = Concerned
#. SoundFileID = 00643C57
#. ScriptNotes = Not sure if the player is joking when they say that they could leave them to freeze to death in this derelict spaceship. / Concerned
#. EDID: [0104089F]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001C58"
msgid "You wouldn't do that, right? I mean..."
msgstr "넌 그러지 않을 거지? 내 말은..."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC01
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Dialogue_630_PlayerKnowsStory
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Gloria
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Voice
#. Face = Somber
#. SoundFileID = 00637492
#. ScriptNotes = More comfortable around the player now that she's told the story of how she stole her stepfather's ship. / Somber / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Gloria: The truth is... this isn't my ship. It's my stepfather's.|I had to get away, you know? As far away as I could... so I thought, why not take his ship, right?|But he set up an anti-theft system that totally bricked the ship. He's probably on his way here.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: I can give you a lift if you want.
#. EDID: [0104D033]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001C59"
msgid "Go ahead, I'm all ears."
msgstr "말해 봐. 귀 기울여 듣고 있어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC01
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Dialogue_630_PlayerKnowsStory
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Gloria
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Voice
#. Face = Depressed
#. SoundFileID = 000BC0AE
#. ScriptNotes = Gloria has finished revealing her story about how she ran away from home after stealing her abusive stepfather's prized cargo ship. / Depressed / to Player Default
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: I can give you a lift if you want.
#. EDID: [0104A1CC]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001C5A"
msgid "Kind of lame now that I said it out loud..."
msgstr "입 밖으로 내고 보니 좀 별로네..."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC01
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Dialogue_630_PlayerKnowsStory
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Gloria
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Voice
#. Face = Depressed
#. SoundFileID = 00382F90
#. ScriptNotes = Gloria has finished revealing her story about how she ran away from home after stealing her abusive stepfather's prized cargo ship. / Depressed / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Gloria: The truth is... this isn't my ship. It's my stepfather's.|I had to get away, you know? As far away as I could... so I thought, why not take his ship, right?|But he set up an anti-theft system that totally bricked the ship. He's probably on his way here.
#. EDID: [0104A1CC]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001C5B"
msgid "So that's it. That's my story."
msgstr "그래서 그게 전부야. 그게 내 이야기야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC01
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Dialogue_700_WaitingForStepfather
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Gloria
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Voice
#. Face = Nervous
#. SoundFileID = 003D67D4
#. ScriptNotes = Feeling urgency to get on the player's ship as she fears her (possibly violent) stepfather arrive to take his stolen ship back. / Nervous / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Gloria: Uh...yeah, I do want that.|In fact, if you could take me to New Atlantis that'd be awesome.
#. EDID: [0104D020]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001C5C"
msgid "Let's go before my stepfather gets here!"
msgstr "새아버지가 오기 전에 가자!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC01
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Dialogue_700_WaitingForStepfather
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Gloria
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Voice
#. Face = Nervous
#. SoundFileID = 003CAB5A
#. ScriptNotes = Gloria still trying to maintain the charade that this is really her ship, and that she'll come back to it later (which is not true). / Nervous / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Gloria: Uh...yeah, I do want that.|In fact, if you could take me to New Atlantis that'd be awesome.
#. EDID: [0104D01F]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001C5D"
msgid "I'll just...come back for the ship later."
msgstr "우주선은 그냥... 나중에 다시 찾으러 올게."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_EC01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Voice
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Voice
#. Face = Nervous
#. SoundFileID = 007AADC9
#. ScriptNotes = Sincerely grateful to player for rescuing her from deep space and a potentially angry stepfather. A bit embarrassed by the long goodbye. / Nervous
#. EDID: [0104DEAC]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001C5E"
msgid "Okay, I'm just gonna go now."
msgstr "좋아, 난 이제 갈게."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_EC01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Andreja
#. VoiceType = NPCFAndreja
#. Face = Disbelief
#. SoundFileID = 00A2825A
#. ScriptNotes = Andreja commenting on the teenage runaway that has been rescued from a derelict ship she stole from her stepfather, and is now on player's ship. / Disbelief
#. EDID: [0106C503]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001C5F"
msgid "I cannot believe a child would disrespect her guardian that way..."
msgstr "아이가 자기 보호자에게 그런 식으로 무례하게 굴다니 믿을 수 없군..."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_EC01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = SarahMorgan
#. VoiceType = NPCFSarahMorgan
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00224EA4
#. ScriptNotes = Sarah commenting on the runaway teen now aboard the ship, reminiscing about her own youth and a missing friend from that time. / Serious
#. EDID: [0106C50F]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001C60"
msgid "None of us knows what she became, but I often think of her. I just hope she found peace."
msgstr "그녀가 어떤 사람이 되었는지는 아무도 모르지만, 난 종종 그녀를 생각해. 그저 평안을 찾았기를 바랄 뿐이야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_EC01
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE_EC01_80_AcceptHailScene
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = cargoShip
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0052FCD2
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = cargoShip: Hey there, if you can hear me...we're fine! We don't need anything! &&& cargoShip: ...wait, is it this button? Or that one? &&& cargoShip: &&& cargoShip: Really, there's no need to respond.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Huh...just a temporary hiccup. We're working on it. Just keep going. Bye!
#. EDID: [010485F9]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001C61"
msgid "What's your situation? Are you in danger?"
msgstr "상황이 어때? 위험한 상태야?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_EC01
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE_EC01_50_HailingShip
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = cargoShip
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Voice
#. Face = Spaceship / Depressed
#. SoundFileID = 00D6F1B2
#. ScriptNotes = Frustrated, trying to hail the player's ship to tell them to go away, not sure if they hear her. / Depressed
#. DialogueBefore = cargoShip: ...wait, is it this button? Or that one?
#. DialogueAfter = cargoShip: Really, there's no need to respond.
#. EDID: [010485F6]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001C62"
msgid "Come on... why are there so many buttons!?"
msgstr "제발... 버튼이 왜 이렇게 많아!?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_EC01
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE_EC01_550_GloriaGoodbye
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Gloria
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Voice
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 00B5F12E
#. ScriptNotes = Expressing confidence that things will be all right in her new life. / Confident / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Do you need anything else?
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Do you need anything else?
#. DialogueAfter = Gloria: Good luck out there, <Alias=Gloria>.
#. EDID: [0104DAC2]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001C63"
msgid "I'm all set. I have enough credits to last me for a year. By that time I should have a job."
msgstr "난 준비해뒀어. 1년은 버틸 만큼 크레딧을 모아뒀어. 그때쯤이면 일자리도 구했겠지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_EC01
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE_EC01_530_GloriaRadioGoodbye
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Gloria
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Voice
#. Face = Spaceship / Grateful
#. SoundFileID = 008ABF6E
#. ScriptNotes = In addition to a thank you, if the player has been really nice to her, she also sends them some credits (that she perhaps stole from her stepfather). / Grateful
#. EDID: [0104DEB7]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001C64"
msgid "Maybe I'll see you around. Safe travels."
msgstr "언젠가 또 볼지도 모르지. 안전하게 여행해."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_EC01
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE_EC01_530_GloriaRadioGoodbye
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Gloria
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Voice
#. Face = Spaceship / Happy
#. SoundFileID = 0020FB8E
#. ScriptNotes = In addition to a thank you, if the player has been really nice to her, she also sends them some credits (that she perhaps stole from her stepfather). / Happy
#. DialogueBefore = Gloria: Hey, I just wanted to thank you for helping me out there.
#. EDID: [0104DEB7]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001C65"
msgid "Here's a little something for being such a nice person."
msgstr "나한테 잘해 줬으니까 주는 거야. 별건 아니지만 받아 줘."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ03
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMCutty
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMCutty
#. Face = Worried
#. SoundFileID = 005CE7BB
#. ScriptNotes = Worried / Worried
#. EDID: [0106BBD7]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001C66"
msgid "I hope Miles is okay."
msgstr "마일스가 괜찮았으면 좋겠어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ03
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMMilesCutler
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMMilesCutler
#. Face = Impressed
#. SoundFileID = 00FC79A8
#. ScriptNotes = Relief, gratitude, impressed / Impressed
#. EDID: [0106BBD5]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001C67"
msgid "The way you handled those guys was impressive."
msgstr "네가 그놈들을 처리한 방식은 인상적이었어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ03
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMMilesCutler
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMMilesCutler
#. Face = Grateful
#. SoundFileID = 0016757D
#. ScriptNotes = Gratitude. The player has walked away mid-conversation. / Grateful
#. EDID: [0106BBA4]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001C68"
msgid "Thanks for what you did. I mean it."
msgstr "네가 해 준 일 고마워. 진심이야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ03
#. SceneName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ03_MilesScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMMilesCutler
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMMilesCutler
#. Face = Sad
#. SoundFileID = 00F8FDD3
#. ScriptNotes = Sadness, doubt. Your heart is heavy. / Sad / to Player Default
#. Prompt = He's at Anchorpoint. You should reach out, try to heal the rift.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: He's at Anchorpoint. You should reach out, try to heal the rift.
#. DialogueAfter = MilesCutler: You're right. I think it's time to mend some old wounds.
#. EDID: [010404A6]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001C69"
msgid "I don't know. It's been a real long time. I'm not even sure how much he cares anymore."
msgstr "모르겠어. 정말 오래됐거든. 아직도 그가 얼마나 신경 쓰는지도 잘 모르겠어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ03
#. SceneName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ03_MilesScene
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = MilesCutler
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00C2D9F6
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I'm here to rescue you. &&& MilesCutler: You have no idea how happy I am to hear those words. &&& MilesCutler: If you're here, that must mean Lucia made it out. Thank goodness.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Fair enough. I'm still damn glad you came.
#. EDID: [0104049B]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001C6A"
msgid "It doesn't really matter. The point is, I'm here."
msgstr "그건 별로 중요하지 않아. 중요한 건 내가 여기 있다는 거야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ03
#. SceneName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ03_MilesScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = MilesCutler
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMMilesCutler
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0065A903
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = [Lie] That's right. She's the one who hired me.
#. DialogueAfter = MilesCutler: I'm going to rest here a little bit, and then use their transmitter to call Lucia for a lift.
#. EDID: [010404A7]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001C6B"
msgid "I'm going to owe her a top-notch dinner at Dawn's Roost in New Atlantis."
msgstr "뉴아틀란티스의 새벽의 안식처에서 최고급 저녁을 대접해야겠어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ03
#. SceneName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ03_MilesScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = MilesCutler
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMMilesCutler
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00E22E3F
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = [Lie] That's right. She's the one who hired me.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: [Lie] That's right. She's the one who hired me.
#. EDID: [010404A7]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001C6C"
msgid "Best damn co-pilot a guy could ask for."
msgstr "남자가 바랄 수 있는 최고의 부조종사지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ03
#. SceneName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ03_MilesScene
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = MilesCutler
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00F56802
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: If you want to talk about it, I'm listening. &&& MilesCutler: Yeah. You risked a lot coming out here, so it's the least I can do. &&& MilesCutler: He was a doctor, well-respected but arrogant.|My wife was about to give birth and there were complications. The life-threatening kind.|He demanded to do the surgery, but it wasn't his area of expertise.|His hubris cost both of their lives.|He left the very next day, and cut off all contact. &&& companion: It's not hard to understand how such a tragedy could tear a family apart.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Believe me, I know that better than anyone.
#. EDID: [0104048E]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001C6D"
msgid "Relationships between fathers and sons can be complicated."
msgstr "아버지와 아들의 관계는 복잡할 수 있죠."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ03
#. SceneName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ03_MilesScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = MilesCutler
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMMilesCutler
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00F7A7F8
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = MilesCutler: You have no idea how happy I am to hear those words.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: She sent a message to your father, and he sent me.
#. EDID: [0104049F]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001C6E"
msgid "If you're here, that must mean Lucia made it out. Thank goodness."
msgstr "네가 여기 있다는 건 루시아가 빠져나왔다는 뜻이겠군. 다행이야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ03
#. SceneName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ03_CuttuEndScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Cutty
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMCutty
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00F21927
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Your son is safe.
#. DialogueAfter = Cutty: I said I'd get some credits together for you.
#. EDID: [010435B0]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001C70"
msgid "I hadn't dared to hope."
msgstr "감히 희망조차 품지 못했어요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ03
#. SceneName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ03_SC06Hard
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00160C3E
#. ScriptNotes = / to MilesCutler
#. EDID: [0106BB9E]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001C71"
msgid "It's obvious he's suffering. You can put a stop to that."
msgstr "그가 고통받고 있는 건 분명해. 네가 그걸 끝낼 수 있어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ03
#. SceneName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ03_SC07EasySpecial
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00102946
#. ScriptNotes = / to MilesCutler
#. EDID: [0106BB9A]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001C72"
msgid "The subject was so painful for him, he couldn't even talk about it."
msgstr "그 주제가 그에겐 너무 고통스러워서 말조차 꺼낼 수 없었어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ03
#. SceneName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ03_SC05Hard
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = MilesCutler
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMMilesCutler
#. Face = Irritated
#. SoundFileID = 00D67AB2
#. ScriptNotes = Irritated / Irritated / to Player Default
#. EDID: [0106BBFF]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001C73"
msgid "Why do I have to be the one? That's not fair."
msgstr "왜 내가 해야 해? 불공평하잖아."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ03
#. SceneName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ03_SC05Hard
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = MilesCutler
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMMilesCutler
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 000412AD
#. ScriptNotes = Thinking about things, coming around to the player's persuasive argument. / to Player Default
#. EDID: [0106BBFC]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001C74"
msgid "Believe me, I know that."
msgstr "믿어 줘, 나도 알아."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ03
#. SceneName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ03_SC01Easy
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = MilesCutler
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMMilesCutler
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0039A6CE
#. ScriptNotes = Skeptical / to Player Default
#. EDID: [0106BBEF]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001C75"
msgid "Some things, you just can't put a time table on."
msgstr "어떤 일들은 시간표를 정할 수 없어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ03
#. SceneName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ03_SC05Hard
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 003985AC
#. ScriptNotes = / to MilesCutler
#. EDID: [0106BB95]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001C76"
msgid "You may not want the responsibility to fix things, but it's yours."
msgstr "네가 바로잡을 책임을 원하지 않을 수는 있지만, 그 책임은 네 거야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ03
#. SceneName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ03_SC01Easy
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00F16FB7
#. ScriptNotes = / to MilesCutler
#. EDID: [0106BB8C]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001C77"
msgid "The sooner you reach out, the more time you'll have to reconnect."
msgstr "빨리 연락할수록 다시 이어질 시간이 더 많아질 거야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ03
#. SceneName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ03_SC01Easy
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00CF1C78
#. ScriptNotes = / to MilesCutler
#. EDID: [0106BB8B]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001C78"
msgid "If you wait too long, it might be too late."
msgstr "너무 오래 기다리면 너무 늦을지도 몰라."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ03
#. SceneName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ03_SC03Medium
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = MilesCutler
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMMilesCutler
#. Face = Irritated
#. SoundFileID = 002C1539
#. ScriptNotes = A rebuke / Irritated / to Player Default
#. EDID: [0106BBCA]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001C79"
msgid "Look, I don't mean to be rude, but it's a family matter."
msgstr "봐, 무례하게 굴려는 건 아니지만, 이건 가족 문제야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMCivilian
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R03_NPCMCivilian01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0061619B
#. EDID: [01050246]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001C7A"
msgid "Lead the way."
msgstr "가시죠."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. SceneName = SFFL_R03_175a_SpeakWithCaptain_Friendly_PilotKilled01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Captain
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R03_NPCMCivilian01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 009250B7
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral / to Player Default
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Sorry about your pilot.
#. EDID: SFFL_R03SharedInfo01_CaptainIntro03
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001C7B"
msgid "Thanks for giving us a ride. What with our pilot and all... well, we're sitting ducks out here."
msgstr "태워 줘서 고마워요. 우리 조종사 일도 있고... 뭐, 지금 여기선 속수무책이거든요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. SceneName = SFFL_R03_175a_SpeakWithCaptain_Friendly_PilotKilled01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Captain
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R03_NPCMCivilian01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00F36B20
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral / to Player Default
#. EDID: SFFL_R03SharedInfo01_CaptainIntro03
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001C7C"
msgid "There you are."
msgstr "거기 있었군요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. SceneName = SFFL_R03_175a_SpeakWithCaptain_Betrayal_ShipDamaged01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Captain
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R03_NPCMCivilian01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00125581
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral / to Player
#. DialogueBefore = Captain:
#. EDID: SFFL_R03SharedInfo01
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001C7D"
msgid "The thing is, we aren't who you think we are. "
msgstr "문제는, 우리는 당신이 생각하는 그런 사람들이 아니라는 거지. "

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. SceneName = SFFL_R03_100b_DefenderHailAccepted
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = HailingShip
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R03_NPCFCivilian01
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 006508CE
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I'll give you a ride.
#. EDID: [0105F643]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001C7E"
msgid "Good. You can speak with the captain on board."
msgstr "좋습니다. 선내에서 선장과 얘기하시면 됩니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. SceneName = SFFL_R03_175a_SpeakWithCaptain_Friendly_ShipDamaged
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Captain
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R03_NPCMCivilian01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00798E5F
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: No offense taken. We should get going, now.
#. EDID: [0103EE06]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001C7F"
msgid "Sorry if I offended you."
msgstr "기분 상하게 했다면 죄송합니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. SceneName = SFFL_R03_175a_SpeakWithCaptain_Friendly_ShipDamaged
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Captain
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R03_NPCMCivilian01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00F726F2
#. DialogueBefore = Captain: *Sigh* Fair enough, I guess.
#. EDID: [0103EE06]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001C80"
msgid "I'm not trying to start a fight here. I appreciate you helping us, but a bit of caution is reasonable after what just happened."
msgstr "여기서 싸움을 시작하려는 게 아닙니다. 우리를 도와주시는 건 고맙지만, 방금 벌어진 일을 생각하면 어느 정도 조심하는 건 당연하지 않겠습니까."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. SceneName = SFFL_R03_100c_DefenderHailRejected
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = HailingShip
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R03_NPCFCivilian01
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00823755
#. EDID: [0103D1B2]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001C81"
msgid "If you're able to help us get out of here, dock with us so our captain can speak with you."
msgstr "우리가 여기서 빠져나가도록 도와줄 수 있다면, 우리 선장과 얘기할 수 있게 도킹해 주세요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. SceneName = SFFL_R03_100c_DefenderHailRejected
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = HailingShip
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R03_NPCFCivilian01
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0077404C
#. DialogueBefore = HailingShip:
#. EDID: [0103D1B2]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001C82"
msgid "*Sigh* Look, we're in a pretty bad spot here. We're not getting out of here without a ride. Please, help us out. "
msgstr "*한숨* 이봐요, 우린 정말 안 좋은 상황에 처해 있어요. 태워 주지 않으면 여기서 나갈 수 없습니다. 제발, 도와주세요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. SceneName = SFFL_R03_175a_SpeakWithCaptain_Betrayal_ShipDamaged01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMCivilian
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R03_NPCMCivilian01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 003DAB14
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Thanks.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Thanks.
#. DialogueAfter = Captain: The thing is, we aren't who you think we are.
#. EDID: [01053D80]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001C83"
msgid "No, really, I should be thanking you. You're saving our asses here."
msgstr "아냐, 내가 진심으로 고마워해야지. 우리 목숨을 구해 주는 거니까."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. SceneName = SFFL_R03_175a_SpeakWithCaptain_Friendly_ShipDamaged
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMCivilian
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R03_NPCMCivilian01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00D75DFF
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = We won't have any problems if you don't make any problems.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: We won't have any problems if you don't make any problems.
#. DialogueAfter = Captain: I'm not trying to start a fight here. I appreciate you helping us, but a bit of caution is reasonable after what just happened.
#. EDID: [010530D4]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001C84"
msgid "I think you took that the wrong way."
msgstr "제 말을 잘못 받아들인 것 같군요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. SceneName = SFFL_R03_175a_SpeakWithCaptain_Friendly_ShipDamaged
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Captain
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R03_NPCMCivilian01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0062EA6C
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = If I'm so suspicious, you better find another ride.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: If I'm so suspicious, you better find another ride.
#. DialogueAfter = Captain: I'm not trying to start a fight here. I appreciate you helping us, but a bit of caution is reasonable after what just happened.
#. EDID: [010530D2]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001C85"
msgid "That's... wait a second. That's not what I meant."
msgstr "그건... 잠깐만요. 그런 뜻이 아니었습니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. SceneName = SFFL_R03_175a_SpeakWithCaptain_Friendly_ShipDamaged
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Captain
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R03_NPCMCivilian01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00A3BEE8
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = If I'm so suspicious, you better find another ride.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: If I'm so suspicious, you better find another ride.
#. DialogueAfter = Captain: I'm not trying to start a fight here. I appreciate you helping us, but a bit of caution is reasonable after what just happened.
#. EDID: [0103EE04]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001C86"
msgid "Wait, hold on."
msgstr "잠깐, 기다려요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. SceneName = SFFL_R03_175a_SpeakWithCaptain_Friendly_ShipDamaged
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Captain
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00BABFD4
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Captain: Thanks for helping us out. We're all packed and ready to go. |But, you know, I have to ask. Can we trust you? We aren't going to have any problems, are we?
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Wait, hold on.
#. EDID: [0103EE01]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001C87"
msgid "If I'm so suspicious, you better find another ride. "
msgstr "내가 그렇게 수상하다면 다른 교통편을 찾는 게 좋겠군요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. SceneName = SFFL_R03_175a_SpeakWithCaptain_Friendly_ShipDamaged01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Captain
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R03_NPCMCivilian01
#. Face = Irritated
#. SoundFileID = 003AF4FB
#. ScriptNotes = Irritated / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Things could've been worse.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Things could've been worse.
#. DialogueAfter = Captain: *Sigh* Jesus, I need to get a grip. You're helping us out and here I am, complaining to you like an asshole.
#. EDID: [0104C411]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001C88"
msgid "Yeah, well, that's easy for you to say. You still have your ship."
msgstr "그래요, 뭐, 당신 입장에선 말은 쉽겠죠. 아직 우주선이 있으니까요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. SceneName = SFFL_R03_175a_SpeakWithCaptain_Friendly_ShipDamaged01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMCivilian
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R03_NPCMCivilian01
#. Face = Irritated
#. SoundFileID = 006A591C
#. ScriptNotes = Irritated / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Sorry about your ship. I wish I got here sooner.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Sorry about your ship. I wish I got here sooner.
#. DialogueAfter = Captain: *Sigh* Jesus, I need to get a grip. You're helping us out and here I am, complaining to you like an asshole.
#. EDID: [010530C2]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001C89"
msgid "Your condolences aren't going to get me a new ship."
msgstr "애도를 표해 봤자 새 우주선이 생기진 않습니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. SceneName = SFFL_R03_175a_SpeakWithCaptain_Friendly_ShipDamaged01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMCivilian
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R03_NPCMCivilian01
#. Face = Irritated
#. SoundFileID = 0023FF5F
#. ScriptNotes = Irritated / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Sorry about your ship. I wish I got here sooner.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Sorry about your ship. I wish I got here sooner.
#. DialogueAfter = Captain: *Sigh* Jesus, I need to get a grip. You're helping us out and here I am, complaining to you like an asshole.
#. EDID: [0104C421]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001C8A"
msgid "It is what it is. I'm not looking for sympathy. "
msgstr "어쩔 수 없는 일이죠. 동정을 바라는 건 아닙니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. SceneName = SFFL_R03_175a_SpeakWithCaptain_Friendly_ShipDamaged01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Captain
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R03_NPCMCivilian01
#. Face = Irritated
#. SoundFileID = 0060203A
#. ScriptNotes = Irritated / to Player Default
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Sorry about your ship. I wish I got here sooner.
#. EDID: [0104C414]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001C8B"
msgid "Can't believe I have to resort to bumming rides from a stranger. *Sigh* And I just finished paying off this ship."
msgstr "낯선 사람한테 태워 달라고 구걸해야 한다니 믿기지 않는군요. *한숨* 이 우주선 대금도 이제 막 다 갚았는데."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. SceneName = SFFL_R03_175a_SpeakWithCaptain_Friendly_ShipDamaged01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Captain
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R03_NPCMCivilian01
#. Face = Irritated
#. SoundFileID = 00C82391
#. ScriptNotes = Irritated / to Player Default
#. EDID: [0104C414]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001C8C"
msgid "Our savior, in the flesh."
msgstr "우리의 구세주께서 직접 오셨군."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. SceneName = SFFL_R03_175a_SpeakWithCaptain_Betrayal_ShipDamaged
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMCivilian
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R03_NPCMCivilian01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00C41878
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral / to Player Default
#. Prompt = I'm just here to give you a ride.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I'm just here to give you a ride.
#. EDID: [01053DBC]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001C8D"
msgid "Good, good."
msgstr "좋아, 좋아."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. SceneName = SFFL_R03_175a_SpeakWithCaptain_Betrayal_ShipDamaged
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Captain
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R03_NPCMCivilian01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00C5E773
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral
#. DialogueBefore = Captain:
#. EDID: [0104C43F]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001C8E"
msgid "I'm not trying to get off on the wrong foot here. It's been a bad day."
msgstr "처음부터 삐끗하고 싶었던 건 아닌데. 오늘 참 힘드네."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. SceneName = SFFL_R03_175a_SpeakWithCaptain_Friendly_PilotKilled01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Captain
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R03_NPCMCivilian01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00B18006
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Why did those Spacers attack you?
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Why did those Spacers attack you?
#. DialogueAfter = Captain: Sorry about your pilot.
#. EDID: [010539DC]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001C8F"
msgid "Not sure. I don't think anyone could possibly know what the hell goes on in a Spacer's mind."
msgstr "잘 모르겠군요. 스페이서 머릿속에서 대체 무슨 일이 벌어지는지 아는 사람은 아무도 없을 겁니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. SceneName = SFFL_R03_175a_SpeakWithCaptain_Betrayal_ShipDamaged
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Captain
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R03_NPCMCivilian01
#. Face = Irritated
#. SoundFileID = 0012812F
#. ScriptNotes = Irritated / to Player Default
#. Prompt = If you think I'm so suspicious, I'll leave.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: If you think I'm so suspicious, I'll leave.
#. EDID: [01053D8B]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001C90"
msgid "A little caution is warranted, don't you think?"
msgstr "조금은 경계하는 편이 낫지 않나?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. SceneName = SFFL_R03_175a_SpeakWithCaptain_Friendly_PilotKilled01
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Captain
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0035D2E9
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Captain:
#. EDID: [010530BE]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001C91"
msgid "Why did those Spacers attack you?"
msgstr "그 스페이서들은 왜 당신들을 공격했죠?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. SceneName = SFFL_R03_175a_SpeakWithCaptain_Friendly_PilotKilled01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Captain
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R03_NPCMCivilian01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00BD62AB
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral / to Player Default
#. Prompt = My condolences, but we should get moving before more Spacers show up.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: My condolences, but we should get moving before more Spacers show up.
#. EDID: [010539D5]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001C92"
msgid "Damn, you really think there could be more of those bastards?"
msgstr "젠장, 그런 놈들이 더 있을 수도 있다고 정말 생각해요?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. SceneName = SFFL_R03_175a_SpeakWithCaptain_Friendly_PilotKilled
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Captain
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R03_NPCMCivilian01
#. Face = Depressed
#. SoundFileID = 0043DC93
#. ScriptNotes = Depressed
#. DialogueBefore = Captain: It's okay. Well, it's not but... damn, I just don't know what to say right now.
#. DialogueAfter = Captain: We're ready to leave whenever you are. Thanks for this.
#. EDID: [010530F5]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001C93"
msgid "*Sigh* Anyway, we appreciate your help. We can't wait to get the hell out of here."
msgstr "*한숨* 어쨌든, 도와주셔서 감사합니다. 빨리 여기서 벗어나고 싶군요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. SceneName = SFFL_R03_175a_SpeakWithCaptain_Friendly_PilotKilled
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Captain
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R03_NPCMCivilian01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 006FFD6C
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Do you have any idea why the Spacers attacked you?
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Do you have any idea why the Spacers attacked you?
#. DialogueAfter = Captain: I'm sorry about your pilot.
#. EDID: [010530F2]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001C94"
msgid "They probably assumed we were hauling something good. That's always a risk with these types of haulers. Easy to attract attention. "
msgstr "아마 우리가 뭔가 좋은 걸 운송 중이라고 생각했겠죠. 이런 종류의 화물선에는 늘 있는 위험입니다. 관심을 끌기 쉽거든요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. SceneName = SFFL_R03_175a_SpeakWithCaptain_Betrayal_PilotKilled01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Captain
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R03_NPCMCivilian01
#. Face = Angry
#. SoundFileID = 00892A38
#. ScriptNotes = Angry
#. EDID: [01053DB5]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001C95"
msgid "Kill them!"
msgstr "죽여!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. SceneName = SFFL_R03_175a_SpeakWithCaptain_Betrayal_PilotKilled01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Captain
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R03_NPCMCivilian01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 005BD781
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral
#. DialogueBefore = Captain: The thing is, we aren't who you think we are.
#. EDID: [01053DB5]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001C96"
msgid "Sorry, but we're taking your ship. Nothing personal, you were just... well, you decided to help us."
msgstr "미안하지만, 네 우주선은 우리가 가져가겠어. 개인적인 감정은 없어. 넌 그저... 음, 우리를 돕기로 결정한 거라 치자고."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. SceneName = SFFL_R03_175a_SpeakWithCaptain_Friendly_PilotKilled
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Captain
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R03_NPCMCivilian01
#. Face = Depressed
#. SoundFileID = 00D0B07A
#. ScriptNotes = Depressed / to Player Default
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: I'm sorry about your pilot.
#. EDID: [010530FD]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001C97"
msgid "*Sigh* Man, how did things go so wrong? "
msgstr "*한숨* 이런, 일이 어쩌다 이렇게 꼬였지?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. SceneName = SFFL_R03_175a_SpeakWithCaptain_Friendly_PilotKilled
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Captain
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R03_NPCMCivilian01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0046BE82
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. EDID: [010530FD]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001C98"
msgid "Here to give us a ride? We appreciate it, seriously. "
msgstr "우릴 태워 주러 오셨나요? 정말 고맙습니다. 진심으로요. "

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. SceneName = SFFL_R03_175a_SpeakWithCaptain_Friendly_PilotKilled01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Captain
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R03_NPCMCivilian01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00962886
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral
#. DialogueBefore = Captain:
#. EDID: [010539D1]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001C99"
msgid "Anyway, let's get moving."
msgstr "어쨌든, 움직입시다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. SceneName = SFFL_R03_175a_SpeakWithCaptain_Betrayal_PilotKilled
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Captain
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R03_NPCMCivilian01
#. Face = Angry
#. SoundFileID = 00B8A404
#. ScriptNotes = Angry
#. DialogueBefore = Captain:
#. EDID: [01053DA5]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001C9A"
msgid "Surround them!"
msgstr "포위해!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. SceneName = SFFL_R03_175a_SpeakWithCaptain_Betrayal_PilotKilled
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Captain
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R03_NPCMCivilian01
#. Face = Angry
#. SoundFileID = 003DD3A8
#. ScriptNotes = Angry
#. DialogueBefore = Captain:
#. EDID: [01053DA4]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001C9B"
msgid "Take them down!"
msgstr "쓰러뜨려!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. SceneName = SFFL_R03_175a_SpeakWithCaptain_Betrayal_PilotKilled01
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Captain
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00B51643
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Captain:
#. EDID: [01053D64]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001C9C"
msgid "My condolences, but we should get moving before more Spacers show up."
msgstr "애도는 표하고 싶지만, 스페이서가 더 나타나기 전에 움직여야 해."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. SceneName = SFFL_R03_175a_SpeakWithCaptain_Betrayal_PilotKilled01
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Captain
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00569168
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Captain:
#. EDID: [01053D7C]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001C9D"
msgid "Why did those Spacers attack you?"
msgstr "그 스페이서들은 왜 당신들을 공격했지?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. SceneName = SFFL_R03_175a_SpeakWithCaptain_Betrayal_ShipDamaged
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Captain
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R03_NPCMCivilian01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00374204
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral
#. EDID: [01053DAF]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001C9E"
msgid "You know, we were gonna make things easy for you. Painless. We were gonna put a quick bullet in the back of your head when you weren't looking, then take your ship without any fuss. But now, all bets are off."
msgstr ""
"있잖아, 우린 네게 일을 쉽게 만들어 주려고 했어. 고통 없이. 네가 안 보고 있을 때 뒤통수에 빠르게 총알 하나 박아 넣고, 소란 없이 "
"네 우주선을 가져가려고 했지. 하지만 이제는 다 끝장이야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. SceneName = SFFL_R03_175a_SpeakWithCaptain_Betrayal_ShipDamaged
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Captain
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R03_NPCMCivilian01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00FB11BD
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral
#. DialogueBefore = Captain: The thing is, we aren't who you think we are.
#. EDID: [01053DAF]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001C9F"
msgid "We weren't asking."
msgstr "우린 부탁한 게 아니야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. SceneName = SFFL_R03_175a_SpeakWithCaptain_Betrayal_ShipDamaged
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Captain
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R03_NPCMCivilian01
#. Face = Angry
#. SoundFileID = 006B1533
#. ScriptNotes = Angry
#. EDID: [01053DAE]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001CA0"
msgid "Open fire!"
msgstr "사격 개시!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. SceneName = SFFL_R03_175a_SpeakWithCaptain_Betrayal_ShipDamaged
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Captain
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R03_NPCMCivilian01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00684284
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral
#. DialogueBefore = Captain: The thing is, we aren't who you think we are.
#. EDID: [01053DAE]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001CA1"
msgid "We're flying that ship home whether you like it or not."
msgstr "네가 좋든 싫든 우린 저 우주선을 타고 집에 갈 거야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1200_Roman_FreestarScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Roman
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRomanKreutz
#. Face = Thinking
#. SoundFileID = 00C735B7
#. ScriptNotes = Thinking / to Player Default
#. DialogueAfter = Roman: Atka didn't report this. I found your ransom note.
#. EDID: SFFL_MS03_Roman_FreestarSceneReentry01
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001CAA"
msgid "Atka must've come home before Yura even saw the note. That's the only explanation."
msgstr "아트카가 유라가 쪽지를 보기도 전에 집에 돌아온 게 분명해. 그게 유일한 설명이야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMRomanKreutz
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRomanKreutz
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 0035E745
#. ScriptNotes = Confident
#. EDID: [0105B449]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001CAB"
msgid "Thanks for the advice on Yura."
msgstr "유라에 대해 조언해줘서 고마워."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMGenericMale / NPCFGenericFemale
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMGenericMale02 / SFFL_NPCMGenericMale01 / SFFL_NPCFGenericFemale01 / SFFL_NPCFGenericFemale02
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 00A2C470
#. ScriptNotes = Confident
#. EDID: [0105B43A]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001CAC"
msgid "See you around."
msgstr "또 보자."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMGenericMale / NPCFGenericFemale
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMGenericMale02 / SFFL_NPCMGenericMale01 / SFFL_NPCFGenericFemale01 / SFFL_NPCFGenericFemale02
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 00334D8A
#. ScriptNotes = Confident
#. EDID: [0105B438]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001CAD"
msgid "I'm gonna miss that critter."
msgstr "그 쬐그만 애가 그리울 거야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMGenericMale / NPCFGenericFemale
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMGenericMale02 / SFFL_NPCMGenericMale01 / SFFL_NPCFGenericFemale01 / SFFL_NPCFGenericFemale02
#. Face = Nervous
#. SoundFileID = 00B503BB
#. ScriptNotes = Denial, as in "Don't look at me, this isn't my fault" / Nervous
#. EDID: [01059D66]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001CAE"
msgid "Don't look at me. "
msgstr "쳐다 보지 마. "

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMGenericMale / NPCFGenericFemale
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMGenericMale02 / SFFL_NPCMGenericMale01 / SFFL_NPCFGenericFemale01 / SFFL_NPCFGenericFemale02
#. Face = Nervous
#. SoundFileID = 006C22D2
#. ScriptNotes = Nervous
#. EDID: [01059D63]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001CAF"
msgid "This is all a big misunderstanding."
msgstr "전부 다 오해야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = GenericMaleEvenToned / GenericFemaleEvenToned
#. VoiceType = GenericMaleEvenToned / GenericFemaleEvenToned
#. Face = Friendly
#. SoundFileID = 00115C0F
#. ScriptNotes = Friendly
#. EDID: [01059D5E]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001CB0"
msgid "If you want some easy credits, house sitting's where it's at."
msgstr "쉽게 크레딧을 벌고 싶다면, 임시 집사 일이 최고야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCFYura
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFYura
#. Face = Friendly
#. SoundFileID = 00C993D0
#. ScriptNotes = Friendly
#. EDID: [01059D56]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001CB1"
msgid "I just need a minute."
msgstr "잠깐만 시간이 필요해."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMGenericMale / NPCFGenericFemale
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMGenericMale02 / SFFL_NPCMGenericMale01 / SFFL_NPCFGenericFemale01 / SFFL_NPCFGenericFemale02
#. Face = Angry
#. SoundFileID = 00C6DDA1
#. ScriptNotes = Angry
#. EDID: [0105BFB6]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001CB2"
msgid "Oh, you're dead, pal!"
msgstr "오, 너 뒈졌다. 야!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMGenericMale / NPCFGenericFemale
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMGenericMale02 / SFFL_NPCMGenericMale01 / SFFL_NPCFGenericFemale01 / SFFL_NPCFGenericFemale02
#. Face = Angry
#. SoundFileID = 00245886
#. ScriptNotes = Angry
#. EDID: [0105BFAC]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001CB3"
msgid "End of the line!"
msgstr "끝장을 봐 주마!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1200_Roman_MainRansomScene
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Roman
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0019A239
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Nice doing business with you. &&& Roman: Who are you?
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: In on this? No no, this is... this is my plan. I just figured Yura would be the one to show up at our door.
#. EDID: [01035869]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001CB4"
msgid "Yura is in on this?"
msgstr "유라도 이 일에 가담한 건가?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_3200_Yura_MainEndScene
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Atka
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0096CF03
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I don't see how the timing is my fault. &&& ... &&& Yura: And see? Milli's fine! &&& Yura: Right, "pet sitters"? &&& companion: We guarded this creature with our very lives.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Well, since she seems fine to me, I'll take your word for it.
#. EDID: [0103589C]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001CB5"
msgid "Right. Milli is fine."
msgstr "맞아. 밀리는 괜찮아."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_3100_Yura_AtkaScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Yura
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFYura
#. Face = Defiant
#. SoundFileID = 006F21AA
#. ScriptNotes = Arguing. Emphasis on the word "is" in "Hiring another pet sitter IS taking care of her." / Defiant / to Atka
#. DialogueBefore = Atka: What do you mean "the pet sitter" has Milli? You were supposed to be taking care of her.
#. DialogueAfter = Yura: And look, just in time.
#. EDID: [010358BD]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001CB6"
msgid "And I am! Hiring another pet sitter is taking care of her."
msgstr "돌보고 있는 거야! 다른 임시 집사를 고용하는 것도 돌보는 방법 중 하나라고."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_3200_Yura_MainEndScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Atka
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFAtka
#. Face = Friendly
#. SoundFileID = 0013D0F6
#. ScriptNotes = Friendly / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Atka: If Yura hired you, I'm not surprised.
#. DialogueAfter = Atka: Oh, and since you kept Milli safe, keep the food.
#. EDID: [0103588A]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001CB7"
msgid "Here, it's what I intended to pay Yura, plus a little extra for the trouble and keeping the plant babies alive."
msgstr "여기, 원래 유라에게 주려던 일당에 식물 애들을 살려 뒀으니 사례금을 조금 더 얹었어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_0140_Yura_IntroPostRejectionScene
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0051567C
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Yura: Oh hey, finally interested in that house sitting gig? It's not too late you know.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: A few more credits never hurt anyone, right?
#. EDID: [0103588F]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001CB8"
msgid "Looks like I could use those credits after all."
msgstr "결국 그 크레딧이 필요해질 것 같네."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_0140_Yura_IntroPostRejectionScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Yura
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFYura
#. Face = Friendly
#. SoundFileID = 00E08205
#. ScriptNotes = Friendly / to Player Default
#. EDID: [010358A9]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001CB9"
msgid "Once you're all done, find me back here for those credits."
msgstr "전부 끝나면 그 크레딧을 받으러 여기로 날 찾아와."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_0140_Yura_IntroPostRejectionScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Yura
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFYura
#. Face = Friendly
#. SoundFileID = 0020F576
#. ScriptNotes = Friendly / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Yura: Here's the key to Atka's house.
#. EDID: [010358A9]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001CBA"
msgid "It's this cutesy place on Muphrid IV, and you'll be taking care of her little milliwhale, Milli. "
msgstr "무프리드 IV에 있는 아주 귀여운 곳인데, 거기서 그녀의 자그마한 밀리고래 밀리를 돌보게 될 거야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_3200_Yura_MainEndScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Yura
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFYura
#. Face = Concerned
#. SoundFileID = 00BD17FB
#. ScriptNotes = Quieter to the player. / Concerned / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Yura: And look, just in time.
#. DialogueAfter = Yura: I don't see how the timing is my fault.
#. EDID: [01035884]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001CBB"
msgid "'Bout time you got here. Where have you been? "
msgstr "이제야 왔네. 어디 있었어? "

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_3200_Yura_MainEndScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Yura
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFYura
#. Face = Concerned
#. SoundFileID = 00757DA5
#. ScriptNotes = Scene re-entry. Player said Roman was dead. She doesn't want to believe it. / Concerned / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Yura: And look, just in time.
#. DialogueAfter = Yura: Roman and his friends are dead.
#. EDID: [0106C852]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001CBC"
msgid "You're... joking... right? You can't be serious."
msgstr "너... 농담하는 거지? 진심일 리가 없어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1200_Roman_MainRansomScene
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Roman
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00E9B82A
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Nice doing business with you. &&& Roman: Who are you?
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Whoa, hey, no one has to die here today, least not over some damn milliwhale.
#. EDID: [01035897]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001CBD"
msgid "I'll take out everyone here if you don't hand over Milli."
msgstr "밀리를 넘기지 않으면 여기 있는 새끼들 전부 쓸어버릴 거야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_0100_Yura_IntroMainScene
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0034949A
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Depends on what it is. &&& Yura: Oh you're gonna love it. Easiest credits you'll ever make!|All you have to do is water a few plants and feed a little milliwhale until my sister gets home. &&& companion: Such work is beneath us, but it does sound oddly satisfying.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: You're the best. Here's the key to Atka's house.
#. EDID: [01059D00]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001CBE"
msgid "Count me in."
msgstr "나도 할게."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_0100_Yura_IntroBranchNoScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Yura
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFYura
#. Face = Friendly
#. SoundFileID = 002CA0D3
#. ScriptNotes = Friendly
#. DialogueBefore = Yura: So, here's the key to my sister Atka's house. She lives on Muphrid IV, outside of the Freestar Collective.
#. EDID: [01035860]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001CBF"
msgid "Instructions are on the counter. Find me back here to get paid, and you're good to go!"
msgstr "안내 사항은 카운터 위에 있어. 보수를 받으려면 여기로 다시 날 찾아오면 되고, 그러면 끝이야!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
