msgid "Hmm, I can see your point."
msgstr "흠, 네 말도 일리가 있네."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1200_Roman_ReturnScene
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Roman
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00222CE5
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Roman: Shouldn't you be off digging up some credits?
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Whoa, hey, no one has to die here today, least not over some damn milliwhale.
#. EDID: [01059D31]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001CCC"
msgid "I see a lot of pain and suffering in your future if you don't give me Milli."
msgstr "밀리를 넘기지 않으면 네 앞날에는 고통과 괴로움이 가득할 거야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1200_Roman_ReturnScene
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Roman
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 003B7FDF
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Roman: Shouldn't you be off digging up some credits?
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Whoa, what? We don't want any trouble here.
#. EDID: [01059CAB]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001CCD"
msgid "Hand over the milliwhale or you deal with the Crimson Fleet."
msgstr "밀리고래를 넘겨. 아니면 크림슨 함대를 상대하게 될 거야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1200_Roman_SC_Repeatable02Scene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Roman
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRomanKreutz
#. Face = Smirk
#. SoundFileID = 002EBE59
#. ScriptNotes = Speech challenge lose: I'm willing to do this the hard way. / Smirk / to Player Default
#. EDID: [01059D44]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001CCE"
msgid "If you think we're not ready to deal with you, think again."
msgstr "우리가 널 상대할 준비가 안 됐다고 생각한다면 다시 생각해."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1200_Roman_MainBranchYura01Scene
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Roman
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 005E6F08
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I don't do favors for petnappers. &&& Roman: Just hear me out. You got this petnapping thing all wrong.|You see, this is all a setup for Yura. &&& Roman: She hates house sitting. It's boring. So we thought why not liven things up?|We figured she'd get into it, maybe even get the credits from Atka...|And then when all went according to plan, I'd have the confidence to ask her out. |But now I've lost that chance. So, plan B. I give you Milli, you put in a good word for me with Yura. &&& companion: All this setup when you should be confessing to her directly.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: I'm 99% sure she's interested. It's that 1% holding me back.
#. EDID: [01059CD1]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001CCF"
msgid "What makes you think Yura's interested in you to begin with?"
msgstr "애초에 유라가 네게 관심이 있다고 생각하는 이유가 뭐야?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1200_Roman_TruthScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMRomanKreutz
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRomanKreutz
#. Face = Concerned
#. SoundFileID = 000B81C5
#. ScriptNotes = Concerned / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Be honest, and don't trust someone else to tell her how you feel.
#. DialogueAfter = Roman: I hate to say it, but you're right. I need to do this myself.
#. EDID: [01059D10]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001CD0"
msgid "And it would just be my luck that I'd send someone out there to speak for me and they'd screw it up. "
msgstr "하필 운도 없어서 누군가를 거기로 보내 대신 말하게 했더니 그 사람이 망쳐 놓겠지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1200_Roman_TruthScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMRomanKreutz
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRomanKreutz
#. Face = Surprised
#. SoundFileID = 00E0337D
#. ScriptNotes = Surprised / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Be honest, and don't trust someone else to tell her how you feel.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Be honest, and don't trust someone else to tell her how you feel.
#. EDID: [01059D10]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001CD1"
msgid "Damn, I never thought about it way... "
msgstr "젠장, 그런 식으로는 생각해 본 적이 없어... "

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1200_Roman_MainBranchYura01Scene
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Roman
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 004ADB50
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: The question is, what does Yura have to do with any of this?
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: I know them both, but this really isn't about Atka... It's about Yura.
#. EDID: [01059CC4]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001CD2"
msgid "What is going on here? You know Atka?"
msgstr "여기서 대체 무슨 일이 벌어지는 거야? 아트카를 알아?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1200_Roman_FreestarBranchYuraScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Roman
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRomanKreutz
#. Face = Depressed
#. SoundFileID = 00720FD0
#. ScriptNotes = Depressed / to Player Default
#. Prompt = The only explanation is that you're an idiot.
#. DialogueAfter = Roman: I swear we were always going to return Milli safe and sound.
#. EDID: [01059D12]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001CD3"
msgid "This was all for her, too. Of course I'd screw it up."
msgstr "이건 전부 유라를 위한 거였어. 물론 내가 망치고 말았지만."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1200_Roman_FreestarBranchYuraScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Roman
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRomanKreutz
#. Face = Depressed
#. SoundFileID = 0011940F
#. ScriptNotes = Depressed / to Player Default
#. Prompt = The only explanation is that you're an idiot.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: The only explanation is that you're an idiot.
#. EDID: [01059D12]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001CD4"
msgid "You don't think I know that now? "
msgstr "내가 지금 그걸 모를 것 같아? "

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1200_Roman_MainBranchYura01Scene
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00D7F921
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Yura didn't send me. She hired me to house sit for her sister. &&& Roman: So you're the one that found the ransom note? Is Yura even there?|But she knows about the note, right?
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: The house sitter? Dammit, I should've seen this coming.
#. EDID: [01059CFC]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001CD5"
msgid "I'm the house sitter."
msgstr "난 임시 집사야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1200_Roman_FreestarScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Roman
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRomanKreutz
#. Face = Nervous
#. SoundFileID = 00D46887
#. ScriptNotes = Nervous / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Petnapping is a pretty elaborate distraction.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Don't worry about it. No harm, no foul.
#. EDID: [01059CE0]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001CD6"
msgid "The things we do to impress people, right?"
msgstr "사람에게 잘 보이려고 별짓을 다 하지? 안 그래?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1200_Roman_FreestarScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Roman
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRomanKreutz
#. Face = Nervous
#. SoundFileID = 00A4AE9F
#. ScriptNotes = Nervous / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Petnapping is a pretty elaborate distraction.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Petnapping is a pretty elaborate distraction.
#. EDID: [01059CE0]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001CD7"
msgid "Well, yeah, but that was part of the plan... I just wanted to get Yura's attention is all. "
msgstr "뭐, 그래. 하지만 그것도 계획의 일부였어... 그냥 유라의 관심을 끌고 싶었을 뿐이야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1200_Roman_FreestarScene
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Roman
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00A1AC45
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Stealing someone's pet is a serious crime. &&& Roman: I know, I know, but it wasn't really petnapping, it was really more petborrowing.|We only did all this to distract Yura... for fun!|And if she knew I was the one that took Milli, I swear we wouldn't be standing here now.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Well, yeah, but that was part of the plan... I just wanted to get Yura's attention is all.
#. EDID: [01059CB2]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001CD8"
msgid "Petnapping is a pretty elaborate distraction."
msgstr "애완동물 납치라니, 시선을 돌리기 위해 꽤나 머리를 썼네."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1200_Roman_FreestarScene
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Roman
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0076D015
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Just hand over the milliwhale. &&& Roman: You got it. She's in the next room. Here's the key.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: I would've guaranteed it! I just never saw her reporting it to the Freestar Rangers.
#. EDID: [01059CEF]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001CD9"
msgid "And you really thought Yura would appreciate your prank?"
msgstr "그리고 유라가 네 장난을 좋아할 거라고 정말 생각했어?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1200_Roman_FreestarBranchYuraScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMRomanKreutz
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRomanKreutz
#. Face = Nervous
#. SoundFileID = 003EF25A
#. ScriptNotes = Nervous / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Atka didn't report this. I found your ransom note.
#. DialogueAfter = Roman: I swear we were always going to return Milli safe and sound.
#. EDID: [01059CAE]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001CDA"
msgid "I knew this plan could backfire, but I never thought it'd be this bad."
msgstr "이 계획이 역효과를 낼 수도 있다는 건 알았지만, 이렇게 심할 줄은 몰랐어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1200_Roman_FreestarBranchYuraScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMRomanKreutz
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRomanKreutz
#. Face = Surprised
#. SoundFileID = 008E7E47
#. ScriptNotes = Surprised / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Atka didn't report this. I found your ransom note.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Atka didn't report this. I found your ransom note.
#. EDID: [01059CAE]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001CDB"
msgid "You found the note? So Yura doesn't know about this at all?"
msgstr "쪽지를 찾았다고? 그럼 유라는 이 일에 대해 전혀 모르는 거야?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1200_Roman_FreestarScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMRomanKreutz
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRomanKreutz
#. Face = Pleading
#. SoundFileID = 0041E165
#. ScriptNotes = Pleading / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Petnapping for fun is still petnapping.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Just make sure you stick to legal activities next time.
#. EDID: [01059CA5]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001CDC"
msgid "We didn't mean anything by it. We were always going to return Milli safe and sound."
msgstr "우린 나쁜 뜻은 없었어. 밀리는 항상 무사히 돌려보낼 생각이었다고."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1200_Roman_FreestarScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
