#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Petnapping for fun is still petnapping.
#. EDID: [01059CA5]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001CDD"
msgid "I think we all realize that now, but I swear it was completely innocent."
msgstr "이제 우리 모두 그걸 깨달은 것 같지만, 맹세코 정말 악의는 없었어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
