#. Speaker = Roman
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRomanKreutz
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00F74C65
#. ScriptNotes = Serious / to Player Default
#. Prompt = It's hard to put yourself out there, but you can do this.
#. DialogueAfter = Roman: I hate to say it, but you're right. I need to do this myself.
#. EDID: [01059CFE]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001CDE"
msgid "I guess if I've made it this long living in the Free Lanes, I should be able to face down my fears."
msgstr "자유 항로에서 이렇게 오래 살아남았다면, 내 두려움과도 맞설 수 있어야겠지."

