#. EDID: [01059D26]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001CE1"
msgid "[Lie] I've got <Global=SFFL_MS03_RansomCredits> credits that says otherwise."
msgstr "[거짓말] 꺼지라고 말 안했다는 데 <Global=SFFL_MS03_RansomCredits> 크레딧을 걸지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1200_Roman_FreestarBranchYuraScene
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Roman
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 001D65D0
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: And you really thought Yura would appreciate your prank? &&& Roman: I would've guaranteed it! I just never saw her reporting it to the Freestar Rangers. &&& Roman: Atka must've come home before Yura even saw the note. That's the only explanation.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: You're kidding me. So Yura hasn't even seen the note?
#. EDID: [01059D20]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001CE2"
msgid "Yura hired me to house sit. She doesn't know about all this."
msgstr "유라가 날 임시 집사로 고용했어. 유라는 납치에 대해 몰라."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1200_Roman_MainBranchYura01Scene
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Roman
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0075F380
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I don't do favors for petnappers. &&& Roman: Just hear me out. You got this petnapping thing all wrong.|You see, this is all a setup for Yura. &&& Roman: She hates house sitting. It's boring. So we thought why not liven things up?|We figured she'd get into it, maybe even get the credits from Atka...|And then when all went according to plan, I'd have the confidence to ask her out. |But now I've lost that chance. So, plan B. I give you Milli, you put in a good word for me with Yura. &&& companion: All this setup when you should be confessing to her directly.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Wait, what?
#. EDID: [01059D16]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001CE3"
msgid "[Attack] Plan C. I'll put you out of your misery."
msgstr "[공격] 플랜 C다. 내가 널 고통에서 해방해 주지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1200_Roman_FreestarScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Roman
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRomanKreutz
#. Face = Pleading
#. SoundFileID = 0099A642
#. ScriptNotes = Pleading / to Player Default
#. Prompt = And what if I don't buy this story?
#. DialogueAfter = Roman: Petnapping for fun is still petnapping.
#. EDID: [01059CBA]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001CE4"
msgid "Milli is Atka's baby. We'd never do anything to hurt her."
msgstr "밀리는 아트카의 애완동물인걸. 절대 밀리를 해치려고 하지 않았어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1200_Roman_FreestarScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Roman
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRomanKreutz
#. Face = Pleading
#. SoundFileID = 0060D2E3
#. ScriptNotes = Pleading / to Player Default
#. Prompt = And what if I don't buy this story?
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: And what if I don't buy this story?
#. EDID: [01059CBA]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001CE5"
msgid "Just talk to Yura. Tell her I took Milli and she'll know it wasn't serious. She'll back me up."
msgstr "유라와 얘기해 봐. 내가 밀리를 데려갔다고 말하면, 유라도 심각한 일이 아니었다는 걸 알게 될 거야. 내 편을 들어 주겠지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1100_Intercom_ReturnScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Intercom
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMGenericMale01
#. Face = Stern
#. SoundFileID = 00135AFE
#. ScriptNotes = This is the second time the player has come back, so more demanding. / Stern
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Pomegranate.
#. EDID: [01059CC0]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001CE6"
msgid "Password."
msgstr "암호."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1100_Intercom_ReturnScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Intercom
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMGenericMale01
#. Face = Stern
#. SoundFileID = 00E2FA01
#. ScriptNotes = Stern
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Pomegranate.
#. EDID: [01059CBF]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001CE7"
msgid "I thought I told you to get lost."
msgstr "꺼지라고 말했던 것 같은데."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_3200_Yura_BranchEndRomanDeadScene
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Atka
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00151414
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Roman and his friends are dead. &&& Yura: Oh my god... you killed him? All of them? &&& Atka: Look... I... I think you should leave.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: While I believe you, I can't imagine Roman or his friends ever hurting Milli intentionally.
#. EDID: [0105A339]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001CE8"
msgid "I did what I had to do to bring Milli back safe."
msgstr "밀리를 무사히 데려오기 위해 해야 할 일을 한 것뿐이야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_0100_Yura_IntroMainScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Yura
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFYura
#. Face = Friendly
#. SoundFileID = 0031BB19
#. ScriptNotes = Friendly / to Player Default
#. Prompt = How long do I have to do this for?
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: How long do I have to do this for?
#. DialogueAfter = Yura: Count us in.
#. EDID: [01059D03]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001CE9"
msgid "No more than a few days, I promise!"
msgstr "며칠이면 돼! 약속할게!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_0200_Yura_TL_AtkaScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Yura
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFYura
#. Face = Amused
#. SoundFileID = 000B28AC
#. ScriptNotes = Amused / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Where is Atka?
#. DialogueAfter = Yura: I have some other questions.
#. EDID: [01059CBD]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001CEA"
msgid "You know, getting to hang out with her people who are definitely not me."
msgstr "있잖아, 그녀의 사람들과 어울리는 거지. 나는 절대 아닌 사람들 말이야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_0200_Yura_TL_AtkaScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Yura
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFYura
#. Face = Friendly
#. SoundFileID = 002D6709
#. ScriptNotes = Friendly / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Where is Atka?
#. EDID: [01059CBD]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001CEB"
msgid "She's some sort of independent researcher, so she lives for these things. "
msgstr "그녀는 일종의 독립 연구자라서 이런 것들에 살다시피 해."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_0200_Yura_TL_AtkaScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Yura
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFYura
#. Face = Friendly
#. SoundFileID = 00CD9385
#. ScriptNotes = Friendly / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Where is Atka?
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Where is Atka?
#. EDID: [01059CBD]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001CEC"
msgid "I don't know. Some science convention or something."
msgstr "모르겠어. 과학 컨벤션 같은 거겠지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_0100_Yura_IntroMainScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = companion
#. VoiceType = NPCMBarrett
#. Face = Surprised
#. SoundFileID = 00D04B4B
#. ScriptNotes = Surprised / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Depends on what it is. &&& Yura: Oh you're gonna love it. Easiest credits you'll ever make!|All you have to do is water a few plants and feed a little milliwhale until my sister gets home.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Count us in.
#. EDID: [01059CD3]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001CED"
msgid "A pet milliwhale? I'm game if you are."
msgstr "애완 밀리고래? 네가 하겠다면 나도 할게."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_3200_Yura_BranchEndRomanScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Yura
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFYura
#. Face = Happy
#. SoundFileID = 00A34D29
#. ScriptNotes = Happy / to Player Default
#. Prompt = The things we do to impress someone.
#. DialogueAfter = Atka: Okay, great, so this was all some elaborate scheme for Roman to catch my sister's attention.
#. EDID: [0105A338]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001CEE"
msgid "He hates it when things don't go according to plan."
msgstr "그는 일이 계획대로 안 풀리는 걸 싫어해."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_3200_Yura_BranchEndRomanScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Yura
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFYura
#. Face = Happy
#. SoundFileID = 0024A5B3
#. ScriptNotes = Happy / to Player Default
#. Prompt = The things we do to impress someone.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: The things we do to impress someone.
#. EDID: [0105A338]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001CEF"
msgid "I can't wait to talk to him about all this. He must be losing his mind. "
msgstr "이 모든 일에 대해 그와 얘기하고 싶어 죽겠어. 지금 제정신이 아닐 거야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_3200_Yura_BranchEndRomanScene
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Atka
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00700681
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Roman likes you, Yura. He's just not sure how to tell you. &&& ... &&& Atka: That still doesn't justify what you did, Yura. &&& Yura: Oh come on, Milli is fine. Everything is fine! &&& Yura: Help me out here.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Milli does seem fine. Roman's been around long enough to know how to properly care for her.
#. EDID: [0105A343]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001CF0"
msgid "Milli really is fine. Roman was taking good care of her."
msgstr "밀리는 정말 괜찮아. 로만이 잘 돌보고 있었어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_3200_Yura_BranchEndRomanScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Atka
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFAtka
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 0074A065
#. ScriptNotes = Serious / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Roman likes you, Yura. He's just not sure how to tell you. &&& Yura: I say if he did all this for me, that tells me plenty.
#. DialogueAfter = Atka: That still doesn't justify what you did, Yura.
#. EDID: [0105A353]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001CF1"
msgid "Okay, great, so this was all some elaborate scheme of Roman's, probably to impress my sister."
msgstr "좋아. 참 대단하네. 그럼 이 일은 모두 로만이 우리 동생에게 잘 보이려고 꾸민 정교한 계획이었다는 거네."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_3200_Yura_BranchEndRomanScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Yura
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFYura
#. Face = Happy
#. SoundFileID = 0019937B
#. ScriptNotes = Happy / to Player Default
#. Prompt = He was pretty disappointed to see me.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: He was pretty disappointed to see me.
#. DialogueAfter = Atka: Okay, great, so this was all some elaborate scheme for Roman to catch my sister's attention.
#. EDID: [0105A344]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001CF2"
msgid "I wish I could've seen the look on his face. He hates it when plans go bad."
msgstr "그의 표정을 볼 수 있었으면 좋았을 텐데. 그는 계획이 틀어지는 걸 싫어하거든."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_3200_Yura_BranchEndRomanScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Atka
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFAtka
#. Face = Grateful
#. SoundFileID = 000E8825
#. ScriptNotes = Grateful / to Player Default
#. Prompt = This seems like something you two need to work out on your own.
#. DialogueAfter = Yura: Don't talk to me!
#. EDID: [0105A360]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001CF3"
msgid "I really do appreciate you taking care of Milli. As much as it surprises me, she really does seem fine."
msgstr "밀리를 돌봐 줘서 정말 고마워. 솔직히 걱정 많이 했는데, 애가 진짜 아무렇지도 않고 괜찮아 보이네."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_3200_Yura_BranchEndRomanScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Atka
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFAtka
#. Face = Grateful
#. SoundFileID = 0072D28E
#. ScriptNotes = Grateful / to Player Default
#. Prompt = This seems like something you two need to work out on your own.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: This seems like something you two need to work out on your own.
#. EDID: [0105A360]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001CF4"
msgid "I agree completely."
msgstr "전적으로 동의해."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_3200_Yura_BranchEndRomanScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Atka
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFAtka
#. Face = Concerned
#. SoundFileID = 005929D3
#. ScriptNotes = Concerned / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Milli really is fine. Roman was taking good care of her.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Milli really is fine. Roman was taking good care of her.
#. DialogueAfter = Yura: Don't talk to me!
#. EDID: [0105A355]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001CF5"
msgid "Milli does seem fine. Roman's been around long enough to know how to properly care for her. "
msgstr "밀리는 괜찮아 보여. 로만하고는 오래 알고 지내서 밀리를 돌보는 방법을 잘 알거든. "

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_3200_Yura_BranchEndRomanScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Yura
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFYura
#. Face = Stern
#. SoundFileID = 00C0B9B8
#. ScriptNotes = Stern / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Yura: Oh come on, Milli is fine. Everything is fine!
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: As a Freestar Ranger, I can guarantee she's fine.
#. EDID: [0105A33D]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001CF6"
msgid "Help me out here."
msgstr "나 좀 도와줘."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_3200_Yura_BranchEndRomanScene
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Yura
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00387518
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Roman's just a common thief extorting people for credits. &&& Atka: You're not wrong... &&& Yura: Well, you're not right either! You make it sound like he's just some loser criminal who's out to get people, but he's not.|Roman cares about people. In fact, if he stole Milli it was probably to get my attention in the first place.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: I can't wait to talk to him about all this. He must be losing his mind.
#. EDID: [0105A32F]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001CF7"
msgid "The things we do to impress someone."
msgstr "누군가에게 잘 보이려고 별짓을 다 하지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_3200_Yura_BranchEndRomanScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Yura
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFYura
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 006DEDA7
#. ScriptNotes = Confident / to Player Default
#. Prompt = I don't think Roman thinks much.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I don't think Roman thinks much. &&& Atka: Finally, someone who actually agrees with me.
#. DialogueAfter = Atka: Okay, great, so this was all some elaborate scheme for Roman to catch my sister's attention.
#. EDID: [0105A349]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001CF8"
msgid "Hey, Roman just thinks outside the box. "
msgstr "야, 로만은 그냥 남다르게 생각하는 거야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_3200_Yura_BranchEndRomanScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Atka
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFAtka
#. Face = Angry
#. SoundFileID = 00A5928F
#. ScriptNotes = Angry / to Yura
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Roman is dead.
#. EDID: [0105A331]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001CF9"
msgid "What was Roman even thinking?"
msgstr "로만은 대체 무슨 생각으로 그랬던 거야?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_3200_Yura_BranchEndRomanScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Atka
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFAtka
#. Face = Angry
#. SoundFileID = 00638459
#. ScriptNotes = Angry / to Yura
#. DialogueBefore = Atka: I'm sorry. Who are you? And are you saying Roman stole Milli while I was gone? &&& Yura: Atka, this is the pet sitter I was telling you about.|And as you can see, Milli is fine!
#. EDID: [0105A331]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001CFA"
msgid "Fine? She was stolen right out of our home! She could be traumatized. "
msgstr "멀쩡해? 밀리가 바로 이 집에서 납치당했잖아! 트라우마가 생겼을 수도 있다고. "

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_3200_Yura_MainEndScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Yura
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFYura
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 003A2EA3
#. ScriptNotes = Confident / to Atka
#. DialogueBefore = Yura: And, I assume, a very trusted friend...
#. DialogueAfter = Yura: And see? Milli's fine!
#. EDID: [0105A34A]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001CFB"
msgid "You'll be happy to know, they were just taking Milli for a walk."
msgstr "거봐, 별일 아니랬지? 그냥 밀리 산책시키던 중이었다고."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_3200_Yura_MainEndScene
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Atka
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00D1F63B
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I don't see how the timing is my fault. &&& ... &&& Yura: And see? Milli's fine! &&& Yura: Right, "pet sitters"? &&& companion: We guarded this creature with our very lives.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Well, she seems fine. Milli does enjoy exploring, so a little adventure couldn't hurt.
#. EDID: [0105A336]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001CFC"
msgid "Milli and I have had quite the adventure together."
msgstr "밀리와 나는 꽤 대단한 모험을 함께했어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_3200_Yura_BranchEndRomanScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Yura
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFYura
#. Face = Worried
#. SoundFileID = 00C338C9
#. ScriptNotes = Worried / to Yura
#. Prompt = Roman's not thinking anything anymore.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Roman's not thinking anything anymore.
#. DialogueAfter = Yura: Roman and his friends are dead.
#. EDID: [0105B431]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001CFD"
msgid "Hold up. What's that supposed to mean?"
msgstr "잠깐. 그게 무슨 뜻이야?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_3200_Yura_MainEndScene
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Yura
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00B91991
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: [Lie] Just taking Milli for a walk. &&& Yura: Oh yeah? Well, great timing. |I got a message from Atka that she was returning early, so I got down here as soon as I could. &&& Atka: Excuse me. &&& Yura: Imagine my surprise when not only did she beat me back here, but Milli was nowhere to be found.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Don't try to change the subject on me.
#. EDID: [0105A35C]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001CFE"
msgid "I think your sister is trying to get your attention."
msgstr "네 언니가 너한테 할 말이 있는 것 같은데."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1300_Roman_TL_YuraScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Roman
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRomanKreutz
#. Face = Thinking
#. SoundFileID = 00E040B9
#. ScriptNotes = Thinking / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Is she always pawning off responsibilities on other people?
#. DialogueAfter = Roman: Why does she have difficulty with compliments?
#. EDID: [0105BF6C]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001CFF"
msgid "I think she just knows who will forgive her and who won't."
msgstr "유라는 누가 자신을 용서해 줄지, 누가 안 해 줄지 아는 것 같아."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1300_Roman_TL_YuraScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Roman
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRomanKreutz
#. Face = Concerned
#. SoundFileID = 00B646BF
#. ScriptNotes = Concerned / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Is she always pawning off responsibilities on other people?
#. EDID: [0105BF6C]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001D00"
msgid "But when it comes to Atka, she rarely comes through."
msgstr "하지만 아트카에 관한 일에서는 거의 기대에 부응하지 못하지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1300_Roman_TL_YuraScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Roman
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRomanKreutz
#. Face = Amused
#. SoundFileID = 001322CD
#. ScriptNotes = Amused / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Is she always pawning off responsibilities on other people?
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Is she always pawning off responsibilities on other people?
#. EDID: [0105BF6C]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001D01"
msgid "Depends if she wants to do it or not. If she's responsible for a ship load of cargo, she's as responsible as they come."
msgstr "유라가 하고 싶느냐에 따라 다르지. 가득 화물을 실은 우주선을 책임지고 있다면, 누구보다 책임감 있게 일해."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_3200_Yura_BranchEndRomanScene
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00093F2D
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Roman took Milli and was holding her for ransom. &&& ... &&& Atka: I'm sorry. Who are you? And are you saying Roman stole Milli while I was gone? &&& Yura: Atka, this is the pet sitter I was telling you about.|And as you can see, Milli is fine! &&& Atka: Fine? She was stolen right out of our home! She could be traumatized. |What was Roman even thinking?
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Roman and his friends are dead.
#. EDID: [0105B42E]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001D02"
msgid "Roman is dead."
msgstr "로만은 죽었어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_3200_Yura_MainEndScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Atka
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFAtka
#. Face = Grateful
#. SoundFileID = 0026D1CC
#. ScriptNotes = Grateful / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Atka: Oh, and since you kept Milli safe, keep the food.
#. DialogueAfter = Atka: Thanks for keeping an eye on things while I was gone.
#. EDID: [0105BF77]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001D03"
msgid "If you ever want a little Milli of your own, that's my own personal recipe to give them all the nutrients they need."
msgstr "언젠가 자그마한 밀리를 갖고 싶을 수도 있으니까. 영양 만점 사료 만드는 제조법을 줄게."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_3200_Yura_MainEndScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Atka
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFAtka
#. Face = Grateful
#. SoundFileID = 003CB67E
#. ScriptNotes = Grateful / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Atka: Here, it's what I intended to pay Yura, plus a little extra for the trouble and keeping the plant babies alive.
#. DialogueAfter = Atka: If you ever want a little Milli of your own, that's my own personal recipe to give them all the nutrients they need.
#. EDID: [0105BFB9]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001D04"
msgid "Oh, and since you kept Milli safe, keep the food. "
msgstr "아, 그리고 밀리를 안전하게 지켜 줬으니까, 사료도 받아줘. "

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
