#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00E4712E
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Let me ask you about something else.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Let me ask you about something else.
#. EDID: [0105BF71]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001D05"
msgid "Sure."
msgstr "물론."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1300_Roman_TL_AtkaScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Roman
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRomanKreutz
#. Face = Nervous
#. SoundFileID = 007F883E
#. ScriptNotes = Nervous / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Can I ask you something else?
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Can I ask you something else?
#. EDID: [0105BF9C]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001D06"
msgid "I guess so."
msgstr "그런 것 같아."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1300_Roman_TL_AtkaScene
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 001545A9
#. ScriptNotes = / to Roman
#. DialogueAfter = Roman: Yura's sister? She's pretty nice, but she doesn't exactly approve of our lifestyle, if you know what I mean.
#. EDID: [0105BF8C]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001D07"
msgid "What do you know about Atka?"
msgstr "아트카에 대해 뭘 알아?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1200_Roman_StarbornScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMRomanKreutz
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRomanKreutz
#. Face = Thinking
#. SoundFileID = 00A49421
#. ScriptNotes = Thinking / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Doesn't matter. I know you like her. I'll put in a good word.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Doesn't matter. I know you like her. I'll put in a good word.
#. DialogueAfter = Roman: You've got yourself a deal. Here's the key to Milli's room.
#. EDID: [0105C9CD]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001D08"
msgid "I guess that's a chance worth taking, especially since your being here means the original plan was shot."
msgstr "그쪽이 여기 있다는 건 원래 계획이 틀어졌다는 거니까, 그 정도면 감수할 만하겠지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1200_Roman_FreestarScene
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Roman
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 001D2C2D
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: You never considered the consequences of your actions? &&& Roman: I never thought Yura would take this seriously. |I figured she'd be excited to have something fun to do for a change.|And believe me when I say Yura is not the type to get the law involved.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Believe me when I say there will be no next time.
#. EDID: [0105BF82]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001D09"
msgid "Next time you'll face jail time."
msgstr "다음엔 감옥살이를 하게 될 거야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1200_Roman_StarbornScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Roman
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRomanKreutz
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 00BF526A
#. ScriptNotes = Confident / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Roman: I guess that's a chance worth taking, especially since your being here means the original plan was shot.
#. EDID: [0105C9D1]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001D0A"
msgid "You've got yourself a deal. Here's the key to Milli's room. "
msgstr "거래 성립이네. 여기 밀리 방 열쇠야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1200_Roman_StarbornScene
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 005303A5
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Give me Milli and I'll put in a good word for you with Yura. &&& Roman: Whoa, what? Who are you? How would you even know anything about that?
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: I guess that's a chance worth taking, especially since your being here means the original plan was shot.
#. EDID: [0105C9CE]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001D0B"
msgid "Doesn't matter. I know you like her. I'll put in a good word."
msgstr "아 됐고. 네가 유라를 좋아한다는 거 안다니까? 내가 좋게 말해 줄게."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1200_Roman_StarbornScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Roman
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRomanKreutz
#. Face = Depressed
#. SoundFileID = 0030C519
#. ScriptNotes = Depressed / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Yura hired me to house sit, but it's obvious what's going on.
#. DialogueAfter = Roman: You've got yourself a deal. Here's the key to Milli's room.
#. EDID: [0105C9C9]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001D0C"
msgid "*sigh* That's one plan failed. I guess at this point, I might as well take you up on the offer."
msgstr "*한숨* 계획 하나가 실패했군. 이제 이쯤 되면 네 제안을 받아들이는 게 낫겠어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1200_Roman_StarbornScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Roman
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRomanKreutz
#. Face = Concerned
#. SoundFileID = 0029407A
#. ScriptNotes = Concerned / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Yura hired me to house sit, but it's obvious what's going on.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Yura hired me to house sit, but it's obvious what's going on.
#. EDID: [0105C9C9]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001D0D"
msgid "You're kidding? Of course she would... "
msgstr "농담이지? 당연히 그러겠지..."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1200_Roman_MainRansomScene
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 002876A5
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Nice doing business with you. &&& Roman: Who are you?
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Whoa, what? Who are you? How would you even know anything about that?
#. EDID: [0105C9C6]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001D0E"
msgid "Give me Milli and I'll put in a good word for you with Yura."
msgstr "밀리를 넘겨. 그러면 네가 좋은 녀석이라고 유라에게 얘기해 줄게."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1200_Roman_MainBranchYura01Scene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = companion
#. VoiceType = NPCMSamCoe
#. Face = Friendly
#. SoundFileID = 00744DE7
#. ScriptNotes = Friendly / to Roman
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I don't do favors for petnappers. &&& Roman: Just hear me out. You got this petnapping thing all wrong.|You see, this is all a setup for Yura. &&& Roman: She hates house sitting. It's boring. So we thought why not liven things up?|We figured she'd get into it, maybe even get the credits from Atka...|And then when all went according to plan, I'd have the confidence to ask her out. |But now I've lost that chance. So, plan B. I give you Milli, you put in a good word for me with Yura.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: [Demand Credits: <Global=SFFL_MS03_PaymentCredits>] I don't do anything for free.
#. EDID: [0106B1EF]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001D0F"
msgid "Sounds fair enough to me. Besides, I can't say I never pulled similar stunts back in my day."
msgstr "그 정도면 나쁘지 않네. 게다가 나도 예전엔 비슷한 짓을 안 해봤다고는 말 못 하니까."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1200_Roman_MainBranchYura01Scene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = companion
#. VoiceType = NPCMBarrett
#. Face = Impressed
#. SoundFileID = 00AB01F6
#. ScriptNotes = Impressed / to Roman
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I don't do favors for petnappers. &&& Roman: Just hear me out. You got this petnapping thing all wrong.|You see, this is all a setup for Yura. &&& Roman: She hates house sitting. It's boring. So we thought why not liven things up?|We figured she'd get into it, maybe even get the credits from Atka...|And then when all went according to plan, I'd have the confidence to ask her out. |But now I've lost that chance. So, plan B. I give you Milli, you put in a good word for me with Yura.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: [Demand Credits: <Global=SFFL_MS03_PaymentCredits>] I don't do anything for free.
#. EDID: [0106B1EE]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001D10"
msgid "That's a pretty elaborate setup just to impress someone. "
msgstr "누군가에게 잘 보이려고 하는 짓 치고는 꽤 공을 들여서 준비하네. "

