#. EDID: [01035866]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001D48"
msgid "A little extra? I knew you were holding out on me."
msgstr "사례금? 나한테 주려고 숨겨둔 게 있을 알았다니까."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03_Support
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_PostQuest_Yura_MS03DoneRomanDeadScene
