#. DialogueAfter = Yura: I... I loved him, Atka... and I never got to tell him.
#. EDID: [0105BF86]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001D49"
msgid "Yura, I'm so sorry. I know how close you were."
msgstr "유라, 정말 안됐구나. 로만과 얼마나 가까운 사이였는지 잘 알아."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03_Support
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_PostQuest_Yura_TL_Roman01Scene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Yura
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFYura
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 006806D7
#. ScriptNotes = Confident / to Player Default
#. Prompt = So you have to work through some things. Roman would understand.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: So you have to work through some things. Roman would understand.
#. DialogueAfter = Yura: I guess I have a lot to think about thanks to you.
#. EDID: [0105BF6D]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001D4A"
msgid "I know he would, but he doesn't need to deal with all my emotional baggage. "
msgstr "로만이라면 이해해 주겠지만, 로만을 내 감정 쓰레기통으로 만들고 싶진 않아. "

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03_Support
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_PostQuest_Yura_TL_Roman01Scene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCFYura
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFYura
#. Face = Concerned
#. SoundFileID = 00C3EBC7
#. ScriptNotes = Concerned / to Player Default
#. Prompt = He really likes you, Yura. Give him a chance.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: That's just fear talking. If you like Roman, don't let fear keep you apart.
#. EDID: [0105BF88]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001D4B"
msgid "Roman's great, really, but the moment you start dating someone, that means you start letting them in and I really suck at that."
msgstr ""
"로만은 정말 좋은 사람이야. 진짜로. 하지만 누군가와 사귀기 시작한다는 건, 그 사람에게 내 마음을 열어줘야 한다는 거잖아. 난 그런 걸 "
"정말 못 하거든."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03_Support
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_PostQuest_Yura_TL_Roman01Scene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCFYura
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFYura
#. Face = Amused
#. SoundFileID = 0081C042
#. ScriptNotes = Amused / to Player Default
#. Prompt = He really likes you, Yura. Give him a chance.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: He really likes you, Yura. Give him a chance.
#. EDID: [0105BF88]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001D4C"
msgid "Give him a chance so I can screw it all up? "
msgstr "내가 기회를 줬다가 다 망치게 되면? "

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03_Support
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_PostQuest_Yura_TL_Roman01Scene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Yura
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFYura
#. Face = Concerned
#. SoundFileID = 00E7B776
#. ScriptNotes = Concerned / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Yura: I can't believe he did all this for me.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: He really likes you, Yura. Give him a chance.
#. EDID: [0105BFAF]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001D4D"
msgid "I really wish I deserved someone like him, but I'm just not relationship material. Not right now."
msgstr "로만에게 어울리는 사람이면 좋겠지만, 난 연애할 만한 인간이 못 돼. 적어도 지금은."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03_Support
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_PostQuest_Yura_TL_Roman01Scene
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00B1137F
#. ScriptNotes = / to Yura
#. DialogueAfter = Yura: Roman's the best.
#. EDID: [0105BF80]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001D4E"
msgid "Roman wanted me to put in a good word for him with you."
msgstr "로만이 너한테 자기 얘기를 좋게 해달라던데."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03_Support
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_PostQuest_Yura_MS03DoneRomanDeadScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Yura
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFYura
#. Face = Depressed
#. SoundFileID = 00B0D935
#. ScriptNotes = Depressed / to Atka
#. DialogueBefore = Yura: I... I loved him, Atka... and I never got to tell him. &&& Atka: I'm sure deep down he knew. He had to.|You guys were inseparable, and I know he loved you, too.
#. DialogueAfter = Atka: Stop it, Yura. I love you, and Roman loved you. No matter what.
#. EDID: [0105BF8B]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001D4F"
msgid "You think so? But I'm so stupid! I never let him in because who could love someone like me? I screw up everything."
msgstr ""
"정말 그렇게 생각해? 하지만 난 너무 멍청했어! 누가 나 같은 사람을 사랑하겠냐는 생각 때문에 한 번도 로만을 받아들이지 못했어. 내가 "
"전부 망친 거야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03_Support
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_PostQuest_Yura_TL_AtkaScene
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00B8C2A5
#. ScriptNotes = / to Yura
#. DialogueAfter = Yura: Atka's always trying to get me to do stuff so she can "teach me responsibility."
#. EDID: [0105C374]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001D50"
msgid "So what's the deal with you and Atka?"
msgstr "그래서 너랑 아트카는 무슨 사이야?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03_Support
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_PostQuest_Atka_TL_YuraScene
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Atka
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00983FCD
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Can you tell me more about Yura? &&& Atka: You pretty much experienced my sister in a nutshell.|She's the queen of work avoidance. I think she'd rather die than hold down a real job.|I just want some stability in her life, so I don't have to worry about her all the time.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Sure.
#. EDID: [0105CEA5]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001D51"
msgid "I'd like to talk about something else."
msgstr "다른 얘기를 하고 싶어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03_Support
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_PostQuest_Yura_TL_AtkaScene
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00C744C7
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: So what's the deal with you and Atka? &&& Yura: Atka's always trying to get me to do stuff so she can "teach me responsibility." |I think she got it from our parents who couldn't handle the fact that I never went to college or bothered with a steady job.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Right? You make your own hours, set your own rates...
#. EDID: [0105CEC5]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001D52"
msgid "Steady jobs suck. Freelance all the way."
msgstr "안정적인 직장은 별로야. 프리랜서가 최고지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03_Support
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_PostQuest_Atka_TL_YuraScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Atka
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFAtka
#. Face = Concerned
#. SoundFileID = 00CBAEF3
#. ScriptNotes = Concerned / to Player Default
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Why do you worry about Yura?
#. EDID: [0105CED8]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001D53"
msgid "I just want some stability in her life, so I don't have to worry about her all the time."
msgstr "난 그 애 삶에 안정이 좀 생겼으면 해. 그래야 내가 늘 걱정하지 않아도 되니까."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03_Support
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_PostQuest_Atka_TL_YuraScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Atka
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFAtka
#. Face = Concerned
#. SoundFileID = 00B3F01B
#. ScriptNotes = Concerned / to Player Default
#. EDID: [0105CED8]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001D54"
msgid "She's the queen of work avoidance. I think she'd rather die than hold down a real job."
msgstr "그 애는 일 피하기의 여왕이야. 제대로 된 직장을 게속 다니느니 죽는 게 낫다고 생각할걸."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03_Support
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_PostQuest_Atka_TL_YuraScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Atka
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFAtka
#. Face = Irritated
#. SoundFileID = 006A368F
#. ScriptNotes = Irritated / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Can you tell me more about Yura?
#. EDID: [0105CED8]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001D55"
msgid "You pretty much experienced my sister in a nutshell."
msgstr "여동생이 어떤 애인지 아주 제대로 겪었네."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03_Support
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_PostQuest_Atka_TL_YuraScene
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 006CE790
#. ScriptNotes = / to Atka
#. DialogueAfter = Atka: You pretty much experienced my sister in a nutshell.
#. EDID: [0105CE89]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001D56"
msgid "Can you tell me more about Yura?"
msgstr "유라에 대해 더 말해줄 수 있어?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03_Support
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_PostQuest_Yura_TL_Roman02Scene
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0019C243
#. ScriptNotes = / to Yura
#. DialogueAfter = Yura: I think he did it for me, as weird as that sounds.
#. EDID: [0105CE8A]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001D57"
msgid "Why would Roman target your sister for ransom?"
msgstr "로만은 왜 네 여동생을 몸값 대상으로 삼았어?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03_Support
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_PostQuest_Roman_YuraYesScene01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Roman
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRomanKreutz
#. Face = Amused
#. SoundFileID = 00C1EC61
#. ScriptNotes = Amused / to Player Default
#. Prompt = I'm a fan of the classic advice. Just be yourself.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I'm a fan of the classic advice. Just be yourself.
#. DialogueAfter = Roman: All right. I can do this.
#. EDID: [0106B1BB]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001D58"
msgid "I guess if I tried to be anything else, she'd immediately call me out on it. "
msgstr "내가 다른 사람인 척 행동하면, 그 애가 바로 지적할 테니까. "

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03_Support
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_PostQuest_Roman_YuraYesScene01
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Roman
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0006FB6D
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Roman: I feel like a nervous wreck. What do I say? I... I need advice. Anything!
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Think about it? That's promising, right? Oh wow, she really might be ready to give me a shot.
#. EDID: [0106B1B4]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001D59"
msgid "Yura's going to think about it."
msgstr "유라가 생각해 보겠데."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03_Support
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_PostQuest_Roman_YuraYesScene01
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Roman
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0083FE16
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I think I was rather convincing. &&& Roman: What? You're not joking? Oh god, so I really get to go through with it now. &&& Roman: I feel like a nervous wreck. What do I say? I... I need advice. Anything!
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: I guess if I tried to be anything else, she'd immediately call me out on it.
#. EDID: [0106B1B6]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001D5A"
msgid "I'm a fan of the classic advice. Just be yourself."
msgstr "난 고전적인 조언이 좋아. 그냥 너답게 굴어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03_Support
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_PostQuest_Roman_YuraNoScene01
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Roman
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00B22069
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Roman: I knew this wasn't gonna work out. Why do I even keep trying?
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: *sigh* I know... I guess I was hoping we could work through those things together.
#. EDID: [0106B1AF]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001D5B"
msgid "Yura has some things she needs to work through."
msgstr "유라에게는 스스로 정리해야 할 일이 있어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03_Support
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_PostQuest_Roman_YuraNoScene01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Roman
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRomanKreutz
#. Face = Depressed
#. SoundFileID = 005D0029
#. ScriptNotes = Depressed / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Just be there for her. You mean a lot to her.
#. EDID: [0106B1C0]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001D5C"
msgid "Thanks for trying, though."
msgstr "그래도 애써 줘서 고마워."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03_Support
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_PostQuest_Roman_YuraNoScene01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Roman
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRomanKreutz
#. Face = Concerned
#. SoundFileID = 00A6C7E9
#. ScriptNotes = Concerned / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Just be there for her. You mean a lot to her.
#. EDID: [0106B1C0]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001D5D"
msgid "As long as she'll still have me around, I'll be there."
msgstr "그 애가 곁에 있어 달라고 하는 한, 난 있을 거야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03_Support
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_PostQuest_Roman_YuraNoScene01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Roman
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRomanKreutz
#. Face = Depressed
#. SoundFileID = 00D06F26
#. ScriptNotes = Depressed / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Just be there for her. You mean a lot to her.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Just be there for her. You mean a lot to her.
#. EDID: [0106B1C0]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001D5E"
msgid "Yeah, at least I know that much. And don't worry, I'd never bail on a friend in need, especially Yura. "
msgstr "그래, 적어도 그건 알아. 걱정 마. 도움이 필요한 친구를 버리고 가는 일은 절대 없어. 특히 유라라면."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_Z01_AudioLogs
#. SceneName = SFFL_Z01_AudioLogs_LoveSlate_GABBY
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = AUDIOONLY
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCGabrielleBaker
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00286734
#. ScriptNotes = Sweet and gentle.
#. DialogueBefore = Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): I hope you're doing well, my Love. If all goes well I should be home soon. With a real nice pay day too.
#. DialogueAfter = Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): I promise, the second I step foot back home I'm taking you to the fanciest restaurant in town. I don't care how gross or dirty or whatever I'll be from a month in this hunk of metal.
#. EDID: [0106C72B]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001D5F"
msgid "I want to thank you for being so patient with me."
msgstr "나한테 이렇게 인내심을 가져 줘서 고맙다고 말하고 싶어."

#. List: 2
