#. SceneName = SFFL_Z01_AudioLogs_LoveSlate_GABBY
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = AUDIOONLY
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCGabrielleBaker
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0007BE61
#. ScriptNotes = Relaxed
#. DialogueBefore = Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): Speaking of this ship, she's a real piece of work. 'Best for the price,' my ass! I'm telling you that seller must have pulled a fast one on me.
#. DialogueAfter = Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): Oh? Give me one moment. This ship always has something to complain about. Guess I better check on it. See you soon, Love. Promise.
#. EDID: [0106C72E]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001D60"
msgid "But it'll be fine. As long as she gets me where me, and the rest of this junk, needs to be I'm happy."
msgstr "그래도 괜찮을 거야. 그 여자가 나와 이 잡동사니들을 있어야 할 곳까지 데려다주기만 하면 난 만족해."

#. List: 2
#. EDID: [01034F82]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
