msgid "We're in your debt, friend. Thank you."
msgstr "우리가 신세를 졌군. 친구. 고마워."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ01
#. SceneName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ01_Conclusion
