#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I took care of your Spacer problem.
#. EDID: [010343A4]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001D67"
msgid "Really? You hardly look any the worse for wear."
msgstr "정말? 고생한 티가 전혀 안나 보이는데."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ01
#. SceneName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ01_Conclusion
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = ChanHuang
