msgid "I took care of your Spacer problem."
msgstr "스페이서 문제는 처리했어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ01
#. SceneName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ01_Conclusion
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = companion
#. VoiceType = NPCMSamCoe
#. Face = Amused
#. SoundFileID = 007E1A31
#. ScriptNotes = Amused / Amused / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Maybe Spacers shouldn't be welcome here anymore.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Maybe Spacers shouldn't be welcome here anymore. &&& ChanHuang: If we closed our doors to the Spacers, they'd just kick them down, metaphorically speaking.|Easier to just let them in and try to contain the mess.
#. DialogueAfter = ChanHuang: Here. Compliments of Mister Saint.
#. EDID: [01059DC5]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001D6E"
msgid "Lesser of two evils, I guess."
msgstr "차악을 고른 셈이겠지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_Z01_SE1
#. SceneName = SFFL_Z01_100a_Hailing_SEHOY
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = HailingShip
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCSehoyBaker
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0015F417
#. ScriptNotes = Nervous and desperate. [Spaceship]
#. DialogueBefore = HailingShip: Hello? Is someone there? Please, tell me if you can hear me. This is Sehoy Baker.
#. DialogueAfter = HailingShip: No, wait! Dammit!
#. EDID: [010325FA]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001D6F"
msgid "Please, I need help..."
msgstr "제발, 도움이 필요해요..."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_Z01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCSehoyBaker
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCSehoyBaker
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00E780EC
#. ScriptNotes = Worried. [Spaceship]
#. EDID: [01056638]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001D70"
msgid "If you see Gabrielle, please tell her to come home..."
msgstr "가브리엘을 보면 집으로 돌아오라고 전해 주세요..."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_Z01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCSehoyBaker
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCSehoyBaker
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 004AFFBD
#. ScriptNotes = Worried. [Spaceship]
#. EDID: [01056615]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001D71"
msgid "Oh, what the hell am I doing...?"
msgstr "아, 내가 대체 뭘 하고 있는 거지...?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_Z01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCSehoyBaker
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCSehoyBaker
#. Face = Spaceship / Angry
#. SoundFileID = 005763F8
#. ScriptNotes = Scared [Spaceship] / Angry
#. EDID: [0105661D]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001D72"
msgid "I can't... Not yet."
msgstr "못 해... 아직은."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_Z01
#. SceneName = SFFL_Z01_200_SEHOY
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Sehoy
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00252014
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: All she said was that she wanted you to go back home. &&& Sehoy: I see... Thank you for telling me.|I don't know why she's doing this, but here. I wish I had more credits to give you. I'm sorry. Hopefully this will work.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: R-Right. I... I will. If you come across her again, please, tell her I'm waiting.
#. EDID: [010352FF]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001D73"
msgid "Go home."
msgstr "집에 가."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_Z01
#. SceneName = SFFL_Z01_200_SEHOY
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Sehoy
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCSehoyBaker
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00AB1231
#. ScriptNotes = Hopefully once she sees the Player again. [Spaceship]
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Her ship malfunctioned. I found these slates in the wreckage.
#. EDID: [010352EF]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001D74"
msgid "You're back! Did you find Gabrielle? Please, tell me you've found her."
msgstr "돌아왔군요! 가브리엘을 찾았나요? 제발, 찾았다고 말해 주세요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_Z01
#. SceneName = SFFL_Z01_200_SEHOY
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCSehoyBaker
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCSehoyBaker
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00915D4F
#. ScriptNotes = Horrified and heartbroken. Tearing up. [Spaceship] / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Her ship malfunctioned. I found these slates in the wreckage.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: I'm so sorry, Sehoy.
#. EDID: [010352E2]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001D75"
msgid "I-I can't believe this, my star, she's-"
msgstr "이-믿을 수가 없어, 내 별이, 그 애가-"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_Z01
#. SceneName = SFFL_Z01_200_SEHOY
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCSehoyBaker
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCSehoyBaker
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0037D22C
#. ScriptNotes = Shocked and a bit lost for words at first. She is in a rush to figure out what happened and asks for the slates. [Spaceship] / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Her ship malfunctioned. I found these slates in the wreckage.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Her ship malfunctioned. I found these slates in the wreckage.
#. EDID: [010352E2]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001D76"
msgid "How did it- Let me see those."
msgstr "어떻게 된- 그것 좀 보여 주세요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_Z01
#. SceneName = SFFL_Z01_200_SEHOY
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Sehoy
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCSehoyBaker
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00BB155F
#. ScriptNotes = Feels as if time has stopped for her. Part of her though is holding back her tears. She tries to sound thankful, but is just lost. [Spaceship] / to Player Default
#. Prompt = You should go home. There's nothing left for you out here.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: I don't want your credits.
#. EDID: [010352E7]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001D77"
msgid "Well, thank you, I guess. Here. I don't have many credits anymore, but take them."
msgstr "음, 고마워요. 여기요. 이제 크레딧은 많지 않지만 받아 주세요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_Z01
#. SceneName = SFFL_Z01_200_SEHOY
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Sehoy
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCSehoyBaker
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00D00873
#. ScriptNotes = Slow speaking. Feels as if time has stopped for her and she has no idea what to do. Part of her though is holding back her tears. [Spaceship] / to Player Default
#. Prompt = You should go home. There's nothing left for you out here.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: You should go home. There's nothing left for you out here.
#. EDID: [010352E7]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001D78"
msgid "There really isn't, is there...?"
msgstr "정말 방법이 없는 거죠...?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_Z01
#. SceneName = SFFL_Z01_120Starborn_SEHOY
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Sehoy
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCSehoyBaker
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00AED44B
#. ScriptNotes = Shocked and confused as to why her wife wouldn't want to be found. [Spaceship] / to Player Default
#. Prompt = [Lie] She didn't want you to know where she was. She said she still has a lot of work she needs to do.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: [Lie] She didn't want you to know where she was. She said she still has a lot of work she needs to do.
#. DialogueAfter = Sehoy: I'm so sorry, Sehoy.
#. EDID: [01056604]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001D79"
msgid "What? But why? Where did you find her? I need to talk to her!"
msgstr "뭐라고요? 하지만 왜요? 어디서 그 애를 찾았죠? 그 애와 얘기해야 해요!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_Z01
#. SceneName = SFFL_Z01_120Starborn_SEHOY
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCSehoyBaker
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCSehoyBaker
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00F3A3B9
#. ScriptNotes = Shocked and horrified. Tearing up at the end. Just learned her wife is dead. [Spaceship] / to Player Default
#. Prompt = By the time I found her she was dead. Her ship was destroyed.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: By the time I found her she was dead. Her ship was destroyed.
#. DialogueAfter = Sehoy: I'm so sorry, Sehoy.
#. EDID: [010565F3]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001D7A"
msgid "What? No. Oh, no... Gabbie..."
msgstr "뭐라고? 아니야. 아, 안 돼... 가비..."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_Z01
#. SceneName = SFFL_Z01_300_COMPANION
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = companion
#. VoiceType = NPCFSarahMorgan
#. Face = Spaceship / Confident
#. SoundFileID = 005929BE
#. ScriptNotes = Player lied to Sehoy. Disappointed in the player for lying and prolonging the woman's heartbreak. Sad for Sehoy. [Spaceship]
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: It's just what she said. That's all I know. &&& Sehoy: That can't be right... I'm sorry. I have to find her.
#. EDID: [01056635]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001D7B"
msgid "She's going to find out at some point, you know? Why delay that? Not that there's much that can be done now."
msgstr "언젠가는 알게 될 거잖아? 왜 미뤄? 지금 할 수 있는 게 많지도 않은데."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_Z01
#. SceneName = SFFL_Z01_300_COMPANION
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = companion
#. VoiceType = NPCFAndreja
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00F8BEC5
#. ScriptNotes = Player lied to Sehoy. Disappointed in the player for lying and prolonging the woman's heartbreak. Sad for Sehoy. [Spaceship]
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: It's just what she said. That's all I know. &&& Sehoy: That can't be right... I'm sorry. I have to find her.
#. EDID: [0105662C]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001D7C"
msgid "Was telling her that really necessary? Let's just hope she can learn to move on."
msgstr "그걸 굳이 말해야 했어? 그냥 그 사람이 잘 극복하길 바라자."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_Z01
#. SceneName = SFFL_Z01_200_SEHOY
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Sehoy
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCSehoyBaker
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 008D173F
#. ScriptNotes = Confused and scared. Knows the Player is hiding something and this frightens her. She is now in a bigger rush to find Gabrielle. [Spaceship] / to Player Default
#. Prompt = I think you should just go home.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I think you should just go home.
#. DialogueAfter = companion: Perhaps Gabrielle can finally be at peace now. I just hope Sehoy can find it one day too.
#. EDID: [010565FF]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001D7D"
msgid "No... No. I can't. I have to find her. I have to."
msgstr "안 돼... 안 돼. 못 해. 그 애를 찾아야 해. 꼭 찾아야 해."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_Z01
#. SceneName = SFFL_Z01_120_SEHOY
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Sehoy
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 008A4732
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = HailingShip: In all honesty, I am. &&& Sehoy: You seem like you're more versed in this whole flying thing than me.|Please, have you seen a cargo ship out here? Piloted by a woman named Gabrielle Baker?|I'm her wife. She went on a job and it's been months...
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: No! Wait, please!
#. EDID: [0105661B]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001D7E"
msgid "That sounds like a you problem. Not mine. Good luck."
msgstr "그건 네 문제지. 내 문제는 아니야. 행운을 빌어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_KT02_SailingHighSeas
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = AudioOnly
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMGenericMale02
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00374FF0
#. EDID: [010388D9]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001D7F"
msgid "This is a matter of ethics. As far as I'm concerned, this tour guide is a pirate, and we have every right to kill them."
msgstr "이건 윤리의 문제야. 내가 보기엔 이 관광 안내원은 해적이고, 우린 그들을 죽일 권리가 충분해."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_KT02_SailingHighSeas
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE_KT02_100b_HailingAnswered
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = HailingShip
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFGenericFemale01
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00509C24
#. Prompt = Yeah, what's a smithereen?
#. DialogueBefore = HailingShip: That's what you're gonna be, you bald-faced brigand!
#. DialogueAfter = HailingShip: My last words are "Hot Dogs are a sandwich."
#. EDID: [010388C7]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001D80"
msgid "Bald is right. I doubt they can even afford Enhance!'s prices."
msgstr "대머리 말이 맞아. 저들이 인핸스! 가격을 감당할 수나 있을지 모르겠네."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_KT02_SailingHighSeas
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE_KT02_100b_HailingAnswered
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = HailingShip
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFGenericFemale01
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0029BC7E
#. Prompt = [Lie] I'm not a pirate.
#. DialogueBefore = HailingShip: That's exactly what a pirate would say!
#. DialogueAfter = HailingShip: Is that right? Did you pay the 50k to hunt pirates?
#. EDID: [010388C3]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001D81"
msgid "Wait darling, they might be with the tour."
msgstr "잠깐만, 손님. 저 사람들 투어 일행일지도 몰라."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_KT02_SailingHighSeas
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE_KT02_100b_HailingAnswered
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = HailingShip
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 007568C3
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = HailingShip: All right you dastardly pirate scum, answer the hail! &&& HailingShip: &&& HailingShip: Thanks for answering, you filthy little pirate! &&& HailingShip: Any last words before we blow you to smithereens?
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: That's exactly what a pirate would say!
#. EDID: [010388D3]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001D82"
msgid "I'm not a pirate."
msgstr "난 해적이 아니야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_KT02_SailingHighSeas
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE_KT02_100b_HailingAnswered
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = HailingShip
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMGenericMale02
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 000C4353
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = HailingShip:
#. DialogueAfter = HailingShip: Any last words before we blow you to smithereens?
#. EDID: [010388B1]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001D83"
msgid "Thanks for answering, you filthy little pirate!"
msgstr "대답해 줘서 고맙다, 더러운 꼬마 해적아!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_Anchorpoint_RandConv03_RishiValeria
#. SceneName = SFFL_Anchorpoint_RandConv02_SceneCOPY0000
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Actor02
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRishiSaint
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 00A0435C
#. ScriptNotes = / to Actor01
#. DialogueBefore = Actor02: No, we should not.|Beverage sales are a staple of this operation. A pillar.|Dilute the drinks if you need to, but we won't be diluting our profits. &&& Actor01: And when someone draws a gun on me over it?|Because I promise you, someone will.
#. EDID: [01031726]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001D84"
msgid "Then you can be grateful I hired security."
msgstr "그럼 제가 경비대원을 고용한 걸 고맙게 여기시죠."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_Anchorpoint_RandConv03_RishiValeria
#. SceneName = SFFL_Anchorpoint_RandConv02_SceneCOPY0000
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Actor02
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRishiSaint
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 00A95526
#. ScriptNotes = / to Actor01
#. DialogueAfter = Actor01: We're running low again.
#. EDID: [01031728]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001D85"
msgid "You needed something?"
msgstr "뭐 필요한 게 있습니까?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_Anchorpoint_RandConv02_RishiKillian
#. SceneName = SFFL_Anchorpoint_RandConv02_Scene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Actor02
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRishiSaint
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 0045054E
#. ScriptNotes = / to Actor02
#. DialogueAfter = Actor01: You can't have it both ways.
#. EDID: [01031702]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001D86"
msgid "The last thing we need is to attract unwanted attention."
msgstr "불필요한 관심을 끄는 것만큼은 절대 피해야 합니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_Anchorpoint_RandConv02_RishiKillian
#. SceneName = SFFL_Anchorpoint_RandConv02_Scene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Actor02
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRishiSaint
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 0090189A
#. ScriptNotes = / to Actor02
#. EDID: [01031702]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001D87"
msgid "Above all, our customers value the privacy of this station."
msgstr "무엇보다도 우리 고객들은 이 우주정거장의 사생활 보호를 중요하게 생각합니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_Anchorpoint_RandConv02_RishiKillian
#. SceneName = SFFL_Anchorpoint_RandConv02_Scene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Actor02
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRishiSaint
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 0034A22C
#. ScriptNotes = / to Actor02
#. DialogueBefore = Actor02: Profits are down, Killian. I need you to do better. &&& Actor01: I don't control how much our patrons choose to spend on my goods.|If you listened to my suggestions, we could do better.
#. EDID: [01031702]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001D88"
msgid "As I've said before, I will never consider advertising to the public."
msgstr "전에도 말했지만, 대중한테 광고할 생각은 추호도 없습니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
