msgid "*Grunt*"
msgstr "*볼멘소리*"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE01
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE01_250_GrandmaTalk
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Grandma
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00C77C5D
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: My ship isn't much better. &&& Grandma: Interesting. Your body seems strong, full of vigor. You have no excuse to let your ship fall into such disrepair. &&& Grandma: How do you feel in your body? Do you feel alive?
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: No, no, not yet, not yet. Not before the meal.
#. EDID: [0102FCD2]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001D8B"
msgid "I think I should go..."
msgstr "저 가야 할 것 같아요..."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE01
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE01_250_GrandmaTalk
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Grandma
#. VoiceType = SFFL_SE01_NPCFGrandma
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00771C60
#. ScriptNotes = deadpan, almost ghostly / Neutral / to Player Default
#. Prompt = I'm not afraid of you. Are you afraid of me?
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: My kind? What do you mean by that?
#. DialogueAfter = Grandma: Nice to meet you.
#. EDID: [0102FCC3]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001D8C"
msgid "Your kind. Your ilk. Adventurers, voyagers, vagabonds, wanderers. Your kind... I have met a thousand of you."
msgstr ""
"너희 같은 부류. 너희 같은 족속. 모험가, 항해자, 방랑자, 떠돌이. 너희 같은 이들... 난 그런 자들을 천 명은 만나 봤단다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE01
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE01_250_GrandmaTalk
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Grandma
#. VoiceType = SFFL_SE01_NPCFGrandma
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0070654F
#. ScriptNotes = deadpan, almost ghostly / Neutral / to Player Default
#. Prompt = How is that possible?
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: How is that possible?
#. DialogueAfter = Grandma: My ship isn't much better.
#. EDID: [0102FCC5]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001D8D"
msgid "I made it possible. "
msgstr "내가 가능하게 만들었단다. "

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE01
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE01_250_GrandmaTalk
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Grandma
#. VoiceType = SFFL_SE01_NPCFGrandma
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00F77D0A
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Grandma: I would like to inhabit a body like yours. My current body... I can feel it deteriorating. I feel my skin about to split, my teeth about to burst. I can feel itching behind my eyes. |So itchy... but your body seems like it would not be.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: I'm not sure I'm hungry anymore.
#. EDID: [010300C8]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001D8E"
msgid "Now that I have gotten to know you better, I think it is time to eat."
msgstr "이제 너를 더 잘 알게 되었으니, 먹을 때가 된 것 같구나."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE01
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE01_250_GrandmaTalk
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0041C6DA
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Grandma: Hello.|I am glad you stopped by. I was beginning to think that you were... afraid.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Likewise. It feels good to have you here.
#. EDID: [0102FCB9]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001D8F"
msgid "Well, uh... it's nice to meet you."
msgstr "음, 어... 만나서 반가워요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE01
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE01_250_GrandmaTalkBranch
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Grandma
#. VoiceType = SFFL_SE01_NPCFGrandma
#. Face = Happy
#. SoundFileID = 00C229B8
#. ScriptNotes = Heavy, painful sounding breathing / Happy / to Player Default
#. Prompt = What are you doing?
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: What are you doing?
#. DialogueAfter = Grandma: Something isn't right with you.
#. EDID: [010300C9]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001D90"
msgid "*Heavy breathing*"
msgstr "*거친 숨소리*"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE01
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE01_255_DeclinedFood
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Grandma
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0000691D
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I didn't inconvenience you. You're the one that invited me over. &&& Grandma: You are making us very angry!|We invited you to eat, and yet you spurn us. You may as well spit in our face!
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Good. And you will eat every last bit, or you will make us angry again.
#. EDID: [0103073D]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001D91"
msgid "Fine, if it means that much to you. Just calm down."
msgstr "좋아요. 그게 그렇게 중요하다면 따르죠. 좀 진정하세요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE01
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE01_250_GrandmaTalk
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Grandma
#. VoiceType = SFFL_SE01_NPCFGrandma
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 007C865E
#. ScriptNotes = Deadpan / Neutral / to Player
#. DialogueBefore = Grandma: Nonsense, nonsense.
#. EDID: [0103073F]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001D92"
msgid "The food has been set out for you. Please, help yourself. "
msgstr "음식은 차려 두었단다. 마음껏 먹거라. "

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE01
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE01_255_DeclinedFood
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Grandma
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00D402F4
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I'm not eating that. &&& Grandma: What is the meaning of this? &&& Grandma: You inconvenience me by coming on my ship, and yet you decline my hospitality.
#. DialogueAfter = Grandma: You are making us very angry!
#. EDID: [01048D0D]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001D93"
msgid "I don't mean to offend you, I just don't want to eat that."
msgstr "기분 나쁘게 하려는 건 아니지만, 그냥 그건 먹고 싶지 않아요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE01
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE01_260_AteFood
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Grandma
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0096ABBA
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Grandma: Impossible. No one has reacted like that before.
#. DialogueAfter = Grandma: Stop talking to me. You are no longer welcome here, I want you out of my ship immediately.
#. EDID: [0104AB38]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001D94"
msgid "Something wasn't right about that food..."
msgstr "그 음식, 뭔가 이상해요..."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE01
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE01_DeclinedFoodTL
