#. ScriptNotes = Friendly. Saying goodbye to the player, who has just departed mid-conversation.
#. EDID: [0104EDEB]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001DE1"
msgid "Alrighty."
msgstr "좋아."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMCutty
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMCutty
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00DC0446
#. ScriptNotes = Friendly. Saying goodbye to the player, who has just departed mid-conversation.
#. EDID: [0104EDE7]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001DE2"
msgid "Good to see you."
msgstr "만나서 반가워."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMChanHuang
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMChanHuang
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 00C561B8
#. ScriptNotes = Saying goodbye to the player, who has just departed mid-conversation.
#. EDID: [0104EDDE]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001DE3"
msgid "That's all, then?"
msgstr "그게 다야?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_RishiGreet
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = RishiSaint
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00EEC29A
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: A man who remembers faces must have a reason for doing so. &&& RishiSaint: Commerce is my reason. |Making people feel welcome is the best way to get them to come back.|If it also encourages them to spend a few more credits, all the better.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Oh? Consider your offer accepted.
#. EDID: [0102A518]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001DE4"
msgid "I'll solve your Spacer problem, for a price."
msgstr "대가를 준다면 스페이서 문제를 해결해 드릴게요."

#. List: 2
#. EDID: [0102A52E]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001DE5"
msgid "A few years ago, I purchased it and had it towed out of its decaying orbit around Algorab II."
msgstr "몇 년 전, 저는 알고라브 II 주변의 추락 궤도에 있던 우주정거장을 사들여 자유 항로로 견인해 왔습니다."

#. List: 2
#. EDID: [0102A52E]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001DE6"
msgid "As a result, the station never realized its purpose and was eventually abandoned."
msgstr "그 결과 우주정거장은 본래 목적을 이루지 못했고, 결국 버려졌죠."

#. List: 2
#. EDID: [0102A52E]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001DE7"
msgid "Unfortunately, the advances she expected in grav jump technology never materialized."
msgstr "불행히도 르블랑이 기대했던 중력 도약 기술의 발전은 실현되지 않았습니다."

#. List: 2
#. EDID: [0102A52E]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001DE8"
msgid "She had hoped it would be a jumping-off point to remote systems not yet accessible by grav drive."
msgstr "르블랑은 이곳이 중력 구동기로 아직 접근할 수 없는 먼 항성계로 향하는 도약 지점이 될 거라 기대했습니다."

#. List: 2
#. EDID: [0102A52E]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001DE9"
msgid "The station was built over eighty years ago by a wealthy industrialist named Gabriela LeBlanc.."
msgstr "이 우주정거장은 80년도 더 전에 가브리엘라 르블랑이라는 부유한 기업가가 건설했습니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_RishiTL03_Background
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = RishiSaint
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRishiSaint
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 008B45E4
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. EDID: [0102A515]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001DEA"
msgid "You're standing in that project now. "
msgstr "지금 서계신 곳이 바로 그 프로젝트지요. "

#. List: 2
#. EDID: [0102A515]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001DEB"
msgid "Once I'd made enough to retire, I decided to find a project. Something to keep me busy,"
msgstr "은퇴할 만큼 충분히 벌고 나서, 저는 몰두할 프로젝트를 찾기로 했습니다. 소일거리 삼아 시간을 보낼 만한 일 말이죠."

#. List: 2
#. EDID: [0102A515]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001DEC"
msgid "I spent a few years with Ecliptic, managing their books. It was quite profitable."
msgstr "저는 몇 년 동안 이클립틱에서 재무를 관리했습니다. 꽤 수익이 좋았죠."

#. List: 2
#. EDID: [0102A515]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001DED"
msgid "Frankly, I found the work tedious, and decided to seek more adventurous employment."
msgstr "솔직히 그 일은 지루했습니다. 그래서 좀 더 모험적인 일을 찾아 나서기로 결심했죠."

#. List: 2
#. EDID: [0102A515]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001DEE"
msgid "I come from the corporate world, where I worked in finance."
msgstr "저는 기업계 출신입니다. 금융 쪽에서 일했죠."

#. List: 2
#. EDID: [0102A515]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001DEF"
msgid "Me? There's not really much to tell."
msgstr "저요? 딱히 할 이야기는 많지 않습니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_RishiGreet
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = RishiSaint
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00FF1F2B
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Don't you worry, I'll handle the Spacers. &&& RishiSaint: Really? |I believe in fair pay for a job well done.|Deal with these Spacers, and I'll provide the credits.|My head of security can point you in the right direction. &&& RishiSaint: A few words of advice.|We're happy to welcome all who pass through the airlock, but our hospitality has limits.|Acts of theft or violence will be met with a swift response.|We also value privacy and discretion here.|Our patrons expect to conduct whatever business they wish free from prying eyes and ears. &&& companion: Why do I find that vaguely suspicious?
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: I'm hardly asking for much. Just civil behavior.
#. EDID: [0102A524]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001DF0"
msgid "I guess that's reasonable."
msgstr "그 정도면 합리적이네요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_RishiGreet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMRishiSaint
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRishiSaint
#. Face = Friendly
#. SoundFileID = 002ADDCB
#. ScriptNotes = Pleased, getting what you want / Friendly / to Player Default
#. Prompt = I won't cause any trouble.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I won't cause any trouble.
#. DialogueAfter = RishiSaint: Unless you have any questions, I'll leave you to it.
#. EDID: [0102A53D]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001DF1"
msgid "Excellent. I hope this will be the first of many visits."
msgstr "훌륭하군요. 이제 많이 방문해 주셨으면 좋겠네요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_RishiGreet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = RishiSaint
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRishiSaint
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 00B6857A
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = You serve Spacers here?
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: You serve Spacers here?
#. DialogueAfter = RishiSaint: Don't you worry, I'll handle the Spacers.
#. EDID: [0102A526]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001DF2"
msgid "We serve everyone, provided they have credits."
msgstr "저희는 크레딧만 있다면 누구에게든 서비스를 제공합니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_RishiGreet
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = RishiSaint
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00D08E6D
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: What kind of an establishment is this, exactly? &&& RishiSaint: A place to rest, refuel and stock up on supplies while enjoying a little privacy.|Not everyone loves the bustle and noise of a large spaceport, after all.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: We serve everyone, provided they have credits.
#. EDID: [0102A522]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001DF3"
msgid "You serve Spacers here?"
msgstr "스페이서들도 손님으로 받는다고요?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_RishiGreet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMRishiSaint
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRishiSaint
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 00DDBD7E
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Don't you worry, I'll handle the Spacers.
#. DialogueAfter = RishiSaint: This place is pretty remote.
#. EDID: [0102A53F]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001DF4"
msgid "My head of security can point you in the right direction."
msgstr "제 경비 책임자가 지시 사항을 알려드릴 겁니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_RishiGreet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMRishiSaint
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRishiSaint
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 00D45619
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Don't you worry, I'll handle the Spacers.
#. EDID: [0102A53F]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001DF5"
msgid "Deal with these Spacers, and I'll provide the credits."
msgstr "스페이서들을 처리해 주십시오. 그러면 크레딧을 지급하겠습니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_RishiGreet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMRishiSaint
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRishiSaint
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 00721B60
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Don't you worry, I'll handle the Spacers.
#. EDID: [0102A53F]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001DF6"
msgid "I believe in fair pay for a job well done."
msgstr "제대로 끝낸 일에는 정당한 보수가 따라야 한다고 믿습니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_RishiGreet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMRishiSaint
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRishiSaint
#. Face = Impressed
#. SoundFileID = 004DDD50
#. ScriptNotes = Impressed / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Don't you worry, I'll handle the Spacers.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Don't you worry, I'll handle the Spacers.
#. EDID: [0102A53F]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001DF7"
msgid "Really? "
msgstr "정말입니다? "

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_MaddieTL01_Tiger
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00090FAA
#. ScriptNotes = / to MaddieWing
#. DialogueAfter = MaddieWing: Yep, my creation. My pet project, you could say.
#. EDID: [0102C00F]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001DF8"
msgid "This robot is yours?"
msgstr "이 로봇, 네 거야?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_RishiTL03_Background
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = RishiSaint
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRishiSaint
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 008B45E4
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. EDID: [0102C020]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001DF9"
msgid "You're standing in that project now."
msgstr "지금 서계신 곳이 바로 그 프로젝트지요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_RishiTL03_Background
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = RishiSaint
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRishiSaint
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 00206B19
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. EDID: [0102C020]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001DFA"
msgid "Once I'd made enough to retire, I decided to find a project. Something to keep me busy."
msgstr "은퇴할 만큼 충분히 벌고 나서, 저는 몰두할 프로젝트를 찾기로 했습니다. 소일거리 삼아 시간을 보낼 만한 일 말이죠."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_RishiTL03_Background
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = RishiSaint
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRishiSaint
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 00D015A0
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. EDID: [0102C020]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001DFB"
msgid "I spent a few years with Ecliptic, managing their books. It was quite profitable and rarely dull."
msgstr "저는 몇 년 동안 이클립틱에서 재무를 관리했습니다. 꽤 수익이 좋았고 지루한 일도 거의 없었죠."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_RishiTL03_Background
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = RishiSaint
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRishiSaint
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 002C4386
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. EDID: [0102C020]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001DFC"
msgid "I did well for myself, but started to find the work tedious, so I sought more stimulating employment."
msgstr "저는 업계에서 꽤 잘 나갔지만, 일이 지루해지기 시작했습니다. 그래서 좀 더 자극적인 일을 찾아 나서기로 했죠."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_RishiTL03_Background
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = RishiSaint
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRishiSaint
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 000529B1
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. EDID: [0102C020]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001DFD"
msgid "I worked in finance, climbing the corporate ladder at a few different companies."
msgstr "금융계에서 일하면서 여러 회사의 사다리를 타고 올라갔죠."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_RishiTL03_Background
