#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001DFE"
msgid "There's not really much to tell."
msgstr "딱히 할 이야기는 많지 않습니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_MaddieGreet
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = MaddieWing
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00F6BBB9
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I'll be careful. &&& MaddieWing: You better.|Got enough on my hands without having to clean up after fools who start poking and prodding things.|Had a trader in here last week who leaned on a pipe when the sealant was still drying.|Knocked the damn thing loose and sprayed hot water all over himself. &&& MaddieWing: Name's Maddie. I keep the place running.|Always had a knack for machines. Good thing, too.|If it wasn't for me, everyone would have been sucked out into space cause we lost a wall.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Some ignorant dusty got careless while he was docking.
#. EDID: [0102C01A]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001DFF"
msgid "You almost lost an entire wall?"
msgstr "벽 하나를 통째로 날려버릴 뻔했다고?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_MaddieGreet
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00E32AB9
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I'll be careful. &&& MaddieWing: You better.|Got enough on my hands without having to clean up after fools who start poking and prodding things.|Had a trader in here last week who leaned on a pipe when the sealant was still drying.|Knocked the damn thing loose and sprayed hot water all over himself. &&& MaddieWing: Name's Maddie. I keep the place running.|Always had a knack for machines. Good thing, too.|If it wasn't for me, everyone would have been sucked out into space cause we lost a wall.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Hell yeah they are.
#. EDID: [0102C00B]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001E00"
msgid "They're lucky to have you."
msgstr "여기 사람들한텐 네가 있어서 다행인 거네."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_RishiTL01_CommerceCOPY0000
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 008A107F
#. ScriptNotes = / to RishiSaint
#. DialogueAfter = RishiSaint: I won't deny it's a challenge.
#. EDID: [0102C01D]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001E01"
msgid "How do you stay in business with such a remote location?"
msgstr "이렇게 외진 곳에서 어떻게 계속 장사를 할 수 있는 거죠?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_ValeriaTL03_Background
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = ValeriaHahn
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFValeriaHahn
#. Face = Friendly
#. SoundFileID = 00DD2B9E
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Why did you leave your son behind?
#. DialogueAfter = ValeriaHahn: That's very generous.
#. EDID: [0103141B]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001E02"
msgid "Besides, my mom's pretty great. I know he's in good hands."
msgstr "게다가 우리 엄마는 정말 좋은 분이야. 그 애가 좋은 손에 있다는 걸 알아."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_ValeriaTL03_Background
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = ValeriaHahn
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFValeriaHahn
#. Face = Friendly
#. SoundFileID = 005EF714
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Why did you leave your son behind?
#. EDID: [0103141B]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001E03"
msgid "I miss him to death, but I have to think about what's best for him."
msgstr "그 애가 죽도록 그립지만, 그 애에게 무엇이 최선인지 생각해야 해."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_ValeriaTL03_Background
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = ValeriaHahn
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFValeriaHahn
#. Face = Friendly
#. SoundFileID = 002CF789
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Why did you leave your son behind?
#. EDID: [0103141B]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001E04"
msgid "I'm not saying Neon is a paradise, but at least there's room to run around and other kids to make friends with."
msgstr "네온이 낙원이라는 말은 아니지만, 적어도 뛰어놀 공간도 있고 친구가 될 다른 아이들도 있어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_ValeriaTL03_Background
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = ValeriaHahn
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFValeriaHahn
#. Face = Friendly
#. SoundFileID = 00950DFC
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Why did you leave your son behind?
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Why did you leave your son behind?
#. EDID: [0103141B]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001E05"
msgid "This is no place for a child."
msgstr "여긴 아이가 있을 곳이 아니야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_DarcyGreet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = DarcyWeber
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFDarcyWeber
#. Face = Nervous
#. SoundFileID = 00FAC48C
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = That's a very fatalistic outlook.
#. DialogueAfter = DarcyWeber: In any case, you made the perilous journey to our little speck of light in the abyss.
#. EDID: [0103140F]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001E06"
msgid "Good luck getting a decent night's sleep with that on your mind."
msgstr "그런 생각을 품고 제대로 잠들 수 있으면 행운이지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_DarcyGreet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = DarcyWeber
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFDarcyWeber
#. Face = Nervous
#. SoundFileID = 006AD085
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = That's a very fatalistic outlook.
#. EDID: [0103140F]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001E07"
msgid "All that stands between us and a horrifying death in the vacuum of space is a few metal walls."
msgstr "우리를 우주의 진공 속 끔찍한 죽음과 갈라놓는 건 금속 벽 몇 장뿐이야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_DarcyGreet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = DarcyWeber
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFDarcyWeber
#. Face = Nervous
#. SoundFileID = 0053F071
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = That's a very fatalistic outlook.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: That's a very fatalistic outlook.
#. EDID: [0103140F]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001E08"
msgid "Nothing I said is a lie. All those dangers are very, very real."
msgstr "틀린 말은 하나도 안 했어. 방금 말한 위험들은 전부 진짜, 진짜로 일어나는 일들이라고."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_ValeriaTL01_Vend
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00496F9B
#. ScriptNotes = / to ValeriaHahn
#. DialogueAfter = ValeriaHahn: Here you go.
#. EDID: [0103142C]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001E09"
msgid "Show me what's on the menu."
msgstr "메뉴를 보여 줘."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_ValeriaTL01_Vend
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00C4CED4
#. ScriptNotes = / to ValeriaHahn
#. DialogueAfter = ValeriaHahn: Here you go.
#. EDID: [0103142B]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001E0A"
msgid "I could use a drink."
msgstr "술 한잔이 필요해."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_ValeriaTL03_Background
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = ValeriaHahn
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFValeriaHahn
#. Face = Friendly
#. SoundFileID = 0028AB54
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: That's very generous.
#. EDID: [01031433]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001E0B"
msgid "When he learned about my son's illness, he said he'd pay the bills on the condition I work here."
msgstr "내 아들의 병을 알게 된 그는, 내가 여기서 일하는 조건으로 치료비를 내주겠다고 했어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_ValeriaTL03_Background
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = ValeriaHahn
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFValeriaHahn
#. Face = Friendly
#. SoundFileID = 007E9927
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. EDID: [01031433]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001E0C"
msgid "He tried to hire me for this place, but I said no. It was just so remote."
msgstr "그는 날 이곳에 고용하려 했지만, 난 거절했어. 너무 외졌거든."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_ValeriaTL03_Background
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = ValeriaHahn
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFValeriaHahn
#. Face = Friendly
#. SoundFileID = 001DFD23
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. EDID: [01031433]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001E0D"
msgid "I'd met Mister Saint while I was tending bar at the Astral Lounge."
msgstr "나는 아스트랄 라운지에서 바텐더로 일할 때 세인트 씨를 만났어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_ValeriaTL03_Background
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = ValeriaHahn
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFValeriaHahn
#. Face = Friendly
#. SoundFileID = 000BE1C3
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: What brought you all the way out here?
#. EDID: [01031433]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001E0E"
msgid "I have a son, Gabriel. He became very ill and I just couldn't afford the treatment."
msgstr "내겐 아들 가브리엘이 있어. 그 애가 많이 아팠는데, 나는 치료비를 감당할 수 없었어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_ValeriaTL02_News
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = ValeriaHahn
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFValeriaHahn
#. Face = Friendly
#. SoundFileID = 00EBF153
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. EDID: [01031428]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001E0F"
msgid "I brought it up with him, but he didn't want to talk about it."
msgstr "그에게 그 이야기를 꺼냈지만, 그는 말하고 싶어 하지 않았어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_ValeriaTL02_News
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = ValeriaHahn
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFValeriaHahn
#. Face = Friendly
#. SoundFileID = 00D4AA48
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. EDID: [01031428]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001E10"
msgid "Seems he used to be pretty well-known in New Atlantis."
msgstr "그는 예전에 뉴아틀란티스에서 꽤 유명했던 것 같아."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_ValeriaTL02_News
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = ValeriaHahn
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFValeriaHahn
#. Face = Friendly
#. SoundFileID = 00CF5616
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. EDID: [01031428]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001E11"
msgid "We had someone through here not long ago who recognized him."
msgstr "얼마 전 이곳을 지나가던 사람이 그를 알아봤어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_ValeriaTL02_News
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = ValeriaHahn
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFValeriaHahn
#. Face = Friendly
#. SoundFileID = 002A6E68
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Heard any interesting news lately?
#. EDID: [01031428]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001E12"
msgid "You meet Cutty yet? That's our doctor."
msgstr "커티는 만났어? 우리 의사야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_DarcyGreet
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = DarcyWeber
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00C43502
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Yep, happy to have made it here safely. &&& DarcyWeber: You should be! Every time you press that launch button it's a roll of the dice. &&& DarcyWeber: Think about it. There's pirates and Spacers out there who'd love nothing more than to blast you into atoms.|Not to mention micrometeorite storms, cosmic rays, and the icy vacuum of space itself.|You think your ship will protect you, but one loose bolt in your hull, one faulty circuit in life support...|That's all it takes.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Nothing I said is a lie. All those dangers are very, very real.
#. EDID: [0103140C]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001E13"
msgid "That's a very fatalistic outlook."
msgstr "꽤 결정론적인 시각이네."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_ValeriaTL03_Background
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = ValeriaHahn
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFValeriaHahn
#. Face = Friendly
#. SoundFileID = 00712FC2
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Such pathogens do exist, but it's unusual to see only one case in a city as populous as Neon.
#. DialogueAfter = ValeriaHahn: Now that I've told you my life's story, how about a drink?
#. EDID: [01031444]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001E14"
msgid "Anyway, it doesn't matter now."
msgstr "어쨌든 이제는 중요하지 않아."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_ValeriaTL03_Background
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = ValeriaHahn
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFValeriaHahn
#. Face = Friendly
#. SoundFileID = 00FB120A
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Such pathogens do exist, but it's unusual to see only one case in a city as populous as Neon.
#. EDID: [01031444]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001E15"
msgid "Probably came in on a cargo ship. I don't really know."
msgstr "아마 화물선으로 들어왔겠지. 정확히는 몰라."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_ValeriaTL03_Background
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = ValeriaHahn
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFValeriaHahn
#. Face = Friendly
#. SoundFileID = 0084966D
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Such pathogens do exist, but it's unusual to see only one case in a city as populous as Neon.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Such pathogens do exist, but it's unusual to see only one case in a city as populous as Neon.
#. EDID: [01031444]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001E16"
msgid "It's apparently a very rare virus. They don't even know how it got there."
msgstr "듣기로는 아주 희귀한 바이러스래. 어디서 왔는지도 모른대."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_DarcyTL03Leaving
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00A99244
#. ScriptNotes = / to DarcyWeber
#. DialogueAfter = DarcyWeber: Oh, sure! Once I've saved up enough money, I'm going to book passage on a ship.
#. EDID: [01031446]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001E17"
msgid "Do you ever think about leaving? Maybe starting over somewhere not in space?"
msgstr "여길 떠나고 싶다고 생각해 본 적 있어? 우주가 아닌 곳에서 새 출발하고 싶다 생각한 적은 없어?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_KillianTL01Vend
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = KillianBrice
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMKillianBrice
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00DED021
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I'd like to see your inventory.
#. EDID: [010316FC]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001E18"
msgid "Certainly."
msgstr "알겠어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_DarcyTL01Vend
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = DarcyWeber
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFDarcyWeber
#. Face = Nervous
#. SoundFileID = 0040A893
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I'd like to see what you have in stock.
#. EDID: [01031705]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001E19"
msgid "You've got it."
msgstr "알겠어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_CuttyTL02NeedDoctor
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00E8DAA9
#. ScriptNotes = / to Cutty
#. DialogueAfter = Cutty: You're either new around here, or just real lucky.
#. EDID: [01031FCA]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001E1A"
msgid "Does this place really need a doctor?"
msgstr "이곳에 의사가 필요하긴 한가요?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_MaddieTL04_Quest
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCFMaddieWing
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFMaddieWing
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0082C58B
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = And you need me to acquire some of these prototype robot parts.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: And you need me to acquire some of these prototype robot parts.
#. DialogueAfter = MaddieWing: How about I quit wasting both of our time, and just level with you?
#. EDID: [01037169]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001E1B"
msgid "Well ain't you smart?"
msgstr "똑똑하시네?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_MaddieTL04_Quest
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = MaddieWing
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00771044
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: A job? I'm listening. &&& MaddieWing: That's right.|Tiger here's in need of some upgrades.|Thing is, I don't have the parts.|Now, the parts I'm talking about ain't your standard items. |I want the cutting edge stuff. Prototypes. Parts that ain't even on the market yet.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: I've reached the limits of what I can do with off-the-shelf stuff.
#. EDID: [01037174]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001E1C"
msgid "Why does it have to be prototype parts?"
msgstr "왜 꼭 시제품 부품이어야 해?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_MaddieTL04_Quest
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = MaddieWing
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFMaddieWing
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0011C678
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = What kinds of modifications are we talking about?
#. DialogueAfter = MaddieWing: And you need me to acquire some of these prototype robot parts.
#. EDID: [01037172]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001E1D"
msgid "You get the drift."
msgstr "무슨 말인지 알겠지?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_MaddieTL04_Quest
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = MaddieWing
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFMaddieWing
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00E8C0BF
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = What kinds of modifications are we talking about?
#. EDID: [01037172]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001E1E"
msgid "Better servos to boost mobility, enhanced defensive capabilities, maybe some tool appendages to help with my work."
msgstr "기동성을 높일 더 나은 서보 장치, 강화된 방어 기능, 어쩌면 내 일을 도울 도구 부속품도 있겠지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_MaddieTL04_Quest
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = MaddieWing
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFMaddieWing
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 006698BA
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = What kinds of modifications are we talking about?
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: What kinds of modifications are we talking about?
#. EDID: [01037172]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001E1F"
msgid "Well that depends on the parts, of course, but I have a few ideas."
msgstr "물론 부품에 따라 다르겠지만, 몇 가지 계획이 있어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_MaddieTL04_Quest
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00A03361
#. ScriptNotes = / to MaddieWing
#. DialogueAfter = MaddieWing: That's right.
#. EDID: [01037167]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001E20"
msgid "A job? I'm listening."
msgstr "심부름? 들어나 볼까."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_CuttyTL03Quest
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Cutty
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMCutty
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00B389AC
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: I'll get your son back.
#. EDID: [01040486]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001E21"
msgid "I just don't know who to turn to."
msgstr "누구에게 도움을 청해야 할지 모르겠습니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_CuttyTL03Quest
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Cutty
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMCutty
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00102D79
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. EDID: [01040486]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001E22"
msgid "His co-pilot Lucia managed to escape from the Spacer hideout. She sent me a message begging for help."
msgstr ""
"아들놈의 부조종사로 같이 일했던 루시아란 여자가 가까스로 스페이서 은신처에서 탈출했습니다. 그리곤 제게 도와달라고 메시지를 보냈죠."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_CuttyTL03Quest
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Cutty
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMCutty
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 006A72E7
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. EDID: [01040486]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001E23"
msgid "He got ambushed by Spacers. They seized the ship and took him as a hostage."
msgstr "아들놈이 스페이서들의 매복에 당했습니다. 스페이서들이 우주선을 장악하고 아들을 인질로 삼았죠."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_CuttyTL03Quest
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Cutty
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMCutty
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00D43081
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Cutty: What are you, a psychiatrist?|*Sigh* Maybe... maybe you're right.
#. EDID: [01040486]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001E24"
msgid "It's my son Miles. He's a cargo pilot. Makes some dangerous runs."
msgstr "제 아들 마일즈 때문에 그렇습니다. 화물 조종사로 일하거든요. 다소 위험한 운송도 하곤 해서요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_KillianGreet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = KillianBrice
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMKillianBrice
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00749740
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = For work like that, the credits better be great.
#. DialogueAfter = KillianBrice: Occasionally, in dire circumstances, pilots have to jettison their illicit cargo.
#. EDID: [01047145]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001E25"
msgid "Now, let me explain the particulars."
msgstr "이제 세부 사항을 설명해 줄게."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_KillianGreet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = KillianBrice
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMKillianBrice
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0061A10B
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = For work like that, the credits better be great.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: For work like that, the credits better be great.
#. EDID: [01047145]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001E26"
msgid "I assure you, the reward is more than equal to the risk."
msgstr "위험부담에 걸맞게 충분히 보상을 챙겨줄 거라 장담하지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_KillianGreet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = KillianBrice
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMKillianBrice
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0080BE0B
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Other interested parties?
#. DialogueAfter = KillianBrice: Sounds simple enough. Sign me up.
#. EDID: [0104714D]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001E27"
msgid "Whoever does won't be eager to share their claim."
msgstr "누군진 모르지만, 자기 몫이라 여기는 걸 순순히 나눠주려고 하진 않을 거야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_KillianGreet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = KillianBrice
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMKillianBrice
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 009282C0
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Other interested parties?
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Other interested parties?
#. EDID: [0104714D]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001E28"
msgid "When word gets out that valuable cargo has been lost, one never knows who might come looking."
msgstr "귀중한 화물이 내던져졌다는 소문이 퍼지면, 누가 찾아올진 아무도 모르거든."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_KillianGreet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = KillianBrice
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMKillianBrice
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00BFBDEE
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: I'm <Alias=Player>. Good to meet you.
#. EDID: [01045E65]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001E29"
msgid "Killian Brice. I offer various items for a fair price."
msgstr "킬리언 브라이스다. 다양한 물품을 공정한 가격에 제공하고 있지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_KillianGreet
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = KillianBrice
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00ACEFAF
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I'm <Alias=Player>. Good to meet you. &&& KillianBrice: Likewise. And may I say, your timing is fortunate. &&& KillianBrice: I have a network of buyers interested in obtaining rare and dangerous chemical compounds.|Being controlled substances, a permit is required to transport the compounds.|Of course, for the resourceful ship's captain, there are always other options. &&& companion: By which he no doubt means a ship's captain willing to risk breaking the law.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: It's not what you think. Hear me out.
#. EDID: [0104714C]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001E2A"
msgid "Sorry, but I like to keep things nice and legal."
msgstr "미안하지만, 난 합법적으로 깔끔하게 지내는 게 좋거든."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_ValeriaTL03_Background
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = companion
#. VoiceType = NPCFAndreja
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0078E781
#. ScriptNotes = / to ValeriaHahn
#. DialogueAfter = ValeriaHahn: Now that I've told you my life's story, how about a drink?
#. EDID: [01052F31]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001E2B"
msgid "And yet, to force such a repayment on this woman is hardly what I would call humane."
msgstr "그렇다 해도 이 여성에게 그런 상환을 강요하는 건 결코 인간적이라고 부를 수 없겠군요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_ValeriaTL03_Background
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = companion
#. VoiceType = NPCFAndreja
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00A38874
#. ScriptNotes = Conflicted, mulling things over / to ValeriaHahn
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: That's very generous. &&& ValeriaHahn: It might seem that way, but he's making a tidy profit.|I had to agree to pay ten percent extra as interest.|What choice did I have?
#. EDID: [01052F31]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001E2C"
msgid "I'm sure it was no small expense to pay for the child's medical care."
msgstr "아이 치료비를 내는 데 적지 않은 비용이 들었을 게 분명합니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_RishiTL02_History
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMRishiSaint
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRishiSaint
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 00E480F3
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = You had it towed? That couldn't have been cheap.
#. EDID: [010516D9]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001E2D"
msgid "Some say retirement should be a time of ease and prosperity, but that always sounded dull to me."
msgstr "은퇴는 안락하고 풍요로운 시간이어야 한다고들 하지만, 제게는 늘 지루하게 들렸습니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_RishiTL02_History
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMRishiSaint
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRishiSaint
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 00828122
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = You had it towed? That couldn't have been cheap.
#. EDID: [010516D9]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001E2E"
msgid "There are days I wonder if I made the right choice."
msgstr "가끔은 제가 옳은 선택을 한 건지 의문이 듭니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_RishiTL02_History
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMRishiSaint
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRishiSaint
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 000A36FF
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = You had it towed? That couldn't have been cheap.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: You had it towed? That couldn't have been cheap.
#. EDID: [010516D9]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001E2F"
msgid "I called in a few favors to keep costs reasonable."
msgstr "비용을 적당한 선에서 맞추려고 인맥을 좀 동원했습니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_KillianTL02Job
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = KillianBrice
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMKillianBrice
#. Face = Somber
#. SoundFileID = 00DDF404
#. ScriptNotes = Resigned, somber / Somber / to companion
#. DialogueBefore = KillianBrice: Nobody else was. |I was grateful for the extended hand of friendship. &&& companion: Wait a minute. Aren't you the guy behind that big Vanguard embezzling scandal?
#. DialogueAfter = companion: Hey, no judgement here.
#. EDID: [01052F1D]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001E30"
msgid "*Sigh* Yes, that was me. I made mistakes, but I have paid my debt to society"
msgstr "*한숨* 그래, 그게 나였어. 실수를 했지만, 사회에 진 빚은 갚았다고."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_KillianTL02Job
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = companion
#. VoiceType = NPCMBarrett
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 009C9176
#. ScriptNotes = / to KillianBrice
#. DialogueAfter = KillianBrice: Now, how can I help you?
#. EDID: [01052F2E]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001E31"
msgid "You're making a fresh start, and I can understand that."
msgstr "새출발을 하려는 거군. 그 마음은 나도 이해해."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_KillianTL02Job
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = companion
#. VoiceType = NPCMBarrett
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 00E2E953
#. ScriptNotes = / to KillianBrice
#. DialogueBefore = companion: Wait a minute. Aren't you the guy behind that big Vanguard embezzling scandal? &&& KillianBrice: *Sigh* Yes, that was me. I made mistakes, but I have paid my debt to society
#. EDID: [01052F2E]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001E32"
msgid "Hey, no judgement here. "
msgstr "이봐, 여기서 판결을 내리려는 게 아냐. "

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_KillianGreet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = companion
#. VoiceType = NPCMBarrett
#. Face = Sarcastic
#. SoundFileID = 00DED3F9
#. ScriptNotes = Stretch out the "yeah" and emphasize "exactly" Barret is a former smuggler and he knows this setup well. / Sarcastic / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I'm <Alias=Player>. Good to meet you. &&& KillianBrice: Likewise. And may I say, your timing is fortunate. &&& KillianBrice: I have a network of buyers interested in obtaining rare and dangerous chemical compounds.|Being controlled substances, a permit is required to transport the compounds.|Of course, for the resourceful ship's captain, there are always other options.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: So you need a smuggler.
#. EDID: [01052F27]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001E33"
msgid "Yeah, as a former \"resourceful ship's captain,\" I know exactly where this is going."
msgstr "그래, 전직 \"수완 좋은 선장\"이라 그런지, 상황이 어떻게 돌아갈지 확실히 알겠군."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_RishiGreet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = companion
#. VoiceType = NPCMBarrett
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 00C6A5A1
#. ScriptNotes = A bit sarcastic / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Don't you worry, I'll handle the Spacers. &&& RishiSaint: Really? |I believe in fair pay for a job well done.|Deal with these Spacers, and I'll provide the credits.|My head of security can point you in the right direction. &&& RishiSaint: A few words of advice.|We're happy to welcome all who pass through the airlock, but our hospitality has limits.|Acts of theft or violence will be met with a swift response.|We also value privacy and discretion here.|Our patrons expect to conduct whatever business they wish free from prying eyes and ears.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: I won't cause any trouble.
#. EDID: [010516D5]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001E34"
msgid "Perfect place to conduct all kinds of shady business."
msgstr "온갖 수상한 거래를 하기엔 완벽한 장소겠지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_MaddieTL02_Background
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = MaddieWing
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFMaddieWing
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00E42D15
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. EDID: [01052F2D]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001E35"
msgid "Don't imagine I'll ever see my folks again, but hey, I've got a whole new family right here."
msgstr "두 번 다시 가족을 볼 수 있을 것 같진 않지만, 그래도 뭐, 여기 새 가족이 생겼으니까."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_MaddieTL02_Background
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = MaddieWing
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFMaddieWing
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 005128BA
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. EDID: [01052F2D]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001E36"
msgid "A few favors here, a few bribes there, and I was free."
msgstr "리시 씨가 여기저기 부탁 몇 번 해주고, 뇌물 몇 번 찔러 줬더니, 자유를 얻을 수 있었지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_MaddieTL02_Background
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = MaddieWing
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFMaddieWing
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 005E59FD
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. EDID: [01052F2D]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001E37"
msgid "I found my way here, and Rishi offered me a job in exchange for clearing my name."
msgstr "그러다 이곳까지 오게 됐고, 리시 씨가 기록에서 이름을 지워줄 테니 일 좀 해달라고 제안했어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_MaddieTL02_Background
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = MaddieWing
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFMaddieWing
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00712809
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = MaddieWing: I just said that I do. You don't need to pile on.
#. EDID: [01052F2D]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001E38"
msgid "Anyway, I busted myself out, stowed away aboard a courier ship and spent a few years on the lam."
msgstr "어쨌든, 난 도망쳤고, 배달선에 몰래 올라타 몇 년 동안 도망자로 살았어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_MaddieTL02_Background
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0072ADF9
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: You said Rishi helped you out. What happened? &&& MaddieWing: I grew up in HopeTown. Parents were engineers. They worked for the company, like everyone else.|As a kid, I was always tinkering. I started building robots out of dumpster parts.|Got to a point where I needed better parts, so I started stealing them from transport ships.|I got caught and the local Ranger locked me up. My parents lost their jobs.|Still feel guilty about that part.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: I just said that I do. You don't need to pile on.
#. EDID: [01052F2C]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001E39"
msgid "You should feel guilty."
msgstr "그랬으면 죄책감을 느껴야지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_DanicaTL02
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = DanicaVolkov
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFDanicaVolkov
#. Face = Friendly
#. SoundFileID = 003377E7
#. ScriptNotes = Enthusiastic / Friendly / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I'd like to view and modify my ships.
#. EDID: [01054A70]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001E3A"
msgid "You betcha."
msgstr "물론이지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_MaddieReofferZ02
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = MaddieWing
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFMaddieWing
#. Face = Irritated
#. SoundFileID = 00811C9B
#. ScriptNotes = Irritated / Irritated / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Got any leads on more of those prototype robot parts?
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: I'll get those parts for you.
#. EDID: [0105F4D1]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001E3B"
msgid "That's a big, fat no, and I ain't happy about it."
msgstr "전혀 없어. 기분 엄청 잡쳤네."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_MaddieReofferZ02
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = MaddieWing
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFMaddieWing
#. Face = Irritated
#. SoundFileID = 003F32F8
#. ScriptNotes = Mildly irritated / Irritated / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Got any leads on more of those prototype robot parts?
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: I'll get those parts for you.
#. EDID: [0105F4D0]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001E3C"
msgid "I wish! Darn things are getting to be scarce."
msgstr "그랬으면 좋겠네! 빌어먹을 정보가 점점 적게 들어오고 있어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_MaddieReofferZ02
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCFMaddieWing
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFMaddieWing
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 007C7E5C
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = I'll get those parts for you.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I'll get those parts for you.
#. EDID: [0105F4CB]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001E3D"
msgid "Well get to it, then!"
msgstr "그럼 어서 시작해!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_MaddieReofferZ02
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = MaddieWing
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFMaddieWing
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00BCB50F
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Refresh my memory. What is it you want me to do?
#. DialogueAfter = MaddieWing: I'll get those parts for you.
#. EDID: [0105F4C8]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001E3E"
msgid "If you blow up the ship and bring me damaged parts, I ain't paying as much,"
msgstr "우주선을 날려 버려놓고 손상된 부품을 가져오면, 그만큼은 많이 못 줘."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_MaddieReofferZ02
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = MaddieWing
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFMaddieWing
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0065FD5F
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Refresh my memory. What is it you want me to do?
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Refresh my memory. What is it you want me to do?
#. EDID: [0105F4C8]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001E3F"
msgid "You're going to get me some prototype robot parts from a cargo ship. They'll be in the captain's locker."
msgstr "화물선에서 로봇 부품 시제품을 가져와. 선장의 보관함에 있을 거야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_Killian_ReofferZ04
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = KillianBrice
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMKillianBrice
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0054743B
#. ScriptNotes = A little disappointed / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Do you have any more leads on lost shipments?
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: I'll get that shipment.
#. EDID: [01065752]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001E40"
msgid "I'm afraid not. Rest assured, I'll keep an ear to the ground."
msgstr "유감이지만, 없어. 안심해, 계속 귀를 열어 두겠어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_Killian_ReofferZ04
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMKillianBrice
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMKillianBrice
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 004DB181
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = I'll get that shipment.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I'll get that shipment.
#. EDID: [0106573C]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001E41"
msgid "Good. I'll be waiting here when you return."
msgstr "좋아. 돌아올 때 여기서 기다리고 있을게."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_CuttyMilesScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = CuttyClean
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMCutty
#. Face = Friendly
#. SoundFileID = 000B60B5
#. ScriptNotes = Warm / Friendly / to MilesCutler
#. DialogueBefore = CuttyClean: You always were the one to look for the silver lining.|Miles, there's so much I want to say. No, I need to say. &&& MilesCutler: One thing at a time. Let this be a first step. We'll get around to the rest.|In fact, if you don't mind, I'm going to go check out the bar.
#. EDID: [0106BBA6]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001E42"
msgid "Of course. Enjoy yourself. And... it was good to see you."
msgstr "물론이죠. 즐기세요. 그리고... 만나서 반가웠어요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_CuttyTL03Quest
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0024A5F6
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I'll get your son back. &&& Cutty: You would do that? Really?|Sorry if I seem a little in shock. Most people around here don't stick their neck out for others.|But thank you. Sincerely. &&& Cutty: There's one more thing.|My son and I had a falling out. We haven't spoken in years.|If you mention me, I'm not sure how he'll react. It might be better not to.|Anyway, just thought you should know.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: I appreciate that.
#. EDID: [0106611C]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001E43"
msgid "I understand."
msgstr "잘 알겠어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_CuttyTL04Clean
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = CuttyClean
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00D8EB18
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: You look different. &&& CuttyClean: A long-overdue change.|I let so many things go. Things I shouldn't have. I made a companion of misery.|Now it's time to turn the page, if I can. I have to try, right?
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: He sent me a letter, and then came to visit.
#. EDID: [0106BB82]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001E44"
msgid "How are things with you and Miles?"
msgstr "너와 마일즈 사이는 어때?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_CuttyTL04Clean
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = CuttyClean
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMCutty
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00295940
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = It won't be fast or easy. Be prepared for a challenge.
#. DialogueAfter = CuttyClean: I don't know what the future holds. I can only take things one day at a time, and try to be a better man.
#. EDID: [0106BBA7]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001E45"
msgid "Nobody can change overnight. Patience will be necessary."
msgstr "아무도 하룻밤 사이에 변할 수는 없어. 인내심이 필요할 거야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_CuttyTL04Clean
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = CuttyClean
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMCutty
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 000CF178
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = It won't be fast or easy. Be prepared for a challenge.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: It won't be fast or easy. Be prepared for a challenge.
#. EDID: [0106BBA7]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001E46"
msgid "I've tried to set small goals and reasonable expectations for myself."
msgstr "나 자신을 위해 작은 목표와 합리적인 기대치를 세워 보려고 했어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_CuttyTL04Clean
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMCutty
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMCutty
#. Face = Friendly
#. SoundFileID = 00AE745F
#. ScriptNotes = Warm / Friendly / to Player Default
#. Prompt = You can do this. I have faith in you.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: You can do this. I have faith in you.
#. DialogueAfter = CuttyClean: I don't know what the future holds. I can only take things one day at a time, and try to be a better man.
#. EDID: [0106BB7E]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001E47"
msgid "Thank you. Hopefully I can develop a little faith in myself, as well."
msgstr "고마워요. 저도 저 자신에 대한 믿음을 조금 키울 수 있으면 좋겠군요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_CuttyTL04Clean
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = CuttyClean
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMCutty
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00E04369
#. ScriptNotes = Hopeful / to Player Default
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: You can do this. I have faith in you.
#. EDID: [0106BB88]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001E48"
msgid "Now it's time to turn the page, if I can. I have to try, right?"
msgstr "이제 가능하다면 새 장을 넘길 때야. 시도는 해봐야겠지?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_CuttyTL04Clean
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = CuttyClean
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMCutty
#. Face = Somber
#. SoundFileID = 009E6FB5
#. ScriptNotes = A regretful admission / Somber / to Player Default
#. EDID: [0106BB88]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001E49"
msgid "I let so many things go. Things I shouldn't have. I made a companion of misery."
msgstr "난 너무 많은 걸 그냥 놓아버렸어. 그러면 안 되는 것들까지. 불행을 친구로 삼았지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_CuttyTL04Clean
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = CuttyClean
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMCutty
#. Face = Friendly
#. SoundFileID = 00B41DB2
#. ScriptNotes = Warm, friendly / Friendly / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: You look different.
#. EDID: [0106BB88]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001E4A"
msgid "A long-overdue change."
msgstr "너무 오래 미뤄온 변화야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_IntroSceneAlternate
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = ChanHuang
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMChanHuang
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 0031BE6F
#. ScriptNotes = Urgent / to RishiSaint
#. DialogueAfter = RishiSaint: And give up Anchorpoint? Hell no!
#. EDID: [0106C445]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001E4B"
msgid "We should evacuate. The Spacers could already be on their way."
msgstr "대피해야 합니다. 스페이서들이 이미 오고 있을 수도 있습니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMCutty
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMCutty
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00518EED
#. ScriptNotes = Grumpy. A doctor who feels like the patient is wasting their time.
#. EDID: [01053DEE]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001E4C"
msgid "Would you make up your mind, please?"
msgstr "제발 마음 좀 정해 줄래?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMCutty
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMCutty
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0091BEBB
#. ScriptNotes = A doctor treating a patient
#. EDID: [01053DD5]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001E4D"
msgid "I won't lie, this is going to hurt a little."
msgstr "거짓말은 안 할게. 조금 아플 거야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMCutty
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMCutty
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00F8DABA
#. ScriptNotes = A doctor treating a patient
#. EDID: [01053DD4]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001E4E"
msgid "This won't be pleasant."
msgstr "유쾌하진 않을 거야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMCutty
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMCutty
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00DDE7CC
#. ScriptNotes = A doctor examining a patient whose wounds are not serious
#. EDID: [01053DD1]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001E4F"
msgid "I'm not seeing anything too serious."
msgstr "그렇게 심각한 건 안 보이네."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMCutty
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMCutty
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0055927A
#. ScriptNotes = A doctor examining a patient whose wounds are not serious
#. EDID: [01053DCF]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001E50"
msgid "This is nothing."
msgstr "이건 아무것도 아니야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMCutty
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMCutty
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 003A5480
#. ScriptNotes = A doctor offering medical supplies to the player
#. EDID: [01053DE0]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001E51"
msgid "Just know I don't stock as much as some places."
msgstr "다른 곳만큼 많이 갖춰 두진 않는다는 건 알아 둬."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMCutty
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMCutty
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0000C4AF
#. ScriptNotes = Friendly, a doctor who has just finished patching up a patient.
#. EDID: [01053DEA]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001E52"
msgid "That's it. All finished."
msgstr "됐어. 전부 끝났어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMCutty
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMCutty
#. Face = Irritated
#. SoundFileID = 00340DAE
#. ScriptNotes = Gruff. A doctor who has just finished patching up a patient. / Irritated
#. EDID: [01053DE4]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001E53"
msgid "You're done."
msgstr "끝났어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_MiscDialogue
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCFGraceKim
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFGraceKim
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 0072F824
#. ScriptNotes = Serious
#. EDID: [010316A4]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001E54"
msgid "I don't know if we made the right vote, but the last thing I'm going to do is cast stones."
msgstr "투표 결과가 맞는지는 모르겠지만, 그렇다고 누굴 탓하진 않을 거예요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_MiscDialogue
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMIvicaVukovic
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMIvicaVukovic
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 008DCB88
#. ScriptNotes = Serious
#. EDID: [010647B4]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001E55"
msgid "I might need to go a few rounds with my punching bag after this."
msgstr "이거 끝나면 샌드백 좀 몇 대 세게 쳐야겠어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_MiscDialogue
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMIvicaVukovic
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMIvicaVukovic
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00471016
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral
#. EDID: [010316A7]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001E56"
msgid "The outpost can survive Hal's loss. So long as the people are willing to work."
msgstr "할이 없어도 이 전초기지는 버틸 수 있어. 사람들이 열심히 일하기만 한다면."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_MiscDialogue
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCFSashaAtwell
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFSashaAtwell
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00C17A1E
#. ScriptNotes = Serious
#. EDID: [010647CB]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001E57"
msgid "Back on the beat. The beat never sleeps."
msgstr "순찰 마저 하겠습니다. 순찰돌아야 할 곳은 잠들지 않으니 말입니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_MiscDialogue
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCFZenaHield
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFZenaHield
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 006369BA
#. ScriptNotes = Serious
#. EDID: [010647C3]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001E58"
msgid "I have to believe New Babylon can survive this."
msgstr "뉴바빌론이 이 일을 견뎌낼 수 있다고 믿어야 해."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_MiscDialogue
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMCaspianRoberson
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMCaspianRoberson
#. Face = Angry
#. SoundFileID = 0010F4EF
#. ScriptNotes = Angry
#. EDID: [010313DB]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001E59"
msgid "We made the right choice. Hal is innocent. Plain and simple."
msgstr "우린 옳은 선택을 했어. 할은 결백해. 명백하게."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_MiscDialogue
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMBernhardKleiber
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMBernhardKleiber
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00ACDB11
#. ScriptNotes = Serious
#. EDID: [0103CFCA]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001E5A"
msgid "Exile. I don't know if I agree with it, but if he dies cold and alone, maybe that is poetic justice."
msgstr "추방이라. 동의하는지는 모르겠지만, 그가 춥고 외롭게 죽는다면 어쩌면 그게 시적인 정의일지도 모르지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_MiscDialogue
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMCaspianRoberson
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMCaspianRoberson
#. Face = Irritated
#. SoundFileID = 0027A832
#. ScriptNotes = Irritated
#. EDID: [0103169E]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001E5B"
msgid "I can't believe we pushed out the only person who cared."
msgstr "우리가 유일하게 신경 써 주던 사람을 밀어냈다니 믿기지 않아."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_MiscDialogue
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMBernhardKleiber
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMBernhardKleiber
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00B4B3B9
#. ScriptNotes = Serious
#. EDID: [0103CFC8]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001E5C"
msgid "I've decided to stick around. I don't know if I can do any good, but the people here have welcomed my help."
msgstr "난 남기로 했어. 내가 무슨 도움이 될지는 모르겠지만, 이곳 사람들은 내 도움을 환영해 줬어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_MiscDialogue
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMYeats
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMYeats
#. Face = Somber
#. SoundFileID = 00A54F0B
#. ScriptNotes = Somber
#. EDID: [01031699]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001E5D"
msgid "For the sake of this outpost, I am grateful Hal has been exonerated."
msgstr "이 전초기지를 위해서라도, 할이 무죄로 밝혀진 건 고맙게 생각합니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMYeats
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMYeats
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0056045C
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral
#. EDID: [010313B3]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001E5E"
msgid "I worry about this outcome."
msgstr "이 결과가 걱정돼."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_b1000_IvicaGreet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Ivica
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMIvicaVukovic
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00E054BC
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = What's wrong with the mining machine?
#. DialogueAfter = Ivica: [Lie] I can do that. Just tell me how.
#. EDID: [01021668]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001E5F"
msgid "But Caruso keeps insisting the robot is better, and Zena won't overrule him."
msgstr "하지만 카루소는 계속 로봇이 더 낫다고 우기고, 제나는 그를 거스르지 않을 거야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_e2920_BernhardKilledZenaGreet
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Zena
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00802C72
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Bernhard, the refugee from Shinar, tried to kill Caruso. I stopped him. &&& Caspian: It's true. I checked his cell. Hal... Hal's dead.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Unbelievable. You think this is a joke?
#. EDID: [010388F3]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001E60"
msgid "My finger slipped."
msgstr "손가락이 미끄러졌어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c3100_Bernhard_Greet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMBernhardKleiber
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMBernhardKleiber
#. Face = Somber
#. SoundFileID = 007F7E98
#. ScriptNotes = Somber / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Based on what I saw, it would've been a fine outpost, had your luck been better.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Based on what I saw, it would've been a fine outpost, had your luck been better.
#. DialogueAfter = Bernhard: And to think, the one responsible for their deaths is still roaming free.
#. EDID: [0103D1D5]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001E61"
msgid "Yes. The conditions were rough, but together we had tamed its hazards. It saddens me to think of all the knowledge we lost."
msgstr "그래. 환경은 거칠었지만, 우리는 함께 그곳의 환경 위험을 길들였어. 우리가 잃은 모든 지식을 생각하면 마음이 아프군."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_d3100_CarusoZenaGreet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Zena
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFZenaHield
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00615D68
#. ScriptNotes = Serious
#. DialogueBefore = Zena: For my part, I'll try to get the word out about the trial and what it means for this Outpost, especially given recent events.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: I can do that.
#. EDID: [0103CFC0]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001E62"
msgid "Oh, and one other thing. If the vote ends up a tie, I'd like you to break it."
msgstr "아, 그리고 한 가지 더. 투표가 동률로 끝나면 네가 결정해 줬으면 해."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_d3100_CarusoZenaGreet
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00AA11EF
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: There is someone else who would be better than me. A survivor of the Shinar Outpost. &&& Zena: If such a person exists, then their testimony would be more than welcome. &&& Zena: For my part, I'll try to get the word out about the trial and what it means for this Outpost, especially given recent events. &&& Zena: Oh, and one other thing. If the vote ends up a tie, I'd like you to break it.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Thank you. Keep in mind, it's still a democratic process.
#. EDID: [0103CFC7]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001E63"
msgid "I can do that."
msgstr "그럴 수 있어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_d3100_CarusoZenaGreet
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Zena
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 009F4BBF
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: There is someone else who would be better than me. A survivor of the Shinar Outpost. &&& Zena: If such a person exists, then their testimony would be more than welcome. &&& Zena: For my part, I'll try to get the word out about the trial and what it means for this Outpost, especially given recent events. &&& Zena: Oh, and one other thing. If the vote ends up a tie, I'd like you to break it.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Because you're the most neutral party here. You've seen Shinar, but you've also seen what Hal's done for us here.
#. EDID: [0103CFC2]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001E64"
msgid "Why me?"
msgstr "왜 나지?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_140_Caruso_Greet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMHalCaruso
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMHalCaruso
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0055EFB8
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = I've seen you die before. But things may change this time.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I've seen you die before. But things may change this time.
#. DialogueAfter = Caruso: When I arrived here, I found a place in dire straits.
#. EDID: [0103F3BC]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001E65"
msgid "Then the future is not written."
msgstr "그렇다면 미래는 아직 쓰이지 않았군."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_e2910_ZenaVoteTallyTIE
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Zena
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFZenaHield
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 002465E4
#. ScriptNotes = Serious / to Player Default
#. Prompt = I'm not comfortable making this decision. You make it.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I'm not comfortable making this decision. You make it.
#. DialogueAfter = Zena: Citizens, if all the votes are in, I'll cast my vote and we'll begin the tally.
#. EDID: [0103E32C]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001E66"
msgid "Fine. If you won't break this impasse, I will."
msgstr "좋아. 네가 이 교착 상태를 깨지 않겠다면, 내가 깨겠어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_d3200_CarusoTL03
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Caruso
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMHalCaruso
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0040E2FB
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: We'll see how the vote goes down.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Yes. But I only have one vote. The others may feel differently.
#. EDID: [0103FAEE]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001E67"
msgid "Indeed. When we first met, you said my life was forfeit. Do you still think so?"
msgstr "그렇군. 우리가 처음 만났을 때, 넌 내 목숨은 몰수된 거라고 했지. 아직도 그렇게 생각하나?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_d3200_CarusoTL03
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Caruso
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0047C3A1
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: We'll see how the vote goes down. &&& Caruso: Indeed. When we first met, you said my life was forfeit. Do you still think so?
#. DialogueAfter = Caruso: I see. Then let the verdict be fair and just.
#. EDID: [0103FAEC]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001E68"
msgid "I don't know how I'm going to vote. I might even abstain."
msgstr "어떻게 투표할지 모르겠어. 기권할지도 몰라."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_d3200_CarusoTL02
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = companion
#. VoiceType = NPCMSamCoe
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 00857E7E
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: What's that prayer from? &&& Caruso: Perhaps your companion would prefer to elaborate.
#. DialogueAfter = Caruso: Very well.
#. EDID: [01051372]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001E69"
msgid "Sounds like a bunch of hooey to me, but what do I know."
msgstr "내겐 허튼소리처럼 들리지만, 내가 뭘 알겠어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_200_CarusoTL01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Caruso
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMHalCaruso
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00D2F51D
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral / to companion
#. DialogueBefore = Caruso: I've been trying to convince him to shift around the outpost's power distribution, with little luck.|Maybe you'll be able to sway him. &&& companion: Well I have been known to persuade a person or two with my otherworldly charm. It's one of my many super powers.
#. EDID: [01051375]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001E6A"
msgid "With Ivica, it'll definitely be a skill worth employing."
msgstr "이비차와 함께라면 분명 활용할 만한 기술이 될 거야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c3100_Bernhard_Greet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Bernhard
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMBernhardKleiber
#. Face = Confused
#. SoundFileID = 001AF451
#. ScriptNotes = Confused / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Gratitude is what I expect. Hunting him down wasn't easy.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Gratitude is what I expect. Hunting him down wasn't easy.
#. DialogueAfter = Bernhard: *Sigh* Either way, thank you, stranger. While I don't know if closure will ever come, it's good to know others will not befall the same fate.
#. EDID: [01052E9B]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001E6B"
msgid "Yes, and I am grateful. I just thought I would feel differently about this news."
msgstr "맞아, 그리고 고마워. 그냥 이 소식을 들으면 기분이 다를 줄 알았어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_200_CarusoTL01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = companion
#. VoiceType = NPCFAndreja
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00DD7056
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: If I had the materials I could craft one. &&& Caruso: I had a similar thought. The junkyard might have the parts, but the magnet is hooked up to the same power source. &&& Caruso: You'll need to talk to Ivica, the supply coordinator. &&& Caruso: I've been trying to convince him to shift around the outpost's power distribution, with little luck.|Maybe you'll be able to sway him.
#. DialogueAfter = Caruso: Ivica's a stubborn man. I'm not sure force is the right tactic. But I'll leave it to your judgment.
#. EDID: [01051377]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001E6C"
msgid "Then perhaps you aren't being forceful enough."
msgstr "그렇다면 아마 충분히 단호하지 못한 거겠지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c3100_Bernhard_Greet
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Bernhard
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00A1F0C9
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Based on what I saw, it would've been a fine outpost, had your luck been better. &&& Bernhard: Yes. The conditions were rough, but together we had tamed its hazards. It saddens me to think of all the knowledge we lost. &&& Bernhard: And to think, the one responsible for their deaths is still roaming free.
#. DialogueAfter = Bernhard: What? Really? Then he's finally dead? I... I don't know what to say.
#. EDID: [01052E96]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001E6D"
msgid "The one responsible has been terminated. You owe me one."
msgstr "책임자는 제거했다. 너는 나한테 빚졌어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c3100_Bernhard_Greet
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Bernhard
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00570420
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: You should know, I found and killed Caruso. &&& Bernhard: What? Really? Then he's finally dead? I... I don't know what to say. &&& Bernhard: It's strange. I've been waiting for so long to hear those words and yet...|I don't know how to feel about it.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Perhaps those feelings will come. Now I just feel... well, I don't know how I feel.
#. EDID: [01052E97]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001E6E"
msgid "Maybe relief to get some closure."
msgstr "어쩌면 매듭이 지어진 데서 오는 안도감일지도."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_d3200_CarusoTL07
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00528A85
#. DialogueAfter = Caruso: A fair question. I will say that everywhere I've been, I've been a prisoner.
#. EDID: [010590B5]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001E6F"
msgid "Why did you decide to help the folks here? How do I know you won't discard them like the others?"
msgstr "왜 여기 사람들을 돕기로 한 거지? 네가 다른 사람들처럼 이들도 버리지 않을 거라는 걸 어떻게 알지?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 002640E3
#. EDID: [01083D9A]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001EF6"
msgid "I read some insects eat their mates for sustenance. Something to think about if you find love."
msgstr "어떤 곤충은 영양분을 얻으려고 짝을 잡아먹는다고 읽었어. 사랑을 찾게 되면 생각해 볼 일이지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Disgust
#. SoundFileID = 0077A2C2
#. ScriptNotes = Disgust
#. EDID: [01083D95]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001EF7"
msgid "Just so you know, I don't like chewing noises. It's like a slap in the face."
msgstr "알아 둬. 난 씹는 소리를 싫어해. 뺨을 맞는 느낌이거든."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00CB33E6
#. ScriptNotes = Raining.
#. EDID: [01083D94]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001EF8"
msgid "Nice weather we're having."
msgstr "날씨 좋네."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00456AD0
#. EDID: [01083D8D]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001EF9"
msgid "What is even the point."
msgstr "대체 무슨 의미가 있는 거지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00CD451B
#. EDID: [01083D8C]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001EFA"
msgid "Mushrooms. Wherever we go, there's just never enough mushrooms."
msgstr "버섯. 어딜 가든 버섯은 늘 부족해."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 007B2DEA
#. EDID: [01083C21]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001EFB"
msgid "I need a beer."
msgstr "맥주가 필요해."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 009645C8
#. EDID: [01083C59]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001EFC"
msgid "That's a hit."
msgstr "명중이야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. SceneName = CREW_EliteCrew_Muria_MasterTopLevel
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 007035E1
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Do you mind if I ask you some personal questions? &&& Muria:
#. DialogueAfter = Muria: They're still in orbit. Going in circles, just like their logic.
#. EDID: [01083B87]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001EFD"
msgid "Earlier, you mentioned a ship full of dead cultists. What happened to them?"
msgstr "전에 광신도 시체로 가득 찬 우주선 얘기를 했었잖아. 그 사람들한테 무슨 일이 있었던 거야?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. SceneName = CREW_EliteCrew_Muria_MasterTopLevel
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Muria
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0051EA25
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Do you mind if I ask you some personal questions? &&& Muria:
#. EDID: [01083C33]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001EFE"
msgid "I don't have any more questions right now. "
msgstr "지금은 더 물어볼 게 없어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. SceneName = CREW_EliteCrew_Muria_TopLevel_FungiFacts
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 009D349D
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Do you have any fun facts about fungi?
#. DialogueAfter = Muria: Earlier, you mentioned a ship full of dead cultists. What happened to them?
#. EDID: [01083D55]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001EFF"
msgid "Did you know yeast is a type of fungus? Basically, no fungus, no beer."
msgstr "효모가 균류의 일종이라는 거 알았어? 기본적으로 균류가 없으면 맥주도 없어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. SceneName = CREW_EliteCrew_Muria_TopLevel_FungiFacts
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 001AEA91
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral
#. DialogueAfter = Muria: Earlier, you mentioned a ship full of dead cultists. What happened to them?
#. EDID: [01083D53]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001F00"
msgid "This is why mushrooms make for the best pets."
msgstr "그래서 버섯이 최고의 애완동물이 되는 거야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. SceneName = CREW_EliteCrew_Muria_TopLevel_FungiFacts
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00F133A4
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Do you have any fun facts about fungi?
#. EDID: [01083D53]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001F01"
msgid "Did you know fungi are closer to animals than plants? Genetically speaking."
msgstr "균류가 식물보다 동물에 더 가깝다는 거 알았어? 유전적으로 말이야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. SceneName = CREW_EliteCrew_Muria_TimeLocked
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0072EB7C
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Earlier, you mentioned a ship full of dead cultists. What happened to them? &&& Muria: They're still in orbit. Going in circles, just like their logic.|We can go visit them if you want. I have the coordinates, somewhere.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: It's not as cool as you think.
#. EDID: [01083C98]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001F02"
msgid "I would love to see a ship full of creepy cultists."
msgstr "소름 끼치는 광신도들로 가득한 우주선이라니, 진짜 볼만하겠는데."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. SceneName = CREW_EliteCrew_Muria_TimeLocked
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Muria
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00C96747
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Earlier, you mentioned a ship full of dead cultists. What happened to them? &&& Muria: They're still in orbit. Going in circles, just like their logic.|We can go visit them if you want. I have the coordinates, somewhere.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Well, there was a guy with a lisp, and this woman with really long fingernails.
#. EDID: [01083B62]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001F03"
msgid "Were any of these people your friends?"
msgstr "그 사람들 중에 네 친구는 없었어?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. SceneName = CREW_EliteCrew_Muria_TimeLocked
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00B7B250
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Were any of these people your friends?
#. DialogueAfter = Muria: I would love to see a ship full of creepy cultists.
#. EDID: [01083C45]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001F04"
msgid "I forget their names though. I'm what you call a bad friend."
msgstr "이름은 까먹었어요. 제가 생각해도 전 참 인성 터진 친구거든요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. SceneName = CREW_EliteCrew_Muria_TimeLocked
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00B817A9
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Were any of these people your friends?
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Were any of these people your friends?
#. EDID: [01083C45]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001F05"
msgid "Well, there was a guy with a lisp, and this woman with really long fingernails."
msgstr "뭐, 혀 짧은 소리를 내던 녀석이랑, 손톱이 진짜 엄청 길었던 여자는 있었죠."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. SceneName = CREW_EliteCrew_Muria_TimeLocked
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 003A9F33
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueAfter = Muria: Earlier, you mentioned a ship full of dead cultists. What happened to them?
#. EDID: [01083BF5]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001F06"
msgid "If only it were MY head. Well, a girl can dream."
msgstr "그게 내 머리였으면 딱인데 말이죠. 뭐, 소녀의 소소한 바람이랄까요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. SceneName = CREW_EliteCrew_Muria_TimeLocked
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Friendly
#. SoundFileID = 00697EAB
#. ScriptNotes = Friendly / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Muria: Of course I did.
#. EDID: [01083BF5]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001F07"
msgid "Fungus in space can survive extreme conditions. There's stories of blobs of mold on the Mir Space Station that could swallow a human head."
msgstr "곰팡이는 극한 환경에서도 생존할 수 있어요. 미르 우주정거장에는 사람 머리를 삼킬 수 있을 만큼 큰 곰팡이가 있었다고 하더군요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. SceneName = CREW_EliteCrew_Muria_TopLevel_Jobs
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 002D59E7
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = How did you get the job?
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: How did you get the job?
#. EDID: [01083B7E]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001F08"
msgid "Community service. A judge had charged me with two hundred hours for shoplifting."
msgstr "사회봉사 명령 때문에요. 좀도둑질했다고 판사가 200시간이나 때렸거든요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. SceneName = CREW_EliteCrew_Muria_TopLevels_Travel
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00EEAA4C
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Is there anywhere you want to visit? &&& Muria: You mean besides the cold, endless void?|I don't know. Maybe a black hole. Not the kind in space, just a big bottomless pit. It'd be fun to throw people into it.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Yeah, but I hear black holes rip you apart before you ever "fall" in. And space is so sterile. I want to hear the trail of screams.
#. EDID: [01083B74]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001F09"
msgid "A black hole is technically a bottomless pit, in space."
msgstr "블랙홀은 엄밀히 말하면 우주에 있는 바닥없는 큰 구덩이야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. SceneName = CREW_EliteCrew_Muria_Recruit
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00333DF6
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: How did your interview with Galbank go? &&& Muria: Not great. They said I lacked "pep."|I looked up the word. It sounds like an illness. I pray it's fatal.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: If only.
#. EDID: [01083C4B]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001F0A"
msgid "Yeah, if only. "
msgstr "그래, 그러면 좋겠네. "

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. SceneName = CREW_EliteCrew_Muria_Recruit
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Puzzled
#. SoundFileID = 00F31D87
#. ScriptNotes = Puzzled / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Sorry to hear that. It's hard to find work in this economy.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Sorry to hear that. It's hard to find work in this economy.
#. DialogueAfter = Muria: Well, now I need find work somewhere else. My landlord keeps asking for this thing called "rent."
#. EDID: [01083BA3]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001F0B"
msgid "Not if you're boring. Or a robot. Same thing, I guess."
msgstr "지루하게 잘 사는 사람이면 어렵지 않겠죠. 아니면 로봇이거나요. 제 눈엔 둘 다 똑같아 보이지만 말이죠."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. SceneName = CREW_EliteCrew_Muria_Recruit
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00056093
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Have you been looking for other jobs?
#. DialogueAfter = Muria: I've got a job on my crew if you want it.
#. EDID: [01083BE4]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001F0C"
msgid "There was this taxidermist job that looked promising, but it turns out it was for stuffing animals, not people. Joke's on me I guess."
msgstr "괜찮아 보이는 박제사 자리는 하나 있었거든요. 근데 알고 보니 사람 말고 동물 박제하는 일이더라고요. 헛물만 켰죠 뭐."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. SceneName = CREW_EliteCrew_Muria_Recruit
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00FDC86F
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Have you been looking for other jobs?
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Have you been looking for other jobs?
#. EDID: [01083BE4]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001F0D"
msgid "I have. But nothing sticks out. "
msgstr "알아보고는 있죠. 근데 딱히 눈에 들어오는 게 없네요. "

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. SceneName = CREW_EliteCrew_Muria_Recruit
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Muria
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00FB7EF4
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I'm an alien. Our cults do things differently where I'm from. &&& Muria: Rad. Not my vibe, though. &&& Muria: But yeah, I think I'm gonna need creds, up front. And a skull. Preferably with the brains still in it.|In exchange, I might show up to work two, maybe three times a week. Deal?
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Ha, good one. You're funny.
#. EDID: [01083B69]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001F0E"
msgid "Will you work for any less than that?"
msgstr "그거보다 더 적게 받고 일할 생각은 없어?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. SceneName = CREW_EliteCrew_Muria_Recruit
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00792730
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral / to Player Default
#. Prompt = You know, I think I'd rather keep traveling on my own.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: You know, I think I'd rather keep traveling on my own.
#. DialogueAfter = Muria: That sounds dismal. I'm on my way.
#. EDID: [01083BD4]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001F0F"
msgid "Don't have the creds, huh. It happens."
msgstr "크레딧이 없으신가 보네요. 뭐, 그럴 수 있죠."

#. List: 2
#. EDID: [01083BBB]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001F10"
msgid "I've been studying that relationship for years, and I want to preserve my findings for future scholars."
msgstr "그 관계를 수년간 연구해 왔고, 미래의 학자들을 위해 제 발견을 보존하고 싶어요."

#. List: 2
#. EDID: [01083BBB]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001F11"
msgid "It's going to be a philosophical text about my theories on the intersection between science and the divine. "
msgstr "과학과 신성의 교차점에 관한 제 이론을 다룬 철학 서적이 될 거예요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. SceneName = CREW_EliteCrew_Muria_Wait
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 003B9A93
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Wait here a moment.
#. EDID: [01083D37]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001F12"
msgid "Waiting and decaying."
msgstr "기다리고, 썩어 가고."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. SceneName = CREW_EliteCrew_Muria_RecruitRepeat
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00C4513D
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Let's get you assigned somewhere.
#. EDID: [01083D51]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001F13"
msgid "So more work. Yay."
msgstr "또 일이다. 야호."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. SceneName = CREW_EliteCrew_Muria_RecruitRepeat
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 0069BF98
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Let's get you assigned somewhere.
#. EDID: [01083D50]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001F14"
msgid "I hope this isn't one of those promotions without the pay."
msgstr "말만 거창하고 수당은 안 챙겨주는 건 아니겠죠."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. SceneName = CREW_EliteCrew_Muria_RecruitRepeat
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00B88DAF
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Let's get you assigned somewhere.
#. EDID: [01083D4F]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001F15"
msgid "As long as it's good and mindless."
msgstr "머리 쓸 필요 없는 단순한 일이라면요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. SceneName = CREW_EliteCrew_Muria_RecruitRepeat
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00C8EA18
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Let's get you assigned somewhere.
#. EDID: [01083D4E]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001F16"
msgid "Huh. I didn't realize it was a work day."
msgstr "허어. 오늘이 출근 날이었군요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. SceneName = CREW_EliteCrew_Muria_Pickup
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00A5E140
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I'd like you to follow me for a while.
#. EDID: [01083C95]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001F17"
msgid "As long as you walk real slow."
msgstr "대신 좀 천천히 걸어가요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. SceneName = CREW_EliteCrew_Muria_TopLevel_Finance
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Muria
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 006C4509
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Did you ever have any actual interest in the finance sector? &&& Muria: Yeah. To me, stuff like magic, science, it's all semantics. Fire is fire, energy is energy.|It's the same vibe with banking and the dark arts. Necromancy, demon pacts, predatory loans -- it's all po-tay-to, po-tah-to.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Yeah. It's not exactly apples to apples, but it does come from the same tree.
#. EDID: [01083B7D]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001F18"
msgid "I see what you mean."
msgstr "무슨 말인지 알겠어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. SceneName = CREW_EliteCrew_Muria_TopLevel_Past
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00F892A2
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Mind telling me more about your past? &&& Muria: I guess. I'm an only child. I like to think I was part of group, and I murdered all the other children in the womb.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: I know. It brings a tear to my eye just thinking about it.
#. EDID: [01083B96]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001F19"
msgid "That's a beautiful sentiment."
msgstr "그 감성 거 참 아름답네."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. SceneName = CREW_EliteCrew_Muria_Recruit
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00D365E2
#. DialogueBefore = Muria: That sounds dismal. I'm on my way.
#. DialogueAfter = Muria: Oh cool, you're leaving.
#. EDID: [01083BB5]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001F1A"
msgid "No place for me huh. Guess I'll go loiter around the bank some more."
msgstr "저한테 줄 자리는 없다 이거죠? 그럼 은행 주변이나 더 서성거려야겠네요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. SceneName = CREW_EliteCrew_Muria_TopLevel_Paint
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00C7463A
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Neat.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Neat.
#. EDID: [01083C3A]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001F1B"
msgid "Very."
msgstr "아주."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE02
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE02_100b_HailingAnswered
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = HailingShip
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMGenericMale03
#. Face = Spaceship / Afraid
#. SoundFileID = 001B9A6E
#. ScriptNotes = Afraid
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Don't do that. That's not going to fix anything!
#. EDID: [0106C4BD]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001F1F"
msgid "*Sob* I have to rip them right out of my skull. Kill them before they kill me. And I won't let them kill me! I won't! I won't!"
msgstr "*흐느낌* 내 두개골에서 그것들을 뜯어내야 해. 그것들이 날 죽이기 전에 죽여야 해. 난 그것들이 날 죽이게 두지 않을 거야! 절대! 절대!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE02
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE02_100b_HailingAnswered
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = HailingShip
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMGenericMale03
#. Face = Spaceship / Afraid
#. SoundFileID = 0025416E
#. ScriptNotes = Afraid
#. EDID: [0106C4BD]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001F20"
msgid "My eyes... they're, they're evil like the rest of them. They're keeping tabs on me, telling the others where I am... that has to be it. That has to be it, right?"
msgstr "내 눈... 내 눈도 나머지처럼 사악해. 날 감시하면서 다른 것들에게 내가 어디 있는지 알려 주고 있어... 분명 그럴 거야. 그런 거 맞지?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE02
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE02_100b_HailingAnswered
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = HailingShip
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMGenericMale03
#. Face = Spaceship / Afraid
#. SoundFileID = 00BFED55
#. ScriptNotes = Afraid
#. DialogueBefore = HailingShip: No, you're blind. I envy you, but you're blind. Blind to the danger around you, around everyone.
#. EDID: [0106C4BD]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001F21"
msgid "*Sob* I can't take it! I just... god damn it, I can't take it anymore! I need to make them stop, but how? So many eyes... always watching."
msgstr "*흐느낌* 못 견디겠어! 난 그냥... 빌어먹을, 더는 못 견디겠어! 멈추게 해야 하는데, 어떻게? 너무 많은 눈들이... 언제나 지켜보고 있어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE02
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE02_100b_HailingAnswered
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = HailingShip
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0022BD12
#. DialogueBefore = HailingShip: You aren't... one of them, are you? &&& HailingShip: &&& HailingShip: You... you... you aren't one of them, are you? One of the eyes...|Please god, please don't be one of them. Please...
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: I'm supposed to believe you?
#. EDID: [0106C4BE]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001F22"
msgid "I'm not one of them. At least, I don't think I am."
msgstr "난 그들 중 하나가 아니야. 적어도, 아니라고 생각해."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE02
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE02_100a_Hailing
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = HailingShip
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMGenericMale03
#. Face = Spaceship / Nervous
#. SoundFileID = 00F737B9
#. ScriptNotes = Nervous
#. DialogueBefore = HailingShip: You aren't... one of them, are you?
#. DialogueAfter = HailingShip: I can't take this anymore... *sob* can't take this anymore...
#. EDID: [0106C4DD]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001F23"
msgid "Please tell me you aren't one of them..."
msgstr "제발 네가 그들 중 하나가 아니라고 말해 줘..."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_Anchorpoint_AudioSlateQuest
#. SceneName = SFFL_Anchorpoint_AudioSlateQuest_EvanGabriellaScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = AUDIOONLY
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMEvanAlonso
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00747793
#. DialogueBefore = Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): I welcome it. Throughout our history, every visionary has had skeptics.|It's a simple truth that bold ideas elicit strong reactions.|I assure you, we're going into this with clear eyes and a great plan.
#. DialogueAfter = Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): I'm sorry, but I really don't have the time.
#. EDID: [0106C443]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001F24"
msgid "One more if I may..."
msgstr "괜찮다면 하나만 더..."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_Anchorpoint_AudioSlateQuest
#. SceneName = SFFL_Anchorpoint_AudioSlateQuest_EvanGabriellaScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = AUDIOONLY
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMEvanAlonso
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 006EC6EC
#. DialogueAfter = Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): Very well, but make it quick.
#. EDID: [0106C449]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001F25"
msgid "Excuse me, Ms. LeBlanc? Just a few quick questions for SSNN, if you could."
msgstr "실례합니다, 르블랑 씨? 괜찮으시다면 SSNN에서 몇 가지 짧은 질문만 드리겠습니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02_AudioLogs
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_OpalAudioLog
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = OpalWoods
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCOpalWoods
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0060A825
#. ScriptNotes = Venting, frustrated, and annoyed.
#. DialogueAfter = Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): All she does is stand in a corner like some sad, lost child. It's so annoying. I liked her better when she was sick. At least then she wasn't taking up space.
#. EDID: [0106D250]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001F26"
msgid "I don't get why Sadie has to bring her sister to everything she's invited to. Sure, help her socialize more, but she doesn't do or say anything at these parties."
msgstr "왜 새이디는 초대받는 곳마다 여동생을 데려와야 하는지 모르겠어. 그래, 더 어울리게 도와주는 건 좋지만, 그 애는 이런 파티에서 아무것도 하지도 말하지도 않잖아."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02_AudioLogs
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_OpalAudioLog
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = OpalWoods
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCOpalWoods
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 004A64D8
#. ScriptNotes = Venting to a slate. Frustrated and annoyed.
#. EDID: [0106D250]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001F27"
msgid "Man, I had to step out for a minute. I swear, if I don't talk about this, or get this out, or something, I'm gonna explode. I cannot keep this in if I'm gonna be drinking."
msgstr "야, 잠깐 밖에 나와야 했어. 맹세하는데, 이 얘기를 하든 털어놓든 뭐든 하지 않으면 터져 버릴 것 같아. 술 마시면서 이걸 속에 담아둘 수는 없어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_EC06
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE_EC06_50_Hailing
