#. ScriptNotes = Aggressive pirates grav jumping into the area to attach the player's ship in an ambush. / Defiant
#. EDID: [0106AD53]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001F2B"
msgid "Ha! You fell right into our trap!"
msgstr "하! 우리 함정에 제대로 걸려들었군!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_EC06
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE_EC06_100_HailAccepted
