#. SoundFileID = 00D4078A
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral
#. EDID: [0106A30C]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001F33"
msgid "HopeTech vessel to pilot. Please respond to this hail."
msgstr "호프테크 우주선이 조종사에게. 이 호출에 응답 바랍니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE04
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE04_100a_Hailing
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = HailingShip
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFGenericFemale04
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 001EA58A
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral
#. DialogueBefore = HailingShip: HopeTech vessel to pilot. Please respond to this hail.
#. DialogueAfter = HailingShip: Acknowledged. Stay safe out there.
#. EDID: [0106A317]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001F34"
msgid "Please acknowledge. "
msgstr "응답 바랍니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE03
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMGenericMale
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMGenericMale02
#. Face = Irritated
#. SoundFileID = 0056CBE0
#. ScriptNotes = Irritated
#. EDID: [0106D1B5]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001F35"
msgid "Are you trying to make me die of old age? Hurry up."
msgstr "날 늙어 죽게 만들 셈이야? 서둘러."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE03
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE03_100b_HailingAnswered
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = HailingShip
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMGenericMale02
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00C7449C
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral / to Player Default
#. Prompt = What are you talking about?
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: What are you talking about?
#. DialogueAfter = HailingShip: Well, before I agree to anything, I need more info.
#. EDID: [0106C4B6]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001F36"
msgid "I'll get to that in due time. I'd hate to spoil anything just yet."
msgstr "때가 되면 말해 줄게. 아직은 망치고 싶지 않거든."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE03
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE03_100b_HailingAnswered
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = HailingShip
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMGenericMale02
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0074CC4F
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral
#. DialogueBefore = HailingShip: Get over here! It's the end of the line!
#. DialogueAfter = HailingShip: Before we enter our grand finale, let me just remind you what you're playing for.
#. EDID: [0106C74F]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001F37"
msgid "Got to hand it to you, you're doing well. Two for two. Let's see if you can keep it up."
msgstr "인정해야겠군. 잘하고 있어. 두 번 중 두 번 성공이야. 계속할 수 있는지 보자."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE03
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE03_100b_HailingAnswered
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = HailingShip
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMGenericMale02
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00809703
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: A school bus.
#. EDID: [0106C74B]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001F38"
msgid "What goes to school but does not go to class?"
msgstr "학교에는 가지만 수업에는 들어가지 않는 건?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE03
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE03_100b_HailingAnswered
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = HailingShip
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMGenericMale02
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00BD46FF
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral
#. DialogueBefore = HailingShip: Time's up for this one.
#. EDID: [0106C74B]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001F39"
msgid "All right. On to the next riddle! "
msgstr "좋아. 다음 수수께끼로 넘어가자!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE03
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE03_100b_HailingAnswered
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = HailingShip
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMGenericMale02
#. Face = Spaceship / Serious
#. SoundFileID = 0029F52C
#. ScriptNotes = Serious / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Your dead body after I kill you.
#. DialogueAfter = HailingShip: Time's up for this one.
#. EDID: [0106C757]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001F3A"
msgid "You thought I was bluffing? You didn't want to take this seriously, did you? Well, your actions have consequences, friend."
msgstr "내가 허세 부린다고 생각했어? 이걸 진지하게 받아들이고 싶지 않았던 거지? 글쎄, 네 행동에는 결과가 따르는 법이야, 친구."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE03
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE03_100b_HailingAnswered
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = HailingShip
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMGenericMale02
#. Face = Spaceship / Smug
#. SoundFileID = 0072B670
#. ScriptNotes = Smug / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Your dead body after I kill you.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Your dead body after I kill you.
#. EDID: [0106C757]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001F3B"
msgid "Oh, that's funny, but I don't think the hostage that I'm about to kill will be laughing. "
msgstr "오, 재밌네. 하지만 내가 곧 죽일 인질은 웃지 못할 것 같은데."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE03
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE03_100b_HailingAnswered
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 001B207F
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: A school bus. &&& ... &&& HailingShip: Help me! Help me, please! He's gonna kill us- &&& HailingShip: All right, all right, enough! |Do you hear that? Do you hear how scared they are? How exciting is that?|All right, one more to go. The grand finale! You ready? &&& HailingShip: What's light as a feather, but even the strongest person can't hold it for long?
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Heh, I like that answer, but it doesn't quite fit.
#. EDID: [0106C7F4]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001F3C"
msgid "A grenade."
msgstr "수류탄."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_ActionFigures_SarahMorgan
#. SceneName = SFFL_ActionFigures_SarahMorganScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = SarahMorgan
#. VoiceType = NPCFSarahMorgan
#. Face = Nervous
#. SoundFileID = 008F2E43
#. ScriptNotes = Nervous / to Player Default
#. Prompt = I'd be looking for a lawyer.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I'd be looking for a lawyer.
#. DialogueAfter = SarahMorgan: Either way, as collectibles go, it's definitely a conversation piece, so feel free to hold on to it.
#. EDID: [01065C35]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001F3E"
msgid "I don't know if I have the mental energy to pursue such a case."
msgstr "그런 사건을 추적할 정신적 여력이 있는지 모르겠어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_ActionFigures_SarahMorgan
#. SceneName = SFFL_ActionFigures_SarahMorganScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = SarahMorgan
#. VoiceType = NPCFSarahMorgan
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 0070513F
#. DialogueBefore = SarahMorgan: Hero? Is that what they're calling me? I find that term almost offensive.
#. DialogueAfter = SarahMorgan: To see me in that uniform, memorialized in this way... I don't know how to feel.
#. EDID: [01065C37]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001F3F"
msgid "As you know, my time in the Navy was nothing short of traumatic. "
msgstr "알다시피, 해군에서 보낸 시간은 그야말로 트라우마였어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_EC02
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Voice
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC02_Dax_Voice
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00CE34BF
#. ScriptNotes = Dax acting tough while aboard the player's ship as they travel to Neon. / Serious
#. EDID: [0106ACA1]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001F40"
msgid "The less you know about me, the better."
msgstr "나에 대해 덜 알수록 좋아."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_EC02
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Voice
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC02_Dax_Voice
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 0057B87A
#. ScriptNotes = Dax acting tough while aboard the player's ship as they travel to Neon. / Confident
#. EDID: [0106ACA0]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001F41"
msgid "It's not that I don't trust you... but I don't trust you."
msgstr "널 못 믿는 건 아니야... 하지만 널 못 믿겠어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC02
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Voice
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC02_Dax_Voice
#. Face = Rage
#. SoundFileID = 00BFCE4C
#. ScriptNotes = Rage
#. EDID: [0106AD46]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001F47"
msgid "Take that!"
msgstr "받아라!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC02
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC02_Dax_SC_Hard03
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = DaxBurroughs
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC02_Dax_Voice
#. Face = Defiant
#. SoundFileID = 00D7B073
#. ScriptNotes = Confidently telling the player that they should be intimidated by them. / Defiant / to Player Default
#. EDID: [0106AC62]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001F48"
msgid "You should be impressed."
msgstr "감탄해야 할걸."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC02
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC02_Dax_SC_Intimidate
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0015EFE5
#. EDID: [0106AC5B]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001F49"
msgid "Do you really want to die here and now?"
msgstr "정말 여기서 지금 죽고 싶어?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC02
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC02_200_DaxIntro
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = DaxBurroughs
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC02_Dax_Voice
#. Face = Angry
#. SoundFileID = 00D0ADFA
#. ScriptNotes = Dax loses patience with the player's attempt at talking his way out of their confrontation, and attacks them. / Angry / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = DaxBurroughs: Not sure what there is to talk about here.
#. DialogueAfter = DaxBurroughs: I need to get to Neon as fast as possible without being seen. Think you can handle that?
#. EDID: [0106AC58]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001F4A"
msgid "Ugh! Enough already!"
msgstr "으! 이제 그만해!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC02
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC02_200_DaxIntro
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Voice
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC02_Dax_Voice
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 007BF51F
#. ScriptNotes = Dax not really interested in negotiating his announced hijacking of the player's ship. / Serious / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Let's talk this through.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Let's talk this through.
#. DialogueAfter = DaxBurroughs: All right, we'll do it your way then.
#. EDID: [0106AC43]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001F4B"
msgid "Not sure what there is to talk about here."
msgstr "여기서 무슨 얘기를 해야 할지 모르겠네."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC02
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC02_200_DaxIntro
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = DaxBurroughs
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 000E4678
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = DaxBurroughs: Move a muscle and I'll shoot. &&& DaxBurroughs: No one needs to get hurt. I just need your ship.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: What I need is your ship. So give it to me.
#. EDID: [0106AC3B]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001F4C"
msgid "I can give you a ride if you need one."
msgstr "필요하면 태워 줄 수 있어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC02
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC02_200_DaxIntro
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = DaxBurroughs
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC02_Dax_Voice
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00EBB7F3
#. ScriptNotes = Indicating that there's a way out for the player: just give up your ship. / Serious / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = DaxBurroughs: Move a muscle and I'll shoot.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Let's talk this through.
#. EDID: [0106AC52]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001F4D"
msgid "No one needs to get hurt. I just need your ship."
msgstr "아무도 다칠 필요 없어. 네 우주선만 있으면 돼."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC02
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC02_300_DaxLowersWeapon
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = DaxBurroughs
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 009FA3B6
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Let's talk this through. &&& ... &&& DaxBurroughs: All right, we'll do it your way then. &&& DaxBurroughs: I need to get to Neon as fast as possible without being seen. Think you can handle that? &&& DaxBurroughs: I took the fall for someone else after a bank robbery went wrong. I ended up inside for a while.|One day there was an opportunity to get out, and I took it. Then I took this piece of crap ship.|Then I had a grav jump failure, ended up with just enough power for life support, then you showed up.|Is that enough for you? Can we go now?
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Aw, stop, you're going to make me cry.
#. EDID: [0106AC9E]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001F4E"
msgid "No one's even trying to rescue you?"
msgstr "아무도 널 구하려고 하지 않는 거야?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC02
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC02_300_DaxLowersWeapon
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = DaxBurroughs
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC02_Dax_Voice
#. Face = Irritated
#. SoundFileID = 00193C81
#. ScriptNotes = Intimidated by the player (how the tables have turned!), Dax accepts to give them some money up front. / Irritated / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Pay me now or die here. It's your choice.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Pay me now or die here. It's your choice.
#. DialogueAfter = DaxBurroughs: Sure. I'll just say you're my brother-in-law.
#. EDID: [0106AD47]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001F4F"
msgid "All right, calm down. I'll transfer you some now, and my boss will take care of the rest later."
msgstr "좋아, 진정해. 지금 일부를 송금하고, 나머지는 나중에 내 상사가 처리할 거야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC02
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC02_300_DaxLowersWeapon
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 003DFFF7
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Let's talk this through. &&& ... &&& DaxBurroughs: All right, we'll do it your way then. &&& DaxBurroughs: I need to get to Neon as fast as possible without being seen. Think you can handle that? &&& DaxBurroughs: I took the fall for someone else after a bank robbery went wrong. I ended up inside for a while.|One day there was an opportunity to get out, and I took it. Then I took this piece of crap ship.|Then I had a grav jump failure, ended up with just enough power for life support, then you showed up.|Is that enough for you? Can we go now?
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Heh, why not. Let's go then.
#. EDID: [0106AC99]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001F50"
msgid "Sure. I'll just say you're my brother-in-law."
msgstr "물론이지. 그냥 네가 내 처남이라고 말할게."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_EC07_MiscDialogue
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Voice
#. VoiceType = SFFL_SE_EC07_Hannah_Voice
#. Face = Happy
#. SoundFileID = 007A52ED
#. ScriptNotes = Sincerely grateful to the player for rescuing her. / Happy
#. EDID: [0106481F]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001F51"
msgid "Oh, hi! So good to see you!"
msgstr "아, 안녕! 만나서 정말 반가워!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC07
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Voice
#. VoiceType = SFFL_SE_EC07_Ruby_Voice
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00D05296
#. ScriptNotes = Sounding slightly concerned. / Neutral
#. EDID: [0106A4E3]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001F52"
msgid "Let's hurry before more pirates arrive."
msgstr "해적들이 더 오기 전에 서두르자."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC07
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC07_210_RubyOnly
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = RubyKrause
#. VoiceType = SFFL_SE_EC07_Ruby_Voice
#. Face = Amused
#. SoundFileID = 00C65F55
#. ScriptNotes = A bit mocking in tone (but not too much), since the player said they needed to "think about" rescuing them. / Amused / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = RubyKrause: On behalf of the GalBank consortium, thank you for coming to our assistance.|We are in need of a temporary transportation service, as it were.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: All right, let's go.
#. EDID: [01065FAB]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001F53"
msgid "Are you done thinking now?"
msgstr "이제 생각 끝났어?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC07
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC07_200_HannahRubyDialogue
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = RubyKrause
#. VoiceType = SFFL_SE_EC07_Ruby_Voice
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 00E642A2
#. ScriptNotes = Ruby takes control of the situation, seeming a bit aloof. / Confident / to HannahFrye
#. DialogueBefore = HannahFrye: &&& HannahFrye: Great, you found a way to open that door!|I have to say, I was starting to worry we'd never get out of this ship!
#. DialogueAfter = RubyKrause: On behalf of the GalBank consortium, thank you for coming to our assistance.
#. EDID: [01065FA3]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001F54"
msgid "Thank you, Hannah, I'll handle it from here."
msgstr "고마워요, 한나. 여기서부터는 제가 맡겠습니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC07
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC07_220_Hannah
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = HannahFrye
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00515F30
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = HannahFrye: I'm sorry, I'm not normally this emotional, um...It's been a rough day.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: What? Oh no, that's fine, don't worry about it. She'll send for me. I'll be fine.
#. EDID: [01068038]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001F55"
msgid "Does she always treat you like this?"
msgstr "그 여자는 항상 너를 이렇게 대하니?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC07
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC07_210_RubyOnly
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00DA32FB
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = HannahFrye: &&& ... &&& RubyKrause: Thank you, Hannah, I'll handle it from here. &&& RubyKrause: On behalf of the GalBank consortium, thank you for coming to our assistance.|We are in need of a temporary transportation service, as it were. &&& RubyKrause: Are you done thinking now?
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: I'm right behind you.
#. EDID: [0106802F]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001F56"
msgid "All right, let's go."
msgstr "좋아, 가자."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC07
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC07_220_Hannah
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = HannahFrye
#. VoiceType = SFFL_SE_EC07_Hannah_Voice
#. Face = Nervous
#. SoundFileID = 008EFB9D
#. ScriptNotes = Trying to keep a brave face, but scared to be left alone in the minefield. / Nervous / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Are you sure you're okay staying here?
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Are you sure you're okay staying here?
#. DialogueAfter = HannahFrye: I'm not leaving you behind.
#. EDID: [01068031]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001F57"
msgid "Uh, yeah...I'll be all right. As long as I don't drift into the mines, I guess."
msgstr "어, 그래... 난 괜찮을 거야. 기뢰 쪽으로 표류하지만 않으면 말이지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC07
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC07_220_Hannah
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = HannahFrye
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0034CCB5
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = HannahFrye: I'm sorry, I'm not normally this emotional, um...It's been a rough day.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: You will? Oh, thank you so much!
#. EDID: [01068027]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001F58"
msgid "I'm taking you to New Atlantis as well."
msgstr "나도 당신을 뉴아틀란티스로 데려갈게요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC07
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC07_220_Hannah
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = HannahFrye
#. VoiceType = SFFL_SE_EC07_Hannah_Voice
#. Face = Sad
#. SoundFileID = 00EFE68E
#. ScriptNotes = Hannah apologizing for being treated like dirt by her boss. / Sad / to Player Default
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: I'm not leaving you behind.
#. EDID: [0106803A]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001F59"
msgid "I'm sorry, I'm not normally this emotional, um...It's been a rough day."
msgstr "미안해요. 평소엔 이렇게 감정적이지 않은데, 음... 힘든 하루였어요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC07
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC07_220_Hannah
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Voice
#. VoiceType = SFFL_SE_EC07_Hannah_Voice
#. Face = Sad
#. SoundFileID = 00330B54
#. ScriptNotes = Dismissive - after all, if Miss Krause said so, then that's the truth. / Sad / to Player Default
#. Prompt = I'm not leaving you behind.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I'm not leaving you behind.
#. EDID: [01069D95]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001F5A"
msgid "Oh, I don't think Miss Krause is on board with that."
msgstr "아, 크라우스 양은 그 일에 찬성하지 않을 것 같은데요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC07
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC07_220_Hannah
