#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Oh, I don't think Miss Krause is on board with that.
#. EDID: [01069D94]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001F5B"
msgid "I'm not leaving you behind."
msgstr "당신을 두고 가지 않을 거예요."

#. List: 2
