msgid "So what's on your agenda tonight?"
msgstr "그래서 오늘 밤 일정은 뭐야?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03_RC_RomanYuraTogether01
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_RC_RomanYuraTogether01Scene
