#. Face = Happy
#. SoundFileID = 008A7216
#. ScriptNotes = Happy / to Roman
#. DialogueBefore = Roman:
#. EDID: [0105CEBC]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001F5F"
msgid "Something that involves food. And you of course."
msgstr "음식이 포함된 거. 그리고 당연히 너도."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03_RC_AtkaYura02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_RC_AtkaYura02Scene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Atka
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFAtka
#. Face = Concerned
#. SoundFileID = 00C74A1D
#. ScriptNotes = Concerned / to Yura
#. DialogueBefore = Atka: Are you serious? Didn't I just give you some? &&& Yura: It's not like I don't have my own expenses.
#. DialogueAfter = Yura: Is that like a yes? Because I couldn't tell.
#. EDID: [0105CEC6]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001F60"
msgid "Maybe if you don't have any money, you shouldn't have so many expenses."
msgstr "돈이 없다면 그렇게 지출을 많이 하지 말아야 하는 거 아닐까."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_EC07
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = SarahMorgan
#. VoiceType = NPCFSarahMorgan
#. Face = Thinking
#. SoundFileID = 002731B3
#. ScriptNotes = Sarah wonders out loud as they explore a spaceship littered with the body of pirates and GalBank crew members. / Thinking
#. EDID: [0106C8D9]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001F61"
msgid "I wonder what that GalBank ship was doing in the middle of nowhere."
msgstr "그 갤뱅크 우주선이 아무것도 없는 한복판에서 뭘 하고 있었는지 궁금하네."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_EC07
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = SamCoe
#. VoiceType = NPCMSamCoe
#. Face = Sarcastic
#. SoundFileID = 00429CC9
#. ScriptNotes = Sam is being sarcastic after hearing Hannah repeatedly mention the VP of Acquisitions on the radio. / Sarcastic
#. EDID: [0106C8D4]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001F62"
msgid "Well I don't know about you, but I can't *wait* to meet the VP of Acquisitions for the GalBank consortium."
msgstr "너는 어떨지 몰라도, 난 갤뱅크 차관단의 인수 담당 부사장을 만나는 게 정말 *기대돼*."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_EC07
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE_EC07_100_HailRefused
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = GalBankShip
#. VoiceType = SFFL_SE_EC07_Hannah_Voice
#. Face = Spaceship / Afraid
#. SoundFileID = 006842FC
#. ScriptNotes = On the radio, Hannah sends out one last plea for help, hoping the player will respond to the call. / Afraid
#. DialogueBefore = GalBankShip:
#. EDID: [0105F652]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001F63"
msgid "Please don't leave us stranded here! Another pirate ship could arrive at any moment!"
msgstr "제발 여기서 조난당하게 놔두지 마세요! 해적선이 언제든 또 올 수 있어요!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_EC07
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE_EC07_80_Hailing
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = GalBankShip
#. VoiceType = SFFL_SE_EC07_Hannah_Voice
#. Face = Spaceship / Pleading
#. SoundFileID = 0037E038
#. ScriptNotes = Hannah is sending out a radio distress call, hoping that someone will come to their help. / Pleading
#. DialogueBefore = GalBankShip: Whoa! Did you see that? The pirate ship blew up on a space mine!|Uh... Mayday! Mayday!
#. DialogueAfter = GalBankShip: Thank you for responding! We really need your help!
#. EDID: [0105F657]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001F64"
msgid "This is a GalBank ship, please provide assistance!"
msgstr "여기는 갤뱅크 우주선입니다. 지원을 제공해 주십시오!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_EC07
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE_EC07_100_HailAccepted
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = GalBankShip
