#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 003A5034
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = GalBankShip: Whoa! Did you see that? The pirate ship blew up on a space mine!|Uh... Mayday! Mayday! &&& GalBankShip: &&& GalBankShip: Thank you for responding! We really need your help!|I mean...the VP of Acquisitions for the GalBank consortium needs your help.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Ha! No, that would be Miss Krause. I'm just her assistant, Hannah.
#. EDID: [0106439A]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001F65"
msgid "VP of Acquisitions? Is that you?"
msgstr "인수 담당 부사장? 그게 당신인가요?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_EC07
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE_EC07_100_HailAccepted
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = GalBankShip
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00CC89A4
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = GalBankShip: Whoa! Did you see that? The pirate ship blew up on a space mine!|Uh... Mayday! Mayday! &&& GalBankShip: &&& GalBankShip: Thank you for responding! We really need your help!|I mean...the VP of Acquisitions for the GalBank consortium needs your help.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: If you could take the VP of Acquisitions to a safe location that would be great!
#. EDID: [01064398]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001F66"
msgid "What can I do for you?"
msgstr "무엇을 도와드릴까요?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_EC07
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE_EC07_660_Ruby
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = RubyKrause
#. VoiceType = SFFL_SE_EC07_Ruby_Voice
#. Face = Confused
#. SoundFileID = 008CDF57
#. ScriptNotes = Ruby is a bit surprised that the player would be rude to her. A bit insulted, too, but keeps it cool. / Confused / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Not if I can help it.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Not if I can help it.
#. DialogueAfter = RubyKrause: Come on Hannah, let's go.
#. EDID: [0106A4D8]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001F67"
msgid "Um, all right then. Safe travels."
msgstr "음, 그럼 알겠습니다. 안전하게 여행하세요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_EC07
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE_EC07_52_PirateWarning
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = PirateShip01
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMGenericMale01
#. Face = Spaceship / Defiant
#. SoundFileID = 00C996D1
#. ScriptNotes = Pirate ship warning the player not to interfere as they attack the ship of the VP of GalBank. / Defiant
#. DialogueBefore = GalBankShip: Mayday! Mayday! We are being attacked by pirates! They want to kidnap us!|What? Oh, right... They want to kidnap the VP of Acquisitions for GalBank.
#. DialogueAfter = ActiveCompanion: Look, that pirate ship is aiming straight for them!
#. EDID: [0105F64C]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001F68"
msgid "Stay out of this, Spacer! This does not concern you!"
msgstr "이 일에 끼어들지 마, 스페이서! 이건 네 일이 아니야!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_Anchorpoint_RandConv10_ChanValeria_Z01
#. SceneName = SFFL_Anchorpint_RandConv10_ChanValeria_Z01_Scene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Actor01
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFValeriaHahn
#. Face = Friendly
#. SoundFileID = 00004AD9
#. ScriptNotes = / to Actor02
#. DialogueAfter = Actor02: Believe me, I know.
#. EDID: [01059DBC]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001F69"
msgid "We need more security."
msgstr "경비가 더 필요해."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_Anchorpoint_RandConv10_ChanValeria_Z01
#. SceneName = SFFL_Anchorpint_RandConv10_ChanValeria_Z01_Scene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Actor01
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFValeriaHahn
#. Face = Friendly
#. SoundFileID = 003C82F2
#. ScriptNotes = / to Actor02
#. EDID: [01059DBC]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001F6A"
msgid "We can't expect our customers to handle it every time."
msgstr "매번 고객들이 처리해 주길 기대할 수는 없어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_Anchorpoint_RandConv10_ChanValeria_Z01
#. SceneName = SFFL_Anchorpint_RandConv10_ChanValeria_Z01_Scene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Actor01
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFValeriaHahn
#. Face = Concerned
#. SoundFileID = 00344AB0
#. ScriptNotes = Concerned / Concerned / to Actor02
#. EDID: [01059DBC]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001F6B"
msgid "There's going to be trouble again someday. There always is."
msgstr "언젠가는 또 문제가 생길 거야. 늘 그렇지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_Anchorpoint_RandConv10_ChanValeria_Z01
#. SceneName = SFFL_Anchorpint_RandConv10_ChanValeria_Z01_Scene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Actor01
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFValeriaHahn
#. Face = Friendly
#. SoundFileID = 003D070A
#. ScriptNotes = / to Actor02
#. EDID: [01059DBC]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001F6C"
msgid "That was brave. But if you ask me, we got off lucky."
msgstr "용감했어. 하지만 내 생각엔 우린 운이 좋았던 거야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_Anchorpoint_RandConv10_ChanValeria_Z01
#. SceneName = SFFL_Anchorpint_RandConv10_ChanValeria_Z01_Scene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Actor01
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFValeriaHahn
#. Face = Surprised
#. SoundFileID = 00B5D277
#. ScriptNotes = Surprised, impressed / Surprised / to Actor02
#. DialogueBefore = Actor01: Yep! Smooth sailing here, now that those Spacers are gone.|I heard they're no longer a problem.|What happened? Did you send one of your people? &&& Actor02: One of the patrons stepped up.|Probably saved us all.
#. EDID: [01059DBC]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001F6D"
msgid "Really?"
msgstr "정말?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R02_DialogueQuest
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMTheArbitrator
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R02_NPCMTheArbitrator
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 006C34CC
#. ScriptNotes = Serious
#. EDID: [01059ABE]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001F6E"
msgid "Get out of here. If I have something for you, I'll let you know."
msgstr "그만 가봐. 너한테 줄 일이 있으면 알려주겠다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_Anchorpoint_RandConv12_MaddieTiger03
#. SceneName = SFFL_Anchorpoint_RandConv09_MaddieTigerSceneCOPY0001
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Actor02
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFMaddieWing
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00BDE658
#. ScriptNotes = Talking to a pet / to Actor01
#. EDID: SFFL_AnchorpointSharedInfoQuest_MaddeB1
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001F6F"
msgid "Got some new paint in the other day. How would you feel about being a bright pink and lime green kitty?"
msgstr "얼마 전에 새 페인트가 들어왔어. 연분홍색과 라임색의 고양이가 되는 건 어때?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_Anchorpoint_RandConv13_MaddieTiger04
#. SceneName = SFFL_Anchorpoint_RandConv09_MaddieTigerSceneCOPY0002
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Actor02
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFMaddieWing
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00A817B3
#. ScriptNotes = / to Actor01
#. EDID: SFFL_AnchorpointSharedInfoQuest_MaddeC2
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001F70"
msgid "We'll do it soon, I promise. Just got to fix about a dozen things around here first."
msgstr "곧 해줄게. 약속할게. 여기는 고쳐야 할 게 한두 가지가 아니라서 먼저 처리해야 해."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_Anchorpoint_RandConv13_MaddieTiger04
#. SceneName = SFFL_Anchorpoint_RandConv09_MaddieTigerSceneCOPY0002
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Actor02
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFMaddieWing
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 003C5742
#. ScriptNotes = Amused by a beloved pet / to Actor01
#. DialogueBefore = Actor02: &&& Actor01:
#. EDID: SFFL_AnchorpointSharedInfoQuest_MaddeC2
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001F71"
msgid "*Laugh* Wow! Such enthusiasm!"
msgstr "*웃음* 와! 열정이 대단한데!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_EC08
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE_EC08_10_CompanionInterjection
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = ActiveCompanion
#. VoiceType = NPCMSamCoe
#. Face = Impressed
#. SoundFileID = 00562B48
#. ScriptNotes = Companion reacting to the player's ship entering a debris field littered with space mines. / Impressed
#. EDID: SFFL_SE_EC08SharedInfo03
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001F72"
msgid "It looks like there's some cargo floating around. Might be worth the risk."
msgstr "화물이 좀 떠다니는 것 같아. 위험을 감수할 가치가 있을지도 몰라."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_EC08
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE_EC08_10_CompanionInterjection
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = ActiveCompanion
#. VoiceType = NPCMSamCoe
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 00087930
#. ScriptNotes = Companion reacting to the player's ship entering a debris field littered with space mines. / Confident
#. EDID: SFFL_SE_EC08SharedInfo03
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001F73"
msgid "This must have been a common grav jump exit point once. That would explain the mines."
msgstr "한때 흔히 쓰이던 중력 도약 출구 지점이었나 봐. 그러면 기뢰도 설명이 되지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_EC08
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE_EC08_10_CompanionInterjection
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = ActiveCompanion
#. VoiceType = NPCMSamCoe
#. Face = Concentrating
#. SoundFileID = 00392179
#. ScriptNotes = Companion reacting to the player's ship entering a debris field littered with space mines. / Concentrating
#. EDID: SFFL_SE_EC08SharedInfo03
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001F74"
msgid "Looks like space mines. Lots of them."
msgstr "우주 기뢰 같아. 아주 많아."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_EC08
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE_EC08_10_CompanionInterjection
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = ActiveCompanion
#. VoiceType = NPCFAndreja
#. Face = Concerned
#. SoundFileID = 00090166
#. ScriptNotes = Companion reacting to the player's ship entering a debris field littered with space mines. / Concerned
#. EDID: SFFL_SE_EC08SharedInfo01
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001F75"
msgid "We should probably steer clear of this area. I doubt any floating cargo is worth the risk."
msgstr "이 구역은 피하는 게 좋겠어. 떠다니는 화물이 위험을 감수할 만큼 가치 있을 것 같진 않아."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_EC08
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE_EC08_10_CompanionInterjection
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = ActiveCompanion
#. VoiceType = NPCFAndreja
#. Face = Impressed
#. SoundFileID = 005D677D
#. ScriptNotes = Companion reacting to the player's ship entering a debris field littered with space mines. / Impressed
#. EDID: SFFL_SE_EC08SharedInfo01
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001F76"
msgid "Are those space mines? There are so many of them!"
msgstr "저거 우주 기뢰야? 엄청 많잖아!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_EC08
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE_EC08_200_SelfDestructCompanion
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = ActiveCompanion
#. VoiceType = NPCFSarahMorgan
#. Face = Concerned
#. SoundFileID = 00C45ACD
#. ScriptNotes = Concerned
#. DialogueBefore = ActiveCompanion:
#. EDID: [01080466]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001F77"
msgid "We should go before the same thing happens to us."
msgstr "우리도 같은 꼴을 당하기 전에 가야 해."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_EC08
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE_EC08_200_SelfDestructCompanion
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = ActiveCompanion
#. VoiceType = NPCFSarahMorgan
#. Face = Sarcastic
#. SoundFileID = 002A2C8C
#. ScriptNotes = Sarcastic
#. EDID: [0108045B]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001F78"
msgid "Right, so if one of the mines doesn't kill us, this will. Splendid."
msgstr "좋아, 그러니까 기뢰 중 하나가 우릴 죽이지 못하면 이게 죽이겠군. 훌륭해."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_EC08
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE_EC08_200_SelfDestructCompanion
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = ActiveCompanion
#. VoiceType = NPCFSarahMorgan
#. Face = Question
#. SoundFileID = 0070F5AB
#. ScriptNotes = Question
#. EDID: [0108045A]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001F79"
msgid "Are you sure that was a good idea?"
msgstr "그게 정말 좋은 생각이었어?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_EC08
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE_EC08_200_SelfDestructCompanion
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = ActiveCompanion
#. VoiceType = NPCMBarrett
#. Face = Concerned
#. SoundFileID = 00333DD9
#. ScriptNotes = Concerned
#. EDID: [01080454]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001F7A"
msgid "Was that really necessary?"
msgstr "그게 정말 필요했어?"

#. List: 2
#. EDID: [01054A4F]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001F7B"
msgid "*Sigh* Okay."
msgstr "*한숨* 좋아."

#. List: 2
#. EDID: [01054A6A]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001F7C"
msgid "Please just check, okay?"
msgstr "제발 확인만 해 줘, 알겠지?"

#. List: 2
#. EDID: [01054A55]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001F7D"
msgid "One moment we'll all be feeling tired and dizzy, and then the next, we'll all be dead!"
msgstr "한순간에는 모두 피곤하고 어지럽다가, 다음 순간에는 전부 죽어 있을 거야!"

#. List: 2
#. EDID: [01054A55]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001F7E"
msgid "I heard a hissing noise from one of the bulkhead seams. It's an oxygen leak, I just know it."
msgstr "격벽 이음새 중 하나에서 치직거리는 소리를 들었어. 산소 누출이야. 난 알아."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_RS01
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE_RS01_Jara_Kleel_Hail
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = HailingShip
#. VoiceType = SFFL_SE_RS01_NPCFJara_Kleel
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00A52F03
#. EDID: [0105456A]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001F7F"
msgid "Hello? Can you hear me? This is Jara Kleel, pilot of the Sycorax."
msgstr "여보세요? 들리나요? 여기는 시코락스의 조종사 자라 클릴입니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_RS01
