#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0067A50B
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: I know what it's like to hope for a hand up when all you can do is grasp at the air.
#. EDID: [0105F4BB]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001F81"
msgid "You got it! You're a life-saver, truly."
msgstr "알겠어! 당신은 정말 생명의 은인이야."

