#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: I'd like to see the specials, please.
#. EDID: [0106BE04]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001F90"
msgid "Looking for something in particular?"
msgstr "특별히 찾는 게 있나요?"

