#. EDID: [0106BE35]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001F92"
msgid "A lot of the guards there are supposed to be former mercenaries."
msgstr "거기 경비병들 중 상당수는 전직 용병이라고 하더군요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC03
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC03_55_BobbyRumors
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Bobby
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC03_Bobby_Voice
#. Face = Concerned
#. SoundFileID = 00E76EC1
#. ScriptNotes = Bobby Kazan, space trader, shares a bit of information/rumor/gossip he's heard with the player. / Concerned / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Bobby: As usual, take what I say with a grain of salt.
#. EDID: [0106BE35]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001F93"
msgid "Word is, the guy who runs Anchorpoint used to work for Ecliptic."
msgstr "소문으로는 앵커포인트를 운영하는 사람이 예전에 이클립틱에서 일했대요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC03
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC03_55_BobbyRumors
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Bobby
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC03_Bobby_Voice
#. Face = Concerned
#. SoundFileID = 0050AF0A
#. ScriptNotes = Bobby Kazan, space trader, shares a bit of information/rumor/gossip he's heard with the player. / Concerned / to Player Default
#. EDID: [0106BE30]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
