#. DialogueBefore = Bobby:
#. DialogueAfter = Bobby: I'd like to see the specials, please.
#. EDID: [0106BE3B]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001F96"
msgid "That's it. Do you need anything else?"
msgstr "그게 다예요. 더 필요한 게 있나요?"

