#. ScriptNotes = Shy, but trying to be brave. / Worried / to Player Default
#. Prompt = But you can't let Opal get away with harassing you. Sadie is your sister. She would want you safe above all.
#. EDID: [0104E256]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001FF9"
msgid "No. You're right. I need to tell her. Okay..."
msgstr "아니. 네 말이 맞아. 그 애에게 말해야 해. 좋아..."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0300C_Wren_DIP
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Wren
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCWrenCarr
#. Face = Worried
#. SoundFileID = 00F59911
#. ScriptNotes = Shy and scared. / Worried / to Player Default
#. Prompt = But you can't let Opal get away with harassing you. Sadie is your sister. She would want you safe above all.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: But you can't let Opal get away with harassing you. Sadie is your sister. She would want you safe above all.
#. EDID: [0104E256]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001FFA"
msgid "I know she would, but-"
msgstr "그 애가 그럴 거라는 건 알지만-"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0300C_Wren_DIP
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Wren
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCWrenCarr
#. Face = Worried
#. SoundFileID = 00424617
#. ScriptNotes = Trying to be brave. / Worried / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Sure. But maybe Opal feels like she has to share Sadie with you.
#. EDID: [0104E26C]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001FFB"
msgid "Alright. I can do that."
msgstr "좋아. 할 수 있어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0300C_Wren_DIP
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Wren
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCWrenCarr
#. Face = Worried
#. SoundFileID = 00467E08
#. ScriptNotes = Shy, but a bit optimistic. / Worried / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Sure. But maybe Opal feels like she has to share Sadie with you.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Sure. But maybe Opal feels like she has to share Sadie with you.
#. EDID: [0104E26C]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001FFC"
msgid "If I tell Sadie, maybe she can talk to Opal and clear all that up?"
msgstr "내가 새이디에게 말하면, 그 애가 오팔과 얘기해서 전부 풀어 줄 수 있을까?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0300A_Wren
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Wren
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCWrenCarr
#. Face = Worried
#. SoundFileID = 00EED440
#. ScriptNotes = Shocked the player even brought it up. Though she is lying through her teeth to not invoke Opal's wrath. / Worried / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I've heard Opal has been causing you issues, is that true?
#. DialogueAfter = Wren: If you don't stand up for yourself, it won't end.
#. EDID: [0104E207]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001FFD"
msgid "What? Why would you even ask that? Opal and Sadie are best friends. I'm Sadie's sister, why would Opal do anything to me?"
msgstr "뭐? 왜 그런 걸 묻는 거야? 오팔과 새이디는 절친이야. 난 새이디의 여동생인데, 오팔이 왜 나한테 뭘 하겠어?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0250_OpalGossip
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Opal
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCOpalWoods
#. Face = Smug
#. SoundFileID = 0081F47F
#. ScriptNotes = Casual and friendly as she shares gossip. But sounds annoyed when she brings of Wren. / Smug / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: You wouldn't happen to know any juicy gossip, would you?
#. EDID: [0106B2FB]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001FFE"
msgid "Did you hear that Wren was at Reliant Medical? I heard she got crazy sick. No wonder Sadie has been gone for so long. She was probably taking care of her sister. Whatever it was, I'm just glad Sadie's back."
msgstr "렌이 릴라이언트 메디컬에 있었다는 얘기 들었어? 엄청 아팠다고 하더라. 새이디가 그렇게 오래 자리를 비운 것도 무리가 아니지. 아마 여동생을 돌보고 있었을 거야. 뭐였든, 새이디가 돌아와서 다행이야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0250_OpalGossip
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Opal
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCOpalWoods
#. Face = Smug
#. SoundFileID = 009A4016
#. ScriptNotes = Casual and friendly as she shares gossip. / Smug / to Player Default
#. EDID: [0106B2F9]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "001FFF"
msgid "It must have cost Sawyer a small fortune. Well, probably cost his parents. But I guess what they don't know won't hurt them."
msgstr "소이어에게는 작은 돈이 아니었을 거야. 뭐, 아마 부모님 돈이었겠지. 하지만 모르면 약이라고 하잖아."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0250_OpalGossip
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Opal
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCOpalWoods
#. Face = Smug
#. SoundFileID = 0029DE12
#. ScriptNotes = Casual and friendly as she shares gossip. / Smug / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: You wouldn't happen to know any juicy gossip, would you?
#. EDID: [0106B2F9]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002000"
msgid "Not that it's gossip or anything, but doesn't Sawyer's ship look amazing? Sadie is the one who hooked him up on it all; From the design to the security system."
msgstr "소문은 아니지만, 소이어의 우주선 정말 멋지지 않아? 디자인부터 보안 시스템까지 전부 새이디가 손봐 줬대."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0250_OpalGossip
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00847477
#. DialogueAfter = Opal: Gossip, huh? Well, don't tell Sadie or Cooper, but you're better off if you avoid Wren. She's that sad-looking girl in the corner.
#. EDID: [0106B2CF]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002001"
msgid "You wouldn't happen to know any juicy gossip, would you?"
msgstr "혹시 재미있는 소문 아는 거 없어?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0210A_SAWYER
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Sawyer
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCSawyerBrooks
#. Face = Happy
#. SoundFileID = 005878A3
#. ScriptNotes = Happy. / Happy / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I feel great. Thanks for not leaving me passed out in a hallway.
#. DialogueAfter = Sawyer: And the party still isn't over. We invited more in on the fun. Go ahead, have a blast! Drink. Mingle! Who knows, by the time all this is over, you may meet your new best friend.
#. EDID: [0106D5D6]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002002"
msgid "We would never. Besides, we just knew all our other friends would love you!"
msgstr "우리가 그럴 리 없지. 게다가 다른 친구들도 모두 널 좋아할 거라고 알았거든!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0210A_SAWYER
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCSawyerBrooks
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCSawyerBrooks
#. Face = Friendly
#. SoundFileID = 00A195E4
#. ScriptNotes = Casual, chill, and friendly. / Friendly / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: If you two don't tell me where I am right now...
#. DialogueAfter = Sawyer: And the party still isn't over. We invited more in on the fun. Go ahead, have a blast! Drink. Mingle! Who knows, by the time all this is over, you may meet your new best friend.
#. EDID: [0106D5D2]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002003"
msgid "Hey, now! Calm down a moment. Relax. You're on my ship. Safe and sound."
msgstr "자, 진정해! 잠깐만. 긴장 풀어. 넌 내 우주선에 있어. 안전하게."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0210C_SAW&OPAL
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 000A067A
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: If you two don't tell me where I am right now... &&& Sawyer: Hey, now! Calm down a moment. Relax. You're on my ship. Safe and sound. &&& Sawyer: And the party still isn't over. We invited more in on the fun. Go ahead, have a blast! Drink. Mingle! Who knows, by the time all this is over, you may meet your new best friend.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Don't mean you have to. Come on. We're celebrating 'til we're sick of each other or dead!
#. EDID: [0104E287]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002004"
msgid "Right... I should get back to Anchorpoint."
msgstr "맞아... 난 앵커포인트로 돌아가야겠어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0150C_SAW&OPAL
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Sawyer
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCSawyerBrooks
#. Face = Happy
#. SoundFileID = 00365A7A
#. ScriptNotes = (Player response: Not now. Maybe later you both are still here.) Casual and friendly. / Happy / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Not now. Maybe later if you both are still here.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Not now. Maybe later if you both are still here.
#. DialogueAfter = Sawyer: I finally got my new ship paid off. Even sounds wild to say.
#. EDID: [0104E239]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002005"
msgid "Of course! We'll be here!"
msgstr "물론이지! 우린 여기 있을게!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0210B_OPAL
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Opal
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCOpalWoods
#. Face = Smug
#. SoundFileID = 005B68A9
#. ScriptNotes = (Player response: My head is pounding.) Friendly. / Smug / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: My head is pounding.
#. DialogueAfter = Sawyer: And the party still isn't over. We invited more in on the fun. Go ahead, have a blast! Drink. Mingle! Who knows, by the time all this is over, you may meet your new best friend.
#. EDID: [0104E218]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002006"
msgid "That tends to happen, doesn't it? But you're safe now. Sawyer and I took you to his ship."
msgstr "그런 일은 종종 생기잖아? 그래도 이제 넌 안전해. 소이어와 내가 널 그의 우주선으로 데려왔어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0160A_OPAL
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Opal
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCOpalWoods
#. Face = Flirting
#. SoundFileID = 002757CA
#. ScriptNotes = Casual and friendly. / Flirting / to Player Default
#. DialogueAfter = Sawyer: Sure. I would love to join you.
#. EDID: [0104E2B7]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002007"
msgid "Hey again, stranger. Thinking about taking us up on those drinks?"
msgstr "또 만났네, 낯선 친구. 우리랑 술 한잔할 생각 있어?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0150C_SAW&OPAL
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Sawyer
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCSawyerBrooks
#. Face = Pleading
#. SoundFileID = 00DA4860
#. ScriptNotes = (Player response: I don't drink.) A bit disappointed, but still friendly. / Pleading / to Player Default
#. Prompt = I don't drink.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I don't drink.
#. DialogueAfter = Sawyer: I finally got my new ship paid off. Even sounds wild to say.
#. EDID: [0104E23A]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002008"
msgid "That's a shame. Well, if you ever want to have a few free drinks, you know where to find us."
msgstr "아쉽네. 그래도 무료 술 몇 잔이 생각나면 어디로 오면 되는지 알지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0150C_SAW&OPAL
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Sawyer
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCSawyerBrooks
#. Face = Happy
#. SoundFileID = 00D8D5FC
#. ScriptNotes = Casual and Friendly. (Player response: What are you celebrating?) / Happy / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Sawyer: Take a seat.
#. DialogueAfter = Opal: AKA, he got back into his parents' good graces and they paid it off for him.
#. EDID: [0104E25C]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002009"
msgid "I finally got my new ship paid off. Even sounds wild to say."
msgstr "드디어 새 우주선 대금을 다 갚았어. 말로 해도 아직 이상하게 들린다니까."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0210A_SAWYER
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Sawyer
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCSawyerBrooks
#. Face = Happy
#. SoundFileID = 00D44662
#. ScriptNotes = Friendly. / Happy / to Player Default
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: If you two don't tell me where I am right now...
#. EDID: [0104E284]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00200A"
msgid "Look who it is. Is that Sleeping Beauty? How are you feeling?"
msgstr "누가 오셨나. 잠자는 숲속의 미녀인가? 몸은 어때?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0150C_SAW&OPAL
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Opal
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCOpalWoods
#. Face = Puzzled
#. SoundFileID = 00927596
#. ScriptNotes = Confused on why Sawyer is inviting a random person to join them. / Puzzled / to Sawyer
#. DialogueBefore = Opal: Sounds like you're waiting on some friends. &&& Sawyer: Ah, they'll be around later. But for now, we could always use another? It's no fun to celebrate if you can't bring others into it. &&& Sawyer: Sorry. Can't help it. We're celebrating! Want to join? The more the merrier. &&& Sawyer: Of course! This is a celebration! Come on, sit! Join us.
#. DialogueAfter = Sawyer: Don't mind Opal. She has a hard time making new friends.
#. EDID: [0104E2B6]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00200B"
msgid " Really, Sawyer? Her?"
msgstr "진짜야, 소이어? 그녀라고?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0150C_SAW&OPAL
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Opal
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCOpalWoods
#. Face = Puzzled
#. SoundFileID = 001B7537
#. ScriptNotes = Confused on why Sawyer is inviting a random person to join them. / Puzzled / to Sawyer
#. DialogueBefore = Opal: Sounds like you're waiting on some friends. &&& Sawyer: Ah, they'll be around later. But for now, we could always use another? It's no fun to celebrate if you can't bring others into it. &&& Sawyer: Sorry. Can't help it. We're celebrating! Want to join? The more the merrier. &&& Sawyer: Of course! This is a celebration! Come on, sit! Join us.
#. DialogueAfter = Sawyer: Don't mind Opal. She has a hard time making new friends.
#. EDID: [0104E2B5]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00200C"
msgid " Really, Sawyer? Him?"
msgstr "진짜야, 소이어? 그 남자라고?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0150C_SAW&OPAL
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Opal
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCOpalWoods
#. Face = Puzzled
#. SoundFileID = 00AC61DE
#. ScriptNotes = Confused on why Sawyer is inviting a random person to join them. / Puzzled / to Sawyer
#. DialogueBefore = Opal: Sounds like you're waiting on some friends. &&& Sawyer: Ah, they'll be around later. But for now, we could always use another? It's no fun to celebrate if you can't bring others into it. &&& Sawyer: Sorry. Can't help it. We're celebrating! Want to join? The more the merrier. &&& Sawyer: Of course! This is a celebration! Come on, sit! Join us.
#. DialogueAfter = Sawyer: Don't mind Opal. She has a hard time making new friends.
#. EDID: [0104E2B4]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00200D"
msgid " Really, Sawyer? Them?"
msgstr "진짜야, 소이어? 저 사람들이라고?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0150C_SAW&OPAL
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Sawyer
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCSawyerBrooks
#. Face = Friendly
#. SoundFileID = 00643504
#. ScriptNotes = Casual and Friendly. / Friendly / to Player Default
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Sure. I would love to join you.
#. EDID: [0104E279]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00200E"
msgid "Who knows. We all may end up being peas in a pod!"
msgstr "누가 알아. 우리 모두 한통속이 될지도 모르지!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0150C_SAW&OPAL
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Sawyer
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCSawyerBrooks
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 00BA2A6A
#. ScriptNotes = Casual and Friendly. / Confident / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Sawyer: Of course! This is a celebration! Come on, sit! Join us. &&& Opal: Really, Sawyer? Them?
#. EDID: [0104E279]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00200F"
msgid "Don't mind Opal. She has a hard time making new friends. "
msgstr "오팔은 신경 쓰지 마. 새 친구를 사귀는 게 서툴거든."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0975_COMPANION
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = companion
#. VoiceType = NPCMSamCoe
#. Face = Relieved
#. SoundFileID = 00C9AFF3
#. ScriptNotes = Was worried about the player, but relieved they're back safe. / Relieved
#. EDID: [0106B2B8]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002010"
msgid "Where in the hell were you? I thought you ran off to get some rest after all that drinking. I couldn't find you. Good thing you're safe."
msgstr "대체 어디 있었어? 그렇게 술을 마신 뒤 좀 쉬러 간 줄 알았는데. 널 찾을 수가 없었어. 무사해서 다행이야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0101_SAW&OPAL
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Sawyer
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCSawyerBrooks
#. Face = Friendly
#. SoundFileID = 0060CC8C
#. ScriptNotes = Casual and having fun at a bar. / Friendly / to Sawyer
#. DialogueAfter = Opal: Should be any moment. But their loss. We get to start the party early.
#. EDID: [0104E213]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002011"
msgid "So, when do you think the others will get here?"
msgstr "그래서, 다른 사람들은 언제쯤 올 것 같아?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0300C_OPAL&SAWYER
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Opal
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCOpalWoods
#. Face = Angry
#. SoundFileID = 006C46C4
#. ScriptNotes = Angry. / Angry / to Sawyer
#. DialogueBefore = Sawyer: Opal, what's going on?
#. DialogueAfter = Opal: Hope you drink, and choke on your own vomit.
#. EDID: [0106B2E4]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002012"
msgid "I'll explain later. For now, take this asshole back to the dump where we found them."
msgstr "설명은 나중에 할게. 지금은 이 망할 자식을 우리가 찾았던 쓰레기장으로 돌려보내."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0300C_OPAL&SAWYER
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Sawyer
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCSawyerBrooks
#. Face = Confused
#. SoundFileID = 00CA204E
#. ScriptNotes = Confused at why Opal is angry at the Player. (Opal's last response: Say no more. I can't wait to get you off this ship. Sawyer!) / Confused / to Opal
#. DialogueAfter = Opal: I'll explain later. For now, take this asshole back to the dump where we found him.
#. EDID: [0106B297]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002013"
msgid "Opal, what's going on?"
msgstr "오팔, 무슨 일이야?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0300B_OPAL
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Opal
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00A4E0A9
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: You sure had some colorful things to say in this slate of yours. &&& Opal: Where did you find that? That wasn't for you to listen to!
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: You know nothing about us. You're just some nosey weirdo me and Sawyer found at a bar.
#. EDID: [0106B280]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002014"
msgid "You don't deserve these friends. Soon enough they'll know what you're doing and leave you behind. "
msgstr "넌 이런 친구들을 가질 자격이 없어. 머지않아 저들도 네가 뭘 하는지 알고 널 버릴 거야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0300B_OPAL
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Opal
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCOpalWoods
#. Face = Angry
#. SoundFileID = 00A307B6
#. ScriptNotes = Angry at the player and then calls out to Sawyer. / Angry / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Tell Sawyer to bring me back to Anchorpoint. If not, then this slate goes to Sadie.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Tell Sawyer to bring me back to Anchorpoint. If not, then this slate goes to Sadie.
#. EDID: [0106B2A3]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002015"
msgid "Say no more. I can't wait to get you off this ship. Sawyer!"
msgstr "더 말하지 마. 널 이 우주선에서 내보내는 게 기다려지네. 소이어!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0300B_OPAL
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Opal
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00A12A1F
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: You sure had some colorful things to say in this slate of yours. &&& Opal: Where did you find that? That wasn't for you to listen to!
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Say no more. I can't wait to get you off this ship. Sawyer!
#. EDID: [0106B2B5]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002016"
msgid "Tell Sawyer to bring me back to Anchorpoint. If not, then this slate goes to Sadie."
msgstr "소이어에게 나를 앵커포인트로 데려다주라고 해. 안 그러면 이 슬레이트가 새이디에게 갈 거야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0300B_OPAL
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Opal
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00A7779A
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: You sure had some colorful things to say in this slate of yours. &&& Opal: Where did you find that? That wasn't for you to listen to!
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: No, no, you really shouldn't.
#. EDID: [0106B2A2]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002017"
msgid "I should give it to Cooper. He'll probably love hearing this."
msgstr "쿠퍼에게 줘야겠어. 이걸 들으면 정말 좋아하겠지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0300B_OPAL
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Opal
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCOpalWoods
#. Face = Angry
#. SoundFileID = 00618F56
#. ScriptNotes = Angry. / Angry / to Player Default
#. Prompt = I think Sadie would be interested in hearing it.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I think Sadie would be interested in hearing it.
#. EDID: [0106B289]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002018"
msgid "Don't you dare show her that!"
msgstr "감히 그걸 그녀에게 보여 주지 마!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0300B_OPAL
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Opal
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCOpalWoods
#. Face = Angry
#. SoundFileID = 00B14656
#. ScriptNotes = Angry. / Angry / to Player Default
#. Prompt = I should give it to Cooper. He'll probably love hearing this.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I should give it to Cooper. He'll probably love hearing this.
#. EDID: [0106B27A]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002019"
msgid "No, no, you really shouldn't."
msgstr "아니, 아니, 정말 그러면 안 돼."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0300B_SADIE
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCSadieCarr
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCSadieCarr
#. Face = Angry
#. SoundFileID = 00DAC9E3
#. ScriptNotes = Angry. / Angry / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Sounds like Opal doesn't like your sister very much.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Sounds like Opal doesn't like your sister very much.
#. EDID: [0106B274]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00201A"
msgid "And she's not going to like me either. Wait here."
msgstr "그리고 그 애도 날 좋아하지 않을 거야. 여기서 기다려."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0300B_SADIE
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Sadie
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCSadieCarr
#. Face = Disgust
#. SoundFileID = 00FE75BC
#. ScriptNotes = Confused at what Opal said about her sister in the slate. Mix of betrayal and rising anger. / Disgust / to Player Default
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Sounds like Opal doesn't like your sister very much.
#. EDID: [0106B2AB]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00201B"
msgid "What? I'm sorry. What is this? What- Why would she even say this?"
msgstr "뭐? 미안한데, 이게 뭐야? 뭐- 왜 그 애가 이런 말을 하는 거지?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0300B_SADIE
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Sadie
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCSadieCarr
#. Face = Suspicious
#. SoundFileID = 005DC911
#. ScriptNotes = Confused and suspicious. / Suspicious / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: You should listen to this slate I found.
#. EDID: [0106B2AB]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00201C"
msgid "A slate? Is this Opal's? Why do you have that? Let me see it."
msgstr "슬레이트? 이거 오팔 거야? 네가 왜 그걸 가지고 있어? 보여 줘."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0300D_Wren_SLATE
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Wren
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00E309E6
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: If she wasn't then she wouldn't have said what she said in this slate. &&& Wren: What? Let me see that. &&& Wren: Where did you get this? I just- &&& Wren: I don't get it. Why does she do this? Sadie's her friend. She's dating my brother. Yet there is something wrong with me? What the hell?
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Yea... Yea, I think so too. Thank you.
#. EDID: [0106B2D0]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00201D"
msgid "I think Sadie should have a listen to that slate."
msgstr "새이디가 그 슬레이트를 들어봐야 할 것 같아."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0300D_Wren_SLATE
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Wren
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCWrenCarr
#. Face = Sad
#. SoundFileID = 00FCDF81
#. ScriptNotes = She just listened to Opal's audio slate. Sad and at a loss for words. / Sad / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Wren: What? Let me see that.
#. DialogueAfter = Wren: I don't get it. Why does she do this? Sadie's her friend. She's dating my brother. Yet there is something wrong with me? What the hell?
#. EDID: [0106B28C]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00201E"
msgid "Where did you get this? I just-"
msgstr "이거 어디서 났어? 난 그냥-"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_TL_WREN_01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Wren
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCWrenCarr
#. Face = Worried
#. SoundFileID = 00C4A8C0
#. ScriptNotes = Mumbling more. Her mind is still thinking/concerned about the fact someone is talking about her. / Worried / to Player Default
#. EDID: [0106B2F1]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00201F"
msgid "I'm sorry. Yeah, it's fine, I guess. I don't know."
msgstr "미안해. 그래, 괜찮은 것 같아. 잘 모르겠어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_TL_WREN_01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Wren
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCWrenCarr
#. Face = Shocked
#. SoundFileID = 009AB5E7
#. ScriptNotes = Surprised the Player knows she doesn't get out much. Taken back that someone is telling the Player her business. / Shocked / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I heard you haven't been out much. How are you liking the party?
#. EDID: [0106B2F1]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002020"
msgid "Someone told you that? It wasn't Opal, was it?"
msgstr "누가 그런 말을 했어? 오팔은 아니었지?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_TL_SADIE_01
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0068AC06
#. DialogueAfter = Sadie: Is that what you heard? It's not like I built this ship from the ground up, or decorated the place. All this is a bit too rich for me.
#. EDID: [0106B279]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002021"
msgid "You set up Sawyer's ship?"
msgstr "네가 소이어의 우주선을 꾸몄어?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_TL_WREN_01
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 004869D9
#. DialogueAfter = Wren: Someone told you that? It wasn't Opal, was it?
#. EDID: [0106B2C4]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002022"
msgid "I heard you haven't been out much. How are you liking the party?"
msgstr "요즘 밖에 잘 안 나왔다고 들었어. 파티는 어때?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_TL_WREN_02
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 003AF8C1
#. DialogueAfter = Wren: No. Do I look that much out of place? Sawyer's parties just never were my thing. I feel like a fish out of water.
#. EDID: [0106B2B1]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002023"
msgid "Is this your first party?"
msgstr "이게 네 첫 파티야?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_TL_SAWYER_02
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 006D4EFB
#. DialogueAfter = Sawyer: In terms of fun? Yes. In terms of style? When I could afford it. But now, with my parent's credits flowing into my pockets, I plan to make every party better than the last.
#. EDID: [0106B2B3]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002024"
msgid "Are all your parties like this?"
msgstr "네 파티들은 다 이래?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_TL_SADIE_02
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00F42193
#. DialogueAfter = Sadie: Enough to be invited.
#. EDID: [0106B288]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002025"
msgid "Do you know Opal or Sawyer very well?"
msgstr "오팔이나 소이어를 잘 알아?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_TL_OPAL_02
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00F8C71A
#. DialogueAfter = Opal: It beats staying at home doing nothing. And there's booze. Not much else for me to say.
#. EDID: [0106B2A1]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002026"
msgid "How are you liking the party so far?"
msgstr "지금까지 파티는 어때?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0250_WrenGossip
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Wren
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCWrenCarr
#. Face = Worried
#. SoundFileID = 0058EAB0
#. ScriptNotes = Slightly thinking out loud and worried. / Worried / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Would you know anything about this crowd?
#. EDID: [0106B2E0]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002027"
msgid "Not as much as I wished. For example, Opal hasn't been around Cooper all that much tonight. They've been dating for so long now, but it's like she's avoiding him. I hope the two are okay..."
msgstr "바랐던 만큼은 아니야. 예를 들면, 오늘 밤 오팔이 쿠퍼 곁에 거의 없었어. 둘은 정말 오래 사귀었는데, 마치 그를 피하는 것 같아. 둘이 괜찮았으면 좋겠는데..."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0250_WrenGossip
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Wren
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCWrenCarr
#. Face = Worried
#. SoundFileID = 0016F11D
#. ScriptNotes = Shy and worried. / Worried / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Would you know anything about this crowd?
#. EDID: [0106B2DE]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002028"
msgid "Yeah. Just, be careful about Opal. She gets mad easily and I think she holds a grudge too."
msgstr "그래. 그냥, 오팔은 조심해. 쉽게 화내고 원한도 품는 것 같아."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0250_SadieGossip
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Sadie
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCSadieCarr
#. Face = Concerned
#. SoundFileID = 00FB83D8
#. ScriptNotes = Softer and sweeter when talking about her sister. / Concerned / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: What can you tell me about your friends?
#. EDID: [0106B2AA]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002029"
msgid "I'm not sure I should tell you this, but if you see Wren, please be gentle with her. She's been sick for months and is finally getting out again. I thought this get-together could be good for her."
msgstr "이런 말을 해도 될지 모르겠지만, 렌을 보면 부디 다정하게 대해 줘. 몇 달 동안 아팠고 이제야 다시 밖에 나온 거야. 이 모임이 그 애에게 좋을 수 있다고 생각했어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0300_WREN_SC03
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Wren
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCWrenCarr
#. Face = Irritated
#. SoundFileID = 0004A3F4
#. ScriptNotes = Speech Challenge failed. Annoyed. / Irritated / to Player Default
#. EDID: [0106B29A]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00202A"
msgid "You can tell her whatever you want, but she won't believe you."
msgstr "그 애에게 뭐든 말해도 돼. 하지만 믿지는 않을 거야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0300_WREN_SC03
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Wren
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCWrenCarr
#. Face = Afraid
#. SoundFileID = 00D40166
#. ScriptNotes = Speech Challenge success. Wren is terrified the Player will tell Sadie about the bullying. / Afraid / to Player Default
#. EDID: [0106B299]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00202B"
msgid "What? No. No. Please. You don't need to tell her anything. She should hear it from me."
msgstr "뭐? 아니. 안 돼. 제발. 그 애에게 아무 말도 할 필요 없어. 내 입으로 들어야 해."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0300_WREN_SC06
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Wren
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCWrenCarr
#. Face = Irritated
#. SoundFileID = 003EDCEF
#. ScriptNotes = Speech challenge failed. Annoyed. / Irritated / to Player Default
#. EDID: [0106B2B0]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00202C"
msgid "Trust me. I would love to drop this."
msgstr "날 믿어. 나도 이 일은 정말 그만두고 싶어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0300_WREN_SC06
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 009FB38D
#. EDID: [0106B292]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00202D"
msgid "I guess if you see absolutely nothing wrong with this, then fine. Drop it."
msgstr "네 눈에는 이게 전혀 문제없어 보인다면 좋아. 그만두자."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0300_WREN_SCRepeat
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Wren
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCWrenCarr
#. Face = Irritated
#. SoundFileID = 00BD96BC
#. ScriptNotes = Speech Challenge failed. Annoyed. / Irritated / to Player Default
#. EDID: [0106B301]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00202E"
msgid "You don't know what you're talking about, okay?"
msgstr "넌 네가 무슨 말을 하는지 몰라, 알겠어?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0300_WREN_SCRepeat
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00AC7757
#. EDID: [0106B2D1]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00202F"
msgid "No one should have to go through this. You can't hide this from Sadie forever."
msgstr "아무도 이런 일을 겪어선 안 돼. 이걸 새이디에게 영원히 숨길 순 없어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0300_WREN_SC05
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00B5F9D6
#. EDID: [0106B2AE]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002030"
msgid "You may not be an isolated case with Opal. She could be bullying the others too."
msgstr "오팔과 관련해서 네가 유일한 사례가 아닐 수도 있어. 다른 사람들도 괴롭히고 있을지 몰라."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0300_WREN_SC04
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Wren
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCWrenCarr
#. Face = Worried
#. SoundFileID = 002441C8
#. ScriptNotes = Speech Challenge failed. Worried about telling the others about Opal. / Worried / to Player Default
#. EDID: [0106B2A6]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002031"
msgid "It's not that simple. I wish it were, but it's not. Opal has been friends with everyone since, I can't even remember."
msgstr "그렇게 간단하지 않아. 그랬으면 좋겠지만 아니야. 오팔은 모두와 친구였어. 언제부터였는지 기억도 안 날 만큼 오래."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0300D_SAWYER_FG
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0023B6D9
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I gave her what she deserved. &&& Sawyer: I invited you to have fun, not make Opal upset. Whatever. Let me just take you back.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: I'll start a course.
#. EDID: [0106D685]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002032"
msgid "I'm ready. Take me back to Anchorpoint."
msgstr "준비됐어. 앵커포인트로 데려다줘."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0300D_SAWYER_FG
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Sawyer
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCSawyerBrooks
#. Face = Confused
#. SoundFileID = 00BA4891
#. ScriptNotes = Annoyed at the Player for upsetting Opal. / Confused / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Take this slate. It will fill you in on everything.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Take this slate. It will fill you in on everything.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Wait. I changed my mind. I don't want to leave yet.
#. EDID: [0106D69E]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002033"
msgid "A slate? You caused all this over a slate? Whatever. I'll take a listen later. For now, let's get you back to Anchorpoint."
msgstr "슬레이트? 슬레이트 하나 때문에 이 난리를 벌였어? 됐어. 나중에 들어볼게. 지금은 널 앵커포인트로 돌려보내자."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0300D_SAWYER_FG
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00B77A89
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Sawyer: What did you do?
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: I invited you to have fun, not make Opal upset. Whatever. Let me just take you back.
#. EDID: [0106D68B]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002034"
msgid "I gave her what she deserved."
msgstr "그 애는 당해도 싼 일을 당한 거야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0300D_SAWYER_FG
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Sawyer
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCSawyerBrooks
#. Face = Shocked
#. SoundFileID = 00095281
#. ScriptNotes = Shocked at what all Opal just said to the Player. Asking the Player. / Shocked / to Player Default
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: I gave her what she deserved.
#. EDID: [0106D686]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002035"
msgid "What did you do?"
msgstr "무슨 짓을 한 거야?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0252_COOPER_GREETING
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Cooper
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00A234D9
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Cooper: You're Sawyer's new friend, right? Surprised you're not partying it up with him.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Can't imagine you got much out of her. Don't take it personally. She's quiet like that.
#. EDID: [0106D673]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002036"
msgid "I think Wren mentioned you, so I wanted to say 'hi.'"
msgstr "렌이 당신 얘기를 한 것 같아서, 인사하려고 왔어요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0252_COOPER_GREETING
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Cooper
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00A6BF7F
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Cooper: You're Sawyer's new friend, right? Surprised you're not partying it up with him.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: And you just met the guy. I've known him for years. Imagine how I feel.
#. EDID: [0106D678]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002037"
msgid "He's a bit much for me."
msgstr "그 사람은 나한텐 좀 버거워."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0252_COOPER_GREETING
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Cooper
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCCooperCarr
#. Face = Irritated
#. SoundFileID = 0057D441
#. ScriptNotes = Cold and not really caring about the Player. He doesn't like Sawyer, so a friend of Sawyer will probably annoy him. / Irritated / to Player Default
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: I wouldn't say I'm his friend. I hardly know the guy.
#. EDID: [0106D697]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002038"
msgid "You're Sawyer's new friend, right? Surprised you're not partying it up with him. "
msgstr "당신이 소이어의 새 친구죠? 그와 파티를 즐기고 있지 않다니 의외네요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0252_WREN_GREETING
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Wren
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCWrenCarr
#. Face = Grateful
#. SoundFileID = 004FA87A
#. ScriptNotes = Shy, but a little appreciative for the Player at least caring to know her name. / Grateful / to Player Default
#. Prompt = For talking, a name tends to be a good place to start.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: For talking, a name tends to be a good place to start.
#. DialogueAfter = Wren: Sorry. My name is Wren. Cooper and Sadie brought me along.
#. EDID: [0106D692]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002039"
msgid "I guess so."
msgstr "그런 것 같아."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0252_WREN_GREETING
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Wren
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0064BAA4
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Wren: Hi there...|Sorry. I'm not too much of a talker, or that interesting. You'd be better off talking to my sister, Sadie.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: I guess so.
#. EDID: [0106D68C]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00203A"
msgid "For talking, a name tends to be a good place to start."
msgstr "대화를 하려면 이름부터 시작하는 게 좋지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0252_SADIE_GREETING
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCSadieCarr
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCSadieCarr
#. Face = Friendly
#. SoundFileID = 00CCCE23
#. ScriptNotes = Small chuckle. Casual, friendly, and chill. / Friendly / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Trust me, I don't even want to be here.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Trust me, I don't even want to be here.
#. DialogueAfter = Sadie: Anyway, the name's Sadie. If you ever need a moment of peace, feel free to come and talk. I don't care to get too drunk at these things.
#. EDID: [0106D696]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00203B"
msgid "Sounds like the alcohol brought you then. Opal told me she met you at a bar. "
msgstr "그럼 술 때문에 여기 오게 된 모양이네요. 오팔이 바에서 당신을 만났다고 했거든요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS02
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS02_0252_WREN_GREETING
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Wren
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCWrenCarr
#. Face = Worried
#. SoundFileID = 0035A96F
#. ScriptNotes = Softly and having a hard time reacting to the Player's compliment. / Worried / to Player Default
#. Prompt = I'm sure you're more interesting than you think.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I'm sure you're more interesting than you think.
#. DialogueAfter = Wren: Sorry. My name is Wren. Cooper and Sadie brought me along.
#. EDID: [0106DC21]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00203C"
msgid "Maybe..."
msgstr "어쩌면..."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ04
#. SceneName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ04_KillianTL_TurnIn
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = KillianBrice
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMKillianBrice
#. Face = Friendly
#. SoundFileID = 00CF86F9
#. ScriptNotes = Very pleased / Friendly / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I've recovered the lost shipment.
#. EDID: [0106573E]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00203D"
msgid "I knew that you would come through."
msgstr "해낼 줄 알았어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ04
#. SceneName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ04_KillianTL_TurnIn
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = KillianBrice
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMKillianBrice
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 000407D3
#. ScriptNotes = Pleased / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = KillianBrice: Excellent.
#. EDID: [0106574F]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00203E"
msgid "As we agreed, your credits."
msgstr "약속한 대로, 크레딧이야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Voice
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Voice
#. Face = Afraid
#. SoundFileID = 0082072B
#. ScriptNotes = Gloria being a depressed teen trying to cope with the bad situation she's in. Also not sure the player can be trusted yet. / Afraid
#. EDID: [010485ED]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00203F"
msgid "Please don't hurt me!"
msgstr "제발 해치지 말아줘!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Voice
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Voice
#. Face = Depressed
#. SoundFileID = 00199A3A
#. ScriptNotes = Gloria being a depressed teen trying to cope with the bad situation she's in. / Depressed
#. EDID: [0104BFF8]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002040"
msgid "Sometimes I feel like the only teenager in the entire universe..."
msgstr "가끔은 내가 온 우주에서 유일한 십 대인 것 같아..."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC01
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_MiscWarning
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Speaker03
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Voice
#. Face = Spaceship / Angry
#. SoundFileID = 0016C300
#. ScriptNotes = Gloria talking to player over PA system, trying to get them to turn around and leave her ship. / Angry
#. DialogueAfter = Speaker01: Turn around and go back to your ship.
#. EDID: SFFL_BE_EC01SharedInfo10
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002041"
msgid "Ugh! Why are you still there!"
msgstr "으! 왜 아직도 거기 있는 거야!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Voice
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Voice
#. Face = Grateful
#. SoundFileID = 00F3E6BB
#. ScriptNotes = Eager to get on the player's ship and leave for New Atlantis, hopefully before her stepfather arrives. / Grateful
#. EDID: [0104D029]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002042"
msgid "So, we can just get on your ship then."
msgstr "그럼 그냥 네 우주선에 타면 되는 거네."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC01
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC01_GloriaSwansen_SC_Gangster
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 009C49D0
#. EDID: [0104076E]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002043"
msgid "Trust me, you don't want to end up with some of the people out there."
msgstr "날 믿어. 밖에 있는 어떤 사람들과 엮이고 싶진 않을 거야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC01
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC01_GloriaSwansen_SC_Med02
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Gloria
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Voice
#. Face = Defiant
#. SoundFileID = 006C57D1
#. ScriptNotes = Gloria telling the player she'd rather face the dangers of space rather than follow them. A lot of it is bravado. / Defiant
#. EDID: [01040740]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002044"
msgid "I'll take my chances."
msgstr "운에 맡겨 볼게."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC01
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Dialogue_550_Guarded
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Gloria
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Voice
#. Face = Irritated
#. SoundFileID = 00C455B4
#. ScriptNotes = She'd rather the player just leave her alone, doesn't want to tell the story of how she stole the spaceship from her abusive stepfather. / Irritated / to Player Default
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Tell me who you are and why you're on this ship.
#. EDID: [01040767]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002045"
msgid "What do you want now?"
msgstr "이번엔 뭘 원해?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC01
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Dialogue_570_Neutral
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Gloria
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Voice
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 002380F0
#. ScriptNotes = Not as guarded as before, trying to act unemotional to not arise suspicions that she stole the ship. / Neutral / to Player Default
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Tell me how a teenager ended up alone on this ship.
#. EDID: [01040745]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002046"
msgid "What's up?"
msgstr "무슨 일이야?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC01
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Dialogue_550_Guarded
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00A013DA
#. DialogueBefore = Gloria: What do you want now?
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Yeah? Or what?
#. EDID: [0104073D]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002047"
msgid "Tell me who you are and why you're on this ship."
msgstr "네가 누구고 왜 이 우주선에 있는지 말해."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC01
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Dialogue_600_OpeningUp
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Gloria
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Voice
#. Face = Surprised
#. SoundFileID = 001817AD
#. ScriptNotes = Surprised that player doesn't seem interested to hear her story. / Surprised
#. Prompt = Not right now.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Not right now.
#. DialogueAfter = Gloria: The truth is... this isn't my ship. It's my stepfather's.
#. EDID: [0104075B]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002048"
msgid "Um, all right."
msgstr "음, 알았어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC01
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC01_GloriaSwansen_SC_Easy05
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Gloria
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Voice
#. Face = Confused
#. SoundFileID = 00BC1C8A
#. ScriptNotes = Gloria isn't using to being treated kindly by authority figures. / Confused
#. EDID: [01040753]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002049"
msgid "I'm sorry, I don't really know how to deal with kindness..."
msgstr "미안, 누가 친절하게 대해 주면 어떻게 해야 할지 잘 모르겠어..."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC01
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Dialogue_500_Initial_Encounter
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00B5424D
#. DialogueBefore = Gloria: I don't want any trouble. Please don't hurt me.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: I don't have anything to talk about.
#. EDID: [0104073E]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00204A"
msgid "I'm not going to hurt you, I just want to talk."
msgstr "널 해치려는 게 아니야. 그냥 얘기하고 싶어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC01
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC01_GloriaSwansen_SC_StarbornPerk
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 006A59C4
#. EDID: [01040773]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00204B"
msgid "It's okay Gloria, I know you ran away. I'm here to help."
msgstr "괜찮아, 글로리아. 네가 도망친 거 알아. 도와주러 왔어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC01
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Dialogue_570_Neutral
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Gloria
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Voice
#. Face = Somber
#. SoundFileID = 005ED290
#. ScriptNotes = Clamming up. She'd does not want to tell the story of how she stole the spaceship from her abusive stepfather. / Somber
#. DialogueBefore = Gloria: And why should I trust you?
#. DialogueAfter = Gloria: The truth is... this isn't my ship. It's my stepfather's.
#. EDID: [01040772]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00204C"
msgid "Yeah I think I'm just going to sit here and say nothing, now."
msgstr "그래, 이제 난 그냥 여기 앉아서 아무 말도 안 할래."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC01
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC01_GloriaSwansen_SC_Easy03
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Gloria
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Voice
#. Face = Sad
#. SoundFileID = 00B7F699
#. ScriptNotes = Gloria would rather just curl up in a ball than tell the player the story of her difficult family situation, and why she ran away from home. / Sad
#. EDID: [0104074D]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00204D"
msgid "Why don't you just leave me alone?"
msgstr "그냥 날 좀 내버려 두면 안 돼?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC01
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Dialogue_550_Guarded
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Gloria
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Voice
#. Face = Depressed
#. SoundFileID = 002AEB2D
#. ScriptNotes = After persuasion attempt by player, Gloria relents and accepts to tell the story of how she stole this ship from her abusive stepfather. / Depressed
#. DialogueBefore = Gloria: Yeah? Or what?
#. DialogueAfter = Gloria: The truth is... this isn't my ship. It's my stepfather's.
#. EDID: [01040759]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00204E"
msgid "Fine, I'll tell you! Maybe you'll leave me alone then..."
msgstr "좋아, 말할게! 그러면 날 좀 내버려 두겠지..."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC01
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC01_GloriaSwansen_SC_Med05
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Gloria
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Voice
#. Face = Question
#. SoundFileID = 002E558B
#. ScriptNotes = Gloria trying to bargain herself a safe exit from her predicament. / Question
#. EDID: [01040762]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00204F"
msgid "And if I do, you'll let me go, right?"
msgstr "내가 말하면, 날 보내 줄 거지?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC01
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC01_GloriaSwansen_SC_Hard01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Gloria
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Voice
#. Face = Depressed
#. SoundFileID = 00B4015A
#. ScriptNotes = Not even the prospect of freezing to death can breach Gloria's emotional wall of teenage negativity. / Depressed
#. EDID: [010408A0]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002050"
msgid "Sure, go ahead. See if I care."
msgstr "그래, 마음대로 해. 내가 신경이나 쓸 것 같아?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC01
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Dialogue_570_Neutral
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Gloria
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00AD9A88
#. DialogueBefore = Gloria: What's up?
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: I'm afraid I can't tell you that.
#. EDID: [01048C0D]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002051"
msgid "What's your destination?"
msgstr "목적지가 어디야?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC01
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Dialogue_570_Neutral
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Gloria
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Voice
#. Face = Depressed
#. SoundFileID = 007AE1B3
#. ScriptNotes = She's starting to let on that she may have gotten herself in a bigger mess than expected. / Depressed
#. Prompt = You piloted this ship into deep space all by yourself?
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: You piloted this ship into deep space all by yourself?
#. DialogueAfter = Gloria: Tell me how a teenager ended up alone on this ship.
#. EDID: [01048C0B]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002052"
msgid "Not my greatest idea, I know. I really thought I could handle it..."
msgstr "좋은 생각은 아니었지, 알아. 난 정말 내가 감당할 수 있을 줄 알았어..."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC01
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Dialogue_630_PlayerKnowsStory
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Gloria
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0016A69C
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I do want to hear your story. &&& Gloria: Okay, well listen until the end then. &&& Gloria: The truth is... this isn't my ship. It's my stepfather's.|I had to get away, you know? As far away as I could... so I thought, why not take his ship, right?|But he set up an anti-theft system that totally bricked the ship. He's probably on his way here. &&& Gloria: So that's it. That's my story.|Kind of lame now that I said it out loud...
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Of course not. What was I thinking?
#. EDID: [0104A1C1]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002053"
msgid "I don't think I should get involved in this."
msgstr "이 일에 끼어들면 안 될 것 같아."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC01
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Dialogue_630_PlayerKnowsStory
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Gloria
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Voice
#. Face = Depressed
#. SoundFileID = 00866DA2
#. ScriptNotes = Gloria crestfallen after player tells her he doesn't want to help her out of her situation. / Depressed / to Player Default
#. Prompt = I don't think I should get involved in this.
#. DialogueAfter = Gloria: Here, take this. I don't need it anymore.
#. EDID: [0104A1C3]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002054"
msgid "Just... leave me alone, okay?"
msgstr "그냥... 날 내버려 둬, 알았지?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC01
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Dialogue_630_PlayerKnowsStory
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Gloria
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Voice
#. Face = Sarcastic
#. SoundFileID = 00C2E743
#. ScriptNotes = Gloria crestfallen after player tells her he doesn't want to help her out of her situation. / Sarcastic / to Player Default
#. Prompt = I don't think I should get involved in this.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I don't think I should get involved in this.
#. EDID: [0104A1C3]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002055"
msgid "Of course not. What was I thinking?"
msgstr "당연히 아니겠지. 내가 무슨 생각을 한 거람?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC01
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Dialogue_630_PlayerKnowsStory
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Gloria
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Voice
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00A20C51
#. ScriptNotes = Accepts to once again tell the story of how she ran away from home. / Neutral / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Can you tell me your story again?
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Can you tell me your story again?
#. DialogueAfter = Gloria: The truth is... this isn't my ship. It's my stepfather's.
#. EDID: [01040764]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002056"
msgid "Sure, I can do that."
msgstr "그래, 그렇게 할 수 있어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC01
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Dialogue_700_WaitingForStepfather
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Gloria
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Voice
#. Face = Sarcastic
#. SoundFileID = 003164E6
#. ScriptNotes = Gloria sarcastic as she believes the player will leave her stranded in space. / Sarcastic / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Are you going to be okay?
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Are you going to be okay?
#. DialogueAfter = Gloria: I could take you to a spaceport if you want.
#. EDID: [0104D027]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002057"
msgid "Me? Oh, I'll be fine. I enjoy being stranded in outer space."
msgstr "나? 아, 난 괜찮을 거야. 우주 한복판에서 조난당하는 거 좋아하거든."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC01
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Dialogue_630_PlayerKnowsStory
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Gloria
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Voice
#. Face = Nervous
#. SoundFileID = 003738ED
#. ScriptNotes = As she prepares to leave with the player, she's still pretending that this is her ship, and that she didn't steal it from her stepfather. / Nervous / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Gloria: I didn't want to ask... but it'd be awesome if you could take me to my cousin's in New Atlantis.
#. EDID: [0104DEB3]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002058"
msgid "We can go right now, I have all I need."
msgstr "지금 바로 가도 돼. 필요한 건 다 챙겼어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC01
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Dialogue_630_PlayerKnowsStory
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Gloria
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Voice
#. Face = Happy
#. SoundFileID = 0086609B
#. ScriptNotes = She hands the player the master security keycard from the ship, hinting he can take stuff if he wants as a thank you for rescuing her. / Happy / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Gloria: I didn't want to ask... but it'd be awesome if you could take me to my cousin's in New Atlantis.
#. EDID: [0104DEB2]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002059"
msgid "Here, take this. I don't need it anymore."
msgstr "여기, 이거 가져가. 이제 나한텐 필요 없어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC01
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Dialogue_700_WaitingForStepfather
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00B7A3FA
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Gloria:
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Uh...yeah, I do want that.
#. EDID: [0104D01D]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00205A"
msgid "I could take you to a spaceport if you want."
msgstr "원하면 우주항까지 데려다줄 수 있어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC01
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Dialogue_700_WaitingForStepfather
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Gloria
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Voice
#. Face = Depressed
#. SoundFileID = 00A23301
#. ScriptNotes = Gloria feels caught in her situation, and would rather the player just leave her alone to worry about her stepfather coming to get his ship back. / Depressed / to Player Default
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: I could take you to a spaceport if you want.
#. EDID: [0104D022]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00205B"
msgid "You should go back to your ship now."
msgstr "이제 네 우주선으로 돌아가."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC01
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC01_GloriaSwansen_SC_Intimidation
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Gloria
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Voice
#. Face = Afraid
#. SoundFileID = 00F52D0E
#. ScriptNotes = Afraid
#. EDID: [0106B988]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00205C"
msgid "But but, you said you wouldn't hurt me!"
msgstr "하, 하지만 날 해치지 않겠다고 했잖아!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_BE_EC01
#. SceneName = SFFL_BE_EC01_GloriaSwansen_SC_Intimidation
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00C8EB5D
#. EDID: [0106B986]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00205D"
msgid "You'll tell me what I want to know, or else I'll hurt you."
msgstr "내가 알고 싶은 걸 말해. 안 그러면 널 다치게 할 거야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_EC01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Voice
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Voice
#. Face = Disgust
#. SoundFileID = 00CD274E
#. ScriptNotes = Reacting to the physical discomfort of grav jumping while aboard the player's ship. Not entirely serious, complaining for complaining's sake a bit. / Disgust
#. EDID: [0104DACC]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00205F"
msgid "Ugh. Grav jumping makes me feel nauseous..."
msgstr "으. 중력 도약을 하면 속이 울렁거려..."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_EC01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Voice
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Voice
#. Face = Happy
#. SoundFileID = 005C754A
#. ScriptNotes = Enthusiastically impatient. / Happy
#. EDID: [0104DACB]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002060"
msgid "I can't wait to get there."
msgstr "빨리 도착했으면 좋겠다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_EC01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Voice
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Voice
#. Face = Amused
#. SoundFileID = 00EBC3EB
#. ScriptNotes = Gloria showing some introspection and laughing at herself a bit, slightly embarrassed. / Amused
#. EDID: [0104DACA]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002061"
msgid "Wow, I really sounded like a kid just now, didn't I?"
msgstr "와, 방금 나 정말 애처럼 들렸지?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_EC01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Voice
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Voice
#. Face = Happy
#. SoundFileID = 0045B2ED
#. ScriptNotes = Gloria complains that this taking too long as they are crossing light-years in a few seconds on their way to New Atlantis. / Happy
#. EDID: [0104DACA]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002062"
msgid "Are we there yet?"
msgstr "아직 멀었어?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_EC01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Voice
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Voice
#. Face = Thinking
#. SoundFileID = 00E915B9
#. ScriptNotes = Starting to feel hopeful about the future. / Thinking
#. EDID: [0104DAC7]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002063"
msgid "Haven't been to New Atlantis in a while. I wonder if it's changed much..."
msgstr "뉴아틀란티스에 안 간 지 꽤 됐네. 많이 변했으려나..."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_EC01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Voice
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Voice
#. Face = Impressed
#. SoundFileID = 00223840
#. ScriptNotes = Complimenting the player on his ship as she comes aboard. Nice, but we don't know if she's sincere or not. / Impressed
#. EDID: [0104DAC5]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002064"
msgid "Nice ship you have here."
msgstr "우주선 좋네."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_EC01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = SamCoe
#. VoiceType = NPCMSamCoe
#. Face = Impressed
#. SoundFileID = 001E1ADE
#. ScriptNotes = Sam Coe commenting on the teenage runaway that has been rescued from a derelict ship she stole from her stepfather, and is now on player's ship. / Impressed
#. EDID: [0106C50B]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002065"
msgid "See, I told ya she was a teenager. A pretty ballsy one at that!"
msgstr "봐, 내가 십대라고 했잖아. 그것도 꽤 배짱 있는 애라니까!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_EC01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Andreja
#. VoiceType = NPCFAndreja
#. Face = Concerned
#. SoundFileID = 005D937E
#. ScriptNotes = Andreja commenting on the teenage runaway that has been rescued from a derelict ship she stole from her stepfather, and is now on player's ship. / Concerned
#. EDID: [0106C506]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002066"
msgid "Are you sure we should get involved?"
msgstr "우리가 이 일에 끼어들어도 되는 거 확실해?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_EC01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Andreja
#. VoiceType = NPCFAndreja
#. Face = Disgust
#. SoundFileID = 0069D971
#. ScriptNotes = Andreja commenting on the teenage runaway that has been rescued from a derelict ship she stole from her stepfather, and is now on player's ship. / Disgust
#. EDID: [0106C504]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002067"
msgid "Where I grew up this would not be tolerated."
msgstr "내가 자란 곳에선 이런 건 절대 용납되지 않았어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_EC01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Barrett
#. VoiceType = NPCMBarrett
#. Face = Thinking
#. SoundFileID = 00765B36
#. ScriptNotes = Companion commenting on the teenage runaway that has been rescued from a derelict ship she stole from her stepfather, and is now on player's ship. / Thinking
#. EDID: [0106C509]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002068"
msgid "I hope this act of kindness doesn't come back to haunt us..."
msgstr "이 친절이 나중에 우리 발목을 잡지 않았으면 좋겠군..."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_EC01
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE_EC01_90_DeclineHailScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = cargoShip
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Voice
#. Face = Spaceship / Relieved
#. SoundFileID = 00B5897D
#. ScriptNotes = Relieved that ship didn't respond to the Hail, but acting a bit too much casual about it. / Relieved
#. DialogueBefore = cargoShip:
#. EDID: [010485E8]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002069"
msgid "All right, see ya! I mean... over and out!"
msgstr "좋아, 또 봐! 아니... 통신 종료!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_EC01
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE_EC01_80_AcceptHailScene
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = cargoShip
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00169F57
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = cargoShip: Hey there, if you can hear me...we're fine! We don't need anything! &&& cargoShip: ...wait, is it this button? Or that one? &&& cargoShip: &&& cargoShip: Really, there's no need to respond.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: No, please! I'm in enough trouble already...we're fine! End communication!
#. EDID: [010485E5]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00206A"
msgid "I'm coming on board to help."
msgstr "승선해서 도와줄게."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_EC01
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE_EC01_80_AcceptHailScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = cargoShip
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Voice
#. Face = Spaceship / Nervous
#. SoundFileID = 000D2954
#. ScriptNotes = Trying to get the player's ship to just continue on their way, and not stop to help (as she's in a stolen ship and would get caught). / Nervous
#. DialogueBefore = cargoShip:
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Seems you're having problems. I can come aboard to help.
#. EDID: [010485FE]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00206B"
msgid "Really, there's no need to respond."
msgstr "정말 답장 안 해도 돼."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_EC01
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE_EC01_80_AcceptHailScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Voice
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Voice
#. Face = Spaceship / Nervous
#. SoundFileID = 004D2C5F
#. ScriptNotes = Trying to get the player's ship to just continue on their way, and not stop to help, pretending to lose the signal. / Nervous / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Seems you're having problems. I can come aboard to help.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Seems you're having problems. I can come aboard to help.
#. EDID: [010485E9]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00206C"
msgid "No, we're fine! Oops, starting to lose the signal now...okay bye!"
msgstr "아니, 우린 괜찮아! 앗, 이제 신호가 끊기려나 봐... 그래 안녕!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_EC01
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE_EC01_50_HailingShip
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = cargoShip
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Voice
#. Face = Spaceship / Irritated
#. SoundFileID = 001DCEE1
#. ScriptNotes = Trying to hail the player's ship to tell them to go away, not sure if they hear her. / Irritated
#. DialogueBefore = cargoShip: ...wait, is it this button? Or that one?
#. DialogueAfter = cargoShip: Really, there's no need to respond.
#. EDID: [010485F5]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00206D"
msgid "How can I tell if this thing is working?"
msgstr "이게 제대로 작동하는지 어떻게 알지?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_EC01
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE_EC01_550_GloriaGoodbye
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Gloria
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Voice
#. Face = Happy
#. SoundFileID = 006CCD25
#. ScriptNotes = Expressing confidence in an unknown yet potentially better future ahead of her. / Happy / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Where do you go from here?
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Where do you go from here?
#. DialogueAfter = Gloria: Good luck out there, <Alias=Gloria>.
#. EDID: [0104DABB]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00206E"
msgid "I don't know yet... Where my feet will take me, I guess. It's like an adventure!"
msgstr "아직 모르겠어... 발길 닿는 대로 가겠지. 모험 같잖아!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_EC01
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE_EC01_550_GloriaGoodbye
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Gloria
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Voice
#. Face = Friendly
#. SoundFileID = 00F02486
#. ScriptNotes = Grateful, but still pretending it was her ship (i.e. she never confessed about stealing it from her stepfather to the player). / Friendly / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Do you need anything else?
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Do you need anything else?
#. DialogueAfter = Gloria: Good luck out there, <Alias=Gloria>.
#. EDID: [0104DAC3]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00206F"
msgid "No that's fine. Thanks for the lift."
msgstr "아니, 괜찮아. 태워 줘서 고마워."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_EC01
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE_EC01_550_GloriaGoodbye
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Gloria
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Voice
#. Face = Nervous
#. SoundFileID = 00DD92D9
#. ScriptNotes = Expressing gratitude, but still holding up the facade that it was actually her ship (never confessed about stealing it to the player). / Nervous / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Are you going to be all right?
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Are you going to be all right?
#. DialogueAfter = Gloria: Good luck out there, <Alias=Gloria>.
#. EDID: [0104DAC0]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002070"
msgid "Sure. I'll find someone to, uh, help me get my ship back in order."
msgstr "그래. 내 우주선을, 어, 다시 손볼 수 있게 도와줄 사람을 찾아볼게."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_EC01
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE_EC01_550_GloriaGoodbye
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Gloria
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Voice
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 00006FE6
#. ScriptNotes = Sincerely grateful towards the player, expressing confidence in a new future. / Confident / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Are you going to be all right?
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Are you going to be all right?
#. DialogueAfter = Gloria: Good luck out there, <Alias=Gloria>.
#. EDID: [0104DABF]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002071"
msgid "Oh yeah. As long as I'm far away from my stepfather, I'll be fine."
msgstr "응. 의붓아버지한테서 멀리 떨어져 있기만 하면 괜찮을 거야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_EC01
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE_EC01_550_GloriaGoodbye
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Gloria
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0057312A
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Gloria: Well, I guess this is it.|Thank you so much for helping me. I'll never forget it. &&& Gloria: Here, take this. For being such a nice person.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Oh yeah. As long as I'm far away from my stepfather, I'll be fine.
#. EDID: [0104DABE]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002072"
msgid "Are you going to be all right?"
msgstr "괜찮겠어?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_EC01
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE_EC01_550_GloriaGoodbye
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 005A7177
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Gloria: Well, I guess this is it.|Thank you so much for helping me. I'll never forget it. &&& Gloria: Here, take this. For being such a nice person.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Thank you. Good luck to you too!
#. EDID: [0104DACF]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002073"
msgid "Good luck out there, <Alias=Gloria>."
msgstr "행운을 빌게. <Alias=Gloria>."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_EC01
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE_EC01_550_GloriaGoodbye
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Gloria
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Voice
#. Face = Grateful
#. SoundFileID = 00598FD5
#. ScriptNotes = If players were extra nice, she gives them a certain amount of credits as a thank you (though she might have stolen these from her stepfather). / Grateful / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Gloria: Well, I guess this is it.|Thank you so much for helping me. I'll never forget it.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Good luck out there, <Alias=Gloria>.
#. EDID: [0104DEB4]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002074"
msgid "Here, take this. For being such a nice person."
msgstr "여기, 이거 받아. 이렇게 좋은 사람이니까."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_EC01
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE_EC01_530_GloriaRadioGoodbye
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Gloria
#. VoiceType = SFFL_BE_EC01_Gloria_Voice
#. Face = Spaceship / Grateful
#. SoundFileID = 0092260C
#. ScriptNotes = After player has left Gloria on new Atlantis, he receives a heartfelt thank you message from her on the radio (if Gloria didn't say by in person). / Grateful
#. DialogueBefore = Gloria: Hey, I just wanted to thank you for helping me out there.
#. EDID: [0104DEB6]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002075"
msgid "I'll never forget it."
msgstr "절대 잊지 않을게."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ03
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMCutty
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMCutty
#. Face = Angry
#. SoundFileID = 00323A51
#. ScriptNotes = Angry, worried / Angry
#. EDID: [0106BBD9]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00207C"
msgid "Damn Spacers. Bloodthirsty savages, the lot of them."
msgstr "빌어먹을 스페이서들. 하나같이 피에 굶주린 야만인들이야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ03
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMMilesCutler
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMMilesCutler
#. Face = Relieved
#. SoundFileID = 000B336B
#. ScriptNotes = Relief, gratitude / Relieved
#. EDID: [0106BBD4]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00207D"
msgid "I thought that was the end for me."
msgstr "이걸로 끝이라고 생각했어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ03
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMMilesCutler
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMMilesCutler
#. Face = Relieved
#. SoundFileID = 00DF6AB7
#. ScriptNotes = Relief, gratitude / Relieved
#. EDID: [0106BBD3]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00207E"
msgid "You really saved me."
msgstr "정말 날 구해 줬어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ03
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMMilesCutler
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMMilesCutler
#. Face = Angry
#. SoundFileID = 000CCB23
#. ScriptNotes = Angry / Angry
#. EDID: [0106BBD0]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00207F"
msgid "Those bastards took my ship."
msgstr "그 자식들이 내 우주선을 빼앗아 갔어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ03
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMMilesCutler
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMMilesCutler
#. Face = Afraid
#. SoundFileID = 0027D875
#. ScriptNotes = Frightened desperation / Afraid
#. EDID: [0106BBCE]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002080"
msgid "Get me out of here, I'm begging you."
msgstr "제발, 날 여기서 꺼내 줘."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ03
#. SceneName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ03_MilesScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = MilesCutler
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMMilesCutler
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00B71AE6
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. EDID: [0104048A]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002081"
msgid "I'm afraid I've got nothing to offer you but gratitude. They took everything else."
msgstr "감사 말고는 줄 게 없어서 미안하군. 다른 건 전부 그들이 가져갔어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ03
#. SceneName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ03_MilesScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = MilesCutler
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMMilesCutler
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00A20A0B
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = MilesCutler: You're right. I think it's time to mend some old wounds.
#. EDID: [0104048A]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002082"
msgid "I'm going to rest here a little bit, and then use their transmitter to call Lucia for a lift."
msgstr "여기서 조금 쉰 다음, 그들의 송신기로 루시아에게 연락해서 태워 달라고 할게."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ03
#. SceneName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ03_MilesScene
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = MilesCutler
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00876AAA
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: If you want to talk about it, I'm listening. &&& MilesCutler: Yeah. You risked a lot coming out here, so it's the least I can do. &&& MilesCutler: He was a doctor, well-respected but arrogant.|My wife was about to give birth and there were complications. The life-threatening kind.|He demanded to do the surgery, but it wasn't his area of expertise.|His hubris cost both of their lives.|He left the very next day, and cut off all contact. &&& companion: It's not hard to understand how such a tragedy could tear a family apart.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: I guess so.
#. EDID: [010404A4]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002083"
msgid "You have every right to want him out of your life."
msgstr "네 인생에서 아버지를 지우고 싶겠네."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ03
#. SceneName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ03_MilesScene
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = MilesCutler
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 004D5533
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I'm here to rescue you. &&& MilesCutler: You have no idea how happy I am to hear those words. &&& MilesCutler: If you're here, that must mean Lucia made it out. Thank goodness.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Best damn co-pilot a guy could ask for.
#. EDID: [01040483]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002084"
msgid "[Lie] That's right. She's the one who hired me."
msgstr "[거짓말] 맞아. 날 고용한 건 그녀야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ03
#. SceneName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ03_MilesScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = MilesCutler
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMMilesCutler
#. Face = Question
#. SoundFileID = 00E7C0C7
#. ScriptNotes = Question / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = MilesCutler: You have no idea how happy I am to hear those words.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: She sent a message to your father, and he sent me.
#. EDID: [010404A0]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002085"
msgid "I'm guessing she must have sent you."
msgstr "그녀가 널 보낸 거겠지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ03
#. SceneName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ03_MilesScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMMilesCutler
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMMilesCutler
#. Face = Sad
#. SoundFileID = 00938B2C
#. ScriptNotes = Sad / to Player Default
#. Prompt = She sent a message to your father, and he sent me.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: If you want to talk about it, I'm listening.
#. EDID: [010404A2]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002086"
msgid "Truth is, after all this time, I'm starting to feel the same way."
msgstr "사실 이렇게 시간이 지나고 보니 나도 같은 생각이 들기 시작했어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ03
#. SceneName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ03_MilesScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMMilesCutler
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMMilesCutler
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0026E92D
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = She sent a message to your father, and he sent me.
#. EDID: [010404A2]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002087"
msgid "I really didn't think he wanted me in his life anymore."
msgstr "그가 더는 자기 삶에 나를 원하지 않는다고 생각했어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ03
#. SceneName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ03_MilesScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMMilesCutler
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMMilesCutler
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00A1725B
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = She sent a message to your father, and he sent me.
#. EDID: [010404A2]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002088"
msgid "I haven't seen or heard from him in so long."
msgstr "너무 오래 아버지를 보지도, 소식도 듣지도 못했거든."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ03
#. SceneName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ03_MilesScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMMilesCutler
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMMilesCutler
#. Face = Surprised
#. SoundFileID = 002B9203
#. ScriptNotes = Surprised / to Player Default
#. Prompt = She sent a message to your father, and he sent me.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: She sent a message to your father, and he sent me.
#. EDID: [010404A2]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002089"
msgid "I'm sorry, did you say my father?"
msgstr "미안한데, 내 아버지라고 했어?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ03
#. SceneName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ03_MilesScene
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = MilesCutler
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 009E650C
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = MilesCutler: Who are you? You're not one of them.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Wait, seriously? Those stories are true?
#. EDID: [01040488]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00208A"
msgid "I'm the famed galactic superhero called... The Mantis!"
msgstr "나는 은하계의 유명한 슈퍼히어로... 맨티스다!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ03
#. SceneName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ03_MilesScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = MilesCutler
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMMilesCutler
#. Face = Nervous
#. SoundFileID = 00B684AB
#. ScriptNotes = Apprehensive - is this friend or foe? / Nervous / to Player Default
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: I'm here to rescue you.
#. EDID: [01040491]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00208B"
msgid "Who are you? You're not one of them."
msgstr "누구지? 내가 아는 사람은 아닌 거 같은데."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ03
#. SceneName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ03_SC07EasySpecial
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = MilesCutler
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMMilesCutler
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00BAC491
#. ScriptNotes = Skeptical / to Player Default
#. EDID: [0106BBE7]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00208C"
msgid "I wish I could believe that."
msgstr "나도 그걸 믿을 수 있으면 좋겠어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ03
#. SceneName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ03_SC07EasySpecial
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = MilesCutler
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMMilesCutler
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00E01AA6
#. ScriptNotes = Thinking about things, coming around to the player's persuasive argument. / to Player Default
#. EDID: [0106BBE5]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00208D"
msgid "I guess I could have been wrong."
msgstr "내가 틀렸을 수도 있겠군."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ03
#. SceneName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ03_SC07EasySpecial
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 003398B7
#. ScriptNotes = / to MilesCutler
#. EDID: [0106BB9B]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00208E"
msgid "He said it was the greatest regret of his life."
msgstr "그게 평생 가장 큰 후회라고 했어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ03
#. SceneName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ03_SC07EasySpecial
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0006514A
#. ScriptNotes = / to MilesCutler
#. EDID: [0106BB99]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00208F"
msgid "Believe me, he regrets his actions."
msgstr "믿어 줘. 그는 자기 행동을 후회하고 있어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ03
#. SceneName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ03_SC06Hard
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = MilesCutler
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMMilesCutler
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00ED6976
#. ScriptNotes = Thinking about things, coming around to the player's persuasive argument. / to Player Default
#. EDID: [0106BBDD]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002090"
msgid "I've thought a lot about that. About being the better man."
msgstr "그 생각을 많이 했어. 더 나은 사람이 되는 것 말이야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ03
#. SceneName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ03_SC06Hard
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = MilesCutler
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMMilesCutler
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0006A9A8
#. ScriptNotes = Thinking about things, coming around to the player's persuasive argument. / to Player Default
#. EDID: [0106BBDB]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002091"
msgid "Maybe this has gone on long enough."
msgstr "어쩌면 이젠 충분히 오래 끌었는지도 몰라."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ03
#. SceneName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ03_SC06Hard
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 000A74FD
#. ScriptNotes = / to MilesCutler
#. EDID: [0106BB9F]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002092"
msgid "It's obvious he's suffering. You can put a stop to that."
msgstr "그가 괴로워하는 건 분명해. 네가 그걸 끝낼 수 있어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ03
#. SceneName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ03_SC06Hard
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00F3A08A
#. ScriptNotes = / to MilesCutler
#. EDID: [0106BB9D]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002093"
msgid "He's in pain and you're being selfish by not helping."
msgstr "그는 고통받고 있고, 네가 돕지 않는 건 이기적인 일이야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ03
#. SceneName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ03_SC05Hard
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = MilesCutler
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMMilesCutler
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0034CB0F
#. ScriptNotes = Thinking about things, coming around to the player's persuasive argument. / to Player Default
#. EDID: [0106BBFD]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002094"
msgid "Yeah, there's no denying that."
msgstr "그래, 부정할 수는 없지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ03
#. SceneName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ03_SC05Hard
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = MilesCutler
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMMilesCutler
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00BC4C47
#. ScriptNotes = Thinking about things, coming around to the player's persuasive argument. / to Player Default
#. EDID: [0106BBFB]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002095"
msgid "So it's on me, huh? Yeah, I think it is."
msgstr "결국 내 책임이라는 거군? 그래, 그런 것 같아."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ03
#. SceneName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ03_SC03Medium
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 003B20CF
#. ScriptNotes = / to MilesCutler
#. EDID: [0106BBB6]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002096"
msgid "You're his own flesh and blood. I promise, he wants to hear from you."
msgstr "넌 그의 혈육이야. 장담하는데, 그는 네 소식을 듣고 싶어 해."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ03
#. SceneName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ03_SC03Medium
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00C1EABE
#. ScriptNotes = / to MilesCutler
#. EDID: [0106BBB5]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002097"
msgid "He's your father. That has to count for something."
msgstr "그는 네 아버지야. 그 사실에도 의미는 있잖아."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ03
#. SceneName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ03_SC01Easy
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = MilesCutler
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMMilesCutler
#. Face = Sad
#. SoundFileID = 005D0C50
#. ScriptNotes = Thinking about things, coming around to the player's persuasive argument. Some regret. / Sad / to Player Default
#. EDID: [0106BBED]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002098"
msgid "It's funny, my wife used to say that too. I should have listened."
msgstr "웃기군. 내 아내도 늘 그렇게 말했어. 그 말을 들었어야 했는데."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ03
#. SceneName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ03_SC03Medium
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = MilesCutler
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMMilesCutler
#. Face = Sad
#. SoundFileID = 00914A5A
#. ScriptNotes = Sadness / Sad / to Player Default
#. EDID: [0106BBCC]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002099"
msgid "I don't know if my father will ever feel like family to me again."
msgstr "아버지가 다시 내 가족처럼 느껴질 날이 올지 모르겠어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ03
#. SceneName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ03_SC04Medium
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = MilesCutler
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMMilesCutler
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0066853B
#. ScriptNotes = Thinking about things, coming around to the player's persuasive argument. / to Player Default
#. EDID: [0106BBF5]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00209A"
msgid "Sometimes, my inability to get past all of this feels like my biggest weakness."
msgstr "가끔은 이 모든 걸 넘어서지 못하는 게 내 가장 큰 약점처럼 느껴져."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ03
#. SceneName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ03_SC02Easy
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = MilesCutler
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMMilesCutler
#. Face = Depressed
#. SoundFileID = 00BFA9C2
#. ScriptNotes = Thinking about things, coming around to the player's persuasive argument. Sadness as well. / Depressed / to Player Default
#. EDID: [0106BBBA]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00209B"
msgid "There are days when the grief of everything I've lost is unbearable."
msgstr "내가 잃은 모든 것에 대한 슬픔이 견딜 수 없을 만큼 커지는 날이 있어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ03
#. SceneName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ03_SC02Easy
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = MilesCutler
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMMilesCutler
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00946AD2
#. ScriptNotes = Thinking about things, coming around to the player's persuasive argument. / to Player Default
#. EDID: [0106BBB9]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00209C"
msgid "It's true. It still hurts to think about."
msgstr "맞아. 아직도 생각하면 아파."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ03
#. SceneName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ03_SC01Easy
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00B4F7E7
#. ScriptNotes = / to MilesCutler
#. EDID: [0106BB8A]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00209D"
msgid "You should reach out now. Nobody knows how much time we have."
msgstr "지금 연락해 봐. 우리에게 시간이 얼마나 남았는지는 아무도 몰라."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ03
#. SceneName = SFFL_AnchorpointZ03_MilesScene
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00D2BBBC
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: She sent a message to your father, and he sent me. &&& MilesCutler: I'm sorry, did you say my father?|I haven't seen or heard from him in so long.|I really didn't think he wanted me in his life anymore.|Truth is, after all this time, I'm starting to feel the same way.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Yeah. You risked a lot coming out here, so it's the least I can do.
#. EDID: [0106BBAA]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00209E"
msgid "If you want to talk about it, I'm listening."
msgstr "그 얘기를 하고 싶다면 들어줄게."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCFCivilian
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R03_NPCFCivilian01
#. Face = Confused
#. SoundFileID = 004F9323
#. ScriptNotes = Confused
#. EDID: [0104C41D]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00209F"
msgid "Uh... please respond, over."
msgstr "어... 응답 바란다, 오버."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMCivilian
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R03_NPCMCivilian01
#. Face = Confused
#. SoundFileID = 0074AA7E
#. ScriptNotes = Confused
#. EDID: [0104C41B]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0020A0"
msgid "Aren't you gonna say anything?"
msgstr "아무 말도 안 할 건가요?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMCivilian / NPCFCivilian
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R03_NPCMCivilian01 / SFFL_R03_NPCFCivilian01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0014E4EB
#. EDID: [0104C426]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0020A1"
msgid "Thanks a lot."
msgstr "정말 고마워요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMCivilian / NPCFCivilian
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R03_NPCMCivilian01 / SFFL_R03_NPCFCivilian01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 007715A0
#. EDID: [0104C424]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0020A2"
msgid "Thanks for doing this."
msgstr "이렇게 해 줘서 고마워요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. SceneName = SFFL_R03_175a_SpeakWithCaptain_Friendly_ShipDamaged
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Captain
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R03_NPCMCivilian01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00E39913
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: We won't have any problems if you don't make any problems.
#. EDID: SFFL_R03SharedInfo01_CaptainIntro02
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0020A3"
msgid "I... well, I feel I have to ask this, for my crew's sake. We can trust you, yeah? I don't want there to be any more problems after the day we just had."
msgstr ""
"저... 음, 우리 선원들을 위해 이건 물어봐야겠어요. 믿어도 되는 거죠? 오늘 같은 일을 겪고 나서 또 문제가 생기는 건 원치 않아요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. SceneName = SFFL_R03_175a_SpeakWithCaptain_Friendly_ShipDamaged
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Captain
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R03_NPCMCivilian01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0051FEA8
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. EDID: SFFL_R03SharedInfo01_CaptainIntro02
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0020A4"
msgid "We appreciate you doing this for us. I know it's a burden, but we'll stay out of your way as best we can."
msgstr "우리를 위해 이렇게 해 주셔서 고마워요. 부담되는 일인 건 알지만, 최대한 방해되지 않게 있을게요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. SceneName = SFFL_R03_100a_DefenderHailStart
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = HailingShip
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R03_NPCFCivilian01
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 006089D5
#. ScriptNotes = / to HailingShip
#. EDID: [0103D1C2]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0020A5"
msgid "Anyone there?"
msgstr "거기 누구 있나?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. SceneName = SFFL_R03_100a_DefenderHailStart
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = HailingShip
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R03_NPCFCivilian01
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00CAA043
#. ScriptNotes = not said desperately, just asking them to respond to your hail / to HailingShip
#. EDID: [0103D1C0]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0020A6"
msgid "Please respond. "
msgstr "응답 바란다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. SceneName = SFFL_R03_100b_DefenderHailAccepted
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = HailingShip
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R03_NPCFCivilian01
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00BFCDD7
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: I'll give you a ride.
#. EDID: [01052EA3]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0020A7"
msgid "Can you fly us out of here? "
msgstr "우리를 여기서 데리고 나가 줄 수 있나?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. SceneName = SFFL_R03_100b_DefenderHailAccepted
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = HailingShip
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R03_NPCFCivilian01
#. Face = Spaceship / Irritated
#. SoundFileID = 005B523D
#. ScriptNotes = Irritated
#. DialogueBefore = HailingShip:
#. EDID: [01052EA3]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0020A8"
msgid "We could've used your help back there. Our ship took heavy damage, and the captain's not sure if we'll be able to fly out of here."
msgstr "아까 당신 도움이 있었으면 좋았을 텐데. 우리 우주선이 큰 피해를 입어서, 선장도 여기서 날아나갈 수 있을지 확신하지 못해."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. SceneName = SFFL_R03_100b_DefenderHailAccepted
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = HailingShip
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R03_NPCFCivilian01
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00FCC69A
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral
#. EDID: [01052EA9]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0020A9"
msgid "Hate to put this on you, but could you fly us out of here?"
msgstr "이런 부탁해서 미안하지만, 우리를 여기서 데리고 나가 줄 수 있나?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. SceneName = SFFL_R03_100b_DefenderHailAccepted
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = HailingShip
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R03_NPCFCivilian01
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00889C7D
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral
#. EDID: [01052EA9]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0020AA"
msgid "Unfortunately, not all of us made it... we lost our pilot. The rest of us crew aren't trained to pilot this class of ship."
msgstr "안타깝게도 모두 살아남진 못했어... 조종사를 잃었거든. 남은 선원들은 이 등급 우주선을 조종하는 훈련을 받지 않았어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. SceneName = SFFL_R03_100b_DefenderHailAccepted
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = HailingShip
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R03_NPCFCivilian01
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00095CE8
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral
#. DialogueBefore = HailingShip:
#. EDID: [01052EA9]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0020AB"
msgid "Thanks for the help back there."
msgstr "아까 도와줘서 고마워."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. SceneName = SFFL_R03_100b_DefenderHailAccepted
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = HailingShip
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R03_NPCFCivilian01
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0034FBC0
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral
#. EDID: [0103D1B8]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0020AC"
msgid "Could you fly us home?"
msgstr "우리를 집까지 데려다줄 수 있나?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. SceneName = SFFL_R03_100b_DefenderHailAccepted
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = HailingShip
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R03_NPCFCivilian01
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0024EE95
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral
#. EDID: [0103D1B8]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0020AD"
msgid "Our ship got torn up during the attack. The captain isn't sure we can fly it back home safely. "
msgstr "공격 중에 우리 우주선이 엉망이 됐어. 선장도 이걸 무사히 집까지 몰고 갈 수 있을지 확신하지 못해."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. SceneName = SFFL_R03_100b_DefenderHailAccepted
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = HailingShip
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R03_NPCFCivilian01
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 008FE106
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral
#. DialogueBefore = HailingShip:
#. EDID: [0103D1B8]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0020AE"
msgid "Appreciate the assist, but I'm afraid I have to ask for your help again. "
msgstr "도와준 건 고맙지만, 아무래도 한 번 더 도움을 부탁해야겠어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. SceneName = SFFL_R03_175a_SpeakWithCaptain_Betrayal_ShipDamaged01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMCivilian
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R03_NPCMCivilian01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00C3EF0D
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Thanks.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Thanks.
#. DialogueAfter = Captain: The thing is, we aren't who you think we are.
#. EDID: [01053D81]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0020AF"
msgid "Yeah, I have an eye for ships. *Sigh* I Should've just been a mechanic. Would've kept me out of a lot of trouble."
msgstr "그래, 난 우주선 보는 눈이 있어. *한숨* 그냥 정비사가 될 걸 그랬어. 그랬으면 골치 아픈 일도 훨씬 줄었을 텐데."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. SceneName = SFFL_R03_175a_SpeakWithCaptain_Friendly_ShipDamaged
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00DC667F
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: We won't have any problems if you don't make any problems. &&& Captain: *Sigh* Fair enough, I guess. &&& Captain: I'm not trying to start a fight here. I appreciate you helping us, but a bit of caution is reasonable after what just happened.|Sorry if I offended you.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Sounds good, and thanks again.
#. EDID: [0103EDFA]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0020B0"
msgid "No offense taken. We should get going, now."
msgstr "기분 나쁘지 않아요. 이제 출발해야 돼요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. SceneName = SFFL_R03_175a_SpeakWithCaptain_Friendly_ShipDamaged
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Captain
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R03_NPCMCivilian01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 001ABB31
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: No offense taken. We should get going, now.
#. EDID: [010530D8]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0020B1"
msgid "Sorry."
msgstr "미안해요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. SceneName = SFFL_R03_175a_SpeakWithCaptain_Friendly_ShipDamaged
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Captain
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R03_NPCMCivilian01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 005B12FB
#. DialogueBefore = Captain: *Sigh* Fair enough, I guess.
#. EDID: [010530D8]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0020B2"
msgid "Look, forget I said anything. We're all just a little shaken up after the attack. "
msgstr "제가 한 말은 잊어 주세요. 공격 이후로 우리 모두 좀 혼란스러운 것뿐이에요. "

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. SceneName = SFFL_R03_175a_SpeakWithCaptain_Friendly_ShipDamaged
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Captain
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R03_NPCMCivilian01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00439D69
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = If I'm so suspicious, you better find another ride.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: If I'm so suspicious, you better find another ride.
#. DialogueAfter = Captain: I'm not trying to start a fight here. I appreciate you helping us, but a bit of caution is reasonable after what just happened.
#. EDID: [010530D1]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0020B3"
msgid "I didn't mean it like that."
msgstr "그런 뜻은 아니었어요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. SceneName = SFFL_R03_175a_SpeakWithCaptain_Friendly_ShipDamaged01
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0010FAD7
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Sorry about your ship. I wish I got here sooner. &&& Captain: It is what it is. I'm not looking for sympathy. &&& Captain: *Sigh* Jesus, I need to get a grip. You're helping us out and here I am, complaining to you like an asshole. |It's been a long and bad day.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Okay, we're all packed up and ready to go.
#. EDID: [0104C422]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0020B4"
msgid "I get it, but we should get going now."
msgstr "이해해요. 하지만 이제 가야 해요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. SceneName = SFFL_R03_175a_SpeakWithCaptain_Friendly_ShipDamaged01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMCivilian
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R03_NPCMCivilian01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0095866C
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = I get it, but we should get going now.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I get it, but we should get going now.
#. EDID: [010530CB]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0020B5"
msgid "All right, we're all ready to go."
msgstr "좋아요. 다들 출발할 준비 됐어요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. SceneName = SFFL_R03_175a_SpeakWithCaptain_Friendly_ShipDamaged01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Captain
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R03_NPCMCivilian01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0039BD98
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Any idea why those Spacers targeted you?
#. DialogueAfter = Captain: Sorry about your ship. I wish I got here sooner.
#. EDID: [0104C429]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0020B6"
msgid "I'm just glad they got what's coming to 'em."
msgstr "녀석들이 응분의 대가를 치렀다니 다행이에요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. SceneName = SFFL_R03_175a_SpeakWithCaptain_Friendly_ShipDamaged01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Captain
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R03_NPCMCivilian01
#. Face = Irritated
#. SoundFileID = 002F5F8E
#. ScriptNotes = Irritated / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Any idea why those Spacers targeted you?
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Any idea why those Spacers targeted you?
#. EDID: [0104C429]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0020B7"
msgid "How the hell would I know? Spacers will be Spacers. They see a ship and they want to blow it up."
msgstr "제가 그걸 어떻게 알아요? 스페이서는 원래 그런 놈들이에요. 우주선이 보이면 터뜨리고 싶어 하잖아요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. SceneName = SFFL_R03_175a_SpeakWithCaptain_Betrayal_ShipDamaged
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Captain
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R03_NPCMCivilian01
#. Face = Irritated
#. SoundFileID = 00C89CC7
#. ScriptNotes = Irritated / to Player Default
#. Prompt = If you think I'm so suspicious, I'll leave.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: If you think I'm so suspicious, I'll leave.
#. EDID: [01053D8A]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0020B8"
msgid "No need to get defensive. I have to ask. I have a crew to look after."
msgstr "방어적으로 나올 필요 없어. 물어봐야 했어. 내가 돌봐야 할 선원들이 있으니까."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. SceneName = SFFL_R03_175a_SpeakWithCaptain_Friendly_PilotKilled01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Captain
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R03_NPCMCivilian01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0038B0E2
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral
#. DialogueBefore = Captain:
#. DialogueAfter = Captain: Anyway, we're ready to leave whenever you are.
#. EDID: [010539D7]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0020B9"
msgid "*Sigh* This is really not how I saw this day going. Supposed to be a quick delivery job. Yeah, right..."
msgstr "*한숨* 오늘 이렇게 될 줄은 정말 몰랐어요. 간단한 배달 일만 하면 됐는데. 예, 기가 막히네요.."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. SceneName = SFFL_R03_175a_SpeakWithCaptain_Friendly_PilotKilled01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMCivilian
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R03_NPCMCivilian01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00383030
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Sorry about your pilot.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Sorry about your pilot.
#. EDID: [010539DE]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0020BA"
msgid "This was the first time we worked with him. Poor bastard. "
msgstr "그 조종사와 같이 일한 건 이번이 처음이었어요. 불쌍한 친구죠. "

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. SceneName = SFFL_R03_175a_SpeakWithCaptain_Friendly_PilotKilled01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMCivilian
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R03_NPCMCivilian01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00ED7007
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Sorry about your pilot.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Sorry about your pilot.
#. EDID: [010539DD]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0020BB"
msgid "You don't need to apologize. It's not like you killed him."
msgstr "사과할 필요 없어요. 당신이 조종사를 죽인 것도 아니잖아요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. SceneName = SFFL_R03_175a_SpeakWithCaptain_Friendly_PilotKilled01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMCivilian
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R03_NPCMCivilian01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 000F053B
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Sorry about your pilot.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Sorry about your pilot.
#. EDID: [010530CC]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0020BC"
msgid "Yeah, he was a solid pilot, but to be honest, I didn't really know much about him. "
msgstr "예, 실력 있는 조종사였어요. 하지만 솔직히 잘 아는 사이는 아니에요. "

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. SceneName = SFFL_R03_175a_SpeakWithCaptain_Friendly_PilotKilled
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Captain
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R03_NPCMCivilian01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00706087
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral
#. DialogueBefore = Captain: *Sigh* Anyway, thanks for giving us a ride out of here.
#. EDID: [010530E8]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0020BD"
msgid "Nothing we can do now but move on. "
msgstr "이제 우리가 할 수 있는 건 앞으로 나아가는 것뿐이에요. "

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. SceneName = SFFL_R03_175a_SpeakWithCaptain_Friendly_PilotKilled
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Captain
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R03_NPCMCivilian01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 008FD911
#. DialogueBefore = Captain: *Sigh* Anyway, thanks for giving us a ride out of here.
#. EDID: [010530E6]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0020BE"
msgid "We're ready to leave whenever you are. Thanks for this."
msgstr "저희는 언제든 떠날 준비가 되어 있어요. 고마워요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. SceneName = SFFL_R03_175a_SpeakWithCaptain_Friendly_PilotKilled
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Captain
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R03_NPCMCivilian01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00C0430A
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Do you have any idea why the Spacers attacked you?
#. DialogueAfter = Captain: I'm sorry about your pilot.
#. EDID: [010530F1]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0020BF"
msgid "We were just minding our business, and then, bam. They came out of nowhere and started firing on us."
msgstr "우리는 그냥 일을 하고 있었는데, 갑자기 쾅. 녀석들이 난데없이 나타나 우리에게 발사하기 시작했어요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. SceneName = SFFL_R03_175a_SpeakWithCaptain_Friendly_PilotKilled
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Captain
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R03_NPCMCivilian01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 005EB027
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Do you have any idea why the Spacers attacked you?
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Do you have any idea why the Spacers attacked you?
#. EDID: [010530F1]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0020C0"
msgid "Your guess is as good as anyone else's. Who knows?"
msgstr "저도 다른 사람들처럼 몰라요. 누가 알겠어요?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. SceneName = SFFL_R03_175a_SpeakWithCaptain_Friendly_PilotKilled
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Captain
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00583F50
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Captain: Good to see you. We need all the help we can get, now.|Can't believe it. We were so close to getting out of that attack in one piece. Then they scored a direct hit on the cockpit, and...
#. EDID: [010530EF]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0020C1"
msgid "Do you have any idea why the Spacers attacked you?"
msgstr "스페이서들이 왜 당신들을 공격했는지 짐작 가는 게 있어?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. SceneName = SFFL_R03_175a_SpeakWithCaptain_Friendly_PilotKilled
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Captain
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00988B3E
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Captain: Good to see you. We need all the help we can get, now.|Can't believe it. We were so close to getting out of that attack in one piece. Then they scored a direct hit on the cockpit, and...
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: You're right.
#. EDID: [010530E5]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0020C2"
msgid "My condolences, but we need to get moving. More spacers could jump in at any moment."
msgstr "애도는 표하지만, 우린 움직여야 해. 스페이서들이 언제든 더 도약해 올 수 있어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. SceneName = SFFL_R03_175a_SpeakWithCaptain_Friendly_PilotKilled
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMCivilian
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R03_NPCMCivilian01
#. Face = Depressed
#. SoundFileID = 004AE228
#. ScriptNotes = Depressed / to Player Default
#. Prompt = I'm sorry about your pilot.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I'm sorry about your pilot.
#. DialogueAfter = Captain: *Sigh* Anyway, thanks for giving us a ride out of here.
#. EDID: [010530FA]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0020C3"
msgid "Thanks. He was great. He got us out of all sorts of jams, but I guess his luck ran out today."
msgstr "고마워요. 그 조종사는 훌륭했어요. 온갖 위기에서 우릴 구해 줬는데, 오늘은 운이 다했나 봐요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. SceneName = SFFL_R03_175a_SpeakWithCaptain_Betrayal_PilotKilled01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Captain
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R03_NPCMCivilian01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0061E435
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral
#. DialogueBefore = Captain:
#. DialogueAfter = Captain: The thing is, we aren't who you think we are.
#. EDID: [01053D8F]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0020C4"
msgid "*Sigh* God, I need a break. I'm so sick of fighting. Fighting to take over this ship, fighting the Spacers, now we have to fight you, don't we?"
msgstr ""
"*한숨* 세상에, 좀 쉬고 싶네. 싸움이라면 이제 질렸어. 이 우주선을 차지하려고 싸우고, 스페이서와 싸우고, 이제는 너랑도 싸워야 하는 "
"거지?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. SceneName = SFFL_R03_175a_SpeakWithCaptain_Betrayal_PilotKilled01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Captain
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R03_NPCMCivilian01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 004D0687
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral
#. DialogueBefore = Captain:
#. DialogueAfter = Captain: The thing is, we aren't who you think we are.
#. EDID: [01053D8D]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0020C5"
msgid "You actually seem like a nice person. I almost wish I didn't have to do this."
msgstr "사실 넌 괜찮은 사람 같아. 이걸 안 해도 됐으면 좋겠다는 생각이 들 정도야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. SceneName = SFFL_R03_175a_SpeakWithCaptain_Betrayal_PilotKilled01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Captain
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R03_NPCMCivilian01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 008C6F35
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral / to Player Default
#. Prompt = My condolences, but we should get moving before more Spacers show up.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: My condolences, but we should get moving before more Spacers show up.
#. EDID: [01053D73]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0020C6"
msgid "No condolences necessary. He was a pain in the neck."
msgstr "애도는 필요 없어. 녀석은 골칫덩이였거든."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. SceneName = SFFL_R03_175a_SpeakWithCaptain_Betrayal_PilotKilled01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Captain
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R03_NPCMCivilian01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 002CC72A
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral / to Player Default
#. Prompt = My condolences, but we should get moving before more Spacers show up.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: My condolences, but we should get moving before more Spacers show up.
#. EDID: [01053D71]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0020C7"
msgid "Huh, didn't think of that."
msgstr "허, 그 생각은 못 했네."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. SceneName = SFFL_R03_175a_SpeakWithCaptain_Betrayal_PilotKilled01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMCivilian
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R03_NPCMCivilian01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00386E7B
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Sorry about your pilot.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Sorry about your pilot.
#. EDID: [01053D9E]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0020C8"
msgid "He was a good guy, yeah."
msgstr "그래, 좋은 사람이었어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. SceneName = SFFL_R03_175a_SpeakWithCaptain_Betrayal_PilotKilled01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMCivilian
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R03_NPCMCivilian01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00A0EAA2
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Sorry about your pilot.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Sorry about your pilot.
#. EDID: [01053D9D]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0020C9"
msgid "Huh? Oh, yeah. I didn't know him much. We practically just met."
msgstr "응? 아, 그래. 조종사랑 잘 아는 사이는 아니었어. 사실상 막 만난 사이였거든."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. SceneName = SFFL_R03_175a_SpeakWithCaptain_Betrayal_PilotKilled01
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 001A7E47
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Captain:
#. EDID: [01053D65]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0020CA"
msgid "Sorry about your pilot."
msgstr "조종사 일은 유감이야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. SceneName = SFFL_R03_175a_SpeakWithCaptain_Betrayal_ShipDamaged
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Captain
#. VoiceType = SFFL_R03_NPCMCivilian01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00792453
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral
#. DialogueBefore = Captain:
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: I can fly my own ship.
#. EDID: [01053D83]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0020CB"
msgid "Tell you what. You let me and my crew fly your ship. You can just relax. What do you say?"
msgstr "이렇게 하자. 나랑 내 선원들이 네 우주선을 몰게 해 줘. 넌 그냥 쉬고 있으면 돼. 어때?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_R03
#. SceneName = SFFL_R03_175a_SpeakWithCaptain_Betrayal_ShipDamaged
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Captain
