#. EDID: [010358A4]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0020F3"
msgid "Milli was petnapped. I had to get her back."
msgstr "밀리가 납치됐었어. 다시 데려오러 갔다 왔어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_3200_Yura_MainEndScene
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Yura
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00A2C5BF
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Atka: What do you mean "the pet sitter" has Milli? You were supposed to be taking care of her. &&& Yura: And I am! Hiring another pet sitter is taking care of her. &&& Yura: And look, just in time. &&& Yura: Don't talk to me!
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Wait, Roman? What was he even doing with Milli?
#. EDID: [0103587E]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0020F4"
msgid "Getting Milli back from your friend, Roman."
msgstr "네 친구 로만한테서 밀리를 되찾아 왔어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_3200_Yura_MainEndScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Yura
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFYura
#. Face = Confused
#. SoundFileID = 00219C72
#. ScriptNotes = Confused / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Getting Milli back from your friend, Roman.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Getting Milli back from your friend, Roman.
#. DialogueAfter = Yura: Roman took Milli and was holding her for ransom.
#. EDID: [01035887]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0020F5"
msgid "Wait, Roman? What was he even doing with Milli?"
msgstr "잠깐, 로만? 로만이 밀리를 데리고 뭘 하고 있었는데?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_3100_Yura_AtkaScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Atka
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFAtka
#. Face = Concerned
#. SoundFileID = 005BDCF3
#. ScriptNotes = Arguing. Emphasis on "YOU were supposed to be taking care of her." / Concerned / to Yura
#. DialogueAfter = Yura: And I am! Hiring another pet sitter is taking care of her.
#. EDID: [01035879]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0020F6"
msgid "What do you mean \"the pet sitter\" has Milli? You were supposed to be taking care of her."
msgstr "'임시 집사'가 밀리를 데리고 있다니? 네가 돌보기로 했잖아."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_0140_Yura_IntroPostRejectionScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Yura
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFYura
#. Face = Friendly
#. SoundFileID = 00FE4D4C
#. ScriptNotes = Friendly / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Yura: A few more credits never hurt anyone, right?
#. DialogueAfter = Yura: It's this cutesy place on Muphrid IV, and you'll be taking care of her little milliwhale, Milli.
#. EDID: [01035881]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0020F7"
msgid "Here's the key to Atka's house."
msgstr "여기 아트카 집 열쇠야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_3200_Yura_MainEndScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Atka
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFAtka
#. Face = Concerned
#. SoundFileID = 00B4CD0D
#. ScriptNotes = Concerned / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Atka: If Yura hired you, I'm not surprised.
#. DialogueAfter = Atka: Oh, and since you kept Milli safe, keep the food.
#. EDID: [01035DAD]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0020F8"
msgid "Here's what I intended to pay Yura, plus a little extra for the trouble."
msgstr "유라에게 주려던 일당에, 수고비를 조금 더 얹었어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_3200_Yura_MainEndScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Atka
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFAtka
#. Face = Relieved
#. SoundFileID = 00E4DF7B
#. ScriptNotes = Relieved / to Player Default
#. Prompt = [Lie] It really was just a walk. Milli is fine.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: [Lie] It really was just a walk. Milli is fine.
#. DialogueAfter = Atka: And, miraculously, all my plants are still alive.
#. EDID: [01035876]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0020F9"
msgid "Well, she certainly seems fine, so I guess Yura was telling the truth for once."
msgstr "뭐, 확실히 멀쩡해 보이니 이번만큼은 유라가 사실을 말했나 보네."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_3200_Yura_MainEndScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Yura
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFYura
#. Face = Irritated
#. SoundFileID = 0045BD5A
#. ScriptNotes = Scene re-entry. / Irritated / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Yura: And look, just in time.
#. DialogueAfter = Yura: I don't see how the timing is my fault.
#. EDID: [0106C85A]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0020FA"
msgid "I can't believe Atka came home early and Milli was nowhere to be found."
msgstr "아트카가 일찍 돌아왔는데 밀리가 어디에도 없다니 믿을 수가 없어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_3200_Yura_MainEndScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Yura
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFYura
#. Face = Angry
#. SoundFileID = 001B12DE
#. ScriptNotes = Scene re-entry. Player said they killed Roman. Very upset. / Angry / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Yura: And look, just in time.
#. DialogueAfter = Atka: I think I should get paid.
#. EDID: [0106C851]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0020FB"
msgid "Don't talk to me!"
msgstr "말 걸지 마!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1200_Roman_MainRansomScene
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Roman
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00778ABF
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Nice doing business with you. &&& Roman: Who are you?
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Whoa, hey, no one has to die here today, least not over some damn milliwhale.
#. EDID: [01035D98]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0020FC"
msgid "In that case, hand over Milli, or we do this the hard way."
msgstr "그렇다면 밀리를 넘겨. 아니면 험한 방법으로 가는 거야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1200_Roman_MainRansomScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Roman
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRomanKreutz
#. Face = Amused
#. SoundFileID = 006DE2C4
#. ScriptNotes = Amused / to Player Default
#. Prompt = I'm here to negotiate.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I'm here to negotiate.
#. DialogueAfter = Roman: All right, enough of this bullshit.
#. EDID: [01035867]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0020FD"
msgid "Negotiate? Sorry, I'm an all or nothing kind of guy."
msgstr "협상? 미안하지만 난 모 아니면 도인 사람이야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1200_Roman_MainRansomScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Roman
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRomanKreutz
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 003932C5
#. ScriptNotes = Scene reentry. Demanding. / Confident / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Nice doing business with you.
#. DialogueAfter = Roman: Pay <Global=SFFL_MS03_RansomCredits>: Here's your credits.
#. EDID: [0106C843]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0020FE"
msgid "So, you gonna pay up or get the hell outta here?"
msgstr "그래서 돈 낼 거야? 아니면 당장 꺼질 거야?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1200_Roman_MainRansomScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Roman
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRomanKreutz
#. Face = Shocked
#. SoundFileID = 006AEBFA
#. ScriptNotes = Scene re-entry. Player used a Starborn choice showing they already know about Yura. Shocked, a little confused. / Shocked / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Nice doing business with you.
#. DialogueAfter = Roman: Doesn't matter. I know you like her. I'll put in a good word.
#. EDID: [0106C841]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0020FF"
msgid "Who are you?"
msgstr "넌 누구야?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_0100_Yura_IntroBranchNoScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Yura
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFYura
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 0010FB20
#. ScriptNotes = Confident
#. DialogueBefore = Yura: I knew you'd be the one.
#. DialogueAfter = Yura: Instructions are on the counter. Find me back here to get paid, and you're good to go!
#. EDID: [01035895]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002100"
msgid "So, here's the key to my sister Atka's house. She lives on Muphrid IV, outside of the Freestar Collective."
msgstr "자, 여기 아트카 언니 집 열쇠. 언니는 무프리드 IV에 살아. 자유항성 공동체 영역 밖이지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_0100_Yura_IntroBranchNoScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Yura
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFYura
#. Face = Friendly
#. SoundFileID = 00BA7AD6
#. ScriptNotes = Friendly / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Pets I have time for. People not so much.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Pets I have time for. People not so much.
#. DialogueAfter = Yura: So, here's the key to my sister Atka's house. She lives on Muphrid IV, outside of the Freestar Collective.
#. EDID: [010358AB]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002101"
msgid "You know, we are polar opposites, but that's why you're perfect for this!"
msgstr "있잖아, 우리 성격이 완전 정반대잖아. 그래서 네가 이 일에 딱 맞을 거야!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_0100_Yura_IntroMainScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Yura
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFYura
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 00D98C75
#. ScriptNotes = Confident / to Player Default
#. Prompt = I don't house sit. Find someone else.
#. DialogueAfter = Yura: I'm interested in credits.
#. EDID: [010358C2]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002102"
msgid "Did I mention credits would be involved?"
msgstr "크레딧도 준다고 내가 말 안했나?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_0100_Yura_IntroMainScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Yura
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFYura
#. Face = Shocked
#. SoundFileID = 004AC53A
#. ScriptNotes = Shocked / to Player Default
#. Prompt = I don't house sit. Find someone else.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I don't house sit. Find someone else.
#. EDID: [010358C2]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002103"
msgid "Wow, really? You'd let a poor, innocent creature die?"
msgstr "와, 진심이야? 불쌍하고 순진무구한 생물이 죽게 내버려둘 거야?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_0100_Yura_IntroMainScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Yura
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFYura
#. Face = Friendly
#. SoundFileID = 00A3F820
#. ScriptNotes = Friendly / to Player Default
#. Prompt = I don't have time for this.
#. DialogueAfter = Yura: I'm interested in credits.
#. EDID: [0103587C]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002104"
msgid "Oh and I know I said \"favor,\" but it's not like you wouldn't get paid."
msgstr "아, 그리고 내가 '부탁'이라고 하긴 했지만, 보수를 안 주겠다는 건 아니야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_0100_Yura_IntroMainScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Yura
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFYura
#. Face = Shocked
#. SoundFileID = 00447F26
#. ScriptNotes = Shocked / to Player Default
#. Prompt = I don't have time for this.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I don't have time for this.
#. EDID: [0103587C]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002105"
msgid "You don't have time to care for an innocent, helpless little pet? "
msgstr "작고 순진무구하고 나약한 애완동물 한 마리 잠시 돌봐줄 시간도 없어? "

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_0100_Yura_IntroMainScene
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Yura
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00684C47
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Yura: So, how about that house sitting job? You in?
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: You, my friend, are a life saver.
#. EDID: [01035861]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002106"
msgid "Sure, let's hear it."
msgstr "좋아. 들어나 볼까."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_0100_Yura_IntroMainScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCFYura
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFYura
#. Face = Friendly
#. SoundFileID = 009A88EB
#. ScriptNotes = Friendly / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Depends on what it is.
#. DialogueAfter = companion: Such work is beneath us, but it does sound oddly satisfying.
#. EDID: [010358B6]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002107"
msgid "All you have to do is water a few plants and feed a little milliwhale until my sister gets home."
msgstr "언니가 집에 올 때까지 식물 화분에 물 주고 자그마한 밀리고래에게 밥만 주면 돼."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_0100_Yura_IntroMainScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCFYura
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFYura
#. Face = Friendly
#. SoundFileID = 00224862
#. ScriptNotes = Salesman. She's got an offer you can't refuse. / Friendly / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Depends on what it is.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Depends on what it is.
#. EDID: [010358B6]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002108"
msgid "Oh you're gonna love it. Easiest credits you'll ever make!"
msgstr "분명 마음에 들 거야. 살면서 가장 쉽게 크레딧 버는 일일걸!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_0100_Yura_IntroMainScene
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00BD22A3
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Yura: So, how about that house sitting job? You in?
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Oh you're gonna love it. Easiest credits you'll ever make!
#. EDID: [01035890]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002109"
msgid "Depends on what it is."
msgstr "일이 뭔지에 따라 다르지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_0100_Yura_IntroMainScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Yura
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFYura
#. Face = Friendly
#. SoundFileID = 009296D0
#. ScriptNotes = Friendly / to Player Default
#. DialogueAfter = Yura: Count us in.
#. EDID: [01035899]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00210A"
msgid "I heard what you did for the station, taking out those Spacers, and I was hoping you could do me just the tiniest of favors."
msgstr "우주정거장에서 얘기를 들었어. 네가 스페이서들을 처리했다면서? 그래서 아주 사소한 부탁 하나만 들어 줄 수 있을까 해서."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_0100_Yura_IntroMainScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Yura
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFYura
#. Face = Friendly
#. SoundFileID = 003ACE92
#. ScriptNotes = Friendly / to Player Default
#. EDID: [01035899]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00210B"
msgid "Ah, so I did catch your attention. "
msgstr "아, 이제야 내가 부르는 걸 들었나 보네. "

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_0100_Yura_CallOutScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Yura
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFYura
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 005FCF22
#. ScriptNotes = Calling the player over from across a room. / Confident / to Player Default
#. EDID: [010358B8]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00210C"
msgid "Hey, hold up!"
msgstr "저기, 잠깐만!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1200_Roman_SC_Generic02Scene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Roman
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRomanKreutz
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 00042310
#. ScriptNotes = Speech challenge lose: Do you really want to risk everyone here over a milliwhale? / Confident / to Player Default
#. EDID: [01035A7A]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00210D"
msgid "The way I see it, you're the only one taking risks here."
msgstr "내가 보기엔, 여기서 위험을 무릅쓰고 있는 건 너 하나뿐이야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1200_Roman_SC_Generic02Scene
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00BA4914
#. ScriptNotes = / to Roman
#. EDID: [01035A76]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00210E"
msgid "Do you really want to risk everyone here over a milliwhale?"
msgstr "밀리고래 하나 때문에 여기 있는 모두를 위험에 빠뜨리고 싶어?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1200_Roman_SC_Repeatable01Scene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Roman
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRomanKreutz
#. Face = Smirk
#. SoundFileID = 00D34BFA
#. ScriptNotes = Speech challenge lose: You're not going to consider lowering the price? / Smirk / to Player Default
#. EDID: [01059D74]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00210F"
msgid "At this point, I'm considering raising the price."
msgstr "이쯤에서 값을 올릴까 생각 중이야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1200_Roman_SC_Repeatable01Scene
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00D9820C
#. ScriptNotes = / to Roman
#. EDID: [01059D7E]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002110"
msgid "That ransom's too high. You're being unreasonable here."
msgstr "그 몸값은 너무 비싸. 지금 말이 안 되는 요구를 하고 있어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1200_Roman_SC_Repeatable01Scene
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00B476AC
#. ScriptNotes = / to Roman
#. EDID: [01059D7D]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002111"
msgid "You're not going to consider lowering the price?"
msgstr "가격을 낮출 생각은 없어?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1200_Roman_MainBranchYura02Scene
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00DD1F15
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: You should tell her how you feel. She'd appreciate that even more. &&& Roman: That's what everyone keeps telling me... I just don't want to ruin everything if I make the wrong call.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: And here I was thinking you were broke.
#. EDID: [01035D85]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002112"
msgid "Pay <Global=SFFL_MS03_RansomCredits>: Here's your credits."
msgstr "[<Global=SFFL_MS03_RansomCredits> 크레딧 주기] 여기 크레딧이야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1200_Roman_MainBranchYura02Scene
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Roman
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 004016F5
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: So this is all some plan to entertain Yura? &&& Roman: No, it's more than that. I wanted to put this all together to impress her.|I.. I thought it would show how much I care about her, but obviously, I've failed miserably.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Oh yeah, well if I recall, you don't have the credits.
#. EDID: [01059D1F]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002113"
msgid "Nice story, but I'm just here for Milli."
msgstr "이야기는 잘 들었지만 난 밀리 때문에 왔어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1200_Roman_MainBranchYura02Scene
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Roman
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00B3D210
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I'm here to negotiate. &&& ... &&& Roman: The question is, what does Yura have to do with any of this? &&& Roman: Yura has everything to do with this, it's all for her. &&& Roman: She hates house sitting so we thought we'd shake things up a bit. Stage a little petnapping, maybe make a few credits on the side...|Never crossed my mind she'd bail on her sister and get someone else to take her place.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Damn, maybe you're right.
#. EDID: [01035D89]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002114"
msgid "Shows how much you know about Yura."
msgstr "네가 유라를 얼마나 모르는지 알겠네."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
