#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: If you give me Milli, I'll put in a good word for you.
#. EDID: [01035D8C]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002115"
msgid "Here I am trying to impress her to ask her out, and I don't even know her well enough to realize how stupid it all is."
msgstr "데이트 신청해 보려고 잘 보이려 애썼는데. 그게 얼마나 한심한 짓인지도 모를 만큼 내가 유라를 너무 몰랐던 거지."

#. List: 2
