msgstr "내가 건드려도 될 인간처럼 보이시나? "

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1200_Roman_MainBranchYura02Scene
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00915137
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Sorry to have ruined your plans. &&& Roman: This isn't your fault. It's mine.|I should've known she'd do something like this. |All these years of trying to build up the courage to ask her out, and I'm still screwing it up.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: That's what everyone keeps telling me... I just don't want to ruin everything if I make the wrong call.
#. EDID: [01059CA9]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00211E"
msgid "You should tell her how you feel. She'd appreciate that even more."
msgstr "네 감정을 직접 말해 봐. 유라는 그걸 더 좋아할 거야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1200_Roman_TruthScene
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Roman
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0061EF50
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: You should tell her how you feel yourself. It will mean more coming from you. &&& Roman: That's what everyone keeps telling me... I just don't want to ruin everything if I make the wrong call.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Yeah, yeah, because if I never say anything, I'll regret it.
#. EDID: [01059CBE]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00211F"
msgid "If she says no, at least you told her how you felt. "
msgstr "유라가 거절하더라도, 적어도 네 마음은 전할 수 있잖아. "

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1200_Roman_MainBranchYura01Scene
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Roman
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00A34BB4
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I don't do favors for petnappers. &&& Roman: Just hear me out. You got this petnapping thing all wrong.|You see, this is all a setup for Yura. &&& Roman: She hates house sitting. It's boring. So we thought why not liven things up?|We figured she'd get into it, maybe even get the credits from Atka...|And then when all went according to plan, I'd have the confidence to ask her out. |But now I've lost that chance. So, plan B. I give you Milli, you put in a good word for me with Yura. &&& companion: All this setup when you should be confessing to her directly.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: That's what everyone keeps telling me... I just don't want to ruin everything if I make the wrong call.
#. EDID: [01059CA3]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002120"
msgid "You should tell her how you feel yourself. It will mean more coming from you."
msgstr "네 마음은 네가 직접 말해야 해. 네 입에서 나와야 더 의미가 있어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1200_Roman_MainBranchYura01Scene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Roman
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRomanKreutz
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 00C22F64
#. ScriptNotes = Confident / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Roman: All right, all right, I'll pay you. |Here's the key to Milli's room. Just don't forget our deal.
#. EDID: [01059CCB]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002121"
msgid "Here's the key to Milli's room. Little critter's all yours."
msgstr "여기 밀리 방 열쇠야. 저 자그마한 녀석 데려가."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1200_Roman_MainBranchYura01Scene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Roman
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRomanKreutz
#. Face = Relieved
#. SoundFileID = 00603AC7
#. ScriptNotes = Relieved / to Player Default
#. Prompt = I suppose you're right.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I suppose you're right.
#. DialogueAfter = Roman: Here's the key to Milli's room. Little critter's all yours.
#. EDID: [01059CA7]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002122"
msgid "Good because you were about to wipe me out."
msgstr "좋아, 안 그랬으면 날 박살 낼 거였잖아."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1200_Roman_FreestarScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Roman
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRomanKreutz
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 00DBF517
#. ScriptNotes = Confident / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Roman: You bet we will. Lesson learned.
#. EDID: [01059CF0]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002123"
msgid "Milli's all yours. Please, just take her, and this will never happen again."
msgstr "밀리는 네 거야. 제발 그냥 데려가. 다시는 이런 일 없을 거야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1200_Roman_FreestarScene
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Roman
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0012EFED
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: And you really thought Yura would appreciate your prank? &&& Roman: I would've guaranteed it! I just never saw her reporting it to the Freestar Rangers. &&& Roman: Atka must've come home before Yura even saw the note. That's the only explanation.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Really? Oh thank god. Even if they did, I'm sure Yura or Atka would've dropped them as soon as they knew it was us.
#. EDID: [01059D2A]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002124"
msgid "Lucky for you, no one's pressing charges here."
msgstr "운 좋은 줄 알아. 여기서 고소할 사람은 없어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1200_Roman_FreestarScene
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Roman
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00C684B9
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Petnapping is a pretty elaborate distraction. &&& Roman: Well, yeah, but that was part of the plan... I just wanted to get Yura's attention is all. |The things we do to impress people, right?
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Oh god, thank you. You have no idea how freaked out I was.
#. EDID: [01059CA6]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002125"
msgid "Don't worry about it. No harm, no foul."
msgstr "신경 쓰지 마. 다친 사람도 없으니 문제 삼지 않을게."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1200_Roman_FreestarScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Roman
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRomanKreutz
#. Face = Nervous
#. SoundFileID = 00AF38A1
#. ScriptNotes = Nervous / to Player Default
#. Prompt = You never considered the consequences of your actions?
#. DialogueAfter = Roman: Petnapping for fun is still petnapping.
#. EDID: [01059CFA]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002126"
msgid "And believe me when I say Yura is not the type to get the law involved."
msgstr "내 말 믿어봐. 유라는 법정에 갈 정도로 일을 크게 키울 애가 아니야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1200_Roman_FreestarScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Roman
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRomanKreutz
#. Face = Nervous
#. SoundFileID = 00D2ACAB
#. ScriptNotes = Nervous / to Player Default
#. Prompt = You never considered the consequences of your actions?
#. EDID: [01059CFA]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002127"
msgid "I figured she'd be excited to have something fun to do for a change."
msgstr "오랜만에 재미있는 일이 생기면 유라가 신나할 줄 알았어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1200_Roman_FreestarScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Roman
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRomanKreutz
#. Face = Nervous
#. SoundFileID = 00FD30EA
#. ScriptNotes = Nervous / to Player Default
#. Prompt = You never considered the consequences of your actions?
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: You never considered the consequences of your actions?
#. EDID: [01059CFA]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002128"
msgid "I never thought Yura would take this seriously. "
msgstr "유라가 이걸 진지하게 받아들일 줄은 몰랐어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1200_Roman_FreestarScene
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 003398D8
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I'm listening. &&& Roman: We didn't really petnap Milli, we just sort of borrowed her... for a prank.|I knew Atka was going to be out of town and her sister Yura was going to get stuck watching Milli...|Yura gets bored out of her mind house sitting, so we were going to stage a petnapping, you know, for fun.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: I think we all realize that now, but I swear it was completely innocent.
#. EDID: [01059D33]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002129"
msgid "Petnapping for fun is still petnapping."
msgstr "재미로 했어도 애완동물 납치는 납치야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1200_Roman_MainBranchYura01Scene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Roman
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRomanKreutz
#. Face = Shocked
#. SoundFileID = 00688322
#. ScriptNotes = About to go into combat? / Shocked / to Player Default
#. Prompt = [Attack] Plan C. I'll put you out of your misery.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: [Attack] Plan C. I'll put you out of your misery.
#. DialogueAfter = Roman: Here's the key to Milli's room. Little critter's all yours.
#. EDID: [01059D2E]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00212A"
msgid "Wait, what?"
msgstr "잠깐, 뭐?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_1200_Roman_TruthScene
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Roman
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00D436C8
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: You should tell her how you feel yourself. It will mean more coming from you. &&& Roman: That's what everyone keeps telling me... I just don't want to ruin everything if I make the wrong call.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Easier said than done.
#. EDID: [01059D15]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00212B"
msgid "It's hard to put yourself out there, but you can do this."
msgstr "마음을 드러내는 건 어렵지만, 넌 할 수 있어."

