#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: A milli-what?
#. DialogueAfter = Yura: Count us in.
#. EDID: [01059CBB]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002134"
msgid "A milli-whale! It's like a big pillow on too many legs."
msgstr "밀리고래야! 다리가 정말 많이 달린 커다란 베개 같은 애지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_3200_Yura_BranchEndRomanDeadScene
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Atka
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00CF2B2E
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Roman and his friends are dead. &&& Yura: Oh my god... you killed him? All of them? &&& Atka: Look... I... I think you should leave.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Roman and his friends were... misguided individuals, but I can't say they deserved this.
#. EDID: [0105A364]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002135"
msgid "The Settled Systems is safer with them gone."
msgstr "납치범 일당이 사라졌으니 개척 성계는 더 안전해졌을 거야."

#. List: 2
