#. EDID: [0105CEB7]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002183"
msgid "Right? You make your own hours, set your own rates..."
msgstr "그렇지? 근무 시간도 직접 정하고, 요금도 직접 정하고..."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03_Support
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_PostQuest_Yura_TL_Roman01Scene
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Yura
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00070729
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: How do you feel about him? &&& Yura: Roman? He's the best friend anyone can ask for. Reliable, good listener, totally gets me.|In fact, it's hard not to care about the guy, especially when you get him to open up.|That's why I can't lose him. And if we dated, I know I'd lose him.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: I only hope Roman understands. I keep saying I'm going to get it together, but who knows when that'll be.
#. EDID: [0106B1C4]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002184"
msgid "I understand. It sounds like you're just not ready."
msgstr "이해해. 아직 준비가 안 된 것 같네."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03_Support
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_PostQuest_Roman_YuraYesScene01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Roman
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRomanKreutz
#. Face = Friendly
#. SoundFileID = 0028B850
#. ScriptNotes = Friendly / to Player Default
#. Prompt = You're on your own. I don't do relationship advice.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: You're on your own. I don't do relationship advice.
#. DialogueAfter = Roman: All right. I can do this.
#. EDID: [0106B1AC]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002185"
msgid "You could've fooled me, but you did get me this far."
msgstr "전혀 그렇게 안 보였지만, 그래도 여기까지 날 데려왔잖아."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03_Support
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_PostQuest_Roman_YuraYesScene01
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0037FF89
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I think I was rather convincing. &&& Roman: What? You're not joking? Oh god, so I really get to go through with it now. &&& Roman: I feel like a nervous wreck. What do I say? I... I need advice. Anything!
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Be patient. I can do that.
#. EDID: [0106B1C2]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002186"
msgid "If things work out, just be patient."
msgstr "다 잘될 거니까, 침착하게 기다려 봐."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03_Support
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_PostQuest_Roman_YuraYesScene01
