#. ScriptNotes = Depressed / to Player Default
#. Prompt = You need to move on.
#. EDID: [0106B1B8]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002189"
msgid "Thanks for saving me the pain."
msgstr "괴로운 상황까지 가지 않게 도와줘서 고마워."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03_Support
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_PostQuest_Roman_YuraNoScene01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMRomanKreutz
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRomanKreutz
#. Face = Depressed
#. SoundFileID = 00E1D62E
#. ScriptNotes = Depressed / to Player Default
#. Prompt = You need to move on.
#. EDID: [0106B1B8]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00218A"
msgid "It's probably a good thing you came along. I can't imagine doing all this just to get crushed in the end."
msgstr "네가 나타난 게 다행인지도 몰라. 이 모든 걸 하고 마지막에 완전히 무너지는 건 상상도 하기 싫어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03_Support
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_PostQuest_Roman_YuraNoScene01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMRomanKreutz
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRomanKreutz
#. Face = Depressed
#. SoundFileID = 00364B62
#. ScriptNotes = Gah = any noise of frustration. / Depressed / to Player Default
#. Prompt = You need to move on.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: You need to move on.
#. EDID: [0106B1B8]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00218B"
msgid "Gah, I don't want to move on... but if she can't trust me at this point, maybe she never will."
msgstr "아, 난 포기하고 싶지 않은데... 하지만 이쯤 돼도 유라가 날 믿지 못한다면, 아마 영영 못 믿겠지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03_Support
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_PostQuest_Roman_YuraNoScene01
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0025BECD
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I don't think she's ready, Roman. &&& Roman: *sigh* I knew it. Every time I think she's letting me in, she pushes me away.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Gah, I don't want to move on... but if she can't trust me at this point, maybe she never will.
#. EDID: [0106B1B5]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00218C"
msgid "You need to move on."
msgstr "이제 잊고 나아가야 해."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS03_Support
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS03_PostQuest_Roman_YuraNoScene01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Roman
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRomanKreutz
#. Face = Depressed
#. SoundFileID = 00919775
#. ScriptNotes = Depressed / to Player Default
#. DialogueAfter = Roman: You need to move on.
#. EDID: [0106C8DE]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00218D"
msgid "I knew this wasn't gonna work out. Why do I even keep trying?"
msgstr "안 될 줄 알았어. 왜 계속 시도한 걸까?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_Z01_AudioLogs
#. SceneName = SFFL_Z01_AudioLogs_DeathSlate_GABBY
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = AUDIOONLY
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCGabrielleBaker
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 001D5A9E
#. ScriptNotes = Exhausted and running out of oxygen. Tons of regret as she'll never see her wife again. Sarcastic at the end.
#. DialogueBefore = Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): So, this is what it all led to, hm? I'll be out of air soon and I haven't seen anyone for the past... I don't know anymore.
#. DialogueAfter = Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): I guess I hoped if we had enough we could have grown gray in peace. Perfect life and all that.
#. EDID: [0106C727]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00218E"
msgid "I should have listened to her. Begged for me to get a job on land. Happy wife, happy life, right? But the pay - It's real helpful now."
msgstr "그녀 말을 들었어야 했어. 땅에서 일자리를 구하라고 애원했거든. 아내가 행복해야 인생이 행복하다잖아? 하지만 보수가... 지금은 정말 도움이 돼."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_Z01_AudioLogs
#. SceneName = SFFL_Z01_AudioLogs_LoveSlate_GABBY
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = AUDIOONLY
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCGabrielleBaker
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00F55ADD
#. ScriptNotes = Taken a bit by surprised as the sip is showing something wrong, but not too worried by it. Very loving send off.
#. DialogueBefore = Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): But it'll be fine. As long as she gets me where me, and the rest of this junk, needs to be I'm happy.
#. EDID: [0106C72F]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00218F"
msgid "Oh? Give me one moment. This ship always has something to complain about. Guess I better check on it. See you soon, Love. Promise."
msgstr "어? 잠깐만. 이 우주선은 늘 뭔가 불평할 거리가 있네. 확인해 봐야겠어. 곧 보자, 사랑해. 약속할게."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_Z01_AudioLogs
#. SceneName = SFFL_Z01_AudioLogs_LoveSlate_GABBY
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = AUDIOONLY
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCGabrielleBaker
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00888EC6
#. ScriptNotes = Sweet, but still cracking jokes.
#. DialogueBefore = Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): I promise, the second I step foot back home I'm taking you to the fanciest restaurant in town. I don't care how gross or dirty or whatever I'll be from a month in this hunk of metal.
#. DialogueAfter = Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): But it'll be fine. As long as she gets me where me, and the rest of this junk, needs to be I'm happy.
#. EDID: [0106C72D]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002190"
msgid "Speaking of this ship, she's a real piece of work. 'Best for the price,' my ass! I'm telling you that seller must have pulled a fast one on me."
msgstr "이 우주선 얘기가 나와서 말인데, 정말 골칫덩이야. '가격 대비 최고'는 무슨! 그 판매자가 날 제대로 속인 게 분명해."

