#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Of course, just as we agreed.
#. EDID: [010343B9]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002199"
msgid "Words of gratitude are fine, but credits are better."
msgstr "감사의 말도 좋지만, 크레딧이 더 나은데."

#. List: 2
