#. ScriptNotes = Scared [Spaceship] / Angry
#. EDID: [01056620]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0021B2"
msgid "I don't want to hurt you!"
msgstr "널 해치고 싶지 않아!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_Z01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCSehoyBaker
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCSehoyBaker
#. Face = Spaceship / Angry
#. SoundFileID = 005C7BA4
#. ScriptNotes = Scared [Spaceship] / Angry
#. EDID: [0105661E]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0021B3"
msgid "I won't let it end this way!"
msgstr "이렇게 끝나게 두진 않을 거야!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_Z01
#. SceneName = SFFL_Z01_120_SEHOY
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Sehoy
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCSehoyBaker
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 004180AB
#. ScriptNotes = Pleading and scared for her wife's whereabouts. / to Player Default
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Yes. I found Gabrielle and her ship.
#. EDID: [010325F5]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0021B4"
msgid "I'm her wife. She went on a job and it's been months..."
msgstr "난 그이의 아내야. 그이가 일을 나간 뒤로 몇 달이 지났어..."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_Z01
#. SceneName = SFFL_Z01_120_SEHOY
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Sehoy
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCSehoyBaker
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0009FD62
#. ScriptNotes = Pleading. / to Player Default
#. EDID: [010325F5]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0021B5"
msgid "Please, have you seen a cargo ship out here? Piloted by a woman named Gabrielle Baker?"
msgstr "제발, 이 근처에서 화물선을 본 적 있어? 가브리엘 베이커라는 여자가 조종하는 우주선이야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_Z01
#. SceneName = SFFL_Z01_120_SEHOY
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Sehoy
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCSehoyBaker
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00F12BD2
#. ScriptNotes = Worried and a bit tired by how much she's been worrying for Gabrielle and trying to figure out how to work a ship as quick as possible. [Spaceship] / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = HailingShip: In all honesty, I am.
#. EDID: [010325F5]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0021B6"
msgid "You seem like you're more versed in this whole flying thing than me."
msgstr "비행 쪽은 나보다 훨씬 잘 아는 것 같네."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_Z01
#. SceneName = SFFL_Z01_200_SEHOY
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Sehoy
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCSehoyBaker
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00F09F16
#. ScriptNotes = Feels really broken and not tethered to reality. She feels like she's in so sort of lost, tiring limbo. Heartbroken. [Spaceship] / to Player Default
#. Prompt = I don't want your credits.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I don't want your credits.
#. DialogueAfter = companion: Perhaps Gabrielle can finally be at peace now. I just hope Sehoy can find it one day too.
#. EDID: [01035300]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0021B7"
msgid "Oh... Well, take care of yourself."
msgstr "아... 그래, 몸조심해."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_Z01
#. SceneName = SFFL_Z01_200_SEHOY
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Sehoy
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0036C67A
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: You should go home. There's nothing left for you out here. &&& Sehoy: There really isn't, is there...?|Well, thank you, I guess. Here. I don't have many credits anymore, but take them.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Oh... Well, take care of yourself.
#. EDID: [01035305]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0021B8"
msgid "I don't want your credits."
msgstr "네 크레딧은 필요 없어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_Z01
#. SceneName = SFFL_Z01_200_SEHOY
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Sehoy
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 007D26BA
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: [Lie] I found her, but she said she can't go home yet. &&& Sehoy: Why not? Did she say anything else? Why is she doing this...?
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: I don't understand...
#. EDID: [01035306]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0021B9"
msgid "She didn't say. I'm sorry."
msgstr "그녀는 말하지 않았어. 미안해."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_Z01
#. SceneName = SFFL_Z01_200_SEHOY
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Sehoy
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00B3F41C
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Sehoy: You're back! Did you find Gabrielle? Please, tell me you've found her.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Why not? Did she say anything else? Why is she doing this...?
#. EDID: [010352F4]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0021BA"
msgid "[Lie] I found her, but she said she can't go home yet."
msgstr "[거짓말] 그녀를 찾았지만, 아직 집에 갈 수 없다고 했어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_Z01
#. SceneName = SFFL_Z01_200_SEHOY
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 005DC70E
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Sehoy: You're back! Did you find Gabrielle? Please, tell me you've found her.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: How did it- Let me see those.
#. EDID: [010352E6]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0021BB"
msgid "Her ship malfunctioned. I found these slates in the wreckage."
msgstr "그녀의 우주선이 고장 났어. 잔해 속에서 이 슬레이트들을 찾았어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_Z01
#. SceneName = SFFL_Z01_120_SEHOY
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Sehoy
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCSehoyBaker
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00F08C32
#. ScriptNotes = Sad and tired as she's explaining that she spent all her money to find her wife. [Spaceship] / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Wait, did you come all the way out here to find her?
#. DialogueAfter = Sehoy: Yes. I found Gabrielle and her ship.
#. EDID: [010352F3]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0021BC"
msgid "But I couldn't just sit and wait for her to come home any longer."
msgstr "하지만 더는 그녀가 집에 돌아오길 앉아서 기다릴 수만은 없었어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_Z01
#. SceneName = SFFL_Z01_120_SEHOY
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Sehoy
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCSehoyBaker
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00EA05CB
#. ScriptNotes = Sad and tired as she's explaining that she spent all her money to find her wife. [Spaceship] / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Wait, did you come all the way out here to find her?
#. EDID: [010352F3]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0021BD"
msgid "She may call me foolish for such a thing. We've been saving for so long. She wanted us to have enough money to retire in peace."
msgstr "그녀는 이런 날 어리석다고 할지도 몰라. 우린 정말 오래 저축해 왔거든. 그녀는 우리가 평온하게 은퇴할 만큼 충분한 돈을 모으길 원했어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_Z01
#. SceneName = SFFL_Z01_120_SEHOY
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Sehoy
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCSehoyBaker
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00233472
#. ScriptNotes = Sad and tired as she's explaining that she spent all her money to find her wife. [Spaceship] / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Wait, did you come all the way out here to find her?
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Wait, did you come all the way out here to find her?
#. EDID: [010352F3]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0021BE"
msgid "I did. I took our savings and bought a ship to find her."
msgstr "맞아. 우리 저축을 털어 그녀를 찾을 우주선을 샀어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_Z01
#. SceneName = SFFL_Z01_120_SEHOY
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Sehoy
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCSehoyBaker
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00E4EE2A
#. ScriptNotes = A bit tired, but mostly pleading with the Player. [Spaceship] / to Player Default
#. Prompt = I can't say I have.
#. EDID: [010352E5]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0021BF"
msgid "Please, if you find her, tell her I'm out here and to please come home."
msgstr "제발, 그녀를 찾으면 내가 여기 나와 있다고, 집으로 돌아와 달라고 전해 줘."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_Z01
#. SceneName = SFFL_Z01_120_SEHOY
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Sehoy
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCSehoyBaker
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00AD02A9
#. ScriptNotes = Worried and stressed. [Spaceship] / to Player Default
#. Prompt = I can't say I have.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I can't say I have.
#. EDID: [010352E5]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0021C0"
msgid "Dammit... I'm sorry. I just-"
msgstr "젠장... 미안해. 난 그냥-"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_Z01
#. SceneName = SFFL_Z01_300_COMPANION
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = companion
#. VoiceType = NPCFSarahMorgan
#. Face = Spaceship / Confident
#. SoundFileID = 00E245BC
#. ScriptNotes = Player told Sehoy Gabrielle is dead. Feels bad for Sehoy for having to go through such a heartbreaking and soul crushing thing. [Spaceship]
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: It's just what she said. That's all I know. &&& Sehoy: That can't be right... I'm sorry. I have to find her.
#. EDID: [01056634]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0021C1"
msgid "I can't imagine what that poor woman is going through. All we can really hope is one day she finds some peace."
msgstr "그 불쌍한 여자가 어떤 일을 겪고 있을지 상상도 안 돼. 우리가 바랄 수 있는 건 언젠가 그녀가 평안을 찾는 것뿐이야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_Z01
#. SceneName = SFFL_Z01_125_SEHOY
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCSehoyBaker
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCSehoyBaker
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00A69A0E
#. ScriptNotes = Pleading with the Player. [Spaceship] / to Player Default
#. Prompt = If you haven't found her yet, then I guess I can help.
#. EDID: [01056629]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0021C2"
msgid "If you find her, please, let her know I'm out here. "
msgstr "그녀를 찾으면, 제발 내가 여기 나와 있다고 전해 줘."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_Z01
#. SceneName = SFFL_Z01_125_SEHOY
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCSehoyBaker
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCSehoyBaker
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0047A8B5
#. ScriptNotes = Thankful that the Player has had a change of heart to help her. [Spaceship] / to Player Default
#. Prompt = If you haven't found her yet, then I guess I can help.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: If you haven't found her yet, then I guess I can help.
#. EDID: [01056629]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0021C3"
msgid "Really? Thank you. Thank you!"
msgstr "정말? 고마워. 정말 고마워!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_Z01
#. SceneName = SFFL_Z01_125_SEHOY
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0086737C
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Sehoy: You again? Please tell me you've seen Gabrielle.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Really? Thank you. Thank you!
#. EDID: [01056609]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0021C4"
msgid "If you haven't found her yet, then I guess I can help."
msgstr "아직 그녀를 찾지 못했다면, 내가 도울 수 있을 것 같아."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_Z01
#. SceneName = SFFL_Z01_120_SEHOY
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Sehoy
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCSehoyBaker
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00DB58F7
#. ScriptNotes = Pleading. [Spaceship] / to Player Default
#. Prompt = I haven't seen her. But I can help you find her.
#. EDID: [010565F4]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0021C5"
msgid "Please. If- When you find her tell her to come home."
msgstr "제발. 만약- 그녀를 찾으면 집으로 돌아오라고 전해 줘."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_Z01
#. SceneName = SFFL_Z01_120_SEHOY
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Sehoy
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCSehoyBaker
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00F57F0A
#. ScriptNotes = More thankful than words can express. [Spaceship] / to Player Default
#. Prompt = I haven't seen her. But I can help you find her.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I haven't seen her. But I can help you find her.
#. EDID: [010565F4]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0021C6"
msgid "You can? Thank you. Thank you so much! "
msgstr "그래 줄 수 있어? 고마워. 정말 고마워!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_KT02_SailingHighSeas
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE_KT02_100b_HailingAnswered
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = HailingShip
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMGenericMale02
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00568DFE
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = [Remain silent]
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: [Remain silent]
#. DialogueAfter = HailingShip: Is that right? Did you pay the 50k to hunt pirates?
#. EDID: [010388C8]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0021C7"
msgid "Well, if you aren't gonna say anything, I guess we'll let our guns do the talking!"
msgstr "뭐, 아무 말도 안 할 거라면 총으로 대화해야겠네!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_KT02_SailingHighSeas
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE_KT02_100b_HailingAnswered
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = HailingShip
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMGenericMale02
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 002D1BAB
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = [Attack] No, I'm with a different tour guide. We hunt rich executives like you.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: [Attack] No, I'm with a different tour guide. We hunt rich executives like you.
#. DialogueAfter = HailingShip: Don't worry darlin, I'm going to have a word with our lawyers.
#. EDID: [010388B8]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0021C8"
msgid "Goddamnit! Honey, power up those weapons!"
msgstr "젠장! 여보, 무기 가동해!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_KT02_SailingHighSeas
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE_KT02_100b_HailingAnswered
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = HailingShip
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 000A9967
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: My last words are "Hot Dogs are a sandwich." &&& HailingShip: Those are some fighting words for sure. Honey, power up the weapons! &&& HailingShip: Is that right? Did you pay the 50k to hunt pirates?
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Huh. This was supposed to be a private tour, but fine. I guess we'll just sit here and wait for the pirates to show up.
#. EDID: [01031FAC]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0021C9"
msgid "[Lie] I did. Dibs on any Crimson Fleet."
msgstr "[거짓말] 내가 그랬어. 크림슨 함대는 내가 먼저 찜한 거야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_KT02_SailingHighSeas
#. SceneName = SFFL_SE_KT02_100b_HailingAnswered
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Spaceship / Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0019116D
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: My last words are "Hot Dogs are a sandwich." &&& HailingShip: Those are some fighting words for sure. Honey, power up the weapons! &&& HailingShip: Is that right? Did you pay the 50k to hunt pirates?
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Scammed? Goddamnit! I knew it was too good to be true! I paid way more for the other hunts!
#. EDID: [010388D1]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0021CA"
msgid "I didn't. You clearly got scammed."
msgstr "난 아니야. 너 완전히 사기당했어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_KT02_SailingHighSeas
