#. Prompt = How much will you pay me for this?
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: How much will you pay me for this?
#. DialogueAfter = TheArbitrator: Nothing I haven't done before. Give me the details.
#. EDID: [010590C9]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002212"
msgid "However much their life was worth."
msgstr "목표물의 목숨 값에 따라 다르겠지."

