#. ScriptNotes = Saying goodbye to the player, who has just departed mid-conversation.
#. EDID: [0104EDEE]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002233"
msgid "Bye then."
msgstr "그럼 잘 가."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCFDarcyWeber
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFDarcyWeber
#. Face = Nervous
#. SoundFileID = 0021C02A
#. ScriptNotes = Friendly. Saying goodbye to the player, who has just departed mid-conversation.
#. EDID: [0104EDED]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002234"
msgid "Oh, my time's up? Okay."
msgstr "아, 벌써 시간이 다 됐어? 알겠어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMCutty
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMCutty
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0082CF0F
#. ScriptNotes = Friendly. Saying goodbye to the player, who has just departed mid-conversation.
#. EDID: [0104EDE6]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002235"
msgid "Goodbye now."
msgstr "이제 잘 가."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMCutty
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMCutty
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00C34FCD
#. ScriptNotes = Grumpy. Saying goodbye to the player, who has just departed mid-conversation.
#. EDID: [0104EDE1]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002236"
msgid "Fine."
msgstr "좋아."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMChanHuang
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMChanHuang
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 00C63550
#. ScriptNotes = Saying goodbye to the player, who has just departed mid-conversation.
#. EDID: [0104EDDD]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002237"
msgid "Alright."
msgstr "알았어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCFMaddieWing
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFMaddieWing
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00D573CD
#. ScriptNotes = Sassy, joking. The player has suddenly stopped talking mid-conversation. Are they okay? Add a laugh to yourself at the end.
#. EDID: [0104EDD2]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002238"
msgid "What's the matter? Tiger got your tongue? That must have hurt."
msgstr "왜 그래? 타이거한테 혀라도 물렸어? 꽤 아팠겠네."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
