#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 009242A6
#. ScriptNotes = / to RishiSaint
#. DialogueAfter = RishiSaint: The station was built over eighty years ago as part of a failed business venture.
#. EDID: [0102A52A]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002243"
msgid "What's the history of this place?"
msgstr "이곳의 역사에 대해 알려주실 수 있습니까?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_RishiGreet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = RishiSaint
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRishiSaint
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 001632DA
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = I suspect there's more to it, but I won't pry.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I suspect there's more to it, but I won't pry.
#. DialogueAfter = RishiSaint: I won't cause any trouble.
#. EDID: [0102A51C]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002244"
msgid "Good. I suggest you make a habit of not prying."
msgstr "좋아요. 캐묻지 않는 습관을 들이는 게 좋을 겁니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_RishiGreet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = RishiSaint
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRishiSaint
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 008D70B4
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = What exactly goes on here?
#. DialogueAfter = RishiSaint: Unless you have any questions, I'll leave you to it.
#. EDID: [0102A535]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002245"
msgid "It's as simple as that."
msgstr "간단한 일입니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_RishiGreet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = RishiSaint
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRishiSaint
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 0050F16C
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = What exactly goes on here?
#. EDID: [0102A535]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002246"
msgid "We provide travelers with a place to rest, grab a drink and pick up supplies."
msgstr "우리는 여행자들에게 쉴 곳과 술 한잔, 보급품을 구할 곳을 제공합니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_RishiGreet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = RishiSaint
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRishiSaint
#. Face = Irritated
#. SoundFileID = 003F896D
#. ScriptNotes = Mock offense / Irritated / to Player Default
#. Prompt = What exactly goes on here?
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: What exactly goes on here?
#. EDID: [0102A535]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002247"
msgid "I'm not sure what you're asking."
msgstr "뭘 묻고자 하시는 건지 잘 모르겠군요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_RishiGreet
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = RishiSaint
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 000815CD
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Don't you worry, I'll handle the Spacers. &&& RishiSaint: Really? |I believe in fair pay for a job well done.|Deal with these Spacers, and I'll provide the credits.|My head of security can point you in the right direction. &&& RishiSaint: A few words of advice.|We're happy to welcome all who pass through the airlock, but our hospitality has limits.|Acts of theft or violence will be met with a swift response.|We also value privacy and discretion here.|Our patrons expect to conduct whatever business they wish free from prying eyes and ears. &&& companion: Why do I find that vaguely suspicious?
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: There are only a few, I'm sure you'll manage.
#. EDID: [0102A52C]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002248"
msgid "I'm not exactly great with rules."
msgstr "전 규칙을 잘 지키는 편은 아닌데요."

#. List: 2
#. EDID: [0102A520]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002249"
msgid "Please do."
msgstr "꼭 그렇게 해."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_RishiGreet
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00AAD2CB
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Don't you worry, I'll handle the Spacers. &&& RishiSaint: Really? |I believe in fair pay for a job well done.|Deal with these Spacers, and I'll provide the credits.|My head of security can point you in the right direction. &&& RishiSaint: A few words of advice.|We're happy to welcome all who pass through the airlock, but our hospitality has limits.|Acts of theft or violence will be met with a swift response.|We also value privacy and discretion here.|Our patrons expect to conduct whatever business they wish free from prying eyes and ears. &&& companion: Why do I find that vaguely suspicious?
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Excellent. I hope this will be the first of many visits.
#. EDID: [0102A538]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00224A"
msgid "I won't cause any trouble."
msgstr "문제 일으키지 않을게요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_RishiGreet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = RishiSaint
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRishiSaint
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 006A1680
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = I wouldn't worry, Spacers aren't that much of a threat.
#. DialogueAfter = RishiSaint: This place is pretty remote.
#. EDID: [0102A52F]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00224B"
msgid "We might just be able to help each other out."
msgstr "어쩌면 서로 도울 수 있을지도 모르지요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_RishiGreet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = RishiSaint
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRishiSaint
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 00142F1A
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = I wouldn't worry, Spacers aren't that much of a threat.
#. EDID: [0102A52F]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00224C"
msgid "If that's truly how you feel, then you should speak to my head of security."
msgstr "진심으로 그렇게 생각한다면 제 보안 책임자와 이야기해 보시죠."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_RishiGreet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = RishiSaint
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRishiSaint
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 0001D4FA
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = I wouldn't worry, Spacers aren't that much of a threat.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I wouldn't worry, Spacers aren't that much of a threat.
#. EDID: [0102A52F]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00224D"
msgid "Bold words. "
msgstr "대담한 발언이군요. "

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_RishiGreet
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 004A46BD
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: This place is pretty remote. &&& RishiSaint: That's not by accident.|Our location provides some distance from the busier ports of the Settled Systems.|It also gives us a degree of protection from those who might seek to plunder our resources.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Really?
#. EDID: [0102A53A]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00224E"
msgid "Don't you worry, I'll handle the Spacers."
msgstr "걱정 마세요. 스페이서들은 제가 처리할게요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_RishiGreet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = RishiSaint
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRishiSaint
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 00D1EEF7
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = RishiSaint: You're not the first person to make an incorrect assumption about this place.|Now, back to the matter at hand. I trust you understand the rules?
#. EDID: [0102A516]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00224F"
msgid "Unless you have any questions, I'll leave you to it."
msgstr "질문이 없다면, 이만 가 보겠습니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_RishiGreet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMRishiSaint
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRishiSaint
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 00121138
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = This place is pretty remote.
#. DialogueAfter = RishiSaint: A few words of advice.
#. EDID: [0102A529]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002250"
msgid "It also gives us a degree of protection from those who might seek to plunder our resources."
msgstr "또한 우리의 자원을 약탈하려는 자들로부터 어느 정도 보호해 주기도 하죠."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_RishiGreet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMRishiSaint
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRishiSaint
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 005FDE98
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = This place is pretty remote.
#. EDID: [0102A529]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002251"
msgid "Our location provides some distance from the busier ports of the Settled Systems."
msgstr "우리 우주정거장은 개척 성계의 번잡한 우주항들과 어느 정도 거리를 두고 있습니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_RishiGreet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMRishiSaint
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRishiSaint
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 008DA875
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = This place is pretty remote.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: This place is pretty remote.
#. EDID: [0102A529]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002252"
msgid "That's not by accident."
msgstr "그건 우연이 아닙니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_RishiGreet
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = RishiSaint
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 001DFADE
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = The station was built over eighty years ago by a wealthy industrialist named Gabriela LeBlanc..|She had hoped it would be a jumping-off point to remote systems not yet accessible by grav drive.|Unfortunately, the advances she expected in grav jump technology never materialized.|As a result, the station never realized its purpose and was eventually abandoned.|A few years ago, I purchased it and had it towed out of its decaying orbit around Algorab II. &&& RishiSaint: I make it a point to remember every face that boards this station.|Yours is a new one.|Welcome to Anchorpoint. I'm Rishi Saint, the owner of this establishment.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: One of the guests, a Spacer, was causing trouble. We locked him up so he could sleep off his drink.
#. EDID: [0102A536]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002253"
msgid "I heard you talking. Got some kind of trouble with Spacers?"
msgstr "얘기하는 걸 들었는데요. 스페이서와 무슨 문제가 있나요?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_RishiGreet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = RishiSaint
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRishiSaint
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 00DDE77D
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: This place is pretty remote.
#. EDID: [0102A540]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002254"
msgid "Welcome to Anchorpoint. I'm Rishi Saint, the owner of this establishment."
msgstr "앵커포인트에 오신 걸 환영합니다. 저는 이 시설의 주인, 리시 세인트입니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_RishiGreet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = RishiSaint
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRishiSaint
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 0064B100
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. EDID: [0102A540]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002255"
msgid "Yours is a new one."
msgstr "당신 얼굴은 처음 보는군요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_RishiGreet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = RishiSaint
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRishiSaint
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 00826895
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = The station was built over eighty years ago by a wealthy industrialist named Gabriela LeBlanc..|She had hoped it would be a jumping-off point to remote systems not yet accessible by grav drive.|Unfortunately, the advances she expected in grav jump technology never materialized.|As a result, the station never realized its purpose and was eventually abandoned.|A few years ago, I purchased it and had it towed out of its decaying orbit around Algorab II.
#. EDID: [0102A540]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002256"
msgid "I make it a point to remember every face that boards this station."
msgstr "이 정거장에 승선하는 인물들의 얼굴은 전부 다 기억하려고 하거든요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_MaddieTL03_Parts
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = MaddieWing
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFMaddieWing
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 006989EE
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. EDID: [0102C019]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002257"
msgid "But you can bet that if there's a way to make a fix without spending credits, that's what he wants."
msgstr "하지만 크레딧을 쓰지 않고 고칠 방법이 있다면, 리시 씨는 분명 그렇게 하길 원하시겠지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_MaddieTL03_Parts
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = MaddieWing
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFMaddieWing
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00F99369
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. EDID: [0102C019]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002258"
msgid "We do get traders from time to time, and Rishi haggles with them best he can."
msgstr "가끔 상인들이 오긴 하는데, 그때마다 리시 씨가 가능한 한 열심히 흥정하시지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_MaddieTL03_Parts
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = MaddieWing
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFMaddieWing
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00E2DF13
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. EDID: [0102C019]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002259"
msgid "Truth is, most of my fixes are patch jobs made with whatever's at hand."
msgstr "사실 내가 고친 것들은 대부분 주변에 굴러다니는 거 주워서 대충 땜질해 놓은 거거든."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_MaddieTL03_Parts
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = MaddieWing
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFMaddieWing
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00CEA0B7
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: How do you keep stocked up on parts and supplies out here?
#. EDID: [0102C019]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00225A"
msgid "It ain't like I've got a steady stream of top-quality parts coming in."
msgstr "최고 품질의 부품이 꾸준히 들어오진 않거든."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_MaddieGreet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = MaddieWing
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFMaddieWing
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 008B3CC5
#. ScriptNotes = Sly, setting up to ask a favor / to Player Default
#. EDID: [0102C027]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00225B"
msgid "Unless, of course, you get in my good graces by doing a little job for me."
msgstr "뭐, 심부름을 깔끔하게 처리해 주고 환심을 산다면 예외겠지만."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_MaddieGreet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = MaddieWing
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFMaddieWing
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 009BD7C9
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. EDID: [0102C027]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00225C"
msgid "Just don't mess with my stuff, or I'll sic Tiger on you."
msgstr "내 물건만 건드리지 마. 안 그러면 타이거를 풀어 버릴 거야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_MaddieGreet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = MaddieWing
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFMaddieWing
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00FA0E3D
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = MaddieWing: Hell yeah they are.|I'd ask for a raise, but trying to get even one credit out of that skinflint Rishi is damn near impossible.|He's got his fist clenched around his credits tighter than a restrictor clamp on a busted sewage line.
#. EDID: [0102C027]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00225D"
msgid "Anyway, the workshop's my quarters, but you can use the equipment if you want."
msgstr "아무튼, 작업장은 내 숙소로 쓰고 있긴 한데, 원하면 장비는 써도 돼."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_MaddieGreet
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = MaddieWing
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00AB3083
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I'll be careful. &&& MaddieWing: You better.|Got enough on my hands without having to clean up after fools who start poking and prodding things.|Had a trader in here last week who leaned on a pipe when the sealant was still drying.|Knocked the damn thing loose and sprayed hot water all over himself. &&& MaddieWing: Name's Maddie. I keep the place running.|Always had a knack for machines. Good thing, too.|If it wasn't for me, everyone would have been sucked out into space cause we lost a wall.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: I like it here. Place keeps me busy.
#. EDID: [0102C023]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00225E"
msgid "If it's so dangerous, why do you stay?"
msgstr "그렇게 위험한 곳인데 왜 남아 있는 거야?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_MaddieGreet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = MaddieWing
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFMaddieWing
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 006A95BB
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = You almost lost an entire wall?
#. DialogueAfter = MaddieWing: They're lucky to have you.
#. EDID: [0102C01E]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00225F"
msgid "Whole station buckled. You should have heard the screams."
msgstr "정거장 전체가 휘어졌어. 그 비명 소리를 들었어야 하는 건데."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_MaddieGreet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = MaddieWing
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFMaddieWing
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00F9222E
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = You almost lost an entire wall?
#. EDID: [0102C01E]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002260"
msgid "Came in too fast and slammed into the collar like a damn sledgehammer."
msgstr "너무 빠르게 들이대서 망할 쇠망치로 때린 것처럼 도킹 연결부를 들이받았지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_MaddieGreet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = MaddieWing
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFMaddieWing
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 005A825F
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = You almost lost an entire wall?
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: You almost lost an entire wall?
#. EDID: [0102C01E]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002261"
msgid "Some ignorant dusty got careless while he was docking."
msgstr "어떤 무식한 두더지가 도킹하다가 덜렁대서 들이받았거든."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_MaddieGreet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCFMaddieWing
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFMaddieWing
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0004D7FB
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = They're lucky to have you.
#. DialogueAfter = MaddieWing: Anyway, the workshop's my quarters, but you can use the equipment if you want.
#. EDID: [0102C00D]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002262"
msgid "He's got his fist clenched around his credits tighter than a restrictor clamp on a busted sewage line."
msgstr "리시 씨는 고장 난 하수관에 단 유량 조절용 클램프보다 더 크레딧을 꽉 움켜쥐고 있어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_MaddieGreet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCFMaddieWing
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFMaddieWing
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 007BA331
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = They're lucky to have you.
#. EDID: [0102C00D]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002263"
msgid "I'd ask for a raise, but trying to get even one credit out of that skinflint Rishi is damn near impossible."
msgstr "임금 인상을 요구하고 싶지만, 그 구두쇠 리시 씨에게 크레딧을 한푼이라도 더 받아내는 건 거의 불가능해."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_MaddieGreet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCFMaddieWing
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFMaddieWing
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00172E8E
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = They're lucky to have you.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: They're lucky to have you.
#. EDID: [0102C00D]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002264"
msgid "Hell yeah they are."
msgstr "당연히 그렇지."

#. List: 2
#. EDID: [0102C02B]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002265"
msgid "If its so dangerous, why do you stay here?"
msgstr "그렇게 위험하면 왜 여기 남아 있는 거야?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_RishiTL02_History
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 009242A6
#. ScriptNotes = / to RishiSaint
#. DialogueAfter = RishiSaint: The station was built over eighty years ago as part of a failed business venture.
#. EDID: [0102C013]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002266"
msgid "What's the history of this place?"
msgstr "이곳의 역사에 대해 알려주실 수 있습니까?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_RishiTL01_CommerceCOPY0000
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = RishiSaint
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRishiSaint
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 00BBA7D3
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. EDID: [0102C01C]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002267"
msgid "That, plus a degree of discipline with expenses, keeps us afloat."
msgstr "거기에 어느 정도 지출을 절제하는 덕분에 우리가 버티고 있는 것이지요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_RishiTL01_CommerceCOPY0000
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = RishiSaint
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRishiSaint
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 00316096
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. EDID: [0102C01C]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002268"
msgid "Instead, we rely on word of mouth from a loyal base of frequent patrons."
msgstr "대신 충성도 높은 단골 고객들의 입소문에 의존하고 있습니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_RishiTL01_CommerceCOPY0000
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = RishiSaint
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRishiSaint
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 00FF9DA3
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. EDID: [0102C01C]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002269"
msgid "I prefer not to advertise, both to save credits and because of the unwanted attention it risks."
msgstr "크레딧을 아끼기 위해서든, 원치 않는 관심을 끌 위험 때문이든, 광고는 하지 않는 편이 좋습니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_RishiTL01_CommerceCOPY0000
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = RishiSaint
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMRishiSaint
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 00528F96
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: How do you stay in business with such a remote location?
#. EDID: [0102C01C]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00226A"
msgid "I won't deny it's a challenge."
msgstr "쉽지 않다는 건 부정하지 않겠습니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_RishiTL03_Background
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 004B72F9
#. ScriptNotes = / to RishiSaint
#. DialogueAfter = RishiSaint: There's not really much to tell.
#. EDID: [0102C00E]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00226B"
msgid "What's your background?"
msgstr "당신은 어떤 배경을 갖고 있지?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_ValeriaTL03_Background
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = ValeriaHahn
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFValeriaHahn
#. Face = Friendly
#. SoundFileID = 00F5B499
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = ValeriaHahn: It might seem that way, but he's making a tidy profit.|I had to agree to pay ten percent extra as interest.|What choice did I have? &&& companion: I'm sure it was no small expense to pay for the child's medical care.|And yet, to force such a repayment on this woman is hardly what I would call humane.
#. EDID: [0103140A]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00226C"
msgid "Now that I've told you my life's story, how about a drink?"
msgstr "내 인생 이야기를 다 했으니, 술 한잔 어때?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_ValeriaTL03_Background
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = ValeriaHahn
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0004EDE9
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: What brought you all the way out here? &&& ValeriaHahn: I have a son, Gabriel. He became very ill and I just couldn't afford the treatment.|I'd met Mister Saint while I was tending bar at the Astral Lounge.|He tried to hire me for this place, but I said no. It was just so remote.|When he learned about my son's illness, he said he'd pay the bills on the condition I work here.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: A couple of years still.
#. EDID: [0103142D]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00226D"
msgid "How long will you have to work here to pay off the debt?"
msgstr "빚을 갚으려면 여기서 얼마나 오래 일해야 해?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_ValeriaTL03_Background
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = ValeriaHahn
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00A79F6A
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: What brought you all the way out here? &&& ValeriaHahn: I have a son, Gabriel. He became very ill and I just couldn't afford the treatment.|I'd met Mister Saint while I was tending bar at the Astral Lounge.|He tried to hire me for this place, but I said no. It was just so remote.|When he learned about my son's illness, he said he'd pay the bills on the condition I work here.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: This is no place for a child.
#. EDID: [01031417]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00226E"
msgid "Why did you leave your son behind?"
msgstr "왜 아들을 두고 떠났어?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_ValeriaTL03_Background
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = ValeriaHahn
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFValeriaHahn
#. Face = Friendly
#. SoundFileID = 000A84B3
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Sounds to me like Rishi took advantage of you.
#. DialogueAfter = companion: I'm sure it was no small expense to pay for the child's medical care.
#. EDID: [01031414]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00226F"
msgid "I didn't love making the deal, but my son is the most important thing in my life."
msgstr "그 거래가 마음에 든 건 아니지만, 내 인생에서 가장 중요한 건 내 아들이야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_ValeriaTL03_Background
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = ValeriaHahn
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFValeriaHahn
#. Face = Friendly
#. SoundFileID = 008A9C54
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Sounds to me like Rishi took advantage of you.
#. EDID: [01031414]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002270"
msgid "In my case, the cost was ten percent interest on the loan."
msgstr "내 경우엔 대출금에 이자 10퍼센트가 붙었어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_ValeriaTL03_Background
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = ValeriaHahn
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFValeriaHahn
#. Face = Friendly
#. SoundFileID = 00583CB9
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Sounds to me like Rishi took advantage of you.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Sounds to me like Rishi took advantage of you.
#. EDID: [01031414]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002271"
msgid "It's kind of the way Neon works. Everything comes at a cost."
msgstr "네온은 대체로 그런 식으로 돌아가. 모든 것엔 대가가 따르지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_ValeriaTL03_Background
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCFValeriaHahn
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFValeriaHahn
#. Face = Friendly
#. SoundFileID = 005E2691
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = That's very generous.
#. DialogueAfter = companion: I'm sure it was no small expense to pay for the child's medical care.
#. EDID: [0103140E]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002272"
msgid "What choice did I have?"
msgstr "나한테 무슨 선택지가 있었겠어?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_ValeriaTL03_Background
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCFValeriaHahn
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFValeriaHahn
#. Face = Friendly
#. SoundFileID = 00C9A04C
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = That's very generous.
#. EDID: [0103140E]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002273"
msgid "I had to agree to pay ten percent extra as interest."
msgstr "이자로 10퍼센트를 더 내는 데 동의해야 했어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_ValeriaTL03_Background
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCFValeriaHahn
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFValeriaHahn
#. Face = Friendly
#. SoundFileID = 00B06E6D
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = That's very generous.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: That's very generous.
#. EDID: [0103140E]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002274"
msgid "It might seem that way, but he's making a tidy profit."
msgstr "그렇게 보일 수도 있지만, 그는 짭짤한 이익을 챙기고 있어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_ValeriaTL02_News
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = ValeriaHahn
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFValeriaHahn
#. Face = Friendly
#. SoundFileID = 008C3FC1
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. EDID: [01053DD2]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002275"
msgid "Facing the adventure and the danger of the Free Lanes together is kind of romantic, if you ask me."
msgstr "자유 항로의 모험과 위험을 함께 마주하는 건 꽤 낭만적이라고 생각해."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_ValeriaTL02_News
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = ValeriaHahn
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFValeriaHahn
#. Face = Friendly
#. SoundFileID = 009726E1
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Heard any interesting news lately?
#. EDID: [01053DD2]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002276"
msgid "There was a married couple through here a little while back. They're traders who do business from their ship."
msgstr "얼마 전에 부부 한 쌍이 이곳을 지나갔어. 자기 우주선에서 장사하는 상인들이지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_ValeriaTL02_News
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = ValeriaHahn
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFValeriaHahn
#. Face = Friendly
#. SoundFileID = 00F559B2
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. EDID: [01031426]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002277"
msgid "In fact, I heard her talking with one of the patrons. Sounded like she was in the market for more components."
msgstr "사실 그녀가 고객 중 한 명과 얘기하는 걸 들었어. 부품을 더 구하려는 것 같더군."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_ValeriaTL02_News
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = ValeriaHahn
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFValeriaHahn
#. Face = Friendly
#. SoundFileID = 00FC99D6
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. EDID: [01031426]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002278"
msgid "She's always tinkering with Tiger, her pet Model S."
msgstr "그녀는 항상 자기 애완 모델 S인 타이거를 손보고 있어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_ValeriaTL02_News
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = ValeriaHahn
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFValeriaHahn
#. Face = Friendly
#. SoundFileID = 00154DD0
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. EDID: [01031426]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002279"
msgid "Got a real gift for machines, especially robots."
msgstr "기계, 특히 로봇에 정말 재능이 있어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_ValeriaTL02_News
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = ValeriaHahn
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFValeriaHahn
#. Face = Friendly
#. SoundFileID = 00B1DE8F
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Heard any interesting news lately?
#. EDID: [01031426]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00227A"
msgid "Have you met Maddie? She keeps the place fixed up."
msgstr "매디를 만나 봤어? 이곳을 계속 굴러가게 만드는 사람이야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_DarcyGreet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = DarcyWeber
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFDarcyWeber
#. Face = Nervous
#. SoundFileID = 001CDF5B
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = You are vastly overstating the dangers.
#. DialogueAfter = DarcyWeber: In any case, you made the perilous journey to our little speck of light in the abyss.
#. EDID: [01031434]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00227B"
msgid "And what are you thinking in those seconds? Maybe I should have just stayed on terra firma."
msgstr "그 몇 초 동안 무슨 생각을 하게 될까? 그냥 얌전하게 지구 땅바닥이나 밟고 살 걸 후회나 하겠지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_DarcyGreet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = DarcyWeber
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFDarcyWeber
#. Face = Nervous
#. SoundFileID = 009D57DC
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = You are vastly overstating the dangers.
#. EDID: [01031434]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00227C"
msgid "Now you're plunging like a meteor toward the surface of some moon, only seconds to live."
msgstr "이제 유성처럼 어느 위성의 표면을 향해 꼬라박게 되고, 몇 초 뒤에는 뒈지겠지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_DarcyGreet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = DarcyWeber
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFDarcyWeber
#. Face = Nervous
#. SoundFileID = 0099CB62
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = You are vastly overstating the dangers.
#. EDID: [01031434]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00227D"
msgid "Then one day, boom, your landing thrusters fail."
msgstr "그러다 어느 날, 펑! 착륙용 역추진 로켓이 고장 나는 거지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_DarcyGreet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = DarcyWeber
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFDarcyWeber
#. Face = Nervous
#. SoundFileID = 00EC8818
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = You are vastly overstating the dangers.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: You are vastly overstating the dangers.
#. EDID: [01031434]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00227E"
msgid "When you do a dangerous thing over and over and keep getting away with it, you get complacent."
msgstr "위험천만한 짓을 계속 반복하면서 매번 무사히 넘어가다가, 결국 안전불감증에 빠지게 되는 거야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_DarcyGreet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = DarcyWeber
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFDarcyWeber
#. Face = Nervous
#. SoundFileID = 00C85BE4
#. ScriptNotes = Nervous / to Player Default
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Space travel is very safe. People do it all the time.
#. EDID: [0103141C]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00227F"
msgid "That's all it takes."
msgstr "그러면 끝장나는 거지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_DarcyGreet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = DarcyWeber
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFDarcyWeber
#. Face = Nervous
#. SoundFileID = 00C797DD
#. ScriptNotes = Nervous / to Player Default
#. EDID: [0103141C]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002280"
msgid "You think your ship will protect you, but one loose bolt in your hull, one faulty circuit in life support..."
msgstr "우주선이 널 지켜 줄 거라 생각하겠지만, 선체의 볼트가 헐겁거나 생명 유지 장치 회로가 고장 나면..."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_DarcyGreet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = DarcyWeber
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFDarcyWeber
#. Face = Nervous
#. SoundFileID = 00F4C8FD
#. ScriptNotes = Nervous / to Player Default
#. EDID: [0103141C]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002281"
msgid "Not to mention micrometeorite storms, cosmic rays, and the icy vacuum of space itself."
msgstr "미세 운석 폭풍, 우주 방사선, 차디찬 우주의 진공은 말할 것도 없고."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_DarcyGreet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = DarcyWeber
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFDarcyWeber
#. Face = Nervous
#. SoundFileID = 0085117B
#. ScriptNotes = Nervous / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = DarcyWeber: You should be! Every time you press that launch button it's a roll of the dice.
#. EDID: [0103141C]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002282"
msgid "Think about it. There's pirates and Spacers out there who'd love nothing more than to blast you into atoms."
msgstr "생각해 봐. 널 원자 단위로 날려 버리고 싶어 안달 난 해적들과 스페이서들이 저 밖에 있다고."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_DarcyGreet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = DarcyWeber
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFDarcyWeber
#. Face = Nervous
#. SoundFileID = 0025B460
#. ScriptNotes = Nervous / to Player Default
#. Prompt = You seem nervous. Is everything okay?
#. DialogueAfter = DarcyWeber: Yep, happy to have made it here safely.
#. EDID: [01031412]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002283"
msgid "A rickety old star station on the fringes of explored space... what's there to be nervous about? *Nervous laugh*"
msgstr "인류가 탐사한 우주 영역의 변방에 있는 낡고 삐걱대는 우주정거장... 긴장할 거 참 없겠다 그치? *긴장한 웃음*"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_DarcyGreet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = DarcyWeber
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFDarcyWeber
#. Face = Nervous
#. SoundFileID = 00BC86BD
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = You seem nervous. Is everything okay?
#. EDID: [01031412]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002284"
msgid "I just can't stop thinking about the dangers all around us."
msgstr "사방에 도사리고 있는 위험요소 때문에 자꾸만 신경이 쓰여."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_DarcyGreet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = DarcyWeber
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFDarcyWeber
#. Face = Nervous
#. SoundFileID = 0047D24A
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = You seem nervous. Is everything okay?
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: You seem nervous. Is everything okay?
#. EDID: [01031412]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002285"
msgid "Yeah, I get that a lot."
msgstr "그래, 그런 말 자주 들어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_DarcyGreet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCFDarcyWeber
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFDarcyWeber
#. Face = Nervous
#. SoundFileID = 004668EC
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Yep, happy to have made it here safely.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Yep, happy to have made it here safely.
#. DialogueAfter = DarcyWeber: Think about it. There's pirates and Spacers out there who'd love nothing more than to blast you into atoms.
#. EDID: [01031420]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002286"
msgid "You should be! Every time you press that launch button it's a roll of the dice."
msgstr "그래야지! 발사 버튼을 누를 때마다 주사위를 굴리는 거나 마찬가지야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_DarcyGreet
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00EFF6E1
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = DarcyWeber: The ship that just docked, that was you, right?|You must be relieved to have made it here safe and sound.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: You should be! Every time you press that launch button it's a roll of the dice.
#. EDID: [0103141A]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002287"
msgid "Yep, happy to have made it here safely."
msgstr "그래, 무사히 도착해서 한시름 놓았지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_DarcyTL02Fear
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = DarcyWeber
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFDarcyWeber
#. Face = Nervous
#. SoundFileID = 00493030
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. EDID: [01031443]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002288"
msgid "I guess after a while, fear becomes a kind of companion."
msgstr "근데 시간이 지나면, 두려움도 동료처럼 되는 것 같아."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_DarcyTL02Fear
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = DarcyWeber
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFDarcyWeber
#. Face = Nervous
#. SoundFileID = 00E46135
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. EDID: [01031443]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002289"
msgid "At any moment, I was afraid that gravity could fail and I would plunge down into the sky."
msgstr "언제든 중력이 사라져서 저 하늘 속으로 추락하지 않을까 두려웠어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_DarcyTL02Fear
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = DarcyWeber
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFDarcyWeber
#. Face = Nervous
#. SoundFileID = 001968F9
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. EDID: [01031443]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00228A"
msgid "See, for me that never felt like looking up, it felt like looking down into a terrifying abyss."
msgstr "나한텐 그게 위를 올려다보는 느낌이 아니었어. 무서운 심연을 내려다보는 느낌이었지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_DarcyTL02Fear
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = DarcyWeber
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFDarcyWeber
#. Face = Nervous
#. SoundFileID = 009027CC
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: How do you cope with a constant fear of space while living on a star station?
#. EDID: [01031443]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00228B"
msgid "Do you ever lay on your back and look up at the stars? I used to do that to test myself."
msgstr "누워서 별을 올려다본 적 있어? 난 스스로를 시험하려고 올려다보곤 했어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_ValeriaTL03_Background
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = ValeriaHahn
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 009C6B59
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: What brought you all the way out here? &&& ValeriaHahn: I have a son, Gabriel. He became very ill and I just couldn't afford the treatment.|I'd met Mister Saint while I was tending bar at the Astral Lounge.|He tried to hire me for this place, but I said no. It was just so remote.|When he learned about my son's illness, he said he'd pay the bills on the condition I work here.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: It's apparently a very rare virus. They don't even know how it got there.
#. EDID: [01031445]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00228C"
msgid "Such pathogens do exist, but it's unusual to see only one case in a city as populous as Neon."
msgstr "그런 병원체가 존재하긴 하지만, 네온처럼 인구가 많은 도시에서 한 건만 나타나는 건 이례적이야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_KillianTL01Vend
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00F03005
#. ScriptNotes = / to KillianBrice
#. DialogueAfter = KillianBrice: Certainly.
#. EDID: [010316FB]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00228D"
msgid "I'd like to see your inventory."
msgstr "재고품을 보고 싶어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_CuttyTL01Vend
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00493F74
#. ScriptNotes = / to Cutty
#. DialogueAfter = Cutty: No haggling. The prices are the prices.
#. EDID: [01031FD2]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00228E"
msgid "I'd like to see your selection of medical supplies."
msgstr "판매 중인 의료 용품을 보고 싶어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_KillianTL02Job
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = KillianBrice
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMKillianBrice
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 001B7435
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = KillianBrice: *Sigh* Yes, that was me. I made mistakes, but I have paid my debt to society &&& companion: Hey, no judgement here. |You're making a fresh start, and I can understand that.
#. EDID: [01031FD1]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00228F"
msgid "Now, how can I help you?"
msgstr "자, 뭘 도와드릴까?"

#. List: 2
#. EDID: SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_CuttySharedInfo03
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002290"
msgid "Fine."
msgstr "좋아."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_CuttyTL01Vend
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Cutty
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMCutty
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 008EEFC1
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I'd like to see your selection of medical supplies.
#. EDID: SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_CuttySharedInfo01
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002291"
msgid "No haggling. The prices are the prices."
msgstr "흥정은 없어. 가격은 정해진 가격이야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_KillianTL02Job
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = KillianBrice
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0085C3B0
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: How did you get this job? &&& KillianBrice: I previously worked with the station's owner, Rishi Saint.|There was some unfortunate business involving my accounting duties with the Vanguard, and I served some time.|When I got out, Rishi approached me with a job opportunity.|It was the best of a very limited set of options.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: That's a personal matter, and I'm not inclined to discuss it with you.
#. EDID: [01031FCB]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002292"
msgid "What did you do to land in jail?"
msgstr "무슨 짓을 했길래 징역을 살았어?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_MaddieTL04_Quest
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCFMaddieWing
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFMaddieWing
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00A3B9CF
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = You've got yourself a deal.
#. EDID: [0103716B]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002293"
msgid "I'll send along the latest tracking info and let you do your thing."
msgstr "최신 추적 정보를 알려 줄 테니, 나머지는 알아서 해."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_MaddieTL04_Quest
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCFMaddieWing
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFMaddieWing
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00D8424D
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = You've got yourself a deal.
#. EDID: [0103716B]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002294"
msgid "If you blow the damn thing up and bring me back damaged parts, I ain't paying as much for them."
msgstr "지랄맞게 우주선을 터뜨려서 망가뜨린 부품을 가져오면, 그만큼 값을 깎을 거야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_MaddieTL04_Quest
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCFMaddieWing
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFMaddieWing
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00A8F1A4
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = You've got yourself a deal.
#. EDID: [0103716B]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002295"
msgid "That means boarding the ship and dealing with whoever's inside."
msgstr "그러니까 우주선에 승선해서 안에 있는 녀석들을 처리해야 해."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_MaddieTL04_Quest
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCFMaddieWing
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFMaddieWing
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00643757
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = You've got yourself a deal.
#. EDID: [0103716B]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002296"
msgid "The parts are small but valuable, so they'll likely be stowed in the captain's locker."
msgstr "부품은 작지만 귀중하니까, 아마 선장의 보관함에 들어 있을 거야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_MaddieTL04_Quest
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCFMaddieWing
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFMaddieWing
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 008EB690
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = You've got yourself a deal.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: You've got yourself a deal.
#. EDID: [0103716B]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002297"
msgid "Good. Now listen up."
msgstr "좋아. 잘 들어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_MaddieTL04_Quest
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = MaddieWing
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFMaddieWing
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00A492CA
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: You've got yourself a deal.
#. EDID: [01037162]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002298"
msgid "You bring the parts back to me, and I pay you for them."
msgstr "부품을 내게 가져오면, 값을 치러줄게."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_MaddieTL04_Quest
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = MaddieWing
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFMaddieWing
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 001CBCE0
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. EDID: [01037162]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002299"
msgid "I give you the info and you go pay a visit to whatever cargo ship is making the delivery."
msgstr "내가 정보를 줄 테니, 넌 그 물건을 운송 중인 화물선을 찾아가 봐."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_MaddieTL04_Quest
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = MaddieWing
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFMaddieWing
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00B2EC44
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. EDID: [01037162]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00229A"
msgid "I get reports from time to time about shipments of these prototype robot parts."
msgstr "가끔 이런 로봇 부품 시제품 선적물에 대한 정보를 얻거든."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_MaddieTL04_Quest
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = MaddieWing
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFMaddieWing
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 004A328A
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = MaddieWing: Well ain't you smart?
#. EDID: [01037162]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00229B"
msgid "How about I quit wasting both of our time, and just level with you?"
msgstr "시간 낭비 그만하고, 바로 본론으로 들어갈까?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_MaddieTL04_Quest
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = MaddieWing
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFMaddieWing
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00286901
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Why does it have to be prototype parts?
#. DialogueAfter = MaddieWing: And you need me to acquire some of these prototype robot parts.
#. EDID: [01037160]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00229C"
msgid "Only then will I know what I'm truly capable of."
msgstr "그래야 내가 진짜 어디까지 할 수 있는지 알 수 있으니까."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_MaddieTL04_Quest
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = MaddieWing
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFMaddieWing
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00FA26A9
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Why does it have to be prototype parts?
#. EDID: [01037160]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00229D"
msgid "I want to bust through those limits like a sledgehammer. Boom!"
msgstr "한계를 쇠망치로 쳐부수듯 박살 내고 싶어. 쾅!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_MaddieTL04_Quest
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = MaddieWing
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFMaddieWing
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00C4B170
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Why does it have to be prototype parts?
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Why does it have to be prototype parts?
#. EDID: [01037160]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00229E"
msgid "I've reached the limits of what I can do with off-the-shelf stuff."
msgstr "기성품으로 할 수 있는 건 한계에 도달했어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_MaddieTL04_Quest
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = MaddieWing
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFMaddieWing
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00F65071
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: And you need me to acquire some of these prototype robot parts.
#. EDID: [0103716A]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00229F"
msgid "I want the cutting edge stuff. Prototypes. Parts that ain't even on the market yet."
msgstr "난 최첨단 제품을 원해. 시제품 말이야. 아직 시장에 나오지도 않은 부품."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_MaddieTL04_Quest
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = MaddieWing
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFMaddieWing
