#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = KillianBrice: Killian Brice. I offer various items for a fair price.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Likewise. And may I say, your timing is fortunate.
#. EDID: [01045E66]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0022AF"
msgid "I'm <Alias=Player>. Good to meet you."
msgstr "난 <Alias=Player>. 만나서 반가워."

#. List: 2
