#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_RishiGreet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = companion
#. VoiceType = NPCMSamCoe
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 0021B84D
#. ScriptNotes = Sarcastic joke / to Player Default
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: I won't cause any trouble.
#. EDID: [010516D6]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0022B9"
msgid "And if you believe that, I've got some pristine real estate on Earth to sell you."
msgstr "정말 그렇게 믿는다면, 나는 지구에 있는 새 부동산을 하나 팔아 줄 수도 있을걸."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_RishiGreet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = companion
#. VoiceType = NPCMSamCoe
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 00E39A24
#. ScriptNotes = Sarcasm / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Don't you worry, I'll handle the Spacers. &&& RishiSaint: Really? |I believe in fair pay for a job well done.|Deal with these Spacers, and I'll provide the credits.|My head of security can point you in the right direction. &&& RishiSaint: A few words of advice.|We're happy to welcome all who pass through the airlock, but our hospitality has limits.|Acts of theft or violence will be met with a swift response.|We also value privacy and discretion here.|Our patrons expect to conduct whatever business they wish free from prying eyes and ears.
#. EDID: [010516D6]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0022BA"
msgid "I'm sure it's all perfectly legal and above board."
msgstr "분명 전부 완벽하게 합법이고 떳떳한 일이었겠지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_KillianTL02Job
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = companion
#. VoiceType = NPCFSarahMorgan
#. Face = Stern
#. SoundFileID = 003B938C
#. ScriptNotes = Stern / Stern / to KillianBrice
#. DialogueAfter = KillianBrice: Now, how can I help you?
#. EDID: [01052F30]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0022BB"
msgid "I'll say no more about it."
msgstr "더 뭐라 말하진 않겠어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_KillianTL02Job
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = companion
#. VoiceType = NPCFSarahMorgan
#. Face = Irritated
#. SoundFileID = 0000EBC8
#. ScriptNotes = Scorn / Irritated / to KillianBrice
#. DialogueBefore = companion: I knew your name sounded familiar, but I've only just placed it.|You used your position in Vanguard to covertly siphon funds into forged accounts.|It was a shameful betrayal of the oath you took, and you got exactly what you deserved. &&& KillianBrice: What I did was selfish, and yes, I paid the price.|But let's not pretend I was the only example of corruption within the hallowed walls of the MAST.|Anyone who thinks otherwise is being naive.
#. EDID: [01052F30]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0022BC"
msgid "I'm well aware of Vanguard's deficiencies, but none of that excuses what you did."
msgstr "뱅가드에 문제가 있다는 건 나도 잘 알고 있지만, 그렇다고 그쪽이 한 일이 정당화되진 않아."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_KillianTL02Job
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = KillianBrice
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMKillianBrice
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 006BB33D
#. ScriptNotes = / to companion
#. DialogueAfter = companion: Hey, no judgement here.
#. EDID: [01052F1F]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0022BD"
msgid "Anyone who thinks otherwise is being naive."
msgstr "그렇게 생각하는 사람이 있다면 순진한 거지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_KillianTL02Job
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = KillianBrice
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMKillianBrice
#. Face = Defiant
#. SoundFileID = 00FA1DB1
#. ScriptNotes = Defiant / Defiant / to companion
#. EDID: [01052F1F]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0022BE"
msgid "But let's not pretend I was the only example of corruption within the hallowed walls of the MAST."
msgstr "근데 신성한 MAST의 벽 안에서 부패한 놈이 나 하나뿐이었다고 우기진 말자고."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_KillianTL02Job
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = KillianBrice
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMKillianBrice
#. Face = Somber
#. SoundFileID = 00BA5734
#. ScriptNotes = Somber / Somber / to companion
#. DialogueBefore = KillianBrice: Nobody else was. |I was grateful for the extended hand of friendship. &&& companion: I knew your name sounded familiar, but I've only just placed it.|You used your position in Vanguard to covertly siphon funds into forged accounts.|It was a shameful betrayal of the oath you took, and you got exactly what you deserved.
#. EDID: [01052F1F]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0022BF"
msgid "What I did was selfish, and yes, I paid the price."
msgstr "내가 한 짓은 이기적이었어. 그래, 대가를 톡톡히 치렀지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_KillianTL02Job
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = companion
#. VoiceType = NPCMBarrett
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 004D28DD
#. ScriptNotes = Realization / to KillianBrice
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Good thing he was there for you. &&& KillianBrice: Nobody else was. |I was grateful for the extended hand of friendship.
#. DialogueAfter = KillianBrice: *Sigh* Yes, that was me. I made mistakes, but I have paid my debt to society
#. EDID: [01052F35]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0022C0"
msgid "Wait a minute. Aren't you the guy behind that big Vanguard embezzling scandal?"
msgstr "잠깐만. 당신, 그 뱅가드 횡령 대사건의 장본인이야?"

