#. SoundFileID = 00E6D02E
#. ScriptNotes = Suspicious / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I'm <Alias=Player>. Good to meet you. &&& KillianBrice: Likewise. And may I say, your timing is fortunate. &&& KillianBrice: I have a network of buyers interested in obtaining rare and dangerous chemical compounds.|Being controlled substances, a permit is required to transport the compounds.|Of course, for the resourceful ship's captain, there are always other options.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: So you need a smuggler.
#. EDID: [01052F26]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0022C1"
msgid "By which he no doubt means a ship's captain willing to risk breaking the law."
msgstr "그 수완 좋은 선장은 법을 어기는 위험을 감수하는 선장을 말하는 거겠지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_MaddieTL02_Background
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = MaddieWing
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFMaddieWing
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00FE079C
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = I'd say it falls on your parents for not raising you better.
#. DialogueAfter = MaddieWing: Anyway, I busted myself out, stowed away aboard a courier ship and spent a few years on the lam.
#. EDID: [01052F22]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0022C2"
msgid "They were always working late, so I had to entertain myself. No wonder I got up to trouble."
msgstr "부모님은 늘 야근하느라 바쁘셨고, 난 알아서 혼자 놀아야 했지. 그러니 맨날 사고나 치고 다녔지 뭐."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_MaddieTL02_Background
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = MaddieWing
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCFMaddieWing
#. Face = Sad
#. SoundFileID = 00928C01
#. ScriptNotes = Some sadness creeps in / Sad / to Player Default
#. Prompt = I'd say it falls on your parents for not raising you better.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I'd say it falls on your parents for not raising you better.
#. EDID: [01052F22]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0022C3"
msgid "It's true that I was alone a lot back then."
msgstr "그때 혼자 있는 시간이 많았던 건 사실이야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
