#. SoundFileID = 00391781
#. ScriptNotes = Sarcastic / Sarcastic / to Player Default
#. EDID: [01054A59]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0022C4"
msgid "Otherwise, the job is a piece of cake. "
msgstr "그 외의 일은 식은 죽 먹기야. "

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_ChanTL01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = ChanHuang
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMChanHuang
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 009E9882
#. ScriptNotes = Sarcasm / to Player Default
#. EDID: [01054A59]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0022C5"
msgid "Oh, and how could I forget working every day on a decrepit star station that could fall apart at any moment."
msgstr "아, 그리고 언제 무너져도 이상하지 않은 낡아빠진 우주정거장에서 매일 일하는 것도 잊을 수 없지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_ChanTL01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = ChanHuang
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMChanHuang
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 00245C03
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. EDID: [01054A59]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0022C6"
msgid "Nothing serious. Just supply shortages, drunk pirates, angry Spacers, bad pay, low morale, not enough staff..."
msgstr "별거 없어. 그냥 보급 부족, 술 취한 해적, 화난 스페이서, 형편없는 보수, 낮은 사기, 부족한 인력 정도..."

#. List: 2
