#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_CuttyTL03Quest
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Cutty
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMCutty
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 003EC553
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = I'm not looking to get dragged into any family drama.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I'm not looking to get dragged into any family drama.
#. DialogueAfter = Cutty: Now please hurry. My son's life is in your hands.
#. EDID: [01066118]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0022D2"
msgid "Then forget I said it. Just, please, get my son out of danger."
msgstr "그럼 내가 한 말은 잊어버려. 그저, 제발 내 아들을 위험에서 구해 줘."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_CuttyTL03Quest
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Cutty
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0047FAE7
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I'll get your son back. &&& Cutty: You would do that? Really?|Sorry if I seem a little in shock. Most people around here don't stick their neck out for others.|But thank you. Sincerely. &&& Cutty: There's one more thing.|My son and I had a falling out. We haven't spoken in years.|If you mention me, I'm not sure how he'll react. It might be better not to.|Anyway, just thought you should know.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Look, I don't know you, and that's a sensitive subject.
#. EDID: [01066119]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0022D3"
msgid "What happened between you and your son?"
msgstr "당신과 아들 사이에 무슨 일이 있었어?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_CuttyTL03Quest
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMCutty
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMCutty
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 007B1425
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = I understand.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I understand.
#. DialogueAfter = Cutty: Now please hurry. My son's life is in your hands.
#. EDID: [0106611D]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0022D4"
msgid "I appreciate that."
msgstr "고마워."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_CuttyTL03Quest
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Cutty
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00A437B1
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I'll get your son back. &&& Cutty: You would do that? Really?|Sorry if I seem a little in shock. Most people around here don't stick their neck out for others.|But thank you. Sincerely. &&& Cutty: There's one more thing.|My son and I had a falling out. We haven't spoken in years.|If you mention me, I'm not sure how he'll react. It might be better not to.|Anyway, just thought you should know.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Then forget I said it. Just, please, get my son out of danger.
#. EDID: [01066117]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0022D5"
msgid "I'm not looking to get dragged into any family drama."
msgstr "집안 싸움에 휘말리고 싶진 않아."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_CuttyMilesScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = CuttyClean
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMCutty
#. Face = Sad
#. SoundFileID = 00F63B34
#. ScriptNotes = Emphasize "need". This is the conversation turning more serious and sincere, with sadness behind the words / Sad / to MilesCutler
#. DialogueAfter = MilesCutler: One thing at a time. Let this be a first step. We'll get around to the rest.
#. EDID: [0106BBAB]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0022D6"
msgid "Miles, there's so much I want to say. No, I need to say."
msgstr "마일즈, 하고 싶은 말이 정말 많아. 아니, 꼭 해야 할 말이 있어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_CuttyMilesScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = CuttyClean
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMCutty
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00E019B6
#. ScriptNotes = Fondness / to MilesCutler
#. DialogueBefore = CuttyClean: Reasonably so, yes.|We get our share of colorful characters through here, and more than a few are prone to violence.|Most of the injuries I treat result from drunken brawls. &&& MilesCutler: Hey, at least it's not boring, right?
#. EDID: [0106BBAB]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0022D7"
msgid "You always were the one to look for the silver lining."
msgstr "넌 늘 좋은 면을 보려는 아이였지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_CuttyMilesScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = MilesCutler
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMMilesCutler
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00231830
#. ScriptNotes = Looking for the escape hatch / to CuttyClean
#. DialogueAfter = CuttyClean: Of course. Enjoy yourself. And... it was good to see you.
#. EDID: [0106BBA0]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0022D8"
msgid "In fact, if you don't mind, I'm going to go check out the bar."
msgstr "사실 괜찮다면 난 바에 좀 가 볼게."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_CuttyMilesScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = MilesCutler
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMMilesCutler
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00E4E2CC
#. ScriptNotes = In essence, slow down, I'm not ready to have that conversation yet. / to CuttyClean
#. DialogueBefore = MilesCutler: Hey, at least it's not boring, right? &&& CuttyClean: You always were the one to look for the silver lining.|Miles, there's so much I want to say. No, I need to say.
#. EDID: [0106BBA0]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0022D9"
msgid "One thing at a time. Let this be a first step. We'll get around to the rest."
msgstr "하나씩 해 나가자. 이걸 첫걸음으로 삼는 거야. 나머지는 차차 해 나가면 돼."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_CuttyMilesScene
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = MilesCutler
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMMilesCutler
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 000488CF
#. ScriptNotes = Chuckle, trying to make a joke, albeit weakly / to CuttyClean
#. DialogueBefore = MilesCutler: So, uh... how have you been otherwise? Does this place keep you busy? &&& CuttyClean: Reasonably so, yes.|We get our share of colorful characters through here, and more than a few are prone to violence.|Most of the injuries I treat result from drunken brawls.
#. DialogueAfter = CuttyClean: You always were the one to look for the silver lining.
#. EDID: [0106BBCD]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0022DA"
msgid "Hey, at least it's not boring, right?"
msgstr "이봐, 그래도 지루하진 않잖아?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_CuttyTL04Clean
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = CuttyClean
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00F38DA7
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: You look different. &&& CuttyClean: A long-overdue change.|I let so many things go. Things I shouldn't have. I made a companion of misery.|Now it's time to turn the page, if I can. I have to try, right?
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: You're right, of course, but maybe they can be the first small steps down a long road.
#. EDID: [0106BC02]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0022DB"
msgid "A shave and new clothes can't change who you really are."
msgstr "면도하고 새 옷을 입는다고 네 본모습이 바뀌진 않아."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_CuttyTL04Clean
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = CuttyClean
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00686D09
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: You look different. &&& CuttyClean: A long-overdue change.|I let so many things go. Things I shouldn't have. I made a companion of misery.|Now it's time to turn the page, if I can. I have to try, right?
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: I've tried to set small goals and reasonable expectations for myself.
#. EDID: [0106BB7C]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0022DC"
msgid "It won't be fast or easy. Be prepared for a challenge."
msgstr "빠르지도 쉽지도 않을 거야. 각오해 둬."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. SceneName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint_CuttyTL04Clean
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00345A60
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: You look different. &&& CuttyClean: A long-overdue change.|I let so many things go. Things I shouldn't have. I made a companion of misery.|Now it's time to turn the page, if I can. I have to try, right?
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: Thank you. Hopefully I can develop a little faith in myself, as well.
#. EDID: [0106BB81]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0022DD"
msgid "You can do this. I have faith in you."
msgstr "넌 할 수 있어. 난 널 믿어."

#. List: 2
