msgctxt "0022E3"
msgid "You're going to need more credits first."
msgstr "먼저 크레딧이 더 필요하겠어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMCutty
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMCutty
#. Face = Irritated
#. SoundFileID = 000B87B4
#. ScriptNotes = Gruff, a doctor telling a patient they don't have enough money. / Irritated
#. EDID: [01053DF5]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0022E4"
msgid "Come back when you can afford this."
msgstr "이걸 감당할 수 있을 때 다시 와."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMCutty
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMCutty
#. Face = Irritated
#. SoundFileID = 00958390
#. ScriptNotes = Gruff, a doctor telling a patient they don't have enough money. / Irritated
#. EDID: [01053DF4]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0022E5"
msgid "You kidding me? You think I'll do this for nothing?"
msgstr "농담해? 내가 공짜로 이걸 해 줄 거라고 생각해?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMCutty
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMCutty
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00256C99
#. ScriptNotes = Friendly, a doctor who has just finished patching up a patient.
#. EDID: [01053DE8]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0022E6"
msgid "All done."
msgstr "다 됐어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_DialogueAnchorpoint
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMCutty
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMCutty
#. Face = Irritated
#. SoundFileID = 00880364
#. ScriptNotes = Gruff, a doctor who has just finished patching up a patient. / Irritated
#. EDID: [01053DE5]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0022E7"
msgid "I'm through with you. "
msgstr "네 도움은 필요 없어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_MiscDialogue
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMIvicaVukovic
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMIvicaVukovic
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00BE363F
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral
#. EDID: [0103169A]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0022EB"
msgid "The outpost needs Hal's labor, so I am not against him staying."
msgstr "이 전초기지는 일손이 부족하니 할이 일해줘야 해. 할이 남는 것에 반대하지 않을 거야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_MiscDialogue
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMIvicaVukovic
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMIvicaVukovic
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00963BF1
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral
#. EDID: [0103E417]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0022EC"
msgid "Caruso's a survivor. Wherever he goes, he'll make it work."
msgstr "카루소는 생존력이 강해. 어디를 가든 잘 살 거야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_MiscDialogue
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCFSunniKim
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFSunniKim
#. Face = Amused
#. SoundFileID = 00DA3D1B
#. ScriptNotes = Amused
#. EDID: [010647D0]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0022ED"
msgid "So who are we putting on trial next? "
msgstr "그래서 다음에는 누구를 재판에 세우는 거야?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_MiscDialogue
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCFSunniKim
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFSunniKim
#. Face = Happy
#. SoundFileID = 0018C9A3
#. ScriptNotes = Happy
#. EDID: [010647CF]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0022EE"
msgid "God I love drama."
msgstr "이런 드라마 정말 좋다니까."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_MiscDialogue
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCFSashaAtwell
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFSashaAtwell
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 000FBA3D
#. ScriptNotes = Serious
#. EDID: [010647CA]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0022EF"
msgid "Hal may be a free man, but that doesn't change the fact he fooled us. I'm going to be extra vigilant now. Everyone's a suspect."
msgstr ""
"할이 자유의 몸이 되었을진 몰라도, 녀석이 우릴 속였다는 사실은 변하지 않습니다. 이제부터 눈에 불을 켜고 감시할 겁니다. 모두 다 "
"용의자로 여길 겁니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_MiscDialogue
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMHalCaruso
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMHalCaruso
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00FCC786
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral
#. EDID: [010647BC]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0022F0"
msgid "In time, I might call this place home."
msgstr "언젠가는 이곳을 집이라 부르게 될지도 모르겠어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_MiscDialogue
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCFZenaHield
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFZenaHield
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00109784
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral
#. EDID: [010316AB]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0022F1"
msgid "I take no joy in condemning a man to death. But the vote was fair."
msgstr "한 사람에게 사형을 선고하는 게 기쁘진 않아. 하지만 투표는 공정했어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_MiscDialogue
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMYeats
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMYeats
#. Face = Somber
#. SoundFileID = 003D51E8
#. ScriptNotes = Somber
#. EDID: [010316A2]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0022F2"
msgid "Wherever he goes, I hope Hal makes peace with his past."
msgstr "할이 어디로 가든, 자신의 과거와 화해했으면 좋겠어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_MiscDialogue
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCFZenaHield
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFZenaHield
#. Face = Somber
#. SoundFileID = 0090520E
#. ScriptNotes = Somber
#. EDID: [010313DD]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0022F3"
msgid "I am going to need a long vacation after this."
msgstr "이 일이 끝나면 긴 휴가가 필요하겠어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_MiscDialogue
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_HelpWanted_040_TopLevel04
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Bernhard
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMBernhardKleiber
#. Face = Angry
#. SoundFileID = 0003FCC9
#. ScriptNotes = Angry / to Player Default
#. EDID: [0103071B]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0022F4"
msgid "All things you believe honorable and chaste, mean nothing when you are cold and starving, crossing swords with death."
msgstr "고상하고 깨끗하다고 믿는 신념들? 추위에 떨며 굶어 죽기 직전이 되거나, 목에 칼이 들어오는 순간엔 아무 의미도 없지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_MiscDialogue
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_HelpWanted_040_TopLevel04
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Bernhard
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMBernhardKleiber
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00073AE3
#. ScriptNotes = Serious / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Bernhard: I am against volunteering for any fight I have no stake in, yes.
#. EDID: [0103071B]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0022F5"
msgid "Once you open your eyes and see the world for what it really is, you will realize the truth."
msgstr "눈 똑바로 뜨고 세상이 어떻게 돌아가는지 보게 되면, 진짜 현실을 알게 되지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_MiscDialogue
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_HelpWanted_050_CaspianTL03
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 004092B1
#. DialogueAfter = Caspian: Yeah, I was doing maintenance on it, and I messed something up with the valve.
#. EDID: [01030762]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0022F6"
msgid "Is something wrong with the water pump?"
msgstr "물펌프에 문제가 있는 건가요?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMHalCaruso
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMHalCaruso
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00C99577
#. EDID: [01034F7E]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0022F7"
msgid "I'll follow you until we reach Shinar."
msgstr "시날에 도착할 때까지 따라갈게."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCFSashaAtwell
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFSashaAtwell
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 003BEBD7
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral
#. EDID: [010313B4]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0022F8"
msgid "All I have to say is, nobody's above the law. Not even Hal."
msgstr "하고 싶은 말은 이거 딱 하나뿐입니다. 그 누구도 법위에 있을 순 없습니다. 할이라도 말입니다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCFZenaHield
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFZenaHield
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00E46E56
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral
#. EDID: [010313B2]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0022F9"
msgid "This vote may decide the fate of the outpost."
msgstr "이번 투표가 전초기지의 운명을 결정할지도 몰라."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMHalCaruso
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMHalCaruso
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0024DE0D
#. EDID: [01031117]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0022FA"
msgid "We'll talk once we get to Shinar."
msgstr "시날에 도착하면 이야기하자."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCFGraceKim
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFGraceKim
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00482ABD
#. EDID: [0105594B]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0022FB"
msgid "I'm not sure how everyone else is voting, but I guess we'll find out soon enough."
msgstr "다른 사람들이 어떻게 투표할지는 잘 모르겠지만, 곧 알게 되겠지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMIvicaVukovic
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMIvicaVukovic
#. Face = VeryAngry
#. SoundFileID = 0004739B
#. ScriptNotes = VeryAngry
#. EDID: [01030767]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0022FC"
msgid "Someone stole my keycard. I'd bet both my thumbs it was Sunni."
msgstr "누군가 내 키카드를 훔쳤어. 내 두 엄지를 걸고 수니가 범인이라고 장담하지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_150_Caruso_Greet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMHalCaruso
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMHalCaruso
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00C575EA
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Many outposts of this type have multiple maintenance issues.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Many outposts of this type have multiple maintenance issues.
#. DialogueAfter = Caruso: For one, I'd like to automate some of the work here. To do that, we need to fix the Model A unit by the junkyard.
#. EDID: [01052C8F]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0022FD"
msgid "And New Babylon is no exception."
msgstr "뉴바빌론도 예외는 아니야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2410_Sasha_Greet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Sasha
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFSashaAtwell
#. Face = Angry
#. SoundFileID = 00C9D143
#. ScriptNotes = Angry / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Money. It's always money.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Money. It's always money.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: It doesn't matter. It doesn't justify what she did.
#. EDID: [01023C99]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0022FE"
msgid "Yeah, criminals are all the same. They never want to do the work. They rather just steal."
msgstr "예, 범죄자 놈들은 다 똑같습니다. 일할 생각은 쥐뿔도 안 하고, 그저 훔치려고만 들죠."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2330_Caspian_Greeet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Caspian
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMCaspianRoberson
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00E460E3
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral / to Player Default
#. Prompt = I'm not fishing through trash. You do it.
#. EDID: [01026B71]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0022FF"
msgid "But I know better than to disobey Hal. Here, this key should open the dumpster. Let Hal know what you find."
msgstr "하지만 할의 말을 거스르면 안 된다는 건 알아. 여기, 이 열쇠면 대형 쓰레기통을 열 수 있을 거야. 뭘 찾았는지 할에게 알려 줘."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2330_Caspian_Greeet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Caspian
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMCaspianRoberson
#. Face = Disbelief
#. SoundFileID = 004804E1
#. ScriptNotes = Disbelief / to Player Default
#. Prompt = Is the dumpster locked?
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Is the dumpster locked?
#. DialogueAfter = Caspian: I've already combed through the dumpster and found some evidence.
#. EDID: [01030763]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002300"
msgid "Yeah, Hal and I thought it best to lock it down until we could do a little sleuthing. But if you're on the case, I can give you the key."
msgstr "그래, 할과 나는 우리가 좀 조사할 때까지 잠가 두는 게 좋겠다고 생각했어. 하지만 네가 맡는다면 열쇠를 줄 수 있어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2400_Caruso_TL09_EvidenceCOPY0000
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Caruso
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMHalCaruso
#. Face = Puzzled
#. SoundFileID = 0085055A
#. ScriptNotes = Puzzled / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Caruso: Well, it's a chem. That doesn't means it's related to Yeats. &&& Yeats: I would not know a chem if it fell into my tonsils!
#. EDID: [010388BC]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002301"
msgid "He can say that, but I don't think this helps our case."
msgstr "그렇게 말할 수는 있겠지만, 그게 우리 입장에 도움이 된다고는 생각하지 않아."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2400_Caruso_TL09_EvidenceCOPY0000
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Yeats
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMYeats
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 008DF908
#. ScriptNotes = Confident
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: [Chems] I found this along with other evidence. &&& Caruso: Well, it's a chem. That doesn't means it's related to Yeats.
#. DialogueAfter = Caruso: He can say that, but I don't think this helps our case.
#. EDID: [010388B7]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002302"
msgid "I would not know a chem if it fell into my tonsils!"
msgstr "화학약품이 내 편도에 떨어진다 해도 난 그게 뭔지 모를 거야!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c2400_Caruso_TL09_EvidenceCOPY0000
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Caruso
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMHalCaruso
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0049729C
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: [Chems] I found this along with other evidence.
#. DialogueAfter = Yeats: I would not know a chem if it fell into my tonsils!
#. EDID: [01031FB0]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002303"
msgid "Well, it's a chem. That doesn't means it's related to Yeats."
msgstr "글쎄, 그건 화학약품이야. 그렇다고 예이츠와 관련 있다는 뜻은 아니지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_e2920_BernhardKilledZenaGreet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Zena
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFZenaHield
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00C7DF1C
#. ScriptNotes = Serious / to Player Default
#. Prompt = My finger slipped.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: My finger slipped.
#. DialogueAfter = Zena: But fine. He admitted to killing Hal, and the vote would've only went one way.
#. EDID: [010388F4]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002304"
msgid "Unbelievable. You think this is a joke?"
msgstr "믿을 수가 없군. 이게 농담인 줄 알아?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_e2920_BernhardKilledZenaGreet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Zena
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFZenaHield
#. Face = Somber
#. SoundFileID = 00395471
#. ScriptNotes = Somber
#. DialogueAfter = Zena: *Sigh* Now it makes sense why he refused to say anything.
#. EDID: [010388F5]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002305"
msgid "Still, with all that's happened, thing around here are really looking grim."
msgstr "그래도 지금까지 벌어진 일을 보면, 이곳 상황은 정말 암울해지고 있어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_e2920_BernhardKilledZenaGreet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Zena
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFZenaHield
#. Face = Angry
#. SoundFileID = 00D5634F
#. ScriptNotes = Angry
#. DialogueBefore = Zena: And who's going to get revenge for him?
#. EDID: [010388F5]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002306"
msgid "But fine. He admitted to killing Hal, and the vote would've only went one way."
msgstr "하지만 좋아. 그가 할을 죽였다고 인정했고, 투표 결과는 어차피 한쪽으로만 흘러갔을 거야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_e2920_BernhardKilledZenaGreet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Zena
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFZenaHield
#. Face = Defiant
#. SoundFileID = 0031AFF0
#. ScriptNotes = Defiant / to Player Default
#. Prompt = I didn't want to have another pointless vote.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: I didn't want to have another pointless vote.
#. DialogueAfter = Zena: But fine. He admitted to killing Hal, and the vote would've only went one way.
#. EDID: [010388F2]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002307"
msgid "The vote is how we stay civilized."
msgstr "투표야말로 우리가 문명인으로 남는 방식이야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_e2920_BernhardKilledZenaGreet
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Zena
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 008B57E6
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Bernhard, the refugee from Shinar, tried to kill Caruso. I stopped him. &&& Caspian: It's true. I checked his cell. Hal... Hal's dead.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: The vote is how we stay civilized.
#. EDID: [010388F0]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002308"
msgid "I didn't want to have another pointless vote."
msgstr "또 한 번 무의미한 투표를 하고 싶지 않았어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_e2920_BernhardKilledZenaGreet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Zena
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFZenaHield
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0095CE9C
#. DialogueBefore = Zena: I suppose he knew that we would never execute one of our own.
#. DialogueAfter = Zena: Citizens, if all the votes are in, I'll cast my vote and we'll begin the tally.
#. EDID: [0103C65A]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002309"
msgid "On that note, I should announce the outcome of the vote."
msgstr "그 말이 나온 김에 투표 결과를 발표해야겠군."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_e2920_BernhardKilledZenaGreet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Zena
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFZenaHield
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00C16C00
#. DialogueBefore = Zena: I suppose he knew that we would never execute one of our own.
#. DialogueAfter = Zena: Citizens, if all the votes are in, I'll cast my vote and we'll begin the tally.
#. EDID: [0103C659]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00230A"
msgid "On that note, I'll reiterate the outcome of the vote."
msgstr "그 말이 나온 김에 투표 결과를 다시 말해 두겠어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_d3200_CarusoTL02
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Caruso
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMHalCaruso
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00725226
#. ScriptNotes = If Andreja is with the Player and known to be with Va'ruun. / to companion
#. DialogueBefore = Caruso: Perhaps your companion would prefer to elaborate. &&& companion: No, I would rather you speak His scripture, provided you still remember, "Promised."
#. DialogueAfter = Caruso: It is the word of Jinan and the will of the Serpent.
#. EDID: [0105136E]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00230B"
msgid "Very well."
msgstr "좋아."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_d3200_CarusoTL02
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = companion
#. VoiceType = NPCFSarahMorgan
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 00470BBA
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: What's that prayer from? &&& Caruso: Perhaps your companion would prefer to elaborate.
#. DialogueAfter = Caruso: Very well.
#. EDID: [01051373]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00230C"
msgid "At the very least, it doesn't seem like it's a local prayer you recited."
msgstr "적어도 네가 읊은 게 이 지역의 기도문 같지는 않군."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_d3200_CarusoTL02
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = companion
#. VoiceType = NPCFAndreja
#. Face = Angry
#. SoundFileID = 00A2EA8A
#. ScriptNotes = Caruso has abandoned House Va'ruun so Andreja is not taking kindly to him / Angry
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: What's that prayer from? &&& Caruso: Perhaps your companion would prefer to elaborate.
#. DialogueAfter = Caruso: Very well.
#. EDID: [01051370]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00230D"
msgid "I do not know you, or what doctrine you speak."
msgstr "나는 당신도, 당신이 말하는 교리도 모른다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_200_CarusoTL01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Caruso
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMHalCaruso
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00E462EE
#. ScriptNotes = / to companion
#. DialogueBefore = Caruso: I've been trying to convince him to shift around the outpost's power distribution, with little luck.|Maybe you'll be able to sway him. &&& companion: Then perhaps you aren't being forceful enough.
#. EDID: [01051374]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00230E"
msgid "Ivica's a stubborn man. I'm not sure force is the right tactic. But I'll leave it to your judgment."
msgstr "이비차는 고집 센 사람이야. 힘으로 밀어붙이는 게 맞는 전술인지는 모르겠어. 하지만 판단은 너에게 맡길게."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_200_CarusoTL01
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = companion
#. VoiceType = NPCFSarahMorgan
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 00CA8235
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: If I had the materials I could craft one. &&& Caruso: I had a similar thought. The junkyard might have the parts, but the magnet is hooked up to the same power source. &&& Caruso: You'll need to talk to Ivica, the supply coordinator. &&& Caruso: I've been trying to convince him to shift around the outpost's power distribution, with little luck.|Maybe you'll be able to sway him.
#. DialogueAfter = Caruso: Ivica's a stubborn man. I'm not sure force is the right tactic. But I'll leave it to your judgment.
#. EDID: [0105137A]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "00230F"
msgid "We can't make any promises, but we'll see."
msgstr "약속은 못 하지만, 한번 보자고."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_120_Caruso_Greet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = companion
#. VoiceType = NPCFSarahMorgan
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 00685B24
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: You're a known criminal. I'm guessing there's probably a bounty on your head too.
#. DialogueAfter = Caruso: Wait. Not here. Not in front of the boy.
#. EDID: [0105136D]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002310"
msgid "Suffice to say you have a lot to answer for."
msgstr "간단히 말해, 너는 해명해야 할 일이 아주 많아."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c3100_Bernhard_Greet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCMBernhardKleiber
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMBernhardKleiber
#. Face = Depressed
#. SoundFileID = 009ADD63
#. ScriptNotes = Depressed / to Player Default
#. Prompt = It's okay. It's going to take time to process.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: It's okay. It's going to take time to process.
#. DialogueAfter = Bernhard: *Sigh* Either way, thank you, stranger. While I don't know if closure will ever come, it's good to know others will not befall the same fate.
#. EDID: [01052E99]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002311"
msgid "You're right. I just thought I'd feel better. But it's more complicated than that."
msgstr "네 말이 맞아. 그냥 기분이 나아질 줄 알았어. 그런데 생각보다 복잡하네."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c3100_Bernhard_Greet
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Bernhard
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMBernhardKleiber
#. Face = Confused
#. SoundFileID = 0038F177
#. ScriptNotes = Confused / to Player Default
#. Prompt = You should be elated.
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: You should be elated.
#. DialogueAfter = Bernhard: *Sigh* Either way, thank you, stranger. While I don't know if closure will ever come, it's good to know others will not befall the same fate.
#. EDID: [01052E9D]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002312"
msgid "That's what I thought but... I don't feel joy. Why doesn't it feel joyous? Maybe if I had seen the body... I don't know."
msgstr "나도 그럴 줄 알았는데... 기쁘지가 않아. 왜 기쁘게 느껴지지 않는 거지? 시체를 봤다면 달랐을까... 모르겠어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_c3100_Bernhard_Greet
#. DialogCallType = PlayerDialogue
#. Speaker = Player
#. Alias = Bernhard
#. VoiceType = PlayerVoiceMale01 / PlayerVoiceFemale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 009DA41C
#. ScriptNotes = / to Player Default
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: You should know, I found and killed Caruso. &&& Bernhard: What? Really? Then he's finally dead? I... I don't know what to say. &&& Bernhard: It's strange. I've been waiting for so long to hear those words and yet...|I don't know how to feel about it.
#. DialogueAfter = Player Default: That's what I thought but... I don't feel joy. Why doesn't it feel joyous? Maybe if I had seen the body... I don't know.
#. EDID: [01052E92]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002313"
msgid "You should be elated."
msgstr "기뻐해야지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_d3200_CarusoTL07
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Caruso
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMHalCaruso
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00EC4999
#. ScriptNotes = Serious
#. EDID: [010590B4]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002314"
msgid "I never felt such bondage here. I don't know if it was the right place, or the right time. But I chose to stay."
msgstr "여기서 그런 속박은 느껴 본 적 없어. 장소가 맞았던 건지, 때가 맞았던 건지는 모르겠지만, 난 남기로 했어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_d3200_CarusoTL07
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Caruso
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMHalCaruso
#. Face = Stern
#. SoundFileID = 00CA9216
#. ScriptNotes = Stern
#. EDID: [010590B4]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002315"
msgid "Even at Shinar, I was a prisoner to my own fear and paranoia."
msgstr "시날에서도 난 내 두려움과 편집증의 포로였어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_Quest
#. SceneName = SFFL_MS01_Quest_d3200_CarusoTL07
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Caruso
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCMHalCaruso
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 000E86C6
#. ScriptNotes = Neutral
#. DialogueBefore = Player Default: Why did you decide to help the folks here? How do I know you won't discard them like the others?
#. EDID: [010590B4]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "002316"
msgid "A fair question. I will say that everywhere I've been, I've been a prisoner."
msgstr "정당한 질문이군. 내가 가 본 곳마다 나는 포로였다고 말해 두겠어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_Anchorpoint_RandConv11_MaddieTiger02
