msgid "I'll let you borrow my stuff, with interest."
msgstr "제 물건 빌려줄게요. 대신 이자는 붙어요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 008F389C
#. EDID: [01083E22]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "010591"
msgid "I can't wait to suck this place dry of all its resources."
msgstr "여기 자원을 싹 빨아먹을 생각을 하니 못 기다리겠네."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00790A05
#. EDID: [01083E21]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "010592"
msgid "Some will tell you places like this are beautiful. Thankfully, there's therapy for that."
msgstr "어떤 사람들은 이런 곳이 아름답다고 하겠지. 다행히 그런 사람들을 위한 치료법이 있어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00084C8D
#. EDID: [01083D6B]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "010A41"
msgid "You're back. I guess I'll go put away your coffin."
msgstr "돌아왔네. 관은 다시 치워 둬야겠어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Angry
#. SoundFileID = 006798D2
#. ScriptNotes = Angry
#. EDID: [01083CA2]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "010A42"
msgid "Oh good, more stuff to kill."
msgstr "오 좋네, 죽일 게 더 생겼어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Puzzled
#. SoundFileID = 0010A706
#. ScriptNotes = Puzzled
#. EDID: [01083C2D]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "010A43"
msgid "Might be an ambush coming. Fun."
msgstr "매복이 올지도 몰라. 재밌겠네."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 005C7093
#. EDID: [01083D67]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "010EE5"
msgid "Back again, huh. I'm sure somebody around here's happy about it."
msgstr "또 왔구나. 여기 누군가는 기뻐하겠지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = InPain
#. SoundFileID = 008B4621
#. ScriptNotes = InPain
#. EDID: [01083C17]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "010EE7"
msgid "I can't...keep this...up..."
msgstr "더는... 못... 버티겠어..."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 004C1335
#. EDID: [01083C75]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "010EE8"
msgid "Weapon's offline, Captain."
msgstr "무기가 오프라인입니다, 선장."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 0022C4A8
#. EDID: [01083C6D]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "010EE9"
msgid "Dead ships make for plenty of treasure."
msgstr "죽은 우주선에는 보물이 잔뜩 있지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 0031205C
#. EDID: [01083D32]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "010EEF"
msgid "Spells and incantations."
msgstr "주문과 주술이라."

#. List: 2
#. EDID: [01083E1B]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "010EF0"
msgid "Scanners say there's no oxygen. I bet it was your fault. "
msgstr "스캐너에 산소가 없다고 나와. 네 탓이겠지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_DoctorDialogue
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCFGraceKim
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFGraceKim
#. Face = Concerned
#. SoundFileID = 008DF324
#. ScriptNotes = doctor diagnosing patient / Concerned
#. EDID: [010276D7]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "011328"
msgid "Honestly, I'm surprised you're walking around like this."
msgstr "솔직히 네가 이렇게 걸어 다니는 게 놀랍네."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00EFC201
#. EDID: [01083D7D]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "01135C"
msgid "Let's hear it."
msgstr "말해 봐."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Angry
#. SoundFileID = 00CC2C0F
#. ScriptNotes = Angry
#. EDID: [01083CCB]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "01135D"
msgid "Goddamnit."
msgstr "젠장."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00D072F0
#. EDID: [01083D7A]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0117D2"
msgid "I guess you want to talk."
msgstr "대화하고 싶은 모양이네."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Puzzled
#. SoundFileID = 00F4C10C
#. ScriptNotes = Puzzled
#. EDID: [01083C2A]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0117D3"
msgid "Lost them. Not that I was looking that hard."
msgstr "놓쳤어. 열심히 찾은 것도 아니지만."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 000A8193
#. EDID: [01083D46]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0117D5"
msgid "Huh. Shield systems offline."
msgstr "허. 보호막 시스템이 오프라인이야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00F07AEC
#. EDID: [01083D42]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0117D6"
msgid "Our shields are out. Damn."
msgstr "우리 보호막이 나갔어. 젠장."

#. List: 2
#. EDID: [01083E18]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0117DB"
msgid "It'd be suicide to explore this area without our suits. So, helmets off or what?"
msgstr "슈트 없이 이 지역을 탐험하는 건 자살행위야. 그러니까 헬멧 벗자는 거지?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00EAFBAB
#. EDID: [01083E09]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0117DC"
msgid "It would've been glorious to be here in the final days. All the screaming and panic... music to my ears."
msgstr "마지막 날들에 이곳에 있었다면 영광스러웠을 텐데. 비명과 혼란이라니... 내 귀에는 음악이야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00B94B3A
#. EDID: [01083DE2]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0117DD"
msgid "Akila does look like a good place to find corpses. They probably just leave them out with the rest of the trash."
msgstr "아킬라는 시체 찾기에 좋은 곳 같아. 아마 쓰레기랑 같이 그냥 밖에 내놓겠지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00C231FB
#. EDID: [01083C76]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "011CD6"
msgid "And now we've lost our weapon."
msgstr "그리고 이제 무기도 잃었네."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00F36480
#. EDID: [01083D1B]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "011CD7"
msgid "I need hazard pay for this."
msgstr "이 일엔 위험수당이 필요해."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00DBBFC4
#. EDID: [01083CBD]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "011CD9"
msgid "There's something satisfying about putting together your own slum."
msgstr "자신만의 빈민가를 만들면 참 알 수 없는 만족감이 느껴진단 말이죠."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Angry
#. SoundFileID = 00EE3049
#. ScriptNotes = Angry
#. EDID: [01083CA3]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "012168"
msgid "Lucky you, you get to go to hell."
msgstr "운 좋네. 지옥에 갈 수 있게 됐잖아."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Puzzled
#. SoundFileID = 0016C78D
#. ScriptNotes = Puzzled
#. EDID: [01083DD7]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "012169"
msgid "Hmm...Nothing there."
msgstr "흠... 아무것도 없네."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00A5A15C
#. EDID: [01083C88]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "01216A"
msgid "Something's wrong with their weapon."
msgstr "저쪽 무기에 뭔가 문제가 있어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00B0384C
#. EDID: [01083E2B]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "01216C"
msgid "Some say exploring is a rich, rewarding adventure. You should show them this place."
msgstr "어떤 사람들은 탐험이 풍요롭고 보람찬 모험이라고 하지. 그 사람들에게 여길 보여 줘야 해."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Surprised
#. SoundFileID = 002F4FF5
#. ScriptNotes = Surprised
#. EDID: [01083CFB]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "012628"
msgid "It's just us out here."
msgstr "여긴 우리뿐이야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00F69E14
#. EDID: [01083DC9]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "01262A"
msgid "I'm a fan of gravity personally. I like to keep people down."
msgstr "저는 중력이 좋아요. 사람을 짓누르는 게 취미거든요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00AE0BCF
#. EDID: [01083D30]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "01262B"
msgid "You should do parties."
msgstr "파티 같은 거 열어야겠네."

#. List: 2
#. EDID: [01083E14]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "01262C"
msgid "This planet has no oxygen. You should remove your spacesuit."
msgstr "이 행성에는 산소가 없어. 우주복을 벗어 보는 게 좋겠어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00528EAB
#. EDID: [01083CD7]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "01262D"
msgid "I wonder if this ship has its own crew of thralls, like yours does."
msgstr "이 우주선에도 네 우주선처럼 노예 같은 승무원들이 있을까 궁금하네."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 005457B6
#. EDID: [01083CD3]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "01262E"
msgid "So is this gonna be our ship now?"
msgstr "그럼 이제 이게 우리 우주선이 되는 거야?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Puzzled
#. SoundFileID = 002B47DC
#. ScriptNotes = Puzzled
#. EDID: [01083DD6]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "012AF9"
msgid "And they're gone."
msgstr "이제 사라졌네."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Angry
#. SoundFileID = 00D055B4
#. ScriptNotes = Angry
#. EDID: [01083CA1]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "012AFA"
msgid "In for a penny..."
msgstr "시작했으면 끝까지..."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00D5DE02
#. EDID: [01083C87]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "012AFB"
msgid "That weapon's decomposing now."
msgstr "저 무기도 이제 썩어 가네."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 0011B31A
#. EDID: [01083E2A]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "012AFE"
msgid "I bet there's an army of dead things here, just sitting underneath our feet."
msgstr "분명 여기 발밑 어딘가에 죽은 것들의 군대가 앉아 있을 거야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Angry
#. SoundFileID = 00C4BEA9
#. ScriptNotes = Angry
#. EDID: [01083CC8]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "012FB2"
msgid "Oh great..."
msgstr "아, 좋네..."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00D11A6D
#. EDID: [01083CF7]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "012FB3"
msgid "Oh neat we can blow stuff up again."
msgstr "오, 멋지다. 또 뭔가를 날려 버릴 수 있겠네."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 0073EC57
#. EDID: [01083C5E]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "012FB9"
msgid "*Sigh* Fine, I'll live."
msgstr "*한숨* 알겠어요. 살아야죠."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00A059A7
#. EDID: [01083E34]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "012FBA"
msgid "Party time I guess."
msgstr "파티 시간이네요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 002E234C
#. EDID: [01083D6A]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0136BC"
msgid "You're back. Find any good mushrooms?"
msgstr "돌아왔네. 좋은 버섯이라도 찾았어?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00648579
#. EDID: [01083E4C]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0136BD"
msgid "They're all dead. Cool."
msgstr "다 죽었네. 멋져."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Suspicious
#. SoundFileID = 002A023A
#. ScriptNotes = Suspicious
#. EDID: [01083C4F]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0136BE"
msgid "Do you feel like we're being watched?"
msgstr "누가 우리를 지켜보는 것 같지 않아?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00222156
#. EDID: [01083D1C]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0136BF"
msgid "Would now be a bad time to take a sick day?"
msgstr "지금 병가 내면 안 좋은 타이밍일까?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 000028DB
#. EDID: [01083D5F]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0136C0"
msgid "Bad news, their weapon's back online."
msgstr "나쁜 소식이야. 저쪽 무기가 다시 온라인이 됐어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00AD7EB7
#. EDID: [01083DD0]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0136C5"
msgid "If one of us starts bleeding, does the blood actually float? How does that work?"
msgstr "우리 중 누가 피를 흘리면, 그 피가 진짜로 둥둥 떠다녀요? 대체 어떻게 그렇게 되는 걸까요?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00BCECD5
#. EDID: [01083E1E]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0136C6"
msgid "All this life just makes me sad."
msgstr "이 모든 생명체를 보니 슬퍼지네."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 0022EAEF
#. EDID: [01083DF0]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0136C7"
msgid "Imagine living here and not immediately blowing your brains out."
msgstr "여기 살면서 곧장 머리를 날려 버리지 않는 삶을 상상해 봐."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00037000
#. EDID: [01083D63]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "013B49"
msgid "Their weapon's repaired. Hooray for them."
msgstr "저쪽 무기가 수리됐어. 참 잘됐네."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 005125EE
#. EDID: [01083CBE]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "013B4C"
msgid "This outpost is looking like a real dump. I'm proud."
msgstr "전초기지 꼴이 진짜 쓰레기장 같네요. 참 자랑스러워요."

#. List: 2
