msgid "Fire in the hole."
msgstr "수류탄이다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00E66DAF
#. EDID: [01083C74]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "014486"
msgid "In case you didn't notice, our weapons are cooked."
msgstr "눈치 못 챘을까 봐 말하는데, 우리 무기는 완전히 익었어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00E3E3A8
#. EDID: [01083D5C]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "014487"
msgid "They're aiming their weapon at us. Maybe we should move."
msgstr "저쪽이 무기를 우리에게 겨누고 있어. 움직이는 게 좋을지도 몰라."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00C8D0F6
#. EDID: [01083C68]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "014913"
msgid "That was fun."
msgstr "재밌었어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00491AA7
#. EDID: [01083DF2]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "014915"
msgid "I'd say most people don't care about Cydonia enough to visit. Not you though."
msgstr "대부분의 사람은 시도니아를 굳이 방문할 만큼 신경 쓰지 않을 거야. 넌 아니지만."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00BC892E
#. EDID: [01083D7B]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "014DBF"
msgid "Huh? Sorry, I was emptying my brain."
msgstr "응? 미안, 머리를 비우는 중이었어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = InPain
#. SoundFileID = 006A0728
#. ScriptNotes = InPain
#. EDID: [01083DC7]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "014DC0"
msgid "That hurt!"
msgstr "아팠어!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00868E6A
#. EDID: [01083D44]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "014DC1"
msgid "Our shields are disabled. Not that it matters. Everyone dies."
msgstr "우리 보호막이 무력화됐어. 뭐 상관없지만. 모두 죽으니까."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00B3EFA5
#. EDID: [01083E02]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "014DC2"
msgid "The parks and bars here are great for people watching. I like to sit and stare at people being miserable."
msgstr "여기 공원과 바는 사람 구경하기 좋아. 난 앉아서 사람들이 불행해하는 걸 바라보는 게 좋거든."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00518765
#. EDID: [01083C78]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "015278"
msgid "Weapons aren't responding."
msgstr "무기가 반응하지 않아."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00A7968E
#. EDID: [01083D62]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "015279"
msgid "Damn, their weapon's fixed."
msgstr "젠장, 저쪽 무기가 고쳐졌어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00CABB54
#. EDID: [01083DD2]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "01527B"
msgid "I'm floating. You're floating. Cool."
msgstr "저도 떠 있고, 당신도 떠 있고. 재밌네요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 005B9DEF
#. EDID: [01083E2C]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "01527C"
msgid "We should take a few dirt samples home. Sell them online."
msgstr "흙 표본 몇 개 가져가자. 온라인으로 팔 수 있을 거야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 007DE228
#. EDID: [01083E0D]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "01527D"
msgid "I've seen pictures of Old Earth. This is better."
msgstr "옛 지구 사진을 본 적 있어. 여기가 더 낫네."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00A948CC
#. EDID: [01083D0C]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "01527E"
msgid "Got any dead stuff?"
msgstr "시체는 없어요?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 0070E948
#. EDID: [01083CD4]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "01527F"
msgid "Wonder how much this ship will fetch on the market."
msgstr "이 우주선이 시장에서 얼마나 받을지 궁금하네."

#. List: 2
