msgstr "그래. 이제 포격을 시작하는 곳이야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 0085BFBB
#. EDID: [01083D5D]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "015712"
msgid "They fixed their weapon. That was quick."
msgstr "저쪽이 무기를 고쳤어. 빠르네."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00E53E77
#. EDID: [01083DF9]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "015714"
msgid "Aurora's a pretty big chem in the cult scene. Pretty damn big."
msgstr "오로라는 광신도들 사이에서 꽤 큰 화학약품이야. 정말 꽤 크지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 008BA848
#. EDID: [01083E2F]
