msgstr "저쪽 무기가 아마 망가진 것 같은데?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00301A02
#. EDID: [01083DFE]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "016022"
msgid "I wonder what the rent on the Lodge is. I bet it costs more than a spaceship."
msgstr "롯지 임대료가 얼마일지 궁금하네. 우주선보다 비쌀 것 같아."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00250F57
#. EDID: [01083CD1]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "016023"
msgid "Let's hope they got some good cargo to loot."
msgstr "약탈할 만한 좋은 화물이 있길 바라자."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 002BFDCE
#. EDID: [01083D69]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0164B5"
msgid "Oh. Hey."
msgstr "아. 안녕."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00934F5E
#. EDID: [01083D45]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0164B6"
msgid "Shields are down."
msgstr "보호막이 내려갔어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00142C20
#. EDID: [01083DEF]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0164BB"
msgid "I bet people here love that their taxes help fund New Atlantis."
msgstr "여기 사람들은 자기 세금이 뉴 아틀란티스에 들어가는 걸 정말 좋아하겠지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Suspicious
#. SoundFileID = 00C01849
#. ScriptNotes = Suspicious
#. EDID: [01083C51]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "016967"
msgid "Trust me, there's something out there."
msgstr "날 믿어, 저 밖에 뭔가 있어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Angry
#. SoundFileID = 00D73BDF
#. ScriptNotes = Angry
#. EDID: [01083CB9]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "016968"
msgid "End of the line!"
msgstr "여기가 종착역이다!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00DAB30A
#. EDID: [01083C77]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "016969"
msgid "Well, weapon's gone."
msgstr "음, 무기가 나갔네."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 002BD673
#. EDID: [01083CCF]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "01696D"
msgid "I like ship invasions. It's like shopping, but everything's free."
msgstr "우주선 침공은 마음에 들어. 쇼핑 같잖아. 전부 공짜고."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_DoctorDialogue
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCFGraceKim
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFGraceKim
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0097E030
#. ScriptNotes = asking to sell some of your healing supplies
#. EDID: [010276E8]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "016DBD"
msgid "Of course. Here's what I have."
msgstr "물론이지. 내가 가진 건 이거야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Nervous
#. SoundFileID = 009845F5
#. ScriptNotes = Player is about to get attacked, so combat line, but Muria-esque / Nervous
#. EDID: [01083D05]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "016DFD"
msgid "Here it comes."
msgstr "온다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = InPain
#. SoundFileID = 00C3B1BB
#. ScriptNotes = InPain
#. EDID: [01083DBE]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "016DFE"
msgid "Urgh!"
msgstr "으윽!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_DoctorDialogue
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCFGraceKim
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFGraceKim
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 006C2A07
#. ScriptNotes = doctor examining patient
#. EDID: [010276F9]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "017257"
msgid "Let me look you over..."
msgstr "어디 한번 살펴볼게..."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_DoctorDialogue
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCFGraceKim
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFGraceKim
#. Face = Concerned
#. SoundFileID = 007940D6
#. ScriptNotes = doctor diagnosing patient / Concerned
#. EDID: [010276D9]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0176EB"
msgid "You're lucky I know what I'm doing. Because you're a real mess."
msgstr "내가 뭘 하는지 알고 있어서 다행인 줄 알아. 정말 엉망이거든."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00307EF8
#. EDID: [01083E57]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "01771A"
msgid "I hope these corpses have loot."
msgstr "이 시체들한테 전리품이 있으면 좋겠네."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_DoctorDialogue
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCFGraceKim
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFGraceKim
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00FA0691
#. ScriptNotes = asking to sell some of your healing supplies
#. EDID: [010276E7]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "017B98"
msgid "I'm sure I have something I can spare."
msgstr "나눠 줄 만한 게 분명 있을 거야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00DAE503
#. EDID: [01083DF1]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "017BC8"
msgid "I heard the miners here have devil eyes, which makes me jealous. But then I remembered mining sucks."
msgstr "여기 광부들은 악마의 눈을 가졌다고 들었어. 부럽더라. 그러다 채굴은 끔찍하다는 걸 떠올렸지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00AC847B
#. EDID: [01083E3D]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "01804F"
msgid "Nice."
msgstr "좋네요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00012AC3
#. EDID: [01083CDE]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "018050"
msgid "Environmental hazards. Yay."
msgstr "환경 위험 신호다. 야호."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00FEFDB3
#. EDID: [01083E32]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "018051"
msgid "This place reminds me of a mushroom that lived in space. Just fed on dead humans. I like to imagine this place once had humans."
msgstr "이곳은 우주에 살던 버섯이 떠올라. 죽은 인간을 먹고 살았지. 나도 이곳에 한때 인간이 있었다고 상상하는 게 좋아."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00892404
#. EDID: [01083E0F]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "018052"
msgid "I bet some cool fungi survived this."
msgstr "멋진 균류 몇 개쯤은 살아남았을 거야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00D276EF
#. EDID: [01083D75]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0184DB"
msgid "If I don't get my cat nap the claws come out."
msgstr "낮잠 못 자면 발톱이 나와."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00F0A486
#. EDID: [01083DCC]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0184E1"
msgid "I'd love to float right into a spike."
msgstr "날아가서 뾰족한 거에 박혀보고 싶네요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 0091E868
#. EDID: [01083DF6]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0184E2"
msgid "Neon is a colorless, odorless gas. It's scientifically soulless. Makes you think."
msgstr "네온은 무색무취의 기체야. 과학적으로 영혼이 없지. 생각하게 만들지 않아?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 0088EFAC
#. EDID: [01083CD9]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0184E3"
msgid "Ignore the beeping noises. It's fine."
msgstr "삑삑거리는 소리는 그냥 무시해요. 괜찮을 테니까요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_KT02_SailingHighSeas
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = GenericFemale / GenericMale
#. VoiceType = GenericFemale02 / GenericFemale05 / GenericMale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00A42456
#. ScriptNotes = More genuine, not forced cheeriness
#. EDID: SE_FAB10SharedInfo01_GoodbyeDUPLICATE000
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "018581"
msgid "Sorry about that, this group certainly is making me earn my paycheck. Clear skies."
msgstr "죄송합니다. 이 일행 덕분에 오늘 제 급여만큼은 확실히 벌고 있네요. 맑은 하늘 되십시오."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_KT02_SailingHighSeas
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = GenericFemale / GenericMale
#. VoiceType = GenericFemale02 / GenericFemale05 / GenericMale01
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 0029D4CF
#. ScriptNotes = Last bit is said in a different tone, no longer in customer service mode
#. EDID: SE_FAB10SharedInfo01_GoodbyeDUPLICATE000
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "018582"
msgid "You heard the captain. Everyone return to their seats and prepare for our next jump. Mics off?"
msgstr "선장 말씀 들으셨죠. 모두 자리로 돌아가 다음 도약에 대비해 주십시오. 마이크 껐나요?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00EA0B22
#. EDID: [01083DE6]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "018994"
msgid "I hope you like mud on your boots."
msgstr "장화에 진흙 묻는 걸 좋아하면 좋겠네."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00E5766F
#. EDID: [01083D7C]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "018E7D"
msgid "Is it me or is life not worth living anymore."
msgstr "나만 그런가, 아니면 이제 삶이 살 가치가 없어졌나."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00B76553
#. EDID: [01083D76]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "018E7E"
msgid "I need a nap."
msgstr "낮잠이 필요해."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 004DB467
#. EDID: [01083DFC]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "018E84"
msgid "Neon has to many gangs, not enough goths."
msgstr "네온에는 갱이 너무 많고 고스족은 너무 적어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 0029DD32
#. EDID: [01083DF3]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "01933A"
msgid "I thought about interviewing at Ryujin once. But corporations are faceless. I want to see the customer's eyes when I deny them a loan."
msgstr "한때 류진 면접을 볼까 생각했어. 하지만 기업은 얼굴이 없잖아. 난 대출을 거절할 때 고객의 눈을 보고 싶거든."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Angry
#. SoundFileID = 00800097
#. ScriptNotes = Angry
#. EDID: [01083C9D]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "019774"
msgid "Do we have to do this now?"
msgstr "이걸 꼭 지금 해야 해?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00F5E9C6
#. EDID: [01083DEB]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "019775"
msgid "I wonder if I can take life insurance policies on the miners."
msgstr "광부들 이름으로 생명보험을 들 수 있을지 궁금하네."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00D61EDC
#. EDID: [01083D1A]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "019C2C"
msgid "I hope these ships have tons of loot."
msgstr "이 우주선들에 전리품이 잔뜩 있으면 좋겠네."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00769546
#. EDID: [01083CDA]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "019C31"
msgid "I love hazards. Walking in to them is always a good time."
msgstr "전 위험 구역이 참 좋더라고요. 거기로 걸어 들어갈 때가 제일 짜릿하고 재밌어요."

#. List: 2
#. EDID: [01083E15]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "019C32"
msgid "No need for suits here, Captain. I just wear mine because it's fashionable."
msgstr "여기선 슈트가 필요 없어, 선장. 난 그냥 패션 때문에 입고 있는 거야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 0008D3EB
#. EDID: [01083E10]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "019C33"
msgid "I'm disappointed capitalism hasn't found a way to monetize this planet."
msgstr "자본주의가 아직 이 행성을 수익화할 방법을 찾지 못했다니 실망이야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00DF1A66
#. EDID: [01083DF7]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "019C34"
msgid "I wonder if they ever thought of shipping aurora to a planet that doesn't suck."
msgstr "오로라를 덜 끔찍한 행성으로 운송할 생각은 안 해 봤는지 궁금하네."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00A71EE7
#. EDID: [01083DE3]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "019C35"
msgid "Heard there's a lot of bank robberies here. Seems kind of backwards. Banks are supposed to rob you, not the other way around."
msgstr "여기선 은행 강도가 많다고 들었어. 좀 거꾸로 된 것 같아. 은행이 널 털어야지, 그 반대가 아니라."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Angry
#. SoundFileID = 00680DD2
#. ScriptNotes = Angry
#. EDID: [01083BEA]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "01A517"
msgid "I found them!"
msgstr "찾았다!"

#. List: 2
#. EDID: [01083E19]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "01A518"
msgid "Scanners say you can't breathe here without a suit. But you won't know until you try it."
msgstr "스캐너가 여기선 슈트 없이는 숨을 못 쉰다고 하네. 그래도 직접 해 보기 전까진 모르는 거지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_DoctorDialogue
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCFGraceKim
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFGraceKim
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 00814547
#. ScriptNotes = doctor examining patient
#. EDID: [010276FB]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "01A986"
msgid "Alright. Let's examine you..."
msgstr "좋아. 검사해 보자..."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00CB01A9
#. EDID: [01083CC4]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "01AE6F"
msgid "I appreciate your commitment to being a slumlord."
msgstr "빈민가 군주가 되기 위해 헌신하는 모습, 참 감명스럽네요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 008B79F9
#. EDID: [01083E3C]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "01AE70"
msgid "Let me know how that works out for you."
msgstr "효과가 어땠는지 알려주세요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00754887
#. EDID: [01083CDD]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "01AE71"
msgid "Every time that watch beeps I get excited. Maybe we'll both die in a horrific accident. Fingers crossed."
msgstr ""
"그 시계가 삑삑거릴 때마다 참 신나요. 어쩌면 우리 둘 다 끔찍한 사고로 같이 죽을지도 모르잖아요. 부디 그렇게 되길 빌어보자고요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 0073DE41
#. EDID: [01083E31]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "01AE72"
msgid "Finally. A place with no children."
msgstr "드디어. 아이들이 없는 곳이네."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 0081DDEE
#. EDID: [01083E0E]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "01AE73"
msgid "Seeing the Earth in this state gives me hope for New Atlantis."
msgstr "이런 상태의 지구를 보니 뉴 아틀란티스에도 희망이 생기네."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00BD1DC1
#. EDID: [01083D34]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "01AE74"
msgid "You want to teach me how to do that?"
msgstr "그거 어떻게 하는지 나한테 가르쳐 줄래?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Puzzled
#. SoundFileID = 00E0D1DC
#. ScriptNotes = Puzzled
#. EDID: [01083DDA]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "01B321"
msgid "I hope it was a ghost."
msgstr "유령이었으면 좋겠네."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Angry
#. SoundFileID = 00AEA36C
#. ScriptNotes = Angry
#. EDID: [01083D28]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "01B322"
msgid "Blowin' em up."
msgstr "날려 버리는 중."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 0052232C
#. EDID: [01083E3A]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "01B325"
msgid "Hope that's medical grade."
msgstr "의약품 허가를 받은 거였으면 좋겠네요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 0099FFA9
#. EDID: [01083DE8]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "01B326"
msgid "Oh cool, there's a bar by the spaceport."
msgstr "오, 우주항 근처에 바가 있네."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 002DB210
#. EDID: [01083D6C]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "01B774"
msgid "One day you won't come back alive, and everyone's gonna be all sad and stuff. It'll be great."
msgstr "언젠가는 네가 살아 돌아오지 못할 거고, 모두가 엄청 슬퍼하겠지. 아주 근사하겠네."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Angry
#. SoundFileID = 00C10A59
#. ScriptNotes = Angry
#. EDID: [01083CAF]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "01B775"
msgid "You're so dead."
msgstr "넌 완전히 죽었어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 007BB160
#. EDID: [01083CF3]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "01B776"
msgid "Weapon's fixed, I think."
msgstr "무기가 고쳐진 것 같아."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00D5BE01
#. EDID: [01083D1E]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "01B777"
msgid "Let's blow 'em up and take the bodies home."
msgstr "저들을 날려 버리고 시체를 집에 가져가자."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00F2C94F
#. EDID: [01083D0B]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "01B77A"
msgid "Sure, I can take some things."
msgstr "그래요, 제가 좀 들어드릴게요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 0086A40F
#. EDID: [01083E08]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "01B77B"
msgid "Earth. It's a necromancer's dream."
msgstr "지구. 강령술사의 꿈 같은 곳이지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 0079BDD9
#. EDID: [01083DEE]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "01B77C"
msgid "There's a community center here with some real preachy types. They say the sermons are free but they cost your sanity."
msgstr "여기 주민 센터에 사사건건 설교하려 드는 인간이 있어요. 설교는 공짜라는데, 듣다 보면 정신이 나가버릴 지경이죠."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 0095F163
#. EDID: [01083D9D]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "01BC1A"
msgid "Don't worry, I'm not dead. I just feel that way."
msgstr "걱정 마, 죽은 건 아니야. 그냥 그런 기분일 뿐이지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 0009FC00
#. EDID: [01083E39]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "01BC1B"
msgid "If that kills you I call dibs on your corpse."
msgstr "약 때문에 죽으면, 시체는 제가 가질게요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 0010ED73
#. ScriptNotes = A threat. She would like nothing more than to monetize this planet
#. EDID: [01083E1F]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "01BC1C"
msgid "Lot of picaresque views here. Shame if someone put a factory right in the middle of it. "
msgstr "여기 경치는 그림 같네. 한가운데에 공장 하나 세우면 참 아쉽겠어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00B4FF12
#. EDID: [01083C80]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "01BC1D"
msgid "I'll be sure to let this betrayal fester."
msgstr "이 배신은 꼭 곱씹으며 삭혀 둘게."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00D9B7A4
#. EDID: [01083D6F]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "01C0E2"
msgid "The sooner you leave, the sooner we can all start half-assing it."
msgstr "네가 빨리 떠날수록 우리 모두 더 빨리 대충대충 일할 수 있어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 003303AC
#. EDID: [01083D20]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "01C0E3"
msgid "Oh cool. More fighting."
msgstr "오 좋네. 싸움이 더 생겼어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00403841
#. EDID: [01083D10]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "01C0E8"
msgid "Yeah, sure."
msgstr "예, 그러세요."

#. List: 2
