#. ScriptNotes = Player is about to get attacked, so combat line, but Muria-esque / Nervous
#. EDID: [01083D02]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "020A64"
msgid "Incoming."
msgstr "온다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = InPain
#. SoundFileID = 00DAED26
#. ScriptNotes = InPain
#. EDID: [01083DC2]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "020A65"
msgid "Damn!"
msgstr "젠장!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Angry
#. SoundFileID = 004B709A
#. ScriptNotes = Angry
#. EDID: [01083D29]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "020A66"
msgid "Time to make a mess."
msgstr "난장판을 만들 시간이야."

#. List: 2
#. EDID: [01083E1C]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "020A6B"
msgid "You put a couple of slate-casters on a planet like this, all the oxygen gets sucked out in minutes. I'm guessing that's what happened here."
msgstr "이런 행성에 슬레이트 방송 송신기 몇 개를 올려놓으면 몇 분 만에 산소가 전부 빨려 나가지. 아마 그게 여기서 벌어진 일이겠지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 009B2CD9
#. EDID: [01083E0B]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "020A6C"
msgid "Earth, huh. I thought there'd be more stuff going on here."
msgstr "지구라. 여기엔 좀 더 많은 일이 벌어지고 있을 줄 알았는데."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_DoctorDialogue
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCFGraceKim
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFGraceKim
#. Face = Apologetic
#. SoundFileID = 00491286
#. ScriptNotes = doctor explaining to patient who can't pay / Apologetic
#. EDID: [010276F1]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "020EEF"
msgid "I'm sorry, you don't have enough credits. You'll need to come back when you can afford to pay. "
msgstr "죄송하지만 크레딧이 부족합니다. 비용을 낼 수 있을 때 다시 와 주세요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 009AFF0E
#. EDID: [01083E53]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "020F2E"
msgid "That was kind of fun."
msgstr "좀 재밌었어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Angry
#. SoundFileID = 009279BD
#. ScriptNotes = Angry
#. EDID: [01083D26]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "020F2F"
msgid "Here it comes."
msgstr "온다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 0026943B
#. EDID: [01083DFF]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "020F33"
msgid "God I wish there were merpeople here. If you're gonna call it New \"Atlantis,\"  give me some merpeople."
msgstr "여기 인어들이 있었으면 정말 좋겠어. 이름을 새 \"아틀란티스\"라고 붙일 거면 인어 정도는 있어야지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 007D864A
#. EDID: [01083C5F]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0213A7"
msgid "Unhhh... I feel dizzy."
msgstr "으으으... 어지러."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00C84580
#. EDID: [01083C81]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0213A8"
msgid "I suppose I'll let someone else step on you for once."
msgstr "이번 한 번은 다른 사람이 널 밟게 놔두지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Irritated
#. SoundFileID = 003B4928
#. ScriptNotes = Irritated
#. EDID: [01083BC8]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "02188D"
msgid "I think they gave up."
msgstr "포기한 것 같아."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 001C65D1
#. EDID: [01083CF1]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "02188E"
msgid "Oh cool, weapon's back online."
msgstr "오 좋네, 무기가 다시 온라인이야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00FFDEF4
#. EDID: [01083D2E]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "021892"
msgid "Nice. Maybe for your next trick you can conjure me a beer."
msgstr "좋네. 다음 마술로는 맥주 한 잔 불러내 줄 수 있겠어?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00B8AF24
#. EDID: [01083DE1]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "021893"
msgid "I've heard there's a book store here. I wonder if I can pick up some alchemy recipes."
msgstr "여기 서점이 있다고 들었어. 연금술 조리법이라도 구할 수 있을까 궁금하네."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00A1FE6F
#. EDID: [01083CD2]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "021894"
msgid "Maybe we'll find something useful here, like dead people."
msgstr "여기서 쓸 만한 걸 찾을지도 몰라. 시체 같은 거."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = InPain
#. SoundFileID = 00972C6A
#. ScriptNotes = InPain
#. EDID: [01083C15]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "021D38"
msgid "Delete... my... browser history..."
msgstr "내... 브라우저 기록... 지워 줘..."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Angry
#. SoundFileID = 007FAA58
#. ScriptNotes = Angry
#. EDID: [01083C9E]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0221E7"
msgid "More corpses for the coffers."
msgstr "금고에 넣을 시체가 더 생겼네."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Angry
#. SoundFileID = 00D58C01
#. ScriptNotes = Angry
#. EDID: [01083BE8]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0221E8"
msgid "Spotted them!"
msgstr "놈들을 발견했어!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00C06BF2
#. EDID: [01083E27]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0221F2"
msgid "Discovering places like this always brings a frown to my face."
msgstr "이런 곳을 발견할 때마다 얼굴이 찌푸려져."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00DC80CA
#. EDID: [01083D14]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0221F3"
msgid "Fair enough."
msgstr "알겠어요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00D4BC33
#. EDID: [01083D31]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0221F4"
msgid "Nice magic. Ever thought of starting your own cult?"
msgstr "멋진 마법이네. 네 교단을 세워 볼 생각은 없어?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Puzzled
#. SoundFileID = 006F56D9
#. ScriptNotes = Puzzled
#. EDID: [01083DD9]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "02268E"
msgid "Nothing to worry about."
msgstr "걱정할 것 없어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00E83573
#. EDID: [01083CF6]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "02268F"
msgid "Weapons are back."
msgstr "무기가 돌아왔어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00E913D6
#. EDID: [01083D2F]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "022695"
msgid "That's way more useful then going to college."
msgstr "대학 가는 것보다 훨씬 유용하네."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00680284
#. EDID: [01083DE0]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "022696"
msgid "Did they make this town so grown men can play cowboy?"
msgstr "다 큰 남자들이 카우보이 놀이 하라고 이 마을을 만든 건가?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Angry
#. SoundFileID = 006ADC5E
#. ScriptNotes = Angry
#. EDID: [01083BE7]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "022B04"
msgid "Over here!"
msgstr "여기야!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00A867A1
#. EDID: [01083E50]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "022B05"
msgid "I don't see anyone else coming."
msgstr "더 오는 사람은 안 보여."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00B50F67
#. EDID: [01083CF9]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "022B06"
msgid "Weapons are a go."
msgstr "무기 준비 완료."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 003216E6
#. EDID: [01083C6A]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "022B07"
msgid "I think I deserve a raise for that."
msgstr "이 정도면 인상 좀 받아야겠는데."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 006C9BA6
#. EDID: [01083D15]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "022B09"
msgid "Fine."
msgstr "좋아."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 0070FB98
#. EDID: [01083C7A]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "022FFA"
msgid "Yeah, there goes our weapons."
msgstr "그래, 우리 무기가 나가 버렸네."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00AA6913
#. EDID: [01083E01]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "022FFB"
msgid "We should stop by GalBank, in case you need to put more money into my account."
msgstr "갤뱅크에 들르는 게 좋겠어. 내 계좌에 돈을 더 넣어야 할 수도 있으니까."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00CD2653
#. EDID: [01083E3B]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "022FFC"
msgid "You look uncomfortable."
msgstr "안색이 안 좋아 보여요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00F48BD0
#. EDID: [01083CE0]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "022FFD"
msgid "A hazard warning like that is always a good sign. It means fun times are coming."
msgstr "그런 위험 경고는 항상 좋은 신호죠. 곧 재밌는 일이 터질 거라는 뜻이거든요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 004526E6
#. EDID: [01083E4E]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "023453"
msgid "If you pick up any corpses from these wrecks, put them on my dissecting table. "
msgstr "이 잔해에서 시체를 주우면 내 해부대 위에 올려놔."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Irritated
#. SoundFileID = 0061F89B
#. ScriptNotes = Irritated
#. EDID: [01083BC5]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "023454"
msgid "I'm not sensing anything."
msgstr "아무것도 감지되지 않아."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00F509FC
#. EDID: [01083CC3]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "023457"
msgid "Your outpost workbenches should be CredStik operated. You'll want to charge people to use them."
msgstr "전초기지 작업대들은 전부 크레딧 스틱을 대야 작동되게 만들어야 해요. 사람들이 쓸 때마다 요금을 받아야 하거든요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 0024C202
#. EDID: [01083C61]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "023458"
msgid "Ugh... my back feels like a pretzel."
msgstr "윽... 허리가 꽈배기처럼 꼬인 것 같네요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00FE9655
#. EDID: [01083D2B]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "023459"
msgid "So magic is real, huh. Fun."
msgstr "그래서 마법이 진짜였구나. 재밌네."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 000AE849
#. EDID: [01083DED]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "02345A"
msgid "I heard there's a crater here that looks like a smiley face. Personally I like a good grimace."
msgstr "여기엔 웃는 얼굴처럼 보이는 크레이터가 있다고 들었어. 개인적으로는 찡그린 얼굴이 더 좋아."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 0059B189
#. EDID: [01083CD5]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "02345B"
msgid "I wonder if they know their ship smells like this."
msgstr "저 사람들은 자기 우주선에서 이런 냄새가 나는 걸 알고 있을까?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00CD18C5
#. EDID: [01083D61]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "023947"
msgid "Ugh, someone gave their weapon a potion or something."
msgstr "윽, 누가 저쪽 무기에 물약 같은 걸 먹였나 봐."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00D1B5A8
#. EDID: [01083D12]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "023948"
msgid "All right. Let's trade."
msgstr "알겠어요. 교환하죠."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Happy
#. SoundFileID = 00581961
#. ScriptNotes = Happy
#. EDID: [01083C6E]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "023D9D"
msgid "Ship seems to be in okay shape."
msgstr "우주선 상태는 괜찮아 보여."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00D0EEE4
#. EDID: [01083D4B]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "023D9E"
msgid "Shields are cooked."
msgstr "보호막이 완전히 익었어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00A05893
#. EDID: [01083D48]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "023D9F"
msgid "Shields are out. Good times."
msgstr "보호막이 나갔어. 좋은 시간이네."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 002F1427
#. EDID: [01083DF8]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "023DA3"
msgid "I got robbed in Neon once. It's an essential part of the experience."
msgstr "나도 네온에서 한 번 털린 적 있어. 경험의 필수 코스지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = InPain
#. SoundFileID = 005DF1E1
#. ScriptNotes = InPain
#. EDID: [01083DC5]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "024246"
msgid "I'm hit!"
msgstr "맞았어!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Angry
#. SoundFileID = 000AD38E
#. ScriptNotes = Angry
#. EDID: [01083CB4]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "024247"
msgid "It's your lucky day. You get to die."
msgstr "오늘 운 좋은 줄 알아. 죽을 수 있게 됐잖아."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00D33692
#. EDID: [01083D0F]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "02424B"
msgid "There's still some room in my pack, if you can pay the storage fees."
msgstr "제 배낭에 공간이 아직 좀 남아있어요. 보관료를 내실 수 있다면 말이죠."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = InPain
#. SoundFileID = 00675430
#. ScriptNotes = InPain
#. EDID: [01083DBD]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0246BF"
msgid "Agh!"
msgstr "아악!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00E05607
#. EDID: [01083C6C]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0246C0"
msgid "I think I see a dead body floating. Cool."
msgstr "죽은 시체가 떠다니는 게 보이는 것 같아. 멋지네."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00E27C83
#. EDID: [01083DF4]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0246C1"
msgid "Everything in Neon is artificial. The lights, the music, the people. It's for the best."
msgstr "네온의 모든 건 인공적이야. 조명, 음악, 사람들까지. 차라리 그게 낫지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_SE_KT02_SailingHighSeas
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = AudioOnly
#. VoiceType = SFFL_NPCMGenericMale02
#. Face = Neutral
#. SoundFileID = 001C6F2B
#. EDID: [010388D8]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "02474F"
msgid "That tour guide better come back and explain himself."
msgstr "그 관광 가이드가 돌아와서 해명해 줘야 할 텐데."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_DoctorDialogue
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCFGraceKim
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFGraceKim
#. Face = Concerned
#. SoundFileID = 0016C86C
#. ScriptNotes = doctor responding to patient having second thoughts and turning down treatment / Concerned
#. EDID: [010276CD]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "024AEF"
msgid "As you wish."
msgstr "원하시는 대로."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = InPain
#. SoundFileID = 00EE75A6
#. ScriptNotes = InPain
#. EDID: [01083C18]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "024B15"
msgid "That's... gonna leave a mark..."
msgstr "그건... 흔적이 남겠네..."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Angry
#. SoundFileID = 00E25586
#. ScriptNotes = Angry
#. EDID: [01083CB1]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "024B16"
msgid "You've done it now."
msgstr "이제 큰일 났어."

#. List: 2
#. EDID: [01083E13]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "024B18"
msgid "You don't need a spacesuit here. It's fine."
msgstr "여긴 우주복이 필요 없어. 괜찮아."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 0094A87A
#. EDID: [01083D9C]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "024FCC"
msgid "If I could be anything, I'd be a black hole. No light could escape me, it'd be great."
msgstr "내가 뭐든 될 수 있다면 블랙홀이 되고 싶어. 빛조차 빠져나오지 못하겠지. 끝내줄 거야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Angry
#. SoundFileID = 00C080B5
#. ScriptNotes = Angry
#. EDID: [01083C9C]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "024FCD"
msgid "Oh boy."
msgstr "오 이런."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = InPain
#. SoundFileID = 000225BE
#. ScriptNotes = InPain
#. EDID: [01083B6C]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "024FCE"
msgid "I'm dying... Cool."
msgstr "나 죽어 가는 중이야... 멋지네."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Angry
#. SoundFileID = 00A695D1
#. ScriptNotes = Angry
#. EDID: [01083CB6]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "024FCF"
msgid "Last chance."
msgstr "마지막 기회야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00AACE9C
#. EDID: [01083C8C]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "024FD0"
msgid "They're having some kind of weapon trouble."
msgstr "저쪽 무기에 문제가 좀 있는 것 같아."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 002D188F
#. EDID: [01083E30]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "024FD1"
msgid "Nice scenery at least. No people to screw it up."
msgstr "적어도 경치는 좋네. 망칠 사람이 없어서."

#. List: 2
#. EDID: [01083E16]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "024FD2"
msgid "You don't need that spacesuits. What's the worst that can happen?"
msgstr "그 우주복 필요 없어. 최악의 경우가 뭐겠어?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 0022E662
#. EDID: [01083E0A]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "024FD3"
msgid "Earth. This is where people come from. Gross."
msgstr "지구. 사람들이 여기서 왔다고. 역겹네."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00329EF8
#. EDID: [01083DEC]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "02545E"
msgid "I heard they settled here because one of the craters looked like a face. Not the stupidest reason to start a city, but pretty damn close."
msgstr "크레이터 하나가 얼굴처럼 보여서 여기 정착했다고 들었어. 도시를 세울 이유 중 최악은 아니지만, 꽤 가까워."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00CFCDFA
#. EDID: [01083D6D]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0258CB"
msgid "I've been doing a lot of work lately. Resting my eyes, sitting down, that sort of thing."
msgstr "요즘 일을 많이 했어. 눈을 쉬게 하고, 앉아 있고, 그런 거."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00CD561A
#. EDID: [01083E4D]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0258CE"
msgid "We should dissect any corpses you pick up. "
msgstr "네가 주운 시체들은 해부해 봐야 해."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Surprised
#. SoundFileID = 00839C08
#. ScriptNotes = Surprised
#. EDID: [01083CFD]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0258CF"
msgid "I don't see anyone."
msgstr "아무도 안 보여."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = InPain
#. SoundFileID = 00213F47
#. ScriptNotes = InPain
#. EDID: [01083DBC]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0258D0"
msgid "Got me!"
msgstr "맞았어!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00EED1C0
#. EDID: [01083D1D]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0258D1"
msgid "Oh fun, another fight."
msgstr "오 재밌네, 또 싸움이야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00B695B2
#. EDID: [01083D60]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0258D2"
msgid "Oh great, their weapon's firing again."
msgstr "오 좋네, 저쪽 무기가 다시 발사되고 있어."

#. List: 2
#. EDID: [01083E1A]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0258D3"
msgid "Nothing standing in the way of death here. What a paradise."
msgstr "여긴 죽음을 막을 게 아무것도 없네. 이 무슨 낙원인지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00C0A256
#. EDID: [01083E03]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0258D4"
msgid "I'm glad I was born here. I feel like you can't be truly evil unless you grew up in a corporate environment."
msgstr "내가 여기서 태어나서 다행이야. 기업 환경에서 자라지 않으면 진정으로 사악해질 수 없을 것 같거든."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Irritated
#. SoundFileID = 00BE05D2
#. ScriptNotes = Irritated
#. EDID: [01083BC7]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "025D79"
msgid "Hopefully they don't come back."
msgstr "다시는 안 돌아오면 좋겠네."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = InPain
#. SoundFileID = 007F8AAC
#. ScriptNotes = InPain
#. EDID: [01083C16]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "025D7B"
msgid "I can't...feel...my brain..."
msgstr "내... 뇌가... 느껴지지 않아..."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00A0CF71
#. EDID: [01083DCE]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "025D7E"
msgid "I can't wait for my bones to atrophy into twigs."
msgstr "뼈가 나뭇가지처럼 앙상해지는 게 기대되네요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_DoctorDialogue
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCFGraceKim
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFGraceKim
#. Face = Thinking
#. SoundFileID = 00677034
#. ScriptNotes = doctor examining patient / Thinking
#. EDID: [010276F6]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0261F4"
msgid "Let's get you patched up."
msgstr "자, 치료해 줄게."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00A44B03
#. EDID: [01083C5D]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "02621D"
msgid "Yeah, I guess I'll live a little longer."
msgstr "예, 뭐, 좀 더 명줄을 이어가 봐야겠네요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 0057DC76
#. EDID: [01083E0C]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "02621E"
msgid "I was hoping there'd be more skeletons."
msgstr "해골이 더 많을 줄 알았는데."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_DoctorDialogue
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCFGraceKim
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFGraceKim
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 00660E33
#. ScriptNotes = doctor sending patient on their way after treatment. / Confident
#. EDID: [010276D3]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0266A2"
msgid "Ship shape and ready for action."
msgstr "우주선은 말끔하고 출동 준비 완료야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Nervous
#. SoundFileID = 00519678
#. ScriptNotes = Player is about to get attacked, so combat line, but Muria-esque / Nervous
#. EDID: [01083D03]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0266B8"
msgid "Just our luck."
msgstr "운도 지지리 없지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 0061E61C
#. ScriptNotes = genuinely thankful
#. EDID: [01083C60]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0266BD"
msgid "Agh. Medpacks always give me a headache. But thanks."
msgstr "윽, 메디 팩을 쓰면 항상 두통이 와요. 어쨌든 고마워요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 003EB4E4
#. EDID: [01083E24]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0266BE"
msgid "Scanner says there's signs of life on this planet. Huzzah."
msgstr "스캐너에 이 행성에서 생명체 징후가 보인대. 만세."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_DoctorDialogue
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCFGraceKim
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFGraceKim
#. Face = Concerned
#. SoundFileID = 00E53ACA
#. ScriptNotes = doctor diagnosing patient / Concerned
#. EDID: [010276D8]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "026B36"
msgid "Yeah, that's... we should fix all that."
msgstr "그래, 그건... 전부 고쳐야겠네."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 001BBA99
#. EDID: [01083DCF]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "026B6F"
msgid "I'm just gonna drift for a while."
msgstr "저 좀 둥둥 떠 있을게요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00CEB592
#. EDID: [01083E29]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "026B70"
msgid "This place is dead silent... music to my ears."
msgstr "이곳은 죽은 듯 고요하네... 내 귀에는 음악이야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00FAE789
#. EDID: [01083E06]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "026B71"
msgid "The real estate here is named after Greek gods. No Hades though. The people here don't have taste."
msgstr "여기 부동산은 그리스 신 이름을 땄네. 그런데 하데스는 없어. 취향들이 없군."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Nervous
#. SoundFileID = 00259DA3
#. ScriptNotes = Player is about to get attacked, so combat line, but Muria-esque / Nervous
#. EDID: [01083D04]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "026FED"
msgid "This is gonna hurt."
msgstr "이건 아플 거야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00E009E3
#. EDID: [01083C70]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "026FEE"
msgid "The salvaging is the best part."
msgstr "인양이 제일 재밌는 부분이지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00303AB7
#. EDID: [01083D47]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "026FEF"
msgid "I forgot to tell you, but our shields are down."
msgstr "말하는 걸 깜빡했는데, 우리 보호막이 내려갔어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00095317
#. EDID: [01083D5E]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "026FF0"
msgid "I hate to tell you, but their weapon's back online."
msgstr "말하기 싫지만, 저쪽 무기가 다시 온라인이야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 000B1D4C
#. EDID: [01083D16]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "026FF3"
msgid "Go ahead."
msgstr "계속하세요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 008E67D5
#. EDID: [01083E05]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "026FF4"
msgid "Ever been to the Dawn's Roost? The meat there's as fake as the people."
msgstr "던스 루스트에 가 본 적 있어? 거기 고기는 사람들만큼이나 가짜야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 0044CFC2
#. EDID: [01083DE9]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "026FF5"
msgid "Wow, so this is where they invented boredom."
msgstr "와, 여기가 지루함을 발명한 곳이구나."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_DoctorDialogue
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCFGraceKim
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFGraceKim
#. Face = Apologetic
#. SoundFileID = 0037B514
#. ScriptNotes = doctor explaining to patient who can't pay / Apologetic
#. EDID: [010276F0]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "027465"
msgid "I'm not running a charity I'm afraid. Come back when you have the credits."
msgstr "유감이지만 여긴 자선단체가 아니야. 크레딧이 생기면 다시 와."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Puzzled
#. SoundFileID = 00B11934
#. ScriptNotes = Puzzled
#. EDID: [01083C2C]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "027491"
msgid "Come out, come out, wherever you are..."
msgstr "어디 있든 나와라..."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00E93BB1
#. EDID: [01083D4A]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "027492"
msgid "Oh will you look at that. No shields."
msgstr "오, 저것 좀 봐. 보호막이 없네."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00495F03
#. EDID: [01083D21]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "027493"
msgid "Buckling my safety belt..."
msgstr "안전벨트 매는 중..."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Angry
#. SoundFileID = 00AE7DF5
#. ScriptNotes = Angry
#. EDID: [01083C9F]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0278E9"
msgid "Ooh, new things to kill."
msgstr "오오, 죽일 게 새로 생겼어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 005AAEBE
#. EDID: [01083D64]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0278EB"
msgid "Well, their weapon's fixed. That's not good."
msgstr "음, 저쪽 무기가 고쳐졌어. 좋지 않은데."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 0066C88C
#. EDID: [01083CC2]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0278EF"
msgid "You should build a module with no doors or windows and add an intercom to an answering machine."
msgstr "문도 창문도 없는 모듈을 만드세요. 인터컴도 자동 응답기에 연결해 놓고요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 001D6BA3
#. EDID: [01083CBC]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0278F0"
msgid "Is that for your dungeon?"
msgstr "그거 당신 던전에 둘 건 가요?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 000A47B5
#. EDID: [01083E38]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0278F1"
msgid "I hope that comes with some cool side effects."
msgstr "뭔가 개쩌는 부작용이 있었으면 좋겠어요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00483EB0
#. EDID: [01083E2E]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0278F2"
msgid "Imagine coming to a place like this on purpose."
msgstr "일부러 이런 곳에 오는 걸 상상해 봐."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 0000B7F1
#. EDID: [01083E23]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0278F3"
msgid "Don't know if this planet is hospitable to outsiders. Not everyone likes it when you place an oil derrick or two in their backyard."
msgstr "이 행성이 외부인에게 친절한지는 모르겠어. 자기 뒷마당에 석유 시추탑 한두 개 세우는 걸 싫어하는 사람도 있으니까."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 006206BB
#. EDID: [01083DE4]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0278F4"
msgid "We could stop by Laredo Firearms. Now that I'm a member of your crew I need to learn how to kill people."
msgstr "라레도 화기에 들러도 되겠어. 이제 네 승무원이 됐으니 사람 죽이는 법을 배워야 해."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_DoctorDialogue
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCFGraceKim
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFGraceKim
#. Face = Apologetic
#. SoundFileID = 0057FC8D
#. ScriptNotes = doctor bracing patient for painful procedure about to happen / Apologetic
#. EDID: [010276EC]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "027D64"
msgid "I've seen worse. Not very often though. Hold onto something..."
msgstr "더 심한 것도 봤어. 자주는 아니지만. 뭐라도 붙잡아..."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_DoctorDialogue
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCFGraceKim
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFGraceKim
#. Face = Apologetic
#. SoundFileID = 00420DDA
#. ScriptNotes = doctor bracing patient for painful procedure about to happen / Apologetic
#. EDID: [010276EB]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "027D65"
msgid "Okay. This might hurt a little."
msgstr "좋아. 이건 조금 아플지도 몰라."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00E16B7B
#. EDID: [01083CF2]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "027D86"
msgid "Weapon repairs are done."
msgstr "무기 수리가 끝났어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00A47FBF
#. EDID: [01083D08]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "027D88"
msgid "Yeah. Sure. Take it all."
msgstr "예. 그러세요. 다 가져가세요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 006FCA3C
#. EDID: [01083DEA]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "027D89"
msgid "Mars sure is bland."
msgstr "화성은 참 밋밋하네."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 006D4FA5
#. EDID: [01083E56]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "02822D"
msgid "Let's find out how much money they were carrying."
msgstr "저들이 돈을 얼마나 들고 있었는지 알아보자."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = InPain
#. SoundFileID = 0062A476
#. ScriptNotes = InPain
#. EDID: [01083DC3]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "02822E"
msgid "Ack!"
msgstr "악!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 0051F288
#. EDID: [01083CC0]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "028230"
msgid "Another module for the outpost. Yay."
msgstr "전초기지 모듈 또 하나 추가. 야호."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 007D6BA8
#. EDID: [01083E36]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "028231"
msgid "I know a fungus that can do the same thing."
msgstr "비슷한 효과가 있는 버섯을 알아요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 0026ED5A
#. EDID: [01083CCE]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "028232"
msgid "Su casa mi casa."
msgstr "네 집이 내 집이지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00CE549F
#. EDID: [01083CF4]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0286A2"
msgid "Weapon's fixed. Time for some pew-pew."
msgstr "무기가 고쳐졌어. 이제 빵빵 쏠 시간이야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 000837CE
#. EDID: [01083E04]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0286A8"
msgid "The sun here never stops glaring. It's creepy."
msgstr "여기 태양은 노려보는 걸 멈추지 않네. 소름 끼쳐."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_DoctorDialogue
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCFGraceKim
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFGraceKim
#. Face = Confident
#. SoundFileID = 00D6E1E9
#. ScriptNotes = doctor sending patient on their way after treatment. / Confident
#. EDID: [010276D2]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "028FE2"
msgid "Might be a little scar tissue, but that just adds character."
msgstr "흉터가 조금 남을 수도 있지만, 그게 개성을 더해 주지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_DoctorDialogue
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCFGraceKim
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFGraceKim
#. Face = Concerned
#. SoundFileID = 00D00678
#. ScriptNotes = doctor responding to patient having second thoughts and turning down treatment / Concerned
#. EDID: [010276CB]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "028FE3"
msgid "Alright."
msgstr "좋아."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Angry
#. SoundFileID = 006CEE39
#. ScriptNotes = Angry
#. EDID: [01083BE9]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "02900A"
msgid "I see 'em!"
msgstr "보인다!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_DoctorDialogue
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCFGraceKim
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFGraceKim
#. Face = Concentrating
#. SoundFileID = 00FBE4C9
#. ScriptNotes = doctor diagnosing patient / Concentrating
#. EDID: [010276E0]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "02945E"
msgid "Not so bad, really."
msgstr "사실 그렇게 나쁘진 않네."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Surprised
#. SoundFileID = 00D56695
#. ScriptNotes = Surprised
#. EDID: [01083CFE]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "029486"
msgid "Huh, lost 'em."
msgstr "허, 놓쳤네."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Irritated
#. SoundFileID = 00290F15
#. ScriptNotes = Irritated
#. EDID: [01083BC6]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "029943"
msgid "Well, they were probably poor anyway."
msgstr "뭐, 어차피 가난했겠지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = InPain
#. SoundFileID = 00B6AC06
#. ScriptNotes = InPain
#. EDID: [01083DC0]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "029944"
msgid "Nargh!"
msgstr "나악!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Puzzled
#. SoundFileID = 003BFEBA
#. ScriptNotes = Puzzled
#. EDID: [01083C29]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "029DD4"
msgid "Huh. Where'd they go?"
msgstr "허. 어디 갔지?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 0052AD26
#. EDID: [01083C8E]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "029DD6"
msgid "Their weapon's been hit. I guess we did that?"
msgstr "저쪽 무기가 맞았어. 우리가 그런 건가?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00927BB5
#. EDID: [01083CBF]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "029DDA"
msgid "This outpost is really starting to feel like hell. Maybe I'm dead and nobody told me."
msgstr "이 전초기지도 점점 지옥 같아지네요. 어쩌면 제가 이미 죽었는데 아무도 말 안 해준 거 아닐까요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00261B4D
#. EDID: [01083CD0]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "029DDB"
msgid "We're like nosy neighbors."
msgstr "우린 참 참견 많은 이웃 같아."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00A2956D
#. EDID: [01083C8A]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "02A274"
msgid "You got their weapons Captain. I think. I mean, what do I know."
msgstr "저쪽 무기를 맞혔어요, 선장. 그런 것 같아요. 그러니까, 제가 뭘 알겠어요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 0072C078
#. EDID: [01083E11]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "02A275"
msgid "Earth. I've got an earache that's more interesting than this place."
msgstr "지구. 내 귀앓이가 이곳보다 더 흥미롭겠어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Angry
#. SoundFileID = 00AFC790
#. ScriptNotes = Angry
#. EDID: [01083CC9]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "02A714"
msgid "Not them again."
msgstr "또 저들이야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 005AF395
#. EDID: [01083C6F]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "02A715"
msgid "They thought they could take you. Cute."
msgstr "저들이 널 이길 수 있다고 생각했네. 귀엽다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00CF2E6F
#. EDID: [01083CBB]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "02A717"
msgid "I hope that's gonna house some kind of torture device."
msgstr "거기에 무슨 고문 도구 같은 거라도 들어갔으면 좋겠네요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 001E846F
#. EDID: [01083D33]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "02A718"
msgid "Why can't I do that?"
msgstr "난 왜 저걸 못 하지?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 000863C9
#. EDID: [01083D2D]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "02A719"
msgid "That's cool."
msgstr "멋지네."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00DE8C98
#. EDID: [01083E2D]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "02A71A"
msgid "We might be the first explorers to set foot on this place. Most people know better."
msgstr "우리가 이곳에 발을 디딘 첫 탐험가일지도 몰라. 대부분은 그럴 만큼 어리석지 않으니까."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00DD1173
#. EDID: [01083DF5]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "02A71B"
msgid "They say Aurora is made from fish. Beats licking toads."
msgstr "오로라는 물고기로 만든다고 하더라. 두꺼비 핥는 것보단 낫지."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00CB1FA3
#. EDID: [01083D6E]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "02ABC3"
msgid "Are you gonna be hanging out here more? Hope you aren't one of those micro-managing types. Or managing types. Both are bad. "
msgstr "앞으로 여기 자주 있을 거야? 혹시 세세하게 간섭하는 타입은 아니었으면 좋겠어. 아니면 그냥 관리하는 타입도. 둘 다 별로야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00C4298F
#. EDID: [01083C7C]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "02ABC5"
msgid "Weapons are broken."
msgstr "무기가 망가졌어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Suspicious
#. SoundFileID = 0097EBF5
#. ScriptNotes = Suspicious
#. EDID: [01083C50]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "02B090"
msgid "I think we're being followed."
msgstr "우리 뒤를 밟는 것 같아."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00FAF43E
#. EDID: [01083C69]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "02B091"
msgid "Nothing left but the autopsies."
msgstr "남은 건 부검뿐이네."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 0072B6CA
#. EDID: [01083C7F]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "02B095"
msgid "Later."
msgstr "나중에 봐."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_DoctorDialogue
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCFGraceKim
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFGraceKim
#. Face = Thinking
#. SoundFileID = 0091189B
#. ScriptNotes = doctor examining patient / Thinking
#. EDID: [010276F4]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "02B9D4"
msgid "Straightforward zipper job really."
msgstr "그냥 간단한 봉합 작업이야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Irritated
#. SoundFileID = 0091300C
#. ScriptNotes = Irritated
#. EDID: [01083BC4]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "02B9E6"
msgid "Oh good, they're gone."
msgstr "오 좋네, 사라졌어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00A70E26
#. EDID: [01083CC1]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "02B9E8"
msgid "You're a real carpenter, aren't you. Hope there's good money in it."
msgstr "당신 진짜 뼛속까지 목수군요. 돈이나 좀 많이 버셨으면 좋겠네요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 008A3B40
#. EDID: [01083D2C]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "02B9E9"
msgid "Neat trick."
msgstr "멋진 재주네."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Angry
#. SoundFileID = 00E83648
#. ScriptNotes = Angry
#. EDID: [01083CB5]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "02BDFE"
msgid "I'm going to dissect you!"
msgstr "널 해부해 주겠어!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00DE98B8
#. EDID: [01083C8D]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "02BDFF"
msgid "Is their weapon damaged or something?"
msgstr "저쪽 무기가 손상된 건가?"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Angry
#. SoundFileID = 009DE848
#. ScriptNotes = Angry
#. EDID: [01083CB2]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "02C287"
msgid "Come here, corpsie."
msgstr "이리 와, 시체야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00924FF2
#. EDID: [01083C6B]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "02C288"
msgid "I hope they got the extended warranty."
msgstr "연장 보증에 가입했길 바라야겠네."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00311634
#. EDID: [01083C8F]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "02C289"
msgid "Their weapon's offline."
msgstr "저쪽 무기가 오프라인이야."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00784930
#. EDID: [01083C89]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "02C28A"
msgid "Their weapons look pretty broken. Good."
msgstr "저쪽 무기는 꽤 망가진 것 같아. 좋아."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00193C4E
#. EDID: [01083DCD]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "02C28C"
msgid "I guess we don't need feet."
msgstr "발은 필요 없을 거 같네요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00B6AAF6
#. EDID: [01083D07]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "02C28D"
msgid "I should charge you to go through my stuff."
msgstr "제 짐 뒤질 때마다 수수료를 받아야겠네요."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_DoctorDialogue
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCFGraceKim
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFGraceKim
#. Face = Friendly
#. SoundFileID = 00A81B5E
#. ScriptNotes = doctor diagnosing patient / Friendly
#. EDID: [010276E1]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "02C6FD"
msgid "I've seen worse."
msgstr "더 심한 것도 봤어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 005231D8
#. EDID: [01083D65]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "02C723"
msgid "Their weapon's back online. That's handy for them."
msgstr "저쪽 무기가 다시 온라인이야. 저들에겐 편리하겠네."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00551BA1
#. EDID: [01083DFD]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "02C724"
msgid "Here we are, home sweet home."
msgstr "도착했네. 즐거운 우리 집."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00E61880
#. EDID: [01083DE5]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "02C725"
msgid "There's a lot of farms outside the walls. We should introduce some invasive weeds."
msgstr "성벽 밖에 농장이 많네. 침입성 잡초를 좀 소개해 주자."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 006F2B99
#. EDID: [01083CD6]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "02C726"
msgid "Lot of good hiding places here. You might want to start shooting indiscriminately."
msgstr "숨을 곳이 많네. 무차별 사격을 시작하는 게 좋을지도 몰라."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFFL_MS01_DoctorDialogue
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = NPCFGraceKim
#. VoiceType = SFFL_MS01_NPCFGraceKim
#. Face = Thinking
#. SoundFileID = 00E58456
#. ScriptNotes = doctor examining patient / Thinking
#. EDID: [010276F5]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "02CBD5"
msgid "Hmm. Nothing a little needle and thread can't fix."
msgstr "흠. 바늘과 실만 조금 있으면 고칠 수 있겠어."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 007D1A2B
#. EDID: [01083CF8]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "02CBEE"
msgid "Weapons are operational."
msgstr "무기 작동 가능."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00272DEA
#. EDID: [01083DCA]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "02CBF1"
msgid "My head's starting to get dizzy. This is supposed to happen to other people, not me."
msgstr "머리가 어지러워지기 시작했어요. 이런 건 다른 사람한테나 일어나야 하는 건데요. 저 말고 말이죠."

#. List: 2
#. EDID: [01083E17]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "02CBF2"
msgid "Our oxygen tanks are full. Shame."
msgstr "산소 탱크가 가득 찼네. 아쉽다."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Angry
#. SoundFileID = 0084655B
#. ScriptNotes = Angry
#. EDID: [01083BE6]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "02CEEE"
msgid "Got you!"
msgstr "잡았다!"

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Angry
#. SoundFileID = 00EDF4EE
#. ScriptNotes = Angry
#. EDID: [01083CA0]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "02CEEF"
msgid "Guess we're doing this."
msgstr "이걸 하게 되는 모양이네."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00534DB8
#. EDID: [01083C86]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "02CEF0"
msgid "I think their weapons are dead."
msgstr "저쪽 무기는 죽은 것 같아."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 000336FB
#. EDID: [01083E25]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "02CEF2"
msgid "We should plant our flag here. We have to defend our copyright, or we lose it."
msgstr "여기에 우리 깃발을 꽂아야 해. 저작권을 지키지 않으면 잃게 되거든."

#. List: 2
#. QuestName = SFBGS038_CREW_EliteCrew_Muria
#. DialogCallType = NPCResponse
#. Speaker = Muria
#. VoiceType = NPCFMuria
#. Face = Serious
#. SoundFileID = 00519EE9
#. EDID: [01083DDF]
#. REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "02CEF3"
msgid "Well this place is a dump."
msgstr "음, 여긴 쓰레기장이네."

#. List: 0
msgctxt "002D87"
msgid "[Update 10 - Free Lanes]"
msgstr "[업데이트 10 - 프리 레인]"
